('7319918b-627b-56ac-b6b6-6393d3a3aa19', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '04d0f65f-27b6-5a5f-bebd-c21a6e729b10', '5cfe7e21-e9bf-519c-a99f-264aa1c3d369', 'spent', '/spent/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đã dùng hết, cạn kiệt năng lượng; kiệt sức.', 'having no energy or resources left after doing a difficult activity.', 'After running the marathon, I felt completely spent and could barely move.', 'Sau khi chạy marathon, tôi cảm thấy hoàn toàn kiệt sức và hầu như không thể di chuyển.', '{\"en\": \"The staff felt completely spent after organizing the annual international trade exhibition.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cảm thấy hoàn toàn kiệt sức sau khi tổ chức triển lãm thương mại quốc tế hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-ljspeech-40d77ecb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-cori-40d77ecb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spent-454e5d00.webp', '[\"exhausted\", \"drained\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"refreshed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel spent\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy kiệt sức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spent force\", \"meaning\": \"lực lượng đã hết thời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exhausted\", \"note_vi\": \"spent mang tính thân mật hơn exhausted khi mô tả sự mệt mỏi kiệt sức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"spend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-cori-40d77ecb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-aru0-40d77ecb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-aru5-40d77ecb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-aru6-40d77ecb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-aru10-40d77ecb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-aru9-40d77ecb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-aru3-40d77ecb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-aru7-40d77ecb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spent-aru8-40d77e