('7e6b33d7-abb2-5aad-8e2e-7fc3183977d6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'despoil', '/dɪˈspɔɪl/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Cướp phá, tước đoạt tài sản; làm hỏng vẻ đẹp hoặc giá trị của cái gì.', 'to steal or violently remove valuable things from a place.', 'The invaders sought to despoil the land of its natural resources.', 'Những kẻ xâm lược tìm cách cướp phá tài nguyên thiên nhiên của vùng đất.', '{\"en\": \"The new construction project must not despoil the natural beauty of the surrounding area.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án xây dựng mới không được làm hỏng vẻ đẹp tự nhiên của khu vực xung quanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-ljspeech-31893694.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-cori-31893694.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/despoil-b9da9714.webp', '[\"plunder\", \"loot\", \"pillage\"]', '[\"protect\", \"preserve\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"despoil the land\", \"meaning\": \"tàn phá đất đai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"despoil resources\", \"meaning\": \"cướp phá tài nguyên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"despoiler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-cori-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru0-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru5-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru6-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru10-31893694.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru9-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru3-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru7-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru8-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-aru2-31893694.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-ljspeech-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt408-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt138-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt624-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt396-31893694.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt498-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt132-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt288-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt42-31893694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despoil-lt90-31893694.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ trang trọng, ít gặp trong giao tiếp hàng ngày.', 'law', 1, 5),
('8aa56033-df7a-5b2c-991a-765cae2aeda8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'exhilarated', '/ɪɡˈzɪləreɪtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy rất vui vẻ, phấn chấn và tràn đầy năng lượng.', 'Experiencing an intense sense of excitement, high spirits, and vitality after a thrilling event.', 'After finishing the marathon, she felt completely exhilarated by her achievement.', 'Sau khi hoàn thành cuộc chạy marathon, cô ấy cảm thấy hoàn toàn phấn chấn vì thành tích của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team felt exhilarated after breaking the annual revenue record last month.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng cảm thấy rất phấn chấn sau khi phá kỷ lục doanh thu hàng năm vào tháng trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-ljspeech-d4d91357.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-cori-d4d91357.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exhilarated-bfb8695d.webp', '[\"thrilled\", \"excited\", \"elated\"]', '[\"depressed\", \"bored\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel exhilarated\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy phấn chấn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exhilarated by success\", \"meaning\": \"phấn khởi vì thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exhausted\", \"note_vi\": \"Exhausted là kiệt sức, ngược lại với exhilarated là tràn đầy năng lượng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exhilarate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"exhilarating\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exhilaration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-cori-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru0-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru5-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru6-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru10-d4d91357.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru9-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru3-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru7-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru8-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-aru2-d4d91357.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-ljspeech-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt408-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt138-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt624-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt396-d4d91357.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt498-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt132-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt288-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt42-d4d91357.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exhilarated-lt90-d4d91357.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với giới từ \'by\' hoặc \'at\'.', 'office', 1, 6),
('e986188e-7a31-5fd8-9242-6609ad08e607', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'armistice', '/ˈɑːmɪstɪs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Thỏa thuận chính thức giữa các bên tham chiến để ngừng chiến đấu.', 'An official pact made by opposing nations to temporarily halt military conflict.', 'The two nations signed an armistice to end the conflict temporarily.', 'Hai quốc gia đã ký một hiệp định đình chiến để tạm thời chấm dứt xung đột.', '{\"en\": \"The labor union and the management signed an armistice to resume production next week.\", \"vi\": \"Công đoàn và ban quản lý đã ký một thỏa thuận ngừng tranh chấp để nối lại sản xuất tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-ljspeech-489d54ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-cori-489d54ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/armistice-7d9f70b0.webp', '[\"truce\", \"ceasefire\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sign an armistice\", \"meaning\": \"ký hiệp định đình chiến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"call an armistice\", \"meaning\": \"kêu gọi ngừng bắn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-cori-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru0-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru5-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru6-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru10-489d54ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru9-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru3-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru7-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru8-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-aru2-489d54ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-ljspeech-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt408-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt138-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt624-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt396-489d54ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt498-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt132-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt288-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt42-489d54ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/armistice-lt90-489d54ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh đàm phán căng thẳng hoặc tranh chấp lao động.', 'law', 1, 7),
('16b82137-abb1-515a-9114-1017b22ec72b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'atrium', '/ˈeɪtriəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một không gian mở lớn ở trung tâm tòa nhà, thường có mái kính.', 'A spacious central interior hallway extending through several storeys of a modern structure.', 'The hotel lobby featured a magnificent atrium with a glass ceiling and lush plants.', 'Sảnh khách sạn có một đại sảnh tráng lệ với trần kính và cây xanh tươi tốt.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate headquarters features a spacious atrium where employees can relax during their lunch breaks.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở công ty có một giếng trời rộng rãi nơi nhân viên có thể thư giãn trong giờ nghỉ trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-ljspeech-6d9c9d08.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-cori-6d9c9d08.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atrium-a93499c9.webp', '[\"courtyard\", \"lobby\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"glass atrium\", \"meaning\": \"giếng trời mái kính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"central atrium\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực trung tâm tòa nhà\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-cori-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru0-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru5-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru6-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru10-6d9c9d08.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru9-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru3-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru7-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru8-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-aru2-6d9c9d08.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-ljspeech-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt408-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt138-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt624-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt396-6d9c9d08.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt498-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt132-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt288-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt42-6d9c9d08.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrium-lt90-6d9c9d08.mp3\"]}}', '', 'office', 1, 8),
('157463d3-3320-5c94-8310-770364411e5e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'banter', '/ˈbæntə(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Nói đùa cợt, trêu chọc một cách thân mật và vui vẻ.', 'to talk to someone in a friendly and humorous way that involves light teasing.', 'The colleagues often banter good-naturedly during their coffee breaks.', 'Các đồng nghiệp thường đùa cợt vui vẻ với nhau trong giờ giải lao uống cà phê.', '{\"en\": \"During the team lunch, the staff members liked to banter about their upcoming weekend travel plans.\", \"vi\": \"Trong bữa trưa của nhóm, các nhân viên thích nói đùa về kế hoạch du lịch cuối tuần sắp tới của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-ljspeech-d8a9794e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-cori-d8a9794e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/banter-f1af7394.webp', '[\"jest\", \"tease\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"friendly banter\", \"meaning\": \"sự đùa cợt thân thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"good-natured banter\", \"meaning\": \"sự trêu chọc vui vẻ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-cori-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru0-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru5-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru6-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru10-d8a9794e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru9-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru3-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru7-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru8-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-aru2-d8a9794e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-ljspeech-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt408-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt138-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt624-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt396-d8a9794e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt498-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt132-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt288-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt42-d8a9794e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banter-lt90-d8a9794e.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ sự giao tiếp thoải mái, không gây tổn thương.', 'office', 1, 9),
('2ffdf8ad-d282-5b85-8c3f-30fdd2369ea8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'demagogue', '/ˈdeməɡɒɡ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một lãnh đạo chính trị tìm cách giành quyền lực bằng cách lợi dụng cảm xúc và định kiến của dân chúng.', 'a political leader who gains power by using people\'s emotions and prejudices rather than reason.', 'The politician was accused of being a demagogue, appealing to people\'s fears.', 'Chính trị gia đó bị buộc tội là kẻ mị dân, lợi dụng nỗi sợ hãi của mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The documentary examined how the demagogue used media to spread fear among voters.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phim tài liệu xem xét cách nhà mị dân sử dụng truyền thông để gieo rắc nỗi sợ hãi trong cử tri.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-ljspeech-cb8b7fdd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-cori-cb8b7fdd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/demagogue-ffc5ef71.webp', '[\"rabble-rouser\", \"agitator\", \"populist\"]', '[\"statesman\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"political demagogue\", \"meaning\": \"nhà mị dân chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dangerous demagogue\", \"meaning\": \"nhà mị dân nguy hiểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"democrat\", \"note_vi\": \"democrat chỉ người ủng hộ dân chủ, không mang nghĩa tiêu cực như demagogue\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"demagoguery\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"demagogic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-cori-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru0-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru5-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru6-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru10-cb8b7fdd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru9-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru3-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru7-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru8-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-aru2-cb8b7fdd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-ljspeech-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt408-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt138-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt624-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt396-cb8b7fdd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt498-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt132-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt288-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt42-cb8b7fdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demagogue-lt90-cb8b7fdd.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang nghĩa tiêu cực mạnh; demagoguery là danh từ chỉ hành vi mị dân.', 'media', 1, 10),
('70099402-1fdd-561b-9d1c-32b1a2dfb1c7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'dragoon', '/drəˈɡuːn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Lính kỵ binh.', 'a soldier in the past who fought on horseback and was armed with weapons.', 'The king\'s dragoons were known for their bravery in battle.', 'Các lính kỵ binh của nhà vua nổi tiếng về lòng dũng cảm trong trận chiến.', '{\"en\": \"The museum\'s new exhibit features uniforms worn by dragoons in the eighteenth century.\", \"vi\": \"Triển lãm mới của bảo tàng trưng bày đồng phục của lính kỵ binh vào thế kỷ mười tám.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-ljspeech-677fae8d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-cori-677fae8d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dragoon-3d49ba2c.webp', '[\"cavalryman\", \"horseman\", \"trooper\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"royal dragoons\", \"meaning\": \"lính kỵ binh hoàng gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dragoon regiment\", \"meaning\": \"trung đoàn kỵ binh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heavy dragoon\", \"meaning\": \"kỵ binh hạng nặng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dragoon\", \"note_vi\": \"dragoon còn là động từ nghĩa là ép buộc ai làm gì đó (verb)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dragoon\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-cori-677fae8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-aru0-677fae8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-aru5-677fae8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-aru6-677fae8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-aru10-677fae8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-aru9-677fae8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-aru3-677fae8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dragoon-aru7-677fae8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dr