('1f5d0dbe-9c8c-5f26-8274-eb7f95768057', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'venerate', '/ˈvenəreɪt/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Tôn kính, sùng bái ai đó hoặc điều gì đó.', 'to respect or admire someone or something very much.', 'Ancient cultures often venerate their ancestors and natural elements.', 'Các nền văn hóa cổ đại thường tôn kính tổ tiên và các yếu tố tự nhiên.', '{\"en\": \"Employees in this traditional company venerate the founder for his ethical business practices.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên trong công ty truyền thống này tôn kính người sáng lập vì các hoạt động kinh doanh đạo đức của ông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-ljspeech-b6af8b23.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-cori-b6af8b23.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/venerate-3928737f.webp', '[\"revere\", \"respect\", \"worship\"]', '[\"despise\", \"dishonor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"venerate as a hero\", \"meaning\": \"tôn kính như một vị anh hùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply venerate\", \"meaning\": \"sùng kính sâu sắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"veneration\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"venerable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-cori-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru0-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru5-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru6-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru10-b6af8b23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru9-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru3-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru7-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru8-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-aru2-b6af8b23.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-ljspeech-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt408-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt138-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt624-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt396-b6af8b23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt498-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt132-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt288-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt42-b6af8b23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/venerate-lt90-b6af8b23.mp3\"]}}', 'Mang sắc thái trang trọng hơn nhiều so với respect.', 'hr', 1, 15),
('e9bf3022-480d-547b-8ccc-4a622cc9f0df', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'monism', '/ˈmɒnɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Học thuyết triết học cho rằng thực tại chỉ có một bản chất hoặc nguyên lý cơ bản.', 'the belief that all things derive from a single fundamental principle or substance.', 'In philosophy, monism suggests that the entire universe can be explained by a single substance or principle.', 'Trong triết học, chủ nghĩa nhất nguyên cho rằng toàn bộ vũ trụ có thể được giải thích bằng một chất hoặc nguyên lý duy nhất.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant\'s monism viewed the company as one unified system needing single leadership.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ nghĩa nhất nguyên của vị tư vấn coi công ty như một hệ thống thống nhất cần lãnh đạo duy nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-ljspeech-99bc7473.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-cori-99bc7473.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monism-37ea2543.webp', NULL, '[\"dualism\", \"pluralism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"absolute monism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa nhất nguyên tuyệt đối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"monism principle\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên lý nhất nguyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"material monism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa nhất nguyên duy vật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monsoon\", \"note_vi\": \"monism là nhất nguyên, monsoon là gió mùa, dễ nhầm âm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"monist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"monistic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-cori-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru0-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru5-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru6-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru10-99bc7473.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru9-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru3-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru7-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru8-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-aru2-99bc7473.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-ljspeech-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt408-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt138-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt624-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt396-99bc7473.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt498-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt132-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt288-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt42-99bc7473.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monism-lt90-99bc7473.mp3\"]}}', 'Monism là thuật ngữ triết học, không dùng trong kinh doanh trừ khi ẩn dụ.', 'academic', 1, 16),
('a8667cb9-4d37-5984-a027-7b4639ecc1bc', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'interdisciplinary', '/ˌɪntədɪsəˈplɪnəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến hoặc kết hợp nhiều ngành học hoặc lĩnh vực kiến thức khác nhau.', 'involving methods and knowledge from several different fields of study.', 'Our research team adopted an interdisciplinary strategy to solve the environmental crisis.', 'Nhóm nghiên cứu của chúng tôi đã áp dụng một chiến lược liên ngành để giải quyết khủng hoảng môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"The interdisciplinary committee reviewed the new product design from multiple perspectives.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban liên ngành đã xem xét thiết kế sản phẩm mới từ nhiều góc độ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-ljspeech-df18b97a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-cori-df18b97a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interdisciplinary-81f37e3c.webp', '[\"multidisciplinary\", \"cross-disciplinary\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"interdisciplinary approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận liên ngành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interdisciplinary team\", \"meaning\": \"đội ngũ liên ngành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interdisciplinary study\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu liên ngành\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intradisciplinary\", \"note_vi\": \"intradisciplinary nghĩa trong một ngành, không phải nhiều ngành.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"interdisciplinarity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-cori-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru0-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru5-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru6-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru10-df18b97a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru9-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru3-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru7-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru8-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-aru2-df18b97a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-ljspeech-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt408-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt138-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt624-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt396-df18b97a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt498-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt132-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt288-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt42-df18b97a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interdisciplinary-lt90-df18b97a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với approach, team; chỉ sự kết hợp nhiều lĩnh vực.', 'academic', 1, 17),
('ef82d8dd-b177-5463-815b-3ee0665577f6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'bouncy', '/ˈbaʊnsi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có tính đàn hồi, nảy lên được.', 'able to spring back easily after hitting a hard surface or floor.', 'The children loved playing on the bouncy castle at the fair.', 'Bọn trẻ rất thích chơi trên lâu đài hơi nảy ở hội chợ.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel gym upgraded its athletic area with high-quality bouncy rubber flooring for safety.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tập của khách sạn đã nâng cấp khu vực thể thao với sàn cao su đàn hồi chất lượng cao vì mục đích an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-ljspeech-72c8337c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-cori-72c8337c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bouncy-248c9187.webp', '[\"resilient\", \"springy\", \"elastic\"]', '[\"rigid\", \"hard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bouncy floor\", \"meaning\": \"sàn đàn hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bouncy castle\", \"meaning\": \"nhà hơi cho trẻ em\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"boundless\", \"note_vi\": \"boundless nghĩa là vô tận, không giới hạn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bounce\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bounce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-cori-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru0-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru5-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru6-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru10-72c8337c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru9-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru3-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru7-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru8-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-aru2-72c8337c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-ljspeech-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt408-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt138-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt624-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt396-72c8337c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt498-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt132-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt288-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt42-72c8337c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouncy-lt90-72c8337c.mp3\"]}}', 'Bouncy miêu tả tính chất nảy, đàn hồi hoặc tính cách năng động.', 'daily', 1, 18),
('19122050-fc82-5a00-a369-625f10918c95', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'hypnotic', '/hɪpˈnɒtɪk/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng gây ngủ hoặc thu hút sự chú ý mạnh mẽ như bị thôi miên.', 'producing sleep or making you feel relaxed and unable to pay attention.', 'The rhythmic sound of the waves had a hypnotic effect, making me feel very sleepy.', 'Âm thanh nhịp nhàng của sóng có tác dụng thôi miên, khiến tôi cảm thấy rất buồn ngủ.', '{\"en\": \"The speaker had a hypnotic voice that kept the entire audience focused during the seminar.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả có một giọng nói đầy mê hoặc giúp toàn bộ khán giả tập trung trong suốt buổi hội thảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-ljspeech-b875fae1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-cori-b875fae1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hypnotic-952f03bf.webp', '[\"mesmerizing\", \"soothing\", \"spellbinding\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hypnotic effect\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu ứng thôi miên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hypnotic state\", \"meaning\": \"trạng thái thôi miên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hypnosis\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hypnotize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-cori-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru0-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru5-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru6-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru10-b875fae1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru9-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru3-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru7-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru8-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-aru2-b875fae1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-ljspeech-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt408-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt138-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt624-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt396-b875fae1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt498-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt132-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt288-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt42-b875fae1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypnotic-lt90-b875fae1.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng nghĩa đen (gây ngủ) hoặc nghĩa bóng (cuốn hút, mê hoặc).', 'office', 1, 19),
('9af00929-f5eb-5fe1-b754-08c18cca233f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'shrill', '/ʃrɪl/', 'C1', 'adjective', '(Âm thanh) cao vút, chói tai, the thé.', 'Characterized by a piercing high frequency tone that creates an ear-splitting sensation.', 'Her shrill voice cut through the noise of the crowded room.', 'Giọng the thé của cô ấy xuyên qua tiếng ồn ào của căn phòng đông người.', '{\"en\": \"A shrill alarm sounded throughout the office building, forcing everyone to evacuate immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Một tiếng chuông báo động chói tai vang lên khắp tòa nhà văn phòng, buộc mọi người phải sơ tán ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-ljspeech-1b0d006e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-cori-1b0d006e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shrill-9a8d31e5.webp', '[\"piercing\", \"high-pitched\", \"sharp\"]', '[\"deep\", \"low\", \"muffled\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"shrill voice\", \"meaning\": \"giọng nói the thé\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shrill sound\", \"meaning\": \"âm thanh chói tai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shrewd\", \"note_vi\": \"Shrewd nghĩa là sắc sảo, khôn ngoan; shrill là chói tai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shrillness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"shrilly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-cori-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru0-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru5-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru6-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru10-1b0d006e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru9-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru3-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru7-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru8-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-aru2-1b0d006e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-ljspeech-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt408-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt138-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt624-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt396-1b0d006e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt498-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt132-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt288-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt42-1b0d006e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrill-lt90-1b0d006e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để tả giọng nói hoặc tiếng chuông báo động gây khó chịu.', 'daily', 1, 20),
('f10195e4-54ee-564d-8a68-a53c577e6f21', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'nasal congestion', '/ˈneɪzəl kənˈdʒestʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng nghẹt mũi, khó thở qua mũi.', 'the state of having your nose blocked with fluid, making it difficult to breathe.', 'I\'m suffering from severe nasal congestion due to my allergies.', 'Tôi đang bị nghẹt mũi nặng do dị ứng.', '{\"en\": \"The employee requested sick leave because severe nasal congestion prevented her from speaking clearly during calls.\", \"vi\": \"Nữ nhân viên đã xin nghỉ phép vì tình trạng nghẹt mũi nặng khiến cô không thể nói rõ ràng trong các cuộc gọi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-ljspeech-1ef946a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-cori-1ef946a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nasal-congestion-3fbc4f33.webp', '[\"stuffy nose\", \"nasal blockage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"relieve nasal congestion\", \"meaning\": \"giảm nghẹt mũi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"severe nasal congestion\", \"meaning\": \"nghẹt mũi nặng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-cori-1ef946a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-aru0-1ef946a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-aru5-1ef946a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-aru6-1ef946a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-aru10-1ef946a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-aru9-1ef946a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-aru3-1ef946a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-aru7-1ef946a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nasal-congestion-aru8-1ef946a0.mp3\", \"/