('3a2156a2-271e-567d-bbd2-8facafc8a3fa', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '11fcb714-5108-5027-8fb8-10e09fea6124', '578e1fb3-7804-5808-9c3e-cb92e8876b01', 'elaborately', 'UK: /ɪˈlæbərətli/ | US: /ɪˈlæbərətli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'một cách tỉ mỉ, công phu', 'In a manner involving great care, attention to detail, and complex decorative elements.', 'The ballroom was elaborately decorated for the company\'s annual gala.', 'Phòng khiêu vũ được trang trí công phu cho buổi dạ tiệc thường niên của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The banquet hall was elaborately decorated for the company\'s annual anniversary gala.\", \"vi\": \"Hội trường bữa tiệc đã được trang trí vô cùng công phu cho lễ kỷ niệm hàng năm của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-ljspeech-6e514acb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-cori-6e514acb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elaborately-31a983d0.webp', '[\"meticulously\", \"intricately\", \"thoroughly\"]', '[\"simply\", \"plainly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"elaborately decorated\", \"meaning\": \"được trang trí công phu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elaborately designed\", \"meaning\": \"được thiết kế tỉ mỉ/cầu kỳ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"elaborate\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"elaborate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"elaboration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-cori-6e514acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-aru0-6e514acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-aru5-6e514acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-aru6-6e514acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-aru10-6e514acb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-aru9-6e514acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elaborately-aru3-6e514acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje