('6aba2ec2-3cd4-5238-b1fd-e50cd9978e82', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'tenet', '/ˈtenɪt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Nguyên lý, giáo lý hoặc niềm tin cơ bản của một hệ thống.', 'one of the main principles or beliefs on which a system is based.', 'A core tenet of democracy is that all citizens have the right to vote.', 'Một nguyên lý cốt lõi của dân chủ là mọi công dân đều có quyền bầu cử.', '{\"en\": \"Honesty and transparency remain a central tenet of our corporate code of ethics.\", \"vi\": \"Sự trung thực và minh bạch vẫn là một nguyên tắc cốt lõi trong bộ quy tắc đạo đức doanh nghiệp của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-ljspeech-cbfae0a3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-cori-cbfae0a3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tenet-17ee76c8.webp', '[\"principle\", \"doctrine\", \"belief\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"core tenet\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên lý cốt lõi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"central tenet\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên tắc trung tâm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tenant\", \"note_vi\": \"tenant là người thuê nhà hoặc văn phòng, tenet là nguyên lý hay niềm tin.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-cori-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru0-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru5-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru6-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru10-cbfae0a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru9-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru3-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru7-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru8-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-aru2-cbfae0a3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-ljspeech-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt408-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt138-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt624-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt396-cbfae0a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt498-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt132-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt288-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt42-cbfae0a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenet-lt90-cbfae0a3.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất dễ nhầm với \'tenant\' (người thuê nhà). Nhớ: tenet = nguyên lý, tenant = người thuê.', 'business', 1, 19),
('464c1bc8-b9e8-518b-8fdc-1d4d18850284', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'pliable', '/ˈplaɪəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Dễ uốn nắn, mềm dẻo; dễ bị ảnh hưởng.', 'easily bent or shaped without breaking, or easily influenced by other people\'s opinions or ideas.', 'The artist used pliable clay to sculpt the intricate figures.', 'Nghệ sĩ đã dùng đất sét dẻo để điêu khắc những hình tượng phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The new plastic material is very pliable, making it perfect for manufacturing flexible phone cases.\", \"vi\": \"Chất liệu nhựa mới rất dễ uốn, khiến nó hoàn hảo để sản xuất ốp điện thoại linh hoạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-ljspeech-fcc4045f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-cori-fcc4045f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pliable-70277276.webp', '[\"flexible\", \"supple\"]', '[\"rigid\", \"stiff\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pliable material\", \"meaning\": \"vật liệu dễ uốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pliable mind\", \"meaning\": \"tư duy dễ tiếp thu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flexible\", \"note_vi\": \"pliable nhấn mạnh sự dễ uốn nắn, flexible nhấn mạnh sự linh hoạt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pliability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-cori-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru0-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru5-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru6-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru10-fcc4045f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru9-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru3-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru7-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru8-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-aru2-fcc4045f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-ljspeech-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt408-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt138-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt624-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt396-fcc4045f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt498-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt132-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt288-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt42-fcc4045f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pliable-lt90-fcc4045f.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cho vật liệu dễ uốn hoặc người dễ bị thuyết phục, thay đổi ý kiến.', 'manufacturing', 1, 20),
('4565db8c-f930-52d4-b9a3-0ef947de4c2c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'delegation', 'UK: /ˌdelɪˈɡeɪʃn/ | US: /ˌdelɪˈɡeɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'sự ủy quyền', 'The act of giving authority or responsibility to another person to act.', 'Delegation of tasks makes a supervisor\'s job easier.', 'Sự ủy quyền nhiệm vụ giúp công việc của người giám sát dễ dàng hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Effective management requires the proper delegation of responsibilities to team members.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý hiệu quả đòi hỏi sự ủy quyền trách nhiệm hợp lý cho các thành viên trong đội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-ljspeech-1797e6eb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-cori-1797e6eb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delegation-04c2b236.webp', '[\"assignment\", \"deputation\", \"conferral\", \"contingent\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"delegation of authority\", \"meaning\": \"sự ủy quyền hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trade delegation\", \"meaning\": \"đoàn đại biểu thương mại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"delegate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"delegate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-cori-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru0-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru5-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru6-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru10-1797e6eb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru9-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru3-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru7-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru8-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-aru2-1797e6eb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-ljspeech-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt408-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt138-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt624-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt396-1797e6eb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt498-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt132-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt288-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt42-1797e6eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delegation-lt90-1797e6eb.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC có 2 nét nghĩa: 1) Sự ủy quyền công việc (\'delegation of authority\') và 2) Đoàn đại biểu (\'trade delegation\').', 'office', 1, 21),
('9a5f4bc5-b72a-527e-b9ee-c1017db52e2e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'glossary', '/ˈɡlɒsəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một danh sách các thuật ngữ khó hoặc chuyên ngành cùng với giải thích ngắn gọn, thường ở cuối sách.', 'a list of special or unusual words and their meanings, usually at the end of a book.', 'You can find definitions for all the technical terms in the glossary at the back of the textbook.', 'Bạn có thể tìm thấy định nghĩa cho tất cả các thuật ngữ chuyên ngành trong bảng chú giải ở cuối sách giáo khoa.', '{\"en\": \"Please refer to the glossary at the end of the employee manual for any unfamiliar technical terms.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng tham khảo bảng chú giải thuật ngữ ở cuối sổ tay nhân viên cho bất kỳ thuật ngữ kỹ thuật nào chưa quen thuộc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-ljspeech-407257a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-cori-407257a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glossary-44adec48.webp', '[\"vocabulary\", \"dictionary\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a comprehensive glossary\", \"meaning\": \"bảng chú giải toàn diện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"refer to the glossary\", \"meaning\": \"tham khảo bảng chú giải\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"index\", \"note_vi\": \"bảng mục lục tra cứu theo vần, không có định nghĩa\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-cori-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru0-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru5-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru6-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru10-407257a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru9-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru3-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru7-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru8-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-aru2-407257a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-ljspeech-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt408-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt138-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt624-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt396-407257a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt498-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt132-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt288-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt42-407257a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glossary-lt90-407257a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các tài liệu hướng dẫn kỹ thuật hoặc sách chuyên ngành.', 'academic', 1, 22),
('0dae7220-c93f-5a68-911c-979a9b34c0b8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'inclement', 'UK: /ɪnˈklɛmənt/ | US: /ɪnˈklɛmənt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'khắc nghiệt (thời tiết)', 'Describing weather that is unpleasantly cold, stormy, severe, or harsh.', 'The inclement weather caused flight delays.', 'Thời tiết khắc nghiệt đã gây ra sự chậm trễ chuyến bay.', '{\"en\": \"Due to inclement weather conditions, the flight to Chicago has been delayed until tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Do điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt, chuyến bay đến Chicago đã bị hoãn đến sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-ljspeech-7a2ab170.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-cori-7a2ab170.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inclement-82964c2d.webp', '[\"severe\", \"stormy\", \"harsh\", \"foul\"]', '[\"mild\", \"pleasant\", \"fair\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inclement weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết khắc nghiệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inclement conditions\", \"meaning\": \"điều kiện khắc nghiệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"element\", \"note_vi\": \"\'element\' là yếu tố hay nguyên tố, không liên quan đến thời tiết khắc nghiệt (\'inclement\').\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inclemency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-cori-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru0-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru5-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru6-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru10-7a2ab170.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru9-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru3-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru7-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru8-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-aru2-7a2ab170.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-ljspeech-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt408-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt138-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt624-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt396-7a2ab170.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt498-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt132-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt288-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt42-7a2ab170.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inclement-lt90-7a2ab170.mp3\"]}}', 'Gần như luôn đi chung với danh từ \'weather\' (\'inclement weather\') trong các thông báo trì hoãn/hủy bỏ chuyến bay hoặc sự kiện.', 'weather', 1, 23),
('961b9e1f-f403-5434-9bd3-b57030de90df', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'expendable', '/ɪkˈspendəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có thể bỏ qua hoặc thay thế mà không gây ảnh hưởng lớn.', 'not necessary and able to be destroyed or replaced without causing major problems.', 'In a crisis, some resources might be considered expendable to save the most critical ones.', 'Trong một cuộc khủng hoảng, một số tài nguyên có thể được coi là có thể bỏ qua để cứu những thứ quan trọng nhất.', '{\"en\": \"During the budget cuts, temporary workers were unfortunately considered expendable by the management team.\", \"vi\": \"Trong đợt cắt giảm ngân sách, những nhân viên tạm thời không May bị ban quản lý coi là có thể thay thế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-ljspeech-5be03d22.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-cori-5be03d22.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expendable-ad832c5d.webp', '[\"replaceable\", \"dispensable\", \"non-essential\"]', '[\"indispensable\", \"essential\", \"crucial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"expendable resources\", \"meaning\": \"tài nguyên có thể tiêu hao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly expendable\", \"meaning\": \"rất dễ bị thay thế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expandable\", \"note_vi\": \"expandable là có thể mở rộng, expendable là có thể tiêu hao hoặc thay thế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expenditure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-cori-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru0-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru5-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru6-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru10-5be03d22.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru9-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru3-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru7-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru8-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-aru2-5be03d22.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-ljspeech-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt408-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt138-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt624-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt396-5be03d22.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt498-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt132-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt288-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt42-5be03d22.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expendable-lt90-5be03d22.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt với expandable (có thể mở rộng).', 'business', 1, 24),
('2af222ab-61aa-559d-8f22-5c7569b10a19', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'bucket shop', '/ˈbʌkɪt ʃɒp/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Công ty môi giới chứng khoán hoặc đại lý du lịch không uy tín, thường bán giá rẻ.', 'an unofficial or unreliable travel agency or broker that sells tickets or services at very low prices.', 'Be careful when buying tickets from a bucket shop; they might not be legitimate.', 'Hãy cẩn thận khi mua vé từ một đại lý vé rẻ; chúng có thể không hợp pháp.', '{\"en\": \"The company warned employees not to book business flights through a bucket shop to avoid problems.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cảnh báo nhân viên không đặt vé máy bay công tác qua đại lý không uy tín để tránh rắc rối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-ljspeech-2596dd2c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-cori-2596dd2c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bucket-shop-dc626279.webp', '[\"fly-by-night agency\", \"dodgy broker\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"buy from a bucket shop\", \"meaning\": \"mua từ đại lý không uy tín\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bucket shop tickets\", \"meaning\": \"vé mua từ đại lý giá rẻ không chính thống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"discount bucket shop\", \"meaning\": \"đại lý giảm giá không đáng tin\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"travel agency\", \"note_vi\": \"travel agency là đại lý du lịch hợp pháp, bucket shop thì không đáng tin cậy\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-cori-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru0-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru5-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru6-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru10-2596dd2c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru9-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru3-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru7-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru8-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-aru2-2596dd2c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-ljspeech-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt408-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt138-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt624-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt396-2596dd2c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt498-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt132-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt288-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt42-2596dd2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bucket-shop-lt90-2596dd2c.mp3\"]}}', 'Bucket shop có thể bán vé rẻ nhưng tiềm ẩn rủi ro; cẩn thận khi gặp từ này trong đề đọc TOEIC.', 'travel', 1, 25),
('061c17c1-1bff-5bbb-ada3-1ebe11c6c6aa', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'offensive', '/əˈfensɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây khó chịu, xúc phạm hoặc tấn công.', 'causing someone to feel deeply upset, annoyed, or insulted by rude behavior or words.', 'His comments were considered highly offensive by many people in the audience.', 'Những bình luận của anh ấy bị nhiều người trong khán giả coi là rất xúc phạm.', '{\"en\": \"The client found the salesperson\'s aggressive tone to be highly offensive during the contract negotiation.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng thấy giọng điệu hung hăng của nhân viên bán hàng là rất xúc phạm trong buổi đàm phán hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-ljspeech-4a23e49d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-cori-4a23e49d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/offensive-900ddb81.webp', '[\"insulting\", \"rude\"]', '[\"polite\", \"pleasant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"offensive language\", \"meaning\": \"ngôn từ gây khó chịu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly offensive\", \"meaning\": \"rất gây xúc phạm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"offend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"offense\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-cori-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru0-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru5-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru6-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru10-4a23e49d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru9-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru3-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru7-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru8-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-aru2-4a23e49d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-ljspeech-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt408-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt138-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt624-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt396-4a23e49d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt498-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt132-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt288-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt42-4a23e49d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/offensive-lt90-4a23e49d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, tránh dùng từ này để duy trì sự chuyên nghiệp.', 'business', 1, 26),
('7e3143c6-b2ef-5f0a-8b50-58e72dbe3410', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'internalization', 'UK: /ˌɪntɜːnəlaɪˈzeɪʃn/ | US: /ˌɪntɜːrnəlaɪˈzeɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'sự nội địa hóa', 'The process of integrating business activities or concepts into the core structure of an organization.', 'Internalization of the firm was successful.', 'Việc nội địa hóa của công ty đã thành công.', '{\"en\": \"The internalization of logistics helped the company reduce dependence on third-party vendors.\", \"vi\": \"Việc nội bộ hóa mâu hậu cần giúp công ty giảm phụ thuộc vào các nhà cung cấp bên thứ ba.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-ljspeech-143a8e9a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-cori-143a8e9a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/internalization-4a4cec2c.webp', '[\"integration\", \"incorporation\", \"assimilation\"]', '[\"externalization\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"process of internalization\", \"meaning\": \"quá trình nội bộ hóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cost internalization\", \"meaning\": \"sự nội bộ hóa chi phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"internationalization\", \"note_vi\": \"Internationalization là sự quốc tế hóa (mở rộng ra toàn cầu), tránh nhầm với internalization (nội bộ hóa).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"internalize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"internal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-cori-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru0-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru5-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru6-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru10-143a8e9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru9-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru3-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru7-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru8-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-aru2-143a8e9a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-ljspeech-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt408-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt138-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt624-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt396-143a8e9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt498-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt132-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt288-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt42-143a8e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalization-lt90-143a8e9a.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ quá trình tích hợp/nội bộ hóa các quy trình, chi phí hoặc tư tưởng vào trong doanh nghiệp.', 'management', 1, 27),
('6adb57d6-9431-53d6-879a-d45b8e25eff6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'geode', '/ˈdʒiːəʊd/', 'C2', 'noun', 'đá hốc (đá rỗng bên trong có tinh thể)', 'a rock that is hollow inside and contains small bright crystals lining the inner wall.', 'We cracked open the geode to reveal beautiful amethyst crystals sparkling inside.', 'Chúng tôi đập vỡ tảng đá hốc để lộ ra những tinh thể thạch anh tím lấp lánh tuyệt đẹp bên trong.', '{\"en\": \"The museum gift shop sells small geodes as souvenirs to tourists visiting the natural history exhibit.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng lưu niệm của bảo tàng bán những viên đá hốc nhỏ làm quà cho du khách tham quan triển lãm lịch sử tự nhiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-ljspeech-b67edd70.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-cori-b67edd70.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/geode-6f21824d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"amethyst geode\", \"meaning\": \"đá hốc thạch anh tím\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crack a geode\", \"meaning\": \"đập vỡ đá hốc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-cori-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru0-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru5-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru6-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru10-b67edd70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru9-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru3-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru7-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru8-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-aru2-b67edd70.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-ljspeech-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt408-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt138-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt624-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt396-b67edd70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt498-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt132-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt288-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt42-b67edd70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geode-lt90-b67edd70.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là một thuật ngữ chuyên ngành địa chất, ít gặp trong giao tiếp hàng ngày.', 'nature', 1, 28),
('14aa7bb6-1076-5031-a326-b7faf44576be', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1483462d-5bb3-55ed-a61e-82b8a50b29a4', '721bdfe8-513e-5afa-8582-d35b51ae0eff', 'psychosis', '/saɪˈkəʊsɪs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một tình trạng sức khỏe tâm thần nghiêm trọng khiến người bệnh mất liên lạc với thực tế.', 'a severe mental condition where a person loses contact with reality and has strange thoughts.', 'Early intervention is crucial for people experiencing symptoms of psychosis.', 'Can thiệp sớm là rất quan trọng đối với những người có triệu chứng rối loạn tâm thần.', '{\"en\": \"The health insurance policy covers treatment for various conditions, including severe cases of psychosis.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách bảo hiểm y tế chi trả cho việc điều trị nhiều tình trạng, bao gồm các trường hợp loạn thần nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-ljspeech-89b6b978.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-cori-89b6b978.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/psychosis-f087bda6.webp', '[\"mental disorder\", \"delusion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"symptoms of psychosis\", \"meaning\": \"triệu chứng loạn thần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"treat psychosis\", \"meaning\": \"điều trị bệnh loạn thần\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"psychotic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-cori-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru0-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru5-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru6-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru10-89b6b978.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru9-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru3-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru7-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru8-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-aru2-89b6b978.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-ljspeech-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt408-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt138-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt624-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt396-89b6b978.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt498-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt132-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt288-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt42-89b6b978.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/psychosis-lt90-89b6b978.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là thuật ngữ y khoa nghiêm trọng, cần dùng cẩn thận.', 'health', 1, 29),
('c08ea6d4-0d17-5caa-9170-f8c2eb8b8b79', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'Solomonic', '/ˌsɒl.əˈmɒn.ɪk/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Thể hiện sự khôn ngoan, công bằng và sáng suốt như Vua Solomon.', 'showing great wisdom, fairness, and cleverness in making a difficult decision.', 'The mediator proposed a Solomonic compromise to resolve the long-standing contract dispute.', 'Người hòa giải đã đề xuất một giải pháp thỏa hiệp khôn ngoan để giải quyết tranh chấp hợp đồng kéo dài.', '{\"en\": \"The board reached a Solomonic agreement that resolved the dispute between the two departments.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã đạt được một thỏa thuận khôn ngoan và công bằng giúp giải quyết tranh chấp giữa hai phòng ban.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-ljspeech-9608ab88.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-cori-9608ab88.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/solomonic-72d8f1e6.webp', '[\"wise\", \"judicious\", \"fair\"]', '[\"foolish\", \"unjust\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"Solomonic decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định khôn ngoan và công bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"Solomonic judgment\", \"meaning\": \"phán quyết sáng suốt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-cori-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru0-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru5-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru6-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru10-9608ab88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru9-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru3-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru7-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru8-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-aru2-9608ab88.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-ljspeech-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt408-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt138-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt624-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt396-9608ab88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt498-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt132-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt288-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt42-9608ab88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solomonic-lt90-9608ab88.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này luôn viết hoa chữ S vì bắt nguồn từ tên Vua Solomon trong Kinh Thánh.', 'law', 1, 0),
('008d6394-ff2c-54af-9585-ec30bc12a783', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'foxy', '/ˈfɒksi/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Xảo quyệt, ranh mãnh, thông minh một cách tinh ranh.', 'behaving in a clever and sometimes dishonest way to get what you want.', 'She gave a foxy smile, hinting at a clever plan she had in mind.', 'Cô ấy nở một nụ cười ranh mãnh, ngụ ý về một kế hoạch khôn ngoan mà cô ấy đang nghĩ tới.', '{\"en\": \"The foxy negotiator managed to get a better deal by hiding his true intentions.\", \"vi\": \"Người đàm phán ranh mãnh đã xoay xở để có được thỏa thuận tốt hơn bằng cách giấu ý định thật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-ljspeech-63e5b70d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-cori-63e5b70d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foxy-1885a606.webp', '[\"cunning\", \"sly\"]', '[\"honest\", \"naive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"foxy smile\", \"meaning\": \"nụ cười ranh mãnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"foxy plan\", \"meaning\": \"kế hoạch tinh ranh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fox\", \"note_vi\": \"con cáo, biểu tượng của sự ranh mãnh trong văn hóa phương Tây.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-cori-63e5b70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru0-63e5b70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru5-63e5b70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru6-63e5b70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru10-63e5b70d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru9-63e5b70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru3-63e5b70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru7-63e5b70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru8-63e5b70d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foxy-aru2-63e5b70d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": 