('602a7449-d324-509e-9091-c96d1953efa7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'hallow', '/ˈhæləʊ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Coi là thiêng liêng, tôn kính.', 'to treat a place or thing as very sacred and worthy of respect.', 'The ancient site was hallowed by centuries of religious ceremonies.', 'Địa điểm cổ xưa này đã được tôn kính qua hàng thế kỷ với các nghi lễ tôn giáo.', '{\"en\": \"The firm hallowed its founding day with an annual respectful ceremony for staff.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tôn kính ngày thành lập bằng lễ kỷ niệm thường niên cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-ljspeech-44954aa8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-cori-44954aa8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hallow-9d8be37b.webp', '[\"sanctify\", \"consecrate\"]', '[\"desecrate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hallow a site\", \"meaning\": \"coi một địa điểm là thiêng liêng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hallow a tradition\", \"meaning\": \"tôn kính một truyền thống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hollow\", \"note_vi\": \"hollow nghĩa là rỗng, dễ nhầm phát âm với hallow\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hallowed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-cori-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru0-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru5-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru6-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru10-44954aa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru9-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru3-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru7-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru8-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-aru2-44954aa8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-ljspeech-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt408-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt138-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt624-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt396-44954aa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt498-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt132-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt288-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt42-44954aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hallow-lt90-44954aa8.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này hiếm gặp, thường thấy ở dạng hallowed (thiêng liêng) trong văn hóa phương Tây.', 'other', 1, 3),
('ebdaf013-c2bc-5368-95a2-55e149099b6a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'quibble', '/ˈkwɪbl/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Tranh cãi hoặc phàn nàn về những chi tiết nhỏ, không quan trọng.', 'to argue or express complaints about small and unimportant matters that do not really matter.', 'There\'s no need to quibble over such minor details when we have bigger issues to discuss.', 'Không cần phải cãi vặt về những chi tiết nhỏ nhặt như vậy khi chúng ta có những vấn đề lớn hơn để thảo luận.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked the team not to quibble over minor formatting issues in the report.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý yêu cầu nhóm không nên tranh cãi về những vấn đề định dạng nhỏ trong báo cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-ljspeech-bc9cc3c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-cori-bc9cc3c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quibble-e943d128.webp', '[\"carp\", \"nitpick\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"quibble over\", \"meaning\": \"tranh cãi về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"without quibble\", \"meaning\": \"không chút phàn nàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"quibble\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-cori-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru0-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru5-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru6-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru10-bc9cc3c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru9-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru3-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru7-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru8-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-aru2-bc9cc3c2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-ljspeech-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt408-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt138-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt624-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt396-bc9cc3c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt498-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt132-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt288-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt42-bc9cc3c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quibble-lt90-bc9cc3c2.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi ai đó quá chú trọng tiểu tiết gây mất thời gian.', 'office', 1, 4),
('b57e51ce-c878-5f14-94f4-705d67c1fa61', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'co-sign', '/ˌkəʊˈsaɪn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'cùng ký tên vào một tài liệu, thường là để bảo lãnh.', 'to write your name on a document with another person to share financial responsibility.', 'Her parents had to co-sign the loan application because she didn\'t have enough credit history.', 'Cha mẹ cô ấy phải đồng ký vào đơn vay vì cô ấy không có đủ lịch sử tín dụng.', '{\"en\": \"You need a business partner to co-sign the office lease agreement this afternoon.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn cần một đối tác kinh doanh cùng ký hợp đồng thuê văn phòng chiều nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-ljspeech-42919eed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-cori-42919eed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/co-sign-cf7136d5.webp', '[\"endorse\", \"guarantee\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"co-sign a loan\", \"meaning\": \"cùng ký bảo lãnh khoản vay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"co-sign a lease\", \"meaning\": \"cùng ký hợp đồng thuê nhà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"countersign\", \"note_vi\": \"countersign là ký xác nhận sau khi người khác đã ký\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"co-signer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-cori-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru0-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru5-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru6-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru10-42919eed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru9-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru3-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru7-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru8-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-aru2-42919eed.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-ljspeech-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt408-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt138-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt624-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt396-42919eed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt498-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt132-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt288-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt42-42919eed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co-sign-lt90-42919eed.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố co- nghĩa là cùng nhau, co-sign là cùng ký tên.', 'finance', 1, 5),
('399ef3bb-e75f-5c80-9e7b-063b0c75bc6e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'superb', '/suːˈpɜːb/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tuyệt hảo, xuất sắc, rất ấn tượng.', 'of extremely high quality, excellent, or very impressive in appearance.', 'The new manager delivered a superb presentation regarding the company\'s expansion strategy.', 'Vị quản lý mới đã trình bày một bài thuyết trình tuyệt vời về chiến lược mở rộng của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel received superb reviews from guests for its outstanding customer service.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã nhận được những đánh giá tuyệt vời từ khách hàng vì dịch vụ chăm sóc khách hàng xuất sắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-ljspeech-e394f7be.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-cori-e394f7be.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/superb-17e2c493.webp', '[\"excellent\", \"outstanding\", \"magnificent\"]', '[\"poor\", \"inferior\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"superb service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ tuyệt hảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"superb performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn trình diễn xuất sắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"super\", \"note_vi\": \"super là cực kỳ (phó từ) hoặc siêu đẳng (tính từ thông tục)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"superbly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-cori-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru0-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru5-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru6-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru10-e394f7be.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru9-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru3-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru7-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru8-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-aru2-e394f7be.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-ljspeech-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt408-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt138-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt624-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt396-e394f7be.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt498-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt132-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt288-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt42-e394f7be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superb-lt90-e394f7be.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen ngợi chất lượng dịch vụ hoặc sản phẩm cực kỳ tốt.', 'travel', 1, 6),
('d971f15c-8fd2-517c-9405-f93736ec6ca6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'enchanted', '/ɪnˈtʃɑːntɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Bị mê hoặc, say đắm, đầy quyến rũ.', 'feeling great pleasure or being very attracted by something that is beautiful or interesting.', 'The children were enchanted by the magician\'s tricks and illusions.', 'Lũ trẻ bị mê hoặc bởi những trò ảo thuật và ảo ảnh của nhà ảo thuật.', '{\"en\": \"The clients were truly enchanted by the elegant design of our new office building interior.\", \"vi\": \"Các khách hàng thực sự bị mê hoặc bởi thiết kế thanh lịch bên trong tòa nhà văn phòng mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-ljspeech-baf07713.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-cori-baf07713.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enchanted-5d216a40.webp', '[\"charmed\", \"captivated\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply enchanted\", \"meaning\": \"bị mê hoặc sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enchanted by\", \"meaning\": \"bị quyến rũ bởi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"enchant\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enchantment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-cori-baf07713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-aru0-baf07713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-aru5-baf07713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-aru6-baf07713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-aru10-baf07713.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-aru9-baf07713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-aru3-baf07713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-aru7-baf07713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enchanted-aru8-baf07713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob