('687ede35-ec99-55d2-a417-9d0af30bb231', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'lumpy', '/ˈlʌmpi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều cục, không mịn hoặc không đều.', 'full of solid pieces or not having a smooth shape or texture.', 'The old mattress felt lumpy and uncomfortable after years of heavy use.', 'Chiếc nệm cũ cảm thấy vón cục và khó chịu sau nhiều năm sử dụng nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"The customer complained that the hotel mattress was lumpy and very uncomfortable.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng phàn nàn rằng nệm của khách sạn bị vón cục và rất khó chịu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-ljspeech-9c347cff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-cori-9c347cff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lumpy-265f828e.webp', '[\"bumpy\", \"uneven\"]', '[\"smooth\", \"flat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lumpy mattress\", \"meaning\": \"nệm bị vón cục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lumpy sauce\", \"meaning\": \"nước sốt bị vón cục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bumpy\", \"note_vi\": \"gồ ghề (đường đi), còn lumpy là vón cục (chất lỏng, nệm)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lump\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lump\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-cori-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru0-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru5-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru6-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru10-9c347cff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru9-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru3-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru7-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru8-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-aru2-9c347cff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-ljspeech-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt408-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt138-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt624-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt396-9c347cff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt498-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt132-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt288-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt42-9c347cff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lumpy-lt90-9c347cff.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cho đồ ăn dạng lỏng/bột hoặc bề mặt đệm, gối.', 'dining', 1, 11),
('22656183-cd5e-5ad8-bd05-d462937e3206', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'catapult', '/ˈkætəpʌlt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Máy bắn đá cổ đại dùng để phóng vật thể lớn.', 'a historical weapon used to throw large objects at buildings or enemy forces.', 'Medieval armies used a catapult to hurl large stones at enemy castle walls.', 'Các đội quân thời Trung cổ đã sử dụng máy bắn đá để ném những tảng đá lớn vào tường thành của kẻ thù.', '{\"en\": \"The museum exhibit displayed an ancient catapult used during historical battles to defend city walls.\", \"vi\": \"Triển lãm bảo tàng đã trưng bày một chiếc máy bắn đá cổ đại được sử dụng trong các trận chiến lịch sử để bảo vệ tường thành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-ljspeech-c812fca9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-cori-c812fca9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catapult-7368e47a.webp', '[\"slingshot\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ancient catapult\", \"meaning\": \"máy bắn đá cổ đại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"operate a catapult\", \"meaning\": \"vận hành máy bắn đá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"catapult\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-cori-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru0-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru5-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru6-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru10-c812fca9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru9-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru3-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru7-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru8-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-aru2-c812fca9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-ljspeech-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt408-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt138-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt624-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt396-c812fca9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt498-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt132-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt288-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt42-c812fca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catapult-lt90-c812fca9.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng: \'catapult someone to success\' (đưa ai đó lên đỉnh cao nhanh chóng).', 'academic', 1, 12),
('f2314740-4308-59b1-8f81-c8b28e1a8b18', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'adjournment', '/əˈdʒɜːnmənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hành động tạm dừng một cuộc họp, phiên tòa hoặc hoạt động khác.', 'a short period of time when a meeting or court case is stopped.', 'The committee agreed on a brief adjournment before voting on the proposed budget.', 'Ủy ban đã đồng ý tạm hoãn một thời gian ngắn trước khi bỏ phiếu cho ngân sách đề xuất.', '{\"en\": \"The committee chairman called for an adjournment to review the latest financial report details.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ tịch ủy ban đã yêu cầu tạm dừng cuộc họp để xem xét các chi tiết báo cáo tài chính mới nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-ljspeech-6fe1403d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-cori-6fe1403d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/adjournment-b2b8d3f3.webp', '[\"recess\", \"suspension\"]', '[\"continuation\", \"resumption\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"call for an adjournment\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu tạm dừng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brief adjournment\", \"meaning\": \"sự tạm dừng ngắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"adjourn\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-cori-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru0-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru5-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru6-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru10-6fe1403d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru9-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru3-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru7-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru8-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-aru2-6fe1403d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-ljspeech-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt408-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt138-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt624-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt396-6fe1403d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt498-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt132-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt288-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt42-6fe1403d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjournment-lt90-6fe1403d.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng nhiều trong văn phong hành chính và pháp lý.', 'office', 1, 13),
('b75c2351-d71e-5a82-873c-58779aa561ff', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'belt-tightening', '/ˈbɛltˌtaɪt.n̩.ɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động cắt giảm chi phí hoặc chi tiêu do khó khăn tài chính.', 'the act of spending less money because of financial trouble.', 'Rising operational expenses forced the university board to enforce strict belt-tightening measures.', 'Chi phí hoạt động gia tăng đã buộc hội đồng đại học phải thực thi các biện pháp thắt lưng buộc bụng nghiêm ngặt.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel implemented belt-tightening measures such as reducing weekend staff shifts.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã áp dụng các biện pháp thắt lưng buộc bụng như giảm ca cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-ljspeech-6fff2d26.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-cori-6fff2d26.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/belt-tightening-3f7428ca.webp', '[\"cost-cutting\", \"austerity\", \"retrenchment\"]', '[\"extravagance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severe belt-tightening\", \"meaning\": \"thắt lưng buộc bụng nghiêm ngặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"belt-tightening measures\", \"meaning\": \"các biện pháp cắt giảm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"period of belt-tightening\", \"meaning\": \"giai đoạn thắt chi tiêu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-cori-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru0-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru5-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru6-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru10-6fff2d26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru9-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru3-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru7-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru8-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-aru2-6fff2d26.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-ljspeech-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt408-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt138-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt624-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt396-6fff2d26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt498-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt132-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt288-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt42-6fff2d26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belt-tightening-lt90-6fff2d26.mp3\"]}}', 'Đến từ idiom \'thắt lưng buộc bụng\', chỉ cắt giảm chi tiêu.', 'finance', 1, 14),
('849b499d-4a3b-5d55-8158-2ab52e3b37e3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '158083aa-b35e-5b7f-a4cc-0cf7cc27ae6a', '59e32933-b7f5-5ff1-af57-4a94cf66521e', 'prevalence', 'UK: /ˈprɛvələns/ | US: /ˈprɛvələns/', 'C1', 'noun', 'sự phổ biến, thịnh hành', 'the state or condition of being widespread, common, or frequently occurring at a given time', 'The prevalence of digital marketing has increased.', 'Sự phổ biến của tiếp thị kỹ thuật số đã gia tăng.', '{\"en\": \"The prevalence of remote work options has increased significantly after the digital transformation.\", \"vi\": \"Sự phổ biến của lựa chọn làm việc từ xa đã tăng lên đáng kể sau quá trình chuyển đổi số.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-ljspeech-eb59112e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-cori-eb59112e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prevalence-d9ed27af.webp', '[\"widespreadness\", \"commonness\", \"pervasiveness\", \"ubiquity\"]', '[\"rarity\", \"scarcity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high prevalence\", \"meaning\": \"tỷ lệ phổ biến cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"growing prevalence\", \"meaning\": \"sự phổ biến ngày càng tăng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"prevalent\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prevail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-cori-eb59112e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-aru0-eb59112e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-aru5-eb59112e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-aru6-eb59112e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-aru10-eb59112e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-aru9-eb59112e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-aru3-eb59112e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevalence-aru7-eb59112e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat