('573cac60-33e9-5383-9a46-6f11d489ed5e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1e6e7e19-02a4-5d38-85a0-9692c9abf84f', 'f3805459-1d03-567f-a5ed-556ac7c32527', 'hydrocarbon', '/ˌhaɪdrəˈkɑːbən/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hợp chất hữu cơ chỉ chứa nguyên tố hydro và carbon.', 'An organic chemical substance composed exclusively of carbon and hydrogen elements, forming petroleum and natural gas.', 'Petroleum is a complex mixture of various hydrocarbons.', 'Dầu mỏ là một hỗn hợp phức tạp của nhiều hydrocarbon khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The chemical factory must monitor and reduce its hydrocarbon emissions to comply with new environmental laws.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy hóa chất phải giám sát và giảm lượng khí thải hydrocacbon để tuân thủ luật môi trường mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-ljspeech-4c00003d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-cori-4c00003d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hydrocarbon-fc82280a.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hydrocarbon emissions\", \"meaning\": \"lượng khí thải hydrocacbon\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chlorinated hydrocarbon\", \"meaning\": \"hydrocacbon clo hóa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-cori-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru0-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru5-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru6-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru10-4c00003d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru9-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru3-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru7-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru8-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-aru2-4c00003d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-ljspeech-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt408-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt138-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt624-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt396-4c00003d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt498-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt132-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt288-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt42-4c00003d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hydrocarbon-lt90-4c00003d.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghép từ hydro (nước/hydro) và carbon. Đây là thành phần chính của dầu mỏ và khí đốt.', 'manufacturing', 1, 7),
('d85ae63a-cc01-540c-977d-92cc18cf04c3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1e6e7e19-02a4-5d38-85a0-9692c9abf84f', 'f3805459-1d03-567f-a5ed-556ac7c32527', 'confit', '/kɒnˈfiːt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Món ăn được nấu chậm trong mỡ của chính nó hoặc trong si-rô để bảo quản và tạo hương vị.', 'meat or fruit cooked slowly in its own fat or sugar syrup to preserve it.', 'Duck confit is a classic French dish, known for its rich flavor and tender meat.', 'Confit vịt là một món ăn Pháp cổ điển, nổi tiếng với hương vị đậm đà và thịt mềm.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant features duck confit on its dinner menu for visiting business clients.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng khách sạn phục vụ món vịt hầm mỡ trên thực đơn bữa tối cho các khách hàng doanh nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-ljspeech-bd7a0ff8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-cori-bd7a0ff8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confit-904f3ae6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"duck confit\", \"meaning\": \"món vịt confit (nấu chậm trong mỡ)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"garlic confit\", \"meaning\": \"tỏi confit\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comfit\", \"note_vi\": \"Kẹo hạt bọc đường, khác với món confit nấu trong mỡ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-cori-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru0-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru5-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru6-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru10-bd7a0ff8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru9-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru3-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru7-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru8-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-aru2-bd7a0ff8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-ljspeech-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt408-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt138-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt624-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt396-bd7a0ff8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt498-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt132-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt288-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt42-bd7a0ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confit-lt90-bd7a0ff8.mp3\"]}}', 'Món ăn truyền thống của Pháp, thực phẩm được hầm chậm trong dầu mỡ hoặc si-rô.', 'dining', 1, 8),
('eab9e272-af4d-5f57-840f-233a316a6d43', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1e6e7e19-02a4-5d38-85a0-9692c9abf84f', 'f3805459-1d03-567f-a5ed-556ac7c32527', 'ethereal', '/ɪˈθɪəriəl/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Nhẹ nhàng, thanh thoát, tinh tế như không khí hoặc cõi thần tiên.', 'extremely light and delicate in a way that seems not of this world.', 'Her voice had an ethereal quality that captivated everyone in the room.', 'Giọng hát của cô ấy có một vẻ thanh tao đã mê hoặc mọi người trong phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The resort advertisement featured ethereal imagery of foggy mountains to attract wealthy travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Quảng cáo khu nghỉ dưỡng sử dụng hình ảnh thanh thoát của những ngọn núi sương mù để thu hút du khách giàu có.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-ljspeech-877559c5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-cori-877559c5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ethereal-18d98629.webp', '[\"delicate\", \"heavenly\", \"graceful\"]', '[\"earthly\", \"substantial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ethereal beauty\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ đẹp thanh thoát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ethereal music\", \"meaning\": \"âm nhạc du dương, nhẹ nhàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ethereally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-cori-877559c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-aru0-877559c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-aru5-877559c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-aru6-877559c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-aru10-877559c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-aru9-877559c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-aru3-877559c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-aru7-877559c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethereal-aru8-877559c5.