('c0c24426-63cb-55b5-8c77-2a49b1471a12', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1e6e7e19-02a4-5d38-85a0-9692c9abf84f', 'f3805459-1d03-567f-a5ed-556ac7c32527', 'anticyclone', '/ˌæntiˈsaɪkləʊn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống thời tiết có áp suất cao, thường mang lại thời tiết ổn định, quang đãng.', 'an area of high atmospheric pressure that usually brings calm, clear weather.', 'The anticyclone brought clear skies and calm weather for several days.', 'Vùng áp cao đã mang lại bầu trời quang đãng và thời tiết lặng gió trong nhiều ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency reported that a large anticyclone would ensure sunny weather for the cruise.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty lữ hành báo cáo rằng một vùng áp cao lớn sẽ đảm bảo thời tiết nắng ráo cho chuyến du thuyền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-ljspeech-2d111c8b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-cori-2d111c8b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anticyclone-fb1daa0c.webp', '[\"high-pressure system\"]', '[\"cyclone\", \"depression\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strong anticyclone\", \"meaning\": \"vùng áp cao mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"winter anticyclone\", \"meaning\": \"vùng áp cao mùa đông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cyclone\", \"note_vi\": \"cyclone là vùng áp thấp gây bão, anticyclone là vùng áp cao thời tiết đẹp.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-cori-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru0-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru5-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru6-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru10-2d111c8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru9-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru3-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru7-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru8-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-aru2-2d111c8b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-ljspeech-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt408-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt138-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt624-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt396-2d111c8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt498-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt132-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt288-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt42-2d111c8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticyclone-lt90-2d111c8b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố anti- nghĩa là ngược lại, anticyclone ngược với cyclone (bão/áp thấp).', 'nature', 1, 10),
('97cc2a8b-e89e-5764-b3bf-402da4d002e5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1e6e7e19-02a4-5d38-85a0-9692c9abf84f', 'f3805459-1d03-567f-a5ed-556ac7c32527', 'lackluster', '/ˈlæklʌstə(r)/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Thiếu sức sống, không ấn tượng, mờ nhạt.', 'lacking energy, excitement, or quality, making it seem dull or uninteresting.', 'The team gave a rather lackluster performance in the first half of the game.', 'Đội đã thể hiện một màn trình diễn khá mờ nhạt trong hiệp một của trận đấu.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported lackluster sales figures for the third quarter due to weak market demand.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã báo cáo số liệu bán hàng mờ nhạt trong quý ba do nhu cầu thị trường yếu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-ljspeech-b9134314.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-cori-b9134314.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lackluster-3c2a2ff9.webp', '[\"uninspired\", \"dull\"]', '[\"impressive\", \"brilliant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lackluster performance\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu suất kém\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lackluster results\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả mờ nhạt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-cori-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru0-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru5-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru6-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru10-b9134314.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru9-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru3-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru7-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru8-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-aru2-b9134314.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-ljspeech-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt408-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt138-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt624-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt396-b9134314.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt498-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt132-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt288-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt42-b9134314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackluster-lt90-b9134314.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay gặp trong các báo cáo tài chính để mô tả kết quả kinh doanh kém.', 'finance', 1, 11),
('802d11d4-e111-5603-ac5f-892523c432ba', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1e6e7e19-02a4-5d38-85a0-9692c9abf84f', 'f3805459-1d03-567f-a5ed-556ac7c32527', 'inaugural', '/ɪˈnɔːɡjərəl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Buổi lễ chính thức đầu tiên, đặc biệt là lễ nhậm chức.', 'the first official event or speech marking the beginning of a new period or role.', 'The president delivered a hopeful speech at his inaugural.', 'Tổng thống đã có một bài phát biểu đầy hy vọng tại lễ nhậm chức của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO gave an inspiring speech during the inaugural ceremony of the new branch office.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã có bài phát biểu đầy cảm hứng trong buổi lễ khai trương chi nhánh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-ljspeech-7e1b1d1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-cori-7e1b1d1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inaugural-0a53fc47.webp', '[\"opening\", \"commencement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"inaugural ceremony\", \"meaning\": \"buổi lễ nhậm chức/khai trương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inaugural speech\", \"meaning\": \"bài phát biểu đầu tiên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"inaugurate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-cori-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru0-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru5-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru6-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru10-7e1b1d1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru9-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru3-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru7-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru8-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-aru2-7e1b1d1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-ljspeech-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt408-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt138-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt624-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt396-7e1b1d1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt498-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt132-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt288-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt42-7e1b1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inaugural-lt90-7e1b1d1d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các sự kiện trang trọng của công ty hoặc chính phủ.', 'business', 1, 12),
('ea2e87bd-8e97-5c9e-8d63-29886d308fe7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1e6e7e19-02a4-5d38-85a0-9692c9abf84f', 'f3805459-1d03-567f-a5ed-556ac7c32527', 'emaciated', '/ɪˈmeɪsieɪtɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Cực kỳ gầy yếu, xanh xao do thiếu ăn hoặc bệnh tật.', 'extremely thin and weak due to lack of food or serious illness.', 'The stray dog was emaciated and weak when it was found by the shelter volunteers.', 'Con chó hoang gầy gò và yếu ớt khi được các tình nguyện viên của trại cứu hộ tìm thấy.', '{\"en\": \"The rescued workers looked emaciated after being trapped without food for days.\", \"vi\": \"Những công nhân được giải cứu trông cực kỳ gầy yếu sau nhiều ngày bị mắc kẹt không có thức ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-ljspeech-8bfaed84.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-cori-8bfaed84.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/emaciated-26e2323e.webp', '[\"gaunt\", \"skeletal\", \"wasted\"]', '[\"obese\", \"plump\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"emaciated body\", \"meaning\": \"thân thể gầy yếu, xanh xao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"emaciated figure\", \"meaning\": \"dáng người tiều tụy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look emaciated\", \"meaning\": \"trông gầy yếu, xanh xao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exhausted\", \"note_vi\": \"exhausted là kiệt sức, không nhất thiết gầy yếu về thể chất\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"emaciate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"emaciation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-cori-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru0-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru5-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru6-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru10-8bfaed84.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru9-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru3-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru7-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru8-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-aru2-8bfaed84.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-ljspeech-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt408-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt138-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt624-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt396-8bfaed84.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt498-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt132-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt288-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt42-8bfaed84.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/emaciated-lt90-8bfaed84.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng để mô tả người hoặc động vật bị suy dinh dưỡng nghiêm trọng, không dùng cho đồ vật.', 'health', 1, 13),
('e882aff2-e033-5746-8248-4216c442ef08', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1e6e7e19-02a4-5d38-85a0-9692c9abf84f', 'f3805459-1d03-567f-a5ed-556ac7c32527', 'cracker', '/ˈkrækə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loại bánh nướng mỏng, giòn, thường ăn kèm với phô mai hoặc đồ nhúng.', 'a thin, dry, and crisp piece of baked food that is often eaten as a snack.', 'She enjoyed a light snack of cheese and crackers with her afternoon tea.', 'Cô ấy thưởng thức một bữa ăn nhẹ gồm phô mai và bánh quy giòn với trà chiều.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service provided a platter of gourmet crackers and cheese for the afternoon meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống đã cung cấp một đĩa bánh quy giòn cao cấp và phô mai cho cuộc họp buổi chiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-ljspeech-1c4cb48e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-cori-1c4cb48e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cracker-b9eb26c1.webp', '[\"biscuit\", \"wafer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cheese and crackers\", \"meaning\": \"phô mai và bánh quy giòn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"salty cracker\", \"meaning\": \"bánh quy mặn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cracker\", \"note_vi\": \"Trong công nghệ, cracker là người bẻ khóa phần mềm, khác với bánh quy. (hacker)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-cori-1c4cb48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-aru0-1c4cb48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-aru5-1c4cb48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-aru6-1c4cb48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-aru10-1c4cb48e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-aru9-1c4cb48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-aru3-1c4cb48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-aru7-1c4cb48e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cracker-aru8-1c4cb48e.m