('3921bc8f-6894-507c-b839-3fd1ba792fd8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'witness tampering', '/ˈwɪt.nəs ˈtæm.pə.rɪŋ/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hành vi cố ý tác động đến lời khai của nhân chứng để thay đổi kết quả vụ án.', 'the illegal act of trying to influence what a person tells the court.', 'The defendant was also charged with witness tampering after allegedly threatening a key witness.', 'Bị cáo cũng bị buộc tội can thiệp nhân chứng sau khi bị cáo buộc đe dọa một nhân chứng quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department warned employees that witness tampering during investigations carries severe penalties.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận pháp lý cảnh báo nhân viên rằng việc mua chuộc nhân chứng trong quá trình điều tra sẽ chịu mức phạt nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-ljspeech-309a237e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-cori-309a237e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/witness-tampering-4ec61cd4.webp', '[\"obstruction of justice\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"charge with witness tampering\", \"meaning\": \"buộc tội tác động nhân chứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"allegations of witness tampering\", \"meaning\": \"cáo buộc tác động nhân chứng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"jury tampering\", \"note_vi\": \"Jury tampering là tác động đến bồi thẩm đoàn, còn witness tampering là tác động đến nhân chứng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-cori-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru0-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru5-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru6-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru10-309a237e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru9-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru3-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru7-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru8-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-aru2-309a237e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-ljspeech-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt408-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt138-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt624-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt396-309a237e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt498-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt132-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt288-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt42-309a237e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witness-tampering-lt90-309a237e.mp3\"]}}', 'Tamper (động từ) là can thiệp trái phép, witness tampering là tội danh pháp lý nghiêm trọng.', 'law', 1, 6),
('26b20b3a-984f-506f-a00b-fa359feca605', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'mediocre', '/ˌmiːdiˈəʊkə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tầm thường, không xuất sắc, chỉ ở mức trung bình.', 'not very good, but not completely bad, just at an average or acceptable level of quality.', 'The new restaurant received mediocre reviews despite its expensive menu items.', 'Nhà hàng mới nhận được những đánh giá tầm thường dù các món ăn trên thực đơn có giá đắt.', '{\"en\": \"The quality of the report was mediocre, so the supervisor asked for a complete revision.\", \"vi\": \"Chất lượng bản báo cáo chỉ ở mức trung bình, nên giám sát đã yêu cầu sửa lại toàn bộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-ljspeech-962e42f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-cori-962e42f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mediocre-04f3e625.webp', '[\"average\", \"ordinary\"]', '[\"excellent\", \"outstanding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mediocre performance\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu suất trung bình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mediocre result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả tầm thường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mediocrity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-cori-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru0-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru5-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru6-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru10-962e42f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru9-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru3-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru7-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru8-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-aru2-962e42f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-ljspeech-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt408-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt138-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt624-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt396-962e42f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt498-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt132-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt288-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt42-962e42f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mediocre-lt90-962e42f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để phê bình công việc khi kết quả không đạt kỳ vọng.', 'business', 1, 7),
('8e1c12be-07b7-561b-90af-c0da618be058', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'ebb', '/eb/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự suy yếu, giảm sút, hoặc rút đi (như thủy triều).', 'a period when something becomes smaller or weaker, or when the sea moves away from land.', 'We could feel the ebb of the tide as the water receded from the shore.', 'Chúng tôi có thể cảm nhận được sự rút xuống của thủy triều khi nước rút khỏi bờ.', '{\"en\": \"The retail store experienced an ebb in customer traffic during the heavy winter snowstorm last week.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng bán lẻ đã trải qua sự sụt giảm lượng khách hàng trong trận bão tuyết mùa đông dữ dội tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-ljspeech-8e863647.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-cori-8e863647.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ebb-baa82765.webp', '[\"decline\", \"decrease\", \"retreat\"]', '[\"flow\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ebb and flow\", \"meaning\": \"sự thăng trầm, lúc lên lúc xuống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at a low ebb\", \"meaning\": \"ở tình trạng tồi tệ, suy yếu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ebb\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-cori-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru0-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru5-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru6-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru10-8e863647.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru9-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru3-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru7-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru8-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-aru2-8e863647.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-ljspeech-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt408-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt138-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt624-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt396-8e863647.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt498-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt132-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt288-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt42-8e863647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ebb-lt90-8e863647.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \"ebb and flow\" rất hay gặp trong bài đọc TOEIC về kinh tế.', 'business', 1, 8),
('e9761593-b66a-5956-a508-b2061a372380', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'torque', '/tɔːk/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Mô-men xoắn, lực làm quay một vật quanh trục.', 'a force that causes something to turn or spin around a central point.', 'The engine\'s high torque allows the car to accelerate quickly.', 'Mô-men xoắn cao của động cơ cho phép xe tăng tốc nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"The new manufacturing equipment requires a motor with high torque to operate efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết bị sản xuất mới yêu cầu một động cơ có mô-men xoắn cao để hoạt động hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-ljspeech-2acb323e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-cori-2acb323e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/torque-87745e04.webp', '[\"force\", \"rotation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high torque\", \"meaning\": \"mô-men xoắn cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maximum torque\", \"meaning\": \"mô-men xoắn cực đại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"torch\", \"note_vi\": \"torch là ngọn đuốc hoặc đèn pin, không phải lực quay.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-cori-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru0-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru5-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru6-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru10-2acb323e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru9-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru3-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru7-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru8-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-aru2-2acb323e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-ljspeech-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt408-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt138-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt624-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt396-2acb323e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt498-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt132-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt288-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt42-2acb323e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/torque-lt90-2acb323e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong các bài đọc về kỹ thuật, bảo trì máy móc hoặc sản xuất.', 'manufacturing', 1, 9),
('38035c42-fd64-5898-867e-921d835dffa8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'backstabbing', '/ˈbækˌstæbɪŋ/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hành động phản bội, nói xấu sau lưng người khác.', 'the act of saying harmful things about someone when they are not there to hear.', 'The office was full of gossip and backstabbing, making it an unpleasant place to work.', 'Văn phòng đầy rẫy những lời đồn đại và sự đâm sau lưng, khiến nó trở thành một nơi làm việc khó chịu.', '{\"en\": \"To prevent toxic backstabbing, the HR department introduced new guidelines for professional workplace communication.\", \"vi\": \"Để ngăn chặn tình trạng nói xấu sau lưng độc hại, phòng nhân sự đã giới thiệu các hướng dẫn mới về giao tiếp chuyên nghiệp tại nơi làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-ljspeech-1130580a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-cori-1130580a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/backstabbing-984af098.webp', '[\"betrayal\", \"treachery\", \"double-crossing\"]', '[\"loyalty\", \"supportiveness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"office backstabbing\", \"meaning\": \"sự nói xấu sau lưng nơi công sở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"victim of backstabbing\", \"meaning\": \"nạn nhân của sự đâm sau lưng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"backstab\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"backstabber\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-cori-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru0-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru5-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru6-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru10-1130580a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru9-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru3-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru7-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru8-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-aru2-1130580a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-ljspeech-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt408-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt138-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt624-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt396-1130580a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt498-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt132-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt288-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt42-1130580a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backstabbing-lt90-1130580a.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghép từ back (lưng) và stab (đâm), nghĩa đen là đâm sau lưng, nghĩa bóng là phản bội.', 'hr', 1, 10),
('d9f5d29a-805a-531d-8beb-8d52791ce081', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'bottom line', '/ˈbɒtəm laɪn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kết quả cuối cùng, điều quan trọng nhất hoặc lợi nhuận ròng của một doanh nghiệp.', 'the final result or the most important fact in a business situation.', 'The bottom line is that we need to increase our sales by at least 10% this quarter.', 'Mấu chốt là chúng ta cần tăng doanh số bán hàng ít nhất 10% trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The bottom line is that we must reduce operational costs to remain profitable this year.\", \"vi\": \"Điểm mấu chốt là chúng ta phải giảm chi phí vận hành để duy trì lợi nhuận trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-ljspeech-63fe27ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-cori-63fe27ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bottom-line-8bbe18ef.webp', '[\"net profit\", \"final result\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"the bottom line\", \"meaning\": \"điểm mấu chốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impact the bottom line\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng đến lợi nhuận\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-cori-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru0-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru5-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru6-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru10-63fe27ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru9-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru3-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru7-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru8-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-aru2-63fe27ce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-ljspeech-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt408-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt138-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt624-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt396-63fe27ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt498-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt132-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt288-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt42-63fe27ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bottom-line-lt90-63fe27ce.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong các cuộc họp kinh doanh và báo cáo tài chính.', 'finance', 1, 11),
('a6b11cce-7853-59aa-89f6-f8fc608c97f1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'practicum', '/ˈpræk.tɪ.kəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một khóa học thực hành hoặc giai đoạn thực tập trong một lĩnh vực cụ thể.', 'a practical section of a course of study where students work in a real environment.', 'Students are required to complete a practicum in a local hospital as part of their medical training.', 'Sinh viên được yêu cầu hoàn thành một đợt thực tập tại một bệnh viện địa phương như một phần của khóa đào tạo y tế của họ.', '{\"en\": \"All nursing candidates must complete a six-week practicum at the city hospital before graduation.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các ứng viên điều dưỡng phải hoàn thành kỳ thực tập sáu tuần tại bệnh viện thành phố trước khi tốt nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-ljspeech-7c8105d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-cori-7c8105d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/practicum-e9885bdf.webp', '[\"internship\", \"placement\", \"training\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"teaching practicum\", \"meaning\": \"thực tập giảng dạy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clinical practicum\", \"meaning\": \"thực tập lâm sàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"practical\", \"note_vi\": \"practical là tính từ (thực tế), practicum là danh từ (kỳ thực tập).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"practical\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"practice\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-cori-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru0-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru5-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru6-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru10-7c8105d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru9-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru3-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru7-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru8-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-aru2-7c8105d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-ljspeech-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt408-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt138-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt624-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt396-7c8105d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt498-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt132-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt288-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt42-7c8105d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practicum-lt90-7c8105d5.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng trong môi trường học thuật, đặc biệt là ngành y hoặc giáo dục.', 'education', 1, 12),
('53c33433-ec69-5331-aa6b-2db3b7fab8a5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'dynasty', '/ˈdɪnəsti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một dòng dõi các nhà cai trị thuộc cùng một gia đình trong một thời gian dài.', 'a series of rulers who belong to the same family for a long period.', 'Archaeologists discovered ancient artifacts belonging to a powerful Egyptian dynasty.', 'Các nhà khảo cổ học đã phát hiện những cổ vật thuộc về một triều đại Ai Cập hùng mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The museum is hosting an exhibition of ancient pottery from the Han dynasty this month.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo tàng đang tổ chức một cuộc triển lãm đồ gốm cổ từ triều đại nhà Hán trong tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-ljspeech-e71e137b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-cori-e71e137b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dynasty-d2c9a4ab.webp', '[\"empire\", \"lineage\", \"house\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ruling dynasty\", \"meaning\": \"triều đại cai trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"found a dynasty\", \"meaning\": \"sáng lập một triều đại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"destiny\", \"note_vi\": \"vận mệnh, số phận\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dynastic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-cori-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru0-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru5-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru6-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru10-e71e137b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru9-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru3-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru7-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru8-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-aru2-e71e137b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-ljspeech-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt408-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt138-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt624-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt396-e71e137b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt498-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt132-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt288-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt42-e71e137b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dynasty-lt90-e71e137b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm là /ˈdɪnəsti/ (Anh) hoặc /ˈdaɪnəsti/ (Mỹ), nghĩa là triều đại.', 'other', 1, 13),
('006dce41-d395-5c27-adc4-5f5755d7acf5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'incumbent', '/ɪnˈkʌmbənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Người đang giữ một chức vụ hoặc vị trí chính thức.', 'a person who currently holds an official position or office.', 'The incumbent mayor is seeking re-election for a second term.', 'Thị trưởng đương nhiệm đang tìm cách tái cử nhiệm kỳ thứ hai.', '{\"en\": \"The incumbent will be responsible for training the new staff members before retiring next month.\", \"vi\": \"Người đương nhiệm sẽ chịu trách nhiệm đào tạo nhân viên mới trước khi nghỉ hưu vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-ljspeech-680abe58.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-cori-680abe58.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/incumbent-f039f4b5.webp', '[\"officeholder\", \"occupant\"]', '[\"challenger\", \"candidate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"the present incumbent\", \"meaning\": \"người đương nhiệm hiện tại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"incumbency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-cori-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru0-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru5-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru6-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru10-680abe58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru9-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru3-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru7-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru8-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-aru2-680abe58.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-ljspeech-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt408-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt138-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt624-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt396-680abe58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt498-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt132-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt288-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt42-680abe58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incumbent-lt90-680abe58.mp3\"]}}', '', 'hr', 1, 14),
('effa4a77-7d07-575c-a642-7a6eb9bc0334', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1f488a52-1983-58fc-b292-98d6b798d1e4', '3b1fa9e4-af06-5a63-acc8-f160511422d9', 'fatigued', '/fəˈtiːɡd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy rất mệt mỏi, kiệt sức về thể chất hoặc tinh thần.', 'feeling extremely tired and lacking energy due to hard work or a long period of activity.', 'The drivers felt severely fatigued following their overnight journey across the country.', 'Những người tài xế cảm thấy rất kiệt sức sau chuyến đi xuyên quốc gia suốt đêm.', '{\"en\": \"The staff felt quite fatigued after finishing the inventory audit late on Friday evening.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên cảm thấy khá mệt mỏi sau khi hoàn thành việc kiểm kê hàng hóa vào tối muộn thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-ljspeech-8c59601a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-cori-8c59601a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fatigued-ca37aa92.webp', '[\"exhausted\", \"weary\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"refreshed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fatigued from\", \"meaning\": \"mệt mỏi vì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mentally fatigued\", \"meaning\": \"mệt mỏi về tinh thần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fatiguing\", \"note_vi\": \"Fatiguing là tính từ chỉ nguyên nhân gây mệt, fatigued chỉ trạng thái.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fatigue\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fatigue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-cori-8c59601a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-aru0-8c59601a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-aru5-8c59601a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-aru6-8c59601a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-aru10-8c59601a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-aru9-8c59601a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigued-aru3-8c59601a.mp3\", \"/sto