('0154b848-29fe-5eba-978c-df11b7796ca1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'stately', '/ˈsteɪtli/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Oai vệ, trang trọng và ấn tượng.', 'formal, impressive, and dignified in appearance, size, or style, moving or standing in a grand manner.', 'The old mansion stood on the hill with a stately presence, overlooking the town.', 'Dinh thự cổ đứng trên đồi với vẻ uy nghiêm, nhìn xuống thị trấn.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate headquarters was built in a stately design to impress visiting international clients and investors.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở chính của tập đoàn được xây dựng theo thiết kế trang trọng nhằm gây ấn tượng với các khách hàng và nhà đầu tư quốc tế đến thăm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-ljspeech-66639ad9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-cori-66639ad9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stately-613461cd.webp', '[\"dignified\", \"majestic\", \"grand\"]', '[\"unimpressive\", \"modest\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stately home\", \"meaning\": \"dinh thự cổ kính nguy nga\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stately presence\", \"meaning\": \"dáng vẻ trang trọng oai vệ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"statewide\", \"note_vi\": \"statewide là trên toàn tiểu bang, stately là oai vệ, trang trọng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stateliness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-cori-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru0-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru5-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru6-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru10-66639ad9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru9-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru3-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru7-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru8-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-aru2-66639ad9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-ljspeech-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt408-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt138-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt624-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt396-66639ad9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt498-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt132-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt288-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt42-66639ad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stately-lt90-66639ad9.mp3\"]}}', 'Tuy có đuôi -ly nhưng stately là tính từ chứ không phải trạng từ.', 'housing', 1, 0),
('e7f959d4-d18d-5e59-8e4d-63adec191bda', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'stratosphere', '/ðə ˈstrætəsfɪə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Tầng khí quyển thứ hai của Trái Đất, nằm trên tầng đối lưu.', 'the layer of the atmosphere above the troposphere where ozone is found.', 'Ozone layer, which protects us from harmful UV rays, is located in the stratosphere.', 'Tầng ôzôn, bảo vệ chúng ta khỏi tia UV có hại, nằm trong tầng bình lưu.', '{\"en\": \"Commercial aircraft usually fly near the stratosphere to avoid bad weather conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Máy bay thương mại thường bay gần tầng bình lưu để tránh điều kiện thời tiết xấu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-ljspeech-74fbe5b5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-cori-74fbe5b5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stratosphere-51713e44.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"enter the stratosphere\", \"meaning\": \"đi vào tầng bình lưu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lower stratosphere\", \"meaning\": \"tầng bình lưu thấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"troposphere\", \"note_vi\": \"troposphere là tầng đối lưu (tầng thấp nhất của khí quyển)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stratospheric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-cori-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru0-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru5-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru6-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru10-74fbe5b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru9-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru3-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru7-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru8-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-aru2-74fbe5b5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-ljspeech-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt408-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt138-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt624-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt396-74fbe5b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt498-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt132-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt288-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt42-74fbe5b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratosphere-lt90-74fbe5b5.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tiếng Anh thương mại, \'stratospheric\' còn mang nghĩa tăng rất cao (về giá cả, chi phí).', 'nature', 1, 1),
('f1630ccf-66ae-5514-b2d2-71ad2166730c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'decongestant', '/ˌdiːkənˈdʒestənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Thuốc giúp giảm nghẹt mũi.', 'a medicine that helps clear a blocked nose so that breathing becomes easier.', 'I took a decongestant to clear my stuffy nose before the flight.', 'Tôi đã uống thuốc thông mũi để làm thông mũi tắc trước chuyến bay.', '{\"en\": \"The pharmacist recommended an effective nasal decongestant for the employee suffering from severe allergies.\", \"vi\": \"Dược sĩ đã giới thiệu một loại thuốc xịt giảm nghẹt mũi hiệu quả cho nhân viên bị dị ứng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-ljspeech-818e9a5e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-cori-818e9a5e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decongestant-c443e7dd.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"nasal decongestant\", \"meaning\": \"thuốc xịt giảm nghẹt mũi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a decongestant\", \"meaning\": \"dùng thuốc giảm nghẹt mũi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"painkiller\", \"note_vi\": \"Painkiller là thuốc giảm đau, không trị nghẹt mũi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"decongest\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"congestion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-cori-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru0-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru5-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru6-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru10-818e9a5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru9-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru3-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru7-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru8-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-aru2-818e9a5e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-ljspeech-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt408-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt138-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt624-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt396-818e9a5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt498-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt132-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt288-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt42-818e9a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decongestant-lt90-818e9a5e.mp3\"]}}', 'Gồm tiền tố de- (giảm) + congestion (tắc nghẽn).', 'health', 1, 2),
('f215a43b-5016-53e8-a8f2-c6f50264f19a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'spry', '/spraɪ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Nhanh nhẹn, năng động, đặc biệt ở người lớn tuổi.', 'active, lively, and moving quickly, especially used to describe older people.', 'Despite his age, the old man was still very spry and enjoyed his daily walks.', 'Mặc dù đã lớn tuổi, ông cụ vẫn rất nhanh nhẹn và thích đi bộ hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The spry retired manager still attends weekly team meetings and contributes great ideas.\", \"vi\": \"Vị quản lý đã nghỉ hưu nhưng vẫn nhanh nhẹn tham dự các cuộc họp nhóm hàng tuần và đóng góp nhiều ý tưởng hay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-ljspeech-e7c4ff71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-cori-e7c4ff71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spry-bf8ebe42.webp', '[\"agile\", \"nimble\", \"lively\"]', '[\"sluggish\", \"frail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spry old man\", \"meaning\": \"ông lão nhanh nhẹn, năng động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"still spry\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn còn nhanh nhẹn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remarkably spry\", \"meaning\": \"nhanh nhẹn một cách đáng kinh ngạc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spy\", \"note_vi\": \"spy là điệp viên hoặc theo dõi bí mật, hoàn toàn khác nghĩa\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-cori-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru0-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru5-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru6-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru10-e7c4ff71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru9-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru3-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru7-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru8-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-aru2-e7c4ff71.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-ljspeech-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt408-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt138-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt624-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt396-e7c4ff71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt498-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt132-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt288-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt42-e7c4ff71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spry-lt90-e7c4ff71.mp3\"]}}', 'Spry thường dùng khen ngợi người lớn tuổi vẫn còn năng động, ít dùng cho người trẻ.', 'hr', 1, 3),
('d9830216-77d3-54f4-b51d-672b8395cc5a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'unavailing', '/ˌʌnəˈveɪlɪŋ/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Không mang lại kết quả mong muốn, vô ích.', 'failing to achieve the desired result or producing no successful outcome despite effort.', 'Despite their best efforts, all their attempts to rescue the lost hiker proved unavailing.', 'Mặc dù đã cố gắng hết sức, mọi nỗ lực của họ để giải cứu người đi bộ bị lạc đều vô ích.', '{\"en\": \"Management made an unavailing attempt to reduce operation costs without cutting staff benefits.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý đã đưa ra nỗ lực vô ích nhằm giảm chi phí vận hành mà không cắt giảm phúc lợi nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-ljspeech-af04fe3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-cori-af04fe3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unavailing-141e162d.webp', '[\"futile\", \"useless\", \"ineffective\"]', '[\"fruitful\", \"successful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unavailing effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực vô ích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unavailing attempt\", \"meaning\": \"mưu toan bất thành\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unavailable\", \"note_vi\": \"unavailable nghĩa là không có sẵn hoặc bận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"avail\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"avail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-cori-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru0-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru5-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru6-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru10-af04fe3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru9-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru3-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru7-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru8-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-aru2-af04fe3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-ljspeech-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt408-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt138-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt624-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt396-af04fe3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt498-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt132-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt288-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt42-af04fe3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unavailing-lt90-af04fe3a.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm unavailing (vô ích) với unavailable (không có sẵn).', 'business', 1, 4),
('6e3ab201-f9e1-5ab6-8f69-756d13e5f34d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'terrestrial', '/təˈrestriəl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về Trái Đất hoặc sống trên mặt đất.', 'living on the land or relating to the earth rather than water or air.', 'Most animals we see daily are terrestrial creatures, unlike fish or birds.', 'Hầu hết các loài động vật chúng ta thấy hàng ngày đều là sinh vật sống trên cạn, không giống cá hay chim.', '{\"en\": \"The telecom company launched a new terrestrial broadcasting service for local businesses.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty viễn thông đã ra mắt một dịch vụ phát sóng mặt đất mới cho các doanh nghiệp địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-ljspeech-bf3bc1aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-cori-bf3bc1aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/terrestrial-fda1027f.webp', '[\"earthly\", \"land-based\"]', '[\"aquatic\", \"extraterrestrial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"terrestrial network\", \"meaning\": \"mạng lưới mặt đất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"terrestrial television\", \"meaning\": \"truyền hình mặt đất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"celestial\", \"note_vi\": \"celestial là thuộc về bầu trời hoặc vũ trụ, trái ngược với terrestrial.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"territory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-cori-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru0-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru5-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru6-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru10-bf3bc1aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru9-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru3-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru7-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru8-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-aru2-bf3bc1aa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-ljspeech-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt408-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt138-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt624-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt396-bf3bc1aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt498-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt132-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt288-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt42-bf3bc1aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/terrestrial-lt90-bf3bc1aa.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt terrestrial (trên mặt đất) với aquatic (dưới nước) và celestial (trên trời).', 'technology', 1, 5),
('e7d7d808-a8f5-549f-bdf8-6172a91d3ab5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'debut', 'UK: /ˈdeɪbjuː/ | US: /deɪˈbjuː/', 'C1', 'verb', 'ra mắt', 'To perform, appear, or present something publicly for the very first time.', 'The new product will debut at the industry trade show.', 'Sản phẩm mới sẽ ra mắt tại triển lãm thương mại ngành.', '{\"en\": \"The tech firm plans to debut its next-generation software at the annual expo.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty công nghệ có kế hoạch ra mắt phần mềm thế hệ tiếp theo tại triển lãm hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-ljspeech-502a2754.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-cori-502a2754.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/debut-6deb8ad7.webp', '[\"launch\", \"introduce\", \"unveil\", \"present\"]', '[\"withdraw\", \"retire\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"debut a product\", \"meaning\": \"ra mắt một sản phẩm mới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a debut\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện màn ra mắt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"debut\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-cori-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru0-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru5-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru6-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru10-502a2754.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru9-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru3-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru7-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru8-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-aru2-502a2754.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-ljspeech-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt408-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt138-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt624-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt396-502a2754.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt498-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt132-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt288-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt42-502a2754.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debut-lt90-502a2754.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm chữ \'t\' câm (/deɪˈbjuː/). Vừa là động từ vừa là danh từ (màn ra mắt).', 'marketing', 1, 6),
('20e22981-a5c1-5048-a695-ba54b3162d40', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'anomalous', '/əˈnɒmələs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Khác thường, không tuân theo quy tắc hoặc mong đợi.', 'different from what is usual, normal, or expected in a particular situation.', 'Scientists observed an anomalous reading on the sensor, suggesting something unusual was happening.', 'Các nhà khoa học đã quan sát thấy một chỉ số bất thường trên cảm biến, cho thấy điều gì đó không bình thường đang xảy ra.', '{\"en\": \"The auditor found some anomalous transactions in the company\'s financial records last month.\", \"vi\": \"Kiểm toán viên đã phát hiện một số giao dịch bất thường trong hồ sơ tài chính của công ty tháng trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-ljspeech-f94b2322.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-cori-f94b2322.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anomalous-c79f06d0.webp', '[\"abnormal\", \"atypical\", \"unusual\"]', '[\"normal\", \"typical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"anomalous results\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả bất thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"anomalous situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống bất thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"anonymous\", \"note_vi\": \"anonymous nghĩa là ẩn danh, vô danh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"anomaly\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"anomalously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-cori-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru0-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru5-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru6-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru10-f94b2322.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru9-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru3-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru7-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru8-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-aru2-f94b2322.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-ljspeech-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt408-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt138-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt624-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt396-f94b2322.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt498-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt132-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt288-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt42-f94b2322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anomalous-lt90-f94b2322.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm anomalous (bất thường) với anonymous (ẩn danh).', 'finance', 1, 7),
('b1ab0ca9-0ef1-56f0-89fd-d2d0d9d07ef0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '1fbd2b09-7901-5bc6-bab7-cf76f433cb49', 'cb820b4e-c999-59ec-9f03-3770487ab679', 'book', '/bʊk/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Tập giấy viết hoặc in, đóng thành tập và có bìa.', 'a bound collection of published pages containing written text or graphics.', 'The accountant recorded all company expenses in the finance ledger book.', 'Nhân viên kế toán đã ghi chép toàn bộ chi phí công ty vào sổ tài chính.', '{\"en\": \"The new training book contains all the guidelines for our customer service representatives.\", \"vi\": \"Cuốn sách đào tạo mới chứa tất cả các hướng dẫn dành cho đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-ljspeech-e7e694c5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-cori-e7e694c5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/book-a76e80cf.webp', '[\"publication\", \"volume\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"read a book\", \"meaning\": \"đọc sách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"publish a book\", \"meaning\": \"xuất bản sách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"notebook\", \"note_vi\": \"vở ghi chép, thường chưa in nội dung\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bookish\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"booklet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-cori-e7e694c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-aru0-e7e694c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-aru5-e7e694c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-aru6-e7e694c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-aru10-e7e694c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-aru9-e7e694c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-aru3-e7e694c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-aru7-e7e694c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/book-aru8-e7e694c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pron