('90d2759c-ce98-5b41-abc2-1e91f2655606', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '30202e58-8446-50cc-ab55-ce4f40b110d6', '0d6c9624-006d-555a-850f-1be4844800d1', 'scatterbrained', '/ˈskætəbreɪnd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Đãng trí, hay quên hoặc thiếu tập trung.', 'often forgetting things or unable to pay attention to what you are doing.', 'The scatterbrained assistant misplaced the confidential reports right before the board meeting.', 'Trợ lý đãng trí đã để thất lạc các bản báo cáo bảo mật ngay trước cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị.', '{\"en\": \"The new assistant is a bit scatterbrained, so she often misplaces important client files.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý mới hơi đãng trí, vì vậy cô ấy thường để nhầm các hồ sơ khách hàng quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-ljspeech-9f8aa4bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-cori-9f8aa4bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scatterbrained-1a691ae8.webp', '[\"forgetful\", \"absent-minded\", \"disorganized\"]', '[\"focused\", \"organized\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a scatterbrained professor\", \"meaning\": \"một vị giáo sư đãng trí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scatterbrained approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận thiếu tập trung\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"scatterbrain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-cori-9f8aa4bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-aru0-9f8aa4bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-aru5-9f8aa4bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-aru6-9f8aa4bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-aru10-9f8aa4bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-aru9-9f8aa4bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatterbrained-aru3-9f8aa4bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scat