('c2d95d78-3027-5a6c-9e72-1b8e9f709177', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '30202e58-8446-50cc-ab55-ce4f40b110d6', '0d6c9624-006d-555a-850f-1be4844800d1', 'stomach ache', '/ˈstʌm.ək eɪk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Cơn đau ở vùng bụng, đau dạ dày.', 'a painful feeling inside the belly area that makes you feel unwell.', 'I ate too much ice cream and now I have a terrible stomach ache.', 'Tôi đã ăn quá nhiều kem và bây giờ tôi bị đau bụng dữ dội.', '{\"en\": \"The employee called in sick after developing a severe stomach ache during the lunch break.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đó đã gọi điện xin nghỉ ốm sau khi bị đau bụng dữ dội trong giờ nghỉ trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-ljspeech-22113ca2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-cori-22113ca2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stomach-ache-70ba93cb.webp', '[\"bellyache\", \"abdominal pain\", \"tummy ache\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have a stomach ache\", \"meaning\": \"bị đau bụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"severe stomach ache\", \"meaning\": \"cơn đau bụng dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stomach ache relief\", \"meaning\": \"giảm đau dạ dày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heartburn\", \"note_vi\": \"heartburn là cảm giác nóng rát ở ngực do axit, không phải đau bụng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-cori-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru0-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru5-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru6-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru10-22113ca2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru9-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru3-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru7-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru8-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-aru2-22113ca2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-ljspeech-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt408-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt138-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt624-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt396-22113ca2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt498-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt132-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt288-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt42-22113ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomach-ache-lt90-22113ca2.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể viết liền \'stomachache\' hoặc tách \'stomach ache\', cả hai đều đúng.', 'health', 1, 27),
('bd9d4e3e-0538-5238-99b0-c73de088225f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '30202e58-8446-50cc-ab55-ce4f40b110d6', '0d6c9624-006d-555a-850f-1be4844800d1', 'wearisome', '/ˈwɪərisəm/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Gây mệt mỏi, chán nản.', 'causing a person to feel tired, bored, or lost of interest.', 'The long, repetitive task became quite wearisome after a few hours.', 'Công việc dài, lặp đi lặp lại trở nên khá mệt mỏi sau vài giờ.', '{\"en\": \"Filling out these repetitive tax forms every month is a wearisome task for the accountant.\", \"vi\": \"Việc điền các tờ khai thuế lặp đi lặp lại hàng tháng là một công việc tẻ nhạt đối với kế toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-ljspeech-b86c07a9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-cori-b86c07a9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wearisome-c44e680b.webp', '[\"tiresome\", \"tedious\", \"boring\"]', '[\"exciting\", \"refreshing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wearisome task\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ mệt mỏi, tẻ nhạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wearisome journey\", \"meaning\": \"hành trình mệt mỏi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"weary\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weariness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-cori-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru0-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru5-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru6-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru10-b86c07a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru9-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru3-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru7-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru8-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-aru2-b86c07a9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-ljspeech-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt408-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt138-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt624-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt396-b86c07a9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt498-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt132-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt288-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt42-b86c07a9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wearisome-lt90-b86c07a9.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này trang trọng hơn \'tiresome\' hay \'boring\', dùng để tả việc gây mệt mỏi tinh thần.', 'office', 1, 28),
('947e72f6-b57a-5842-867d-1ba8e35b49e0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '30202e58-8446-50cc-ab55-ce4f40b110d6', '0d6c9624-006d-555a-850f-1be4844800d1', 'corporal punishment', '/ˈkɔːpərəl ˈpʌnɪʃmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hình phạt dùng bạo lực thể chất, như đánh đập.', 'physical pain inflicted as a penalty for wrongdoing.', 'Educational experts strongly oppose corporal punishment as an effective method of disciplining children.', 'Các chuyên gia giáo dục phản đối mạnh mẽ hình phạt thể xác như một phương pháp kỷ luật trẻ em hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The school policy strictly forbids any corporal punishment during student discipline sessions.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách nhà trường nghiêm cấm mọi hình phạt thân thể trong các phiên kỷ luật học sinh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-ljspeech-302fbbc3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-cori-302fbbc3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corporal-punishment-79fb6399.webp', '[\"physical punishment\", \"bodily punishment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ban corporal punishment\", \"meaning\": \"cấm hình phạt thân thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"administer corporal punishment\", \"meaning\": \"thi hành phạt đánh đập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"capital punishment\", \"note_vi\": \"capital punishment là án tử, khác với phạt thân thể\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-cori-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru0-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru5-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru6-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru10-302fbbc3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru9-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru3-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru7-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru8-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-aru2-302fbbc3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-ljspeech-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt408-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt138-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt624-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt396-302fbbc3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt498-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt132-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt288-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt42-302fbbc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporal-punishment-lt90-302fbbc3.mp3\"]}}', 'Corporal punishment là phạt đánh đập, không phải capital punishment (tử hình).', 'education', 1, 29),
('754acb5d-c111-50eb-b145-1fa3305f351e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '322f90ef-aa83-59c5-8ccf-da73c9c104a1', 'c540aeb2-22e6-5faf-af25-ab811655c7fb', 'extol', '/ɪkˈstəʊl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Khen ngợi ai đó hoặc điều gì đó rất nhiều.', 'To express warm or enthusiastic approval for the virtues or achievements of a person or object.', 'The speaker extolled the virtues of hard work and perseverance.', 'Người diễn thuyết ca ngợi những đức tính của sự chăm chỉ và kiên trì.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing director chose to extol the benefits of the new software during the presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị đã chọn ca ngợi các lợi ích của phần mềm mới trong suốt buổi thuyết trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-ljspeech-88f8aea1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-cori-88f8aea1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extol-534cf062.webp', '[\"praise\", \"laud\", \"acclaim\"]', '[\"criticize\", \"condemn\", \"denigrate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extol the virtues of\", \"meaning\": \"ca ngợi những ưu điểm của\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extol the benefits of\", \"meaning\": \"ca ngợi những lợi ích của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exalt\", \"note_vi\": \"đề bạt hoặc tôn kính ai đó lên địa vị cao hơn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-cori-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru0-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru5-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru6-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru10-88f8aea1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru9-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru3-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru7-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru8-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-aru2-88f8aea1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-ljspeech-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt408-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt138-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt624-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt396-88f8aea1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt498-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt132-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt288-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt42-88f8aea1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extol-lt90-88f8aea1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với \'virtues\' (đức tính, ưu điểm) hoặc \'benefits\' (lợi ích).', 'marketing', 1, 0),
('d146be15-79e4-594f-b241-ed90b5416a64', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '322f90ef-aa83-59c5-8ccf-da73c9c104a1', 'c540aeb2-22e6-5faf-af25-ab811655c7fb', 'archeology', '/ˌɑːkiˈɒlədʒi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Ngành khoa học nghiên cứu về các nền văn hóa cổ đại qua di tích vật chất.', 'the scientific study of past human societies by examining objects and structures they left behind.', 'Students on the field trip learned about ancient civilizations through archeology.', 'Các sinh viên trong chuyến đi thực tế đã tìm hiểu về các nền văn minh cổ đại thông qua khảo cổ học.', '{\"en\": \"The museum hired an expert in archeology to help design its new ancient history exhibit.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo tàng đã thuê một chuyên gia khảo cổ học để giúp thiết kế triển lãm lịch sử cổ đại mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-ljspeech-dce11faa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-cori-dce11faa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/archeology-0a8c087b.webp', '[\"archaeology\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"study archeology\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu khảo cổ học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"archeology expedition\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến thám hiểm khảo cổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"field of archeology\", \"meaning\": \"lĩnh vực khảo cổ học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"anthropology\", \"note_vi\": \"anthropology nghiên cứu con người và văn hóa hiện đại, không chỉ cổ đại\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"archeologist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"archeological\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"archeologically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-cori-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru0-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru5-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru6-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru10-dce11faa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru9-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru3-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru7-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru8-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-aru2-dce11faa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-ljspeech-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt408-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt138-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt624-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt396-dce11faa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt498-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt132-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt288-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt42-dce11faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/archeology-lt90-dce11faa.mp3\"]}}', '\'Archeology\' là cách viết Mỹ; \'archaeology\' là cách viết Anh – cả hai đều đúng.', 'academic', 1, 1),
('5037aa25-8064-5541-8041-cc64d12146a1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '322f90ef-aa83-59c5-8ccf-da73c9c104a1', 'c540aeb2-22e6-5faf-af25-ab811655c7fb', 'regrettably', 'UK: /rɪˈɡrɛtəbli/ | US: /rɪˈɡrɛtəbli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'đáng tiếc là', 'used to express sadness or disappointment that a situation is unfortunate.', 'Regrettably, the project did not meet its deadline.', 'Đáng tiếc là dự án đã không đạt được thời hạn của nó.', '{\"en\": \"Regrettably, the flight has been canceled due to adverse weather conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Đáng tiếc là chuyến bay đã bị hủy do điều kiện thời tiết bất lợi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-ljspeech-6a45700b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-cori-6a45700b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regrettably-737bc7a7.webp', '[\"unfortunately\", \"sadly\", \"unhappily\"]', '[\"fortunately\", \"happily\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"regrettably high\", \"meaning\": \"cao một cách đáng tiếc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"regrettably unavailable\", \"meaning\": \"đáng tiếc là không có sẵn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"regretfully\", \"note_vi\": \"regrettably chỉ hoàn cảnh đáng tiếc (dùng như trạng từ câu), còn regretfully miêu tả tâm trạng hối tiếc của ai đó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"regret\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"regrettable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"regret\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-cori-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru0-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru5-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru6-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru10-6a45700b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru9-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru3-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru7-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru8-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru2-6a45700b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-ljspeech-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt408-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt138-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt624-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt396-6a45700b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt498-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt132-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt288-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt42-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt90-6a45700b.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ đứng đầu câu để diễn tả hoàn cảnh đáng tiếc (đồng nghĩa với \'unfortunately\').', 'travel', 1, 2),
('520864bc-4c83-5995-901c-c5120c70b9ed', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '322f90ef-aa83-59c5-8ccf-da73c9c104a1', 'c540aeb2-22e6-5faf-af25-ab811655c7fb', 'alternating current', '/ɔːl.tə.neɪ.tɪŋ kʌr.ənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Dòng điện đổi chiều liên tục, được dùng phổ biến trong nhà.', 'an electrical flow that regularly reverses its direction, commonly used in homes and offices.', 'Most household appliances run on alternating current, which is supplied through wall outlets.', 'Hầu hết các thiết bị gia dụng chạy bằng dòng điện xoay chiều, được cung cấp qua các ổ cắm trên tường.', '{\"en\": \"The new factory equipment requires a stable alternating current to operate safely and efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết bị nhà máy mới yêu cầu dòng điện xoay chiều ổn định để hoạt động an toàn và hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-ljspeech-c4e12ebf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-cori-c4e12ebf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/alternating-current-d61d273f.webp', '[\"AC\"]', '[\"direct current\", \"DC\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"alternating current power\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn điện xoay chiều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"generate alternating current\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra dòng điện xoay chiều\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"direct current\", \"note_vi\": \"dòng điện một chiều, không đổi hướng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"alternate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-cori-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru0-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru5-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru6-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru10-c4e12ebf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru9-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru3-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru7-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru8-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-aru2-c4e12ebf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-ljspeech-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt408-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt138-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt624-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt396-c4e12ebf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt498-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt132-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt288-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt42-c4e12ebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternating-current-lt90-c4e12ebf.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết tắt là AC, thường gặp trong các bài đọc về bảo trì thiết bị hoặc sản xuất.', 'manufacturing', 1, 3),
('048fc196-295b-5e54-a364-625b9dbc9c90', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '322f90ef-aa83-59c5-8ccf-da73c9c104a1', 'c540aeb2-22e6-5faf-af25-ab811655c7fb', 'parapet', '/ˈpærəpɪt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Bức tường thấp bảo vệ ở mép mái nhà, cầu hoặc ban công.', 'a dwarf barrier constructed along the margin of a structure to prevent falls.', 'The soldiers took cover behind the parapet on the castle wall.', 'Các binh sĩ nấp sau bức tường chắn trên tường thành của lâu đài.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed a stone parapet to ensure safety on the building\'s rooftop terrace.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế một bức tường chắn bằng đá để đảm bảo an toàn trên sân thượng của tòa nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-ljspeech-5e99dc3f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-cori-5e99dc3f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/parapet-3c2e9f5e.webp', '[\"railing\", \"barrier\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bridge parapet\", \"meaning\": \"lan can cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stone parapet\", \"meaning\": \"tường chắn bằng đá\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-cori-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru0-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru5-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru6-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru10-5e99dc3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru9-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru3-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru7-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru8-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-aru2-5e99dc3f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-ljspeech-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt408-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt138-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt624-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt396-5e99dc3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt498-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt132-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt288-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt42-5e99dc3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parapet-lt90-5e99dc3f.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong xây dựng và kiến trúc.', 'housing', 1, 4),
('728226f2-9698-5776-bb9e-fbf8b543e1bb', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '322f90ef-aa83-59c5-8ccf-da73c9c104a1', 'c540aeb2-22e6-5faf-af25-ab811655c7fb', 'maestro', '/ˈmaɪstrəʊ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một nhạc sĩ hoặc nhạc trưởng có kỹ năng xuất chúng.', 'a highly skilled and respected musician or conductor who leads performances.', 'Audience members gave a standing ovation to the maestro after an outstanding performance.', 'Các khán giả đã đứng dậy vỗ tay khen ngợi vị nhạc trưởng sau một màn trình diễn xuất sắc.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a renowned maestro to perform at the annual gala dinner.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một nhạc trưởng nổi tiếng biểu diễn tại bữa tiệc gala thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-ljspeech-da92ec1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-cori-da92ec1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/maestro-0e3e1727.webp', '[\"virtuoso\", \"conductor\", \"master\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"acclaimed maestro\", \"meaning\": \"nhạc trưởng được ca ngợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maestro of the orchestra\", \"meaning\": \"nhạc trưởng của dàn nhạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"legendary maestro\", \"meaning\": \"nhạc trưởng huyền thoại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mentor\", \"note_vi\": \"mentor là người hướng dẫn/cố vấn, không nhất thiết liên quan âm nhạc\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-cori-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru0-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru5-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru6-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru10-da92ec1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru9-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru3-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru7-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru8-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-aru2-da92ec1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-ljspeech-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt408-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt138-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt624-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt396-da92ec1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt498-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt132-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt288-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt42-da92ec1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maestro-lt90-da92ec1b.mp3\"]}}', 'Maestro thường dùng để gọi nhạc trưởng hoặc nhạc sĩ bậc thầy, mang sắc thái trang trọng, ngưỡng mộ.', 'other', 1, 5),
('71bef6a0-a643-5e9f-86b3-9f3e4ccce20e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '322f90ef-aa83-59c5-8ccf-da73c9c104a1', 'c540aeb2-22e6-5faf-af25-ab811655c7fb', 'crank', '/kræŋk/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một bộ phận có tay cầm dùng để quay hoặc khởi động máy.', 'a handle attached to a machine that you turn in order to make the machine work.', 'He turned the crank to raise the window in the old car.', 'Anh ấy quay tay quay để nâng cửa sổ chiếc xe cũ lên.', '{\"en\": \"The technician replaced the broken crank on the factory\'s main conveyor belt to restore production.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã thay thế tay quay bị hỏng trên băng chuyền chính của nhà máy để khôi phục sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-ljspeech-81566ce5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-cori-81566ce5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crank-a57969ca.webp', '[\"handle\", \"lever\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"turn a crank\", \"meaning\": \"quay tay quay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hand crank\", \"meaning\": \"tay quay thủ công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crack\", \"note_vi\": \"\'crack\' là vết nứt, dễ nhầm mặt chữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"crank\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cranky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-cori-81566ce5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-aru0-81566ce5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-aru5-81566ce5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-aru6-81566ce5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-aru10-81566ce5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-aru9-81566ce5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-aru3-81566ce5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-aru7-81566ce5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crank-aru8-81566ce5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc