('7e0b820e-3c68-569c-a072-7416562925c5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '33e95a78-96a6-5888-a522-35fd82c2266f', 'fa131de1-ea61-5cdb-862a-8b024368246d', 'pepsin', '/ˈpɛpsɪn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một loại enzyme tiêu hóa protein có trong dịch vị dạ dày.', 'a substance produced in the stomach that breaks down proteins to help with digestion.', 'Pepsin plays a crucial role in the initial breakdown of proteins in the stomach.', 'Pepsin đóng vai trò quan trọng trong việc phân hủy protein ban đầu trong dạ dày.', '{\"en\": \"The pharmaceutical company is developing a new supplement that contains pepsin to aid patients with digestion.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty dược phẩm đang phát triển một loại thực phẩm bổ sung mới có chứa pepsin để hỗ trợ bệnh nhân tiêu hóa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-ljspeech-f2a6eef1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-cori-f2a6eef1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pepsin-37daf3ba.webp', '[\"enzyme\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-cori-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru0-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru5-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru6-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru10-f2a6eef1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru9-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru3-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru7-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru8-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-aru2-f2a6eef1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-ljspeech-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt408-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt138-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt624-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt396-f2a6eef1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt498-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt132-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt288-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt42-f2a6eef1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pepsin-lt90-f2a6eef1.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là thuật ngữ chuyên ngành sinh học và y học.', 'health', 1, 23),
('ae82d64b-231a-5ac8-92a7-a1b5c502bef9', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '33e95a78-96a6-5888-a522-35fd82c2266f', 'fa131de1-ea61-5cdb-862a-8b024368246d', 'resolution', '/ˌrezəˈluːʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự quyết tâm mạnh mẽ để làm điều gì đó; lời hứa với bản thân.', 'a formal determination or decision intended to guide future actions or behavior.', 'The committee passed a resolution to increase funding for renewable energy projects.', 'Ủy ban đã thông qua một nghị quyết nhằm tăng nguồn vốn cho các dự án năng lượng tái tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The board passed a resolution to increase the marketing budget for the next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã thông qua nghị quyết tăng ngân sách tiếp thị cho quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-ljspeech-4680cad3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-cori-4680cad3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/resolution-27e0b7a6.webp', '[\"decision\", \"determination\", \"settlement\"]', '[\"indecision\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make a resolution\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra quyết tâm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pass a resolution\", \"meaning\": \"thông qua nghị quyết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"revolution\", \"note_vi\": \"revolution là cuộc cách mạng, dễ nhầm mặt chữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"resolve\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"resolute\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-cori-4680cad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-aru0-4680cad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-aru5-4680cad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-aru6-4680cad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-aru10-4680cad3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-aru9-4680cad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolution-aru3-4680cad3.mp3\", \"/storag