('8c7f08ec-2b5c-5ff6-8200-4ab511dfe20c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'jangling', '/ˈdʒæŋɡl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Âm thanh kim loại va vào nhau tạo ra tiếng leng keng.', 'a loud, harsh sound made by metal objects hitting each other repeatedly.', 'The loud jangling of coins inside his pocket disturbed the quiet library environment.', 'Tiếng leng keng ồn ào của những đồng xu trong túi anh ấy đã làm phiền không gian yên tĩnh của thư viện.', '{\"en\": \"The jangling of coins in the register was the only sound in the quiet shop.\", \"vi\": \"Tiếng leng keng của tiền xu trong máy tính tiền là âm thanh duy nhất trong cửa hàng yên tĩnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-ljspeech-6316661b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-cori-6316661b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jangling-1a1cc727.webp', '[\"clinking\", \"rattling\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"jangling sound\", \"meaning\": \"âm thanh leng keng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jangling keys\", \"meaning\": \"chùm chìa khóa kêu leng keng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"jangle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-cori-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru0-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru5-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru6-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru10-6316661b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru9-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru3-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru7-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru8-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-aru2-6316661b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-ljspeech-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt408-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt138-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt624-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt396-6316661b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt498-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt132-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt288-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt42-6316661b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jangling-lt90-6316661b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để tả âm thanh kim loại va chạm, gây cảm giác khó chịu.', 'daily', 1, 2),
('3a69b5e5-a42e-5c5c-8fe0-2ca03f80be4a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'acquiesce', '/ˌækwiˈes/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Đồng ý hoặc chấp nhận điều gì đó một cách miễn cưỡng.', 'to accept something or agree to something without arguing, even if you are unhappy.', 'Although he didn\'t fully agree, he decided to acquiesce to their demands for peace.', 'Mặc dù không hoàn toàn đồng ý, anh ấy quyết định chấp nhận yêu cầu của họ vì hòa bình.', '{\"en\": \"The union had to acquiesce to the management\'s final offer to avoid a long strike.\", \"vi\": \"Công đoàn đã phải miễn cưỡng chấp nhận đề nghị cuối cùng của ban quản lý để tránh đình công kéo dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-ljspeech-7e875ee3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-cori-7e875ee3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acquiesce-393ab0ee.webp', '[\"comply\", \"consent\"]', '[\"refuse\", \"resist\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"acquiesce to\", \"meaning\": \"bằng lòng với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reluctantly acquiesce\", \"meaning\": \"miễn cưỡng đồng ý\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"acquiescence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-cori-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru0-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru5-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru6-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru10-7e875ee3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru9-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru3-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru7-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru8-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-aru2-7e875ee3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-ljspeech-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt408-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt138-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt624-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt396-7e875ee3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt498-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt132-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt288-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt42-7e875ee3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquiesce-lt90-7e875ee3.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh đàm phán khi một bên phải nhượng bộ.', 'business', 1, 3),
('b4b9de5e-9ba7-53c8-a4cc-179b648a2ccf', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'begrudge', '/bɪˈɡrʌdʒ/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Ghen tị, không muốn ai đó có được điều gì đó.', 'to feel unhappy or angry because someone has something that you think they do not deserve.', 'Nobody should begrudge the dedicated team their well-deserved annual bonus.', 'Không ai nên ghen tị với đội ngũ tận tụy về khoản tiền thưởng hàng năm rất xứng đáng của họ.', '{\"en\": \"No one should begrudge her promotion because she has worked harder than anyone else.\", \"vi\": \"Không ai nên ghen tị với sự thăng tiến của cô ấy vì cô ấy đã làm việc chăm chỉ hơn bất kỳ ai khác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-ljspeech-d87010d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-cori-d87010d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/begrudge-801f4355.webp', '[\"envy\", \"grudge\", \"resent\"]', '[\"welcome\", \"applaud\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"begrudge someone\'s success\", \"meaning\": \"ghen tị với thành công của ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"begrudge the cost\", \"meaning\": \"tiếc tiền, không muốn trả chi phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grudge\", \"note_vi\": \"mối hận thù (danh từ) hoặc đố kị (động từ)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"begrudgingly\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"begrudging\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-cori-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru0-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru5-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru6-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru10-d87010d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru9-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru3-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru7-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru8-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-aru2-d87010d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-ljspeech-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt408-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt138-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt624-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt396-d87010d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt498-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt132-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt288-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt42-d87010d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/begrudge-lt90-d87010d6.mp3\"]}}', 'Begrudge có hai nghĩa: ghen tị với ai đó hoặc tiếc rẻ khi phải cho đi cái gì.', 'hr', 1, 4),
('7a4a2097-539c-5388-a043-7f04e9a4f5f8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'wring your hands', '/rɪŋ jɔː hændz/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Vò hoặc xoắn hai bàn tay vào nhau để thể hiện sự lo lắng, tuyệt vọng.', 'to hold your hands together and twist them because you are feeling very worried or sad.', 'There\'s no point in wringing your hands over things you can\'t change.', 'Chẳng ích gì khi vò tay lo lắng về những điều bạn không thể thay đổi.', '{\"en\": \"Instead of wringing your hands about the budget deficit, you should propose a cost-saving plan.\", \"vi\": \"Thay vì ngồi lo lắng vò đầu bứt tai về thâm hụt ngân sách, bạn nên đề xuất kế hoạch tiết kiệm chi phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-ljspeech-5230d7e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-cori-5230d7e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wring-your-hands-91c09212.webp', '[\"fret\", \"agonize\"]', '[\"relax\", \"rejoice\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"worry about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"show anxiety\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự lo âu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"wring\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-cori-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru0-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru5-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru6-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru10-5230d7e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru9-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru3-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru7-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru8-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-aru2-5230d7e8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-ljspeech-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt408-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt138-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt624-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt396-5230d7e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt498-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt132-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt288-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt42-5230d7e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wring-your-hands-lt90-5230d7e8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ sự lo lắng thái quá, không giải quyết được vấn đề.', 'office', 1, 5),
('5f7cdb68-fbf6-5ee0-9137-c007c95cfbaa', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'legislation', 'UK: /ˌledʒɪsˈleɪʃn/ | US: /ˌledʒɪsˈleɪʃən/', 'C1', 'noun', 'luật pháp, đạo luật', 'a law or a group of official rules enacted by a government body.', 'New legislation will affect all small businesses.', 'Luật mới sẽ ảnh hưởng đến tất cả các doanh nghiệp nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The government passed new legislation to regulate environmental standards for factories.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đã thông qua đạo luật mới để điều chỉnh các tiêu chuẩn môi trường cho các nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-ljspeech-8c6451df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-cori-8c6451df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/legislation-7d54906f.webp', '[\"law\", \"statute\", \"regulation\", \"act\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pass legislation\", \"meaning\": \"thông qua đạo luật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enact legislation\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành luật pháp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proposed legislation\", \"meaning\": \"dự luật được đề xuất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"legislator\", \"note_vi\": \"legislator chỉ nhà lập pháp (con người), legislation chỉ luật pháp/đạo luật (văn bản)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"legislate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"legislative\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"legislator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-cori-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru0-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru5-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru6-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru10-8c6451df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru9-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru3-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru7-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru8-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-aru2-8c6451df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-ljspeech-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt408-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt138-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt624-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt396-8c6451df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt498-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt132-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt288-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt42-8c6451df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislation-lt90-8c6451df.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ không đếm được chỉ bộ luật/luật pháp nói chung. Hay đi với \'pass\', \'enact\', \'introduce\'.', 'law', 1, 6),
('5957313d-de56-57f0-94ed-35a9487955b7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'monotonous', '/məˈnɒtənəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đều đều, lặp đi lặp lại, thiếu sự thay đổi.', 'dull and repetitive, with little or no variety or change.', 'He found the factory work monotonous and unchallenging.', 'Anh ấy thấy công việc ở nhà máy thật đơn điệu và không có tính thử thách.', '{\"en\": \"Employees complained that the data entry tasks were too monotonous and requested job rotation.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phàn nàn rằng các công việc nhập liệu quá đơn điệu và yêu cầu luân chuyển công việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-ljspeech-9c060d09.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-cori-9c060d09.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monotonous-120f0b58.webp', '[\"tedious\", \"repetitive\", \"dull\"]', '[\"varied\", \"exciting\", \"dynamic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"monotonous routine\", \"meaning\": \"thói quen đơn điệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"monotonous work\", \"meaning\": \"công việc đơn điệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"monotonous voice\", \"meaning\": \"giọng nói đều đều\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monogamous\", \"note_vi\": \"monogamous nghĩa là chung thủy một vợ/chồng, không liên quan đến sự đơn điệu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"monotony\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"monotonously\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"monotone\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-cori-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru0-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru5-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru6-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru10-9c060d09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru9-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru3-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru7-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru8-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-aru2-9c060d09.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-ljspeech-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt408-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt138-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt624-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt396-9c060d09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt498-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt132-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt288-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt42-9c060d09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monotonous-lt90-9c060d09.mp3\"]}}', 'Monotonous thường dùng để mô tả công việc hoặc giọng nói nhàm chán, thiếu biến đổi.', 'office', 1, 7),
('4206f813-4b5c-5e3f-b216-aea576c2efd2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'biohazard', '/ˌbaɪ.əʊˈhæz.əd/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Chất hoặc tác nhân sinh học có khả năng gây hại cho sinh vật sống.', 'A risk to human wellbeing or nature caused by exposure to harmful biological agents.', 'The laboratory clearly marked the containers with biohazard symbols.', 'Phòng thí nghiệm đã đánh dấu rõ ràng các thùng chứa bằng các ký hiệu mối nguy sinh học.', '{\"en\": \"The chemical plant has strict safety protocols for handling any potential biohazard in the laboratory.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy hóa chất có các quy trình an toàn nghiêm ngặt để xử lý bất kỳ mối nguy hiểm sinh học tiềm ẩn nào trong phòng thí nghiệm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-ljspeech-ea773b28.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-cori-ea773b28.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/biohazard-a3dafa40.webp', '[\"biological hazard\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"biohazard waste\", \"meaning\": \"rác thải nguy hiểm sinh học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"biohazard suit\", \"meaning\": \"đồ bảo hộ chống độc sinh học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hazard\", \"note_vi\": \"hazard là mối nguy hiểm nói chung, biohazard là nguy hiểm sinh học.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-cori-ea773b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-aru0-ea773b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-aru5-ea773b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-aru6-ea773b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-aru10-ea773b28.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-aru9-ea773b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-aru3-ea773b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biohazard-aru