('37f54e91-ddb2-58bb-b7fe-23be7a9c95c7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'dejection', '/dɪˈdʒekʃn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái buồn bã, thất vọng hoặc mất tinh thần.', 'a feeling of sadness or lack of hope, especially after a disappointment.', 'After failing the exam, a deep sense of dejection settled over him.', 'Sau khi trượt kỳ thi, một cảm giác chán nản sâu sắc bao trùm lấy anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"A feeling of dejection spread through the office after they lost the major contract.\", \"vi\": \"Cảm giác thất vọng bao trùm khắp văn phòng sau khi họ để mất hợp đồng lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-ljspeech-68f1950e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-cori-68f1950e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dejection-9864b6de.webp', '[\"depression\", \"sadness\", \"despair\"]', '[\"elation\", \"joy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deep dejection\", \"meaning\": \"sự thất vọng sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look of dejection\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ mặt chán nản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rejection\", \"note_vi\": \"rejection là sự từ chối, dejection là sự nản lòng/buồn bã.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dejected\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"dejectedly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-cori-68f1950e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-aru0-68f1950e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-aru5-68f1950e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-aru6-68f1950e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-aru10-68f1950e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-aru9-68f1950e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-aru3-68f1950e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dejection-aru7-68f1950e