('5c438be3-ebe3-5fb9-acb2-1cf7ef51378f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'wolf', '/wʊlf/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một loài động vật hoang dã thuộc họ chó, thường sống theo bầy đàn.', 'a wild animal that looks like a large dog and lives in a group.', 'Researchers tracked a wild wolf as it moved across the snowy forest.', 'Các nhà nghiên cứu đã theo dấu một con sói hoang dã khi nó di chuyển qua khu rừng tuyết.', '{\"en\": \"The wildlife sanctuary opened a new center to educate visitors about local wolf conservation efforts.\", \"vi\": \"Khu bảo tồn thiên nhiên đã mở một trung tâm mới để giáo dục du khách về nỗ lực bảo tồn chó sói địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-ljspeech-a3cb7388.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-cori-a3cb7388.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wolf-36ca1432.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wolf pack\", \"meaning\": \"bầy sói\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lone wolf\", \"meaning\": \"người hoặc con vật thích hành động một mình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"wolfish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-cori-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru0-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru5-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru6-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru10-a3cb7388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru9-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru3-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru7-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru8-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-aru2-a3cb7388.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-ljspeech-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt408-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt138-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt624-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt396-a3cb7388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt498-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt132-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt288-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt42-a3cb7388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wolf-lt90-a3cb7388.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ số nhiều của wolf là wolves (thay f bằng ves).', 'nature', 1, 19),
('db420ac4-b811-5005-aa99-d6105f7602e7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'eukaryote', '/juːˈkæriəʊt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sinh vật có tế bào chứa nhân và các bào quan có màng bao bọc.', 'a living thing that has cells with a clear center and organized parts.', 'Humans, animals, plants, and fungi are all examples of eukaryotes.', 'Con người, động vật, thực vật và nấm đều là ví dụ về sinh vật nhân thực.', '{\"en\": \"The laboratory technician analyzed the eukaryote samples to ensure the quality of the product.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên phòng thí nghiệm đã phân tích các mẫu sinh vật nhân thực để đảm bảo chất lượng sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-ljspeech-031165ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-cori-031165ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eukaryote-11ebd263.webp', NULL, '[\"prokaryote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eukaryote cell\", \"meaning\": \"tế bào nhân thực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"eukaryotic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-cori-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru0-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru5-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru6-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru10-031165ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru9-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru3-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru7-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru8-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-aru2-031165ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-ljspeech-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt408-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt138-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt624-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt396-031165ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt498-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt132-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt288-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt42-031165ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eukaryote-lt90-031165ca.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ sinh học, dùng trong các ngành công nghiệp sinh học hoặc dược phẩm.', 'manufacturing', 1, 20),
('1728d7a7-abd1-5f60-b89b-c3fccd72ad89', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'byzantine', '/bɪˈzæn.taɪn/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'phức tạp, rắc rối một cách khó hiểu.', 'extremely complicated and difficult to understand, especially when referring to rules or systems.', 'The company\'s internal bureaucracy was so byzantine that no one understood all the rules.', 'Hệ thống quan liêu nội bộ của công ty quá phức tạp đến nỗi không ai hiểu hết các quy tắc.', '{\"en\": \"The new tax policy was criticized for having a byzantine system of exemptions.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách thuế mới bị chỉ trích vì có hệ thống miễn trừ phức tạp đến rắc rối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-ljspeech-081edb05.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-cori-081edb05.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/byzantine-9a008356.webp', '[\"complicated\", \"convoluted\", \"intricate\"]', '[\"simple\", \"straightforward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"byzantine rules\", \"meaning\": \"quy định rắc rối khó hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"byzantine bureaucracy\", \"meaning\": \"bộ máy hành chính rườm rà\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-cori-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru0-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru5-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru6-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru10-081edb05.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru9-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru3-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru7-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru8-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-aru2-081edb05.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-ljspeech-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt408-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt138-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt624-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt396-081edb05.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt498-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt132-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt288-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt42-081edb05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/byzantine-lt90-081edb05.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ sự phức tạp rắc rối mang tính rườm rà của thủ tục, quy định.', 'business', 1, 21),
('fbb9105e-690b-5f6c-a10f-fe3aba3b684f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'horrendous', '/həˈrendəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất tệ, khủng khiếp, gây sốc.', 'extremely bad, shocking, or unpleasant in a way that causes strong negative feelings.', 'Our team suffered a horrendous financial loss after the unexpected market crash.', 'Đội ngũ của chúng tôi đã chịu một khoản tổn thất tài chính kinh khủng sau đợt sụp đổ thị trường bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"The horrendous delay in shipment caused the client to cancel the entire order.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chậm trễ khủng khiếp trong việc giao hàng khiến khách hàng hủy toàn bộ đơn hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-ljspeech-841ff388.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-cori-841ff388.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/horrendous-c61ee839.webp', '[\"terrible\", \"dreadful\", \"appalling\"]', '[\"wonderful\", \"excellent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"horrendous mistake\", \"meaning\": \"sai lầm nghiêm trọng, khủng khiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"horrendous conditions\", \"meaning\": \"điều kiện tệ hại, khủng khiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"horrendous cost\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí cực kỳ cao, khủng khiếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"horrid\", \"note_vi\": \"horrid nhẹ hơn horrendous, thường dùng trong văn nói thông thường\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"horrendously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-cori-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru0-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru5-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru6-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru10-841ff388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru9-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru3-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru7-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru8-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-aru2-841ff388.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-ljspeech-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt408-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt138-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt624-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt396-841ff388.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt498-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt132-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt288-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt42-841ff388.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/horrendous-lt90-841ff388.mp3\"]}}', 'Horrendous mạnh hơn terrible hay bad rất nhiều; dùng khi muốn nhấn mạnh mức độ tệ hại cực đoan.', 'business', 1, 22),
('4d027fa3-5a7f-5c0c-8754-8d4d78a5e992', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'gossamer', '/ˈɡɒsəmə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sợi tơ mỏng manh, nhẹ nhàng như tơ nhện.', 'very thin, light, and delicate threads, similar to a spider\'s web.', 'The morning dew sparkled on the delicate gossamer threads stretching between the branches.', 'Sương sớm lấp lánh trên những sợi tơ nhện mỏng manh giăng giữa các cành cây.', '{\"en\": \"The designer used gossamer fabric to create an elegant and lightweight wedding veil.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế sử dụng vải mỏng manh như tơ nhện để tạo ra một chiếc mạng cưới thanh lịch và nhẹ nhàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-ljspeech-1ffda31d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-cori-1ffda31d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gossamer-6d7edde0.webp', '[\"cobweb\", \"filament\", \"gauze\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gossamer threads\", \"meaning\": \"sợi tơ mỏng manh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gossamer fabric\", \"meaning\": \"vải mỏng nhẹ như tơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gossamer wings\", \"meaning\": \"đôi cánh mỏng như tơ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gauze\", \"note_vi\": \"gauze là vải thưa dùng trong y tế, còn gossamer thiên về hình ảnh thơ mộng, mỏng manh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"gossamer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-cori-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru0-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru5-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru6-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru10-1ffda31d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru9-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru3-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru7-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru8-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-aru2-1ffda31d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-ljspeech-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt408-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt138-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt624-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt396-1ffda31d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt498-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt132-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt288-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt42-1ffda31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gossamer-lt90-1ffda31d.mp3\"]}}', 'Gossamer thường dùng như tính từ (gossamer wings/fabric) trong văn học và thời trang cao cấp.', 'other', 1, 23),
('a00a4f5c-a291-5a41-8480-41298575e337', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'melancholic', '/ˌmelənˈkɒlɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có tâm trạng buồn bã, u sầu hoặc trầm tư.', 'having a sad, pensive mood showing deep sorrow or quiet reflection.', 'The melancholic music perfectly matched the somber mood of the scene.', 'Bản nhạc u sầu hoàn toàn phù hợp với tâm trạng u ám của cảnh quay.', '{\"en\": \"The melancholic employee resigned after the company\'s sudden restructuring was announced.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên u sầu đã từ chức sau khi công ty bất ngờ công bố tái cơ cấu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-ljspeech-b19f8995.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-cori-b19f8995.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/melancholic-b68188aa.webp', '[\"sad\", \"sorrowful\", \"gloomy\"]', '[\"cheerful\", \"joyful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"melancholic mood\", \"meaning\": \"tâm trạng u sầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"melancholic music\", \"meaning\": \"âm nhạc buồn bã\"}, {\"phrase\": \"melancholic expression\", \"meaning\": \"biểu cảm trầm tư\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"melodic\", \"note_vi\": \"melodic nghĩa là giai điệu, không phải buồn bã.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"melancholy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"melancholically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-cori-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru0-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru5-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru6-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru10-b19f8995.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru9-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru3-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru7-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru8-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-aru2-b19f8995.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-ljspeech-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt408-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt138-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt624-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt396-b19f8995.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt498-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt132-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt288-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt42-b19f8995.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melancholic-lt90-b19f8995.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm với melodic (giai điệu); melancholic luôn chỉ nỗi buồn.', 'daily', 1, 24),
('ffd3677a-49b3-5474-a4c8-d82b950bbd6b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'plop', '/plɒp/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Rơi xuống hoặc đặt cái gì đó xuống một cách nhẹ nhàng nhưng đột ngột, thường tạo ra tiếng \"bộp\".', 'to drop something into a liquid or onto a surface with a soft sound.', 'She watched the pebble plop into the water, creating tiny ripples.', 'Cô ấy nhìn hòn sỏi rơi bộp xuống nước, tạo ra những gợn sóng nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"Please plop the documents onto the desk so we can review them after the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đặt xấp tài liệu xuống bàn để chúng ta có thể xem xét sau cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-ljspeech-64faf5d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-cori-64faf5d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plop-e302024c.webp', '[\"drop\", \"plunk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"plop down\", \"meaning\": \"đặt mạnh xuống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plop into\", \"meaning\": \"rơi tõm vào\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-cori-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru0-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru5-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru6-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru10-64faf5d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru9-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru3-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru7-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru8-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-aru2-64faf5d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-ljspeech-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt408-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt138-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt624-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt396-64faf5d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt498-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt132-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt288-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt42-64faf5d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plop-lt90-64faf5d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ tượng thanh, diễn tả hành động đặt vật gì đó xuống một cách tự nhiên.', 'office', 1, 25),
('6c917f4d-65bf-5c15-931b-aefa0b308672', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'atoll', '/ˈætɒl/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Đảo san hô vòng, một hòn đảo hình vòng cung bao quanh đầm phá.', 'A circular reef structure of organic marine deposits enclosing a central shallow lagoon.', 'Many beautiful tropical islands are actually atolls formed by coral reefs.', 'Nhiều hòn đảo nhiệt đới xinh đẹp thực chất là các đảo san hô vòng được hình thành từ rạn san hô.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency organized an exclusive luxury tour package to a remote Pacific atoll.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã tổ chức một gói tour sang trọng độc quyền đến một đảo san hô vòng hẻo lánh ở Thái Bình Dương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-ljspeech-e154f040.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-cori-e154f040.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atoll-fa968978.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coral atoll\", \"meaning\": \"đảo san hô vòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remote atoll\", \"meaning\": \"đảo san hô vòng hẻo lánh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-cori-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru0-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru5-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru6-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru10-e154f040.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru9-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru3-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru7-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru8-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-aru2-e154f040.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-ljspeech-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt408-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt138-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt624-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt396-e154f040.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt498-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt132-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt288-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt42-e154f040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atoll-lt90-e154f040.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ đảo san hô dạng vòng, bên trong là đầm nước (lagoon).', 'travel', 1, 26),
('8cb362e2-a4f3-538c-bcab-e80d8ebe1e6a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'infraction', '/ɪnˈfrækʃn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hành vi vi phạm một quy tắc hoặc luật lệ nhỏ.', 'an instance of breaking a rule or law, usually a minor one.', 'Parking in a no-parking zone is a minor infraction that usually results in a fine.', 'Đỗ xe ở khu vực cấm đỗ là một lỗi vi phạm nhỏ thường dẫn đến việc bị phạt tiền.', '{\"en\": \"Any further safety infraction in the manufacturing plant will result in immediate termination of your contract.\", \"vi\": \"Bất kỳ vi phạm an toàn nào nữa trong nhà máy sản xuất sẽ dẫn đến việc chấm dứt hợp đồng của bạn ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-ljspeech-5c3508d2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-cori-5c3508d2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infraction-f011d7c2.webp', '[\"violation\", \"breach\", \"offense\"]', '[\"compliance\", \"obedience\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"minor infraction\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safety infraction\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm an toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"traffic infraction\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm giao thông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"infarction\", \"note_vi\": \"Dễ nhầm với \'infarction\' (nhồi máu) trong y khoa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-cori-5c3508d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-aru0-5c3508d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-aru5-5c3508d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-aru6-5c3508d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-aru10-5c3508d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-aru9-5c3508d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infraction-aru3-5c3508d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje