('a0479903-5851-589d-a3e3-2ed9e4f34360', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'coulomb', '/ˈkuːlɒm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Đơn vị đo điện tích trong hệ SI.', 'The International System unit measuring the quantity of electricity conveyed by a constant current.', 'One coulomb is approximately the charge of 6.24 x 10^18 electrons.', 'Một culông xấp xỉ bằng điện tích của 6,24 x 10^18 electron.', '{\"en\": \"The technician measured the total coulomb output to ensure the battery was functioning correctly.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã đo tổng lượng điện tích để đảm bảo pin đang hoạt động chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-ljspeech-d0358195.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-cori-d0358195.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coulomb-c1394d85.webp', '[\"charge unit\", \"electric unit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"electric coulomb\", \"meaning\": \"coulomb điện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"measure in coulombs\", \"meaning\": \"đo bằng đơn vị coulomb\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-cori-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru0-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru5-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru6-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru10-d0358195.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru9-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru3-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru7-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru8-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-aru2-d0358195.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-ljspeech-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt408-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt138-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt624-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt396-d0358195.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt498-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt132-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt288-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt42-d0358195.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coulomb-lt90-d0358195.mp3\"]}}', 'Đơn vị vật lý, ít dùng trong giao tiếp thông thường, chủ yếu trong kỹ thuật.', 'technology', 1, 28),
('32df483a-44d8-57d5-b663-c1dd39866668', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '354b32e6-d419-585d-8755-b3ffa7f2aa29', '497cf464-c15d-5825-92f1-4dfe5384b0fb', 'comptroller', '/kənˈtrəʊlə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Viên chức chịu trách nhiệm giám sát tài chính và kế toán của một tổ chức.', 'a person who is in charge of the financial accounts and spending of an organization.', 'The city comptroller is responsible for managing the public funds.', 'Người kiểm soát tài chính thành phố chịu trách nhiệm quản lý quỹ công.', '{\"en\": \"The comptroller reviewed the quarterly budget reports to ensure all expenses were properly documented.\", \"vi\": \"Viên chức kiểm soát tài chính đã xem xét các báo cáo ngân sách hàng quý để đảm bảo mọi chi phí được ghi chép đúng cách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-ljspeech-4a6a38ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-cori-4a6a38ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/comptroller-8f2d61d4.webp', '[\"controller\", \"auditor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"city comptroller\", \"meaning\": \"viên chức kiểm soát tài chính thành phố\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financial comptroller\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm soát viên tài chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comptroller\", \"note_vi\": \"comptroller thường dùng cho chính phủ, controller dùng cho doanh nghiệp.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-cori-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru0-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru5-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru6-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru10-4a6a38ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru9-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru3-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru7-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru8-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-aru2-4a6a38ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-ljspeech-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt408-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt138-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt624-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt396-4a6a38ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt498-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt132-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt288-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt42-4a6a38ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comptroller-lt90-4a6a38ec.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm giống từ \'controller\' nhưng viết khác.', 'finance', 1, 29),
('d4993661-de9e-5b20-a890-58081aa76a61', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'sinewy', '/ˈsɪnjuːi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rắn chắc, gân guốc (thường chỉ cơ thể).', 'having a lean, strong body with clearly visible muscles and tendons, usually from physical work.', 'The old farmer had a sinewy build from years of hard work.', 'Người nông dân già có vóc dáng gân guốc do nhiều năm làm việc vất vả.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse supervisor was a sinewy man who easily handled heavy equipment on the floor.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát kho hàng là một người đàn ông gân guốc, dễ dàng xử lý thiết bị nặng trên sàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-ljspeech-d2389cdd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-cori-d2389cdd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sinewy-e76dd44f.webp', '[\"muscular\", \"lean\", \"wiry\"]', '[\"flabby\", \"soft\", \"pudgy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sinewy build\", \"meaning\": \"vóc dáng gân guốc, rắn chắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sinewy arms\", \"meaning\": \"cánh tay gân guốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sinewy frame\", \"meaning\": \"khung người rắn chắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stocky\", \"note_vi\": \"stocky là thấp và chắc nịch, còn sinewy nhấn mạnh gân cơ rõ nét, thường người gầy\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sinew\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-cori-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru0-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru5-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru6-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru10-d2389cdd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru9-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru3-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru7-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru8-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-aru2-d2389cdd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-ljspeech-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt408-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt138-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt624-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt396-d2389cdd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt498-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt132-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt288-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt42-d2389cdd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sinewy-lt90-d2389cdd.mp3\"]}}', '\'Sinewy\' ít dùng trong TOEIC; thường gặp trong văn miêu tả nhân vật hoặc văn học.', 'manufacturing', 1, 0),
('671c4571-ab72-5084-807e-5fd6abbe395a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'onerous', '/ˈəʊnərəs/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Khó khăn, nặng nhọc, đòi hỏi nhiều nỗ lực.', 'involving a large amount of effort, responsibility, or difficulty that is considered a heavy burden.', 'The task of organizing the entire conference proved to be quite onerous.', 'Nhiệm vụ tổ chức toàn bộ hội nghị hóa ra khá nặng nhọc.', '{\"en\": \"Managing the company\'s tax records became an onerous task due to the complex new regulations.\", \"vi\": \"Việc quản lý hồ sơ thuế của công ty trở thành một nhiệm vụ nặng nề do các quy định mới phức tạp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-ljspeech-a6b1c5ae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-cori-a6b1c5ae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/onerous-2d3a2e35.webp', '[\"burdensome\", \"demanding\"]', '[\"easy\", \"light\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"onerous task\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ nặng nề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"onerous duty\", \"meaning\": \"trách nhiệm nặng nề\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"onus\", \"note_vi\": \"onus là danh từ (trách nhiệm), onerous là tính từ (nặng nề).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"onerously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-cori-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru0-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru5-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru6-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru10-a6b1c5ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru9-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru3-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru7-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru8-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-aru2-a6b1c5ae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-ljspeech-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt408-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt138-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt624-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt396-a6b1c5ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt498-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt132-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt288-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt42-a6b1c5ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onerous-lt90-a6b1c5ae.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'onus\' (trách nhiệm), onerous là tính từ chỉ sự nặng nề, khó khăn.', 'finance', 1, 1),
('86d2eb46-8968-5ba8-9f5b-78e23be9fd5e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'decrement', '/ˈdɛkrɪmənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự giảm đi về số lượng, giá trị hoặc mức độ.', 'a reduction in the amount, value, or level of something.', 'The software update resulted in a slight decrement in performance for older devices.', 'Bản cập nhật phần mềm đã dẫn đến một sự giảm nhẹ về hiệu suất cho các thiết bị cũ hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The financial report showed a steady decrement in operating costs over the last three business quarters.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo tài chính cho thấy sự sụt giảm đều đặn trong chi phí hoạt động qua ba quý kinh doanh vừa qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-ljspeech-cb874715.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-cori-cb874715.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decrement-3c390f28.webp', '[\"decrease\", \"reduction\", \"decline\"]', '[\"increment\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a steady decrement\", \"meaning\": \"sự giảm đều đặn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a gradual decrement\", \"meaning\": \"sự giảm dần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"increment\", \"note_vi\": \"increment là sự tăng lên, trái nghĩa hoàn toàn với decrement.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"decrement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-cori-cb874715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-aru0-cb874715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-aru5-cb874715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-aru6-cb874715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-aru10-cb874715.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-aru9-cb874715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-aru3-cb874715.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decrement-a