('92040359-fcd1-5510-a33d-d0db26642848', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'vigilante', '/ˌvɪdʒɪˈlænti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Người tự ý thực thi pháp luật mà không có thẩm quyền hợp pháp.', 'a person who tries to punish criminals without having any legal authority to do so.', 'The town was divided on whether the vigilante was a hero or a dangerous criminal.', 'Thị trấn bị chia rẽ về việc liệu người tự xử đó là anh hùng hay tội phạm nguy hiểm.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard was warned not to act like a vigilante when handling shoplifters.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ được cảnh báo không được hành động như người thực thi pháp luật khi xử lý kẻ trộm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-ljspeech-699cd24f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-cori-699cd24f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vigilante-7a978d63.webp', '[\"avenger\", \"crusader\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"vigilante group\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm tự phát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"act like a vigilante\", \"meaning\": \"hành động như người thực thi pháp luật\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vigilance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"vigilant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-cori-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru0-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru5-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru6-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru10-699cd24f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru9-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru3-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru7-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru8-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-aru2-699cd24f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-ljspeech-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt408-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt138-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt624-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt396-699cd24f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt498-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt132-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt288-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt42-699cd24f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigilante-lt90-699cd24f.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ những người tự ý xử lý tội phạm, thường bị coi là trái luật.', 'law', 1, 7),
('ce9aab33-f6a0-508b-940b-f19d57de643d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'rant', '/rænt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một bài nói dài, giận dữ và thường không hợp lý.', 'a long angry speech that is often not logical.', 'His rant about the poor customer service lasted for ten minutes.', 'Bài phàn nàn của anh ấy về dịch vụ khách hàng kém chất lượng đã kéo dài mười phút.', '{\"en\": \"The client\'s rant about the delayed shipment annoyed the support team.\", \"vi\": \"Bài chửi bới của khách hàng về lô hàng bị trễ đã làm phiền đội hỗ trợ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-ljspeech-46110a3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-cori-46110a3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rant-dff36017.webp', '[\"tirade\", \"harangue\"]', '[\"praise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"go on a rant\", \"meaning\": \"bắt đầu bài diễn thuyết giận dữ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public rant\", \"meaning\": \"lời phàn nàn công khai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rent\", \"note_vi\": \"không nhầm với rent (thuê), phát âm gần nhưng nghĩa khác.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-cori-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru0-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru5-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru6-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru10-46110a3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru9-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru3-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru7-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru8-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-aru2-46110a3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-ljspeech-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt408-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt138-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt624-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt396-46110a3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt498-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt132-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt288-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt42-46110a3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rant-lt90-46110a3a.mp3\"]}}', 'Rant là danh từ bài chửi, không phát âm như rent (thuê).', 'business', 1, 8),
('126e4349-4e1c-56c2-b407-d758a96b2a31', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'coalition', 'UK: /ˌkəʊ.əˈlɪʃ.ən/ | US: /ˌkoʊ.əˈlɪʃ.ən/', 'C1', 'noun', 'liên minh', 'a temporary union of different political parties or groups working together for a shared purpose.', 'The business coalition works for economic growth.', 'Liên minh doanh nghiệp hoạt động vì tăng trưởng kinh tế.', '{\"en\": \"Several local businesses formed a coalition to promote tourism in the downtown area.\", \"vi\": \"Một số doanh nghiệp địa phương đã thành lập một liên minh để thúc đẩy du lịch ở khu vực trung tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-ljspeech-d3fa0ebb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-cori-d3fa0ebb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coalition-0e6e044c.webp', '[\"alliance\", \"union\", \"partnership\", \"bloc\"]', '[\"division\", \"separation\", \"disunion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"form a coalition\", \"meaning\": \"thành lập một liên minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coalition government\", \"meaning\": \"chính phủ liên minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"business coalition\", \"meaning\": \"liên minh doanh nghiệp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coalesce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-cori-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru0-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru5-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru6-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru10-d3fa0ebb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru9-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru3-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru7-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru8-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-aru2-d3fa0ebb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-ljspeech-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt408-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt138-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt624-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt396-d3fa0ebb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt498-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt132-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt288-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt42-d3fa0ebb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coalition-lt90-d3fa0ebb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với các động từ như \'form\' hoặc \'build\' (ví dụ: form a coalition = thành lập liên minh).', 'business', 1, 9),
('84ae5954-55c2-5d97-bdbd-fefb7a38d214', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'IP address', '/aɪ piː əˈdrɛs/', 'B2', 'abbreviation', 'Một chuỗi số duy nhất xác định thiết bị trên mạng internet.', 'a set of numbers that identifies a specific computer or device on a digital network.', 'Every device connected to the internet has a unique IP address.', 'Mọi thiết bị kết nối internet đều có một địa chỉ IP duy nhất.', '{\"en\": \"The network administrator needs to assign a static IP address to the company server today.\", \"vi\": \"Quản trị viên mạng cần gán một địa chỉ IP tĩnh cho máy chủ công ty vào hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-ljspeech-fe316770.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-cori-fe316770.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ip-address-56c81cd6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"static IP address\", \"meaning\": \"địa chỉ IP tĩnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assign an IP address\", \"meaning\": \"gán địa chỉ IP\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-cori-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru0-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru5-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru6-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru10-fe316770.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru9-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru3-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru7-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru8-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-aru2-fe316770.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-ljspeech-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt408-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt138-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt624-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt396-fe316770.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt498-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt132-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt288-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt42-fe316770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ip-address-lt90-fe316770.mp3\"]}}', 'IP là viết tắt của Internet Protocol.', 'technology', 1, 10),
('9c61316f-6bfb-5677-95b1-9bc7efe56775', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'groundbreaking', '/ˈɡraʊndˌbreɪkɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đột phá, mang tính đổi mới, mở đường cho những phát triển mới.', 'making new discoveries or using new methods that have never been used before.', 'Her groundbreaking research changed the way scientists understood the disease.', 'Nghiên cứu đột phá của cô ấy đã thay đổi cách các nhà khoa học hiểu về căn bệnh này.', '{\"en\": \"The company announced a groundbreaking software solution to automate customer billing.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã công bố một giải pháp phần mềm đột phá để tự động hóa việc lập hóa đơn khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-ljspeech-7885bf3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-cori-7885bf3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/groundbreaking-d78df10c.webp', '[\"innovative\", \"pioneering\", \"revolutionary\"]', '[\"conventional\", \"traditional\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"groundbreaking research\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu đột phá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"groundbreaking technology\", \"meaning\": \"công nghệ đột phá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"breathtaking\", \"note_vi\": \"Đẹp ngoạn mục hoặc gây ngỡ ngàng, khác với đột phá đổi mới.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-cori-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru0-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru5-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru6-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru10-7885bf3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru9-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru3-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru7-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru8-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-aru2-7885bf3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-ljspeech-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt408-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt138-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt624-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt396-7885bf3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt498-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt132-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt288-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt42-7885bf3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/groundbreaking-lt90-7885bf3a.mp3\"]}}', 'Tách ra là ground (mặt đất) + break (phá vỡ) -> đào đất mở đường, tức mang tính đột phá.', 'technology', 1, 11),
('376b1d48-920d-59a1-8493-9fc11c2c9166', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'jovial', '/ˈdʒəʊviəl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Vui vẻ, hòa nhã và thân thiện.', 'cheerful, friendly, and full of good humor in a warm and pleasant way.', 'Santa Claus is often depicted as a jovial man with a big laugh.', 'Ông già Noel thường được miêu tả là một người đàn ông vui vẻ với tiếng cười lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The jovial manager always greeted his team with a smile before morning meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý vui vẻ luôn chào đón nhóm của mình bằng nụ cười trước các cuộc họp buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-ljspeech-55c50bce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-cori-55c50bce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jovial-f13c933a.webp', '[\"cheerful\", \"jolly\", \"genial\"]', '[\"gloomy\", \"sullen\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"jovial manner\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách vui vẻ, hòa nhã\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jovial atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí vui vẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jovial personality\", \"meaning\": \"tính cách vui vẻ thân thiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"jolly\", \"note_vi\": \"jolly gần nghĩa nhưng thường mang sắc thái trẻ con hoặc bề ngoài hơn jovial\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"jovially\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"joviality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-cori-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru0-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru5-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru6-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru10-55c50bce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru9-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru3-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru7-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru8-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-aru2-55c50bce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-ljspeech-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt408-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt138-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt624-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt396-55c50bce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt498-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt132-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt288-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt42-55c50bce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jovial-lt90-55c50bce.mp3\"]}}', 'Jovial thường dùng để mô tả tính cách người lớn tuổi hoặc cấp trên thân thiện trong môi trường công sở.', 'hr', 1, 12),
('dccfcdeb-ebab-592b-9d6b-6528abdb0a37', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'commencement', '/kəˈmensmənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Buổi lễ trao bằng tốt nghiệp cho sinh viên.', 'a ceremony at which university degrees or diplomas are given to students.', 'My sister\'s commencement ceremony is next month, and we\'re all very excited.', 'Lễ tốt nghiệp của chị gái tôi là vào tháng tới, và tất cả chúng tôi đều rất phấn khởi.', '{\"en\": \"The university invited a famous business leader to deliver the speech at commencement.\", \"vi\": \"Trường đại học đã mời một nhà lãnh đạo doanh nghiệp nổi tiếng đến phát biểu tại lễ tốt nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-ljspeech-e9fc1263.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-cori-e9fc1263.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commencement-0750c43e.webp', '[\"graduation\", \"convocation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"commencement ceremony\", \"meaning\": \"lễ tốt nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commencement speech\", \"meaning\": \"bài phát biểu tốt nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commencement\", \"note_vi\": \"Vừa có nghĩa là sự bắt đầu vừa có nghĩa là lễ trao bằng tốt nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"commence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-cori-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru0-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru5-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru6-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru10-e9fc1263.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru9-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru3-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru7-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru8-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-aru2-e9fc1263.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-ljspeech-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt408-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt138-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt624-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt396-e9fc1263.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt498-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt132-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt288-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt42-e9fc1263.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commencement-lt90-e9fc1263.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý commencement vừa có nghĩa là sự bắt đầu (formal) vừa có nghĩa là lễ tốt nghiệp.', 'education', 1, 13),
('6e54d1d9-cee0-5831-8995-d5f4ac573f1a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'bawl', '/bɔːl/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Khóc to, gào thét hoặc la hét.', 'to cry loudly or to shout something in a very loud voice.', 'The baby started to bawl loudly when he couldn\'t find his toy.', 'Em bé bắt đầu gào khóc ầm ĩ khi không tìm thấy đồ chơi của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The angry customer began to bawl at the receptionist over a delayed room service.\", \"vi\": \"Người khách hàng giận dữ bắt đầu la hét vào mặt nhân viên lễ tân vì dịch vụ phòng bị trễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-ljspeech-aa7d074c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-cori-aa7d074c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bawl-281bb089.webp', '[\"shout\", \"scream\", \"cry\"]', '[\"whisper\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bawl out\", \"meaning\": \"mắng mỏ ai đó dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bawl eyes out\", \"meaning\": \"khóc lóc thảm thiết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bowl\", \"note_vi\": \"cái bát hoặc trò chơi bowling, phát âm gần giống\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-cori-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru0-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru5-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru6-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru10-aa7d074c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru9-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru3-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru7-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru8-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-aru2-aa7d074c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-ljspeech-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt408-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt138-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt624-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt396-aa7d074c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt498-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt132-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt288-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt42-aa7d074c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bawl-lt90-aa7d074c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'bawl out\' rất hay gặp trong văn phong nói, nghĩa là mắng mỏ ai đó.', 'travel', 1, 14),
('f6ebc1ac-aa01-5cb0-9f94-d01d688f36aa', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'ditty', '/ˈdɪti/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một bài hát hoặc giai điệu ngắn, đơn giản và thường vui tươi.', 'a short, simple, and often happy song or piece of music that is easy to remember.', 'The children sang a cheerful little ditty as they played in the garden.', 'Lũ trẻ hát một bài hát ngắn vui vẻ khi chúng chơi trong vườn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team created a catchy ditty to help customers remember the brand\'s new slogan.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã tạo ra một giai điệu ngắn bắt tai để giúp khách hàng ghi nhớ khẩu hiệu mới của thương hiệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-ljspeech-76a9c956.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-cori-76a9c956.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ditty-537e4cd5.webp', '[\"jingle\", \"tune\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"catchy ditty\", \"meaning\": \"giai điệu ngắn bắt tai\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-cori-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru0-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru5-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru6-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru10-76a9c956.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru9-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru3-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru7-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru8-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-aru2-76a9c956.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-ljspeech-76a9c956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ditty-lt4