('1507c5fd-ebe0-5b3a-b24a-532c6fa76f2b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'midget', '/ˈmɪdʒɪt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'người có tầm vóc rất nhỏ (từ này có thể bị coi là xúc phạm).', 'a person who is extremely small because of a medical condition, often considered offensive today.', 'In some old tales, midgets are depicted as having magical powers.', 'Trong một số câu chuyện cổ, người lùn được miêu tả là có sức mạnh ma thuật.', '{\"en\": \"The historical document described the circus performers, including a midget, in a very outdated manner.\", \"vi\": \"Tài liệu lịch sử mô tả các nghệ sĩ xiếc, bao gồm cả một người tầm vóc nhỏ, theo cách rất lỗi thời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-ljspeech-3c280ce8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-cori-3c280ce8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/midget-7da2b584.webp', '[\"dwarf\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"circus midget\", \"meaning\": \"nghệ sĩ xiếc tầm vóc nhỏ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-cori-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru0-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru5-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru6-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru10-3c280ce8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru9-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru3-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru7-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru8-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-aru2-3c280ce8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-ljspeech-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt408-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt138-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt624-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt396-3c280ce8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt498-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt132-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt288-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt42-3c280ce8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/midget-lt90-3c280ce8.mp3\"]}}', 'Cảnh báo: Đây là từ nhạy cảm, nên dùng \'person of short stature\' để lịch sự.', 'other', 1, 18),
('cf904b49-291a-50cf-83be-b4a3e650105c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'pointer', '/ˈpɔɪntə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một cây gậy mảnh dùng để chỉ vào bản đồ, bảng hoặc màn hình.', 'a thin stick used to indicate things on a board or screen.', 'The teacher used a long pointer to highlight important information on the whiteboard.', 'Giáo viên dùng một cây que chỉ dài để làm nổi bật thông tin quan trọng trên bảng trắng.', '{\"en\": \"The trainer used a laser pointer during the sales meeting presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Người huấn luyện đã dùng một chiếc laser pointer trong buổi trình bày cuộc họp bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-ljspeech-b35bb38d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-cori-b35bb38d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pointer-03a745a4.webp', '[\"indicator\", \"rod\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"laser pointer\", \"meaning\": \"bút laser chỉ bảng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pointer stick\", \"meaning\": \"cây gậy chỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"painter\", \"note_vi\": \"không nhầm với painter (thợ sơn) dù phát âm hơi giống.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"point\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pointed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-cori-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru0-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru5-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru6-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru10-b35bb38d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru9-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru3-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru7-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru8-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-aru2-b35bb38d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-ljspeech-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt408-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt138-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt624-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt396-b35bb38d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt498-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt132-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt288-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt42-b35bb38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointer-lt90-b35bb38d.mp3\"]}}', 'Pointer là cây gậy chỉ, không phải painter (thợ vẽ).', 'office', 1, 19),
('bbc2384a-bc65-5e3e-9158-3ac2934b6cd8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'refute', '/rɪˈfjuːt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Bác bỏ, chứng minh một tuyên bố hoặc lý thuyết là sai.', 'Disprove an argument, claim, or accusation by presenting logical reasoning or clear evidence.', 'She presented evidence to refute the accusations against her.', 'Cô ấy đưa ra bằng chứng để bác bỏ những lời buộc tội chống lại mình.', '{\"en\": \"The financial analyst worked hard to refute the incorrect data presented in the quarterly report.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà phân tích tài chính đã làm việc chăm chỉ để bác bỏ dữ liệu không chính xác được trình bày trong báo cáo hàng quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-ljspeech-3411327b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-cori-3411327b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/refute-10b579f1.webp', '[\"disprove\", \"rebut\"]', '[\"confirm\", \"verify\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"refute an argument\", \"meaning\": \"bác bỏ một lập luận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"refute a claim\", \"meaning\": \"bác bỏ một tuyên bố\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"refuse\", \"note_vi\": \"Refuse là từ chối làm gì, còn refute là bác bỏ thông tin.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"refutation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-cori-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru0-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru5-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru6-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru10-3411327b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru9-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru3-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru7-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru8-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-aru2-3411327b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-ljspeech-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt408-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt138-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt624-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt396-3411327b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt498-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt132-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt288-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt42-3411327b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refute-lt90-3411327b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong ngữ cảnh tranh luận hoặc phản biện chuyên nghiệp.', 'business', 1, 20),
('b934f679-9e3d-510e-9373-f8654af2dfbd', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'entropy', '/ˈentrəpi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Mức độ không trật tự hoặc ngẫu nhiên trong một hệ thống.', 'the degree of disorder or randomness in a closed system.', 'In physics, entropy is a measure of the disorder or randomness in a system.', 'Trong vật lý, entropy là thước đo sự hỗn loạn hoặc ngẫu nhiên trong một hệ thống.', '{\"en\": \"The engineer measured the entropy to improve the manufacturing process efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ sư đã đo lường mức entropy để cải thiện hiệu quả quy trình sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-ljspeech-5f9395c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-cori-5f9395c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/entropy-bff3df23.webp', '[\"disorder\", \"randomness\"]', '[\"order\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increase entropy\", \"meaning\": \"làm tăng sự hỗn loạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"measure entropy\", \"meaning\": \"đo lường entropy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"energy\", \"note_vi\": \"entropy là entropy, energy là năng lượng, dễ phát âm nhầm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"entropic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-cori-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru0-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru5-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru6-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru10-5f9395c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru9-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru3-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru7-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru8-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-aru2-5f9395c3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-ljspeech-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt408-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt138-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt624-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt396-5f9395c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt498-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt132-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt288-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt42-5f9395c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/entropy-lt90-5f9395c3.mp3\"]}}', 'Entropy là thuật ngữ khoa học, không nhầm với energy (năng lượng).', 'manufacturing', 1, 21),
('bc51d505-c2ee-55b0-93a5-68665d5155ea', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'electromagnetism', '/ɪˌlektrəʊˈmæɡnətɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Ngành vật lý nghiên cứu mối quan hệ giữa điện và từ tính.', 'the branch of science that studies the forces between electrical charges and magnetic fields.', 'Maxwell\'s equations are fundamental to the study of electromagnetism.', 'Các phương trình của Maxwell là nền tảng cho việc nghiên cứu điện từ học.', '{\"en\": \"The engineering team applied principles of electromagnetism to design the new high-speed train.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kỹ sư đã áp dụng các nguyên lý điện từ học để thiết kế tàu cao tốc mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-ljspeech-9df7dd55.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-cori-9df7dd55.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/electromagnetism-753e81ca.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"laws of electromagnetism\", \"meaning\": \"các định luật điện từ học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"study of electromagnetism\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu điện từ học\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"electromagnetic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-cori-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru0-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru5-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru6-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru10-9df7dd55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru9-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru3-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru7-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru8-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-aru2-9df7dd55.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-ljspeech-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt408-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt138-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt624-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt396-9df7dd55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt498-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt132-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt288-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt42-9df7dd55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electromagnetism-lt90-9df7dd55.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghép từ electro- (điện) và magnetism (từ tính) để chỉ điện từ học.', 'technology', 1, 22),
('5cfc3148-9e49-51cb-8940-8cceaf354f28', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '35e7f9cf-0ac5-55cd-9262-723178ed3d19', '760f8a02-c095-5a40-a13e-e3fd32ab3d44', 'brinkmanship', '/ˈbrɪŋkmənʃɪp/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Chính sách đẩy tình hình đến bờ vực nguy hiểm để đạt được mục tiêu.', 'the practice of forcing a dangerous situation to the limit to achieve victory.', 'Their negotiation strategy involved a dangerous game of brinkmanship, risking a complete breakdown.', 'Chiến lược đàm phán của họ bao gồm một trò chơi chính sách bên bờ vực nguy hiểm, liều lĩnh gây ra sự đổ vỡ hoàn toàn.', '{\"en\": \"Both companies engaged in aggressive brinkmanship during the final stages of merger negotiations.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai công ty đều tham gia vào chiến thuật đẩy tình hình lên căng thẳng trong giai đoạn đàm phán sáp nhập cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brinkmanship-ljspeech-4f493cef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brinkmanship-cori-4f493cef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brinkmanship-1de2f7c1.webp', '[\"risk-taking\", \"confrontation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"political brinkmanship\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách liều lĩnh chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"diplomatic brinkmanship\", \"meaning\": \"ngoại giao bên miệng hố chiến tranh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sportsmanship\", \"note_vi\": \"Sportsmanship là tinh thần thể thao, brinkmanship là chiến thuật gây áp lực liều lĩnh.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brinkmanship-cori-4f493cef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brinkmanship-aru0-4f493cef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brinkmanship-aru5-4f493cef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brinkmanship-aru6-4f493cef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brinkmanship-aru10-4f493cef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brinkmanship-aru9-4f493cef.mp3\", \