('bf3162e0-8b1b-52ec-b82c-55e113e03e13', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'draining', '/dreɪn/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây mệt mỏi, làm cạn kiệt sức lực.', 'making you feel very tired and without any energy.', 'The long journey was physically and emotionally draining.', 'Chuyến đi dài đã làm kiệt quệ cả về thể chất lẫn tinh thần.', '{\"en\": \"Working overtime for three consecutive weeks proved to be extremely draining for the design team.\", \"vi\": \"Làm việc tăng ca trong ba tuần liên tiếp tỏ ra vô cùng kiệt sức đối với đội ngũ thiết kế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-ljspeech-d4a53a10.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-cori-d4a53a10.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/draining-1dbd04ff.webp', '[\"exhausting\", \"tiring\", \"wearisome\"]', '[\"energizing\", \"refreshing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"physically draining\", \"meaning\": \"vắt kiệt sức lực thể chất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"emotionally draining\", \"meaning\": \"vắt kiệt sức lực tinh thần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tiring\", \"note_vi\": \"tiring là mệt mỏi thông thường, draining là kiệt quệ hoàn toàn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"drain\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"drain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-cori-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru0-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru5-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru6-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru10-d4a53a10.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru9-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru3-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru7-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru8-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-aru2-d4a53a10.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-ljspeech-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt408-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt138-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt624-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt396-d4a53a10.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt498-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt132-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt288-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt42-d4a53a10.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draining-lt90-d4a53a10.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy nhớ draining mang nghĩa tiêu cực, làm cạn kiệt năng lượng như nước chảy xuống cống.', 'hr', 1, 4),
('a9a93b48-edaa-5cc8-bacc-0d5bba260c7b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'lithium', 'UK: /ˈlɪθ.i.əm/ | US: /ˈlɪθ.i.əm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'liti (nguyên tố hóa học)', 'a soft, silver-white chemical element used in manufacturing rechargeable batteries for modern devices.', 'Lithium is used in batteries for electronic devices.', 'Liti được sử dụng trong pin của các thiết bị điện tử.', '{\"en\": \"The electronics manufacturer signed a supply agreement for high-grade lithium to produce electric vehicle batteries.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sản xuất đồ điện tử đã ký hợp đồng cung ứng liti cấp cao để sản xuất pin xe điện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-ljspeech-c5004576.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-cori-c5004576.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lithium-bda80695.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lithium battery\", \"meaning\": \"pin liti\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lithium-ion cell\", \"meaning\": \"cell pin lithium-ion\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-cori-c5004576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru0-c5004576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru5-c5004576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru6-c5004576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru10-c5004576.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru9-c5004576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru3-c5004576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru7-c5004576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru8-c5004576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-aru2-c5004576.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithium-ljspeech-c5004576.mp3\", 