('1636cc8f-aec8-5ff8-948a-b7da23ad897a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'best boy', '/best bɔɪ/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Trợ lý chính cho trưởng bộ phận ánh sáng hoặc âm thanh trong sản xuất phim.', 'the main assistant to the person in charge of lighting or electrical equipment on a film set.', 'The best boy made sure all the lighting equipment was ready for the next scene.', 'Trợ lí kĩ thuật đã đảm bảo tất cả thiết bị chiếu sáng sẵn sàng cho cảnh quay tiếp theo.', '{\"en\": \"The production company is currently hiring a best boy to assist with their upcoming commercial shoot.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sản xuất hiện đang thuê một trợ lý ánh sáng để hỗ trợ cho buổi quay quảng cáo sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-ljspeech-c32c459f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-cori-c32c459f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/best-boy-665fb1f6.webp', '[\"assistant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"best boy grip\", \"meaning\": \"trợ lý thiết bị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"best boy electric\", \"meaning\": \"trợ lý ánh sáng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-cori-c32c459f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru0-c32c459f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru5-c32c459f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru6-c32c459f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru10-c32c459f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru9-c32c459f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru3-c32c459f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru7-c32c459f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru8-c32c459f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/best-boy-aru2-c32c459f.mp3