('3b7fe1d4-c9c9-51ce-b254-549694a36ba0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'troupe', 'UK: /truːp/ | US: /truːp/', 'C1', 'noun', 'đoàn (biểu diễn)', 'a group of actors, singers, or dancers who travel and perform together.', 'The dance troupe prepared for the upcoming show.', 'Đoàn múa chuẩn bị cho buổi biểu diễn sắp tới.', '{\"en\": \"The international dance troupe will perform at the corporate gala dinner next Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Đoàn múa quốc tế sẽ biểu diễn tại bữa tiệc tối trang trọng của công ty vào thứ Sáu tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-ljspeech-15b357bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-cori-15b357bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/troupe-c281626a.webp', '[\"group\", \"company\", \"band\", \"ensemble\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dance troupe\", \"meaning\": \"đoàn múa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"theater troupe\", \"meaning\": \"đoàn kịch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"troop\", \"note_vi\": \"Troop chỉ quân đội, toán lính, còn troupe chỉ đoàn nghệ sĩ biểu diễn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-cori-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru0-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru5-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru6-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru10-15b357bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru9-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru3-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru7-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru8-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-aru2-15b357bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-ljspeech-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt408-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt138-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt624-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt396-15b357bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt498-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt132-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt288-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt42-15b357bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troupe-lt90-15b357bb.mp3\"]}}', '\'Troupe\' phát âm giống \'troop\', nhưng \'troupe\' chỉ dùng cho đoàn nghệ sĩ/diễn viên/vũ công biểu diễn.', 'entertainment', 1, 13),
('cdd5c1f7-6fcf-5da0-8425-844d92b300f2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'self-reliant', '/ˌself rɪˈlaɪənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tự lực, độc lập, không phụ thuộc vào người khác.', 'able to do things and make decisions for yourself without needing help from others.', 'After moving out, she quickly became self-reliant, managing all her finances and chores.', 'Sau khi ra ở riêng, cô ấy nhanh chóng trở nên tự lực, tự quản lý mọi tài chính và việc nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The manager prefers to hire self-reliant employees who can complete tasks without constant supervision.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý ưu tiên tuyển dụng những nhân viên tự lực, có thể hoàn thành công việc mà không cần giám sát liên tục.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-ljspeech-1fe2727d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-cori-1fe2727d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/self-reliant-00b4a61e.webp', '[\"independent\", \"self-sufficient\", \"autonomous\"]', '[\"dependent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"become self-reliant\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên tự lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly self-reliant\", \"meaning\": \"rất độc lập/tự lực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"self-reliance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-cori-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru0-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru5-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru6-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru10-1fe2727d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru9-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru3-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru7-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru8-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-aru2-1fe2727d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-ljspeech-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt408-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt138-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt624-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt396-1fe2727d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt498-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt132-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt288-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt42-1fe2727d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-reliant-lt90-1fe2727d.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ tích cực thường dùng để mô tả tính cách nhân viên trong bài đọc TOEIC.', 'hr', 1, 14),
('718de834-ad1a-513c-9cc4-3e2c159401fd', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'chaconne', '/ʃəˈkɒn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một hình thức âm nhạc cổ điển dựa trên một chuỗi hợp âm lặp lại.', 'a classical music piece that is based on a short repeating series of chords.', 'Bach\'s Chaconne from the Partita in D minor is a masterpiece for solo violin.', 'Bản Chaconne của Bach trong Partita cung Rê thứ là một kiệt tác dành cho violin độc tấu.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby played a soft chaconne to create a relaxing atmosphere for guests.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn đã phát một bản nhạc chaconne nhẹ nhàng để tạo không khí thư giãn cho khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-ljspeech-5dbbd4fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-cori-5dbbd4fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chaconne-e80ef395.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"classical chaconne\", \"meaning\": \"bản nhạc chaconne cổ điển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compose a chaconne\", \"meaning\": \"sáng tác một bản nhạc chaconne\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-cori-5dbbd4fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru0-5dbbd4fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru5-5dbbd4fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru6-5dbbd4fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru10-5dbbd4fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru9-5dbbd4fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru3-5dbbd4fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru7-5dbbd4fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru8-5dbbd4fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaconne-aru2-5dbbd4fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage