('6b51af2b-11fa-5edd-98e3-6f7e302752d7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'processor', '/ˈprəʊsesə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Bộ phận trong máy tính thực hiện các phép tính và lệnh.', 'a part of a computer that controls all the other parts and performs calculations.', 'A powerful processor is essential for running complex software smoothly.', 'Một bộ xử lý mạnh mẽ là điều cần thiết để chạy phần mềm phức tạp một cách trơn tru.', '{\"en\": \"We need to upgrade the processor in this server to handle the new accounting software efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần nâng cấp bộ vi xử lý trong máy chủ này để chạy phần mềm kế toán mới một cách hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-ljspeech-8eab5a6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-cori-8eab5a6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/processor-a28ea25c.webp', '[\"cpu\", \"microprocessor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"word processor\", \"meaning\": \"phần mềm xử lý văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"food processor\", \"meaning\": \"máy xay đa năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fast processor\", \"meaning\": \"bộ vi xử lý nhanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"process\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"process\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"processing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-cori-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru0-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru5-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru6-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru10-8eab5a6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru9-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru3-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru7-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru8-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-aru2-8eab5a6d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-ljspeech-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt408-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt138-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt624-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt396-8eab5a6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt498-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt132-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt288-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt42-8eab5a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processor-lt90-8eab5a6d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong các bài đọc TOEIC về mua sắm thiết bị văn phòng.', 'technology', 1, 16),
('afb3b481-9028-5bb6-88b3-af3db65a69ae', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'depreciation', '/dɪˌpriːʃiˈeɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự giảm giá trị của tài sản theo thời gian do hao mòn hoặc lỗi thời.', 'the process of an asset losing value over time because of wear or becoming old.', 'Cars typically experience significant depreciation in their first few years of ownership.', 'Ô tô thường bị mất giá đáng kể trong vài năm đầu sở hữu.', '{\"en\": \"The accountant calculated the annual depreciation of the office equipment to prepare the company\'s tax report.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán đã tính toán mức khấu hao hàng năm của thiết bị văn phòng để chuẩn bị báo cáo thuế của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-ljspeech-28e734a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-cori-28e734a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/depreciation-1d36a34d.webp', '[\"devaluation\", \"loss in value\"]', '[\"appreciation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"annual depreciation\", \"meaning\": \"khấu hao hàng năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"calculate depreciation\", \"meaning\": \"tính khấu hao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"appreciation\", \"note_vi\": \"appreciation là tăng giá trị, depreciation là giảm giá trị.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"depreciate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-cori-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru0-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru5-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru6-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru10-28e734a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru9-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru3-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru7-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru8-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-aru2-28e734a5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-ljspeech-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt408-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt138-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt624-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt396-28e734a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt498-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt132-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt288-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt42-28e734a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciation-lt90-28e734a5.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất quan trọng trong kế toán và tài chính doanh nghiệp.', 'finance', 1, 17),
('7e99e6e2-213a-53ee-83aa-517a09c03eaa', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'immaterial', '/ˌɪməˈtɪəriəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không quan trọng, không liên quan hoặc không đáng kể.', 'not important, relevant, or significant in a given situation.', 'Whether he arrives five minutes late is completely immaterial to the outcome of the meeting.', 'Việc anh ấy đến muộn năm phút hoàn toàn không quan trọng đối với kết quả cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The slight delay in shipping is immaterial to our overall quarterly profit.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chậm trễ nhẹ trong vận chuyển không quan trọng với lợi nhuận quý của ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-ljspeech-acc82cb1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-cori-acc82cb1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/immaterial-f3602fe9.webp', '[\"irrelevant\", \"unimportant\", \"insignificant\"]', '[\"important\", \"relevant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"immaterial point\", \"meaning\": \"điểm không đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immaterial detail\", \"meaning\": \"chi tiết không quan trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"immaterial to\", \"meaning\": \"không liên quan tới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"immature\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là chưa trưởng thành, dễ nhầm âm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"material\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"immateriality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-cori-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru0-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru5-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru6-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru10-acc82cb1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru9-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru3-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru7-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru8-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-aru2-acc82cb1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-ljspeech-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt408-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt138-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt624-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt396-acc82cb1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt498-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt132-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt288-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt42-acc82cb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/immaterial-lt90-acc82cb1.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ trái nghĩa với \'material\' (quan trọng); không nhầm \'immature\' (chưa lớn).', 'finance', 1, 18),
('4c8f7109-7b6a-5b0f-8f87-6169d7ca9d17', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'discerning', '/dɪˈsɜːnɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng nhận biết, đánh giá tốt; tinh tế.', 'able to show good judgment about the quality of things.', 'She has a discerning eye for fashion and always chooses the most elegant outfits.', 'Cô ấy có con mắt tinh tường về thời trang và luôn chọn những bộ trang phục thanh lịch nhất.', '{\"en\": \"Our boutique hotel offers luxury services designed to satisfy even the most discerning guests.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cao cấp của chúng tôi cung cấp dịch vụ sang trọng được thiết kế để làm hài lòng cả những vị khách tinh tế nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-ljspeech-1f5d8d43.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-cori-1f5d8d43.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/discerning-75416d71.webp', '[\"discriminating\", \"perceptive\", \"astute\"]', '[\"indiscriminate\", \"uncritical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"discerning customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng tinh tế có gu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"discerning eye\", \"meaning\": \"con mắt tinh đời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"discerning\", \"note_vi\": \"sáng suốt, tinh tế trong đánh giá.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"discern\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"discernment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-cori-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru0-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru5-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru6-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru10-1f5d8d43.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru9-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru3-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru7-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru8-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-aru2-1f5d8d43.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-ljspeech-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt408-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt138-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt624-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt396-1f5d8d43.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt498-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt132-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt288-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt42-1f5d8d43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discerning-lt90-1f5d8d43.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để miêu tả người có gu thẩm mỹ cao hoặc khả năng nhận xét sắc bén.', 'marketing', 1, 19),
('665e1982-137b-5bb9-bca3-2ef143ef7c8d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'grin and bear it', '/ɡrɪn ən beər ɪt/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Chấp nhận một tình huống khó chịu mà không phàn nàn.', 'To endure an unfortunate circumstance patiently and without voicing dissatisfaction or suffering.', 'The project was difficult, but we had to grin and bear it until it was finished.', 'Dự án rất khó khăn, nhưng chúng tôi phải cắn răng chịu đựng cho đến khi hoàn thành.', '{\"en\": \"During the office renovation, employees had to grin and bear it despite the ongoing noise.\", \"vi\": \"Trong thời gian cải tạo văn phòng, nhân viên phải ngậm đắng nuốt cay chịu đựng bất chấp tiếng ồn kéo dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-ljspeech-1da9f977.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-cori-1da9f977.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grin-and-bear-it-b22cf508.webp', '[\"endure\", \"tolerate\", \"put up with\"]', '[\"complain\", \"protest\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-cori-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru0-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru5-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru6-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru10-1da9f977.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru9-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru3-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru7-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru8-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-aru2-1da9f977.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-ljspeech-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt408-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt138-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt624-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt396-1da9f977.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt498-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt132-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt288-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt42-1da9f977.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grin-and-bear-it-lt90-1da9f977.mp3\"]}}', 'bản thân đầu vào đã là thành ngữ (idiom) nên trường idioms để mảng rỗng.', 'office', 1, 20),
('3864f59c-e47d-5141-89d3-37476eb04976', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'formulate', 'UK: /ˈfɔːmjuleɪt/ | US: /ˈfɔrmjuˌleɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'đề ra, hình thành, xây dựng', 'To create, plan, or prepare something in a careful and systematic way.', 'The team needs to formulate a new strategy for growth.', 'Đội cần đề ra một chiến lược mới để phát triển.', '{\"en\": \"The executive committee will convene next Monday to formulate a comprehensive business strategy.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban điều hành sẽ họp vào thứ Hai tuần tới để xây dựng một chiến lược kinh doanh toàn diện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-ljspeech-85533010.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-cori-85533010.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/formulate-4e4af975.webp', '[\"devise\", \"develop\", \"draft\", \"create\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"formulate a strategy\", \"meaning\": \"xây dựng một chiến lược\"}, {\"phrase\": \"formulate a policy\", \"meaning\": \"đề ra một chính sách\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"formula\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"formulation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-cori-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru0-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru5-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru6-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru10-85533010.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru9-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru3-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru7-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru8-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-aru2-85533010.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-ljspeech-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt408-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt138-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt624-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt396-85533010.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt498-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt132-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt288-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt42-85533010.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/formulate-lt90-85533010.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với các từ như strategy (chiến lược), policy (chính sách), plan (kế hoạch).', 'management', 1, 21),
('fb884d91-26bf-5a75-990c-a479a91b0928', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'misdemeanor', '/ˌmɪsdɪˈmiːnə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tội phạm ít nghiêm trọng hơn trọng tội, thường bị phạt nhẹ.', 'a minor crime that is not considered very serious by the law in a country.', 'Shoplifting is generally considered a misdemeanor, not a felony.', 'Tội ăn cắp vặt thường được coi là tội nhẹ, không phải trọng tội.', '{\"en\": \"The employee was fired after committing a misdemeanor involving the misuse of company property.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đó đã bị sa thải sau khi phạm một tội nhẹ liên quan đến việc lạm dụng tài sản công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-ljspeech-7b82cd01.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-cori-7b82cd01.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/misdemeanor-a20c380c.webp', '[\"offense\", \"infraction\"]', '[\"felony\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"commit a misdemeanor\", \"meaning\": \"phạm tội nhẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"misdemeanor charge\", \"meaning\": \"cáo buộc tội nhẹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"felony\", \"note_vi\": \"felony là tội nặng, misdemeanor là tội nhẹ hơn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-cori-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru0-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru5-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru6-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru10-7b82cd01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru9-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru3-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru7-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru8-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-aru2-7b82cd01.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-ljspeech-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt408-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt138-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt624-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt396-7b82cd01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt498-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt132-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt288-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt42-7b82cd01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misdemeanor-lt90-7b82cd01.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \"felony\" (trọng tội) là tội rất nghiêm trọng.', 'law', 1, 22),
('889a7ad9-d972-5ff6-9105-25183484cc73', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '37e3a87a-8ddb-557b-9b02-43625b66b7ee', 'b2044891-0977-5631-8f1a-1c718e11dc23', 'lagoon', '/ləˈɡuːn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một vùng nước mặn nông được ngăn cách với biển lớn bởi dải đất hoặc rạn san hô.', 'an area of sea water separated from the ocean by a line of rock or sand.', 'The calm, clear waters of the lagoon were perfect for snorkeling.', 'Vùng nước trong xanh, yên tĩnh của đầm phá rất lý tưởng để lặn với ống thở.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury resort features private villas built directly over the beautiful blue waters of the lagoon.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng sang trọng có các biệt thự riêng được xây dựng trực tiếp trên làn nước trong xanh tuyệt đẹp của đầm phá.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-ljspeech-a30fb066.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-cori-a30fb066.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lagoon-61387c67.webp', '[\"bay\", \"cove\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"blue lagoon\", \"meaning\": \"đầm phá xanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coastal lagoon\", \"meaning\": \"đầm phá ven biển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lake\", \"note_vi\": \"\'lake\' thường là nước ngọt, \'lagoon\' là nước mặn ven biển.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-cori-a30fb066.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-aru0-a30fb066.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-aru5-a30fb066.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-aru6-a30fb066.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-aru10-a30fb066.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-aru9-a30fb066.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-aru3-a30fb066.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-aru7-a30fb066.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lagoon-aru8-a30fb066.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj