('5c8a93b8-1fd9-5ec5-88ba-c03821aeb23c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '39d7ea3f-ec3d-5965-b008-2ff2a823c168', '8c6fe0e9-8857-5e77-8250-32df8253b743', 'avian', '/ˈeɪviən/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về hoặc liên quan đến loài chim.', 'relating to or connected with birds, often used in scientific or medical contexts regarding animals.', 'The sanctuary is dedicated to protecting various avian species.', 'Khu bảo tồn này dành riêng cho việc bảo vệ các loài chim khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The research team is studying the spread of the avian virus in local poultry farms.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đang nghiên cứu sự lây lan của virus cúm gia cầm tại các trang trại địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-ljspeech-e11dd420.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-cori-e11dd420.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/avian-d7bfcd94.webp', '[\"bird-related\", \"winged\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"avian flu\", \"meaning\": \"cúm gia cầm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avian species\", \"meaning\": \"các loài chim\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"aviation\", \"note_vi\": \"aviation là hàng không, avian liên quan đến chim chóc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-cori-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru0-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru5-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru6-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru10-e11dd420.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru9-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru3-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru7-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru8-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-aru2-e11dd420.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-ljspeech-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt408-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt138-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt624-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt396-e11dd420.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt498-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt132-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt288-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt42-e11dd420.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avian-lt90-e11dd420.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'aviation\' (hàng không), avian liên quan đến chim chóc.', 'health', 1, 11),
('72188822-bead-566a-bd1e-89781cddda5f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '39d7ea3f-ec3d-5965-b008-2ff2a823c168', '8c6fe0e9-8857-5e77-8250-32df8253b743', 'protagonist', '/prəˈtæɡənɪst/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Nhân vật chính hoặc người hùng trong một câu chuyện, bộ phim hoặc vở kịch.', 'the main character in a play, film, or book who drives the story forward.', 'The protagonist of the novel embarks on a perilous journey to save his kingdom.', 'Nhân vật chính của cuốn tiểu thuyết bắt đầu một cuộc hành trình đầy nguy hiểm để cứu vương quốc của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s CEO acted as the protagonist in the new promotional video for the brand.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành của công ty đóng vai trò là nhân vật chính trong video quảng bá thương hiệu mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-ljspeech-533a8ff0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-cori-533a8ff0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/protagonist-f0683448.webp', '[\"hero\", \"lead\"]', '[\"antagonist\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"main protagonist\", \"meaning\": \"nhân vật chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"central protagonist\", \"meaning\": \"nhân vật trung tâm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-cori-533a8ff0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-aru0-533a8ff0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-aru5-533a8ff0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-aru6-533a8ff0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-aru10-533a8ff0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-aru9-533a8ff0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-aru3-533a8ff0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-aru7-533a8ff0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/protagonist-aru8-533a8ff0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/