('5562726b-ff4a-5c4f-bff4-280e7458fac0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '437908ee-423e-5254-9eec-7c06de8ae744', 'b9b589d2-daa3-578f-93f8-5757c428adeb', 'jagged', '/ˈdʒæɡɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có cạnh sắc, lởm chởm, không đều.', 'having rough, sharp points protruding from an edge or surface.', 'The broken glass had a jagged edge, making it dangerous to handle.', 'Mảnh kính vỡ có cạnh sắc lởm chởm, rất nguy hiểm khi cầm.', '{\"en\": \"The worker wore thick gloves to protect his hands from the jagged metal sheets.\", \"vi\": \"Người công nhân đã đeo găng tay dày để bảo vệ tay khỏi những tấm kim loại có cạnh sắc lởm chởm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-ljspeech-bb4d6135.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-cori-bb4d6135.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jagged-759a2ef7.webp', '[\"uneven\", \"rough\", \"pointed\"]', '[\"smooth\", \"even\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"jagged edge\", \"meaning\": \"cạnh lởm chởm sắc nhọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"jagged rocks\", \"meaning\": \"đá lởm chởm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-cori-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru0-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru5-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru6-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru10-bb4d6135.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru9-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru3-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru7-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru8-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-aru2-bb4d6135.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-ljspeech-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt408-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt138-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt624-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt396-bb4d6135.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt498-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt132-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt288-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt42-bb4d6135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jagged-lt90-bb4d6135.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để mô tả các bề mặt bị vỡ hoặc cắt không đều như kính, đá, kim loại.', 'manufacturing', 1, 6),
('6f87eec2-cfb8-54e4-a748-d1fc7bc088d3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '437908ee-423e-5254-9eec-7c06de8ae744', 'b9b589d2-daa3-578f-93f8-5757c428adeb', 'hand-to-mouth', '/ˈhændtəˌmaʊθ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Sống chật vật, chỉ đủ ăn từng bữa, không có tích lũy.', 'having only just enough money or food to live on now, without saving.', 'Unemployed workers struggling with high inflation often face a hand-to-mouth lifestyle.', 'Những người lao động mất việc phải trải qua cuộc sống chật vật, chỉ đủ ăn qua ngày.', '{\"en\": \"Before the business became successful, the founders lived a hand-to-mouth existence for two years.\", \"vi\": \"Trước khi doanh nghiệp thành công, các nhà sáng lập đã sống một cuộc sống chật vật trong hai năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-ljspeech-9543c981.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-cori-9543c981.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hand-to-mouth-171f6af2.webp', '[\"impoverished\", \"precarious\", \"poor\"]', '[\"wealthy\", \"prosperous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hand-to-mouth existence\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc sống chật vật qua ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hand-to-mouth living\", \"meaning\": \"lối sống thắt lưng buộc bụng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-cori-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru0-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru5-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru6-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru10-9543c981.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru9-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru3-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru7-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru8-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-aru2-9543c981.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-ljspeech-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt408-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt138-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt624-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt396-9543c981.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt498-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt132-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt288-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt42-9543c981.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hand-to-mouth-lt90-9543c981.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng dưới dạng cụm \'live from hand to mouth\' hoặc tính từ \'hand-to-mouth existence\'.', 'finance', 1, 7),
('571a78fd-117e-5fd6-8e1c-cc414fca94ed', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '437908ee-423e-5254-9eec-7c06de8ae744', 'b9b589d2-daa3-578f-93f8-5757c428adeb', 'bog down', '/bɒɡ daʊn/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Gặp khó khăn, bị mắc kẹt và không thể tiến triển.', 'to become so involved in details that you cannot make progress.', 'The negotiations got bogged down over minor details, delaying the agreement.', 'Các cuộc đàm phán bị sa lầy vì những chi tiết nhỏ, làm chậm trễ thỏa thuận.', '{\"en\": \"We should not let the project bog down in endless technical meetings this week.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta không nên để dự án bị đình trệ trong các cuộc họp kỹ thuật kéo dài tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-ljspeech-983d6581.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-cori-983d6581.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bog-down-161328c9.webp', '[\"stall\", \"stagnate\", \"delay\"]', '[\"progress\", \"advance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get bogged down\", \"meaning\": \"bị sa lầy, mắc kẹt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bog down in details\", \"meaning\": \"sa lầy vào chi tiết\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-cori-983d6581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru0-983d6581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru5-983d6581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru6-983d6581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru10-983d6581.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru9-983d6581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru3-983d6581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru7-983d6581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru8-983d6581.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bog-down-aru2-983d6581.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1