('9ac6e08f-207c-5406-8f47-f8ed87a9d853', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '437908ee-423e-5254-9eec-7c06de8ae744', 'b9b589d2-daa3-578f-93f8-5757c428adeb', 'supervisory', 'UK: /ˌsuːpəˈvaɪzəri/ | US: /ˌsuːpərˈvaɪzəri/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'thuộc về giám sát', 'connected with the job of directing and overseeing the work of others', 'He has extensive supervisory experience in management.', 'Ông ấy có kinh nghiệm giám sát sâu rộng trong quản lý.', '{\"en\": \"Candidates with previous supervisory experience are strongly encouraged to apply for the position.\", \"vi\": \"Những ứng viên có kinh nghiệm giám sát trước đó được khuyến khích nộp đơn cho vị trí này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-ljspeech-cb9ab228.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-cori-cb9ab228.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supervisory-54d3f5f1.webp', '[\"managerial\", \"executive\", \"administrative\", \"directorial\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"supervisory board\", \"meaning\": \"hội đồng giám sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supervisory role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò giám sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supervisory skills\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ năng giám sát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"supervisor\", \"note_vi\": \"Supervisor là danh từ (người giám sát), còn supervisory là tính từ (thuộc về giám sát).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"supervise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supervision\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supervisor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-cori-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru0-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru5-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru6-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru10-cb9ab228.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru9-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru3-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru7-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru8-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-aru2-cb9ab228.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-ljspeech-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt408-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt138-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt624-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt396-cb9ab228.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt498-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt132-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt288-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt42-cb9ab228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisory-lt90-cb9ab228.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ thường đứng trước danh từ để bổ nghĩa, ví dụ: \'supervisory board\' (hội đồng giám sát), \'supervisory role\' (vai trò giám sát).', 'office', 1, 25),
('a72e1d97-cbc4-55ad-a258-7b4d3b53cafb', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '437908ee-423e-5254-9eec-7c06de8ae744', 'b9b589d2-daa3-578f-93f8-5757c428adeb', 'laud', '/lɔːd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Khen ngợi, tán dương ai đó hoặc điều gì đó.', 'to praise someone or something highly for their achievement.', 'The critics unanimously lauded her performance in the new play.', 'Các nhà phê bình đồng lòng khen ngợi màn trình diễn của cô ấy trong vở kịch mới.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO lauded the sales team for exceeding quarterly targets.\", \"vi\": \"CEO khen ngợi đội ngũ bán hàng vì đã vượt chỉ tiêu quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-ljspeech-cd818625.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-cori-cd818625.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/laud-1ba95498.webp', '[\"praise\", \"commend\", \"applaud\"]', '[\"criticize\", \"blame\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"laud someone\", \"meaning\": \"khen ngợi ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"laud the effort\", \"meaning\": \"tán dương nỗ lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly lauded\", \"meaning\": \"được tán dương nhiều\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"loud\", \"note_vi\": \"loud nghĩa là ồn, không phải khen ngợi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"laudable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"laudation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-cori-cd818625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-aru0-cd818625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-aru5-cd818625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-aru6-cd818625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-aru10-cd818625.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-aru9-cd818625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-aru3-cd818625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-aru7-cd818625.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/laud-aru8-cd818625.mp3\", \"/stora