('8d50dbf2-1105-5c99-8ab8-d62fe758966d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '4416e840-ea13-59af-874f-fccb4d8b5c26', 'bf4a6ba8-3977-527e-a9fc-8be88734ca07', 'restitution', '/ˌrestɪˈtjuːʃn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hành động hoàn trả hoặc đền bù cho thiệt hại, mất mát đã gây ra.', 'the act of returning something or paying money to make up for a loss or damage.', 'The court ordered the thief to make full restitution to the victims.', 'Tòa án yêu cầu tên trộm phải bồi thường đầy đủ cho các nạn nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The company agreed to make full restitution to customers who received the defective product batch.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đồng ý bồi thường đầy đủ cho những khách hàng đã nhận lô sản phẩm lỗi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-ljspeech-08652ecc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-cori-08652ecc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/restitution-96f9a39c.webp', '[\"compensation\", \"repayment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make restitution\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện bồi thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full restitution\", \"meaning\": \"sự bồi thường đầy đủ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"restitute\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-cori-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru0-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru5-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru6-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru10-08652ecc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru9-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru3-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru7-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru8-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-aru2-08652ecc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-ljspeech-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt408-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt138-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt624-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt396-08652ecc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt498-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt132-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt288-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt42-08652ecc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restitution-lt90-08652ecc.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh pháp lý hoặc bồi thường thiệt hại.', 'law', 1, 10),
('bd355d8f-d1f1-5e1a-a956-35a0af8b826c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '4416e840-ea13-59af-874f-fccb4d8b5c26', 'bf4a6ba8-3977-527e-a9fc-8be88734ca07', 'soul-destroying', '/ˌsəʊl dɪˈstrɔɪɪŋ/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Rất tẻ nhạt hoặc khó khăn đến mức làm mất đi niềm vui sống.', 'extremely boring or unpleasant, making you lose all energy, hope, and happiness.', 'Working in a factory with repetitive tasks can be incredibly soul-destroying.', 'Làm việc trong nhà máy với những công việc lặp đi lặp lại có thể cực kỳ tẻ nhạt và gây chán nản.', '{\"en\": \"Entering data manually into the system all day was a soul-destroying task for the intern.\", \"vi\": \"Việc nhập dữ liệu thủ công vào hệ thống cả ngày là một công việc cực kỳ tẻ nhạt đối với thực tập sinh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-ljspeech-3ce4e11b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-cori-3ce4e11b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/soul-destroying-0c9548be.webp', '[\"mind-numbing\", \"monotonous\", \"tedious\"]', '[\"soul-stirring\", \"inspiring\", \"rewarding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"soul-destroying work\", \"meaning\": \"công việc tẻ nhạt đến kiệt quệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soul-destroying job\", \"meaning\": \"công việc làm mất đi niềm vui sống\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-cori-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru0-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru5-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru6-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru10-3ce4e11b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru9-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru3-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru7-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru8-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-aru2-3ce4e11b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-ljspeech-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt408-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt138-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt624-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt396-3ce4e11b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt498-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt132-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt288-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt42-3ce4e11b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soul-destroying-lt90-3ce4e11b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ ghép kết hợp giữa soul (tâm hồn) và destroy (hủy hoại).', 'hr', 1, 11),
('0278109d-85c8-5965-84a3-4b12dfa97f9c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '4416e840-ea13-59af-874f-fccb4d8b5c26', 'bf4a6ba8-3977-527e-a9fc-8be88734ca07', 'onslaught', '/ˈɒnslɔːt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một cuộc tấn công dữ dội hoặc một lượng lớn thứ gì đó ập đến.', 'a sudden and powerful arrival of a large number of things or people at once.', 'The small village struggled to withstand the relentless onslaught of enemy forces.', 'Ngôi làng nhỏ đã chật vật chống đỡ cuộc tấn công không ngừng của quân địch.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service department was unprepared for the sudden onslaught of complaints after the update.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận dịch vụ khách hàng đã không chuẩn bị cho sự ập đến đột ngột của các khiếu nại sau bản cập nhật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-ljspeech-e40d088b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-cori-e40d088b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/onslaught-2f48ee60.webp', '[\"barrage\", \"rush\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"onslaught of requests\", \"meaning\": \"sự dồn dập các yêu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relentless onslaught\", \"meaning\": \"sự tấn công không ngừng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-cori-e40d088b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-aru0-e40d088b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-aru5-e40d088b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-aru6-e40d088b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-aru10-e40d088b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-aru9-e40d088b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-aru3-e40d088b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-aru7-e40d088b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaught-aru8-e40d088b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/onslaugh