('f7040cce-2d26-5366-98a7-b7e25320a3bc', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '462fafce-39c8-5ca8-82ad-184d3c1c9973', '983b11bd-1e2c-5b75-b94f-7061b53c4553', 'diverge', '/daɪˈvɜːdʒ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Rẽ ra hoặc tách ra khỏi một điểm chung, đi theo các hướng khác nhau.', 'to move in different directions from a starting point or become different from each other.', 'The two paths diverge here; we need to decide which way to go.', 'Hai con đường rẽ nhánh ở đây; chúng ta cần quyết định đi lối nào.', '{\"en\": \"Market trends often diverge when consumer preferences shift toward new technology in the retail sector.\", \"vi\": \"Xu hướng thị trường thường rẽ hướng khi sở thích người tiêu dùng chuyển sang công nghệ mới trong lĩnh vực bán lẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-ljspeech-b713e121.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-cori-b713e121.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diverge-f480eb62.webp', '[\"deviate\", \"separate\"]', '[\"converge\", \"unite\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"opinions diverge\", \"meaning\": \"ý kiến bất đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"paths diverge\", \"meaning\": \"các con đường rẽ hướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"divert\", \"note_vi\": \"Divert là chuyển hướng cái gì đó, diverge là tự rẽ ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"divergence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"divergent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-cori-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru0-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru5-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru6-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru10-b713e121.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru9-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru3-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru7-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru8-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-aru2-b713e121.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-ljspeech-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt408-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt138-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt624-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt396-b713e121.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt498-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt132-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt288-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt42-b713e121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diverge-lt90-b713e121.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với \'converge\' (hội tụ).', 'business', 1, 11),
('8979f04e-f6c4-5d91-a1f0-6d06580bb533', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '462fafce-39c8-5ca8-82ad-184d3c1c9973', '983b11bd-1e2c-5b75-b94f-7061b53c4553', 'drained', '/dreɪnd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy rất mệt mỏi, kiệt sức về thể chất hoặc tinh thần.', 'very tired and lacking energy, especially after hard work or stress.', 'After working all night, she felt completely drained and needed to rest.', 'Sau khi làm việc cả đêm, cô ấy cảm thấy hoàn toàn kiệt sức và cần phải nghỉ ngơi.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant looked completely drained after presenting the financial report to executives.\", \"vi\": \"Vị cố vấn trông hoàn toàn kiệt sức sau khi trình bày báo cáo tài chính cho các giám đốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-ljspeech-07320a06.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-cori-07320a06.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drained-c3a22928.webp', '[\"exhausted\", \"depleted\", \"fatigued\"]', '[\"refreshed\", \"energized\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"emotionally drained\", \"meaning\": \"kiệt sức về mặt cảm xúc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel drained\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy cạn kiệt năng lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dry\", \"note_vi\": \"drained dùng cho mệt mỏi tinh thần hoặc thể xác, dry chỉ tình trạng khô ráo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"drain\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"drainage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-cori-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru0-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru5-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru6-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru10-07320a06.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru9-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru3-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru7-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru8-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-aru2-07320a06.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-ljspeech-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt408-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt138-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt624-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt396-07320a06.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt498-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt132-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt288-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt42-07320a06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drained-lt90-07320a06.mp3\"]}}', 'Drained tả cảm giác năng lượng như bị rút cạn hoàn toàn.', 'office', 1, 12),
('cd3a839f-1699-580d-8f1a-d393c8581d0c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '462fafce-39c8-5ca8-82ad-184d3c1c9973', '983b11bd-1e2c-5b75-b94f-7061b53c4553', 'devolve on', '/dɪˈvɒlv ɒn/', 'C2', 'phrasal verb', 'Chuyển giao quyền hạn, trách nhiệm cho người khác hoặc cấp dưới.', 'to pass duty, responsibility, or authority to a person at a lower level.', 'When the president steps down, executive authority will devolve on her deputy.', 'Khi chủ tịch từ chức, quyền lực điều hành sẽ được chuyển giao cho cấp phó của bà.', '{\"en\": \"When the senior director retired, key operational tasks began to devolve on his deputy.\", \"vi\": \"Khi giám đốc cao cấp nghỉ hưu, các nhiệm vụ vận hành chính bắt đầu được giao lại cho cấp dưới của ông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-ljspeech-4fab3f00.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-cori-4fab3f00.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/devolve-on-b6a134cd.webp', '[\"delegate to\", \"pass to\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"devolve on someone\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển giao trách nhiệm cho ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"evolve\", \"note_vi\": \"Phát triển hoặc tiến hóa, không phải giao trách nhiệm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"devolution\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-cori-4fab3f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-aru0-4fab3f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-aru5-4fab3f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-aru6-4fab3f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-aru10-4fab3f00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-aru9-4fab3f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-aru3-4fab3f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-on-aru7-4fab3f00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devolve-