('d487f9c9-9b72-5f20-b967-384175fa1e27', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '47a178f5-4e2b-53ff-ba27-3115edc232f3', 'dd9a43da-8a11-530e-9c0d-efa9c56d377b', 'prostrate', '/ˈprɒstreɪt/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Nằm sấp mặt xuống đất, thường vì mệt mỏi hoặc kính trọng.', 'lying flat on the ground facing downwards due to weakness, tiredness, or respect.', 'After the long hike, he was so exhausted he lay prostrate on the grass.', 'Sau chuyến đi bộ dài, anh ấy kiệt sức đến mức nằm sấp trên cỏ.', '{\"en\": \"Several heatstroke victims were prostrate on the floor until the medical team arrived promptly.\", \"vi\": \"Một số nạn nhân bị sốc nhiệt đã nằm sấp trên sàn cho đến khi đội y tế đến kịp thời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-ljspeech-19e2ac19.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-cori-19e2ac19.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prostrate-c77bf299.webp', '[\"prone\", \"flat\"]', '[\"upright\", \"erect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lie prostrate\", \"meaning\": \"nằm sấp mặt xuống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prostrate with grief\", \"meaning\": \"gục ngã vì đau buồn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prostate\", \"note_vi\": \"prostate (không có \'r\' thứ hai) là tuyến tiền liệt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prostrate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prostration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-cori-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru0-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru5-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru6-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru10-19e2ac19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru9-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru3-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru7-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru8-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-aru2-19e2ac19.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-ljspeech-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt408-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt138-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt624-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt396-19e2ac19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt498-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt132-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt288-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt42-19e2ac19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prostrate-lt90-19e2ac19.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý chữ \'r\' thứ hai: prostrate khác với prostate (tuyến tiền liệt).', 'health', 1, 4),
('95da75d2-276c-5846-b7cb-4549e38a9684', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '47a178f5-4e2b-53ff-ba27-3115edc232f3', 'dd9a43da-8a11-530e-9c0d-efa9c56d377b', 'whet', '/wet/', 'B1', 'verb', 'kích thích, khơi gợi (sự thèm muốn, hứng thú)', 'To stimulate interest, curiosity, or eagerness regarding a particular topic or experience.', 'The aroma of freshly baked bread really whetted my appetite.', 'Mùi bánh mì mới nướng thực sự đã kích thích vị giác của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The free sample whetted customers\' interest in the new software.\", \"vi\": \"Mẫu dùng thử miễn phí đã khơi gợi hứng thú của khách hàng với phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-ljspeech-084d7efa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-cori-084d7efa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whet-760524d3.webp', '[\"stimulate\", \"arouse\"]', '[\"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"whet appetite\", \"meaning\": \"kích thích cảm giác thèm ăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whet interest\", \"meaning\": \"khơi gợi sự quan tâm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wet\", \"note_vi\": \"wet là ướt, whet là kích thích thèm muốn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-cori-084d7efa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru0-084d7efa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru5-084d7efa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru6-084d7efa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru10-084d7efa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru9-084d7efa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru3-084d7efa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru7-084d7efa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru8-084d7efa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-aru2-084d7efa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whet-ljspeech-0