('85d5f978-caad-5c49-9d96-d2b18abe77c3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '47a178f5-4e2b-53ff-ba27-3115edc232f3', 'dd9a43da-8a11-530e-9c0d-efa9c56d377b', 'capital market', '/ˈkæpɪtl̩ ˈmɑːkɪt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Thị trường tài chính nơi các doanh nghiệp và chính phủ huy động vốn dài hạn.', 'a system where companies and governments get money for long-term investments from investors.', 'Investing in the capital market can offer higher returns but also involves greater risks.', 'Đầu tư vào thị trường vốn có thể mang lại lợi nhuận cao hơn nhưng cũng tiềm ẩn rủi ro lớn hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Fluctuations in the capital market have affected the company\'s ability to issue new shares.\", \"vi\": \"Những biến động trên thị trường vốn đã ảnh hưởng đến khả năng phát hành cổ phiếu mới của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-ljspeech-bf969a21.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-cori-bf969a21.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/capital-market-b2e0bf38.webp', '[\"financial market\", \"stock market\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"global capital market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường vốn toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"capital market access\", \"meaning\": \"quyền tiếp cận thị trường vốn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-cori-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru0-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru5-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru6-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru10-bf969a21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru9-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru3-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru7-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru8-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-aru2-bf969a21.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-ljspeech-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt408-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt138-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt624-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt396-bf969a21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt498-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt132-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt288-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt42-bf969a21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-market-lt90-bf969a21.mp3\"]}}', 'Thị trường vốn khác thị trường tiền tệ ở thời hạn đầu tư dài hơn.', 'finance', 1, 6),
('b54d87a1-b034-5136-8113-59752889c6e2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '47a178f5-4e2b-53ff-ba27-3115edc232f3', 'dd9a43da-8a11-530e-9c0d-efa9c56d377b', 'relic', '/ˈrelɪk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một vật còn sót lại từ quá khứ, thường có ý nghĩa lịch sử hoặc tôn giáo.', 'an object from the past that has survived and is of historical interest.', 'The museum displayed ancient relics from the Roman Empire.', 'Viện bảo tàng trưng bày các di vật cổ từ Đế chế La Mã.', '{\"en\": \"The old typewriter in the office is a relic from the pre-computer era of business.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc máy đánh chữ cũ trong văn phòng là một di tích từ kỷ nguyên kinh doanh trước thời máy tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-ljspeech-102bfe15.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-cori-102bfe15.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relic-6e216ff8.webp', '[\"antique\", \"artifact\", \"remnant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"historical relic\", \"meaning\": \"di tích lịch sử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ancient relic\", \"meaning\": \"cổ vật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"relict\", \"note_vi\": \"relict là sinh vật còn sót lại, relic là di vật hoặc cổ vật\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-cori-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru0-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru5-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru6-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru10-102bfe15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru9-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru3-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru7-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru8-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-aru2-102bfe15.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-ljspeech-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt408-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt138-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt624-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt396-102bfe15.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt498-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt132-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt288-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt42-102bfe15.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relic-lt90-102bfe15.mp3\"]}}', 'Relic thường dùng để chỉ di vật lịch sử hoặc những thứ đã lỗi thời nhưng vẫn tồn tại.', 'other', 1, 7),
('09d54d3c-7ff1-5a68-9b49-4f2948b8dc1b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '47a178f5-4e2b-53ff-ba27-3115edc232f3', 'dd9a43da-8a11-530e-9c0d-efa9c56d377b', 'express', '/ɪkˈspres/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Nhanh chóng, hỏa tốc.', 'moving or being sent at a very high speed to save time.', 'We sent the urgent documents by express mail to ensure they arrived tomorrow.', 'Chúng tôi đã gửi các tài liệu khẩn cấp bằng thư tốc hành để đảm bảo chúng đến nơi vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"We requested an express delivery for the contract to reach the client by tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã yêu cầu chuyển phát nhanh để hợp đồng đến tay khách hàng vào sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-ljspeech-f3c62de4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-cori-f3c62de4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/express-f82a9342.webp', '[\"fast\", \"rapid\"]', '[\"slow\", \"local\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"express delivery\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển phát nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ hỏa tốc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"explicit\", \"note_vi\": \"Explicit là rõ ràng, express là nhanh chóng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"expressly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-cori-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru0-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru5-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru6-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru10-f3c62de4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru9-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru3-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru7-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru8-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-aru2-f3c62de4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-ljspeech-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt408-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt138-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt624-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt396-f3c62de4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt498-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt132-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt288-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt42-f3c62de4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/express-lt90-f3c62de4.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong lĩnh vực logistics và vận chuyển.', 'business', 1, 8),
('331a61ad-e2f3-55b0-a610-acce559fece8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '47a178f5-4e2b-53ff-ba27-3115edc232f3', 'dd9a43da-8a11-530e-9c0d-efa9c56d377b', 'moraine', '/məˈreɪn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Khối vật liệu đá, đất do sông băng di chuyển và lắng đọng.', 'a mass of rocks and earth that is left behind by a moving ice sheet.', 'The glacier left behind a large terminal moraine as it retreated.', 'Sông băng để lại một khối băng tích cuối lớn khi nó rút đi.', '{\"en\": \"The environmental report mentions that the construction site is located near an ancient glacial moraine area.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo môi trường đề cập rằng địa điểm xây dựng nằm gần khu vực trầm tích sông băng cổ đại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-ljspeech-94366a45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-cori-94366a45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/moraine-c652d4b0.webp', '[\"debris\", \"sediment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"terminal moraine\", \"meaning\": \"trầm tích tận cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"glacial moraine\", \"meaning\": \"trầm tích sông băng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-cori-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru0-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru5-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru6-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru10-94366a45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru9-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru3-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru7-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru8-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-aru2-94366a45.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-ljspeech-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt408-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt138-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt624-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt396-94366a45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt498-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt132-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt288-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt42-94366a45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/moraine-lt90-94366a45.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên ngành địa lý, hiếm khi xuất hiện trong ngữ cảnh văn phòng.', 'academic', 1, 9),
('ff8b7b05-97ef-5af3-a905-cfa4cf94465e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '47a178f5-4e2b-53ff-ba27-3115edc232f3', 'dd9a43da-8a11-530e-9c0d-efa9c56d377b', 'unilateralism', '/ˌjuːnɪˈlætrəlɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Chính sách hành động một mình mà không cần sự hợp tác của các quốc gia khác.', 'the policy of taking action by one country without the agreement of others.', 'The country\'s shift towards unilateralism caused tension with its allies.', 'Sự chuyển dịch của quốc gia này sang chủ nghĩa đơn phương đã gây căng thẳng với các đồng minh.', '{\"en\": \"Economic analysts warned that trade unilateralism would harm international business relationships and increase tariffs.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà phân tích kinh tế cảnh báo rằng chủ nghĩa đơn phương thương mại sẽ làm hại quan hệ kinh doanh quốc tế và tăng thuế quan.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-ljspeech-3554eed8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-cori-3554eed8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unilateralism-145b9c88.webp', NULL, '[\"multilateralism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"adopt unilateralism\", \"meaning\": \"áp dụng chủ nghĩa đơn phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economic unilateralism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa đơn phương kinh tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"multilateralism\", \"note_vi\": \"Multilateralism là chủ nghĩa đa phương, trái nghĩa với unilateralism.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unilateral\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"unilaterally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-cori-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru0-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru5-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru6-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru10-3554eed8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru9-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru3-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru7-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru8-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-aru2-3554eed8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-ljspeech-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt408-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt138-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt624-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt396-3554eed8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt498-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt132-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt288-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt42-3554eed8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unilateralism-lt90-3554eed8.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố uni- nghĩa là một (đơn phương), trái ngược với multi- (đa phương).', 'business', 1, 10),
('b379cc29-b034-5ff7-86f4-1a87f3ac28f2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '47a178f5-4e2b-53ff-ba27-3115edc232f3', 'dd9a43da-8a11-530e-9c0d-efa9c56d377b', 'crusade', '/kruːˈseɪd/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một cuộc chiến tranh tôn giáo hoặc một chiến dịch mạnh mẽ vì một mục tiêu.', 'a strong and determined effort to change something or achieve a specific important goal.', 'The historical crusades were military expeditions by European Christians to reclaim the Holy Land.', 'Các cuộc Thập tự chinh lịch sử là các cuộc viễn chinh quân sự của Kitô hữu châu Âu để giành lại Đất Thánh.', '{\"en\": \"The company launched a new crusade to reduce paper waste across all its international branch offices.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã phát động một chiến dịch mạnh mẽ nhằm giảm thiểu rác thải giấy tại tất cả các chi nhánh quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-ljspeech-8169a81b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-cori-8169a81b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crusade-1e4a2a44.webp', '[\"campaign\", \"movement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"launch a crusade\", \"meaning\": \"phát động một chiến dịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"moral crusade\", \"meaning\": \"chiến dịch đạo đức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"crusader\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-cori-8169a81b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-aru0-8169a81b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-aru5-8169a81b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-aru6-8169a81b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-aru10-8169a81b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-aru9-8169a81b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-aru3-8169a81b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crusade-aru7-8169a81b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/