('8a8d879a-aedc-5abc-80e8-ab23e00b7d5a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'diagnostic', 'UK: /ˌdaɪ.əɡˈnɒs.tɪk/ | US: /ˌdaɪ.əɡˈnɑː.stɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'chẩn đoán (thuộc về việc chẩn đoán)', 'Used for identifying a particular illness, fault, or technical issue from symptoms or tests.', 'The diagnostic tools helped identify the engine problem.', 'Các công cụ chẩn đoán đã giúp xác định vấn đề của động cơ.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department installed diagnostic software to monitor network performance and detect system errors.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận IT đã cài đặt phần mềm chẩn đoán để giám sát hiệu suất mạng và phát hiện lỗi hệ thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-ljspeech-3e1a359d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-cori-3e1a359d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diagnostic-97e63b01.webp', '[\"investigative\", \"analytical\", \"evaluative\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"diagnostic tool\", \"meaning\": \"công cụ chẩn đoán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"diagnostic test\", \"meaning\": \"bài thử nghiệm / kiểm tra chẩn đoán\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"diagnose\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"diagnosis\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-cori-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru0-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru5-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru6-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru10-3e1a359d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru9-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru3-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru7-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru8-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-aru2-3e1a359d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-ljspeech-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt408-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt138-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt624-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt396-3e1a359d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt498-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt132-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt288-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt42-3e1a359d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diagnostic-lt90-3e1a359d.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ thường xuất hiện trong cụm \'diagnostic test\' (kiểm tra chẩn đoán) hoặc \'diagnostic tool\' (công cụ chẩn đoán lỗi).', 'technology', 1, 0),
('cc0c25f5-8751-508c-8036-62ca3b91b896', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'parabolic', '/ˌpærəˈbɒlɪk/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng giống đường parabol.', 'having the shape of a curve that is like the path of an object thrown into air.', 'The new stadium roof features a parabolic design to optimize acoustics.', 'Mái che nhà thi đấu mới có thiết kế hình parabol để tối ưu hóa âm thanh.', '{\"en\": \"The new antenna features a parabolic design to improve the signal reception for our office network.\", \"vi\": \"Ăng-ten mới có thiết kế hình parabol để cải thiện việc thu tín hiệu cho mạng lưới văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-ljspeech-62cd36a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-cori-62cd36a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/parabolic-7f82d676.webp', '[\"curved\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"parabolic shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình dạng parabol\"}, {\"phrase\": \"parabolic antenna\", \"meaning\": \"ăng-ten parabol\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"parabola\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-cori-62cd36a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru0-62cd36a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru5-62cd36a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru6-62cd36a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru10-62cd36a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru9-62cd36a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru3-62cd36a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru7-62cd36a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru8-62cd36a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/parabolic-aru2-62cd36a5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"