('7dc7e420-49c8-532d-82d4-3f257cc1f18e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'steadily', '/ˈstedəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách ổn định, không thay đổi hoặc tăng dần đều.', 'developing or changing at a constant pace without unpredictable interruptions.', 'The company\'s profits have been growing steadily over the past few quarters.', 'Lợi nhuận của công ty đã tăng trưởng đều đặn trong vài quý vừa qua.', '{\"en\": \"The demand for our new software products has been rising steadily throughout the fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Nhu cầu đối với các sản phẩm phần mềm mới của chúng tôi đã tăng đều đặn trong suốt năm tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-ljspeech-2c5f535f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-cori-2c5f535f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/steadily-480a6294.webp', '[\"consistently\", \"constantly\", \"gradually\"]', '[\"erratically\", \"fluctuating\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"growing steadily\", \"meaning\": \"tăng trưởng ổn định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"increasing steadily\", \"meaning\": \"tăng dần đều\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"steady\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"steadiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-cori-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru0-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru5-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru6-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru10-2c5f535f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru9-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru3-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru7-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru8-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-aru2-2c5f535f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-ljspeech-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt408-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt138-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt624-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt396-2c5f535f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt498-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt132-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt288-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt42-2c5f535f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadily-lt90-2c5f535f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong báo cáo tài chính để mô tả xu hướng tích cực.', 'business', 1, 17),
('68c8b602-1a18-53e9-95e0-f30d8f0cedf3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'astringent', '/əˈstrɪndʒənt/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có vị chát, se miệng; hoặc gay gắt, nghiêm khắc (về lời nói).', 'having a sharp or bitter taste, or being very critical and severe in the way you speak.', 'The unripe persimmon had an astringent taste that made my mouth pucker.', 'Quả hồng xanh có vị chát làm miệng tôi se lại.', '{\"en\": \"The food critic wrote an astringent review of the new restaurant in the local business magazine.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà phê bình ẩm thực đã viết một bài đánh giá gay gắt về nhà hàng mới trên tạp chí kinh doanh địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-ljspeech-06e9d348.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-cori-06e9d348.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/astringent-f41355ac.webp', '[\"severe\", \"harsh\", \"bitter\"]', '[\"mild\", \"gentle\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"astringent taste\", \"meaning\": \"vị chát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"astringent criticism\", \"meaning\": \"lời chỉ trích gay gắt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stringent\", \"note_vi\": \"stringent là nghiêm ngặt (luật lệ), astringent là chát hoặc gay gắt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"astringency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-cori-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru0-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru5-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru6-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru10-06e9d348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru9-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru3-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru7-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru8-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-aru2-06e9d348.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-ljspeech-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt408-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt138-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt624-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt396-06e9d348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt498-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt132-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt288-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt42-06e9d348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/astringent-lt90-06e9d348.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt với \'stringent\' (nghiêm ngặt, khắt khe về quy định).', 'media', 1, 18),
('1c22a87e-530f-5a11-a10b-85a197b2bc58', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'disconcert', '/ˌdɪskənˈsɜːt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm ai đó bối rối, lo lắng hoặc mất bình tĩnh.', 'to make someone feel confused, anxious, or embarrassed by saying or doing something.', 'Her sudden question disconcerted him, and he struggled to find an answer.', 'Câu hỏi bất ngờ của cô ấy làm anh bối rối, và anh phải vật lộn để tìm câu trả lời.', '{\"en\": \"The unexpected questions during the press conference seemed to disconcert the company spokesperson.\", \"vi\": \"Những câu hỏi bất ngờ trong cuộc họp báo có vẻ đã làm người phát ngôn công ty bị bối rối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-ljspeech-cdbf6ea3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-cori-cdbf6ea3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disconcert-83b430a2.webp', '[\"unsettle\", \"fluster\", \"disturb\"]', '[\"reassure\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disconcert someone\", \"meaning\": \"làm ai đó bối rối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply disconcert\", \"meaning\": \"làm mất bình tĩnh sâu sắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disconnect\", \"note_vi\": \"disconnect là ngắt kết nối, disconcert là làm bối rối.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disconcerting\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disconcertment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-cori-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru0-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru5-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru6-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru10-cdbf6ea3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru9-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru3-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru7-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru8-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-aru2-cdbf6ea3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-ljspeech-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt408-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt138-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt624-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt396-cdbf6ea3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt498-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt132-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt288-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt42-cdbf6ea3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disconcert-lt90-cdbf6ea3.mp3\"]}}', 'Dạng tính từ \'disconcerting\' (gây bối rối, lo ngại) rất thường gặp.', 'office', 1, 19),
('67b07786-aa75-5510-9dcb-1da77167943e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'fetching', '/ˈfetʃɪŋ/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Hấp dẫn, quyến rũ, đặc biệt về vẻ bề ngoài.', 'having a pleasing or attractive appearance that draws attention to someone or something.', 'The young model wore a fetching outfit for the summer commercial shoot.', 'Nữ người mẫu trẻ mặc một bộ trang phục quyến rũ cho buổi quay quảng cáo mùa hè.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby was decorated with a fetching floral arrangement that impressed all the guests.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn được trang trí bằng một bình hoa đầy quyến rũ khiến tất cả khách hàng ấn tượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-ljspeech-2a2e3ac2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-cori-2a2e3ac2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fetching-3ca288c7.webp', '[\"attractive\", \"charming\"]', '[\"unattractive\", \"ugly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fetching look\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài hấp dẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fetching color\", \"meaning\": \"màu sắc bắt mắt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fetch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-cori-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru0-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru5-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru6-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru10-2a2e3ac2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru9-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru3-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru7-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru8-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-aru2-2a2e3ac2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-ljspeech-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt408-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt138-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt624-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt396-2a2e3ac2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt498-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt132-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt288-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt42-2a2e3ac2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fetching-lt90-2a2e3ac2.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái trang trọng và hơi cổ điển, thường dùng để khen vẻ ngoài.', 'travel', 1, 20),
('2c0d092d-49e9-513b-8008-7ae8575dc7c2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'consolidate', '/kənˈsɒlɪdeɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó mạnh hơn, vững chắc hơn; hợp nhất.', 'To merge multiple distinct assets or elements into one unified and efficient system.', 'They decided to consolidate their debts into a single loan with a lower interest rate.', 'Họ quyết định hợp nhất các khoản nợ của mình thành một khoản vay duy nhất với lãi suất thấp hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The two departments decided to consolidate their resources to improve overall efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Hai phòng ban đã quyết định hợp nhất các nguồn lực của họ để nâng cao hiệu quả tổng thể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-ljspeech-47a72197.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-cori-47a72197.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consolidate-607989d6.webp', '[\"merge\", \"combine\", \"strengthen\"]', '[\"separate\", \"weaken\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"consolidate power\", \"meaning\": \"củng cố quyền lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consolidate debts\", \"meaning\": \"gộp các khoản nợ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consolidate position\", \"meaning\": \"củng cố vị thế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consult\", \"note_vi\": \"consult là tham khảo ý kiến; consolidate là củng cố, hợp nhất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consolidation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"consolidated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-cori-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru0-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru5-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru6-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru10-47a72197.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru9-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru3-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru7-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru8-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-aru2-47a72197.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-ljspeech-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt408-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt138-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt624-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt396-47a72197.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt498-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt132-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt288-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt42-47a72197.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consolidate-lt90-47a72197.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong tài chính (gộp nợ) hoặc quản trị (củng cố vị thế, hợp nhất phòng ban).', 'business', 1, 21),
('c504f5ee-f3c3-58a4-9ac3-4c8d480b9084', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'directive', '/dəˈrektɪv/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một chỉ thị hoặc hướng dẫn chính thức từ một cơ quan có thẩm quyền.', 'An authoritative command issued by a governing body to mandate specific actions.', 'The new directive from the CEO outlined the company\'s updated policy on remote work.', 'Chỉ thị mới từ CEO đã phác thảo chính sách cập nhật của công ty về làm việc từ xa.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must read the new safety directive issued by the human resources department.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải đọc chỉ thị an toàn mới do phòng nhân sự ban hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-ljspeech-3d981bf9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-cori-3d981bf9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/directive-65945936.webp', '[\"instruction\", \"mandate\", \"order\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"issue a directive\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành một chỉ thị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strict directive\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ thị nghiêm ngặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"direction\", \"note_vi\": \"direction là hướng đi hoặc sự hướng dẫn; directive là chỉ thị chính thức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"direct\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"direction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-cori-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru0-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru5-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru6-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru10-3d981bf9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru9-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru3-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru7-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru8-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-aru2-3d981bf9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-ljspeech-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt408-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt138-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt624-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt396-3d981bf9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt498-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt132-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt288-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt42-3d981bf9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/directive-lt90-3d981bf9.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này thường xuất hiện trong các thông báo nội bộ của công ty.', 'office', 1, 22),
('672e15df-979e-5ace-ab61-e9a873612980', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'pill', '/pɪl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một viên nhỏ chứa thuốc, thường được nuốt để chữa bệnh.', 'a small solid piece of medicine that you swallow to treat an illness or condition.', 'Remember to take your iron pill every morning with breakfast.', 'Hãy nhớ uống viên thuốc sắt của bạn mỗi sáng cùng bữa ăn sáng.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are reminded to take their prescribed pills before attending the health screening.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được nhắc nhở uống thuốc theo toa trước khi tham gia khám sức khỏe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-ljspeech-93720caa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-cori-93720caa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pill-ee713779.webp', '[\"tablet\", \"capsule\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a pill\", \"meaning\": \"uống một viên thuốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sleeping pill\", \"meaning\": \"thuốc ngủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pain pill\", \"meaning\": \"thuốc giảm đau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tablet\", \"note_vi\": \"tablet và pill gần nghĩa, nhưng tablet thường phẳng hơn, pill thường tròn hơn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-cori-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru0-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru5-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru6-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru10-93720caa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru9-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru3-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru7-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pill-aru8-93720caa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/p