('ae82f431-a6bd-5812-bbe4-8197f2f92fde', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'squishy', '/ˈskwɪʃi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Mềm, dễ bị bóp méo hoặc lún vào khi chạm vào.', 'soft and easily pressed or changed in shape when you touch or squeeze it.', 'The ripe avocado felt deliciously squishy when I squeezed it.', 'Quả bơ chín có cảm giác mềm mại dễ chịu khi tôi bóp nhẹ.', '{\"en\": \"The packaging material is made of a squishy foam to protect fragile items during shipping.\", \"vi\": \"Vật liệu đóng gói được làm bằng xốp mềm để bảo vệ các mặt hàng dễ vỡ trong quá trình vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-ljspeech-ecfd73cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-cori-ecfd73cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/squishy-25b3f763.webp', '[\"soft\", \"spongy\"]', '[\"hard\", \"firm\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-cori-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru0-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru5-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru6-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru10-ecfd73cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru9-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru3-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru7-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru8-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-aru2-ecfd73cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-ljspeech-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt408-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt138-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt624-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt396-ecfd73cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt498-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt132-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt288-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt42-ecfd73cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squishy-lt90-ecfd73cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả cảm giác khi chạm vào vật mềm.', 'daily', 1, 25),
('5bae7a97-d0fc-537c-87d2-909c955ab650', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'ameba', '/əˈmiːbə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sinh vật đơn bào, thường sống trong nước, có khả năng thay đổi hình dạng.', 'a tiny living thing with one cell that alters its form.', 'Under the microscope, we watched an ameba absorb food particles using pseudopods.', 'Dưới kính hiển vi, chúng tôi đã quan sát một con amip hấp thụ các hạt thức ăn bằng chân giả.', '{\"en\": \"The biology teacher explained how an ameba survives in a pond ecosystem.\", \"vi\": \"Giáo viên sinh học giải thích cách một sinh vật đơn bào sinh tồn trong hệ sinh thái ao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-ljspeech-a6a4be4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-cori-a6a4be4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ameba-7885a49a.webp', '[\"protozoan\", \"single-celled organism\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ameba species\", \"meaning\": \"loài sinh vật đơn bào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ameba cell\", \"meaning\": \"tế bào đơn bào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bacteria\", \"note_vi\": \"là vi khuẩn, thường không thay đổi hình dạng như sinh vật đơn bào\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ameboid\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-cori-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru0-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru5-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru6-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru10-a6a4be4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru9-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru3-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru7-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru8-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-aru2-a6a4be4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-ljspeech-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt408-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt138-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt624-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt396-a6a4be4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt498-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt132-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt288-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt42-a6a4be4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ameba-lt90-a6a4be4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Còn viết là amoeba, sinh vật đổi hình, thường ở nước, đừng nhầm vi khuẩn.', 'nature', 1, 26),
('69e6e74f-1cc5-59af-9700-7695920d12b7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'dermatology', '/ˌdɜːməˈtɒlədʒi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Ngành y học chuyên nghiên cứu và điều trị các bệnh về da.', 'the area of medicine concerned with the study and treatment of skin diseases.', 'She consulted a specialist in dermatology for her persistent skin condition.', 'Cô ấy đã tham khảo ý kiến của một chuyên gia khoa da liễu về tình trạng da dai dẳng của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The hospital opened a new dermatology clinic to treat employees with work-related skin conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Bệnh viện đã mở một phòng khám da liễu mới để điều trị cho nhân viên mắc các bệnh về da liên quan đến công việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-ljspeech-94a8c135.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-cori-94a8c135.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dermatology-4e3634ff.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dermatology clinic\", \"meaning\": \"phòng khám da liễu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cosmetic dermatology\", \"meaning\": \"da liễu thẩm mỹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"demography\", \"note_vi\": \"demography là nhân khẩu học, dermatology là da liễu học.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dermatologist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dermatological\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-cori-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru0-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru5-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru6-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru10-94a8c135.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru9-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru3-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru7-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru8-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-aru2-94a8c135.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-ljspeech-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt408-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt138-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt624-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt396-94a8c135.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt498-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt132-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt288-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt42-94a8c135.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dermatology-lt90-94a8c135.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'derm\' nghĩa là da, giống như trong \'epidermis\' (biểu bì).', 'health', 1, 27),
('d757a334-927a-5d58-ba3c-bfded0382cba', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '59559fe0-4919-5991-a1b3-95efe647bd10', '5b73a89a-11c9-5e80-9687-113ac2781cf1', 'paleontology', '/ˌpæliɒnˈtɒlədʒi/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Ngành khoa học nghiên cứu về sự sống cổ đại thông qua hóa thạch.', 'the study of ancient life through the examination of fossils found in the earth.', 'Paleontology helps us understand the evolution of life on Earth.', 'Cổ sinh vật học giúp chúng ta hiểu về sự tiến hóa của sự sống trên Trái Đất.', '{\"en\": \"The university department of paleontology is seeking funding for its new research project on fossils.\", \"vi\": \"Khoa cổ sinh vật học của trường đại học đang tìm kiếm nguồn tài trợ cho dự án nghiên cứu hóa thạch mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-ljspeech-f744e20b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-cori-f744e20b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/paleontology-ccc00d30.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"study paleontology\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu cổ sinh vật học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"field of paleontology\", \"meaning\": \"lĩnh vực cổ sinh vật học\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"paleontologist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-cori-f744e20b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-aru0-f744e20b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-aru5-f744e20b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-aru6-f744e20b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-aru10-f744e20b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-aru9-f744e20b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-aru3-f744e20b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-aru7-f744e20b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paleontology-aru8-f744