('fbda4d60-5e77-50a8-b356-a4442ddcf420', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'transmogrify', '/ˌtrænzˈmɒɡrɪfaɪ/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Biến đổi một cách kỳ lạ hoặc hài hước thành một dạng khác.', 'to change someone or something into a different shape or form in a strange way.', 'In the story, the magician could transmogrify a rabbit into a dove with a wave of his wand.', 'Trong câu chuyện, nhà ảo thuật có thể biến một con thỏ thành một con chim bồ câu chỉ bằng một cái vẫy đũa phép.', '{\"en\": \"The software can transmogrify raw data into colorful charts for the monthly board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm có thể biến đổi dữ liệu thô thành các biểu đồ đầy màu sắc cho cuộc họp hội đồng hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-ljspeech-a9da1416.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-cori-a9da1416.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/transmogrify-f5347b1a.webp', '[\"transform\", \"metamorphose\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"transmogrify into\", \"meaning\": \"biến đổi thành\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-cori-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru0-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru5-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru6-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru10-a9da1416.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru9-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru3-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru7-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru8-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-aru2-a9da1416.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-ljspeech-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt408-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt138-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt624-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt396-a9da1416.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt498-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt132-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt288-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt42-a9da1416.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmogrify-lt90-a9da1416.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái kỳ lạ, ít dùng trong văn phong công sở trang trọng.', 'technology', 1, 1),
('0d6c75ac-6151-57ba-864e-8d5600281e73', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'deteriorate', '/dɪˈtɪəriəreɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Trở nên tồi tệ hơn, xuống cấp về chất lượng hoặc tình trạng.', 'to become worse in quality or condition over a period of time.', 'Without proper maintenance, the old building will continue to deteriorate over time.', 'Nếu không được bảo trì đúng cách, tòa nhà cũ sẽ tiếp tục xuống cấp theo thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s financial situation will deteriorate if they do not reduce their operational costs soon.\", \"vi\": \"Tình hình tài chính của công ty sẽ trở nên tồi tệ hơn nếu họ không sớm cắt giảm chi phí vận hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-ljspeech-9d24ea3b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-cori-9d24ea3b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deteriorate-1e2b220e.webp', '[\"worsen\", \"decline\"]', '[\"improve\", \"recover\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"condition deteriorates\", \"meaning\": \"tình trạng xấu đi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deteriorate rapidly\", \"meaning\": \"xuống cấp nhanh chóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"deterioration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-cori-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru0-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru5-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru6-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru10-9d24ea3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru9-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru3-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru7-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru8-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-aru2-9d24ea3b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-ljspeech-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt408-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt138-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt624-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt396-9d24ea3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt498-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt132-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt288-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt42-9d24ea3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deteriorate-lt90-9d24ea3b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng nhiều trong báo cáo kinh doanh hoặc kỹ thuật.', 'business', 1, 2),
('09b3d001-508c-5c79-ab43-6356ed3c25e6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'searing', '/ˈsɪərɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'cực kỳ nóng, bỏng rát hoặc dữ dội', 'extremely hot or intense, often used to describe weather or criticism.', 'The desert sun was searing, making it difficult to stay outside for long.', 'Mặt trời sa mạc thiêu đốt, khiến việc ở ngoài trời lâu trở nên khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team faced searing criticism from the board regarding the failed advertising campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã phải đối mặt với sự chỉ trích dữ dội từ hội đồng quản trị về chiến dịch quảng cáo thất bại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-ljspeech-14757ab6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-cori-14757ab6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/searing-cea3f5b0.webp', '[\"scorching\", \"intense\"]', '[\"mild\", \"cool\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"searing heat\", \"meaning\": \"cái nóng như thiêu đốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"searing criticism\", \"meaning\": \"sự chỉ trích gay gắt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sear\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-cori-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru0-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru5-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru6-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru10-14757ab6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru9-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru3-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru7-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru8-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-aru2-14757ab6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-ljspeech-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt408-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt138-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt624-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt396-14757ab6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt498-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt132-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt288-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt42-14757ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/searing-lt90-14757ab6.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa đen là nóng bỏng, nghĩa bóng là gay gắt.', 'marketing', 1, 3),
('88f5b1b6-8a75-5185-8f9d-0c61f70e4d14', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'customary', 'UK: /ˈkʌstəməri/ | US: /ˈkʌstəˌmɛri/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'thông lệ, theo thường lệ', 'According to the habits or traditional practices that are usually followed in a particular society.', 'It is customary to shake hands when meeting new clients.', 'Thật thông lệ khi bắt tay khi gặp gỡ khách hàng mới.', '{\"en\": \"It is customary for the company president to give an opening speech at the annual gala.\", \"vi\": \"Theo thông lệ, chủ tịch công ty sẽ phát biểu khai mạc tại buổi tiệc thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-ljspeech-22da012a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-cori-22da012a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/customary-2b89157e.webp', '[\"traditional\", \"usual\", \"conventional\"]', '[\"unusual\", \"unconventional\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"customary practice\", \"meaning\": \"thực tiễn theo thông lệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customary procedure\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình thường lệ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"customarily\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"custom\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-cori-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru0-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru5-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru6-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru10-22da012a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru9-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru3-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru7-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru8-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-aru2-22da012a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-ljspeech-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt408-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt138-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt624-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt396-22da012a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt498-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt132-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt288-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt42-22da012a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customary-lt90-22da012a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cấu trúc \'It is customary (for somebody) to do something\' (Theo thông lệ thì ai đó làm gì).', 'business policy', 1, 4),
('3beeb605-e4b1-5a72-9485-115725cb6971', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'post-traumatic stress disorder', '/pəʊst trɔːˈmætɪk stres dɪˈsɔːdə/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Rối loạn tâm lý phát sinh sau khi trải qua sự kiện đau buồn.', 'a mental health condition triggered by experiencing or seeing a very frightening or bad event.', 'Symptoms of post-traumatic stress disorder can include flashbacks, nightmares, and severe anxiety.', 'Các triệu chứng của rối loạn căng thẳng sau chấn thương có thể bao gồm hồi tưởng, ác mộng và lo lắng nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The company offers counseling services to employees suffering from post-traumatic stress disorder after the accident.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cung cấp dịch vụ tư vấn cho nhân viên bị rối loạn căng thẳng sau sang chấn sau tai nạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-ljspeech-b38348d8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-cori-b38348d8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-722ca275.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suffer from PTSD\", \"meaning\": \"bị mắc chứng rối loạn này\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-cori-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru0-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru5-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru6-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru10-b38348d8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru9-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru3-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru7-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru8-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-aru2-b38348d8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-ljspeech-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt408-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt138-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt624-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt396-b38348d8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt498-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt132-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt288-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt42-b38348d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/post-traumatic-stress-disorder-lt90-b38348d8.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết tắt là PTSD, thường dùng trong các chính sách phúc lợi nhân viên.', 'health', 1, 5),
('1491ab2a-d125-5a4a-bbf0-601056cf0b84', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'indictment', '/ɪnˈdaɪtmənt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Lời buộc tội chính thức hoặc văn bản tố cáo một người phạm tội.', 'a formal document that accuses someone of a serious crime in a court of law.', 'Formal charges were brought following the indictment of the former corporate director.', 'Các cáo buộc chính thức đã được đưa ra sau bản cáo trạng dành cho cựu giám đốc doanh nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"The company faced a formal indictment after the investigation revealed serious financial irregularities last year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đối mặt với bản cáo trạng chính thức sau khi cuộc điều tra tiết lộ sai phạm tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-ljspeech-b3eaaa62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-cori-b3eaaa62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/indictment-e970390d.webp', '[\"accusation\", \"charge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"formal indictment\", \"meaning\": \"bản cáo trạng chính thức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"face an indictment\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt với cáo trạng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"indict\", \"note_vi\": \"indict là động từ, indictment là danh từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"indict\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-cori-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru0-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru5-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru6-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru10-b3eaaa62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru9-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru3-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru7-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru8-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-aru2-b3eaaa62.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-ljspeech-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt408-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt138-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt624-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt396-b3eaaa62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt498-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt132-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt288-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt42-b3eaaa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indictment-lt90-b3eaaa62.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý âm \"c\" trong \"indict\" là âm câm, không phát âm.', 'law', 1, 6),
('1080988f-d2cf-5b8a-861f-a392c0f4062a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'impenetrable', '/ɪmˈpenɪtrəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không thể xuyên qua, không thể thấu hiểu.', 'impossible to pass through, enter, or understand clearly.', 'The fortress had impenetrable walls, making it impossible to attack.', 'Pháo đài có những bức tường không thể xuyên thủng, khiến việc tấn công là bất khả thi.', '{\"en\": \"The company installed an impenetrable security system to protect sensitive client data.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã cài đặt một hệ thống bảo mật không thể xâm nhập để bảo vệ dữ liệu khách hàng nhạy cảm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impenetrable-ljspeech-c368bff9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impenetrable-cori-c368bff9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impenetrable-115a020b.webp', '[\"impassable\", \"incomprehensible\", \"impervious\"]', '[\"penetrable\", \"accessible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impenetrable barrier\", \"meaning\": \"rào cản không thể xuyên qua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impenetrable mystery\", \"meaning\": \"bí ẩn không thể thấu hiểu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"impermeable\", \"note_vi\": \"Impermeable thường dùng chỉ chất lỏng hoặc khí không thấm qua được.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"impenetrability\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"impenetrably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impenetrable-cori-c368bff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impenetrable-aru0-c368bff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impenetrable-aru5-c368bff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impenetrable-aru6-c368bff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impenetrable-aru10-c368bff9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impenetrable-aru9-c368bff9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ