('4acbd2e8-4ff9-5b09-861b-b97e792b2427', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'uncomely', '/ʌnˈkʌm.li/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không đẹp, xấu xí hoặc không hấp dẫn về mặt ngoại hình.', 'not attractive or pleasant to look at; physically ugly.', 'Despite her uncomely appearance, her kindness and intelligence shone through.', 'Mặc dù vẻ ngoài không được đẹp, sự tử tế và thông minh của cô ấy vẫn tỏa sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The uncomely design of the product failed to attract customers in the market.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế xấu xí của sản phẩm đã không thu hút được khách hàng trên thị trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-ljspeech-7dd83e19.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-cori-7dd83e19.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uncomely-ef73a03e.webp', '[\"ugly\", \"unattractive\", \"plain\"]', '[\"comely\", \"beautiful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"uncomely face\", \"meaning\": \"khuôn mặt xấu xí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"uncomely appearance\", \"meaning\": \"ngoại hình không đẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"uncomely design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế xấu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comely\", \"note_vi\": \"comely nghĩa đẹp, trái ngược uncomely\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"comely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"uncomeliness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-cori-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru0-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru5-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru6-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru10-7dd83e19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru9-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru3-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru7-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru8-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-aru2-7dd83e19.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-ljspeech-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt408-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt138-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt624-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt396-7dd83e19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt498-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt132-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt288-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt42-7dd83e19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uncomely-lt90-7dd83e19.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ hiếm nghĩa xấu xí; trái nghĩa comely (xinh đẹp), dễ nhầm vì gần giống.', 'marketing', 1, 13),
('fda314d3-aebe-5db2-89a8-59c9acf2db8b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'cartwheel', '/kɑːtwiːl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Động tác nhào lộn xoay ngang người, hai tay và chân chạm đất lần lượt.', 'a physical movement where you turn your body sideways with your hands and feet touching ground.', 'The student excitedly performed a cartwheel on the lawn during recess.', 'Học sinh hào hứng thực hiện một cú lộn ngang trên bãi cỏ trong giờ ra chơi.', '{\"en\": \"The company retreat included fun activities like a cartwheel contest to boost team spirit.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến dã ngoại của công ty bao gồm các hoạt động vui nhộn như thi nhào lộn để tăng tinh thần đồng đội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-ljspeech-a86fbeef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-cori-a86fbeef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cartwheel-19a9328f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"perform a cartwheel\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện động tác nhào lộn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-cori-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru0-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru5-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru6-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru10-a86fbeef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru9-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru3-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru7-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru8-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-aru2-a86fbeef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-ljspeech-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt408-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt138-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt624-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt396-a86fbeef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt498-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt132-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt288-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt42-a86fbeef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cartwheel-lt90-a86fbeef.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này ghép từ \'cart\' (xe) và \'wheel\' (bánh xe).', 'daily', 1, 14),
('8a303397-e49d-5569-a52a-c321d9fa8716', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'annul', '/əˈnʌl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Tuyên bố một cái gì đó không còn hiệu lực pháp lý.', 'to state officially that something, such as a law or agreement, is no longer active.', 'The court decided to annul the contract due to fraudulent activity.', 'Tòa án quyết định hủy bỏ hợp đồng vì hoạt động gian lận.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors voted to annul the merger agreement due to financial discrepancies.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã bỏ phiếu hủy bỏ thỏa thuận sáp nhập do có sự sai lệch tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-ljspeech-86d77cfd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-cori-86d77cfd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/annul-5c4c60db.webp', '[\"cancel\", \"invalidate\", \"nullify\"]', '[\"validate\", \"confirm\", \"enact\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"annul a contract\", \"meaning\": \"hủy bỏ hợp đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"annul an election\", \"meaning\": \"hủy bỏ kết quả bầu cử\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"annual\", \"note_vi\": \"annual là tính từ hàng năm; annul là động từ hủy bỏ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"annulment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-cori-86d77cfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-aru0-86d77cfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-aru5-86d77cfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-aru6-86d77cfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-aru10-86d77cfd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-aru9-86d77cfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-aru3-86d77cfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-aru7-86d77cfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annul-aru8-86d77cfd.mp3\", \"/