('8cafa75c-f745-57de-9a6c-ac36e17a63ad', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5d21076e-7f43-5bd9-90c7-31a6d6bf397a', '435b764a-90dc-5a54-a45a-41d198e3a56c', 'pertain', 'UK: /pəˈteɪn/ | US: /pərˈteɪn/', 'C1', 'verb', 'liên quan đến', 'to be appropriate, related, or applicable to a specific matter or situation.', 'The regulations pertain to fair workplace practices.', 'Các quy định liên quan đến các hoạt động công bằng tại nơi làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"All documents pertaining to the merger must be reviewed by the legal department before Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các tài liệu liên quan đến việc sáp nhập phải được bộ phận pháp lý rà soát trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-ljspeech-5b3cbb16.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-cori-5b3cbb16.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pertain-0ba6b094.webp', '[\"relate\", \"apply\", \"concern\", \"appertain\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pertain to\", \"meaning\": \"liên quan đến, gắn liền với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pertaining to the contract\", \"meaning\": \"liên quan tới hợp đồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"obtain\", \"note_vi\": \"obtain có nghĩa là \'đạt được, lấy được\', còn pertain (to) có nghĩa là \'liên quan đến\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pertinent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-cori-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru0-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru5-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru6-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru10-5b3cbb16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru9-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru3-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru7-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru8-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-aru2-5b3cbb16.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-ljspeech-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt408-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt138-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt624-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt396-5b3cbb16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt498-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt132-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt288-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt42-5b3cbb16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pertain-lt90-5b3cbb16.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn đi kèm với giới từ \'to\' (pertain to something). Thường xuất hiện trong văn bản trang trọng, hợp đồng hoặc quy định.', 'contracts', 1, 29),
('7ef10230-ce34-58d7-9972-32805a10ace6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'classified', '/ˈklæsɪfaɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Được xếp loại là thông tin mật, chỉ những người có quyền mới được biết.', 'kept secret by a government or organization because it is very important.', 'The government report contained highly classified information about national security.', 'Báo cáo của chính phủ chứa thông tin tuyệt mật về an ninh quốc gia.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must sign a non-disclosure agreement before accessing classified financial documents.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải ký thỏa thuận bảo mật trước khi tiếp cận các tài liệu tài chính mật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-ljspeech-05812b70.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-cori-05812b70.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/classified-274a416a.webp', '[\"secret\", \"confidential\", \"restricted\"]', '[\"public\", \"open\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"classified information\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"classified document\", \"meaning\": \"tài liệu mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly classified\", \"meaning\": \"mật độ cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"classifieds\", \"note_vi\": \"classifieds (danh từ số nhiều) là mục quảng cáo rao vặt trên báo\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"classify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"classification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-cori-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru0-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru5-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru6-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru10-05812b70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru9-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru3-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru7-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru8-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-aru2-05812b70.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-ljspeech-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt408-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt138-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt624-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt396-05812b70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt498-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt132-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt288-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt42-05812b70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classified-lt90-05812b70.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa classified (tính từ: bảo mật) và classifieds (danh từ: mục rao vặt).', 'office', 1, 0),
('2abfc8f7-0ca1-5f1e-8608-124a7f35ffaa', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'plodding', '/ˈplɒdɪŋ/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Chậm chạp, nặng nề, đều đặn.', 'moving or working slowly and continuously but without excitement or imagination.', 'His plodding progress through the long textbook made him feel frustrated.', 'Sự tiến bộ chậm chạp của anh ấy khi đọc cuốn sách giáo khoa dài khiến anh ấy cảm thấy nản lòng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager complained about the plodding pace of the software development project.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý phàn nàn về tiến độ chậm chạp của dự án phát triển phần mềm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-ljspeech-625c823d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-cori-625c823d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plodding-bfcc8192.webp', '[\"slow\", \"laborious\", \"tedious\"]', '[\"rapid\", \"swift\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"plodding pace\", \"meaning\": \"tốc độ chậm chạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plodding progress\", \"meaning\": \"tiến trình chậm chạp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"plotting\", \"note_vi\": \"plotting là việc âm mưu hoặc vẽ biểu đồ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"plod\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"plodder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-cori-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru0-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru5-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru6-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru10-625c823d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru9-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru3-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru7-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru8-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-aru2-625c823d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-ljspeech-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt408-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt138-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt624-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt396-625c823d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt498-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt132-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt288-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt42-625c823d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plodding-lt90-625c823d.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mô tả tiến độ chậm chạp, tẻ nhạt nhưng đều đặn.', 'office', 1, 1),
('e237620e-61ef-55eb-b950-a997f817ee98', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'languid', '/ˈlæŋɡwɪd/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Thờ ơ, chậm chạp vì mệt mỏi hoặc thiếu năng lượng.', 'moving or acting slowly and softly because of a lack of energy.', 'The hot weather made everyone feel languid and unwilling to work.', 'Thời tiết nóng bức khiến mọi người đều cảm thấy uể oải và không muốn làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"Sales reached a languid pace during the quiet summer afternoon at the resort.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số đạt mức chậm chạp trong suốt buổi chiều hè yên tĩnh tại khu nghỉ dưỡng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-ljspeech-d66236bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-cori-d66236bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/languid-124bbc90.webp', '[\"lethargic\", \"sluggish\", \"listless\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"lively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"languid pace\", \"meaning\": \"nhịp độ chậm chạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"languid manner\", \"meaning\": \"dáng vẻ uể uả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"liquid\", \"note_vi\": \"liquid nghĩa là chất lỏng, phát âm gần giống.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"languish\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"languor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-cori-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru0-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru5-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru6-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru10-d66236bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru9-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru3-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru7-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru8-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-aru2-d66236bc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-ljspeech-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt408-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt138-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt624-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt396-d66236bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt498-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt132-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt288-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt42-d66236bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languid-lt90-d66236bc.mp3\"]}}', 'Languid miêu tả sự uể uả, thong thả do mệt mỏi.', 'daily', 1, 2),
('e72f363f-a4c9-50d6-9134-81251138cf77', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'stoicism', '/ˈstəʊɪsɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Triết lý sống nhấn mạnh sự bình tĩnh, lý trí và chấp nhận số phận.', 'the quality of facing hardship without complaint and with calm self-control.', 'Her stoicism helped her remain calm and composed even in the face of adversity.', 'Chủ nghĩa khắc kỷ của cô ấy đã giúp cô ấy giữ bình tĩnh và điềm đạm ngay cả khi đối mặt với nghịch cảnh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager\'s stoicism during the crisis reassured the worried employees and stakeholders.\", \"vi\": \"Sự bình tĩnh của người quản lý trong khủng hoảng đã trấn an nhân viên và cổ đông lo lắng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-ljspeech-d3712d9d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-cori-d3712d9d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stoicism-394db6c4.webp', '[\"fortitude\", \"resilience\", \"equanimity\"]', '[\"hysteria\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"display stoicism\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự bình tĩnh chịu đựng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stoicism in crisis\", \"meaning\": \"sự bình tĩnh trong khủng hoảng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adopt stoicism\", \"meaning\": \"áp dụng triết lý khắc kỷ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stock\", \"note_vi\": \"stoicism là triết lý khắc kỷ, stock là cổ phiếu, dễ nhầm chữ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stoic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"stoically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-cori-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru0-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru5-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru6-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru10-d3712d9d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru9-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru3-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru7-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru8-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-aru2-d3712d9d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-ljspeech-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt408-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt138-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt624-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt396-d3712d9d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt498-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt132-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt288-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt42-d3712d9d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stoicism-lt90-d3712d9d.mp3\"]}}', 'Stoicism viết hoa là trường phái Khắc kỷ, viết thường là sự chịu đựng bình tĩnh.', 'daily', 1, 3),
('6383a592-76fb-52bf-bc23-79b10b865777', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'invigorating', '/ɪnˈvɪɡəreɪtɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Làm cho tràn đầy năng lượng, sảng khoái và khỏe khoắn.', 'making you feel very healthy, full of energy, and ready to do things.', 'Taking a brisk morning walk through the crisp mountain air felt deeply invigorating.', 'Đi dạo vào buổi sáng trong không khí trong lành của vùng núi mang lại cảm giác rất sảng khoái.', '{\"en\": \"The leadership seminar was an invigorating experience that motivated all the department heads to work harder.\", \"vi\": \"Hội thảo lãnh đạo là một trải nghiệm đầy hứng khởi giúp tạo động lực cho tất cả các trưởng phòng làm việc chăm chỉ hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-ljspeech-85ae11d1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-cori-85ae11d1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/invigorating-0c9c2e46.webp', '[\"refreshing\", \"energizing\", \"stimulating\"]', '[\"tiring\", \"exhausting\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"an invigorating walk\", \"meaning\": \"một chuyến đi dạo sảng khoái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"invigorating climate\", \"meaning\": \"khí hậu trong lành, khỏe khoắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"invigorate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"invigoration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-cori-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru0-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru5-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru6-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru10-85ae11d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru9-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru3-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru7-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru8-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-aru2-85ae11d1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-ljspeech-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt408-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt138-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt624-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt396-85ae11d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt498-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt132-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt288-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt42-85ae11d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigorating-lt90-85ae11d1.mp3\"]}}', 'Bắt nguồn từ chữ \'vigor\' nghĩa là sức mạnh, sinh lực.', 'hr', 1, 4),
('0bd95253-1bd1-533a-b910-e6d6037c24fe', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'unanimously', 'UK: /juːˈnænɪməsli/ | US: /juˈnænɪməsli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'một cách nhất trí', 'With the complete agreement of all the people involved in a group decision or vote.', 'The board unanimously approved the new company policy.', 'Hội đồng quản trị đã nhất trí thông qua chính sách mới của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The committee voted unanimously to expand the company\'s research facility.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban đã bỏ phiếu nhất trí 100% việc mở rộng cơ sở nghiên cứu của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-ljspeech-9d972316.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-cori-9d972316.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unanimously-8f45820f.webp', '[\"consensually\", \"without opposition\", \"unitedly\"]', '[\"controversially\", \"disagreeingly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vote unanimously\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ phiếu nhất trí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unanimously approved\", \"meaning\": \"được phê duyệt đồng thuận hoàn toàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unanimous\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"unanimity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-cori-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru0-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru5-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru6-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru10-9d972316.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru9-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru3-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru7-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun