('72bb684c-0a6e-5b01-bd18-3b22a3a21b24', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'ping', '/pɪŋ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Gửi một tín hiệu điện tử để kiểm tra kết nối mạng hoặc sự hiện diện.', 'to send an electronic signal or message to someone, usually to check connection.', 'I\'ll ping you later to confirm our meeting time.', 'Tôi sẽ gửi tín hiệu cho bạn sau để xác nhận thời gian họp của chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"Please ping the IT department if you cannot access the company database this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nhắn tin cho bộ phận CNTT nếu bạn không thể truy cập cơ sở dữ liệu công ty sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-ljspeech-572982bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-cori-572982bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ping-af36324a.webp', '[\"message\", \"contact\", \"alert\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ping a server\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra kết nối máy chủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ping someone an email\", \"meaning\": \"gửi nhanh cho ai đó một email\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ring\", \"note_vi\": \"gọi điện thoại làm nghe tiếng chuông reo\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ping\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-cori-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru0-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru5-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru6-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru10-572982bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru9-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru3-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru7-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru8-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-aru2-572982bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-ljspeech-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt408-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt138-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt624-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt396-572982bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt498-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt132-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt288-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt42-572982bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ping-lt90-572982bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn phòng, \'ping\' thường được dùng với nghĩa nhắn tin nhanh qua các ứng dụng chat.', 'technology', 1, 6),
('ed1c412e-7fc1-5c67-853a-bcc8c5fa4048', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'sacrilege', '/ˈsæk.rɪ.lɪdʒ/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hành động xúc phạm hoặc làm ô uế những thứ thiêng liêng.', 'an act of treating something holy or important with a lack of respect.', 'Desecrating the ancient temple was considered a grave sacrilege by the locals.', 'Việc xúc phạm ngôi đền cổ bị người dân địa phương coi là một tội phạm thánh nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"It would be a sacrilege to ignore the safety protocols established by the company board.\", \"vi\": \"Sẽ là một sự xúc phạm nghiêm trọng nếu phớt lờ các quy định an toàn do hội đồng quản trị thiết lập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-ljspeech-5ca2a592.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-cori-5ca2a592.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sacrilege-fb7f60bd.webp', '[\"desecration\", \"profanity\"]', '[\"reverence\", \"respect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grave sacrilege\", \"meaning\": \"sự xúc phạm nghiêm trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commit sacrilege\", \"meaning\": \"phạm tội xúc phạm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sacrilegious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-cori-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru0-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru5-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru6-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru10-5ca2a592.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru9-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru3-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru7-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru8-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-aru2-5ca2a592.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-ljspeech-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt408-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt138-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt624-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt396-5ca2a592.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt498-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt132-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt288-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt42-5ca2a592.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sacrilege-lt90-5ca2a592.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng dùng để chỉ việc coi thường các quy tắc hoặc giá trị cốt lõi.', 'other', 1, 7),
('2800f373-68bf-5ee3-aaf4-3572bde3c49e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'gorge', '/ɡɔːdʒ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Ăn ngấu nghiến, ăn rất nhiều cho đến khi no căng.', 'To consume excessive quantities of food enthusiastically beyond normal satiety levels.', 'After the long hike, they decided to gorge themselves on pizza.', 'Sau chuyến đi bộ dài, họ quyết định ngốn pizza.', '{\"en\": \"The staff decided to gorge on the leftover catering food after the long afternoon conference.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên quyết định ăn ngấu nghiến số thức ăn thừa của dịch vụ tiệc sau hội nghị dài vào buổi chiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-ljspeech-c2e70b00.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-cori-c2e70b00.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gorge-6e6486fb.webp', '[\"stuff\", \"overeat\"]', '[\"starve\", \"diet\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gorge on\", \"meaning\": \"ăn ngấu nghiến món gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gorge oneself\", \"meaning\": \"ăn no nê\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gorge\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-cori-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru0-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru5-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru6-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru10-c2e70b00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru9-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru3-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru7-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru8-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-aru2-c2e70b00.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-ljspeech-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt408-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt138-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt624-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt396-c2e70b00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt498-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt132-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt288-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt42-c2e70b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gorge-lt90-c2e70b00.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang nghĩa tiêu cực, chỉ việc ăn uống thiếu kiểm soát.', 'dining', 1, 8),
('43c472a6-e89b-5fc0-a008-1c0ea7e9ab03', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'barometer', '/bəˈrɒmɪtə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Dụng cụ đo áp suất khí quyển, thường dùng để dự báo thời tiết.', 'a scientific instrument used to measure air pressure to help predict changes in the weather.', 'The falling barometer indicated that a storm was approaching.', 'Áp kế giảm cho thấy một cơn bão đang đến gần.', '{\"en\": \"The office manager checked the barometer to see if the outdoor event should be rescheduled.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý văn phòng kiểm tra khí áp kế để xem liệu sự kiện ngoài trời có nên dời lịch không.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-ljspeech-2075c44e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-cori-2075c44e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/barometer-a442efc2.webp', '[\"gauge\", \"indicator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"falling barometer\", \"meaning\": \"áp suất khí quyển giảm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rising barometer\", \"meaning\": \"áp suất khí quyển tăng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"thermometer\", \"note_vi\": \"thermometer đo nhiệt độ, còn barometer đo áp suất khí quyển.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"barometric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-cori-2075c44e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-aru0-2075c44e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-aru5-2075c44e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-aru6-2075c44e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-aru10-2075c44e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-aru9-2075c44e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-aru3-2075c44e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barometer-aru7-2075c44e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun