('c6baafb8-d0a0-5f5b-9bc3-8d7d2f37080e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'verifiable', 'UK: /ˈvɛrɪfaɪəbl/ | US: /ˈvɛrɪfaɪəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'có thể kiểm chứng', 'able to be checked, confirmed, or proved to be accurate or true.', 'All data presented must be verifiable for accuracy.', 'Tất cả dữ liệu được trình bày phải có thể kiểm chứng về độ chính xác.', '{\"en\": \"Applicants must provide verifiable references from their previous employers.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên phải cung cấp thông tin người tham chiếu có thể kiểm chứng được từ các người sử dụng lao động trước đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-ljspeech-c8c78ad2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-cori-c8c78ad2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/verifiable-fbf6d6af.webp', '[\"confirmable\", \"provable\", \"checkable\"]', '[\"unverifiable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"verifiable evidence\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng có thể xác minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"verifiable data\", \"meaning\": \"dữ liệu có thể kiểm chứng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"verify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"verification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-cori-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru0-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru5-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru6-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru10-c8c78ad2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru9-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru3-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru7-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru8-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-aru2-c8c78ad2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-ljspeech-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt408-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt138-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt624-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt396-c8c78ad2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt498-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt132-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt288-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt42-c8c78ad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verifiable-lt90-c8c78ad2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng trước các danh từ như \'evidence\', \'proof\', \'information\', \'data\' trong các báo cáo tài chính hoặc thông tin tuyển dụng.', 'employment', 1, 11),
('efd691c7-27e6-5d04-bac3-a8284c2a0df2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'spatchcock', '/ˈspætʃkɒk/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Gà được mổ dọc sống lưng và làm dẹt ra để nướng hoặc quay nhanh hơn.', 'a poultry bird that has been split open along the spine and flattened before cooking.', 'For dinner, we decided to roast a spatchcock chicken with herbs.', 'Cho bữa tối, chúng tôi quyết định nướng một con gà mổ phanh với các loại thảo mộc.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant added grilled spatchcock chicken to their lunch menu for quicker service.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng khách sạn đã thêm món gà mổ ép dẹt nướng vào thực đơn trưa để phục vụ nhanh hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-ljspeech-1a93cbc6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-cori-1a93cbc6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spatchcock-d85ab23f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spatchcock chicken\", \"meaning\": \"gà mổ ép dẹt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"spatchcock\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-cori-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru0-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru5-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru6-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru10-1a93cbc6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru9-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru3-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru7-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru8-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-aru2-1a93cbc6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-ljspeech-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt408-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt138-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt624-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt396-1a93cbc6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt498-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt132-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt288-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt42-1a93cbc6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spatchcock-lt90-1a93cbc6.mp3\"]}}', 'Cả danh từ và động từ đều ám chỉ việc lọc xương sống ép phẳng gia cầm để nấu nhanh.', 'dining', 1, 12),
('3ae62155-4cec-55a5-8a5c-4057becb1abe', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'geopolitics', '/ˌdʒiːəʊˈpɒlətɪks/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Nghiên cứu về ảnh hưởng của địa lý đến chính trị và quan hệ quốc tế.', 'the study of the way a country\'s size, position, and resources influence its politics.', 'Understanding the geopolitics of the region is crucial for international relations.', 'Hiểu biết về địa chính trị của khu vực là rất quan trọng đối với quan hệ quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO hired a consultant to assess how regional geopolitics might affect supply chains.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã thuê một cố vấn để đánh giá địa chính trị khu vực có thể ảnh hưởng thế nào đến chuỗi cung ứng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-ljspeech-c65a8ead.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-cori-c65a8ead.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/geopolitics-a0bf50a2.webp', '[\"international relations\", \"foreign policy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"global geopolitics\", \"meaning\": \"địa chính trị toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"regional geopolitics\", \"meaning\": \"địa chính trị khu vực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"geography\", \"note_vi\": \"geography chỉ là địa lý tự nhiên/nhân văn, không bao gồm yếu tố chính trị.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"geopolitical\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"geopolitician\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-cori-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru0-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru5-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru6-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru10-c65a8ead.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru9-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru3-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru7-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru8-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-aru2-c65a8ead.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-ljspeech-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt408-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt138-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt624-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt396-c65a8ead.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt498-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt132-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt288-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt42-c65a8ead.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geopolitics-lt90-c65a8ead.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ ghép từ geo- (đất đai/địa lý) và politics (chính trị).', 'business', 1, 13),
('788b8c89-db39-57da-9174-a176d05898b0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'clamber', '/ˈklæmbə(r)/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Trèo lên hoặc xuống một cách khó khăn, dùng cả tay và chân.', 'To move or scale steep terrain awkwardly by holding on with hands and feet.', 'We had to clamber over the rocks to reach the hidden beach.', 'Chúng tôi phải trèo qua những tảng đá để đến được bãi biển ẩn.', '{\"en\": \"Technicians had to clamber up the steep roof to repair the broken solar panels.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ thuật viên đã phải leo lên mái nhà dốc để sửa chữa các tấm pin mặt trời bị hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-ljspeech-dff01cbd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-cori-dff01cbd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clamber-ccd73e7f.webp', '[\"scramble\", \"climb\", \"scale\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clamber up\", \"meaning\": \"trèo lên khó khăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clamber over\", \"meaning\": \"trèo qua khó khăn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"clamor\", \"note_vi\": \"clamor là la hét, phản đối ầm ĩ, còn clamber là leo trèo.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-cori-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru0-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru5-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru6-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru10-dff01cbd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru9-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru3-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru7-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru8-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-aru2-dff01cbd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-ljspeech-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt408-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt138-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt624-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt396-dff01cbd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt498-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt132-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt288-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt42-dff01cbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clamber-lt90-dff01cbd.mp3\"]}}', 'Clamber thường đi kèm giới từ như up, down, over để chỉ hướng trèo.', 'manufacturing', 1, 14),
('2f546a0d-fe5c-5a51-ba21-c7f6435a4215', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'visual effects', '/ˈvɪʒ.u.əl ɪˈfɛkts/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Các kỹ thuật điện ảnh tạo ra hình ảnh không thể quay trực tiếp.', 'images created for movies or television using computers to make them look real or exciting.', 'The movie won an award for its stunning visual effects, making the dragons look incredibly real.', 'Bộ phim đã giành giải thưởng nhờ hiệu ứng hình ảnh tuyệt đẹp, khiến những con rồng trông vô cùng chân thực.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team decided to use advanced visual effects to make the product launch video impressive.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị quyết định sử dụng hiệu ứng hình ảnh tiên tiến để làm cho video ra mắt sản phẩm trở nên ấn tượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-ljspeech-2adaf953.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-cori-2adaf953.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/visual-effects-f2bfc92d.webp', '[\"special effects\", \"CGI\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stunning visual effects\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu ứng hình ảnh tuyệt đẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"create visual effects\", \"meaning\": \"tạo hiệu ứng hình ảnh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-cori-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru0-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru5-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru6-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru10-2adaf953.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru9-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru3-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru7-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru8-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-aru2-2adaf953.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-ljspeech-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt408-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt138-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt624-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt396-2adaf953.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt498-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt132-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt288-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt42-2adaf953.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/visual-effects-lt90-2adaf953.mp3\"]}}', 'thường viết tắt là VFX trong ngành công nghiệp điện ảnh và quảng cáo.', 'media', 1, 15),
('b8862bfe-0712-5610-bb23-08c4544a4135', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'gimmick', '/ˈɡɪmɪk/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một mánh lới hoặc thủ thuật độc đáo, thường để thu hút sự chú ý.', 'an unusual trick or feature intended to attract attention or publicity.', 'The new phone\'s main gimmick was its foldable screen, but it was very expensive.', 'Mánh lới chính của chiếc điện thoại mới là màn hình gập, nhưng nó rất đắt.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department rejected the promotional idea, calling it a cheap sales gimmick.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tiếp thị đã bác bỏ ý tưởng quảng cáo, gọi đó là một mánh lới bán hàng rẻ tiền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-ljspeech-ac0db5f8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-cori-ac0db5f8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gimmick-3de1cd08.webp', '[\"trick\", \"stunt\", \"device\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"marketing gimmick\", \"meaning\": \"mánh lới tiếp thị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"publicity gimmick\", \"meaning\": \"thủ thuật thu hút công chúng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gimmickry\", \"note_vi\": \"gimmickry là danh từ tập hợp chỉ tập hợp các mánh lới\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"gimmicky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-cori-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru0-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru5-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru6-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru10-ac0db5f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru9-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru3-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru7-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru8-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-aru2-ac0db5f8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-ljspeech-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt408-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt138-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt624-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt396-ac0db5f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt498-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt132-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt288-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt42-ac0db5f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gimmick-lt90-ac0db5f8.mp3\"]}}', 'Gimmick thường mang sắc thái tiêu cực hoặc hoài nghi trong kinh doanh.', 'marketing', 1, 16),
('7f7bf64e-558e-5e98-9f68-36d6e06c0d52', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'query', '/ˈkwɪəri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Câu hỏi, thắc mắc.', 'a request for information or a question sent to a person or a computer system.', 'The customer submitted a query about their recent order, asking for an update.', 'Khách hàng đã gửi một câu hỏi về đơn hàng gần đây của họ, yêu cầu cập nhật thông tin.', '{\"en\": \"Please direct your query to the customer service department if you have any billing issues.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gửi thắc mắc của bạn đến bộ phận chăm sóc khách hàng nếu bạn có vấn đề về hóa đơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-ljspeech-7cd9148e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-cori-7cd9148e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/query-04039279.webp', '[\"inquiry\", \"question\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"submit a query\", \"meaning\": \"gửi một câu hỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handle a query\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý một thắc mắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"queue\", \"note_vi\": \"Queue là hàng đợi, query là câu hỏi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"query\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-cori-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru0-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru5-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru6-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru10-7cd9148e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru9-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru3-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru7-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru8-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-aru2-7cd9148e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-ljspeech-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt408-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt138-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt624-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt396-7cd9148e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt498-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt132-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt288-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt42-7cd9148e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/query-lt90-7cd9148e.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong văn phong công sở chuyên nghiệp thay cho \'question\'.', 'office', 1, 17),
('b9ce81c1-eaad-5e42-a76d-3b6cdc248a04', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'brainy', '/ˈbreɪni/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất thông minh, có trí tuệ.', 'having or showing a high level of intelligence and mental ability.', 'Our company decided to hire a brainy software engineer to solve the complex algorithm issue.', 'Công ty chúng tôi đã quyết định thuê một kỹ sư phần mềm thông minh để giải quyết vấn đề thuật toán phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The tech startup preferred to hire brainy engineers capable of solving complex software issues.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp công nghệ ưu tiên tuyển dụng các kỹ sư thông minh có khả năng giải quyết các vấn đề phần mềm phức tạp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-ljspeech-de4468c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-cori-de4468c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brainy-17043511.webp', '[\"clever\", \"intelligent\", \"smart\"]', '[\"stupid\", \"foolish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"brainy kid\", \"meaning\": \"đứa trẻ thông minh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brainy student\", \"meaning\": \"học sinh thông minh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brawny\", \"note_vi\": \"brawny có nghĩa là cơ bắp, khỏe mạnh thể chất, trái ngược với brainy\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"brain\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"brainily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-cori-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru0-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru5-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru6-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru10-de4468c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru9-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru3-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru7-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru8-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-aru2-de4468c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-ljspeech-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt408-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt138-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt624-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt396-de4468c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt498-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt132-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt288-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt42-de4468c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brainy-lt90-de4468c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ mang tính thân mật (informal) chỉ người thông minh.', 'hr', 1, 18),
('6108d997-d6b3-5db4-96a3-e4788fcb3732', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'weighty', '/ˈweɪti/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Quan trọng, có ảnh hưởng lớn hoặc cần được xem xét cẩn thận.', 'very serious, important, or having a lot of influence.', 'The committee had to make a weighty decision about the company\'s future.', 'Ủy ban phải đưa ra một quyết định quan trọng về tương lai của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors spent hours discussing several weighty matters regarding the merger.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã dành nhiều giờ để thảo luận về một số vấn đề quan trọng liên quan đến việc sáp nhập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-ljspeech-0cc764a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-cori-0cc764a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weighty-d6f6e586.webp', '[\"serious\", \"important\", \"grave\"]', '[\"trivial\", \"lightweight\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"weighty matter\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề quan trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weighty decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định quan trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heavy\", \"note_vi\": \"nặng về thể chất, còn weighty thường dùng cho nghĩa bóng (quan trọng)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weight\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weigh\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-cori-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru0-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru5-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru6-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru10-0cc764a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru9-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru3-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru7-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru8-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-aru2-0cc764a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-ljspeech-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt408-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt138-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt624-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt396-0cc764a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt498-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt132-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt288-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt42-0cc764a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weighty-lt90-0cc764a4.mp3\"]}}', 'Dù bắt nguồn từ \'weight\' (cân nặng), từ này thường mang nghĩa bóng là quan trọng, nghiêm trọng.', 'business', 1, 19),
('23d3aaca-6f33-5c9c-8a78-303555ecea3b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'atrocity', '/əˈtrɒsəti/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một hành động cực kỳ tàn ác, dã man và gây sốc.', 'a very cruel and violent act that causes great suffering and shock to other people.', 'The reports of war atrocities shocked the international community.', 'Những báo cáo về các hành động tàn bạo trong chiến tranh đã gây sốc cho cộng đồng quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The investigation revealed a horrific atrocity committed against the workers during the recent labor dispute.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc điều tra đã tiết lộ một hành động tàn bạo kinh hoàng gây ra cho các công nhân trong cuộc tranh chấp lao động gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-ljspeech-11751d0a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-cori-11751d0a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atrocity-90ad15ef.webp', '[\"cruelty\", \"barbarity\"]', '[\"humanity\", \"kindness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"commit an atrocity\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra hành động tàn bạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"war atrocity\", \"meaning\": \"tội ác chiến tranh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"atrocious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-cori-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru0-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru5-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru6-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru10-11751d0a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru9-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru3-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru7-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru8-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-aru2-11751d0a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-ljspeech-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt408-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt138-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt624-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt396-11751d0a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt498-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt132-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt288-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt42-11751d0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atrocity-lt90-11751d0a.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái rất mạnh, chỉ dùng cho những việc cực kỳ tồi tệ.', 'other', 1, 20),
('b2220411-47f3-5f6b-822c-0053d1fdf46b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'filet', '/ˈfɪlɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Lóc xương, cắt thịt hoặc cá thành miếng không xương.', 'a piece of meat or fish that has no bones and is cut carefully.', 'The chef expertly filleted the fish, removing all the bones before cooking it.', 'Đầu bếp đã lóc xương cá một cách điêu luyện, loại bỏ tất cả xương trước khi nấu.', '{\"en\": \"The chef will filet the fresh salmon before serving it to the guests at dinner.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp sẽ lóc xương cá hồi tươi trước khi phục vụ cho thực khách vào bữa tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-ljspeech-588f13fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-cori-588f13fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/filet-3aa3e804.webp', '[\"slice\", \"debone\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"filet mignon\", \"meaning\": \"thịt bò phi lê\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fish filet\", \"meaning\": \"phi lê cá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fillet\", \"note_vi\": \"Filet là cách viết kiểu Pháp, fillet là cách viết phổ biến hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fillet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-cori-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru0-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru5-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru6-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru10-588f13fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru9-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru3-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru7-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru8-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-aru2-588f13fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-ljspeech-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt408-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt138-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt624-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt396-588f13fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt498-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt132-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt288-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt42-588f13fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filet-lt90-588f13fd.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong nhà hàng cao cấp hoặc chế biến thực phẩm.', 'dining', 1, 21),
('268de858-b3d5-508a-9e0d-f0df98f79b99', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'keynote', 'UK: /ˈkiː.nəʊt/ | US: /ˈkiː.noʊt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'chính, quan trọng nhất, chủ đạo (liên quan đến một bài phát biểu hoặc diễn giả trong hội nghị)', 'Serving as the main, most important, or central part of an event or conference.', 'The keynote speech was expected to inspire attendees.', 'Bài phát biểu quan trọng nhất được kỳ vọng sẽ truyền cảm hứng cho những người tham dự.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker will address the opening ceremony of the international summit.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính sẽ phát biểu tại lễ khai mạc hội nghị thượng đỉnh quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-ljspeech-88d14500.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-cori-88d14500.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/keynote-c5cedce2.webp', '[\"main\", \"central\", \"principal\", \"leading\"]', '[\"minor\", \"secondary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keynote speaker\", \"meaning\": \"diễn giả chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keynote address\", \"meaning\": \"bài phát biểu chủ đạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"headline\", \"note_vi\": \"Headline là tiêu đề bài báo, trong khi keynote dùng cho bài phát biểu/tư tưởng chính trong hội nghị.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"keynote\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-cori-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru0-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru5-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru6-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru10-88d14500.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru9-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru3-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru7-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru8-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-aru2-88d14500.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-ljspeech-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt408-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt138-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt624-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt396-88d14500.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt498-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt132-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt288-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt42-88d14500.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keynote-lt90-88d14500.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng trước danh từ: \'keynote speaker\' (diễn giả chính) hoặc \'keynote address/speech\' (bài phát biểu chủ đạo).', 'conferences', 1, 22),
('9c0b32fd-fe84-5833-b6af-20c5871e56df', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'flaky', '/ˈfleɪki/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không đáng tin cậy, thất thường, kỳ quặc.', 'describing someone who behaves in a strange way or forgets to do things they promised.', 'He\'s a bit flaky sometimes, so don\'t be surprised if he changes his plans last minute.', 'Anh ấy đôi khi hơi thất thường, nên đừng ngạc nhiên nếu anh ấy thay đổi kế hoạch vào phút chót.', '{\"en\": \"The new supplier has been quite flaky, missing two delivery deadlines in the past month alone.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp mới khá thất thường, đã trễ hai hạn chót giao hàng chỉ trong tháng qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-ljspeech-0612bcf5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-cori-0612bcf5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flaky-2f073f9f.webp', '[\"unreliable\", \"eccentric\", \"inconsistent\"]', '[\"reliable\", \"dependable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a flaky person\", \"meaning\": \"người không đáng tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flaky behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi thất thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flaky\", \"note_vi\": \"còn có nghĩa là dễ bong tróc (như bánh ngọt)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flake\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-cori-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru0-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru5-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru6-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru10-0612bcf5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru9-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru3-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru7-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru8-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-aru2-0612bcf5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-ljspeech-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt408-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt138-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt624-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt396-0612bcf5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt498-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt132-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt288-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt42-0612bcf5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flaky-lt90-0612bcf5.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, từ này mang nghĩa tiêu cực chỉ sự thiếu chuyên nghiệp.', 'business', 1, 23),
('47b3d942-c786-5602-9090-bc42c479a00a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'descent', '/dɪˈsent/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nguồn gốc gia đình hoặc tổ tiên của một người.', 'the state of coming from a particular group of ancestors or country.', 'She is of Vietnamese descent, though she was born and raised in America.', 'Cô ấy có nguồn gốc Việt Nam, mặc dù cô ấy sinh ra và lớn lên ở Mỹ.', '{\"en\": \"The international law firm values diversity and employs staff of Asian, European, and African descent.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty luật quốc tế coi trọng sự đa dạng và tuyển dụng nhân viên có nguồn gốc châu Á, châu Âu và châu Phi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-ljspeech-9490580e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-cori-9490580e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/descent-a468957c.webp', '[\"ancestry\", \"origin\", \"lineage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"of Vietnamese descent\", \"meaning\": \"gốc Việt Nam\"}, {\"phrase\": \"line of descent\", \"meaning\": \"dòng dõi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decent\", \"note_vi\": \"decent là tử tế/lịch sự, descent là sự đi xuống hoặc nguồn gốc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"descend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"descendant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-cori-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru0-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru5-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru6-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru10-9490580e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru9-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru3-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru7-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru8-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-aru2-9490580e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-ljspeech-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt408-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt138-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt624-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt396-9490580e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt498-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt132-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt288-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt42-9490580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/descent-lt90-9490580e.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm \'descent\' (nguồn gốc/sự đi xuống) với \'decent\' (tử tế, đàng hoàng).', 'hr', 1, 24),
('a182b04a-318f-5c20-b661-c49bef364460', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'refoulement', '/rɪˈfuːl.mɒnt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Việc buộc một người tị nạn hoặc người xin tị nạn phải trở về nơi họ có thể bị nguy hiểm.', 'the act of forcing someone to return to a country where they might suffer harm or unfair treatment.', 'International law prohibits the refoulement of individuals to countries where they face persecution.', 'Luật pháp quốc tế cấm việc buộc hồi hương các cá nhân về những quốc gia mà họ có thể đối mặt với sự đàn áp.', '{\"en\": \"The legal team argued that the deportation order violated the international principle of non-refoulement.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm pháp lý lập luận rằng lệnh trục xuất vi phạm nguyên tắc quốc tế về không đẩy trả người tị nạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-ljspeech-69f4a67d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-cori-69f4a67d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/refoulement-931eb49a.webp', '[\"deportation\", \"expulsion\"]', '[\"asylum\", \"protection\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"principle of non-refoulement\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên tắc không đẩy trả\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-cori-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru0-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru5-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru6-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru10-69f4a67d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru9-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru3-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru7-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru8-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-aru2-69f4a67d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-ljspeech-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt408-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt138-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt624-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt396-69f4a67d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt498-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt132-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt288-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt42-69f4a67d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/refoulement-lt90-69f4a67d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ pháp lý chuyên ngành, thường đi kèm với tiền tố \'non-\' (non-refoulement).', 'law', 1, 25),
('ad549430-d306-5b00-a178-709c98697f47', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '5df03ae5-063e-5337-ae9d-965725f552f6', '30fef6d0-489a-5d57-a8d6-30496b32989b', 'dodecahedron', '/ˌdəʊdekəˈhiːdrən/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Khối đa diện có mười hai mặt, mỗi mặt là một hình ngũ giác.', 'a three dimensional shape that has twelve flat sides which are all equal pentagons.', 'The geometry teacher asked us to construct a wooden model of a dodecahedron.', 'Giáo viên hình học đã yêu cầu chúng tôi dựng một mô hình gỗ của hình mười hai mặt.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed a unique display case shaped like a dodecahedron for the jewelry store.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế một tủ trưng bày độc đáo hình khối mười hai mặt cho cửa hàng trang sức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-ljspeech-1b4a8aa3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-cori-1b4a8aa3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dodecahedron-d5a124a3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"regular dodecahedron\", \"meaning\": \"khối đa diện đều mười hai mặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"geometric shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình khối hình học\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-cori-1b4a8aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-aru0-1b4a8aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-aru5-1b4a8aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-aru6-1b4a8aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-aru10-1b4a8aa3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-aru9-1b4a8aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-aru3-1b4a8aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-aru7-1b4a8aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dodecahedron-aru8-1b4a8aa3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation