('cf91b99c-00f3-597b-ae4f-cb15eef55935', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '617bf481-469c-5779-8bd1-3347cbcbe1f2', '860a5b50-e39c-5ebd-9967-d4c1da4d02c6', 'executioner', '/ˌeksɪˈkjuːʃənə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Người thực hiện án tử hình.', 'a person whose official job is to carry out a death sentence on a condemned person.', 'Historically, the executioner wore a mask to conceal their identity.', 'Trong lịch sử, người hành quyết thường đeo mặt nạ để che giấu danh tính.', '{\"en\": \"The historical documentary described the role of the executioner in medieval justice systems.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phim tài liệu lịch sử mô tả vai trò của người hành quyết trong hệ thống tư pháp thời trung cổ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-ljspeech-b7af50db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-cori-b7af50db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/executioner-178a84f7.webp', '[\"hangman\", \"headsman\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"public executioner\", \"meaning\": \"người hành quyết công khai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"role of the executioner\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò của người thi hành án tử\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"executive\", \"note_vi\": \"executive là giám đốc/lãnh đạo doanh nghiệp, hoàn toàn khác nghĩa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"execute\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"execution\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"executive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-cori-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru0-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru5-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru6-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru10-b7af50db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru9-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru3-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru7-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru8-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-aru2-b7af50db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-ljspeech-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt408-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt138-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt624-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt396-b7af50db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt498-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt132-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt288-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt42-b7af50db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/executioner-lt90-b7af50db.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'executive\' (giám đốc) vì cùng gốc \'execute\' nhưng nghĩa rất khác nhau.', 'law', 1, 13),
('b80c762e-1d73-5248-a2d6-31335cf604e0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '617bf481-469c-5779-8bd1-3347cbcbe1f2', '860a5b50-e39c-5ebd-9967-d4c1da4d02c6', 'blanch', '/blɑːntʃ/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Chần thực phẩm trong nước sôi rồi làm lạnh nhanh.', 'to put food briefly into boiling water and then into cold water.', 'To prepare the almonds, you need to blanch them first to remove their skins easily.', 'Để chuẩn bị hạnh nhân, bạn cần chần chúng trước để dễ dàng bóc vỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant chef instructed the assistant to blanch the vegetables before serving them.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp nhà hàng đã hướng dẫn phụ tá chần rau trước khi phục vụ chúng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-ljspeech-dd7d6b5e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-cori-dd7d6b5e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blanch-17868536.webp', '[\"scald\", \"parboil\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"blanch vegetables\", \"meaning\": \"chần rau củ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blanch almonds\", \"meaning\": \"chần hạnh nhân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bleach\", \"note_vi\": \"bleach là tẩy trắng (quần áo), blanch là chần nước sôi (nấu ăn)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-cori-dd7d6b5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru0-dd7d6b5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru5-dd7d6b5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru6-dd7d6b5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru10-dd7d6b5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru9-dd7d6b5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru3-dd7d6b5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru7-dd7d6b5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru8-dd7d6b5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanch-aru2-dd7d6b5e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/