('9b3fa672-8e81-538f-b1b2-4ced6bdf97bc', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '617bf481-469c-5779-8bd1-3347cbcbe1f2', '860a5b50-e39c-5ebd-9967-d4c1da4d02c6', 'cinematography', '/ˌsɪnəməˈtɒɡrəfi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nghệ thuật và kỹ thuật quay phim, tạo ra hình ảnh cho phim.', 'the art and science of making motion pictures by capturing images with a camera.', 'The cinematography in that film was stunning, capturing beautiful landscapes.', 'Kỹ thuật quay phim trong bộ phim đó thật tuyệt vời, đã ghi lại những phong cảnh tuyệt đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a professional to improve the cinematography of their new promotional video.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một chuyên gia để cải thiện kỹ thuật quay phim cho video quảng cáo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-ljspeech-833fe628.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-cori-833fe628.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cinematography-b48fca6e.webp', '[\"filmmaking\", \"videography\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stunning cinematography\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ thuật quay phim tuyệt đẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"award-winning cinematography\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ thuật quay phim đạt giải\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cinematic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cinema\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-cori-833fe628.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-aru0-833fe628.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-aru5-833fe628.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-aru6-833fe628.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-aru10-833fe628.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-aru9-833fe628.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cinematography-aru3-833fe628.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun