('6be1a057-41ab-580b-a170-44049b102a04', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'deposition', '/ˌdepəˈzɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lời khai có tuyên thệ được ghi lại ngoài tòa án để sử dụng trong một vụ kiện.', 'a sworn written statement recorded outside court for use in legal case.', 'The lawyer took a deposition from the witness before the trial began.', 'Luật sư đã lấy lời khai của nhân chứng trước khi phiên tòa bắt đầu.', '{\"en\": \"The employee\'s deposition was used as evidence in the contract dispute case.\", \"vi\": \"Lời khai của nhân viên được dùng làm bằng chứng trong vụ tranh chấp hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-ljspeech-cf696907.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-cori-cf696907.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deposition-7915a65c.webp', '[\"affidavit\", \"testimony\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a deposition\", \"meaning\": \"lấy lời khai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deposition transcript\", \"meaning\": \"bản ghi lời khai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sworn deposition\", \"meaning\": \"lời khai tuyên thệ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deposit\", \"note_vi\": \"deposit nghĩa là tiền gửi hoặc lắng đọng, không phải lời khai\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"depose\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-cori-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru0-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru5-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru6-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru10-cf696907.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru9-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru3-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru7-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru8-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-aru2-cf696907.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-ljspeech-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt408-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt138-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt624-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt396-cf696907.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt498-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt132-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt288-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt42-cf696907.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposition-lt90-cf696907.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC hiếm, nhưng đề luật thường gặp deposition nghĩa lời khai ngoài tòa.', 'law', 1, 10),
('a3fbbeef-f9d2-5e51-82ad-ea72040b934c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'erratically', '/ɪˈrætɪkli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách không đều, không ổn định.', 'in a way that is not regular, certain, or organized.', 'The car was swerving erratically on the highway, causing concern for other drivers.', 'Chiếc xe đang lạng lách thất thường trên đường cao tốc, khiến các tài xế khác lo lắng.', '{\"en\": \"Because the printer was behaving erratically, the office manager called a technician to repair it.\", \"vi\": \"Vì máy in hoạt động không ổn định, quản lý văn phòng đã gọi kỹ thuật viên đến sửa chữa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-ljspeech-3e6add99.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-cori-3e6add99.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/erratically-f7ec8136.webp', '[\"unpredictably\", \"irregularly\", \"inconsistently\"]', '[\"predictably\", \"consistently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"behave erratically\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động thất thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fluctuate erratically\", \"meaning\": \"biến động thất thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"erotically\", \"note_vi\": \"erotically nghĩa là gợi dục, tránh nhầm với erratically\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"erratic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-cori-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru0-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru5-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru6-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru10-3e6add99.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru9-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru3-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru7-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru8-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-aru2-3e6add99.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-ljspeech-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt408-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt138-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt624-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt396-3e6add99.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt498-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt132-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt288-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt42-3e6add99.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erratically-lt90-3e6add99.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \"erotically\" (một cách gợi dục) do phát âm và mặt chữ gần giống.', 'office', 1, 11),
('7ad8d98e-746e-5baf-98a5-c30f822e78a1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'pincer', '/ˈpɪnsə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Kìm hoặc dụng cụ có hai càng để kẹp.', 'a tool with two parts that are joined together, used for holding or pulling things.', 'The crab used its large pincer to defend itself from predators.', 'Con cua dùng chiếc càng lớn của mình để tự vệ khỏi kẻ săn mồi.', '{\"en\": \"The technician used a small pincer to remove the damaged wire from the circuit board.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã dùng một chiếc kìm nhỏ để tháo sợi dây bị hỏng khỏi bảng mạch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-ljspeech-4984c7e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-cori-4984c7e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pincer-b2b76501.webp', '[\"pliers\", \"grippers\", \"tongs\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a pair of pincers\", \"meaning\": \"một chiếc kìm/càng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sharp pincers\", \"meaning\": \"càng sắc nhọn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pinch\", \"note_vi\": \"pinch là động từ cấu, véo; pincer là danh từ cái kìm, càng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-cori-4984c7e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru0-4984c7e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru5-4984c7e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru6-4984c7e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru10-4984c7e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru9-4984c7e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru3-4984c7e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru7-4984c7e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru8-4984c7e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pincer-aru2-4984c7e1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/