('cbd4600a-acf9-528c-be71-54f00de036cf', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'subduction', '/sʌbˈdʌkʃən/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Quá trình một mảng kiến tạo trượt xuống dưới một mảng khác.', 'A geological event where one tectonic plate descends underneath another into the mantle.', 'The subduction zone is where one tectonic plate is forced beneath another.', 'Vùng hút chìm là nơi một mảng kiến tạo bị đẩy xuống dưới một mảng khác.', '{\"en\": \"The geology professor explained how subduction can lead to powerful earthquakes and volcanic eruptions.\", \"vi\": \"Giáo sư địa chất giải thích cách sự hút chìm có thể dẫn đến động đất mạnh và phun trào núi lửa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-ljspeech-b4fa90bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-cori-b4fa90bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/subduction-3eac6805.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"subduction zone\", \"meaning\": \"đới hút chìm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"subduct\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-cori-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru0-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru5-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru6-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru10-b4fa90bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru9-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru3-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru7-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru8-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-aru2-b4fa90bf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-ljspeech-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt408-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt138-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt624-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt396-b4fa90bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt498-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt132-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt288-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt42-b4fa90bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subduction-lt90-b4fa90bf.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ chuyên ngành địa chất học.', 'academic', 1, 13),
('414f6bf3-2710-5d71-bcfa-eadf085fe7b6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'lithosphere', '/ˈlɪθəsfɪə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Lớp vỏ ngoài cùng rắn chắc của Trái Đất, bao gồm vỏ và phần trên cùng của lớp phủ.', 'the rigid outer layer of earth consisting of crust and upper mantle.', 'Tectonic plates are large pieces of the Earth\'s lithosphere that move slowly over time.', 'Các mảng kiến tạo là những mảnh lớn của thạch quyển Trái Đất di chuyển chậm theo thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"The environmental report mentioned the lithosphere during the corporate sustainability meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo môi trường đã đề cập đến lớp vỏ Trái Đất trong cuộc họp phát triển bền vững của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-ljspeech-0376e598.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-cori-0376e598.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lithosphere-61fd77e3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"earth\'s lithosphere\", \"meaning\": \"lớp vỏ Trái Đất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lithosphere plate\", \"meaning\": \"mảng vỏ Trái Đất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rigid lithosphere\", \"meaning\": \"lớp vỏ cứng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"atmosphere\", \"note_vi\": \"atmosphere là khí quyển, khác lớp vỏ rắn\"}, {\"word\": \"hydrosphere\", \"note_vi\": \"hydrosphere là thủy quyển, chứa nước\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lithospheric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-cori-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru0-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru5-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru6-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru10-0376e598.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru9-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru3-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru7-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru8-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-aru2-0376e598.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-ljspeech-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt408-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt138-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt624-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt396-0376e598.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt498-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt132-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt288-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt42-0376e598.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lithosphere-lt90-0376e598.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ khoa học chỉ lớp vỏ cứng; đừng nhầm với atmosphere (khí quyển).', 'nature', 1, 14),
('0ad3202f-a9ad-514e-a5fe-c70991d77965', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'bandwidth', '/ˈbændwɪdθ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khả năng truyền dữ liệu của một hệ thống mạng trong một khoảng thời gian nhất định.', 'the amount of data that can be sent through a network connection in a given time.', 'Our internet connection has high bandwidth, allowing for fast downloads and streaming.', 'Kết nối internet của chúng tôi có băng thông cao, cho phép tải xuống và phát trực tuyến nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"We need to upgrade our server bandwidth to handle the increasing traffic on our e-commerce website.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần nâng cấp băng thông máy chủ để xử lý lượng truy cập ngày càng tăng trên trang web thương mại điện tử.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-ljspeech-4d86429f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-cori-4d86429f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bandwidth-c38a8b1b.webp', '[\"capacity\", \"data rate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high bandwidth\", \"meaning\": \"băng thông cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bandwidth requirements\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu băng thông\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-cori-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru0-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru5-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru6-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru10-4d86429f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru9-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru3-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru7-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru8-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-aru2-4d86429f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-ljspeech-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt408-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt138-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt624-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt396-4d86429f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt498-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt132-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt288-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt42-4d86429f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bandwidth-lt90-4d86429f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, từ này còn lóng chỉ thời gian hoặc năng lực để làm việc gì đó.', 'technology', 1, 15),
('1923defe-17c2-5321-afe0-d4d8ada1580e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'self-assured', '/ˌsɛlf.əˈʃʊəd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tự tin vào khả năng và giá trị của bản thân.', 'feeling sure about your own abilities and not worrying about what other people think of you.', 'She walked onto the stage, looking calm and self-assured, ready to deliver her speech.', 'Cô ấy bước lên sân khấu, trông bình tĩnh và tự tin, sẵn sàng trình bày bài phát biểu của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The self-assured candidate impressed the interview panel with her clear answers and professional body language.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên tự tin đã gây ấn tượng với hội đồng phỏng vấn bằng câu trả lời rõ ràng và ngôn ngữ cơ thể chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-ljspeech-603cb6c4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-cori-603cb6c4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/self-assured-192013ab.webp', '[\"confident\", \"poised\"]', '[\"insecure\", \"shy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"self-assured manner\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ tự tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"self-assured person\", \"meaning\": \"người tự tin\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"self-assurance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-cori-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru0-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru5-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru6-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru10-603cb6c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru9-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru3-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru7-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru8-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-aru2-603cb6c4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-ljspeech-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt408-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt138-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt624-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt396-603cb6c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt498-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt132-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt288-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt42-603cb6c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-assured-lt90-603cb6c4.mp3\"]}}', 'từ này mang sắc thái tích cực, chỉ sự điềm tĩnh và làm chủ tình huống.', 'hr', 1, 16),
('535ba499-da10-5e17-bb82-fcd02bd6d69a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'culinary', '/ˈkʌlɪnəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về nấu ăn hoặc nghệ thuật ẩm thực.', 'related to cooking, food preparation, or the art of good eating.', 'She enrolled in a culinary school to pursue her dream of becoming a chef.', 'Cô ấy đã ghi danh vào một trường dạy nấu ăn để theo đuổi ước mơ trở thành đầu bếp.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel hired a renowned chef to elevate its culinary offerings for business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã thuê một đầu bếp nổi tiếng để nâng cao chất lượng ẩm thực phục vụ khách công tác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-ljspeech-13323234.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-cori-13323234.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/culinary-236f9124.webp', '[\"gastronomic\", \"cooking\", \"food-related\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"culinary skills\", \"meaning\": \"kỹ năng nấu ăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"culinary arts\", \"meaning\": \"nghệ thuật ẩm thực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"culinary experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm ẩm thực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cultural\", \"note_vi\": \"cultural liên quan đến văn hóa nói chung, không chỉ riêng ẩm thực như culinary\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-cori-13323234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-aru0-13323234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-aru5-13323234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-aru6-13323234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-aru10-13323234.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-aru9-13323234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-aru3-13323234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/culinary-aru7-13323234.mp3