('5c1cd47a-dad5-547a-be81-aae88ebf72bf', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'apocalypse', '/əˈpɒkəlɪps/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự kiện thảm khốc dẫn đến sự hủy diệt thế giới.', 'a great disaster or event that causes total destruction of the world.', 'Many ancient texts describe a coming apocalypse that will reshape the world.', 'Nhiều văn bản cổ mô tả một ngày tận thế sắp tới sẽ định hình lại thế giới.', '{\"en\": \"The documentary compared the financial crash to an economic apocalypse for small businesses.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phim tài liệu so sánh vụ sụp đổ tài chính với một thảm họa kinh tế đối với các doanh nghiệp nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-ljspeech-b71e3f7f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-cori-b71e3f7f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/apocalypse-51b38bc8.webp', '[\"catastrophe\", \"armageddon\", \"cataclysm\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"nuclear apocalypse\", \"meaning\": \"thảm họa hạt nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"post-apocalypse\", \"meaning\": \"thời kỳ sau thảm họa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"apocalypse scenario\", \"meaning\": \"kịch bản tận thế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"catastrophe\", \"note_vi\": \"catastrophe là thảm họa thông thường, apocalypse mang nghĩa hủy diệt toàn thế giới\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"apocalyptic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"apocalyptically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-cori-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru0-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru5-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru6-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru10-b71e3f7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru9-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru3-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru7-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru8-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-aru2-b71e3f7f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-ljspeech-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt408-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt138-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt624-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt396-b71e3f7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt498-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt132-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt288-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt42-b71e3f7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apocalypse-lt90-b71e3f7f.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này ít xuất hiện trong TOEIC; thường dùng theo nghĩa bóng để chỉ thảm họa rất lớn.', 'other', 1, 18),
('c0639ddc-e121-5d4c-b5a3-e4fed67c5682', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'careen', '/kəˈriːn/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Nghiêng ngả, chao đảo nhanh chóng.', 'to move forward quickly in an uncontrolled way, often leaning to one side.', 'The car careened around the corner, narrowly avoiding a collision with a lamppost.', 'Chiếc xe chao đảo quanh góc cua, suýt chút nữa va chạm với cột đèn.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck careened through the narrow warehouse aisle, causing staff to step aside quickly.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng lao nhanh qua lối đi hẹp trong kho, khiến nhân viên phải nhanh chóng tránh sang một bên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-ljspeech-5e609a5e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-cori-5e609a5e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/careen-faefb198.webp', '[\"swerve\", \"lurch\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"careen around\", \"meaning\": \"lao nhanh quanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"careen down\", \"meaning\": \"lao xuống nhanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"career\", \"note_vi\": \"Trong tiếng Anh Anh, \'career\' cũng có nghĩa là lao đi mất kiểm soát.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-cori-5e609a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-aru0-5e609a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-aru5-5e609a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-aru6-5e609a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-aru10-5e609a5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-aru9-5e609a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-aru3-5e609a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-aru7-5e609a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-aru8-5e609a5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careen-