('10c1fc07-c4f9-57ec-b6cd-91af6945f406', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '624cd6e2-cbc1-5bdc-936f-5211a3f5e973', '6eb01ea5-ffa1-54d1-98e5-13c19b136d4e', 'repulsive', '/rɪˈpʌlsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây cảm giác ghê tởm, khó chịu mạnh mẽ.', 'causing a strong feeling of dislike or disgust because something is very unpleasant to experience.', 'The smell from the garbage dump was absolutely repulsive.', 'Mùi từ bãi rác thật sự ghê tởm.', '{\"en\": \"The office staff complained about the repulsive odor coming from the broken breakroom refrigerator yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên văn phòng phàn nàn về mùi hôi khó chịu bốc ra từ chiếc tủ lạnh hỏng ở phòng nghỉ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-ljspeech-9ac1501b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-cori-9ac1501b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/repulsive-7ad30533.webp', '[\"disgusting\", \"offensive\"]', '[\"attractive\", \"pleasant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"repulsive smell\", \"meaning\": \"mùi hôi thối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"repulsive behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi đáng ghê tởm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"repulsive\", \"note_vi\": \"gây ghê tởm; còn repellent là chất xua đuổi côn trùng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"repulsion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-cori-9ac1501b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-aru0-9ac1501b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-aru5-9ac1501b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-aru6-9ac1501b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-aru10-9ac1501b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-aru9-9ac1501b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-aru3-9ac1501b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/repulsive-aru7-9ac1501b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation