('121db69b-6439-5699-98d1-a5dec68b1b5b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'rhapsody', '/ˈræpsədi/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tác phẩm âm nhạc hoặc văn học mang tính tự do, biểu cảm mạnh mẽ.', 'a musical or literary piece that expresses strong feelings and does not follow a strict structure.', 'The pianist performed a brilliant rhapsody that captivated the entire audience.', 'Nghệ sĩ piano đã biểu diễn một bản rhapsody tuyệt vời làm say đắm toàn bộ khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team used a creative rhapsody of ideas to launch the new product campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã sử dụng một chuỗi ý tưởng sáng tạo đầy cảm hứng để khởi động chiến dịch sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-ljspeech-e35c3814.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-cori-e35c3814.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rhapsody-29c9b397.webp', '[\"fantasy\", \"epic\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"musical rhapsody\", \"meaning\": \"bản nhạc phóng túng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poetic rhapsody\", \"meaning\": \"bài thơ đầy cảm xúc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rhapsodic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-cori-e35c3814.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-aru0-e35c3814.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-aru5-e35c3814.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-aru6-e35c3814.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-aru10-e35c3814.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-aru9-e35c3814.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-aru3-e35c3814.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-aru7-e35c3814.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rhapsody-aru8-e35c3814.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj