('b5112ba1-19ba-56bb-ad73-08e87f55d726', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'gruesome', '/ˈɡruːsəm/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây cảm giác kinh hoàng, ghê rợn, thường liên quan đến cái chết hoặc thương tích.', 'very unpleasant and shocking, especially because it involves death or injury.', 'The detective described the crime scene as one of the most gruesome he had ever witnessed.', 'Thám tử mô tả hiện trường vụ án là một trong những cảnh rùng rợn nhất mà ông từng chứng kiến.', '{\"en\": \"The safety inspector warned that ignoring the rules could lead to gruesome accidents.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra an toàn cảnh báo rằng việc phớt lờ các quy tắc có thể dẫn đến những tai nạn thảm khốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-ljspeech-cd2208ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-cori-cd2208ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gruesome-65109fb7.webp', '[\"ghastly\", \"horrific\", \"grisly\"]', '[\"pleasant\", \"delightful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gruesome details\", \"meaning\": \"chi tiết rùng rợn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gruesome murder\", \"meaning\": \"vụ giết người man rợ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"gruesomely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-cori-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru0-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru5-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru6-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru10-cd2208ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru9-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru3-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru7-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru8-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-aru2-cd2208ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-ljspeech-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt408-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt138-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt624-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt396-cd2208ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt498-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt132-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt288-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt42-cd2208ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gruesome-lt90-cd2208ad.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mô tả những thứ gây sợ hãi, ghê rợn về mặt hình ảnh (máu me, tai nạn).', 'manufacturing', 1, 11),
('8f1c47ce-27ff-5b4e-be8d-aaa464a6345a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'sidestep', '/ˈsaɪdstep/', 'C1', 'verb', 'né tránh, lảng tránh (một vấn đề, trách nhiệm).', 'to avoid dealing with a difficult problem, question, or responsibility.', 'The executive managed to sidestep potential conflicts by proposing a fair compromise.', 'Giám đốc điều hành đã né tránh xung đột tiềm ẩn bằng cách đề xuất một sự thỏa hiệp công bằng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager tried to sidestep the issue of salary increases during the staff meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã cố gắng né tránh vấn đề tăng lương trong cuộc họp nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-ljspeech-fca9a267.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-cori-fca9a267.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sidestep-fe1b6726.webp', '[\"avoid\", \"evade\", \"dodge\"]', '[\"confront\", \"tackle\", \"face\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sidestep an issue\", \"meaning\": \"né tránh một vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sidestep responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"né tránh trách nhiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bypass\", \"note_vi\": \"bypass là đi vòng qua để tránh vật cản, sidestep là né tránh câu hỏi/trách nhiệm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sidestep\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-cori-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru0-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru5-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru6-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru10-fca9a267.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru9-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru3-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru7-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru8-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-aru2-fca9a267.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-ljspeech-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt408-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt138-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt624-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt396-fca9a267.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt498-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt132-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt288-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt42-fca9a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sidestep-lt90-fca9a267.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghép từ side (bên cạnh) và step (bước) -> bước sang bên để né tránh.', 'office', 1, 12),
('7e847aca-e737-56b6-a476-774e8fe2d10e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'intestacy', '/ɪnˈtestəsi/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng một người qua đời mà không để lại di chúc hợp lệ.', 'the state of dying without having made a valid will.', 'The family had to deal with the complexities of intestacy after their father\'s sudden death.', 'Gia đình phải đối mặt với sự phức tạp của việc không có di chúc sau cái chết đột ngột của cha họ.', '{\"en\": \"The legal team advised the client on the risks of intestacy regarding their estate.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ pháp lý đã tư vấn cho khách hàng về những rủi ro khi không để lại di chúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-ljspeech-f4746234.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-cori-f4746234.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intestacy-4f5be4ba.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"law of intestacy\", \"meaning\": \"luật về thừa kế không di chúc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rules of intestacy\", \"meaning\": \"quy định về thừa kế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"intestate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-cori-f4746234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru0-f4746234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru5-f4746234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru6-f4746234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru10-f4746234.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru9-f4746234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru3-f4746234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru7-f4746234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru8-f4746234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intestacy-aru2-