('dde36b97-e113-566d-9f54-c1446bae6c45', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'tedious', '/ˈtiːdiəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Tẻ nhạt, nhàm chán, gây mệt mỏi.', 'boring and continuing for a long time without anything interesting happening.', 'The lecture was so tedious that some students started to fall asleep.', 'Bài giảng quá tẻ nhạt đến nỗi một số sinh viên bắt đầu ngủ gật.', '{\"en\": \"Entering data into the system manually is a very tedious task for employees.\", \"vi\": \"Việc nhập dữ liệu vào hệ thống bằng tay là một công việc rất tẻ nhạt đối với nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-ljspeech-54c4f31b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-cori-54c4f31b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tedious-a1490ac2.webp', '[\"boring\", \"dull\", \"monotonous\"]', '[\"exciting\", \"interesting\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tedious task\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ tẻ nhạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tedious process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình nhàm chán\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tedium\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"tediously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-cori-54c4f31b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru0-54c4f31b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru5-54c4f31b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru6-54c4f31b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru10-54c4f31b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru9-54c4f31b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru3-54c4f31b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru7-54c4f31b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru8-54c4f31b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tedious-aru2-54c