('a05a82c9-eb23-586d-802b-558918d59e71', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'isthmus', '/ˈɪsməs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Dải đất hẹp nối hai vùng đất lớn hơn và có biển ở hai bên.', 'A slender neck of land bordered by water linking two substantial landmasses together.', 'The Panama Canal was built across the Isthmus of Panama to connect the Atlantic and Pacific oceans.', 'Kênh đào Panama được xây dựng qua Eo đất Panama để nối Đại Tây Dương và Thái Bình Dương.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping company routes its vessels through the isthmus to save time on global deliveries.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty vận tải định tuyến tàu của họ qua eo đất để tiết kiệm thời gian giao hàng toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-ljspeech-21ba1886.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-cori-21ba1886.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/isthmus-08925461.webp', '[\"neck\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-cori-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru0-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru5-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru6-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru10-21ba1886.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru9-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru3-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru7-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru8-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-aru2-21ba1886.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-ljspeech-21ba1886.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/isthmus-lt408-21ba1886.m