vốn là thuật ngữ cũ hơn.', 'health', 1, 25),
('62ba7f6f-a346-55a1-8c72-76defcfcafa5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'muggy', '/ˈmʌɡi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Nóng ẩm và khó chịu (thời tiết).', 'warm and damp in an uncomfortable way, especially regarding the weather.', 'I don\'t like summer days when it\'s so muggy that you can barely breathe.', 'Tôi không thích những ngày hè khi trời oi bức đến mức bạn khó thở.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel air conditioning kept guests comfortable despite the muggy weather outside the building.\", \"vi\": \"Điều hòa của khách sạn giữ cho khách thoải mái bất chấp thời tiết nóng ẩm khó chịu bên ngoài tòa nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-ljspeech-78cbb165.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-cori-78cbb165.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/muggy-721a9294.webp', '[\"humid\", \"sticky\", \"stuffy\"]', '[\"dry\", \"cool\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"muggy weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết nóng ẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"muggy day\", \"meaning\": \"ngày nóng ẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"muddy\", \"note_vi\": \"muddy là lầy lội nhiều bùn, khác với muggy là nóng ẩm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mugginess\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-cori-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru0-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru5-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru6-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru10-78cbb165.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru9-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru3-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru7-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru8-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-aru2-78cbb165.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-ljspeech-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt408-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt138-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt624-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt396-78cbb165.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt498-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt132-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt288-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt42-78cbb165.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muggy-lt90-78cbb165.mp3\"]}}', 'Muggy miêu tả kiểu thời tiết vừa nóng vừa nồm ẩm khó chịu.', 'travel', 1, 26),
('88821f44-43ca-5544-b6ea-7a4e4a07ca2a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'committal', '/kəˈmɪtl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc lệnh chính thức đưa ai đó vào tù, bệnh viện tâm thần hoặc tòa án.', 'a formal legal order sending a person to prison, a court, or a psychiatric institution.', 'The judge ordered the committal of the suspect to prison pending trial.', 'Thẩm phán ra lệnh giam giữ nghi phạm vào tù trong thời gian chờ xét xử.', '{\"en\": \"The attorney reviewed the committal papers before the hearing began the next morning.\", \"vi\": \"Luật sư xem xét các giấy tờ giam giữ trước khi phiên điều trần bắt đầu vào sáng hôm sau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-ljspeech-043c89a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-cori-043c89a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/committal-588fb7a7.webp', '[\"imprisonment\", \"detention\", \"remand\"]', '[\"release\", \"discharge\", \"acquittal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"committal proceedings\", \"meaning\": \"thủ tục tố tụng sơ bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"committal order\", \"meaning\": \"lệnh giam giữ/đưa vào cơ sở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"committal to prison\", \"meaning\": \"lệnh tống giam\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commitment\", \"note_vi\": \"commitment là sự cam kết/cống hiến, committal là lệnh giam giữ chính thức về pháp lý\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"commit\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commitment\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"committed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-cori-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru0-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru5-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru6-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru10-043c89a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru9-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru3-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru7-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru8-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-aru2-043c89a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-ljspeech-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt408-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt138-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt624-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt396-043c89a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt498-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt132-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt288-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt42-043c89a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committal-lt90-043c89a7.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm committal (lệnh giam giữ pháp lý) với commitment (sự cam kết); hai từ rất khác nghĩa.', 'law', 1, 27),
('195bb80a-f886-5107-9437-7624bc3f7bad', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '6e16613c-ccf6-56d7-94e1-64873d971c30', 'a0561df2-8925-52c3-9b06-d6fe417d0a32', 'prescription', '/prɪˈskrɪpʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Đơn thuốc của bác sĩ; sự quy định, chỉ dẫn.', 'a written paper from a doctor that allows you to get medicine from a pharmacy.', 'You must present a valid prescription before purchasing these painkiller tablets from the pharmacy.', 'Bạn phải trình đơn thuốc hợp lệ trước khi mua các viên thuốc giảm đau này từ nhà thuốc.', '{\"en\": \"Please bring your prescription to the pharmacy counter to collect your medication for the flu.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng mang đơn thuốc của bạn đến quầy dược phẩm để nhận thuốc trị cúm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-ljspeech-9fd01ae4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-cori-9fd01ae4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prescription-f20cc915.webp', '[\"medical order\", \"medication instruction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"write a prescription\", \"meaning\": \"viết đơn thuốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fill a prescription\", \"meaning\": \"lấy thuốc theo đơn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"description\", \"note_vi\": \"Description là sự mô tả, prescription là đơn thuốc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prescribe\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"prescriptive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-cori-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru0-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru5-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru6-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru10-9fd01ae4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru9-9fd01ae4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prescription-aru3-9fd01ae