('986f370a-38ce-51c9-acc8-b9183358aec1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'yap', '/jæp/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Sủa liên tục, thường là tiếng nhỏ, chói tai (chó).', 'to make short, sharp, high sounds, especially of a small dog.', 'The small dog started to yap excitedly when it saw its owner return.', 'Chú chó nhỏ bắt đầu sủa liên tục một cách phấn khích khi thấy chủ về.', '{\"en\": \"The customer complained that the neighbor\'s dogs yap constantly during his online business meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng phàn nàn rằng những con chó của hàng xóm sủa liên tục trong các cuộc họp kinh doanh trực tuyến của ông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-ljspeech-4226580e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-cori-4226580e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/yap-4ddf9403.webp', '[\"bark\", \"yelp\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"yap excitedly\", \"meaning\": \"sủa phấn khích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"yap continuously\", \"meaning\": \"sủa liên tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"yawp\", \"note_vi\": \"yawp là tiếng kêu to, thô kệch; yap là tiếng sủa nhỏ, chói tai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"yap\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"yappy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-cori-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru0-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru5-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru6-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru10-4226580e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru9-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru3-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru7-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru8-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-aru2-4226580e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-ljspeech-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt408-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt138-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt624-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt396-4226580e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt498-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt132-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt288-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt42-4226580e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/yap-lt90-4226580e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tiếng lóng hiện đại, \'yap\' còn có nghĩa là nói nhiều, nói nhảm.', 'daily', 1, 0),
('fa8c0041-e8d1-5272-8e9e-c57665f33f4b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'dizzy', '/ˈdɪzi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy choáng váng, mất thăng bằng, như muốn ngã.', 'feeling as if everything is turning around and likely to lose balance.', 'After spinning around, she felt dizzy and had to sit down.', 'Sau khi quay vòng vòng, cô ấy cảm thấy chóng mặt và phải ngồi xuống.', '{\"en\": \"The technician felt dizzy due to the high temperature in the engine room.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên cảm thấy choáng váng do nhiệt độ cao trong phòng máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-ljspeech-16199d86.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-cori-16199d86.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dizzy-ff904cf2.webp', '[\"lightheaded\", \"giddy\", \"unsteady\"]', '[\"steady\", \"balanced\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel dizzy\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy choáng váng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dizzy spell\", \"meaning\": \"cơn chóng mặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dizzying\", \"note_vi\": \"dizzying là tính từ chỉ thứ gây choáng váng (như tốc độ).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dizziness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-cori-16199d86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru0-16199d86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru5-16199d86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru6-16199d86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru10-16199d86.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru9-16199d86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru3-16199d86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru7-16199d86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru8-16199d86.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dizzy-aru2-16199