('3d8d17c0-2b2f-51bd-9e11-df28bfd8c6de', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'upswing', '/ˈʌpswɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một sự tăng lên, cải thiện hoặc phát triển.', 'an increase or positive change in business activity, sales, or economic growth.', 'The company is experiencing an upswing in sales this quarter.', 'Công ty đang trải qua một sự tăng trưởng về doanh số trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The retail store reported a major upswing in customer orders during the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng bán lẻ đã báo cáo một sự gia tăng lớn về đơn hàng của khách trong mùa lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-ljspeech-974b5421.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-cori-974b5421.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upswing-05f7d6f7.webp', '[\"increase\", \"upturn\", \"rise\"]', '[\"downturn\", \"decline\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"an upswing in sales\", \"meaning\": \"sự gia tăng doanh số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"an economic upswing\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng kinh tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"upturn\", \"note_vi\": \"Upturn chỉ sự cải thiện sau một giai đoạn suy giảm, gần nghĩa với upswing.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-cori-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru0-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru5-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru6-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru10-974b5421.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru9-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru3-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru7-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru8-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-aru2-974b5421.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-ljspeech-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt408-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt138-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt624-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt396-974b5421.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt498-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt132-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt288-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt42-974b5421.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upswing-lt90-974b5421.mp3\"]}}', 'Upswing thường đi với giới từ \'in\' (an upswing in profits/sales).', 'business', 1, 10),
('17bb3512-6512-5c5d-bbad-7a748b2de6fd', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'allusion', '/əˈluːʒn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một sự ám chỉ gián tiếp đến một điều gì đó mà không nói thẳng ra.', 'a remark that mentions something indirectly without talking about it in a direct or clear way.', 'Her poem contained several allusions to Greek mythology, which made it more profound.', 'Bài thơ của cô ấy chứa một vài ám chỉ đến thần thoại Hy Lạp, điều này làm cho nó sâu sắc hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager made a subtle allusion to the budget cuts during the quarterly staff meeting today.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã ám chỉ khéo léo về việc cắt giảm ngân sách trong cuộc họp nhân viên hàng quý hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-ljspeech-70ce603d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-cori-70ce603d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/allusion-0ce89e74.webp', '[\"reference\", \"hint\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an allusion\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra sự ám chỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear allusion\", \"meaning\": \"sự ám chỉ rõ ràng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"illusion\", \"note_vi\": \"allusion là ám chỉ; illusion là ảo giác, sự lầm tưởng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"allude\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-cori-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru0-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru5-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru6-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru10-70ce603d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru9-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru3-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru7-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru8-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-aru2-70ce603d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-ljspeech-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt408-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt138-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt624-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt396-70ce603d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt498-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt132-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt288-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt42-70ce603d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allusion-lt90-70ce603d.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng trong văn phong trang trọng hoặc phân tích văn bản.', 'business', 1, 11),
('d793dd05-847d-5487-afbd-585d0a8055f2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'bolt', '/bəʊlt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một thanh kim loại dùng để khóa cửa hoặc gắn các bộ phận lại với nhau.', 'a metal pin or bar used to fasten things together or keep a door closed securely.', 'Make sure you slide the bolt across the door before you go to bed.', 'Hãy chắc chắn rằng bạn đã kéo chốt cửa trước khi đi ngủ.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance worker replaced the rusty bolt to ensure the heavy gate remains locked tightly.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã thay thế chiếc chốt gỉ sét để đảm bảo cổng nặng được khóa chặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-ljspeech-cfb20987.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-cori-cfb20987.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bolt-0111a6a6.webp', '[\"fastener\", \"latch\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tighten a bolt\", \"meaning\": \"siết chặt ốc vít\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slide the bolt\", \"meaning\": \"gạt chốt cửa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"volt\", \"note_vi\": \"đơn vị đo điện áp, phát âm gần giống nhưng nghĩa khác hẳn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bolt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-cori-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru0-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru5-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru6-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru10-cfb20987.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru9-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru3-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru7-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru8-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-aru2-cfb20987.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-ljspeech-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt408-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt138-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt624-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt396-cfb20987.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt498-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt132-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt288-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt42-cfb20987.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bolt-lt90-cfb20987.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'volt\' (đơn vị điện). \'Bolt\' còn có nghĩa là chạy trốn nhanh.', 'manufacturing', 1, 12),
('ea5b5609-43f0-5ac8-bb83-c470335a8a94', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'staycation', '/steɪˈkeɪʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Kỳ nghỉ dưỡng mà bạn ở lại nhà hoặc gần nhà thay vì đi xa.', 'a holiday spent at home or nearby instead of traveling to another place.', 'We decided on a staycation this year to save money and explore local attractions.', 'Năm nay chúng tôi quyết định chọn kỳ nghỉ tại nhà để tiết kiệm tiền và khám phá các điểm tham quan địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency launched a new package promoting staycation options for local residents.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch đã tung ra một gói dịch vụ mới quảng bá các lựa chọn nghỉ dưỡng tại chỗ cho người dân địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-ljspeech-264d27e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-cori-264d27e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/staycation-c84812d7.webp', NULL, '[\"vacation\", \"trip\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"plan a staycation\", \"meaning\": \"lên kế hoạch nghỉ dưỡng tại chỗ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weekend staycation\", \"meaning\": \"kỳ nghỉ cuối tuần tại chỗ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vacation\", \"note_vi\": \"vacation là kỳ nghỉ đi xa, staycation là nghỉ tại chỗ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-cori-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru0-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru5-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru6-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru10-264d27e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru9-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru3-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru7-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru8-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-aru2-264d27e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-ljspeech-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt408-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt138-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt624-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt396-264d27e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt498-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt132-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt288-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt42-264d27e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/staycation-lt90-264d27e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ ghép giữa \'stay\' (ở lại) và \'vacation\' (kỳ nghỉ).', 'travel', 1, 13),
('1c21a544-4f7b-5390-877c-f9bdde1e4009', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'internalize', 'UK: /ɪnˈtɜːnəlaɪz/ | US: /ɪnˈtɜːrnəlaɪz/', 'C1', 'verb', 'tiếp thu, nắm vững', 'To make attitudes, values, or knowledge a permanent part of one\'s own character or thinking.', 'Employees must internalize company policies.', 'Nhân viên phải nắm vững các chính sách công ty.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are encouraged to internalize the company\'s core values during training.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được khuyến khích thấm nhuần các giá trị cốt lõi của công ty trong đợt đào tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-ljspeech-0e13aa12.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-cori-0e13aa12.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/internalize-297a4bba.webp', '[\"absorb\", \"assimilate\", \"adopt\"]', '[\"externalize\", \"reject\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"internalize values\", \"meaning\": \"thấm nhuần các giá trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"internalize feedback\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp thu phản hồi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"internalization\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"internal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-cori-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru0-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru5-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru6-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru10-0e13aa12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru9-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru3-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru7-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru8-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-aru2-0e13aa12.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-ljspeech-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt408-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt138-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt624-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt396-0e13aa12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt498-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt132-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt288-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt42-0e13aa12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/internalize-lt90-0e13aa12.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong ngữ cảnh nhân sự tiếp thu văn hóa công ty hoặc tiếp thu kiến thức đào tạo.', 'human resources', 1, 14),
('aa149e37-282e-5dd3-9e67-6a53b1435637', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'full-scale', 'UK: /ˌfʊl ˈskeɪl/ | US: /ˌfʊl ˈskeɪl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'toàn diện, toàn bộ', 'using all possible resources or involving every aspect of a situation or activity.', 'The company launched a full-scale investigation into the matter.', 'Công ty đã phát động một cuộc điều tra toàn diện về vấn đề này.', '{\"en\": \"The company launched a full-scale investigation into the recent data breach.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tiến hành một cuộc điều tra toàn diện về vụ vi phạm dữ liệu gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-ljspeech-152a559f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-cori-152a559f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/full-scale-53293e4c.webp', '[\"comprehensive\", \"thorough\", \"all-out\", \"extensive\"]', '[\"partial\", \"limited\", \"small-scale\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"full-scale investigation\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc điều tra toàn diện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full-scale production\", \"meaning\": \"sản xuất hàng loạt quy mô lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full-scale review\", \"meaning\": \"rà soát toàn bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"full-time\", \"note_vi\": \"\'full-scale\' chỉ quy mô/mức độ toàn diện, \'full-time\' chỉ thời gian làm việc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-cori-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru0-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru5-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru6-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru10-152a559f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru9-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru3-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru7-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru8-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-aru2-152a559f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-ljspeech-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt408-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt138-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt624-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt396-152a559f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt498-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt132-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt288-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt42-152a559f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/full-scale-lt90-152a559f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường làm tính từ bổ nghĩa cho các danh từ như investigation, review, production, model.', 'corporate management', 1, 15),
('7a9944d8-48ea-52f2-8d21-b9ba32a3cb7d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'pelt', '/pelt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Lớp da động vật còn nguyên lông hoặc len, thường dùng làm áo khoác.', 'the skin of a dead animal with the fur or wool still on it.', 'Thick winter coats were historically crafted from the pelt of Arctic foxes.', 'Những chiếc áo khoác mùa đông dày từng được chế tạo từ bộ da của cáo Bắc Cực.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury fashion brand decided to stop using animal pelt in their winter coats.\", \"vi\": \"Thương hiệu thời trang xa xỉ quyết định ngừng sử dụng da lông thú trong áo khoác mùa đông của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-ljspeech-0025d9c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-cori-0025d9c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pelt-f3ff46b2.webp', '[\"fur\", \"hide\", \"skin\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"animal pelt\", \"meaning\": \"da lông thú\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beaver pelt\", \"meaning\": \"da hải ly\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"peel\", \"note_vi\": \"peel là vỏ trái cây hoặc lột vỏ, pelt là da lông thú.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pelt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-cori-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru0-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru5-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru6-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru10-0025d9c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru9-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru3-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru7-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru8-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-aru2-0025d9c7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-ljspeech-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt408-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt138-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt624-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt396-0025d9c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt498-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt132-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt288-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt42-0025d9c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pelt-lt90-0025d9c7.mp3\"]}}', 'Pelt vừa là danh từ (da lông thú) vừa là động từ (ném tới tấp).', 'shopping', 1, 16),
('69a4c375-15f6-57d5-80a3-898f9c5ef8e1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'thug', '/θʌɡ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Kẻ côn đồ, kẻ bạo lực, thường là thành viên của băng đảng.', 'a violent person, especially a criminal who attacks people in the street.', 'A group of thugs vandalized the public park late last night.', 'Một nhóm côn đồ đã phá hoại công viên công cộng vào đêm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The store owner hired extra security guards to protect the property from local thugs.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ cửa hàng đã thuê thêm bảo vệ để bảo vệ tài sản khỏi những kẻ côn đồ địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-ljspeech-701d0c4c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-cori-701d0c4c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thug-ce469ea7.webp', '[\"hooligan\", \"ruffian\", \"gangster\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"street thug\", \"meaning\": \"côn đồ đường phố\"}, {\"phrase\": \"violent thug\", \"meaning\": \"kẻ côn đồ bạo lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"thief\", \"note_vi\": \"\'thief\' là kẻ trộm, còn \'thug\' thiên về bạo lực và hành hung hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thuggery\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"thuggish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-cori-701d0c4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-aru0-701d0c4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-aru5-701d0c4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-aru6-701d0c4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-aru10-701d0c4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-aru9-701d0c4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-aru3-701d0c4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-aru7-701d0c4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thug-aru8-701d0c4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o