('ee48e6a5-b1d4-5268-a529-0b9efbb5c1db', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'gregarious', '/ɡrɪˈɡeəriəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Thích giao tiếp, hòa đồng và ở cùng người khác.', 'liking to be with other people and enjoying social activities.', 'She\'s a very gregarious person who loves attending social events and meeting new people.', 'Cô ấy là một người rất thích giao du, yêu thích tham dự các sự kiện xã hội và gặp gỡ những người mới.', '{\"en\": \"The sales department is looking for a gregarious representative to handle client relations.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận bán hàng đang tìm kiếm một đại diện hòa đồng để xử lý quan hệ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-ljspeech-713a031e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-cori-713a031e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gregarious-f1d0c51b.webp', '[\"sociable\", \"outgoing\", \"friendly\"]', '[\"unsociable\", \"introverted\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gregarious personality\", \"meaning\": \"tính cách hòa đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gregarious animal\", \"meaning\": \"động vật sống theo bầy đàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gregariousness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-cori-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru0-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru5-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru6-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru10-713a031e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru9-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru3-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru7-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru8-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-aru2-713a031e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-ljspeech-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt408-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt138-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt624-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt396-713a031e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt498-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt132-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt288-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt42-713a031e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gregarious-lt90-713a031e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mô tả người thích giao du, hướng ngoại, hoặc động vật sống bầy đàn.', 'hr', 1, 24),
('27f0cdd5-e09b-5122-a438-1315681d023f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'scram', '/skræm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đi khỏi ngay lập tức, biến đi (thường dùng để ra lệnh).', 'to leave a place quickly because someone is angry or wants you to go away.', 'The angry homeowner yelled at the kids to scram from his lawn.', 'Chủ nhà tức giận hét lên bảo lũ trẻ cút khỏi bãi cỏ của ông ta.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard told the unauthorized visitors to scram from the private office area immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ bảo những vị khách không mời hãy biến khỏi khu vực văn phòng ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-ljspeech-e07ae909.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-cori-e07ae909.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scram-d0b4d95f.webp', '[\"leave\", \"depart\"]', '[\"stay\", \"remain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scram out of\", \"meaning\": \"biến khỏi đâu đó\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-cori-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru0-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru5-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru6-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru10-e07ae909.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru9-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru3-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru7-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru8-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-aru2-e07ae909.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-ljspeech-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt408-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt138-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt624-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt396-e07ae909.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt498-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt132-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt288-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt42-e07ae909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scram-lt90-e07ae909.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là từ lóng, mang sắc thái ra lệnh thô lỗ, không dùng trong giao tiếp công sở lịch sự.', 'other', 1, 25),
('208c62cf-409c-52d1-aeb8-87ea51321cc2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'proactive', '/ˌprəʊˈæktɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Chủ động hành động để kiểm soát tình hình thay vì chỉ phản ứng.', 'taking action to make changes or deal with problems before they happen.', 'Being proactive in your job search can lead to better opportunities.', 'Chủ động trong việc tìm kiếm việc làm có thể mang lại những cơ hội tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department takes a proactive approach to recruiting top talent.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận nhân sự thực hiện một cách tiếp cận chủ động để tuyển dụng nhân tài hàng đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-ljspeech-64512b62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-cori-64512b62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/proactive-70bfcff5.webp', '[\"active\", \"enterprising\", \"forward-looking\"]', '[\"reactive\", \"passive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"proactive approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận chủ động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proactive measures\", \"meaning\": \"các biện pháp chủ động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"active\", \"note_vi\": \"active là năng động, proactive là chủ động đón đầu trước khi việc xảy ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"proactively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"proactivity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-cori-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru0-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru5-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru6-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru10-64512b62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru9-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru3-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru7-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru8-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-aru2-64512b62.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-ljspeech-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt408-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt138-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt624-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt396-64512b62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt498-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt132-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt288-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt42-64512b62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proactive-lt90-64512b62.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -active chỉ tính chất hành động, thêm tiền tố pro- nghĩa là trước, tức là chủ động trước.', 'hr', 1, 26),
('b8870438-01d6-5105-ae26-750c4a3ca5a5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'ailing', '/ˈeɪlɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Bị ốm yếu hoặc gặp vấn đề, đặc biệt là trong thời gian dài.', 'experiencing difficulty, weakness, or illness over a long period of time.', 'The investor bought the ailing company with plans to restructure its operations.', 'Nhà đầu tư đã mua lại công ty đang suy yếu với kế hoạch tái cấu trúc các hoạt động của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors decided to sell the ailing division of the company.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã quyết định bán đi bộ phận đang làm ăn thua lỗ của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-ljspeech-b5c4fa5c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-cori-b5c4fa5c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ailing-bafa559c.webp', '[\"weak\", \"failing\", \"sickly\"]', '[\"healthy\", \"flourishing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ailing economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế suy thoái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ailing company\", \"meaning\": \"công ty đang gặp khó khăn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ail\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ailment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-cori-b5c4fa5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-aru0-b5c4fa5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-aru5-b5c4fa5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-aru6-b5c4fa5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-aru10-b5c4fa5c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-aru9-b5c4fa5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-aru3-b5c4fa5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-aru7-b5c4fa5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailing-aru8-b5c4fa5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub