('45161ff6-4c72-58db-a6d4-945e28386e74', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '720e727b-3014-5f49-8c03-66afaa349094', '610a84c5-aa42-5ab0-9415-4ccf920a6f12', 'pitted', '/ˈpɪtɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều vết lõm nhỏ trên bề mặt.', 'having many small holes or marks on the surface, often caused by wear or damage.', 'The old road surface was badly pitted after years of heavy traffic.', 'Mặt đường cũ bị rỗ nặng sau nhiều năm chịu lượng giao thông lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery van had a pitted body due to years of exposure to harsh weather conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc xe tải giao hàng có thân xe bị rỗ do nhiều năm tiếp xúc với điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-ljspeech-cd57cd72.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-cori-cd57cd72.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pitted-89e08429.webp', '[\"dented\", \"rough\"]', '[\"smooth\", \"flat\"]', NULL, NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-cori-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru0-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru5-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru6-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru10-cd57cd72.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru9-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru3-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru7-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru8-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-aru2-cd57cd72.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-ljspeech-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitted-lt408-cd57cd72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec