('3df3ff52-507b-5f74-a5a3-05bffbbc9937', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '7380af7e-6f9d-5248-8bbf-c6218854a7d1', '04820dda-a397-5d3a-8187-04523c9865fb', 'swindle', '/ˈswɪndl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Lừa gạt ai đó để lấy tiền hoặc tài sản của họ.', 'to trick someone in order to take their money or belongings in a dishonest way.', 'The con artist tried to swindle elderly people out of their savings.', 'Kẻ lừa đảo đã cố gắng lừa gạt những người lớn tuổi để chiếm đoạt tiền tiết kiệm của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The company warned customers not to trust emails that try to swindle them out of money.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cảnh báo khách hàng không nên tin vào các email cố gắng lừa đảo tiền của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-ljspeech-14301194.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-cori-14301194.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/swindle-1e07a1f9.webp', '[\"cheat\", \"defraud\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"swindle someone out of\", \"meaning\": \"lừa ai lấy mất cái gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"swindler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-cori-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru0-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru5-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru6-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru10-14301194.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru9-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru3-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru7-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru8-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-aru2-14301194.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-ljspeech-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt408-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt138-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt624-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt396-14301194.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt498-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt132-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt288-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt42-14301194.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swindle-lt90-14301194.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ hành vi lừa đảo tài chính có tính toán.', 'business', 1, 27),
('6153b497-9ce5-5a59-8edb-ca0f89029700', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '7380af7e-6f9d-5248-8bbf-c6218854a7d1', '04820dda-a397-5d3a-8187-04523c9865fb', 'gable', '/ˈɡeɪbl/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Phần tường hình tam giác ở đầu hồi nhà, dưới mái dốc.', 'A vertical triangular section of a building wall situated beneath pitched rooflines.', 'The old house had a charming wooden gable facing the street.', 'Ngôi nhà cũ có một đầu hồi gỗ duyên dáng hướng ra đường.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed a modern office building with a large glass gable to let in light.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế một tòa nhà văn phòng hiện đại với phần đầu hồi bằng kính lớn để đón ánh sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-ljspeech-a4ae8180.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-cori-a4ae8180.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gable-09830d71.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gable roof\", \"meaning\": \"mái đầu hồi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gable end\", \"meaning\": \"phần tường đầu hồi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-cori-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru0-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru5-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru6-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru10-a4ae8180.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru9-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru3-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru7-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru8-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-aru2-a4ae8180.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-ljspeech-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt408-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt138-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt624-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt396-a4ae8180.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt498-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt132-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt288-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt42-a4ae8180.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gable-lt90-a4ae8180.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên môn về kiến trúc, ít gặp trong giao tiếp thông thường.', 'housing', 1, 28),
('c726d89d-7525-5765-b982-dc511bd4cff9', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '7380af7e-6f9d-5248-8bbf-c6218854a7d1', '04820dda-a397-5d3a-8187-04523c9865fb', 'weary', '/ˈwɪəri/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Mệt mỏi rã rời, kiệt sức.', 'feeling very tired and lacking energy after a lot of effort or activity.', 'After a long day of hiking, I felt completely weary.', 'Sau một ngày dài đi bộ đường dài, tôi cảm thấy hoàn toàn mệt mỏi rã rời.', '{\"en\": \"The staff felt weary after working overtime to meet the project deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cảm thấy mệt mỏi sau khi làm thêm giờ để kịp thời hạn dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-ljspeech-4b393ad7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-cori-4b393ad7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weary-b890ccc2.webp', '[\"exhausted\", \"tired\", \"fatigued\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"refreshed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grow weary\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên mệt mỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weary of something\", \"meaning\": \"chán nản, mệt mỏi với điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weary traveler\", \"meaning\": \"người lữ hành mệt mỏi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wary\", \"note_vi\": \"wary nghĩa là cảnh giác, đề phòng; không liên quan đến mệt mỏi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weariness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"wearily\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-cori-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru0-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru5-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru6-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru10-4b393ad7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru9-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru3-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru7-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru8-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-aru2-4b393ad7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-ljspeech-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt408-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt138-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt624-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt396-4b393ad7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt498-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt132-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt288-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt42-4b393ad7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weary-lt90-4b393ad7.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'weary\' (mệt mỏi) với \'wary\' (cảnh giác); hai từ khác nghĩa hoàn toàn.', 'hr', 1, 29),
('b074b921-445b-50fa-ac98-17e374a1bfe2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '74dc0ebc-792b-53aa-9aaf-e85eb4aed917', '864686b2-8eac-546f-8166-9913e181ce38', 'dense', '/dens/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dày đặc, rậm rạp; khó hiểu (người).', 'having parts that are close together so that it is difficult to go through.', 'The tour guide led the group safely through the dense forest yesterday afternoon.', 'Người hướng dẫn viên đã dẫn đoàn đi an toàn qua khu rừng rậm rạp vào chiều qua.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck was delayed by dense traffic on the main highway this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng đã bị trễ do giao thông đông đúc trên đường cao tốc chính sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-ljspeech-c8e834d8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-cori-c8e834d8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dense-f780f06e.webp', '[\"thick\", \"heavy\", \"crowded\"]', '[\"thin\", \"sparse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dense fog\", \"meaning\": \"sương mù dày đặc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dense population\", \"meaning\": \"dân cư đông đúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dent\", \"note_vi\": \"dent là vết lõm, không liên quan đến dense.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"densely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"density\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-cori-c8e834d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-aru0-c8e834d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-aru5-c8e834d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-aru6-c8e834d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-aru10-c8e834d8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-aru9-c8e834d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-aru3-c8e834d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-aru7-c8e834d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dense-aru8-c8e834d8.mp3\