('c7533b6b-cb25-56ca-9d19-7e035df58081', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '74dc0ebc-792b-53aa-9aaf-e85eb4aed917', '864686b2-8eac-546f-8166-9913e181ce38', 'sectarianism', '/sekˈteəriənɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự chia rẽ, thù địch dựa trên sự khác biệt về tôn giáo hoặc chính trị.', 'Rigid devotion to a specific faction or denomination, frequently causing social division.', 'The country struggled with deep-rooted sectarianism that often led to conflict.', 'Đất nước này phải vật lộn với chủ nghĩa bè phái sâu sắc thường dẫn đến xung đột.', '{\"en\": \"The international business council warned that political sectarianism could harm foreign investments in the region.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng kinh doanh quốc tế cảnh báo rằng bè phái chính trị có thể gây hại cho đầu tư nước ngoài vào khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-ljspeech-03b23fef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-cori-03b23fef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sectarianism-30312ff0.webp', '[\"factionalism\", \"partisanism\", \"dogmatism\"]', '[\"unity\", \"integration\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"religious sectarianism\", \"meaning\": \"sự chia rẽ tôn giáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"political sectarianism\", \"meaning\": \"sự chia rẽ chính trị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"secularism\", \"note_vi\": \"secularism là chủ nghĩa thế tục, tách biệt tôn giáo khỏi nhà nước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sectarian\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sect\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-cori-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru0-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru5-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru6-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru10-03b23fef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru9-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru3-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru7-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru8-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-aru2-03b23fef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-ljspeech-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt408-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt138-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt624-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt396-03b23fef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt498-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt132-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt288-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt42-03b23fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sectarianism-lt90-03b23fef.mp3\"]}}', 'Sectarianism xuất phát từ gốc \'sect\' (môn phái, giáo phái), chỉ sự chia rẽ phe phái.', 'business', 1, 2),
('ac24ebba-a2c2-5ea4-b56b-759e7a8020b2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '74dc0ebc-792b-53aa-9aaf-e85eb4aed917', '864686b2-8eac-546f-8166-9913e181ce38', 'vacuole', '/ˈvækjuəʊl/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Không bào, túi chứa chất lỏng trong tế bào thực vật hoặc động vật.', 'a small space inside a cell that contains liquid and stores food or waste.', 'Plant cells often have a large central vacuole that stores water and nutrients.', 'Tế bào thực vật thường có một không bào trung tâm lớn chứa nước và chất dinh dưỡng.', '{\"en\": \"The biology lab report explains how the vacuole helps maintain the structure of plant cells.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo phòng thí nghiệm sinh học giải thích cách không bào giúp duy trì cấu trúc của tế bào thực vật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-ljspeech-474b1ab3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-cori-474b1ab3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vacuole-6b2607d6.webp', '[\"cavity\", \"sac\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"central vacuole\", \"meaning\": \"không bào trung tâm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"food vacuole\", \"meaning\": \"không bào tiêu hóa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-cori-474b1ab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru0-474b1ab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru5-474b1ab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru6-474b1ab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru10-474b1ab3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru9-474b1ab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru3-474b1ab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru7-474b1ab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru8-474b1ab3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacuole-aru2-474b1ab3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v