('ed849736-14cc-5a8c-9ed4-88edbf634585', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '74dc0ebc-792b-53aa-9aaf-e85eb4aed917', '864686b2-8eac-546f-8166-9913e181ce38', 'exosphere', '/ði ˈeksəʊsfɪə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tầng ngoài cùng của bầu khí quyển Trái Đất, nơi các hạt khí thoát ra không gian.', 'the highest part of the atmosphere where the air is very thin and leads into outer space.', 'The exosphere is the outermost layer of Earth\'s atmosphere, extending into space.', 'Tầng ngoài là lớp ngoài cùng của khí quyển Trái Đất, kéo dài vào không gian.', '{\"en\": \"Satellites are often positioned in the exosphere to monitor weather patterns and global communications.\", \"vi\": \"Các vệ tinh thường được đặt ở tầng ngoài cùng của khí quyển để theo dõi các kiểu thời tiết và liên lạc toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-ljspeech-fcb38fd2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-cori-fcb38fd2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exosphere-a6b93af8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"Earth\'s exosphere\", \"meaning\": \"tầng ngoài cùng của khí quyển Trái Đất\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-cori-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru0-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru5-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru6-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru10-fcb38fd2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru9-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru3-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru7-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru8-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-aru2-fcb38fd2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-ljspeech-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt408-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt138-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt624-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt396-fcb38fd2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt498-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt132-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt288-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt42-fcb38fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exosphere-lt90-fcb38fd2.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên ngành khoa học, ít gặp trong giao tiếp văn phòng thông thường.', 'technology', 1, 24),
('7d1972b4-64e5-5103-9214-e67e60a9396e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '74dc0ebc-792b-53aa-9aaf-e85eb4aed917', '864686b2-8eac-546f-8166-9913e181ce38', 'lousy', '/ˈlaʊzi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất tệ, dở hoặc không tốt chút nào.', 'of very poor quality or not good at all in a specific situation.', 'The service at that restaurant was absolutely lousy; I won\'t go back.', 'Dịch vụ ở nhà hàng đó tệ hại kinh khủng; tôi sẽ không quay lại.', '{\"en\": \"We received a lousy performance report from the supplier after the shipment was delayed again.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã nhận được một báo cáo hiệu suất rất tệ từ nhà cung cấp sau khi lô hàng bị trì hoãn lần nữa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-ljspeech-ec1b5031.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-cori-ec1b5031.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lousy-03801068.webp', '[\"terrible\", \"awful\"]', '[\"excellent\", \"great\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lousy service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ tồi tệ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-cori-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru0-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru5-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru6-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru10-ec1b5031.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru9-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru3-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru7-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru8-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-aru2-ec1b5031.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-ljspeech-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lousy-lt408-ec1b5031.mp3\", \"/