('e4167d91-bbfb-5772-9bea-46f5f07a9aee', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '8f951e58-6e1d-536e-8d31-2a47abe8caf3', '54158ea5-fb07-5ab1-90e9-67aff920041e', 'fever', '/ˈfiːvə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng sốt, thân nhiệt cao hơn bình thường.', 'a medical condition in which the body temperature is higher than normal.', 'Mark called in sick yesterday because he developed a severe fever along with body aches.', 'Mark đã xin nghỉ ốm hôm qua vì anh ấy bị sốt nặng cùng với đau mỏi cơ thể.', '{\"en\": \"Employees running a high fever should stay home and rest to prevent spreading illness.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bị sốt cao nên ở nhà nghỉ ngơi để tránh lây lan bệnh tật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-ljspeech-e2f347fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-cori-e2f347fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fever-f24117e9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high fever\", \"meaning\": \"sốt cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"run a fever\", \"meaning\": \"bị sốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fever pitch\", \"meaning\": \"mức độ cuồng nhiệt hoặc đỉnh điểm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"feverish\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"feverishly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-cori-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru0-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru5-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru6-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru10-e2f347fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru9-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru3-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru7-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru8-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-aru2-e2f347fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-ljspeech-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt408-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt138-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt624-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt396-e2f347fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt498-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt132-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt288-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt42-e2f347fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fever-lt90-e2f347fb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cụm \'have a fever\' hoặc \'run a fever\' để nói bị sốt.', 'health', 1, 23),
('b2a87069-2623-5943-bf59-465926b3ccfc', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '8f951e58-6e1d-536e-8d31-2a47abe8caf3', '54158ea5-fb07-5ab1-90e9-67aff920041e', 'tort', '/tɔːt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hành vi sai trái gây thiệt hại cho người khác, có thể bị kiện dân sự.', 'an action that causes harm to someone and can be decided in a civil court.', 'Slander is a type of tort that can lead to a lawsuit.', 'Vu khống là một loại hành vi gây thiệt hại có thể dẫn đến một vụ kiện.', '{\"en\": \"The company was sued for a tort after their product injured several customers.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã bị kiện vì hành vi gây hại sau khi sản phẩm của họ làm bị thương vài khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-ljspeech-92c68d9b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-cori-92c68d9b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tort-b9b4c294.webp', '[\"wrongdoing\", \"misdeed\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"commit a tort\", \"meaning\": \"phạm luật dân sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"law of torts\", \"meaning\": \"luật về bồi thường thiệt hại ngoài hợp đồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tart\", \"note_vi\": \"bánh tart ngọt hoặc chua, không phải hành vi sai trái\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tortious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-cori-92c68d9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-aru0-92c68d9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-aru5-92c68d9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-aru6-92c68d9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-aru10-92c68d9b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-aru9-92c68d9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-aru3-92c68d9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-aru7-92c68d9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tort-aru8-92c68d9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v