('91c69e09-d92a-5542-a4ba-1a643bc07247', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'fallout', '/ˈfɔːlˌaʊt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hậu quả không mong muốn hoặc tác động phụ của một sự kiện.', 'Adverse consequences or indirect outcomes following a significant action, incident, or controversy.', 'The political fallout from the scandal was severe.', 'Hậu quả chính trị từ vụ bê bối rất nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The company faced significant negative fallout after the CEO announced the sudden budget cuts.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phải đối mặt với hậu quả tiêu cực đáng kể sau khi giám đốc điều hành thông báo cắt giảm ngân sách đột ngột.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-ljspeech-cbf72aca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-cori-cbf72aca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fallout-be2faa13.webp', '[\"consequence\", \"aftermath\", \"repercussion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"radioactive fallout\", \"meaning\": \"bụi phóng xạ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"political fallout\", \"meaning\": \"hậu quả chính trị\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-cori-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru0-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru5-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru6-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru10-cbf72aca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru9-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru3-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru7-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru8-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-aru2-cbf72aca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-ljspeech-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt408-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt138-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt624-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt396-cbf72aca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt498-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt132-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt288-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt42-cbf72aca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fallout-lt90-cbf72aca.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh tiêu cực, không phải nghĩa đen là bụi phóng xạ.', 'business', 1, 10),
('9c58a730-fb69-549c-bbf1-0ad2efe304c7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'mailshot', '/ˈmeɪlʃɒt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Thư hoặc tài liệu quảng cáo gửi hàng loạt qua bưu điện.', 'a large amount of advertising material sent to many people at the same time by post.', 'The company sent out a mailshot to all potential customers announcing their new product.', 'Công ty đã gửi một thư quảng cáo hàng loạt đến tất cả khách hàng tiềm năng để thông báo về sản phẩm mới của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team prepared a mailshot to inform existing clients about our seasonal discount offers.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã chuẩn bị một đợt gửi thư quảng cáo để thông báo cho khách hàng về ưu đãi giảm giá.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-ljspeech-ff220849.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-cori-ff220849.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mailshot-369d0d7c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"send a mailshot\", \"meaning\": \"gửi thư quảng cáo hàng loạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"marketing mailshot\", \"meaning\": \"thư quảng cáo tiếp thị\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-cori-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru0-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru5-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru6-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru10-ff220849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru9-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru3-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru7-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru8-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-aru2-ff220849.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-ljspeech-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt408-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt138-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt624-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt396-ff220849.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt498-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt132-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt288-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt42-ff220849.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mailshot-lt90-ff220849.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh tiếp thị trực tiếp.', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('0141a415-4255-57e3-98a4-d474209c702a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'satire', '/ˈsætaɪə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Việc sử dụng sự hài hước, châm biếm hoặc phóng đại để chỉ trích ai đó hoặc cái gì đó.', 'a way of criticizing people or ideas by using humor, irony, or exaggeration to show faults.', 'The show was a sharp satire on modern politics and society.', 'Chương trình đó là một sự châm biếm sâu sắc về chính trị và xã hội hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"The magazine published a clever satire regarding the inefficiency of current bureaucratic office procedures.\", \"vi\": \"Tạp chí đã xuất bản một bài châm biếm thông minh về sự kém hiệu quả của các thủ tục văn phòng quan liêu hiện nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-ljspeech-48531bba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-cori-48531bba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/satire-be237eef.webp', '[\"parody\", \"irony\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"political satire\", \"meaning\": \"châm biếm chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sharp satire\", \"meaning\": \"sự châm biếm sâu cay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"satirical\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"satirize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-cori-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru0-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru5-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru6-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru10-48531bba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru9-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru3-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru7-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru8-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-aru2-48531bba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-ljspeech-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt408-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt138-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt624-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt396-48531bba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt498-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt132-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt288-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt42-48531bba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/satire-lt90-48531bba.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong văn học hoặc truyền thông để phê phán.', 'media', 1, 12),
('8af6f51d-b22d-52ff-b0a0-36d8e6b1771a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'nitpick', '/ˈnɪt.pɪk/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Bới móc, chỉ trích những lỗi nhỏ nhặt, không quan trọng.', 'to find fault with small, unimportant details in a critical way.', 'Instead of nitpicking every small detail, we should focus on the main objective.', 'Thay vì soi mói từng chi tiết nhỏ, chúng ta nên tập trung vào mục tiêu chính.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not nitpick minor formatting errors during the initial draft review process.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng không bới móc các lỗi định dạng nhỏ trong quá trình xem xét bản thảo đầu tiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-ljspeech-d77ea62d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-cori-d77ea62d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nitpick-9fc61047.webp', '[\"cavil\", \"quibble\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tendency to nitpick\", \"meaning\": \"xu hướng bới lông tìm vết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nitpick details\", \"meaning\": \"săm soi chi tiết nhỏ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nitpicker\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"nitpicking\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-cori-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru0-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru5-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru6-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru10-d77ea62d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru9-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru3-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru7-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru8-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-aru2-d77ea62d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-ljspeech-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt408-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt138-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt624-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt396-d77ea62d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt498-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt132-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt288-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt42-d77ea62d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nitpick-lt90-d77ea62d.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái tiêu cực, chỉ việc quá chú trọng vào lỗi vặt thay vì tổng thể.', 'office', 1, 13),
('e3fb90d3-1b7b-578c-828b-be0a425f9307', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'patronage', 'UK: /ˈpætrənɪdʒ/ | US: /ˈpeɪtrənɪdʒ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'sự bảo trợ, sự ủng hộ của khách hàng', 'The financial support or regular custom given to a business by its loyal customers.', 'We appreciate your continued patronage.', 'Chúng tôi đánh giá cao sự ủng hộ liên tục của quý vị.', '{\"en\": \"We would like to express our gratitude to all customers for their continued patronage.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi xin bày tỏ lòng biết ơn đến tất cả khách hàng vì sự ủng hộ liên tục của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-ljspeech-4379794c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-cori-4379794c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/patronage-c936c229.webp', '[\"support\", \"sponsorship\", \"backing\", \"business\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"continued patronage\", \"meaning\": \"sự ủng hộ liên tục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thank you for your patronage\", \"meaning\": \"cảm ơn sự ủng hộ của quý vị\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"patron\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"patronize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-cori-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru0-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru5-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru6-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru10-4379794c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru9-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru3-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru7-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru8-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-aru2-4379794c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-ljspeech-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt408-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt138-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt624-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt396-4379794c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt498-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt132-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt288-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt42-4379794c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patronage-lt90-4379794c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ cảm ơn \'Thank you for your patronage\' (Cảm ơn sự ủng hộ của quý khách) xuất hiện rất thường xuyên trong thông báo và thư từ thương mại.', 'customer service', 1, 14),
('335a558d-ca7d-5d60-8470-c1190386a2b3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'flat out', '/ˌflæt ˈaʊt/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Với tốc độ hoặc cường độ tối đa, hết sức mình.', 'to do something at maximum speed or with full effort and energy.', 'The customer support team is working flat out to process all refund requests today.', 'Đội ngũ hỗ trợ khách hàng đang nỗ lực hết sức để xử lý mọi yêu cầu hoàn tiền hôm nay.', '{\"en\": \"The production team worked flat out to meet the client\'s urgent delivery schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm sản xuất đã làm việc hết sức để đáp ứng lịch giao hàng gấp của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-ljspeech-28bf4f70.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-cori-28bf4f70.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flat-out-c43968e6.webp', '[\"all out\", \"at full speed\", \"full throttle\"]', '[\"take it easy\", \"go slow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work flat out\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc hết sức, không ngừng nghỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go flat out\", \"meaning\": \"chạy/hoạt động hết tốc độ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flat out effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực tối đa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flat\", \"note_vi\": \"flat một mình có nghĩa bằng phẳng hoặc căn hộ, khác nghĩa flat out\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-cori-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru0-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru5-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru6-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru10-28bf4f70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru9-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru3-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru7-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru8-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-aru2-28bf4f70.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-ljspeech-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt408-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt138-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt624-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt396-28bf4f70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt498-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt132-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt288-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt42-28bf4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flat-out-lt90-28bf4f70.mp3\"]}}', 'Flat out là cụm từ thông dụng trong tiếng Anh Anh, hay gặp trong bối cảnh deadline công việc.', 'office', 1, 15),
('bfa88b02-6436-5b88-b28b-365a9d320788', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'galley', '/ˈɡæli/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Thuyền lớn chạy bằng mái chèo và buồm, thường dùng trong chiến tranh hoặc nhà tù.', 'a long, flat ship with sails and oars, used in ancient times for war.', 'Ancient Roman warships were often large galleys powered by hundreds of rowers.', 'Các chiến thuyền La Mã cổ đại thường là những chiếc thuyền lớn được điều khiển bởi hàng trăm người chèo thuyền.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping museum displayed a model of an ancient galley used for transporting commercial goods.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo tàng hàng hải đã trưng bày mô hình một chiếc thuyền cổ dùng để vận chuyển hàng hóa thương mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-ljspeech-4bf6a2e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-cori-4bf6a2e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/galley-f68651a2.webp', '[\"ship\", \"vessel\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ancient galley\", \"meaning\": \"thuyền cổ chạy bằng mái chèo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"galley slave\", \"meaning\": \"nô lệ chèo thuyền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gallery\", \"note_vi\": \"phòng trưng bày nghệ thuật, khác galley chỉ có một chữ r\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-cori-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru0-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru5-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru6-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru10-4bf6a2e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru9-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru3-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru7-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru8-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-aru2-4bf6a2e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-ljspeech-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt408-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt138-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt624-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt396-4bf6a2e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt498-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt132-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt288-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt42-4bf6a2e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/galley-lt90-4bf6a2e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với gallery (phòng triển lãm) vì chỉ khác nhau một chữ \'r\'.', 'travel', 1, 16),
('c41e0134-c02a-5ff4-af5a-294e6902dac4', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'quasar', '/ˈkweɪzɑː(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một thiên thể rất sáng và xa, được cho là trung tâm của một số thiên hà.', 'a very bright object in space that is extremely far away from the earth.', 'Astronomers are studying the distant quasar to understand the early universe.', 'Các nhà thiên văn học đang nghiên cứu chuẩn tinh xa xôi để hiểu về vũ trụ sơ khai.', '{\"en\": \"The science magazine published a detailed article about the discovery of a distant quasar.\", \"vi\": \"Tạp chí khoa học đã xuất bản một bài báo chi tiết về việc phát hiện ra một chuẩn tinh ở xa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-ljspeech-a89479e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-cori-a89479e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quasar-ea298d4b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"distant quasar\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn tinh ở xa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bright quasar\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn tinh sáng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-cori-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru0-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru5-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru6-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru10-a89479e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru9-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru3-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru7-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru8-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-aru2-a89479e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-ljspeech-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt408-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt138-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt624-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt396-a89479e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt498-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt132-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt288-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt42-a89479e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quasar-lt90-a89479e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên ngành thiên văn học, ít xuất hiện trong bài thi TOEIC thông thường.', 'media', 1, 17),
('fea506f2-5a43-5ec8-9d06-b3e3f4c8faf5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'unforeseen', 'UK: /ˌʌnfɔːˈsiːn/ | US: /ˌʌnfɔːrˈsiːn/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'không lường trước được', 'Not expected, anticipated, or predicted in advance before a particular situation occurs.', 'The project faced unforeseen challenges during its development.', 'Dự án phải đối mặt với những thách thức không lường trước được trong quá trình phát triển.', '{\"en\": \"Due to unforeseen circumstances, the keynote speaker had to cancel his presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Do những lý do không lường trước được, diễn giả chính đã phải hủy bài phát biểu của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-ljspeech-4d8cf0db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-cori-4d8cf0db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unforeseen-35ed6d2f.webp', '[\"unexpected\", \"unpredicted\", \"unanticipated\", \"accidental\"]', '[\"foreseen\", \"expected\", \"predictable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unforeseen circumstances\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn cảnh không lường trước được\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unforeseen expenses\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí phát sinh bất ngờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"uninformed\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Unforeseen\' là không lường trước được, còn \'uninformed\' là thiếu thông tin.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"foresee\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"foreseeable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-cori-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru0-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru5-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru6-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru10-4d8cf0db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru9-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru3-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru7-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru8-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru2-4d8cf0db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-ljspeech-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt408-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt138-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt624-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt396-4d8cf0db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt498-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt132-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt288-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt42-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-lt90-4d8cf0db.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay gặp nhất trong cụm \'unforeseen circumstances\' (những sự cố/hoàn cảnh không lường trước).', 'event management', 1, 18),
('f32b1c4a-c175-588c-a2c6-d12b644155cc', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'babble', '/ˈbæbl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nói nhanh, không rõ ràng hoặc nói chuyện trẻ con.', 'to talk quickly in a way that is hard to understand, or to make sounds like a young baby.', 'The nervous candidate began to babble incoherently during the final job interview.', 'Ứng viên đầy lo lắng bắt đầu nói lảm nhảm thiếu mạch lạc trong buổi phỏng vấn xin việc cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The nervous intern began to babble during the job interview when asked about his experience.\", \"vi\": \"Thực tập sinh lo lắng bắt đầu nói lắp bắp trong buổi phỏng vấn khi được hỏi về kinh nghiệm của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-ljspeech-fe19d485.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-cori-fe19d485.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/babble-70d0252f.webp', '[\"ramble\", \"chatter\", \"jabber\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"babble on\", \"meaning\": \"nói liên tục không rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"babble incoherently\", \"meaning\": \"nói lảm nhảm, không mạch lạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"babble away\", \"meaning\": \"nói chuyện không ngừng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mumble\", \"note_vi\": \"mumble là nói lầm bầm, khó nghe vì giọng nhỏ, không phải nói nhanh lộn xộn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"babble\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"babbling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-cori-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru0-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru5-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru6-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru10-fe19d485.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru9-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru3-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru7-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru8-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-aru2-fe19d485.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-ljspeech-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt408-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt138-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt624-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt396-fe19d485.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt498-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt132-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt288-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt42-fe19d485.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/babble-lt90-fe19d485.mp3\"]}}', 'Babble mang nghĩa tiêu cực khi dùng cho người lớn, ngụ ý nói vô nghĩa hoặc thiếu tự tin.', 'hr', 1, 19),
('84f6f1ac-7bc4-5266-a4a9-89ffb491ba3d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'heresy', '/ˈherəsi/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Niềm tin hoặc học thuyết đi ngược lại giáo lý chính thống của một tôn giáo.', 'an opinion or belief that goes against official religious or accepted principles.', 'Galileo was accused of heresy for supporting the heliocentric model of the universe.', 'Galileo bị buộc tội dị giáo vì ủng hộ mô hình vũ trụ nhật tâm.', '{\"en\": \"Suggesting a complete change in the company\'s traditional business model was seen as heresy.\", \"vi\": \"Đề xuất thay đổi hoàn toàn mô hình kinh doanh truyền thống của công ty bị coi là dị giáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-ljspeech-1e227eec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-cori-1e227eec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heresy-b5cfd811.webp', '[\"dissent\", \"unorthodoxy\", \"nonconformity\"]', '[\"orthodoxy\", \"conformity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"commit heresy\", \"meaning\": \"phạm tội dị giáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accuse of heresy\", \"meaning\": \"buộc tội dị giáo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hearsay\", \"note_vi\": \"hearsay là tin đồn, lời đồn đại; heresy là dị giáo\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"heretic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"heretical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-cori-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru0-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru5-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru6-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru10-1e227eec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru9-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru3-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru7-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru8-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-aru2-1e227eec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-ljspeech-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt408-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt138-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt624-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt396-1e227eec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt498-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt132-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt288-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt42-1e227eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heresy-lt90-1e227eec.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công sở, từ này đôi khi được dùng ẩn dụ để chỉ ý kiến đi ngược số đông.', 'other', 1, 20),
('1e26292b-1015-52f6-8c1f-d9b8b1a55767', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'voluminous', '/vəˈluːmɪnəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất lớn về kích thước, khối lượng hoặc số lượng.', 'very large in size, amount, or scale, containing a lot of space or detail.', 'She wore a voluminous skirt that swirled around her ankles as she walked.', 'Cô ấy mặc một chiếc váy rộng thùng thình, xoay tròn quanh mắt cá chân khi cô đi.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department prepared a voluminous report detailing all the contract terms.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận pháp lý đã chuẩn bị một báo cáo đồ sộ chi tiết tất cả các điều khoản hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-ljspeech-dafe917a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-cori-dafe917a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/voluminous-6903f120.webp', '[\"huge\", \"massive\", \"spacious\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"small\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"voluminous report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo đồ sộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"voluminous notes\", \"meaning\": \"ghi chép dày đặc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"luminous\", \"note_vi\": \"luminous nghĩa là phát sáng, chói sáng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"volume\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"voluminously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-cori-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru0-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru5-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru6-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru10-dafe917a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru9-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru3-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru7-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru8-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-aru2-dafe917a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-ljspeech-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt408-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt138-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt624-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt396-dafe917a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt498-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt132-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt288-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt42-dafe917a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/voluminous-lt90-dafe917a.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với luminous (phát sáng). Voluminous liên quan đến volume (thể tích, số lượng lớn).', 'office', 1, 21),
('795b2eb4-33fe-5136-abfd-457844e0a168', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'bridgehead', '/ˈbrɪdʒhed/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một vị trí an toàn được chiếm giữ trong lãnh thổ đối phương, làm cơ sở cho cuộc tấn công tiếp theo.', 'a strong position secured in enemy territory from which to advance.', 'The troops successfully established a bridgehead on the enemy\'s side of the river.', 'Quân đội đã thiết lập thành công một đầu cầu ở phía bên kia sông của đối phương.', '{\"en\": \"Opening a small office in Tokyo served as a bridgehead for our expansion into Asia.\", \"vi\": \"Việc mở một văn phòng nhỏ tại Tokyo đã đóng vai trò là bàn đạp cho sự mở rộng của chúng tôi vào châu Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-ljspeech-9213a085.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-cori-9213a085.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bridgehead-9c7a5c95.webp', '[\"foothold\", \"beachhead\", \"outpost\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"establish a bridgehead\", \"meaning\": \"thiết lập một bàn đạp hoặc vị trí tiền tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"secure a bridgehead\", \"meaning\": \"giữ vững bàn đạp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"foothold\", \"note_vi\": \"chỗ đứng vững chắc, nghĩa rộng và phổ biến hơn trong kinh doanh\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-cori-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru0-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru5-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru6-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru10-9213a085.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru9-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru3-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru7-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru8-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-aru2-9213a085.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-ljspeech-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt408-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt138-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt624-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt396-9213a085.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt498-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt132-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt288-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt42-9213a085.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bridgehead-lt90-9213a085.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, \'bridgehead\' thường được dùng ẩn dụ để chỉ bước đi đầu tiên nhằm thâm nhập một thị trường mới.', 'business', 1, 22),
('b7955cd7-1d01-5047-adb9-b7774902125d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '962a44ff-3311-51d3-b40c-13f53865caf2', '2a0f3211-044f-5285-a5ac-d2e85bdce357', 'depress', '/dɪˈpres/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho ai đó cảm thấy buồn bã hoặc tuyệt vọng.', 'to make someone feel very sad and without enthusiasm or hope.', 'The gloomy weather often tends to depress me during the winter months.', 'Thời tiết ảm đạm thường có xu hướng làm tôi chán nản trong những tháng mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"The poor sales figures for this quarter will likely depress the company shareholders.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số bán hàng kém trong quý này có thể sẽ làm các cổ đông công ty thất vọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-ljspeech-6d7ef923.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-cori-6d7ef923.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/depress-4ca76a94.webp', '[\"sadden\", \"discourage\", \"deject\"]', '[\"cheer\", \"encourage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"depress the market\", \"meaning\": \"làm suy thoái thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"depress wages\", \"meaning\": \"làm giảm tiền lương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"oppress\", \"note_vi\": \"oppress nghĩa là đàn áp, áp bức bằng quyền lực\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"depression\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"depressed\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"depressing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-cori-6d7ef923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-aru0-6d7ef923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-aru5-6d7ef923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-aru6-6d7ef923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-aru10-6d7ef923.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-aru9-6d7ef923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depress-aru3-6d7ef923.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio