('117fb7c5-689f-5813-81e2-2c57185cd7f2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9ab71b75-97ac-5bc6-a1ba-62d77e1d5027', '7ceb4fff-a01a-5677-85b7-baf36d279f78', 'carp', '/kɑːp/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một loài cá nước ngọt lớn, thường được nuôi làm thực phẩm.', 'a large freshwater fish that is often kept for food or in gardens.', 'We caught a large carp in the lake, much to our surprise.', 'Chúng tôi đã bắt được một con cá chép lớn trong hồ, khiến chúng tôi rất ngạc nhiên.', '{\"en\": \"The seafood restaurant added fresh carp dishes to attract more local diners.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng hải sản đã thêm các món cá chép tươi vào menu để thu hút thêm thực khách địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-ljspeech-96fdff65.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-cori-96fdff65.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carp-034e3740.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"freshwater carp\", \"meaning\": \"cá chép nước ngọt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raise carp\", \"meaning\": \"nuôi cá chép\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"carp\", \"note_vi\": \"carp danh từ là cá chép, động từ carp (at sb) là bới lông tìm vết.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-cori-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru0-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru5-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru6-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru10-96fdff65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru9-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru3-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru7-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru8-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-aru2-96fdff65.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-ljspeech-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt408-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt138-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt624-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt396-96fdff65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt498-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt132-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt288-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt42-96fdff65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carp-lt90-96fdff65.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa danh từ (cá chép), động từ carp có nghĩa phàn nàn nhỏ nhặt.', 'dining', 1, 0),
('06bedc1f-9c4c-5db9-9a08-4e26df9b5851', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9ab71b75-97ac-5bc6-a1ba-62d77e1d5027', '7ceb4fff-a01a-5677-85b7-baf36d279f78', 'deluxe', '/dɪˈlʌks/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Sang trọng, cao cấp, xa xỉ.', 'of very high quality and often more expensive than other similar things.', 'We booked a deluxe room at the hotel with a stunning view of the ocean.', 'Chúng tôi đã đặt một phòng hạng sang tại khách sạn với tầm nhìn tuyệt đẹp ra biển.', '{\"en\": \"The business traveler requested a deluxe suite for his three-day stay in the city.\", \"vi\": \"Người đi công tác yêu cầu một phòng hạng sang cho chuyến lưu trú ba ngày tại thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-ljspeech-7afdd33e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-cori-7afdd33e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deluxe-59d86d23.webp', '[\"luxurious\", \"premium\"]', '[\"basic\", \"standard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deluxe room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng hạng sang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deluxe service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ cao cấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"de luxe\", \"note_vi\": \"cách viết khác của deluxe, nghĩa hoàn toàn giống nhau.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-cori-7afdd33e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru0-7afdd33e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru5-7afdd33e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru6-7afdd33e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru10-7afdd33e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru9-7afdd33e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru3-7afdd33e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru7-7afdd33e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru8-7afdd33e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluxe-aru2-7afdd33e.mp3\"]},