('82e45de3-eb20-5a3a-a113-1ad81bce883f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9ab71b75-97ac-5bc6-a1ba-62d77e1d5027', '7ceb4fff-a01a-5677-85b7-baf36d279f78', 'glee', '/ɡliː/', 'C1', 'noun', 'cảm giác vui sướng, hân hoan tột độ.', 'a feeling of great happiness and excitement, usually caused by success.', 'The children clapped their hands with glee when they saw the ice cream truck.', 'Bọn trẻ vỗ tay vui sướng khi thấy xe kem.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team expressed immense glee when they secured the lucrative contract.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kinh doanh bày tỏ sự vui sướng tột cùng khi giành được hợp đồng béo bở.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-ljspeech-4372fa3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-cori-4372fa3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glee-1c44a3e7.webp', '[\"delight\", \"joy\", \"elation\"]', '[\"gloom\", \"sorrow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"with glee\", \"meaning\": \"với sự hân hoan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express glee\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự vui sướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gloom\", \"note_vi\": \"glee là sự hân hoan hỉ hả, còn gloom là sự u ám ảm đạm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"gleeful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"gleefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-cori-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru0-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru5-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru6-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru10-4372fa3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru9-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru3-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru7-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru8-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-aru2-4372fa3c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-ljspeech-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt408-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt138-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt624-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt396-4372fa3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt498-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt132-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt288-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt42-4372fa3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glee-lt90-4372fa3c.mp3\"]}}', 'Glee thường đi kèm cụm \'with glee\' hoặc \'glee at something\'.', 'business', 1, 14),
('ac85600d-16af-5b4f-820f-2cfd6f26cd9a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9ab71b75-97ac-5bc6-a1ba-62d77e1d5027', '7ceb4fff-a01a-5677-85b7-baf36d279f78', 'broiling', '/brɔɪl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất nóng, như bị nướng.', 'extremely hot and uncomfortable, like being cooked under direct heat.', 'It was a broiling hot day, so we decided to stay indoors with the air conditioning.', 'Đó là một ngày nóng như thiêu đốt, vì vậy chúng tôi quyết định ở trong nhà với điều hòa.', '{\"en\": \"Workers wore protective gear despite the broiling weather inside the manufacturing plant.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân phải mặc đồ bảo hộ bất chấp thời tiết nóng như nướng bên trong nhà máy sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-ljspeech-bdffcb29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-cori-bdffcb29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/broiling-3fffcb49.webp', '[\"sweltering\", \"scorching\", \"boiling\"]', '[\"freezing\", \"chilly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"broiling heat\", \"meaning\": \"cái nóng như nướng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"broiling sun\", \"meaning\": \"mặt trời nóng rát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"boiling\", \"note_vi\": \"boiling là nóng như sôi, broiling là nóng rát trực tiếp như bị nướng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"broil\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-cori-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru0-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru5-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru6-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru10-bdffcb29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru9-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru3-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru7-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru8-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-aru2-bdffcb29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-ljspeech-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt408-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt138-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt624-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt396-bdffcb29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt498-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt132-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt288-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt42-bdffcb29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broiling-lt90-bdffcb29.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng mô tả thời tiết cực kỳ nóng rát hoặc môi trường nhiệt cao.', 'manufacturing', 1, 15),
('b675fb55-ba5f-5462-a609-e6808c3cb9eb', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9ab71b75-97ac-5bc6-a1ba-62d77e1d5027', '7ceb4fff-a01a-5677-85b7-baf36d279f78', 'disheartened', '/dɪsˈhɑːtnd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Nản lòng, mất hết hy vọng hoặc sự nhiệt tình.', 'feeling loss of hope, confidence, or enthusiasm to continue doing something.', 'After several rejections, she felt disheartened but refused to give up.', 'Sau nhiều lần bị từ chối, cô ấy cảm thấy nản lòng nhưng từ chối bỏ cuộc.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team felt disheartened after losing the contract to a major competitor.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng cảm thấy nản lòng sau khi mất hợp đồng vào tay một đối thủ cạnh tranh lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-ljspeech-de15c161.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-cori-de15c161.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disheartened-680d4a0d.webp', '[\"discouraged\", \"demoralized\", \"downhearted\"]', '[\"encouraged\", \"inspired\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel disheartened\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy nản lòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply disheartened\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ nản lòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"discouraged\", \"note_vi\": \"disheartened nhấn mạnh cảm xúc thất vọng và buồn sâu sắc hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dishearten\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disheartening\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-cori-de15c161.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-aru0-de15c161.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-aru5-de15c161.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-aru6-de15c161.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-aru10-de15c161.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-aru9-de15c161.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disheartened-aru3-