('200753a5-f3f0-51b0-af39-6516b9f427a1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9ab71b75-97ac-5bc6-a1ba-62d77e1d5027', '7ceb4fff-a01a-5677-85b7-baf36d279f78', 'octahedron', '/ˌɒktəˈhiːdrən/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Khối đa diện có tám mặt, mỗi mặt là một hình tam giác.', 'a solid shape with eight flat faces, especially where each face is a triangle.', 'A regular octahedron has eight equilateral triangular faces and six vertices.', 'Một hình bát diện đều có tám mặt tam giác đều và sáu đỉnh.', '{\"en\": \"The designer created a crystal award in the shape of a regular octahedron.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế đã tạo ra một chiếc cúp pha lê có hình khối tám mặt đều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-ljspeech-49fd8234.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-cori-49fd8234.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/octahedron-5125a65f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"regular octahedron\", \"meaning\": \"khối tám mặt đều\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"octagram\", \"note_vi\": \"hình sao tám cánh, không phải khối tám mặt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"octahedral\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-cori-49fd8234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru0-49fd8234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru5-49fd8234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru6-49fd8234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru10-49fd8234.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru9-49fd8234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru3-49fd8234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru7-49fd8234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru8-49fd8234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/octahedron-aru2-49fd8234.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st