('a7eb7609-08d5-5f2f-990e-479159ae9ff0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9ab71b75-97ac-5bc6-a1ba-62d77e1d5027', '7ceb4fff-a01a-5677-85b7-baf36d279f78', 'outperform', '/ˌaʊtpəˈfɔːm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Thực hiện tốt hơn, đạt kết quả cao hơn ai/cái gì.', 'to achieve better results or work more effectively than another person or group.', 'Our new marketing strategy is expected to outperform last year\'s efforts significantly.', 'Chiến lược tiếp thị mới của chúng tôi dự kiến sẽ vượt trội đáng kể so với nỗ lực của năm ngoái.', '{\"en\": \"Our sales team managed to outperform all competitors in the region during the last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng của chúng tôi đã thể hiện tốt hơn tất cả các đối thủ cạnh tranh trong khu vực trong quý vừa qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-ljspeech-f48d3fb1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-cori-f48d3fb1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outperform-31be6d68.webp', '[\"surpass\", \"exceed\", \"outdo\"]', '[\"underperform\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"outperform competitors\", \"meaning\": \"vượt trội hơn đối thủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outperform expectations\", \"meaning\": \"vượt quá kỳ vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"overperform\", \"note_vi\": \"Overperform thường dùng trong tài chính khi cổ phiếu vượt kỳ vọng thị trường.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"performance\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"performer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-cori-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru0-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru5-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru6-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru10-f48d3fb1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru9-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru3-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru7-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru8-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-aru2-f48d3fb1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-ljspeech-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt408-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt138-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt624-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt396-f48d3fb1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt498-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt132-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt288-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt42-f48d3fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outperform-lt90-f48d3fb1.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'out-\' có nghĩa là vượt trội hơn (ví dụ: outsmart, outnumber).', 'business', 1, 22),
('97216787-d0f7-5863-a566-a131e4ca8482', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9ab71b75-97ac-5bc6-a1ba-62d77e1d5027', '7ceb4fff-a01a-5677-85b7-baf36d279f78', 'stifle', '/ˈstaɪfl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Kìm nén, ngăn chặn hoặc làm nghẹt thở.', 'to stop yourself from doing something or to prevent something from happening or developing.', 'Strict company policies can sometimes stifle creativity and prevent young employees from sharing fresh ideas.', 'Các chính sách nghiêm ngặt của công ty đôi khi có thể kìm hãm sự sáng tạo và ngăn cản nhân viên trẻ chia sẻ những ý tưởng mới mẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager had to stifle his laughter when the client made a silly mistake during the presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý phải kìm nén tiếng cười khi khách hàng mắc một sai lầm ngớ ngẩn trong buổi thuyết trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-ljspeech-1f69f90a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-cori-1f69f90a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stifle-5617225e.webp', '[\"suppress\", \"restrain\", \"choke\"]', '[\"encourage\", \"promote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stifle a laugh\", \"meaning\": \"kìm nén tiếng cười\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stifle growth\", \"meaning\": \"kìm hãm sự phát triển\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-cori-1f69f90a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-aru0-1f69f90a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-aru5-1f69f90a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-aru6-1f69f90a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-aru10-1f69f90a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-aru9-1f69f90a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-aru3-1f69f90a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-aru7-1f69f90a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stifle-aru8-1f69f90a.mp3\", \"