('c040ed0a-c1d9-5598-8ba7-e6d9aff5eb8c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9b475423-8276-5b7c-be0b-f10b32abefd6', '77a1524d-2003-5596-9868-903ed0330c1a', 'upbraid', '/ʌpˈbreɪd/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Chỉ trích hoặc khiển trách ai đó một cách gay gắt.', 'to scold or criticize someone severely for a mistake.', 'The manager upbraided the employee for consistently being late to meetings.', 'Người quản lý đã mắng mỏ nhân viên vì liên tục đến muộn các cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The director upbraided the supplier for delivering faulty goods last month.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã khiển trách nhà cung cấp vì giao hàng lỗi tháng trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-ljspeech-1b592974.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-cori-1b592974.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upbraid-2251fc59.webp', '[\"rebuke\", \"reproach\", \"scold\"]', '[\"praise\", \"commend\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upbraid someone for\", \"meaning\": \"khiển trách ai vì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sharply upbraid\", \"meaning\": \"quở trách gay gắt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upbraid publicly\", \"meaning\": \"trách mắng trước đám đông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"upgrade\", \"note_vi\": \"upgrade là nâng cấp, không phải khiển trách.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"upbraiding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-cori-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru0-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru5-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru6-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru10-1b592974.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru9-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru3-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru7-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru8-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-aru2-1b592974.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-ljspeech-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt408-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt138-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt624-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt396-1b592974.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt498-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt132-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt288-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt42-1b592974.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upbraid-lt90-1b592974.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ trang trọng cho \'mắng mỏ\'; nhầm với upgrade (nâng cấp).', 'hr', 1, 22),
('1bbab470-a938-5689-a171-9c820d50ad78', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9b475423-8276-5b7c-be0b-f10b32abefd6', '77a1524d-2003-5596-9868-903ed0330c1a', 'leaden', '/ˈledn/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Nặng nề, u ám, chậm chạp.', 'feeling very heavy and slow because you are tired or unhappy about something.', 'After the long flight, his legs felt leaden and he just wanted to rest.', 'Sau chuyến bay dài, chân anh ấy nặng nề và anh ấy chỉ muốn nghỉ ngơi.', '{\"en\": \"After the long business trip, my feet felt leaden as I walked to the office.\", \"vi\": \"Sau chuyến công tác dài ngày, đôi chân tôi cảm thấy nặng nề khi tôi đi bộ đến văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-ljspeech-5328b9e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-cori-5328b9e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leaden-dd0beaa9.webp', '[\"heavy\", \"dull\"]', '[\"light\", \"lively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"leaden sky\", \"meaning\": \"bầu trời u ám\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leaden feet\", \"meaning\": \"đôi chân nặng nề\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lead\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-cori-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru0-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru5-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru6-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru10-5328b9e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru9-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru3-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru7-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru8-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-aru2-5328b9e3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-ljspeech-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt408-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt138-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt624-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt396-5328b9e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt498-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt132-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt288-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt42-5328b9e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leaden-lt90-5328b9e3.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa đen là làm bằng chì, nghĩa bóng là nặng nề, uể oải.', 'daily', 1, 23),
('f58892e6-fc6c-5dc4-bf61-beb389da4b95', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9b475423-8276-5b7c-be0b-f10b32abefd6', '77a1524d-2003-5596-9868-903ed0330c1a', 'buoyant', '/ˈbɔɪənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng nổi lên; hoặc vui vẻ, lạc quan, phấn chấn.', 'capable of remaining afloat, or exhibiting a cheerful, energetic, and positive mental attitude.', 'After receiving the good news, she felt incredibly buoyant and full of energy.', 'Sau khi nhận được tin tốt, cô ấy cảm thấy vô cùng phấn chấn và tràn đầy năng lượng.', '{\"en\": \"Investors remained buoyant after the company announced higher quarterly earnings than expected yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà đầu tư vẫn giữ tâm lý lạc quan sau khi công ty báo cáo doanh thu quý cao hơn dự kiến vào hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-ljspeech-78fbb93d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-cori-78fbb93d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/buoyant-d1189792.webp', '[\"cheerful\", \"optimistic\", \"floating\"]', '[\"depressed\", \"pessimistic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"buoyant mood\", \"meaning\": \"tâm trạng vui vẻ lạc quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"buoyant economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế phát triển khởi sắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"boyish\", \"note_vi\": \"Phát âm gần giống nhưng có nghĩa là trẻ con, như con trai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"buoyancy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"buoyantly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-cori-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru0-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru5-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru6-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru10-78fbb93d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru9-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru3-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru7-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru8-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-aru2-78fbb93d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-ljspeech-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt408-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt138-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt624-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt396-78fbb93d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt498-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt132-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt288-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt42-78fbb93d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buoyant-lt90-78fbb93d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC rất hay dùng với nghĩa thị trường/tâm trạng khởi sắc.', 'business', 1, 24),
('0dea4d43-3a33-52a8-a4b8-b4e7e1e95c1d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9b475423-8276-5b7c-be0b-f10b32abefd6', '77a1524d-2003-5596-9868-903ed0330c1a', 'oblong', '/ˈɒblɒŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một hình chữ nhật có hai cạnh dài hơn hai cạnh kia.', 'a geometric shape that has four straight sides and four right angles, longer than it is wide.', 'The conference table was an elegant oblong shape, seating many people comfortably.', 'Chiếc bàn hội nghị có hình thuôn trang nhã, đủ chỗ cho nhiều người ngồi thoải mái.', '{\"en\": \"The facilities manager ordered a large oblong table to fit all board members in the main meeting room.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cơ sở vật chất đã đặt một chiếc bàn hình chữ nhật dài để đủ chỗ cho tất cả thành viên hội đồng trong phòng họp chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-ljspeech-43389783.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-cori-43389783.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oblong-c5a18f5e.webp', '[\"rectangle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"oblong shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình chữ nhật / hình thon dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oblong table\", \"meaning\": \"bàn hình chữ nhật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"oval\", \"note_vi\": \"oval là hình bầu dục (cong), oblong có góc vuông và cạnh thẳng (hình chữ nhật).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"oblong\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-cori-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru0-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru5-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru6-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru10-43389783.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru9-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru3-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru7-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru8-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-aru2-43389783.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-ljspeech-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt408-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt138-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt624-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt396-43389783.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt498-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt132-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt288-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt42-43389783.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblong-lt90-43389783.mp3\"]}}', 'Oblong vừa là danh từ vừa là tính từ, chỉ hình chữ nhật hoặc hình có dạng thon dài.', 'office', 1, 25),
('8d2a3ce9-c558-5206-956a-1ff97bc82ebf', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9b475423-8276-5b7c-be0b-f10b32abefd6', '77a1524d-2003-5596-9868-903ed0330c1a', 'utter', '/ˈʌtə(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Phát ra tiếng nói, nói ra điều gì đó.', 'To produce vocal sounds or express words using one\'s voice.', 'The shocked witness could barely utter a response when questioned by reporters.', 'Nhân chứng bàng hoàng khó có thể thốt ra câu trả lời khi được các phóng viên phỏng vấn.', '{\"en\": \"The board members did not utter a single objection when the new company policy was proposed.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã không thốt ra một lời phản đối nào khi chính sách mới của công ty được đề xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-ljspeech-25135ef6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-cori-25135ef6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/utter-9ef66ab1.webp', '[\"say\", \"speak\", \"voice\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"utter a word\", \"meaning\": \"nói một lời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"utter a sound\", \"meaning\": \"phát ra âm thanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"utter\", \"note_vi\": \"utter còn là tính từ mang nghĩa \'hoàn toàn\' (ví dụ: utter nonsense). (adjective)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"utterance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"utter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-cori-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru0-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru5-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru6-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru10-25135ef6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru9-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru3-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru7-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru8-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-aru2-25135ef6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-ljspeech-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt408-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt138-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt624-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt396-25135ef6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt498-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt132-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt288-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt42-25135ef6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utter-lt90-25135ef6.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong câu phủ định (không nói một lời nào).', 'office', 1, 26),
('b88aec3f-4ba3-5be5-99da-03f3b4dbef7f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9b475423-8276-5b7c-be0b-f10b32abefd6', '77a1524d-2003-5596-9868-903ed0330c1a', 'siege', '/siːdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cuộc vây hãm quân sự một thành phố hoặc pháo đài.', 'a situation in which an army surrounds a place to force the people inside to surrender.', 'The castle withstood a long siege before the attackers finally gave up.', 'Lâu đài đã chịu đựng một cuộc vây hãm dài trước khi những kẻ tấn công cuối cùng bỏ cuộc.', '{\"en\": \"The company faced a siege of negative press after the unexpected data leak occurred last week.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phải đối mặt với sự bủa vằn bởi báo chí tiêu cực sau khi sự cố rò rỉ dữ liệu bất ngờ xảy ra tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-ljspeech-371c5e97.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-cori-371c5e97.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/siege-19a3c84f.webp', '[\"blockade\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"under siege\", \"meaning\": \"đang bị vây hãm / chịu sức ép lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lay siege to\", \"meaning\": \"bao vây, vây hãm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"seize\", \"note_vi\": \"seize là động từ nắm lấy, bắt giữ, phát âm gần giống siege\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-cori-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru0-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru5-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru6-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru10-371c5e97.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru9-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru3-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru7-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru8-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-aru2-371c5e97.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-ljspeech-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt408-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt138-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt624-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt396-371c5e97.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt498-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt132-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt288-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt42-371c5e97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/siege-lt90-371c5e97.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý quy tắc i đứng trước e (ie), dễ viết nhầm với seize (ei).', 'other', 1, 27),
('1c62f6a8-7254-5044-b468-a5b86af9a7ca', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9b475423-8276-5b7c-be0b-f10b32abefd6', '77a1524d-2003-5596-9868-903ed0330c1a', 'lap up', '/læp ʌp/', 'C1', 'phrasal verb', 'Uống nước hoặc ăn thức ăn bằng cách liếm, thường dùng cho động vật.', 'to drink a liquid using the tongue, usually done by animals.', 'The thirsty puppy quickly began to lap up the water from its bowl.', 'Chú chó con khát nước nhanh chóng bắt đầu liếm hết nước trong bát của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The stray cat in front of the café began to lap up the fresh milk.\", \"vi\": \"Con mèo hoang trước quán cà phê bắt đầu liếm sạch chỗ sữa tươi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-ljspeech-683168b0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-cori-683168b0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lap-up-12acfd00.webp', '[\"lick up\", \"drink\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lap up milk\", \"meaning\": \"liếm sạch sữa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lap up water\", \"meaning\": \"liếm uống nước\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-cori-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru0-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru5-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru6-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru10-683168b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru9-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru3-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru7-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru8-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-aru2-683168b0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-ljspeech-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt408-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt138-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt624-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt396-683168b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt498-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt132-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt288-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt42-683168b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lap-up-lt90-683168b0.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa liếm thức ăn, nghĩa bóng của \'lap up\' là thích thú đón nhận thông tin hoặc sự khen ngợi.', 'daily', 1, 28),
('1e89118b-f091-583d-b2b1-4444f9a83b1f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9b475423-8276-5b7c-be0b-f10b32abefd6', '77a1524d-2003-5596-9868-903ed0330c1a', 'buxom', '/ˈbʌksəm/', 'C2', 'adjective', '(Phụ nữ) đầy đặn, có thân hình hấp dẫn.', 'having a full, rounded, and attractive physical shape, usually referring to a woman.', 'She was often cast in roles that highlighted her buxom figure.', 'Cô ấy thường được giao những vai diễn làm nổi bật thân hình đẫy đà của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The costume designer selected a dress that complemented her buxom figure for the formal business gala.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế trang phục đã chọn một chiếc váy tôn lên vóc dáng đầy đặn của cô ấy cho buổi dạ tiệc kinh doanh trang trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-ljspeech-14ee4306.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-cori-14ee4306.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/buxom-e8e7074c.webp', '[\"curvy\", \"plump\"]', '[\"thin\", \"slender\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"buxom figure\", \"meaning\": \"vóc dáng đầy đặn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"buxom woman\", \"meaning\": \"người phụ nữ có thân hình đầy đặn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-cori-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru0-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru5-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru6-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru10-14ee4306.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru9-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru3-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru7-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru8-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-aru2-14ee4306.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-ljspeech-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt408-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt138-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt624-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt396-14ee4306.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt498-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt132-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt288-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt42-14ee4306.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buxom-lt90-14ee4306.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang tính mô tả ngoại hình, cần dùng cẩn thận.', 'other', 1, 29),
('e03e4999-9db1-5fa9-8cbe-166a64446e87', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'transcend', '/trænˈsend/', 'C2', 'verb', 'vượt lên, vượt qua giới hạn.', 'to go beyond the normal limits or boundaries of something in a positive way.', 'Her art manages to transcend cultural barriers and appeal to everyone.', 'Nghệ thuật của cô ấy đã vượt qua được rào cản văn hóa và thu hút mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s innovative software aims to transcend traditional methods of managing global supply chains.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm sáng tạo của công ty nhằm mục đích vượt qua các phương pháp quản lý chuỗi cung ứng toàn cầu truyền thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-ljspeech-6a61fd50.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-cori-6a61fd50.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/transcend-dd255081.webp', '[\"surpass\", \"exceed\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"transcend boundaries\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua ranh giới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"transcend expectations\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua mong đợi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"transcendence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"transcendent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-cori-6a61fd50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-aru0-6a61fd50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-aru5-6a61fd50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-aru6-6a61fd50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-aru10-6a61fd50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-aru9-6a61fd50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-aru3-6a61fd50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-aru7-6a61fd50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transcend-aru8-6a61