('308121c2-3067-5021-bdf8-1352369aa947', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'sleek', '/sliːk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'mượt mà, bóng bẩy, thường mang vẻ hiện đại hoặc sang trọng.', 'having a smooth, shiny, and attractive appearance that often suggests high quality or modern style.', 'The new sports car had a sleek design and shiny black paint.', 'Chiếc xe thể thao mới có thiết kế mượt mà và lớp sơn đen bóng loáng.', '{\"en\": \"The company launched a sleek new laptop model designed for business professionals who travel frequently.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã ra mắt mẫu máy tính xách tay mới bóng bẩy được thiết kế cho các chuyên gia kinh doanh hay đi lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-ljspeech-a4ca4935.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-cori-a4ca4935.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sleek-1b8856c8.webp', '[\"smooth\", \"stylish\"]', '[\"dull\", \"rough\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sleek design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế mượt mà/bóng bẩy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sleek appearance\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài sang trọng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-cori-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru0-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru5-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru6-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru10-a4ca4935.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru9-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru3-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru7-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru8-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-aru2-a4ca4935.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-ljspeech-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt408-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt138-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt624-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt396-a4ca4935.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt498-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt132-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt288-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt42-a4ca4935.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleek-lt90-a4ca4935.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen ngợi vẻ ngoài hiện đại của sản phẩm công nghệ hoặc xe hơi.', 'technology', 1, 2),
('c28efb10-f0b6-5130-a7d2-35deab784786', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'doddering', '/ˈdɒdərɪŋ/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Già yếu, đi đứng lảo đảo.', 'moving slowly and weakly, especially because of being old.', 'The old man was doddering slowly across the street with his cane.', 'Ông lão đang đi lảo đảo chậm rãi qua đường với cây gậy của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel porter helped the doddering guest carry his heavy luggage to the elevator.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên khuân vác của khách sạn đã giúp vị khách già yếu mang hành lý nặng đến thang máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-ljspeech-f59d44a3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-cori-f59d44a3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/doddering-bdf5ecbb.webp', '[\"feeble\", \"shaky\", \"tottering\"]', '[\"vigorous\", \"strong\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"doddering old man\", \"meaning\": \"ông lão già yếu lảo đảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"doddering steps\", \"meaning\": \"những bước đi lảo đảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dreadful\", \"note_vi\": \"dreadful nghĩa là khủng khiếp, không liên quan đến doddering (già yếu).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dodder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-cori-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru0-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru5-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru6-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru10-f59d44a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru9-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru3-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru7-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru8-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-aru2-f59d44a3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-ljspeech-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt408-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt138-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt624-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt396-f59d44a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt498-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt132-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt288-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt42-f59d44a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doddering-lt90-f59d44a3.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái miêu tả sự run rẩy, lảo đảo do tuổi già.', 'travel', 1, 3)
