('cbf02bca-9148-569d-9425-93f5b38f93ca', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'idiot-proof', '/ˈɪd.i.ət.pruːf/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất dễ sử dụng, không thể làm sai.', 'extremely easy to use or understand so that anyone can operate it without making mistakes.', 'The new software is designed to be idiot-proof, even for beginners.', 'Phần mềm mới được thiết kế để cực kỳ dễ sử dụng, ngay cả với người mới bắt đầu.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department created an idiot-proof guide to help all employees install the software update.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận IT đã tạo ra một hướng dẫn vô cùng đơn giản để giúp tất cả nhân viên cài đặt bản cập nhật phần mềm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-ljspeech-42b45c52.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-cori-42b45c52.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/idiot-proof-2441dc02.webp', '[\"foolproof\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"idiot-proof system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống cực kỳ dễ sử dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make something idiot-proof\", \"meaning\": \"làm cho cái gì đó dễ dùng tuyệt đối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"waterproof\", \"note_vi\": \"waterproof là chống nước, đuôi -proof chỉ khả năng ngăn ngừa/bảo vệ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-cori-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru0-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru5-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru6-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru10-42b45c52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru9-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru3-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru7-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru8-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-aru2-42b45c52.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-ljspeech-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt408-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt138-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt624-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt396-42b45c52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt498-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt132-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt288-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt42-42b45c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idiot-proof-lt90-42b45c52.mp3\"]}}', 'Hậu tố -proof mang nghĩa chống/phòng ngừa lỗi (tương tự foolproof).', 'technology', 1, 4),
('189596c7-2c27-5124-baf4-14a16ddfe381', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'gargantuan', '/ɡɑːˈɡæntʃuən/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Cực kỳ to lớn, vĩ đại.', 'extremely large in size, amount, or degree, far bigger than usual.', 'The company faced a gargantuan task of rebuilding its reputation after the scandal.', 'Công ty đối mặt với nhiệm vụ cực kỳ to lớn là xây dựng lại danh tiếng sau vụ bê bối.', '{\"en\": \"The company invested a gargantuan budget into developing its next generation electric vehicle.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đầu tư một khoản ngân sách khổng lồ để phát triển thế hệ xe điện tiếp theo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-ljspeech-467bac1a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-cori-467bac1a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gargantuan-422aa11c.webp', '[\"gigantic\", \"huge\", \"enormous\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"miniature\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gargantuan task\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ vô cùng to lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gargantuan effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực phi thường\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-cori-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru0-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru5-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru6-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru10-467bac1a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru9-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru3-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru7-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru8-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-aru2-467bac1a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-ljspeech-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt408-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt138-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt624-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt396-467bac1a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt498-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt132-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt288-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt42-467bac1a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gargantuan-lt90-467bac1a.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh quy mô cực kỳ lớn, tương tự gigantic nhưng trang trọng hơn.', 'business', 1, 5),
('704c4483-9149-5c18-96f9-80d032c58dec', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'crossover', '/ˈkrɒsəʊvə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự kết hợp hoặc giao thoa giữa hai hoặc nhiều phong cách, thể loại.', 'a mixture or combination of two different things, often used in music or art.', 'Her new album is a fascinating crossover between pop and traditional folk music.', 'Album mới của cô ấy là một sự giao thoa hấp dẫn giữa nhạc pop và nhạc dân gian truyền thống.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team created a successful crossover between luxury branding and affordable retail strategies.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã tạo ra sự kết hợp thành công giữa xây dựng thương hiệu cao cấp và chiến lược bán lẻ giá rẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-ljspeech-081e51d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-cori-081e51d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crossover-bd1aafb4.webp', '[\"hybrid\", \"blend\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"market crossover\", \"meaning\": \"sự giao thoa thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"successful crossover\", \"meaning\": \"sự kết hợp thành công\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-cori-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru0-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru5-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru6-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru10-081e51d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru9-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru3-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru7-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru8-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-aru2-081e51d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-ljspeech-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt408-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt138-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt624-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt396-081e51d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt498-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt132-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt288-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt42-081e51d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crossover-lt90-081e51d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ sự hòa trộn các yếu tố khác biệt để thu hút đối tượng mới.', 'marketing', 1, 6),
('aadab898-b6ba-5324-b60c-72fde121d040', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'imposing', '/ɪmˈpəʊzɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Ấn tượng và hùng vĩ về kích thước, vẻ ngoài hoặc quyền lực.', 'appearing large, important, and impressive, often making people feel respect or a bit of fear.', 'The old castle stood on the hill, an imposing structure that dominated the landscape.', 'Lâu đài cổ đứng trên đồi, một kiến trúc uy nghi thống trị phong cảnh.', '{\"en\": \"The company headquarters is an imposing building that reflects the firm\'s long history and great success.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở công ty là một tòa nhà hùng vĩ phản ánh lịch sử lâu đời và thành công lớn của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-ljspeech-735ea0a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-cori-735ea0a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/imposing-0f715ccf.webp', '[\"impressive\", \"grand\", \"majestic\"]', '[\"insignificant\", \"unimpressive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"imposing figure\", \"meaning\": \"dáng vẻ oai vệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"imposing structure\", \"meaning\": \"công trình hùng vĩ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"impose\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-cori-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru0-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru5-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru6-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru10-735ea0a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru9-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru3-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru7-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru8-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-aru2-735ea0a2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-ljspeech-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt408-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt138-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt624-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt396-735ea0a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt498-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt132-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt288-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt42-735ea0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imposing-lt90-735ea0a2.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để tả cái gì đó to lớn, hoành tráng gây ấn tượng mạnh.', 'business', 1, 7),
('17f5b7d1-12ea-5a10-bda0-331fba75d8be', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'mesosphere', '/ðə ˈmezəsfɪə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tầng khí quyển nằm trên tầng bình lưu và dưới tầng nhiệt.', 'the layer of the earth\'s atmosphere that is directly above the stratosphere.', 'Most meteors burn up in the mesosphere as they enter Earth\'s atmosphere.', 'Hầu hết các thiên thạch bốc cháy trong tầng trung lưu khi chúng đi vào bầu khí quyển của Trái Đất.', '{\"en\": \"The aerospace company launched a research balloon to collect data from the mesosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty hàng không vũ trụ đã phóng một khinh khí cầu nghiên cứu để thu thập dữ liệu từ tầng trung lưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-ljspeech-edeb2116.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-cori-edeb2116.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mesosphere-fa924fb5.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"upper mesosphere\", \"meaning\": \"phần trên của tầng trung lưu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mesosphere layer\", \"meaning\": \"tầng trung lưu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stratosphere\", \"note_vi\": \"tầng bình lưu, nằm ngay dưới tầng trung lưu (mesosphere)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mesospheric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-cori-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru0-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru5-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru6-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru10-edeb2116.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru9-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru3-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru7-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru8-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-aru2-edeb2116.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-ljspeech-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt408-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt138-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt624-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt396-edeb2116.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt498-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt132-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt288-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt42-edeb2116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mesosphere-lt90-edeb2116.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'meso-\' nghĩa là ở giữa, mesosphere là tầng khí quyển ở giữa.', 'nature', 1, 8),
('0bf6be88-f714-5662-b99a-de70aba70cc8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'application programming interface', '/ˌæplɪˈkeɪʃn̩ ˈprəʊɡræmɪŋ ˈɪntəfeɪs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Giao diện lập trình ứng dụng, bộ quy tắc cho phép các phần mềm tương tác với nhau.', 'A software intermediary enabling distinct applications to interact and exchange data seamlessly.', 'Developers use an application programming interface to connect different software components and services.', 'Các nhà phát triển sử dụng giao diện lập trình ứng dụng để kết nối các thành phần và dịch vụ phần mềm khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"Our IT department is integrating a new application programming interface to improve data synchronization.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng CNTT của chúng tôi đang tích hợp một giao diện lập trình ứng dụng mới để cải thiện đồng bộ hóa dữ liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-ljspeech-b5e1504b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-cori-b5e1504b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/application-programming-interface-6e5dc942.webp', '[\"interface\", \"protocol\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"API integration\", \"meaning\": \"tích hợp giao diện lập trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use an API\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng giao diện lập trình\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-cori-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru0-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru5-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru6-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru10-b5e1504b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru9-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru3-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru7-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru8-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-aru2-b5e1504b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-ljspeech-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt408-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt138-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt624-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt396-b5e1504b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt498-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt132-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt288-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt42-b5e1504b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/application-programming-interface-lt90-b5e1504b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được gọi tắt là API trong công việc.', 'technology', 1, 9),
('05fdc2c5-1dfa-56dd-a6a7-1ddb62d355a0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'reason with', '/ˈriːzən wɪð/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Thuyết phục ai đó bằng cách đưa ra lý lẽ hợp lý.', 'to try to persuade someone to act in a sensible way by arguing logically.', 'It was difficult to reason with him once he had made up his mind.', 'Rất khó để lý lẽ với anh ấy một khi anh ấy đã quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service representative tried to reason with the angry client about the refund policy.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên dịch vụ khách hàng đã cố gắng giải thích hợp lý với vị khách đang tức giận về chính sách hoàn tiền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-ljspeech-bdf5c2ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-cori-bdf5c2ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reason-with-6fb3181b.webp', '[\"persuade\", \"convince\"]', '[\"argue\", \"fight\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reason with someone\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục ai đó\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reason\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reasonable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-cori-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru0-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru5-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru6-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru10-bdf5c2ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru9-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru3-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru7-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru8-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-aru2-bdf5c2ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-ljspeech-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt408-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt138-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt624-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt396-bdf5c2ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt498-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt132-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt288-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt42-bdf5c2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reason-with-lt90-bdf5c2ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi bạn muốn dùng lý lẽ để làm ai đó bớt nóng giận hoặc đổi ý.', 'office', 1, 10),
('f58f80c2-b8ca-5a8b-a491-70e3ca1fec13', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'tuck in', '/tʌk ɪn/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Đắp chăn kỹ cho ai đó; ăn uống ngon lành.', 'to fold blankets around someone in bed; or to eat food with great enjoyment.', 'She gently tucked her children in before reading them a bedtime story.', 'Cô ấy nhẹ nhàng đắp chăn cho các con trước khi đọc truyện cổ tích cho chúng nghe.', '{\"en\": \"After the long business trip, he was happy to tuck in to a warm meal at the hotel.\", \"vi\": \"Sau chuyến công tác dài, anh ấy vui mừng được ăn ngon lành một bữa ấm tại khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-ljspeech-c2af05d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-cori-c2af05d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tuck-in-89a8b75b.webp', '[\"dig in\", \"settle in\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tuck in for the night\", \"meaning\": \"đắp chăn đi ngủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tuck in to a meal\", \"meaning\": \"ăn uống ngon lành, hào hứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tuck someone in\", \"meaning\": \"đắp chăn kỹ cho ai đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tuck away\", \"note_vi\": \"tuck away là cất giấu hoặc ăn nhiều một cách bí mật, khác với tuck in\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-cori-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru0-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru5-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru6-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru10-c2af05d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru9-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru3-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru7-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru8-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-aru2-c2af05d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-ljspeech-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt408-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt138-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt624-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt396-c2af05d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt498-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt132-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt288-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt42-c2af05d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tuck-in-lt90-c2af05d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Tuck in có hai nghĩa khác nhau: đắp chăn cho ai và ăn ngon lành — cần xem ngữ cảnh để hiểu đúng.', 'dining', 1, 11),
('a328e887-6b74-5ef2-95b2-d7a300c4d582', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'buttery', '/ˈbʌtəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có hương vị hoặc kết cấu như bơ, thường là mềm và mịn.', 'having a taste or soft smooth feeling similar to a common yellow fat made from milk.', 'The chef described the steak as incredibly tender and buttery, melting in your mouth.', 'Đầu bếp mô tả miếng bít tết mềm và béo ngậy đến khó tin, tan chảy trong miệng.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant was famous for serving buttery pastries to corporate clients during morning meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng nổi tiếng với việc phục vụ bánh quy bơ mềm mịn cho khách hàng doanh nghiệp trong các cuộc họp buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-ljspeech-21810a65.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-cori-21810a65.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/buttery-053c3735.webp', '[\"smooth\", \"creamy\", \"soft\"]', '[\"tough\", \"rough\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"buttery flavor\", \"meaning\": \"hương vị bơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"buttery texture\", \"meaning\": \"kết cấu mềm mịn như bơ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bitter\", \"note_vi\": \"bitter có nghĩa là đắng, khác với buttery có vị bơ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"butter\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"butter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-cori-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru0-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru5-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru6-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru10-21810a65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru9-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru3-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru7-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru8-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-aru2-21810a65.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-ljspeech-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt408-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt138-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt624-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt396-21810a65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt498-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt132-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt288-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt42-21810a65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buttery-lt90-21810a65.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng mô tả thức ăn mềm mịn hoặc có mùi vị bơ béo.', 'dining', 1, 12),
('f3a11dfc-61c3-5c1f-b459-2ac823da4b6d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', '9d7be848-d90f-5103-8db6-95a848642feb', '1ee5bab3-5bf7-52d2-9b24-aa004b666f7f', 'mitigation', '/ˌmɪtɪˈɡeɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự làm giảm nhẹ, làm dịu bớt (tác động xấu).', 'the act of making something less severe, harmful, or painful through specific actions or policies.', 'The city implemented various measures for climate change mitigation.', 'Thành phố đã thực hiện nhiều biện pháp khác nhau để giảm thiểu biến đổi khí hậu.', '{\"en\": \"The company introduced new safety protocols as a mitigation strategy against potential workplace accidents.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã giới thiệu các quy trình an toàn mới như một chiến lược giảm thiểu rủi ro tai nạn lao động.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-ljspeech-d13b43f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-cori-d13b43f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mitigation-4ffb03e6.webp', '[\"reduction\", \"alleviation\"]', '[\"aggravation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"risk mitigation\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mitigation measures\", \"meaning\": \"các biện pháp giảm nhẹ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mitigate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-cori-d13b43f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-aru0-d13b43f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-aru5-d13b43f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-aru6-d13b43f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-aru10-d13b43f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-aru9-d13b43f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-aru3-d13b43f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-aru7-d13b43f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitigation-aru8-