('01eb474c-38d3-58ed-8c08-b8b3663da01e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'a7beee3b-41b5-5df4-a380-81b68ba0efcd', '4415c4d8-2140-5880-9081-88a5bb034fab', 'pint', '/paɪnt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Đơn vị đo lường chất lỏng hoặc hạt khô, khoảng 0.57 lít ở Anh hoặc 0.47 lít ở Mỹ.', 'a unit for measuring liquid equal to about half a liter in many countries.', 'He ordered a pint of beer at the pub after work.', 'Anh ấy gọi một panh bia ở quán rượu sau giờ làm.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant serves a pint of fresh juice with every breakfast set ordered by guests.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng phục vụ một panh nước ép tươi với mỗi suất ăn sáng mà khách đặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-ljspeech-b767ebbe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-cori-b767ebbe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pint-43f25424.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a pint of beer\", \"meaning\": \"một panh bia\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-cori-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru0-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru5-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru6-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru10-b767ebbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru9-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru3-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru7-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru8-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-aru2-b767ebbe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-ljspeech-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt408-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt138-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt624-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt396-b767ebbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt498-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt132-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt288-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt42-b767ebbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pint-lt90-b767ebbe.mp3\"]}}', 'Đơn vị đo lường phổ biến ở Anh và Mỹ, không dùng hệ mét.', 'dining', 1, 11),
('db783277-af61-59e6-8ba2-bd24d7468eb7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'a7beee3b-41b5-5df4-a380-81b68ba0efcd', '4415c4d8-2140-5880-9081-88a5bb034fab', 'distend', '/dɪˈstend/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Làm phồng lên hoặc sưng to ra.', 'to swell or expand outward because of pressure from inside something.', 'The patient\'s abdomen began to distend due to the internal swelling.', 'Bụng bệnh nhân bắt đầu phình to do sưng bên trong.', '{\"en\": \"The technician warned that the old gas pipe might distend under high pressure.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên cảnh báo rằng đường ống khí cũ có thể bị phồng lên dưới áp suất cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-ljspeech-684c52b4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-cori-684c52b4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/distend-75e99353.webp', '[\"swell\", \"expand\", \"bloat\"]', '[\"shrink\", \"contract\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"distend the stomach\", \"meaning\": \"làm đầy hơi hoặc trướng bụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"distend with gas\", \"meaning\": \"phồng lên do chứa khí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"extend\", \"note_vi\": \"Extend là kéo dài ra, còn distend là phồng hoặc sưng to ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"distension\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-cori-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru0-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru5-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru6-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru10-684c52b4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru9-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru3-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru7-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru8-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-aru2-684c52b4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-ljspeech-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt408-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt138-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt624-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt396-684c52b4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt498-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt132-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt288-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt42-684c52b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distend-lt90-684c52b4.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt distend (phồng/sưng to từ bên trong) và extend (kéo dài ra).', 'health', 1, 12),
('1374fb75-b611-5a6a-b003-1ab051fad116', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'a7beee3b-41b5-5df4-a380-81b68ba0efcd', '4415c4d8-2140-5880-9081-88a5bb034fab', 'be on cloud nine', '/biː ɒn klaʊd naɪn/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Cực kỳ hạnh phúc, vui sướng tột độ.', 'to feel extremely happy and excited because something very good has happened to you recently.', 'After she got the job offer, she was on cloud nine for the rest of the day.', 'Sau khi nhận được lời mời làm việc, cô ấy đã vui sướng tột độ suốt cả ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing manager was on cloud nine after the new campaign exceeded all our sales targets.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng tiếp thị vô cùng hạnh phúc sau khi chiến dịch mới vượt mọi mục tiêu doanh số.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-ljspeech-882aa68d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-cori-882aa68d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/be-on-cloud-nine-d5e098d3.webp', '[\"over the moon\", \"thrilled\"]', '[\"depressed\", \"sad\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be on cloud nine\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ hạnh phúc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-cori-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru0-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru5-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru6-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru10-882aa68d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru9-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru3-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru7-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru8-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-aru2-882aa68d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-ljspeech-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt408-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt138-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt624-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt396-882aa68d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt498-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt132-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt288-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt42-882aa68d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-on-cloud-nine-lt90-882aa68d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ chỉ trạng thái cực kỳ vui sướng, giống như đang ở trên chín tầng mây.', 'daily', 1, 13),
('6a67c392-75b5-5708-a109-9a218a9cfbc8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'a7beee3b-41b5-5df4-a380-81b68ba0efcd', '4415c4d8-2140-5880-9081-88a5bb034fab', 'lackadaisical', '/ˌlækəˈdeɪzɪkl/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Hời hợt, thiếu nhiệt tình hoặc uể oải.', 'showing a clear lack of enthusiasm, effort, or interest in doing something.', 'His lackadaisical attitude towards his studies resulted in poor grades.', 'Thái độ hời hợt của anh ấy đối với việc học đã dẫn đến kết quả kém.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor criticized his lackadaisical performance during the recent product development campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã chỉ trích biểu hiện uể oải của anh ấy trong chiến dịch phát triển sản phẩm gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-ljspeech-2d8ef190.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-cori-2d8ef190.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lackadaisical-1e35890c.webp', '[\"lethargic\", \"apathetic\", \"careless\"]', '[\"enthusiastic\", \"energetic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lackadaisical attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ hời hợt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lackadaisical approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận thiếu nhiệt tình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"lackadaisically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-cori-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru0-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru5-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru6-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru10-2d8ef190.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru9-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru3-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru7-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru8-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-aru2-2d8ef190.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-ljspeech-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt408-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt138-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt624-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt396-2d8ef190.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt498-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt132-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt288-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt42-2d8ef190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lackadaisical-lt90-2d8ef190.mp3\"]}}', 'Diễn tả thái độ làm việc qua loa, uể oải, hay đi cùng với attitude hoặc approach.', 'hr', 1, 14),
('a79fa25a-d510-5591-bd18-1a1f21535d38', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'a7beee3b-41b5-5df4-a380-81b68ba0efcd', '4415c4d8-2140-5880-9081-88a5bb034fab', 'benevolent', '/bəˈnevələnt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rộng lượng, nhân ái, có lòng tốt.', 'being kind, helpful, and generous to other people in need.', 'The benevolent old man always donated a portion of his income to charity.', 'Ông lão nhân từ đó luôn quyên góp một phần thu nhập của mình cho từ thiện.', '{\"en\": \"The benevolent CEO decided to give all employees an extra bonus for the holidays.\", \"vi\": \"Vị giám đốc điều hành nhân ái đã quyết định thưởng thêm cho tất cả nhân viên dịp lễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-ljspeech-94fab583.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-cori-94fab583.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/benevolent-8cf6a2cb.webp', '[\"kind\", \"generous\", \"charitable\"]', '[\"cruel\", \"malevolent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"benevolent fund\", \"meaning\": \"quỹ từ thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"benevolent organization\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức từ thiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"malevolent\", \"note_vi\": \"malevolent mang nghĩa ác ý, là từ trái nghĩa hoàn toàn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"benevolence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"benevolently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-cori-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru0-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru5-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru6-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru10-94fab583.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru9-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru3-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru7-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru8-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-aru2-94fab583.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-ljspeech-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt408-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt138-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt624-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt396-94fab583.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt498-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt132-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt288-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt42-94fab583.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/benevolent-lt90-94fab583.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'bene-\' nghĩa là tốt (good). Trái nghĩa là \'malevolent\'.', 'hr', 1, 15),
('37f32f81-445a-58be-b169-5877c4b7289b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'a7beee3b-41b5-5df4-a380-81b68ba0efcd', '4415c4d8-2140-5880-9081-88a5bb034fab', 'disrepair', 'UK: /ˌdɪsrɪˈpɛə/ | US: /ˌdɪsrɪˈpɛr/', 'C1', 'noun', 'tình trạng hư hỏng, xuống cấp', 'a poor condition resulting from neglect and lack of maintenance or repairs.', 'The old building had fallen into a state of severe disrepair.', 'Tòa nhà cũ đã rơi vào tình trạng hư hỏng nặng.', '{\"en\": \"The old storage facility had fallen into disrepair after remaining vacant for five years.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ sở kho bãi cũ đã rơi vào tình trạng xuống cấp sau khi bị bỏ trống suốt 5 năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-ljspeech-14080205.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-cori-14080205.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disrepair-0743a2da.webp', '[\"dilapidation\", \"decay\", \"neglect\", \"ruin\"]', '[\"good condition\", \"maintenance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fall into disrepair\", \"meaning\": \"rơi vào tình trạng xuống cấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in a state of disrepair\", \"meaning\": \"trong tình trạng hư hỏng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"repair\", \"note_vi\": \"sự sửa chữa (hành động tích cực), trong khi disrepair là trạng thái hỏng hóc/bỏ mặc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"repair\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-cori-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru0-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru5-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru6-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru10-14080205.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru9-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru3-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru7-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru8-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-aru2-14080205.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-ljspeech-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt408-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt138-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt624-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt396-14080205.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt498-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt132-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt288-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt42-14080205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disrepair-lt90-14080205.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với cấu trúc \'fall into disrepair\' (rơi vào tình trạng hư hỏng/xuống cấp) hoặc \'in a state of disrepair\'.', 'facility management', 1, 16),
('0027186b-65e0-5209-a6b2-94c19dfbe5db', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'a7beee3b-41b5-5df4-a380-81b68ba0efcd', '4415c4d8-2140-5880-9081-88a5bb034fab', 'despondent', '/dɪˈspɒndənt/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Rất buồn bã, mất hết hy vọng.', 'feeling very sad and without any hope that a situation will improve in the future.', 'After failing the final exam, she felt completely despondent about her future.', 'Sau khi trượt kỳ thi cuối kỳ, cô ấy cảm thấy hoàn toàn chán nản về tương lai của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager felt despondent after the quarterly sales report showed a significant decline in revenue.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy chán nản sau khi báo cáo doanh số quý cho thấy doanh thu giảm đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-ljspeech-3e604855.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-cori-3e604855.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/despondent-df1aa029.webp', '[\"hopeless\", \"dejected\"]', '[\"hopeful\", \"cheerful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel despondent\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy chán nản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply despondent\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng tuyệt vọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"despondency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-cori-3e604855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-aru0-3e604855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-aru5-3e604855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-aru6-3e604855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-aru10-3e604855.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-aru9-3e604855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-aru3-3e604855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-aru7-3e604855.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despondent-aru8-3e604855.mp3\", \"/sto