('9571ad0d-14c4-52ed-abd8-e32ef2357078', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'abe90d83-13d9-5576-a094-578231fa232b', 'ed95f82e-e8e5-5dfb-bd19-99c9556fe96b', 'elation', '/ɪˈleɪʃn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác vui sướng, phấn khởi tột độ.', 'a feeling of great happiness and excitement because of a success or a good event.', 'Her elation was obvious when she received the news of her promotion.', 'Niềm hân hoan của cô ấy là rõ ràng khi cô ấy nhận được tin thăng chức.', '{\"en\": \"The team shared a sense of elation after winning the contract from a major client.\", \"vi\": \"Cả nhóm chia sẻ cảm giác phấn khởi sau khi giành được hợp đồng từ một khách hàng lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-ljspeech-3e8be67a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-cori-3e8be67a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elation-b60ce9e6.webp', '[\"joy\", \"delight\"]', '[\"depression\", \"misery\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sense of elation\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác phấn khởi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"great elation\", \"meaning\": \"sự phấn khởi tột độ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"elated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-cori-3e8be67a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru0-3e8be67a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru5-3e8be67a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru6-3e8be67a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru10-3e8be67a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru9-3e8be67a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru3-3e8be67a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru7-3e8be67a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru8-3e8be67a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elation-aru2-3e8be67a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v