('c20570b2-7c44-54f3-94a8-e240240c2870', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'abe90d83-13d9-5576-a094-578231fa232b', 'ed95f82e-e8e5-5dfb-bd19-99c9556fe96b', 'dwindle', '/ˈdwɪndl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Trở nên nhỏ hơn hoặc ít hơn dần dần, suy giảm.', 'to become gradually smaller in size or amount over time.', 'The company\'s profits began to dwindle after the new competitor entered the market.', 'Lợi nhuận của công ty bắt đầu suy giảm sau khi đối thủ cạnh tranh mới gia nhập thị trường.', '{\"en\": \"Our customer base started to dwindle due to poor after-sales service quality.\", \"vi\": \"Lượng khách hàng của chúng tôi bắt đầu sụt giảm do chất lượng dịch vụ hậu mãi kém.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-ljspeech-cb779ee6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-cori-cb779ee6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dwindle-83c27c6a.webp', '[\"decrease\", \"diminish\", \"shrink\"]', '[\"increase\", \"grow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dwindle away\", \"meaning\": \"dần dần biến mất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dwindle to\", \"meaning\": \"suy giảm còn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dangle\", \"note_vi\": \"dangle nghĩa là đung đưa, không phải suy giảm\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-cori-cb779ee6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru0-cb779ee6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru5-cb779ee6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru6-cb779ee6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru10-cb779ee6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru9-cb779ee6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru3-cb779ee6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru7-cb779ee6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru8-cb779ee6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwindle-aru