('211ed904-d998-57e2-9029-4e52d608fa95', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'abe90d83-13d9-5576-a094-578231fa232b', 'ed95f82e-e8e5-5dfb-bd19-99c9556fe96b', 'augmentation', '/ˌɔːɡmenˈteɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc kết quả của việc tăng thêm.', 'the act of increasing the size, value, or amount of something.', 'The company announced an augmentation of its workforce to meet growing demand.', 'Công ty đã công bố việc tăng cường lực lượng lao động để đáp ứng nhu cầu ngày càng tăng.', '{\"en\": \"The department requested an augmentation of the budget to hire three new software developers.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận đã yêu cầu tăng thêm ngân sách để thuê ba nhà phát triển phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-ljspeech-14672c92.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-cori-14672c92.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/augmentation-b8fa4118.webp', '[\"increase\", \"addition\", \"enhancement\"]', '[\"reduction\", \"decrease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"budget augmentation\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng thêm ngân sách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"staff augmentation\", \"meaning\": \"sự bổ sung nhân sự\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"argument\", \"note_vi\": \"argument là sự tranh cãi, augmentation là sự tăng thêm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"augment\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"augmented\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-cori-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru0-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru5-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru6-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru10-14672c92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru9-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru3-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru7-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru8-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-aru2-14672c92.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-ljspeech-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt408-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt138-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt624-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt396-14672c92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt498-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt132-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt288-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt42-14672c92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/augmentation-lt90-14672c92.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \'argument\' (sự tranh luận, lập luận).', 'business', 1, 19),
('a161e42c-2e6c-5c10-91f5-c81f59d2aa09', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'abe90d83-13d9-5576-a094-578231fa232b', 'ed95f82e-e8e5-5dfb-bd19-99c9556fe96b', 'junk mail', '/dʒʌŋk meɪl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thư quảng cáo không mong muốn hoặc không cần thiết.', 'advertising letters, booklets, or emails that are sent to people who have not asked for them.', 'Our office email server filters out unwanted junk mail automatically every day.', 'Máy chủ email văn phòng của chúng tôi tự động lọc bỏ thư rác không mong muốn mỗi ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The office assistant filters out all junk mail so the manager only receives important business letters.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý văn phòng lọc bỏ tất cả thư rác để người quản lý chỉ nhận được những thư kinh doanh quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-ljspeech-f616f3bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-cori-f616f3bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/junk-mail-dce7d2b6.webp', '[\"spam\", \"direct mail\", \"unsolicited mail\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pile of junk mail\", \"meaning\": \"đống thư rác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"filter out junk mail\", \"meaning\": \"lọc bỏ thư rác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spam\", \"note_vi\": \"spam thường dùng cho thư điện tử; junk mail dùng cho cả thư giấy quảng cáo.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-cori-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru0-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru5-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru6-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru10-f616f3bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru9-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru3-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru7-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru8-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-aru2-f616f3bc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-ljspeech-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt408-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt138-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt624-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt396-f616f3bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt498-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt132-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt288-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt42-f616f3bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/junk-mail-lt90-f616f3bc.mp3\"]}}', '\'Junk\' nghĩa là rác, phế liệu; \'junk mail\' là thư rác.', 'office', 1, 20),
('4478c10a-3132-5054-8a21-80dfa7e19209', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'abe90d83-13d9-5576-a094-578231fa232b', 'ed95f82e-e8e5-5dfb-bd19-99c9556fe96b', 'ecstatic', '/ɪkˈstætɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Cực kỳ vui sướng, hân hoan.', 'feeling extremely happy and full of joy about something.', 'Fans were ecstatic when their team won the championship in the final seconds.', 'Người hâm mộ vỡ òa trong sung sướng khi đội của họ giành chức vô địch ở những giây cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team was ecstatic after closing the biggest deal of the year.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bán hàng vô cùng hân hoan sau khi chốt được hợp đồng lớn nhất năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-ljspeech-39198ca9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-cori-39198ca9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ecstatic-e08db09b.webp', '[\"elated\", \"overjoyed\", \"thrilled\"]', '[\"miserable\", \"devastated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ecstatic about\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ vui sướng về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ecstatic reaction\", \"meaning\": \"phản ứng hân hoan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ecstatic crowd\", \"meaning\": \"đám đông phấn khích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"enthusiastic\", \"note_vi\": \"enthusiastic nghĩa là nhiệt tình, không mạnh bằng ecstatic\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ecstasy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ecstatically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-cori-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru0-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru5-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru6-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru10-39198ca9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru9-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru3-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru7-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru8-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-aru2-39198ca9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-ljspeech-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt408-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt138-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt624-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt396-39198ca9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt498-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt132-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt288-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt42-39198ca9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecstatic-lt90-39198ca9.mp3\"]}}', 'Ecstatic mạnh hơn happy hay excited rất nhiều, dùng khi vui đến mức như \"bay lên mây\".', 'office', 1, 21),
('3ccdf71f-8796-5123-abba-444ea0c5b54f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'abe90d83-13d9-5576-a094-578231fa232b', 'ed95f82e-e8e5-5dfb-bd19-99c9556fe96b', 'blistering', '/ˈblɪstərɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất nhanh, mạnh mẽ hoặc cực kỳ nóng.', 'extremely fast, strong, or hot, often used to describe speed or weather conditions in reports.', 'The runner finished the marathon at a blistering pace, breaking the previous record.', 'Vận động viên đã hoàn thành cuộc đua marathon với tốc độ cực nhanh, phá vỡ kỷ lục trước đó.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics team managed to deliver the urgent shipment at a blistering speed to the client.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ hậu cần đã xoay xở để giao lô hàng khẩn cấp cho khách hàng với tốc độ cực nhanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-ljspeech-47ab3962.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-cori-47ab3962.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blistering-ca90093e.webp', '[\"rapid\", \"intense\"]', '[\"slow\", \"mild\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"blistering pace\", \"meaning\": \"tốc độ cực nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blistering heat\", \"meaning\": \"cái nóng như thiêu đốt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-cori-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru0-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru5-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru6-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru10-47ab3962.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru9-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru3-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru7-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru8-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-aru2-47ab3962.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-ljspeech-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt408-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt138-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt624-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt396-47ab3962.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt498-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt132-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt288-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt42-47ab3962.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blistering-lt90-47ab3962.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'blister\' (vết phồng rộp), dùng để nhấn mạnh sự dữ dội.', 'manufacturing', 1, 22),
('0c8f3f28-b0a0-5764-980f-6f1f02010e2a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'abe90d83-13d9-5576-a094-578231fa232b', 'ed95f82e-e8e5-5dfb-bd19-99c9556fe96b', 'underperform', '/ˌʌndəpəˈfɔːm/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Hoạt động hoặc thực hiện kém hơn mong đợi hoặc so với những người khác.', 'to produce results that are not as good as expected or compared to others.', 'Several regional branches tend to underperform during the slow winter season.', 'Một số chi nhánh khu vực có xu hướng hoạt động kém hiệu quả trong mùa đông chậm chạp.', '{\"en\": \"The sales department began to underperform after the new manager changed the weekly reporting system.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng kinh doanh bắt đầu hoạt động kém hiệu quả sau khi người quản lý mới thay đổi hệ thống báo cáo hàng tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-ljspeech-dd9d5b2a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-cori-dd9d5b2a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/underperform-9b03a004.webp', '[\"fail\", \"lag\"]', '[\"outperform\", \"succeed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"underperform the market\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động kém hơn thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consistently underperform\", \"meaning\": \"liên tục hoạt động kém\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"overperform\", \"note_vi\": \"trái nghĩa, làm tốt hơn mong đợi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"underperformance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-cori-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru0-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru5-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru6-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru10-dd9d5b2a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru9-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru3-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru7-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru8-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-aru2-dd9d5b2a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-ljspeech-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt408-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt138-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt624-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt396-dd9d5b2a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt498-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt132-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt288-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt42-dd9d5b2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underperform-lt90-dd9d5b2a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong báo cáo tài chính hoặc đánh giá nhân viên.', 'business', 1, 23),
('01793820-f6ef-5d41-84a4-db59a8709ae7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'abe90d83-13d9-5576-a094-578231fa232b', 'ed95f82e-e8e5-5dfb-bd19-99c9556fe96b', 'urology', '/jʊəˈrɒlədʒi/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Chuyên khoa y học về hệ tiết niệu và sinh dục nam.', 'the branch of medicine concerned with the urinary system and male reproductive organs.', 'He decided to specialize in urology after medical school.', 'Anh ấy quyết định chuyên về khoa tiết niệu sau trường y.', '{\"en\": \"The hospital appointed a new chief of urology to improve specialized care for patients.\", \"vi\": \"Bệnh viện đã bổ nhiệm một trưởng khoa tiết niệu mới để cải thiện việc chăm sóc chuyên khoa cho bệnh nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-ljspeech-6c215c0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-cori-6c215c0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/urology-370ef9c4.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"department of urology\", \"meaning\": \"khoa tiết niệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pediatric urology\", \"meaning\": \"nhi khoa tiết niệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"neurology\", \"note_vi\": \"Neurology là thần kinh học; urology là niệu học.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"urologist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"urological\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-cori-6c215c0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-aru0-6c215c0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-aru5-6c215c0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-aru6-6c215c0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-aru10-6c215c0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-aru9-6c215c0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-aru3-6c215c0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-aru7-6c215c0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urology-aru8-