('f737e6ac-48b6-53ee-9421-967ac600b3d3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'gust', '/ɡʌst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cơn gió mạnh hoặc luồng không khí đột ngột.', 'a sudden strong movement of wind or air that lasts for a short time.', 'A powerful gust blew open the office windows, scattering paperwork across the desk.', 'Một cơn gió giật mạnh đã thổi tung các cửa sổ văn phòng, làm phân tán giấy tờ khắp bàn làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"An unexpected gust of wind damaged the outdoor display banner before the morning trade show.\", \"vi\": \"Một cơn gió mạnh bất ngờ làm hỏng băng rôn trưng bày ngoài trời trước buổi triển lãm thương mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-ljspeech-d8e4751e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-cori-d8e4751e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gust-b9c41396.webp', '[\"blast\", \"burst\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"strong gust\", \"meaning\": \"cơn gió mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gust of wind\", \"meaning\": \"luồng gió đột ngột\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gut\", \"note_vi\": \"gut là ruột hoặc lòng dũng cảm, gust là cơn gió đột ngột\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"gusty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-cori-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru0-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru5-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru6-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru10-d8e4751e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru9-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru3-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru7-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru8-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-aru2-d8e4751e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-ljspeech-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt408-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt138-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt624-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt396-d8e4751e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt498-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt132-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt288-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt42-d8e4751e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gust-lt90-d8e4751e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với \'wind\' thành cụm \'a gust of wind\'.', 'nature', 1, 0),
('c60e17e2-c52b-5395-84d6-cef4f47778e1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'Afrofuturism', '/ˌæfrəʊˈfjuːtʃərɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một thể loại văn hóa khám phá sự giao thoa giữa văn hóa châu Phi và công nghệ.', 'a cultural style that combines elements of african history with modern science and technology.', 'The museum features an innovative exhibition combining African diaspora history with Afrofuturism themes.', 'Bảo tàng trưng bày một triển lãm sáng tạo kết hợp lịch sử di dân châu Phi với các chủ đề về chủ nghĩa tương lai da đen.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team studied Afrofuturism to create a unique design for the new product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã nghiên cứu Afrofuturism để tạo ra thiết kế độc đáo cho buổi ra mắt sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-ljspeech-f4dc3772.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-cori-f4dc3772.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/afrofuturism-7b7a2e15.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"elements of Afrofuturism\", \"meaning\": \"các yếu tố của Afrofuturism\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-cori-f4dc3772.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-aru0-f4dc3772.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-aru5-f4dc3772.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-aru6-f4dc3772.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-aru10-f4dc3772.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-aru9-f4dc3772.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-aru3-f4dc3772.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-aru7-f4dc3772.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afrofuturism-aru8-f4dc3772.mp3\", \"/storag