('700862d1-08b5-5e8a-ba53-f71844159c2f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'disquieting', '/dɪsˈkwaɪətɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây ra cảm giác lo lắng, bồn chồn hoặc bất an.', 'causing a feeling of worry, unease or nervousness in someone.', 'The disquieting news about the economy made many people worried about their jobs.', 'Tin tức đáng lo ngại về nền kinh tế đã khiến nhiều người lo lắng về công việc của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The disquieting email from the client raised concerns among the sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Email gây bất an từ khách hàng đã làm dấy lên lo ngại trong đội ngũ bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-ljspeech-a8dd0925.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-cori-a8dd0925.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disquieting-b4c1ec7e.webp', '[\"worrying\", \"alarming\", \"disturbing\"]', '[\"reassuring\", \"calming\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disquieting news\", \"meaning\": \"tin tức gây lo âu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disquieting silence\", \"meaning\": \"sự im lặng đáng lo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disquieting trend\", \"meaning\": \"xu hướng đáng ngại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"quiet\", \"note_vi\": \"quiet là yên tĩnh, disquieting là gây lo âu\"}, {\"word\": \"dispute\", \"note_vi\": \"dispute là tranh cãi, không liên quan\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disquiet\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disquiet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-cori-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru0-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru5-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru6-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru10-a8dd0925.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru9-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru3-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru7-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru8-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-aru2-a8dd0925.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-ljspeech-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt408-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt138-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt624-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt396-a8dd0925.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt498-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt132-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt288-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt42-a8dd0925.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disquieting-lt90-a8dd0925.mp3\"]}}', 'Disquieting có gốc quiet nhưng nghĩa ngược: gây bất an, không phải yên tĩnh.', 'business', 1, 2),
('8979f8dc-cdd1-5684-9253-4f5b1b29afdd', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'riveting', '/ˈrɪvɪtɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất hấp dẫn, lôi cuốn, thu hút sự chú ý.', 'extremely interesting or exciting, holding your attention completely.', 'The documentary about ancient civilizations was absolutely riveting from start to finish.', 'Bộ phim tài liệu về các nền văn minh cổ đại cực kỳ hấp dẫn từ đầu đến cuối.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker gave a riveting presentation on the future of artificial intelligence in business.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính đã trình bày một bài thuyết trình cực kỳ lôi cuốn về tương lai của trí tuệ nhân tạo trong kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-ljspeech-36aa9031.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-cori-36aa9031.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/riveting-fb676c47.webp', '[\"fascinating\", \"captivating\", \"engrossing\"]', '[\"boring\", \"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"riveting performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn trình diễn lôi cuốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"riveting story\", \"meaning\": \"câu chuyện hấp dẫn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"revealing\", \"note_vi\": \"revealing là để lộ ra, riveting là cực kỳ hấp dẫn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rivet\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rivet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-cori-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru0-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru5-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru6-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru10-36aa9031.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru9-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru3-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru7-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru8-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-aru2-36aa9031.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-ljspeech-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt408-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt138-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt624-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt396-36aa9031.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt498-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt132-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt288-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt42-36aa9031.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/riveting-lt90-36aa9031.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy nhớ \'riveting\' giống như cái đinh tán (rivet) giữ chặt sự chú ý của bạn.', 'business', 1, 3),
('a8d98f0a-e007-52c4-a8c8-9196524b1644', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'lepton', '/ˈlɛptɒn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một loại hạt cơ bản không chịu tương tác mạnh, bao gồm electron và neutrino.', 'a tiny particle in physics that does not experience strong nuclear force.', 'Electrons are the most well-known type of lepton, carrying a negative electric charge.', 'Electron là loại lepton được biết đến nhiều nhất, mang điện tích âm.', '{\"en\": \"The research lab ordered new equipment to measure subatomic particles including the lepton.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nghiên cứu đã đặt mua thiết bị mới để đo các hạt dưới nguyên tử bao gồm hạt lepton.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-ljspeech-98fe55dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-cori-98fe55dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lepton-7e0593a1.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lepton family\", \"meaning\": \"họ hạt lepton\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lepton decay\", \"meaning\": \"sự phân rã lepton\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"photon\", \"note_vi\": \"Hạt ánh sáng (quang tử), khác với hạt lepton trong vật lý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"leptonic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-cori-98fe55dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-aru0-98fe55dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-aru5-98fe55dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-aru6-98fe55dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-aru10-98fe55dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-aru9-98fe55dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-aru3-98fe55dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-aru7-98fe55dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lepton-aru8-98fe55dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o