('1c219da6-529d-5444-a391-ccf6fc245af6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'disdainful', '/dɪsˈdeɪnfl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Thể hiện sự coi thường, khinh bỉ.', 'showing that you do not respect someone or something because you think they are worthless.', 'The critic made disdainful remarks about the amateur artist\'s latest sculpture exhibition.', 'Nhà phê bình đã đưa ra những nhận xét khinh thường về triển lãm điêu khắc mới nhất của nghệ sĩ nghiệp dư.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave a disdainful look when the intern suggested a very impractical new idea.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhìn với vẻ khinh bỉ khi thực tập sinh đề xuất một ý tưởng phi thực tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-ljspeech-b17b5e8e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-cori-b17b5e8e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disdainful-87d08003.webp', '[\"scornful\", \"contemptuous\"]', '[\"respectful\", \"admiring\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disdainful look\", \"meaning\": \"cái nhìn khinh bỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disdainful attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ khinh bỉ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disdain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-cori-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru0-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru5-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru6-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru10-b17b5e8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru9-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru3-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru7-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru8-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-aru2-b17b5e8e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-ljspeech-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt408-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt138-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt624-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt396-b17b5e8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt498-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt132-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt288-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt42-b17b5e8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disdainful-lt90-b17b5e8e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để mô tả thái độ khinh khỉnh, coi thường người khác.', 'office', 1, 19),
('7b4e114c-695e-53fb-afd7-ba6cba4f3ae1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'zap', '/zæp/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Tấn công hoặc phá hủy bằng năng lượng hoặc điện đột ngột.', 'to destroy or damage something quickly with sudden heat, light, or electricity.', 'The superhero could zap his enemies with bolts of lightning.', 'Siêu anh hùng có thể phóng sét tiêu diệt kẻ thù của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The new security system can zap computer viruses before they infect the company database.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống bảo mật mới có thể tiêu diệt virus máy tính trước khi chúng lây nhiễm vào cơ sở dữ liệu công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-ljspeech-4949a8d2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-cori-4949a8d2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/zap-b02bf2fa.webp', '[\"destroy\", \"kill\", \"nuke\"]', '[\"create\", \"protect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"zap a virus\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu diệt virus\"}, {\"phrase\": \"zap with electricity\", \"meaning\": \"bắn bằng điện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"zip\", \"note_vi\": \"zip là kéo khóa kéo hoặc nén file; zap là tiêu diệt nhanh\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-cori-4949a8d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru0-4949a8d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru5-4949a8d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru6-4949a8d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru10-4949a8d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru9-4949a8d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru3-4949a8d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru7-4949a8d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru8-4949a8d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zap-aru2-4949a8d2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\":