('2c16634c-7ba0-5ee0-94a1-163cb93c8a2f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'convex', '/ˈkɒnveks/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có bề mặt cong ra phía ngoài, phồng lên.', 'curved outward like the outside of a bowl or a ball.', 'The outer surface of a magnifying glass is typically convex.', 'Bề mặt bên ngoài của một chiếc kính lúp thường lồi.', '{\"en\": \"The security team installed a convex mirror in the warehouse to prevent accidents.\", \"vi\": \"Đội an ninh đã lắp đặt một gương cầu lồi trong kho hàng để ngăn ngừa tai nạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-ljspeech-bee0c1a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-cori-bee0c1a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/convex-b6d12873.webp', '[\"curved\", \"bulging\"]', '[\"concave\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"convex lens\", \"meaning\": \"thấu kính hội tụ (lồi)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convex mirror\", \"meaning\": \"gương cầu lồi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"concave\", \"note_vi\": \"concave là lõm (cong vào trong), ngược nghĩa với convex (lồi).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"convexity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-cori-bee0c1a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru0-bee0c1a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru5-bee0c1a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru6-bee0c1a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru10-bee0c1a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru9-bee0c1a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru3-bee0c1a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru7-bee0c1a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru8-bee0c1a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convex-aru2-bee0c1a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\":