('315c5ea9-b80f-53e0-9410-36916eb1ac40', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'spindly', '/ˈspɪndli/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Gầy gò, khẳng khiu, yếu ớt.', 'long, thin, and weak-looking, often used to describe legs or arms.', 'The old man had spindly legs that made walking difficult for him.', 'Ông lão có đôi chân gầy guộc khiến việc đi lại khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The spindly table legs were not strong enough to support the heavy office equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Những chân bàn khẳng khiu không đủ chắc để đỡ thiết bị văn phòng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-ljspeech-cab2b99c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-cori-cab2b99c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spindly-87460084.webp', '[\"scrawny\", \"gangly\", \"lanky\"]', '[\"sturdy\", \"stocky\", \"robust\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spindly legs\", \"meaning\": \"đôi chân gầy guộc, khẳng khiu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spindly arms\", \"meaning\": \"đôi tay gầy yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spindly figure\", \"meaning\": \"vóc dáng gầy gò\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slender\", \"note_vi\": \"slender gầy nhưng thanh mảnh đẹp, spindly gầy theo nghĩa yếu ớt, không hấp dẫn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-cori-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru0-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru5-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru6-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru10-cab2b99c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru9-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru3-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru7-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru8-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-aru2-cab2b99c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-ljspeech-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt408-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt138-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt624-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt396-cab2b99c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt498-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt132-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt288-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt42-cab2b99c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spindly-lt90-cab2b99c.mp3\"]}}', 'Spindly mang nghĩa tiêu cực về vẻ ngoài yếu đuối; đừng dùng thay cho \'slim\' hay \'slender\'.', 'other', 1, 28),
('a21adf69-da12-5f52-85a5-f3a520aab97d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b6afe5e5-5b3e-5d54-9978-d918451a484a', 'bab25065-9ab0-5ad2-b3cf-66883871108a', 'objectively', 'UK: /əbˈdʒɛktɪvli/ | US: /əbˈdʒɛktɪvli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'một cách khách quan', 'In a manner based on facts rather than personal feelings or opinions.', 'The manager evaluated the proposals objectively.', 'Người quản lý đã đánh giá các đề xuất một cách khách quan.', '{\"en\": \"The performance review committee evaluated all sales representatives objectively based on their quarterly achievements.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng đánh giá hiệu suất đã đánh giá tất cả các đại diện kinh doanh một cách khách quan dựa trên thành tích hàng quý của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-ljspeech-39951b11.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-cori-39951b11.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/objectively-bb42c733.webp', '[\"impartially\", \"unbiasedly\", \"fairly\", \"dispassionately\"]', '[\"subjectively\", \"biasedly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"evaluate objectively\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá một cách khách quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assess objectively\", \"meaning\": \"xem xét/đánh giá khách quan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"subjectively\", \"note_vi\": \"subjectively có nghĩa là \'một cách chủ quan\', trái ngược với objectively.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"objectivity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"objective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-cori-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru0-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru5-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru6-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru10-39951b11.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru9-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru3-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru7-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru8-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-aru2-39951b11.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-ljspeech-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt408-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt138-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt624-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt396-39951b11.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt498-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt132-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt288-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt42-39951b11.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/objectively-lt90-39951b11.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi từ tính từ \'objective\' (khách quan). Trong đề TOEIC hay xuất hiện cụm \'evaluate objectively\' (đánh giá một cách khách quan).', 'management', 1, 29),
('8a9fdc4c-6bd8-521a-985b-63055d0374d5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'salute', '/səˈluːt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Chào (quân đội), giơ tay chào hoặc bày tỏ sự tôn kính.', 'to show respect to someone by raising your hand to your head.', 'The entire board stood up to salute the retiring director for his lifetime achievements.', 'Toàn bộ hội đồng quản trị đã đứng dậy vinh danh vị giám đốc nghỉ hưu vì những thành tựu trọn đời của ông.', '{\"en\": \"The security guards salute the chief executive officer whenever he enters the main building.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên bảo vệ chào người giám đốc điều hành mỗi khi ông vào tòa nhà chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-ljspeech-17040e92.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-cori-17040e92.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salute-6f0e8839.webp', '[\"greet\", \"honor\", \"respect\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"salute the flag\", \"meaning\": \"chào cờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"formal salute\", \"meaning\": \"cú chào trang trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"solute\", \"note_vi\": \"chất tan trong hóa học, viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"salute\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"salutation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-cori-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru0-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru5-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru6-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru10-17040e92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru9-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru3-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru7-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru8-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru2-17040e92.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-ljspeech-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt408-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt138-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt624-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt396-17040e92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt498-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt132-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt288-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt42-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt90-17040e92.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa chào kiểu quân đội, từ này còn mang nghĩa tôn vinh, ca ngợi thành tựu.', 'office', 1, 0),
('2d23b253-68d5-52f5-89ab-92f470f01b92', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'syringe', '/sɪˈrɪndʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Dụng cụ y tế dùng để tiêm hoặc hút chất lỏng.', 'a small tube with a needle used for putting medicine into or taking blood from the body.', 'The nurse prepared the vaccine in a sterile syringe before administering the injection.', 'Y tá chuẩn bị vắc-xin vào một ống tiêm vô trùng trước khi tiêm.', '{\"en\": \"The medical clinic ordered a new supply of sterile syringes for the upcoming vaccination program.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám y tế đã đặt mua một lô ống tiêm vô trùng mới cho chương trình tiêm chủng sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-ljspeech-41cf6fbe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-cori-41cf6fbe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/syringe-34cdab78.webp', '[\"injector\", \"needle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sterile syringe\", \"meaning\": \"ống tiêm vô trùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use a syringe\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng ống tiêm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-cori-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru0-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru5-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru6-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru10-41cf6fbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru9-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru3-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru7-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru8-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-aru2-41cf6fbe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-ljspeech-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt408-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt138-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt624-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt396-41cf6fbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt498-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt132-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt288-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt42-41cf6fbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syringe-lt90-41cf6fbe.mp3\"]}}', 'từ chuyên ngành y tế, cần dùng đúng trong ngữ cảnh bệnh viện.', 'health', 1, 1),
('c1c32cdb-825e-5015-ba78-44ff3b13e038', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'a dime a dozen', '/ə daɪm ə dʌzən/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Rất phổ biến, nhiều đến mức không có giá trị đặc biệt.', 'very common and of no special value or interest.', 'In this city, coffee shops are a dime a dozen, so it\'s hard to find a unique one.', 'Ở thành phố này, quán cà phê nhiều như nấm, nên rất khó tìm được một quán độc đáo.', '{\"en\": \"In this competitive job market, basic computer skills are a dime a dozen.\", \"vi\": \"Trong thị trường việc làm cạnh tranh này, các kỹ năng máy tính cơ bản rất phổ biến và bình thường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-ljspeech-69ae5948.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-cori-69ae5948.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-dime-a-dozen-ca7cc521.webp', '[\"commonplace\", \"ubiquitous\", \"ordinary\"]', '[\"rare\", \"scarce\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-cori-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru0-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru5-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru6-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru10-69ae5948.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru9-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru3-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru7-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru8-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-aru2-69ae5948.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-ljspeech-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt408-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt138-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt624-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt396-69ae5948.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt498-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt132-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt288-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt42-69ae5948.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dime-a-dozen-lt90-69ae5948.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này mang tính chất hơi hạ thấp giá trị của thứ gì đó vì nó quá nhiều.', 'hr', 1, 2),
('db6311fa-a9b9-55eb-b8ed-d6ad54ae2827', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'corrugated', '/ˈkɒrəɡeɪtɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có dạng lượn sóng hoặc có rãnh song song.', 'having a surface with a series of regular folds or ridges that look like waves.', 'Workers packed the fragile glass items inside heavy corrugated cardboard boxes for transport.', 'Công nhân đã đóng gói các đồ thủy tinh dễ vỡ vào trong những hộp carton lượn sóng dày để vận chuyển.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse roof is made of corrugated iron to ensure it can withstand heavy rain storms.\", \"vi\": \"Mái nhà kho được làm bằng tôn lượn sóng để đảm bảo nó có thể chịu được những trận mưa lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-ljspeech-6911efe0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-cori-6911efe0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corrugated-68d2815f.webp', '[\"ridged\", \"wavy\"]', '[\"flat\", \"smooth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"corrugated metal\", \"meaning\": \"kim loại lượn sóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corrugated cardboard\", \"meaning\": \"giấy bìa carton sóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"corrugate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-cori-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru0-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru5-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru6-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru10-6911efe0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru9-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru3-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru7-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru8-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-aru2-6911efe0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-ljspeech-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt408-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt138-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt624-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt396-6911efe0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt498-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt132-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt288-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt42-6911efe0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corrugated-lt90-6911efe0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cho vật liệu xây dựng hoặc bao bì đóng gói.', 'housing', 1, 3)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('ed7c78a8-29e5-5279-b2d4-300a8a8bd2fb', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'fracking', '/frækɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kỹ thuật khai thác khí hoặc dầu bằng cách bơm chất lỏng áp suất cao vào lòng đất để phá vỡ đá.', 'a method of extracting gas by breaking rock with high-pressure liquid.', 'Environmental groups have raised concerns about the potential impact of fracking on groundwater.', 'Các nhóm môi trường đã bày tỏ lo ngại về tác động tiềm tàng của nứt vỡ thủy lực đối với nước ngầm.', '{\"en\": \"The energy company invested in fracking to boost natural gas production.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty năng lượng đầu tư vào khai thác thủy lực cường độ cao để tăng sản lượng khí tự nhiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-ljspeech-a6c57e53.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-cori-a6c57e53.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fracking-7350b584.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fracking site\", \"meaning\": \"địa điểm khoan thủy lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ban fracking\", \"meaning\": \"cấm khai thác thủy lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fracking process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình fracking\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cracking\", \"note_vi\": \"fracking là khoan thủy lực, cracking là nứt/phá vỡ, dễ nhầm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"frack\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-cori-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru0-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru5-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru6-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru10-a6c57e53.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru9-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru3-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru7-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru8-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-aru2-a6c57e53.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-ljspeech-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt408-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt138-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt624-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt396-a6c57e53.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt498-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt132-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt288-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt42-a6c57e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracking-lt90-a6c57e53.mp3\"]}}', 'Fracking là viết tắt của hydraulic fracturing, kỹ thuật gây tranh cãi về môi trường.', 'nature', 1, 4),
('5db7c36c-827e-5147-a4d6-62ae64edaea4', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'collective', '/kəˈlektɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về hoặc liên quan đến một nhóm người, mang tính tập thể.', 'done by or belonging to all members of a group acting together.', 'The employees took collective action to demand better working conditions and higher wages.', 'Các nhân viên đã hành động tập thể để yêu cầu điều kiện làm việc tốt hơn và lương cao hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The team reached a collective decision on the marketing budget after hours of discussion.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm đã đạt được quyết định tập thể về ngân sách tiếp thị sau nhiều giờ thảo luận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-ljspeech-84c09210.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-cori-84c09210.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/collective-786d95c6.webp', '[\"joint\", \"shared\", \"combined\"]', '[\"individual\", \"personal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"collective effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực tập thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"collective responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"trách nhiệm tập thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"collective decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định tập thể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"corrective\", \"note_vi\": \"corrective mang nghĩa mang tính sửa chữa, khắc phục\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"collectively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"collection\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"collect\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-cori-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru0-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru5-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru6-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru10-84c09210.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru9-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru3-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru7-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru8-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-aru2-84c09210.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-ljspeech-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt408-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt138-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt624-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt396-84c09210.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt498-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt132-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt288-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt42-84c09210.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collective-lt90-84c09210.mp3\"]}}', 'Collective trái nghĩa trực tiếp với individual.', 'business', 1, 5),
('f642aabd-c624-560c-b892-ed2235a44915', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'chronicle', '/ˈkrɒnɪkl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một bản ghi chép các sự kiện theo thứ tự thời gian, thường là lịch sử.', 'a written record of events arranged in the order that they happened over a long time.', 'The old chronicle detailed the major events of the kingdom over several centuries.', 'Cuốn biên niên sử cổ ghi lại chi tiết các sự kiện chính của vương quốc qua nhiều thế kỷ.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate chronicle documents every major merger and acquisition since the firm was first established.\", \"vi\": \"Bản ghi chép lịch sử doanh nghiệp ghi lại mọi vụ sáp nhập và mua lại lớn kể từ khi công ty được thành lập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-ljspeech-52659b45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-cori-52659b45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chronicle-e5617863.webp', '[\"record\", \"archive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"historical chronicle\", \"meaning\": \"biên niên sử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"detailed chronicle\", \"meaning\": \"bản ghi chép chi tiết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chronology\", \"note_vi\": \"Chronicle là bản ghi chép, chronology là trình tự thời gian.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"chronicler\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"chronic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-cori-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru0-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru5-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru6-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru10-52659b45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru9-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru3-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru7-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru8-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-aru2-52659b45.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-ljspeech-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt408-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt138-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt624-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt396-52659b45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt498-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt132-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt288-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt42-52659b45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronicle-lt90-52659b45.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'chron-\' liên quan đến thời gian.', 'academic', 1, 6),
('1253fb84-c9ad-5e41-9733-66ecac75c4b1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'monad', '/ˈmɒnæd/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Thực thể cơ bản, không thể chia nhỏ, trong triết học hoặc lập trình.', 'a single unit that is considered the smallest part of something and cannot be divided further.', 'In some philosophical systems, the monad is considered the ultimate indivisible unit of reality.', 'Trong một số hệ thống triết học, đơn tử được coi là đơn vị không thể chia nhỏ cuối cùng của thực tại.', '{\"en\": \"The software developer explained how each functional monad helps maintain the stability of the system.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà phát triển phần mềm giải thích cách mỗi đơn vị chức năng giúp duy trì sự ổn định của hệ thống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-ljspeech-a6dd51f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-cori-a6dd51f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monad-78f9426b.webp', '[\"unit\", \"entity\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"basic monad\", \"meaning\": \"đơn vị cơ bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"philosophical monad\", \"meaning\": \"đơn vị triết học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monad\", \"note_vi\": \"monad là đơn vị, nomad là người du mục.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-cori-a6dd51f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-aru0-a6dd51f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-aru5-a6dd51f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-aru6-a6dd51f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-aru10-a6dd51f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-aru9-a6dd51f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-aru3-a6dd51f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-aru7-a6dd51f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monad-aru8-a6dd51f7.mp3\