('ce70dd2d-0200-53cc-b1b5-bebff9d63547', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'pout', '/paʊt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Bĩu môi, chu môi (thể hiện sự không hài lòng hoặc giận dỗi).', 'to push out your lips to show that you are unhappy or do not agree with something.', 'The child started to pout when he didn\'t get his way.', 'Đứa trẻ bắt đầu bĩu môi khi không được như ý.', '{\"en\": \"The junior employee began to pout after her proposal was rejected in the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cấp dưới bắt đầu bĩu môi sau khi đề xuất của cô bị từ chối trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-ljspeech-2862411b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-cori-2862411b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pout-3be821fa.webp', '[\"sulk\", \"grimace\", \"scowl\"]', '[\"smile\", \"beam\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pout in disappointment\", \"meaning\": \"bĩu môi vì thất vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pout sulkily\", \"meaning\": \"chu môi ra vẻ hờn dỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pout one\'s lips\", \"meaning\": \"chu môi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shout\", \"note_vi\": \"shout là hét to, không liên quan đến môi hay thái độ hờn dỗi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pout\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pouty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-cori-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru0-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru5-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru6-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru10-2862411b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru9-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru3-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru7-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru8-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-aru2-2862411b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-ljspeech-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt408-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt138-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt624-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt396-2862411b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt498-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt132-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt288-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt42-2862411b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pout-lt90-2862411b.mp3\"]}}', '\'Pout\' thường dùng để tả biểu cảm khuôn mặt, không dùng trong văn phong trang trọng.', 'other', 1, 15),
('71463318-4a44-5595-a681-b327cd98290e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'film noir', '/fɪlm nwɑːr/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thể loại phim hình sự đặc trưng bởi tông màu tối, không khí u ám và nhân vật phức tạp.', 'a style of crime cinema marked by dark tones and morally ambiguous figures.', 'Classic film noir often features cynical detectives and mysterious femme fatales.', 'Phim noir kinh điển thường có các thám tử hoài nghi và những người phụ nữ quyến rũ bí ẩn.', '{\"en\": \"The film noir screening at the conference attracted many media professionals.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi chiếu phim noir tại hội nghị đã thu hút nhiều chuyên gia truyền thông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-ljspeech-123cf656.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-cori-123cf656.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/film-noir-2d68eab0.webp', '[\"crime drama\", \"dark thriller\", \"detective film\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"classic film noir\", \"meaning\": \"phim noir kinh điển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"film noir style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách phim noir\"}, {\"phrase\": \"film noir director\", \"meaning\": \"đạo diễn phim noir\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"noir\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là màu đen, không chỉ thể loại phim\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-cori-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru0-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru5-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru6-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru10-123cf656.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru9-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru3-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru7-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru8-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-aru2-123cf656.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-ljspeech-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt408-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt138-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt624-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt396-123cf656.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt498-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt132-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt288-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt42-123cf656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/film-noir-lt90-123cf656.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ điện ảnh chỉ thể loại phim tội phạm u ám, không viết \'noir film\'.', 'media', 1, 16),
('9ea112ad-2551-5cf8-8b2f-c489fd619494', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'baroque', '/bəˈrɒk/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Phong cách nghệ thuật, kiến trúc và âm nhạc phát triển ở châu Âu từ thế kỷ 17 đến 18.', 'a style of art and architecture from the seventeenth century known for being very detailed.', 'The Baroque period is known for its dramatic and elaborate artistic styles.', 'Thời kỳ Baroque nổi tiếng với các phong cách nghệ thuật kịch tính và công phu.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby features a beautiful design inspired by the classic baroque style of architecture.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn có thiết kế đẹp mắt lấy cảm hứng từ phong cách kiến trúc baroque cổ điển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-ljspeech-1a022410.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-cori-1a022410.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/baroque-55d5fa17.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"baroque style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách baroque\"}, {\"phrase\": \"baroque art\", \"meaning\": \"nghệ thuật baroque\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-cori-1a022410.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru0-1a022410.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru5-1a022410.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru6-1a022410.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru10-1a022410.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru9-1a022410.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru3-1a022410.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru7-1a022410.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru8-1a022410.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baroque-aru2-1a022410.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/objec