('a063def3-91ae-511d-ad76-286ae7a47697', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'mislabel', 'UK: /ˌmɪsˈleɪbəl/ | US: /ˌmɪsˈleɪbəl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'dán sai nhãn', 'To attach an incorrect tag or description to an object.', 'The products were mislabeled, causing confusion.', 'Các sản phẩm bị dán nhãn sai, gây ra sự nhầm lẫn.', '{\"en\": \"Several packages were delayed because they had been mislabeled at the distribution center.\", \"vi\": \"Một số kiện hàng đã bị chậm trễ vì chúng đã bị dán sai nhãn tại trung tâm phân phối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-ljspeech-fa2290fc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-cori-fa2290fc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mislabel-4038b6e1.webp', '[\"misbrand\", \"mistag\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mislabeled package\", \"meaning\": \"bưu kiện bị dán sai nhãn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accidental mislabeling\", \"meaning\": \"việc dán nhầm nhãn do vô ý\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mislabeling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-cori-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru0-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru5-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru6-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru10-fa2290fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru9-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru3-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru7-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru8-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-aru2-fa2290fc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-ljspeech-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt408-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt138-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt624-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt396-fa2290fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt498-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt132-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt288-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt42-fa2290fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mislabel-lt90-fa2290fc.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng dạng bị động (be mislabeled) trong vận chuyển hàng hóa, đóng gói bao bì.', 'shipping', 1, 18),
('55513e07-6dd4-5ca6-82a2-68491ca363e0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'abhorrent', '/əbˈhɒrənt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Đáng ghét, kinh tởm, không thể chấp nhận được.', 'causing a strong feeling of dislike, disapproval, or hatred.', 'The idea of animal cruelty is abhorrent to most people.', 'Ý tưởng ngược đãi động vật là điều đáng ghét đối với hầu hết mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"Discrimination of any kind is abhorrent to our corporate values and will not be tolerated.\", \"vi\": \"Phân biệt đối xử dưới mọi hình thức là điều không thể chấp nhận được đối với các giá trị của công ty chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-ljspeech-375278a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-cori-375278a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/abhorrent-2f01543a.webp', '[\"repugnant\", \"detestable\", \"loathsome\"]', '[\"acceptable\", \"admirable\", \"appealing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"abhorrent to\", \"meaning\": \"không thể chấp nhận được đối với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find something abhorrent\", \"meaning\": \"thấy điều gì đó đáng ghét\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"abhor\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"abhorrence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-cori-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru0-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru5-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru6-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru10-375278a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru9-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru3-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru7-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru8-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-aru2-375278a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-ljspeech-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt408-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt138-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt624-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt396-375278a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt498-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt132-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt288-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt42-375278a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abhorrent-lt90-375278a1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'to\' để chỉ điều gì đó trái với đạo đức hoặc nguyên tắc của ai.', 'hr', 1, 19),
('6e42ffa6-993c-5828-aa2d-d5ab89a1dff6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'scrawny', '/ˈskrɔːni/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất gầy, xương xẩu, thiếu cơ bắp.', 'describing someone or something extremely thin, bony, and lacking muscle.', 'The stray cat was scrawny and looked like it hadn\'t eaten in days.', 'Con mèo hoang gầy gò và trông như đã không ăn gì trong nhiều ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The scrawny intern struggled to lift the heavy boxes in the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Thực tập sinh xương xẩu đã vật lộn để nâng những hộp nặng trong kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-ljspeech-3f5f62dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-cori-3f5f62dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scrawny-c1f4aed2.webp', '[\"skinny\", \"bony\", \"emaciated\"]', '[\"muscular\", \"brawny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scrawny cat\", \"meaning\": \"mèo xương xẩu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scrawny arms\", \"meaning\": \"cánh tay gầy nhẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look scrawny\", \"meaning\": \"trông xương xẩu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scrubby\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là bẩn thỉu, không phải gầy\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"scrawniness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-cori-3f5f62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-aru0-3f5f62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-aru5-3f5f62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-aru6-3f5f62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-aru10-3f5f62dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-aru9-3f5f62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-aru3-3f5f62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-aru7-3f5f62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scrawny-aru8-3f5f62dd.mp3\", \"/s