('fed90cae-78b4-5a4c-a868-3a1e91e36812', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'tectonics', '/ˌpleɪt tekˈtɒnɪks/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Ngành khoa học nghiên cứu về cấu trúc và chuyển động của vỏ Trái Đất.', 'the scientific study of the structure and movement of the surface of the earth.', 'The study of plate tectonics helps us understand earthquakes and volcanoes.', 'Nghiên cứu về kiến tạo mảng giúp chúng ta hiểu về động đất và núi lửa.', '{\"en\": \"Engineering consultants must analyze local plate tectonics before designing earthquake-resistant office buildings.\", \"vi\": \"Các cố vấn kỹ thuật phải phân tích kiến tạo mảng địa phương trước khi thiết kế các tòa nhà văn phòng chịu được động đất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-ljspeech-2f8bc1e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-cori-2f8bc1e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tectonics-5679a3e6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"plate tectonics\", \"meaning\": \"kiến tạo mảng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"global tectonics\", \"meaning\": \"kiến tạo toàn cầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"architecture\", \"note_vi\": \"Architecture là kiến trúc xây dựng; tectonics là kiến tạo địa chất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tectonic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-cori-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru0-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru5-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru6-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru10-2f8bc1e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru9-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru3-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru7-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru8-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-aru2-2f8bc1e8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-ljspeech-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt408-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt138-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt624-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt396-2f8bc1e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt498-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt132-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt288-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt42-2f8bc1e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tectonics-lt90-2f8bc1e8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong cụm từ \'plate tectonics\' (kiến tạo mảng).', 'academic', 1, 24),
('f00115df-5db7-575e-8d8b-b10e6465fa90', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'b86e6013-928b-56eb-a984-392dc60bec9f', 'c6d61546-0854-5da8-a942-cbbfa7247080', 'bishop', '/ˈbɪʃəp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một chức sắc cao cấp trong một số giáo hội Kitô giáo.', 'a high-ranking Christian priest who is in charge of a large church area.', 'The local bishop visited several rural parishes to meet with community members.', 'Vị giám mục địa phương đã ghé thăm vài giáo xứ nông thôn để gặp gỡ người dân trong cộng đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The local bishop attended the charity gala to support the new community center project.\", \"vi\": \"Giám mục địa phương đã tham dự buổi dạ tiệc từ thiện để ủng hộ dự án trung tâm cộng đồng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-ljspeech-7c60903e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-cori-7c60903e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bishop-d131357b.webp', '[\"prelate\", \"archbishop\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ordain a bishop\", \"meaning\": \"phong chức giám mục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"catholic bishop\", \"meaning\": \"giám mục Công giáo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bishopric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-cori-7c60903e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru0-7c60903e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru5-7c60903e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru6-7c60903e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru10-7c60903e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru9-7c60903e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru3-7c60903e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru7-7c60903e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru8-7c60903e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bishop-aru2-7c60903e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"