('caa7f0c6-6ba7-5c32-a29d-9da7ac4a899e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'ba61f2bf-9bd5-5571-9aae-c5c7ceb7dddc', '314fa3f2-295b-5aae-a1c7-91bd4329b852', 'sullen', '/ˈsʌlən/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Buồn bã, ủ rũ và không muốn nói chuyện.', 'feeling unhappy and not wanting to speak or be friendly with other people.', 'After losing the game, the team captain was sullen and refused to talk to reporters.', 'Sau khi thua trận, đội trưởng ủ rũ và từ chối nói chuyện với phóng viên.', '{\"en\": \"The employee remained sullen throughout the meeting after receiving negative feedback on his performance report.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đó vẫn giữ thái độ ủ rũ trong suốt cuộc họp sau khi nhận phản hồi tiêu cực về báo cáo hiệu suất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-ljspeech-9aeb990e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-cori-9aeb990e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sullen-8b040463.webp', '[\"gloomy\", \"morose\"]', '[\"cheerful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sullen look\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ mặt ủ rũ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sullen silence\", \"meaning\": \"sự im lặng khó chịu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-cori-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru0-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru5-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru6-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru10-9aeb990e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru9-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru3-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru7-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru8-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-aru2-9aeb990e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-ljspeech-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt408-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt138-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt624-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt396-9aeb990e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt498-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt132-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt288-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt42-9aeb990e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sullen-lt90-9aeb990e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mô tả thái độ tiêu cực, thiếu chuyên nghiệp trong môi trường công sở.', 'office', 1, 17),
('7955f216-21fd-5913-8aa1-352c6b7467d0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'ba61f2bf-9bd5-5571-9aae-c5c7ceb7dddc', '314fa3f2-295b-5aae-a1c7-91bd4329b852', 'pathogen', '/ˈpæθədʒən/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một tác nhân sinh học gây bệnh, ví dụ như vi khuẩn, virus.', 'a tiny living thing that can make people or animals become sick or unwell.', 'Scientists are studying new ways to combat dangerous pathogens.', 'Các nhà khoa học đang nghiên cứu những cách mới để chống lại các mầm bệnh nguy hiểm.', '{\"en\": \"The laboratory staff must wear protective gear to avoid contact with any harmful pathogen.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phòng thí nghiệm phải mặc đồ bảo hộ để tránh tiếp xúc với bất kỳ tác nhân gây bệnh nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-ljspeech-6d777f4d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-cori-6d777f4d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pathogen-9620ffcb.webp', '[\"germ\", \"microbe\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"harmful pathogen\", \"meaning\": \"tác nhân gây bệnh nguy hiểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spread of pathogens\", \"meaning\": \"sự lây lan của mầm bệnh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pathogenic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-cori-6d777f4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-aru0-6d777f4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-aru5-6d777f4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-aru6-6d777f4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-aru10-6d777f4d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-aru9-6d777f4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-aru3-6d777f4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-aru7-6d777f4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pathogen-aru8-6d777f4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patho