('88e995a9-ff52-5b7a-8c73-aec5ffca5af6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'ba61f2bf-9bd5-5571-9aae-c5c7ceb7dddc', '314fa3f2-295b-5aae-a1c7-91bd4329b852', 'languish', '/ˈlæŋɡwɪʃ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Trở nên yếu ớt, suy yếu hoặc chịu đựng trong hoàn cảnh khó khăn.', 'to become weak or suffer because you are in a bad situation for a long time.', 'Many old books languish forgotten in dusty attics for decades.', 'Nhiều cuốn sách cũ bị bỏ quên héo mòn trong những căn gác bụi bặm hàng thập kỷ.', '{\"en\": \"The project continued to languish without funding, causing the team to miss the deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án tiếp tục bị trì trệ do thiếu kinh phí, khiến nhóm bỏ lỡ thời hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-ljspeech-47ef7825.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-cori-47ef7825.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/languish-b72a37bd.webp', '[\"suffer\", \"decline\"]', '[\"thrive\", \"flourish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"languish in\", \"meaning\": \"trì trệ trong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"languish for\", \"meaning\": \"mòn mỏi vì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"languor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"languid\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-cori-47ef7825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-aru0-47ef7825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-aru5-47ef7825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-aru6-47ef7825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-aru10-47ef7825.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-aru9-47ef7825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-aru3-47ef7825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-aru7-47ef7825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languish-aru8-47ef7825.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lan