('8049ba9b-9a02-5063-b4f9-814690f5f4ce', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c478b78a-bddb-53f8-93a1-593aeddec3c8', '49971f7f-279a-572a-9b52-d26ca667e59b', 'theosophy', '/θiˈɒsəfi/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống triết học hoặc tôn giáo tìm kiếm kiến thức về bản chất thần thánh thông qua sự mặc khải thần bí.', 'a system of beliefs that tries to understand God through special spiritual experiences.', 'She became interested in theosophy, believing it offered a deeper understanding of spiritual truths.', 'Cô ấy bắt đầu quan tâm đến thần trí học, tin rằng nó mang lại sự hiểu biết sâu sắc hơn về các chân lý tâm linh.', '{\"en\": \"The bookstore ordered several rare books about theosophy for a regular customer.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sách đã đặt một số cuốn sách hiếm về thông thiên học cho một khách hàng thân thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-ljspeech-b1db06cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-cori-b1db06cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/theosophy-b4145668.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"study of theosophy\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu thông thiên học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"theosophy movement\", \"meaning\": \"phong trào thông thiên học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"theology\", \"note_vi\": \"thần học nói chung, không nhất thiết là thần bí như theosophy\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"theosophical\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"theosophist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-cori-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru0-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru5-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru6-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru10-b1db06cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru9-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru3-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru7-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru8-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-aru2-b1db06cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-ljspeech-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt408-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt138-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt624-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt396-b1db06cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt498-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt132-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt288-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt42-b1db06cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/theosophy-lt90-b1db06cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này dịch sang tiếng Việt là Thông thiên học.', 'other', 1, 6),
('ddbb3db8-1a2f-5a50-bf7b-68c9b410148b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c478b78a-bddb-53f8-93a1-593aeddec3c8', '49971f7f-279a-572a-9b52-d26ca667e59b', 'soot', '/sʊt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Bồ hóng, muội đen còn lại sau khi đốt cháy không hoàn toàn.', 'a black powder that is produced when wood, coal, or oil is burned in a fire.', 'After the chimney fire, there was a thick layer of soot on the fireplace and walls.', 'Sau vụ cháy ống khói, có một lớp bồ hóng dày đặc trên lò sưởi và các bức tường.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team cleaned the soot from the ventilation system to improve the air quality.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã làm sạch muội than khỏi hệ thống thông gió để cải thiện chất lượng không khí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-ljspeech-276b70b4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-cori-276b70b4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/soot-5d7c787c.webp', '[\"grime\", \"ash\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"thick soot\", \"meaning\": \"lớp bồ hóng dày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cover in soot\", \"meaning\": \"phủ đầy muội than\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-cori-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru0-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru5-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru6-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru10-276b70b4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru9-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru3-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru7-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru8-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-aru2-276b70b4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-ljspeech-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt408-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt138-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt624-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt396-276b70b4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt498-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt132-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt288-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt42-276b70b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soot-lt90-276b70b4.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với \'ash\' (tro), soot là muội đen bám vào bề mặt.', 'housing', 1, 7),
('72147a32-cb07-56da-9880-375f3aacf93e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c478b78a-bddb-53f8-93a1-593aeddec3c8', '49971f7f-279a-572a-9b52-d26ca667e59b', 'exorcism', '/ˈeksɔːsɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Nghi lễ trục xuất tà ma hoặc linh hồn quỷ ám ra khỏi người hoặc nơi chốn.', 'a religious ceremony used to force an evil spirit to leave a person or a place.', 'The ancient ritual of exorcism is still practiced in some cultures and religions today.', 'Nghi lễ trừ tà cổ xưa vẫn được thực hành ở một số nền văn hóa và tôn giáo ngày nay.', '{\"en\": \"The historical documentary about the ancient ritual of exorcism will be broadcast on our media channel.\", \"vi\": \"Phim tài liệu lịch sử về nghi lễ trừ tà cổ xưa sẽ được phát sóng trên kênh truyền thông của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-ljspeech-69198c8c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-cori-69198c8c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exorcism-b18d4808.webp', '[\"expulsion\", \"purification\"]', '[\"possession\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"perform an exorcism\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện nghi lễ trừ tà\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exorcise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exorcist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-cori-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru0-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru5-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru6-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru10-69198c8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru9-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru3-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru7-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru8-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-aru2-69198c8c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-ljspeech-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt408-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt138-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt624-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt396-69198c8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt498-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt132-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt288-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt42-69198c8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exorcism-lt90-69198c8c.mp3\"]}}', 'Ít gặp trong TOEIC, thường xuất hiện trong các bài đọc về lịch sử, văn hóa hoặc phim ảnh.', 'media', 1, 8),
('3c063bb0-4959-5991-bbdc-03c88615a916', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c478b78a-bddb-53f8-93a1-593aeddec3c8', '49971f7f-279a-572a-9b52-d26ca667e59b', 'supplicate', '/ˈsʌplɪkeɪt/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Cầu xin, van nài một cách tha thiết, khiêm nhường.', 'to ask for something in a very humble and sincere way, often during difficult times.', 'The villagers supplicated for mercy from the invading army.', 'Dân làng cầu xin lòng thương xót từ quân đội xâm lược.', '{\"en\": \"The small supplier had to supplicate the bank for an extension on their loan repayment deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp nhỏ phải cầu xin ngân hàng gia hạn thời hạn trả nợ vay của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-ljspeech-facb83c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-cori-facb83c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supplicate-f9f3aae6.webp', '[\"beg\", \"entreat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"supplicate for mercy\", \"meaning\": \"cầu xin sự khoan hồng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supplication\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-cori-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru0-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru5-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru6-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru10-facb83c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru9-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru3-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru7-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru8-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-aru2-facb83c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-ljspeech-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt408-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt138-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt624-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt396-facb83c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt498-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt132-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt288-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt42-facb83c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplicate-lt90-facb83c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái trang trọng và cổ điển, ít dùng trong công việc hàng ngày.', 'law', 1, 9),
('f3a09a43-1d32-5caa-be1d-6a3b2b87eef8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c478b78a-bddb-53f8-93a1-593aeddec3c8', '49971f7f-279a-572a-9b52-d26ca667e59b', 'chlorophyll', '/ˈklɒrəfɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'chất diệp lục (tạo màu xanh cho thực vật)', 'the green substance in plants that absorbs light to produce food energy.', 'Chlorophyll is essential for photosynthesis, allowing plants to convert sunlight into energy.', 'Diệp lục rất cần thiết cho quá trình quang hợp, giúp thực vật chuyển đổi ánh sáng mặt trời thành năng lượng.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier sells natural chlorophyll extracts to health food stores across the country.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp bán các chiết xuất diệp lục tự nhiên cho các cửa hàng thực phẩm sức khỏe trên toàn quốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-ljspeech-199bae23.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-cori-199bae23.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chlorophyll-165b27c2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chlorophyll content\", \"meaning\": \"hàm lượng diệp lục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extract chlorophyll\", \"meaning\": \"chiết xuất diệp lục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chloroform\", \"note_vi\": \"Chloroform là chất gây mê, chlorophyll là chất diệp lục.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-cori-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru0-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru5-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru6-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru10-199bae23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru9-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru3-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru7-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru8-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-aru2-199bae23.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-ljspeech-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt408-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt138-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt624-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt396-199bae23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt498-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt132-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt288-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt42-199bae23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chlorophyll-lt90-199bae23.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt chlorophyll (diệp lục) với chloroform (chất gây mê dạng chất lỏng).', 'nature', 1, 10),
('5730817a-34e9-52d8-8f37-57dd74ea28c8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c478b78a-bddb-53f8-93a1-593aeddec3c8', '49971f7f-279a-572a-9b52-d26ca667e59b', 'foreseeable', 'UK: /fɔːˈsiːəbl/ | US: /fɔːrˈsiːəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'có thể thấy trước, dự đoán được', 'Capable of being known or predicted before it actually happens.', 'The company expects stable growth for the foreseeable future.', 'Công ty dự kiến tăng trưởng ổn định trong tương lai gần.', '{\"en\": \"We do not anticipate any changes to the current department budget in the foreseeable future.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi không lường trước bất kỳ sự thay đổi nào đối với ngân sách phòng ban hiện tại trong tương lai gần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-ljspeech-d5457e8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-cori-d5457e8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foreseeable-bda66855.webp', '[\"predictable\", \"expected\", \"anticipatable\"]', '[\"unforeseeable\", \"unpredictable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in the foreseeable future\", \"meaning\": \"trong tương lai gần / có thể đoán trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"foreseeable consequence\", \"meaning\": \"hậu quả có thể lường trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unforeseen\", \"note_vi\": \"Unforeseen nghĩa là \'không lường trước được, bất ngờ\' (thường đi với expenses/events), ngược nghĩa với foreseeable.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"foresee\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unforeseen\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-cori-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru0-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru5-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru6-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru10-d5457e8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru9-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru3-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru7-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru8-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-aru2-d5457e8f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-ljspeech-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt408-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt138-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt624-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt396-d5457e8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt498-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt132-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt288-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt42-d5457e8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foreseeable-lt90-d5457e8f.mp3\"]}}', 'Xuất hiện cực kỳ phổ biến trong TOEIC qua cụm \'in the foreseeable future\' (trong tương lai gần/có thể lường trước).', 'planning', 1, 11),
('5b7c90b0-3a65-5cb8-ba83-f628dd8b0b27', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c478b78a-bddb-53f8-93a1-593aeddec3c8', '49971f7f-279a-572a-9b52-d26ca667e59b', 'sound effect', '/saʊnd ɪˈfekt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Âm thanh được tạo ra hoặc tăng cường nhân tạo để sử dụng trong phim, kịch, trò chơi điện tử.', 'an artificial noise added to a film or game for realism.', 'The movie\'s realistic sound effects made the battle scenes feel incredibly intense.', 'Các hiệu ứng âm thanh sống động của bộ phim đã khiến những cảnh chiến đấu trở nên vô cùng dữ dội.', '{\"en\": \"The training video used a sound effect to signal completion.\", \"vi\": \"Video đào tạo sử dụng một hiệu ứng âm thanh để báo hiệu hoàn thành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-ljspeech-2d748ad1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-cori-2d748ad1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sound-effect-69341563.webp', '[\"audio effect\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"special sound effect\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu ứng âm thanh đặc biệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sound effect library\", \"meaning\": \"thư viện hiệu ứng âm thanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sound track\", \"note_vi\": \"soundtrack là nhạc phim, khác hiệu ứng âm thanh\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-cori-2d748ad1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-aru0-2d748ad1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-aru5-2d748ad1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-aru6-2d748ad1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-aru10-2d748ad1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-aru9-2d748ad1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-aru3-2d748ad1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-effect-aru7-2d748ad1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati