('1f6bcc3e-9153-5383-ac73-66aa392a0aca', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c4cda262-0bd6-5005-a87f-2c68fcc18f4a', '545f5134-e61a-5c3b-bc7e-544537e12db7', 'ketone', '/ˈkiːtəʊn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một hợp chất hữu cơ có chứa nhóm carbonyl gắn với hai nhóm hydrocarbon.', 'a chemical substance made by the body when it burns fat for energy instead of sugar.', 'High levels of ketones in the urine can indicate a serious health condition.', 'Nồng độ ketone cao trong nước tiểu có thể là dấu hiệu của một tình trạng sức khỏe nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The health report showed that the patient had high ketone levels due to a strict diet.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo sức khỏe cho thấy bệnh nhân có mức ketone cao do chế độ ăn kiêng nghiêm ngặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-ljspeech-638d0089.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-cori-638d0089.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ketone-8853d495.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ketone levels\", \"meaning\": \"mức ketone\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ketone body\", \"meaning\": \"thể ketone\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ketosis\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-cori-638d0089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru0-638d0089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru5-638d0089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru6-638d0089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru10-638d0089.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru9-638d0089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru3-638d0089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru7-638d0089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru8-638d0089.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ketone-aru2-638d0089.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pu