('802331c9-d286-5c33-93d0-096d1698d7cd', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c4cda262-0bd6-5005-a87f-2c68fcc18f4a', '545f5134-e61a-5c3b-bc7e-544537e12db7', 'rubbery', '/ˈrʌbəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có tính chất giống cao su, dai và đàn hồi.', 'feeling or looking like a tough, elastic substance that is hard to chew.', 'The overcooked chicken became tough and rubbery.', 'Miếng gà nấu quá kỹ trở nên dai và giống cao su.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant received complaints because the squid in the seafood pasta was rubbery.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng đã nhận được những lời phàn nàn vì mực trong món mì hải sản bị dai như cao su.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-ljspeech-72317ca2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-cori-72317ca2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rubbery-e249641f.webp', '[\"elastic\", \"tough\", \"chewy\"]', '[\"tender\", \"soft\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rubbery texture\", \"meaning\": \"kết cấu dai như cao su\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rubbery substance\", \"meaning\": \"chất giống cao su\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rubber\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-cori-72317ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru0-72317ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru5-72317ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru6-72317ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru10-72317ca2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru9-72317ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru3-72317ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru7-72317ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru8-72317ca2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubbery-aru2-72317ca2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio