('52239844-c03b-56c9-ad01-c5daa17975d5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c4cda262-0bd6-5005-a87f-2c68fcc18f4a', '545f5134-e61a-5c3b-bc7e-544537e12db7', 'jittery', '/ˈdʒɪtəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Bồn chồn, lo lắng hoặc căng thẳng.', 'feeling nervous, anxious, or unable to stay still because of worry or excitement.', 'Drinking three cups of espresso made the new intern feel extremely jittery.', 'Uống ba tách cà phê đậm đặc đã khiến thực tập sinh mới cảm thấy cực kỳ bồn chồn.', '{\"en\": \"The new intern felt jittery while waiting for the results of her performance review meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Thực tập sinh mới cảm thấy bồn chồn trong khi chờ đợi kết quả cuộc họp đánh giá hiệu suất của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-ljspeech-e150f0ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-cori-e150f0ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/jittery-b67917c2.webp', '[\"nervous\", \"anxious\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel jittery\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy bồn chồn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get jittery\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên lo lắng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"jitters\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-cori-e150f0ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru0-e150f0ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru5-e150f0ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru6-e150f0ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru10-e150f0ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru9-e150f0ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru3-e150f0ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru7-e150f0ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru8-e150f0ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/jittery-aru2-e150f0ff.mp3\"]}, \"