('8c78e666-e3d0-581e-a5cb-423f15e4637e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'amplitude', '/ˈæmplɪtjuːd/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Độ lớn hoặc cường độ tối đa của một dao động hoặc sóng.', 'the maximum distance that a wave or vibration moves from its normal central position.', 'The amplitude of the sound wave determines how loud the sound is.', 'Biên độ của sóng âm quyết định độ lớn của âm thanh.', '{\"en\": \"The engineering team measured the amplitude of the vibrations to ensure the machine operates safely.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kỹ thuật đã đo biên độ rung động để đảm bảo máy móc hoạt động an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-ljspeech-c1d622af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-cori-c1d622af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amplitude-dc5eb935.webp', '[\"magnitude\", \"intensity\", \"volume\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high amplitude\", \"meaning\": \"biên độ cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wave amplitude\", \"meaning\": \"biên độ sóng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"aptitude\", \"note_vi\": \"\'aptitude\' là năng khiếu, rất dễ nhầm mặt chữ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-cori-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru0-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru5-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru6-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru10-c1d622af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru9-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru3-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru7-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru8-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-aru2-c1d622af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-ljspeech-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt408-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt138-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt624-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt396-c1d622af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt498-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt132-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt288-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt42-c1d622af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplitude-lt90-c1d622af.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên ngành vật lý/kỹ thuật, ít gặp trong giao tiếp hàng ngày.', 'technology', 1, 13),
('9f28abaa-83c3-5f7b-99bb-dfe320706315', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'battalion', '/bəˈtæliən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một đơn vị quân đội lớn, thường gồm vài đại đội.', 'a large group of soldiers that forms part of a bigger army unit.', 'The entire battalion was deployed to the conflict zone for peacekeeping operations.', 'Toàn bộ tiểu đoàn đã được triển khai đến vùng xung đột để thực hiện các hoạt động gìn giữ hòa bình.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics battalion is responsible for transporting supplies to all regional branches of the company.\", \"vi\": \"Tiểu đoàn hậu cần chịu trách nhiệm vận chuyển hàng hóa đến tất cả các chi nhánh khu vực của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-ljspeech-a8306627.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-cori-a8306627.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/battalion-8638349b.webp', '[\"unit\", \"regiment\", \"division\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"logistics battalion\", \"meaning\": \"tiểu đoàn hậu cần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"military battalion\", \"meaning\": \"tiểu đoàn quân đội\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-cori-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru0-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru5-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru6-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru10-a8306627.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru9-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru3-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru7-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru8-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-aru2-a8306627.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-ljspeech-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt408-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt138-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt624-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt396-a8306627.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt498-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt132-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt288-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt42-a8306627.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/battalion-lt90-a8306627.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh tổ chức quân đội hoặc hậu cần quy mô lớn.', 'other', 1, 14),
('a4443377-85a3-55d3-9797-21f0d826c932', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'palaver', '/pəˈlɑːvə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Cuộc nói chuyện dài dòng, không cần thiết, hoặc sự ồn ào.', 'a lot of unnecessary talk, worry, or activity about something that is not important.', 'There was a lot of palaver over the minor details of the contract.', 'Có rất nhiều ồn ào về những chi tiết nhỏ của hợp đồng.', '{\"en\": \"We wasted two hours in a useless palaver about the office seating arrangement.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã lãng phí hai giờ đồng hồ thảo luận vô ích về việc sắp xếp chỗ ngồi trong văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-ljspeech-d61fba94.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-cori-d61fba94.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/palaver-117b94fc.webp', '[\"fuss\", \"commotion\", \"babble\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"what a palaver\", \"meaning\": \"thật là phiền phức, rắc rối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a palaver\", \"meaning\": \"làm ầm ĩ lên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"palaver\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-cori-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru0-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru5-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru6-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru10-d61fba94.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru9-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru3-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru7-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru8-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-aru2-d61fba94.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-ljspeech-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt408-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt138-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt624-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt396-d61fba94.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt498-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt132-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt288-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt42-d61fba94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/palaver-lt90-d61fba94.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng trong văn nói để chỉ sự phiền hà, rắc rối không đáng có.', 'office', 1, 15),
('d01a5fb2-656b-51f3-84ce-8975b1031cab', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'invigilate', '/ɪnˈvɪdʒɪleɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Giám sát thí sinh trong một kỳ thi để đảm bảo không ai gian lận.', 'to watch people taking an exam to make sure that they do not cheat.', 'University professors often have to invigilate exams at the end of the semester.', 'Các giáo sư đại học thường phải giám thị các kỳ thi vào cuối học kỳ.', '{\"en\": \"Two senior instructors were assigned to invigilate the certification exam in the main conference hall.\", \"vi\": \"Hai giảng viên dày dạn kinh nghiệm được phân công giám khảo kỳ thi cấp chứng chỉ tại hội trường chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-ljspeech-68044190.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-cori-68044190.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/invigilate-638f1e5f.webp', '[\"proctor\", \"supervise\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"invigilate an exam\", \"meaning\": \"giám thị một kỳ thi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be required to invigilate\", \"meaning\": \"được yêu cầu coi thi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"investigate\", \"note_vi\": \"investigate là điều tra, trong khi invigilate là coi thi/giám thị\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"invigilator\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"invigilation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-cori-68044190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-aru0-68044190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-aru5-68044190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-aru6-68044190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-aru10-68044190.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-aru9-68044190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invigilate-aru3-68044190.mp3\", 