('a0fe1f35-dce4-573b-bfce-996fa89f033f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'obstetric', 'UK: /ɒbˈstɛtrɪks/ | US: /əbˈstɛtrɪks/', 'C1', 'noun', 'khoa sản', 'The branch of medical science concerned with childbirth and the care of pregnant women.', 'She works in obstetrics at the local hospital.', 'Cô ấy làm việc tại khoa sản ở bệnh viện địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The newly built hospital wing includes a state-of-the-art obstetric department for expectant mothers.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nhà mới xây của bệnh viện bao gồm một khoa sản hiện đại dành cho các bà mẹ mang thai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-ljspeech-2af1b0ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-cori-2af1b0ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obstetric-ef48747f.webp', '[\"maternity\", \"midwifery\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"obstetric care\", \"meaning\": \"chăm sóc sản khoa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obstetric department\", \"meaning\": \"khoa sản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pediatric\", \"note_vi\": \"pediatric liên quan đến nhi khoa (trẻ em), còn obstetric liên quan đến sản khoa (mang thai và sinh nở).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obstetrics\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obstetrician\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-cori-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru0-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru5-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru6-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru10-2af1b0ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru9-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru3-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru7-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru8-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-aru2-2af1b0ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-ljspeech-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt408-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt138-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt624-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt396-2af1b0ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt498-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt132-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt288-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt42-2af1b0ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstetric-lt90-2af1b0ba.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thuộc thuật ngữ y tế, thường gặp dưới dạng tính từ \'obstetric care\' (chăm sóc sản khoa) hoặc danh từ số nhiều \'obstetrics\'.', 'health', 1, 19),
('ae12b058-790f-5926-a865-fb00ae343894', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'scoff', '/skɒf/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Chế giễu, cười nhạo hoặc coi thường ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'to speak about someone or something in a disrespectful and mocking way.', 'The critics scoffed at his new play, calling it unoriginal.', 'Các nhà phê bình chế giễu vở kịch mới của anh ấy, gọi nó là không có tính sáng tạo.', '{\"en\": \"Several board members scoffed at the proposal to reduce employee benefits next year.\", \"vi\": \"Một số thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã chế giễu đề xuất giảm phúc lợi nhân viên vào năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-ljspeech-a3bfd58c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-cori-a3bfd58c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scoff-6266aebf.webp', '[\"mock\", \"deride\", \"ridicule\"]', '[\"praise\", \"respect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scoff at\", \"meaning\": \"cười nhạo, coi thường cái gì/ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scorn\", \"note_vi\": \"scorn tỏ thái độ khinh bỉ, scoff thể hiện sự nhạo báng bằng lời nói.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"scoffer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-cori-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru0-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru5-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru6-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru10-a3bfd58c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru9-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru3-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru7-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru8-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-aru2-a3bfd58c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-ljspeech-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt408-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt138-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt624-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt396-a3bfd58c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt498-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt132-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt288-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt42-a3bfd58c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scoff-lt90-a3bfd58c.mp3\"]}}', 'Hầu như luôn đi cùng giới từ \'at\' (scoff at something).', 'office', 1, 20),
('b004b13d-e19e-5e02-bfd4-f703a090dba3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'perimeter', '/pəˈrɪmɪtə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Đường viền bao quanh một khu vực hoặc hình dạng.', 'the outer boundary enclosing a specific area or shape.', 'Security guards patrolled the perimeter of the fenced-off construction site.', 'Các nhân viên bảo vệ tuần tra chu vi của khu vực công trường được rào chắn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must display IDs when entering the secure perimeter of the office park.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải trình thẻ khi vào khu vực bảo mật xung quanh khuôn viên văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-ljspeech-94ef9c27.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-cori-94ef9c27.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/perimeter-500c97a7.webp', '[\"boundary\", \"border\", \"circumference\"]', '[\"center\", \"interior\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"building perimeter\", \"meaning\": \"chu vi tòa nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perimeter fence\", \"meaning\": \"hàng rào bao quanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perimeter wall\", \"meaning\": \"tường bao quanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"parameter\", \"note_vi\": \"parameter là tham số, không phải đường viền.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"perimetric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-cori-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru0-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru5-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru6-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru10-94ef9c27.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru9-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru3-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru7-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru8-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-aru2-94ef9c27.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-ljspeech-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt408-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt138-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt624-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt396-94ef9c27.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt498-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt132-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt288-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt42-94ef9c27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perimeter-lt90-94ef9c27.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm với parameter (tham số); perimeter là đường bao quanh.', 'office', 1, 21),
('69702def-aa09-56ca-8807-95e2ac96f0df', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'docket', '/ˈdɒkɪt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Lịch trình các vụ án được tòa án thụ lý.', 'a list of cases to be dealt with in a law court, or a list of things to do.', 'The judge had a full docket of cases to hear that day.', 'Vị thẩm phán có một danh sách đầy đủ các vụ án cần xét xử vào ngày hôm đó.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate lawyer checked the court docket to see when our patent infringement case would begin.\", \"vi\": \"Luật sư doanh nghiệp đã kiểm tra lịch trình tòa án để xem khi nào vụ án vi phạm bằng sáng chế của chúng ta sẽ bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-ljspeech-c3b7b314.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-cori-c3b7b314.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/docket-885d0f94.webp', '[\"schedule\", \"agenda\", \"list\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on the docket\", \"meaning\": \"nằm trong lịch trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"court docket\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trình tòa án\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pocket\", \"note_vi\": \"pocket là túi áo/quần, khác hoàn toàn nghĩa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"docket\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-cori-c3b7b314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-aru0-c3b7b314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-aru5-c3b7b314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-aru6-c3b7b314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-aru10-c3b7b314.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-aru9-c3b7b314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-aru3-c3b7b314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-aru7-c3b7b314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/docket-aru8-c3b7b314.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec