('234f0609-f849-501e-8837-316549eec154', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'dissent', '/dɪˈsent/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự không đồng ý, phản đối một ý kiến hoặc quyết định chung.', 'the feeling of not agreeing with an official opinion or a group decision.', 'There was strong dissent among the committee members regarding the new policy.', 'Có sự bất đồng mạnh mẽ giữa các thành viên ủy ban về chính sách mới.', '{\"en\": \"Despite some internal dissent, the board finally approved the merger agreement this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù có một số ý kiến bất đồng nội bộ, hội đồng quản trị cuối cùng đã phê duyệt thỏa thuận sáp nhập sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-ljspeech-de608d31.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-cori-de608d31.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dissent-1513d7a4.webp', '[\"disagreement\", \"opposition\"]', '[\"agreement\", \"consensus\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"express dissent\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự bất đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"internal dissent\", \"meaning\": \"bất đồng nội bộ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dissenting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-cori-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru0-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru5-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru6-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru10-de608d31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru9-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru3-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru7-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru8-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-aru2-de608d31.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-ljspeech-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt408-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt138-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt624-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt396-de608d31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt498-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt132-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt288-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt42-de608d31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissent-lt90-de608d31.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các cuộc họp hội đồng hoặc chính trị.', 'business', 1, 23),
('10d1b2a9-90bb-5680-aafa-3913fe31ad12', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'gangland', '/ˈɡæŋlænd/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Thế giới tội phạm có tổ chức, băng đảng.', 'the world of organized crime and violent criminal groups.', 'The documentary explored the notorious history of gangland violence in the city.', 'Bộ phim tài liệu đã khám phá lịch sử bạo lực khét tiếng của thế giới ngầm trong thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Security guards at the hotel received extra training to prevent gangland activity in the area.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ tại khách sạn đã được đào tạo thêm để ngăn chặn hoạt động của các băng đảng trong khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-ljspeech-af310f02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-cori-af310f02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gangland-2f600c85.webp', '[\"underworld\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gangland violence\", \"meaning\": \"bạo lực băng đảng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gangland killing\", \"meaning\": \"vụ chém giết của băng đảng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gang\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-cori-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru0-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru5-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru6-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru10-af310f02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru9-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru3-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru7-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru8-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-aru2-af310f02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-ljspeech-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt408-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt138-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt624-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt396-af310f02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt498-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt132-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt288-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt42-af310f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gangland-lt90-af310f02.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ ghép từ \'gang\' (băng nhóm) và \'land\' (vùng đất), chỉ thế giới ngầm.', 'law', 1, 24),
('bacba979-b5d6-550e-bc52-d1e2de6863a4', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'agitprop', '/ˈædʒɪtprɒp/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tuyên truyền chính trị, đặc biệt là thông qua nghệ thuật hoặc văn học.', 'political information used to influence people, often through creative works like art or writing.', 'The government used agitprop posters to spread its message to the public.', 'Chính phủ đã sử dụng các áp phích tuyên truyền để truyền bá thông điệp của mình đến công chúng.', '{\"en\": \"The company avoided using agitprop in its advertisements to maintain a neutral brand image.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tránh sử dụng tuyên truyền chính trị trong các quảng cáo để duy trì hình ảnh thương hiệu trung lập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-ljspeech-3e4db144.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-cori-3e4db144.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/agitprop-58f9b59c.webp', '[\"propaganda\", \"indoctrination\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"political agitprop\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên truyền chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use agitprop\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng tuyên truyền\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-cori-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru0-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru5-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru6-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru10-3e4db144.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru9-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru3-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru7-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru8-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-aru2-3e4db144.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-ljspeech-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt408-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt138-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt624-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt396-3e4db144.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt498-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt132-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt288-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt42-3e4db144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitprop-lt90-3e4db144.mp3\"]}}', 'từ này mang sắc thái tiêu cực, chỉ dùng trong ngữ cảnh chính trị hoặc phê bình.', 'media', 1, 25),
('cb85b1fe-b3d4-549f-b1d5-03152cb9dd59', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'hyperbola', '/haɪˈpɜːbələ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một đường cong hình học có hai nhánh mở rộng vô hạn, được tạo thành từ giao của mặt nón và mặt phẳng.', 'a symmetric curve with two branches formed by cutting a cone.', 'In mathematics, a hyperbola is defined by its two foci and constant difference in distances.', 'Trong toán học, một đường hyperbol được định nghĩa bởi hai tiêu điểm và hiệu khoảng cách không đổi.', '{\"en\": \"The engineering student plotted the hyperbola using software for the design task.\", \"vi\": \"Sinh viên kỹ thuật đã vẽ đường hyperbola bằng phần mềm cho bài tập thiết kế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-ljspeech-8880c793.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-cori-8880c793.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hyperbola-2f76bee5.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rectangular hyperbola\", \"meaning\": \"hyperbola chữ nhật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hyperbola branch\", \"meaning\": \"nhánh của hyperbola\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"parabola\", \"note_vi\": \"hyperbola có hai nhánh, parabola chỉ có một nhánh cong.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hyperbolic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-cori-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru0-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru5-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru6-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru10-8880c793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru9-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru3-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru7-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru8-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-aru2-8880c793.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-ljspeech-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt408-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt138-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt624-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt396-8880c793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt498-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt132-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt288-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt42-8880c793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hyperbola-lt90-8880c793.mp3\"]}}', 'Hyperbola là danh từ hình học, đừng nhầm với parabola (parabol).', 'academic', 1, 26),
('450ea9b2-c02a-5339-bcbb-a6675a381967', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'pudgy', '/ˈpʌdʒi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Hơi béo, mập mạp một cách dễ thương.', 'slightly fat and round in a soft, often cute way.', 'The puppy rested its pudgy paws on the owner\'s warm lap.', 'Chú chó con tựa những chiếc chân mập mạp lên đùi ấm áp của chủ nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The new product mascot featured a pudgy cartoon character that appealed to young customers.\", \"vi\": \"Linh vật của sản phẩm mới là một nhân vật hoạt hình mập mạp dễ thương thu hút khách hàng trẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-ljspeech-0ed1e985.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-cori-0ed1e985.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pudgy-0cb06986.webp', '[\"chubby\", \"plump\", \"tubby\"]', '[\"slim\", \"slender\", \"lean\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pudgy fingers\", \"meaning\": \"những ngón tay mũm mĩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pudgy cheeks\", \"meaning\": \"đôi má phúng phính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pudgy little hands\", \"meaning\": \"đôi bàn tay nhỏ mũm mĩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"podgy\", \"note_vi\": \"podgy là biến thể tiếng Anh Anh của pudgy, cùng nghĩa\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-cori-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru0-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru5-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru6-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru10-0ed1e985.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru9-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru3-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru7-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru8-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-aru2-0ed1e985.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-ljspeech-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt408-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt138-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt624-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt396-0ed1e985.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt498-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt132-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt288-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt42-0ed1e985.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudgy-lt90-0ed1e985.mp3\"]}}', 'Pudgy thường mang sắc thái dễ thương, dùng cho trẻ em hoặc vật nuôi; ít dùng cho người lớn.', 'daily', 1, 27),
('d373a992-a99b-5bb4-9351-8e2761bf4d91', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'denigrate', '/ˈdenɪɡreɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Nói xấu, bôi nhọ hoặc làm giảm giá trị của ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'to unfairly criticize a person or an achievement to make them appear unimportant.', 'It\'s unfair to denigrate someone\'s efforts just because you don\'t agree with them.', 'Thật không công bằng khi hạ thấp nỗ lực của ai đó chỉ vì bạn không đồng ý với họ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager urged staff not to denigrate competitor products during sales presentations to clients.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý kêu gọi nhân viên không nói xấu sản phẩm của đối thủ trong các buổi thuyết trình bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-ljspeech-137bcf03.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-cori-137bcf03.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/denigrate-6a737328.webp', '[\"disparage\", \"belittle\", \"defame\"]', '[\"praise\", \"extol\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"denigrate achievements\", \"meaning\": \"làm giảm giá trị thành tựu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"denigrate efforts\", \"meaning\": \"bôi nhọ, coi thường nỗ lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"derogate\", \"note_vi\": \"cả hai đều gièm pha, nhưng derogate hay đi kèm từ \'from\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"denigration\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"denigrative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-cori-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru0-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru5-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru6-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru10-137bcf03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru9-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru3-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru7-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru8-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-aru2-137bcf03.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-ljspeech-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt408-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt138-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt624-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt396-137bcf03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt498-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt132-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt288-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt42-137bcf03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denigrate-lt90-137bcf03.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi trực tiếp với tân ngữ mà không cần giới từ.', 'business', 1, 28),
('d379e511-bf5e-5ff5-9ecc-55df7cd841c7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c6ac9b63-ca2f-5f66-ad46-589c01526136', '176580e4-bbf1-5965-8cb8-091e6febcb3d', 'reluctantly', '/rɪˈlʌktəntli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách miễn cưỡng, không tình nguyện hoặc do dự.', 'doing something in a way that shows you do not really want to.', 'He reluctantly agreed to help with the extra work, even though he was already busy.', 'Anh ấy miễn cưỡng đồng ý giúp làm thêm việc, mặc dù anh ấy đã bận rộn rồi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager reluctantly accepted the resignation of his most experienced sales supervisor yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã miễn cưỡng chấp nhận đơn xin nghỉ việc của giám sát bán hàng giàu kinh nghiệm nhất vào hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-ljspeech-3212e692.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-cori-3212e692.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reluctantly-cf135130.webp', '[\"unwillingly\", \"hesitantly\", \"grudgingly\"]', '[\"willingly\", \"eagerly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"agree reluctantly\", \"meaning\": \"miễn cưỡng đồng ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reluctantly accept\", \"meaning\": \"miễn cưỡng chấp nhận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reluctant\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reluctance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-cori-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru0-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru5-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru6-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru10-3212e692.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru9-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru3-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru7-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru8-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-aru2-3212e692.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-ljspeech-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt408-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt138-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt624-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt396-3212e692.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt498-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt132-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt288-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt42-3212e692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reluctantly-lt90-3212e692.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ hay gặp trong TOEIC: reluctantly accept/agree (miễn cưỡng chấp nhận/đồng ý).', 'office', 1, 29),
('0125f101-519e-5edb-9449-6b5417d60a32', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'coronation', '/ˌkɒrəˈneɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Nghi lễ chính thức trao vương miện cho một vị vua hoặc nữ hoàng.', 'a ceremony at which a person is formally crowned as a king or queen.', 'Millions watched the historic coronation of the new monarch on television.', 'Hàng triệu người đã theo dõi lễ đăng quang lịch sử của vị vua mới trên truyền hình.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency designed special tour packages for tourists attending the royal coronation ceremony.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty lữ hành đã thiết kế các gói tour đặc biệt cho du khách tham dự lễ đăng quang của hoàng gia.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-ljspeech-75763b63.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-cori-75763b63.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coronation-6c46a4b1.webp', '[\"crowning\", \"enthronement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coronation ceremony\", \"meaning\": \"lễ đăng quang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"royal coronation\", \"meaning\": \"lễ đăng quang hoàng gia\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coronate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-cori-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru0-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru5-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru6-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru10-75763b63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru9-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru3-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru7-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru8-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-aru2-75763b63.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-ljspeech-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt408-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt138-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt624-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt396-75763b63.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt498-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt132-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt288-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt42-75763b63.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coronation-lt90-75763b63.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này bắt nguồn từ \"corona\" nghĩa là vương miện trong tiếng Latin.', 'travel', 1, 0),
('b34b00e7-0ebb-5f13-910a-8a995c700074', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'peppy', '/ˈpepi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'đầy năng lượng, sôi nổi, hoạt bát', 'full of high energy, enthusiasm, and lively movement.', 'She always starts her day with a peppy song to boost her mood.', 'Cô ấy luôn bắt đầu ngày mới bằng một bài hát sôi nổi để cải thiện tâm trạng.', '{\"en\": \"The trainer led a peppy morning session to keep conference participants awake.\", \"vi\": \"Huấn luyện viên đã dẫn dắt một buổi sáng đầy năng lượng để giữ cho các tham dự viên hội thảo tỉnh táo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-ljspeech-ade39519.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-cori-ade39519.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/peppy-31e21e77.webp', '[\"lively\", \"energetic\", \"spirited\"]', '[\"sluggish\", \"lethargic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"peppy music\", \"meaning\": \"nhạc sôi động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"peppy mood\", \"meaning\": \"tâm trạng vui tươi, tràn đầy năng lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"poppy\", \"note_vi\": \"poppy là hoa anh túc, peppy mới là tính từ nghĩa sôi nổi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pep\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-cori-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru0-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru5-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru6-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru10-ade39519.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru9-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru3-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru7-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru8-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-aru2-ade39519.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-ljspeech-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt408-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt138-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt624-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt396-ade39519.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt498-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt132-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt288-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt42-ade39519.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/peppy-lt90-ade39519.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ mang tính thân mật (informal), tả không khí, âm nhạc hoặc tính cách.', 'hr', 1, 1),
('32f43c4c-8c6a-5288-85d3-a884240aed87', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'quirky', '/ˈkwɜːki/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có những nét tính cách hoặc hành vi hơi lạ, độc đáo nhưng thường dễ thương.', 'having unusual habits or qualities that are attractive and interesting.', 'Her quirky sense of humor always makes people laugh.', 'Khiếu hài hước kỳ quặc của cô ấy luôn khiến mọi người bật cười.', '{\"en\": \"The boutique hotel is famous for its quirky design and excellent customer service.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn boutique này nổi tiếng với thiết kế độc đáo, kỳ lạ và dịch vụ khách hàng xuất sắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-ljspeech-78f3b7ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-cori-78f3b7ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quirky-3b0a34da.webp', '[\"eccentric\", \"unconventional\", \"peculiar\"]', '[\"conventional\", \"normal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"quirky sense of humor\", \"meaning\": \"khiếu hài hước độc đáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quirky character\", \"meaning\": \"tính cách kỳ lạ thú vị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"weird\", \"note_vi\": \"weird mang nghĩa kỳ dị, tiêu cực hơn so với sự độc đáo dễ thương của quirky.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"quirk\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"quirkiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-cori-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru0-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru5-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru6-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru10-78f3b7ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru9-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru3-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru7-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru8-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-aru2-78f3b7ef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-ljspeech-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt408-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt138-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt624-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt396-78f3b7ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt498-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt132-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt288-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt42-78f3b7ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quirky-lt90-78f3b7ef.mp3\"]}}', 'Quirky thường mang nghĩa tích cực, chỉ sự độc lạ, đáng yêu chứ không phải điên rồ.', 'travel', 1, 2),
('df828552-f2e0-5a6b-bff3-c445ee25cc9a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'alcohol', '/ˈælkəhɒl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Chất lỏng không màu, dễ cháy, được dùng làm dung môi, nhiên liệu hoặc có trong đồ uống có cồn.', 'a clear liquid that can make people drunk and is used in drinks and medicine.', 'Many hand sanitizers contain a high percentage of alcohol to kill germs effectively.', 'Nhiều nước rửa tay có chứa tỷ lệ cồn cao để diệt khuẩn hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The company policy strictly prohibits serving alcohol during regular working hours.\", \"vi\": \"Quy định của công ty nghiêm cấm phục vụ đồ uống có cồn trong giờ làm việc bình thường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-ljspeech-52efcb6c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-cori-52efcb6c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/alcohol-821946c2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"alcohol consumption\", \"meaning\": \"việc tiêu thụ đồ uống có cồn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rubbing alcohol\", \"meaning\": \"cồn y tế sát trùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"alcoholic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-cori-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru0-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru5-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru6-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru10-52efcb6c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru9-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru3-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru7-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru8-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-aru2-52efcb6c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-ljspeech-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt408-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt138-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt624-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt396-52efcb6c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt498-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt132-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt288-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt42-52efcb6c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alcohol-lt90-52efcb6c.mp3\"]}}', 'Alcohol là danh từ không đếm được khi nói về chất cồn hoặc đồ uống có cồn.', 'dining', 1, 3)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('c87e2a8c-2ea4-5456-a616-77b3717858f6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'recidivism', '/rɪˈsɪdɪvɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng tái phạm tội hoặc tái nghiện sau khi đã được cải tạo.', 'the act of repeating an unwanted behavior or crime after being punished.', 'Vocational training courses help former offenders find jobs, thereby lowering rates of recidivism.', 'Các khóa đào tạo nghề giúp những người từng phạm tội tìm được việc làm, từ đó hạ thấp tỷ lệ tái phạm.', '{\"en\": \"The government funded vocational training programs to reduce recidivism among former employees who broke laws.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đã tài trợ cho các chương trình đào tạo nghề để giảm tỷ lệ tái phạm tội của những cựu nhân viên từng vi phạm pháp luật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-ljspeech-fa5e5228.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-cori-fa5e5228.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recidivism-6c44191a.webp', '[\"relapse\", \"backsliding\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rate of recidivism\", \"meaning\": \"tỷ lệ tái phạm tội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduce recidivism\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu sự tái phạm tội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"relapse\", \"note_vi\": \"relapse thường dùng cho y tế/sức khỏe (tái phát bệnh), recidivism dùng cho luật pháp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"recidivist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"recidivous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-cori-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru0-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru5-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru6-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru10-fa5e5228.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru9-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru3-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru7-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru8-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-aru2-fa5e5228.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-ljspeech-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt408-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt138-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt624-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt396-fa5e5228.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt498-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt132-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt288-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt42-fa5e5228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recidivism-lt90-fa5e5228.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh luật pháp và tội phạm học.', 'law', 1, 4),
('5a4dc8bb-cd3e-54fb-9636-326351afc6e7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'inadvertently', 'UK: /ˌɪnədˈvɜːtəntli/ | US: /ˌɪnədˈvɜːrtəntli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'vô tình', 'Done without intent, planning, or full attention to what one is doing.', 'He inadvertently deleted the important file.', 'Anh ấy vô tình xóa tập tin quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The confidential report was inadvertently attached to the public newsletter.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo bảo mật đã vô tình được đính kèm vào bản tin công khai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-ljspeech-0142d5e8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-cori-0142d5e8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inadvertently-89ee6d2d.webp', '[\"unintentionally\", \"accidentally\", \"unwittingly\", \"by mistake\"]', '[\"intentionally\", \"deliberately\", \"purposely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inadvertently delete\", \"meaning\": \"vô tình xóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inadvertently omit\", \"meaning\": \"sơ suất bỏ sót\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adversely\", \"note_vi\": \"\'adversely\' nghĩa là tiêu cực/bất lợi (từ \'adverse\'), tránh nhầm phát âm với \'inadvertently\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inadvertent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-cori-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru0-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru5-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru6-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru10-0142d5e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru9-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru3-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru7-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru8-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-aru2-0142d5e8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-ljspeech-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt408-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt138-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt624-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt396-0142d5e8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt498-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt132-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt288-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt42-0142d5e8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inadvertently-lt90-0142d5e8.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ thể hiện sự vô ý hoặc sơ suất dẫn đến sai sót ngoài mong muốn.', 'office', 1, 5),
('6a5dbb78-9f60-5b88-92e2-6b82855dc378', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'stow', 'UK: /stəʊ/ | US: /stoʊ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'cất giữ gọn gàng', 'to pack or store items away neatly and securely in a designated space.', 'Please stow your luggage in the overhead compartment.', 'Vui lòng cất hành lý của bạn vào ngăn chứa đồ phía trên.', '{\"en\": \"Passengers are requested to stow their carry-on bags safely before takeoff.\", \"vi\": \"Hành khách được yêu cầu cất gọn hành lý xách tay an toàn trước khi cất cánh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-ljspeech-e66cf34d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-cori-e66cf34d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stow-6be84482.webp', '[\"pack\", \"store\", \"stash\"]', '[\"unpack\", \"remove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stow away\", \"meaning\": \"cất giấu gọn gàng / trốn trên tàu xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stow carry-on luggage\", \"meaning\": \"cất hành lý xách tay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stowage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-cori-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru0-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru5-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru6-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru10-e66cf34d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru9-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru3-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru7-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru8-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-aru2-e66cf34d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-ljspeech-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt408-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt138-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt624-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt396-e66cf34d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt498-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt132-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt288-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt42-e66cf34d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stow-lt90-e66cf34d.mp3\"]}}', '\'Stow\' rất hay xuất hiện trong hướng dẫn an toàn bay: \'stow your hand luggage under the seat/in the overhead bin\'.', 'travel', 1, 6),
('b7bbfa1d-0d3c-5a6c-baef-6081ca04d402', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'outlandish', '/aʊtˈlændɪʃ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất lạ lùng, kỳ dị hoặc bất thường.', 'looking or sounding very strange, unusual, and difficult to accept or like.', 'The startup founder made several outlandish claims regarding their expected revenue growth.', 'Nhà sáng lập công ty khởi nghiệp đã đưa ra nhiều tuyên bố kỳ quặc liên quan đến tăng trưởng doanh thu dự kiến của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team rejected the outlandish proposal because it would cost too much money.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã bác bỏ đề xuất kỳ dị đó vì nó sẽ tốn quá nhiều tiền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-ljspeech-5056bd29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-cori-5056bd29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outlandish-44128a1a.webp', '[\"bizarre\", \"weird\", \"eccentric\"]', '[\"ordinary\", \"normal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"outlandish idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng kỳ dị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outlandish claim\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố kỳ lạ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"outstanding\", \"note_vi\": \"outstanding là xuất sắc, nổi bật; outlandish là kỳ dị.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"outlandishly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-cori-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru0-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru5-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru6-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru10-5056bd29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru9-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru3-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru7-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru8-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-aru2-5056bd29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-ljspeech-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt408-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt138-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt624-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt396-5056bd29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt498-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt132-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt288-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt42-5056bd29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outlandish-lt90-5056bd29.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực, chỉ sự kỳ quặc đến mức khó chấp nhận.', 'business', 1, 7),
('b1ac2600-12bc-53e9-92bc-8068551a8272', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'anaphora', '/əˈnæfərə/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Phép tu từ lặp lại từ hoặc cụm từ ở đầu câu.', 'the act of repeating a word or phrase at the beginning of several sentences.', 'The speech used anaphora effectively with the phrase \"I have a dream.\"', 'Bài phát biểu đã sử dụng phép trùng lặp một cách hiệu quả với cụm từ \"Tôi có một giấc mơ.\"', '{\"en\": \"The marketing manager used anaphora in the presentation to make the brand message more memorable.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị đã sử dụng phép điệp từ trong bài thuyết trình để làm thông điệp thương hiệu đáng nhớ hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-ljspeech-b76a13f8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-cori-b76a13f8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anaphora-69478222.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rhetorical device\", \"meaning\": \"biện pháp tu từ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use anaphora\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng phép điệp từ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-cori-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru0-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru5-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru6-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru10-b76a13f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru9-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru3-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru7-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru8-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-aru2-b76a13f8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-ljspeech-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt408-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt138-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt624-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt396-b76a13f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt498-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt132-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt288-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt42-b76a13f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anaphora-lt90-b76a13f8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ chuyên môn về ngôn ngữ học và kỹ năng thuyết trình.', 'marketing', 1, 8),
('751e56e6-35b2-5d72-8cc7-e445fe44fd1c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'glaciation', '/ˌɡleɪsiˈeɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự hình thành hoặc tác động của sông băng; thời kỳ băng hà.', 'the process by which glaciers form and spread across land, or a period when this happened.', 'The landscape was dramatically altered by repeated periods of glaciation.', 'Cảnh quan đã bị thay đổi đáng kể bởi các thời kỳ băng hà lặp đi lặp lại.', '{\"en\": \"The geology report explained how glaciation shaped the valley\'s current landscape over time.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo địa chất giải thích cách sự băng hà đã định hình cảnh quan hiện tại của thung lũng theo thời gian.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-ljspeech-3a11d1df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-cori-3a11d1df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glaciation-1973c894.webp', '[\"ice age\", \"glacial period\"]', '[\"deglaciation\", \"interglacial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"period of glaciation\", \"meaning\": \"thời kỳ băng hà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"glaciation process\", \"meaning\": \"quá trình băng hà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"repeated glaciation\", \"meaning\": \"băng hà lặp đi lặp lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"glacier\", \"note_vi\": \"glacier là khối băng cụ thể; glaciation là quá trình hoặc thời kỳ hình thành băng hà\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"glacier\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"glacial\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"glaciate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-cori-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru0-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru5-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru6-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru10-3a11d1df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru9-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru3-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru7-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru8-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-aru2-3a11d1df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-ljspeech-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt408-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt138-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt624-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt396-3a11d1df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt498-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt132-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt288-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt42-3a11d1df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glaciation-lt90-3a11d1df.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ học thuật về địa lý/khoa học; gốc \'glaci\' từ tiếng Latin nghĩa là băng, dễ nhớ qua \'glacier\'.', 'nature', 1, 9),
('cfbff579-bd05-5981-8af9-2e960ce3b43b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'bungle', '/ˈbʌŋɡl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm hỏng việc gì đó do vụng về hoặc thiếu năng lực.', 'to do something badly or fail to complete a task because of a mistake.', 'The inexperienced assistant managed to bungle the simple task.', 'Người trợ lý thiếu kinh nghiệm đã làm hỏng nhiệm vụ đơn giản đó.', '{\"en\": \"The new clerk May bungle the account setup process if he receives no proper guidance.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mới có thể làm hỏng quá trình cài đặt tài khoản nếu không nhận được sự hướng dẫn phù hợp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-ljspeech-3b22e1e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-cori-3b22e1e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bungle-ffef3c3a.webp', '[\"botch\", \"mishandle\", \"spoil\"]', '[\"succeed\", \"manage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bungle a job\", \"meaning\": \"làm hỏng một công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bungle an attempt\", \"meaning\": \"làm hỏng một nỗ lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bundle\", \"note_vi\": \"bundle có nghĩa là bó, gói, không phải làm hỏng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bungler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-cori-3b22e1e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-aru0-3b22e1e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-aru5-3b22e1e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-aru6-3b22e1e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-aru10-3b22e1e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-aru9-3b22e1e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-aru3-3b22e1e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-aru7-3b22e1e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bungle-aru8-3b22e1e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v