('8f9e32a5-e7e2-5aa4-a113-81c2dbe7ad32', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'catalyst', '/ˈkætəlɪst/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Chất hoặc yếu tố gây ra hoặc thúc đẩy một sự thay đổi.', 'a person or thing that causes a significant change or event to happen more quickly.', 'Her innovative idea acted as a catalyst for the entire team\'s creativity.', 'Ý tưởng đổi mới của cô ấy đóng vai trò là chất xúc tác cho sự sáng tạo của toàn đội.', '{\"en\": \"The new software update served as a catalyst for improving our office productivity levels.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm mới đóng vai trò là chất xúc tác để cải thiện mức năng suất văn phòng của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-ljspeech-c6482363.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-cori-c6482363.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catalyst-fa9b2c14.webp', '[\"stimulus\", \"impetus\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"act as a catalyst\", \"meaning\": \"đóng vai trò là chất xúc tác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a catalyst for change\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố thúc đẩy sự thay đổi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"catalyze\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-cori-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru0-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru5-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru6-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru10-c6482363.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru9-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru3-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru7-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru8-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-aru2-c6482363.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-ljspeech-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt408-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt138-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt624-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt396-c6482363.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt498-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt132-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt288-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt42-c6482363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catalyst-lt90-c6482363.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong ngữ cảnh kinh doanh để chỉ những yếu tố tạo ra bước ngoặt.', 'business', 1, 23),
('22033799-7b34-522d-85d6-461e78e1f1d1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'surpass', 'UK: /səˈpɑːs/ | US: /sərˈpæs/', 'C1', 'verb', 'vượt qua, trội hơn', 'To exceed or be greater in quality, degree, or quantity than expected or intended.', 'Sales have surpassed expectations this year.', 'Doanh số đã vượt quá mong đợi trong năm nay.', '{\"en\": \"This quarter\'s revenue surpassed our initial financial forecasts by 15 percent.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh thu quý này đã vượt qua dự báo tài chính ban đầu của chúng tôi 15 phần trăm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-ljspeech-c78b573c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-cori-c78b573c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surpass-dd135020.webp', '[\"exceed\", \"outperform\", \"excel\"]', '[\"fail\", \"fall short of\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"surpass expectations\", \"meaning\": \"vượt quá kỳ vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surpass targets\", \"meaning\": \"vượt chỉ tiêu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unsurpassed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-cori-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru0-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru5-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru6-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru10-c78b573c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru9-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru3-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru7-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru8-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-aru2-c78b573c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-ljspeech-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt408-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt138-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt624-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt396-c78b573c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt498-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt132-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt288-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt42-c78b573c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surpass-lt90-c78b573c.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'surpass\' mang nghĩa vượt qua chỉ tiêu/kỳ vọng, đi trực tiếp với tân ngữ (surpass expectations/targets), không dùng \'than\'.', 'finance', 1, 24),
('82a116ba-eb34-5d15-86c1-9017e13dc2b3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'infinitesimal', '/ˌɪnfɪnɪˈtesɪml/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Rất nhỏ, không đáng kể.', 'Extremely minute to a degree that makes detection or precise measurement difficult.', 'Only an infinitesimal amount of impurities remained in the chemical solution after filtration.', 'Chỉ còn một lượng tạp chất cực kỳ nhỏ bé trong dung dịch hóa chất sau khi lọc.', '{\"en\": \"There was an infinitesimal change in the production cost after we upgraded the old machinery.\", \"vi\": \"Có một sự thay đổi nhỏ không đáng kể trong chi phí sản xuất sau khi chúng tôi nâng cấp máy móc cũ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-ljspeech-3a44cf38.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-cori-3a44cf38.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infinitesimal-dcb091c6.webp', '[\"tiny\", \"minute\"]', '[\"huge\", \"enormous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"infinitesimal amount\", \"meaning\": \"lượng rất nhỏ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-cori-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru0-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru5-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru6-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru10-3a44cf38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru9-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru3-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru7-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru8-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-aru2-3a44cf38.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-ljspeech-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt408-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt138-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt624-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt396-3a44cf38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt498-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt132-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt288-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt42-3a44cf38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infinitesimal-lt90-3a44cf38.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong kỹ thuật hoặc báo cáo tài chính để chỉ sự sai lệch nhỏ.', 'manufacturing', 1, 25),
('dd0336e9-1fc1-55a7-be5d-e90ca219492b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'oviparous', '/əʊˈvɪpərəs/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Động vật sinh sản bằng cách đẻ trứng.', 'producing eggs that hatch outside the body of the mother animal.', 'Reptiles such as turtles are oviparous animals that bury their eggs in sandy beaches.', 'Các loài bò sát như rùa là động vật đẻ trứng, chúng chôn trứng của mình trên các bãi biển cát.', '{\"en\": \"The nature documentary about oviparous animals attracted millions of viewers online yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phim tài liệu thiên nhiên về động vật đẻ trứng đã thu hút hàng triệu người xem trực tuyến vào ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-ljspeech-751221a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-cori-751221a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oviparous-75fd3b48.webp', NULL, '[\"viviparous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"oviparous species\", \"meaning\": \"loài đẻ trứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oviparous animals\", \"meaning\": \"động vật đẻ trứng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"viviparous\", \"note_vi\": \"động vật sinh con chứ không đẻ trứng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"oviparity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-cori-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru0-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru5-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru6-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru10-751221a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru9-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru3-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru7-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru8-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-aru2-751221a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-ljspeech-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt408-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt138-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt624-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt396-751221a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt498-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt132-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt288-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt42-751221a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oviparous-lt90-751221a7.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc ovi- nghĩa là trứng (tương tự oval, ovary).', 'nature', 1, 26),
('3dba8c73-c918-5e53-8a21-0d821d68348d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'c892dd41-8fb9-5ae0-903b-5d424b401787', 'ac803cc8-9617-53ce-831b-2d93eda1f8c5', 'pamphleteer', '/ˌpæmfləˈtɪə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Người viết và phát hành các tập sách nhỏ (pamphlet) về các vấn đề chính trị hoặc xã hội.', 'a person who writes and distributes small books to share strong opinions on public issues.', 'During the revolution, many pamphleteers spread their ideas through short, persuasive writings.', 'Trong cuộc cách mạng, nhiều người viết tờ rơi đã truyền bá ý tưởng của họ thông qua các bài viết ngắn, thuyết phục.', '{\"en\": \"The local pamphleteer distributed flyers outside the station to protest against the new tax policy.\", \"vi\": \"Người viết truyền đơn địa phương đã phát tờ rơi bên ngoài nhà ga để phản đối chính sách thuế mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-ljspeech-ce4f20f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-cori-ce4f20f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pamphleteer-4e8c56eb.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pamphlet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-cori-ce4f20f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru0-ce4f20f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru5-ce4f20f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru6-ce4f20f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru10-ce4f20f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru9-ce4f20f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru3-ce4f20f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru7-ce4f20f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru8-ce4f20f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pamphleteer-aru2-ce4f20f4.mp3\"]