('19b9230d-3820-51b5-a4c2-29b94db24a24', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cbe3002f-52f8-52b1-a2dc-da72783b8179', '212f8151-546a-545c-b4e2-0cd74cb4c156', 'ball bearing', '/bɔːl beərɪŋ/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Bạc đạn, một bộ phận cơ khí giúp giảm ma sát.', 'a small metal ring containing small steel spheres that helps machinery parts turn smoothly.', 'The smooth operation of the machine depends on the quality of its ball bearings.', 'Hoạt động trơn tru của cỗ máy phụ thuộc vào chất lượng của các bạc đạn của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance engineer ordered high-quality steel ball bearings for the conveyor system.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ sư bảo trì đã đặt mua các bạc đạn thép chất lượng cao cho hệ thống băng tải.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-ljspeech-807d7d59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-cori-807d7d59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ball-bearing-a7d855e7.webp', '[\"roller bearing\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ball bearing assembly\", \"meaning\": \"cụm vòng bi / bạc đạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sealed ball bearing\", \"meaning\": \"vòng bi kín dầu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-cori-807d7d59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru0-807d7d59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru5-807d7d59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru6-807d7d59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru10-807d7d59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru9-807d7d59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru3-807d7d59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru7-807d7d59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru8-807d7d59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ball-bearing-aru