('efb9b6ad-81f0-5f1d-b76f-da54203c1bbe', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cbe3002f-52f8-52b1-a2dc-da72783b8179', '212f8151-546a-545c-b4e2-0cd74cb4c156', 'bland', '/blænd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không có hương vị mạnh hoặc đặc trưng; nhạt nhẽo.', 'having very little taste or not having a strong or interesting flavor.', 'The hospital food was quite bland, lacking any strong seasoning.', 'Thức ăn ở bệnh viện khá nhạt nhẽo, không có bất kỳ gia vị đậm đà nào.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service received complaints that the main course was too bland for the guests.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ cung cấp suất ăn đã nhận được khiếu nại rằng món chính quá nhạt nhẽo đối với các vị khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-ljspeech-efb61c7f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-cori-efb61c7f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bland-9f8a23e5.webp', '[\"tasteless\", \"flavorless\"]', '[\"tasty\", \"flavorful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bland food\", \"meaning\": \"thức ăn nhạt nhẽo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bland taste\", \"meaning\": \"vị nhạt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-cori-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru0-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru5-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru6-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru10-efb61c7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru9-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru3-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru7-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru8-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-aru2-efb61c7f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bland-ljspeech-efb61c7f.mp3\", \"/