('64c9f456-440c-514b-b181-2549ac6066c1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cbe3002f-52f8-52b1-a2dc-da72783b8179', '212f8151-546a-545c-b4e2-0cd74cb4c156', 'loot', '/luːt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cướp bóc tài sản, thường trong tình trạng hỗn loạn hoặc chiến tranh.', 'to steal valuable goods from a place during a violent event or crisis.', 'After the riot, several shops were looted by opportunistic individuals.', 'Sau cuộc bạo loạn, một số cửa hàng đã bị những kẻ cơ hội cướp phá.', '{\"en\": \"Security guards were stationed outside the retail store so nobody would loot the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo vệ đã được bố trí bên ngoài cửa hàng bán lẻ để không ai cướp bóc kho hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-ljspeech-7a616a8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-cori-7a616a8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/loot-26ea7fe2.webp', '[\"plunder\", \"rob\", \"ransack\"]', '[\"protect\", \"guard\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"loot stores\", \"meaning\": \"cướp bóc cửa hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"loot property\", \"meaning\": \"cướp phá tài sản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"root\", \"note_vi\": \"rễ cây hoặc cổ vũ, khác với loot (cướp bóc)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"loot\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"looter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-cori-7a616a8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-aru0-7a616a8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-aru5-7a616a8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-aru6-7a616a8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-aru10-7a616a8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-aru9-7a616a8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-aru3-7a616a8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-aru7-7a616a8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/loot-aru8-7a616a8f.mp3\", \"/storag