('d8cc38be-e220-51fa-9571-4f21d15b9252', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cbe3002f-52f8-52b1-a2dc-da72783b8179', '212f8151-546a-545c-b4e2-0cd74cb4c156', 'resit', '/ˈriːsɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Thi lại một kỳ thi mà bạn đã trượt hoặc muốn cải thiện điểm.', 'to take an exam again because you failed or want to improve your mark.', 'If you fail the exam, you will have a chance to resit it next month.', 'Nếu bạn trượt kỳ thi, bạn sẽ có cơ hội thi lại vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must resit the safety certification exam if they fail their first attempt.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải thi lại kỳ thi chứng chỉ an toàn nếu họ trượt ở lần thử đầu tiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-ljspeech-1dab1c55.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-cori-1dab1c55.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/resit-0c2a89ae.webp', '[\"retake\", \"re-examine\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"resit an exam\", \"meaning\": \"thi lại một kỳ thi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"resit a test\", \"meaning\": \"thi lại bài kiểm tra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"re-sit\", \"note_vi\": \"Cách viết khác có dấu gạch nối, nghĩa không đổi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"resit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-cori-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru0-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru5-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru6-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru10-1dab1c55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru9-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru3-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru7-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru8-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-aru2-1dab1c55.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-ljspeech-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt408-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt138-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt624-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt396-1dab1c55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt498-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt132-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt288-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt42-1dab1c55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resit-lt90-1dab1c55.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này rất phổ biến trong tiếng Anh-Anh (British English).', 'education', 1, 22),
('2596101b-a568-572d-b76d-32f011a36fdd', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cbe3002f-52f8-52b1-a2dc-da72783b8179', '212f8151-546a-545c-b4e2-0cd74cb4c156', 'overindulgent', '/ˌəʊvərɪnˈdʌldʒənt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Quá mức khoan dung hoặc nuông chiều, đặc biệt là với trẻ em.', 'allowing someone to have everything they want, often in a way that is not helpful or healthy.', 'Some parents fear being overindulgent will spoil their children.', 'Một số bậc cha mẹ sợ rằng việc quá nuông chiều sẽ làm hư con cái.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was overindulgent with the staff, leading to a lack of discipline in the office.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã quá nuông chiều nhân viên, dẫn đến việc thiếu kỷ luật trong văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-ljspeech-c8117d6e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-cori-c8117d6e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overindulgent-f70d0501.webp', '[\"lenient\", \"permissive\"]', '[\"strict\", \"severe\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"overindulgent parent\", \"meaning\": \"cha mẹ quá nuông chiều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overindulgent behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi quá nuông chiều\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"overindulgence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-cori-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru0-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru5-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru6-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru10-c8117d6e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru9-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru3-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru7-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru8-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-aru2-c8117d6e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-ljspeech-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt408-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt138-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt624-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt396-c8117d6e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt498-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt132-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt288-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt42-c8117d6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overindulgent-lt90-c8117d6e.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'indulge\' (chiều chuộng), thêm \'over\' để nhấn mạnh sự quá mức tiêu cực.', 'hr', 1, 23),
('07c8e037-34c5-5037-bc4c-67753f60259f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cbe3002f-52f8-52b1-a2dc-da72783b8179', '212f8151-546a-545c-b4e2-0cd74cb4c156', 'stalwart', '/ˈstɔːlwət/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Kiên định, trung thành và mạnh mẽ.', 'loyal, reliable, and hardworking, especially for a particular cause or team.', 'She was a stalwart supporter of the team through both good and bad seasons.', 'Cô ấy là một người ủng hộ kiên định của đội bóng qua cả những mùa giải thành công và thất bại.', '{\"en\": \"He has been a stalwart employee, working for the firm for over twenty years.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy là một nhân viên trung thành, đã làm việc cho công ty hơn hai mươi năm rồi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-ljspeech-131d3831.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-cori-131d3831.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stalwart-829c3079.webp', '[\"loyal\", \"dependable\"]', '[\"disloyal\", \"unreliable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stalwart supporter\", \"meaning\": \"người ủng hộ kiên định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stalwart member\", \"meaning\": \"thành viên trung thành\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-cori-131d3831.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru0-131d3831.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru5-131d3831.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru6-131d3831.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru10-131d3831.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru9-131d3831.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru3-131d3831.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru7-131d3831.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru8-131d3831.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalwart-aru2-131d3831.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/st