('ce600d76-3f50-5c5b-aa32-9b9daf6c5674', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cdbac910-7fa0-5df8-a385-eefabd770916', '48021502-5763-51e7-b276-d0895d21613a', 'luxuriant', '/lʌɡˈʒʊəriənt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Xum xuê, um tùm và phát triển phong phú.', 'growing very thickly and in a healthy way, often used for plants or hair.', 'The tropical rainforest was full of luxuriant vegetation and exotic plants.', 'Rừng nhiệt đới đầy những thảm thực vật xum xuê và cây cối kỳ lạ.', '{\"en\": \"The landscaping team maintained the luxuriant gardens surrounding the corporate headquarters throughout the summer season.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ cảnh quan đã chăm sóc những khu vườn xum xuê bao quanh trụ sở công ty trong suốt mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-ljspeech-5133e32f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-cori-5133e32f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/luxuriant-ac193717.webp', '[\"lush\", \"abundant\"]', '[\"sparse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"luxuriant growth\", \"meaning\": \"sự phát triển xum xuê\"}, {\"phrase\": \"luxuriant vegetation\", \"meaning\": \"thảm thực vật tươi tốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"luxurious\", \"note_vi\": \"Luxuriant là tươi tốt/xum xuê; luxurious là sang trọng/đắt tiền.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"luxury\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-cori-5133e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-aru0-5133e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-aru5-5133e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-aru6-5133e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-aru10-5133e32f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-aru9-5133e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-aru3-5133e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/luxuriant-aru7-5133e32f.mp3\