('3b342991-3026-5b8a-a055-cd0d6ba1edba', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cdbac910-7fa0-5df8-a385-eefabd770916', '48021502-5763-51e7-b276-d0895d21613a', 'metaverse', '/ˈmet.ə.vɜːs/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một không gian ảo ba chiều, nơi người dùng có thể tương tác với nhau và với môi trường số.', 'a virtual computer space where people can interact with each other digitally.', 'Many companies are investing in the metaverse, hoping to create new digital experiences.', 'Nhiều công ty đang đầu tư vào metaverse, hy vọng tạo ra những trải nghiệm kỹ thuật số mới.', '{\"en\": \"The tech startup hosted its annual shareholder meeting inside a virtual metaverse platform.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp công nghệ đã tổ chức cuộc họp cổ đông hàng năm bên trong một nền tảng vũ trụ ảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-ljspeech-9c3944ce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-cori-9c3944ce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/metaverse-06971c36.webp', '[\"virtual world\", \"cyberspace\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"enter the metaverse\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia vào vũ trụ ảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"metaverse platform\", \"meaning\": \"nền tảng vũ trụ ảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"multiverse\", \"note_vi\": \"multiverse là đa vũ trụ trong viễn tưởng, metaverse là không gian mạng 3D\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-cori-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru0-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru5-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru6-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru10-9c3944ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru9-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru3-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru7-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru8-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-aru2-9c3944ce.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-ljspeech-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt408-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt138-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt624-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt396-9c3944ce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt498-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt132-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt288-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt42-9c3944ce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/metaverse-lt90-9c3944ce.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghép từ meta- (vượt lên) và universe, chỉ thế giới ảo tương tác 3D.', 'technology', 1, 23),
('be488100-50dc-5fb8-b045-ac711aab9560', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'cdbac910-7fa0-5df8-a385-eefabd770916', '48021502-5763-51e7-b276-d0895d21613a', 'screech', '/skriːtʃ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Phát ra tiếng kêu chói tai, the thé.', 'to make an unpleasant, loud, and high sound when you are angry or afraid.', 'The car tires screeched loudly as the driver slammed on the brakes.', 'Lốp xe ô tô rít lên chói tai khi người lái xe phanh gấp.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck screeched to a halt right in front of the main warehouse entrance.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc xe tải giao hàng rít lên chói tai rồi dừng lại ngay trước lối vào nhà kho chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-ljspeech-768d5b43.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-cori-768d5b43.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/screech-a238aff6.webp', '[\"shriek\", \"squeal\", \"scream\"]', '[\"whisper\", \"murmur\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"screech to a halt\", \"meaning\": \"rít lên rồi dừng lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"screech in terror\", \"meaning\": \"hét lên trong sợ hãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"screen\", \"note_vi\": \"screen là màn hình, screech là tiếng rít.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"screech\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-cori-768d5b43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-aru0-768d5b43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-aru5-768d5b43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-aru6-768d5b43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-aru10-768d5b43.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-aru9-768d5b43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-aru3-768d5b43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-aru7-768d5b43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/screech-aru8-768d5b43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p