('27a5bfec-4a0a-5abe-9c33-fd19239ca54e', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'rapture', '/ˈræptʃə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái cực kỳ vui sướng, say mê hoặc ngây ngất.', 'a feeling of extreme pleasure, joy, or excitement about something.', 'She listened to the music with an expression of pure rapture on her face.', 'Cô ấy lắng nghe bản nhạc với vẻ mặt hoàn toàn ngây ngất.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team listened in rapture as the director announced the record-breaking sales figures.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã lắng nghe trong sự phấn khích tột cùng khi giám đốc công bố số liệu doanh thu kỷ lục.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-ljspeech-c60d0728.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-cori-c60d0728.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rapture-e0fb5355.webp', '[\"ecstasy\", \"delight\", \"bliss\"]', '[\"misery\", \"depression\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"listen in rapture\", \"meaning\": \"nghe trong sự say mê\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expression of rapture\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ mặt cực kỳ vui sướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rupture\", \"note_vi\": \"rupture nghĩa là sự đứt gãy, vỡ nứt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rapturous\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"rapturously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-cori-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru0-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru5-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru6-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru10-c60d0728.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru9-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru3-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru7-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru8-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-aru2-c60d0728.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-ljspeech-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt408-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt138-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt624-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt396-c60d0728.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt498-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt132-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt288-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt42-c60d0728.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rapture-lt90-c60d0728.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'rupture\' (sự đứt, vỡ) chỉ khác nhau một chữ cái.', 'marketing', 1, 0),
('0bbade79-b4b4-5a8a-b099-0b751b434f1c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'trespass', '/ˈtrespəs/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Xâm nhập trái phép vào tài sản của người khác.', 'To intrude onto private real estate without authorization or legal grounds.', 'The sign clearly stated, \"No Trespassing,\" warning visitors to stay out.', 'Biển báo ghi rõ \"Cấm xâm phạm,\" cảnh báo du khách không được vào.', '{\"en\": \"Security guards alerted the manager after catching unauthorized personnel trying to trespass.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo vệ đã báo cho quản lý sau khi phát hiện nhân sự không có thẩm quyền cố tình xâm phạm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-ljspeech-a7d964ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-cori-a7d964ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trespass-414d5c58.webp', '[\"encroach\", \"intrude\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"trespass on private property\", \"meaning\": \"xâm phạm tài sản riêng tư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"no trespassing\", \"meaning\": \"cấm xâm nhập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"transgress\", \"note_vi\": \"transgress là vi phạm luật lệ hoặc chuẩn mực đạo đức nói chung.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trespasser\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-cori-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru0-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru5-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru6-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru10-a7d964ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru9-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru3-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru7-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru8-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-aru2-a7d964ff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-ljspeech-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt408-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt138-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt624-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt396-a7d964ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt498-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt132-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt288-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt42-a7d964ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trespass-lt90-a7d964ff.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ on (trespass on private property).', 'law', 1, 1),
('58a0e6f4-609c-5948-99d1-b9aec704ae64', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'the Beaufort scale', '/ðə ˈbəʊfət skeɪl/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Thang đo lường cường độ gió dựa trên quan sát các hiệu ứng của nó.', 'a system used to measure wind speed based on observable land or sea conditions.', 'Meteorologists referenced the Beaufort scale to classify the strength of the approaching storm.', 'Các nhà khí tượng học đã tham chiếu thang Beaufort để phân loại cường độ của cơn bão đang tới.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping company checked the Beaufort scale before sending cargo vessels out to sea.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty vận tải biển đã kiểm tra thang đo Beaufort trước khi cho tàu chở hàng ra khơi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-ljspeech-a00a1584.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-cori-a00a1584.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/the-beaufort-scale-57550823.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"according to the Beaufort scale\", \"meaning\": \"theo thang đo Beaufort\"}, {\"phrase\": \"Beaufort scale force\", \"meaning\": \"cấp gió theo thang Beaufort\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"Richter scale\", \"note_vi\": \"Richter scale đo cường độ động đất, Beaufort scale đo cấp gió\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-cori-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru0-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru5-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru6-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru10-a00a1584.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru9-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru3-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru7-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru8-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-aru2-a00a1584.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-ljspeech-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt408-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt138-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt624-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt396-a00a1584.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt498-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt132-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt288-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt42-a00a1584.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-beaufort-scale-lt90-a00a1584.mp3\"]}}', 'Thang đo cấp gió trong khí tượng và hàng hải từ 0 đến 12.', 'travel', 1, 2),
('035162eb-9cf2-5209-81cc-c20b2a5fb65a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'melodramatic', '/ˌmelədrəˈmætɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Quá kịch tính, cường điệu hóa cảm xúc.', 'behaving in a way that is too emotional or dramatic for the situation you are in.', 'His reaction to the spilled coffee was a bit melodramatic, considering it was just a small stain.', 'Phản ứng của anh ấy với cốc cà phê bị đổ hơi quá kịch tính, xét cho cùng thì đó chỉ là một vết bẩn nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"Please avoid a melodramatic response to the minor error in the monthly sales report.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng tránh phản ứng thái quá trước lỗi nhỏ trong báo cáo doanh số hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-ljspeech-a4a830e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-cori-a4a830e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/melodramatic-aac09417.webp', '[\"theatrical\", \"exaggerated\"]', '[\"calm\", \"restrained\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"melodramatic reaction\", \"meaning\": \"phản ứng kịch tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"melodramatic behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi cường điệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"melodrama\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-cori-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru0-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru5-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru6-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru10-a4a830e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru9-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru3-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru7-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru8-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-aru2-a4a830e1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-ljspeech-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt408-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt138-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt624-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt396-a4a830e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt498-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt132-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt288-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt42-a4a830e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/melodramatic-lt90-a4a830e1.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để phê bình những người làm quá vấn đề.', 'office', 1, 3)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('00bdaed1-9dba-5aef-a0ef-d0064eeb7ec7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'automate', '/ˈɔːtəmeɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tự động hóa, làm cho một quy trình hoặc hệ thống hoạt động tự động.', 'to use machines or computers to do work that was previously done by human workers.', 'The company decided to automate many of its manufacturing processes to increase efficiency.', 'Công ty đã quyết định tự động hóa nhiều quy trình sản xuất để tăng hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"We plan to automate the billing process to reduce errors and save time for staff.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi dự định tự động hóa quy trình thanh toán để giảm sai sót và tiết kiệm thời gian cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-ljspeech-da0966aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-cori-da0966aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/automate-4225b028.webp', '[\"mechanize\", \"computerize\"]', '[\"manualize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"automate a process\", \"meaning\": \"tự động hóa quy trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fully automate\", \"meaning\": \"tự động hóa hoàn toàn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"automatic\", \"note_vi\": \"automatic là tính từ, automate là động từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"automation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"automatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-cori-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru0-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru5-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru6-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru10-da0966aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru9-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru3-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru7-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru8-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-aru2-da0966aa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-ljspeech-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt408-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt138-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt624-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt396-da0966aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt498-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt132-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt288-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt42-da0966aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/automate-lt90-da0966aa.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong bối cảnh tối ưu hóa quy trình sản xuất.', 'business', 1, 4),
('9b2f295f-bbe2-5c05-9142-80ae3ff8f7ae', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'reckon', '/ˈrekən/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nghĩ rằng, tin rằng hoặc tính toán điều gì đó.', 'to think or believe that something is true or to calculate an amount.', 'I reckon it\'s going to rain later, so we should bring an umbrella.', 'Tôi cho rằng lát nữa trời sẽ mưa, nên chúng ta nên mang theo ô.', '{\"en\": \"The accountant reckons that our total travel expenses will decrease next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán viên cho rằng tổng chi phí đi lại của chúng ta sẽ giảm trong quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-ljspeech-b66ea8d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-cori-b66ea8d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reckon-eac234e8.webp', '[\"believe\", \"calculate\", \"suppose\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reckon that\", \"meaning\": \"cho rằng là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be reckoned to be\", \"meaning\": \"được tính toán/coi là\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reckless\", \"note_vi\": \"Liều lĩnh, cẩu thả, không liên quan đến suy nghĩ hay tính toán.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reckoning\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-cori-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru0-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru5-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru6-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru10-b66ea8d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru9-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru3-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru7-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru8-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-aru2-b66ea8d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-ljspeech-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt408-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt138-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt624-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt396-b66ea8d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt498-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt132-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt288-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt42-b66ea8d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reckon-lt90-b66ea8d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong văn nói (cho rằng) hoặc trong tài chính (tính toán).', 'business', 1, 5),
('9da304cd-181b-5e21-bd4a-94b129df4e0d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'statism', '/ˈsteɪtɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hệ tư tưởng ủng hộ việc nhà nước kiểm soát đáng kể các vấn đề kinh tế và xã hội.', 'An ideology advocating extensive state authority and centralized governance over national economic activity.', 'Critics argue that excessive statism can stifle individual liberty and economic growth.', 'Các nhà phê bình cho rằng chủ nghĩa nhà nước quá mức có thể kìm hãm tự do cá nhân và tăng trưởng kinh tế.', '{\"en\": \"Some business leaders argue that excessive statism prevents private companies from growing and creating new jobs.\", \"vi\": \"Một số nhà lãnh đạo doanh nghiệp lập luận rằng sự can thiệp quá mức của nhà nước ngăn cản các công ty tư nhân phát triển và tạo ra việc làm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-ljspeech-a8722fd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-cori-a8722fd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/statism-fd61dd1c.webp', NULL, '[\"anarchism\", \"libertarianism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rise of statism\", \"meaning\": \"sự trỗi dậy của chủ nghĩa nhà nước kiểm soát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economic statism\", \"meaning\": \"sự kiểm soát kinh tế của nhà nước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sadism\", \"note_vi\": \"sadism là ác dâm/sự bạo ngược; statism là chủ nghĩa nhà nước kiểm soát.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"statist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"statist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-cori-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru0-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru5-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru6-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru10-a8722fd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru9-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru3-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru7-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru8-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-aru2-a8722fd1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-ljspeech-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt408-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt138-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt624-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt396-a8722fd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt498-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt132-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt288-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt42-a8722fd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statism-lt90-a8722fd1.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này bắt nguồn từ \'state\' (nhà nước) cộng với đuôi \'-ism\' (chủ nghĩa).', 'business', 1, 6),
('893f255d-7d1a-51d3-884e-9b52f9a26f93', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'sprocket', '/ˈsprɒkɪt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Bánh xe có răng ăn khớp với xích hoặc băng tải.', 'A profiled wheel featuring radial projections that engage with a chain or perforated band.', 'The bicycle\'s rear sprocket allows the rider to change gears for different terrains.', 'Bánh xích sau của xe đạp cho phép người lái chuyển số phù hợp với các địa hình khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The factory technician replaced the worn sprocket to keep the conveyor belt running smoothly.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên nhà máy đã thay thế bánh răng bị mòn để giữ cho băng tải hoạt động trơn tru.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-ljspeech-11fdc216.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-cori-11fdc216.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sprocket-7b61589a.webp', '[\"gearwheel\", \"cogwheel\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"drive sprocket\", \"meaning\": \"bánh răng chủ động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rear sprocket\", \"meaning\": \"bánh răng phía sau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"socket\", \"note_vi\": \"ổ cắm điện hoặc hốc mắt, khác với bánh răng sprocket\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-cori-11fdc216.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-aru0-11fdc216.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-aru5-11fdc216.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-aru6-11fdc216.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-aru10-11fdc216.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-aru9-11fdc216.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-aru3-11fdc216.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-aru7-11fdc216.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprocket-aru8-11fdc216.mp3