('b0036f44-4ae3-58ca-94dd-0993a142b8cc', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'budgetary', 'UK: /ˈbʌdʒɪtəri/ | US: /ˈbʌdʒɪtɛri/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'thuộc về ngân sách', 'relating to a detailed financial plan or the total amount of money available for a project', 'The team faced budgetary constraints for the new project.', 'Đội phải đối mặt với các hạn chế ngân sách cho dự án mới.', '{\"en\": \"Due to budgetary constraints, the department had to delay purchasing new laptop computers.\", \"vi\": \"Do những hạn chế về ngân sách, bộ phận đã phải hoãn việc mua máy tính xách tay mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-ljspeech-d7de3887.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-cori-d7de3887.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/budgetary-2a85ba44.webp', '[\"financial\", \"fiscal\", \"monetary\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"budgetary constraints\", \"meaning\": \"những hạn chế ngân sách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"budgetary approval\", \"meaning\": \"sự phê duyệt ngân sách\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"budget\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"budget\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-cori-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru0-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru5-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru6-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru10-d7de3887.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru9-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru3-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru7-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru8-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-aru2-d7de3887.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-ljspeech-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt408-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt138-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt624-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt396-d7de3887.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt498-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt132-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt288-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt42-d7de3887.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/budgetary-lt90-d7de3887.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ này hay đứng trước danh từ như \'constraints\' (hạn chế) hoặc \'approval\' (sự phê duyệt ngân sách).', 'finance', 1, 18),
('66e77f98-6c64-5285-ba7c-2278412a9a94', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'expedite', '/ˈekspədaɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đẩy nhanh, xúc tiến hoặc làm cho một quá trình diễn ra nhanh hơn.', 'to cause something to happen sooner or to speed up a procedure.', 'The supervisor approved extra funding to expedite the construction project before winter.', 'Người giám sát đã phê duyệt thêm kinh phí để đẩy nhanh tiến độ dự án xây dựng trước mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked us to expedite the client\'s order before the holiday.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý yêu cầu chúng tôi đẩy nhanh đơn hàng của khách trước kỳ nghỉ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-ljspeech-cd4ebec9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-cori-cd4ebec9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expedite-2895b57f.webp', '[\"accelerate\", \"hasten\", \"quicken\"]', '[\"delay\", \"slow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"expedite the process\", \"meaning\": \"xúc tiến quá trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expedite delivery\", \"meaning\": \"đẩy nhanh giao hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expedition\", \"note_vi\": \"expedition là cuộc thám hiểm, không phải đẩy nhanh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"expeditious\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expediter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-cori-cd4ebec9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-aru0-cd4ebec9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-aru5-cd4ebec9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-aru6-cd4ebec9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-aru10-cd4ebec9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-aru9-cd4ebec9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expedite-aru3-cd4ebec9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio