('26a49906-fbbc-543c-9dfd-bceb8c9a9748', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'vestibule', '/ˈvestɪbjuːl/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sảnh nhỏ hoặc khu vực lối vào ngay bên trong cửa chính của một tòa nhà.', 'a small room or hall just inside the main entrance of a large building.', 'We waited in the vestibule while the receptionist checked our appointment.', 'Chúng tôi đợi ở tiền sảnh trong khi lễ tân kiểm tra cuộc hẹn của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"Visitors are requested to wait in the vestibule before entering the main conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Khách được yêu cầu đợi ở sảnh chờ trước khi vào phòng họp chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-ljspeech-db293982.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-cori-db293982.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vestibule-f073ea79.webp', '[\"lobby\", \"foyer\", \"anteroom\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"building vestibule\", \"meaning\": \"sảnh vào tòa nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"entrance vestibule\", \"meaning\": \"lối vào sảnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lobby\", \"note_vi\": \"lobby thường rộng hơn và có thể có quầy lễ tân.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-cori-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru0-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru5-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru6-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru10-db293982.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru9-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru3-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru7-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru8-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-aru2-db293982.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-ljspeech-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt408-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt138-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt624-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt396-db293982.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt498-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt132-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt288-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt42-db293982.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vestibule-lt90-db293982.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ khu vực đệm giữa cửa ra vào và không gian chính.', 'housing', 1, 25),
('712097d1-46a9-5a8e-84e6-8c839d04bb9f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'dew', '/djuː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hơi nước ngưng tụ thành giọt trên bề mặt vào buổi sáng sớm.', 'small drops of water that form on the ground and other surfaces outside during the night.', 'The grass was covered with sparkling dew in the early morning light.', 'Cỏ được bao phủ bởi những hạt sương lấp lánh dưới ánh sáng ban mai.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team must wipe the morning dew off the outdoor seating before the cafe opens.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì phải lau sạch sương mai trên chỗ ngồi ngoài trời trước khi quán cà phê mở cửa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-ljspeech-72d628f9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-cori-72d628f9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dew-cdb65368.webp', '[\"condensation\", \"moisture\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"morning dew\", \"meaning\": \"sương sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heavy dew\", \"meaning\": \"sương dày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"due\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm giống nhau nhưng \'due\' nghĩa là đến hạn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dewy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-cori-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru0-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru5-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru6-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru10-72d628f9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru9-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru3-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru7-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru8-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-aru2-72d628f9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-ljspeech-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt408-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt138-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt624-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt396-72d628f9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt498-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt132-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt288-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt42-72d628f9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dew-lt90-72d628f9.mp3\"]}}', '\'Dew\' là sương đọng trên lá, khác với \'fog\' là sương mù bay trong không khí.', 'nature', 1, 26),
('8d24f2bf-3c69-5313-8ac2-31e353ec52d7', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'stomp', '/stɒmp/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Dậm chân mạnh xuống đất, thường là để thể hiện sự tức giận.', 'to walk with heavy steps, usually because you are feeling very angry or upset.', 'The child began to stomp his feet when he didn\'t get his way.', 'Đứa trẻ bắt đầu dậm chân khi không được như ý muốn.', '{\"en\": \"The frustrated manager began to stomp around the office after the failed client presentation.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý thất vọng bắt đầu dậm chân đi quanh văn phòng sau buổi thuyết trình khách hàng thất bại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-ljspeech-c55ee102.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-cori-c55ee102.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stomp-ba169da9.webp', '[\"trample\", \"stamp\"]', '[\"tiptoe\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stomp off\", \"meaning\": \"dậm chân bỏ đi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stomp around\", \"meaning\": \"dậm chân đi quanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stomper\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-cori-c55ee102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru0-c55ee102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru5-c55ee102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru6-c55ee102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru10-c55ee102.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru9-c55ee102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru3-c55ee102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru7-c55ee102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru8-c55ee102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-aru2-c55ee102.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stomp-l