('ba2d14ed-c828-5f7e-817f-c0a3e1c3b3b3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'alternative fuel', '/ɔːlˈtɜːnətɪv fjuːəl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Loại nhiên liệu không phải hóa thạch, ít gây hại môi trường hơn.', 'any source of power that is not oil or coal and helps protect the environment.', 'Many car manufacturers are investing in research for alternative fuels like hydrogen.', 'Nhiều nhà sản xuất ô tô đang đầu tư vào nghiên cứu các loại nhiên liệu thay thế như hydro.', '{\"en\": \"The government is offering tax incentives to companies that switch to using sustainable alternative fuel sources.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đang cung cấp các ưu đãi thuế cho các công ty chuyển sang sử dụng các nguồn nhiên liệu thay thế bền vững.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-ljspeech-0ddb8da0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-cori-0ddb8da0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/alternative-fuel-4814f484.webp', '[\"renewable energy\", \"green energy\"]', '[\"fossil fuel\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"use alternative fuel\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng nhiên liệu thay thế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"develop alternative fuel\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển nhiên liệu thay thế\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-cori-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru0-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru5-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru6-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru10-0ddb8da0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru9-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru3-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru7-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru8-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-aru2-0ddb8da0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-ljspeech-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt408-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt138-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt624-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt396-0ddb8da0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt498-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt132-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt288-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt42-0ddb8da0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alternative-fuel-lt90-0ddb8da0.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này rất phổ biến trong các bài đọc về môi trường.', 'technology', 1, 28),
('c192ceba-12d7-58e6-be87-b9d527aa773f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd50812e1-b604-5bc6-bc27-7a2011c0584b', '7955520e-691f-55e1-9138-f57b5760e207', 'topography', '/təˈpɒɡrəfi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Đặc điểm tự nhiên của bề mặt một khu vực, như núi, sông, thung lũng.', 'The detailed mapping or description of surface terrain characteristics belonging to a particular geographic region.', 'The topography of the region makes it challenging to build new roads.', 'Địa hình của khu vực này khiến việc xây dựng đường mới trở nên khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The complex topography of the site made it difficult for the construction team to lay foundations.\", \"vi\": \"Đặc điểm địa hình phức tạp của khu đất khiến đội xây dựng gặp khó khăn trong việc đặt nền móng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-ljspeech-fdf6780b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-cori-fdf6780b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/topography-e89fc8b7.webp', '[\"terrain\", \"landscape\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rugged topography\", \"meaning\": \"địa hình gồ ghề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mountainous topography\", \"meaning\": \"địa hình đồi núi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"topographical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-cori-fdf6780b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-aru0-fdf6780b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-aru5-fdf6780b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-aru6-fdf6780b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-aru10-fdf6780b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-aru9-fdf6780b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-aru3-fdf6780b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-aru7-fdf6780b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/topography-