('91004b29-0a17-532a-8659-675ff6f27ff5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'seamlessly', 'UK: /ˈsiːmləsli/ | US: /ˈsiːmləsli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'một cách liền mạch, không bị gián đoạn', 'smoothly and continuously without any noticeable breaks, gaps, or difficulties.', 'The new system integrates seamlessly with existing software.', 'Hệ thống mới tích hợp liền mạch với phần mềm hiện có.', '{\"en\": \"The new software integrates seamlessly with our existing database system.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới tích hợp một cách liền mạch với hệ thống dữ liệu hiện tại của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-ljspeech-b555aa48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-cori-b555aa48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seamlessly-16eafb21.webp', '[\"smoothly\", \"flawlessly\", \"continuously\"]', '[\"clumsily\", \"disruptively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"integrate seamlessly\", \"meaning\": \"tích hợp liền mạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"transition seamlessly\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển đổi êm đẹp/trơn tru\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"seamless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-cori-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru0-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru5-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru6-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru10-b555aa48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru9-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru3-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru7-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru8-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-aru2-b555aa48.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-ljspeech-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt408-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt138-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt624-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt396-b555aa48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt498-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt132-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt288-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt42-b555aa48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seamlessly-lt90-b555aa48.mp3\"]}}', 'Xuất phát từ \'seam\' (đường may), \'seamlessly\' nghĩa là trơn tru không để lại vết nối. Rất hay xuất hiện trong bài thi TOEIC về mảng công nghệ/tích hợp hệ thống.', 'technology', 1, 7),
('950dd6f4-aba4-5f9e-a066-2baff8329b0b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'cerebral', '/səˈriːbrəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Liên quan đến não bộ hoặc thiên về trí tuệ, suy nghĩ.', 'relating to the brain or appealing to intellect rather than emotion.', 'The film was quite cerebral, requiring deep thought and analysis rather than just emotion.', 'Bộ phim khá thiên về trí tuệ, đòi hỏi suy nghĩ và phân tích sâu sắc hơn là chỉ cảm xúc.', '{\"en\": \"The cerebral training module challenged the new analysts\' logical skills.\", \"vi\": \"Mô-đun đào tạo thiên về trí tuệ thách thức kỹ năng logic của các nhà phân tích mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-ljspeech-30534f34.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-cori-30534f34.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cerebral-cb8929f8.webp', '[\"intellectual\", \"mental\", \"brainy\"]', '[\"emotional\", \"physical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cerebral cortex\", \"meaning\": \"vỏ não\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cerebral activity\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động não bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cerebral film\", \"meaning\": \"phim thiên về tư duy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cereal\", \"note_vi\": \"cereal là ngũ cốc, không liên quan não bộ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cerebrum\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"cerebrally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-cori-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru0-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru5-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru6-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru10-30534f34.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru9-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru3-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru7-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru8-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-aru2-30534f34.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-ljspeech-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt408-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt138-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt624-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt396-30534f34.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt498-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt132-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt288-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt42-30534f34.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cerebral-lt90-30534f34.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với cereal (ngũ cốc) vì phát âm gần giống.', 'education', 1, 8),
('da4176d4-1c17-555f-a24b-9e486775a7c2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'deliberation', 'UK: /dɪˌlɪbəˈreɪʃən/ | US: /dɪˌlɪbəˈreɪʃən/', 'C1', 'noun', 'sự cân nhắc kỹ lưỡng', 'Careful thought and formal discussion before making an important final decision.', 'After much deliberation, the committee approved the proposal.', 'Sau nhiều cân nhắc kỹ lưỡng, ủy ban đã chấp thuận đề xuất.', '{\"en\": \"After hours of careful deliberation, the board of directors selected Mr. Cho as the new CEO.\", \"vi\": \"Sau nhiều giờ cân nhắc kỹ lưỡng, hội đồng quản trị đã chọn ông Cho làm CEO mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-ljspeech-9f26e813.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-cori-9f26e813.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deliberation-eddf617c.webp', '[\"consideration\", \"discussion\", \"consultation\", \"pondering\"]', '[\"impulsiveness\", \"haste\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"after much deliberation\", \"meaning\": \"sau nhiều sự cân nhắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"board deliberations\", \"meaning\": \"các cuộc thảo luận của hội đồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"liberation\", \"note_vi\": \"Sự giải phóng (khác với deliberation là sự cân nhắc kỹ)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"deliberate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"deliberate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"deliberately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-cori-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru0-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru5-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru6-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru10-9f26e813.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru9-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru3-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru7-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru8-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-aru2-9f26e813.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-ljspeech-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt408-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt138-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt624-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt396-9f26e813.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt498-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt132-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt288-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt42-9f26e813.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deliberation-lt90-9f26e813.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng ở dạng số nhiều \'deliberations\' khi nói về các cuộc thảo luận/cân nhắc kéo dài của ban quản trị hoặc hội đồng.', 'management', 1, 9),
('1f7741de-b521-53f7-8a24-c778a6698c57', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'notary', '/ˈnəʊtəri/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Người có thẩm quyền chứng thực các văn bản pháp lý.', 'an official who has the legal authority to say that documents are official.', 'You\'ll need to sign these documents in front of a notary public for them to be legally binding.', 'Bạn sẽ cần ký các tài liệu này trước mặt một công chứng viên để chúng có giá trị pháp lý.', '{\"en\": \"The contract must be signed in the presence of a notary before it is valid.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng phải được ký trước sự chứng kiến của công chứng viên trước khi có hiệu lực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-ljspeech-f11b2c46.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-cori-f11b2c46.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/notary-c84fc33a.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"notary public\", \"meaning\": \"công chứng viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"notary office\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng công chứng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"notice\", \"note_vi\": \"thông báo, không liên quan đến pháp lý\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"notarize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-cori-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru0-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru5-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru6-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru10-f11b2c46.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru9-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru3-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru7-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru8-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-aru2-f11b2c46.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-ljspeech-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt408-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt138-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt624-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt396-f11b2c46.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt498-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt132-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt288-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt42-f11b2c46.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notary-lt90-f11b2c46.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp dưới dạng cụm từ \'notary public\' (công chứng viên).', 'law', 1, 10),
('ceb38e9b-0241-5438-b471-7db9f3685197', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'thorny', '/ˈθɔːni/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều gai; (nghĩa bóng) khó khăn, gây tranh cãi.', 'full of difficulties or controversial points that are hard to deal with.', 'We had to navigate a thorny path through the dense forest.', 'Chúng tôi phải đi qua một con đường đầy gai góc xuyên qua khu rừng rậm.', '{\"en\": \"The HR department is trying to resolve a thorny dispute between the two managers.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận nhân sự đang cố gắng giải quyết một tranh chấp phức tạp giữa hai người quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-ljspeech-d5184932.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-cori-d5184932.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thorny-c48f7f0f.webp', '[\"knotty\", \"problematic\", \"difficult\"]', '[\"easy\", \"straightforward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thorny issue\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề hóc búa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thorny question\", \"meaning\": \"câu hỏi hóc búa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"horny\", \"note_vi\": \"horny mang nghĩa thô tục hoặc có sừng, tránh nhầm với thorny (đầy gai/khó khăn)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thorn\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-cori-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru0-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru5-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru6-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru10-d5184932.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru9-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru3-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru7-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru8-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-aru2-d5184932.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-ljspeech-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt408-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt138-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt624-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt396-d5184932.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt498-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt132-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt288-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt42-d5184932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thorny-lt90-d5184932.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng của thorny là \'đầy gai nhọn\', ám chỉ việc giải quyết rất dễ bị tổn thương hoặc đau đầu.', 'hr', 1, 11),
('296c84c9-adf5-5f64-aba1-70229c5b2c7f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'altitude', '/ˈæltɪtjuːd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Độ cao của một địa điểm so với mực nước biển hoặc một mặt phẳng tham chiếu.', 'the height of an object or place above sea level.', 'The aircraft reached its cruising altitude of 35,000 feet within minutes after takeoff.', 'Máy bay đạt độ cao hành trình 35.000 feet chỉ trong vài phút sau khi cất cánh.', '{\"en\": \"The pilot adjusted the flight altitude to avoid the severe storm over the mountain range.\", \"vi\": \"Phi công đã điều chỉnh độ cao bay để tránh cơn bão dữ dội trên dãy núi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-ljspeech-e4c1a71b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-cori-e4c1a71b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/altitude-be8ad4e5.webp', '[\"height\", \"elevation\"]', '[\"depth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high altitude\", \"meaning\": \"độ cao lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cruising altitude\", \"meaning\": \"độ cao bay hành trình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attitude\", \"note_vi\": \"attitude nghĩa là thái độ, cách cư xử\"}, {\"word\": \"aptitude\", \"note_vi\": \"aptitude nghĩa là năng khiếu, khả năng tự nhiên\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-cori-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru0-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru5-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru6-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru10-e4c1a71b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru9-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru3-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru7-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru8-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-aru2-e4c1a71b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-ljspeech-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt408-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt138-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt624-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt396-e4c1a71b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt498-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt132-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt288-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt42-e4c1a71b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altitude-lt90-e4c1a71b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với attitude (thái độ) và aptitude (năng khiếu).', 'travel', 1, 12),
('eddcd481-d5a0-5ae7-8fd9-d1c7f7dcb052', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'neurosis', '/njʊəˈrəʊsɪs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Rối loạn tâm thần gây ra căng thẳng, lo âu, nhưng không làm mất liên lạc với thực tế.', 'A non-psychotic psychological disorder characterized by chronic anxiety, emotional distress, or compulsive behaviors.', 'Symptoms of neurosis can include anxiety, phobias, and obsessive thoughts.', 'Các triệu chứng của chứng loạn thần kinh có thể bao gồm lo âu, ám ảnh sợ hãi và suy nghĩ ám ảnh.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate wellness program aims to help employees manage stress before it turns into neurosis.\", \"vi\": \"Chương trình chăm sóc sức khỏe doanh nghiệp nhằm giúp nhân viên quản lý căng thẳng trước khi nó biến thành bệnh hoang tưởng lo âu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-ljspeech-bb903d3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-cori-bb903d3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/neurosis-240b2efc.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"severe neurosis\", \"meaning\": \"rối loạn thần kinh nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"anxiety neurosis\", \"meaning\": \"rối loạn thần kinh lo âu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"psychosis\", \"note_vi\": \"psychosis là bệnh tâm thần nặng làm mất liên lạc với thực tế\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"neurotic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-cori-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru0-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru5-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru6-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru10-bb903d3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru9-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru3-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru7-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru8-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-aru2-bb903d3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-ljspeech-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt408-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt138-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt624-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt396-bb903d3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt498-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt132-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt288-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt42-bb903d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurosis-lt90-bb903d3a.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với psychosis (loạn thần nặng hơn, mất nhận thức thực tế).', 'health', 1, 13),
('00278d61-f908-5a3a-a3e8-aca8bcd25fd0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'gab', '/ɡæb/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Nói chuyện nhiều, tán gẫu về những điều không quan trọng.', 'to talk continuously for a long time about unimportant things with friends.', 'They spent hours just gabbin\' about their summer vacation plans.', 'Họ đã dành hàng giờ chỉ để tán gẫu về kế hoạch nghỉ hè của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Employees were warned not to gab about personal matters during working hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được cảnh báo không được tán gẫu về các vấn đề cá nhân trong giờ làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-ljspeech-41ae4110.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-cori-41ae4110.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gab-ffc466d4.webp', '[\"chatter\", \"gossip\", \"prattle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gab about something\", \"meaning\": \"tán gẫu về điều gì đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gag\", \"note_vi\": \"bịt miệng hoặc trò diễn hài\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"gabby\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gabber\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-cori-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru0-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru5-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru6-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru10-41ae4110.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru9-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru3-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru7-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru8-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-aru2-41ae4110.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-ljspeech-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt408-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt138-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt624-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt396-41ae4110.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt498-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt132-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt288-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt42-41ae4110.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gab-lt90-41ae4110.mp3\"]}}', 'Gab là từ thân mật mang nghĩa nói chuyện phiếm, tán gẫu.', 'office', 1, 14),
('4535d442-844b-5f7e-b346-a50a06c187f5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'diligent', '/ˈdɪlɪdʒənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Chăm chỉ, siêng năng và cẩn thận trong công việc hoặc học tập.', 'working very carefully and putting in a lot of effort over a long time.', 'She is a very diligent student, always completing her assignments on time and with great care.', 'Cô ấy là một học sinh rất cần mẫn, luôn hoàn thành bài tập đúng hạn và rất cẩn thận.', '{\"en\": \"The diligent accountant reviewed every invoice before submitting the financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán viên chăm chỉ đã xem xét từng hóa đơn trước khi nộp báo cáo tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-ljspeech-74f55636.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-cori-74f55636.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diligent-3d1cf8ef.webp', '[\"hardworking\", \"industrious\", \"conscientious\"]', '[\"lazy\", \"negligent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"diligent worker\", \"meaning\": \"người lao động chăm chỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"diligent effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực siêng năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"diligent research\", \"meaning\": \"nghiên cứu cẩn thận, tỉ mỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"meticulous\", \"note_vi\": \"meticulous nhấn mạnh sự tỉ mỉ từng chi tiết, diligent nhấn mạnh sự chăm chỉ bền bỉ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"diligence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"diligently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-cori-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru0-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru5-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru6-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru10-74f55636.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru9-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru3-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru7-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru8-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-aru2-74f55636.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-ljspeech-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt408-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt138-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt624-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt396-74f55636.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt498-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt132-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt288-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt42-74f55636.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diligent-lt90-74f55636.mp3\"]}}', 'Diligent thường xuất hiện trong đánh giá nhân viên TOEIC; đừng nhầm với intelligent (thông minh).', 'hr', 1, 15),
('3ced1227-1f76-5db7-92d0-9c883a6232d4', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'syndicate', '/ˈsɪndɪkət/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Phân phối hoặc bán một bài báo, chương trình truyền hình cho nhiều nhà xuất bản/đài truyền hình.', 'to sell articles or programs to many different newspapers or television stations for publication.', 'The newspaper decided to syndicate the popular comic strip to other publications.', 'Tờ báo quyết định phân phối truyện tranh nổi tiếng cho các ấn phẩm khác.', '{\"en\": \"The media group plans to syndicate their new business column to international newspapers next month.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn truyền thông có kế hoạch phân phối chuyên mục kinh doanh mới của họ cho các tờ báo quốc tế vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-ljspeech-54d56ee7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-cori-54d56ee7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/syndicate-b133a214.webp', '[\"distribute\", \"circulate\"]', '[\"monopolize\", \"restrict\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"syndicate content\", \"meaning\": \"phân phối nội dung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"syndicate news\", \"meaning\": \"phân phối tin tức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"syndication\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"syndicate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-cori-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru0-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru5-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru6-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru10-54d56ee7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru9-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru3-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru7-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru8-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-aru2-54d56ee7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-ljspeech-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt408-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt138-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt624-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt396-54d56ee7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt498-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt132-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt288-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt42-54d56ee7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syndicate-lt90-54d56ee7.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng chuyên biệt trong ngành báo chí và truyền hình.', 'media', 1, 16),
('f2cb8df4-e70b-5015-a7d7-f502f03f5bf0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'tenacious', '/təˈneɪʃəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Kiên trì, bền bỉ không bỏ cuộc.', 'holding firmly to a purpose or position and refusing to stop trying.', 'Her tenacious spirit helped her overcome many challenges in her career.', 'Tinh thần kiên trì của cô ấy đã giúp cô vượt qua nhiều thử thách trong sự nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"Thanks to the sales team\'s tenacious efforts, the firm secured a major international contract.\", \"vi\": \"Nhờ những nỗ lực kiên trì của đội ngũ kinh doanh, công ty đã giành được một hợp đồng quốc tế lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-ljspeech-8da24bbe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-cori-8da24bbe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tenacious-8970a30a.webp', '[\"persistent\", \"determined\", \"resolute\"]', '[\"irresolute\", \"yielding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tenacious effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực kiên trì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tenacious grip\", \"meaning\": \"sự nắm giữ chặt chẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tentative\", \"note_vi\": \"dự kiến/ngập ngừng, khác với tenacious kiên trì\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tenacity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"tenaciously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-cori-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru0-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru5-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru6-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru10-8da24bbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru9-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru3-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru7-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru8-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-aru2-8da24bbe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-ljspeech-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt408-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt138-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt624-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt396-8da24bbe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt498-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt132-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt288-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt42-8da24bbe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenacious-lt90-8da24bbe.mp3\"]}}', 'Mang nghĩa tích cực biểu thị sự quyết tâm không bỏ cuộc.', 'hr', 1, 17),
('5746c0fa-133d-5da0-8091-bc3422970b1b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'backlot', '/ˈbæklɒt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Khu đất rộng tại trường quay dùng để xây dựng bối cảnh phim ngoài trời.', 'an outdoor area in a film studio where large sets are built for filming.', 'Many classic Western films were shot on the studio\'s backlot, featuring elaborate frontier towns.', 'Nhiều bộ phim Viễn Tây kinh điển được quay tại khu vực ngoại cảnh của hãng phim, với những thị trấn biên giới được dựng công phu.', '{\"en\": \"The media company invested millions to upgrade the outdoor sets on their main backlot.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty truyền thông đã đầu tư hàng triệu đô la để nâng cấp các bối cảnh ngoài trời trên trường quay ngoài trời chính của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-ljspeech-d52a3102.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-cori-d52a3102.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/backlot-d1d5765c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"studio backlot\", \"meaning\": \"trường quay ngoài trời của hãng phim\"}, {\"phrase\": \"film on a backlot\", \"meaning\": \"quay phim trên trường quay ngoài trời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"backyard\", \"note_vi\": \"sân sau của một ngôi nhà\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-cori-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru0-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru5-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru6-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru10-d52a3102.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru9-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru3-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru7-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru8-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-aru2-d52a3102.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-ljspeech-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt408-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt138-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt624-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt396-d52a3102.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt498-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt132-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt288-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt42-d52a3102.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backlot-lt90-d52a3102.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là thuật ngữ chuyên ngành điện ảnh, chỉ khu đất trống ngoài trời của trường quay.', 'media', 1, 18),
('dd978dca-108e-5215-84ff-2c9dea8a99f9', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'libretto', '/lɪˈbretəʊ/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Văn bản lời thoại và cốt truyện của một vở opera hoặc oratorio.', 'A formal text containing all dialogue and lyrics written for dramatic musical performances.', 'Before the performance, I read the libretto to better understand the opera\'s story.', 'Trước buổi biểu diễn, tôi đã đọc lời nhạc kịch để hiểu rõ hơn câu chuyện của vở opera.', '{\"en\": \"The theater company printed copies of the libretto for attendees of the opera festival.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nhà hát đã in các bản kịch bản lời thoại cho khán giả tham dự liên hoan opera.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-ljspeech-2f513b7d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-cori-2f513b7d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/libretto-e4fdf0a5.webp', '[\"script\", \"text\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"write a libretto\", \"meaning\": \"viết lời thoại opera\"}, {\"phrase\": \"opera libretto\", \"meaning\": \"kịch bản opera\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"script\", \"note_vi\": \"Script là kịch bản nói chung, libretto dành riêng cho opera.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"librettist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-cori-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru0-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru5-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru6-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru10-2f513b7d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru9-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru3-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru7-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru8-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-aru2-2f513b7d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-ljspeech-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt408-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt138-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt624-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt396-2f513b7d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt498-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt132-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt288-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt42-2f513b7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/libretto-lt90-2f513b7d.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ mượn tiếng Ý, số nhiều có thể là librettos hoặc libretti.', 'other', 1, 19),
('ab08c367-19fc-5eca-93fa-be8fe620db41', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'rack rate', '/ræk reɪt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Giá phòng khách sạn hoặc dịch vụ được niêm yết công khai, không giảm giá.', 'the published regular tariff for accommodation prior to corporate promotions or markdowns.', 'Corporate clients usually negotiate lower rates instead of paying the published rack rate.', 'Các khách hàng doanh nghiệp thường đàm phán mức giá thấp hơn thay vì trả giá niêm yết được công bố.', '{\"en\": \"Travelers often avoid paying the rack rate by booking their hotel rooms well in advance.\", \"vi\": \"Du khách thường tránh trả giá niêm yết bằng cách đặt phòng khách sạn trước một thời gian dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-ljspeech-d9dee90e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-cori-d9dee90e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rack-rate-7ac7c5e5.webp', '[\"standard rate\", \"published price\"]', '[\"discounted rate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pay the rack rate\", \"meaning\": \"trả giá niêm yết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full rack rate\", \"meaning\": \"giá niêm yết đầy đủ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-cori-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru0-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru5-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru6-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru10-d9dee90e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru9-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru3-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru7-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru8-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-aru2-d9dee90e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-ljspeech-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt408-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt138-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt624-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt396-d9dee90e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt498-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt132-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt288-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt42-d9dee90e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rack-rate-lt90-d9dee90e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ chuyên ngành khách sạn, chỉ giá gốc cao nhất.', 'travel', 1, 20),
('f806e259-2862-5dd0-81b9-1b9d85d831fc', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'appropriate', '/əˈprəʊpriət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Phù hợp hoặc đúng đắn với một tình huống hoặc mục đích cụ thể.', 'suitable or right for a particular situation, person, or purpose.', 'Please select an appropriate venue for hosting the upcoming annual shareholder meeting.', 'Vui lòng chọn một địa điểm phù hợp để tổ chức cuộc họp cổ đông thường niên sắp tới.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure you wear appropriate business attire for the annual shareholders meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo bạn mặc trang phục công sở phù hợp cho cuộc họp cổ đông thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-ljspeech-f290fd9a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-cori-f290fd9a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appropriate-d387d884.webp', '[\"suitable\", \"proper\", \"fitting\"]', '[\"inappropriate\", \"unsuitable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"appropriate action\", \"meaning\": \"hành động thích hợp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"appropriate response\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi phù hợp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly appropriate\", \"meaning\": \"rất phù hợp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"approximate\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là xấp xỉ, gần đúng, dễ nhầm vì viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"appropriately\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"appropriateness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-cori-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru0-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru5-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru6-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru10-f290fd9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru9-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru3-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru7-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru8-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru2-f290fd9a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-ljspeech-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt408-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt138-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt624-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt396-f290fd9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt498-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt132-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt288-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt42-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt90-f290fd9a.mp3\"]}}', 'Giới từ đi kèm thường là \'for\' hoặc \'to\' (ví dụ: appropriate for the job).', 'office', 1, 21),
('346972a3-f65e-586a-ab3f-8fee14b8454b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'altimeter', '/ˈæltɪmiːtə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị đo độ cao so với mặt đất hoặc mực nước biển.', 'an instrument used to measure the height of an aircraft above sea level.', 'Before jumping out of the aircraft, the skydiver double-checked his digital altimeter for safety.', 'Trước khi nhảy ra khỏi máy bay, người nhảy dù đã kiểm tra lại cao kế kỹ thuật số của mình để đảm bảo an toàn.', '{\"en\": \"The technician calibrated the helicopter\'s altimeter before the rescue team departed for the mountains.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã hiệu chuẩn máy đo độ cao của trực thăng trước khi đội cứu hộ khởi hành lên núi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-ljspeech-499321ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-cori-499321ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/altimeter-7d7834bd.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"radar altimeter\", \"meaning\": \"máy đo độ cao bằng radar\"}, {\"phrase\": \"calibrate an altimeter\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu chuẩn máy đo độ cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"altitude\", \"note_vi\": \"độ cao (danh từ chỉ khoảng cách), còn altimeter là thiết bị đo\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-cori-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru0-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru5-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru6-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru10-499321ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru9-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru3-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru7-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru8-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-aru2-499321ef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-ljspeech-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt408-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt138-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt624-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt396-499321ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt498-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt132-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt288-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt42-499321ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/altimeter-lt90-499321ef.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -meter chỉ dụng cụ đo lường (như thermometer - nhiệt kế, altimeter - cao độ kế).', 'travel', 1, 22),
('9639f5bd-4d91-5171-961d-ca796781fb49', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd7f3f4d3-b8fd-55db-8531-6d8fe51e20be', 'd57476b2-b93a-5aa1-8470-4b9c48ac5f56', 'still life', '/stɪl laɪf/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thể loại tranh hoặc ảnh mô tả các vật thể vô tri như hoa quả, đồ vật hàng ngày.', 'a type of painting or photograph that shows objects like fruit, flowers, or dishes.', 'The art class began by studying famous still life paintings to understand composition.', 'Lớp học nghệ thuật bắt đầu bằng cách nghiên cứu các bức tranh tĩnh vật nổi tiếng để hiểu về bố cục.', '{\"en\": \"The office lobby features a beautiful still life painting that creates a calm and professional atmosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh văn phòng có một bức tranh tĩnh vật tuyệt đẹp tạo ra bầu không khí bình tĩnh và chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-ljspeech-98a374c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-cori-98a374c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/still-life-2f2cdd29.webp', '[\"nature morte\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"still life painting\", \"meaning\": \"tranh tĩnh vật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"still life photography\", \"meaning\": \"nhiếp ảnh tĩnh vật\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-cori-98a374c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-aru0-98a374c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-aru5-98a374c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-aru6-98a374c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-aru10-98a374c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-aru9-98a374c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-aru3-98a374c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-aru7-98a374c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/still-life-aru8-98a374c2.mp3\", \"/st