('a5bb9051-1712-5d15-a1d2-c03b8f3f3245', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd9e33e4e-d62d-53fd-b1e6-05fe08d21a5a', '2085e720-03e5-5df9-84d7-e91d5bd1d119', 'eczema', '/ˈeksmə/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Bệnh viêm da gây ngứa, khô và mẩn đỏ.', 'a common skin condition that makes the surface of the body dry, itchy, and red.', 'The baby\'s delicate skin was prone to eczema, especially in dry weather.', 'Làn da mỏng manh của em bé dễ bị bệnh chàm, đặc biệt khi thời tiết khô hanh.', '{\"en\": \"The office air conditioning can sometimes trigger eczema for employees with very sensitive skin types.\", \"vi\": \"Máy điều hòa trong văn phòng đôi khi có thể gây kích ứng bệnh chàm cho những nhân viên có làn da nhạy cảm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-ljspeech-435846e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-cori-435846e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eczema-98b4b1f4.webp', '[\"dermatitis\", \"rash\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suffer from eczema\", \"meaning\": \"bị bệnh chàm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"treat eczema\", \"meaning\": \"điều trị bệnh chàm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-cori-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru0-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru5-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru6-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru10-435846e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru9-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru3-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru7-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru8-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-aru2-435846e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-ljspeech-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt408-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt138-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt624-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt396-435846e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt498-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt132-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt288-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt42-435846e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eczema-lt90-435846e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là thuật ngữ y khoa chỉ bệnh viêm da.', 'health', 1, 10),
('c3804352-6f02-56f6-b0ba-34c130ebc31b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'd9e33e4e-d62d-53fd-b1e6-05fe08d21a5a', '2085e720-03e5-5df9-84d7-e91d5bd1d119', 'coarse', '/kɔːs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thô ráp, không mịn; hoặc thô tục, kém văn minh.', 'rough and not smooth, or rude and offensive in manner or language.', 'Workers used coarse sand to create a non-slip coating on the factory floor.', 'Các công nhân đã dùng cát thô để tạo lớp phủ chống trượt trên sàn nhà máy.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel manager replaced the coarse bath towels with softer, high-quality cotton ones.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý khách sạn đã thay thế những chiếc khăn tắm thô ráp bằng những chiếc khăn cotton mềm mại, chất lượng cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-ljspeech-21ba46e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-cori-21ba46e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coarse-30825782.webp', '[\"rough\", \"rude\", \"vulgar\"]', '[\"smooth\", \"fine\", \"polite\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"coarse fabric\", \"meaning\": \"vải thô ráp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coarse language\", \"meaning\": \"ngôn từ thô tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"course\", \"note_vi\": \"khóa học hoặc lộ trình, phát âm giống hệt coarse\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"coarsely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coarseness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-cori-21ba46e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-aru0-21ba46e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-aru5-21ba46e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-aru6-21ba46e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-aru10-21ba46e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-aru9-21ba46e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-aru3-21ba46e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coarse-aru7-21ba46e1.mp3\", \"/storage/