('410a2d71-1867-54c0-ae70-10d05e2a8ae6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'buff', '/bʌf/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có cơ bắp, vạm vỡ.', 'having a strong, healthy body with well-developed muscles from regular physical exercise.', 'After months of working out at the gym, he became quite buff and strong.', 'Sau nhiều tháng tập gym, anh ấy trở nên khá vạm vỡ và khỏe mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The fitness center hired a buff instructor to lead the new morning workout classes for employees.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm thể dục đã thuê một huấn luyện viên vạm vỡ để dẫn dắt các lớp tập luyện buổi sáng cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-ljspeech-c516faa0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-cori-c516faa0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/buff-376d9b3f.webp', '[\"muscular\", \"athletic\"]', '[\"weak\", \"frail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"buff body\", \"meaning\": \"cơ thể vạm vỡ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-cori-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru0-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru5-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru6-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru10-c516faa0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru9-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru3-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru7-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru8-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-aru2-c516faa0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-ljspeech-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt408-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt138-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt624-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt396-c516faa0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt498-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt132-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt288-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt42-c516faa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/buff-lt90-c516faa0.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang tính thân mật, không dùng trong văn bản trang trọng.', 'health', 1, 11),
('65f2a9e5-66fe-582c-b284-1d5cf27cf25c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'acculturation', '/əˌkʌltʃəˈreɪʃn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Quá trình một nhóm người tiếp nhận văn hóa của nhóm khác.', 'the process of changing culture by adapting to another cultural group.', 'The acculturation of immigrants often involves learning a new language and customs.', 'Quá trình tiếp biến văn hóa của người nhập cư thường bao gồm việc học một ngôn ngữ và phong tục mới.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources department offered language classes to help foreign workers with acculturation.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự đã cung cấp các lớp học ngôn ngữ để giúp công nhân nước ngoài tiếp nhận văn hóa mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-ljspeech-dd0fb9de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-cori-dd0fb9de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acculturation-e6f809b2.webp', '[\"assimilation\", \"adaptation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"process of acculturation\", \"meaning\": \"quá trình tiếp biến văn hóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cultural acculturation\", \"meaning\": \"sự thích nghi văn hóa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"enculturation\", \"note_vi\": \"Enculturation là học văn hóa gốc từ nhỏ, acculturation là tiếp nhận văn hóa mới.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"acculturate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-cori-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru0-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru5-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru6-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru10-dd0fb9de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru9-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru3-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru7-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru8-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-aru2-dd0fb9de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-ljspeech-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt408-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt138-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt624-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt396-dd0fb9de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt498-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt132-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt288-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt42-dd0fb9de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acculturation-lt90-dd0fb9de.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh hội nhập của người di cư hoặc nhân sự quốc tế.', 'hr', 1, 12),
('718d9330-18a2-51bb-9097-b9d18ae31a46', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'comely', '/ˈkʌmli/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Xinh đẹp, duyên dáng và dễ nhìn (thường dùng cho phụ nữ).', 'having a pleasant and attractive appearance that is easy for people to look at.', 'She was a comely young woman, admired by many for her gentle demeanor.', 'Cô ấy là một phụ nữ trẻ duyên dáng, được nhiều người ngưỡng mộ vì thái độ dịu dàng.', '{\"en\": \"The comely receptionist greeted all the clients with a warm and professional smile today.\", \"vi\": \"Cô lễ tân xinh xắn đã chào đón tất cả khách hàng bằng nụ cười ấm áp và chuyên nghiệp hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-ljspeech-d7ee2455.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-cori-d7ee2455.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/comely-317b80cb.webp', '[\"attractive\", \"pretty\"]', '[\"ugly\", \"unattractive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"comely appearance\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài xinh xắn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-cori-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru0-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru5-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru6-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru10-d7ee2455.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru9-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru3-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru7-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru8-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-aru2-d7ee2455.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comely-ljspeech-d7ee2455.mp3\", \"/stora