('eac08a04-7126-59ca-a8bf-07987e6dd015', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'option', '/ˈɒpʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự chọn lựa giữa hai hay nhiều khả năng; quyền được chọn.', 'the ability or right to choose between two or more possibilities.', 'You have the option to pay by credit card or cash.', 'Bạn có lựa chọn thanh toán bằng thẻ tín dụng hoặc tiền mặt.', '{\"en\": \"Our company offers the option of flexible working hours to new employees.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi cung cấp quyền lựa chọn giờ làm việc linh hoạt cho nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-ljspeech-14eb14ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-cori-14eb14ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/option-b50169ee.webp', '[\"choice\", \"alternative\", \"selection\"]', '[\"obligation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have the option\", \"meaning\": \"có quyền lựa chọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exercise an option\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện quyền chọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"option to purchase\", \"meaning\": \"quyền mua\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"opinion\", \"note_vi\": \"option là lựa chọn, opinion là ý kiến, dễ nhầm chính tả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"optional\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"opt\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"optionally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-cori-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru0-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru5-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru6-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru10-14eb14ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru9-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru3-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru7-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru8-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-aru2-14eb14ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-ljspeech-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt408-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt138-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt624-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt396-14eb14ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt498-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt132-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt288-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt42-14eb14ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/option-lt90-14eb14ec.mp3\"]}}', 'Option thường đi với to infinitive (option to do) hoặc of doing.', 'business', 1, 16),
('6337d0f8-f332-5c26-b187-e787d88dec18', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'alibi', '/ˈæləbaɪ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Bằng chứng cho thấy ai đó ở một nơi khác khi tội ác xảy ra.', 'a claim or piece of evidence that someone was somewhere else when a crime happened.', 'The suspect had a strong alibi, claiming he was out of town at the time of the robbery.', 'Nghi phạm có bằng chứng ngoại phạm vững chắc, khai rằng anh ta đã ở ngoài thành phố vào thời điểm vụ cướp.', '{\"en\": \"The employee provided a solid alibi, proving he was in a meeting during the theft.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đã cung cấp bằng chứng ngoại phạm vững chắc, chứng minh anh ta đang họp trong lúc vụ trộm xảy ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-ljspeech-3348e64f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-cori-3348e64f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/alibi-547dd579.webp', '[\"excuse\", \"defense\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"provide an alibi\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp bằng chứng ngoại phạm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"solid alibi\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng ngoại phạm vững chắc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-cori-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru0-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru5-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru6-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru10-3348e64f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru9-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru3-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru7-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru8-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-aru2-3348e64f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-ljspeech-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt408-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt138-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt624-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt396-3348e64f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt498-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt132-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt288-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt42-3348e64f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alibi-lt90-3348e64f.mp3\"]}}', 'Không chỉ là lý do, alibi bắt buộc phải là bằng chứng về địa điểm.', 'law', 1, 17),
('62bf5505-d3bf-57f4-a982-4f1f79ea8ca8', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'corona', '/kəˈrəʊnə/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Vầng sáng bao quanh một vật thể, đặc biệt là Mặt Trời hoặc Mặt Trăng.', 'a circle of light that is seen around the sun or moon, especially during an eclipse.', 'During a total solar eclipse, the sun\'s beautiful corona becomes visible.', 'Trong một lần nhật thực toàn phần, vầng hào quang tuyệt đẹp của mặt trời sẽ hiện rõ.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel rooftop offered a perfect view of the sun\'s corona during the solar eclipse event.\", \"vi\": \"Sân thượng của khách sạn mang lại tầm nhìn hoàn hảo về vầng hào quang của mặt trời trong sự kiện nhật thực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-ljspeech-a0819d56.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-cori-a0819d56.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corona-dbda856a.webp', '[\"halo\", \"ring of light\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"solar corona\", \"meaning\": \"vầng hào quang mặt trời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stellar corona\", \"meaning\": \"vành nhật hoa của sao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"coronavirus\", \"note_vi\": \"corona là vầng sáng, coronavirus là loại virus có hình vầng sáng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"coronal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-cori-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru0-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru5-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru6-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru10-a0819d56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru9-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru3-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru7-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru8-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-aru2-a0819d56.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-ljspeech-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt408-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt138-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt624-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt396-a0819d56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt498-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt132-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt288-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt42-a0819d56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corona-lt90-a0819d56.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này gốc Latinh nghĩa là vương miện, dùng để chỉ vầng sáng bao quanh mặt trời.', 'nature', 1, 18),
('8668758e-5056-54b0-8087-246bb86e3c07', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'languorous', '/ˈlæŋɡərəs/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Uể oải, mệt mỏi, thiếu năng lượng hoặc sức sống.', 'lacking energy or enthusiasm, often in a pleasant or relaxed way.', 'A languorous afternoon spent reading in the sun felt wonderfully relaxing.', 'Một buổi chiều uể oải đọc sách dưới nắng thật tuyệt vời để thư giãn.', '{\"en\": \"After a long business flight, the manager felt too languorous to attend the evening reception.\", \"vi\": \"Sau chuyến bay công tác dài, vị quản lý cảm thấy quá uể oải để tham dự buổi tiệc chiêu đãi tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-ljspeech-8f03e8e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-cori-8f03e8e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/languorous-93b43dfe.webp', '[\"lethargic\", \"listless\", \"sluggish\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"vigorous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"languorous mood\", \"meaning\": \"tâm trạng uể oải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"languorous look\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ nhìn lờ đờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rigorous\", \"note_vi\": \"rigorous nghĩa là nghiêm ngặt, chặt chẽ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"languor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"languorously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-cori-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru0-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru5-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru6-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru10-8f03e8e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru9-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru3-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru7-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru8-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-aru2-8f03e8e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-ljspeech-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt408-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt138-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt624-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt396-8f03e8e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt498-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt132-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt288-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt42-8f03e8e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/languorous-lt90-8f03e8e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường mang sắc thái uể oải nhưng dễ chịu, thư giãn.', 'travel', 1, 19),
('8dc7b176-dd46-579a-a0f1-49877695c0e0', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'unsurpassed', '/ˌʌnsəˈpɑːst/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Vượt trội, không ai sánh bằng, không thể vượt qua.', 'better or greater than any other of its kind.', 'Her artistic talent is truly unsurpassed by any of her contemporaries.', 'Tài năng nghệ thuật của cô ấy thực sự vô song so với bất kỳ người cùng thời nào.', '{\"en\": \"Our company offers unsurpassed customer service, ensuring that every client is completely satisfied with their purchase.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi cung cấp dịch vụ khách hàng vượt trội, đảm bảo mọi khách hàng đều hoàn toàn hài lòng với giao dịch mua của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-ljspeech-1917a646.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-cori-1917a646.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unsurpassed-cd08ac62.webp', '[\"unmatched\", \"unrivaled\", \"incomparable\"]', '[\"inferior\", \"mediocre\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unsurpassed quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng không ai sánh bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unsurpassed beauty\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ đẹp tuyệt trần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unsurpassable\", \"note_vi\": \"không có khả năng bị vượt qua\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"surpass\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-cori-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru0-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru5-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru6-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru10-1917a646.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru9-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru3-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru7-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru8-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-aru2-1917a646.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-ljspeech-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt408-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt138-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt624-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt396-1917a646.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt498-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt132-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt288-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt42-1917a646.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsurpassed-lt90-1917a646.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong quảng cáo hoặc đánh giá hiệu suất để nhấn mạnh sự xuất sắc.', 'business', 1, 20),
('3192b248-c4d2-5f81-9b95-f927a9b5f3af', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'desperation', '/ˌdespəˈreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng tuyệt vọng, không còn hy vọng hay giải pháp.', 'the feeling of having no hope and being ready to do anything to change a bad situation.', 'In desperation, he tried one last time to call for help.', 'Trong tuyệt vọng, anh ấy đã cố gắng lần cuối cùng để gọi giúp đỡ.', '{\"en\": \"In desperation, the company lowered its prices to attract customers before going bankrupt.\", \"vi\": \"Trong sự tuyệt vọng, công ty đã hạ giá để thu hút khách hàng trước khi phá sản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-ljspeech-49b69c76.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-cori-49b69c76.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/desperation-faad92c6.webp', '[\"hopelessness\", \"despair\", \"distress\"]', '[\"hopefulness\", \"optimism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"act of desperation\", \"meaning\": \"hành động trong lúc tuyệt vọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in desperation\", \"meaning\": \"trong sự tuyệt vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"despair\", \"note_vi\": \"despair là trạng thái mất hết hy vọng, desperation là sự liều lĩnh do tuyệt vọng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"desperate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"desperately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-cori-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru0-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru5-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru6-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru10-49b69c76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru9-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru3-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru7-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru8-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-aru2-49b69c76.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-ljspeech-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt408-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt138-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt624-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt396-49b69c76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt498-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt132-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt288-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt42-49b69c76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desperation-lt90-49b69c76.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cụm \'in desperation\' (trong cơn tuyệt vọng).', 'business', 1, 21),
('a2c8f822-e5e7-50d0-9ca8-a4e157723284', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'statuesque', '/ˌstætʃuˈesk/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có dáng người cao lớn, thanh tú và đẹp như tượng.', 'having a tall, graceful, and attractive body shape that looks like a piece of art.', 'The statuesque model gracefully walked down the runway.', 'Người mẫu có dáng người như tượng đã sải bước duyên dáng trên sàn diễn.', '{\"en\": \"The statuesque receptionist greeted all the visiting clients with a professional and very welcoming smile.\", \"vi\": \"Cô lễ tân có dáng người cao ráo đã chào đón tất cả khách hàng đến thăm bằng nụ cười chuyên nghiệp và rất niềm nở.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-ljspeech-3f15e3f8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-cori-3f15e3f8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/statuesque-2a4d64f7.webp', '[\"imposing\", \"majestic\"]', '[\"petite\", \"short\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"statuesque figure\", \"meaning\": \"dáng người cao ráo, thanh tú\"}, {\"phrase\": \"statuesque beauty\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ đẹp cao sang, thanh tú\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"statutory\", \"note_vi\": \"Liên quan đến luật pháp, không liên quan đến hình dáng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"statue\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-cori-3f15e3f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-aru0-3f15e3f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-aru5-3f15e3f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-aru6-3f15e3f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-aru10-3f15e3f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-aru9-3f15e3f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statuesque-aru3-3f15e3f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v