('56c5ac70-9c88-52c3-98fb-e56f141bdd3a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'cadenza', '/kəˈdenzə/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một đoạn nhạc solo phô diễn kỹ thuật trong một bản concerto hoặc tác phẩm khác.', 'a solo passage in a concerto showing the performer\'s skill.', 'The violinist performed a dazzling cadenza that showcased her exceptional skill.', 'Nghệ sĩ violin đã trình diễn một đoạn ngẫu hứng tuyệt vời thể hiện kỹ năng đặc biệt của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The pianist played a brilliant cadenza during the company\'s annual gala dinner.\", \"vi\": \"Người chơi piano đã trình tấu một đoạn solo xuất sắc trong bữa tiệc thường niên của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-ljspeech-45dfeea6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-cori-45dfeea6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cadenza-a056b603.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"violin cadenza\", \"meaning\": \"đoạn solo violin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"piano cadenza\", \"meaning\": \"đoạn solo piano\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dazzling cadenza\", \"meaning\": \"cadenza rực rỡ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cadence\", \"note_vi\": \"cadence nghĩa nhịp điệu, không phải đoạn solo\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-cori-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru0-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru5-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru6-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru10-45dfeea6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru9-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru3-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru7-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru8-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-aru2-45dfeea6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-ljspeech-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt408-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt138-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt624-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt396-45dfeea6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt498-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt132-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt288-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt42-45dfeea6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cadenza-lt90-45dfeea6.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ âm nhạc chỉ đoạn solo; dễ nhầm với cadence (nhịp).', 'dining', 1, 23),
('5476e804-a768-5478-bf05-44a483d04161', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'draught', '/drɑːft/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Luồng gió lạnh thổi qua khe hở.', 'A continuous flow of uncomfortably chilly air entering an enclosed interior space.', 'Please close the window; I can feel a cold draught coming in.', 'Xin hãy đóng cửa sổ; tôi cảm thấy có một luồng gió lạnh đang lùa vào.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance staff repaired the office window to stop a cold draught from entering the room.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã sửa cửa sổ văn phòng để ngăn luồng gió lạnh lùa vào phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-ljspeech-0569983f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-cori-0569983f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/draught-0cbbd54f.webp', '[\"breeze\", \"current\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cold draught\", \"meaning\": \"luồng gió lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel a draught\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy gió lùa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"draft\", \"note_vi\": \"draft là bản thảo hoặc sự phác thảo (kiểu Anh-Mỹ)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"draughty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-cori-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru0-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru5-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru6-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru10-0569983f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru9-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru3-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru7-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru8-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-aru2-0569983f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-ljspeech-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt408-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt138-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt624-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt396-0569983f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt498-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt132-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt288-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt42-0569983f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/draught-lt90-0569983f.mp3\"]}}', 'Draught là cách viết tiếng Anh-Anh, tiếng Anh-Mỹ thường viết là draft.', 'housing', 1, 24),
('9262a283-c40f-52e0-b47d-48145f305219', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'withstand', 'UK: /wɪðˈstænd/ | US: /wɪðˈstænd/', 'C1', 'verb', 'chống chọi, chịu đựng', 'to remain undamaged or unaffected when exposed to strong forces or opposition.', 'The bridge was built to withstand strong earthquakes.', 'Cây cầu được xây dựng để chống chọi với động đất mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The new smartphone model is designed to withstand heavy impacts and water exposure.\", \"vi\": \"Mẫu điện thoại thông minh mới được thiết kế để chịu được va đập mạnh và tiếp xúc với nước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-ljspeech-dea39a98.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-cori-dea39a98.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/withstand-415de5a9.webp', '[\"resist\", \"endure\", \"bear\"]', '[\"succumb\", \"yield\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"withstand pressure\", \"meaning\": \"chịu đựng áp lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"withstand harsh conditions\", \"meaning\": \"chịu đựng điều kiện khắc nghiệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"undergo\", \"note_vi\": \"\'undergo\' là trải qua (kiểm tra, phẫu thuật), còn \'withstand\' là chịu đựng tác động mà không hỏng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-cori-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru0-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru5-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru6-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru10-dea39a98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru9-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru3-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru7-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru8-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-aru2-dea39a98.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-ljspeech-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt408-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt138-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt624-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt396-dea39a98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt498-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt132-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt288-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt42-dea39a98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/withstand-lt90-dea39a98.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ bất quy tắc (withstand - withstood - withstood), dùng mô tả khả năng chịu lực/chịu áp lực của sản phẩm.', 'manufacturing', 1, 25),
('27733d91-d3c6-5d75-b527-8350c15dfd99', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'da01e2d5-5eaa-5438-ae89-6ca29bfbcb99', '18762935-98fc-5599-82af-39fa0ded96a9', 'rivet', '/ˈrɪvɪt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một loại chốt kim loại dùng để nối hai hoặc nhiều mảnh vật liệu lại với nhau.', 'a strong metal pin used to fasten two or more pieces of metal together.', 'The old bridge was held together by thousands of sturdy rivets.', 'Cây cầu cũ được giữ vững bởi hàng ngàn chiếc đinh tán chắc chắn.', '{\"en\": \"Engineers inspected every single rivet on the airplane body before granting flight approval.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ sư đã kiểm tra từng đinh rố-vê trên thân máy bay trước khi cấp phép bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-ljspeech-9b5ab4ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-cori-9b5ab4ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rivet-1006add7.webp', '[\"fastener\", \"pin\", \"bolt\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pop rivet\", \"meaning\": \"đinh rút, đinh tán pop\"}, {\"phrase\": \"steel rivet\", \"meaning\": \"chốt đinh tán thép\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rivet\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"riveting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-cori-9b5ab4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru0-9b5ab4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru5-9b5ab4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru6-9b5ab4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru10-9b5ab4ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru9-9b5ab4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru3-9b5ab4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru7-9b5ab4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru8-9b5ab4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rivet-aru2-9b5ab4ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu