('633628a2-58eb-57bb-b18e-102644322909', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'sleet', '/sliːt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hỗn hợp mưa và tuyết rơi xuống cùng lúc.', 'precipitation of rain and snow falling together from the sky.', 'We had to drive very carefully because the roads were icy from the sleet overnight.', 'Chúng tôi phải lái xe rất cẩn thận vì đường trơn trượt do mưa tuyết đêm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The flight was delayed due to heavy sleet at the airport this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến bay bị hoãn do mưa tuyết dày đặc tại sân bay sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-ljspeech-08af1bc4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-cori-08af1bc4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sleet-27c354d3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy sleet\", \"meaning\": \"mưa tuyết dày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sleet storm\", \"meaning\": \"bão mưa tuyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"freezing sleet\", \"meaning\": \"mưa tuyết đóng băng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slush\", \"note_vi\": \"slush là tuyết tan trên đất, sleet là mưa tuyết rơi\"}, {\"word\": \"snow\", \"note_vi\": \"snow chỉ tuyết, không có mưa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sleety\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-cori-08af1bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-aru0-08af1bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-aru5-08af1bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-aru6-08af1bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-aru10-08af1bc4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-aru9-08af1bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-aru3-08af1bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-aru7-08af1bc4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sleet-aru8-08af1bc4.mp3\"