('1ebef979-1123-5a94-99ea-6a27af62dc1a', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'coiled', '/kɔɪl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Được cuộn lại hoặc quấn thành hình xoắn ốc.', 'wound into a continuous and regular series of circular rings one above the other.', 'The worker carefully stored the coiled garden hose near the storage shed after finishing his task.', 'Người công nhân cẩn thận cất ống nước làm vườn đã được cuộn tròn gần nhà kho sau khi hoàn thành nhiệm vụ.', '{\"en\": \"The technician replaced the coiled wire inside the heating system to restore its functionality.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã thay thế cuộn dây bên trong hệ thống sưởi để khôi phục chức năng của nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-ljspeech-39616434.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-cori-39616434.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coiled-e256ec31.webp', '[\"curled\", \"twisted\", \"spiraled\"]', '[\"straight\", \"uncoiled\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"coiled spring\", \"meaning\": \"lò xo cuộn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coiled wire\", \"meaning\": \"dây cuộn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coil\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coil\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-cori-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru0-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru5-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru6-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru10-39616434.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru9-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru3-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru7-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru8-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-aru2-39616434.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-ljspeech-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt408-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt138-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt624-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt396-39616434.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt498-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt132-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt288-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt42-39616434.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coiled-lt90-39616434.mp3\"]}}', 'Bắt nguồn từ động từ \'coil\' (cuộn lại).', 'manufacturing', 1, 11),
('ec1b52eb-3e25-52bf-8c16-bcf7ecea4784', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'forlorn', '/fəˈlɔːn/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Buồn bã, cô đơn hoặc vô vọng.', 'Describing someone who appears unhappy, deserted, and miserable because of a complete lack of hope.', 'The lost puppy had a forlorn look in its eyes, waiting for its owner to return.', 'Chú chó con bị lạc có ánh mắt buồn bã, chờ đợi chủ quay về.', '{\"en\": \"The abandoned office building looked completely forlorn after the company relocated to another city.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng bị bỏ hoang trông hoàn toàn cô quạnh sau khi công ty chuyển sang thành phố khác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-ljspeech-7bffb72b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-cori-7bffb72b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forlorn-d171fd3a.webp', '[\"sad\", \"lonely\", \"miserable\"]', '[\"cheerful\", \"happy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"forlorn hope\", \"meaning\": \"hy vọng mong manh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"forlorn look\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ mặt buồn bã\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"forlornly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-cori-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru0-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru5-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru6-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru10-7bffb72b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru9-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru3-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru7-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru8-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-aru2-7bffb72b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-ljspeech-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt408-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt138-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt624-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt396-7bffb72b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt498-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt132-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt288-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt42-7bffb72b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forlorn-lt90-7bffb72b.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái buồn bã và bị bỏ rơi, ít dùng trong văn bản thương mại thông thường.', 'business', 1, 12),
('1e00765d-b6a0-50c8-ac2c-6da5a30c97d9', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'quality assurance', 'UK: /ˈkwɒləti əˈʃʊərəns/ | US: /ˈkwɑləti əˈʃʊrəns/', 'C1', 'phrase', 'đảm bảo chất lượng', 'The practice of inspecting products to guarantee they meet required high standards of excellence.', 'Our quality assurance team checks every product carefully.', 'Đội đảm bảo chất lượng của chúng tôi kiểm tra kỹ lưỡng mọi sản phẩm.', '{\"en\": \"The quality assurance team conducts rigorous tests on all software releases before launch.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ đảm bảo chất lượng tiến hành các bài kiểm tra nghiêm ngặt trên mọi bản phần mềm trước khi ra mắt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-ljspeech-23c19c93.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-cori-23c19c93.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/quality-assurance-2a5e4a0a.webp', '[\"QA\", \"quality management\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"quality assurance manager\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý đảm bảo chất lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quality assurance system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống đảm bảo chất lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"quality control\", \"note_vi\": \"Quality Assurance (QA) thiên về chuẩn hóa quy trình, Quality Control (QC) thiên về kiểm tra sản phẩm đầu ra.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-cori-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru0-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru5-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru6-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru10-23c19c93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru9-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru3-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru7-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru8-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-aru2-23c19c93.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-ljspeech-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt408-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt138-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt624-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt396-23c19c93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt498-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt132-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt288-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt42-23c19c93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/quality-assurance-lt90-23c19c93.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết tắt là QA. Phân biệt với QC (Quality Control): QA quản lý quy trình để đảm bảo không tạo ra lỗi, QC kiểm tra thành phẩm.', 'manufacturing', 1, 13),
('973be450-f2f5-5915-8150-9f09fea068af', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'contort', '/kənˈtɔːt/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Vặn vẹo, bẻ cong một cách bất thường.', 'to twist or bend something into a shape that is not normal or natural.', 'The dancer could contort her body into incredible shapes.', 'Nữ vũ công có thể uốn dẻo cơ thể mình thành những hình dạng khó tin.', '{\"en\": \"The heavy box caused the metal shelf to contort under the extreme weight of inventory.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc hộp nặng khiến kệ kim loại bị vặn vẹo dưới sức nặng khủng khiếp của hàng tồn kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-ljspeech-1e82e0e2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-cori-1e82e0e2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contort-af830069.webp', '[\"twist\", \"distort\"]', '[\"straighten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"contort into\", \"meaning\": \"vặn vẹo thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"contort in pain\", \"meaning\": \"quằn quại vì đau\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contortion\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contortionist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-cori-1e82e0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru0-1e82e0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru5-1e82e0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru6-1e82e0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru10-1e82e0e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru9-1e82e0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru3-1e82e0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru7-1e82e0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru8-1e82e0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contort-aru2-1e82e0e2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [