('be45ba55-053b-57d5-b232-cbb659edc0bd', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'backfire', '/ˌbækˈfaɪə(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Kế hoạch hoặc hành động có kết quả ngược lại mong muốn.', 'to have the opposite result to the one that you intended.', 'His clever plan to trick his friends backfired, and he ended up looking foolish.', 'Kế hoạch khôn ngoan lừa bạn bè của anh ta đã phản tác dụng, và cuối cùng anh ta trông thật ngốc nghếch.', '{\"en\": \"The aggressive marketing campaign backfired, causing many loyal customers to leave the brand.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị hung hãn đã phản tác dụng, khiến nhiều khách hàng trung thành rời bỏ thương hiệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-ljspeech-fc2def45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-cori-fc2def45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/backfire-96d85225.webp', '[\"rebound\", \"fail\", \"miscarry\"]', '[\"succeed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"backfire on somebody\", \"meaning\": \"phản tác dụng đối với ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"completely backfire\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn phản tác dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"backtrack\", \"note_vi\": \"rút lui, thay đổi ý kiến, khác với backfire là phản tác dụng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-cori-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru0-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru5-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru6-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru10-fc2def45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru9-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru3-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru7-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru8-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-aru2-fc2def45.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-ljspeech-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt408-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt138-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt624-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt396-fc2def45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt498-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt132-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt288-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt42-fc2def45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backfire-lt90-fc2def45.mp3\"]}}', 'Backfire thường đi với giới từ \'on\' (backfire on someone) để chỉ việc phản tác dụng lên ai.', 'marketing', 1, 17),
('44716714-b889-514a-8f6b-810e20d575f2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'plunder', '/ˈplʌndə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Tài sản hoặc của cải bị lấy đi bằng vũ lực hoặc cướp bóc.', 'Stolen goods or assets seized illegally from a location during armed conflict or unrest.', 'The pirates returned to their ship with a large amount of plunder from the captured merchant vessel.', 'Bọn cướp biển trở về tàu với một lượng lớn của cải cướp được từ con tàu buôn bị chiếm.', '{\"en\": \"The security report described how thieves escaped with plunder worth thousands of dollars.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo an ninh mô tả cách những tên trộm tẩu thoát với số tài sản cướp được trị giá hàng nghìn đô la.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-ljspeech-9bb92790.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-cori-9bb92790.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plunder-4ce6b060.webp', '[\"loot\", \"booty\", \"spoils\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"war plunder\", \"meaning\": \"chiến lợi phẩm cướp được trong chiến tranh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carry off plunder\", \"meaning\": \"mang đi tài sản cướp bóc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plunder and pillage\", \"meaning\": \"cướp bóc và tàn phá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pillage\", \"note_vi\": \"pillage nhấn mạnh hành động cướp phá, plunder nhấn mạnh cả hành động lẫn tài sản cướp được\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"plunder\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"plunderer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-cori-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru0-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru5-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru6-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru10-9bb92790.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru9-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru3-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru7-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru8-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-aru2-9bb92790.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-ljspeech-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt408-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt138-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt624-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt396-9bb92790.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt498-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt132-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt288-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt42-9bb92790.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plunder-lt90-9bb92790.mp3\"]}}', 'Plunder vừa là danh từ (tài sản cướp được) vừa là động từ (cướp bóc); chú ý dùng đúng loại từ.', 'other', 1, 18),
('2dcb5457-7a17-5e13-88b3-a17ec316f362', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'indulgent', '/ɪnˈdʌldʒənt/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có xu hướng chiều chuộng, dễ dãi với người khác, đặc biệt là trẻ em.', 'allowing someone to have or do what they want, even if not good.', 'Her grandparents were very indulgent, always buying her whatever she wanted.', 'Ông bà cô bé rất nuông chiều, luôn mua cho cô bé bất cứ thứ gì cô bé muốn.', '{\"en\": \"The resort offers indulgent spa treatments for guests looking to relax during their stay.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng cung cấp các liệu trình spa nuông chiều bản thân cho những vị khách muốn thư giãn trong kỳ lưu trú.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-ljspeech-710d1b41.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-cori-710d1b41.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/indulgent-24989955.webp', '[\"lenient\", \"tolerant\", \"pampering\"]', '[\"strict\", \"severe\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"indulgent parents\", \"meaning\": \"cha mẹ nuông chiều con\"}, {\"phrase\": \"self-indulgent\", \"meaning\": \"nuông chiều bản thân\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"indulge\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"indulgence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"indulgently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-cori-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru0-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru5-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru6-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru10-710d1b41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru9-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru3-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru7-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru8-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-aru2-710d1b41.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-ljspeech-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt408-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt138-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt624-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt396-710d1b41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt498-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt132-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt288-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt42-710d1b41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indulgent-lt90-710d1b41.mp3\"]}}', 'Indulgent có nghĩa là nuông chiều, dễ dãi. Tránh nhầm với các từ chỉ sự nghiêm khắc.', 'travel', 1, 19),
('01586d19-9dd3-519b-ba4d-d38c336f2c31', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'deluge', '/ˈdeljuːdʒ/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một trận lụt lớn hoặc lượng mưa rất lớn.', 'a very large amount of water that covers an area, or a sudden heavy rain.', 'The small town was completely cut off after a sudden deluge of rain.', 'Thị trấn nhỏ bị cô lập hoàn toàn sau một trận mưa lớn bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse suffered damage after a sudden deluge caused water to leak through the roof.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà kho bị hư hại sau khi một trận mưa lớn bất ngờ khiến nước rò rỉ qua mái nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-ljspeech-bc28bfa4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-cori-bc28bfa4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deluge-d09b893e.webp', '[\"flood\", \"downpour\"]', '[\"drought\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a deluge of rain\", \"meaning\": \"một trận mưa lớn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-cori-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru0-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru5-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru6-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru10-bc28bfa4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru9-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru3-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru7-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru8-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-aru2-bc28bfa4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-ljspeech-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deluge-lt408-bc28bfa4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/