('e55a08f1-9650-5da9-84ab-78a881a333b1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'skirmish', '/ˈskɜːmɪʃ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một cuộc giao chiến nhỏ, ngắn giữa các nhóm quân hoặc đối thủ.', 'a short and usually not very serious fight or argument between two groups of people.', 'Protesters engaged in a brief skirmish with security guards outside the corporate headquarters.', 'Những người biểu tình đã tham gia vào một cuộc đụng độ ngắn với bảo vệ bên ngoài trụ sở công ty.', '{\"en\": \"A minor skirmish between the two departments over budget allocation was quickly resolved by management.\", \"vi\": \"Một cuộc tranh cãi nhỏ giữa hai phòng ban về việc phân bổ ngân sách đã được ban quản lý giải quyết nhanh chóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-ljspeech-7d6162a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-cori-7d6162a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skirmish-78e72148.webp', '[\"clash\", \"conflict\"]', '[\"agreement\", \"harmony\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"minor skirmish\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tranh cãi nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid a skirmish\", \"meaning\": \"tránh một cuộc xung đột\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-cori-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru0-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru5-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru6-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru10-7d6162a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru9-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru3-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru7-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru8-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-aru2-7d6162a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-ljspeech-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt408-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt138-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt624-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt396-7d6162a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt498-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt132-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt288-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt42-7d6162a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skirmish-lt90-7d6162a4.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng nghĩa bóng cho các cuộc tranh cãi nhỏ trong công việc.', 'office', 1, 24),
('f32a722f-98ab-5763-8c51-40d4f82e78b9', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'scuttle', '/ˈskʌtl/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Chạy nhanh và vội vã, thường là để trốn thoát.', 'to move quickly with short steps, especially to escape danger or hide.', 'The mouse scuttled across the kitchen floor and disappeared behind the cupboard.', 'Con chuột chạy vụt qua sàn bếp và biến mất sau tủ chén.', '{\"en\": \"The assistant scuttled into the meeting room to hand the urgent documents to the manager.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý vội vã chạy vào phòng họp để đưa tài liệu khẩn cấp cho người quản lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-ljspeech-3f574a01.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-cori-3f574a01.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scuttle-640eba12.webp', '[\"scamper\", \"hurry\", \"dash\"]', '[\"crawl\", \"stroll\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scuttle away\", \"meaning\": \"vội vã chạy đi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scuttle back\", \"meaning\": \"vội vã chạy quay lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scuffle\", \"note_vi\": \"Scuffle là ẩu đả, xô xát; scuttle là chạy vội vã.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-cori-3f574a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru0-3f574a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru5-3f574a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru6-3f574a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru10-3f574a01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru9-3f574a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru3-3f574a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru7-3f574a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru8-3f574a01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scuttle-aru2-3f574a01.mp3