('99b34433-46ee-5e5a-aa1a-a25ee271d034', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'concave', '/kɒnˈkeɪv/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Bề mặt cong vào trong, tạo thành hình lòng chảo.', 'Curved or hollowed inward, resembling the interior shape of a sphere or circle.', 'The concave mirror reflected the light inwards to a focal point.', 'Gương lõm phản chiếu ánh sáng vào trong đến một tiêu điểm.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed a concave wall in the lobby to improve the acoustics of the room.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế một bức tường cong vào trong ở sảnh để cải thiện âm học của căn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-ljspeech-2a7ef058.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-cori-2a7ef058.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/concave-5e7a5476.webp', '[\"curved\", \"dented\"]', '[\"convex\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"concave lens\", \"meaning\": \"thấu kính phân kỳ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"concave surface\", \"meaning\": \"bề mặt lõm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"convex\", \"note_vi\": \"convex là lồi (cong ra ngoài), concave là lõm (cong vào trong).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"concavity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-cori-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru0-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru5-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru6-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru10-2a7ef058.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru9-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru3-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru7-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru8-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-aru2-2a7ef058.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-ljspeech-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt408-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt138-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt624-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt396-2a7ef058.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt498-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt132-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt288-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt42-2a7ef058.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concave-lt90-2a7ef058.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ cave (hang động) - hang động thì lõm vào trong núi.', 'technology', 1, 26),
('e5771c58-2d09-5af0-b294-bc6b76c6ea66', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'thermosphere', '/ðə ˈθɜːməsfɪə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tầng khí quyển trên cùng của Trái Đất, nơi nhiệt độ tăng cao.', 'the layer of the Earth\'s atmosphere above the mesosphere where heat increases significantly.', 'Satellites often orbit within the thermosphere, experiencing extreme temperature variations.', 'Các vệ tinh thường quay quanh trong tầng nhiệt quyển, trải qua sự biến đổi nhiệt độ khắc nghiệt.', '{\"en\": \"Researchers monitor communication satellites operating in the thermosphere for atmospheric data collection.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà nghiên cứu theo dõi vệ tinh thông tin hoạt động ở tầng nhiệt để thu thập dữ liệu khí quyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-ljspeech-8daa9984.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-cori-8daa9984.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thermosphere-40cfb2e5.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"upper thermosphere\", \"meaning\": \"tầng nhiệt trên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thermosphere region\", \"meaning\": \"vùng tầng nhiệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stratosphere\", \"note_vi\": \"Tầng bình lưu, nằm thấp hơn nhiều so với tầng nhiệt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"thermospheric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-cori-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru0-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru5-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru6-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru10-8daa9984.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru9-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru3-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru7-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru8-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-aru2-8daa9984.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-ljspeech-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt408-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt138-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt624-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt396-8daa9984.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt498-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt132-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt288-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt42-8daa9984.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thermosphere-lt90-8daa9984.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố thermo- nghĩa là nhiệt, hay xuất hiện trong bài đọc khoa học.', 'nature', 1, 27),
('af301e91-bf94-50d3-b2c2-10f1d44a7a24', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'mucus', '/ˈmjuːkəs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Chất nhầy do cơ thể tiết ra để bảo vệ các bề mặt bên trong, như trong mũi hoặc họng.', 'a thick liquid produced inside the nose and other parts of the body.', 'When you have a cold, your body produces more mucus to trap germs.', 'Khi bạn bị cảm lạnh, cơ thể bạn sản xuất nhiều chất nhầy hơn để giữ lại vi trùng.', '{\"en\": \"The company clinic provides medicine to reduce mucus production during flu season.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám của công ty cung cấp thuốc để giảm tiết chất nhầy trong mùa cúm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-ljspeech-c835ccbc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-cori-c835ccbc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mucus-b37d2798.webp', '[\"phlegm\", \"slime\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"excess mucus\", \"meaning\": \"chất nhầy dư thừa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nasal mucus\", \"meaning\": \"nước mũi, chất nhầy trong mũi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mucous\", \"note_vi\": \"mucous là tính từ, còn mucus là danh từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mucous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-cori-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru0-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru5-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru6-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru10-c835ccbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru9-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru3-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru7-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru8-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-aru2-c835ccbc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-ljspeech-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt408-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt138-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt624-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt396-c835ccbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt498-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt132-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt288-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt42-c835ccbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mucus-lt90-c835ccbc.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -us là danh từ (mucus), đuôi -ous là tính từ (mucous).', 'health', 1, 28),
('cf467c38-a336-5dc2-8553-2d43dd66349c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'dbd237af-efa9-5b33-a654-e9834a5a0d75', 'dce08d00-d351-5084-b80a-72a6b99f190e', 'supervillain', '/ˈsuːpəˌvɪlən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một nhân vật phản diện hư cấu có sức mạnh hoặc mưu đồ siêu phàm, thường đối đầu với siêu anh hùng.', 'a bad character in a story who has special powers and tries to harm others.', 'The superhero faced his most cunning supervillain yet in the final battle.', 'Siêu anh hùng đã đối mặt với siêu phản diện xảo quyệt nhất của mình trong trận chiến cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing campaign used a funny supervillain character to promote their new security software.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị đã sử dụng một nhân vật siêu phản diện hài hước để quảng bá phần mềm bảo mật mới của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-ljspeech-caef2d98.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-cori-caef2d98.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supervillain-85ee6d48.webp', '[\"antagonist\", \"enemy\", \"foe\"]', '[\"superhero\", \"hero\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"comic book supervillain\", \"meaning\": \"siêu phản diện trong truyện tranh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"defeat the supervillain\", \"meaning\": \"đánh bại siêu phản diện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"villain\", \"note_vi\": \"villain là nhân vật phản diện thông thường, supervillain có sức mạnh siêu phàm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"villain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-cori-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru0-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru5-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru6-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru10-caef2d98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru9-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru3-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru7-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru8-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-aru2-caef2d98.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-ljspeech-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt408-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt138-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt624-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt396-caef2d98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt498-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt132-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt288-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt42-caef2d98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervillain-lt90-caef2d98.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này ghép từ \'super\' (siêu) và \'villain\' (kẻ phản diện).', 'marketing', 1, 29),
('5559a630-5546-5699-b452-347bfda1c01b', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'ordain', '/ɔːˈdeɪn/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Phong chức linh mục, mục sư hoặc bổ nhiệm chính thức.', 'To confer holy orders upon a candidate or enact a decree through authoritative legal decision.', 'She decided to ordain as a priest after many years of religious study.', 'Cô ấy quyết định được phong chức linh mục sau nhiều năm nghiên cứu tôn giáo.', '{\"en\": \"The organization will officially ordain its new director during the annual ceremony next month.\", \"vi\": \"Tổ chức sẽ chính thức bổ nhiệm giám đốc mới trong buổi lễ hàng năm vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-ljspeech-4b55967d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-cori-4b55967d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ordain-ef456f62.webp', '[\"appoint\", \"anoint\", \"consecrate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ordain a priest\", \"meaning\": \"phong chức linh mục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be ordained as\", \"meaning\": \"được bổ nhiệm hoặc phong chức làm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"order\", \"note_vi\": \"order nghĩa là ra lệnh hoặc đặt hàng, ordain mang tính bổ nhiệm mang nghi lễ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ordination\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-cori-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru0-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru5-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru6-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru10-4b55967d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru9-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru3-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru7-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru8-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-aru2-4b55967d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-ljspeech-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt408-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt138-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt624-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt396-4b55967d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt498-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt132-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt288-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt42-4b55967d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ordain-lt90-4b55967d.mp3\"]}}', 'Ordain thường đi với cấu trúc be ordained as + chức danh.', 'other', 1, 0),
('cdd6ff0b-27f5-54f0-945a-a5dc952bee53', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'set piece', '/set piːs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một cảnh hoặc đoạn hành động được dàn dựng công phu, ấn tượng trong phim, kịch.', 'a highly planned and exciting scene or event in a film, play, or show.', 'The car chase through the city was a thrilling set piece that kept the audience on the edge of their seats.', 'Cảnh rượt đuổi xe hơi xuyên thành phố là một màn hành động được dàn dựng công phu, gay cấn khiến khán giả đứng ngồi không yên.', '{\"en\": \"The theater group spent weeks rehearsing the major set piece for the opening show.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm kịch đã dành nhiều tuần tập luyện cảnh dàn dựng công phu chính cho buổi diễn mở màn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-ljspeech-1c7a3956.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-cori-1c7a3956.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/set-piece-ed25a52f.webp', '[\"showpiece\", \"spectacle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dramatic set piece\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh dàn dựng kịch tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elaborate set piece\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh dàn dựng công phu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-cori-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru0-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru5-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru6-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru10-1c7a3956.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru9-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru3-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru7-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru8-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-aru2-1c7a3956.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-ljspeech-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt408-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt138-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt624-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt396-1c7a3956.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt498-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt132-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt288-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt42-1c7a3956.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-piece-lt90-1c7a3956.mp3\"]}}', 'Cũng dùng trong bóng đá để chỉ tình huống cố định.', 'media', 1, 1),
('2f1e2163-0b11-5229-8235-e33d637cccf1', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'imprecisely', '/ˌɪmprɪˈsaɪsli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách không rõ ràng, không chính xác.', 'in a way that is not clear, accurate, or exact.', 'He described the location somewhat imprecisely, making it hard to find.', 'Anh ấy mô tả địa điểm khá không chính xác, khiến việc tìm kiếm trở nên khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The budget report was written imprecisely, leading to confusion among the board members.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo ngân sách được viết một cách không chính xác, dẫn đến sự bối rối giữa các thành viên hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-ljspeech-e93e8e6a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-cori-e93e8e6a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/imprecisely-b9efeafb.webp', '[\"inaccurately\", \"vaguely\", \"incorrectly\"]', '[\"precisely\", \"accurately\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"imprecisely defined\", \"meaning\": \"được định nghĩa không rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"imprecisely measured\", \"meaning\": \"được đo lường không chính xác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"incorrectly\", \"note_vi\": \"incorrectly là sai hoàn toàn, còn imprecisely là thiếu chính xác/mơ hồ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"imprecise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"imprecision\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"precisely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-cori-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru0-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru5-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru6-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru10-e93e8e6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru9-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru3-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru7-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru8-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-aru2-e93e8e6a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-ljspeech-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt408-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt138-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt624-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt396-e93e8e6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt498-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt132-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt288-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt42-e93e8e6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/imprecisely-lt90-e93e8e6a.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố im- mang nghĩa phủ định, kết hợp với precisely (chính xác).', 'finance', 1, 2),
('178336db-ebeb-5584-913e-bd2bdccefcac', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'upmarket', '/ˌʌpˈmɑːkɪt/', 'B2', 'adjective__adverb', 'Dành cho khách hàng có thu nhập cao; cao cấp.', 'designed for or used by people who have a lot of money.', 'The company decided to launch an upmarket version of its popular smartphone.', 'Công ty quyết định ra mắt một phiên bản cao cấp hơn của chiếc điện thoại thông minh phổ biến của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The developer plans to build an upmarket hotel near the new business district.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà phát triển có kế hoạch xây dựng một khách sạn cao cấp gần khu tài chính mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-ljspeech-6e3f1632.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-cori-6e3f1632.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upmarket-1eb68d0f.webp', '[\"upscale\", \"high-end\", \"luxury\"]', '[\"downmarket\", \"budget\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upmarket brand\", \"meaning\": \"thương hiệu cao cấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go upmarket\", \"meaning\": \"hướng tới phân khúc cao cấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"upscale\", \"note_vi\": \"đồng nghĩa nhưng phổ biến hơn ở Mỹ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-cori-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru0-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru5-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru6-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru10-6e3f1632.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru9-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru3-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru7-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru8-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-aru2-6e3f1632.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-ljspeech-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt408-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt138-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt624-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt396-6e3f1632.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt498-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt132-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt288-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt42-6e3f1632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upmarket-lt90-6e3f1632.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này phổ biến trong tiếng Anh-Anh, tương đương với upscale trong tiếng Anh-Mỹ.', 'business', 1, 3)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('7ca53fa9-44b3-50c1-b381-90c371a2fd90', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'catharsis', '/kəˈθɑːsɪs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự giải tỏa cảm xúc mạnh mẽ, đặc biệt là sự sợ hãi hoặc thương cảm, mang lại cảm giác nhẹ nhõm.', 'the process of releasing strong or repressed emotions to feel relief.', 'Watching the tragic play provided a powerful sense of catharsis for the audience.', 'Xem vở kịch bi thảm đã mang lại cảm giác thanh tẩy mạnh mẽ cho khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"Writing a formal complaint letter provided a sense of catharsis after the difficult project.\", \"vi\": \"Việc viết thư khiếu nại chính thức mang lại cảm giác giải tỏa sau dự án khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-ljspeech-1d256e9a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-cori-1d256e9a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catharsis-751f3063.webp', '[\"relief\", \"release\", \"purging\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"emotional catharsis\", \"meaning\": \"sự giải tỏa cảm xúc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide catharsis\", \"meaning\": \"mang lại sự giải tỏa\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-cori-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru0-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru5-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru6-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru10-1d256e9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru9-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru3-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru7-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru8-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-aru2-1d256e9a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-ljspeech-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt408-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt138-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt624-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt396-1d256e9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt498-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt132-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt288-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt42-1d256e9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catharsis-lt90-1d256e9a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong tâm lý học hoặc văn học.', 'daily', 1, 4),
('50c036f8-cf84-5970-a97e-a05d3ed41b49', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'pilfer', '/ˈpɪlfə(r)/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Ăn cắp những thứ nhỏ nhặt, có giá trị thấp.', 'to steal things that are not worth a lot of money.', 'Someone tried to pilfer a few items from the unattended shop.', 'Ai đó đã cố gắng trộm vặt vài món đồ từ cửa hàng không người trông coi.', '{\"en\": \"Security guards were hired to prevent dishonest workers from trying to pilfer office supplies.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo vệ đã được thuê để ngăn chặn những nhân viên không trung thực cố gắng ăn cắp vặt văn phòng phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-ljspeech-5222ef9a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-cori-5222ef9a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pilfer-5c00ce3c.webp', '[\"steal\", \"filch\", \"purloin\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pilfer supplies\", \"meaning\": \"ăn cắp vặt vật tư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pilfer goods\", \"meaning\": \"trộm vặt hàng hóa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rob\", \"note_vi\": \"cướp tài sản bằng đe dọa hoặc bạo lực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pilferage\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pilferer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-cori-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru0-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru5-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru6-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru10-5222ef9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru9-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru3-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru7-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru8-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-aru2-5222ef9a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-ljspeech-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt408-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt138-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt624-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt396-5222ef9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt498-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt132-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt288-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt42-5222ef9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pilfer-lt90-5222ef9a.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ hành vi ăn cắp những món đồ nhỏ, ít giá trị.', 'office', 1, 5),
('e44c40d5-b73a-5e61-b153-21d318a4d34d', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'bigoted', '/ˈbɪɡətɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Cố chấp, thành kiến, không khoan dung.', 'having strong and unfair beliefs that make you refuse to accept other people\'s different opinions or ways.', 'His bigoted views on other cultures made him unpopular with his colleagues.', 'Quan điểm cố chấp của anh ấy về các nền văn hóa khác khiến anh ấy không được lòng đồng nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was criticized for his bigoted remarks during the diversity training session last week.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã bị chỉ trích vì những nhận xét đầy thành kiến trong buổi đào tạo về sự đa dạng tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-ljspeech-cf7e5572.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-cori-cf7e5572.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bigoted-597e3e3b.webp', '[\"prejudiced\", \"intolerant\"]', '[\"tolerant\", \"open-minded\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bigoted views\", \"meaning\": \"quan điểm cố chấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bigoted attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ thành kiến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bigot\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bigotry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-cori-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru0-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru5-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru6-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru10-cf7e5572.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru9-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru3-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru7-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru8-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-aru2-cf7e5572.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-ljspeech-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt408-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt138-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt624-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt396-cf7e5572.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt498-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt132-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt288-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt42-cf7e5572.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bigoted-lt90-cf7e5572.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ sự phân biệt đối xử trong môi trường làm việc.', 'hr', 1, 6),
('ed09bcd5-50ab-5f7e-bee8-3d28a852a0fc', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'infomercial', '/ˌɪnfəʊˈmɜːʃəl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Chương trình quảng cáo dài trên truyền hình, thường giới thiệu chi tiết một sản phẩm.', 'a long television advertisement that provides detailed information about a product or service.', 'The company launched an infomercial to demonstrate their new exercise equipment to home viewers.', 'Công ty đã phát sóng một chương trình quảng cáo thương mại để giới thiệu thiết bị tập thể dục mới cho khán giả xem truyền hình.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team decided to produce an infomercial to boost sales of the new vacuum cleaner.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã quyết định sản xuất một chương trình quảng cáo dài để thúc đẩy doanh số của chiếc máy hút bụi mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-ljspeech-35d378a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-cori-35d378a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infomercial-4e1df18f.webp', '[\"commercial\", \"advertisement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shoot an infomercial\", \"meaning\": \"quay một chương trình quảng cáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"late-night infomercial\", \"meaning\": \"quảng cáo đêm khuya\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commercial\", \"note_vi\": \"commercial thường ngắn gọn, infomercial kéo dài như một chương trình.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-cori-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru0-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru5-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru6-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru10-35d378a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru9-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru3-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru7-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru8-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-aru2-35d378a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-ljspeech-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt408-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt138-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt624-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt396-35d378a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt498-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt132-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt288-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt42-35d378a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infomercial-lt90-35d378a1.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ ghép giữa information (thông tin) và commercial (quảng cáo).', 'marketing', 1, 7),
('c8dd5789-712e-5b6c-9b78-bdcb77ddbcf4', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'dart', '/dɑːt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phi tiêu (môn thể thao) hoặc vật nhỏ nhọn dùng để phóng.', 'a small pointed object that is thrown or shot as a weapon or in a game.', 'He threw a dart with precision, hitting the bullseye on the board.', 'Anh ấy ném một mũi phi tiêu chính xác, trúng hồng tâm trên bảng.', '{\"en\": \"The staff members organized a fun dart game during their annual company retreat.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên đã tổ chức một trò chơi phi tiêu vui vẻ trong chuyến dã ngoại hàng năm của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-ljspeech-c1785e56.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-cori-c1785e56.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dart-d2c9ca84.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"throw a dart\", \"meaning\": \"ném phi tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dart board\", \"meaning\": \"bảng phi tiêu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"date\", \"note_vi\": \"Ngày tháng hoặc cuộc hẹn, khác với phi tiêu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dart\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-cori-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru0-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru5-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru6-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru10-c1785e56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru9-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru3-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru7-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru8-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-aru2-c1785e56.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-ljspeech-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt408-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt138-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt624-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt396-c1785e56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt498-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt132-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt288-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt42-c1785e56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dart-lt90-c1785e56.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là trò chơi phi tiêu (danh từ), vừa có nghĩa là lao nhanh tới (động từ).', 'daily', 1, 8),
('fcabba8f-178b-543c-b3bf-3de9fabdb76f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'fermion', '/ˈfɜːmɪɒn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một loại hạt hạ nguyên tử tuân theo nguyên lý loại trừ Pauli.', 'a basic particle of matter in physics that cannot share the same state as another.', 'Electrons and protons are examples of fermions, which are fundamental particles.', 'Electron và proton là những ví dụ về fermion, là các hạt cơ bản.', '{\"en\": \"The research team published a paper on how a specific fermion behaves under extreme temperatures.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đã xuất bản một bài báo về cách một hạt fermion cụ thể phản ứng dưới nhiệt độ khắc nghiệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-ljspeech-36bab885.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-cori-36bab885.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fermion-5a046760.webp', '[\"particle\"]', '[\"boson\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fermion particle\", \"meaning\": \"hạt fermion\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-cori-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru0-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru5-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru6-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru10-36bab885.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru9-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru3-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru7-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru8-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-aru2-36bab885.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-ljspeech-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt408-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt138-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt624-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt396-36bab885.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt498-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt132-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt288-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt42-36bab885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fermion-lt90-36bab885.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên ngành vật lý, hiếm gặp trong TOEIC thông thường, có thể xuất hiện trong IELTS Reading.', 'academic', 1, 9),
('ffc29087-51af-5dec-8da1-65eb3a29dc0f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'millenarianism', '/ˌmɪl.əˈneə.ri.ə.nɪ.zəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Niềm tin vào một thời kỳ vàng son hoặc biến đổi lớn sắp đến.', 'the belief that a major change or a golden age will happen soon.', 'The group\'s ideology was rooted in millenarianism, predicting a new era of peace and prosperity.', 'Hệ tư tưởng của nhóm bắt nguồn từ thuyết thiên niên kỷ, dự đoán một kỷ nguyên hòa bình và thịnh vượng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker discussed how technology fuels modern millenarianism among young entrepreneurs.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính đã thảo luận về cách công nghệ thúc đẩy niềm tin vào thời kỳ hoàng kim hiện đại ở giới khởi nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-ljspeech-38cd0508.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-cori-38cd0508.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/millenarianism-104372fa.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"secular millenarianism\", \"meaning\": \"tư tưởng thiên niên kỷ phi tôn giáo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"millennium\", \"note_vi\": \"thời kỳ một nghìn năm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"millenarian\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"millenarian\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-cori-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru0-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru5-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru6-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru10-38cd0508.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru9-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru3-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru7-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru8-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-aru2-38cd0508.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-ljspeech-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt408-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt138-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt624-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt396-38cd0508.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt498-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt132-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt288-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt42-38cd0508.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/millenarianism-lt90-38cd0508.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ triết học chỉ niềm tin vào một kỷ nguyên hoàng kim sắp tới.', 'other', 1, 10),
('542b6911-e308-52cc-be2d-aec18f8819d6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'mutilate', '/ˈmjuːtɪleɪt/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Làm tổn thương nặng hoặc cắt bỏ một phần cơ thể.', 'to damage severely something so that it is completely ruined or destroyed.', 'The ancient manuscript was badly mutilated over time, making parts of it unreadable.', 'Cuốn bản thảo cổ đã bị hư hại nặng nề theo thời gian, khiến một số phần không thể đọc được.', '{\"en\": \"The courier service agreed to pay compensation for packages that were severely mutilated.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ chuyển phát nhanh đã đồng ý bồi thường cho các kiện hàng bị hư hỏng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-ljspeech-d3922dad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-cori-d3922dad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mutilate-3941950d.webp', '[\"damage\", \"ruin\", \"deface\"]', '[\"repair\", \"restore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severely mutilate\", \"meaning\": \"làm hư hỏng nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mutilate document\", \"meaning\": \"làm rách nát tài liệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mutate\", \"note_vi\": \"biến đổi di truyền, không phải làm hỏng nặng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mutilation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-cori-d3922dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-aru0-d3922dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-aru5-d3922dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-aru6-d3922dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-aru10-d3922dad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-aru9-d3922dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-aru3-d3922dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutilate-aru7-d3922dad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p