('07969f51-384f-53bd-a962-0563704c5b85', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'cough', '/kɒf/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hành động ho, tiếng ho.', 'a sudden and noisy release of air from the lungs through the throat and mouth.', 'She had a persistent cough that kept her awake at night.', 'Cô ấy bị một cơn ho dai dẳng khiến cô ấy thức giấc cả đêm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager had a bad cough during the meeting and had to leave early today.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bị ho nặng trong cuộc họp và phải rời đi sớm hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-ljspeech-1b9bcbed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-cori-1b9bcbed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cough-6903aa87.webp', '[\"hacking\", \"cold\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dry cough\", \"meaning\": \"ho khan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"persistent cough\", \"meaning\": \"ho dai dẳng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"choke\", \"note_vi\": \"choke là nghẹn, cough là ho.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cough\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-cori-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru0-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru5-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru6-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru10-1b9bcbed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru9-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru3-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru7-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru8-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-aru2-1b9bcbed.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-ljspeech-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt408-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt138-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt624-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt396-1b9bcbed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt498-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt132-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt288-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt42-1b9bcbed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cough-lt90-1b9bcbed.mp3\"]}}', '\"Cough up\" còn có nghĩa lóng là buộc phải trả tiền.', 'health', 1, 17),
('e4f57f26-a19b-5f70-8717-fd71d567850f', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'intently', '/ɪnˈtentli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách tập trung cao độ, chú ý kỹ lưỡng.', 'in a way that shows great attention and high concentration on something.', 'The engineer stared intently at the computer screen to spot the coding error.', 'Kỹ sư đã nhìn chằm chằm một cách chú tâm vào màn hình máy tính để phát hiện lỗi mã hóa.', '{\"en\": \"The board members listened intently as the consultant explained the new financial strategy.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã chăm chú lắng nghe khi cố vấn giải thích chiến lược tài chính mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-ljspeech-6a8d0992.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-cori-6a8d0992.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intently-2694e1c1.webp', '[\"attentively\", \"closely\", \"keenly\"]', '[\"distractedly\", \"indifferently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"listen intently\", \"meaning\": \"chăm chú lắng nghe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stare intently\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn chằm chằm đầy tập trung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intensely\", \"note_vi\": \"intensely là cực kỳ, dữ dội; intently là chăm chú\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"intent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intention\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-cori-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru0-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru5-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru6-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru10-6a8d0992.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru9-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru3-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru7-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru8-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-aru2-6a8d0992.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-ljspeech-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt408-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt138-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt624-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt396-6a8d0992.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt498-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt132-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt288-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt42-6a8d0992.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intently-lt90-6a8d0992.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn intently (chăm chú) với intensely (một cách dữ dội, cực kỳ).', 'office', 1, 18),
('51fa53d5-82b8-56dc-99cb-b2c3087dd839', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'asbestos', '/æsˈbestɒs/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một loại khoáng chất sợi, từng được dùng trong xây dựng nhưng nay bị cấm vì độc hại.', 'a natural fibrous mineral once widely used in building materials, now banned due to health risks.', 'Many old buildings still contain asbestos, which can be dangerous if disturbed.', 'Nhiều tòa nhà cũ vẫn còn chứa a-mi-ăng, thứ có thể nguy hiểm nếu bị tác động.', '{\"en\": \"The renovation was delayed because workers discovered asbestos in the ceiling panels.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cải tạo bị trì hoãn vì công nhân phát hiện amiăng trong các tấm trần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-ljspeech-457c6506.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-cori-457c6506.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/asbestos-794fada8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"asbestos removal\", \"meaning\": \"loại bỏ amiăng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"asbestos exposure\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp xúc với amiăng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"asbestos insulation\", \"meaning\": \"vật liệu cách nhiệt amiăng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"asphalt\", \"note_vi\": \"asphalt là nhựa đường, không liên quan đến amiăng\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-cori-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru0-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru5-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru6-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru10-457c6506.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru9-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru3-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru7-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru8-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-aru2-457c6506.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-ljspeech-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt408-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt138-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt624-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt396-457c6506.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt498-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt132-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt288-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt42-457c6506.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asbestos-lt90-457c6506.mp3\"]}}', 'Asbestos (amiăng) là từ chuyên ngành xây dựng/an toàn lao động, thường gặp trong đề TOEIC về bảo trì.', 'manufacturing', 1, 19),
('32df1828-b7a0-5362-bac8-0789e71028dd', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'scorch', 'UK: /ˈskɔːtʃɪŋ/ | US: /ˈskɔːrtʃɪŋ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'làm cháy xém', 'to burn or discolor a surface slightly by applying intense heat.', 'Be careful not to scorch the documents with the iron.', 'Hãy cẩn thận đừng làm cháy xém tài liệu bằng bàn ủi.', '{\"en\": \"Be careful when ironing the silk shirts so that you do not scorch the delicate fabric.\", \"vi\": \"Hãy cẩn thận khi ủi áo sơ mi lụa để bạn không làm cháy xém chất liệu vải mỏng nhẹ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-ljspeech-18784810.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-cori-18784810.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scorch-ff794021.webp', '[\"singe\", \"char\", \"burn\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"scorch mark\", \"meaning\": \"vết cháy xém\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scorch the surface\", \"meaning\": \"làm cháy xém bề mặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scotch\", \"note_vi\": \"scotch là loại rượu whiskie hoặc băng keo (Scotch tape), khác với scorch (làm cháy xém).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scorching\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-cori-18784810.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru0-18784810.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru5-18784810.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru6-18784810.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru10-18784810.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru9-18784810.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru3-18784810.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru7-18784810.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru8-18784810.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scorch-aru2-18