('b22d2579-7498-5372-ba72-473dce17a456', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'ampere', '/æmp/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Đơn vị đo cường độ dòng điện.', 'An international unit quantifying the rate of electrical charge flow through a conductor.', 'The circuit breaker tripped because too many devices were drawing too many amperes of current.', 'Cầu dao bị ngắt vì quá nhiều thiết bị đang tiêu thụ quá nhiều ampe dòng điện.', '{\"en\": \"The technician checked if the machine safe limit exceeded twenty amperes of electricity.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã kiểm tra xem giới hạn an toàn của máy có vượt quá 20 ampe điện hay không.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-ljspeech-cc1e0b1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-cori-cc1e0b1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ampere-2766aa18.webp', '[\"amp\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ampere rating\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ số ampe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"draw amperes\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu thụ dòng điện ampe\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"volt\", \"note_vi\": \"ampere đo cường độ dòng điện, volt đo hiệu điện thế.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-cori-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru0-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru5-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru6-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru10-cc1e0b1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru9-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru3-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru7-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru8-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-aru2-cc1e0b1e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-ljspeech-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt408-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt138-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt624-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt396-cc1e0b1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt498-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt132-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt288-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt42-cc1e0b1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ampere-lt90-cc1e0b1e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đời sống và kỹ thuật thường được viết tắt là \'amp\' hoặc ký hiệu \'A\'.', 'manufacturing', 1, 22),
('ebf81b0c-2a5c-5b8f-8f5c-e15a4eb82ad5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'e946be83-fab5-53f1-b103-88eb55185a9b', 'd936ebb0-8fdc-56fa-a0e0-fcbbab06542f', 'shrewd', '/ʃruːd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Khôn ngoan, sắc sảo trong việc đánh giá và đưa ra quyết định.', 'having good judgment and being able to make smart decisions in difficult situations.', 'She made a shrewd business deal that benefited both companies.', 'Cô ấy đã thực hiện một thỏa thuận kinh doanh khôn ngoan mang lại lợi ích cho cả hai công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The manager made a shrewd investment that increased the company\'s annual profit significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã thực hiện một khoản đầu tư khôn ngoan giúp tăng lợi nhuận hàng năm của công ty đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-ljspeech-dd7aa6b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-cori-dd7aa6b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shrewd-f85741da.webp', '[\"astute\", \"sharp\"]', '[\"foolish\", \"naive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"shrewd businessman\", \"meaning\": \"doanh nhân sắc sảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shrewd decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định khôn ngoan\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"shrewdly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-cori-dd7aa6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-aru0-dd7aa6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-aru5-dd7aa6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-aru6-dd7aa6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-aru10-dd7aa6b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-aru9-dd7aa6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-aru3-dd7aa6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-aru7-dd7aa6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrewd-aru8-dd7aa6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati