('6d41c5fa-76e2-5eb6-837c-6f75a87fc570', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f25f3758-a70d-5454-b39a-985261b04987', 'fbdb8355-d325-5e3e-a9eb-00bb7f97d2b3', 'endorse', '/ɪnˈdɔːs/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Công khai ủng hộ, tán thành hoặc xác nhận điều gì đó.', 'to say publicly that you support a person, statement, or action.', 'The committee voted unanimously to endorse the updated environmental policies proposed by the director.', 'Ủy ban đã bỏ phiếu nhất trí tán thành các chính sách môi trường cập nhật do giám đốc đề xuất.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors decided to endorse the new marketing strategy proposed by the manager.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã quyết định ủng hộ chiến lược tiếp thị mới do người quản lý đề xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-ljspeech-1ad6211d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-cori-1ad6211d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/endorse-123c6eda.webp', '[\"support\", \"approve\", \"back\"]', '[\"oppose\", \"reject\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"endorse a product\", \"meaning\": \"quảng cáo hoặc ủng hộ một sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"publicly endorse\", \"meaning\": \"công khai ủng hộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insure\", \"note_vi\": \"insure là mua bảo hiểm, endorse là ủng hộ hoặc ký hậu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"endorsement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-cori-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru0-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru5-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru6-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru10-1ad6211d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru9-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru3-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru7-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru8-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-aru2-1ad6211d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-ljspeech-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt408-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt138-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt624-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt396-1ad6211d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt498-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt132-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt288-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt42-1ad6211d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/endorse-lt90-1ad6211d.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh tài chính, từ này còn có nghĩa là ký tên vào mặt sau séc.', 'marketing', 1, 8),
('25784e82-e57e-58a2-8a73-870430fb2842', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f25f3758-a70d-5454-b39a-985261b04987', 'fbdb8355-d325-5e3e-a9eb-00bb7f97d2b3', 'obstinate', '/ˈɒbstɪnət/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Cố chấp, bướng bỉnh, không chịu thay đổi ý kiến.', 'refusing to change your opinions or behavior even when other people try to persuade you.', 'Despite all the evidence, he remained obstinate in his belief.', 'Mặc dù có tất cả bằng chứng, anh ta vẫn cố chấp với niềm tin của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The client remained obstinate about the project deadline despite the team\'s request for an extension.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng vẫn giữ thái độ cố chấp về thời hạn dự án bất chấp yêu cầu gia hạn của nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-ljspeech-5a174617.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-cori-5a174617.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obstinate-ad43421f.webp', '[\"stubborn\", \"inflexible\"]', '[\"flexible\", \"compliant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"obstinate refusal\", \"meaning\": \"sự từ chối bướng bỉnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"obstinate person\", \"meaning\": \"người cố chấp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obstinacy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-cori-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru0-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru5-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru6-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru10-5a174617.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru9-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru3-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru7-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru8-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-aru2-5a174617.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-ljspeech-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt408-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt138-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt624-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt396-5a174617.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt498-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt132-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt288-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt42-5a174617.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstinate-lt90-5a174617.mp3\"]}}', 'mang nghĩa tiêu cực, chỉ sự cứng nhắc không chịu hợp tác.', 'business', 1, 9),
('d379f433-8050-52d5-96a6-3ee714fbff80', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f25f3758-a70d-5454-b39a-985261b04987', 'fbdb8355-d325-5e3e-a9eb-00bb7f97d2b3', 'rave', '/reɪv/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lời khen ngợi nhiệt tình hoặc đánh giá rất tích cực.', 'an expression of strong praise and admiration for a product, service, or performance.', 'The new restaurant received rave reviews from all the food critics.', 'Nhà hàng mới nhận được những lời khen ngợi nhiệt tình từ tất cả các nhà phê bình ẩm thực.', '{\"en\": \"The new hotel received rave reviews from business travelers for its excellent service.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn mới đã nhận được những lời khen ngợi nồng nhiệt từ khách du lịch công tác vì dịch vụ xuất sắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-ljspeech-7a94a7a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-cori-7a94a7a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rave-7ed183b3.webp', '[\"praise\", \"acclaim\", \"compliment\"]', '[\"criticism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rave review\", \"meaning\": \"lời đánh giá khen ngợi hết lời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"receive raves\", \"meaning\": \"nhận được nhiều lời khen\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crave\", \"note_vi\": \"crave là động词 chỉ sự thèm muốn, khao khát.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rave\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-cori-7a94a7a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-aru0-7a94a7a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-aru5-7a94a7a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-aru6-7a94a7a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-aru10-7a94a7a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-aru9-7a94a7a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-aru3-7a94a7a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-aru7-7a94a7a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rave-aru8-7a94a7a4.m