('0b60c022-b39a-5cec-a4c8-5fbea20538a6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'weepy', '/ˈwiːpi/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Dễ khóc, hay khóc, hoặc có vẻ buồn bã muốn khóc.', 'feeling sad and ready to cry, or making you want to cry.', 'The emotional farewell speech at the retirement party made several long-time colleagues feel surprisingly weepy.', 'Bài phát biểu chia tay đầy xúc động tại buổi tiệc nghỉ hưu đã khiến nhiều đồng nghiệp lâu năm cảm thấy vô cùng cảm động muốn khóc.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service representative remained calm even when dealing with a very weepy client.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên dịch vụ khách hàng vẫn bình tĩnh ngay cả khi đối phó với một khách hàng rất dễ xúc động phát khóc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-ljspeech-5e57e1bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-cori-5e57e1bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weepy-ad650b2c.webp', '[\"tearful\", \"sad\", \"emotional\"]', '[\"cheerful\", \"happy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel weepy\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy muốn khóc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weepy movie\", \"meaning\": \"bộ phim sướt mướt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weep\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weepiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-cori-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru0-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru5-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru6-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru10-5e57e1bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru9-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru3-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru7-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru8-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-aru2-5e57e1bc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-ljspeech-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt408-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt138-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt624-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt396-5e57e1bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt498-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt132-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt288-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt42-5e57e1bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weepy-lt90-5e57e1bc.mp3\"]}}', 'Xuất phát từ động từ \"weep\" (khóc). Đuôi \"-y\" biến nó thành tính từ chỉ trạng thái dễ khóc.', 'daily', 1, 11),
('8ad2cc29-2d7e-54fb-9bcc-87de41a14ff4', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'ram', '/ræm/', 'B1', 'abbreviation', 'Bộ nhớ truy cập ngẫu nhiên của máy tính (viết tắt của Random Access Memory).', 'a type of computer memory that can be accessed quickly by hardware.', 'Adding more RAM can significantly improve your computer\'s performance.', 'Thêm nhiều RAM có thể cải thiện đáng kể hiệu suất máy tính của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Our IT department recommended upgrading the RAM to improve office workstation speeds.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận IT của chúng tôi khuyên nên nâng cấp bộ nhớ RAM để cải thiện tốc độ máy tính văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-ljspeech-77c7960e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-cori-77c7960e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ram-86f7e5eb.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"upgrade RAM\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cấp RAM\"}, {\"phrase\": \"system RAM\", \"meaning\": \"RAM hệ thống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ROM\", \"note_vi\": \"RAM là bộ nhớ tạm thời lưu dữ liệu đang xử lý, ROM là bộ nhớ chỉ đọc cố định.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-cori-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru0-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru5-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru6-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru10-77c7960e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru9-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru3-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru7-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru8-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-aru2-77c7960e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-ljspeech-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt408-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt138-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt624-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt396-77c7960e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt498-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt132-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt288-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt42-77c7960e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ram-lt90-77c7960e.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết tắt của Random Access Memory, là bộ nhớ tạm thời của máy tính.', 'technology', 1, 12),
('c838f4b0-7445-52ed-9140-6ae9f6f49b7c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'exaggeration', 'UK: /ɪɡˌzædʒəˈreɪʃən/ | US: /ɪɡˌzædʒəˈreɪʃən/', 'C1', 'noun', 'sự phóng đại', 'A statement that represents something as larger, better, or worse than it really is.', 'His story was full of exaggeration.', 'Câu chuyện của anh ấy đầy sự phóng đại.', '{\"en\": \"It is no exaggeration to say that Ms. Lee’s strategy saved the firm from bankruptcy.\", \"vi\": \"Không hề nói quá khi cho rằng chiến lược của cô Lee đã cứu công ty khỏi phá sản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-ljspeech-d502391d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-cori-d502391d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exaggeration-3f0097b2.webp', '[\"overstatement\", \"hyperbole\", \"amplification\"]', '[\"understatement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gross exaggeration\", \"meaning\": \"sự phóng đại quá mức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"without exaggeration\", \"meaning\": \"không hề nói quá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"evaluation\", \"note_vi\": \"exaggeration là sự phóng đại, còn evaluation là sự đánh giá.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exaggerate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"exaggerated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-cori-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru0-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru5-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru6-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru10-d502391d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru9-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru3-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru7-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru8-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-aru2-d502391d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-ljspeech-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt408-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt138-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt624-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt396-d502391d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt498-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt132-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt288-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt42-d502391d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exaggeration-lt90-d502391d.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay dùng trong các bài phát biểu hoặc báo cáo qua cụm \'without exaggeration\' (không hề nói quá) hoặc \'it is no exaggeration to say...\' (không quá lời khi nói...).', 'general business', 1, 13),
('b8604d09-0e9c-58c9-bed8-e89fceef96bb', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'complement', 'UK: /ˈkɒmplɪmənt/ | US: /ˈkɑmpləˌmɛnt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'bổ sung', 'to add to something in a way that improves it or makes it complete', 'Her skills will complement the team\'s strengths.', 'Kỹ năng của cô ấy sẽ bổ sung cho thế mạnh của nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"The new software complements our existing database system perfectly.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới bổ sung hoàn hảo cho hệ thống cơ sở dữ liệu hiện tại của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-ljspeech-6d5c9dab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-cori-6d5c9dab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/complement-bcb2b916.webp', '[\"enhance\", \"supplement\", \"complete\"]', '[\"clash\", \"conflict\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"complement each other\", \"meaning\": \"bổ sung cho nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"complement the team\", \"meaning\": \"bổ sung năng lực cho đội ngũ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compliment\", \"note_vi\": \"khen ngợi (v/n), lưu ý chữ \'i\' thay vì \'e\'\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"complementary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-cori-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru0-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru5-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru6-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru10-6d5c9dab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru9-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru3-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru7-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru8-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-aru2-6d5c9dab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-ljspeech-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt408-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt138-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt624-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt396-6d5c9dab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt498-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt132-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt288-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt42-6d5c9dab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complement-lt90-6d5c9dab.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'complement\' (bổ sung cho phù hợp/hoàn thiện) với \'compliment\' (khen ngợi).', 'office', 1, 14),
('59d15d99-7b5f-5219-a97a-d44730098cd2', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'condone', '/kənˈdəʊn/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Tha thứ, bỏ qua, dung túng (hành vi sai trái).', 'To disregard or overlook immoral behavior, giving implicit approval.', 'The school does not condone cheating in any form.', 'Nhà trường không dung túng bất kỳ hình thức gian lận nào.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO stated clearly that the company will not condone any unethical behavior.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành tuyên bố rõ ràng rằng công ty sẽ không dung túng cho bất kỳ hành vi phi đạo đức nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-ljspeech-9f35bfd4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-cori-9f35bfd4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/condone-8afe0055.webp', '[\"pardon\", \"overlook\", \"forgive\"]', '[\"condemn\", \"forbid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"condone violence\", \"meaning\": \"dung túng bạo lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"condone behavior\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ qua hành vi sai trái\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"condemn\", \"note_vi\": \"Condone là bao che dung túng, trái ngược hẳn với condemn là lên án.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-cori-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru0-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru5-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru6-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru10-9f35bfd4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru9-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru3-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru7-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru8-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-aru2-9f35bfd4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-ljspeech-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt408-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt138-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt624-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt396-9f35bfd4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt498-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt132-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt288-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt42-9f35bfd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condone-lt90-9f35bfd4.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện ở dạng phủ định (not condone) trong quy định công ty.', 'hr', 1, 15),
('4dcdd796-999c-5ce0-b177-60829e623709', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'rough cut', '/rʌf kʌt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Bản phim hoặc video được dựng sơ bộ, chưa hoàn chỉnh.', 'an early and unfinished version of a film or video that needs further editing.', 'The director showed us a rough cut of the movie to get our initial feedback.', 'Đạo diễn đã cho chúng tôi xem bản dựng thô của bộ phim để nhận phản hồi ban đầu.', '{\"en\": \"The media production team submitted a rough cut of the commercial for client approval.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ sản xuất truyền thông đã gửi bản dựng sơ bộ của quảng cáo để khách hàng duyệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-ljspeech-96e2085d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-cori-96e2085d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rough-cut-e74e76c8.webp', '[\"draft\", \"preliminary version\"]', '[\"final cut\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"review a rough cut\", \"meaning\": \"xem xét bản dựng sơ bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"submit a rough cut\", \"meaning\": \"nộp bản dựng sơ bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"draft\", \"note_vi\": \"draft dùng cho bản thảo văn bản, rough cut dùng cho phim hoặc video.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-cori-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru0-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru5-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru6-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru10-96e2085d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru9-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru3-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru7-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru8-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-aru2-96e2085d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-ljspeech-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt408-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt138-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt624-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt396-96e2085d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt498-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt132-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt288-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt42-96e2085d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rough-cut-lt90-96e2085d.mp3\"]}}', 'rough cut thường dùng trong ngành điện ảnh và sản xuất truyền hình, video.', 'media', 1, 16),
('d453e813-76f1-564c-ac5d-45b44fb99d10', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'sweeping', '/ˈswiːpɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Bao quát rộng lớn, ảnh hưởng đến nhiều thứ hoặc nhiều người.', 'having a very great impact or affecting a wide range of things.', 'The new policy introduced sweeping changes across the entire education system.', 'Chính sách mới đã đưa ra những thay đổi sâu rộng trên toàn bộ hệ thống giáo dục.', '{\"en\": \"The newly appointed CEO announced sweeping changes to improve company productivity next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Tân tổng giám đốc đã thông báo những thay đổi sâu rộng để cải thiện năng suất công ty trong quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-ljspeech-94570394.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-cori-94570394.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sweeping-abbc755a.webp', '[\"far-reaching\", \"extensive\", \"comprehensive\"]', '[\"limited\", \"narrow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sweeping changes\", \"meaning\": \"những thay đổi sâu rộng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sweeping reform\", \"meaning\": \"cải cách toàn diện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sweep\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-cori-94570394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-aru0-94570394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-aru5-94570394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-aru6-94570394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-aru10-94570394.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-aru9-94570394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-aru3-94570394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-aru7-94570394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sweeping-aru8-94570394.mp3\", \"/sto