('e766d17b-04b7-5563-85de-338aad0a55e6', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'forefront', 'UK: /ˈfɔːˌfrʌnt/ | US: /ˈfɔrˌfrʌnt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'hàng đầu, vị trí tiên phong', 'The leading or most prominent position in any activity or movement.', 'Our company is at the forefront of technological innovation.', 'Công ty chúng tôi luôn đi đầu trong đổi mới công nghệ.', '{\"en\": \"Our company strives to remain at the forefront of technological innovation in the renewable energy sector.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi nỗ lực duy trì vị trí hàng đầu trong đổi mới công nghệ ở lĩnh vực năng lượng tái tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-ljspeech-b3359b73.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-cori-b3359b73.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forefront-322b8241.webp', '[\"vanguard\", \"lead\", \"frontline\"]', '[\"background\", \"rear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at the forefront of\", \"meaning\": \"ở vị trí hàng đầu trong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bring something to the forefront\", \"meaning\": \"đưa cái gì lên vị trí hàng đầu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-cori-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru0-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru5-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru6-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru10-b3359b73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru9-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru3-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru7-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru8-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-aru2-b3359b73.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-ljspeech-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt408-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt138-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt624-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt396-b3359b73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt498-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt132-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt288-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt42-b3359b73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forefront-lt90-b3359b73.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm trong cụm cố định \'at the forefront of\' (ở vị trí hàng đầu của...)', 'technology', 1, 18),
('92ae27ae-669d-5eb2-9f6f-a6e4dc4f920c', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'concern', '/kənˈsɜːn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự lo lắng, bận tâm về một vấn đề hoặc tình huống.', 'a feeling of worry about a difficult situation or problem that needs attention.', 'Environmental protection is a major concern for many governments worldwide.', 'Bảo vệ môi trường là một mối lo ngại lớn đối với nhiều chính phủ trên toàn thế giới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager expressed deep concern regarding the rising costs of raw materials.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã bày tỏ sự quan ngại sâu sắc về chi phí nguyên vật liệu tăng cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-ljspeech-c5c3bf59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-cori-c5c3bf59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/concern-cf08ed6d.webp', '[\"worry\", \"anxiety\", \"apprehension\"]', '[\"indifference\", \"calmness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"express concern\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự quan ngại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause concern\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra sự lo ngại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"growing concern\", \"meaning\": \"mối bận tâm ngày càng tăng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"concern\", \"note_vi\": \"Trong ngữ cảnh doanh nghiệp, \'concern\' còn có nghĩa là một công ty hoặc doanh nghiệp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"concern\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"concerned\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-cori-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru0-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru5-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru6-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru10-c5c3bf59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru9-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru3-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru7-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru8-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru2-c5c3bf59.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-ljspeech-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt408-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt138-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt624-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt396-c5c3bf59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt498-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt132-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt288-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt42-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt90-c5c3bf59.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cấu trúc \'concern about/over/regarding something\'.', 'business', 1, 19),
('d5076ffc-75b0-5bb9-b328-3c674ad441e5', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'upscale', '/ʌpˈskeɪl/', 'B2', 'adjective__adverb', 'Thuộc về hoặc dành cho tầng lớp giàu có, chất lượng cao.', 'relating to expensive products or services designed for people with a lot of money.', 'They decided to dine at an upscale restaurant for their anniversary celebration.', 'Họ quyết định ăn tối tại một nhà hàng cao cấp để kỷ niệm ngày cưới.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel chain is targeting upscale travelers by offering luxury suites and premium concierge services.\", \"vi\": \"Chuỗi khách sạn đang nhắm đến những du khách thượng lưu bằng cách cung cấp các phòng suite sang trọng và dịch vụ hỗ trợ cao cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-ljspeech-d103ff52.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-cori-d103ff52.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upscale-6ee242f7.webp', '[\"luxurious\", \"exclusive\"]', '[\"budget\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upscale market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường cao cấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upscale restaurant\", \"meaning\": \"nhà hàng sang trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"upstage\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là chiếm sự chú ý của người khác, khác hoàn toàn về nghĩa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-cori-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru0-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru5-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru6-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru10-d103ff52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru9-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru3-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru7-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru8-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-aru2-d103ff52.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-ljspeech-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt408-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt138-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt624-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt396-d103ff52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt498-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt132-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt288-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt42-d103ff52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upscale-lt90-d103ff52.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong marketing để chỉ phân khúc khách hàng cao cấp.', 'business', 1, 20),
('74a29dfe-c875-5eee-968b-a03b8c19c436', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'mitochondrion', '/ˌmaɪtəˈkɒndriən/', 'C2', 'noun', 'ti thể (bộ phận tạo năng lượng trong tế bào)', 'a small part within a living cell that produces energy for it to function properly.', 'Each mitochondrion in a cell is responsible for generating most of the chemical energy needed to power biochemical reactions.', 'Mỗi ti thể trong tế bào chịu trách nhiệm tạo ra phần lớn năng lượng hóa học cần thiết để cung cấp năng lượng cho các phản ứng sinh hóa.', '{\"en\": \"The research laboratory received funding to study how a damaged mitochondrion affects overall cellular health.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng thí nghiệm nghiên cứu đã nhận được tài trợ để nghiên cứu xem một ti thể bị hỏng ảnh hưởng thế nào đến sức khỏe tổng thể của tế bào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-ljspeech-bdacb761.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-cori-bdacb761.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mitochondrion-020c05fe.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mitochondria\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mitochondrial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-cori-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru0-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru5-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru6-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru10-bdacb761.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru9-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru3-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru7-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru8-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-aru2-bdacb761.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-ljspeech-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt408-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt138-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt624-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt396-bdacb761.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt498-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt132-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt288-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt42-bdacb761.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitochondrion-lt90-bdacb761.mp3\"]}}', 'Dạng số nhiều của từ này là \'mitochondria\', rất phổ biến trong sinh học.', 'academic', 1, 21),
('d9a70660-2f3e-58d2-8015-6da8f8ac7473', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'dreary', '/ˈdrɪəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Buồn tẻ, ảm đạm, thiếu niềm vui.', 'making you feel sad, bored, or tired because nothing interesting or exciting is happening at all.', 'The weather was so dreary that we decided to stay indoors all day.', 'Thời tiết ảm đạm đến nỗi chúng tôi quyết định ở trong nhà cả ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The long meeting in the dreary conference room made everyone feel tired and lose their focus.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp kéo dài trong phòng hội nghị ảm đạm khiến mọi người cảm thấy mệt mỏi và mất tập trung.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-ljspeech-54d0c9ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-cori-54d0c9ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dreary-c6f87ecc.webp', '[\"dull\", \"gloomy\"]', '[\"cheerful\", \"exciting\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dreary weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết ảm đạm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dreary task\", \"meaning\": \"công việc buồn tẻ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-cori-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru0-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru5-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru6-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru10-54d0c9ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru9-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru3-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru7-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru8-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-aru2-54d0c9ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-ljspeech-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt408-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt138-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt624-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt396-54d0c9ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt498-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt132-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt288-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt42-54d0c9ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dreary-lt90-54d0c9ad.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để tả thời tiết hoặc không gian làm việc gây chán nản.', 'daily', 1, 22),
('41369c57-8e56-51c6-b8a0-b61160351c34', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'labyrinthine', '/ˌlæbəˈrɪnθaɪn/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Rắc rối, phức tạp như mê cung.', 'having many complicated paths or details that are difficult to understand.', 'The company\'s new policy was so labyrinthine that no one fully understood it.', 'Chính sách mới của công ty quá rắc rối đến nỗi không ai hiểu rõ hoàn toàn.', '{\"en\": \"New employees often struggle to navigate the company\'s labyrinthine organizational structure.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên mới thường gặp khó khăn trong việc định hướng cấu trúc tổ chức phức tạp như mê cung của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-ljspeech-a5b2cfc0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-cori-a5b2cfc0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/labyrinthine-fd83cd1f.webp', '[\"complicated\", \"intricate\", \"convoluted\"]', '[\"simple\", \"straightforward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"labyrinthine structure\", \"meaning\": \"cấu trúc phức tạp như mê cung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"labyrinthine procedures\", \"meaning\": \"thủ tục rắc rối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"labyrinth\", \"note_vi\": \"labyrinth là danh từ (mê cung), còn labyrinthine là tính từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"labyrinth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-cori-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru0-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru5-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru6-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru10-a5b2cfc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru9-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru3-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru7-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru8-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-aru2-a5b2cfc0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-ljspeech-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt408-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt138-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt624-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt396-a5b2cfc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt498-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt132-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt288-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt42-a5b2cfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labyrinthine-lt90-a5b2cfc0.mp3\"]}}', 'Xuất phát từ từ \'labyrinth\' (mê cung), dùng để tả sự phức tạp, rắc rối.', 'hr', 1, 23),
('608cdf51-b8ae-585c-a8cf-b2edd70a53c3', '0a4ec2d7-01c5-5457-a414-6530a08abf22', 'f4cc0387-36ec-5479-a8c0-8d7a26b6279b', 'afacdeac-0803-5fad-a946-c49d166b4644', 'surmount', '/səˈmaʊnt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Vượt qua một khó khăn, trở ngại; khắc phục.', 'to successfully deal with and overcome a difficult problem or barrier.', 'She worked hard to surmount the obstacles in her path to success.', 'Cô ấy đã làm việc chăm chỉ để vượt qua những trở ngại trên con đường thành công của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The team must surmount several challenges to finish the project on time.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ phải vượt qua một số thách thức để hoàn thành dự án đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surmount-ljspeech-d00e7cca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surmount-cori-d00e7cca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surmount-f43fef49.webp', '[\"overcome\", \"conquer\", \"clear\"]', '[\"succumb\", \"surrender\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"surmount an obstacle\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua trở ngại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surmount difficulties\", \"meaning\": \"khắc phục khó khăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surmount a hurdle\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua rào cản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"summit\", \"note_vi\": \"summit là đỉnh núi, surmount là vượt qua\"}, {\"word\": \"mount\", \"note_vi\": \"mount là leo lên, surmount là khắc phục trở ngại\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"surmountable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"insurmountable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surmount-cori-d00e7cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surmount-aru0-d00e7cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surmount-aru5-d00e7cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surmount-aru6-d00e7cca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surmount-aru10-d00e7cca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surmount-aru9-d00e7cca.mp3\", \