('4a6ce3a9-adf5-561c-beaf-b60a78f6ccf8', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '45f5c0d9-dfbd-5e95-9ce5-25ebde37677e', 'af55d930-b6ca-5b22-b399-023bc97d568c', 'read one\'s mind', '/riːd wʌnz maɪnd/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Đoán được suy nghĩ của người khác.', 'to know what another person is thinking without them telling you.', 'I was just about to ask for coffee, you must have read my mind!', 'Tôi vừa định hỏi xin cà phê, chắc bạn đọc được suy nghĩ của tôi rồi!', '{\"en\": \"The assistant seemed to read my mind by ordering lunch before I even asked.\", \"vi\": \"Người trợ lý dường như đọc được suy nghĩ của tôi khi đặt bữa trưa trước cả khi tôi yêu cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-ljspeech-9f9e1fc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-cori-9f9e1fc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/read-one-s-mind-caf04606.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"almost read one\'s mind\", \"meaning\": \"gần như đọc được suy nghĩ của ai\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-cori-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru0-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru5-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru6-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru10-9f9e1fc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru9-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru3-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru7-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru8-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-aru2-9f9e1fc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-ljspeech-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt408-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt138-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt624-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt396-9f9e1fc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt498-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt132-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt288-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt42-9f9e1fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/read-one-s-mind-lt90-9f9e1fc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để diễn tả sự thấu hiểu suy nghĩ của người khác mà không cần nói ra.', 'office', 1, 14),
('dff97f53-52e1-5e7e-a553-ec99b8ba4e4a', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '45f5c0d9-dfbd-5e95-9ce5-25ebde37677e', 'af55d930-b6ca-5b22-b399-023bc97d568c', 'all in the same boat', '/ɔːl ɪn ðə seɪm bəʊt/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Ở trong cùng một tình huống khó khăn hoặc bất lợi.', 'in the identical difficult or unpleasant situation as other people.', 'We\'re all in the same boat trying to meet this deadline, so let\'s help each other.', 'Chúng ta đều cùng cảnh ngộ khi cố gắng hoàn thành hạn chót này, vậy nên hãy giúp đỡ lẫn nhau.', '{\"en\": \"During the budget cuts, all department heads were in the same boat regarding staffing decisions.\", \"vi\": \"Trong đợt cắt giảm ngân sách, tất cả trưởng bộ phận đều ở trong cùng hoàn cảnh khó khăn về nhân sự.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-ljspeech-2a0c6094.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-cori-2a0c6094.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/all-in-the-same-boat-498e03e4.webp', '[\"in the same predicament\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"we are in the same boat\", \"meaning\": \"chúng ta cùng chung số phận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find oneself in the same boat\", \"meaning\": \"thấy mình ở cùng hoàn cảnh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-cori-2a0c6094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-aru0-2a0c6094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-aru5-2a0c6094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-aru6-2a0c6094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-aru10-2a0c6094.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-aru9-2a0c6094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-same-boat-aru3-2a0c6094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/all-in-the-sa