('55cf7646-aa37-5d3f-8061-765f52d86815', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '45f5c0d9-dfbd-5e95-9ce5-25ebde37677e', 'af55d930-b6ca-5b22-b399-023bc97d568c', 'go back to the drawing board', '/ɡəʊ bæk tə ðə ˈdrɔːɪŋ bɔːd/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Bắt đầu lại từ đầu một kế hoạch hoặc thiết kế vì cái cũ không thành công.', 'to start planning a project again because the previous attempt failed completely.', 'When the client rejected our initial design, we were forced to go back to the drawing board.', 'Khi khách hàng từ chối thiết kế ban đầu của chúng tôi, chúng tôi buộc phải làm lại từ đầu.', '{\"en\": \"Since the marketing campaign failed, the team had to go back to the drawing board.\", \"vi\": \"Vì chiến dịch tiếp thị thất bại, cả đội phải làm lại từ đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-ljspeech-7848e57b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-cori-7848e57b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-f8aec51e.webp', '[\"start over\", \"rethink\", \"restart\"]', '[\"finalize\", \"complete\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"force someone back to the drawing board\", \"meaning\": \"buộc ai đó phải làm lại từ đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"time to go back to the drawing board\", \"meaning\": \"đã đến lúc làm lại từ đầu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-cori-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru0-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru5-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru6-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru10-7848e57b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru9-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru3-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru7-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru8-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-aru2-7848e57b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-ljspeech-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt408-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt138-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt624-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt396-7848e57b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt498-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt132-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt288-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt42-7848e57b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/go-back-to-the-drawing-board-lt90-7848e57b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong công việc khi kế hoạch trước đó không đem lại kết quả.', 'marketing', 1, 21),
('0ba6685f-12f0-572a-9e61-424fe3db5c29', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '45f5c0d9-dfbd-5e95-9ce5-25ebde37677e', 'af55d930-b6ca-5b22-b399-023bc97d568c', 'hit the hay', '/hɪt ðə heɪ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Đi ngủ, nghỉ ngơi sau một ngày.', 'to go to bed in order to sleep after a long day.', 'After a long day of hiking, I was so tired I just wanted to hit the hay.', 'Sau một ngày dài đi bộ đường dài, tôi mệt đến mức chỉ muốn đi ngủ ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"After working late to finish the monthly sales report, the manager decided to hit the hay.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi làm việc muộn để hoàn thành báo cáo doanh số hàng tháng, quản lý quyết định đi ngủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-ljspeech-147ef808.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-cori-147ef808.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hit-the-hay-35fdab0d.webp', '[\"hit the sack\", \"turn in\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"time to hit the hay\", \"meaning\": \"đã đến lúc đi ngủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ready to hit the hay\", \"meaning\": \"sẵn sàng đi ngủ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-cori-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru0-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru5-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru6-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru10-147ef808.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru9-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru3-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru7-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru8-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-aru2-147ef808.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-ljspeech-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt408-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt138-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt624-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt396-147ef808.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt498-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt132-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt288-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt42-147ef808.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-hay-lt90-147ef808.mp3\"]}}', 'Là cách nói thân mật trong giao tiếp, đồng nghĩa với \'hit the sack\'.', 'daily', 1, 22),
('df11cab5-8ec8-55f4-95b7-41ffa8697444', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '45f5c0d9-dfbd-5e95-9ce5-25ebde37677e', 'af55d930-b6ca-5b22-b399-023bc97d568c', 'a breath of fresh air', '/ə breθ əv freʃ eə/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Một điều gì đó mới mẻ, tích cực, mang lại sự thay đổi tốt đẹp.', 'someone or something that is new, interesting, and exciting in a situation.', 'The new CEO\'s transparent leadership style is a breath of fresh air for all employees.', 'Phong cách lãnh đạo minh bạch của vị giám đốc điều hành mới là một luồng gió mới cho toàn thể nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing director\'s creative strategy was a breath of fresh air for the team.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến lược sáng tạo của giám đốc tiếp thị mới là một luồng gió mới cho cả đội ngũ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-ljspeech-f0293e49.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-cori-f0293e49.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-breath-of-fresh-air-92e6b291.webp', '[\"novelty\", \"refreshment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"bring a breath of fresh air\", \"meaning\": \"mang lại một luồng gió mới\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-cori-f0293e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-aru0-f0293e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-aru5-f0293e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-aru6-f0293e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-aru10-f0293e49.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-aru9-f0293e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-aru3-f0293e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-breath-of-fresh-air-aru7-f0293e49.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v