('694f175a-9774-58f4-8333-3577adba8696', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '66285396-d9aa-572e-b222-e1e2ab74a36a', '24d17a38-d186-5e77-b23e-fe629710ce97', 'leave well enough alone', '/liːv wel ɪˈnʌf əˈləʊn/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Không can thiệp, không cố gắng cải thiện khi mọi thứ đang ổn.', 'to avoid changing or interfering with something that is already working well.', 'The computer was working fine, so I decided to leave well enough alone and not try to update it.', 'Máy tính vẫn chạy tốt, nên tôi quyết định cứ để yên và không cố gắng cập nhật nó.', '{\"en\": \"Since the current filing system works well, the supervisor advised staff to leave well enough alone.\", \"vi\": \"Vì hệ thống lưu trữ hiện tại hoạt động tốt, người giám sát khuyên nhân viên không nên can thiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-ljspeech-c404500c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-cori-c404500c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leave-well-enough-alone-fce21143.webp', '[\"let sleeping dogs lie\", \"if it ain\'t broke don\'t fix it\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"decide to leave well enough alone\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định không can thiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"better to leave well enough alone\", \"meaning\": \"tốt hơn là không nên thay đổi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-cori-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru0-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru5-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru6-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru10-c404500c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru9-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru3-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru7-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru8-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-aru2-c404500c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-ljspeech-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt408-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt138-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt624-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt396-c404500c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt498-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt132-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt288-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt42-c404500c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leave-well-enough-alone-lt90-c404500c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này khuyên không nên thay đổi khi mọi thứ đang ổn; tương đương \'đừng vẽ đường cho hươu chạy\'.', 'office', 1, 17),
('9e756ff8-8663-5769-946a-606e45079d70', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '66285396-d9aa-572e-b222-e1e2ab74a36a', '24d17a38-d186-5e77-b23e-fe629710ce97', 'last straw', '/lɑːst strɔː/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Giới hạn cuối cùng, điểm chịu đựng cuối cùng.', 'the final problem in a series of bad events that makes you lose patience.', 'Losing my keys was the last straw after a series of unfortunate events that day.', 'Việc mất chìa khóa là giọt nước tràn ly sau một loạt những sự kiện không may trong ngày hôm đó.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden cancellation of the project was the last straw for the creative director.\", \"vi\": \"Việc đột ngột hủy bỏ dự án là giọt nước tràn ly đối với giám đốc sáng tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-ljspeech-9703a6b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-cori-9703a6b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/last-straw-ac5c069f.webp', '[\"the final straw\", \"breaking point\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"be the last straw\", \"meaning\": \"là giọt nước tràn ly\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prove to be the last straw\", \"meaning\": \"hóa ra là giới hạn chịu đựng cuối cùng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"the straw that broke the camel\'s back\", \"note_vi\": \"Phiên bản đầy đủ của thành ngữ này.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-cori-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru0-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru5-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru6-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru10-9703a6b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru9-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru3-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru7-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru8-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-aru2-9703a6b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-ljspeech-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt408-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt138-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt624-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt396-9703a6b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt498-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt132-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt288-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt42-9703a6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/last-straw-lt90-9703a6b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Tương đương với câu thành ngữ \'giọt nước tràn ly\' trong tiếng Việt.', 'hr', 1, 18),
('07a57657-af10-54a8-995a-6e609ea5238d', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '66285396-d9aa-572e-b222-e1e2ab74a36a', '24d17a38-d186-5e77-b23e-fe629710ce97', 'throw in the towel', '/θrəʊ ɪn ðə taʊəl/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Quyết định từ bỏ một nỗ lực hoặc cuộc chiến.', 'to admit that you have been defeated and stop trying to do something difficult.', 'After trying for hours, she finally threw in the towel and asked for help.', 'Sau nhiều giờ cố gắng, cuối cùng cô ấy cũng từ bỏ và nhờ giúp đỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The startup company had to throw in the towel after failing to secure additional funding.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp đã phải bỏ cuộc sau khi không kêu gọi được thêm vốn tài trợ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-ljspeech-038a3a58.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-cori-038a3a58.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/throw-in-the-towel-6a5aa4c4.webp', '[\"give up\", \"surrender\", \"quit\"]', '[\"persevere\", \"keep going\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be ready to throw in the towel\", \"meaning\": \"sẵn sàng bỏ cuộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"finally throw in the towel\", \"meaning\": \"cuối cùng cũng bỏ cuộc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-cori-038a3a58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-aru0-038a3a58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-aru5-038a3a58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-aru6-038a3a58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-aru10-038a3a58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-aru9-038a3a58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-aru3-038a3a58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/throw-in-the-towel-aru7-038a3a58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p