('29614f73-a6d9-5171-a71d-ae6278ff6166', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', '66285396-d9aa-572e-b222-e1e2ab74a36a', '24d17a38-d186-5e77-b23e-fe629710ce97', 'give the benefit of the doubt', '/ɡɪv ðə ˈbenɪfɪt əv ðə daʊt/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Tin tưởng ai đó vô tội hoặc nói thật, dù có thể nghi ngờ.', 'to accept that someone is telling the truth even if you are not completely sure.', 'I\'ll give him the benefit of the doubt this time, but he needs to be more careful.', 'Lần này tôi sẽ tạm tin anh ấy, nhưng anh ấy cần cẩn thận hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to give the employee the benefit of the doubt regarding his late arrival.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý quyết định tin tưởng nhân viên về lý do anh ấy đến muộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-ljspeech-02f0f387.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-cori-02f0f387.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-a388553f.webp', '[\"trust\", \"believe\"]', '[\"suspect\", \"distrust\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deserve the benefit of the doubt\", \"meaning\": \"xứng đáng được tin tưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"receive the benefit of the doubt\", \"meaning\": \"được tin tưởng dù còn nghi ngờ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-cori-02f0f387.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-aru0-02f0f387.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-aru5-02f0f387.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-aru6-02f0f387.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-aru10-02f0f387.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-the-doubt-aru9-02f0f387.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/give-the-benefit-of-t