('7c8b4d3e-1723-5ab3-a353-b3f8942cb614', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'it takes two to tango', '/ɪt teɪks tuː tə ˈtæŋɡəʊ/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Cả hai bên đều phải chịu trách nhiệm hoặc tham gia vào một tình huống.', 'both people involved must share the blame or effort in a situation.', 'When there\'s a disagreement, remember that it takes two to tango, so both sides need to compromise.', 'Khi có bất đồng, hãy nhớ rằng cả hai bên đều có trách nhiệm, vì vậy cả hai cần phải thỏa hiệp.', '{\"en\": \"During the contract dispute, the manager said it takes two to tango to resolve it.\", \"vi\": \"Trong tranh chấp hợp đồng, người quản lý nói cả hai bên đều có trách nhiệm để giải quyết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-ljspeech-05e6c8d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-cori-05e6c8d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/it-takes-two-to-tango-fd3232e9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"say it takes two to tango\", \"meaning\": \"nói rằng cả hai bên đều có trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"it takes two to tango in business\", \"meaning\": \"cả hai bên cùng chịu trách nhiệm trong kinh doanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tangle\", \"note_vi\": \"tangle là làm rối, không liên quan điệu nhảy tango\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-cori-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru0-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru5-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru6-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru10-05e6c8d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru9-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru3-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru7-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru8-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-aru2-05e6c8d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-ljspeech-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt408-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt138-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt624-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt396-05e6c8d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt498-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt132-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt288-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt42-05e6c8d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-takes-two-to-tango-lt90-05e6c8d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ chỉ cả hai phía cùng có lỗi, đừng hiểu theo nghĩa đen điệu nhảy.', 'business', 1, 5),
('4467b6df-d69f-5b91-97f4-99a3fd33df6d', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'get the ball rolling', '/ɡɛt ðə bɔːl rəʊlɪŋ/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Bắt đầu một hoạt động hoặc quá trình.', 'to start a process or activity and make it begin to move forward.', 'To get the ball rolling, the manager introduced the primary objectives of the campaign.', 'Để khởi động tiến trình, người quản lý đã giới thiệu các mục tiêu chính của chiến dịch.', '{\"en\": \"The director asked the marketing team to get the ball rolling on the new campaign immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc yêu cầu nhóm marketing bắt đầu triển khai chiến dịch mới ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-ljspeech-1dd074a3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-cori-1dd074a3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-the-ball-rolling-1ad1864e.webp', '[\"kick off\", \"set the wheels in motion\", \"start the process\"]', '[\"bring to a halt\", \"put on hold\", \"stall\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get the ball rolling on something\", \"meaning\": \"bắt đầu triển khai điều gì đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep the ball rolling\", \"meaning\": \"duy trì tiến độ, không để dừng lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"set the ball rolling\", \"meaning\": \"khởi động một quá trình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"keep the ball rolling\", \"note_vi\": \"\'keep\' là duy trì tiến độ đang có, còn \'get\' là bắt đầu từ đầu\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-cori-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru0-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru5-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru6-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru10-1dd074a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru9-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru3-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru7-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru8-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-aru2-1dd074a3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-ljspeech-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt408-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt138-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt624-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt396-1dd074a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt498-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt132-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt288-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt42-1dd074a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-the-ball-rolling-lt90-1dd074a3.mp3\"]}}', '\'Keep the ball rolling\' là cụm liên quan hay gặp: duy trì tiến độ sau khi đã bắt đầu.', 'business', 1, 6),
('01f2f855-8849-54ca-9143-c32a2cc5da1b', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'get a head start', '/ɡɛt ə hɛd stɑːt/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Bắt đầu sớm hơn để có lợi thế.', 'to begin something earlier than others in order to gain an advantage.', 'We decided to leave early to get a head start on the holiday traffic.', 'Chúng tôi quyết định đi sớm để tránh tắc đường vào kỳ nghỉ.', '{\"en\": \"We should submit the proposal today to get a head start on our competitors.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta nên nộp bản đề xuất hôm nay để có lợi thế sớm trước các đối thủ cạnh tranh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-ljspeech-6a804a05.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-cori-6a804a05.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-a-head-start-0c60655a.webp', '[\"gain an advantage\", \"get ahead\"]', '[\"fall behind\", \"start late\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get a head start on\", \"meaning\": \"có lợi thế sớm hơn trong việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"give someone a head start\", \"meaning\": \"cho ai đó lợi thế đi trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"headstart\", \"note_vi\": \"Thường viết rời thành hai từ \'head start\' trong tiếng Anh Mỹ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-cori-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru0-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru5-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru6-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru10-6a804a05.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru9-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru3-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru7-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru8-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-aru2-6a804a05.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-ljspeech-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt408-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt138-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt624-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt396-6a804a05.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt498-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt132-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt288-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt42-6a804a05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-a-head-start-lt90-6a804a05.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm này bắt nguồn từ đua ngựa, khi một con ngựa được xuất phát trước.', 'business', 1, 7),
('b6c139bc-e110-55eb-b9db-e4c8ece41b02', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'run of the mill', '/rʌn əv ðə mɪl/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Tầm thường, không có gì đặc biệt.', 'describing something that is ordinary and lacks any unique or interesting qualities.', 'Instead of a run-of-the-mill presentation, she delivered an engaging and highly creative speech.', 'Thay vì một bài thuyết trình tầm thường, cô ấy đã trình bày một diễn văn lôi cuốn và cực kỳ sáng tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The office furniture provided by the supplier is quite run of the mill and uncomfortable.\", \"vi\": \"Đồ nội thất văn phòng do nhà cung cấp mang đến khá tầm thường và không thoải mái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-ljspeech-1d61c8ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-cori-1d61c8ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/run-of-the-mill-b9d4657c.webp', '[\"ordinary\", \"average\"]', '[\"exceptional\", \"unique\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"run of the mill product\", \"meaning\": \"sản phẩm thông thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"run of the mill service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ bình thường\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-cori-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru0-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru5-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru6-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru10-1d61c8ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru9-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru3-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru7-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru8-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-aru2-1d61c8ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-ljspeech-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt408-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt138-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt624-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt396-1d61c8ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt498-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt132-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt288-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt42-1d61c8ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/run-of-the-mill-lt90-1d61c8ab.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ những thứ không có gì nổi bật, dễ bị lãng quên.', 'business', 1, 8),
('5c5efef7-76cb-5b7c-9719-12509aefae74', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'far cry from', '/fɑː kraɪ frəm/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Khác xa hoặc kém hơn nhiều so với điều gì đó.', 'to be very different from or much worse than something that was expected or promised.', 'The reality of the job was a far cry from what I had imagined.', 'Thực tế công việc khác xa so với những gì tôi đã tưởng tượng.', '{\"en\": \"The current office facilities are a far cry from the modern ones we were promised.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ sở vật chất văn phòng hiện tại khác xa với những gì chúng ta được hứa hẹn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-ljspeech-453ebcb4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-cori-453ebcb4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/far-cry-from-05183529.webp', '[\"poles apart\", \"worlds apart\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a far cry\", \"meaning\": \"một khoảng cách lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be a far cry from\", \"meaning\": \"khác xa với\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-cori-453ebcb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru0-453ebcb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru5-453ebcb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru6-453ebcb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru10-453ebcb4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru9-453ebcb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru3-453ebcb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru7-453ebcb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru8-453ebcb4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/far-cry-from-aru2-453ebcb4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/o