('935d629f-e0b6-5839-bf5c-9a65bcf23da0', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'hit the nail on the head', '/hɪt ðə neɪl ɒn ðə hed/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Nói hoặc làm điều gì đó hoàn toàn đúng, chính xác.', 'to describe exactly what is causing a situation or problem.', 'When you said the main problem was communication, you really hit the nail on the head.', 'Khi bạn nói vấn đề chính là giao tiếp, bạn thực sự đã nói trúng phóc.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant hit the nail on the head with his analysis of our sales.\", \"vi\": \"Người tư vấn đã chỉ ra rất chính xác với phân tích của ông ấy về doanh số của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-ljspeech-2c028d23.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-cori-2c028d23.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-8d76e885.webp', '[\"be exactly right\", \"be spot on\", \"strike home\"]', '[\"miss the mark\", \"be wide of the mark\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"really hit the nail on the head\", \"meaning\": \"nói trúng phóc, cực kỳ chính xác\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-cori-2c028d23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-aru0-2c028d23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-aru5-2c028d23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-aru6-2c028d23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-aru10-2c028d23.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-aru9-2c028d23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-aru3-2c028d23.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hit-the-nail-on-the-head-aru7-2c028d23.mp3\", 