('a9fdf877-331c-5792-8a23-4d31ea36a899', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'for ages', '/fə ˈeɪdʒɪz/', 'A2', 'idiom', 'Trong một khoảng thời gian rất dài.', 'for a very long period of time indeed.', 'I haven\'t seen her for ages; she must be busy.', 'Tôi đã không gặp cô ấy rất lâu rồi; chắc cô ấy bận lắm.', '{\"en\": \"We have not received their payment for ages, so we paused the order.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đã không nhận được khoản thanh toán của họ mãi nên tạm dừng đơn hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-ljspeech-635ebc4d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-cori-635ebc4d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/for-ages-34dae1ff.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wait for ages\", \"meaning\": \"chờ đợi rất lâu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"not see someone for ages\", \"meaning\": \"không gặp ai đó mãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ages\", \"note_vi\": \"ages là thời gian dài, không phải số nhiều của tuổi\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-cori-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru0-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru5-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru6-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru10-635ebc4d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru9-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru3-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru7-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru8-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-aru2-635ebc4d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-ljspeech-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt408-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt138-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt624-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt396-635ebc4d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt498-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt132-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt288-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt42-635ebc4d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-ages-lt90-635ebc4d.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng chỉ thời gian dài, không phải danh từ tuổi tác.', 'finance', 1, 11),
('81436b23-3733-5c13-90b8-271f611bcc9a', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'a penny for your thoughts', '/ə ˈpen.i fə jə ˈθɔːts/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Bạn đang nghĩ gì vậy? (Hỏi khi thấy ai đó trầm tư).', 'a way of asking someone what they are thinking about when they are quiet.', 'Tom has been unusually quiet during the meeting today; a penny for your thoughts?', 'Tom đã yên lặng một cách bất thường trong cuộc họp hôm nay; bạn đang mải suy nghĩ gì thế?', '{\"en\": \"You look very serious; a penny for your thoughts on this new business proposal?\", \"vi\": \"Trông bạn rất nghiêm túc; bạn đang nghĩ gì về đề xuất kinh doanh mới này vậy?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-ljspeech-496ca347.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-cori-496ca347.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-75221708.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-cori-496ca347.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-aru0-496ca347.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-aru5-496ca347.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-aru6-496ca347.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-aru10-496ca347.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-aru9-496ca347.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-aru3-496ca347.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-aru7-496ca347.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-thoughts-aru8-496ca347.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-penny-for-your-th