('6f8bdbbf-9abf-53cd-bc04-ef0ad1f0da7e', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'a drop in the ocean', '/ə drɒp ɪn ðə ˈəʊʃən/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Một lượng rất nhỏ so với tổng thể, không đáng kể.', 'a very small amount of something compared to the total amount needed.', 'Our small donation was just a drop in the ocean compared to the millions needed for relief efforts.', 'Khoản quyên góp nhỏ của chúng tôi chỉ là muối bỏ bể so với hàng triệu đô la cần thiết cho công tác cứu trợ.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing budget is just a drop in the ocean compared to last year.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân sách tiếp thị mới chỉ là một lượng rất nhỏ so với năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-ljspeech-62f7f20f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-cori-62f7f20f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-drop-in-the-ocean-2d96f65b.webp', '[\"a drop in the bucket\", \"insignificant amount\"]', '[\"a large amount\", \"vast quantity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be a drop in the ocean\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ là muối bỏ bể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"a drop in the bucket\", \"note_vi\": \"Nghĩa tương tự, phổ biến hơn trong tiếng Anh Mỹ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-cori-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru0-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru5-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru6-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru10-62f7f20f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru9-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru3-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru7-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru8-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-aru2-62f7f20f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-ljspeech-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt408-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt138-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt624-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt396-62f7f20f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt498-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt132-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt288-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt42-62f7f20f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-drop-in-the-ocean-lt90-62f7f20f.mp3\"]}}', 'Tương đương thành ngữ \'muối bỏ bể\' trong tiếng Việt.', 'finance', 1, 23),
('c30cba70-fa13-57ba-b92c-d6c9ce00ee61', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'ad5fae72-7d85-5584-8011-8fbfc3d3e7f9', '5db2ab89-91be-54c2-b5ae-9a6d5e49016c', 'explore all avenues', '/ɪkˈsplɔːr ɔːl ˈævənjuːz/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Tìm kiếm mọi khả năng, mọi giải pháp có thể.', 'to investigate every possible method or possibility to solve a problem.', 'Before making a final decision, we need to explore all avenues to ensure we\'ve considered every option.', 'Trước khi đưa ra quyết định cuối cùng, chúng ta cần tìm mọi cách để đảm bảo đã xem xét tất cả các lựa chọn.', '{\"en\": \"The legal team will explore all avenues to protect our company\'s patent rights.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ pháp lý sẽ tìm kiếm mọi giải pháp có thể để bảo vệ quyền bằng sáng chế của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-ljspeech-fdcc9117.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-cori-fdcc9117.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/explore-all-avenues-d0c603ed.webp', '[\"leave no stone unturned\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"explore all avenues to\", \"meaning\": \"thử mọi cách để\"}, {\"phrase\": \"need to explore all avenues\", \"meaning\": \"cần tìm kiếm mọi hướng đi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-cori-fdcc9117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-aru0-fdcc9117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-aru5-fdcc9117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-aru6-fdcc9117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-aru10-fdcc9117.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-aru9-fdcc9117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-aru3-fdcc9117.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/explore-all-avenues-aru7-fdc