('698b8fc9-af7a-5782-80a9-e6ac1057efaa', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'd559fb60-7639-5987-b962-00a540cc462e', 'bbdbe1b1-23ac-5f53-b27d-89ddc755fac6', 'burn the midnight oil', '/bɜːn ðə ˈmɪdnaɪt ɔɪl/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Thức khuya làm việc hoặc học bài.', 'to stay awake late to work or study hard.', 'Students often have to burn the midnight oil before big exams.', 'Sinh viên thường phải thức khuya học bài trước các kỳ thi lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The engineer burned the midnight oil to fix the server before launch.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ sư đã thức khuya làm việc để sửa máy chủ trước khi ra mắt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-ljspeech-8652294e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-cori-8652294e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/burn-the-midnight-oil-c1b757d9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"burn the midnight oil at office\", \"meaning\": \"thức khuya làm việc văn phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have to burn midnight oil\", \"meaning\": \"phải thức đêm làm việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"midnight\", \"note_vi\": \"midnight là nửa đêm, không phải dầu thực sự bị đốt\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-cori-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru0-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru5-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru6-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru10-8652294e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru9-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru3-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru7-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru8-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-aru2-8652294e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-ljspeech-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt408-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt138-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt624-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt396-8652294e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt498-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt132-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt288-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt42-8652294e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/burn-the-midnight-oil-lt90-8652294e.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng thức khuya, không phải đốt dầu lúc nửa đêm.', 'technology', 1, 7),
('afc47e6d-3ef0-5f8d-aee2-7661c624d8cd', '3cb5eba7-1277-5218-a8ad-8b9586fd9ccf', 'd559fb60-7639-5987-b962-00a540cc462e', 'bbdbe1b1-23ac-5f53-b27d-89ddc755fac6', 'the wee hours', '/ðə wiː aʊəz/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Thời gian rất sớm vào buổi sáng, trước bình minh.', 'the very early hours of the morning, shortly after midnight until sunrise.', 'The dedicated IT team worked into the wee hours to finalize the system update.', 'Đội ngũ công nghệ thông tin tận tụy đã làm việc đến tận rạng sáng để hoàn tất bản cập nhật hệ thống.', '{\"en\": \"The IT team worked until the wee hours to fix the server before the morning shift.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ IT đã làm việc đến tận sáng sớm để sửa máy chủ trước ca làm việc sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-ljspeech-58b344cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-cori-58b344cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/the-wee-hours-ac73af63.webp', '[\"early morning\", \"dawn\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"work in the wee hours\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc vào lúc sáng sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stay up until the wee hours\", \"meaning\": \"thức đến tận sáng sớm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-cori-58b344cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-aru0-58b344cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-aru5-58b344cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-aru6-58b344cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-aru10-58b344cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-aru9-58b344cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-aru3-58b344cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-aru7-58b344cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-wee-hours-aru8-58b344cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p