('b77de197-8b5c-5029-9d4d-2ba9dfb0b66e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0286e4c8-8720-572f-bf9a-f507be0ae580', 'a965a5a7-3d61-55b3-bbc9-76457d88e548', 'inconclusive', '/ˌɪnkənˈkluːsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không đi đến kết luận rõ ràng, không có kết quả quyết định.', 'not giving a clear or final result after examination.', 'The evidence was inconclusive, so they couldn\'t make a final judgment.', 'Bằng chứng không kết luận được gì, nên họ không thể đưa ra phán quyết cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The meeting ended with inconclusive discussions about the merger plan.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp kết thúc với những thảo luận không ngã ngũ về kế hoạch sáp nhập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-ljspeech-5e62d298.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-cori-5e62d298.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inconclusive-375790f1.webp', '[\"undecided\", \"ambiguous\"]', '[\"conclusive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inconclusive evidence\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng không rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inconclusive result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả không quyết định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inconclusive test\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra không kết luận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inclusive\", \"note_vi\": \"inclusive là bao gồm, không phải không kết luận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"inconclusively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inconclusiveness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-cori-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru0-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru5-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru6-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru10-5e62d298.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru9-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru3-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru7-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru8-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-aru2-5e62d298.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-ljspeech-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt408-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt138-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt624-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt396-5e62d298.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt498-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt132-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt288-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt42-5e62d298.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconclusive-lt90-5e62d298.mp3\"]}}', 'Inconclusive nghĩa là không rõ ràng, trái nghĩa với conclusive.', 'business', 1, 26),
('05491768-ee42-553b-91b9-19ec739b5732', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0286e4c8-8720-572f-bf9a-f507be0ae580', 'a965a5a7-3d61-55b3-bbc9-76457d88e548', 'amino acid', '/əˈmiːnəʊ ˈæsɪd/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hợp chất hữu cơ là đơn vị cấu tạo cơ bản của protein.', 'a simple organic compound that forms the basic building block of proteins.', 'Essential amino acids must be obtained through food because the human body cannot produce them.', 'Các axit amin thiết yếu phải được hấp thụ qua thực phẩm vì cơ thể người không thể tự sản xuất chúng.', '{\"en\": \"The health company sells supplements containing essential amino acids for muscle recovery.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sức khỏe bán các chất bổ sung chứa các axit amin thiết yếu cho sự phục hồi cơ bắp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-ljspeech-3ce49f9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-cori-3ce49f9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amino-acid-c3b328a2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"essential amino acid\", \"meaning\": \"axit amin thiết yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amino acid sequence\", \"meaning\": \"chuỗi axit amin\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-cori-3ce49f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru0-3ce49f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru5-3ce49f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru6-3ce49f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru10-3ce49f9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru9-3ce49f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru3-3ce49f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru7-3ce49f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru8-3ce49f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amino-acid-aru2-3ce49