('a7e6990f-e1c9-5bfb-83c2-b1134b17e2c2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0286e4c8-8720-572f-bf9a-f507be0ae580', 'a965a5a7-3d61-55b3-bbc9-76457d88e548', 'hurdle', '/ˈhɜːdl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'chướng ngại vật, khó khăn cần vượt qua', 'a problem or difficulty that must be solved before you can succeed.', 'Learning a new language can present many hurdles, but consistency helps.', 'Học một ngôn ngữ mới có thể gặp nhiều rào cản, nhưng sự kiên trì sẽ giúp ích.', '{\"en\": \"Securing a government permit was the final hurdle before starting factory construction.\", \"vi\": \"Việc xin được giấy phép chính phủ là rào cản cuối cùng trước khi bắt đầu xây dựng nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-ljspeech-fe3b2db8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-cori-fe3b2db8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hurdle-18ad470f.webp', '[\"obstacle\", \"barrier\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"overcome a hurdle\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua rào cản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear a hurdle\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua chướng ngại vật\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hurdle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-cori-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru0-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru5-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru6-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru10-fe3b2db8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru9-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru3-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru7-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru8-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-aru2-fe3b2db8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-ljspeech-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt408-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt138-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt624-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt396-fe3b2db8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt498-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt132-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt288-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt42-fe3b2db8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hurdle-lt90-fe3b2db8.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh kinh doanh nghĩa là khó khăn, rào cản cần vượt qua.', 'business', 1, 28),
('ff83d432-ff8a-52da-b83b-b8874dfd48c4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0286e4c8-8720-572f-bf9a-f507be0ae580', 'a965a5a7-3d61-55b3-bbc9-76457d88e548', 'contented', '/kənˈtentɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy hài lòng, mãn nguyện với những gì mình có.', 'feeling happy and satisfied with one\'s situation, life, or current achievements.', 'After a long day of work, she felt contented as she relaxed with a book.', 'Sau một ngày làm việc dài, cô ấy cảm thấy hài lòng khi thư giãn với một cuốn sách.', '{\"en\": \"The company survey showed that most employees felt contented with their current work benefits.\", \"vi\": \"Khảo sát của công ty cho thấy hầu hết nhân viên cảm thấy mãn nguyện với các phúc lợi công việc hiện tại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-ljspeech-d97118d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-cori-d97118d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contented-c91ad5fc.webp', '[\"satisfied\", \"pleased\", \"fulfilled\"]', '[\"discontented\", \"unhappy\", \"dissatisfied\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel contented\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy hài lòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"contented smile\", \"meaning\": \"nụ cười mãn nguyện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"content\", \"note_vi\": \"content có thể làm danh từ (nội dung) hoặc tính từ (hài lòng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contentment\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"contentedly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-cori-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru0-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru5-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru6-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru10-d97118d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru9-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru3-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru7-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru8-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-aru2-d97118d3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-ljspeech-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt408-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt138-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt624-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt396-d97118d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt498-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt132-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt288-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt42-d97118d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contented-lt90-d97118d3.mp3\"]}}', 'Contented miêu tả trạng thái mãn nguyện, hài lòng lâu dài.', 'hr', 1, 29),
('ffa8e6d1-77a1-5cec-98b6-3f8a2b69aaa1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'monolingual', '/ˌmɒnəˈlɪŋɡwəl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Chỉ nói hoặc sử dụng một ngôn ngữ duy nhất.', 'speaking, writing, or using only one language instead of multiple languages.', 'Many people in isolated communities are monolingual, speaking only their native tongue.', 'Nhiều người trong các cộng đồng biệt lập là đơn ngữ, chỉ nói tiếng mẹ đẻ của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The company is hiring bilingual staff because most of their current employees are monolingual.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang tuyển dụng nhân viên song ngữ vì hầu hết nhân viên hiện tại của họ chỉ nói một ngôn ngữ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-ljspeech-000e0e03.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-cori-000e0e03.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monolingual-29da64fa.webp', NULL, '[\"bilingual\", \"multilingual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"monolingual dictionary\", \"meaning\": \"từ điển đơn ngữ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"monolingual speaker\", \"meaning\": \"người chỉ nói một thứ tiếng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monologue\", \"note_vi\": \"monologue là độc thoại, còn monolingual là đơn ngữ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-cori-000e0e03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-aru0-000e0e03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-aru5-000e0e03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-aru6-000e0e03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-aru10-000e0e03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-aru9-000e0e03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-aru3-000e0e03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monolingual-aru7-000e0e03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1