('79a2dca4-b145-57bc-918f-37a46bd6c0db', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'stun', 'UK: /ˈstʌnɪŋ/ | US: /ˈstʌnɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'tuyệt đẹp, làm choáng váng', 'extremely impressive, beautiful, or striking to the point of overwhelming someone with surprise.', 'The hotel offers stunning views of the ocean.', 'Khách sạn có tầm nhìn tuyệt đẹp ra biển.', '{\"en\": \"The keynote speaker delivered a stunning presentation that impressed all the conference attendees.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả chính đã đưa ra một bài thuyết trình tuyệt vời làm ấn tượng tất cả người tham dự hội thảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-ljspeech-fea71c3b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-cori-fea71c3b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stun-f582f9d7.webp', '[\"impressive\", \"breathtaking\", \"astonishing\", \"remarkable\"]', '[\"unimpressive\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stunning success\", \"meaning\": \"thành công vang dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stunning view\", \"meaning\": \"quang cảnh tuyệt đẹp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stubborn\", \"note_vi\": \"Stubborn nghĩa là bướng bỉnh/ngoan cố, không liên quan tới sự ấn tượng hay vẻ đẹp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stun\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stunning\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stunned\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-cori-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru0-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru5-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru6-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru10-fea71c3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru9-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru3-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru7-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru8-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-aru2-fea71c3b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-ljspeech-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt408-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt138-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt624-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt396-fea71c3b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt498-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt132-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt288-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt42-fea71c3b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stun-lt90-fea71c3b.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'stun\' là động từ (làm kinh ngạc/choáng váng). Tính từ phổ biến là \'stunning\' (lộng lẫy, ấn tượng) hoặc \'stunned\' (bị kinh ngạc).', 'office', 1, 1),
('9aa55963-03f5-5da6-ba07-d6f611deeb27', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'suppress', '/səˈpres/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đàn áp, kiềm chế, ngăn chặn một cách mạnh mẽ.', 'to prevent something from developing, continuing, or being expressed by force.', 'The government tried to suppress the protests with force.', 'Chính phủ đã cố gắng đàn áp các cuộc biểu tình bằng vũ lực.', '{\"en\": \"The company tried to suppress negative customer reviews by improving its online service.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã cố gắng kiềm chế các đánh giá tiêu cực của khách hàng bằng cách cải thiện dịch vụ trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-ljspeech-7309ece9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-cori-7309ece9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suppress-41d19578.webp', '[\"repress\", \"stifle\", \"restrain\"]', '[\"encourage\", \"promote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"suppress information\", \"meaning\": \"che giấu hoặc ngăn chặn thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"suppress feelings\", \"meaning\": \"kìm hãm cảm xúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"express\", \"note_vi\": \"Express là bộc lộ, bày tỏ; suppress là đè nén, kiềm chế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"suppression\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"suppressive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-cori-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru0-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru5-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru6-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru10-7309ece9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru9-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru3-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru7-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru8-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-aru2-7309ece9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-ljspeech-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt408-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt138-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt624-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt396-7309ece9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt498-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt132-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt288-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt42-7309ece9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suppress-lt90-7309ece9.mp3\"]}}', 'Suppress mang ý nghĩa đè nén, dập tắt hoặc kiềm chế điều gì đó.', 'business', 1, 2),
('1ed54bdb-8f21-5fbe-b605-94f50cad5332', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'misfortune', '/ˌmɪsˈfɔːtʃuːn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Vận rủi, sự việc không may mắn.', 'bad luck, or an unlucky event that causes problems or trouble.', 'It was a great misfortune that their house burned down just before winter.', 'Thật là một bất hạnh lớn khi nhà của họ bị cháy ngay trước mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"The company had the misfortune of launching their product right before the market crashed.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã gặp vận rủi khi tung ra sản phẩm của họ ngay trước khi thị trường sụp đổ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-ljspeech-89ed2a6b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-cori-89ed2a6b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/misfortune-2f07fb55.webp', '[\"adversity\", \"bad luck\", \"mishap\"]', '[\"fortune\", \"good luck\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have the misfortune to\", \"meaning\": \"gặp vận rủi phải làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stroke of misfortune\", \"meaning\": \"sự việc không may bất ngờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"misconduct\", \"note_vi\": \"misconduct là hành vi sai trái, khác misfortune là vận rủi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fortunate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"unfortunately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-cori-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru0-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru5-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru6-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru10-89ed2a6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru9-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru3-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru7-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru8-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-aru2-89ed2a6b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-ljspeech-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt408-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt138-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt624-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt396-89ed2a6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt498-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt132-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt288-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt42-89ed2a6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/misfortune-lt90-89ed2a6b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'mis-\' mang nghĩa tiêu cực, ngược lại với fortune.', 'business', 1, 3),
('1f0a3013-8d29-5a63-b068-de47e3d25d04', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'dwelt', '/dwel/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Đã sống hoặc cư trú ở một nơi nào đó.', 'to stay or remain in a particular place for a long period of time.', 'For many years, the old man dwelt alone in a small cabin by the lake.', 'Trong nhiều năm, ông lão đã sống một mình trong một căn nhà gỗ nhỏ bên hồ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager dwelt in the city center for years before moving to the suburbs.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã sống ở trung tâm thành phố nhiều năm trước khi chuyển đến vùng ngoại ô.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-ljspeech-ab2c594b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-cori-ab2c594b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dwelt-7bfd804a.webp', '[\"reside\", \"inhabit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dwell on\", \"meaning\": \"suy nghĩ mãi về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dwell in\", \"meaning\": \"cư trú tại đâu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dwelling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-cori-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru0-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru5-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru6-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru10-ab2c594b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru9-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru3-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru7-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru8-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-aru2-ab2c594b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwelt-ljspeech-ab2c594b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec