('da7e4b08-c111-5eb2-bff9-1d90f659d8cd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'baffled', '/ˈbæfl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất bối rối hoặc khó hiểu về điều gì đó.', 'completely unable to understand or explain something because it is confusing or strange.', 'The detective was completely baffled by the mysterious clues.', 'Thám tử hoàn toàn bối rối trước những manh mối bí ẩn.', '{\"en\": \"Management was completely baffled by the sudden drop in product sales last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý hoàn toàn bối rối trước sự sụt giảm đột ngột của doanh số sản phẩm trong quý trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-ljspeech-98e7198c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-cori-98e7198c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/baffled-a2143811.webp', '[\"puzzled\", \"perplexed\", \"confused\"]', '[\"clear\", \"certain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"completely baffled\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn bối rối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"baffled by\", \"meaning\": \"bị bối rối bởi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"baffle\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"baffling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-cori-98e7198c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-aru0-98e7198c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-aru5-98e7198c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-aru6-98e7198c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-aru10-98e7198c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-aru9-98e7198c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-aru3-98e7198c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-aru7-98e7198c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled-aru8-98e7198c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/baffled