('169e7db8-dc62-5829-8ed3-faf46e486fcd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'comedian', 'UK: /kəˈmiːdiən/ | US: /kəˈmiːdiən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'diễn viên hài', 'an entertainer whose job is to make people laugh by telling jokes or funny stories.', 'The comedian\'s new show received rave reviews.', 'Chương trình mới của diễn viên hài đã nhận được những đánh giá tích cực.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a famous comedian to perform at the annual corporate dinner.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một diễn viên hài nổi tiếng đến biểu diễn tại tiệc tối thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-ljspeech-471df234.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-cori-471df234.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/comedian-85982830.webp', '[\"humorist\", \"comic\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stand-up comedian\", \"meaning\": \"diễn viên hài độc thoại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comedy\", \"note_vi\": \"hài kịch (thể loại), trong khi comedian là danh từ chỉ người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"comedy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"comical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-cori-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru0-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru5-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru6-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru10-471df234.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru9-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru3-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru7-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru8-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-aru2-471df234.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-ljspeech-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt408-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt138-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt624-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt396-471df234.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt498-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt132-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt288-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt42-471df234.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comedian-lt90-471df234.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ người biểu diễn hài. Khác với \'comedy\' là thể loại kịch/phim hài.', 'entertainment', 1, 24),
('a7b819cf-3c68-521e-a7ef-054af6d113ff', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'situate', 'UK: /ˈsɪtʃ.u.eɪ.tɪd/ | US: /ˈsɪtʃ.u.eɪ.tɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'tọa lạc, được đặt ở', 'located or positioned in a particular spot or within a specific set of circumstances.', 'The new office building is ideally situated near public transport.', 'Tòa nhà văn phòng mới có vị trí lý tưởng gần phương tiện giao thông công cộng.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate headquarters is situate near the central financial district for convenient client access.\", \"vi\": \"Trụ sở chính của công ty tọa lạc gần khu tài chính trung tâm để khách hàng truy cập thuận tiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-ljspeech-5e6dfd91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-cori-5e6dfd91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/situate-96e4517e.webp', '[\"located\", \"positioned\", \"placed\", \"stationed\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conveniently situate\", \"meaning\": \"tọa lạc ở vị trí thuận tiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"situate near\", \"meaning\": \"nằm gần / tọa lạc gần\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"situate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"situation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-cori-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru0-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru5-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru6-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru10-5e6dfd91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru9-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru3-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru7-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru8-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-aru2-5e6dfd91.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-ljspeech-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt408-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt138-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt624-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt396-5e6dfd91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt498-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt132-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt288-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt42-5e6dfd91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/situate-lt90-5e6dfd91.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn bản chính thức hoặc TOEIC, dạng tính từ/quá khứ phân từ \'situated\' (be situated in/on/near) dùng để chỉ vị trí.', 'real estate', 1, 25),
('95d083da-371a-5330-8771-c9b751295558', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'gig', '/ɡɪɡ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một buổi biểu diễn nhạc sống hoặc hài kịch, thường là ngắn.', 'a single job or performance, often for a short period of time.', 'As a freelance designer, she recently accepted a short-term gig for an advertising agency.', 'Là một nhà thiết kế tự do, cô ấy gần đây đã nhận một công việc ngắn hạn cho một công ty quảng cáo.', '{\"en\": \"Many freelancers are looking for a new gig to fill their schedule next month.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều người làm tự do đang tìm kiếm một công việc ngắn hạn mới để lấp đầy lịch trình tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-ljspeech-12f295f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-cori-12f295f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gig-f5bd0b95.webp', '[\"job\", \"assignment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gig economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế việc làm tự do\"}, {\"phrase\": \"freelance gig\", \"meaning\": \"công việc tự do\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-cori-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru0-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru5-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru6-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru10-12f295f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru9-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru3-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru7-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru8-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-aru2-12f295f7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gig-ljspeech-12f295f7.mp3\", \"/storage