('c9ba0b4e-fbc1-56f1-8cda-8157769e1948', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'delivery', 'UK: /dɪˈlɪvəri/ | US: /dɪˈlɪvəri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự giao hàng', 'The process of taking goods, mail, or items to a recipient.', 'The delivery will arrive by noon tomorrow.', 'Hàng sẽ được giao vào trưa mai.', '{\"en\": \"Customers will receive a notification email as soon as their delivery is dispatched.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng sẽ nhận được email thông báo ngay khi đơn giao hàng của họ được gửi đi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-ljspeech-391cb1e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-cori-391cb1e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delivery-6c635460.webp', '[\"shipment\", \"dispatch\", \"consignment\", \"transportation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"express delivery\", \"meaning\": \"giao hàng hỏa tốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delivery charge\", \"meaning\": \"phí giao hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a delivery\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện việc giao hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"deliver\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-cori-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru0-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru5-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru6-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru10-391cb1e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru9-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru3-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru7-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru8-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-aru2-391cb1e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-ljspeech-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt408-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt138-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt624-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt396-391cb1e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt498-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt132-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt288-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt42-391cb1e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delivery-lt90-391cb1e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Các cụm \'free delivery\' (giao hàng miễn phí) và \'delivery charge\' (phí giao hàng) rất phổ biến trong bài thi TOEIC.', 'shipping', 1, 27),
('a4a1c6ef-f191-5c08-8031-acd72536fe30', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '03b85554-39ee-50da-ae19-2cbfa9de910e', 'e0f08246-97be-5a3c-bd17-1e98fcb635bd', 'steel', '/stiːl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại hợp kim sắt bền chắc, dùng trong xây dựng và chế tạo.', 'a strong metal alloy made of iron and carbon, used in building structures.', 'Many modern skyscrapers are built with a strong steel frame.', 'Nhiều tòa nhà chọc trời hiện đại được xây dựng với khung thép vững chắc.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturing plant ordered extra tons of steel to complete the bridge project.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy sản xuất đã đặt thêm hàng tấn thép để hoàn thành dự án cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-ljspeech-f91421de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-cori-f91421de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/steel-8b7da7cd.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"steel frame\", \"meaning\": \"khung thép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stainless steel\", \"meaning\": \"thép không gỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"steel industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành công nghiệp thép\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"steal\", \"note_vi\": \"Steel là chất liệu thép, steal (động từ) là ăn trộm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"steel\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"steely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-cori-f91421de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-aru0-f91421de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-aru5-f91421de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-aru6-f91421de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-aru10-f91421de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-aru9-f91421de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-aru3-f91421de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-aru7-f91421de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steel-aru8-f91421de.