('ef633bb6-92c3-500d-a65a-f3a34cfca4fd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'scented', '/ˈsentɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có mùi hương dễ chịu, thường là nhân tạo.', 'having a pleasant or sweet smell, often added artificially to products.', 'The room was filled with the pleasant smell of scented candles.', 'Căn phòng tràn ngập mùi hương dễ chịu của nến thơm.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby uses scented oils to create a relaxing atmosphere for guests.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn sử dụng dầu thơm để tạo ra bầu không khí thư giãn cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-ljspeech-5aed9760.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-cori-5aed9760.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scented-152d4fdc.webp', '[\"fragrant\", \"perfumed\", \"aromatic\"]', '[\"odorless\", \"smelly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scented candle\", \"meaning\": \"nến thơm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scented soap\", \"meaning\": \"xà phòng thơm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sent\", \"note_vi\": \"sent là quá khứ của send, phát âm giống scent nhưng nghĩa khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"scent\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"scent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-cori-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru0-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru5-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru6-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru10-5aed9760.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru9-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru3-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru7-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru8-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-aru2-5aed9760.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-ljspeech-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt408-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt138-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt624-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt396-5aed9760.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt498-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt132-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt288-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt42-5aed9760.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scented-lt90-5aed9760.mp3\"]}}', 'Scented thường dùng cho sản phẩm được ướp hương nhân tạo như nến, xà phòng.', 'travel', 1, 8),
('307384e4-c0b1-573a-a249-dc643e094a74', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'overstate', '/ˌəʊvəˈsteɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nêu một điều gì đó lớn hơn, quan trọng hơn thực tế.', 'to present something as greater or more important than reality.', 'While the new policy has benefits, it\'s important not to overstate its immediate impact.', 'Mặc dù chính sách mới có lợi ích, điều quan trọng là không nên nói quá mức tác động tức thì của nó.', '{\"en\": \"We must not overstate the projected revenue to our investors this year.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta không được phóng đại doanh thu dự kiến với các nhà đầu tư năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-ljspeech-b0d42ace.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-cori-b0d42ace.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overstate-e4c36429.webp', '[\"exaggerate\", \"inflate\"]', '[\"understate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"overstate the risk\", \"meaning\": \"nói quá rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overstate importance\", \"meaning\": \"phóng đại tầm quan trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"overstay\", \"note_vi\": \"viết gần nhưng nghĩa là lưu lại quá thời hạn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"overstatement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"overstated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-cori-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru0-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru5-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru6-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru10-b0d42ace.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru9-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru3-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru7-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru8-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-aru2-b0d42ace.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-ljspeech-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt408-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt138-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt624-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt396-b0d42ace.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt498-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt132-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt288-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt42-b0d42ace.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overstate-lt90-b0d42ace.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này trang trọng, thường dùng trong báo cáo tài chính, trái nghĩa với understate.', 'business', 1, 9),
('0e610363-f522-5c33-9711-4d603515ddbc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'the Bronze Age', '/ðə brɒnz eɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Giai đoạn lịch sử khi con người sử dụng đồng và hợp kim đồng để chế tạo công cụ.', 'a period in human history when people used tools made from a mixture of copper and tin.', 'Artifacts from the Bronze Age provide valuable insights into ancient civilizations.', 'Các hiện vật từ thời đại đồ đồng cung cấp những hiểu biết quý giá về các nền văn minh cổ đại.', '{\"en\": \"The museum exhibit displays various metal tools that were commonly used during the Bronze Age.\", \"vi\": \"Triển lãm bảo tàng trưng bày nhiều công cụ kim loại thường được sử dụng trong thời đại đồ đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-ljspeech-dbffb419.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-cori-dbffb419.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/the-bronze-age-52a2a901.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"Bronze Age artifacts\", \"meaning\": \"cổ vật thời đồ đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"during the Bronze Age\", \"meaning\": \"trong thời đại đồ đồng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-cori-dbffb419.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-aru0-dbffb419.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-aru5-dbffb419.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-aru6-dbffb419.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-aru10-dbffb419.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-aru9-dbffb419.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-aru3-dbffb419.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-age-aru7-dbffb419.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-bronze-a