('3f3aaa37-b25e-568d-a555-db738e2651a6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'carbohydrate', '/ˌkɑːbəʊˈhaɪdreɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Chất dinh dưỡng chính trong thực phẩm như bánh mì, gạo, cung cấp năng lượng.', 'a substance in food that provides the body with energy for daily activities.', 'Athletes need a lot of carbohydrates for energy during their training.', 'Các vận động viên cần nhiều carbohydrate để có năng lượng trong quá trình tập luyện.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service provides a balanced meal containing protein and healthy carbohydrates for employees.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống cung cấp bữa ăn cân bằng chứa protein và tinh bột lành mạnh cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-ljspeech-d1402d57.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-cori-d1402d57.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carbohydrate-c42c6980.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"complex carbohydrates\", \"meaning\": \"tinh bột phức hợp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"low carbohydrate\", \"meaning\": \"ít tinh bột\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-cori-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru0-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru5-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru6-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru10-d1402d57.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru9-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru3-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru7-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carbohydrate-aru8-d1402d57.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ca