('18f6daa4-9c97-5d61-9b80-753ac9206207', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'marine', '/məˈriːn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người lính thuộc lực lượng hải quân đặc biệt.', 'a soldier who is trained to serve on land or at sea.', 'The brave marine completed his training exercise before deploying overseas last month.', 'Người lính thủy đánh bộ dũng cảm đã hoàn tất bài tập huấn luyện trước khi triển khai sang nước ngoài vào tháng trước.', '{\"en\": \"The security firm hired a former marine to manage their high-profile client protection team.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty bảo vệ đã thuê một cựu lính thủy đánh bộ để quản lý đội bảo vệ khách hàng cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-ljspeech-1fd1b451.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-cori-1fd1b451.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/marine-e5eb7608.webp', '[\"soldier\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"former marine\", \"meaning\": \"cựu lính thủy đánh bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"marine corps\", \"meaning\": \"thủy quân lục chiến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"marina\", \"note_vi\": \"bến cảng dành cho du thuyền\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"marine\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-cori-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru0-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru5-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru6-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru10-1fd1b451.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru9-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru3-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru7-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru8-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-aru2-1fd1b451.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-ljspeech-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt408-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt138-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt624-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt396-1fd1b451.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt498-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt132-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt288-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt42-1fd1b451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marine-lt90-1fd1b451.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở dạng danh từ, marine chỉ người lính thủy đánh bộ. Tránh nhầm với tính từ marine (thuộc về biển).', 'hr', 1, 23),
('98f157a9-1cb2-56b2-b56c-0692c8f2fb91', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'diversity', 'UK: /daɪˈvɜːsəti/ | US: /daɪˈvɝsəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự đa dạng', 'the state or quality of including many different types of people or things together.', 'We celebrate the diversity within our team and welcome all backgrounds.', 'Chúng tôi tôn vinh sự đa dạng trong đội ngũ của mình và chào đón mọi xuất thân.', '{\"en\": \"The company values workplace diversity because it brings innovative ideas from different backgrounds.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty coi trọng sự đa dạng tại nơi làm việc vì nó mang lại những ý tưởng sáng tạo từ nhiều góc nhìn khác nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-ljspeech-a63b60ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-cori-a63b60ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diversity-6fad5dfc.webp', '[\"variety\", \"assortment\", \"mixture\", \"range\"]', '[\"uniformity\", \"similarity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"workplace diversity\", \"meaning\": \"sự đa dạng tại nơi làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cultural diversity\", \"meaning\": \"sự đa dạng văn hóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a diversity of opinions\", \"meaning\": \"sự đa dạng các ý kiến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"diverse\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"diversify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"diversification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-cori-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru0-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru5-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru6-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru10-a63b60ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru9-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru3-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru7-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru8-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-aru2-a63b60ee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-ljspeech-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt408-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt138-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt624-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt396-a63b60ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt498-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt132-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt288-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt42-a63b60ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversity-lt90-a63b60ee.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'of\' (a diversity of...). Trong TOEIC hay xuất hiện ở chủ đề nhân sự (workplace diversity).', 'personnel', 1, 24)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('48d6a11e-8af1-574f-be05-49e10e8dc8e2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'straightforward', 'UK: /ˌstreɪtˈfɔː.wəd/ | US: /ˌstreɪtˈfɔːr.wərd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thẳng thắn, dễ hiểu, đơn giản', 'easy to understand or complete, without any unnecessary complexity or dishonesty.', 'The instructions for assembly were very straightforward.', 'Hướng dẫn lắp ráp rất đơn giản.', '{\"en\": \"The user manual provides straightforward instructions for assembling the office desk.\", \"vi\": \"Sách hướng dẫn sử dụng đưa ra các chỉ dẫn dễ hiểu để lắp ráp bàn làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-ljspeech-ffaecb2c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-cori-ffaecb2c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/straightforward-c8cef9cd.webp', '[\"uncomplicated\", \"simple\", \"direct\", \"candid\"]', '[\"complicated\", \"confusing\", \"ambiguous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"straightforward process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình đơn giản/dễ hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"straightforward answer\", \"meaning\": \"câu trả lời thẳng thắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"straightforwardly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-cori-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru0-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru5-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru6-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru10-ffaecb2c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru9-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru3-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru7-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru8-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-aru2-ffaecb2c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-ljspeech-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt408-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt138-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt624-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt396-ffaecb2c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt498-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt132-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt288-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt42-ffaecb2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/straightforward-lt90-ffaecb2c.mp3\"]}}', '\'Straightforward\' dùng cho cả tính cách người (thẳng thắn) lẫn quy trình/hướng dẫn (rõ ràng, không phức tạp).', 'office', 1, 25),
('fbc04d13-52d9-5523-8c07-0f260808818f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'construction', 'UK: /kənˈstrʌkʃən/ | US: /kənˈstrʌkʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự xây dựng', 'The process or activity of building large structures such as houses, bridges, or roads.', 'The construction of the new office building will start next month.', 'Việc xây dựng tòa nhà văn phòng mới sẽ bắt đầu vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The main highway is currently under construction, so commuters should expect delays.\", \"vi\": \"Đường cao tốc chính hiện đang được thi công, vì vậy người đi làm nên lường trước khả năng trễ giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-ljspeech-535ae678.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-cori-535ae678.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/construction-7ca1d5db.webp', '[\"building\", \"erection\", \"assembly\"]', '[\"demolition\", \"destruction\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"under construction\", \"meaning\": \"đang trong quá trình thi công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"construction site\", \"meaning\": \"công trường xây dựng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"construct\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"constructive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-cori-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru0-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru5-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru6-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru10-535ae678.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru9-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru3-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru7-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru8-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-aru2-535ae678.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-ljspeech-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt408-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt138-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt624-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt396-535ae678.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt498-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt132-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt288-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt42-535ae678.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/construction-lt90-535ae678.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ đặc trưng TOEIC: \'under construction\' (đang được thi công/xây dựng).', 'construction', 1, 26),
('9d2d666d-4980-548e-bc75-62f5e6d9390d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'science fiction', '/ˈsaɪəns ˈfɪkʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thể loại văn học hoặc phim ảnh dựa trên khoa học và công nghệ tương lai.', 'books or films about imaginary future events involving advanced technology and space.', 'My favorite genre to read is science fiction, especially stories about space exploration.', 'Thể loại yêu thích của tôi để đọc là khoa học viễn tưởng, đặc biệt là những câu chuyện về khám phá không gian.', '{\"en\": \"The bookstore offers discounts on all science fiction novels this week.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sách giảm giá tất cả các tiểu thuyết khoa học viễn tưởng trong tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-ljspeech-29a7ed2f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-cori-29a7ed2f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/science-fiction-7e0d1250.webp', '[\"sci-fi\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"science fiction novel\", \"meaning\": \"tiểu thuyết khoa học viễn tưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"science fiction film\", \"meaning\": \"phim khoa học viễn tưởng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-cori-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru0-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru5-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru6-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru10-29a7ed2f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru9-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru3-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru7-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru8-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-aru2-29a7ed2f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-ljspeech-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt408-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt138-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt624-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt396-29a7ed2f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt498-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt132-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt288-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt42-29a7ed2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/science-fiction-lt90-29a7ed2f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được viết tắt là sci-fi.', 'media', 1, 27),
('c2d613d4-9c91-509b-84b1-b8da942b7b17', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'third-rate', '/ˌθɜːdˈreɪt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Kém chất lượng, hạng xoàng.', 'of very low quality; not good enough to be taken seriously or respected.', 'Many critics dismissed the film as a third-rate attempt at comedy.', 'Nhiều nhà phê bình đã bác bỏ bộ phim là một nỗ lực hài kịch hạng xoàng.', '{\"en\": \"The client rejected the proposal, calling it a third-rate solution to their logistics problem.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng từ chối đề xuất, gọi đó là giải pháp hạng xoàng cho vấn đề hậu cần của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-ljspeech-19639de9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-cori-19639de9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/third-rate-910630c2.webp', '[\"inferior\", \"substandard\", \"mediocre\"]', '[\"first-rate\", \"top-notch\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"third-rate product\", \"meaning\": \"sản phẩm kém chất lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"third-rate service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ tệ hại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"third-rate performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn trình diễn xoàng xĩnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"second-rate\", \"note_vi\": \"second-rate cũng có nghĩa kém nhưng nhẹ hơn third-rate một bậc\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-cori-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru0-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru5-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru6-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru10-19639de9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru9-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru3-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru7-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru8-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-aru2-19639de9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-ljspeech-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt408-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt138-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt624-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt396-19639de9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt498-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt132-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt288-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt42-19639de9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/third-rate-lt90-19639de9.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm tính từ ghép với số thứ tự: first-rate (tốt nhất), second-rate, third-rate (tệ nhất trong ba bậc).', 'business', 1, 28),
('b2410965-b59a-5b6d-8cc3-cce9b12c1bc5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '05426358-6357-5bc3-8ffe-0d4d08c49ff3', '8ccc73d2-6d2f-5b8a-8169-ade3bbec449b', 'soft', '/sɒft/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Mềm mại, dễ uốn nắn hoặc không cứng rắn.', 'not hard or firm, easy to press, bend, or cut.', 'The modern office lounge features soft leather chairs for visitors waiting for interviews.', 'Phòng chờ văn phòng hiện đại có những chiếc ghế da mềm mại dành cho khách ghé thăm trong lúc chờ phỏng vấn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel provides soft pillows and clean bed sheets to ensure a comfortable stay.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp gối mềm và ga giường sạch sẽ để đảm bảo một kỳ nghỉ thoải mái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-ljspeech-eb74f2cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-cori-eb74f2cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/soft-39bbc5f1.webp', '[\"flexible\", \"smooth\", \"gentle\"]', '[\"hard\", \"firm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"soft tissue\", \"meaning\": \"mô mềm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soft voice\", \"meaning\": \"giọng nói nhẹ nhàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"soft copy\", \"meaning\": \"bản sao điện tử\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"smooth\", \"note_vi\": \"Smooth là mượt mà (bề mặt), soft là mềm mại (độ cứng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"softly\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"soften\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"softness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-cori-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru0-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru5-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru6-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru10-eb74f2cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru9-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru3-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru7-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru8-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-aru2-eb74f2cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-ljspeech-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt408-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt138-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt624-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt396-eb74f2cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt498-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt132-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt288-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt42-eb74f2cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/soft-lt90-eb74f2cb.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tin học, \'soft copy\' là bản sao mềm (file máy tính), trái với \'hard copy\'.', 'travel', 1, 29),
('7026f9ef-00bd-5803-80f3-ede0ffd29769', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '06519daa-8074-5e4a-945a-7679eb0756ea', '550c501d-3cf2-5a68-afba-d97702eb2e40', 'disorder', '/dɪsˈɔːdə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái lộn xộn, không có trật tự hoặc tổ chức.', 'a state of untidiness or lack of clear organization and arrangement.', 'The sudden power outage caused complete disorder in the busy office.', 'Sự cố mất điện đột ngột đã gây ra sự hỗn loạn hoàn toàn trong văn phòng bận rộn.', '{\"en\": \"The office was in total disorder after the unexpected inspection by the auditors.\", \"vi\": \"Văn phòng đã rơi vào tình trạng hoàn toàn lộn xộn sau buổi kiểm tra đột xuất của các kiểm toán viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-ljspeech-ce2fcff2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-cori-ce2fcff2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disorder-e144ff49.webp', '[\"chaos\", \"confusion\", \"disarray\"]', '[\"order\", \"organization\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in total disorder\", \"meaning\": \"trong tình trạng hoàn toàn hỗn loạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"create disorder\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra sự lộn xộn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disease\", \"note_vi\": \"Disorder cũng có nghĩa là rối loạn bệnh lý, khác với disease là bệnh nhiễm trùng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disorderly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-cori-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru0-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru5-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru6-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru10-ce2fcff2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru9-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru3-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru7-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru8-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-aru2-ce2fcff2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-ljspeech-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt408-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt138-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt624-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt396-ce2fcff2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt498-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt132-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt288-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt42-ce2fcff2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorder-lt90-ce2fcff2.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ này vừa chỉ sự lộn xộn, vừa chỉ sự rối loạn chức năng hoặc bệnh lý.', 'office', 1, 0),
('a4636e01-7d27-5529-8ba6-023abeaf8ce4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '06519daa-8074-5e4a-945a-7679eb0756ea', '550c501d-3cf2-5a68-afba-d97702eb2e40', 'unforeseen', '/ˌʌnfɔːˈsiːn/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không thể đoán trước, bất ngờ.', 'not expected, known, or planned before it actually happens in reality.', 'Due to unforeseen circumstances, the event has been postponed.', 'Do những tình huống không lường trước được, sự kiện đã bị hoãn lại.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager adjusted the schedule to account for unforeseen delays in shipment.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý dự án đã điều chỉnh lịch trình để tính đến những sự chậm trễ không đoán trước trong vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-ljspeech-4d8cf0db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-cori-4d8cf0db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unforeseen-35ed6d2f.webp', '[\"unexpected\", \"unanticipated\", \"unplanned\"]', '[\"expected\", \"predictable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unforeseen circumstances\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống bất ngờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unforeseen expenses\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí phát sinh ngoài dự kiến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unnoticed\", \"note_vi\": \"Unnoticed là không được chú ý tới, unforeseen là không đoán trước được.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"foresee\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"foreseen\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-cori-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru0-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru5-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru6-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru10-4d8cf0db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru9-4d8cf0db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unforeseen-aru3-4d8cf0db.mp3\"