('10c0ee60-05c6-5054-bd6d-a8f7855a552b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '06519daa-8074-5e4a-945a-7679eb0756ea', '550c501d-3cf2-5a68-afba-d97702eb2e40', 'recently', '/ˈriːsntli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Vào một thời điểm không xa trong quá khứ.', 'not long ago, or at a time that started not long ago.', 'I haven\'t seen him recently, but I heard he\'s doing well.', 'Gần đây tôi không gặp anh ấy, nhưng tôi nghe nói anh ấy vẫn ổn.', '{\"en\": \"The management team recently announced a new policy regarding employee vacation days.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý gần đây đã công bố một chính sách mới liên quan đến ngày nghỉ phép của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-ljspeech-fd92cc85.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-cori-fd92cc85.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/recently-b74216f8.webp', '[\"lately\", \"newly\"]', '[\"previously\", \"formerly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"until recently\", \"meaning\": \"cho đến gần đây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"very recently\", \"meaning\": \"rất gần đây\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"recent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-cori-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru0-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru5-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru6-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru10-fd92cc85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru9-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru3-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru7-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru8-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-aru2-fd92cc85.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-ljspeech-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt408-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt138-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt624-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt396-fd92cc85.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt498-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt132-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt288-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt42-fd92cc85.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/recently-lt90-fd92cc85.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng với thì hiện tại hoàn thành hoặc quá khứ đơn.', 'office', 1, 22),
('9c55db77-e25e-5555-bb74-508e2bd9b079', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '06519daa-8074-5e4a-945a-7679eb0756ea', '550c501d-3cf2-5a68-afba-d97702eb2e40', 'transparency', 'UK: /trænsˈpærənsi/ | US: /trænsˈpærənsi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự minh bạch', 'the quality of being open, honest, and easy to understand or observe.', 'The company values transparency in all its dealings.', 'Công ty coi trọng sự minh bạch trong mọi giao dịch.', '{\"en\": \"The board pledged to improve financial transparency by releasing detailed quarterly reports.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị cam kết cải thiện sự minh bạch tài chính bằng cách phát hành các báo cáo quý chi tiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-ljspeech-ce03e308.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-cori-ce03e308.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/transparency-8b39ec69.webp', '[\"openness\", \"clarity\", \"candor\", \"accountability\"]', '[\"opacity\", \"secrecy\", \"dishonesty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"financial transparency\", \"meaning\": \"sự minh bạch tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"promote transparency\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy sự minh bạch\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"transparent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"transparently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-cori-ce03e308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-aru0-ce03e308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-aru5-ce03e308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-aru6-ce03e308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-aru10-ce03e308.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-aru9-ce03e308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-aru3-ce03e308.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transparency-aru7-ce03e308.mp3\", \"/s