('c7bd6a12-66f1-5c82-a3e1-30b139249ed1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '06519daa-8074-5e4a-945a-7679eb0756ea', '550c501d-3cf2-5a68-afba-d97702eb2e40', 'gauge', '/ɡeɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để đo lường mức độ, kích thước hoặc áp suất.', 'a measuring instrument used to show the level, amount, or pressure of something.', 'The fuel gauge in my car is broken, so I never know how much gas I have left.', 'Đồng hồ đo nhiên liệu trong xe của tôi bị hỏng, nên tôi không bao giờ biết còn bao nhiêu xăng.', '{\"en\": \"The pressure gauge on the industrial machine indicates that it is running at safe levels.\", \"vi\": \"Đồng hồ đo áp suất trên máy công nghiệp cho thấy nó đang hoạt động ở mức an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-ljspeech-7e0e0190.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-cori-7e0e0190.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gauge-a1cdb878.webp', '[\"meter\", \"indicator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pressure gauge\", \"meaning\": \"đồng hồ đo áp suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fuel gauge\", \"meaning\": \"đồng hồ đo nhiên liệu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-cori-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru0-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru5-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru6-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru10-7e0e0190.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru9-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru3-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru7-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru8-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-aru2-7e0e0190.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-ljspeech-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt408-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt138-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt624-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt396-7e0e0190.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt498-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt132-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt288-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt42-7e0e0190.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gauge-lt90-7e0e0190.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể là danh từ (thiết bị) hoặc động từ (đo lường/đánh giá).', 'manufacturing', 1, 28),
('9e66e9f3-b02f-5a24-9cbc-83f90f1e5c5d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '06519daa-8074-5e4a-945a-7679eb0756ea', '550c501d-3cf2-5a68-afba-d97702eb2e40', 'postpone', '/pəˈspəʊn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Dời một sự kiện hoặc cuộc hẹn sang thời gian muộn hơn.', 'to delay an event or plan until a later time.', 'Due to the heavy rain, the football match was postponed until next week.', 'Do mưa lớn, trận đấu bóng đá đã bị hoãn lại đến tuần sau.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors decided to postpone the annual meeting until next month.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã quyết định hoãn cuộc họp thường niên cho đến tháng sau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-ljspeech-cdbd03bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-cori-cdbd03bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/postpone-e355176f.webp', '[\"delay\", \"defer\", \"put off\"]', '[\"advance\", \"bring forward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"postpone a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"hoãn một cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"postpone indefinitely\", \"meaning\": \"hoãn vô thời hạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cancel\", \"note_vi\": \"cancel là hủy bỏ hoàn toàn, còn postpone chỉ là hoãn lại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"postponement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-cori-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru0-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru5-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru6-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru10-cdbd03bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru9-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru3-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru7-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/postpone-aru8-cdbd03bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o