('39c48e46-f4be-5e8c-afe0-096770735b08', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '072fa9a4-7ee0-5422-bd51-0a6d4139b152', '9aba316e-feb9-5014-b111-2b0eff423d4a', 'restriction', 'UK: /rɪˈstrɪkʃən/ | US: /rɪˈstrɪkʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự hạn chế, giới hạn', 'an official rule or law that limits what people can do or how things are done.', 'The new parking restrictions limit free parking hours.', 'Các giới hạn đỗ xe mới hạn chế giờ đỗ xe miễn phí.', '{\"en\": \"The government lifted travel restrictions, allowing business trips to resume normal operations.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đã dỡ bỏ các hạn chế đi lại, cho phép các chuyến công tác hoạt động bình thường trở lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-ljspeech-993b3394.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-cori-993b3394.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/restriction-aea9cd22.webp', '[\"limitation\", \"constraint\", \"curb\", \"regulation\"]', '[\"freedom\", \"allowance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impose restrictions\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt các hạn chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lift restrictions\", \"meaning\": \"dỡ bỏ quy định hạn chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"travel restriction\", \"meaning\": \"hạn chế đi lại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"restrict\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"restrictive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-cori-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru0-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru5-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru6-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru10-993b3394.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru9-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru3-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru7-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru8-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-aru2-993b3394.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-ljspeech-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt408-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt138-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt624-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt396-993b3394.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt498-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt132-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt288-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt42-993b3394.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restriction-lt90-993b3394.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay dùng với các động từ như \'impose restrictions\' (áp đặt hạn chế) hoặc \'lift restrictions\' (dỡ bỏ hạn chế).', 'travel', 1, 0),
('5d99690e-8b75-5422-80fd-5f6c79a7f06f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '072fa9a4-7ee0-5422-bd51-0a6d4139b152', '9aba316e-feb9-5014-b111-2b0eff423d4a', 'profoundly', '/prəˈfaʊndli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách rất sâu sắc hoặc mạnh mẽ, ảnh hưởng lớn.', 'in a way that is very strongly felt or has a major effect.', 'The experience profoundly changed her perspective on life.', 'Trải nghiệm đó đã thay đổi sâu sắc quan điểm sống của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO\'s speech on sustainability profoundly affected the company\'s long-term business strategy.\", \"vi\": \"Bài phát biểu của CEO về sự phát triển bền vững đã ảnh hưởng sâu sắc đến chiến lược kinh doanh dài hạn của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-ljspeech-ae6a4a83.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-cori-ae6a4a83.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/profoundly-809461c1.webp', '[\"deeply\", \"greatly\", \"extremely\"]', '[\"superficially\", \"slightly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"profoundly affect\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"profoundly grateful\", \"meaning\": \"vô cùng biết ơn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"profound\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-cori-ae6a4a83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-aru0-ae6a4a83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-aru5-ae6a4a83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-aru6-ae6a4a83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-aru10-ae6a4a83.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-aru9-ae6a4a83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-aru3-ae6a4a83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-aru7-ae6a4a83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profoundly-aru8-ae6a4a83.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje