('06f320bb-8300-55df-b77e-0ac491e75bb8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '072fa9a4-7ee0-5422-bd51-0a6d4139b152', '9aba316e-feb9-5014-b111-2b0eff423d4a', 'willfully', '/ˈwɪlfəli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Với ý định rõ ràng, có chủ đích, không phải vô tình.', 'doing something in a way that is intentional and done on purpose, often causing harm.', 'He willfully disobeyed the instructions, knowing the consequences.', 'Anh ta cố ý không tuân theo hướng dẫn, dù biết rõ hậu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The employee was fired because he willfully ignored the safety regulations during the construction project.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đó đã bị sa thải vì anh ta cố tình phớt lờ các quy định an toàn trong dự án xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-ljspeech-10c3f65a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-cori-10c3f65a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/willfully-c1264ecd.webp', '[\"deliberately\", \"intentionally\"]', '[\"accidentally\", \"unintentionally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"willfully ignore\", \"meaning\": \"cố tình phớt lờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"willfully neglect\", \"meaning\": \"cố tình bỏ bê\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"willful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-cori-10c3f65a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-aru0-10c3f65a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-aru5-10c3f65a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-aru6-10c3f65a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-aru10-10c3f65a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-aru9-10c3f65a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-aru3-10c3f65a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-aru7-10c3f65a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/willfully-aru8-10c3f65a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o