('6d31148a-0350-56ee-b143-26f6dbc4501d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '072fa9a4-7ee0-5422-bd51-0a6d4139b152', '9aba316e-feb9-5014-b111-2b0eff423d4a', 'intertwined', '/ˌɪntəˈtwaɪn/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Gắn bó, kết nối chặt chẽ với nhau.', 'twisted or connected together so that things are difficult to separate from each other.', 'The destinies of the two ancient kingdoms were deeply intertwined.', 'Vận mệnh của hai vương quốc cổ đại gắn bó sâu sắc với nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The success of our marketing campaign and sales growth are closely intertwined this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Sự thành công của chiến dịch tiếp thị và tăng trưởng doanh số của chúng ta gắn bó chặt chẽ trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-ljspeech-2c6e7e7f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-cori-2c6e7e7f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intertwined-673ca4cf.webp', '[\"connected\", \"linked\"]', '[\"separate\", \"detached\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"closely intertwined\", \"meaning\": \"gắn bó chặt chẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deeply intertwined\", \"meaning\": \"gắn kết sâu sắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intertwine\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-cori-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru0-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru5-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru6-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru10-2c6e7e7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru9-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru3-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru7-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru8-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-aru2-2c6e7e7f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-ljspeech-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt408-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt138-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt624-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt396-2c6e7e7f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt498-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt132-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt288-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt42-2c6e7e7f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intertwined-lt90-2c6e7e7f.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ mối quan hệ mật thiết giữa các yếu tố.', 'business', 1, 5),
('cb135230-e124-54af-98b7-27e554029ed2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '072fa9a4-7ee0-5422-bd51-0a6d4139b152', '9aba316e-feb9-5014-b111-2b0eff423d4a', 'crochet', '/ˈkrəʊʃeɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nghệ thuật dùng kim móc để tạo ra vải hoặc đồ vật từ sợi.', 'a method of making clothes or items by using a special hooked needle and yarn.', 'My grandmother taught me how to crochet beautiful blankets and scarves.', 'Bà tôi đã dạy tôi cách móc những chiếc chăn và khăn đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The local craft shop sells high-quality yarn for those who enjoy the art of crochet.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng thủ công địa phương bán len chất lượng cao cho những ai yêu thích nghệ thuật móc len.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-ljspeech-b142827e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-cori-b142827e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crochet-08d9b0f8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"crochet hook\", \"meaning\": \"kim móc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crochet pattern\", \"meaning\": \"mẫu móc len\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"crochet\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-cori-b142827e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru0-b142827e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru5-b142827e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru6-b142827e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru10-b142827e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru9-b142827e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru3-b142827e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru7-b142827e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru8-b142827e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-aru2-b142827e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crochet-ljspeech-b14