('36f02b5b-14cd-500c-918f-f496d93ec358', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '072fa9a4-7ee0-5422-bd51-0a6d4139b152', '9aba316e-feb9-5014-b111-2b0eff423d4a', 'frequent', '/ˈfriːkwənt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Xảy ra hoặc làm gì đó thường xuyên.', 'happening or doing something very often at short intervals of time in daily life.', 'He is a frequent visitor to the local library, often spending hours there.', 'Anh ấy là khách quen của thư viện địa phương, thường dành hàng giờ ở đó.', '{\"en\": \"Frequent updates on the project status are required to keep all team members well informed.\", \"vi\": \"Các cập nhật thường xuyên về trạng thái dự án là cần thiết để giữ cho tất cả thành viên nắm bắt thông tin.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-ljspeech-79eb183e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-cori-79eb183e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frequent-c1258699.webp', '[\"regular\", \"common\"]', '[\"rare\", \"infrequent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"frequent updates\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật thường xuyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"frequent flyer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng bay thường xuyên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"frequently\", \"note_vi\": \"frequent là tính từ, frequently là trạng từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"frequency\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"frequently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-cori-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru0-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru5-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru6-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru10-79eb183e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru9-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru3-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru7-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru8-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-aru2-79eb183e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-ljspeech-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt408-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt138-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt624-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt396-79eb183e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt498-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt132-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt288-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt42-79eb183e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequent-lt90-79eb183e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trọng âm rơi vào âm tiết đầu khi là tính từ.', 'office', 1, 18),
