('697699fa-fa68-59fe-b438-d980eb785f59', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '09519a5e-a6bc-5f84-84d6-079e5660aa0a', '5f88d697-e32b-5b62-bc23-3b1e78cf0155', 'excitedly', '/ɪkˈsaɪtɪdli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách hăm hở, vui mừng hoặc kích động.', 'in a way that shows someone is very happy and full of energy about something.', 'The children talked excitedly about their upcoming trip to the amusement park.', 'Bọn trẻ nói chuyện hăm hở về chuyến đi sắp tới đến công viên giải trí.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team spoke excitedly about the new product launch during the morning staff meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã nói chuyện một cách đầy hào hứng về việc ra mắt sản phẩm mới trong cuộc họp nhân viên buổi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-ljspeech-8ed86c58.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-cori-8ed86c58.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excitedly-b73995d6.webp', '[\"enthusiastically\", \"eagerly\"]', '[\"calmly\", \"quietly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"talk excitedly\", \"meaning\": \"nói chuyện hăm hở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wait excitedly\", \"meaning\": \"chờ đợi đầy háo hức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"excite\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"excitement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"excited\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-cori-8ed86c58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-aru0-8ed86c58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-aru5-8ed86c58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-aru6-8ed86c58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-aru10-8ed86c58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-aru9-8ed86c58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-aru3-8ed86c58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excitedly-aru7-8ed86c58.mp