('dd30794a-7d86-51f2-8cd2-6ff13d597dc7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0cbe2c62-cbd1-5a15-aa34-3521b07a6d9d', 'd78b68f7-9382-5fb3-a042-1d851af959bb', 'grasp', '/ɡrɑːsp/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nắm chặt, túm lấy; hoặc hiểu rõ một vấn đề.', 'to understand something difficult or complex clearly and completely after thinking about it for a while.', 'It took him a while to fully grasp the complex mathematical concept.', 'Anh ấy mất một lúc để nắm bắt hoàn toàn khái niệm toán học phức tạp đó.', '{\"en\": \"It is essential to grasp the new software features before the training session begins tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Việc nắm bắt các tính năng phần mềm mới trước khi buổi đào tạo bắt đầu vào ngày mai là rất cần thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-ljspeech-9b3fc3a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-cori-9b3fc3a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grasp-e0f8d805.webp', '[\"understand\", \"comprehend\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"grasp the concept\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu khái niệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grasp the opportunity\", \"meaning\": \"nắm bắt cơ hội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"grasp\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-cori-9b3fc3a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru0-9b3fc3a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru5-9b3fc3a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru6-9b3fc3a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru10-9b3fc3a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru9-9b3fc3a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru3-9b3fc3a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru7-9b3fc3a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru8-9b3fc3a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-aru2-9b3fc3a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/s