('ec9f37d4-9469-562a-b3b2-028a947f04be', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0cbe2c62-cbd1-5a15-aa34-3521b07a6d9d', 'd78b68f7-9382-5fb3-a042-1d851af959bb', 'humble', '/ˈhʌmbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Khiêm tốn, không khoe khoang hay tự mãn.', 'having a low opinion of one\'s own importance and not thinking one is better than others.', 'Despite his great success, he remained humble and always treated everyone with respect.', 'Dù thành công lớn, anh ấy vẫn khiêm tốn và luôn đối xử tôn trọng với mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The manager remained humble despite the company achieving record profits during the last fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý vẫn giữ thái độ khiêm tốn dù công ty đạt lợi nhuận kỷ lục năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-ljspeech-055b9a4c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-cori-055b9a4c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/humble-1bd24d27.webp', '[\"modest\", \"unassuming\"]', '[\"arrogant\", \"proud\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"humble beginnings\", \"meaning\": \"xuất thân khiêm tốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in my humble opinion\", \"meaning\": \"theo ý kiến khiêm tốn của tôi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"humility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"humbly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-cori-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru0-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru5-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru6-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru10-055b9a4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru9-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru3-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru7-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru8-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-aru2-055b9a4c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-ljspeech-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt408-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt138-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt624-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt396-055b9a4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt498-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt132-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt288-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt42-055b9a4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humble-lt90-055b9a4c.mp3\"]}}', 'Humble thường dùng để khen ngợi người thành công nhưng không kiêu ngạo.', 'business', 1, 15),
('ab3ee77e-89ae-573f-81d9-febeccfab736', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0cbe2c62-cbd1-5a15-aa34-3521b07a6d9d', 'd78b68f7-9382-5fb3-a042-1d851af959bb', 'confer', '/kənˈfɜː(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Bàn bạc, thảo luận với ai đó để đưa ra quyết định.', 'to discuss something with other people before making a decision.', 'Members of the jury stepped outside to confer about the final verdict.', 'Các thành viên bồi thẩm đoàn đã bước ra ngoài để hội ý về phán quyết cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The managers need to confer with the legal team before signing the agreement.\", \"vi\": \"Các quản lý cần thảo luận với đội ngũ pháp lý trước khi ký kết thỏa thuận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-ljspeech-6f7ce528.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-cori-6f7ce528.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confer-900ebea3.webp', '[\"consult\", \"discuss\", \"deliberate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"confer with somebody\", \"meaning\": \"thảo luận với ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confer a degree\", \"meaning\": \"trao bằng cấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"defer\", \"note_vi\": \"defer là trì hoãn hoặc tôn trọng ý kiến, confer là bàn bạc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conference\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-cori-6f7ce528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-aru0-6f7ce528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-aru5-6f7ce528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-aru6-6f7ce528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-aru10-6f7ce528.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-aru9-6f7ce528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-aru3-6f7ce528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-aru7-6f7ce528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confer-aru8-6f7ce528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci