('69c5c0ef-c2b5-5832-ac31-f908eeabac3e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0dc87b42-470c-525f-9278-da68327132c4', '6f26ebda-9c64-5c40-8cf8-ba06a9859787', 'therapeutic', '/ˌθerəˈpjuːtɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có tác dụng chữa bệnh, trị liệu.', 'helping to cure an illness or make someone feel happier and more relaxed.', 'Spending time in nature can have a very therapeutic effect on stress.', 'Dành thời gian trong thiên nhiên có thể có tác dụng trị liệu rất tốt đối với căng thẳng.', '{\"en\": \"The wellness center offers therapeutic massages to help employees reduce work stress.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm chăm sóc sức khỏe cung cấp các bài massage trị liệu giúp nhân viên giảm căng thẳng công việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-ljspeech-5b2cf757.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-cori-5b2cf757.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/therapeutic-65b04d23.webp', '[\"healing\", \"curative\", \"beneficial\"]', '[\"harmful\", \"damaging\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"therapeutic effect\", \"meaning\": \"tác dụng trị liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"therapeutic treatment\", \"meaning\": \"phương pháp điều trị trị liệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"therapy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"therapist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-cori-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru0-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru5-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru6-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru10-5b2cf757.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru9-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru3-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru7-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru8-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-aru2-5b2cf757.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-ljspeech-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt408-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt138-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt624-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt396-5b2cf757.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt498-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt132-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt288-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt42-5b2cf757.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/therapeutic-lt90-5b2cf757.mp3\"]}}', 'Therapeutic có gốc từ \'therapy\' (trị liệu), chỉ những gì có lợi cho sức khỏe.', 'health', 1, 25),
('9be70330-ef84-5990-ac5f-e9fc99f1461b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0dc87b42-470c-525f-9278-da68327132c4', '6f26ebda-9c64-5c40-8cf8-ba06a9859787', 'stroll', 'UK: /strəʊl/ | US: /stroʊl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'đi dạo', 'to walk in a relaxed, leisurely way for pleasure rather than to reach a place.', 'The couple decided to stroll in the park after lunch.', 'Cặp đôi quyết định đi dạo trong công viên sau bữa trưa.', '{\"en\": \"During the lunch break, several employees strolled around the nearby park to get fresh air.\", \"vi\": \"Trong giờ nghỉ trưa, một vài nhân viên đã đi dạo quanh công viên gần đó để hít thở không khí trong lành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-ljspeech-486b5354.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-cori-486b5354.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stroll-3da4fba9.webp', '[\"walk\", \"wander\", \"promenade\"]', '[\"run\", \"rush\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take a stroll\", \"meaning\": \"đi dạo mát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stroll along\", \"meaning\": \"đi dạo dọc theo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stroller\", \"note_vi\": \"Stroller là xe đẩy em bé, tránh nhầm lẫn khi làm bài nghe miêu tả tranh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stroll\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stroller\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-cori-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru0-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru5-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru6-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru10-486b5354.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru9-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru3-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru7-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru8-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-aru2-486b5354.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-ljspeech-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt408-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt138-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt624-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt396-486b5354.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt498-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt132-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt288-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt42-486b5354.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stroll-lt90-486b5354.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong Part 1 TOEIC tả hành động thư giãn: \'taking a stroll\' hoặc \'strolling along the riverbank\'.', 'daily life', 1, 26),
('0776215f-af9b-5b18-8dc4-acb3bd597856', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0dc87b42-470c-525f-9278-da68327132c4', '6f26ebda-9c64-5c40-8cf8-ba06a9859787', 'spasmodically', '/spæzˈmɒdɪkli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách không đều, từng cơn hoặc gián đoạn.', 'happening in an irregular way with sudden bursts of activity followed by periods of rest.', 'The old engine ran spasmodically, coughing and sputtering before finally giving out.', 'Động cơ cũ chạy gián đoạn, ho và khạc rồi cuối cùng dừng hẳn.', '{\"en\": \"The production line operated spasmodically due to frequent power outages throughout the busy manufacturing day.\", \"vi\": \"Dây chuyền sản xuất hoạt động gián đoạn do mất điện thường xuyên trong suốt ngày sản xuất bận rộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-ljspeech-dbdb832c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-cori-dbdb832c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spasmodically-2cd16823.webp', '[\"irregularly\", \"intermittently\"]', '[\"steadily\", \"constantly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"move spasmodically\", \"meaning\": \"di chuyển gián đoạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work spasmodically\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc không đều\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spasm\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"spasmodic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-cori-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru0-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru5-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru6-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru10-dbdb832c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru9-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru3-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru7-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru8-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-aru2-dbdb832c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-ljspeech-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt408-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt138-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt624-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt396-dbdb832c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt498-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt132-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt288-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt42-dbdb832c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasmodically-lt90-dbdb832c.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này khá trang trọng, dùng để mô tả sự không ổn định.', 'manufacturing', 1, 27),
('be60f423-1df0-57fa-b53b-eb9d5d0a8521', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0dc87b42-470c-525f-9278-da68327132c4', '6f26ebda-9c64-5c40-8cf8-ba06a9859787', 'tricky', '/ˈtrɪki/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Khó khăn, phức tạp hoặc cần sự khéo léo để giải quyết.', 'difficult to deal with and needing careful attention or special skills to solve.', 'This math problem is quite tricky, but I think I can solve it.', 'Bài toán này khá hóc búa, nhưng tôi nghĩ mình có thể giải được.', '{\"en\": \"Negotiating the terms of this new contract can be quite tricky without a good lawyer.\", \"vi\": \"Việc đàm phán các điều khoản của hợp đồng mới này có thể khá phức tạp nếu không có một luật sư giỏi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-ljspeech-22bd6f1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-cori-22bd6f1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tricky-89ffa032.webp', '[\"difficult\", \"complicated\", \"complex\"]', '[\"easy\", \"simple\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tricky situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống phức tạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tricky question\", \"meaning\": \"câu hỏi hóc búa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trick\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trickiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-cori-22bd6f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-aru0-22bd6f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-aru5-22bd6f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-aru6-22bd6f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-aru10-22bd6f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-aru9-22bd6f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-aru3-22bd6f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-aru7-22bd6f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tricky-aru8-22bd6f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia