('6ac42a89-ec31-526a-8ed5-45b62ba4bb44', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0f57abf4-8090-5acf-9147-196c9ea2fccc', 'df2909da-48f9-5c4e-83a9-95012f570dea', 'increased', '/ɪnˈkriːst/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Đã được tăng lên, gia tăng.', 'greater in size, amount, degree, or value than before.', 'There\'s an increased demand for sustainable products in the market.', 'Có một nhu cầu gia tăng đối với các sản phẩm bền vững trên thị trường.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing campaign led to increased sales during the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị đã dẫn đến doanh số bán hàng gia tăng trong mùa lễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-ljspeech-fc399f91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-cori-fc399f91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/increased-0d4cc3aa.webp', '[\"higher\", \"expanded\", \"raised\"]', '[\"decreased\", \"reduced\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increased demand\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu gia tăng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"increased competition\", \"meaning\": \"sự cạnh tranh gia tăng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"increase\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"increase\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"increasingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-cori-fc399f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-aru0-fc399f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-aru5-fc399f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-aru6-fc399f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-aru10-fc399f91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-aru9-fc399f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-aru3-fc399f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-aru7-fc399f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/increased-aru8-fc399f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob