('a51d8529-bd67-59df-9c6e-4edce8601e27', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0f57abf4-8090-5acf-9147-196c9ea2fccc', 'df2909da-48f9-5c4e-83a9-95012f570dea', 'calm', 'UK: /kɑːm/ | US: /kɑm/', 'B1', 'verb', 'trấn tĩnh, làm dịu', 'to make someone feel peaceful, relaxed, or free from agitation and anxiety', 'The manager tried to calm the angry customer.', 'Người quản lý cố gắng trấn tĩnh khách hàng giận dữ.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service representative tried to calm the dissatisfied client by offering a full refund.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng đã cố gắng làm dịu vị khách không hài lòng bằng cách đề nghị hoàn tiền đầy đủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-ljspeech-2ec3d0c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-cori-2ec3d0c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/calm-ea81d177.webp', '[\"soothe\", \"pacify\", \"appease\", \"mollify\"]', '[\"agitate\", \"upset\", \"excite\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"calm down\", \"meaning\": \"bình tĩnh lại / làm dịu lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"calm someone\'s fears\", \"meaning\": \"xoa dịu nỗi sợ của ai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"calm\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"calmly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"calmness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-cori-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru0-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru5-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru6-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru10-2ec3d0c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru9-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru3-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru7-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru8-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-aru2-2ec3d0c7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-ljspeech-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt408-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt138-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt624-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt396-2ec3d0c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt498-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt132-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt288-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt42-2ec3d0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calm-lt90-2ec3d0c7.mp3\"]}}', 'Âm \'l\' câm (/kɑːm/). Động từ này thường đi với \'down\' thành phrasal verb \'calm down\' (trấn tĩnh lại).', 'customer service', 1, 12),
('09405798-77ad-515c-8431-ee53138ae895', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0f57abf4-8090-5acf-9147-196c9ea2fccc', 'df2909da-48f9-5c4e-83a9-95012f570dea', 'prejudiced', '/ˈpredʒədɪst/', '', 'adjective', 'Có định kiến hoặc quan điểm không công bằng về ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'having an unfair and negative opinion about someone or something without enough knowledge.', 'It\'s important not to be prejudiced against people from different backgrounds.', 'Điều quan trọng là không nên có thành kiến với những người từ các nền văn hóa khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was warned not to be prejudiced when reviewing applications from different countries.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã được cảnh báo không được có định kiến khi xem xét các đơn ứng tuyển từ các quốc gia khác nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-ljspeech-0d60b299.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-cori-0d60b299.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prejudiced-e9712696.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-cori-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru0-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru5-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru6-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru10-0d60b299.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru9-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru3-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru7-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru8-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-aru2-0d60b299.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prejudiced-ljspeech-0d60b299.mp3\", \"/storage/