('e9cd9705-4802-5467-a41c-f60b2ce87857', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0f57abf4-8090-5acf-9147-196c9ea2fccc', 'df2909da-48f9-5c4e-83a9-95012f570dea', 'seasonal', 'UK: /ˈsiːzənl/ | US: /ˈsiːzənl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'theo mùa', 'happening, available, or suitable during a particular time of the year.', 'The store offers seasonal discounts on winter clothes.', 'Cửa hàng đưa ra các đợt giảm giá theo mùa cho quần áo mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"The retail company hires extra seasonal workers to handle the high volume of holiday orders.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty bán lẻ thuê thêm công nhân thời vụ để xử lý lượng đơn hàng lớn vào dịp lễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-ljspeech-64fd6383.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-cori-64fd6383.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seasonal-cb4a49aa.webp', '[\"periodic\", \"cyclical\", \"temporary\"]', '[\"year-round\", \"permanent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"seasonal staff\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên thời vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seasonal demand\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu theo mùa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seasonal discount\", \"meaning\": \"giảm giá theo mùa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"seasoned\", \"note_vi\": \"\'seasoned\' nghĩa là dày dạn kinh nghiệm, khác với \'seasonal\' mang nghĩa theo mùa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"season\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"seasonally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-cori-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru0-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru5-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru6-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru10-64fd6383.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru9-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru3-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru7-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru8-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-aru2-64fd6383.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-ljspeech-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt408-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt138-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt624-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt396-64fd6383.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt498-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt132-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt288-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt42-64fd6383.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonal-lt90-64fd6383.mp3\"]}}', '\'Seasonal\' dùng cho các sự việc/công việc diễn ra theo mùa (vd: seasonal workers - công nhân thời vụ).', 'business', 1, 14),
('df62b625-b2f5-5a1c-9c50-36be4dc3fc39', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0f57abf4-8090-5acf-9147-196c9ea2fccc', 'df2909da-48f9-5c4e-83a9-95012f570dea', 'intuit', '/ɪnˈtjuːɪt/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Hiểu hoặc biết điều gì đó bằng trực giác, không cần suy luận.', 'to know or understand something based on feelings rather than facts or logic.', 'She could often intuit what her children needed before they even asked.', 'Cô ấy thường có thể trực giác biết được con mình cần gì trước khi chúng kịp hỏi.', '{\"en\": \"Experienced managers can often intuit when a project is likely to fail before seeing the data.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà quản lý giàu kinh nghiệm thường có thể cảm nhận được khi nào một dự án có khả năng thất bại trước khi xem dữ liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-ljspeech-2bb85305.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-cori-2bb85305.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intuit-f837b8fc.webp', '[\"sense\", \"perceive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"intuit the truth\", \"meaning\": \"cảm nhận được sự thật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intuit a need\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu được nhu cầu bằng trực giác\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intuition\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"intuitive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-cori-2bb85305.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-aru0-2bb85305.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-aru5-2bb85305.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-aru6-2bb85305.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-aru10-2bb85305.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-aru9-2bb85305.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-aru3-2bb85305.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-aru7-2bb85305.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intuit-aru8-2bb85305.