('deb3aabb-080b-5902-9571-8fbdbc65c9dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0f57abf4-8090-5acf-9147-196c9ea2fccc', 'df2909da-48f9-5c4e-83a9-95012f570dea', 'cyberpunk', '/ˈsaɪbəpʌŋk/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một thể loại khoa học viễn tưởng về tương lai công nghệ cao nhưng xã hội suy đồi.', 'a style of science fiction that focuses on advanced technology and a dark society.', 'Many fans enjoy the dark, futuristic themes found in cyberpunk literature and movies.', 'Nhiều người hâm mộ yêu thích các chủ đề đen tối, tương lai trong văn học và phim cyberpunk.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team decided to use a cyberpunk aesthetic for the new video game campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã quyết định sử dụng thẩm mỹ cyberpunk cho chiến dịch trò chơi điện tử mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-ljspeech-bf00f417.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-cori-bf00f417.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cyberpunk-b296e232.webp', '[\"sci-fi\", \"futuristic fiction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cyberpunk genre\", \"meaning\": \"thể loại cyberpunk\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cyberpunk style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách cyberpunk\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-cori-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru0-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru5-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru6-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru10-bf00f417.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru9-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru3-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru7-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru8-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-aru2-bf00f417.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-ljspeech-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt408-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt138-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt624-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt396-bf00f417.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt498-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt132-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt288-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt42-bf00f417.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cyberpunk-lt90-bf00f417.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ một phong cách văn hóa/nghệ thuật cụ thể.', 'media', 1, 16),
('7e8ea207-4ba3-5e35-9b1d-0f4ccf6af90e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0f57abf4-8090-5acf-9147-196c9ea2fccc', 'df2909da-48f9-5c4e-83a9-95012f570dea', 'snappy', '/ˈsnæpi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Nhanh chóng, hoạt bát và tràn đầy năng lượng.', 'moving or acting quickly and with a lot of energy or style.', 'He gave a snappy reply, showing his quick wit.', 'Anh ấy đưa ra một câu trả lời nhanh gọn, thể hiện sự nhanh trí của mình.', '{\"en\": \"We need a snappy marketing slogan that will easily catch the attention of young consumers.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần một khẩu hiệu tiếp thị ngắn gọn bắt tai để dễ dàng thu hút sự chú ý của người tiêu dùng trẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-ljspeech-a0b1117d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-cori-a0b1117d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/snappy-301b6ec5.webp', '[\"quick\", \"energetic\", \"catchy\"]', '[\"slow\", \"sluggish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"snappy title\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu đề bắt tai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"snappy dresser\", \"meaning\": \"người ăn mặc bảnh bao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"snap\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"snappily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-cori-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru0-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru5-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru6-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru10-a0b1117d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru9-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru3-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru7-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru8-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-aru2-a0b1117d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-ljspeech-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt408-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt138-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt624-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt396-a0b1117d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt498-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt132-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt288-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt42-a0b1117d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/snappy-lt90-a0b1117d.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \"make it snappy\" rất hay gặp trong giao tiếp khi muốn hối thúc ai đó.', 'marketing', 1, 17),
('5d8fbf93-92ca-5db6-a05f-6870f6df0bc3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '0f57abf4-8090-5acf-9147-196c9ea2fccc', 'df2909da-48f9-5c4e-83a9-95012f570dea', 'beak', '/biːk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Mỏ chim.', 'the hard outside part of a bird\'s mouth used for feeding and picking up things.', 'The eagle used its sharp beak to tear apart its prey.', 'Đại bàng dùng chiếc mỏ sắc nhọn của nó để xé con mồi.', '{\"en\": \"The souvenir shop sells decorative wooden birds with a brightly painted yellow beak.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng quà lưu niệm bán những con chim gỗ trang trí có chiếc mỏ sơn màu vàng tươi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-ljspeech-4cb84941.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-cori-4cb84941.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beak-8b4497bd.webp', '[\"bill\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sharp beak\", \"meaning\": \"mỏ sắc nhọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"curved beak\", \"meaning\": \"mỏ cong\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"peak\", \"note_vi\": \"peak nghĩa là đỉnh cao hoặc chóp núi, khác với beak là mỏ chim.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"beaked\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-cori-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru0-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru5-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru6-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru10-4cb84941.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru9-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru3-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru7-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru8-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-aru2-4cb84941.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beak-ljspeech-4cb84941.mp3\", \"/sto