('9f715d9d-376e-5931-826d-324b4ee171f2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'decide', '/dɪˈsaɪd/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Đưa ra sự lựa chọn hoặc kết luận sau khi cân nhắc.', 'to make a choice or judgment about something after considering options.', 'It\'s difficult to decide which university to attend next year.', 'Thật khó để quyết định nên học trường đại học nào vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The board will decide which candidate to hire for the manager position today.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị sẽ quyết định ứng viên nào được nhận vào vị trí quản lý hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-ljspeech-d14809f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-cori-d14809f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decide-9457bc01.webp', '[\"determine\", \"choose\", \"resolve\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"decide to do something\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"decide on something\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn cái gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"decision\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"decisive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"decisively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-cori-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru0-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru5-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru6-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru10-d14809f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru9-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru3-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru7-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru8-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-aru2-d14809f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-ljspeech-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt408-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt138-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt624-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt396-d14809f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt498-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt132-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt288-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt42-d14809f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decide-lt90-d14809f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Theo sau decide thường là động từ dạng to-V (decide to do something).', 'office', 1, 3),
('dd2e198e-24e1-5e1c-8dd5-bbf0e22a7563', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'lofty', '/ˈlɒfti/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất cao; cũng có thể chỉ những ý tưởng, mục tiêu cao cả, đáng ngưỡng mộ.', 'having very high standards or goals that are difficult to achieve but are very admirable.', 'She had a lofty ambition to become the first woman to travel to Mars.', 'Cô ấy có một tham vọng cao cả là trở thành người phụ nữ đầu tiên du hành lên sao Hỏa.', '{\"en\": \"The company set lofty goals for sales growth in the next fiscal year for everyone.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đặt ra những mục tiêu cao cả về tăng trưởng doanh số trong năm tài chính tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-ljspeech-378439d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-cori-378439d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lofty-f4ad7548.webp', '[\"high\", \"ambitious\"]', '[\"low\", \"modest\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lofty goal\", \"meaning\": \"mục tiêu cao cả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lofty ambition\", \"meaning\": \"hoài bão lớn lao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"loft\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-cori-378439d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru0-378439d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru5-378439d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru6-378439d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru10-378439d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru9-378439d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru3-378439d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru7-378439d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru8-378439d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lofty-aru2-378439d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\