('dc48ee6c-ebb4-5dc5-a023-ccfd468a5c73', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'prophesy', '/ˈprɒfəsaɪ/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Dự đoán điều sẽ xảy ra trong tương lai.', 'to say or predict that a specific event will happen in the future.', 'Some financial analysts prophesy a major economic recovery by next year.', 'Một số nhà phân tích tài chính tiên đoán về một sự phục hồi kinh tế lớn vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"Economic analysts prophesy that technological innovation will significantly boost market productivity next year.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà phân tích kinh tế dự báo rằng đổi mới công nghệ sẽ thúc đẩy đáng kể năng suất thị trường vào năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-ljspeech-0ee3a8e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-cori-0ee3a8e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prophesy-29bdbb8f.webp', '[\"predict\", \"foretell\", \"forecast\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prophesy the future\", \"meaning\": \"dự đoán tương lai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"correctly prophesy\", \"meaning\": \"dự đoán chính xác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prophecy\", \"note_vi\": \"prophesy (đuôi -sy) là động từ, prophecy (đuôi -cy) là danh từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prophecy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prophet\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"prophetic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-cori-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru0-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru5-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru6-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru10-0ee3a8e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru9-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru3-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru7-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru8-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-aru2-0ee3a8e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-ljspeech-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt408-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt138-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt624-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt396-0ee3a8e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt498-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt132-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt288-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt42-0ee3a8e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prophesy-lt90-0ee3a8e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt prophesy /ˈprɒf.ɪ.saɪ/ (động từ) và prophecy /ˈprɒf.ɪ.si/ (danh từ).', 'business', 1, 8),
('1c3c7a82-6582-5957-bf09-f4ed9ebe0af2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'disregard', '/ˌdɪsrɪˈɡɑːd/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Phớt lờ, không chú ý hoặc coi trọng.', 'to ignore something or treat it as not important.', 'You should not disregard the safety warnings, as they are there for a reason.', 'Bạn không nên phớt lờ những cảnh báo an toàn, vì chúng có lý do để tồn tại.', '{\"en\": \"Please disregard the previous email regarding the schedule change, as it contained incorrect information.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng bỏ qua email trước đó về việc thay đổi lịch trình, vì nó chứa thông tin sai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-ljspeech-e8f1c107.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-cori-e8f1c107.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disregard-dd4636f4.webp', '[\"ignore\", \"neglect\", \"overlook\"]', '[\"respect\", \"heed\", \"consider\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"completely disregard\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn phớt lờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disregard instructions\", \"meaning\": \"phớt lờ hướng dẫn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dislike\", \"note_vi\": \"dislike là không thích, còn disregard là phớt lờ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disregard\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-cori-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru0-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru5-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru6-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru10-e8f1c107.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru9-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru3-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru7-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru8-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-aru2-e8f1c107.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-ljspeech-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt408-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt138-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt624-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt396-e8f1c107.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt498-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt132-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt288-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt42-e8f1c107.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disregard-lt90-e8f1c107.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng làm cả danh từ và động từ với nghĩa phớt lờ.', 'office', 1, 9),
('080f2848-23da-5937-8cbd-ad7afec4e612', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'available', '/əˈveɪləbl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có thể có được, sử dụng hoặc tìm thấy.', 'able to be obtained, used, or reached at a particular time.', 'Free Wi-Fi service is available for all guests throughout the hotel lobby.', 'Dịch vụ Wi-Fi miễn phí có sẵn cho tất cả khách hàng trên khắp sảnh khách sạn.', '{\"en\": \"The conference room is available for booking every Monday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng hội nghị có thể đặt vào mỗi sáng thứ Hai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-ljspeech-7b231a50.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-cori-7b231a50.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/available-3f6ab43c.webp', '[\"accessible\", \"obtainable\", \"on hand\"]', '[\"unavailable\", \"inaccessible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"readily available\", \"meaning\": \"dễ dàng có được\"}, {\"phrase\": \"available for\", \"meaning\": \"sẵn sàng cho (mục đích gì)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"widely available\", \"meaning\": \"có sẵn rộng rãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"applicable\", \"note_vi\": \"applicable nghĩa là \'có thể áp dụng\', không phải \'có sẵn\'\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"availability\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unavailable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-cori-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru0-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru5-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru6-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru10-7b231a50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru9-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru3-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru7-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru8-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-aru2-7b231a50.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-ljspeech-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt408-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt138-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt624-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt396-7b231a50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt498-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt132-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt288-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt42-7b231a50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/available-lt90-7b231a50.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay gặp trong email công sở: \'Please let me know your available time.\'', 'office', 1, 10),
('f91c1488-d484-5cf9-8b97-896cf710b4ff', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'age-group', 'UK: /ˈeɪdʒ ˌɡruːp/ | US: /ˈeɪdʒ ˌɡruːp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhóm tuổi', 'a set of people who are all of a similar stage of life.', 'Our marketing targets a young age-group.', 'Chiến lược tiếp thị của chúng tôi nhắm vào nhóm tuổi trẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The survey results indicated that our new software is most popular among the 25-34 age-group.\", \"vi\": \"Kết quả khảo sát chỉ ra rằng phần mềm mới của chúng tôi phổ biến nhất trong nhóm tuổi từ 25 đến 34.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-ljspeech-530aef6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-cori-530aef6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/age-group-c3d46dd7.webp', '[\"age bracket\", \"demographic group\", \"cohort\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"target age-group\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm tuổi mục tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"demographic age-group\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm tuổi nhân khẩu học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"within the age-group\", \"meaning\": \"trong nhóm tuổi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-cori-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru0-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru5-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru6-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru10-530aef6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru9-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru3-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru7-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru8-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-aru2-530aef6d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-ljspeech-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt408-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt138-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt624-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt396-530aef6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt498-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt132-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt288-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt42-530aef6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/age-group-lt90-530aef6d.mp3\"]}}', 'Age-group (viết gạch nối hoặc tách rời \'age group\') dùng phổ biến trong nghiên cứu thị trường và phân tích khách hàng mục tiêu.', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('0d68f302-ac5b-51e1-91a3-8069d3da01c8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'egotistic', '/ˌiːɡəʊˈɪstɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Quá tự cao tự đại, chỉ quan tâm đến bản thân.', 'thinking that you are better or more important than other people.', 'His egotistic behavior often alienated his friends and colleagues.', 'Hành vi tự cao tự đại của anh ấy thường làm bạn bè và đồng nghiệp xa lánh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager\'s egotistic attitude made it very difficult for team members to collaborate smoothly.\", \"vi\": \"Thái độ tự cao của người quản lý khiến các thành viên trong đội rất khó hợp tác êm đẹp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-ljspeech-f66b3d9c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-cori-f66b3d9c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/egotistic-66f23bc7.webp', '[\"selfish\", \"arrogant\", \"conceited\"]', '[\"humble\", \"modest\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"egotistic behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi tự cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"egotistic nature\", \"meaning\": \"bản chất tự mãn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"egoistic\", \"note_vi\": \"egoistic thiên về triết học hoặc chủ nghĩa vị kỷ cá nhân\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"egotism\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"egotistically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-cori-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru0-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru5-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru6-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru10-f66b3d9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru9-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru3-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru7-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru8-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-aru2-f66b3d9c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-ljspeech-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt408-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt138-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt624-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt396-f66b3d9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt498-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt132-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt288-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt42-f66b3d9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/egotistic-lt90-f66b3d9c.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với egotistical vì cả hai từ này là biến thể đồng nghĩa của nhau.', 'hr', 1, 12),
('acdd303d-91ff-5a74-acb6-8798546eb084', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'shotgun', '/ˈʃɒtɡʌn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Loại súng trường nòng trơn, thường dùng để săn bắn.', 'a long gun that fires many small metal balls at once, often used for hunting animals.', 'He used a shotgun for hunting small game in the forest.', 'Anh ấy đã sử dụng một khẩu súng săn để săn thú nhỏ trong rừng.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard carried a shotgun while patrolling the remote warehouse during the night shift.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ mang theo một khẩu súng săn khi tuần tra nhà kho hẻo lánh trong ca đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-ljspeech-2f9096fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-cori-2f9096fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shotgun-168b0899.webp', '[\"firearm\", \"weapon\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pump-action shotgun\", \"meaning\": \"súng săn loại nạp đạn bằng tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sawed-off shotgun\", \"meaning\": \"súng săn cưa nòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"handgun\", \"note_vi\": \"súng ngắn cầm tay, khác với súng săn nòng dài.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-cori-2f9096fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-aru0-2f9096fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-aru5-2f9096fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-aru6-2f9096fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-aru10-2f9096fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-aru9-2f9096fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-aru3-2f9096fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-aru7-2f9096fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-aru8-2f9096fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shotgun-a