('d92b31c1-f409-56ed-8fa8-99092d9637d5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18b2f036-9bcf-5566-94b6-50bc863e2177', '8fc857e1-e218-5c87-bc4b-d96521c9cf57', 'lethargic', '/ləˈθɑːdʒɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Uể oải, lờ đờ, thiếu năng lượng.', 'lacking energy and not wanting to do anything or make any effort.', 'After a big meal, I often feel lethargic and want to take a nap.', 'Sau một bữa ăn lớn, tôi thường cảm thấy uể oải và muốn ngủ một giấc.', '{\"en\": \"Employees often feel lethargic during the hot summer months if the office air conditioner breaks.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên thường cảm thấy uể oải trong những tháng hè nóng bức nếu điều hòa văn phòng bị hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-ljspeech-5e69e464.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-cori-5e69e464.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lethargic-885edfec.webp', '[\"sluggish\", \"apathetic\", \"listless\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"active\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel lethargic\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy uể oải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lethargic response\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi chậm chạp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lethargy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-cori-5e69e464.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru0-5e69e464.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru5-5e69e464.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru6-5e69e464.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru10-5e69e464.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru9-5e69e464.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru3-5e69e464.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru7-5e69e464.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru8-5e69e464.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lethargic-aru2