('a01e0afc-de8c-5553-8f3b-c4d8f39cb8c0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18dd7632-1794-5b23-9817-e760ab417531', '81078d4a-f9a5-5ab7-a796-f9792e54f1c6', 'ballad', '/ˈbæləd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Bài hát hoặc bản nhạc kể chuyện, thường có giai điệu nhẹ nhàng, trữ tình.', 'a slow song or poem that tells a story, usually about romantic love.', 'The singer performed a beautiful folk ballad that moved the audience.', 'Ca sĩ đã trình bày một bản ballad dân gian tuyệt đẹp làm lay động khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"The radio station played a slow romantic ballad during the evening music program.\", \"vi\": \"Đài phát thanh đã phát một bản tình ca ballad nhẹ nhàng trong chương trình âm nhạc buổi tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-ljspeech-5f4bc45e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-cori-5f4bc45e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ballad-652da90f.webp', '[\"love song\", \"poem\", \"story-song\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"power ballad\", \"meaning\": \"bản ballad sôi nổi/mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"love ballad\", \"meaning\": \"bản tình ca ballad\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-cori-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru0-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru5-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru6-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru10-5f4bc45e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru9-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru3-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru7-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru8-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-aru2-5f4bc45e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-ljspeech-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt408-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt138-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt624-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt396-5f4bc45e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt498-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt132-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt288-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt42-5f4bc45e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ballad-lt90-5f4bc45e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ nhạc trữ tình nhẹ nhàng trong âm nhạc hiện đại.', 'media', 1, 14),
('f991ce0d-dbac-55cb-ac8f-bfcc2ebf4db6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18dd7632-1794-5b23-9817-e760ab417531', '81078d4a-f9a5-5ab7-a796-f9792e54f1c6', 'lavish', '/ˈlævɪʃ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất xa hoa, phung phí, hoặc hào phóng.', 'having or showing a very large amount of money spent on something to make it look expensive.', 'They threw a lavish party to celebrate their 50th wedding anniversary.', 'Họ đã tổ chức một bữa tiệc xa hoa để kỷ niệm 50 năm ngày cưới.', '{\"en\": \"The company hosted a lavish banquet to welcome the new international business partners last night.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức một bữa tiệc xa hoa để chào đón các đối tác kinh doanh quốc tế mới tối qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-ljspeech-67c5c899.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-cori-67c5c899.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lavish-ea460aae.webp', '[\"luxurious\", \"extravagant\"]', '[\"modest\", \"frugal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lavish lifestyle\", \"meaning\": \"lối sống xa hoa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lavish praise\", \"meaning\": \"lời khen ngợi nồng nhiệt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"lavishly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-cori-67c5c899.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru0-67c5c899.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru5-67c5c899.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru6-67c5c899.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru10-67c5c899.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru9-67c5c899.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru3-67c5c899.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru7-67c5c899.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru8-67c5c899.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lavish-aru2-67c5c899.mp3\"]}, \"