('c8e918a5-d8bc-5b9c-bdd8-a6db0d419a3e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18dd7632-1794-5b23-9817-e760ab417531', '81078d4a-f9a5-5ab7-a796-f9792e54f1c6', 'applicant', 'UK: /ˈæplɪkənt/ | US: /ˈæplɪkənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'người ứng tuyển', 'A person who formally requests or seeks a job, position, or role.', 'The applicant must have at least five years of experience.', 'Người ứng tuyển phải có ít nhất năm năm kinh nghiệm.', '{\"en\": \"Qualified applicants will be invited for an interview next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Những ứng viên đủ điều kiện sẽ được mời đến phỏng vấn vào thứ Hai tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-ljspeech-f3a51c09.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-cori-f3a51c09.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/applicant-00a1f354.webp', '[\"candidate\", \"job seeker\", \"contender\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"job applicant\", \"meaning\": \"người ứng tuyển công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"successful applicant\", \"meaning\": \"ứng viên trúng tuyển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"application\", \"note_vi\": \"Application là tờ đơn/ứng dụng, còn applicant là người nộp đơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"apply\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"application\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-cori-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru0-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru5-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru6-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru10-f3a51c09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru9-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru3-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru7-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru8-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-aru2-f3a51c09.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-ljspeech-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt408-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt138-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt624-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt396-f3a51c09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt498-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt132-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt288-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt42-f3a51c09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applicant-lt90-f3a51c09.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ đếm được chỉ NGUỜI nộp đơn. Thường đi với giới từ \'for\' (applicant for a position).', 'human resources', 1, 19),
('c0ed380c-aad0-533f-b576-b767b8bfecef', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18dd7632-1794-5b23-9817-e760ab417531', '81078d4a-f9a5-5ab7-a796-f9792e54f1c6', 'side dish', '/saɪd dɪʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Món ăn kèm theo món chính, thường là rau hoặc tinh bột.', 'an extra portion of food served with the main course of a meal.', 'Grilled vegetables make a healthy and delicious side dish for any meal.', 'Rau nướng là một món ăn phụ lành mạnh và ngon miệng cho bất kỳ bữa ăn nào.', '{\"en\": \"Customers can choose a free side dish when ordering any steak at our restaurant.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể chọn một món ăn kèm miễn phí khi gọi bất kỳ món bít tết nào tại nhà hàng của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-ljspeech-64619ae2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-cori-64619ae2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/side-dish-a4c4cce4.webp', '[\"accompaniment\", \"side order\"]', '[\"main course\", \"entree\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"order a side dish\", \"meaning\": \"gọi món ăn kèm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"popular side dish\", \"meaning\": \"món ăn kèm phổ biến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"main dish\", \"note_vi\": \"món ăn chính, ngược nghĩa với side dish\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-cori-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru0-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru5-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru6-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru10-64619ae2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru9-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru3-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru7-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru8-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-aru2-64619ae2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-ljspeech-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt408-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt138-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt624-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt396-64619ae2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt498-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt132-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt288-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt42-64619ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/side-dish-lt90-64619ae2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong thực đơn nhà hàng để chỉ các món như khoai tây chiên, salad.', 'dining', 1, 20),
('da54ced2-09cd-5cfc-96bd-2ebe9d3a59db', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18dd7632-1794-5b23-9817-e760ab417531', '81078d4a-f9a5-5ab7-a796-f9792e54f1c6', 'assumption', 'UK: /əˈsʌmpʃən/ | US: /əˈsʌmpʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'giả định, giả thuyết', 'a belief or statement accepted as true without having proof or evidence to verify it', 'The assumption was that he would lead the team.', 'Giả định là anh ấy sẽ dẫn dắt đội.', '{\"en\": \"We based our financial projections on the assumption that sales will grow by 10%.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi dựa trên dự báo tài chính của mình với giả định rằng doanh số sẽ tăng 10%.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-ljspeech-57763304.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-cori-57763304.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assumption-02f7789f.webp', '[\"presumption\", \"hypothesis\", \"supposition\", \"belief\"]', '[\"fact\", \"proof\", \"certainty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make an assumption\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra giả định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on the assumption that\", \"meaning\": \"với giả định / cho rằng là\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consumption\", \"note_vi\": \"sự tiêu thụ (hàng hóa, năng lượng), không liên quan tới giả định.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assume\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-cori-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru0-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru5-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru6-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru10-57763304.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru9-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru3-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru7-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru8-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-aru2-57763304.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-ljspeech-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt408-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt138-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt624-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt396-57763304.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt498-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt132-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt288-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt42-57763304.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assumption-lt90-57763304.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay đi với cấu trúc \'make an assumption\' (đưa ra giả định) hoặc cụm giới từ \'on the assumption that\' (dựa trên giả định rằng).', 'business', 1, 21),
('0b72227c-14ab-5848-b543-cea98bdfb440', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18dd7632-1794-5b23-9817-e760ab417531', '81078d4a-f9a5-5ab7-a796-f9792e54f1c6', 'abbreviation', '/əˌbriːviˈeɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Dạng rút gọn của một từ hoặc cụm từ.', 'a short form of a word or phrase that is used to represent the whole.', '\"ASAP\" is a common abbreviation for \"as soon as possible.\"', '\"ASAP\" là một từ viết tắt phổ biến của cụm từ \"càng sớm càng tốt.\"', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked staff to use the standard abbreviation for department names on documents.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý yêu cầu nhân viên sử dụng tên viết tắt chuẩn cho các phòng ban trên tài liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-ljspeech-0d72f71e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-cori-0d72f71e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/abbreviation-e9672b56.webp', '[\"acronym\", \"shortening\"]', '[\"expansion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"standard abbreviation\", \"meaning\": \"từ viết tắt chuẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"common abbreviation\", \"meaning\": \"từ viết tắt phổ biến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"acronym\", \"note_vi\": \"Acronym là từ viết tắt đọc thành một từ riêng như NASA.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"abbreviate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"abbreviated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-cori-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru0-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru5-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru6-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru10-0d72f71e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru9-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbreviation-aru3-0d72f71e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abbr