('ec8d2b34-a0da-5eda-9518-16888260b3c9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18dd7632-1794-5b23-9817-e760ab417531', '81078d4a-f9a5-5ab7-a796-f9792e54f1c6', 'reduced', '/rɪˈdjuːs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Đã được làm cho nhỏ hơn, ít hơn hoặc thấp hơn.', 'made smaller in size, amount, degree, or price.', 'Due to the heavy rain, the visibility on the road was significantly reduced.', 'Do mưa lớn, tầm nhìn trên đường bị giảm đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"The store offers a reduced price on items that are slightly damaged.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng giảm giá cho những mặt hàng bị hư hỏng nhẹ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-ljspeech-e6642a95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-cori-e6642a95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reduced-f111beb7.webp', '[\"lowered\", \"decreased\", \"discounted\"]', '[\"increased\", \"raised\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"at a reduced price\", \"meaning\": \"với mức giá giảm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduced rate\", \"meaning\": \"mức phí giảm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deducted\", \"note_vi\": \"đã bị khấu trừ (tiền lương, thuế)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reduce\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reduction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-cori-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru0-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru5-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru6-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru10-e6642a95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru9-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru3-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru7-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru8-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-aru2-e6642a95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-ljspeech-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt408-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt138-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt624-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt396-e6642a95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt498-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt132-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt288-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt42-e6642a95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reduced-lt90-e6642a95.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cụm \'at a reduced price/rate\' để chỉ giá ưu đãi.', 'shopping', 1, 28),
('7c6b70cb-4113-52e5-97c9-8cbda815db35', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '18dd7632-1794-5b23-9817-e760ab417531', '81078d4a-f9a5-5ab7-a796-f9792e54f1c6', 'clueless', '/ˈkluːləs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không biết gì, hoàn toàn không hiểu.', 'having no knowledge or understanding about something at all.', 'He was completely clueless about how to fix the computer problem.', 'Anh ấy hoàn toàn mù tịt về cách khắc phục sự cố máy tính.', '{\"en\": \"The new intern was clueless about the company\'s invoicing procedures on his first day.\", \"vi\": \"Thực tập sinh mới hoàn toàn không biết gì về quy trình lập hóa đơn của công ty trong ngày đầu tiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-ljspeech-53cd5ea8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-cori-53cd5ea8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clueless-0384b8b3.webp', '[\"ignorant\", \"oblivious\", \"unaware\"]', '[\"informed\", \"knowledgeable\", \"aware\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"completely clueless\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn không biết gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clueless about\", \"meaning\": \"không hiểu gì về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"totally clueless\", \"meaning\": \"mù tịt hoàn toàn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"careless\", \"note_vi\": \"careless nghĩa là \'bất cẩn\', còn clueless nghĩa là \'không biết gì, thiếu hiểu biết\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"clue\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cluelessness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-cori-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru0-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru5-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru6-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru10-53cd5ea8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru9-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru3-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru7-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru8-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-aru2-53cd5ea8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-ljspeech-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt408-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt138-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt624-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt396-53cd5ea8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt498-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt132-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt288-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt42-53cd5ea8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clueless-lt90-53cd5ea8.mp3\"]}}', '\'Clueless\' mang sắc thái thông tục, thường dùng trong văn nói; trong văn viết trang trọng nên dùng \'unaware\'.', 'office', 1, 29),
('d660db1f-77e5-54b1-9adf-636dafc24065', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'ritual', '/ˈrɪtʃuəl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi hành động theo truyền thống hoặc tôn giáo.', 'a series of actions performed according to a fixed pattern or custom.', 'The tea ceremony is an important cultural ritual in Japan.', 'Nghi lễ trà đạo là một nghi thức văn hóa quan trọng ở Nhật Bản.', '{\"en\": \"Drinking coffee together before the weekly meeting has become a pleasant team ritual.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cùng nhau uống cà phê trước buổi họp hàng tuần đã trở thành một thói quen quen thuộc dễ chịu của nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-ljspeech-6f38d9dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-cori-6f38d9dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ritual-24a09489.webp', '[\"rite\", \"ceremony\", \"custom\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"daily ritual\", \"meaning\": \"thói quen hàng ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"morning ritual\", \"meaning\": \"thói quen buổi sáng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"routine\", \"note_vi\": \"Routine là lịch trình hàng ngày, ritual là thói quen mang ý nghĩa tinh thần/nghi thức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ritualistic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ritually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-cori-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru0-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru5-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru6-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru10-6f38d9dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru9-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru3-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru7-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru8-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-aru2-6f38d9dd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-ljspeech-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt408-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt138-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt624-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt396-6f38d9dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt498-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt132-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt288-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt42-6f38d9dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ritual-lt90-6f38d9dd.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng cho nghi lễ tôn giáo hoặc thói quen lặp đi lặp lại hàng ngày.', 'daily', 1, 0),
('8463b0c8-a53a-5c05-9e55-03851e1631b2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'unmistakably', '/ˌʌnmɪˈsteɪkəbli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'một cách rõ ràng, không thể nhầm lẫn được.', 'in a way that is very easy to recognize and impossible to confuse with anything else.', 'Her unique laugh was unmistakably hers, even from across the crowded room.', 'Tiếng cười độc đáo của cô ấy rõ ràng là của cô ấy, ngay cả từ phía bên kia căn phòng đông đúc.', '{\"en\": \"The new logo is unmistakably modern and perfectly represents our innovative technology brand.\", \"vi\": \"Biểu tượng mới rõ ràng là rất hiện đại và đại diện hoàn hảo cho thương hiệu công nghệ đổi mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-ljspeech-078ee72c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-cori-078ee72c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unmistakably-547cb957.webp', '[\"clearly\", \"obviously\", \"distinctly\"]', '[\"vaguely\", \"ambiguously\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unmistakably clear\", \"meaning\": \"rõ ràng không thể nhầm lẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unmistakably different\", \"meaning\": \"khác biệt rõ ràng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unmistakable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mistake\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-cori-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru0-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru5-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru6-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru10-078ee72c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru9-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru3-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru7-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru8-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-aru2-078ee72c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-ljspeech-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt408-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt138-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt624-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt396-078ee72c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt498-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt132-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt288-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt42-078ee72c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unmistakably-lt90-078ee72c.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ là \"mistake\" (lỗi lầm), thêm tiền tố un- và hậu tố -ably.', 'marketing', 1, 1),
('1f01a132-b140-5eb7-a050-41f0e1619901', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'polyglot', '/ˈpɒliɡlɒt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng nói hoặc viết nhiều ngôn ngữ.', 'able to communicate in multiple tongues with both spoken and written fluency.', 'She is a truly polyglot person, fluent in five different languages.', 'Cô ấy thực sự là một người đa ngôn ngữ, thông thạo năm thứ tiếng khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"Our polyglot sales manager handled clients from France, Japan, and Brazil efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bán hàng đa ngôn ngữ của chúng tôi đã xử lý khách hàng từ Pháp, Nhật và Brazil hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-ljspeech-f9028c62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-cori-f9028c62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/polyglot-bdf5b0f0.webp', '[\"multilingual\", \"polylingual\"]', '[\"monolingual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"polyglot community\", \"meaning\": \"cộng đồng sử dụng nhiều ngôn ngữ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"polyglot talent\", \"meaning\": \"tài năng nói nhiều thứ tiếng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"polygon\", \"note_vi\": \"polygon là hình đa giác, không liên quan ngôn ngữ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"polyglot\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-cori-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru0-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru5-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru6-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru10-f9028c62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru9-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru3-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru7-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru8-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-aru2-f9028c62.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-ljspeech-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt408-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt138-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt624-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt396-f9028c62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt498-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt132-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt288-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt42-f9028c62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/polyglot-lt90-f9028c62.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm với polygon (hình đa giác); poly=nhiều, glot=ngôn ngữ.', 'education', 1, 2),
('61bd59de-9426-5601-aaaa-ca6e448dc72d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'connection', 'UK: /kəˈnɛkʃən/ | US: /kəˈnɛkʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'kết nối', 'A relationship, link, or path that joins two things, places, or electronic networks together.', 'The internet connection is very slow today.', 'Kết nối internet hôm nay rất chậm.', '{\"en\": \"An unstable internet connection interrupted our video conference call with international partners.\", \"vi\": \"Kết nối internet không ổn định đã làm gián đoạn cuộc họp video của chúng tôi với các đối tác quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-ljspeech-814605c6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-cori-814605c6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/connection-a3157a2c.webp', '[\"link\", \"linkage\", \"bond\", \"association\"]', '[\"disconnection\", \"separation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"internet connection\", \"meaning\": \"kết nối mạng internet\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in connection with\", \"meaning\": \"có liên quan tới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"collection\", \"note_vi\": \"bộ sưu tập/sự thu hồi, không phải kết nối\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"connect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"connected\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-cori-814605c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-aru0-814605c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-aru5-814605c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-aru6-814605c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-aru10-814605c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-aru9-814605c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-aru3-814605c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/connection-aru7-814605c