('4d098dbc-0827-575b-8e5a-91d859422b6d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'banish', '/ˈbænɪʃ/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Đuổi ai đó ra khỏi một nơi hoặc một quốc gia.', 'to force someone to leave a place or country as a punishment for their actions.', 'Regular exercise can help banish negative thoughts and reduce stress levels significantly.', 'Tập thể dục thường xuyên có thể giúp xua tan những suy nghĩ tiêu cực và giảm đáng kể mức độ căng thẳng.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to banish the dishonest manager from the office permanently after the investigation.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty quyết định đuổi vĩnh viễn người quản lý không trung thực khỏi văn phòng sau cuộc điều tra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-ljspeech-6cc4add5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-cori-6cc4add5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/banish-747c8652.webp', '[\"expel\", \"exile\"]', '[\"welcome\", \"admit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"banish from\", \"meaning\": \"đuổi khỏi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"banishment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-cori-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru0-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru5-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru6-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru10-6cc4add5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru9-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru3-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru7-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru8-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-aru2-6cc4add5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-ljspeech-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt408-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt138-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt624-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt396-6cc4add5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt498-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt132-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt288-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt42-6cc4add5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/banish-lt90-6cc4add5.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý hoặc hình phạt nghiêm khắc.', 'law', 1, 11),
('1a76c88f-5cf7-55bd-a9b4-056954a6bf26', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'flawless', '/ˈflɔːləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không có bất kỳ lỗi lầm, khuyết điểm nào; hoàn mỹ.', 'without any mistakes, faults, or bad parts.', 'Her performance was flawless, earning her a standing ovation from the audience.', 'Màn trình diễn của cô ấy hoàn hảo, mang lại cho cô ấy tràng pháo tay nhiệt liệt từ khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel received a five-star rating thanks to its flawless customer service.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã nhận được xếp hạng năm sao nhờ dịch vụ khách hàng hoàn hảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-ljspeech-ef316ca7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-cori-ef316ca7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flawless-28221e22.webp', '[\"perfect\", \"faultless\", \"impeccable\"]', '[\"flawed\", \"imperfect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flawless performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn trình diễn hoàn hảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flawless service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ không tì vết\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flaw\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"flawlessly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-cori-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru0-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru5-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru6-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru10-ef316ca7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru9-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru3-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru7-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru8-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-aru2-ef316ca7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-ljspeech-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt408-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt138-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt624-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt396-ef316ca7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt498-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt132-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt288-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt42-ef316ca7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flawless-lt90-ef316ca7.mp3\"]}}', 'Hậu tố \'-less\' nghĩa là không có, \'flaw\' là lỗi -> không có lỗi.', 'travel', 1, 12),
('afd2e8c4-f53c-5ea1-b5ca-fb7db8f6c5d9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'raid', '/reɪd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một cuộc tấn công bất ngờ hoặc khám xét đột ngột.', 'a sudden attack or search by authorities to find illegal items or people.', 'The police conducted a raid on the illegal gambling den last night.', 'Cảnh sát đã thực hiện một cuộc đột kích vào sòng bạc bất hợp pháp đêm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The tax office conducted a surprise raid on the company to check for financial records.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ quan thuế đã tiến hành một cuộc kiểm tra đột xuất vào công ty để kiểm tra hồ sơ tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-ljspeech-345912bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-cori-345912bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/raid-ec657a6e.webp', '[\"attack\", \"search\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conduct a raid\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành cuộc đột kích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"police raid\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc đột kích của cảnh sát\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"raid\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-cori-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru0-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru5-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru6-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru10-345912bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru9-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru3-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru7-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru8-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-aru2-345912bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-ljspeech-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt408-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt138-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt624-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt396-345912bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt498-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt132-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt288-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt42-345912bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raid-lt90-345912bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực liên quan đến pháp luật.', 'law', 1, 13),
('84a86db9-03a8-536e-bf0e-4467668076f6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'clench', '/klentʃ/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Siết chặt hoặc nắm chặt cái gì đó, thường là tay hoặc răng.', 'to press your hands or teeth together tightly, usually because you are angry or determined.', 'He had to clench his fists to control his anger during the argument.', 'Anh ấy phải nắm chặt tay để kiểm soát cơn giận của mình trong cuộc tranh cãi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager had to clench his teeth to remain calm during the difficult negotiation.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã phải nghiến răng để giữ bình tĩnh trong suốt cuộc đàm phán khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-ljspeech-69c9cd73.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-cori-69c9cd73.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clench-c45badfc.webp', '[\"grip\", \"clasp\", \"squeeze\"]', '[\"relax\", \"release\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clench one\'s fists\", \"meaning\": \"nắm chặt tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clench one\'s teeth\", \"meaning\": \"nghiến răng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"clinch\", \"note_vi\": \"clinch là giành được, chốt hạ; clench là siết chặt tay/răng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-cori-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru0-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru5-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru6-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru10-69c9cd73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru9-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru3-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru7-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru8-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-aru2-69c9cd73.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-ljspeech-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt408-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt138-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt624-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt396-69c9cd73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt498-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt132-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt288-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt42-69c9cd73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clench-lt90-69c9cd73.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng nhiều nhất với fists (nắm đấm) và teeth/jaw (răng/hàm).', 'daily', 1, 14),
('36a583ad-f04b-5fa8-8913-b80a6352969f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'eagerly', '/ˈiːɡəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Với thái độ mong muốn, nhiệt tình.', 'in a way that shows great interest and enthusiasm about something.', 'Shareholders eagerly anticipated the announcement of the annual financial report during the conference.', 'Các cổ đông háo hức chờ đón thông báo về báo cáo tài chính hàng năm trong cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The shareholders eagerly awaited the announcement regarding the annual dividend payments.\", \"vi\": \"Các cổ đông háo hức chờ đợi thông báo về việc chi trả cổ tức hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-ljspeech-d4ee87d9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-cori-d4ee87d9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eagerly-6bf7af78.webp', '[\"enthusiastically\", \"keenly\", \"avidly\"]', '[\"reluctantly\", \"indifferently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eagerly await\", \"meaning\": \"háo hức chờ đợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eagerly anticipate\", \"meaning\": \"mòn mỏi mong chờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"anxiously\", \"note_vi\": \"anxiously là lo âu, phập phồng; eagerly là hào hứng, phấn khởi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"eager\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eagerness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-cori-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru0-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru5-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru6-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru10-d4ee87d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru9-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru3-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru7-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru8-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-aru2-d4ee87d9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-ljspeech-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt408-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt138-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt624-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt396-d4ee87d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt498-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt132-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt288-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt42-d4ee87d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eagerly-lt90-d4ee87d9.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay đi kèm với các động từ như await, anticipate, accept.', 'finance', 1, 15),
('e4294304-aa14-5b36-99f7-9d242e756bf1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'scan', '/skæn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đọc lướt qua để tìm thông tin chính; dùng máy quét để tạo ảnh kỹ thuật số.', 'to look at information quickly or to copy a paper document into a digital computer file.', 'The cashier will scan each barcode carefully before packing the items into bags.', 'Thu ngân sẽ quét từng mã vạch cẩn thận trước khi đóng gói các mặt hàng vào túi.', '{\"en\": \"Please scan the signed contract and upload it to our secure company server by noon.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng quét hợp đồng đã ký và tải nó lên máy chủ bảo mật của công ty trước buổi trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-ljspeech-ffa9c24c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-cori-ffa9c24c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scan-8f416fe6.webp', '[\"examine\", \"digitize\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"scan for\", \"meaning\": \"quét tìm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scan document\", \"meaning\": \"quét tài liệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"scanner\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-cori-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru0-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru5-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru6-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru10-ffa9c24c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru9-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru3-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru7-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru8-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-aru2-ffa9c24c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-ljspeech-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt408-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt138-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt624-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt396-ffa9c24c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt498-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt132-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt288-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt42-ffa9c24c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scan-lt90-ffa9c24c.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn phòng, từ này thường dùng cho cả việc đọc lướt tài liệu và dùng máy quét.', 'technology', 1, 16),
('2a3d65a6-9ba2-5f00-874e-9fb0bcc73a9f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'traverse', '/trəˈvɜːs/', 'C1', 'verb', 'đi qua hoặc di chuyển ngang qua một khu vực rộng lớn, khó khăn.', 'to move across, over, or through an area of land or water.', 'We had to traverse a dense forest to reach the hidden waterfall.', 'Chúng tôi phải băng qua một khu rừng rậm để đến thác nước ẩn giấu.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery trucks must traverse several mountain roads to reach the remote retail stores.\", \"vi\": \"Các xe tải giao hàng phải đi qua một số con đường núi để đến các cửa hàng bán lẻ xa xôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-ljspeech-b7390b07.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-cori-b7390b07.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/traverse-2944e57e.webp', '[\"cross\", \"navigate\", \"journey\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traverse the country\", \"meaning\": \"đi ngang qua đất nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"traverse a distance\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua một khoảng cách\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"traversal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-cori-b7390b07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru0-b7390b07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru5-b7390b07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru6-b7390b07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru10-b7390b07.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru9-b7390b07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru3-b7390b07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru7-b7390b07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru8-b7390b07.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traverse-aru2-b7390b07.mp3\"]}, \"