('ac412dc9-e9b2-5991-a90b-c33858a2546a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'transmute', '/trænzˈmjuːt/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Thay đổi hoặc biến đổi hoàn toàn từ dạng này sang dạng khác.', 'to change something completely from one form or substance into another.', 'The innovative program aims to transmute agricultural waste into clean energy.', 'Chương trình đổi mới sáng tạo này nhằm biến đổi chất thải nông nghiệp thành năng lượng sạch.', '{\"en\": \"The company managed to transmute simple customer feedback into a profitable new product line.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã biến phản hồi đơn giản của khách hàng thành một dòng sản phẩm mới mang lại lợi nhuận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-ljspeech-f3da8dd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-cori-f3da8dd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/transmute-44181d8c.webp', '[\"transform\", \"convert\", \"alter\"]', '[\"preserve\", \"retain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"transmute A into B\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển hóa A thành B\"}, {\"phrase\": \"transmute stress into energy\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển hóa căng thẳng thành năng lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"transmit\", \"note_vi\": \"Transmit nghĩa là truyền phát tín hiệu hoặc lây bệnh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"transmutation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-cori-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru0-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru5-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru6-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru10-f3da8dd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru9-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru3-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru7-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru8-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-aru2-f3da8dd1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-ljspeech-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt408-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt138-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt624-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt396-f3da8dd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt498-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt132-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt288-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt42-f3da8dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmute-lt90-f3da8dd1.mp3\"]}}', 'Transmute đi kèm với giới từ \'into\' để chỉ sự biến đổi sang dạng mới.', 'business', 1, 20),
('91a4fd09-0761-54d1-82d2-7092b68f00b6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'revolting', '/rɪˈvəʊltɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất khó chịu, đáng ghê tởm.', 'causing a feeling of strong dislike or disgust because something is very unpleasant.', 'Spoiled milk inside the broken refrigerator produced a revolting odor.', 'Sữa hỏng bên trong chiếc tủ lạnh hỏng tạo ra một mùi ghê tởm.', '{\"en\": \"The staff complained about the revolting condition of the breakroom after the holiday party ended.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phàn nàn về tình trạng tồi tệ của phòng nghỉ sau khi bữa tiệc lễ kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-ljspeech-66d9092c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-cori-66d9092c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/revolting-8693e3cf.webp', '[\"disgusting\", \"nauseating\"]', '[\"pleasant\", \"delightful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"revolting smell\", \"meaning\": \"mùi hôi thối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"revolting state\", \"meaning\": \"tình trạng tồi tệ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"revolt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-cori-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru0-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru5-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru6-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru10-66d9092c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru9-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru3-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru7-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru8-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-aru2-66d9092c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-ljspeech-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt408-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt138-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt624-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt396-66d9092c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt498-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt132-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt288-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt42-66d9092c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revolting-lt90-66d9092c.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả sự khó chịu cực độ về giác quan.', 'office', 1, 21),
('358e37bb-50bc-5788-be3b-52cc6e8f31ee', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'extranet', '/ˈɛkstrəˌnɛt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một mạng máy tính riêng tư cho phép truy cập giới hạn từ bên ngoài tổ chức.', 'a private computer network that allows limited access to people outside of a specific organization.', 'Our company uses an extranet to securely share information with trusted partners.', 'Công ty chúng tôi sử dụng mạng ngoại bộ để chia sẻ thông tin an toàn với các đối tác đáng tin cậy.', '{\"en\": \"Our suppliers can access the extranet to check the status of their pending orders online.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà cung cấp của chúng tôi có thể truy cập mạng nội bộ mở rộng để kiểm tra trạng thái đơn hàng đang chờ xử lý trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-ljspeech-27ed4817.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-cori-27ed4817.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extranet-cfeaa62f.webp', '[\"private network\", \"intranet\"]', '[\"internet\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"secure extranet\", \"meaning\": \"mạng nội bộ bảo mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"access the extranet\", \"meaning\": \"truy cập mạng nội bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intranet\", \"note_vi\": \"Intranet chỉ dành cho nhân viên nội bộ, extranet cho phép đối tác ngoài.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-cori-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru0-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru5-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru6-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru10-27ed4817.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru9-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru3-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru7-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru8-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-aru2-27ed4817.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-ljspeech-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt408-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt138-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt624-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt396-27ed4817.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt498-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt132-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt288-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt42-27ed4817.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extranet-lt90-27ed4817.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với internet; extranet chỉ dành cho đối tác hoặc khách hàng được cấp quyền.', 'technology', 1, 22),
('d77c9f99-effe-5279-96f7-7a06b8990250', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'ingenious', '/ɪnˈdʒiːniəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất thông minh và sáng tạo, khéo léo trong việc giải quyết vấn đề.', 'having or showing a lot of clever new ideas and skills to solve problems.', 'Engineers designed an ingenious device that converts solar energy directly into clean drinking water.', 'Các kỹ sư đã thiết kế một thiết bị tài tình chuyển đổi năng lượng mặt trời trực tiếp thành nước uống sạch.', '{\"en\": \"The engineering team developed an ingenious design to reduce manufacturing costs significantly.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kỹ sư đã phát triển một thiết kế tài tình nhằm giảm đáng kể chi phí sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-ljspeech-7314b44c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-cori-7314b44c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ingenious-c9011b5b.webp', '[\"clever\", \"inventive\", \"creative\"]', '[\"unimaginative\", \"clumsy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ingenious solution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp tài tình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ingenious design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế độc đáo sáng tạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ingenuous\", \"note_vi\": \"ingenuous nghĩa là chân thật, ngây thơ, chớ nhầm với ingenious là tài trí.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ingenuity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ingeniously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-cori-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru0-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru5-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru6-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru10-7314b44c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru9-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru3-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru7-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru8-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-aru2-7314b44c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-ljspeech-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt408-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt138-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt624-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt396-7314b44c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt498-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt132-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt288-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt42-7314b44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ingenious-lt90-7314b44c.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với ingenuous (chân thật, ngây thơ). Ingenious miêu tả sự sáng tạo và khéo léo.', 'technology', 1, 23),
('25e5f67d-75fe-5a14-8a89-6d618f84f021', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'single out', '/ˈsɪŋɡl̩ aʊt/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Chọn ra một người hoặc vật từ một nhóm, thường để khen ngợi hoặc chỉ trích.', 'to choose one person or thing from a group for special attention or praise.', 'The teacher decided to single out Sarah for her excellent performance in the project.', 'Giáo viên quyết định chọn riêng Sarah vì thành tích xuất sắc của em trong dự án.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to single out John for his outstanding sales achievements this month.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý quyết định chọn riêng John để tuyên dương vì thành tích bán hàng xuất sắc trong tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-ljspeech-8b52167a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-cori-8b52167a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/single-out-a7082fd7.webp', '[\"select\", \"choose\", \"pick\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"include\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"single out for praise\", \"meaning\": \"chọn ra để khen ngợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"single out for criticism\", \"meaning\": \"chọn ra để chỉ trích\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-cori-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru0-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru5-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru6-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru10-8b52167a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru9-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru3-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru7-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru8-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-aru2-8b52167a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-ljspeech-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt408-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt138-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt624-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt396-8b52167a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt498-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt132-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt288-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt42-8b52167a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/single-out-lt90-8b52167a.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này thường đi với giới từ \'for\' (single out somebody for something).', 'hr', 1, 24),
('4dd1aaca-21f8-5d02-89c7-26fcf803369f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'backup', '/ˈbækʌp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bản sao chép dữ liệu để phòng khi bản gốc bị mất.', 'a copy of data kept separately to prevent loss.', 'The power grid failed, but our generator served as a reliable backup.', 'Lưới điện bị hỏng, nhưng máy phát điện của chúng tôi đã đóng vai trò là nguồn dự phòng đáng tin cậy.', '{\"en\": \"The IT team restored the backup after the server crashed yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ IT đã khôi phục bản sao lưu sau khi máy chủ sập ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-ljspeech-89121dc9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-cori-89121dc9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/backup-c7aeaf07.webp', '[\"copy\", \"duplicate\", \"reserve\"]', '[\"original\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"data backup\", \"meaning\": \"sao lưu dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"backup file\", \"meaning\": \"tệp dự phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"create backup\", \"meaning\": \"tạo bản sao lưu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"backdrop\", \"note_vi\": \"backdrop là phông nền, backup là bản sao lưu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"back up\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-cori-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru0-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru5-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru6-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru10-89121dc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru9-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru3-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru7-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru8-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-aru2-89121dc9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-ljspeech-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt408-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt138-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt624-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt396-89121dc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt498-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt132-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt288-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt42-89121dc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backup-lt90-89121dc9.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong IT, backup luôn là danh từ chỉ bản sao; động từ là back up.', 'technology', 1, 25),
('5b2d31c2-63e9-5f3b-9acd-ba6575e10fc0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1bd22373-a775-5f55-8de3-643045feb05c', 'f89f7167-b452-5e45-8f06-0a56440f8e9c', 'concern', 'UK: /kənˈsɜːn/ | US: /kənˈsɜːrn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'mối lo ngại', 'A feeling of worry or anxiety about a matter that is important to someone.', 'The manager listened to the employees\' concerns.', 'Người quản lý đã lắng nghe những mối lo ngại của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"Shareholders expressed concern about the company\'s declining sales in the third quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Các cổ đông đã bày tỏ sự lo ngại về doanh số bán hàng sụt giảm của công ty trong quý ba.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-ljspeech-c5c3bf59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-cori-c5c3bf59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/concern-cf08ed6d.webp', '[\"worry\", \"anxiety\", \"apprehension\", \"issue\"]', '[\"indifference\", \"calmness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"express concern\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự quan ngại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"growing concern\", \"meaning\": \"mối lo ngại gia tăng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause for concern\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên nhân gây lo lắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"concernment\", \"note_vi\": \"Concernment là từ cũ ít dùng, dùng concern cho các ngữ cảnh doanh nghiệp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"concern\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"concerned\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-cori-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru0-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru5-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru6-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru10-c5c3bf59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru9-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru3-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \