('1d1efc4f-5868-504e-9d4f-7ca6669dbddb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1e5d2a2f-9d39-54a8-97fb-63537f4bebee', '453b42ee-1342-5bba-9e3a-041eb946e1d0', 'differ', 'UK: /ˈdɪfə/ | US: /ˈdɪfər/', 'B2', 'verb', 'khác nhau', 'To be unlike or distinct from another thing in nature, form, or opinion.', 'Their opinions on the project differ greatly.', 'Ý kiến của họ về dự án khác nhau rất nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"Opinions among the board members differ regarding the allocation of the annual marketing budget.\", \"vi\": \"Ý kiến giữa các thành viên hội đồng quản trị khác nhau liên quan đến việc phân bổ ngân sách tiếp thị hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-ljspeech-dfbc6454.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-cori-dfbc6454.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/differ-844602c8.webp', '[\"vary\", \"contrast\", \"diverge\"]', '[\"match\", \"resemble\", \"conform\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"differ from\", \"meaning\": \"khác với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"differ significantly\", \"meaning\": \"khác biệt đáng kể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"different\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"difference\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-cori-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru0-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru5-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru6-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru10-dfbc6454.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru9-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru3-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru7-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru8-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-aru2-dfbc6454.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-ljspeech-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt408-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt138-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt624-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt396-dfbc6454.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt498-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt132-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt288-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt42-dfbc6454.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/differ-lt90-dfbc6454.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ thường đi với giới từ \'from\' (differ from = khác với) hoặc \'in\' (differ in = khác nhau ở điểm nào).', 'office', 1, 6),
('4a8eec8c-ad26-5276-ba5f-65d95723140d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1e5d2a2f-9d39-54a8-97fb-63537f4bebee', '453b42ee-1342-5bba-9e3a-041eb946e1d0', 'fade', '/feɪd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Trở nên nhạt hơn, yếu hơn hoặc biến mất dần theo thời gian.', 'to slowly become less bright, strong, or visible over time.', 'The old photograph had started to fade, making the faces hard to recognize.', 'Bức ảnh cũ đã bắt đầu mờ dần, khiến các khuôn mặt khó nhận ra.', '{\"en\": \"The printed logo on the company uniforms began to fade after several washes.\", \"vi\": \"Logo in trên đồng phục công ty bắt đầu bị phai màu sau nhiều lần giặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-ljspeech-78166c9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-cori-78166c9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fade-2a04afed.webp', '[\"diminish\", \"wane\", \"dwindle\"]', '[\"brighten\", \"intensify\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fade away\", \"meaning\": \"biến mất dần dần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fade out\", \"meaning\": \"mờ dần, tắt dần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fade to black\", \"meaning\": \"màn hình tối dần (trong phim/trình chiếu)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"faze\", \"note_vi\": \"faze nghĩa là làm ai bối rối, không liên quan đến màu sắc hay cường độ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fading\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"faded\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-cori-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru0-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru5-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru6-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru10-78166c9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru9-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru3-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru7-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru8-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-aru2-78166c9f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-ljspeech-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt408-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt138-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt624-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt396-78166c9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt498-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt132-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt288-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt42-78166c9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fade-lt90-78166c9f.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'fade\' (phai màu/mờ dần) với \'faze\' (làm bối rối) vì phát âm gần giống nhau.', 'office', 1, 7),
('fc9e92e3-c27c-56c2-9427-ff2fe0f93361', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1e5d2a2f-9d39-54a8-97fb-63537f4bebee', '453b42ee-1342-5bba-9e3a-041eb946e1d0', 'calmly', '/ˈkɑːmli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách bình tĩnh, không lo lắng hay hoảng sợ.', 'in a quiet and peaceful way, without showing any signs of worry or sudden movement.', 'She calmly explained the situation to the police officer.', 'Cô ấy bình tĩnh giải thích tình hình cho viên cảnh sát.', '{\"en\": \"The manager calmly addressed the client\'s complaints about the delayed shipment during the conference call.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bình tĩnh giải quyết các khiếu nại của khách hàng về lô hàng bị chậm trong cuộc gọi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-ljspeech-56916abf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-cori-56916abf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/calmly-276b00e7.webp', '[\"quietly\", \"peacefully\"]', '[\"anxiously\", \"nervously\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"calmly explain\", \"meaning\": \"giải thích bình tĩnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"react calmly\", \"meaning\": \"phản ứng bình tĩnh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"calm\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"calmness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-cori-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru0-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru5-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru6-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru10-56916abf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru9-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru3-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru7-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru8-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-aru2-56916abf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-ljspeech-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt408-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt138-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt624-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt396-56916abf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt498-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt132-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt288-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt42-56916abf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmly-lt90-56916abf.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả thái độ chuyên nghiệp khi xử lý sự cố.', 'office', 1, 8),
('f304e08e-95f9-5019-b30c-a57a3ea46664', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1e5d2a2f-9d39-54a8-97fb-63537f4bebee', '453b42ee-1342-5bba-9e3a-041eb946e1d0', 'cubic', '/ˈkjuːbɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng khối lập phương, hoặc liên quan đến thể tích.', 'having the shape of a cube, or relating to a volume measurement.', 'The new storage warehouse provides over five thousand cubic meters of available space.', 'Kho lưu trữ mới cung cấp hơn năm nghìn mét khối không gian có sẵn.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse has over ten thousand cubic meters of storage space available.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà kho có hơn mười nghìn mét khối không gian lưu trữ có sẵn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-ljspeech-0cabcd56.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-cori-0cabcd56.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cubic-523148d9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cubic meter\", \"meaning\": \"mét khối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cubic capacity\", \"meaning\": \"dung tích xi lanh/thể tích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cubicle\", \"note_vi\": \"cubicle là phòng làm việc nhỏ ngăn vách trong văn phòng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cube\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-cori-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru0-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru5-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru6-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru10-0cabcd56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru9-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru3-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru7-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru8-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-aru2-0cabcd56.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-ljspeech-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt408-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt138-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt624-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt396-0cabcd56.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt498-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt132-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt288-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt42-0cabcd56.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubic-lt90-0cabcd56.mp3\"]}}', 'Cubic meter (m³) là đơn vị đo thể tích phổ biến trong vận chuyển hàng hóa.', 'manufacturing', 1, 9),
('51040eb0-4db9-59d7-8ef8-c1eecf9ab935', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1e5d2a2f-9d39-54a8-97fb-63537f4bebee', '453b42ee-1342-5bba-9e3a-041eb946e1d0', 'infographic', '/ˌɪnfəʊˈɡræfɪk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Đồ họa thông tin, biểu đồ hình ảnh trình bày dữ liệu một cách trực quan.', 'a picture or chart that shows information or data in a clear and easy way.', 'The company created an infographic to explain their complex business model simply.', 'Công ty đã tạo một đồ họa thông tin để giải thích mô hình kinh doanh phức tạp của họ một cách đơn giản.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team designed a colorful infographic to present the annual sales results.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã thiết kế một đồ họa thông tin đầy màu sắc để trình bày kết quả doanh thu hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-ljspeech-00ad8747.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-cori-00ad8747.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infographic-1bb7e190.webp', '[\"chart\", \"diagram\", \"illustration\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"design an infographic\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế đồ họa thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interactive infographic\", \"meaning\": \"đồ họa thông tin tương tác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"graph\", \"note_vi\": \"graph là biểu đồ đường/cột đơn thuần, không chứa nhiều hình ảnh minh họa\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-cori-00ad8747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-aru0-00ad8747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-aru5-00ad8747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-aru6-00ad8747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-aru10-00ad8747.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-aru9-00ad8747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infographic-aru3-00ad8747.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje