('796c17f1-9ec3-5dc6-8045-44e2cd16e5ae', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1e5d2a2f-9d39-54a8-97fb-63537f4bebee', '453b42ee-1342-5bba-9e3a-041eb946e1d0', 'periodically', '/ˌpɪəriˈɒdɪkli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Theo định kỳ, có chu kỳ.', 'happening regularly after equal amounts of time or at fixed repeated intervals.', 'The car needs to be serviced periodically to ensure it runs well.', 'Xe ô tô cần được bảo dưỡng định kỳ để đảm bảo hoạt động tốt.', '{\"en\": \"Staff members must periodically update their account passwords to ensure maximum data security.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải định kỳ cập nhật mật khẩu tài khoản để đảm bảo an toàn dữ liệu tối đa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-ljspeech-5b53dc50.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-cori-5b53dc50.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/periodically-7e5dbac7.webp', '[\"regularly\", \"routinely\"]', '[\"irregularly\", \"rarely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"review periodically\", \"meaning\": \"xem xét theo định kỳ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"check periodically\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra định kỳ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"permanently\", \"note_vi\": \"periodically là theo định kỳ, permanently là vĩnh viễn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"period\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"periodic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-cori-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru0-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru5-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru6-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru10-5b53dc50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru9-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru3-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru7-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru8-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-aru2-5b53dc50.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-ljspeech-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt408-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt138-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt624-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt396-5b53dc50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt498-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt132-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt288-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt42-5b53dc50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/periodically-lt90-5b53dc50.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ diễn tả hành động lặp lại theo chu kỳ cố định.', 'office', 1, 20),
('058bcc26-79d6-5403-9f8b-d7babe1f2a8d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1e5d2a2f-9d39-54a8-97fb-63537f4bebee', '453b42ee-1342-5bba-9e3a-041eb946e1d0', 'underage', '/ˈʌndərˌeɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Chưa đủ tuổi hợp pháp để làm điều gì đó.', 'younger than the allowed legal age to do a specific activity.', 'The night club venue employs security guards to stop underage visitors from gaining admission.', 'Địa điểm hộp đêm sử dụng bảo vệ để ngăn khách hàng chưa đủ tuổi vào cửa.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard checked identification cards to prevent underage drinking at the venue.\", \"vi\": \"Bảo vệ đã kiểm tra thẻ căn cước để ngăn chặn việc uống rượu chưa đủ tuổi tại địa điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-ljspeech-e9d1bf33.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-cori-e9d1bf33.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/underage-da0455d7.webp', '[\"minor\"]', '[\"adult\", \"overage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"underage drinking\", \"meaning\": \"uống rượu khi chưa đủ tuổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"underage worker\", \"meaning\": \"lao động chưa đủ tuổi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shortage\", \"note_vi\": \"Underage là chưa đủ tuổi, shortage là sự thiếu hụt.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-cori-e9d1bf33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-aru0-e9d1bf33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-aru5-e9d1bf33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-aru6-e9d1bf33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-aru10-e9d1bf33.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-aru9-e9d1bf33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-aru3-e9d1bf33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-aru7-e9d1bf33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underage-aru8-e9d1bf33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje