('d48f21db-fa4d-50ae-b3d4-6041eaa3f680', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'neurology', '/njʊəˈrɒlədʒi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Ngành y học chuyên nghiên cứu về hệ thần kinh và các bệnh liên quan.', 'the scientific study of the nervous system and its disorders.', 'She decided to specialize in neurology because she was fascinated by the human brain.', 'Cô ấy quyết định chuyên về thần kinh học vì cô ấy bị cuốn hút bởi bộ não con người.', '{\"en\": \"The hospital expanded its neurology department to provide advanced treatments for brain conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Bệnh viện đã mở rộng khoa thần kinh để cung cấp các phương pháp điều trị tiên tiến cho các bệnh lý về não.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-ljspeech-fadc28e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-cori-fadc28e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/neurology-34cd949d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"neurology department\", \"meaning\": \"khoa thần kinh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clinical neurology\", \"meaning\": \"thần kinh học lâm sàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"urology\", \"note_vi\": \"Urology là niệu khoa (hệ tiết niệu), neurology là khoa thần kinh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"neurologist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"neurological\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-cori-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru0-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru5-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru6-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru10-fadc28e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru9-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru3-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru7-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru8-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-aru2-fadc28e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-ljspeech-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt408-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt138-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt624-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt396-fadc28e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt498-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt132-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt288-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt42-fadc28e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neurology-lt90-fadc28e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ neuro- liên quan đến dây thần kinh và bộ não.', 'health', 1, 6),
('a42f8ab7-55ec-5354-b4f6-3b334bc9f6dc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'evaporate', '/ɪˈvæpəreɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Biến thành hơi nước hoặc biến mất dần.', 'to change from a liquid state into gas because of heat or dry air.', 'The water in the puddle will evaporate quickly under the hot sun.', 'Nước trong vũng sẽ bay hơi nhanh chóng dưới ánh nắng mặt trời gay gắt.', '{\"en\": \"The chemical solution will evaporate if the container is left open during the long shift.\", \"vi\": \"Dung dịch hóa chất sẽ bay hơi nếu bình chứa bị để mở trong suốt ca làm việc dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-ljspeech-254ad77c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-cori-254ad77c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/evaporate-52dec4f3.webp', '[\"vaporize\", \"disappear\"]', '[\"condense\", \"freeze\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"evaporate quickly\", \"meaning\": \"bay hơi nhanh chóng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"allow to evaporate\", \"meaning\": \"để cho bay hơi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"evaporation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-cori-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru0-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru5-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru6-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru10-254ad77c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru9-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru3-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru7-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru8-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-aru2-254ad77c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-ljspeech-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt408-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt138-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt624-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt396-254ad77c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt498-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt132-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt288-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt42-254ad77c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/evaporate-lt90-254ad77c.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ cả nghĩa đen (nước) và nghĩa bóng (cơ hội, hy vọng).', 'manufacturing', 1, 7),
('c5012dfc-2b6a-5f1a-bacd-b9bca5b80a7d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'trade fair', '/treɪd feə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự kiện nơi các công ty trưng bày và quảng bá sản phẩm, dịch vụ của mình.', 'a large event where companies show their new products to people in the same industry.', 'Many regional manufacturers set up display booths at the annual trade fair downtown.', 'Nhiều nhà sản xuất trong vùng đã dựng các gian hàng trưng bày tại hội chợ thương mại hàng năm ở trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team will attend the international trade fair to meet potential business partners next month.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi sẽ tham dự hội chợ thương mại quốc tế để gặp gỡ các đối tác kinh doanh tiềm năng vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-ljspeech-1a9895da.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-cori-1a9895da.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trade-fair-e18be3eb.webp', '[\"exhibition\", \"trade show\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"attend a trade fair\", \"meaning\": \"tham dự hội chợ thương mại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"organize a trade fair\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức hội chợ thương mại\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-cori-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru0-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru5-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru6-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru10-1a9895da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru9-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru3-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru7-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru8-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-aru2-1a9895da.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-ljspeech-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt408-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt138-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt624-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt396-1a9895da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt498-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt132-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt288-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt42-1a9895da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trade-fair-lt90-1a9895da.mp3\"]}}', 'Nơi lý tưởng để tìm kiếm đối tác và khách hàng mới.', 'business', 1, 8),
('23c967aa-6a2a-5957-87b8-511618b4581f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'spasms', '/ˈspæzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự co rút đột ngột và không tự chủ của cơ bắp.', 'sudden and uncontrolled movements of a body muscle usually caused by pain or tiredness.', 'He experienced painful muscle spasms in his leg after the intense workout.', 'Anh ấy bị co thắt cơ chân đau đớn sau buổi tập luyện cường độ cao.', '{\"en\": \"The worker suffered severe muscle spasms after lifting heavy boxes in the warehouse all day.\", \"vi\": \"Người công nhân bị co thắt cơ dữ dội sau khi bê các thùng hàng nặng trong kho cả ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-ljspeech-0e07976a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-cori-0e07976a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spasms-798c95bd.webp', '[\"contractions\", \"cramps\", \"twitches\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"muscle spasms\", \"meaning\": \"sự co thắt cơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"severe spasms\", \"meaning\": \"những cơn co thắt dữ dội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spartan\", \"note_vi\": \"Spartan nghĩa là giản dị, khắc khổ, không liên quan đến cơ bắp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spasm\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"spasmodic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-cori-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru0-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru5-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru6-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru10-0e07976a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru9-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru3-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru7-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru8-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-aru2-0e07976a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-ljspeech-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt408-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt138-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt624-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt396-0e07976a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt498-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt132-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt288-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt42-0e07976a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spasms-lt90-0e07976a.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ này thường dùng ở số nhiều khi nói về các cơn co thắt cơ bắp.', 'health', 1, 9),
('127a008b-bda8-5316-82af-78a8c5e8a0b6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'reflection', '/rɪˈflekʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hình ảnh được phản chiếu trên bề mặt như gương hoặc nước.', 'an image that you can see in a mirror, glass, or water.', 'The bright glare of sunshine created a sharp reflection on the polished glass table.', 'Ánh nắng chói chang đã tạo nên hình ảnh phản chiếu rõ nét trên mặt bàn kính được lau bóng.', '{\"en\": \"The glass building showed a clear reflection of the surrounding office towers.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà kính hiển thị hình ảnh phản chiếu rõ nét của các tòa tháp văn phòng xung quanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-ljspeech-50c0788f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-cori-50c0788f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reflection-38950226.webp', '[\"image\", \"likeness\", \"shadow\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mirror reflection\", \"meaning\": \"hình ảnh phản chiếu qua gương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reflection of light\", \"meaning\": \"sự phản chiếu ánh sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on reflection\", \"meaning\": \"sau khi suy nghĩ kỹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reflex\", \"note_vi\": \"Phản xạ tự nhiên của cơ thể, khác với hình ảnh phản chiếu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reflect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reflective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-cori-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru0-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru5-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru6-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru10-50c0788f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru9-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru3-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru7-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru8-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-aru2-50c0788f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-ljspeech-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt408-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt138-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt624-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt396-50c0788f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt498-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt132-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt288-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt42-50c0788f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reflection-lt90-50c0788f.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa hình ảnh phản chiếu, từ này còn có nghĩa là sự suy ngẫm sâu sắc.', 'daily', 1, 10),
('59570d73-4897-5310-977c-536d53f90132', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'disgust', '/dɪsˈɡʌst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác cực kỳ khó chịu, ghê sợ trước điều gì đó.', 'a powerful emotion of revulsion caused by something offensive, dirty, or highly objectionable.', 'The sight of the unhygienic kitchen filled her with disgust.', 'Cảnh tượng nhà bếp mất vệ sinh khiến cô ấy cảm thấy ghê tởm.', '{\"en\": \"The unclean office cafeteria caused visible disgust among the visiting clients.\", \"vi\": \"Căn tin văn phòng bẩn thỉu gây ra sự ghê sợ rõ rệt giữa các khách hàng đến thăm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-ljspeech-521ca27d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-cori-521ca27d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disgust-e4af709d.webp', '[\"revulsion\", \"repugnance\", \"loathing\"]', '[\"delight\", \"pleasure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fill with disgust\", \"meaning\": \"làm ai đó cảm thấy ghê sợ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express disgust\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự ghê tởm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in disgust\", \"meaning\": \"với vẻ ghê sợ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disguise\", \"note_vi\": \"gần giống mặt chữ, nghĩa là ngụy trang, che giấu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disgust\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disgusted\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disgusting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-cori-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru0-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru5-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru6-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru10-521ca27d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru9-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru3-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru7-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru8-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-aru2-521ca27d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-ljspeech-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt408-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt138-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt624-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt396-521ca27d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt498-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt132-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt288-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt42-521ca27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disgust-lt90-521ca27d.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm với discuss (thảo luận) hay disguise (ngụy trang).', 'daily', 1, 11),
('d942b93e-479d-561a-9462-3bcb67abdfb2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'esteem', '/ɪˈstiːm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự kính trọng, ngưỡng mộ dành cho ai đó.', 'a feeling of great respect and admiration for someone because of their qualities or achievements.', 'The professor was held in high esteem by his students.', 'Vị giáo sư được các sinh viên của mình rất kính trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO is held in high esteem by her colleagues for her exceptional leadership skills.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành được đồng nghiệp kính trọng nhờ kỹ năng lãnh đạo xuất sắc của bà ấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-ljspeech-17b47e5a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-cori-17b47e5a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/esteem-5b6548e8.webp', '[\"respect\", \"admiration\"]', '[\"disrespect\", \"contempt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in high esteem\", \"meaning\": \"được kính trọng cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold in esteem\", \"meaning\": \"quý trọng, coi trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"estimate\", \"note_vi\": \"estimate là ước tính, esteem là sự kính trọng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"esteem\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-cori-17b47e5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-aru0-17b47e5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-aru5-17b47e5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-aru6-17b47e5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-aru10-17b47e5a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-aru9-17b47e5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-aru3-17b47e5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-aru7-17b47e5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/esteem-aru8-17b47e5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p