('078abd58-79ae-5f1e-b045-a83533389d6e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'tenderly', '/ˈtendəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách nhẹ nhàng, âu yếm và cẩn thận.', 'in a gentle, loving, and careful way that shows care.', 'He held the newborn baby tenderly in his arms.', 'Anh ấy bế đứa bé sơ sinh một cách dịu dàng trong vòng tay mình.', '{\"en\": \"The nurse tenderly cared for the injured employee until the ambulance arrived.\", \"vi\": \"Y tá đã chăm sóc một cách nhẹ nhàng cho nhân viên bị thương cho đến khi xe cứu thương đến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-ljspeech-c87f35f6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-cori-c87f35f6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tenderly-129046af.webp', '[\"gently\", \"lovingly\", \"softly\"]', '[\"harshly\", \"roughly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"care tenderly\", \"meaning\": \"chăm sóc dịu dàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"speak tenderly\", \"meaning\": \"nói chuyện nhẹ nhàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intensely\", \"note_vi\": \"intensely nghĩa là một cách dữ dội, cực kỳ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tender\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tenderness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-cori-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru0-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru5-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru6-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru10-c87f35f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru9-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru3-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru7-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru8-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-aru2-c87f35f6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-ljspeech-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt408-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt138-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt624-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt396-c87f35f6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt498-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt132-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt288-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt42-c87f35f6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tenderly-lt90-c87f35f6.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'tender\' trong đấu thầu hoặc mềm/nhạy cảm.', 'health', 1, 13),
('ea777743-b3aa-535a-a89d-3c1d2346808e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'logarithm', '/ˈlɒɡərɪðəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một hàm toán học liên quan đến số mũ.', 'a mathematical quantity representing the power to which a fixed number must be raised.', 'In mathematics, the logarithm of a number is the exponent to which another fixed number, the base, must be raised to produce that number.', 'Trong toán học, logarit của một số là số mũ mà một số cố định khác, cơ số, phải được nâng lên để tạo ra số đó.', '{\"en\": \"The software engineer used a complex logarithm to optimize the database search speed.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ sư phần mềm đã sử dụng một hàm lôgarit phức tạp để tối ưu hóa tốc độ tìm kiếm cơ sở dữ liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-ljspeech-138526b3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-cori-138526b3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/logarithm-a37f1c5f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"natural logarithm\", \"meaning\": \"lôgarit tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"common logarithm\", \"meaning\": \"lôgarit thập phân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"algorithm\", \"note_vi\": \"algorithm là thuật toán, còn logarithm là hàm lôgarit trong toán học.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"logarithmic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-cori-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru0-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru5-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru6-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru10-138526b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru9-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru3-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru7-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru8-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-aru2-138526b3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-ljspeech-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt408-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt138-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt624-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt396-138526b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt498-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt132-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt288-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt42-138526b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logarithm-lt90-138526b3.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với algorithm (thuật toán) vì viết gần giống nhau.', 'technology', 1, 14),
('ab88ec7d-4236-5b41-b5e6-532f61f86b13', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'on the contrary', '/ɒn ðə ˈkɒntrəri/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Ngược lại; để khẳng định điều ngược lại với những gì vừa được nói.', 'used to state the opposite of what was just said.', 'Many people thought the project would fail, but on the contrary, it was a great success.', 'Nhiều người nghĩ dự án sẽ thất bại, nhưng trái lại, nó đã thành công rực rỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The client expected delays; on the contrary, the shipment arrived early.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng dự kiến trễ; ngược lại, lô hàng lại đến sớm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-ljspeech-a66c771b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-cori-a66c771b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/on-the-contrary-9ffc8291.webp', '[\"conversely\", \"instead\"]', '[\"likewise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"on the contrary\", \"meaning\": \"ngược lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quite on the contrary\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn ngược lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"on the other hand\", \"note_vi\": \"on the other hand là mặt khác, không phải phủ định.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-cori-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru0-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru5-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru6-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru10-a66c771b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru9-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru3-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru7-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru8-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-aru2-a66c771b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-ljspeech-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt408-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt138-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt624-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt396-a66c771b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt498-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt132-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt288-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt42-a66c771b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-the-contrary-lt90-a66c771b.mp3\"]}}', 'On the contrary dùng phủ định điều vừa nói, không dùng chỉ sự đối lập nhẹ.', 'business', 1, 15),
('aeb7c776-d681-5f58-951c-805e113f70a3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'militia', '/məˈlɪʃə/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Lực lượng quân sự không chính quy, thường là công dân tình nguyện.', 'a group of ordinary people trained as soldiers to fight in an emergency.', 'The local militia was called upon to help during the emergency.', 'Lực lượng dân quân địa phương đã được triệu tập để giúp đỡ trong tình huống khẩn cấp.', '{\"en\": \"The local militia assisted the police in securing the area after the storm.\", \"vi\": \"Lực lượng dân quân địa phương đã hỗ trợ cảnh sát bảo vệ khu vực sau cơn bão.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-ljspeech-e5d154cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-cori-e5d154cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/militia-ff2cbed8.webp', '[\"paramilitary\", \"citizen army\", \"reserve forces\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local militia\", \"meaning\": \"dân quân địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"armed militia\", \"meaning\": \"dân quân tự vệ có vũ trang\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"military\", \"note_vi\": \"military là quân đội chính quy, militia là dân quân tự vệ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"militiaman\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-cori-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru0-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru5-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru6-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru10-e5d154cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru9-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru3-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru7-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru8-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-aru2-e5d154cf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-ljspeech-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt408-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt138-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt624-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt396-e5d154cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt498-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt132-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt288-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt42-e5d154cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/militia-lt90-e5d154cf.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ lực lượng vũ trang không chính quy, gồm những người dân thường.', 'other', 1, 16),
('b01ebc14-1b3d-56c3-a65a-886ae9ca7f72', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'decree', '/dɪˈkriː/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Ra sắc lệnh, ban bố chính thức.', 'to officially announce a decision, law, or rule with authority.', 'The government issued an official decree to regulate environmental safety standards across the industry.', 'Chính phủ đã ra một sắc lệnh chính thức nhằm điều chỉnh các tiêu chuẩn an toàn môi trường trong toàn ngành.', '{\"en\": \"The chief executive officer decided to decree new guidelines for remote working procedures.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng giám đốc điều hành đã quyết định ban bố các hướng dẫn mới cho quy trình làm việc từ xa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-ljspeech-d67401c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-cori-d67401c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decree-45582317.webp', '[\"order\", \"command\", \"ordain\"]', '[\"revoke\", \"repeal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"decree a law\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành luật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"officially decree\", \"meaning\": \"chính thức sắc lệnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"declare\", \"note_vi\": \"Declare là tuyên bố chung, decree mang tính ban hành luật lệ hay sắc lệnh bắt buộc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"decree\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-cori-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru0-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru5-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru6-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru10-d67401c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru9-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru3-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru7-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru8-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-aru2-d67401c3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-ljspeech-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt408-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt138-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt624-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt396-d67401c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt498-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt132-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt288-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt42-d67401c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decree-lt90-d67401c3.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là động từ (ban bố) vừa là danh từ (sắc lệnh, nghị định).', 'law', 1, 17),
('eac6c38f-bb9f-53a8-80ed-c8da3a302990', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'sniff', '/snɪf/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Hít hơi vào mũi để ngửi hoặc do khóc.', 'to breathe air in through your nose in order to smell something.', 'The dog started to sniff around the bushes, looking for something interesting.', 'Con chó bắt đầu hít ngửi quanh bụi cây, tìm kiếm thứ gì đó thú vị.', '{\"en\": \"The customs officer let the dog sniff the luggage for any illegal items.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên hải quan để con chó ngửi hành lý để tìm các mặt hàng bất hợp pháp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-ljspeech-438eb25f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-cori-438eb25f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sniff-4e296fe1.webp', '[\"smell\", \"scent\", \"inhale\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sniff at something\", \"meaning\": \"ngửi cái gì đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sniff suspiciously\", \"meaning\": \"ngửi một cách nghi ngờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sneeze\", \"note_vi\": \"hắt hơi (do dị ứng hoặc cảm lạnh)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sniffle\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sniffy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-cori-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru0-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru5-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru6-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru10-438eb25f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru9-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru3-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru7-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru8-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-aru2-438eb25f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-ljspeech-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt408-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt138-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt624-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt396-438eb25f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt498-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt132-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt288-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt42-438eb25f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sniff-lt90-438eb25f.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'sneeze\' (hắt hơi) hoặc \'snore\' (ngáy).', 'travel', 1, 18),
('d4e371e8-96f3-5db1-a5a1-b2abb7571bc8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'steadfast', '/ˈstedfɑːst/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'kiên định, vững vàng, không thay đổi.', 'firm and determined in your beliefs or actions and not changing your mind easily.', 'Despite many challenges, her steadfast commitment to her goals never wavered.', 'Mặc dù gặp nhiều thử thách, sự cam kết kiên định của cô ấy với mục tiêu không bao giờ lung lay.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO remained steadfast in her decision to expand the business despite the economic downturn.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành vẫn kiên định với quyết định mở rộng kinh doanh bất chấp suy thoái kinh tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-ljspeech-efe27c4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-cori-efe27c4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/steadfast-cb0c077a.webp', '[\"firm\", \"resolute\", \"loyal\"]', '[\"wavering\", \"unstable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"steadfast commitment\", \"meaning\": \"cam kết vững vàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain steadfast\", \"meaning\": \"giữ vững lập trường\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-cori-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru0-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru5-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru6-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru10-efe27c4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru9-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru3-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru7-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru8-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-aru2-efe27c4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-ljspeech-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt408-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt138-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt624-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt396-efe27c4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt498-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt132-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt288-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt42-efe27c4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steadfast-lt90-efe27c4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh lãnh đạo giữ vững mục tiêu.', 'business', 1, 19),
('f959b254-c832-5ae7-bb21-8f291498fd98', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'agitated', '/ˈædʒɪteɪtɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Lo lắng, bồn chồn hoặc bị kích thích mạnh.', 'showing in your behavior that you are anxious, nervous, or excited.', 'She became visibly agitated when she heard the bad news.', 'Cô ấy trở nên kích động rõ rệt khi nghe tin xấu.', '{\"en\": \"The customer became agitated when the representative could not resolve the billing issue.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng trở nên kích động khi người đại diện không thể giải quyết vấn đề hóa đơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-ljspeech-d56a0e77.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-cori-d56a0e77.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/agitated-67db50da.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"nervous\", \"restless\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"become agitated\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên bồn chồn/kích động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look agitated\", \"meaning\": \"trông có vẻ lo lắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"excited\", \"note_vi\": \"excited thường là hào hứng tích cực, agitated là bồn chồn lo âu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"agitate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"agitation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-cori-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru0-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru5-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru6-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru10-d56a0e77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru9-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru3-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru7-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru8-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-aru2-d56a0e77.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-ljspeech-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt408-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt138-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt624-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt396-d56a0e77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt498-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt132-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt288-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt42-d56a0e77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agitated-lt90-d56a0e77.mp3\"]}}', 'Agitated thể hiện sự lo lắng, bồn chồn pha lẫn tức giận hoặc kích động.', 'office', 1, 20),
('0bffe1b0-484d-5440-b4c1-6bd7469daf23', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'conclude', '/kənˈkluːd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Kết thúc; đi đến kết luận.', 'to finish something or decide something is true after careful thought.', 'After reviewing all the evidence, the jury concluded that he was guilty.', 'Sau khi xem xét mọi bằng chứng, bồi thẩm đoàn đã kết luận rằng anh ta có tội.', '{\"en\": \"The manager concluded the meeting by summarizing the main action points.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã kết thúc cuộc họp bằng cách tóm tắt các điểm hành động chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-ljspeech-5c187656.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-cori-5c187656.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conclude-cd0bbbd6.webp', '[\"finish\", \"deduce\", \"settle\"]', '[\"begin\", \"commence\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conclude a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"kết thúc cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conclude that\", \"meaning\": \"kết luận rằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conclude an agreement\", \"meaning\": \"ký kết thỏa thuận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"include\", \"note_vi\": \"Include nghĩa là bao gồm, không phải kết luận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conclusion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conclusive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-cori-5c187656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-aru0-5c187656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-aru5-5c187656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-aru6-5c187656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-aru10-5c187656.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-aru9-5c187656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conclude-aru3-5c187656.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co