('389f7ca2-9f34-5dbe-8146-a9428ceb4fde', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'courteous', 'UK: /ˈkɜː.ti.əs/ | US: /ˈkɜr.t̬i.əs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'lịch sự, nhã nhặn', 'polite, respectful, and showing good manners toward other people in social situations', 'The staff was very courteous and helpful.', 'Nhân viên rất lịch sự và nhiệt tình.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service representative was extremely courteous while resolving the complaint.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng rất lịch sự trong khi giải quyết khiếu nại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-ljspeech-80952094.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-cori-80952094.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/courteous-77b5af41.webp', '[\"polite\", \"respectful\", \"civil\", \"mannerly\"]', '[\"impolite\", \"rude\", \"discourteous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"courteous service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ lịch sự/chu đáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"courteous manner\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ lịch sự\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"courtesy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"courteously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-cori-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru0-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru5-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru6-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru10-80952094.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru9-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru3-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru7-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru8-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-aru2-80952094.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-ljspeech-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt408-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt138-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt624-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt396-80952094.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt498-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt132-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt288-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt42-80952094.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/courteous-lt90-80952094.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ tương ứng là \'courtesy\'. Rất hay dùng trong các bài đánh giá chất lượng phục vụ khách hàng.', 'customer service', 1, 23),
('1831d6b7-c0fc-59e7-b080-7c2d8267a858', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'corruption', '/kəˈrʌpʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành vi không trung thực hoặc gian lận, đặc biệt là của những người có quyền lực.', 'dishonest or illegal behavior by people in positions of power, especially for personal gain.', 'The government launched a campaign to fight corruption in public services.', 'Chính phủ đã phát động một chiến dịch chống tham nhũng trong các dịch vụ công.', '{\"en\": \"The firm introduced a strict policy to prevent corruption among its procurement staff.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đưa ra chính sách nghiêm ngặt để ngăn chặn tham nhũng trong đội ngũ mua sắm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-ljspeech-c4587d77.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-cori-c4587d77.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corruption-1b9e7ae6.webp', '[\"bribery\", \"misconduct\", \"fraud\"]', '[\"integrity\", \"honesty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fight corruption\", \"meaning\": \"chống tham nhũng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"political corruption\", \"meaning\": \"tham nhũng chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corruption scandal\", \"meaning\": \"bê bối tham nhũng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"corrosion\", \"note_vi\": \"corrosion là sự ăn mòn vật chất; corruption là tham nhũng hoặc hư hỏng đạo đức\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"corrupt\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"corrupt\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"corruptly\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"corruptible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-cori-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru0-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru5-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru6-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru10-c4587d77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru9-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru3-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru7-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru8-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-aru2-c4587d77.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-ljspeech-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt408-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt138-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt624-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt396-c4587d77.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt498-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt132-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt288-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt42-c4587d77.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corruption-lt90-c4587d77.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'corruption\' (tham nhũng) với \'corrosion\' (ăn mòn kim loại).', 'law', 1, 24),
('9bb7635d-736a-5d39-95c2-7ea33caa6032', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'gratifying', '/ˈɡrætɪfaɪɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Mang lại cảm giác hài lòng, thỏa mãn.', 'making you feel pleased and satisfied because you have achieved something important.', 'It was gratifying to see all our hard work finally pay off with a successful event.', 'Thật thỏa mãn khi thấy tất cả công sức của chúng tôi cuối cùng đã được đền đáp bằng một sự kiện thành công.', '{\"en\": \"It was gratifying to receive positive feedback from our clients after the product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Thật thỏa mãn khi nhận được phản hồi tích cực từ khách hàng sau khi ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-ljspeech-91da7922.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-cori-91da7922.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gratifying-b481eed6.webp', '[\"satisfying\", \"rewarding\", \"pleasing\"]', '[\"frustrating\", \"disappointing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gratifying result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả mỹ mãn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gratifying experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm hài lòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grateful\", \"note_vi\": \"biết ơn, còn gratifying là mang lại sự thỏa mãn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"gratify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gratification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-cori-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru0-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru5-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru6-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru10-91da7922.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru9-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru3-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru7-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru8-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-aru2-91da7922.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-ljspeech-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt408-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt138-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt624-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt396-91da7922.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt498-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt132-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt288-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt42-91da7922.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gratifying-lt90-91da7922.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi \'-ing\' dùng để mô tả tính chất của sự việc mang lại cảm giác hài lòng.', 'business', 1, 25),
('85afc95e-9058-52d4-84af-b5214b35e371', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '1f023f58-a8de-5949-bbbf-6051e5106604', '8b79bec1-22bb-51d4-8494-87439a4ccc80', 'a great deal of', '/ə ɡreɪt diːl əv/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Rất nhiều, một lượng lớn.', 'a large amount or quantity of something that cannot be counted.', 'She dedicated a great deal of her time to volunteering for the community.', 'Cô ấy đã dành rất nhiều thời gian của mình để tình nguyện cho cộng đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team spent a great deal of money on the new advertising campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã chi rất nhiều tiền cho chiến dịch quảng cáo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-ljspeech-bd901acc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-cori-bd901acc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-great-deal-of-fa8448cb.webp', '[\"a lot of\", \"much\", \"plenty of\"]', '[\"a little of\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a great deal of time\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhiều thời gian\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a great deal of effort\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhiều nỗ lực\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-cori-bd901acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru0-bd901acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru5-bd901acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru6-bd901acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru10-bd901acc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru9-bd901acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru3-bd901acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru7-bd901acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru8-bd901acc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-great-deal-of-aru