('35b03138-82f4-51f7-a102-f8ccf5d07a7a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'incomparable', '/ɪnˈkɒmprəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Vô song, không thể so sánh được.', 'so good or special that nothing else can be compared to it.', 'Her talent as a singer is truly incomparable; no one else sounds quite like her.', 'Tài năng ca hát của cô ấy thực sự vô song; không ai khác có giọng hát giống cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel\'s incomparable service made it the top choice for international business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ vô song của khách sạn khiến nó trở thành lựa chọn hàng đầu cho khách thương nhân quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-ljspeech-93439a90.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-cori-93439a90.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/incomparable-918f3746.webp', '[\"unmatched\", \"unrivaled\", \"peerless\"]', '[\"ordinary\", \"mediocre\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"incomparable quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng vô song\"}, {\"phrase\": \"incomparable service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ không gì sánh bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"incomparable talent\", \"meaning\": \"tài năng vô song\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comparable\", \"note_vi\": \"comparable nghĩa là có thể so sánh được, ngược nghĩa với incomparable.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compare\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"comparable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"comparison\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-cori-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru0-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru5-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru6-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru10-93439a90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru9-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru3-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru7-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru8-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-aru2-93439a90.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-ljspeech-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt408-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt138-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt624-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt396-93439a90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt498-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt132-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt288-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt42-93439a90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incomparable-lt90-93439a90.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'in-\' mang nghĩa phủ định; \'incomparable\' = không thể so sánh = vô song.', 'marketing', 1, 0),
('597d8e58-9ed9-5cd4-87ae-dff5f25762bb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'bidder', 'UK: /ˈbɪdə(r)/ | US: /ˈbɪdər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nhà thầu, người đấu thầu', 'a person or organization that offers a specific price for a job or item.', 'The company selected the lowest bidder for the contract.', 'Công ty đã chọn nhà thầu có giá thấp nhất cho hợp đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The surplus office furniture will be auctioned off to the highest bidder next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Số đồ nội thất văn phòng dư thừa sẽ được bán đấu giá cho nhà thầu trả giá cao nhất vào thứ Hai tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-ljspeech-79dc6bef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-cori-79dc6bef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bidder-551d1a28.webp', '[\"contender\", \"applicant\", \"offerer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"highest bidder\", \"meaning\": \"người trả giá cao nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"successful bidder\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thầu trúng thầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bid\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bid\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-cori-79dc6bef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru0-79dc6bef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru5-79dc6bef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru6-79dc6bef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru10-79dc6bef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru9-79dc6bef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru3-79dc6bef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru7-79dc6bef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru8-79dc6bef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bidder-aru2-79dc6bef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [