('8200700e-f321-5298-9c28-a7c3e67b4d6b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'scope', '/skəʊp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Giới hạn hoặc phạm vi của một hoạt động, chủ đề, hoặc quyền hạn.', 'the range of things that a subject, activity, or book deals with.', 'The scope of this project is quite broad and covers many areas.', 'Phạm vi của dự án này khá rộng và bao gồm nhiều lĩnh vực.', '{\"en\": \"We need to define the scope of the contract before signing the agreement.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần xác định phạm vi của hợp đồng trước khi ký kết thỏa thuận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-ljspeech-aacd3103.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-cori-aacd3103.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scope-3085d55d.webp', '[\"range\", \"extent\", \"breadth\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"scope of work\", \"meaning\": \"phạm vi công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beyond the scope of\", \"meaning\": \"vượt ngoài phạm vi của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scale\", \"note_vi\": \"quy mô, tỷ lệ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-cori-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru0-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru5-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru6-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru10-aacd3103.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru9-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru3-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru7-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru8-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-aru2-aacd3103.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-ljspeech-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt408-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt138-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt624-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt396-aacd3103.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt498-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt132-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt288-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt42-aacd3103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scope-lt90-aacd3103.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'scope of work\' (SOW) rất phổ biến trong các hợp đồng thương mại.', 'business', 1, 4),
('6a856deb-c059-5731-85e4-9f6d5689e40b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'sugary', '/ˈʃʊɡəri/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Chứa nhiều đường, ngọt lịm hoặc quá ngọt.', 'containing a large amount of sweet substance or having a taste like sugar.', 'Many processed foods are surprisingly sugary.', 'Nhiều thực phẩm chế biến sẵn chứa lượng đường đáng ngạc nhiên.', '{\"en\": \"The cafeteria decided to reduce sugary drinks to promote a healthier lifestyle for employees.\", \"vi\": \"Căng tin quyết định giảm đồ uống nhiều đường để thúc đẩy lối sống lành mạnh hơn cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-ljspeech-2b2a1696.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-cori-2b2a1696.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sugary-07e1da2a.webp', '[\"sweet\", \"sweetened\"]', '[\"unsweetened\", \"bitter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sugary drink\", \"meaning\": \"đồ uống nhiều đường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sugary snack\", \"meaning\": \"đồ ăn vặt nhiều đường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sugar\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sweeten\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-cori-2b2a1696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru0-2b2a1696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru5-2b2a1696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru6-2b2a1696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru10-2b2a1696.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru9-2b2a1696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru3-2b2a1696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru7-2b2a1696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru8-2b2a1696.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sugary-aru2-2b2a1696.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"n