('34dee6ec-97f4-52f9-be80-778977c2d690', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'be the best thing since sliced bread', '/biː ðə best θɪŋ sɪns slaɪst bred/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Rất tuyệt vời hoặc cực kỳ hữu ích, một cải tiến lớn.', 'to be an excellent invention, product, or idea that is extremely useful.', 'This new smartphone app is the best thing since sliced bread for organizing tasks.', 'Ứng dụng điện thoại thông minh mới này cực kỳ tuyệt vời để sắp xếp công việc.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees think the new scheduling software is the best thing since sliced bread.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên nghĩ rằng phần mềm lập lịch mới là một phát kiến cực kỳ tuyệt vời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-ljspeech-254a7894.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-cori-254a7894.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-f13d0c87.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-cori-254a7894.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-aru0-254a7894.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-aru5-254a7894.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-aru6-254a7894.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-aru10-254a7894.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-aru9-254a7894.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-aru3-254a7894.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-the-best-thing-since-sliced-bread-aru7-254a7894.mp3\", \"/storage/v