('52336849-9530-510b-99ed-ff605fc41b94', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'elegant', '/ˈelɪɡənt/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Sang trọng, tinh tế và đẹp đẽ một cách duyên dáng.', 'showing good taste and grace in appearance or manner.', 'The architect presented an elegant solution to maximize natural light in the building.', 'Kiến trúc sư đã trình bày một giải pháp thanh lịch nhằm tối đa hóa ánh sáng tự nhiên trong tòa nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby featured an elegant design that impressed the corporate guests.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn có thiết kế sang trọng làm ấn tượng các khách doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-ljspeech-732d5909.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-cori-732d5909.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elegant-69931823.webp', '[\"graceful\", \"stylish\", \"refined\"]', '[\"plain\", \"crude\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"elegant dress\", \"meaning\": \"váy áo sang trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elegant design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế tinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elegant solution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp khéo léo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"element\", \"note_vi\": \"element là yếu tố, elegant là sang trọng duyên dáng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"elegance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"elegantly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-cori-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru0-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru5-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru6-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru10-732d5909.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru9-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru3-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru7-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru8-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-aru2-732d5909.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-ljspeech-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt408-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt138-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt624-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt396-732d5909.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt498-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt132-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt288-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt42-732d5909.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elegant-lt90-732d5909.mp3\"]}}', 'Elegant nghĩa là sang trọng, tránh nhầm với element (yếu tố).', 'travel', 1, 12),
('bfa99239-3923-5b51-9799-7a4d433cd654', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'dishearten', '/dɪsˈhɑːtn/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Khiến ai đó mất hy vọng hoặc sự tự tin.', 'To cause an individual to feel discouraged, losing motivation or belief in success.', 'Don\'t let a few failures dishearten you; keep trying.', 'Đừng để một vài thất bại làm bạn nản lòng; hãy tiếp tục cố gắng.', '{\"en\": \"Low sales figures during the first quarter did not dishearten the sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số thấp trong quý đầu tiên không làm nhóm bán hàng nản lòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-ljspeech-7adb7aab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-cori-7adb7aab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dishearten-6224ce44.webp', '[\"discourage\", \"demoralize\", \"depress\"]', '[\"encourage\", \"hearten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel disheartened\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy nản lòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dishearten the staff\", \"meaning\": \"làm nhân viên nản lòng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disheartening\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disheartened\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-cori-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru0-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru5-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru6-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru10-7adb7aab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru9-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru3-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru7-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru8-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-aru2-7adb7aab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-ljspeech-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt408-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt138-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt624-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt396-7adb7aab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt498-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt132-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt288-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt42-7adb7aab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dishearten-lt90-7adb7aab.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố dis- (làm ngược lại) + hearten (làm phấn khởi) = làm nản lòng.', 'hr', 1, 13),
('e1f938f4-a219-5113-b366-49f184e58ac0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'mature', '/məˈtʃʊə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Trưởng thành về thể chất hoặc tinh thần; chín chắn.', 'behaving in a sensible and reasonable way, like an adult, even in difficult situations at work.', 'She shows a very mature attitude for her age, handling challenges calmly.', 'Cô ấy thể hiện thái độ rất trưởng thành so với tuổi, xử lý các thử thách một cách bình tĩnh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager appreciated her mature response to the client\'s complaint during the meeting yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đánh giá cao phản ứng chín chắn của cô ấy trước khiếu nại của khách hàng trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-ljspeech-f0499e7c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-cori-f0499e7c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mature-f3c22018.webp', '[\"sensible\", \"adult\"]', '[\"immature\", \"childish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mature approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận chín chắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mature decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định trưởng thành\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"maturity\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mature\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-cori-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru0-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru5-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru6-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru10-f0499e7c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru9-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru3-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru7-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru8-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-aru2-f0499e7c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-ljspeech-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt408-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt138-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt624-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt396-f0499e7c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt498-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt132-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt288-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt42-f0499e7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mature-lt90-f0499e7c.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen ngợi thái độ làm việc chuyên nghiệp, điềm đạm.', 'hr', 1, 14),
('b631e394-ff70-5dd1-8c5b-1c7fe1f42c00', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'backbreaking', '/ˈbæk breɪkɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Cực kỳ vất vả, đòi hỏi nhiều sức lực.', 'needing a lot of hard physical effort and making you extremely tired.', 'Farming can be a backbreaking job, especially during harvest season.', 'Nghề nông có thể là một công việc nặng nhọc, đặc biệt là trong mùa thu hoạch.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse workers complained about the backbreaking labor required to move heavy boxes.\", \"vi\": \"Các công nhân nhà kho đã phàn nàn về công việc cực kỳ vất vả khi phải di chuyển những thùng hàng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-ljspeech-3862188d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-cori-3862188d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/backbreaking-5a57ee19.webp', '[\"exhausting\", \"grueling\", \"strenuous\"]', '[\"easy\", \"effortless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"backbreaking work\", \"meaning\": \"công việc vất vả kiệt sức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"backbreaking labor\", \"meaning\": \"lao động cực kỳ nặng nhọc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heartbreaking\", \"note_vi\": \"heartbreaking là gây đau lòng, backbreaking là vất vả kiệt sức.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-cori-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru0-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru5-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru6-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru10-3862188d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru9-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru3-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru7-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru8-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-aru2-3862188d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-ljspeech-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt408-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt138-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt624-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt396-3862188d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt498-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt132-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt288-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt42-3862188d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backbreaking-lt90-3862188d.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ ghép từ back (lưng) + break (gãy), hình ảnh làm việc nặng nhọc đến gãy lưng.', 'manufacturing', 1, 15),
('f8dfd202-93ab-528b-bf5f-9f82468eb961', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'vivacious', '/vɪˈveɪʃəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Sống động, hoạt bát và đầy năng lượng.', 'full of energy, enthusiasm, and a cheerful, lively character.', 'Her vivacious personality made her the life of every party.', 'Tính cách sôi nổi của cô ấy khiến cô ấy trở thành linh hồn của mọi bữa tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"The vivacious receptionist created a welcoming atmosphere for all hotel guests.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ tân sôi nổi đã tạo ra bầu không khí chào đón cho tất cả khách của khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-ljspeech-2347e070.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-cori-2347e070.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vivacious-6b0d6878.webp', '[\"lively\", \"energetic\", \"animated\"]', '[\"dull\", \"lethargic\", \"reserved\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vivacious personality\", \"meaning\": \"tính cách sôi nổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vivacious smile\", \"meaning\": \"nụ cười rạng rỡ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vivacious young woman\", \"meaning\": \"cô gái trẻ hoạt bát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vibrant\", \"note_vi\": \"vibrant mô tả cả người lẫn nơi chốn sôi động; vivacious chỉ dùng cho người hoặc tính cách.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vivacity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"vivaciously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-cori-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru0-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru5-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru6-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru10-2347e070.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru9-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru3-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru7-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru8-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-aru2-2347e070.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-ljspeech-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt408-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt138-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt624-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt396-2347e070.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt498-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt132-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt288-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt42-2347e070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vivacious-lt90-2347e070.mp3\"]}}', 'Vivacious thường dùng để mô tả người (đặc biệt phụ nữ) có tính cách sôi nổi, ít dùng cho đồ vật.', 'hr', 1, 16),
('981c1d48-da05-51ac-b990-e5f09f082d13', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'statute', '/ˈstætʃuːt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một đạo luật chính thức được ban hành bởi cơ quan lập pháp.', 'a formal rule or law that has been written down by a legislative body.', 'Parliament recently passed a statute regulating industrial waste management across the country.', 'Nghị viện gần đây đã thông qua một đạo luật quy định quản lý chất thải công nghiệp trên toàn quốc.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department reviewed the new statute to ensure full compliance with current labor laws.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng pháp chế đã xem xét đạo luật mới để đảm bảo tuân thủ đầy đủ luật lao động hiện hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-ljspeech-717f4144.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-cori-717f4144.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/statute-fb6c6344.webp', '[\"law\", \"legislation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"enact a statute\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành đạo luật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"comply with a statute\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ đạo luật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"status\", \"note_vi\": \"Status là tình trạng, statute là đạo luật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"statutory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-cori-717f4144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-aru0-717f4144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-aru5-717f4144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-aru6-717f4144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-aru10-717f4144.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-aru9-717f4144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-aru3-717f4144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/statute-aru7-717f4144.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ