('aebe8eba-dfde-528b-b76d-c11b78f50071', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'reader', '/ˈriːdə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Người đọc sách, báo, hoặc bất kỳ văn bản nào.', 'a person who looks at and understands written words in books or documents.', 'The author hopes her new book will appeal to a wide range of readers.', 'Tác giả hy vọng cuốn sách mới của cô ấy sẽ thu hút nhiều đối tượng độc giả.', '{\"en\": \"The magazine attracts a diverse group of readers interested in international business trends.\", \"vi\": \"Tạp chí thu hút một nhóm độc giả đa dạng quan tâm đến các xu hướng kinh doanh quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-ljspeech-24b55fe8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-cori-24b55fe8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reader-0028a524.webp', '[\"subscriber\", \"audience\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"avid reader\", \"meaning\": \"người đọc sách say mê\"}, {\"phrase\": \"target reader\", \"meaning\": \"độc giả mục tiêu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"read\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-cori-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru0-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru5-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru6-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru10-24b55fe8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru9-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru3-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru7-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru8-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-aru2-24b55fe8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-ljspeech-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt408-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt138-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt624-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt396-24b55fe8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt498-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt132-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt288-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt42-24b55fe8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reader-lt90-24b55fe8.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ đối tượng khách hàng của báo chí hoặc sách.', 'media', 1, 27),
('df16d987-ea42-58d8-bf88-554d1ceae6a2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'upturn', '/ˈʌptɜːn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một sự cải thiện hoặc tăng trưởng trong một tình huống hoặc xu hướng.', 'an increase or improvement in a situation, business activity, or economic trend.', 'Economists are hoping for an upturn in the housing market next year.', 'Các nhà kinh tế đang hy vọng vào sự gia tăng trên thị trường nhà đất vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported a significant upturn in sales after launching the new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã báo cáo sự tăng trưởng đáng kể về doanh số sau khi triển khai chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-ljspeech-778a19ed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-cori-778a19ed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/upturn-fc8fe432.webp', '[\"improvement\", \"increase\", \"rise\"]', '[\"downturn\", \"decline\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economic upturn\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a sharp upturn\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng đột ngột\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"downturn\", \"note_vi\": \"downturn là sự suy giảm, trái ngược với upturn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-cori-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru0-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru5-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru6-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru10-778a19ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru9-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru3-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru7-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru8-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-aru2-778a19ed.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-ljspeech-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt408-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt138-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt624-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt396-778a19ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt498-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt132-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt288-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt42-778a19ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/upturn-lt90-778a19ed.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với downturn (sự suy giảm kinh tế hoặc kinh doanh).', 'business', 1, 28),
('b8d62ca4-919d-50f3-ad31-a48acd662511', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '20992d35-b257-51b9-8359-24a389f1d897', '6b695fc4-d861-57d0-ab15-733677a6f057', 'empiricism', '/ɪmˈpɪrɪsɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Chủ nghĩa kinh nghiệm, triết lý dựa trên quan sát và kinh nghiệm thực tế.', 'the belief that knowledge comes from real experience and observation rather than theories.', 'The scientific method is rooted in empiricism, emphasizing evidence-based conclusions.', 'Phương pháp khoa học bắt nguồn từ chủ nghĩa kinh nghiệm, nhấn mạnh các kết luận dựa trên bằng chứng.', '{\"en\": \"Modern market research relies on empiricism to predict consumer behavior accurately.\", \"vi\": \"Nghiên cứu thị trường hiện đại dựa trên chủ nghĩa kinh nghiệm để dự đoán hành vi người tiêu dùng một cách chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-ljspeech-5f59c05b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-cori-5f59c05b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/empiricism-4b2be93e.webp', '[\"pragmatism\", \"realism\"]', '[\"rationalism\", \"theoreticalism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scientific empiricism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa kinh nghiệm khoa học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"radical empiricism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa kinh nghiệm triệt để\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"imperialism\", \"note_vi\": \"imperialism là chủ nghĩa đế quốc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"empirical\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"empiricist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-cori-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru0-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru5-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru6-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru10-5f59c05b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru9-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru3-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru7-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru8-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-aru2-5f59c05b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-ljspeech-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt408-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt138-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt624-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt396-5f59c05b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt498-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt132-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt288-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt42-5f59c05b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/empiricism-lt90-5f59c05b.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ism chỉ học thuyết, hệ tư tưởng.', 'academic', 1, 29),
('be7624b8-c712-5362-83b2-8b7f4b3188f2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '24fcb506-e117-5eaa-b508-150183a0d39b', '55867208-525a-5507-94b0-cb0482eaf098', 'competitor', 'UK: /kəmˈpɛtɪtə/ | US: /kəmˈpɛtɪtər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'đối thủ cạnh tranh', 'a business entity or person offering similar products or services in the same market', 'Our main competitor just launched a similar product.', 'Đối thủ cạnh tranh chính của chúng tôi vừa ra mắt một sản phẩm tương tự.', '{\"en\": \"Our main competitor has just launched a new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đối thủ cạnh tranh chính của chúng tôi vừa mới tung ra một chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-ljspeech-52143c6b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-cori-52143c6b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/competitor-60e85dec.webp', '[\"rival\", \"opponent\", \"contender\"]', '[\"partner\", \"ally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"main competitor\", \"meaning\": \"đối thủ cạnh tranh chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outperform competitors\", \"meaning\": \"vượt trội hơn các đối thủ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compete\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"competition\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"competitive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-cori-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru0-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru5-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru6-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru10-52143c6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru9-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru3-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru7-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru8-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-aru2-52143c6b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-ljspeech-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt408-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt138-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt624-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt396-52143c6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt498-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt132-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt288-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt42-52143c6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competitor-lt90-52143c6b.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ đếm được chỉ một cá nhân hoặc công ty đối thủ (khác với \'competition\' vừa là danh từ không đếm được vừa mang nghĩa rộng hơn).', 'business strategy', 1, 0),
('2e62f6d9-6e14-5c92-a6b6-77346a1a2dd1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '24fcb506-e117-5eaa-b508-150183a0d39b', '55867208-525a-5507-94b0-cb0482eaf098', 'monstrous', '/ˈmɒnstrəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất lớn, khổng lồ, hoặc ghê tởm, quái dị.', 'very large, ugly, or frightening in appearance or size.', 'Constructing that skyscraper required a monstrous amount of concrete and steel.', 'Việc xây dựng tòa nhà cao tầng đó đã tiêu tốn một lượng bê tông và thép khổng lồ.', '{\"en\": \"The merger resulted in a monstrous amount of paperwork for the legal department.\", \"vi\": \"Vụ sáp nhập đã dẫn đến một lượng giấy tờ khổng lồ cho bộ phận pháp lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-ljspeech-bd52e668.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-cori-bd52e668.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monstrous-b42a59bc.webp', '[\"gigantic\", \"huge\", \"horrible\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"beautiful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"monstrous size\", \"meaning\": \"kích thước khổng lồ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"monstrous lie\", \"meaning\": \"lời nói dối trắng trợn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"huge\", \"note_vi\": \"huge chỉ to lớn, monstrous còn mang nghĩa ghê tởm, quái dị\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"monster\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"monstrosity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"monstrously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-cori-bd52e668.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-aru0-bd52e668.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-aru5-bd52e668.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-aru6-bd52e668.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-aru10-bd52e668.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-aru9-bd52e668.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monstrous-aru3-bd52e668.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci