('fbb3462a-0a76-5dd9-98c3-206d20bd1064', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '24fcb506-e117-5eaa-b508-150183a0d39b', '55867208-525a-5507-94b0-cb0482eaf098', 'expansive', '/ɪkˈspænsɪv/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rộng rãi, bao la; hoặc cởi mở, thân thiện.', 'covering a large area or having a very wide range of something.', 'The house has an expansive view of the ocean from its balcony.', 'Ngôi nhà có tầm nhìn rộng lớn ra biển từ ban công.', '{\"en\": \"The new office building features an expansive lobby designed to welcome all our international clients.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng mới có sảnh đợi rộng rãi được thiết kế để chào đón tất cả khách hàng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-ljspeech-0020db1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-cori-0020db1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expansive-a182b052.webp', '[\"vast\", \"extensive\"]', '[\"narrow\", \"limited\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"expansive view\", \"meaning\": \"tầm nhìn bao quát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expansive range\", \"meaning\": \"phạm vi rộng lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expensive\", \"note_vi\": \"dễ nhầm với expensive (đắt đỏ) do phát âm gần giống.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"expand\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expansion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-cori-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru0-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru5-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru6-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru10-0020db1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru9-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru3-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru7-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru8-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-aru2-0020db1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-ljspeech-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt408-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt138-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt624-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt396-0020db1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt498-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt132-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt288-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt42-0020db1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expansive-lt90-0020db1b.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'expensive\' (đắt tiền) vì cách phát âm gần giống nhau.', 'office', 1, 2),
('ca7bfb6c-5e04-53f2-b8a2-ac7666628847', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '24fcb506-e117-5eaa-b508-150183a0d39b', '55867208-525a-5507-94b0-cb0482eaf098', 'sizable', 'UK: /ˈsaɪ.zə.bəl/ | US: /ˈsaɪ.zə.bəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đáng kể, khá lớn', 'fairly large in scale, amount, or extent compared to average standards.', 'The company reported a sizable increase in profits this quarter.', 'Công ty đã báo cáo một sự gia tăng đáng kể về lợi nhuận trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The company secured a sizable grant to expand its renewable energy research.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã nhận được một khoản viện trợ khá lớn để mở rộng nghiên cứu năng lượng tái tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-ljspeech-be0c9613.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-cori-be0c9613.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sizable-f86796bd.webp', '[\"substantial\", \"considerable\", \"significant\", \"large\"]', '[\"small\", \"negligible\", \"tiny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sizable amount\", \"meaning\": \"một số lượng đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sizable portion\", \"meaning\": \"một phần khá lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"size\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-cori-be0c9613.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru0-be0c9613.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru5-be0c9613.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru6-be0c9613.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru10-be0c9613.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru9-be0c9613.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru3-be0c9613.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru7-be0c9613.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru8-be0c9613.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sizable-aru2-be0c9613.m