('fae3c183-e69d-5543-a54a-3c46573fbe99', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '24fcb506-e117-5eaa-b508-150183a0d39b', '55867208-525a-5507-94b0-cb0482eaf098', 'weak', '/wiːk/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Yếu ớt, không có sức mạnh.', 'lacking physical strength or energy, often making it difficult to perform normal daily tasks.', 'The manager rejected the proposal because it offered a weak strategy for market expansion.', 'Quản lý đã bác bỏ đề xuất vì nó đưa ra một chiến lược yếu kém cho việc mở rộng thị trường.', '{\"en\": \"The weak signal caused the video conference to disconnect several times during the important meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Tín hiệu yếu khiến cuộc họp trực tuyến bị ngắt kết nối vài lần trong buổi họp quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-ljspeech-1ded3053.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-cori-1ded3053.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weak-28c4d220.webp', '[\"feeble\", \"frail\"]', '[\"strong\", \"powerful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"weak signal\", \"meaning\": \"tín hiệu yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weak economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế yếu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"week\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ chỉ 7 ngày, phát âm giống hệt nhau.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weaken\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weakness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-cori-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru0-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru5-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru6-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru10-1ded3053.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru9-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru3-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weak-aru7-1ded3053.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v