('ea7866eb-e943-5b07-b0ef-6aca2b99f557', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '24fcb506-e117-5eaa-b508-150183a0d39b', '55867208-525a-5507-94b0-cb0482eaf098', 'adjacent', 'UK: /əˈdʒeɪsənt/ | US: /əˈdʒeɪsənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'liền kề, kế bên', 'located right next to or very near to something else', 'The new office space is adjacent to the main building.', 'Không gian văn phòng mới liền kề với tòa nhà chính.', '{\"en\": \"The executive conference room is located adjacent to the main administrative office.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng họp lãnh đạo nằm ngay bên cạnh văn phòng hành chính chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-ljspeech-7d1dd83e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-cori-7d1dd83e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/adjacent-661cadcf.webp', '[\"next to\", \"neighboring\", \"adjoining\", \"bordering\"]', '[\"distant\", \"remote\", \"faraway\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"adjacent to\", \"meaning\": \"ngay bên cạnh / liền kề với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adjacent building\", \"meaning\": \"tòa nhà kế bên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adjoining\", \"note_vi\": \"liền kề có chung vách/bức tường hoặc cửa nối\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"adjacency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-cori-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru0-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru5-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru6-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru10-7d1dd83e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru9-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru3-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru7-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru8-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-aru2-7d1dd83e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-ljspeech-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt408-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt138-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt624-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt396-7d1dd83e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt498-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt132-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt288-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt42-7d1dd83e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjacent-lt90-7d1dd83e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với giới từ \'to\' (adjacent to something).', 'office', 1, 23),
('6eb52e68-0f30-52f6-ac1d-d827f81dd87b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '24fcb506-e117-5eaa-b508-150183a0d39b', '55867208-525a-5507-94b0-cb0482eaf098', 'massive', '/ˈmæsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất lớn về kích thước, số lượng hoặc mức độ.', 'very large in size, amount, or degree and often heavy or solid.', 'The company made a massive investment in new technology.', 'Công ty đã thực hiện một khoản đầu tư to lớn vào công nghệ mới.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team launched a massive advertising campaign to promote the new smartphone.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã tung ra một chiến dịch quảng cáo quy mô lớn để quảng bá điện thoại thông minh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-ljspeech-6e04f08f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-cori-6e04f08f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/massive-0d460f16.webp', '[\"huge\", \"enormous\", \"gigantic\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"small\", \"minor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"massive scale\", \"meaning\": \"quy mô khổng lồ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"massive increase\", \"meaning\": \"sự gia tăng đáng kể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"passive\", \"note_vi\": \"Passive nghĩa là bị động, khác hoàn toàn về nghĩa và cách viết.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"massively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mass\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-cori-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru0-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru5-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru6-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru10-6e04f08f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru9-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru3-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru7-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru8-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-aru2-6e04f08f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-ljspeech-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt408-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt138-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt624-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt396-6e04f08f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt498-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt132-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt288-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt42-6e04f08f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/massive-lt90-6e04f08f.mp3\"]}}', 'Massive thường dùng để nhấn mạnh sự to lớn về quy mô hoặc số lượng.', 'marketing', 1, 24),
('3c398e68-51ac-56c1-a517-d3d6830a6032', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '24fcb506-e117-5eaa-b508-150183a0d39b', '55867208-525a-5507-94b0-cb0482eaf098', 'zestful', '/ˈzestfl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Đầy nhiệt huyết, năng lượng và sự hứng thú.', 'full of energy, excitement, and enthusiasm for doing things.', 'Her zestful approach to life makes her a joy to be around.', 'Cách tiếp cận cuộc sống đầy nhiệt huyết của cô ấy khiến mọi người vui vẻ khi ở bên.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing manager brought a zestful attitude to every team meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý marketing mới mang thái độ đầy nhiệt huyết vào mỗi cuộc họp nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zestful-ljspeech-59312951.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zestful-cori-59312951.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/zestful-5cf838d0.webp', '[\"enthusiastic\", \"energetic\", \"vibrant\"]', '[\"apathetic\", \"listless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"zestful approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận đầy nhiệt huyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"zestful attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ hứng khởi, năng động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"zestful personality\", \"meaning\": \"tính cách sôi nổi, nhiệt tình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"zealous\", \"note_vi\": \"zealous nghĩa là nhiệt thành, cuồng nhiệt hơn, thường mang tính cực đoan\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"zest\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"zestfully\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"zestfulness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zestful-cori-59312951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zestful-aru0-59312951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zestful-aru5-59312951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zestful-aru6-59312951.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zestful-aru10-59312951.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zestful-aru9-59312951.mp3\", \"/storage