('d37c4321-2499-5b1e-b438-029cd4aae3ff', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26ad1d8d-b0c4-5787-ab0a-ed1148635970', '66bafade-0076-5f11-8905-773ee6625ddf', 'barbecue', '/ˈbɑːbɪkjuː/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một bữa tiệc ngoài trời nơi thức ăn được nướng trên than hồng.', 'an outdoor event where meat is cooked over an open fire or hot coals.', 'We\'re planning a big barbecue in the backyard next Saturday.', 'Chúng tôi đang lên kế hoạch tổ chức một bữa tiệc nướng lớn ở sân sau vào thứ Bảy tới.', '{\"en\": \"The company organized a barbecue for all employees to celebrate the end of the project.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tổ chức một bữa tiệc nướng cho tất cả nhân viên để ăn mừng dự án kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-ljspeech-91d4a73c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-cori-91d4a73c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/barbecue-18b6fd09.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"host a barbecue\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức tiệc nướng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attend a barbecue\", \"meaning\": \"tham dự tiệc nướng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-cori-91d4a73c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru0-91d4a73c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru5-91d4a73c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru6-91d4a73c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru10-91d4a73c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru9-91d4a73c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru3-91d4a73c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru7-91d4a73c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru8-91d4a73c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-aru2-91d4a73c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barbecue-ljspe