('bf00d08e-00fb-579d-9c83-bf40c30ae990', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26ad1d8d-b0c4-5787-ab0a-ed1148635970', '66bafade-0076-5f11-8905-773ee6625ddf', 'confidentiality', '/ˌkɒnfɪˌdenʃiˈæləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tính bảo mật, sự giữ kín thông tin.', 'the state of keeping secret or private information safe from public access.', 'We assure our clients of complete confidentiality regarding their personal data.', 'Chúng tôi đảm bảo với khách hàng về tính bảo mật hoàn toàn đối với dữ liệu cá nhân của họ.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must sign a confidentiality agreement before accessing sensitive customer data.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải ký thỏa thuận bảo mật trước khi truy cập dữ liệu khách hàng nhạy cảm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-ljspeech-fbab88e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-cori-fbab88e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confidentiality-d57434f8.webp', '[\"secrecy\", \"privacy\"]', '[\"publicity\", \"openness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"confidentiality agreement\", \"meaning\": \"thỏa thuận bảo mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"maintain confidentiality\", \"meaning\": \"duy trì tính bảo mật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confidence\", \"note_vi\": \"confidence là sự tự tin hoặc sự tin tưởng, khác với confidentiality (tính bảo mật).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confidential\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"confidentially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-cori-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru0-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru5-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru6-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru10-fbab88e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru9-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru3-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru7-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru8-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-aru2-fbab88e1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-ljspeech-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt408-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt138-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt624-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt396-fbab88e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt498-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt132-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt288-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt42-fbab88e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confidentiality-lt90-fbab88e1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong cụm \'Non-Disclosure Agreement\' (NDA) hoặc \'confidentiality agreement\'.', 'hr', 1, 11),
('b32160d3-5b84-5e0d-b996-6d9676c9422d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26ad1d8d-b0c4-5787-ab0a-ed1148635970', '66bafade-0076-5f11-8905-773ee6625ddf', 'engrave', '/ɪnˈɡreɪv/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Khắc chữ hoặc hình ảnh lên bề mặt cứng.', 'to cut words or pictures into a hard surface like metal or wood.', 'He decided to engrave his initials onto the silver locket.', 'Anh ấy quyết định khắc chữ cái đầu tên mình lên chiếc mề đay bạc.', '{\"en\": \"The jeweler will engrave the winner\'s name on the silver trophy before the ceremony.\", \"vi\": \"Thợ kim hoàn sẽ khắc tên người thắng cuộc lên chiếc cúp bạc trước lễ trao giải.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-ljspeech-754bcb93.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-cori-754bcb93.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/engrave-9397d19a.webp', '[\"carve\", \"etch\", \"inscribe\"]', '[\"erase\", \"smooth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"engrave a name\", \"meaning\": \"khắc tên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"engrave on metal\", \"meaning\": \"khắc lên kim loại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inscribe\", \"note_vi\": \"inscribe là viết hoặc khắc lời đề tặng, engrave là chạm khắc sâu lên bề mặt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"engraving\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-cori-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru0-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru5-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru6-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru10-754bcb93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru9-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru3-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru7-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru8-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-aru2-754bcb93.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-ljspeech-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt408-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt138-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt624-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt396-754bcb93.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt498-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt132-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt288-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt42-754bcb93.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engrave-lt90-754bcb93.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng với các vật liệu cứng như kim loại, gỗ hoặc thủy tinh.', 'manufacturing', 1, 12),
('f132934d-1e00-5f38-bf3c-f502734fd95a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26ad1d8d-b0c4-5787-ab0a-ed1148635970', '66bafade-0076-5f11-8905-773ee6625ddf', 'radical', '/ˈrædɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Hoàn toàn khác biệt so với những gì truyền thống; cấp tiến hoặc triệt để.', 'causing or being a complete and exciting change from what is traditional.', 'The company introduced a radical new approach to product development.', 'Công ty đã giới thiệu một phương pháp phát triển sản phẩm mới cấp tiến.', '{\"en\": \"The board proposed a radical restructuring of the department to improve efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã đề xuất một cuộc tái cơ cấu triệt để bộ phận để cải thiện hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-ljspeech-5da0e27d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-cori-5da0e27d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/radical-c924487f.webp', '[\"revolutionary\", \"drastic\", \"fundamental\"]', '[\"conservative\", \"moderate\", \"gradual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"radical change\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi triệt để\"}, {\"phrase\": \"radical reform\", \"meaning\": \"cải cách cấp tiến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"radically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"radicalism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-cori-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru0-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru5-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru6-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru10-5da0e27d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru9-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru3-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru7-5da0e27d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radical-aru8-5