('1d83b53a-825e-5eb2-a191-d8f6a3a3e1be', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26ad1d8d-b0c4-5787-ab0a-ed1148635970', '66bafade-0076-5f11-8905-773ee6625ddf', 'inundated', '/ˈɪnʌndeɪt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Bị ngập hoàn toàn trong nước hoặc bị tràn ngập.', 'covered completely with water or overwhelmed by a huge amount of work or requests.', 'After the heavy rain, the low-lying areas were completely inundated.', 'Sau trận mưa lớn, các khu vực trũng thấp đã bị ngập hoàn toàn.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service department was inundated with calls after the system upgrade failed.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận chăm sóc khách hàng đã bị quá tải cuộc gọi sau khi nâng cấp hệ thống thất bại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-ljspeech-246efb1f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-cori-246efb1f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inundated-914b7b7c.webp', '[\"swamped\", \"overwhelmed\", \"flooded\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"be inundated with\", \"meaning\": \"bị tràn ngập bởi cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inundated area\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực bị ngập lụt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inundation\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"inundate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-cori-246efb1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-aru0-246efb1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-aru5-246efb1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-aru6-246efb1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-aru10-246efb1f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-aru9-246efb1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-aru3-246efb1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-aru7-246efb1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inundated-aru8-246efb1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob