('26a77dd2-d76a-5a0e-9b34-93c77074c21d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26ad1d8d-b0c4-5787-ab0a-ed1148635970', '66bafade-0076-5f11-8905-773ee6625ddf', 'license', '/ˈlaɪsns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Giấy tờ chính thức cho phép làm gì đó.', 'an official document giving permission to do a specific activity.', 'The software vendor granted our firm a commercial license to distribute the application.', 'Nhà cung cấp phần mềm đã cấp cho công ty chúng tôi giấy phép thương mại để phân phối ứng dụng.', '{\"en\": \"The new restaurant must obtain a license before starting food sales.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng mới phải xin giấy phép trước khi bắt đầu bán đồ ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-ljspeech-23457129.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-cori-23457129.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/license-65400bbd.webp', '[\"permit\", \"certificate\"]', '[\"prohibition\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"apply for license\", \"meaning\": \"xin cấp phép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"license fee\", \"meaning\": \"phí cấp phép\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"licence\", \"note_vi\": \"chính tả Anh Anh, cùng nghĩa với license.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"license\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"licensed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-cori-23457129.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-aru0-23457129.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-aru5-23457129.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-aru6-23457129.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-aru10-23457129.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-aru9-23457129.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-aru3-23457129.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-aru7-23457129.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/license-aru8-23457129.mp3\", \"/st