('94b42267-ed9a-50bf-9a45-3d90ca417375', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'thriving', '/ˈθraɪvɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Phát triển mạnh mẽ, thành công.', 'growing very successfully, developing well, and earning a lot of profit or success.', 'Thanks to innovative marketing techniques, the tech startup became a thriving company within two years.', 'Nhờ các kỹ thuật tiếp thị sáng tạo, công ty khởi nghiệp công nghệ đã trở thành một công ty phát triển mạnh trong vòng hai năm.', '{\"en\": \"The industrial district has become a thriving area for innovative technology companies.\", \"vi\": \"Khu công nghiệp đã trở thành một khu vực phát triển mạnh mẽ cho các công ty công nghệ sáng tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-ljspeech-5087a274.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-cori-5087a274.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thriving-855e7c98.webp', '[\"flourishing\", \"prosperous\", \"booming\"]', '[\"struggling\", \"failing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thriving business\", \"meaning\": \"doanh nghiệp phát triển thịnh vượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thriving economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế phát triển mạnh mẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prosperous\", \"note_vi\": \"Prosperous nhấn mạnh sự giàu có về tài chính hơn là sự phát triển chung.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"thrive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-cori-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru0-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru5-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru6-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru10-5087a274.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru9-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru3-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru7-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru8-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-aru2-5087a274.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-ljspeech-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt408-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt138-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt624-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt396-5087a274.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt498-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt132-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt288-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt42-5087a274.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thriving-lt90-5087a274.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để miêu tả công ty, thị trường hoặc nền kinh tế đang phát triển tốt.', 'business', 1, 1),
('faee952b-18bf-5332-aa18-d0019947ba08', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'foretell', '/fɔːˈtel/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Nói trước về một sự kiện sẽ xảy ra trong tương lai.', 'to say what is going to happen in the future before it actually takes place.', 'Ancient prophets claimed they could foretell the future.', 'Các nhà tiên tri cổ đại tuyên bố họ có thể tiên đoán tương lai.', '{\"en\": \"The financial analyst tried to foretell the market trends for the upcoming fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyên gia tài chính đã cố gắng dự đoán các xu hướng thị trường cho năm tài chính sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-ljspeech-2a9da7c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-cori-2a9da7c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foretell-b2af94ba.webp', '[\"predict\", \"forecast\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"foretell the future\", \"meaning\": \"tiên đoán tương lai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"foretell events\", \"meaning\": \"tiên đoán sự kiện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"foretelling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-cori-2a9da7c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru0-2a9da7c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru5-2a9da7c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru6-2a9da7c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru10-2a9da7c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru9-2a9da7c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru3-2a9da7c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru7-2a9da7c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru8-2a9da7c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foretell-aru2-2a9da7c7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/o