('44184fd1-570e-51fc-b637-e199218ed528', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'virtuous', '/ˈvɜːtʃuəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có đạo đức tốt, hành xử đúng đắn và có phẩm chất cao quý.', 'behaving in a very good, moral, and honest way.', 'She was praised for her virtuous character and honest behavior.', 'Cô ấy được khen ngợi vì tính cách đức hạnh và hành vi trung thực.', '{\"en\": \"The company aims to build a virtuous cycle of investment and sustainable growth.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đặt mục tiêu xây dựng một chu kỳ phát triển bền vững và đầu tư hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-ljspeech-10ab3671.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-cori-10ab3671.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/virtuous-15a8bf5d.webp', '[\"moral\", \"righteous\", \"ethical\"]', '[\"wicked\", \"vicious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"virtuous cycle\", \"meaning\": \"chu kỳ đạo đức/vòng tuần hoàn tốt đẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"virtuous life\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc sống đạo đức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"virtual\", \"note_vi\": \"virtual là ảo (thế giới ảo), virtuous là có đạo đức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"virtue\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"virtuously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-cori-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru0-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru5-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru6-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru10-10ab3671.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru9-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru3-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru7-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru8-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-aru2-10ab3671.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-ljspeech-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt408-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt138-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt624-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt396-10ab3671.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt498-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt132-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt288-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt42-10ab3671.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtuous-lt90-10ab3671.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'virtuous cycle\' (vòng tuần hoàn tốt đẹp) trái nghĩa với \'vicious cycle\' (vòng xoáy luẩn quẩn).', 'business', 1, 8),
('8f1e35d4-2322-567d-83c7-d528d68f3672', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'thicken', '/ˈθɪkən/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Trở nên đặc hơn hoặc làm cho cái gì đó đặc hơn.', 'to become denser or to make something denser.', 'You can add a little cornstarch to thicken the sauce.', 'Bạn có thể thêm một chút bột bắp để làm đặc nước sốt.', '{\"en\": \"The chef will thicken the soup by simmering it for ten minutes.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp sẽ làm đặc món súp bằng cách đun liu riu trong mười phút.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-ljspeech-7caa69a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-cori-7caa69a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thicken-e4c39435.webp', NULL, '[\"thin\", \"dilute\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thicken sauce\", \"meaning\": \"làm đặc nước xốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thicken mixture\", \"meaning\": \"làm đặc hỗn hợp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"threaten\", \"note_vi\": \"threaten là đe dọa, dễ nhầm chính tả với thicken\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"thick\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thickness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-cori-7caa69a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru0-7caa69a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru5-7caa69a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru6-7caa69a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru10-7caa69a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru9-7caa69a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru3-7caa69a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru7-7caa69a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru8-7caa69a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thicken-aru2-7caa69a5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stor