('ba5a8b89-c686-5e2a-abde-a0c1a3e14935', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'intolerant', '/ɪnˈtɒlərənt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không chấp nhận hoặc không tôn trọng sự khác biệt của người khác.', 'refusing to accept ideas, beliefs, or behaviors that are different from your own.', 'She was often criticized for being intolerant of opinions that differed from her own.', 'Cô ấy thường bị chỉ trích vì không dung thứ những ý kiến khác với mình.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager was completely intolerant of any delays in submitting the monthly financial reports.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý mới hoàn toàn không chấp nhận bất kỳ sự chậm trễ nào trong việc nộp báo cáo tài chính hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-ljspeech-a756131a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-cori-a756131a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intolerant-ee1fb78a.webp', '[\"narrow-minded\", \"prejudiced\", \"bigoted\"]', '[\"tolerant\", \"open-minded\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intolerant of\", \"meaning\": \"không khoan dung với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly intolerant\", \"meaning\": \"rất thiếu khoan dung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intolerable\", \"note_vi\": \"intolerable là không thể chịu đựng nổi (vật/việc), intolerant là không khoan dung (người).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intolerance\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tolerate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-cori-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru0-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru5-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru6-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru10-a756131a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru9-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru3-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru7-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru8-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-aru2-a756131a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-ljspeech-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt408-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt138-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt624-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt396-a756131a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt498-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt132-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt288-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt42-a756131a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intolerant-lt90-a756131a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với giới từ \'of\' (intolerant of something).', 'hr', 1, 20),
('19f43454-731a-5397-8d30-85f94390b713', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'anticipation', '/ænˌtɪsɪˈpeɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác mong chờ hoặc đoán trước điều gì sẽ xảy ra.', 'a feeling of excitement or expectation about something that is going to happen.', 'Employees waited with high anticipation for the announcement regarding annual bonuses.', 'Các nhân viên chờ đợi với sự háo hức lớn về thông báo liên quan đến tiền thưởng hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"There was great anticipation among staff ahead of the company\'s new product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên rất háo hức trước buổi ra mắt sản phẩm mới của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-ljspeech-047d3cbf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-cori-047d3cbf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anticipation-8e0f74a1.webp', '[\"expectation\", \"excitement\", \"eagerness\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"in anticipation of\", \"meaning\": \"để chuẩn bị trước cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sense of anticipation\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác mong chờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eager anticipation\", \"meaning\": \"sự mong chờ háo hức\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expectation\", \"note_vi\": \"expectation thiên về điều được dự đoán; anticipation nhấn mạnh cảm xúc mong chờ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"anticipate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"anticipated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-cori-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru0-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru5-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru6-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru10-047d3cbf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru9-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru3-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru7-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru8-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-aru2-047d3cbf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-ljspeech-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt408-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt138-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt624-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt396-047d3cbf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt498-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt132-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt288-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt42-047d3cbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anticipation-lt90-047d3cbf.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'in anticipation of\' rất hay xuất hiện trong văn bản thương mại TOEIC.', 'business', 1, 21),
('99e9f797-4de7-58ae-bf59-cafd5125fdf0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'cylindrical', '/səˈlɪndrɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng giống như một hình trụ.', 'having the shape of a straight tube with round ends of equal size.', 'The ancient tower had a distinctive cylindrical shape.', 'Tòa tháp cổ có hình dạng trụ tròn đặc trưng.', '{\"en\": \"The factory manufactures durable cylindrical metal containers for storing industrial chemicals safely.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy sản xuất các thùng kim loại hình trụ bền để chứa hóa chất công nghiệp an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-ljspeech-9bd277ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-cori-9bd277ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cylindrical-8bcbf9c0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cylindrical shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình dạng hình trụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cylindrical container\", \"meaning\": \"thùng chứa hình trụ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"circular\", \"note_vi\": \"circular là hình tròn phẳng 2D, cylindrical là hình trụ 3D\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cylinder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-cori-9bd277ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-aru0-9bd277ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-aru5-9bd277ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-aru6-9bd277ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-aru10-9bd277ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-aru9-9bd277ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-aru3-9bd277ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-aru7-9bd277ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cylindrical-aru8-9bd277ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec