('6c0318f1-10b2-51f3-a7dd-5b474da2c1da', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'waiver', 'UK: /ˈweɪvə/ | US: /ˈweɪvər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'giấy từ bỏ quyền, giấy miễn trừ', 'an official document that surrenders or gives up a legal right, claim, or requirement.', 'Visitors must sign a liability waiver before entering the facility.', 'Khách tham quan phải ký giấy miễn trừ trách nhiệm trước khi vào cơ sở.', '{\"en\": \"All participants must sign a liability waiver before taking part in the corporate outdoor adventure trip.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả người tham gia phải ký giấy miễn trừ trách nhiệm trước khi tham gia chuyến dã ngoại mạo hiểm của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-ljspeech-7fb32ad3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-cori-7fb32ad3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/waiver-0f83ce65.webp', '[\"disclaimer\", \"release\", \"renunciation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"liability waiver\", \"meaning\": \"giấy miễn trừ trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sign a waiver\", \"meaning\": \"ký giấy từ bỏ quyền/miễn trừ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"waive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-cori-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru0-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru5-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru6-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru10-7fb32ad3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru9-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru3-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru7-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru8-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-aru2-7fb32ad3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-ljspeech-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt408-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt138-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt624-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt396-7fb32ad3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt498-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt132-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt288-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt42-7fb32ad3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/waiver-lt90-7fb32ad3.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ rất phổ biến: \'liability waiver\' (giấy miễn trừ trách nhiệm pháp lý) hoặc \'fee waiver\' (văn bản miễn phí).', 'law', 1, 23),
('e1397a67-716e-5302-939a-b0975735c227', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'whack', '/wæk/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đánh mạnh, đập mạnh.', 'to hit something or someone very hard, often making a loud noise when doing so.', 'He gave the ball a good whack with the bat.', 'Anh ấy đã đánh mạnh quả bóng bằng gậy.', '{\"en\": \"He accidentally gave the printer a hard whack to fix the paper jam this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy vô tình đập mạnh vào máy in để sửa lỗi kẹt giấy sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-ljspeech-54c44266.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-cori-54c44266.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whack-f9d73ff0.webp', '[\"hit\", \"strike\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"whack someone\", \"meaning\": \"đánh ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whack something\", \"meaning\": \"đập cái gì đó\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"whack\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-cori-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru0-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru5-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru6-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru10-54c44266.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru9-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru3-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru7-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru8-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-aru2-54c44266.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-ljspeech-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt408-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt138-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt624-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt396-54c44266.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt498-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt132-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt288-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt42-54c44266.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whack-lt90-54c44266.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang tính suồng sã, không dùng trong văn bản trang trọng.', 'office', 1, 24)
