('e35e2b95-f98f-5acc-bbbd-d95d61dad0db', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'walkway', 'UK: /ˈwɔːkweɪ/ | US: /ˈwɔːkˌweɪ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'lối đi bộ', 'a designated path or passage created specifically for people to travel along on foot.', 'The park has a beautiful walkway for visitors to enjoy.', 'Công viên có một lối đi bộ đẹp để du khách thưởng thức.', '{\"en\": \"A covered walkway connects the main office building to the multi-story parking structure.\", \"vi\": \"Một lối đi bộ có mái che nối tòa nhà văn phòng chính với nhà xe nhiều tầng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-ljspeech-960630a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-cori-960630a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/walkway-bc93b9c0.webp', '[\"pathway\", \"footpath\", \"walk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"covered walkway\", \"meaning\": \"lối đi bộ có mái che\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pedestrian walkway\", \"meaning\": \"đường/lối đi dành cho người đi bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"highway\", \"note_vi\": \"Walkway là đường nhỏ dành cho người đi bộ, còn highway là xa lộ/đường cao tốc dành cho xe cơ giới.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-cori-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru0-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru5-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru6-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru10-960630a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru9-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru3-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru7-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru8-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-aru2-960630a5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-ljspeech-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt408-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt138-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt624-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt396-960630a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt498-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt132-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt288-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt42-960630a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/walkway-lt90-960630a5.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay gặp trong Part 1 Listening mô tả tranh: \'a covered walkway\' (lối đi bộ có mái che), \'pedestrian walkway\' (đường dành cho người đi bộ).', 'real estate', 1, 25),
('bb8d0804-424f-5ba7-9839-43c188fa41fe', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'conservative', 'UK: /kənˈsɜːvətɪv/ | US: /kənˈsɜrvətɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thận trọng, dè dặt', 'Expressing a cautious estimate or judgment that is likely to be lower than the actual amount.', 'The company made a conservative estimate for quarterly sales.', 'Công ty đưa ra một ước tính thận trọng cho doanh số hàng quý.', '{\"en\": \"According to a conservative estimate, project revenue will increase by at least five percent next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Theo một ước tính thận trọng, doanh thu dự án sẽ tăng ít nhất 5% trong quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-ljspeech-42dc7e4f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-cori-42dc7e4f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conservative-ee9fd483.webp', '[\"cautious\", \"moderate\", \"guarded\", \"prudent\"]', '[\"ambitious\", \"extravagant\", \"risky\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conservative estimate\", \"meaning\": \"ước tính thận trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conservative approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận thận trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conservation\", \"note_vi\": \"sự bảo tồn (môi trường/tài nguyên), khác với tính từ conservative (thận trọng)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"conservatively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conservatism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-cori-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru0-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru5-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru6-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru10-42dc7e4f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru9-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru3-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru7-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru8-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-aru2-42dc7e4f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-ljspeech-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt408-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt138-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt624-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt396-42dc7e4f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt498-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt132-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt288-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt42-42dc7e4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservative-lt90-42dc7e4f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh tài chính/TOEIC, thường đi với estimate (conservative estimate = con số ước tính thận trọng/dè dặt).', 'finance', 1, 26),
('41ac1d55-8b4e-553b-83df-d55aeb413549', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'clarification', '/ˌklærəfɪˈkeɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc lời giải thích giúp điều gì đó trở nên dễ hiểu hơn.', 'an act of making a statement or situation clearer and easier to understand for others.', 'We requested a clarification on the terms of the contract before signing it.', 'Chúng tôi yêu cầu làm rõ các điều khoản của hợp đồng trước khi ký.', '{\"en\": \"Please provide a written clarification regarding the new policy changes before the staff meeting starts.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng cung cấp văn bản làm rõ về những thay đổi chính sách mới trước khi cuộc họp nhân viên bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-ljspeech-f6a2729c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-cori-f6a2729c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clarification-cbd6404b.webp', '[\"explanation\", \"elucidation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"seek clarification\", \"meaning\": \"tìm kiếm sự làm rõ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide clarification\", \"meaning\": \"cung cấp sự làm rõ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"clarify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-cori-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru0-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru5-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru6-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru10-f6a2729c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru9-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru3-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru7-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru8-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-aru2-f6a2729c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-ljspeech-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt408-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt138-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt624-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt396-f6a2729c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt498-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt132-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt288-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt42-f6a2729c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clarification-lt90-f6a2729c.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng nhiều trong giao tiếp công sở khi cần xác nhận thông tin.', 'office', 1, 27),
('913fd6fd-8d8a-5955-a056-2bb0755f97d9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'pressure', '/ˈpreʃə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Áp lực, sức ép.', 'a continuous force or strong influence that makes someone feel stressed or worried.', 'Students often feel a lot of pressure to perform well in exams.', 'Học sinh thường cảm thấy rất nhiều áp lực phải làm tốt trong các kỳ thi.', '{\"en\": \"Employees work well under pressure to meet the tight deadline for the new project.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên làm việc tốt dưới áp lực để hoàn thành hạn chót gấp cho dự án mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-ljspeech-3b4c0c65.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-cori-3b4c0c65.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pressure-251dba18.webp', '[\"stress\", \"strain\", \"burden\"]', '[\"relief\", \"relaxation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work under pressure\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc dưới áp lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high pressure\", \"meaning\": \"áp lực cao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"press\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pressurized\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-cori-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru0-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru5-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru6-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru10-3b4c0c65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru9-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru3-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru7-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru8-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-aru2-3b4c0c65.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-ljspeech-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt408-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt138-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt624-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt396-3b4c0c65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt498-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt132-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt288-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt42-3b4c0c65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressure-lt90-3b4c0c65.mp3\"]}}', '\'Under pressure\' nghĩa là chịu áp lực, cụm từ rất hay gặp trong đề thi TOEIC.', 'hr', 1, 28),
('09128ec9-5a1b-573a-a8eb-8744681f1e60', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '26f30e50-2128-5b5e-b923-8277db713604', '9be4e31d-7ed7-54b2-a38c-c0262fdf8d7e', 'year-round', '/ˌjɪəˈraʊnd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Xảy ra hoặc kéo dài suốt cả năm.', 'happening, available, or continuing during all seasons of the year.', 'This resort offers year-round activities for guests, regardless of the season.', 'Khu nghỉ dưỡng này cung cấp các hoạt động quanh năm cho du khách, bất kể mùa nào.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers year-round outdoor activities for business travelers and tourists.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp các hoạt động ngoài trời quanh năm cho khách công tác và khách du lịch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-ljspeech-631664cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-cori-631664cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/year-round-c09a6027.webp', '[\"all-year\", \"continuous\", \"perennial\"]', '[\"seasonal\", \"temporary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"year-round service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ quanh năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"year-round employment\", \"meaning\": \"việc làm quanh năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"year-round destination\", \"meaning\": \"điểm đến quanh năm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"yearly\", \"note_vi\": \"yearly là xảy ra mỗi năm một lần, year-round là kéo dài suốt cả năm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"year-round\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-cori-631664cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-aru0-631664cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-aru5-631664cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-aru6-631664cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-aru10-631664cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-aru9-631664cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/year-round-aru3-6