('35c4bb0b-3a49-595f-b9ad-85fbbce64c9c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28a9fba9-3bc8-5d68-a3a5-c5d488d18c97', '2d26b9d8-2dbf-5453-bbd2-59178d6ece60', 'wander', '/ˈwɒndə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đi bộ mà không có mục đích hay phương hướng cụ thể.', 'to walk slowly around an area without having a clear direction or purpose.', 'After dinner, we decided to wander through the park for a bit.', 'Sau bữa tối, chúng tôi quyết định đi dạo quanh công viên một lúc.', '{\"en\": \"Clients often wander through the showroom to look at the new furniture collection.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng thường đi dạo quanh phòng trưng bày để xem bộ sưu tập nội thất mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-ljspeech-325d4882.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-cori-325d4882.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wander-310d73c0.webp', '[\"stroll\", \"roam\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wander around\", \"meaning\": \"đi lang thang quanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wander off\", \"meaning\": \"đi lạc khỏi nhóm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wonder\", \"note_vi\": \"wonder là tự hỏi/ngạc nhiên, wander là đi lang thang.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wanderer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-cori-325d4882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru0-325d4882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru5-325d4882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru6-325d4882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru10-325d4882.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru9-325d4882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru3-325d4882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru7-325d4882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru8-325d4882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wander-aru2-325d4882.mp3\"