('e26c463c-8d71-5200-80fa-e264dcbbad83', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28a9fba9-3bc8-5d68-a3a5-c5d488d18c97', '2d26b9d8-2dbf-5453-bbd2-59178d6ece60', 'bossy', '/ˈbɒsi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'hay ra lệnh, độc đoán, thích chỉ huy người khác.', 'always telling other people what to do in an annoying way.', 'My younger sister can be quite bossy when she plays with her friends.', 'Em gái tôi có thể khá độc đoán khi chơi với bạn bè.', '{\"en\": \"The new supervisor is quite bossy, which makes the team members feel uncomfortable.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát mới khá thích ra lệnh, điều này khiến các thành viên trong nhóm cảm thấy khó chịu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-ljspeech-801ed8fc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-cori-801ed8fc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bossy-792ab492.webp', '[\"domineering\", \"authoritative\", \"overbearing\"]', '[\"submissive\", \"humble\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bossy attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ hách dịch, hay ra lệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bossy behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi thích chỉ huy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"boss\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bossiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-cori-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru0-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru5-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru6-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru10-801ed8fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru9-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru3-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru7-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru8-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-aru2-801ed8fc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-ljspeech-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt408-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt138-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt624-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt396-801ed8fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt498-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt132-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt288-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt42-801ed8fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bossy-lt90-801ed8fc.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái tiêu cực, chỉ người thích làm \'sếp\' và ra lệnh cho người khác một cách khó chịu.', 'hr', 1, 16),
('9d026c7e-a105-54b9-9cf1-f836ca737a7f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28a9fba9-3bc8-5d68-a3a5-c5d488d18c97', '2d26b9d8-2dbf-5453-bbd2-59178d6ece60', 'learned', '/ˈlɜːnɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có kiến thức sâu rộng, uyên bác.', 'having or showing a lot of knowledge gained from study and reading.', 'The professor was a highly learned man, respected by all his colleagues.', 'Vị giáo sư là một người đàn ông rất uyên bác, được tất cả đồng nghiệp kính trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Our legal advisor gave a learned speech on international trade regulations during the seminar.\", \"vi\": \"Cố vấn pháp lý của chúng tôi đã phát biểu một bài uyên bác về quy định thương mại quốc tế trong buổi thảo luận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-ljspeech-de31af58.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-cori-de31af58.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/learned-67cf1748.webp', '[\"scholarly\", \"knowledgeable\"]', '[\"ignorant\", \"uneducated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"learned professor\", \"meaning\": \"giáo sư uyên bác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"learned journal\", \"meaning\": \"tạp chí học thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"learned\", \"note_vi\": \"tính từ phát âm là /ˈlɜː.nɪd/, động từ quá khứ phát âm là /lɜːnd/\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"learn\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"learning\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-cori-de31af58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-aru0-de31af58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-aru5-de31af58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-aru6-de31af58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-aru10-de31af58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-aru9-de31af58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-aru3-de31af58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/learned-aru