('5be7dd6a-b065-521d-9fff-c45dc566a548', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28bfcc3c-95c8-5db0-b8ba-02832c898879', '464920b0-65c2-5803-96bb-c980c64d1a84', 'deter', '/dɪˈtɜː(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Ngăn cản hoặc làm nản lòng ai đó không làm điều gì.', 'to discourage or prevent someone from doing something by making them fear the consequences.', 'Strict legal penalties are designed to deter individuals from committing financial crimes.', 'Các hình phạt pháp lý nghiêm khắc được thiết kế nhằm ngăn chặn các cá nhân thực hiện hành vi phạm tội tài chính.', '{\"en\": \"The company installed security cameras to deter potential shoplifters from stealing merchandise.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã lắp đặt camera an ninh để ngăn chặn những kẻ có ý định trộm cắp hàng hóa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-ljspeech-9ff612bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-cori-9ff612bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deter-e1497525.webp', '[\"discourage\", \"prevent\", \"hinder\"]', '[\"encourage\", \"promote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deter someone from doing something\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn cản ai làm việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deterrent effect\", \"meaning\": \"tác dụng răn đe\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"defer\", \"note_vi\": \"defer là trì hoãn, còn deter là ngăn cản/răn đe.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"deterrent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"deterrent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-cori-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru0-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru5-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru6-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru10-9ff612bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru9-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru3-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru7-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru8-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-aru2-9ff612bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-ljspeech-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt408-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt138-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt624-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt396-9ff612bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt498-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt132-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt288-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt42-9ff612bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deter-lt90-9ff612bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cấu trúc \'deter someone from doing something\'.', 'business', 1, 13),
('0925d241-754c-5d5d-a1a1-f222c09b9c2b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28bfcc3c-95c8-5db0-b8ba-02832c898879', '464920b0-65c2-5803-96bb-c980c64d1a84', 'distinctive', '/dɪˈstɪŋktɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có những đặc điểm riêng biệt, dễ nhận biết.', 'having a special quality or character that makes something easy to recognize.', 'The artist developed a distinctive style that was easily recognizable.', 'Người nghệ sĩ đã phát triển một phong cách đặc trưng dễ dàng nhận ra.', '{\"en\": \"The new brand logo has a distinctive design that attracts many young customers.\", \"vi\": \"Logo thương hiệu mới có thiết kế đặc biệt thu hút nhiều khách hàng trẻ tuổi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinctive-ljspeech-0c95a462.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinctive-cori-0c95a462.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/distinctive-5d0d84fb.webp', '[\"characteristic\", \"unique\", \"distinguishing\"]', '[\"common\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"distinctive feature\", \"meaning\": \"đặc điểm nổi bật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"distinctive smell\", \"meaning\": \"mùi đặc trưng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"distinct\", \"note_vi\": \"distinct là rõ ràng, riêng biệt; distinctive là mang tính đặc trưng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"distinction\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"distinguish\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"distinctively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinctive-cori-0c95a462.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinctive-aru0-0c95a462.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinctive-aru5-0c95a462.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinctive-aru6-0c95a462.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinctive-aru10-0c95a462.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distinctive-aru9-0c95a462.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disti