('bf3ef3dc-6a20-5e38-a711-43f6da9f47bc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28bfcc3c-95c8-5db0-b8ba-02832c898879', '464920b0-65c2-5803-96bb-c980c64d1a84', 'seduce', '/sɪˈdjuːs/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Dụ dỗ, lôi kéo ai đó làm điều gì đó sai trái hoặc không khôn ngoan.', 'to persuade someone to do something that they should not do.', 'The tempting offer could easily seduce someone into making a bad decision.', 'Lời đề nghị hấp dẫn có thể dễ dàng dụ dỗ ai đó đưa ra quyết định sai lầm.', '{\"en\": \"The competitor tried to seduce our best employees with higher salaries and better benefits.\", \"vi\": \"Đối thủ cạnh tranh đã cố gắng lôi kéo những nhân viên giỏi nhất của chúng ta bằng mức lương cao hơn và phúc lợi tốt hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-ljspeech-08b413af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-cori-08b413af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seduce-fc7227ea.webp', '[\"tempt\", \"lure\"]', '[\"dissuade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"seduce into\", \"meaning\": \"dụ dỗ làm gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"seduction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-cori-08b413af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru0-08b413af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru5-08b413af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru6-08b413af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru10-08b413af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru9-08b413af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru3-08b413af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru7-08b413af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru8-08b413af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-aru2-08b413af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seduce-ljspeech-0