('408154ba-ee36-5c98-aae7-867f52f685a6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28bfcc3c-95c8-5db0-b8ba-02832c898879', '464920b0-65c2-5803-96bb-c980c64d1a84', 'heritage', '/ˈherɪtɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Di sản văn hóa, lịch sử hoặc thiên nhiên được truyền lại từ thế hệ trước.', 'the traditions, buildings, or objects that have been passed down from previous generations to today.', 'The city takes great pride in preserving its rich cultural heritage.', 'Thành phố rất tự hào trong việc bảo tồn di sản văn hóa phong phú của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to renovate the old office building to preserve its architectural heritage.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty quyết định cải tạo tòa nhà văn phòng cũ để bảo tồn di sản kiến trúc của nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-ljspeech-f19976f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-cori-f19976f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heritage-643ce209.webp', '[\"tradition\", \"legacy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cultural heritage\", \"meaning\": \"di sản văn hóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"world heritage\", \"meaning\": \"di sản thế giới\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"inherit\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inheritance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-cori-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru0-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru5-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru6-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru10-f19976f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru9-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru3-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru7-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru8-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-aru2-f19976f4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-ljspeech-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt408-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt138-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt624-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt396-f19976f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt498-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt132-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt288-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt42-f19976f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heritage-lt90-f19976f4.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh bảo tồn hoặc lịch sử.', 'academic', 1, 25),
('f5afe23a-692a-555c-b622-11ca02183f25', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28bfcc3c-95c8-5db0-b8ba-02832c898879', '464920b0-65c2-5803-96bb-c980c64d1a84', 'electrical engineering', '/ɪˈlɛktrɪkəl ˌɛndʒɪˈnɪərɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Ngành kỹ thuật nghiên cứu, thiết kế và ứng dụng điện, điện tử.', 'the study and use of power and electronic systems in industry.', 'My cousin is studying electrical engineering at university, hoping to work with renewable energy.', 'Anh họ tôi đang học kỹ thuật điện ở trường đại học, hy vọng sẽ làm việc với năng lượng tái tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a graduate in electrical engineering to improve the factory systems.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một cử nhân ngành kỹ thuật điện để cải thiện hệ thống nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-ljspeech-ae41f8d9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-cori-ae41f8d9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/electrical-engineering-4c2d3c91.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"study electrical engineering\", \"meaning\": \"học ngành kỹ thuật điện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"electrical engineering degree\", \"meaning\": \"bằng kỹ thuật điện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"department of electrical engineering\", \"meaning\": \"khoa kỹ thuật điện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"electronic engineering\", \"note_vi\": \"electronic thiên về thiết bị số, electrical về điện nói chung\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"electrical\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"engineer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-cori-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru0-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru5-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru6-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru10-ae41f8d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru9-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru3-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru7-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru8-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-aru2-ae41f8d9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-ljspeech-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt408-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt138-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt624-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt396-ae41f8d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt498-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt132-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt288-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt42-ae41f8d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/electrical-engineering-lt90-ae41f8d9.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ electrical là về điện, electronic là về thiết bị điện tử.', 'technology', 1, 26),
('12dd78ea-0f16-5f75-ac92-29afcd37287f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28bfcc3c-95c8-5db0-b8ba-02832c898879', '464920b0-65c2-5803-96bb-c980c64d1a84', 'secularism', '/ˈsekjələrɪzəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Chủ nghĩa tách rời tôn giáo khỏi chính trị và giáo dục.', 'the belief that religion should not be involved in organization of society.', 'Many modern states embrace secularism to ensure religious freedom for all citizens.', 'Nhiều quốc gia hiện đại chấp nhận chủ nghĩa thế tục để đảm bảo tự do tín ngưỡng cho mọi công dân.', '{\"en\": \"The university promotes secularism to ensure that students of all faiths feel welcome.\", \"vi\": \"Trường đại học thúc đẩy sự tách biệt tôn giáo để đảm bảo sinh viên thuộc mọi đức tin đều cảm thấy được chào đón.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-ljspeech-9d6b674e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-cori-9d6b674e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/secularism-c264f9e5.webp', NULL, '[\"theocracy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"promote secularism\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy sự tách biệt tôn giáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"principles of secularism\", \"meaning\": \"các nguyên tắc thế tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sectarianism\", \"note_vi\": \"Khác nhau: secularism là thế tục hóa, sectarianism là chủ nghĩa bè phái tôn giáo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"secular\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"secularize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-cori-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru0-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru5-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru6-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru10-9d6b674e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru9-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru3-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru7-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru8-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-aru2-9d6b674e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-ljspeech-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt408-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt138-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt624-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt396-9d6b674e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt498-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt132-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt288-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt42-9d6b674e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/secularism-lt90-9d6b674e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này ít gặp trong TOEIC nhưng rất phổ biến trong IELTS Academic.', 'academic', 1, 27),
('0e108759-2931-5abb-a3e6-58675a5e820f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28bfcc3c-95c8-5db0-b8ba-02832c898879', '464920b0-65c2-5803-96bb-c980c64d1a84', 'nudge', '/nʌdʒ/', 'C2', 'verb', 'đẩy nhẹ bằng khuỷu tay để thu hút sự chú ý.', 'to push someone gently, especially with your elbow, to attract their attention.', 'She gave him a gentle nudge to remind him it was his turn to speak.', 'Cô ấy khẽ thúc anh ấy để nhắc anh ấy đến lượt nói.', '{\"en\": \"During the presentation, she had to nudge her colleague to start speaking.\", \"vi\": \"Trong suốt buổi thuyết trình, cô ấy phải huých nhẹ đồng nghiệp để bắt đầu nói.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-ljspeech-37e4ac97.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-cori-37e4ac97.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nudge-cf332b7d.webp', '[\"poke\", \"elbow\", \"shove\"]', '[\"pull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"nudge someone gently\", \"meaning\": \"huých nhẹ ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nudge someone to do something\", \"meaning\": \"thúc giục ai đó làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"budge\", \"note_vi\": \"nhúc nhích, di chuyển nhẹ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nudge\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-cori-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru0-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru5-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru6-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru10-37e4ac97.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru9-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru3-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru7-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru8-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-aru2-37e4ac97.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-ljspeech-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt408-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt138-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt624-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt396-37e4ac97.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt498-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt132-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt288-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt42-37e4ac97.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nudge-lt90-37e4ac97.mp3\"]}}', 'Nudge là huých nhẹ bằng khuỷu tay, nghĩa bóng là nhắc nhở nhẹ nhàng.', 'office', 1, 28),
('a43114a2-753d-51a3-8c4a-81516d4b8f25', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '28bfcc3c-95c8-5db0-b8ba-02832c898879', '464920b0-65c2-5803-96bb-c980c64d1a84', 'hornet', '/ˈhɔːnɪt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một loại ong lớn, hung dữ, có thể đốt rất đau.', 'a large stinging insect that belongs to the wasp family.', 'Be careful when walking near that tree; there\'s a hornet\'s nest in one of its branches.', 'Hãy cẩn thận khi đi gần cái cây đó; có một tổ ong bắp cày trên một trong những cành cây.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance worker called exterminators after discovering a hornet nest behind the office.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã gọi thợ diệt côn trùng sau khi phát hiện một tổ ong bắp cày phía sau văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-ljspeech-06c25908.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-cori-06c25908.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hornet-553bfe50.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hornet nest\", \"meaning\": \"tổ ong bắp cày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wasp\", \"note_vi\": \"Wasp là ong vò vẽ nói chung, hornet là loại ong bắp cày to và hung dữ hơn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-cori-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru0-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru5-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru6-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru10-06c25908.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru9-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru3-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru7-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru8-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-aru2-06c25908.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-ljspeech-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt408-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt138-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt624-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt396-06c25908.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt498-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt132-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt288-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt42-06c25908.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hornet-lt90-06c25908.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ \'stir up a hornet\'s nest\' rất hay gặp, nghĩa là gây ra phản ứng gay gắt.', 'nature', 1, 29),
('ac8f809c-1cd7-52fb-9a8b-42f206da9f93', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'pray', '/preɪ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Cầu xin hoặc nói chuyện với Chúa hoặc một vị thần.', 'to speak to a god or spirit to express thanks or ask for help.', 'Villagers gather at the local church every Sunday to pray for a good harvest.', 'Dân làng tập hợp tại nhà thờ địa phương mỗi Chủ Nhật để cầu nguyện cho một vụ mùa bội thu.', '{\"en\": \"Employees often pray for success before launching a major new marketing campaign for the company.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên thường cầu nguyện cho sự thành công trước khi tung ra một chiến dịch tiếp thị lớn mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-ljspeech-77973d44.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-cori-77973d44.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pray-58b48e8f.webp', '[\"worship\", \"implore\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pray for\", \"meaning\": \"cầu nguyện cho\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prey\", \"note_vi\": \"Đồng âm nhưng nghĩa là con mồi hoặc săn mồi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prayer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-cori-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru0-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru5-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru6-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru10-77973d44.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru9-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru3-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru7-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru8-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-aru2-77973d44.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-ljspeech-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt408-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt138-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt624-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt396-77973d44.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt498-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt132-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt288-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt42-77973d44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pray-lt90-77973d44.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với \'prey\' (con mồi).', 'other', 1, 0),
('5b191cab-177c-5c49-86a1-5d34d36e9058', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'etiquette', '/ˈetɪkət/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Các quy tắc ứng xử lịch sự trong xã hội hoặc một tình huống cụ thể.', 'the set of rules for polite behavior in society or in a specific professional environment.', 'Proper email etiquette ensures professional communication between team members and clients.', 'Quy tắc ứng xử qua email đúng chuẩn đảm bảo sự giao tiếp chuyên nghiệp giữa các thành viên trong đội và khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Following proper business etiquette is essential when meeting with international clients for the first time.\", \"vi\": \"Tuân thủ quy tắc ứng xử kinh doanh đúng mực là điều cần thiết khi gặp gỡ khách hàng quốc tế lần đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-ljspeech-e04b8a19.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-cori-e04b8a19.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/etiquette-8a9d2bca.webp', '[\"manners\", \"protocol\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business etiquette\", \"meaning\": \"phép lịch sự trong kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"table etiquette\", \"meaning\": \"phép lịch sự trên bàn ăn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-cori-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru0-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru5-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru6-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru10-e04b8a19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru9-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru3-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru7-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru8-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-aru2-e04b8a19.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-ljspeech-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt408-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt138-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt624-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt396-e04b8a19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt498-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt132-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt288-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt42-e04b8a19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/etiquette-lt90-e04b8a19.mp3\"]}}', 'Đọc là /et-i-ket/, âm cuối không phát âm là \'t\'.', 'business', 1, 1),
('e73055e4-9de6-5aef-9195-d667f56ea683', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'slip away', '/slɪp əˈweɪ/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Rời đi một cách kín đáo, không gây chú ý.', 'to leave a place quietly and secretly so that other people do not notice you are going.', 'I tried to slip away from the party unnoticed, but my friend saw me.', 'Tôi cố gắng lặng lẽ rời khỏi bữa tiệc mà không bị chú ý, nhưng bạn tôi đã thấy tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The executive managed to slip away from the gala dinner to attend an urgent conference call.\", \"vi\": \"Vị giám đốc đã lẻn ra khỏi bữa tiệc tối để tham gia một cuộc gọi hội nghị khẩn cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-ljspeech-5a592571.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-cori-5a592571.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slip-away-ba2546f5.webp', '[\"sneak out\", \"depart\"]', '[\"arrive\", \"stay\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"slip away unnoticed\", \"meaning\": \"lẻn đi không ai hay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slip away from\", \"meaning\": \"rời khỏi đâu đó một cách kín đáo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-cori-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru0-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru5-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru6-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru10-5a592571.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru9-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru3-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru7-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru8-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-aru2-5a592571.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-ljspeech-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt408-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt138-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt624-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt396-5a592571.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt498-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt132-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt288-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt42-5a592571.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slip-away-lt90-5a592571.mp3\"]}}', 'dùng khi muốn rời đi mà không muốn gây sự chú ý.', 'office', 1, 2),
('5ef77d86-76e2-590c-870e-6ad3bf44a5af', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'outcome', '/ˈaʊtkʌm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Kết quả cuối cùng của một sự kiện, quá trình.', 'the final result or effect of a process, event, or situation.', 'The outcome of the negotiations is still uncertain.', 'Kết quả của cuộc đàm phán vẫn còn chưa chắc chắn.', '{\"en\": \"The positive outcome of the merger talks encouraged both companies to sign the agreement.\", \"vi\": \"Kết quả tích cực của các cuộc đàm phán sáp nhập đã khuyến khích cả hai công ty ký kết thỏa thuận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-ljspeech-dfcb43ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-cori-dfcb43ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outcome-43493c1e.webp', '[\"result\", \"consequence\", \"conclusion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"positive outcome\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả tích cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outcome of negotiations\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả đàm phán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"desired outcome\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả mong muốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"output\", \"note_vi\": \"output là sản lượng/đầu ra cụ thể; outcome là kết quả tổng thể của một quá trình\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-cori-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru0-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru5-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru6-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru10-dfcb43ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru9-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru3-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru7-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru8-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-aru2-dfcb43ff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-ljspeech-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt408-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt138-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt624-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt396-dfcb43ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt498-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt132-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt288-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt42-dfcb43ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcome-lt90-dfcb43ff.mp3\"]}}', '\'Outcome\' nhấn mạnh kết quả cuối cùng sau một quá trình; khác \'result\' thường dùng cho số liệu cụ thể.', 'business', 1, 3),
('a1253657-75d5-5657-b240-a82a8b270895', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'accordingly', 'UK: /əˈkɔːdɪŋli/ | US: /əˈkɔːrdɪŋli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'tương ứng, phù hợp', 'in a manner that is appropriate or suitable to the given circumstances.', 'Please submit your request, and we will act accordingly.', 'Vui lòng gửi yêu cầu của bạn, và chúng tôi sẽ hành động phù hợp.', '{\"en\": \"Budget allocations have been reduced, so all project leads must adjust their spending plans accordingly.\", \"vi\": \"Phân bổ ngân sách đã bị cắt giảm, vì vậy tất cả các trưởng nhóm dự án phải điều chỉnh kế hoạch chi tiêu sao cho phù hợp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-ljspeech-e5fc8009.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-cori-e5fc8009.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accordingly-ec4bffa1.webp', '[\"consequently\", \"appropriately\", \"suitably\", \"therefore\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"act accordingly\", \"meaning\": \"hành động tương ứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adjust accordingly\", \"meaning\": \"điều chỉnh cho phù hợp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"preposition\", \"word\": \"according to\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-cori-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru0-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru5-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru6-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru10-e5fc8009.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru9-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru3-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru7-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru8-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-aru2-e5fc8009.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-ljspeech-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt408-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt138-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt624-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt396-e5fc8009.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt498-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt132-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt288-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt42-e5fc8009.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accordingly-lt90-e5fc8009.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng cuối câu hoặc đứng sau dấu phẩy trong văn phong hợp đồng/chỉ thị: \'Please review the guidelines and act accordingly.\'', 'management', 1, 4),
('ee329ae6-bf80-5c4d-b06a-394016a678cb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'dedication', 'UK: /ˌdɛdɪˈkeɪʃən/ | US: /ˌdɛdɪˈkeɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự cống hiến, tận tâm', 'The willing commitment of energy and time to a particular task or purpose.', 'Her dedication to the project ensured its success.', 'Sự cống hiến của cô ấy cho dự án đã đảm bảo thành công của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The Board of Directors recognized Mr. Park for his years of dedication to the company\'s research team.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã ghi nhận ông Park vì nhiều năm cống hiến cho đội ngũ nghiên cứu của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-ljspeech-773a44d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-cori-773a44d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dedication-dc85ab6b.webp', '[\"commitment\", \"devotion\", \"allegiance\"]', '[\"apathy\", \"indifference\", \"negligence\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"show dedication\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự tận tụy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dedication to work\", \"meaning\": \"sự tận tụy với công việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dedicate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dedicated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-cori-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru0-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru5-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru6-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru10-773a44d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru9-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru3-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru7-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru8-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-aru2-773a44d3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-ljspeech-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt408-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt138-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt624-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt396-773a44d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt498-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt132-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt288-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt42-773a44d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dedication-lt90-773a44d3.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ đi với giới từ \'to\' (dedication to something). Thường khen ngợi nhân viên trong thư cảm ơn hoặc buổi trao giải.', 'human resources', 1, 5),
('4e1b1c72-0cfd-5aaf-9a3d-20878fe637f1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'Ethernet', '/ˈiːθənet/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một công nghệ mạng máy tính phổ biến dùng để kết nối các thiết bị trong mạng cục bộ (LAN).', 'a system for connecting computers together in a local network to share information.', 'You can connect your computer to the internet using an Ethernet cable for a stable connection.', 'Bạn có thể kết nối máy tính của mình với internet bằng cáp Ethernet để có kết nối ổn định.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure that your office computer is connected to the Ethernet port for faster internet.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo rằng máy tính văn phòng của bạn được kết nối với cổng Ethernet để có internet nhanh hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-ljspeech-991755b7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-cori-991755b7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ethernet-83f9b87b.webp', '[\"network connection\", \"LAN\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"Ethernet cable\", \"meaning\": \"cáp mạng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"Ethernet port\", \"meaning\": \"cổng mạng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-cori-991755b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-aru0-991755b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-aru5-991755b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-aru6-991755b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-aru10-991755b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-aru9-991755b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-aru3-991755b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-aru7-991755b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ethernet-aru8-991755b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/