('709dc91a-77b2-5e28-b646-20e2bb168faa', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'charter', '/ˈtʃɑːtə(r)/', '', 'noun', 'Một văn bản chính thức quy định quyền lợi, nguyên tắc hoặc mục đích.', 'a formal document that states the rights, aims, and principles of an organization.', 'The company\'s charter outlines its mission and how it will operate.', 'Điều lệ của công ty phác thảo sứ mệnh và cách thức hoạt động của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors reviewed the company charter to ensure all new policies remain compliant.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã xem xét điều lệ công ty để đảm bảo mọi chính sách mới vẫn tuân thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-ljspeech-ca3979a3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-cori-ca3979a3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/charter-9c6fd8c3.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-cori-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru0-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru5-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru6-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru10-ca3979a3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru9-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru3-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru7-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru8-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-aru2-ca3979a3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-ljspeech-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charter-lt408-ca3979a3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/