('d55c26c3-885f-51e8-8211-cd3656573d7d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '293c44bc-498c-5096-ae77-f8917c062c2c', '8b4e999a-a9d4-5468-bbaf-c3e6793f7c26', 'mitosis', '/maɪˈtəʊsɪs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Quá trình phân chia tế bào tạo ra hai tế bào con giống hệt tế bào mẹ.', 'a process of cell division that results in two identical daughter cells.', 'Mitosis is a fundamental process for growth and repair in living organisms.', 'Nguyên phân là một quá trình cơ bản cho sự phát triển và sửa chữa ở các sinh vật sống.', '{\"en\": \"The medical lab technician carefully observed cell division through mitosis under the microscope.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên phòng thí nghiệm y khoa cẩn thận quan sát sự phân chia tế bào qua quá trình nguyên phân dưới kính hiển vi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-ljspeech-4d7fb425.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-cori-4d7fb425.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mitosis-d8cddf2b.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"process of mitosis\", \"meaning\": \"quá trình nguyên phân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"meiosis\", \"note_vi\": \"Meiosis là quá trình giảm phân tạo ra tế bào giao tử.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"mitotic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-cori-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru0-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru5-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru6-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru10-4d7fb425.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru9-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru3-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru7-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru8-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-aru2-4d7fb425.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-ljspeech-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt408-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt138-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt624-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt396-4d7fb425.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt498-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt132-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt288-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt42-4d7fb425.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mitosis-lt90-4d7fb425.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ sinh học chỉ sự nguyên phân (phân chia tế bào).', 'academic', 1, 29),
('d8ae00ad-ff24-5fbd-8cef-fd2397b87b88', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '299e8bf0-69ec-55f6-a76b-7542b90dceb0', '40578878-d4c1-5d9c-b2cf-cb8ca32f8eba', 'conceivable', '/kənˈsiːvəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có thể tưởng tượng được, có thể xảy ra.', 'able to be believed or imagined as a possible situation or outcome in the future.', 'It\'s conceivable that we might finish the project ahead of schedule.', 'Có thể hình dung được rằng chúng ta có thể hoàn thành dự án trước thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"It is entirely conceivable that the merger will lead to a significant increase in profits.\", \"vi\": \"Việc sáp nhập dẫn đến sự gia tăng lợi nhuận đáng kể là điều hoàn toàn có thể xảy ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-ljspeech-81c5841a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-cori-81c5841a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conceivable-1b2c09d1.webp', '[\"imaginable\", \"plausible\"]', '[\"unthinkable\", \"impossible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"perfectly conceivable\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn có thể tưởng tượng được\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hardly conceivable\", \"meaning\": \"khó mà tin được\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conceive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-cori-81c5841a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-aru0-81c5841a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-aru5-81c5841a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-aru6-81c5841a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-aru10-81c5841a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-aru9-81c5841a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-aru3-81c5841a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-aru7-81c5841a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conceivable-aru8-81c5841a.mp3\"