('fcd747be-9427-5718-b3b2-1940a50ebb28', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '299e8bf0-69ec-55f6-a76b-7542b90dceb0', '40578878-d4c1-5d9c-b2cf-cb8ca32f8eba', 'fuzzy', '/ˈfʌzi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không rõ ràng, lờ mờ hoặc có lông tơ mềm.', 'not clear or sharp, often making it difficult to see or understand the details properly.', 'The old photograph was a bit fuzzy, making it hard to see the faces clearly.', 'Bức ảnh cũ hơi mờ, khiến khó nhìn rõ các khuôn mặt.', '{\"en\": \"The printed document was too fuzzy to read, so I requested a new copy immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Tài liệu được in quá mờ không thể đọc được, vì vậy tôi đã yêu cầu một bản sao mới ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-ljspeech-6d3b96d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-cori-6d3b96d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fuzzy-ec88db70.webp', '[\"blurry\", \"unclear\"]', '[\"clear\", \"sharp\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fuzzy image\", \"meaning\": \"hình ảnh mờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fuzzy logic\", \"meaning\": \"logic mờ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fuzz\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-cori-6d3b96d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru0-6d3b96d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru5-6d3b96d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru6-6d3b96d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru10-6d3b96d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru9-6d3b96d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru3-6d3b96d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru7-6d3b96d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru8-6d3b96d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-aru2-6d3b96d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fuzzy-ljspeech-6d