('9967e58d-a606-5a11-b57f-4dd9bf4c62fc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '299e8bf0-69ec-55f6-a76b-7542b90dceb0', '40578878-d4c1-5d9c-b2cf-cb8ca32f8eba', 'look up to', '/lʊk ʌp tə/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Tôn trọng và ngưỡng mộ ai đó vì phẩm chất hoặc thành tựu của họ.', 'to admire and respect someone because of their qualities or their achievements.', 'New staff members often look up to senior managers for guidance and inspiration.', 'Nhân viên mới thường ngưỡng mộ các quản lý cấp cao để nhận sự hướng dẫn và nguồn cảm hứng.', '{\"en\": \"Junior employees often look up to the senior manager for her leadership and experience.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cấp dưới thường ngưỡng mộ người quản lý cấp cao vì khả năng lãnh đạo và kinh nghiệm của cô ấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-ljspeech-9c96eb55.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-cori-9c96eb55.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/look-up-to-f1b9aa2e.webp', '[\"admire\", \"respect\"]', '[\"look down on\", \"despise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look up to someone\", \"meaning\": \"ngưỡng mộ ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look up to a leader\", \"meaning\": \"ngưỡng mộ một nhà lãnh đạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"look down on\", \"note_vi\": \"Trái nghĩa hoàn toàn với look up to.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-cori-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru0-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru5-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru6-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru10-9c96eb55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru9-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru3-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru7-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru8-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-aru2-9c96eb55.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-ljspeech-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt408-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt138-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt624-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt396-9c96eb55.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt498-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt132-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt288-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt42-9c96eb55.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-up-to-lt90-9c96eb55.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với \'look down on\' (coi thường).', 'office', 1, 25),
('8e9a47b7-300f-5f0c-a32e-782e0052e580', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '299e8bf0-69ec-55f6-a76b-7542b90dceb0', '40578878-d4c1-5d9c-b2cf-cb8ca32f8eba', 'fourteen', '/ˌfɔːˈtiːn/', 'A1', 'determiner', 'Số đếm sau mười ba, viết là 14.', 'the cardinal number that comes immediately after thirteen and before fifteen in counting.', 'My little brother will be fourteen next month.', 'Em trai tôi sẽ mười bốn tuổi vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The department head requested fourteen new laptops for the incoming group of summer interns.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng bộ phận đã yêu cầu mười bốn chiếc máy tính xách tay mới cho nhóm thực tập sinh mùa hè mới vào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-ljspeech-8a13a01d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-cori-8a13a01d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fourteen-96275279.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fourteen days\", \"meaning\": \"mười bốn ngày (hai tuần)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fourteen percent\", \"meaning\": \"mười bốn phần trăm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"forty\", \"note_vi\": \"fourteen là 14 (nhấn âm 2), forty là 40 (nhấn âm 1).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fourteenth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-cori-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru0-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru5-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru6-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru10-8a13a01d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru9-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru3-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru7-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourteen-aru8-8a13a01d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fourte