('4615b953-4abe-5e0d-9182-e540be75e66a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'insolvency', '/ɪnˈsɒlvənsi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng vỡ nợ, không có khả năng thanh toán.', 'the state of being unable to pay debts owed.', 'Heavy debts eventually forced the local retail chain into insolvency.', 'Những khoản nợ lớn cuối cùng đã buộc chuỗi bán lẻ địa phương rơi vào tình trạng vỡ nợ.', '{\"en\": \"The bank reviewed the small firm\'s insolvency risk before approving the loan.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân hàng đánh giá rủi ro vỡ nợ của công ty nhỏ trước khi duyệt khoản vay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-ljspeech-698f2e3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-cori-698f2e3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/insolvency-fe2e2393.webp', NULL, '[\"solvency\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"declared insolvency\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố vỡ nợ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"insolvency proceedings\", \"meaning\": \"thủ tục phá sản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"solvency\", \"note_vi\": \"solvency là khả năng trả nợ, trái nghĩa insolvency\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"insolvent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-cori-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru0-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru5-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru6-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru10-698f2e3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru9-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru3-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru7-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru8-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-aru2-698f2e3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-ljspeech-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt408-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt138-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt624-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt396-698f2e3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt498-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt132-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt288-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt42-698f2e3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolvency-lt90-698f2e3a.mp3\"]}}', 'Insolvency là danh từ chỉ vỡ nợ, khác với bankrupt (phá sản).', 'finance', 1, 0),
('9cb4ae2c-93a4-57f5-860f-c478ff1c272b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'warmth', 'UK: /wɔːmθ/ | US: /wɔːrmθ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự ấm áp', 'the comfortable state or quality of having a moderate degree of heat.', 'The heater provides ample warmth to the room.', 'Lò sưởi cung cấp đủ hơi ấm cho căn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager welcomed the new staff members with great warmth during the orientation session.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã chào đón các nhân viên mới với sự nồng hậu lớn trong buổi định hướng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-ljspeech-cf345a5b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-cori-cf345a5b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/warmth-c5b67160.webp', '[\"friendliness\", \"cordiality\", \"heat\"]', '[\"coldness\", \"coolness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"welcome somebody with warmth\", \"meaning\": \"đón tiếp ai đó một cách nồng hậu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel the warmth\", \"meaning\": \"cảm nhận được sự ấm áp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"warmness\", \"note_vi\": \"Thường dùng \'warmth\' nhiều hơn cho cả nghĩa nhiệt độ lẫn cảm xúc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"warm\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"warm\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"warmly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-cori-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru0-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru5-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru6-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru10-cf345a5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru9-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru3-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru7-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru8-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-aru2-cf345a5b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-ljspeech-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt408-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt138-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt624-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt396-cf345a5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt498-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt132-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt288-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt42-cf345a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warmth-lt90-cf345a5b.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ của \'warm\', chỉ sự ấm áp (nhiệt độ) hoặc sự nồng hậu trong thái độ đón tiếp.', 'human resources', 1, 1),
('0b93c056-d838-5f41-a9ad-25495035237d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'plenteous', '/ˈplentiəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'dồi dào, phong phú, có nhiều.', 'existing in large amounts or numbers; more than enough is available.', 'The tropical region benefits from plenteous rainfall throughout the entire summer season.', 'Vùng nhiệt đới được hưởng lợi từ lượng mưa dồi dào trong suốt cả mùa hè.', '{\"en\": \"The plenteous supply of raw materials kept the factory running all month.\", \"vi\": \"Nguồn cung nguyên liệu dồi dào đã giúp nhà máy hoạt động suốt cả tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-ljspeech-a181bfe7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-cori-a181bfe7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plenteous-c395436f.webp', '[\"abundant\", \"ample\", \"copious\"]', '[\"scarce\", \"sparse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"plenteous harvest\", \"meaning\": \"mùa màng bội thu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plenteous supply\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn cung dồi dào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"plentiful\", \"note_vi\": \"cùng nghĩa nhưng phổ biến hơn trong tiếng Anh hiện đại.\"}, {\"word\": \"precious\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm gần nhưng nghĩa là quý giá, không phải nhiều.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"plenty\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"plenteously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-cori-a181bfe7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-aru0-a181bfe7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-aru5-a181bfe7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-aru6-a181bfe7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-aru10-a181bfe7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-aru9-a181bfe7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plenteous-aru3-a181bfe