('1c9625b0-5c44-5ae3-9b97-56ea227d4fda', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'anxious', '/ˈæŋkʃəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng, bồn chồn hoặc mong muốn điều gì đó.', 'feeling worried or nervous about something that might happen in the future.', 'Investors grew anxious when the stock prices began dropping sharply yesterday.', 'Các nhà đầu tư trở nên lo lắng khi giá cổ phiếu bắt đầu giảm mạnh vào ngày hôm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The manager felt anxious about the upcoming quarterly review with the company board members.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy lo lắng về buổi đánh giá hàng quý sắp tới với các thành viên hội đồng công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-ljspeech-3d58dabf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-cori-3d58dabf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anxious-5ebf0d83.webp', '[\"worried\", \"nervous\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"anxious about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"anxious to do\", \"meaning\": \"nóng lòng làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eager\", \"note_vi\": \"Eager là háo hức, anxious có thể là lo lắng hoặc nóng lòng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"anxiety\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-cori-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru0-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru5-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru6-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru10-3d58dabf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru9-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru3-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru7-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru8-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru2-3d58dabf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-ljspeech-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt408-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt138-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt624-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt396-3d58dabf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt498-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt132-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt288-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt42-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-lt90-3d58dabf.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận: anxious to do sth nghĩa là rất mong muốn làm gì.', 'office', 1, 3),
('4f5f2f0d-1455-5a2e-9bde-0f77b38e869d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'relieved', '/rɪˈliːvd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy nhẹ nhõm, bớt lo lắng hoặc căng thẳng.', 'feeling less worried or tense after a problem is gone.', 'I felt incredibly relieved when I heard that everyone was safe after the accident.', 'Tôi cảm thấy vô cùng nhẹ nhõm khi nghe tin mọi người đều an toàn sau vụ tai nạn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was relieved when the client signed the contract before deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã thấy nhẹ nhõm khi khách hàng ký hợp đồng trước hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-ljspeech-34c5beaa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-cori-34c5beaa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relieved-56f14390.webp', '[\"comforted\", \"reassured\", \"untroubled\"]', '[\"anxious\", \"worried\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel relieved\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy nhẹ nhõm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"relieved to hear\", \"meaning\": \"nhẹ nhõm khi nghe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"visibly relieved\", \"meaning\": \"hiện rõ sự nhẹ nhõm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"relived\", \"note_vi\": \"relived là sống lại ký ức, relieved là nhẹ nhõm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"relieve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"relief\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-cori-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru0-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru5-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru6-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru10-34c5beaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru9-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru3-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru7-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru8-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-aru2-34c5beaa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-ljspeech-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt408-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt138-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt624-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt396-34c5beaa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt498-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt132-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt288-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt42-34c5beaa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relieved-lt90-34c5beaa.mp3\"]}}', 'Relieved (nhẹ nhõm) dễ nhầm với relived (sống lại) do cách viết.', 'business', 1, 4),
('6db7f15a-3eb0-5a35-8326-a00763b07b46', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'inventive', '/ɪnˈventɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng sáng tạo, nhiều ý tưởng mới.', 'having the ability to think of new and original ideas or methods.', 'The chef was known for his inventive dishes that combined unusual flavors.', 'Đầu bếp nổi tiếng với những món ăn đầy sáng tạo kết hợp các hương vị độc đáo.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team came up with several inventive ideas for the new product campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi đã đưa ra một số ý tưởng sáng tạo cho chiến dịch sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-ljspeech-3b5b939a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-cori-3b5b939a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inventive-c8a33fb5.webp', '[\"creative\", \"imaginative\", \"innovative\"]', '[\"unimaginative\", \"uncreative\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inventive mind\", \"meaning\": \"đầu óc sáng tạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inventive solution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp sáng tạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"invented\", \"note_vi\": \"invented là dạng quá khứ của invent, không phải tính từ chỉ phẩm chất sáng tạo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"invent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"invention\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inventor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-cori-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru0-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru5-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru6-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru10-3b5b939a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru9-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru3-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru7-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru8-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-aru2-3b5b939a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-ljspeech-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt408-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt138-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt624-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt396-3b5b939a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt498-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt132-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt288-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt42-3b5b939a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inventive-lt90-3b5b939a.mp3\"]}}', 'Khác với innovative (đổi mới công nghệ), inventive thiên về trí tưởng tượng sáng tạo.', 'marketing', 1, 5),
('cbb8f5e8-9d15-5d83-b1a9-969fed27e24d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'underpriced', '/ˌʌndəˈpraɪst/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Được định giá thấp hơn giá trị thực.', 'sold at a price that is lower than the real value of the item or service.', 'Many investors believe that the company\'s stock is currently underpriced.', 'Nhiều nhà đầu tư tin rằng cổ phiếu của công ty hiện đang bị định giá thấp.', '{\"en\": \"The property was clearly underpriced, attracting many buyers at the weekend open house event.\", \"vi\": \"Bất động sản này rõ ràng đã bị định giá thấp, thu hút nhiều người mua tại sự kiện mở cửa cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-ljspeech-614377e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-cori-614377e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/underpriced-c57622bd.webp', '[\"undervalued\", \"cheap\"]', '[\"overpriced\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severely underpriced\", \"meaning\": \"bị định giá thấp nghiêm trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"underpriced asset\", \"meaning\": \"tài sản bị định giá thấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"overpriced\", \"note_vi\": \"overpriced là quá đắt, underpriced là quá rẻ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun/verb\", \"word\": \"price\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-cori-614377e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-aru0-614377e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-aru5-614377e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-aru6-614377e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-aru10-614377e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-aru9-614377e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-aru3-614377e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underpriced-aru7-61437