('fcb0c77a-97c3-58f7-92d7-41426ae1b20e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'appendix', 'UK: /əˈpen.dɪks/ | US: /əˈpen.dɪks/', 'B2', 'noun', 'phụ lục', 'Supplementary material added at the end of a book, document, or report.', 'Important data is included in the report’s appendix.', 'Dữ liệu quan trọng được đính kèm trong phụ lục của báo cáo.', '{\"en\": \"Detailed financial charts are provided in Appendix B at the end of the report.\", \"vi\": \"Các biểu đồ tài chính chi tiết được cung cấp trong Phụ lục B ở cuối báo cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-ljspeech-e8a60301.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-cori-e8a60301.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appendix-4c43fef9.webp', '[\"addendum\", \"supplement\", \"attachment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"refer to the appendix\", \"meaning\": \"tham khảo phụ lục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attached appendix\", \"meaning\": \"phụ lục được đính kèm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-cori-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru0-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru5-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru6-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru10-e8a60301.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru9-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru3-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru7-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru8-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-aru2-e8a60301.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-ljspeech-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt408-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt138-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt624-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt396-e8a60301.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt498-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt132-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt288-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt42-e8a60301.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appendix-lt90-e8a60301.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ phần phụ lục ở cuối báo cáo hoặc tài liệu. Danh từ số nhiều có thể ghi là \'appendices\' hoặc \'appendixes\'.', 'office', 1, 10),
('bd7c8a34-fee8-56cb-847d-5c22525d2c8b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'uninvolved', '/ˌʌnɪnˈvɒlvd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không tham gia, không liên quan hoặc không có cảm xúc.', 'not taking part in something, or not showing any feeling about it.', 'Senior managers chose to remain uninvolved in the minor dispute among team members.', 'Ban quản lý cấp cao quyết định đứng ngoài cuộc tranh chấp nhỏ giữa các nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The manager stayed uninvolved in the dispute to keep the team\'s trust.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý giữ thái độ không tham gia vào cuộc tranh chấp để duy trì lòng tin đội ngũ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninvolved-ljspeech-075d1756.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninvolved-cori-075d1756.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uninvolved-66f948b7.webp', '[\"detached\", \"neutral\", \"aloof\"]', '[\"engaged\", \"participating\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remain uninvolved\", \"meaning\": \"giữ thái độ không tham gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stay uninvolved\", \"meaning\": \"không dính líu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"emotionally uninvolved\", \"meaning\": \"không có cảm xúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"uninvited\", \"note_vi\": \"khác nghĩa: không được mời, không phải không tham gia.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"involve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"involvement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninvolved-cori-075d1756.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninvolved-aru0-075d1756.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninvolved-aru5-075d1756.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninvolved-aru6-075d1756.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninvolved-aru10-075d1756.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uninvolved-aru9-075d1756.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu