('b8ff477d-91a8-54c0-9372-d2c4dc93f4f7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'underprivileged', '/ˌʌndəˈprɪvəlɪdʒd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'kém may mắn, không có đủ điều kiện sống hoặc cơ hội.', 'having less money and fewer opportunities than most people in society.', 'The charity works to provide education for underprivileged children in rural areas.', 'Tổ chức từ thiện hoạt động để cung cấp giáo dục cho trẻ em thiệt thòi ở các vùng nông thôn.', '{\"en\": \"The corporation donated funds to support education programs for underprivileged students in the community.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn đã quyên góp quỹ để hỗ trợ các chương trình giáo dục cho học sinh có hoàn cảnh khó khăn trong cộng đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-ljspeech-2db9a5e4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-cori-2db9a5e4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/underprivileged-684239ee.webp', '[\"disadvantaged\", \"needy\"]', '[\"privileged\", \"wealthy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"underprivileged children\", \"meaning\": \"trẻ em kém may mắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"underprivileged background\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn cảnh khó khăn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-cori-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru0-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru5-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru6-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru10-2db9a5e4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru9-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru3-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru7-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru8-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-aru2-2db9a5e4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-ljspeech-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt408-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt138-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt624-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt396-2db9a5e4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt498-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt132-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt288-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt42-2db9a5e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underprivileged-lt90-2db9a5e4.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các thông báo về trách nhiệm xã hội của doanh nghiệp.', 'other', 1, 13),
('1b9e5369-a2b5-55ee-84e4-3db68de528df', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'virtual private network', '/ˈvɜːtʃəl ˈpraɪvɪt ˈnetwɜːk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một công nghệ cho phép tạo kết nối mạng an toàn qua một mạng công cộng.', 'a technology that creates a secure encrypted connection over a less secure public internet system.', 'Many companies use a virtual private network to ensure secure communication for remote employees.', 'Nhiều công ty sử dụng mạng riêng ảo để đảm bảo giao tiếp an toàn cho nhân viên làm việc từ xa.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must connect to the company virtual private network when working from home for security.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải kết nối với mạng riêng ảo của công ty khi làm việc tại nhà để đảm bảo an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-network-ljspeech-af64f4e4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-network-cori-af64f4e4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/virtual-private-network-15f21537.webp', '[\"VPN\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"secure virtual private network\", \"meaning\": \"mạng riêng ảo bảo mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"connect via virtual private network\", \"meaning\": \"kết nối qua mạng riêng ảo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-network-cori-af64f4e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-network-aru0-af64f4e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-network-aru5-af64f4e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-network-aru6-af64f4e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-network-aru10-af64f4e4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-network-aru9-af64f4e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/virtual-private-