('9b2e158e-d7e5-50fa-9d86-3b04b7217514', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'cabinet', 'UK: /ˈkæbɪnɪt/ | US: /ˈkæbɪnɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'tủ', 'a piece of furniture with doors and shelves used for storing items safely', 'The files are stored in the cabinet next to the window.', 'Các tập tin được lưu trữ trong tủ cạnh cửa sổ.', '{\"en\": \"Please make sure all confidential personnel documents are locked inside the filing cabinet.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo tất cả các tài liệu nhân sự bảo mật được khóa bên trong tủ hồ sơ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-ljspeech-69d203a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-cori-69d203a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cabinet-3f03c366.webp', '[\"cupboard\", \"closet\", \"locker\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"filing cabinet\", \"meaning\": \"tủ lưu trữ hồ sơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"display cabinet\", \"meaning\": \"tủ trưng bày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cabin\", \"note_vi\": \"buồng máy bay/tàu hoặc nhà gỗ nhỏ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-cori-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru0-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru5-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru6-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru10-69d203a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru9-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru3-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru7-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru8-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-aru2-69d203a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-ljspeech-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt408-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt138-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt624-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt396-69d203a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt498-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt132-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt288-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt42-69d203a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cabinet-lt90-69d203a8.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường văn phòng TOEIC, cụm \'filing cabinet\' (tủ hồ sơ) xuất hiện rất nhiều.', 'office', 1, 22),
('c86d1e9c-8ddf-5dab-86da-5d7f6a039325', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'fattening', '/ˈfætnɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng làm tăng cân hoặc gây béo.', 'containing a lot of calories and likely to make a person gain weight.', 'Most fast foods are considered fattening due to their high calorie content.', 'Hầu hết đồ ăn nhanh được coi là gây béo vì hàm lượng calo cao.', '{\"en\": \"The cafeteria decided to offer fewer fattening items on its daily lunch menu.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà ăn quyết định cung cấp ít các món ăn gây béo hơn trên thực đơn ăn trưa hàng ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-ljspeech-edd34d4b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-cori-edd34d4b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fattening-5659e088.webp', '[\"caloric\", \"high-calorie\"]', '[\"non-fattening\", \"low-calorie\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fattening food\", \"meaning\": \"thức ăn gây béo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fattening snack\", \"meaning\": \"đồ ăn vặt dễ tăng cân\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fatty\", \"note_vi\": \"Fatty có nghĩa là chứa nhiều mỡ, còn fattening là dễ gây béo/tăng cân.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fatten\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-cori-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru0-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru5-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru6-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru10-edd34d4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru9-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru3-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru7-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru8-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-aru2-edd34d4b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-ljspeech-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt408-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt138-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt624-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt396-edd34d4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt498-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt132-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt288-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt42-edd34d4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fattening-lt90-edd34d4b.mp3\"]}}', 'Fattening mô tả thực phẩm làm tăng cân, fatty mô tả món ăn chứa nhiều chất béo/mỡ.', 'dining', 1, 23),
('675dea95-013a-5350-9541-38d60fc06944', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'oftentimes', '/ˈɒfntaɪmz/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Thường xuyên, nhiều lần.', 'on many occasions or in many cases; frequently.', 'Oftentimes, the simplest solutions are the most effective.', 'Thông thường, những giải pháp đơn giản nhất lại là hiệu quả nhất.', '{\"en\": \"Oftentimes, employees prefer flexible working hours over a small salary increase.\", \"vi\": \"Thường thì nhân viên thích giờ làm việc linh hoạt hơn là tăng lương một chút.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-ljspeech-0c2908a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-cori-0c2908a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oftentimes-72c79a26.webp', '[\"often\", \"frequently\", \"repeatedly\"]', '[\"rarely\", \"seldom\"]', NULL, '[{\"word\": \"sometimes\", \"note_vi\": \"sometimes là thỉnh thoảng, còn oftentimes là thường xuyên.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-cori-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru0-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru5-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru6-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru10-0c2908a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru9-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru3-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru7-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru8-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-aru2-0c2908a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-ljspeech-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt408-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt138-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt624-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt396-0c2908a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt498-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt132-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt288-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt42-0c2908a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oftentimes-lt90-0c2908a6.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là dạng trang trọng hoặc cổ hơn của \'often\', phổ biến trong tiếng Anh Mỹ.', 'hr', 1, 24)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('53634b1d-8a67-5d6c-85fa-eb3a5f6c67d2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'overcome', '/ˌəʊvəˈkʌm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Vượt qua hoặc kiểm soát một khó khăn, cảm xúc.', 'to succeed in dealing with or controlling a problem or difficulty.', 'She worked hard to overcome her fear of public speaking.', 'Cô ấy đã cố gắng rất nhiều để vượt qua nỗi sợ nói trước đám đông.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team worked hard to overcome the budget limitations for the new campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã làm việc chăm chỉ để vượt qua những hạn chế về ngân sách cho chiến dịch mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-ljspeech-aa078da4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-cori-aa078da4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overcome-173f7596.webp', '[\"surmount\", \"conquer\", \"defeat\"]', '[\"succumb\", \"fail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"overcome obstacles\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua các trở ngại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overcome difficulties\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua khó khăn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"overtake\", \"note_vi\": \"overtake nghĩa là vượt qua xe khác hoặc vượt trội hơn về số lượng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-cori-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru0-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru5-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru6-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru10-aa078da4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru9-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru3-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru7-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru8-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-aru2-aa078da4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-ljspeech-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt408-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt138-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt624-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt396-aa078da4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt498-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt132-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt288-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt42-aa078da4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overcome-lt90-aa078da4.mp3\"]}}', 'Quá khứ là \"overcame\", phân từ hai quay lại là \"overcome\".', 'business', 1, 25),
('5cd6df97-f3a7-54b0-82f9-e5ed3bbeb38d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'surf', '/sɜːf/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Lướt trên sóng biển hoặc lướt qua các trang web trên mạng.', 'to ride on waves at the sea using a board, or to browse through websites on the internet.', 'On weekends, he often goes to the beach to surf.', 'Vào cuối tuần, anh ấy thường ra biển để lướt sóng.', '{\"en\": \"Employees should not surf social media websites during working hours.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên không nên lướt các trang mạng xã hội trong giờ làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-ljspeech-a001cca4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-cori-a001cca4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surf-58b3c462.webp', '[\"browse\", \"navigate\", \"ride\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"surf the internet\", \"meaning\": \"lướt mạng internet\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surf the web\", \"meaning\": \"lướt web\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surf the waves\", \"meaning\": \"lướt sóng biển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"search\", \"note_vi\": \"search là tìm kiếm có chủ đích, surf là lướt qua nhiều trang không có mục tiêu cụ thể\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surfer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surfing\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surfboard\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-cori-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru0-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru5-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru6-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru10-a001cca4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru9-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru3-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru7-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru8-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-aru2-a001cca4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-ljspeech-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt408-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt138-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt624-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt396-a001cca4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt498-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt132-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt288-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt42-a001cca4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surf-lt90-a001cca4.mp3\"]}}', 'Surf the internet và browse the internet đều nghĩa là lướt mạng, dùng thay thế nhau được.', 'technology', 1, 26),
('6e7439d0-c4c7-5e84-9859-9f650b6378f9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'unknowledgeable', '/ʌnˈnɒlɪdʒəbəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không có đủ kiến thức hoặc hiểu biết về một chủ đề cụ thể.', 'lacking information or understanding about a specific subject or area of study.', 'He admitted he was quite unknowledgeable about advanced physics.', 'Anh ấy thừa nhận mình khá thiếu hiểu biết về vật lý nâng cao.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant was unknowledgeable about the local tax laws, so he asked for more time.\", \"vi\": \"Người tư vấn thiếu kiến thức về luật thuế địa phương, vì vậy anh ấy đã xin thêm thời gian.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-ljspeech-552e9713.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-cori-552e9713.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unknowledgeable-af1ed581.webp', '[\"ignorant\", \"uninformed\"]', '[\"knowledgeable\", \"informed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remain unknowledgeable\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn thiếu hiểu biết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"completely unknowledgeable\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn không có kiến thức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"knowledge\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-cori-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru0-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru5-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru6-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru10-552e9713.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru9-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru3-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru7-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru8-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-aru2-552e9713.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-ljspeech-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt408-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt138-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt624-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt396-552e9713.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt498-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt132-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt288-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt42-552e9713.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unknowledgeable-lt90-552e9713.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ sự thiếu hụt kiến thức chuyên môn trong công việc.', 'business', 1, 27),
('f0ce187d-0ad5-591a-9141-d7ed35ce2e28', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'manifestly', '/ˈmænɪfestli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách rõ ràng, dễ thấy và không thể nghi ngờ.', 'in a way that is very clear and easy to notice or understand.', 'The old regulations were manifestly inadequate for dealing with modern financial technology.', 'Các quy định cũ rõ ràng không đủ để đối phó với công nghệ tài chính hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"The proposed budget cuts are manifestly unfair to the hard-working employees in the production department.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cắt giảm ngân sách được đề xuất rõ ràng là không công bằng đối với những nhân viên chăm chỉ ở bộ phận sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-ljspeech-4899b9d1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-cori-4899b9d1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/manifestly-94e8eb69.webp', '[\"clearly\", \"obviously\", \"evidently\"]', '[\"secretly\", \"vaguely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"manifestly clear\", \"meaning\": \"rõ ràng rành rành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"manifestly unfair\", \"meaning\": \"rõ ràng là không công bằng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"manifest\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"manifestation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-cori-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru0-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru5-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru6-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru10-4899b9d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru9-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru3-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru7-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru8-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-aru2-4899b9d1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-ljspeech-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt408-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt138-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt624-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt396-4899b9d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt498-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt132-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt288-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt42-4899b9d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifestly-lt90-4899b9d1.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này khá trang trọng, thường dùng trong văn bản pháp lý hoặc học thuật.', 'business', 1, 28),
('d994ffa6-d722-563d-9e7d-0564af153668', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29b2cd89-9392-59c2-bbe8-926f51a5ed3c', 'ac5dbf95-980f-573e-8da9-ff073ba5a2ac', 'lilliputian', '/ˌlɪlɪˈpjuːʃn/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Rất nhỏ bé, tí hon.', 'extremely small in size or importance, often used to describe something tiny or insignificant.', 'The miniature train set included lilliputian figures and tiny buildings.', 'Bộ tàu hỏa mô hình bao gồm các hình người tí hon và những tòa nhà nhỏ xíu.', '{\"en\": \"The new microchip features lilliputian components that allow for faster processing in modern mobile devices.\", \"vi\": \"Con chip mới có các thành phần tí hon cho phép xử lý nhanh hơn trong các thiết bị di động hiện đại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-ljspeech-e1a4dc62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-cori-e1a4dc62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lilliputian-0d77d704.webp', '[\"tiny\", \"minuscule\"]', '[\"gigantic\", \"enormous\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-cori-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru0-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru5-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru6-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru10-e1a4dc62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru9-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru3-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru7-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru8-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-aru2-e1a4dc62.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-ljspeech-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt408-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt138-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt624-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt396-e1a4dc62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt498-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt132-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt288-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt42-e1a4dc62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lilliputian-lt90-e1a4dc62.mp3\"]}}', 'bắt nguồn từ tên hòn đảo người tí hon trong tác phẩm Gulliver du ký.', 'technology', 1, 29),
('c36954a7-2b3a-5d49-9367-36670a6e1dd1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'unnerve', '/ˌʌnˈnɜːv/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm cho ai đó mất bình tĩnh, lo lắng.', 'to make someone feel worried, nervous, or lose their confidence in a situation.', 'The sudden silence in the old house unnerved her.', 'Sự im lặng đột ngột trong ngôi nhà cũ làm cô ấy lo lắng.', '{\"en\": \"The unexpected questions from the board members seemed to unnerve the project manager.\", \"vi\": \"Những câu hỏi bất ngờ từ các thành viên hội đồng quản trị dường như làm người quản lý dự án mất bình tĩnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-ljspeech-dfa48784.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-cori-dfa48784.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unnerve-fe79d801.webp', '[\"disturb\", \"rattle\"]', '[\"encourage\", \"reassure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unnerve someone\", \"meaning\": \"làm ai đó lo lắng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-cori-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru0-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru5-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru6-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru10-dfa48784.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru9-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru3-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru7-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru8-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-aru2-dfa48784.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-ljspeech-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt408-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt138-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt624-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt396-dfa48784.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt498-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt132-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt288-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt42-dfa48784.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unnerve-lt90-dfa48784.mp3\"]}}', 'Gợi ý: \'un-\' (không) + \'nerve\' (thần kinh/sự tự tin) = mất tự tin.', 'office', 1, 0),
('f8b7df5a-968f-5df3-95a3-4dbcbbf445c8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'efficiently', '/ɪˈfɪʃntli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Thực hiện công việc một cách hiệu quả, không lãng phí thời gian hay năng lượng.', 'working well and quickly without wasting time, energy, or effort.', 'The new software helps employees complete their tasks more efficiently.', 'Phần mềm mới giúp nhân viên hoàn thành công việc của họ hiệu quả hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The new filing system allows our administrative staff to process client requests much more efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống lưu trữ mới cho phép nhân viên hành chính của chúng tôi xử lý các yêu cầu của khách hàng hiệu quả hơn nhiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-ljspeech-5273df4f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-cori-5273df4f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/efficiently-5c116b84.webp', '[\"effectively\", \"productively\"]', '[\"inefficiently\", \"wastefully\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work efficiently\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"operate efficiently\", \"meaning\": \"vận hành hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"effectively\", \"note_vi\": \"effectively là đạt kết quả tốt, efficiently là tốn ít thời gian/công sức\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"efficient\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"efficiency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-cori-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru0-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru5-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru6-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru10-5273df4f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru9-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru3-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru7-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru8-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-aru2-5273df4f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-ljspeech-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt408-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt138-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt624-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt396-5273df4f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt498-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt132-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt288-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt42-5273df4f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/efficiently-lt90-5273df4f.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'effectively\': efficiently nhấn mạnh vào việc tiết kiệm thời gian và nguồn lực.', 'office', 1, 1),
('6ecae70a-061f-5e58-b9e9-04ecfddae860', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'sector', '/ˈsektə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một phần hoặc một mảng riêng biệt trong một hệ thống lớn hơn, như kinh tế hoặc xã hội.', 'a part of an area of activity, especially of a country\'s economy.', 'Many new jobs were created in the tourism sector during the summer holiday.', 'Nhiều việc làm mới đã được tạo ra trong lĩnh vực du lịch trong kỳ nghỉ hè.', '{\"en\": \"Many jobs were created in the private sector during the last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều việc làm đã được tạo ra trong khu vực tư nhân trong quý vừa qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-ljspeech-cefd7472.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-cori-cefd7472.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sector-213ce2b6.webp', '[\"industry\", \"segment\", \"division\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"private sector\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực tư nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public sector\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"section\", \"note_vi\": \"section là một phần nhỏ của một vật hoặc tài liệu.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-cori-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru0-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru5-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru6-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru10-cefd7472.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru9-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru3-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru7-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru8-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-aru2-cefd7472.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-ljspeech-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt408-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt138-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt624-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt396-cefd7472.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt498-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt132-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt288-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt42-cefd7472.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sector-lt90-cefd7472.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để chỉ các mảng lớn của nền kinh tế.', 'finance', 1, 2),
('966ee604-ecd5-5c35-9359-a14255498769', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'proficient', '/prəˈfɪʃnt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Giỏi hoặc thành thạo một kỹ năng hay lĩnh vực nào đó.', 'skilled and competent in a particular activity or field.', 'Our new project manager is proficient at using advanced data analysis software.', 'Quản lý dự án mới của chúng tôi thành thạo việc sử dụng phần mềm phân tích dữ liệu nâng cao.', '{\"en\": \"Our new accountant is proficient with the latest tax software.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán mới của chúng tôi rất thành thạo phần mềm thuế mới nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-ljspeech-b4903c4a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-cori-b4903c4a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/proficient-bd71017e.webp', '[\"skilled\", \"competent\", \"adept\"]', '[\"inept\", \"incompetent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"proficient in\", \"meaning\": \"thành thạo về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proficient at\", \"meaning\": \"giỏi ở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proficient with\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng thuần thục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"efficient\", \"note_vi\": \"efficient là hiệu quả, proficient là thành thạo kỹ năng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"proficiency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-cori-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru0-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru5-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru6-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru10-b4903c4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru9-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru3-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru7-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru8-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-aru2-b4903c4a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-ljspeech-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt408-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt138-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt624-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt396-b4903c4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt498-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt132-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt288-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt42-b4903c4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proficient-lt90-b4903c4a.mp3\"]}}', 'Proficient khác efficient. Proficient là giỏi, efficient là làm nhanh ít tốn.', 'hr', 1, 3),
('2b64b79e-02cd-55e8-b474-99f9156b2f12', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'sanity', '/ˈsænəti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Trạng thái tinh thần minh mẫn, tỉnh táo.', 'the state of having a healthy mind and not being mentally ill.', 'After working for 12 hours, she questioned her own sanity.', 'Sau khi làm việc 12 tiếng, cô ấy tự hỏi liệu mình còn tỉnh táo không.', '{\"en\": \"Taking regular breaks during long working hours is important for maintaining your sanity.\", \"vi\": \"Nghỉ ngơi thường xuyên trong giờ làm việc kéo dài là điều quan trọng để duy trì sự tỉnh táo của bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-ljspeech-dc6c4c51.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-cori-dc6c4c51.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sanity-c558d4cd.webp', '[\"reason\", \"rationality\", \"lucidity\"]', '[\"insanity\", \"madness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keep one\'s sanity\", \"meaning\": \"giữ sự tỉnh táo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"question someone\'s sanity\", \"meaning\": \"nghi ngờ sự tỉnh táo của ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sanitation\", \"note_vi\": \"sanitation là hệ thống vệ sinh, làm sạch\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sane\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-cori-dc6c4c51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-aru0-dc6c4c51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-aru5-dc6c4c51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-aru6-dc6c4c51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-aru10-dc6c4c51.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-aru9-dc6c4c51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-aru3-dc6c4c51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-aru7-dc6c4c51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanity-aru8-dc6c4c51.mp3\", \