('7fb6ebd1-af00-593f-9a54-960a0c20f86b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'delay', '/dɪˈleɪ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự trì hoãn hoặc chậm trễ.', 'a situation where something happens later than it was planned or expected to happen.', 'There was a significant delay in the flight due to bad weather.', 'Chuyến bay đã bị trì hoãn đáng kể do thời tiết xấu.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping department reported a minor delay in processing the customer\'s order due to inventory.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận vận chuyển đã báo cáo một sự chậm trễ nhỏ trong việc xử lý đơn hàng của khách do vấn đề kho bãi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-ljspeech-ab464f02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-cori-ab464f02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delay-0928fcd7.webp', '[\"postponement\", \"setback\"]', '[\"punctuality\", \"promptness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cause a delay\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra sự chậm trễ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid delay\", \"meaning\": \"tránh sự chậm trễ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"delay\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-cori-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru0-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru5-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru6-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru10-ab464f02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru9-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru3-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru7-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru8-ab464f02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delay-aru2-ab464f02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc