('933bf8fe-6f06-59e6-8d32-346b42cbe455', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'assume', 'UK: /əˈsjuːm/ | US: /əˈsuːm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'đảm nhận, gánh vác', 'to take on or accept a particular role, duty, or responsibility upon oneself', 'She will assume responsibility for the new project next month.', 'Cô ấy sẽ đảm nhận trách nhiệm cho dự án mới vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The newly appointed manager will assume responsibility for the project next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý mới được bổ nhiệm sẽ gánh vác trách nhiệm cho dự án vào thứ Hai tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-ljspeech-661e458e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-cori-661e458e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assume-1a475879.webp', '[\"take on\", \"undertake\", \"presume\", \"suppose\"]', '[\"relinquish\", \"surrender\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"assume responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"gánh vác / chịu trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assume the role\", \"meaning\": \"đảm nhận vai trò\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"resume\", \"note_vi\": \"tiếp tục lại sau khi ngắt quãng (động từ) hoặc hồ sơ xin việc (résumé).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assumption\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-cori-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru0-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru5-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru6-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru10-661e458e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru9-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru3-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru7-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru8-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-aru2-661e458e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-ljspeech-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt408-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt138-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt624-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt396-661e458e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt498-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt132-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt288-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt42-661e458e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assume-lt90-661e458e.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC có 2 nét nghĩa chính: (1) gánh vác trách nhiệm (assume responsibility) và (2) giả định/cho là (assume that...).', 'management', 1, 8),
('240fba6b-045f-5d6d-9fd9-36f86af5f7e3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'supervisor', 'UK: /ˈsuːpəvaɪzə/ | US: /ˈsuːpərˌvaɪzər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'người giám sát', 'a person who monitors and guides workers to ensure tasks are completed correctly', 'The supervisor approved the employee\'s leave request.', 'Người giám sát đã duyệt đơn xin nghỉ phép của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"If you need to request time off, please submit the form to your immediate supervisor.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu bạn cần xin nghỉ phép, vui lòng nộp đơn cho người giám sát trực tiếp của bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-ljspeech-0f4d09e4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-cori-0f4d09e4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supervisor-8044c296.webp', '[\"manager\", \"boss\", \"overseer\", \"foreman\"]', '[\"subordinate\", \"employee\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"immediate supervisor\", \"meaning\": \"người quản lý/giám sát trực tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shift supervisor\", \"meaning\": \"trưởng ca giám sát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"supervision\", \"note_vi\": \"Supervisor là danh từ chỉ người (người giám sát), còn supervision là danh từ chỉ hành động/sự việc (sự giám sát).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"supervise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supervision\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"supervisory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-cori-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru0-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru5-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru6-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru10-0f4d09e4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru9-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru3-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru7-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru8-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-aru2-0f4d09e4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-ljspeech-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt408-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt138-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt624-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt396-0f4d09e4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt498-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt132-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt288-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt42-0f4d09e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervisor-lt90-0f4d09e4.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ rất phổ biến chỉ sếp/người quản lý trực tiếp trong bài thi TOEIC. Cụm từ hay gặp: \'immediate supervisor\' (cấp trên trực tiếp).', 'office', 1, 9),
('bb822071-128f-5029-9af3-43f5589b481e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'fiddle', '/ˈfɪdl/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Chạm hoặc di chuyển vật gì đó bằng tay một cách bồn chồn, không mục đích.', 'to touch or move something with your hands in a nervous way.', 'He tends to fiddle with his pen when he\'s nervous during meetings.', 'Anh ấy có xu hướng nghịch cây bút khi lo lắng trong các cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The presenter began to fiddle with the projector cables when the screen went blank.\", \"vi\": \"Người thuyết trình bắt đầu nghịch các dây cáp máy chiếu khi màn hình bị tắt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-ljspeech-775adc12.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-cori-775adc12.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fiddle-a70a2f11.webp', '[\"fidget\", \"tinker\", \"toy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fiddle with something\", \"meaning\": \"nghịch/chỉnh sửa cái gì bằng tay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fiddly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-cori-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru0-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru5-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru6-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru10-775adc12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru9-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru3-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru7-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru8-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-aru2-775adc12.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fiddle-ljspeech-775adc12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj