('ff08b754-a406-507b-b506-eba73cad7697', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'belittle', '/bɪˈlɪtl/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Làm cho ai đó hoặc điều gì đó có vẻ kém quan trọng, không đáng giá.', 'to say that someone or something is not important or not worth much attention.', 'Don\'t let anyone belittle your achievements; you worked hard for them.', 'Đừng để ai coi thường thành tựu của bạn; bạn đã rất nỗ lực vì chúng.', '{\"en\": \"A professional manager should never belittle the contributions of team members during a project meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Một người quản lý chuyên nghiệp không bao giờ nên hạ thấp đóng góp của các thành viên trong cuộc họp dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-ljspeech-5a893c41.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-cori-5a893c41.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/belittle-f0810443.webp', '[\"disparage\", \"minimize\"]', '[\"praise\", \"exalt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"belittle someone\'s efforts\", \"meaning\": \"coi thường nỗ lực của ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"belittle the importance\", \"meaning\": \"xem nhẹ tầm quan trọng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-cori-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru0-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru5-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru6-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru10-5a893c41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru9-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru3-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru7-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru8-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-aru2-5a893c41.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-ljspeech-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt408-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt138-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt624-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt396-5a893c41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt498-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt132-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt288-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt42-5a893c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/belittle-lt90-5a893c41.mp3\"]}}', 'Gợi nhớ: \'be\' + \'little\' (làm cho nhỏ bé đi).', 'office', 1, 20),
('64f90514-2146-5f5d-adf9-20b958c4d822', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'aim', 'UK: /eɪm/ | US: /eɪm/', 'B1', 'verb', 'nhằm mục đích', 'to direct one\'s efforts or intentions toward achieving a specific goal or result.', 'The project aims to improve customer satisfaction.', 'Dự án nhằm mục đích cải thiện sự hài lòng của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The company aims to expand its overseas client base by 20 percent this year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có mục tiêu mở rộng tập khách hàng nước ngoài thêm 20% trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-ljspeech-6c6c2766.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-cori-6c6c2766.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aim-f608b35f.webp', '[\"target\", \"intend\", \"strive\", \"aspire\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"aim to improve\", \"meaning\": \"nhắm tới việc cải thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"aim at target market\", \"meaning\": \"nhắm vào thị trường mục tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"aim for perfection\", \"meaning\": \"hướng tới sự hoàn hảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"target\", \"note_vi\": \"Aim đi kèm to-V hoặc at + V-ing, còn target thường đi trực tiếp với danh từ tân ngữ (target high-income earners).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"aim\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"aimless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-cori-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru0-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru5-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru6-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru10-6c6c2766.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru9-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru3-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru7-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru8-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-aru2-6c6c2766.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-ljspeech-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt408-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt138-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt624-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt396-6c6c2766.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt498-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt132-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt288-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt42-6c6c2766.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aim-lt90-6c6c2766.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thông dụng: \'aim to do something\' (hướng tới làm gì) hoặc \'aim at + V-ing\'.', 'business', 1, 21),
('49c00d30-1cda-5407-9f12-f38ac18ed9e9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'boiler', '/ˈbɔɪlə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị dùng để đun nóng nước, tạo hơi nước hoặc nước nóng.', 'a large container used for heating water to provide heat or hot water.', 'Our old boiler broke down, so we had to install a new one before winter.', 'Nồi hơi cũ của chúng tôi bị hỏng, vì vậy chúng tôi phải lắp một cái mới trước mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"The facility manager scheduled a technician to repair the broken boiler in the basement.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cơ sở đã lên lịch cho một kỹ thuật viên đến sửa nồi hơi bị hỏng ở tầng hầm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-ljspeech-29312d5d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-cori-29312d5d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/boiler-8c9fbd55.webp', '[\"water heater\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"boiler room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng nồi hơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"repair the boiler\", \"meaning\": \"sửa nồi hơi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"broiler\", \"note_vi\": \"lò nướng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"boil\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-cori-29312d5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru0-29312d5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru5-29312d5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru6-29312d5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru10-29312d5d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru9-29312d5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru3-29312d5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru7-29312d5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru8-29312d5d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boiler-aru2-29312d5d.mp3\"]}, \"us\"