('2b848fd1-0d56-5efc-9956-28ad1d81a7f9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'vigorous', '/ˈvɪɡərəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đầy năng lượng, mạnh mẽ và quyết liệt.', 'full of energy, enthusiasm, determination, or strong physical effort.', 'The company launched a vigorous marketing campaign to promote its new product.', 'Công ty đã phát động một chiến dịch tiếp thị mạnh mẽ để quảng bá sản phẩm mới của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The board engaged in a vigorous discussion regarding the new expansion budget.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã thảo luận rất sôi nổi về ngân sách mở rộng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-ljspeech-d4362077.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-cori-d4362077.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vigorous-c983a963.webp', '[\"energetic\", \"dynamic\", \"robust\"]', '[\"weak\", \"feeble\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vigorous debate\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tranh luận sôi nổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vigorous effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vigorous campaign\", \"meaning\": \"chiến dịch quyết liệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rigorous\", \"note_vi\": \"rigorous là nghiêm ngặt, khắt khe; còn word này là mạnh mẽ, đầy năng lượng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vigor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"vigorously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-cori-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru0-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru5-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru6-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru10-d4362077.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru9-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru3-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru7-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru8-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-aru2-d4362077.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-ljspeech-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt408-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt138-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt624-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt396-d4362077.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt498-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt132-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt288-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt42-d4362077.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vigorous-lt90-d4362077.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với rigorous (nghiêm ngặt). Vigorous nhấn mạnh tính mạnh mẽ, năng nổ.', 'business', 1, 26),
('156e8d89-9663-5c30-8cae-64e3945d3bf6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'hail', '/heɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Những hạt băng nhỏ rơi từ trời, mưa đá.', 'small hard balls of ice that fall from the sky like rain during a storm.', 'The sudden hail storm damaged many cars parked outside.', 'Trận mưa đá bất ngờ đã làm hư hại nhiều ô tô đỗ bên ngoài.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck was damaged by heavy hail while driving to the distribution center.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng bị hư hại do mưa đá nặng hạt khi đang lái đến trung tâm phân phối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-ljspeech-71cd3baa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-cori-71cd3baa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hail-385d5da2.webp', '[\"ice\", \"pellets\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hail storm\", \"meaning\": \"trận mưa đá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heavy hail\", \"meaning\": \"mưa đá lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hale\", \"note_vi\": \"Hale nghĩa là khỏe mạnh, hail là mưa đá hoặc chào hỏi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-cori-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru0-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru5-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru6-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru10-71cd3baa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru9-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru3-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru7-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru8-71cd3baa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-aru2-71cd3baa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hail-lj