('e4aee17c-d72f-510d-a194-cab58d9dbc88', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'big-boned', '/ˈbɪɡˌbəʊnd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có bộ xương lớn, thân hình vạm vỡ một cách tự nhiên.', 'having a large body frame that is natural rather than being caused by fat.', 'She\'s not overweight, she\'s just naturally big-boned.', 'Cô ấy không hề thừa cân, chỉ là có bộ xương lớn một cách tự nhiên thôi.', '{\"en\": \"The uniform supplier asked for measurements to ensure a comfortable fit for the big-boned staff.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp đồng phục đã yêu cầu số đo để đảm bảo vừa vặn thoải mái cho nhân viên có khung xương lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-ljspeech-c1171d6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-cori-c1171d6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/big-boned-d1257492.webp', '[\"sturdy\", \"broad-shouldered\"]', '[\"slender\", \"petite\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-cori-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru0-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru5-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru6-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru10-c1171d6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru9-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru3-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru7-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru8-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-aru2-c1171d6d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-ljspeech-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt408-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt138-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt624-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt396-c1171d6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt498-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt132-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt288-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt42-c1171d6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/big-boned-lt90-c1171d6d.mp3\"]}}', 'cách nói lịch sự để mô tả vóc dáng to lớn.', 'other', 1, 28),
('046bb891-fe0f-5456-acaa-af2d63338bd2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d0417b-3032-5641-9595-fef63808d4a6', '8a7e0f90-799f-5ee1-afc6-a563be720e92', 'wireless', '/ˈwaɪələs/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Không cần dây cáp để truyền tín hiệu hoặc kết nối.', 'using radio waves or infrared signals instead of wires to transmit information.', 'I prefer wireless headphones because they offer more freedom of movement.', 'Tôi thích tai nghe không dây hơn vì chúng mang lại sự tự do di chuyển.', '{\"en\": \"The IT department installed a high-speed wireless network throughout the office building.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng CNTT đã cài đặt mạng không dây tốc độ cao khắp tòa nhà văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-ljspeech-9f56b812.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-cori-9f56b812.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wireless-80c03b1c.webp', '[\"cordless\"]', '[\"wired\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wireless connection\", \"meaning\": \"kết nối không dây\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wireless device\", \"meaning\": \"thiết bị không dây\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wire\", \"note_vi\": \"Wireless là không dây, wire là dây điện/dây cáp.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-cori-9f56b812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru0-9f56b812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru5-9f56b812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru6-9f56b812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru10-9f56b812.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru9-9f56b812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru3-9f56b812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru7-9f56b812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru8-9f56b812.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wireless-aru2-