('d559c6c7-1482-509f-a761-57738c2b035f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d6c751-607b-527a-a690-870d13cc181b', 'a2f06fec-bfbd-5963-8ef0-448be1647614', 'framework', '/ˈfreɪmwɜːk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống cấu trúc hoặc ý tưởng làm nền tảng.', 'a system of rules or ideas that is used to plan or decide something.', 'The new policy provides a clear framework for future development.', 'Chính sách mới cung cấp một khuôn khổ rõ ràng cho sự phát triển trong tương lai.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department established a new framework for managing international contracts.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận pháp lý đã thiết lập một khuôn khổ mới để quản lý các hợp đồng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-ljspeech-f178867d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-cori-f178867d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/framework-dae98ce1.webp', '[\"structure\", \"system\", \"skeleton\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"regulatory framework\", \"meaning\": \"khuôn khổ pháp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conceptual framework\", \"meaning\": \"khung khái niệm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-cori-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru0-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru5-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru6-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru10-f178867d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru9-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru3-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru7-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru8-f178867d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/framework-aru2-f178867d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/p