('9b87f101-83e4-5461-94c0-7dfc5f7ea4dc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d6c751-607b-527a-a690-870d13cc181b', 'a2f06fec-bfbd-5963-8ef0-448be1647614', 'painless', '/ˈpeɪnləs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không gây đau đớn hoặc khó khăn; dễ chịu.', 'causing no physical pain or requiring very little effort and trouble.', 'The dentist assured me that the procedure would be completely painless.', 'Nha sĩ đảm bảo với tôi rằng thủ thuật này sẽ hoàn toàn không đau.', '{\"en\": \"The new online registration system made the booking process completely painless for clients.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống đăng ký trực tuyến mới giúp quy trình đặt chỗ hoàn toàn dễ dàng cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-ljspeech-17d79688.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-cori-17d79688.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/painless-fc0735f4.webp', '[\"effortless\", \"easy\", \"comfortable\"]', '[\"painful\", \"difficult\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"painless transition\", \"meaning\": \"sự chuyển đổi suôn sẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"painless procedure\", \"meaning\": \"thủ thuật không đau\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pain\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"painlessly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-cori-17d79688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-aru0-17d79688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-aru5-17d79688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-aru6-17d79688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-aru10-17d79688.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-aru9-17d79688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-aru3-17d79688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-aru7-17d79688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/painless-aru8-17d79688.mp3\", \"/storage