('549fac2e-d08b-5d07-8c64-3d8047b7af35', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '29d6c751-607b-527a-a690-870d13cc181b', 'a2f06fec-bfbd-5963-8ef0-448be1647614', 'intriguing', '/ɪnˈtriːɡɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất thú vị, hấp dẫn và khơi gợi sự tò mò.', 'very interesting and attractive in a way that makes you want to know more about it.', 'The detective found an intriguing clue that could solve the whole mystery.', 'Thám tử tìm thấy một manh mối hấp dẫn có thể giải quyết toàn bộ bí ẩn.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant presented an intriguing proposal that caught the attention of all investors.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyên gia tư vấn đã trình bày một đề xuất hấp dẫn thu hút sự chú ý của tất cả các nhà đầu tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-ljspeech-56640cdc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-cori-56640cdc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intriguing-8d1b5618.webp', '[\"fascinating\", \"captivating\", \"compelling\"]', '[\"boring\", \"dull\", \"uninteresting\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intriguing idea\", \"meaning\": \"ý tưởng hấp dẫn, thú vị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intriguing proposal\", \"meaning\": \"đề xuất gợi tò mò\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find something intriguing\", \"meaning\": \"thấy điều gì đó thú vị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"interesting\", \"note_vi\": \"interesting là thú vị thông thường, intriguing gợi thêm sự bí ẩn, tò mò sâu hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intrigue\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intrigue\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"intriguingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-cori-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru0-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru5-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru6-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru10-56640cdc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru9-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru3-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru7-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru8-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-aru2-56640cdc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-ljspeech-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt408-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt138-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt624-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt396-56640cdc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt498-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt132-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt288-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt42-56640cdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intriguing-lt90-56640cdc.mp3\"]}}', 'Intriguing mạnh hơn interesting, gợi cảm giác muốn khám phá thêm — dùng khi khen ý tưởng độc đáo.', 'business', 1, 29),
('4c3c0f41-cc0c-5c34-9590-7ffa94f757d2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'countryside', 'UK: /ˈkʌntrisaɪd/ | US: /ˈkʌntrisaɪd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nông thôn', 'land outside of towns and cities, consisting of fields, farms, and natural scenery', 'They decided to move to the quiet countryside.', 'Họ quyết định chuyển đến vùng nông thôn yên tĩnh.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate retreat was held at a quiet resort in the countryside.\", \"vi\": \"Kỳ nghỉ dưỡng của công ty được tổ chức tại một khu nghỉ dưỡng yên tĩnh ở vùng nông thôn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-ljspeech-82bf7e0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-cori-82bf7e0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/countryside-a249481e.webp', '[\"rural area\", \"country\", \"provinces\"]', '[\"city\", \"urban area\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in the countryside\", \"meaning\": \"ở vùng nông thôn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scenic countryside\", \"meaning\": \"vùng nông thôn có cảnh đẹp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"country\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-cori-82bf7e0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru0-82bf7e0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru5-82bf7e0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru6-82bf7e0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru10-82bf7e0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru9-82bf7e0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru3-82bf7e0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru7-82bf7e0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru8-82bf7e0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/countryside-aru2-82bf7e0d.mp3\"]},