('bf3b0bd0-bb37-5ae3-94b4-8f2574619fcd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'matriarchy', '/ˈmeɪtriɑːki/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống xã hội mà phụ nữ nắm giữ quyền lực và vai trò lãnh đạo.', 'a social system where females hold the main power and leadership roles.', 'Some ancient civilizations are believed to have lived under a matriarchy.', 'Một số nền văn minh cổ đại được cho là đã sống dưới chế độ mẫu hệ.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s unique matriarchy surprised foreign investors during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống nữ quyền độc đáo của công ty làm kinh ngạc các nhà đầu tư nước ngoài trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-ljspeech-611f69e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-cori-611f69e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/matriarchy-1a7c8ed7.webp', NULL, '[\"patriarchy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ancient matriarchy\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ mẫu hệ cổ đại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"establish a matriarchy\", \"meaning\": \"thiết lập chế độ mẫu hệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"matriarchy system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống mẫu hệ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"patriarchy\", \"note_vi\": \"patriarchy là cha quyền, matriarchy là mẫu quyền\"}, {\"word\": \"matriarch\", \"note_vi\": \"matriarch là nữ trưởng tộc, không phải hệ thống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"matriarch\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"matriarchal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-cori-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru0-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru5-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru6-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru10-611f69e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru9-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru3-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru7-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru8-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-aru2-611f69e7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-ljspeech-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt408-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt138-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt624-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt396-611f69e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt498-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt132-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt288-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt42-611f69e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/matriarchy-lt90-611f69e7.mp3\"]}}', 'Matriarchy là chế độ nữ quyền, trái nghĩa với patriarchy (nam quyền).', 'other', 1, 1),
('5f521006-2324-5e2c-b657-26cb9f053736', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'dental', 'UK: /ˈden.təl/ | US: /ˈden.t̬əl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thuộc về răng', 'Relating to or connected with the care and medical treatment of teeth.', 'She scheduled a dental appointment for a check-up.', 'Cô ấy đã đặt lịch hẹn nha khoa để kiểm tra tổng quát.', '{\"en\": \"The comprehensive employee benefit package includes full medical and dental insurance.\", \"vi\": \"Gói phúc lợi nhân viên toàn diện bao gồm bảo hiểm y tế và nha khoa đầy đủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-ljspeech-407d3b02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-cori-407d3b02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dental-8847c6ef.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dental insurance\", \"meaning\": \"bảo hiểm nha khoa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dental checkup\", \"meaning\": \"khám răng định kỳ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dentist\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dentistry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-cori-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru0-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru5-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru6-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru10-407d3b02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru9-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru3-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru7-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru8-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-aru2-407d3b02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-ljspeech-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt408-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt138-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt624-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt396-407d3b02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt498-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt132-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt288-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt42-407d3b02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dental-lt90-407d3b02.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong phần thông tin bảo hiểm/phúc lợi công ty: \'dental insurance\' / \'dental coverage\'.', 'personnel', 1, 2),
('3180088b-75be-52f1-ae72-7788d11055f5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'simile', '/ˈsɪməli/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Biện pháp tu từ so sánh hai vật khác nhau bằng \"like\" hoặc \"as\".', 'an expression comparing one thing with another using words such as like or as.', 'The poet used a beautiful simile, describing the moon as \"a silver coin in the dark sky.\"', 'Nhà thơ đã sử dụng một phép so sánh tuyệt đẹp, miêu tả mặt trăng như \"một đồng xu bạc trên bầu trời tối.\"', '{\"en\": \"The speaker used an effective simile to compare market competition to a marathon race.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả đã sử dụng một phép so sánh hiệu quả để so sánh sự cạnh tranh thị trường với một cuộc đua marathon.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-ljspeech-47271566.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-cori-47271566.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/simile-8b65645b.webp', '[\"comparison\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"use a simile\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng phép so sánh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"metaphor\", \"note_vi\": \"ẩn dụ (so sánh ngầm, không dùng từ like hoặc as)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-cori-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru0-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru5-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru6-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru10-47271566.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru9-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru3-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru7-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru8-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-aru2-47271566.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-ljspeech-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt408-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt138-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt624-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt396-47271566.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt498-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt132-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt288-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt42-47271566.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simile-lt90-47271566.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với metaphor: simile luôn dùng \'like\' hoặc \'as\' để so sánh.', 'academic', 1, 3),
('b66d3aae-9d8e-5ad5-9f26-2b913ff6ed84', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'bouquet', 'UK: /buˈkeɪ/ | US: /buˈkeɪ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'bó hoa', 'An arrangement of fresh flowers that are artistically bound together to be given as a gift.', 'She received a beautiful bouquet of roses.', 'Cô ấy đã nhận được một bó hoa hồng đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The staff presented a bouquet of flowers to Ms. Davis on her retirement day.\", \"vi\": \"Tập thể nhân viên đã tặng một bó hoa cho bà Davis vào ngày bà nghỉ hưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-ljspeech-03156b6e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-cori-03156b6e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bouquet-6193fbf6.webp', '[\"posy\", \"flower arrangement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a bouquet of flowers\", \"meaning\": \"một bó hoa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"present a bouquet\", \"meaning\": \"trao tặng bó hoa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"banquet\", \"note_vi\": \"banquet là tiệc lớn/yến tiệc, còn bouquet là bó hoa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-cori-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru0-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru5-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru6-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru10-03156b6e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru9-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru3-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru7-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru8-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-aru2-03156b6e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-ljspeech-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt408-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt138-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt624-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt396-03156b6e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt498-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt132-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt288-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt42-03156b6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bouquet-lt90-03156b6e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ mượn tiếng Pháp có phát âm /buˈkeɪ/ (âm \'t\' bị câm).', 'events', 1, 4),
('dc6ec9c6-6f25-5a60-9c0e-0e7bc7ebf8e1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'delirious', '/dɪˈlɪriəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Mê sảng, nói hoặc hành động không bình thường do bệnh tật hoặc sốt cao.', 'unable to think or speak clearly because of fever or mental confusion.', 'The patient became delirious with a high fever and started talking nonsense.', 'Bệnh nhân bị sốt cao đến mê sảng và bắt đầu nói linh tinh.', '{\"en\": \"The patient was delirious when admitted to the clinic, making it hard to get details.\", \"vi\": \"Bệnh nhân đã mê sảng khi nhập viện phòng khám, khiến việc lấy thông tin chi tiết gặp khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-ljspeech-cc24b097.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-cori-cc24b097.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delirious-18d7474e.webp', '[\"feverish\", \"hallucinating\", \"ecstatic\"]', '[\"lucid\", \"sane\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"delirious with fever\", \"meaning\": \"mê sảng vì sốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delirious joy\", \"meaning\": \"vui mừng đến phát điên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"delicious\", \"note_vi\": \"ngon miệng, phát âm và viết gần giống delirious\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"delirium\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"deliriously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-cori-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru0-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru5-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru6-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru10-cc24b097.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru9-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru3-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru7-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru8-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-aru2-cc24b097.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-ljspeech-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt408-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt138-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt624-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt396-cc24b097.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt498-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt132-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt288-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt42-cc24b097.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delirious-lt90-cc24b097.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa mê sảng do bệnh, từ này còn nghĩa bóng là cực kỳ phấn khích (delirious with joy).', 'health', 1, 5),
('5f9323de-5f39-57be-b750-9079c7c94c1a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'shuttle', 'UK: /ˈʃʌtl/ | US: /ˈʃʌt̮l/', 'B2', 'noun', 'xe đưa đón', 'A vehicle that travels back and forth regularly between two fixed locations.', 'The hotel provides a complimentary shuttle to the airport.', 'Khách sạn cung cấp dịch vụ xe đưa đón miễn phí ra sân bay.', '{\"en\": \"Complimentary shuttle service to the airport is available every thirty minutes.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ xe đưa đón miễn phí ra sân bay có sẵn mỗi 30 phút một chuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-ljspeech-87648e0f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-cori-87648e0f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shuttle-d57fed30.webp', '[\"transit vehicle\", \"transfer bus\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shuttle bus\", \"meaning\": \"xe buýt đưa đón tuyến cố định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shuttle service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ xe đưa đón\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"subway\", \"note_vi\": \"subway là tàu điện ngầm, khác với shuttle là phương tiện đưa đón qua lại giữa hai điểm cố định\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shuttle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-cori-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru0-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru5-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru6-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru10-87648e0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru9-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru3-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru7-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru8-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-aru2-87648e0f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-ljspeech-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt408-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt138-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt624-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt396-87648e0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt498-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt132-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt288-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt42-87648e0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuttle-lt90-87648e0f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường kết hợp thành cụm \'shuttle bus\' hoặc \'shuttle service\' phục vụ việc di chuyển sân bay, khách sạn.', 'travel', 1, 6),
('d4038f9c-3d1d-54da-9062-0edc72922e4c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'consent', '/kənˈsent/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự cho phép hoặc chấp thuận một điều gì đó.', 'permission or agreement for something to happen or for someone to do something.', 'The doctor cannot perform the operation without written consent from the patient.', 'Bác sĩ không thể thực hiện phẫu thuật nếu không có sự đồng ý bằng văn bản từ bệnh nhân.', '{\"en\": \"We cannot publish the survey results without the written consent of all participants.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi không thể công bố kết quả khảo sát nếu không có sự đồng ý bằng văn bản của tất cả những người tham gia.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-ljspeech-15b61788.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-cori-15b61788.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consent-1fcf55bd.webp', '[\"agreement\", \"permission\", \"approval\"]', '[\"disagreement\", \"refusal\", \"dissent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"written consent\", \"meaning\": \"sự đồng ý bằng văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mutual consent\", \"meaning\": \"sự đồng thuận từ hai phía\"}, {\"phrase\": \"give consent\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra sự chấp thuận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"content\", \"note_vi\": \"content là nội dung hoặc hài lòng, còn consent là sự đồng ý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"consent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"consensual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-cori-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru0-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru5-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru6-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru10-15b61788.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru9-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru3-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru7-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru8-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-aru2-15b61788.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-ljspeech-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt408-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt138-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt624-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt396-15b61788.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt498-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt132-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt288-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt42-15b61788.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consent-lt90-15b61788.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'written consent\' (sự đồng ý bằng văn bản) rất hay gặp trong hợp đồng.', 'law', 1, 7),
('c2c38172-46e1-528a-b146-c02bd27a4fc7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'instantly', '/ˈɪnstəntli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Ngay lập tức, tức thì.', 'happening or done at once without any delay or waiting time in between events.', 'She recognized him instantly, even after all those years.', 'Cô ấy nhận ra anh ta ngay lập tức, dù đã nhiều năm trôi qua.', '{\"en\": \"The new software updates will instantly improve the processing speed of all company computers today.\", \"vi\": \"Các bản cập nhật phần mềm mới sẽ cải thiện ngay lập tức tốc độ xử lý của tất cả máy tính công ty hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-ljspeech-083814db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-cori-083814db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/instantly-3bd6db9b.webp', '[\"immediately\", \"promptly\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"instantly recognizable\", \"meaning\": \"có thể nhận ra ngay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"instantly available\", \"meaning\": \"có sẵn ngay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"instant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-cori-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru0-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru5-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru6-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru10-083814db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru9-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru3-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru7-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru8-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-aru2-083814db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-ljspeech-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt408-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt138-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt624-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt396-083814db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt498-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt132-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt288-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt42-083814db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instantly-lt90-083814db.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ chỉ thời gian, thường đứng trước động từ hoặc tính từ.', 'technology', 1, 8),
('404613ab-2668-5611-ad36-1d91cfdaad9d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'tetanus', '/ˈtetnəs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bệnh uốn ván.', 'a serious bacterial infection that causes muscle stiffness and spasms.', 'It\'s important to get a tetanus shot if you get a deep cut.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải tiêm vắc xin uốn ván nếu bạn bị vết cắt sâu.', '{\"en\": \"The hr department requires a tetanus vaccine for new factory workers.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự yêu cầu tiêm vắc-xin uốn ván cho công nhân mới trong nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-ljspeech-7352f8bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-cori-7352f8bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tetanus-d5b2c503.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tetanus shot\", \"meaning\": \"mũi tiêm uốn ván\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tetanus vaccine\", \"meaning\": \"vắc-xin uốn ván\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tennis\", \"note_vi\": \"tetanus phát âm gần tennis nhưng nghĩa khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tetanic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-cori-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru0-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru5-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru6-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru10-7352f8bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru9-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru3-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru7-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru8-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-aru2-7352f8bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-ljspeech-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt408-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt138-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt624-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt396-7352f8bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt498-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt132-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt288-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt42-7352f8bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tetanus-lt90-7352f8bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Tetanus là bệnh nhiễm trùng, nhớ đi tiêm khi bị vết thương sâu.', 'health', 1, 9),
('9ff5392e-c244-5090-9643-9db8f45e9180', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'compulsory', '/kəmˈpʌlsəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Bắt buộc phải làm hoặc có.', 'must be done because of a law or a particular rule.', 'Attending the morning meeting is compulsory for all team members.', 'Việc tham dự cuộc họp sáng là bắt buộc đối với tất cả thành viên trong nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"Safety training is compulsory for all new staff before starting work at the factory.\", \"vi\": \"Huấn luyện an toàn là bắt buộc đối với tất cả nhân viên mới trước khi bắt đầu làm việc tại nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-ljspeech-c66a1fd2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-cori-c66a1fd2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compulsory-ce9f95b2.webp', '[\"mandatory\", \"obligatory\", \"required\"]', '[\"optional\", \"voluntary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"compulsory education\", \"meaning\": \"giáo dục bắt buộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compulsory attendance\", \"meaning\": \"sự tham dự bắt buộc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compulsive\", \"note_vi\": \"Compulsive là do ham muốn khó kiểm soát, không phải do luật bắt buộc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"compulsion\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compel\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-cori-c66a1fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-aru0-c66a1fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-aru5-c66a1fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-aru6-c66a1fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-aru10-c66a1fd2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-aru9-c66a1fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compulsory-aru3-c66a1fd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v