('ea351c19-bc05-595e-9ea1-2d151668c905', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'compass', '/ˈkʌmpəs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Dụng cụ dùng để xác định hướng, thường có kim chỉ Bắc.', 'a device with a magnetic needle that shows the direction of north.', 'Hikers always carry a map and a compass to navigate through the wilderness.', 'Những người đi bộ đường dài luôn mang theo bản đồ và la bàn để định hướng trong vùng hoang dã.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics team uses a digital compass to ensure the delivery vehicles follow the correct routes.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ hậu cần sử dụng la bàn kỹ thuật số để đảm bảo các phương tiện giao hàng đi đúng lộ trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-ljspeech-9d0f85fe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-cori-9d0f85fe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compass-f706ed66.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"magnetic compass\", \"meaning\": \"la bàn từ tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use a compass\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng la bàn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-cori-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru0-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru5-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru6-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru10-9d0f85fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru9-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru3-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru7-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru8-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-aru2-9d0f85fe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-ljspeech-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt408-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt138-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt624-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt396-9d0f85fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt498-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt132-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt288-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt42-9d0f85fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compass-lt90-9d0f85fe.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa la bàn, còn có nghĩa là compa vẽ hình tròn.', 'travel', 1, 17),
('6e89e4ce-f56d-5841-af91-10937e1c15ef', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'well read', '/wel red/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Đọc nhiều sách, có kiến thức rộng.', 'having learned a lot of information about different subjects by reading a large number of books.', 'A well-read person usually has a rich vocabulary and a broad perspective.', 'Một người đọc nhiều sách thường có vốn từ vựng phong phú và một cái nhìn rộng.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring manager was impressed by the well-read candidate who demonstrated extensive knowledge of global markets.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tuyển dụng rất ấn tượng với ứng viên uyên bác, người đã thể hiện kiến thức sâu rộng về thị trường toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-ljspeech-676889c6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-cori-676889c6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/well-read-0e526a0b.webp', '[\"knowledgeable\", \"literate\", \"educated\"]', '[\"ignorant\", \"uneducated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly well-read\", \"meaning\": \"rất uyên bác, đọc rất nhiều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a well-read person\", \"meaning\": \"một người đọc nhiều sách\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-cori-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru0-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru5-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru6-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru10-676889c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru9-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru3-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru7-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru8-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-aru2-676889c6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-ljspeech-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt408-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt138-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt624-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt396-676889c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt498-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt132-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt288-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt42-676889c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/well-read-lt90-676889c6.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường viết có dấu gạch nối (well-read) khi đứng trước danh từ.', 'hr', 1, 18),
('b0602ff5-148c-5458-8a7d-28ce10fe55fc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'thrilling', '/ˈθrɪlɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây ra cảm giác phấn khích, hồi hộp mạnh mẽ.', 'causing a feeling of great excitement and pleasure or intense interest.', 'It was a thrilling experience to go skydiving for the first time.', 'Đó là một trải nghiệm cực kỳ phấn khích khi lần đầu tiên nhảy dù.', '{\"en\": \"It was a thrilling opportunity to present our marketing strategy to the company board members.\", \"vi\": \"Đó là một cơ hội đầy phấn khích khi được trình bày chiến lược tiếp thị của chúng tôi với các thành viên hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-ljspeech-e28776f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-cori-e28776f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thrilling-17090ecb.webp', '[\"exciting\", \"exhilarating\"]', '[\"boring\", \"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thrilling experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm thú vị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thrilling victory\", \"meaning\": \"chiến thắng đầy kịch tính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thrill\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"thrill\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-cori-e28776f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-aru0-e28776f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-aru5-e28776f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-aru6-e28776f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-aru10-e28776f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-aru9-e28776f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-aru3-e28776f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-aru7-e28776f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thrilling-ar