('0a291d4b-756e-565a-9f21-4cca6e751b59', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'beta blocker', '/biːtə blɒkə/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Loại thuốc dùng để điều trị huyết áp cao, đau thắt ngực.', 'a type of medicine used to lower blood pressure and treat heart conditions.', 'Taking a daily beta blocker helped reduce the patient\'s high blood pressure effectively.', 'Uống thuốc chẹn beta hàng ngày đã giúp giảm huyết áp cao của bệnh nhân một cách hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The employee health clinic provides a beta blocker prescription to manage high blood pressure.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám sức khỏe nhân viên cung cấp đơn thuốc chẹn beta để kiểm soát huyết áp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-ljspeech-52796ff8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-cori-52796ff8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beta-blocker-d0d32632.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prescribe a beta blocker\", \"meaning\": \"kê đơn thuốc chẹn beta\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a beta blocker\", \"meaning\": \"uống thuốc chẹn beta\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-cori-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru0-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru5-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru6-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru10-52796ff8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru9-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru3-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru7-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru8-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-aru2-52796ff8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-ljspeech-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt408-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt138-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt624-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt396-52796ff8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt498-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt132-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt288-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt42-52796ff8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beta-blocker-lt90-52796ff8.mp3\"]}}', 'Beta blocker là thuốc chẹn beta, dùng trong y khoa để hạ huyết áp.', 'health', 1, 22),
('2fa6f100-5cc7-5124-a0a5-df370e1da03b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'observant', '/əbˈzɜːvənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng nhận thấy mọi thứ một cách nhanh chóng, tinh ý.', 'quick to notice and pay attention to things around you, having sharp awareness.', 'She is very observant and noticed the small detail nobody else did.', 'Cô ấy rất tinh ý và đã nhận ra chi tiết nhỏ mà không ai khác thấy.', '{\"en\": \"An observant quality inspector can detect product defects before they reach the customer.\", \"vi\": \"Một kiểm tra viên chất lượng tinh ý có thể phát hiện lỗi sản phẩm trước khi đến tay khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-ljspeech-954ab07f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-cori-954ab07f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/observant-8ab85672.webp', '[\"perceptive\", \"attentive\", \"sharp\"]', '[\"inattentive\", \"oblivious\", \"unaware\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly observant\", \"meaning\": \"rất tinh ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"observant eye\", \"meaning\": \"con mắt tinh tường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keen and observant\", \"meaning\": \"sắc bén và tinh ý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"observatory\", \"note_vi\": \"observatory là đài quan sát thiên văn, không phải tính từ mô tả người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"observe\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"observation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"observer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"observantly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-cori-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru0-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru5-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru6-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru10-954ab07f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru9-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru3-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru7-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru8-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-aru2-954ab07f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-ljspeech-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt408-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt138-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt624-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt396-954ab07f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt498-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt132-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt288-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt42-954ab07f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observant-lt90-954ab07f.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ gốc từ \'observe\' (quan sát); observant = người có thói quen quan sát kỹ lưỡng.', 'manufacturing', 1, 23),
('7e26ff5d-c169-5b28-8234-bd2f9f1a6c08', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'renter', 'UK: /ˈrɛntə/ | US: /ˈrɛntər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'người thuê nhà/tài sản', 'A person who pays money regularly to live in or use property belonging to someone else.', 'Renters must sign a lease agreement before moving in.', 'Người thuê nhà phải ký hợp đồng thuê trước khi chuyển vào.', '{\"en\": \"The property owner requires all new renters to pay a security deposit.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ sở hữu bất động sản yêu cầu tất cả người thuê nhà mới phải đặt cọc an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-ljspeech-0c7113be.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-cori-0c7113be.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/renter-5f554455.webp', '[\"tenant\", \"lessee\", \"occupant\"]', '[\"landlord\", \"lessor\", \"owner\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prospective renter\", \"meaning\": \"người thuê tiềm năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"apartment renter\", \"meaning\": \"người thuê căn hộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"owner\", \"note_vi\": \"owner là chủ sở hữu, renter là người thuê lại\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-cori-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru0-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru5-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru6-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru10-0c7113be.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru9-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru3-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru7-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru8-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-aru2-0c7113be.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-ljspeech-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt408-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt138-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt624-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt396-0c7113be.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt498-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt132-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt288-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt42-0c7113be.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renter-lt90-0c7113be.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ người trả tiền để thuê nhà hoặc tài sản. Phân biệt với landlord (chủ nhà).', 'real estate', 1, 24),
('32a203e4-7ead-5b4b-b165-9352d734e3e4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'beetle', '/ˈbiːtl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loài côn trùng có cánh cứng, thường sống dưới đất hoặc trên cây.', 'an insect with a hard shell-like back and wings.', 'The gardener discovered a rare beetle resting under the damp tree bark.', 'Người làm vườn đã phát hiện một con bọ cánh cứng hiếm gặp đang đậu dưới vỏ cây ẩm ướt.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel garden suffered damage from a rare type of black beetle last summer.\", \"vi\": \"Khu vườn của khách sạn đã bị thiệt hại do một loại bọ cánh cứng màu đen quý hiếm vào mùa hè năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-ljspeech-23668cd2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-cori-23668cd2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beetle-0f9cb69c.webp', '[\"bug\", \"insect\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dung beetle\", \"meaning\": \"bọ hung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stag beetle\", \"meaning\": \"bọ cánh cứng sừng hươu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"beatle\", \"note_vi\": \"Beatle viết hoa là thành viên ban nhạc The Beatles, phát âm giống nhau\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-cori-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru0-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru5-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru6-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru10-23668cd2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru9-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru3-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru7-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru8-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-aru2-23668cd2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-ljspeech-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt408-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt138-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt624-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt396-23668cd2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt498-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt132-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt288-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt42-23668cd2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beetle-lt90-23668cd2.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn cách viết với ban nhạc huyền thoại \'The Beatles\'.', 'nature', 1, 25),
('1705d62a-994a-5e3d-9461-229db77a2980', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'assured', '/əˈʃʊəd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tự tin, chắc chắn về bản thân hoặc điều gì đó.', 'feeling very sure and confident about your own abilities or a specific situation.', 'Her assured tone convinced everyone that she knew what she was talking about.', 'Giọng điệu tự tin của cô ấy đã thuyết phục mọi người rằng cô ấy biết mình đang nói về điều gì.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave an assured presentation that convinced the investors to fund the project.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã có một bài thuyết trình đầy tự tin thuyết phục các nhà đầu tư rót vốn vào dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-ljspeech-019dc1d2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-cori-019dc1d2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assured-e6f6ddb4.webp', '[\"confident\", \"certain\"]', '[\"hesitant\", \"uncertain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"assured manner\", \"meaning\": \"phong thái tự tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assured tone\", \"meaning\": \"giọng điệu chắc chắn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assure\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assurance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-cori-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru0-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru5-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru6-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru10-019dc1d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru9-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru3-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru7-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru8-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-aru2-019dc1d2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-ljspeech-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt408-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt138-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt624-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt396-019dc1d2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt498-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt132-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt288-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt42-019dc1d2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assured-lt90-019dc1d2.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen ngợi phong thái làm việc chuyên nghiệp.', 'office', 1, 26),
('5bcdcfdc-a0f5-51cd-8052-bc13cfe1b1b0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'inane', '/ɪˈneɪn/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thiếu ý nghĩa, ngu ngốc hoặc vô vị.', 'lacking sense or meaning; silly and without value.', 'I can\'t believe they spent hours discussing such an inane topic.', 'Tôi không thể tin họ đã dành hàng giờ để thảo luận về một chủ đề ngớ ngẩn như vậy.', '{\"en\": \"The meeting was delayed by an inane argument about office supplies.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp bị trì hoãn bởi một cuộc tranh luận vô nghĩa về đồ dùng văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-ljspeech-8ce376b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-cori-8ce376b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inane-08176928.webp', '[\"silly\", \"pointless\", \"meaningless\"]', '[\"meaningful\", \"sensible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inane comment\", \"meaning\": \"bình luận vô nghĩa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inane topic\", \"meaning\": \"chủ đề nhảm nhí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inane conversation\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc trò chuyện vô vị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insane\", \"note_vi\": \"insane là điên rồ, mạnh hơn và khác nghĩa vô nghĩa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inanity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"inanely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-cori-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru0-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru5-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru6-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru10-8ce376b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru9-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru3-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru7-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru8-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-aru2-8ce376b9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-ljspeech-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt408-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt138-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt624-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt396-8ce376b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt498-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt132-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt288-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt42-8ce376b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inane-lt90-8ce376b9.mp3\"]}}', 'Inane phát âm là /ɪˈneɪn/, đừng nhầm với insane (điên).', 'office', 1, 27),
('b76672a7-a6a4-54c4-a3cf-1dd9f97aaddd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'civil engineering', '/ˈsɪv.əl ˌɛn.dʒɪˈnɪə.rɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Ngành kỹ thuật thiết kế và xây dựng cơ sở hạ tầng công cộng.', 'the study or work of designing and building public structures like roads and bridges.', 'Bridges, roads, and dams are typical projects in civil engineering.', 'Cầu, đường và đập là những dự án điển hình trong kỹ thuật xây dựng dân dụng.', '{\"en\": \"The firm hired a new specialist to oversee several civil engineering projects next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một chuyên gia mới để giám sát một số dự án kỹ thuật dân dụng vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-ljspeech-79c08b29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-cori-79c08b29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/civil-engineering-ad6f0c6d.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"civil engineering project\", \"meaning\": \"dự án kỹ thuật dân dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"degree in civil engineering\", \"meaning\": \"bằng kỹ sư xây dựng/dân dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"architecture\", \"note_vi\": \"Architecture thiên về thiết kế thẩm mỹ tòa nhà, civil engineering thiên về kết cấu hạ tầng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"civil engineer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-cori-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru0-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru5-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru6-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru10-79c08b29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru9-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru3-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru7-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru8-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-aru2-79c08b29.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-ljspeech-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt408-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt138-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt624-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt396-79c08b29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt498-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt132-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt288-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt42-79c08b29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-engineering-lt90-79c08b29.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm này chỉ ngành kỹ thuật thiết kế và xây dựng hạ tầng công cộng như cầu đường, đập nước.', 'manufacturing', 1, 28),
('331a2cda-b75e-5b38-8439-d00f6e8b0833', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '2ad9d6a8-ad71-59d2-b362-7725be1e146d', '4d6545b7-c04e-5567-b286-dee42a6d4bd5', 'blow', '/bləʊ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một cú đánh mạnh hoặc một sự kiện gây sốc.', 'a hard hit, or a sudden event that causes great shock or disappointment.', 'The unexpected news was a real blow to his confidence.', 'Tin tức bất ngờ là một cú sốc lớn đối với sự tự tin của anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"Losing the major contract was a serious blow to the company\'s annual revenue.\", \"vi\": \"Mất hợp đồng lớn là một đòn giáng nặng nề vào doanh thu hàng năm của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-ljspeech-a6ffe720.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-cori-a6ffe720.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blow-a5010496.webp', '[\"shock\", \"setback\", \"hit\"]', '[\"boost\", \"relief\", \"benefit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a blow to\", \"meaning\": \"một đòn giáng vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deal a blow\", \"meaning\": \"giáng một đòn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a severe blow\", \"meaning\": \"một cú sốc nghiêm trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flow\", \"note_vi\": \"flow nghĩa là dòng chảy, chỉ giống vần, khác nghĩa hoàn toàn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"blow\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"blown\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-cori-a6ffe720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-aru0-a6ffe720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-aru5-a6ffe720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-aru6-a6ffe720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-aru10-a6ffe720.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-aru9-a6ffe720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-aru3-a6ffe720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blow-aru7-a6ffe720.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati