('12bf656a-92e8-5510-95cc-3879cdb89af5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '309a94da-cb93-5a6f-bbde-041f31e8aec9', 'f1eb58e9-be93-5642-ac8b-a8c82e28b96e', 'spectroscope', '/ˈspektrəskəʊp/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Dụng cụ phân tích ánh sáng thành các thành phần màu sắc hoặc bước sóng.', 'a scientific instrument that separates light into its different colors or wavelengths for analysis.', 'Scientists use a spectroscope to study the chemical composition of stars.', 'Các nhà khoa học dùng kính quang phổ để nghiên cứu thành phần hóa học của các vì sao.', '{\"en\": \"The laboratory ordered a new spectroscope to analyze material samples for quality control.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng thí nghiệm đã đặt mua một máy quang phổ mới để phân tích mẫu vật liệu nhằm kiểm soát chất lượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-ljspeech-59f8a1a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-cori-59f8a1a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spectroscope-19295f61.webp', '[\"spectrometer\", \"spectroscopy device\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"use a spectroscope\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng máy quang phổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spectroscope analysis\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích bằng máy quang phổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"optical spectroscope\", \"meaning\": \"máy quang phổ quang học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spectrometer\", \"note_vi\": \"spectrometer đo chính xác bước sóng; spectroscope chỉ quan sát phổ ánh sáng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spectroscopy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"spectroscopic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spectrum\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-cori-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru0-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru5-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru6-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru10-59f8a1a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru9-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru3-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru7-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru8-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-aru2-59f8a1a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-ljspeech-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt408-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt138-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt624-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt396-59f8a1a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt498-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt132-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt288-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt42-59f8a1a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectroscope-lt90-59f8a1a7.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ hiếm gặp trong TOEIC; nhớ gốc \'spectrum\' (phổ) + \'scope\' (quan sát).', 'technology', 1, 28),
('db83782e-b519-5af3-8e07-4d2d7299b980', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '309a94da-cb93-5a6f-bbde-041f31e8aec9', 'f1eb58e9-be93-5642-ac8b-a8c82e28b96e', 'encrypt', '/ɪnˈkrɪpt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Biến đổi thông tin thành mã để bảo mật, chỉ người có khóa mới đọc được.', 'to change information into a secret code to prevent unauthorized people from reading it.', 'It\'s important to encrypt your personal data when sending it over the internet.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải mã hóa dữ liệu cá nhân của bạn khi gửi qua internet.', '{\"en\": \"Our company uses advanced software to encrypt all sensitive client information before sending emails.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi sử dụng phần mềm tiên tiến để mã hóa mọi thông tin khách hàng nhạy cảm trước khi gửi email.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-ljspeech-dc65dfc0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-cori-dc65dfc0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/encrypt-81f8b741.webp', '[\"encode\", \"scramble\"]', '[\"decrypt\", \"decode\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"encrypt data\", \"meaning\": \"mã hóa dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"encrypt files\", \"meaning\": \"mã hóa tập tin\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"encryption\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-cori-dc65dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-aru0-dc65dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-aru5-dc65dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-aru6-dc65dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-aru10-dc65dfc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-aru9-dc65dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-aru3-dc65dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-aru7-dc65dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encrypt-aru8-dc65dfc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob