('f4c0d43a-8dd0-553c-a06c-12208b674e06', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'herd', '/hɜːd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm lớn động vật cùng loài sống và di chuyển cùng nhau.', 'a large group of animals of the same type that live and feed together naturally.', 'A large herd of elephants migrated across the savanna.', 'Một bầy voi lớn di cư qua thảo nguyên.', '{\"en\": \"The documentary showed a large herd of cattle grazing peacefully in the vast open field.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phim tài liệu cho thấy một đàn gia súc lớn đang gặm cỏ bình yên trên cánh đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-ljspeech-dffdaa3f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-cori-dffdaa3f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/herd-53fece32.webp', '[\"group\", \"flock\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"herd of cattle\", \"meaning\": \"đàn gia súc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"herd of sheep\", \"meaning\": \"đàn cừu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heard\", \"note_vi\": \"Quá khứ của \\\"hear\\\", phát âm giống hệt \\\"herd\\\".\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-cori-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru0-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru5-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru6-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru10-dffdaa3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru9-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru3-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru7-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru8-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-aru2-dffdaa3f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-ljspeech-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt408-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt138-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt624-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt396-dffdaa3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt498-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt132-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt288-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt42-dffdaa3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/herd-lt90-dffdaa3f.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với \"heard\" (quá khứ của \"hear\") vì phát âm giống hệt nhau.', 'nature', 1, 6),
('13db91c4-00f0-54cb-9235-d00eaedecec0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'infrastructure', '/ˈɪnfrəstrʌktʃə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống các công trình và dịch vụ cơ bản cần thiết cho một quốc gia hoặc khu vực hoạt động.', 'the basic systems and services that are necessary for a country or an organization to run smoothly.', 'The government plans to invest heavily in improving the country\'s infrastructure.', 'Chính phủ có kế hoạch đầu tư mạnh vào việc cải thiện cơ sở hạ tầng của đất nước.', '{\"en\": \"The city council approved a new budget to upgrade the local transportation infrastructure this year.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng thành phố đã phê duyệt ngân sách mới để nâng cấp cơ sở hạ tầng giao thông địa phương trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-ljspeech-35f8b746.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-cori-35f8b746.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infrastructure-0c38be13.webp', '[\"framework\", \"base\", \"foundation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"transport infrastructure\", \"meaning\": \"cơ sở hạ tầng giao thông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"IT infrastructure\", \"meaning\": \"cơ sở hạ tầng công nghệ thông tin\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"infrastructural\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-cori-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru0-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru5-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru6-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru10-35f8b746.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru9-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru3-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru7-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru8-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-aru2-35f8b746.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-ljspeech-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt408-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt138-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt624-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt396-35f8b746.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt498-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt132-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt288-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt42-35f8b746.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infrastructure-lt90-35f8b746.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này không đếm được, không dùng số nhiều \'infrastructures\'.', 'business', 1, 7),
('f54c0c8c-b72f-5eb0-aa55-bd5e2afdfad8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'urbanity', '/ɜːˈbænəti/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự lịch sự, tinh tế và phong thái tao nhã của người thành thị.', 'polite and confident behavior that is typical of people who live in cities.', 'His urbanity and wit made him a popular guest at social gatherings.', 'Sự lịch thiệp và hóm hỉnh của anh ấy khiến anh ấy trở thành một vị khách được yêu thích trong các buổi gặp mặt xã hội.', '{\"en\": \"The manager\'s natural urbanity helped calm the angry clients during the difficult negotiation.\", \"vi\": \"Sự lịch thiệp tự nhiên của người quản lý đã giúp làm dịu những khách hàng giận dữ trong cuộc đàm phán khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-ljspeech-1d84d97c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-cori-1d84d97c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/urbanity-5703ffa4.webp', '[\"sophistication\", \"politeness\", \"suavity\"]', '[\"rudeness\", \"vulgarity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"natural urbanity\", \"meaning\": \"sự lịch thiệp tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"polish and urbanity\", \"meaning\": \"sự bóng bẩy và lịch thiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"urbanization\", \"note_vi\": \"urbanization là sự đô thị hóa, còn urbanity là sự lịch thiệp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"urban\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"urbane\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-cori-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru0-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru5-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru6-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru10-1d84d97c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru9-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru3-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru7-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru8-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-aru2-1d84d97c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-ljspeech-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt408-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt138-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt624-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt396-1d84d97c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt498-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt132-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt288-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt42-1d84d97c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/urbanity-lt90-1d84d97c.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với urbanization (sự đô thị hóa).', 'hr', 1, 8),
('1d338b57-2e73-5964-8d51-b8178c068117', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'diminutive', '/dɪˈmɪnjətɪv/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất nhỏ, bé xíu.', 'extremely small in size or very short compared to what is expected.', 'Despite her diminutive size, the gymnast displayed incredible strength and agility.', 'Mặc dù có vóc dáng nhỏ bé, nữ vận động viên thể dục dụng cụ đã thể hiện sức mạnh và sự nhanh nhẹn đáng kinh ngạc.', '{\"en\": \"Despite his diminutive stature, the CEO commanded respect from everyone in the large boardroom.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù vóc dáng nhỏ bé, vị CEO vẫn nhận được sự tôn trọng từ mọi người trong phòng họp lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-ljspeech-260c6dd6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-cori-260c6dd6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diminutive-39d4b28b.webp', '[\"tiny\", \"small\"]', '[\"huge\", \"giant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"diminutive size\", \"meaning\": \"kích thước nhỏ bé\"}, {\"phrase\": \"diminutive figure\", \"meaning\": \"dáng người nhỏ nhắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"diminish\", \"note_vi\": \"Diminish là động từ (giảm bớt), diminutive là tính từ (nhỏ bé).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"diminish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-cori-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru0-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru5-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru6-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru10-260c6dd6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru9-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru3-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru7-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru8-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-aru2-260c6dd6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-ljspeech-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt408-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt138-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt624-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt396-260c6dd6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt498-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt132-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt288-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt42-260c6dd6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminutive-lt90-260c6dd6.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để miêu tả kích thước một cách trang trọng.', 'other', 1, 9),
('c8d1d2aa-0e03-5b19-9e03-812c6621d886', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'cacophonous', '/kəˈkɒfənəs/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Tạo ra âm thanh hỗn độn, ồn ào và khó chịu.', 'having an unpleasant, loud, and mixture of sounds that do not go together.', 'The cacophonous noise from the construction site made it hard to concentrate.', 'Tiếng ồn chói tai từ công trường khiến việc tập trung trở nên khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The cacophonous noise of construction outside the office made it difficult to conduct meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Tiếng ồn hỗn độn từ việc thi công bên ngoài văn phòng khiến việc họp hành gặp khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-ljspeech-e581a391.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-cori-e581a391.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cacophonous-52ad0ac3.webp', '[\"discordant\", \"harsh\", \"noisy\"]', '[\"harmonious\", \"melodious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cacophonous sound\", \"meaning\": \"âm thanh hỗn tạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cacophonous music\", \"meaning\": \"âm nhạc chói tai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cacophony\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-cori-e581a391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-aru0-e581a391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-aru5-e581a391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-aru6-e581a391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-aru10-e581a391.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-aru9-e581a391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-aru3-e581a391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-aru7-e581a391.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cacophonous-aru8-e581a391.mp3\", \"/st