('b70d63f5-a92e-5e9a-a006-2766eeb698dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'bid', 'UK: /bɪd/ | US: /bɪd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự dự thầu, giá thầu', 'an offer of a specific price to buy something or complete a contract.', 'We received three competitive bids for the construction project.', 'Chúng tôi nhận được ba hồ sơ dự thầu cạnh tranh cho dự án xây dựng.', '{\"en\": \"Our engineering firm submitted a competitive bid for the municipal highway project.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty kỹ thuật của chúng tôi đã nộp một hồ sơ dự thầu cạnh tranh cho dự án đường cao tốc đô thị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-ljspeech-a65df709.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-cori-a65df709.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bid-bf23e85a.webp', '[\"tender\", \"offer\", \"proposal\", \"quote\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"submit a bid\", \"meaning\": \"nộp giá/hồ sơ dự thầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"win a bid\", \"meaning\": \"trúng thầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"bid\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bidder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-cori-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru0-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru5-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru6-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru10-a65df709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru9-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru3-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru7-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru8-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-aru2-a65df709.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-ljspeech-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt408-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt138-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt624-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt396-a65df709.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt498-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt132-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt288-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt42-a65df709.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bid-lt90-a65df709.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với các động từ \'submit a bid\' (nộp giá thầu) hoặc \'win a bid\' (trúng thầu).', 'contracts', 1, 11),
('8cbdef4a-84f4-5b1d-935d-4a881c8e7bd6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'debris', '/ˈdebriː/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Các mảnh vỡ, tàn tích sau khi một vật bị phá hủy hoặc rơi vỡ.', 'broken pieces of something that has been destroyed or left behind after an accident.', 'After the earthquake, the streets were covered with debris from collapsed buildings.', 'Sau trận động đất, các con phố ngập tràn những mảnh vỡ từ các tòa nhà bị sập.', '{\"en\": \"The construction crew cleared the debris from the site before starting the new project.\", \"vi\": \"Đội xây dựng đã dọn dẹp các mảnh vỡ khỏi công trường trước khi bắt đầu dự án mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-ljspeech-6aa5cd51.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-cori-6aa5cd51.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/debris-02074e70.webp', '[\"rubble\", \"waste\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clear debris\", \"meaning\": \"dọn dẹp mảnh vỡ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remove debris\", \"meaning\": \"loại bỏ tàn tích\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-cori-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru0-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru5-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru6-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru10-6aa5cd51.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru9-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru3-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru7-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru8-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-aru2-6aa5cd51.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-ljspeech-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt408-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt138-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt624-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt396-6aa5cd51.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt498-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt132-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt288-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt42-6aa5cd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/debris-lt90-6aa5cd51.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phát âm /dəˈbriː/, âm \'s\' ở cuối là câm.', 'manufacturing', 1, 12),
('4172966c-e301-53df-90ea-45c2e5479d03', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'opt', '/ɒpt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'lựa chọn, quyết định chọn.', 'to make a choice or decision from a range of possibilities.', 'Customers often opt for electronic receipts to reduce paper waste.', 'Khách hàng thường chọn hóa đơn điện tử để giảm thiểu rác thải giấy.', '{\"en\": \"Employees can opt to receive their monthly payslips electronically instead of on paper.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có thể chọn nhận phiếu lương hàng tháng qua mạng thay vì trên giấy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-ljspeech-102210fe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-cori-102210fe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/opt-3506813e.webp', '[\"choose\", \"select\", \"decide\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"opt for\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"opt out\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định không tham gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"opt in\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định tham gia\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adopt\", \"note_vi\": \"nhận nuôi hoặc áp dụng, dễ nhầm vì viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"option\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"optional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-cori-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru0-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru5-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru6-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru10-102210fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru9-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru3-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru7-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru8-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-aru2-102210fe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-ljspeech-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt408-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt138-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt624-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt396-102210fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt498-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt132-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt288-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt42-102210fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/opt-lt90-102210fe.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm giới từ \'for\' (opt for something) hoặc động từ to-infinitive (opt to do).', 'hr', 1, 13),
('26b70aa1-5247-5524-b710-f2d0a71f7d30', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'unfruitful', '/ʌnˈfruːtfəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không mang lại kết quả, vô ích.', 'producing no useful result or successful outcome at all.', 'After hours of discussion, the business meeting ended up being completely unfruitful.', 'Sau nhiều giờ thảo luận, cuộc họp kinh doanh rốt cuộc đã hoàn toàn không mang lại kết quả.', '{\"en\": \"The unfruitful meeting with the client led to no signed contract.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp vô ích với khách hàng không dẫn đến hợp đồng nào được ký.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-ljspeech-43c5ca65.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-cori-43c5ca65.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unfruitful-8f12a037.webp', '[\"fruitless\", \"unproductive\"]', '[\"fruitful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unfruitful meeting\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp vô ích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unfruitful search\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tìm kiếm vô ích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unfriendly\", \"note_vi\": \"unfriendly là không thân thiện, khác unfruitful vô ích.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fruit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fruitfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-cori-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru0-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru5-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru6-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru10-43c5ca65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru9-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru3-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru7-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru8-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-aru2-43c5ca65.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-ljspeech-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt408-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt138-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt624-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt396-43c5ca65.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt498-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt132-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt288-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt42-43c5ca65.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfruitful-lt90-43c5ca65.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường miêu tả nỗ lực, cuộc họp không đạt kết quả.', 'business', 1, 14),
('e6d751ab-46f2-5435-a3c7-bfb7a625f324', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'prompt', '/prɒmpt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Thúc đẩy, gợi ý hoặc nhắc nhở ai đó làm gì.', 'to cause someone to take action or to make a decision.', 'His strange behavior prompted us to call for help.', 'Hành vi kỳ lạ của anh ấy đã thúc đẩy chúng tôi gọi giúp đỡ.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden drop in sales prompted the board of directors to revise the annual budget plan.\", \"vi\": \"Sự sụt giảm doanh số đột ngột đã thúc đẩy hội đồng quản trị sửa đổi kế hoạch ngân sách hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-ljspeech-9c7e05e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-cori-9c7e05e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prompt-6384039f.webp', '[\"encourage\", \"motivate\"]', '[\"hinder\", \"delay\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prompt action\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy hành động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prompt someone to do\", \"meaning\": \"thúc giục ai làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"promote\", \"note_vi\": \"Promote là thăng chức hoặc quảng bá, prompt là thúc đẩy.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"promptly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"promptness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-cori-9c7e05e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-aru0-9c7e05e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-aru5-9c7e05e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-aru6-9c7e05e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-aru10-9c7e05e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-aru9-9c7e05e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-aru3-9c7e05e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-aru7-9c7e05e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prompt-aru8-9c7e05e5.mp3\", \