('828f7953-e811-5dd1-a683-9eda7b9791e1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'obsession', '/əbˈseʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng bị chi phối bởi một ý nghĩ hoặc cảm xúc mạnh mẽ, không thể thoát ra.', 'state of being controlled by a persistent strong feeling.', 'Her obsession with perfection made her spend hours on every small detail.', 'Sự ám ảnh về sự hoàn hảo khiến cô ấy dành hàng giờ cho từng chi tiết nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"His obsession with meeting deadlines caused stress among the project team.\", \"vi\": \"Sự ám ảnh của anh ấy với việc đúng hạn gây căng thẳng cho đội dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-ljspeech-b1c1a27a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-cori-b1c1a27a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obsession-bd7577b5.webp', '[\"fixation\", \"preoccupation\", \"compulsion\"]', '[\"indifference\", \"disinterest\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"obsession with\", \"meaning\": \"sự ám ảnh với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"childhood obsession\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi ám ảnh thời thơ ấu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become an obsession\", \"meaning\": \"trở thành nỗi ám ảnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"passion\", \"note_vi\": \"đam mê tích cực, không mang nghĩa tiêu cực như obsession\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"obsess\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obsessive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-cori-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru0-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru5-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru6-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru10-b1c1a27a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru9-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru3-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru7-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru8-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-aru2-b1c1a27a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-ljspeech-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt408-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt138-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt624-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt396-b1c1a27a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt498-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt132-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt288-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt42-b1c1a27a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obsession-lt90-b1c1a27a.mp3\"]}}', 'Obsession mang sắc thái tiêu cực, khác với \'passion\' (đam mê).', 'office', 1, 19),
('2d184f14-f03e-5275-a01e-b456089ac1e3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'array', 'UK: /əˈreɪ/ | US: /əˈreɪ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'một dãy, một loạt', 'an impressive or large collection of different things displayed or organized together in one place', 'The store offers a wide array of products.', 'Cửa hàng cung cấp một loạt sản phẩm đa dạng.', '{\"en\": \"The department store offers a wide array of high-end electronic products.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng bách hóa cung cấp một loạt các sản phẩm điện tử cao cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-ljspeech-19edc121.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-cori-19edc121.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/array-6a4c7cf9.webp', '[\"range\", \"variety\", \"assortment\", \"selection\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a wide array of\", \"meaning\": \"một loạt/dãy đa dạng các\"}, {\"phrase\": \"an impressive array\", \"meaning\": \"một tập hợp ấn tượng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-cori-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru0-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru5-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru6-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru10-19edc121.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru9-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru3-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru7-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru8-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-aru2-19edc121.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-ljspeech-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt408-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt138-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt624-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt396-19edc121.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt498-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt132-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt288-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt42-19edc121.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/array-lt90-19edc121.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi trong cấu trúc \'a wide array of + N số nhiều\' (một loạt rất nhiều cái gì đó).', 'shopping', 1, 20),
('cfc2b0b6-48a6-57b5-ab90-fb7862fec36c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'litigation', '/ˌlɪtɪˈɡeɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Quá trình giải quyết tranh chấp pháp lý thông qua tòa án.', 'the process of making or defending a claim in a court of law.', 'The company faced costly litigation after the product recall.', 'Công ty phải đối mặt với vụ kiện tốn kém sau khi thu hồi sản phẩm.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department advised settling the contract dispute to avoid expensive litigation.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận pháp lý đã khuyên nên giải quyết tranh chấp hợp đồng để tránh kiện tụng tốn kém.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-ljspeech-f5e506ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-cori-f5e506ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/litigation-38477982.webp', '[\"lawsuit\", \"legal action\", \"prosecution\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pending litigation\", \"meaning\": \"vụ kiện tụng đang chờ xử lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid litigation\", \"meaning\": \"tránh kiện tụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"litigation cost\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí kiện tụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"legislation\", \"note_vi\": \"việc ban hành luật pháp, tránh nhầm với litigation là kiện tụng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"litigate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"litigious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-cori-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru0-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru5-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru6-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru10-f5e506ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru9-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru3-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru7-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru8-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-aru2-f5e506ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-ljspeech-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt408-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt138-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt624-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt396-f5e506ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt498-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt132-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt288-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt42-f5e506ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/litigation-lt90-f5e506ab.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \"legislation\" (pháp luật). Litigation liên quan đến kiện tụng tòa án.', 'law', 1, 21),
('88544788-4f01-5984-812b-0e9e7e11b654', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'behave', 'UK: /bɪˈheɪv/ | US: /bɪˈheɪv/', 'B1', 'verb', 'cư xử', 'to act or conduct oneself in a specified way towards others.', 'Employees should behave professionally at all times.', 'Nhân viên nên cư xử chuyên nghiệp mọi lúc.', '{\"en\": \"All candidates are expected to behave professionally during the interview process.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các ứng viên được kỳ vọng sẽ cư xử chuyên nghiệp trong suốt quá trình phỏng vấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-ljspeech-9ad09bca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-cori-9ad09bca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/behave-6a5284d1.webp', '[\"act\", \"conduct oneself\", \"comport\"]', '[\"misbehave\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"behave professionally\", \"meaning\": \"cư xử chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"behave appropriately\", \"meaning\": \"ứng xử phù hợp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"behavior\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"behavioral\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-cori-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru0-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru5-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru6-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru10-9ad09bca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru9-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru3-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru7-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru8-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-aru2-9ad09bca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-ljspeech-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt408-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt138-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt624-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt396-9ad09bca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt498-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt132-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt288-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt42-9ad09bca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behave-lt90-9ad09bca.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'behave professionally\' thường được dùng trong môi trường công sở để chỉ phong cách làm việc lịch sự, đúng mực.', 'office', 1, 22),
('fcdba435-1a8e-50a2-8a54-3818642e6be6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'controversial', 'UK: /ˌkɒntrəˈvɜrʃəl/ | US: /ˌkɑntrəˈvɜrʃəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'gây tranh cãi', 'causing a lot of public discussion, disagreement, or heated argument among people.', 'His controversial decision sparked public debate.', 'Quyết định gây tranh cãi của ông đã gây ra tranh luận công khai.', '{\"en\": \"The board decided to postpone the controversial proposal until further market research was done.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã quyết định hoãn đề xuất gây tranh cãi cho đến khi thực hiện thêm nghiên cứu thị trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-ljspeech-4768682b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-cori-4768682b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/controversial-71a83425.webp', '[\"debatable\", \"disputed\", \"contentious\"]', '[\"uncontroversial\", \"agreed\", \"undisputed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"controversial decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định gây tranh cãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"controversial topic\", \"meaning\": \"chủ đề gây tranh cãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"contradictory\", \"note_vi\": \"Mâu thuẫn, trái ngược nhau về mặt logic, không giống controversial là gây tranh cãi dư luận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"controversy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"controversially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-cori-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru0-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru5-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru6-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru10-4768682b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru9-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru3-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru7-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru8-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-aru2-4768682b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-ljspeech-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt408-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt138-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt624-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt396-4768682b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt498-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt132-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt288-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt42-4768682b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/controversial-lt90-4768682b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ dùng để miêu tả một quyết định, đề xuất hay chính sách gây nhiều ý kiến tranh cãi trái chiều.', 'business', 1, 23),
('3f771bd0-9fff-527f-831b-238cfc448d74', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'credit', '/ˈkredɪt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khả năng hoặc sự tin tưởng rằng ai đó sẽ trả nợ trong tương lai.', 'the state of being trusted to pay back money that you have borrowed later on.', 'It\'s important to build a good credit score for future loans.', 'Việc xây dựng điểm tín dụng tốt là quan trọng cho các khoản vay trong tương lai.', '{\"en\": \"The bank manager reviewed his financial history before approving the line of credit for business.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc ngân hàng đã xem xét lịch sử tài chính của anh ấy trước khi phê duyệt hạn mức tín dụng cho doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-ljspeech-9cf5e7cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-cori-9cf5e7cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/credit-302e1372.webp', '[\"trust\", \"reputation\"]', '[\"debt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"credit score\", \"meaning\": \"điểm tín dụng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"credit card\", \"meaning\": \"thẻ tín dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"debit\", \"note_vi\": \"debit là ghi nợ, credit là ghi có hoặc khoản tín dụng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creditor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"credible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-cori-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru0-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru5-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru6-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru10-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru9-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru3-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru7-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru8-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-aru2-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-ljspeech-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt408-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt138-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt624-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt396-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt498-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt132-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt288-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt42-9cf5e7cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credit-lt90-9cf5e7cd.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm lẫn với \'debit\' (ghi nợ) trong kế toán.', 'finance', 1, 24)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('3848c536-84a9-5e78-a24c-911ba98dcdea', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'articulate', '/ɑːˈtɪkjuleɪt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Diễn đạt rõ ràng, lưu loát bằng lời nói.', 'able to express thoughts and feelings clearly and effectively using words in a conversation.', 'She is a very articulate speaker who can explain complex ideas simply.', 'Cô ấy là một diễn giả rất lưu loát, có thể giải thích những ý tưởng phức tạp một cách đơn giản.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate was very articulate during the interview, explaining his previous experience with great clarity.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên rất lưu loát trong buổi phỏng vấn, giải thích kinh nghiệm trước đây của anh ấy rất rõ ràng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-ljspeech-b7ae978b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-cori-b7ae978b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/articulate-50f1e7c2.webp', '[\"eloquent\", \"expressive\"]', '[\"inarticulate\", \"unclear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"articulate speaker\", \"meaning\": \"người diễn đạt tốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"articulate thoughts\", \"meaning\": \"diễn đạt suy nghĩ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"articulated\", \"note_vi\": \"articulate là tính từ, articulated là quá khứ phân từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"articulation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"articulately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-cori-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru0-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru5-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru6-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru10-b7ae978b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru9-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru3-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru7-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru8-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-aru2-b7ae978b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-ljspeech-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt408-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt138-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt624-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt396-b7ae978b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt498-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt132-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt288-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt42-b7ae978b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/articulate-lt90-b7ae978b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen khả năng giao tiếp tốt, mạch lạc.', 'hr', 1, 25),
('998a1abd-3a0d-5ccd-a6f6-b808728df6ba', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'poop', '/puːp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Chất thải rắn từ cơ thể người hoặc động vật.', 'solid waste material that comes out of the body of a person or animal.', 'Parents often have to change diapers full of baby poop.', 'Cha mẹ thường phải thay tã đầy phân em bé.', '{\"en\": \"The pet hotel staff must clean any animal poop in the play area regularly.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên khách sạn thú cưng phải dọn sạch phân động vật ở khu vui chơi thường xuyên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-ljspeech-81b06fac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-cori-81b06fac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/poop-31b10a82.webp', '[\"feces\", \"excrement\", \"stool\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dog poop\", \"meaning\": \"phân chó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clean up poop\", \"meaning\": \"dọn dẹp phân\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"poop\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-cori-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru0-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru5-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru6-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru10-81b06fac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru9-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru3-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru7-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru8-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-aru2-81b06fac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-ljspeech-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poop-lt408-81b06fac.mp3\", \"/sto