('875d734a-d851-56f6-8229-a893dcdf90dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'reorganization', 'UK: /ˌriː.ˌɔː.ɡə.naɪˈzeɪ.ʃən/ | US: /ˌriː.ˌɔːr.ɡə.nəˈzeɪ.ʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự tái tổ chức', 'The act of changing the structure or internal system of an organization or business entity.', 'The company announced a major reorganization of its departments.', 'Công ty đã công bố tái tổ chức lớn các phòng ban của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The firm underwent a major structural reorganization to improve operational efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã trải qua một đợt tái cấu trúc quy mô lớn để nâng cao hiệu quả hoạt động.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-ljspeech-d3a2b9c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-cori-d3a2b9c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reorganization-2df1af4f.webp', '[\"restructuring\", \"rearrangement\", \"overhaul\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"corporate reorganization\", \"meaning\": \"sự tái cấu trúc doanh nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"undergo reorganization\", \"meaning\": \"trải qua quá trình tái cấu trúc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reorganize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-cori-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru0-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru5-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru6-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru10-d3a2b9c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru9-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru3-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru7-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru8-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-aru2-d3a2b9c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-ljspeech-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt408-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt138-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt624-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt396-d3a2b9c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt498-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt132-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt288-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt42-d3a2b9c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reorganization-lt90-d3a2b9c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Sự tái cấu trúc bộ máy/phòng ban trong doanh nghiệp. Thường đi với cụm \'undergo reorganization\'.', 'office', 1, 27),
('d00b3abe-0a17-5772-bb46-aaed9157609a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'ceo', 'UK: /ˌsiː.iːˈəʊ/ | US: /ˌsiː.iːˈoʊ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tổng giám đốc Điều hành', 'The executive who holds the highest rank and authority within a business organization.', 'The CEO announced the company\'s new strategic direction.', 'Tổng giám đốc điều hành đã công bố định hướng chiến lược mới của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The newly appointed CEO outlined her five-year growth strategy during the shareholders\' meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng giám đốc mới được bổ nhiệm đã nêu rõ chiến lược phát triển 5 năm tại cuộc họp cổ đông.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-ljspeech-9d382342.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-cori-9d382342.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ceo-2cdf4a0b.webp', '[\"chief executive\", \"managing director\", \"president\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"appoint a CEO\", \"meaning\": \"bổ nhiệm Tổng giám đốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"former CEO\", \"meaning\": \"cựu Tổng giám đốc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"CFO\", \"note_vi\": \"CFO là Giám đốc Tài chính (Chief Financial Officer), phân biệt với CEO điều hành chung.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-cori-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru0-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru5-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru6-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru10-9d382342.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru9-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru3-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru7-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru8-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-aru2-9d382342.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-ljspeech-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt408-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt138-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt624-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt396-9d382342.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt498-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt132-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt288-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt42-9d382342.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceo-lt90-9d382342.mp3\"]}}', 'CEO là viết tắt của \'Chief Executive Officer\'. Trong doanh nghiệp, đây là người nắm quyền điều hành cao nhất.', 'corporate leadership', 1, 28),
('6fdc634d-3cdb-5a40-9863-2d3b79357e1c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3171ed15-a24d-5785-9eb7-1259ad6590ca', '5d621bf2-5f03-5d77-a52e-88c3950dc597', 'client', 'UK: /ˈklaɪənt/ | US: /ˈklaɪənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'khách hàng', 'a person or organization that receives professional advice or services from a business provider.', 'Our important client signed the new contract.', 'Khách hàng quan trọng của chúng tôi đã ký hợp đồng mới.', '{\"en\": \"Our consulting firm strives to maintain strong long-term relationships with all key corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tư vấn của chúng tôi nỗ lực duy trì mối quan hệ lâu dài vững chắc với tất cả các khách hàng doanh nghiệp lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-ljspeech-d2a04d71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-cori-d2a04d71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/client-fcdfdab8.webp', '[\"patron\", \"buyer\", \"purchaser\", \"account\"]', '[\"provider\", \"vendor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"corporate client\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng doanh nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"potential client\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng tiềm năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"client satisfaction\", \"meaning\": \"sự hài lòng của khách hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"customer\", \"note_vi\": \"Khách hàng mua hàng hóa thương mại thông thường\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"clientele\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-cori-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru0-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru5-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru6-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru10-d2a04d71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru9-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru3-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru7-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru8-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-aru2-d2a04d71.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-ljspeech-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt408-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt138-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt624-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt396-d2a04d71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt498-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt132-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt288-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt42-d2a04d71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/client-lt90-d2a04d71.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'client\' (khách hàng sử dụng dịch vụ chuyên nghiệp: tư vấn, luật, tài chính) với \'customer\' (khách hàng mua sản phẩm/hàng hóa bán lẻ).', 'business', 1, 29),
('e4b2d98d-f606-5099-a039-da006613a481', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'inquire', '/ɪnˈkwaɪə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Hỏi hoặc tìm hiểu thông tin về điều gì đó.', 'to ask for information or details about a particular situation or service.', 'I called the hotel to inquire about room availability.', 'Tôi đã gọi cho khách sạn để hỏi về tình trạng phòng trống.', '{\"en\": \"Many potential clients called to inquire about the new software features before making a purchase.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều khách hàng tiềm năng đã gọi điện để hỏi về các tính năng phần mềm mới trước khi mua hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-ljspeech-8a96ccde.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-cori-8a96ccde.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inquire-6095be8d.webp', '[\"ask\", \"question\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"inquire about\", \"meaning\": \"hỏi về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inquire into\", \"meaning\": \"điều tra về\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"enquire\", \"note_vi\": \"cách viết khác của inquire, phổ biến hơn trong tiếng Anh Anh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inquiry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-cori-8a96ccde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-aru0-8a96ccde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-aru5-8a96ccde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-aru6-8a96ccde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-aru10-8a96ccde.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-aru9-8a96ccde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-aru3-8a96ccde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-aru7-8a96ccde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-aru8-8a96ccde.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inquire-a