('dd264e1f-4464-5df8-a468-c232f77bf2ec', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'expect', '/ɪkˈspekt/', 'A1', 'verb', 'Nghĩ rằng điều gì đó sẽ xảy ra hoặc ai đó sẽ đến.', 'To regard something as likely to occur or anticipate the arrival of a person.', 'I expect her to arrive by noon, as she promised.', 'Tôi mong cô ấy sẽ đến trước buổi trưa, như cô ấy đã hứa.', '{\"en\": \"We expect the shipment of new office chairs to arrive by next Tuesday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi mong đợi lô hàng ghế văn phòng mới sẽ đến trước sáng thứ Ba tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-ljspeech-ff93c451.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-cori-ff93c451.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/expect-c4bdd223.webp', '[\"anticipate\", \"await\", \"predict\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"expect a call\", \"meaning\": \"chờ đợi một cuộc gọi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"expect the worst\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn bị cho điều tồi tệ nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"except\", \"note_vi\": \"ngoại trừ, viết gần giống expect\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"expectation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"expectant\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unexpected\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-cori-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru0-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru5-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru6-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru10-ff93c451.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru9-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru3-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru7-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru8-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-aru2-ff93c451.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-ljspeech-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt408-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt138-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt624-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt396-ff93c451.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt498-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt132-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt288-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt42-ff93c451.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/expect-lt90-ff93c451.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: expect someone/something to do something.', 'office', 1, 1),
('4d6e37f0-ab6f-5b75-9e3b-8baa888fc292', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'unprecedented', '/ʌnˈpresɪdentɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Chưa từng xảy ra hoặc tồn tại trước đây.', 'something that has never happened or existed in the past, often used for major events.', 'The recent heatwave was unprecedented, breaking all previous temperature records.', 'Đợt nắng nóng gần đây là chưa từng có, phá vỡ mọi kỷ lục nhiệt độ trước đó.', '{\"en\": \"The company faced an unprecedented demand for its products during the holiday shopping season.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã phải đối mặt với nhu cầu chưa từng có đối với các sản phẩm của mình trong mùa mua sắm lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-ljspeech-afbeeda5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-cori-afbeeda5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unprecedented-48a75a06.webp', '[\"unparalleled\", \"unmatched\"]', '[\"common\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unprecedented growth\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng chưa từng có\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unprecedented level\", \"meaning\": \"mức độ chưa từng có\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"precedent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-cori-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru0-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru5-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru6-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru10-afbeeda5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru9-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru3-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru7-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru8-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-aru2-afbeeda5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-ljspeech-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt408-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt138-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt624-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt396-afbeeda5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt498-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt132-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt288-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt42-afbeeda5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unprecedented-lt90-afbeeda5.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với \'level\', \'scale\' hoặc \'growth\' trong báo cáo kinh doanh.', 'business', 1, 2),
('08758f07-03fb-5548-a816-4225dfcfbb00', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'bizarre', '/bɪˈzɑː(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất lạ lùng, kỳ quặc hoặc khác thường.', 'something that is very difficult to explain because it is not normal or expected.', 'We saw a bizarre performance art piece that involved people dressed as vegetables.', 'Chúng tôi đã xem một màn trình diễn nghệ thuật kỳ dị liên quan đến những người hóa trang thành rau củ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager made a bizarre decision to cancel the annual company picnic without any explanation.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đưa ra một quyết định kỳ quặc là hủy buổi dã ngoại thường niên của công ty mà không có lời giải thích nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-ljspeech-6afeb9ac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-cori-6afeb9ac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bizarre-84e890c0.webp', '[\"strange\", \"odd\", \"peculiar\"]', '[\"normal\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bizarre behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi kỳ quặc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bizarre situation\", \"meaning\": \"tình huống lạ lùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"bizarrely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-cori-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru0-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru5-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru6-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru10-6afeb9ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru9-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru3-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru7-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru8-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-aru2-6afeb9ac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-ljspeech-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt408-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt138-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt624-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt396-6afeb9ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt498-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt132-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt288-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt42-6afeb9ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bizarre-lt90-6afeb9ac.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'bazaar\' (chợ phiên), từ này có hai chữ \'r\' ở cuối.', 'office', 1, 3),
('9cd090b7-8ce6-5a69-9f80-8503aa816628', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'effective', '/ɪˈfektɪv/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Đạt được kết quả mong muốn, có hiệu lực.', 'producing the result that is wanted or intended to achieve a specific goal successfully.', 'The new marketing strategy proved to be very effective in increasing sales.', 'Chiến lược tiếp thị mới đã chứng minh rất hiệu quả trong việc tăng doanh số.', '{\"en\": \"We need to find an effective way to manage our time during the busy season.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần tìm một cách hiệu quả để quản lý thời gian trong mùa cao điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-ljspeech-da225248.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-cori-da225248.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/effective-4d3d21a6.webp', '[\"successful\", \"productive\"]', '[\"ineffective\", \"useless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly effective\", \"meaning\": \"rất hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cost-effective\", \"meaning\": \"hiệu quả về chi phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"efficient\", \"note_vi\": \"hiệu quả về mặt năng suất, ít tốn kém thời gian/công sức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"effect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"effectively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-cori-da225248.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-aru0-da225248.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-aru5-da225248.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-aru6-da225248.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-aru10-da225248.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-aru9-da225248.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-aru3-da225248.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effective-aru7-da22524