('950accf7-0b03-5b1b-b4c3-370e3d65e50a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'authorization', 'UK: /ˌɔːθəraɪˈzeɪʃən/ | US: /ˌɔːθərəˈzeɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự cho phép, sự ủy quyền', 'official permission, approval, or power given to perform a specific action or task.', 'You need proper authorization to access these files.', 'Bạn cần có sự cho phép thích hợp để truy cập các tệp này.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must obtain written authorization before requesting reimbursement for travel expenses.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải có sự cho phép bằng văn bản trước khi yêu cầu hoàn trả chi phí đi lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-ljspeech-2abb6437.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-cori-2abb6437.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/authorization-2589bdae.webp', '[\"permission\", \"approval\", \"consent\", \"clearance\"]', '[\"prohibition\", \"denial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"written authorization\", \"meaning\": \"sự cho phép/ủy quyền bằng văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prior authorization\", \"meaning\": \"sự cho phép/cấp phép trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"authority\", \"note_vi\": \"authorization là sự chấp thuận/cấp phép, còn authority là tư cách thẩm quyền/quyền hạn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"authorize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"authority\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-cori-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru0-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru5-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru6-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru10-2abb6437.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru9-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru3-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru7-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru8-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-aru2-2abb6437.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-ljspeech-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt408-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt138-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt624-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt396-2abb6437.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt498-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt132-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt288-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt42-2abb6437.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authorization-lt90-2abb6437.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất thường gặp cụm \'written authorization\' (sự ủy quyền/cho phép bằng văn bản) hay \'prior authorization\' (sự cấp phép trước).', 'office', 1, 15),
('30b8a866-b5fe-5653-a895-d421fc9bf3f2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'preservative', '/prɪˈzɜːvətɪv/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Chất hóa học dùng để bảo quản thực phẩm hoặc vật liệu không bị hỏng.', 'a substance used to prevent food or wood from decaying.', 'Many processed foods contain artificial preservatives to extend their shelf life.', 'Nhiều thực phẩm chế biến sẵn chứa chất bảo quản nhân tạo để kéo dài thời hạn sử dụng.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturer added a natural preservative to prolong the shelf life of the juice.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sản xuất đã thêm một chất bảo quản tự nhiên để kéo dài thời hạn sử dụng của nước trái cây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-ljspeech-16adc28a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-cori-16adc28a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/preservative-87a6ff1b.webp', '[\"additive\", \"protectant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chemical preservative\", \"meaning\": \"chất bảo quản hóa học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"artificial preservative\", \"meaning\": \"chất bảo quản nhân tạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reservation\", \"note_vi\": \"reservation là sự đặt chỗ trước.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"preserve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"preservation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"preservative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-cori-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru0-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru5-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru6-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru10-16adc28a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru9-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru3-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru7-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru8-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-aru2-16adc28a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-ljspeech-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt408-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt138-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt624-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt396-16adc28a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt498-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt132-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt288-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt42-16adc28a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preservative-lt90-16adc28a.mp3\"]}}', 'Tuy có đuôi -ive thường là tính từ nhưng từ này rất phổ biến với vai trò danh từ.', 'dining', 1, 16),
('0ab7e993-f778-521e-91e1-a97438570a05', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'labor', '/ˈleɪbə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'công việc nặng nhọc, đặc biệt là công việc chân tay.', 'practical work, especially when it involves hard physical effort.', 'Manual labor can be very demanding on the body.', 'Lao động chân tay có thể rất nặng nhọc đối với cơ thể.', '{\"en\": \"The construction company hired extra labor to complete the office building on schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty xây dựng đã thuê thêm nhân công để hoàn thành tòa nhà văn phòng đúng tiến độ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-ljspeech-0b8c568d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-cori-0b8c568d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/labor-c8a4cddc.webp', '[\"work\", \"toil\", \"manpower\"]', '[\"leisure\", \"rest\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"manual labor\", \"meaning\": \"lao động chân tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"labor market\", \"meaning\": \"thị trường lao động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"labor costs\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí nhân công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"laboratory\", \"note_vi\": \"Khác nhau: labor là lao động, laboratory là phòng thí nghiệm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"labor\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"laborer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"laborious\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-cori-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru0-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru5-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru6-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru10-0b8c568d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru9-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru3-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru7-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru8-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-aru2-0b8c568d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-ljspeech-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt408-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt138-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt624-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt396-0b8c568d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt498-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt132-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt288-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt42-0b8c568d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/labor-lt90-0b8c568d.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiếng Anh-Anh viết là labour, tiếng Anh-Mỹ viết là labor.', 'manufacturing', 1, 17),
('fd9574a5-7660-58a1-a3f9-e87c7b6aaf79', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'twiddle', '/ˈtwɪdl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Xoay, vặn nhẹ một vật gì đó bằng ngón tay một cách không chủ đích.', 'to turn something repeatedly with your fingers, often because you are bored or nervous.', 'He tends to twiddle his thumbs when he\'s nervous or bored.', 'Anh ấy có xu hướng xoay ngón tay cái khi lo lắng hoặc buồn chán.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not twiddle your pen during the interview as it looks very unprofessional.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đừng xoay bút trong buổi phỏng vấn vì trông rất thiếu chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-ljspeech-bc17d53e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-cori-bc17d53e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/twiddle-be79283d.webp', '[\"spin\", \"rotate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"twiddle thumbs\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"twiddle pen\", \"meaning\": \"xoay bút\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-cori-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru0-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru5-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru6-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru10-bc17d53e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru9-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru3-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru7-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru8-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-aru2-bc17d53e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twiddle-ljspeech-bc17d53e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob