('a5ce83b9-d771-598d-a641-2346e7db4af4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'activate', 'UK: /ˈæktɪveɪt/ | US: /ˈæktɪveɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'kích hoạt, kích thích', 'to cause a device or system to start working properly', 'We need to activate the emergency response plan immediately.', 'Chúng ta cần kích hoạt kế hoạch ứng phó khẩn cấp ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"Clients must click the verification link in the confirmation email to activate their online accounts.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng phải nhấp vào liên kết xác minh trong email xác nhận để kích hoạt tài khoản trực tuyến của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-ljspeech-2c1e2b1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-cori-2c1e2b1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/activate-74fa8feb.webp', '[\"enable\", \"trigger\", \"initiate\"]', '[\"deactivate\", \"disable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"activate an account\", \"meaning\": \"kích hoạt tài khoản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"activate a service\", \"meaning\": \"kích hoạt dịch vụ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"activation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"active\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-cori-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru0-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru5-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru6-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru10-2c1e2b1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru9-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru3-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru7-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru8-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-aru2-2c1e2b1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-ljspeech-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt408-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt138-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt624-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt396-2c1e2b1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt498-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt132-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt288-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt42-2c1e2b1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/activate-lt90-2c1e2b1d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp khi kích hoạt tài khoản phần mềm, thẻ ngân hàng hoặc dịch vụ điện tử mới.', 'technology', 1, 19),
('b88ea8ed-d5e0-5f97-8f7f-90fb2232bcaf', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'passive', '/ˈpæsɪv/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Dạng bị động trong ngữ pháp.', 'a grammatical form where the subject receives the action instead of performing it.', 'In English grammar, the passive voice is often used when the action\'s recipient is more important than the doer.', 'Trong ngữ pháp tiếng Anh, thể bị động thường được dùng khi đối tượng chịu tác động của hành động quan trọng hơn người thực hiện.', '{\"en\": \"The report was written in the passive voice to maintain a formal and objective tone.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo được viết ở dạng bị động để duy trì giọng văn trang trọng và khách quan.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-ljspeech-8cf03f5f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-cori-8cf03f5f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passive-083bfb85.webp', NULL, '[\"active\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"passive voice\", \"meaning\": \"thể bị động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"use the passive\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng dạng bị động\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"passively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-cori-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru0-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru5-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru6-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru10-8cf03f5f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru9-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru3-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru7-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru8-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-aru2-8cf03f5f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-ljspeech-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt408-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt138-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt624-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt396-8cf03f5f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt498-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt132-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt288-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt42-8cf03f5f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passive-lt90-8cf03f5f.mp3\"]}}', 'thường gặp trong các bài kiểm tra ngữ pháp TOEIC.', 'academic', 1, 20),
('6fe1f262-8e33-5399-ac03-7688adccf751', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'operating system', '/ɒpəreɪtɪŋ sɪstəm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Phần mềm quản lý các tài nguyên máy tính và cung cấp giao diện cho người dùng.', 'the primary software that manages all other programs on a computer.', 'Most computers use an operating system like Windows or macOS to function.', 'Hầu hết các máy tính đều sử dụng một hệ điều hành như Windows hoặc macOS để hoạt động.', '{\"en\": \"We need to upgrade the operating system on all office computers next week.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần nâng cấp hệ điều hành trên tất cả máy tính văn phòng vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-ljspeech-2caa6242.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-cori-2caa6242.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/operating-system-3a084208.webp', '[\"OS\", \"system software\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"install an operating system\", \"meaning\": \"cài đặt hệ điều hành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mobile operating system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ điều hành di động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"application\", \"note_vi\": \"application là ứng dụng chạy trên hệ điều hành.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-cori-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru0-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru5-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru6-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru10-2caa6242.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru9-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru3-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru7-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru8-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-aru2-2caa6242.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-ljspeech-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt408-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt138-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt624-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt396-2caa6242.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt498-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt132-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt288-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt42-2caa6242.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/operating-system-lt90-2caa6242.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết tắt phổ biến là OS.', 'technology', 1, 21),
('d0c1a4bc-6f42-5084-9e74-8d49324c84f0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'steam', '/stiːm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hơi nước, khí không màu sinh ra khi nước sôi.', 'the hot gas that rises when water is heated to its boiling point.', 'Thick steam rose continuously from the coffee mug during our morning strategy meeting.', 'Hơi nước dày đặc bốc lên liên tục từ cốc cà phê trong cuộc họp chiến lược buổi sáng của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team checked the steam pipes in the hotel kitchen for any leaks.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì kiểm tra các đường ống hơi nước trong bếp khách sạn để phát hiện rò rỉ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-ljspeech-bf2903b5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-cori-bf2903b5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/steam-03f157f3.webp', '[\"vapor\", \"mist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"steam engine\", \"meaning\": \"động cơ hơi nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full steam ahead\", \"meaning\": \"tiến lên với tốc độ tối đa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"steam room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng xông hơi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"smoke\", \"note_vi\": \"smoke là khói từ đốt cháy; steam là hơi nước từ nhiệt độ cao\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"steam\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"steamy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-cori-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru0-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru5-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru6-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru10-bf2903b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru9-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru3-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru7-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru8-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-aru2-bf2903b5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-ljspeech-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt408-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt138-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt624-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt396-bf2903b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt498-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt132-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt288-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt42-bf2903b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steam-lt90-bf2903b5.mp3\"]}}', 'steam vừa là danh từ (hơi nước) vừa là động từ (hấp, xông hơi) — chú ý ngữ cảnh.', 'manufacturing', 1, 22),
('1669090e-110c-5bdd-8f86-848cc9985e42', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'clay', '/kleɪ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại đất dẻo, mịn, được dùng để làm gốm sứ hoặc xây dựng.', 'a type of thick, soft earth that becomes hard when it is baked or dried.', 'Potters prefer using soft red clay when crafting handmade coffee mugs.', 'Các thợ gốm thích dùng đất sét đỏ mềm khi làm những chiếc cốc cà phê thủ công.', '{\"en\": \"The local craft shop sells handmade pots made from high-quality clay found in the region.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng thủ công địa phương bán các loại chậu làm bằng tay từ đất sét chất lượng cao được tìm thấy trong vùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-ljspeech-de6b29cb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-cori-de6b29cb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clay-1c04b139.webp', '[\"mud\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pottery clay\", \"meaning\": \"đất sét làm gốm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"molded clay\", \"meaning\": \"đất sét được tạo hình\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-cori-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru0-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru5-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru6-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru10-de6b29cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru9-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru3-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru7-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru8-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-aru2-de6b29cb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-ljspeech-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt408-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt138-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt624-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt396-de6b29cb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt498-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt132-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt288-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt42-de6b29cb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clay-lt90-de6b29cb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường liên quan đến sản xuất gốm sứ hoặc xây dựng.', 'shopping', 1, 23),
('8b83dc9b-2dca-5054-80f0-63220b34242d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'requisition', '/ˌrekwɪˈzɪʃn/', 'C1', 'verb', 'chính thức yêu cầu hoặc trưng dụng thứ gì đó.', 'to officially request or demand the use of supplies, equipment, or property.', 'The manager had to requisition new office supplies because they were running low.', 'Người quản lý phải yêu cầu cung cấp vật tư văn phòng mới vì chúng sắp hết.', '{\"en\": \"The department manager needs to requisition additional laptops for the new remote staff.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng cần yêu cầu cấp thêm máy tính xách tay cho nhân viên làm việc từ xa mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-ljspeech-c6ff74f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-cori-c6ff74f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/requisition-cd542022.webp', '[\"request\", \"order\", \"demand\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"requisition supplies\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu cung cấp vật tư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"requisition equipment\", \"meaning\": \"trưng dụng thiết bị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"require\", \"note_vi\": \"require là yêu cầu chung, requisition là yêu cầu cấp phát vật tư chính thức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"requisition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-cori-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru0-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru5-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru6-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru10-c6ff74f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru9-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru3-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru7-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru8-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-aru2-c6ff74f4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-ljspeech-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt408-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt138-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt624-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt396-c6ff74f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt498-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt132-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt288-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt42-c6ff74f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/requisition-lt90-c6ff74f4.mp3\"]}}', 'Requisition thường xuất hiện trong ngữ cảnh mua sắm, đề nghị cấp phát vật tư công ty.', 'office', 1, 24),
('1716bca3-46c7-59e1-affe-08ba12d38957', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'trademark', '/ˈtreɪdmɑːk/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đăng ký tên, biểu tượng hoặc khẩu hiệu để bảo vệ quyền sở hữu trí tuệ.', 'to officially register a special name, symbol, or slogan for exclusive commercial use.', 'Companies often trademark their brand names and logos to prevent others from using them.', 'Các công ty thường đăng ký nhãn hiệu tên thương hiệu và logo của họ để ngăn người khác sử dụng chúng.', '{\"en\": \"Our legal team decided to trademark the new product line before launching the campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ pháp lý của chúng tôi đã quyết định đăng ký nhãn hiệu cho dòng sản phẩm mới trước khi khởi động chiến dịch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-ljspeech-01c37993.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-cori-01c37993.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trademark-0b323327.webp', '[\"register\", \"brand\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"trademark a brand\", \"meaning\": \"đăng ký nhãn hiệu một thương hiệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trademark a logo\", \"meaning\": \"đăng ký nhãn hiệu một logo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"copyright\", \"note_vi\": \"Copyright bảo vệ tác phẩm sáng tạo; trademark bảo vệ tên hoặc logo thương hiệu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trademark\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-cori-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru0-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru5-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru6-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru10-01c37993.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru9-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru3-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru7-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru8-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-aru2-01c37993.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-ljspeech-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt408-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt138-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt624-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt396-01c37993.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt498-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt132-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt288-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt42-01c37993.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trademark-lt90-01c37993.mp3\"]}}', 'Trademark vừa là động từ (đăng ký nhãn hiệu), vừa là danh từ (nhãn hiệu đã đăng ký).', 'law', 1, 25),
('bf020652-7675-5c0a-b72a-7ce726073b9b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'shredder', 'UK: /ˈʃrɛd.ər/ | US: /ˈʃrɛd.ɚ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'máy hủy tài liệu', 'A mechanical device designed to slice confidential paper documents into tiny unreadable strips.', ' confidential documents should be put through the shredder.', 'Tài liệu mật nên được đưa qua máy hủy tài liệu.', '{\"en\": \"Please put all sensitive financial documents directly into the paper shredder after the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng cho tất cả tài liệu tài chính nhạy cảm vào thẳng máy hủy tài liệu sau cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-ljspeech-66c35070.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-cori-66c35070.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shredder-903c60f3.webp', '[\"paper shredder\", \"grinder\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"paper shredder\", \"meaning\": \"máy hủy giấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cross-cut shredder\", \"meaning\": \"máy hủy tài liệu cắt vụn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shred\", \"note_vi\": \"shred là động từ (xé/hủy), còn shredder là danh từ chỉ thiết bị máy móc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shred\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-cori-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru0-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru5-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru6-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru10-66c35070.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru9-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru3-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru7-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru8-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-aru2-66c35070.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-ljspeech-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt408-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt138-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt624-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt396-66c35070.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt498-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt132-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt288-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt42-66c35070.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shredder-lt90-66c35070.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ xuất phát từ động từ \'shred\' (xé nhỏ/hủy). Thường xuất hiện trong bối cảnh văn phòng xử lý tài liệu bảo mật.', 'office', 1, 26),
('79649bd3-5525-5a4e-8280-70b2a417b745', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'effortless', '/ˈefətləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không cần nhiều nỗ lực, có vẻ dễ dàng.', 'needing little or no hard work or energy to do something.', 'He made the complex task look effortless, completing it in record time.', 'Anh ấy đã làm cho nhiệm vụ phức tạp trông thật dễ dàng, hoàn thành nó trong thời gian kỷ lục.', '{\"en\": \"The new software makes data entry an effortless task for our employees.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới giúp việc nhập dữ liệu trở thành một công việc dễ dàng đối với nhân viên của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-ljspeech-467edc9e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-cori-467edc9e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/effortless-aa1a8c0a.webp', '[\"easy\", \"simple\", \"painless\"]', '[\"difficult\", \"hard\", \"laborious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"effortless style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách tự nhiên, không gượng ép\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem effortless\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ dễ dàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"efficient\", \"note_vi\": \"efficient là hiệu quả, còn effortless là không tốn sức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"effort\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"effortlessly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-cori-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru0-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru5-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru6-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru10-467edc9e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru9-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru3-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru7-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru8-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-aru2-467edc9e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-ljspeech-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt408-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt138-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt624-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt396-467edc9e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt498-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt132-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt288-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt42-467edc9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/effortless-lt90-467edc9e.mp3\"]}}', 'Hậu tố -less mang nghĩa phủ định (không có nỗ lực -> dễ dàng).', 'office', 1, 27),
('e83366f3-2c4f-52ad-b713-f34d3cf91ae5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'hasty', '/ˈheɪsti/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Nhanh chóng, vội vã, thường thiếu suy nghĩ.', 'done very quickly and without enough thought or careful attention.', 'Making a hasty decision can sometimes lead to regrets.', 'Đưa ra một quyết định vội vàng đôi khi có thể dẫn đến hối tiếc.', '{\"en\": \"We should not make a hasty decision about the new marketing strategy today.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta không nên đưa ra quyết định vội vã về chiến lược tiếp thị mới hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-ljspeech-e69055fe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-cori-e69055fe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hasty-295d1154.webp', '[\"hurried\", \"rushed\", \"impulsive\"]', '[\"careful\", \"deliberate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hasty decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định vội vã\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hasty conclusion\", \"meaning\": \"kết luận vội vàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"hastily\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"haste\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-cori-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru0-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru5-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru6-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru10-e69055fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru9-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru3-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru7-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru8-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-aru2-e69055fe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-ljspeech-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt408-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt138-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt624-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt396-e69055fe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt498-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt132-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt288-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt42-e69055fe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hasty-lt90-e69055fe.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ \'more haste, less speed\' (dục tốc bất đạt) rất phổ biến.', 'business', 1, 28),
('d66cba8f-2e5d-5f14-8c4d-f319b41da04d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '34497580-daaf-50cc-841c-a36a82e6aff6', '411ab854-dc1a-546a-a2da-009db62e92af', 'disallow', '/ˌdɪsəˈlaʊ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Từ chối cho phép hoặc chấp thuận điều gì đó.', 'to officially say that something is not allowed or cannot be accepted as valid.', 'Tax authorities may disallow certain business expenses if proper receipts are not provided.', 'Cơ quan thuế có thể không chấp nhận một số chi phí kinh doanh nếu không cung cấp đủ hóa đơn hợp lệ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to disallow the expense report because it lacked the necessary original receipts.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý quyết định từ chối báo cáo chi phí vì nó thiếu các hóa đơn gốc cần thiết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-ljspeech-70378cf4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-cori-70378cf4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disallow-e6fba468.webp', '[\"reject\", \"forbid\"]', '[\"allow\", \"approve\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disallow a claim\", \"meaning\": \"từ chối yêu cầu bồi thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disallow an entry\", \"meaning\": \"không chấp nhận mục nhập\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disallowance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-cori-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru0-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru5-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru6-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru10-70378cf4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru9-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru3-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru7-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru8-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-aru2-70378cf4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-ljspeech-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt408-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt138-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt624-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt396-70378cf4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt498-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt132-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt288-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt42-70378cf4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disallow-lt90-70378cf4.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng trong bối cảnh pháp lý, quy định hoặc thủ tục hành chính.', 'business', 1, 29),
('633e4a48-2f11-515a-8785-788faa95427f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'whizz', '/wɪz/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Di chuyển rất nhanh với âm thanh vù vù.', 'to move extremely fast, often making a continuous humming or buzzing noise.', 'The cars whizzed past us on the highway, heading towards the city.', 'Những chiếc ô tô vút qua chúng tôi trên đường cao tốc, hướng về thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Delivery couriers on motorbikes whizz through city streets to make tight shipping deadlines.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên giao hàng trên xe máy phóng vù vù qua các con phố để kịp thời hạn giao hàng gấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-ljspeech-8d784438.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-cori-8d784438.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whizz-46e3bc77.webp', '[\"zoom\", \"speed\", \"rush\"]', '[\"crawl\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"whizz past\", \"meaning\": \"phóng vụt qua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"whizz by\", \"meaning\": \"lướt qua nhanh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"whizz\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-cori-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru0-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru5-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru6-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru10-8d784438.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru9-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru3-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru7-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru8-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-aru2-8d784438.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-ljspeech-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt408-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt138-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt624-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt396-8d784438.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt498-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt132-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt288-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt42-8d784438.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whizz-lt90-8d784438.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể viết là whizz hoặc whiz, mô tả hành động di chuyển cực nhanh.', 'travel', 1, 0),
('cff635ec-8cc7-591c-a7cb-bf56a5c15b2d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'analyst', 'UK: /ˈænəlɪst/ | US: /ˈænəlɪst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nhà phân tích', 'a specialist who examines data, information, or situations to draw useful conclusions.', 'Market analysts predict a strong economic recovery.', 'Các nhà phân tích thị trường dự đoán nền kinh tế sẽ phục hồi mạnh mẽ.', '{\"en\": \"The financial analyst predicted a steady increase in revenue for the next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà phân tích tài chính đã dự đoán doanh thu sẽ tăng trưởng ổn định trong quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-ljspeech-e366805d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-cori-e366805d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/analyst-ad14f3af.webp', '[\"expert\", \"evaluator\", \"specialist\", \"investigator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"financial analyst\", \"meaning\": \"nhà phân tích tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"data analyst\", \"meaning\": \"nhà phân tích dữ liệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"analyze\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analysis\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"analytical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-cori-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru0-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru5-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru6-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru10-e366805d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru9-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru3-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru7-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru8-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-aru2-e366805d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-ljspeech-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt408-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt138-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt624-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt396-e366805d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt498-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt132-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt288-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt42-e366805d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyst-lt90-e366805d.mp3\"]}}', 'Là danh từ chỉ người chuyên nghiệp (ví dụ: financial analyst - nhà phân tích tài chính).', 'finance', 1, 1),
('19871937-b53f-59bb-9829-80fc869aeefe', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'cold war', '/kəʊld wɔː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Giai đoạn đối đầu chính trị và quân sự giữa các cường quốc mà không có chiến tranh trực tiếp.', 'a long period of political and military tension between powerful nations without direct armed conflict.', 'The Cold War era significantly influenced global politics and international relations for decades.', 'Kỷ nguyên Chiến tranh Lạnh đã ảnh hưởng đáng kể đến chính trị toàn cầu và quan hệ quốc tế trong nhiều thập kỷ.', '{\"en\": \"The documentary series covers the cold war period and its effects on international trade.\", \"vi\": \"Loạt phim tài liệu đề cập đến thời kỳ chiến tranh lạnh và tác động của nó đến thương mại quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-ljspeech-e6d21c98.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-cori-e6d21c98.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cold-war-fe73c4df.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cold war era\", \"meaning\": \"thời đại chiến tranh lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cold war tensions\", \"meaning\": \"căng thẳng thời chiến tranh lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cold war politics\", \"meaning\": \"chính trị thời chiến tranh lạnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"civil war\", \"note_vi\": \"civil war là nội chiến trong một quốc gia, không phải đối đầu giữa các cường quốc\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-cori-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru0-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru5-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru6-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru10-e6d21c98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru9-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru3-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru7-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru8-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-aru2-e6d21c98.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-ljspeech-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt408-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt138-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt624-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt396-e6d21c98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt498-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt132-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt288-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt42-e6d21c98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cold-war-lt90-e6d21c98.mp3\"]}}', 'Cold War (viết hoa) chỉ giai đoạn Mỹ–Xô 1947–1991; viết thường dùng nghĩa rộng hơn.', 'other', 1, 2),
('ef4217d8-e79c-5e23-b4e9-ce8394b4ec33', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'catch on', '/kætʃ ɒn/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'hiểu hoặc nhận ra điều gì đó.', 'to understand something, especially after a long time or with some difficulty.', 'It took him a while to catch on to the new game rules.', 'Anh ấy mất một lúc mới hiểu ra luật chơi mới.', '{\"en\": \"The new employees will quickly catch on to our daily office procedures.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên mới sẽ nhanh chóng nắm bắt được các quy trình văn phòng hàng ngày của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-ljspeech-1d80d445.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-cori-1d80d445.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catch-on-b6a5721a.webp', '[\"understand\", \"comprehend\", \"grasp\"]', '[\"misunderstand\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"catch on quickly\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"catch on to something\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu ra điều gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"catch up\", \"note_vi\": \"catch up là bắt kịp, catch on là hiểu ra hoặc trở nên phổ biến.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-cori-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru0-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru5-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru6-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru10-1d80d445.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru9-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru3-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru7-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru8-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-aru2-1d80d445.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-ljspeech-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt408-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt138-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt624-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt396-1d80d445.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt498-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt132-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt288-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt42-1d80d445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-on-lt90-1d80d445.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa phổ biến khác của catch on là trở nên thịnh hành, được ưa chuộng.', 'hr', 1, 3),
('1db49e91-8e51-5381-b823-b854277f3364', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'synchronize', '/ˈsɪŋkrənaɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho hai hoặc nhiều thứ xảy ra cùng lúc hoặc hoạt động ăn khớp.', 'to make two or more things happen at the same time or work together smoothly.', 'It\'s important to synchronize your watch with the official time before the race starts.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải đồng bộ hóa đồng hồ của bạn với giờ chính thức trước khi cuộc đua bắt đầu.', '{\"en\": \"Please synchronize the project timeline with all department heads before Friday\'s meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đồng bộ hóa tiến độ dự án với tất cả các trưởng phòng trước cuộc họp thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-ljspeech-d8da2c7c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-cori-d8da2c7c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/synchronize-03c607ca.webp', '[\"coordinate\", \"align\", \"harmonize\"]', '[\"desynchronize\", \"clash\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"synchronize with\", \"meaning\": \"đồng bộ với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"synchronize data\", \"meaning\": \"đồng bộ dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"synchronize schedules\", \"meaning\": \"sắp xếp lịch trình ăn khớp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"synthesize\", \"note_vi\": \"synthesize nghĩa là tổng hợp các thành phần, không phải đồng bộ thời gian\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"synchronization\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"synchronized\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"synchronous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-cori-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru0-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru5-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru6-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru10-d8da2c7c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru9-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru3-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru7-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru8-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-aru2-d8da2c7c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-ljspeech-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt408-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt138-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt624-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt396-d8da2c7c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt498-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt132-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt288-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt42-d8da2c7c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/synchronize-lt90-d8da2c7c.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay gặp trong ngữ cảnh công nghệ: \'sync your devices\'; \'synchronize\' là dạng đầy đủ.', 'technology', 1, 4),
('a2ca211d-c605-54bf-8283-6248c1198c8a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'anxiously', '/ˈæŋkʃəsli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách bồn chồn, lo lắng về điều gì đó không chắc chắn.', 'in a way that shows feeling worried, nervous, or uneasy about something.', 'She waited anxiously for the exam results to be posted online.', 'Cô ấy đã chờ đợi một cách lo lắng kết quả thi được đăng tải trực tuyến.', '{\"en\": \"The job applicant waited anxiously in the reception room for her interview results.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên xin việc bồn chồn chờ đợi trong phòng lễ tân để nhận kết quả phỏng vấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-ljspeech-2da5c8ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-cori-2da5c8ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anxiously-ea25b641.webp', '[\"nervously\", \"uneasily\", \"apprehensively\"]', '[\"calmly\", \"confidently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wait anxiously\", \"meaning\": \"bồn chồn chờ đợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look anxiously\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng nhìn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"anxious\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"anxiety\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-cori-2da5c8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-aru0-2da5c8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-aru5-2da5c8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-aru6-2da5c8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-aru10-2da5c8ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-aru9-2da5c8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-aru3-2da5c8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-aru7-2da5c8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiously-aru8-2da5c8ba.mp3\", \"/storage/