('70ff3b68-01f8-55bc-905b-f83b0e110c5e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'flying', '/ˈflaɪɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc quá trình bay.', 'act or process of moving through air using wings or engine.', 'She enjoys the feeling of freedom while flying in a glider.', 'Cô ấy thích cảm giác tự do khi bay trên tàu lượn.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agent arranged flying tickets for the staff conference in Tokyo.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch đã sắp xếp vé bay cho hội nghị nhân viên ở Tokyo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-ljspeech-0974abfe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-cori-0974abfe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flying-f339c666.webp', '[\"flight\", \"aviation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"flying hours\", \"meaning\": \"giờ bay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flying license\", \"meaning\": \"giấy phép bay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gliding\", \"note_vi\": \"gliding là lướt không động cơ, flying có thể có động cơ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-cori-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru0-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru5-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru6-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru10-0974abfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru9-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru3-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru7-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru8-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-aru2-0974abfe.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-ljspeech-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt408-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt138-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt624-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt396-0974abfe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt498-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt132-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt288-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt42-0974abfe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flying-lt90-0974abfe.mp3\"]}}', 'Flying là danh từ chỉ việc bay, không phải tính từ nghĩa bay lượn.', 'travel', 1, 7),
('0f04aee6-9862-5255-bfb4-47770704d15c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'chairperson', 'UK: /ˈtʃeəˌpɜːrsən/ | US: /ˈtʃɛrˌpɜːrsən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'chủ tịch, chủ tọa', 'A person who presides over a meeting, committee, or organization to maintain order.', 'The chairperson opened the meeting with a brief introduction.', 'Chủ tịch khai mạc cuộc họp bằng một lời giới thiệu ngắn gọn.', '{\"en\": \"The chairperson called the board meeting to order at exactly nine o\'clock.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ tọa đã tuyên bố bắt đầu cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị vào đúng 9 giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-ljspeech-36d8a724.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-cori-36d8a724.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chairperson-3a2655a6.webp', '[\"chair\", \"president\", \"head\", \"leader\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"committee chairperson\", \"meaning\": \"chủ tịch ủy ban\"}, {\"phrase\": \"board chairperson\", \"meaning\": \"chủ tịch hội đồng quản trị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chairman\", \"note_vi\": \"Chairman dùng cho nam giới, còn chairperson dùng trung tính cho cả nam và nữ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-cori-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru0-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru5-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru6-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru10-36d8a724.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru9-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru3-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru7-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru8-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-aru2-36d8a724.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-ljspeech-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt408-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt138-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt624-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt396-36d8a724.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt498-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt132-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt288-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt42-36d8a724.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chairperson-lt90-36d8a724.mp3\"]}}', '\'Chairperson\' là từ mang tính trung tính giới tính chỉ người chủ trì cuộc họp hay đứng đầu một ban/ủy ban.', 'corporate leadership', 1, 8),
('d53c6df4-4a9a-5139-a004-d346697cd17d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'floaty', '/ˈfləʊti/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Nhẹ nhàng, bồng bềnh, mềm mại.', 'describing something that is light and moves easily in the air like a piece of cloth.', 'She wore a floaty summer dress that swayed gracefully in the breeze.', 'Cô ấy mặc một chiếc váy mùa hè bồng bềnh nhẹ nhàng đung đưa trong làn gió.', '{\"en\": \"The fashion designer chose a floaty fabric for the new collection of summer office wear.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế thời trang đã chọn loại vải nhẹ nhàng cho bộ sưu tập trang phục công sở mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-ljspeech-83984924.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-cori-83984924.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/floaty-b120ae1a.webp', '[\"airy\", \"light\"]', '[\"heavy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"floaty dress\", \"meaning\": \"váy bồng bềnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"floaty fabric\", \"meaning\": \"vải nhẹ nhàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"float\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-cori-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru0-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru5-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru6-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru10-83984924.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru9-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru3-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru7-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru8-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-aru2-83984924.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-ljspeech-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt408-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt138-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt624-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt396-83984924.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt498-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt132-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt288-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt42-83984924.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/floaty-lt90-83984924.mp3\"]}}', 'thường dùng để mô tả chất liệu vải hoặc trang phục nữ giới.', 'shopping', 1, 9),
('412d263e-82ef-5c5f-b412-0cec9a488bb6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'cubism', '/ˈkjuːbɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Trường phái hội họa lập thể, dùng hình khối để thể hiện vật thể.', 'an early 20th-century art style that uses geometric shapes to show objects from many angles.', 'Picasso is one of the most famous artists associated with Cubism.', 'Picasso là một trong những họa sĩ nổi tiếng nhất gắn liền với trường phái Lập thể.', '{\"en\": \"The gallery\'s new exhibition features works inspired by cubism and modern abstract art.\", \"vi\": \"Triển lãm mới của phòng tranh trưng bày các tác phẩm lấy cảm hứng từ chủ nghĩa lập thể và nghệ thuật trừu tượng hiện đại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-ljspeech-98409839.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-cori-98409839.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cubism-90471313.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"Cubism movement\", \"meaning\": \"phong trào lập thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"influenced by Cubism\", \"meaning\": \"chịu ảnh hưởng của chủ nghĩa lập thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"Cubism style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách lập thể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"surrealism\", \"note_vi\": \"surrealism là chủ nghĩa siêu thực, khác hoàn toàn với lập thể\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cubist\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cubist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-cori-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru0-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru5-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru6-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru10-98409839.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru9-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru3-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru7-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru8-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-aru2-98409839.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-ljspeech-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt408-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt138-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt624-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt396-98409839.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt498-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt132-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt288-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt42-98409839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cubism-lt90-98409839.mp3\"]}}', 'Cubism viết hoa khi chỉ trường phái nghệ thuật cụ thể, viết thường khi dùng chung.', 'other', 1, 10),
('7cae727c-7df7-57bf-8ce5-5bf3325b1927', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'assure', 'UK: /əˈʃɔː/ | US: /əˈʃʊr/', 'B2', 'verb', 'đảm bảo, cam đoan', 'to inform someone positively and confidently in order to remove their doubts.', 'We assure customers of the quality of our products.', 'Chúng tôi đảm bảo với khách hàng về chất lượng sản phẩm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The sales representative assured the client that the project would be completed on schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện kinh doanh đã cam đoan với khách hàng rằng dự án sẽ hoàn thành đúng tiến độ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-ljspeech-a90bcd21.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-cori-a90bcd21.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assure-a7218e67.webp', '[\"reassure\", \"guarantee\", \"promise\"]', '[\"alarm\", \"dissuade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"assure someone of something\", \"meaning\": \"cam đoan với ai về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rest assured\", \"meaning\": \"yên tâm rằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ensure\", \"note_vi\": \"Ensure nghĩa là đảm bảo điều gì xảy ra (không cần tân ngữ chỉ người như assure).\"}, {\"word\": \"insure\", \"note_vi\": \"Insure là mua hoặc bán hợp đồng bảo hiểm tài chính.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assurance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"assured\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-cori-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru0-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru5-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru6-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru10-a90bcd21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru9-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru3-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru7-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru8-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-aru2-a90bcd21.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-ljspeech-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt408-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt138-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt624-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt396-a90bcd21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt498-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt132-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt288-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt42-a90bcd21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assure-lt90-a90bcd21.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc kinh điển: \'assure SOMEONE that/of something\' (bắt buộc phải có tân ngữ chỉ người đứng ngay sau). Phân biệt với \'ensure\' (+ mệnh đề/danh từ).', 'customer service', 1, 11),
('6cdb767b-94e2-5b08-a7ac-f8e20e288b5c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'certainty', 'UK: /ˈsɜːtnti/ | US: /ˈsɜːrtnti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự chắc chắn', 'The state of being completely confident about something without any doubt or hesitation.', 'We can\'t predict the future with certainty.', 'Chúng tôi không thể dự đoán tương lai một cách chắc chắn.', '{\"en\": \"There is no certainty that the proposed merger will receive regulatory approval by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Không có sự chắc chắn nào rằng thương vụ sáp nhập được đề xuất sẽ nhận được sự phê duyệt của cơ quan quản lý trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-ljspeech-1f401e4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-cori-1f401e4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/certainty-beedccc0.webp', '[\"sureness\", \"confidence\", \"conviction\", \"guarantee\"]', '[\"uncertainty\", \"doubt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"with certainty\", \"meaning\": \"với sự chắc chắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"absolute certainty\", \"meaning\": \"sự chắc chắn tuyệt đối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"certificate\", \"note_vi\": \"Certificate là bằng cấp/chứng chỉ (danh từ chỉ vật), còn certainty là sự chắc chắn (danh từ trừu tượng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"certain\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"certainly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-cori-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru0-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru5-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru6-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru10-1f401e4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru9-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru3-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru7-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru8-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-aru2-1f401e4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-ljspeech-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt408-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt138-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt624-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt396-1f401e4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt498-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt132-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt288-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt42-1f401e4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/certainty-lt90-1f401e4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ của \'certain\'. Thường đi trong cụm \'with certainty\' (một cách chắc chắn) hoặc \'there is no certainty that...\'.', 'general business', 1, 12),
('6aa11a2a-224b-5556-bd6f-0768cdc4af62', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'consistently', '/kənˈsɪstəntli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'một cách nhất quán, luôn luôn giữ vững.', 'in a way that is always the same and does not change over time.', 'Our customer service team consistently delivers high-quality assistance to all clients.', 'Đội ngũ dịch vụ khách hàng của chúng tôi luôn cung cấp sự hỗ trợ chất lượng cao cho tất cả khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Our team consistently meets the monthly sales targets ahead of schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ của chúng tôi luôn đạt chỉ tiêu bán hàng tháng trước thời hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-ljspeech-94f2f00e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-cori-94f2f00e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consistently-362bb419.webp', '[\"steadily\", \"uniformly\"]', '[\"inconsistently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"consistently high\", \"meaning\": \"luôn cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consistently perform\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện nhất quán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consistently meet\", \"meaning\": \"luôn đáp ứng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"constantly\", \"note_vi\": \"constantly là liên tục, consistently là nhất quán\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"consistent\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consistency\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-cori-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru0-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru5-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru6-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru10-94f2f00e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consistently-aru9-94f2f00e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cons