('f4ca5ff8-3219-5277-904b-cea99a753d68', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'listless', '/ˈlɪstləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Mệt mỏi, uể oải, thiếu năng lượng hoặc nhiệt tình.', 'lacking energy, enthusiasm, or interest to do anything because of tiredness or illness.', 'After a long flight, she felt listless and just wanted to rest.', 'Sau một chuyến bay dài, cô ấy cảm thấy uể oải và chỉ muốn nghỉ ngơi.', '{\"en\": \"The staff members appeared listless after working overtime to meet the tight project deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên trông uể oải sau khi làm thêm giờ để đáp ứng thời hạn dự án gấp gáp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-ljspeech-00bb2a1c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-cori-00bb2a1c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/listless-e9bb1c47.webp', '[\"lethargic\", \"apathetic\", \"sluggish\"]', '[\"energetic\", \"lively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel listless\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy uể oải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"listless attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ uể oải\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"restless\", \"note_vi\": \"restless là bồn chồn/không yên, listless là uể oải/thiếu năng lượng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"listlessly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"listlessness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-cori-00bb2a1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-aru0-00bb2a1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-aru5-00bb2a1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-aru6-00bb2a1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-aru10-00bb2a1c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-aru9-00bb2a1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/listless-aru3-00bb2a1c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation