('f643899f-527b-54bd-bd66-f67837a812e7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'blueshift', '/ˈbluːʃɪft/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng ánh sáng dịch về phía màu xanh trong quang phổ.', 'a shift of light toward the shorter, blue end of the visible spectrum.', 'Astronomers observe a blueshift in the light from a galaxy moving towards Earth.', 'Các nhà thiên văn học quan sát thấy sự dịch chuyển xanh trong ánh sáng từ một thiên hà đang di chuyển về phía Trái Đất.', '{\"en\": \"The research team studied the blueshift data to understand the movement of distant stars.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đã nghiên cứu dữ liệu dịch chuyển xanh để hiểu sự chuyển động của các ngôi sao xa xôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-ljspeech-8eede55b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-cori-8eede55b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blueshift-f1dabe70.webp', NULL, '[\"redshift\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"observe blueshift\", \"meaning\": \"quan sát hiện tượng dịch chuyển xanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blueshift data\", \"meaning\": \"dữ liệu dịch chuyển xanh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-cori-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru0-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru5-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru6-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru10-8eede55b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru9-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru3-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru7-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru8-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-aru2-8eede55b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-ljspeech-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt408-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt138-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt624-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt396-8eede55b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt498-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt132-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt288-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt42-8eede55b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blueshift-lt90-8eede55b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ chuyên ngành vật lý thiên văn.', 'academic', 1, 26),
('c88980f8-b568-50f3-8fc1-34af71d05484', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'profound', '/prəˈfaʊnd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'rất sâu sắc, uyên thâm; mạnh mẽ, to lớn.', 'showing great knowledge or having a very strong effect on someone or something.', 'The sudden economic downturn brought profound changes to how local businesses operate.', 'Sự suy thoái kinh tế đột ngột đã mang lại những thay đổi sâu sắc cho cách các doanh nghiệp địa phương vận hành.', '{\"en\": \"The merger had a profound impact on the financial growth of both companies.\", \"vi\": \"Vụ sáp nhập đã có tác động sâu sắc đến sự phát triển tài chính của cả hai công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-ljspeech-0d8898fc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-cori-0d8898fc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/profound-8dcc24ef.webp', '[\"deep\", \"far-reaching\"]', '[\"superficial\", \"slight\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"profound impact\", \"meaning\": \"tác động sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"profound knowledge\", \"meaning\": \"tri thức sâu rộng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"profoundly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"profundity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-cori-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru0-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru5-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru6-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru10-0d8898fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru9-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru3-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru7-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru8-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-aru2-0d8898fc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-ljspeech-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt408-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt138-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt624-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt396-0d8898fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt498-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt132-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt288-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt42-0d8898fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profound-lt90-0d8898fc.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với các từ chỉ ảnh hưởng như impact, effect, influence.', 'business', 1, 27),
('f61e1e5f-0015-59d0-81f2-4502be933d9f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'insomnia', '/ɪnˈsɒmniə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Chứng khó ngủ hoặc không thể ngủ được.', 'a condition where a person finds it very difficult to fall or stay asleep regularly.', 'She has been suffering from insomnia for weeks, making her feel tired all the time.', 'Cô ấy đã bị chứng mất ngủ trong nhiều tuần, khiến cô ấy luôn cảm thấy mệt mỏi.', '{\"en\": \"High stress levels at work often lead to insomnia, affecting the employee\'s overall daily productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Mức độ căng thẳng cao tại nơi làm việc thường dẫn đến chứng mất ngủ, ảnh hưởng năng suất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-ljspeech-b2719240.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-cori-b2719240.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/insomnia-c9ee8066.webp', '[\"sleeplessness\", \"wakefulness\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suffer from insomnia\", \"meaning\": \"bị chứng mất ngủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chronic insomnia\", \"meaning\": \"mất ngủ kinh niên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"insomniac\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-cori-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru0-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru5-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru6-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru10-b2719240.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru9-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru3-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru7-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru8-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-aru2-b2719240.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-ljspeech-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt408-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt138-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt624-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt396-b2719240.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt498-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt132-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt288-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt42-b2719240.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insomnia-lt90-b2719240.mp3\"]}}', '\"In-\" là tiền tố phủ định, \"somnia\" liên quan đến giấc ngủ.', 'health', 1, 28),
('8f74997a-9283-5665-971e-3a1f6c1f1767', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '39277b99-376c-53b2-ae2a-71d597f6ec86', '6ba1704b-d906-5be0-95b7-86a4104fa1b6', 'crackling', '/ˈkræklɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Tạo ra âm thanh lách tách nhỏ, giòn.', 'making short, sharp noises repeatedly, like something burning in a fire or being crushed.', 'The old radio made a strange crackling noise during the severe thunderstorm.', 'Chiếc đài cũ phát ra tiếng lách tách kỳ lạ trong suốt trận bão lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The technician fixed the speaker system to eliminate the annoying crackling sound during our video conferences.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã sửa hệ thống loa để loại bỏ âm thanh lách tách khó chịu trong các cuộc họp trực tuyến của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-ljspeech-d4999e53.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-cori-d4999e53.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crackling-9101a716.webp', '[\"popping\", \"snapping\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"crackling sound\", \"meaning\": \"âm thanh lách tách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crackling noise\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng lách tách\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"crackle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-cori-d4999e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-aru0-d4999e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-aru5-d4999e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-aru6-d4999e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-aru10-d4999e53.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-aru9-d4999e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-aru3-d4999e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-aru7-d4999e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crackling-aru8-d4999e53.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p