('f7a44923-3a53-58e6-910d-1f7f544ef0ee', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3cb101d8-fa69-5837-8d8a-419f561f8dfa', '973cb442-1059-5b93-88ff-d207cb025afd', 'rehearsal', '/rɪˈhɜːsl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Buổi thực hành chuẩn bị cho một buổi biểu diễn, sự kiện hoặc chương trình.', 'a practice session held before a public performance or important event.', 'Actors gathered on stage early this morning for their mandatory dress rehearsal.', 'Các diễn viên đã tập hợp trên sân khấu vào sáng sớm nay cho buổi tổng duyệt trang phục bắt buộc của họ.', '{\"en\": \"All staff must attend the dress rehearsal for the annual company awards ceremony tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải tham dự buổi tổng duyệt cho lễ trao giải thưởng thường niên của công ty vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-ljspeech-d6cb3ba3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-cori-d6cb3ba3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rehearsal-b6310daa.webp', '[\"practice\", \"run-through\", \"dry run\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dress rehearsal\", \"meaning\": \"buổi tổng duyệt (mặc trang phục đầy đủ)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"final rehearsal\", \"meaning\": \"buổi tập cuối cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold a rehearsal\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức buổi tập duyệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"recital\", \"note_vi\": \"recital là buổi biểu diễn thật sự (thường âm nhạc), rehearsal chỉ là buổi tập\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rehearse\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rehearsed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-cori-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru0-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru5-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru6-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru10-d6cb3ba3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru9-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru3-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru7-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru8-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-aru2-d6cb3ba3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-ljspeech-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt408-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt138-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt624-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt396-d6cb3ba3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt498-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt132-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt288-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt42-d6cb3ba3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rehearsal-lt90-d6cb3ba3.mp3\"]}}', '\'Dress rehearsal\' là buổi tổng duyệt với đầy đủ trang phục — cụm từ hay gặp trong TOEIC.', 'other', 1, 28),
('41df541c-42c3-5e4a-892c-2423845281d7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3cb101d8-fa69-5837-8d8a-419f561f8dfa', '973cb442-1059-5b93-88ff-d207cb025afd', 'noble', '/ˈnəʊbl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người thuộc tầng lớp quý tộc, dòng dõi cao quý.', 'a person born into a high social rank with special privileges.', 'In ancient times, a noble often held significant power and land.', 'Thời xa xưa, một quý tộc thường nắm giữ quyền lực và đất đai đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel was once owned by a noble family from the region.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn này từng được sở hữu bởi một gia đình quý tộc trong vùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-ljspeech-8eca84b7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-cori-8eca84b7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/noble-5912a7f5.webp', '[\"aristocrat\", \"lord\"]', '[\"commoner\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"noble family\", \"meaning\": \"gia đình quý tộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"noble rank\", \"meaning\": \"tước vị quý tộc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nobel\", \"note_vi\": \"nobel là giải thưởng, noble là quý tộc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nobility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"noble\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-cori-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru0-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru5-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru6-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru10-8eca84b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru9-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru3-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru7-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru8-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-aru2-8eca84b7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-ljspeech-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt408-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt138-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt624-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt396-8eca84b7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt498-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt132-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt288-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt42-8eca84b7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noble-lt90-8eca84b7.mp3\"]}}', 'Noble làm danh từ nghĩa quý tộc, làm tính từ nghĩa cao quý.', 'housing', 1, 29),
('13c751d2-e4ec-5e05-8829-6ffe877d069d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'output', '/ˈaʊtpʊt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sản phẩm, lượng sản xuất hoặc kết quả của một quá trình.', 'the amount of something that a person, machine, or organization produces.', 'The factory increased its daily output by 10% after upgrading the machinery.', 'Nhà máy đã tăng sản lượng hàng ngày lên 10% sau khi nâng cấp máy móc.', '{\"en\": \"The assembly line managed to double its daily output after installing automated machinery.\", \"vi\": \"Dây chuyền lắp ráp đã tăng gấp đôi sản lượng hàng ngày sau khi lắp đặt máy móc tự động.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-ljspeech-1029d676.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-cori-1029d676.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/output-77e6c505.webp', '[\"production\", \"yield\", \"result\"]', '[\"input\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"total output\", \"meaning\": \"tổng sản lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"increase output\", \"meaning\": \"tăng sản lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"industrial output\", \"meaning\": \"sản lượng công nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"input\", \"note_vi\": \"input là dữ liệu hoặc nguyên liệu đầu vào, ngược nghĩa với output\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"output\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-cori-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru0-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru5-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru6-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru10-1029d676.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru9-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru3-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru7-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru8-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-aru2-1029d676.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-ljspeech-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt408-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt138-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt624-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt396-1029d676.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt498-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt132-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt288-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt42-1029d676.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/output-lt90-1029d676.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là danh từ (sản lượng), vừa là động từ (xuất dữ liệu/sản phẩm).', 'manufacturing', 1, 0),
('1909e6d6-b74f-5c1b-acdf-cf70b6a62585', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'seasonally', '/ˈsiːzənəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Theo chu kỳ của các mùa trong năm.', 'in a way that relates to or depends on a particular period of the year.', 'Many fruits are only available seasonally, like cherries in summer.', 'Nhiều loại trái cây chỉ có theo mùa, ví dụ như anh đào vào mùa hè.', '{\"en\": \"The resort hires additional service staff seasonally to accommodate high numbers of summer tourists.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng tuyển thêm nhân viên dịch vụ theo mùa để đáp ứng lượng khách du lịch mùa hè đông đúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-ljspeech-88893dd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-cori-88893dd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seasonally-77e34e26.webp', '[\"periodically\"]', '[\"permanently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"adjust seasonally\", \"meaning\": \"điều chỉnh theo mùa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hire seasonally\", \"meaning\": \"tuyển dụng theo mùa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"season\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"seasonal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-cori-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru0-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru5-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru6-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru10-88893dd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru9-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru3-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru7-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru8-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-aru2-88893dd1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-ljspeech-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt408-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt138-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt624-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt396-88893dd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt498-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt132-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt288-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt42-88893dd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seasonally-lt90-88893dd1.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay xuất hiện trong các bài đọc TOEIC nói về tuyển dụng thời vụ (seasonally hired workers).', 'hr', 1, 1),
('f3f11c53-7f9e-59ce-873d-bbad86358244', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'actively', 'UK: /ˈæk.tɪv.li/ | US: /ˈæk.tɪv.li/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách tích cực', 'in a dynamic way that involves enthusiastic participation and direct effort', 'The team members actively participated in the training session.', 'Các thành viên trong nhóm đã tích cực tham gia vào buổi tập huấn.', '{\"en\": \"Our headhunting department is actively recruiting qualified software engineers for the new office.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận săn nhân tài của chúng tôi đang tích cực tuyển dụng các kỹ sư phần mềm đủ năng lực cho văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-ljspeech-bfbb15f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-cori-bfbb15f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/actively-893d7337.webp', '[\"energetically\", \"enthusiastically\", \"vigorously\"]', '[\"passively\", \"inactively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"actively seek\", \"meaning\": \"tích cực tìm kiếm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"actively participate\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia tích cực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"active\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"activity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-cori-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru0-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru5-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru6-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru10-bfbb15f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru9-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru3-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru7-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru8-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-aru2-bfbb15f2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-ljspeech-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt408-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt138-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt624-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt396-bfbb15f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt498-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt132-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt288-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt42-bfbb15f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actively-lt90-bfbb15f2.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay bổ nghĩa cho các động từ hành động như seek, recruit, participate, engage.', 'human resources', 1, 2),
('f9169552-adf8-5766-84b6-bde0621718a1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'dictate', '/dɪkˈteɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Ra lệnh, chỉ thị hoặc kiểm soát.', 'to give orders, make rules, or control how something is done.', 'The terms of the contract were dictated by the larger company.', 'Các điều khoản của hợp đồng đã được công ty lớn hơn ra lệnh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will dictate the new safety guidelines during the staff meeting tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý sẽ chỉ thị các hướng dẫn an toàn mới trong cuộc họp nhân viên ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-ljspeech-9f4acf4e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-cori-9f4acf4e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dictate-4bcd11f9.webp', '[\"command\", \"order\", \"control\"]', '[\"obey\", \"follow\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dictate terms\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt các điều khoản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dictate policy\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định chính sách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dedicate\", \"note_vi\": \"dedicate là cống hiến, dictate là ra lệnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dictation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dictator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-cori-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru0-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru5-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru6-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru10-9f4acf4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru9-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru3-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru7-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru8-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-aru2-9f4acf4e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-ljspeech-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt408-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt138-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt624-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt396-9f4acf4e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt498-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt132-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt288-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt42-9f4acf4e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dictate-lt90-9f4acf4e.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với dedicate (cống hiến) vì viết gần giống nhau.', 'office', 1, 3),
('72a08d99-3b17-54d5-ba49-eda62777f872', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'taboo', '/təˈbuː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Điều bị cấm hoặc bị coi là không được chấp nhận trong một nền văn hóa.', 'a social custom that forbids people from doing or talking about something.', 'In some cultures, discussing death openly is a taboo.', 'Ở một số nền văn hóa, việc thảo luận công khai về cái chết là một điều cấm kỵ.', '{\"en\": \"Discussing salary details with colleagues is often considered a taboo in many corporate environments.\", \"vi\": \"Việc thảo luận chi tiết lương với đồng nghiệp thường được coi là điều cấm kỵ trong nhiều môi trường công sở.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-ljspeech-3d25d9dc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-cori-3d25d9dc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/taboo-226f22e2.webp', '[\"prohibition\", \"ban\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"social taboo\", \"meaning\": \"điều cấm kỵ xã hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"break a taboo\", \"meaning\": \"phá vỡ điều cấm kỵ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"taboo\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-cori-3d25d9dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru0-3d25d9dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru5-3d25d9dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru6-3d25d9dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru10-3d25d9dc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru9-3d25d9dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru3-3d25d9dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru7-3d25d9dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru8-3d25d9dc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taboo-aru2-3d25d9dc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stora