('f49c0254-682f-52c6-a668-4c61a782abd2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'transform', 'UK: /trænsˈfɔːm/ | US: /trænsˈfɔrm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'biến đổi', 'to change the form, appearance, or character of something completely.', 'Digital tools can transform business operations.', 'Các công cụ kỹ thuật số có thể biến đổi hoạt động kinh doanh.', '{\"en\": \"The digital strategy helped transform the traditional bookstore into a thriving online retailer.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến lược kỹ thuật số đã giúp biến đổi cửa hàng sách truyền thống thành một nhà bán lẻ trực tuyến phát triển mạnh mẽ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-ljspeech-dd8ce13a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-cori-dd8ce13a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/transform-90ee9cfc.webp', '[\"convert\", \"alter\", \"reshape\", \"revolutionize\"]', '[\"preserve\", \"maintain\", \"retain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"transform into\", \"meaning\": \"biến đổi thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"completely transform\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi/biến đổi hoàn toàn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"transfer\", \"note_vi\": \"transfer liên quan đến di chuyển vị trí/tiền bạc; transform là thay đổi hình thái/bản chất.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"transformation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"transformative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-cori-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru0-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru5-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru6-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru10-dd8ce13a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru9-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru3-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru7-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru8-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-aru2-dd8ce13a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-ljspeech-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt408-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt138-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt624-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt396-dd8ce13a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt498-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt132-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt288-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt42-dd8ce13a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transform-lt90-dd8ce13a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'into\' (transform A into B: biến đổi A thành B).', 'business', 1, 7),
('1fb1b52c-14f3-5c38-9e0e-b9c7b569ec8a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'reserve', '/rɪˈzɜːv/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một lượng tài nguyên, hàng hóa hoặc tiền bạc được giữ lại để sử dụng trong tương lai.', 'a supply of something that is kept to be used if it is needed later.', 'The country has large oil reserves under its territory.', 'Quốc gia này có trữ lượng dầu mỏ lớn dưới lãnh thổ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The company maintains a cash reserve to cover unexpected expenses during the slow business season.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty duy trì một khoản dự trữ tiền mặt để chi trả các chi phí bất ngờ trong mùa kinh doanh thấp điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-ljspeech-5bac43c0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-cori-5bac43c0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reserve-548f17ad.webp', '[\"stockpile\", \"supply\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cash reserve\", \"meaning\": \"dự trữ tiền mặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"natural resource reserve\", \"meaning\": \"dự trữ tài nguyên thiên nhiên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reserve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-cori-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru0-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru5-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru6-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru10-5bac43c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru9-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru3-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru7-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru8-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-aru2-5bac43c0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-ljspeech-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt408-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt138-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt624-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt396-5bac43c0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt498-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt132-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt288-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt42-5bac43c0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserve-lt90-5bac43c0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh tài chính hoặc tài nguyên.', 'finance', 1, 8),
('d8d6ff5b-abef-5f67-a004-e51e47acd06b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'pretentious', '/prɪˈtenʃəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Cố tỏ ra quan trọng, thông minh hơn thực tế để gây ấn tượng.', 'trying to appear more important, intelligent, or high-class than one actually is.', 'His speech was full of pretentious words that no one really understood.', 'Bài phát biểu của anh ấy đầy những từ ngữ khoe khoang mà không ai thực sự hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant received bad reviews for its pretentious atmosphere and overpriced menu.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng nhận được những đánh giá không tốt vì bầu không khí tự cao tự đại và thực đơn quá đắt đỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-ljspeech-be2d0073.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-cori-be2d0073.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pretentious-1f002131.webp', '[\"showy\", \"affected\", \"ostentatious\"]', '[\"modest\", \"humble\", \"simple\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pretentious language\", \"meaning\": \"ngôn từ tự cao/kiêu kỳ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pretentious style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách tự cao/kiêu kỳ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pretend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pretension\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-cori-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru0-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru5-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru6-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru10-be2d0073.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru9-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru3-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru7-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru8-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-aru2-be2d0073.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-ljspeech-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt408-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt138-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt624-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt396-be2d0073.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt498-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt132-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt288-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt42-be2d0073.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pretentious-lt90-be2d0073.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ là pretend (giả vờ), mang nghĩa tiêu cực chỉ sự làm bộ làm tịch.', 'dining', 1, 9),
('e47387f4-7ae9-5425-b27c-cf9f8dbe7544', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'liturgy', '/ˈlɪtədʒi/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Nghi thức, nghi lễ tôn giáo chính thức của một giáo phái.', 'a fixed form of public worship used in a religious group.', 'The church\'s liturgy included hymns, prayers, and readings from the Bible.', 'Nghi thức phụng vụ của nhà thờ bao gồm các bài thánh ca, lời cầu nguyện và các đoạn đọc từ Kinh Thánh.', '{\"en\": \"The venue coordinator printed the official liturgy program for the Sunday ceremony.\", \"vi\": \"Người điều phối địa điểm đã in chương trình nghi lễ chính thức cho buổi lễ Chủ nhật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-ljspeech-02c3030e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-cori-02c3030e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/liturgy-5e2cc12a.webp', '[\"ritual\", \"service\", \"ceremony\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"divine liturgy\", \"meaning\": \"phụng vụ thánh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"church liturgy\", \"meaning\": \"nghi thức nhà thờ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"liturgical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-cori-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru0-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru5-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru6-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru10-02c3030e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru9-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru3-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru7-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru8-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-aru2-02c3030e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-ljspeech-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt408-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt138-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt624-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt396-02c3030e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt498-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt132-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt288-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt42-02c3030e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liturgy-lt90-02c3030e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ vựng thuộc chủ đề tôn giáo, hiếm khi xuất hiện trong môi trường làm việc TOEIC.', 'other', 1, 10),
('05b3ddc8-931f-58f7-9375-0a594887b521', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'ponderous', '/ˈpɒndərəs/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Rất nặng nề, cồng kềnh và chậm chạp.', 'moving slowly and heavily, or completely lacking grace because of great weight.', 'The old book was a ponderous tome filled with complex theories.', 'Cuốn sách cũ là một tập sách dày cộp, nặng nề chứa đầy những lý thuyết phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery workers struggled to move the ponderous wooden crates into the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên giao hàng đã chật vật di chuyển những chiếc thùng gỗ nặng nề vào kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-ljspeech-a210ad39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-cori-a210ad39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ponderous-24405629.webp', '[\"heavy\", \"clumsy\", \"cumbersome\"]', '[\"light\", \"graceful\", \"agile\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ponderous movement\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển động chậm chạp nặng nề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ponderous style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách nặng nề/tẻ nhạt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ponder\", \"note_vi\": \"ponder là động từ suy ngẫm, ponderous là tính từ nặng nề.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ponderously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-cori-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru0-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru5-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru6-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru10-a210ad39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru9-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru3-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru7-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru8-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-aru2-a210ad39.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-ljspeech-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt408-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt138-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt624-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt396-a210ad39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt498-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt132-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt288-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt42-a210ad39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ponderous-lt90-a210ad39.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với động từ ponder (suy nghĩ, cân nhắc).', 'manufacturing', 1, 11),
('36efe884-b5c7-50b0-a43e-9a49fbbe4fb9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'shrug', '/ʃrʌɡ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Nhấc vai lên xuống để thể hiện sự không quan tâm hoặc không biết.', 'to raise your shoulders briefly to show that you do not know something.', 'When asked about his plans, he just shrugged, indicating he had no idea.', 'Khi được hỏi về kế hoạch của mình, anh ấy chỉ nhún vai, ra hiệu là mình không biết.', '{\"en\": \"The assistant just shrugged when asked about the missing files from the office cabinet.\", \"vi\": \"Người trợ lý chỉ nhún vai khi được hỏi về các tập tin bị thiếu trong tủ văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-ljspeech-d2ec8455.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-cori-d2ec8455.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shrug-28b25cd2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shrug one\'s shoulders\", \"meaning\": \"nhún vai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shrug off\", \"meaning\": \"phớt lờ, coi nhẹ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-cori-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru0-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru5-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru6-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru10-d2ec8455.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru9-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru3-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru7-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru8-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-aru2-d2ec8455.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-ljspeech-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt408-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt138-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt624-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt396-d2ec8455.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt498-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt132-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt288-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt42-d2ec8455.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrug-lt90-d2ec8455.mp3\"]}}', 'Hành động cơ thể thể hiện sự thờ ơ hoặc không biết.', 'office', 1, 12),
('1ce33821-1c16-548b-b4c6-6540d55a8dfd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'approve', 'UK: /əˈpruːv/ | US: /əˈpruːv/', 'B1', 'verb', 'phê duyệt, chấp thuận', 'To officially accept, consent to, or agree to a plan or proposal.', 'The board needs to approve the new budget plan.', 'Hội đồng quản trị cần phê duyệt kế hoạch ngân sách mới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager agreed to approve the travel expense request without delay.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đồng ý phê duyệt yêu cầu chi phí đi lại mà không chậm trễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-ljspeech-e4788b8a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-cori-e4788b8a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/approve-bfa509e5.webp', '[\"authorize\", \"sanction\", \"endorse\"]', '[\"reject\", \"disapprove\", \"deny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"approve a budget\", \"meaning\": \"phê duyệt ngân sách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"approve of a plan\", \"meaning\": \"tán thành một kế hoạch\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"approval\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"approved\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-cori-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru0-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru5-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru6-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru10-e4788b8a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru9-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru3-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru7-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru8-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-aru2-e4788b8a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-ljspeech-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt408-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt138-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt624-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt396-e4788b8a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt498-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt132-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt288-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt42-e4788b8a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approve-lt90-e4788b8a.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa \'phê duyệt tài liệu/ngân sách\' dùng \'approve sth\'; nghĩa \'tán thành/ủng hộ hành vi\' dùng \'approve of sth\'.', 'office', 1, 13),
('84158c27-a348-5750-96f6-7cd21b3a0297', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'reboot', '/ˈriːbuːt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động khởi động lại một hệ thống (máy tính, thiết bị).', 'the act of restarting a computer system or electronic device to work properly.', 'You should reboot your laptop after installing the latest system updates.', 'Bạn nên khởi động lại máy tính xách tay sau khi cài đặt các bản cập nhật hệ thống mới nhất.', '{\"en\": \"The technician suggested a full reboot of the server to resolve the connectivity issue.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đề xuất khởi động lại toàn bộ máy chủ để giải quyết sự cố kết nối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-ljspeech-531c9e1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-cori-531c9e1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reboot-79a13e49.webp', '[\"restart\", \"reset\"]', '[\"shutdown\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"system reboot\", \"meaning\": \"việc khởi động lại hệ thống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"require a reboot\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu khởi động lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"force a reboot\", \"meaning\": \"bắt buộc khởi động lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"restart\", \"note_vi\": \"reboot dùng cho phần cứng hay hệ thống máy tính, restart dùng rộng rãi hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reboot\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-cori-531c9e1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-aru0-531c9e1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-aru5-531c9e1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-aru6-531c9e1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-aru10-531c9e1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-aru9-531c9e1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reboot-aru3-531c9e1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronun