('198cd618-8b88-59c3-937f-3149b488b99b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3d4d386f-375e-5a77-bad4-d4575a50784a', '911d461f-eb39-57f3-bd6f-b34aa3cc55aa', 'skeletal', '/ˈskelətl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Gầy trơ xương, chỉ còn da bọc xương.', 'being very thin because of illness or lack of food, showing the bones.', 'After weeks of illness, the stray dog looked almost skeletal.', 'Sau nhiều tuần bị bệnh, con chó hoang trông gần như gầy trơ xương.', '{\"en\": \"The archeologists discovered skeletal remains during the excavation for the new office building.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà khảo cổ đã phát hiện ra hài cốt chỉ còn xương trong quá trình đào móng xây dựng tòa nhà văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-ljspeech-51db86d1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-cori-51db86d1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/skeletal-0407405d.webp', '[\"bony\", \"emaciated\", \"scrawny\"]', '[\"plump\", \"fleshy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"skeletal remains\", \"meaning\": \"hài cốt chỉ còn xương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"skeletal structure\", \"meaning\": \"cấu trúc xương\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"skeleton\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-cori-51db86d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru0-51db86d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru5-51db86d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru6-51db86d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru10-51db86d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru9-51db86d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru3-51db86d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru7-51db86d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru8-51db86d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/skeletal-aru2-5