('6aa7c732-e8b3-5526-ac79-abc0fbddcbb2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3f00c09c-8fb8-5a5e-a16a-75a41dbd5327', 'be85c457-7679-5aa4-9f9b-7595dfd65a0c', 'naked', '/ˈneɪkɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'không mặc quần áo, trần truồng.', 'not wearing any clothes on the body.', 'The baby was running around the house naked, enjoying the warm weather.', 'Em bé chạy khắp nhà trong tình trạng khỏa thân, tận hưởng thời tiết ấm áp.', '{\"en\": \"The product advertisement was criticized for using a naked model to sell simple kitchen appliances.\", \"vi\": \"Quảng cáo sản phẩm bị chỉ trích vì sử dụng người mẫu khỏa thân để bán các thiết bị nhà bếp đơn giản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-ljspeech-842df0e2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-cori-842df0e2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/naked-7e86577d.webp', '[\"unclothed\", \"bare\"]', '[\"clothed\", \"dressed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"naked eye\", \"meaning\": \"mắt thường\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-cori-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru0-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru5-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru6-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru10-842df0e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru9-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru3-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru7-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru8-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-aru2-842df0e2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-ljspeech-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt408-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt138-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt624-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt396-842df0e2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt498-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt132-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt288-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt42-842df0e2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naked-lt90-842df0e2.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng \'naked truth\' rất hay gặp trong văn phong báo chí.', 'other', 1, 16),
('226b11f7-becd-5c47-9800-f2f3ab19273d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3f00c09c-8fb8-5a5e-a16a-75a41dbd5327', 'be85c457-7679-5aa4-9f9b-7595dfd65a0c', 'muscle-bound', '/ˈmʌs.əl.baʊnd/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có cơ bắp phát triển quá mức, làm giảm sự linh hoạt.', 'having large, stiff body parts that make it difficult to move easily or bend.', 'Despite being very strong, the muscle-bound bodybuilder found it hard to move quickly.', 'Mặc dù rất khỏe, người tập thể hình quá cơ bắp lại thấy khó di chuyển nhanh nhẹn.', '{\"en\": \"The gym hired a trainer who was not muscle-bound but possessed great flexibility.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tập đã thuê một huấn luyện viên không quá đô con nhưng có sự linh hoạt tuyệt vời.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-ljspeech-df20c569.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-cori-df20c569.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/muscle-bound-b5693cb8.webp', '[\"muscular\", \"brawny\"]', '[\"flabby\", \"weak\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"muscle-bound athlete\", \"meaning\": \"vận động viên cơ bắp cuồn cuộn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"muscle-bound bodybuilder\", \"meaning\": \"lực sĩ thể hình cơ bắp quá khổ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"muscular\", \"note_vi\": \"có cơ bắp khỏe mạnh, không mang nghĩa tiêu cực\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-cori-df20c569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-aru0-df20c569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-aru5-df20c569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-aru6-df20c569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-aru10-df20c569.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-aru9-df20c569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-aru3-df20c569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muscle-bound-aru7-df20c