('75c1eceb-ba38-509c-b9c6-7d4ec5b69f20', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '3f00c09c-8fb8-5a5e-a16a-75a41dbd5327', 'be85c457-7679-5aa4-9f9b-7595dfd65a0c', 'reserved', '/rɪˈzɜːvd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Kín đáo, ít nói, không bộc lộ cảm xúc dễ dàng.', 'tending to keep your feelings or thoughts private instead of sharing them with others.', 'She\'s usually quite reserved, but she opened up a lot after a few drinks.', 'Cô ấy thường khá kín đáo, nhưng cô ấy đã cởi mở hơn nhiều sau vài ly rượu.', '{\"en\": \"He is a very reserved person who prefers to work alone rather than in teams.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy là một người khá kín đáo, người thích làm việc một mình hơn là làm việc nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-ljspeech-c3fed1da.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-cori-c3fed1da.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reserved-0b152646.webp', '[\"shy\", \"introverted\"]', '[\"outgoing\", \"sociable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remain reserved\", \"meaning\": \"giữ thái độ kín đáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly reserved\", \"meaning\": \"rất kín tiếng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reserve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reservation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-cori-c3fed1da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-aru0-c3fed1da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-aru5-c3fed1da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-aru6-c3fed1da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-aru10-c3fed1da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-aru9-c3fed1da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-aru3-c3fed1da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-aru7-c3fed1da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reserved-aru8-c3fed1da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi