('3f36dd6e-0847-5c5d-9292-c3818d8000f4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '406c2fc6-8bdf-5163-9881-21c9777245b4', 'd1691f06-3348-52c6-97f0-b230ebd5e94f', 'on your last legs', '/ɒn jə lɑːst leɡz/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Rất mệt mỏi, sắp hỏng hoặc không thể hoạt động được nữa.', 'to be very tired or close to failing because of exhaustion or long use.', 'After working 12 hours, I was completely on my last legs.', 'Sau khi làm việc 12 tiếng, tôi hoàn toàn kiệt sức.', '{\"en\": \"After managing the project for six months, the team leader was on his last legs.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi quản lý dự án trong sáu tháng, trưởng nhóm đã vô cùng kiệt sức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-ljspeech-63df67f3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-cori-63df67f3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/on-your-last-legs-ca096af0.webp', '[\"exhausted\", \"worn out\"]', '[\"energetic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be on one\'s last legs\", \"meaning\": \"kiệt sức hoặc sắp hỏng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-cori-63df67f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru0-63df67f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru5-63df67f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru6-63df67f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru10-63df67f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru9-63df67f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru3-63df67f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru7-63df67f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru8-63df67f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-your-last-legs-aru2-63df67f3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1