('96fd19b8-eae9-5598-92c6-8aae66d1e8e1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '406c2fc6-8bdf-5163-9881-21c9777245b4', 'd1691f06-3348-52c6-97f0-b230ebd5e94f', 'agony', '/ˈæɡəni/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nỗi đau đớn thể xác hoặc tinh thần cực độ.', 'very severe pain or distress felt in body or mind.', 'He was in agony after twisting his ankle during the game.', 'Anh ấy đau đớn tột cùng sau khi bị trẹo mắt cá chân trong trận đấu.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was in agony when the server crashed during the sales meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đau đớn tột độ khi máy chủ sập trong cuộc họp bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-ljspeech-7395d019.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-cori-7395d019.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/agony-aaf491ed.webp', '[\"torment\", \"anguish\", \"suffering\"]', '[\"pleasure\", \"comfort\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in agony\", \"meaning\": \"trong tình trạng đau đớn cực độ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"physical agony\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi đau thể xác tột cùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mental agony\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi đau tinh thần khổng lồ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"agency\", \"note_vi\": \"agency là cơ quan, khác với nỗi đau đớn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"agonize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"agonizing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-cori-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru0-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru5-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru6-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru10-7395d019.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru9-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru3-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru7-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru8-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-aru2-7395d019.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-ljspeech-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt408-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt138-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt624-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt396-7395d019.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt498-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt132-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt288-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt42-7395d019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agony-lt90-7395d019.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ agony là danh từ chỉ nỗi đau cực độ, không dùng như tính từ.', 'health', 1, 22),
('99167cd2-0886-5444-9018-2a223256a439', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '406c2fc6-8bdf-5163-9881-21c9777245b4', 'd1691f06-3348-52c6-97f0-b230ebd5e94f', 'sanctuary', '/ˈsæŋktʃuəri/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Nơi an toàn, được bảo vệ khỏi nguy hiểm hoặc sự truy đuổi.', 'a place where people or animals are protected from danger or harm.', 'The national park serves as a wildlife sanctuary for many endangered species.', 'Công viên quốc gia này đóng vai trò là khu bảo tồn động vật hoang dã cho nhiều loài có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng.', '{\"en\": \"The company created a quiet sanctuary in the office for employees to rest during breaks.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tạo ra một nơi trú ẩn yên tĩnh trong văn phòng để nhân viên nghỉ ngơi trong giờ giải lao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-ljspeech-7e42a105.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-cori-7e42a105.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sanctuary-11da7738.webp', '[\"refuge\", \"shelter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wildlife sanctuary\", \"meaning\": \"khu bảo tồn động vật hoang dã\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safe sanctuary\", \"meaning\": \"nơi trú ẩn an toàn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-cori-7e42a105.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru0-7e42a105.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru5-7e42a105.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru6-7e42a105.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru10-7e42a105.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru9-7e42a105.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru3-7e42a105.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru7-7e42a105.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru8-7e42a105.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanctuary-aru2