('ce9fc372-5206-583b-8348-4a4eb2603902', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'amplification', '/ˌæmplɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự khuếch đại, làm tăng cường âm thanh, tín hiệu hoặc hiệu ứng.', 'an act of increasing the strength, magnitude, or volume of a signal, sound, or idea.', 'The concert hall used advanced technology for sound amplification.', 'Phòng hòa nhạc đã sử dụng công nghệ tiên tiến để khuếch đại âm thanh.', '{\"en\": \"The conference room requires sound amplification equipment for the upcoming shareholder meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng họp hội nghị cần thiết bị khuếch đại âm thanh cho cuộc họp cổ đông sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-ljspeech-3ece7e9b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-cori-3ece7e9b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amplification-41160e0d.webp', '[\"boost\", \"enhancement\", \"intensification\"]', '[\"reduction\", \"decrease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sound amplification\", \"meaning\": \"sự khuếch đại âm thanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"signal amplification\", \"meaning\": \"sự khuếch đại tín hiệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"amplify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"amplifier\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-cori-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru0-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru5-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru6-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru10-3ece7e9b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru9-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru3-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru7-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru8-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-aru2-3ece7e9b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-ljspeech-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt408-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt138-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt624-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt396-3ece7e9b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt498-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt132-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt288-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt42-3ece7e9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amplification-lt90-3ece7e9b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong lĩnh vực âm thanh, điện tử hoặc báo cáo phân tích.', 'technology', 1, 2),
('f5b81573-0b12-5e66-8956-fceedaebd87a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'zit', '/zɪt/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một nốt mụn nhỏ trên da, thường là trên mặt.', 'a small spot on the skin, especially on the face.', 'She was upset when she woke up with a big zit right on her nose.', 'Cô ấy buồn khi thức dậy thấy một nốt mụn lớn ngay trên mũi.', '{\"en\": \"The cosmetic company launched a new cream designed to clear up a zit overnight.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty mỹ phẩm đã tung ra một loại kem mới được thiết kế để làm sạch mụn chỉ trong một đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-ljspeech-6d106456.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-cori-6d106456.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/zit-bf98263d.webp', '[\"pimple\", \"spot\", \"acne\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pop a zit\", \"meaning\": \"nặn mụn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"squeeze a zit\", \"meaning\": \"nặn mụn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"zip\", \"note_vi\": \"khóa kéo hoặc nén tập tin, phát âm gần giống\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-cori-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru0-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru5-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru6-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru10-6d106456.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru9-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru3-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru7-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru8-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-aru2-6d106456.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/zit-ljspeech-6d106456.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2