('5fd18f4f-bacc-575a-ae93-d97c02993612', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'foamy', '/ˈfəʊmi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều bọt, sủi bọt.', 'consisting of or covered with a mass of small bubbles.', 'The waves crashed against the shore, leaving a foamy white line on the sand.', 'Những con sóng vỗ vào bờ, để lại một vệt bọt biển trắng xóa trên cát.', '{\"en\": \"The barista served a cup of coffee with a thick, foamy layer of milk on top.\", \"vi\": \"Người pha chế đã phục vụ một tách cà phê với một lớp sữa sủi bọt dày ở trên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-ljspeech-7d12edb0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-cori-7d12edb0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foamy-efd35bd2.webp', '[\"frothy\", \"bubbly\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"foamy soap\", \"meaning\": \"xà phòng tạo bọt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"foamy liquid\", \"meaning\": \"chất lỏng sủi bọt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"foam\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"foam\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-cori-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru0-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru5-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru6-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru10-7d12edb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru9-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru3-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru7-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru8-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-aru2-7d12edb0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foamy-ljspeech-7d12edb0.mp3\", \"/storage/