('23e5bca9-8f8a-57ab-be75-57fa867cf7b7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'indeed', '/ɪnˈdiːd/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Thực sự, quả thật, dùng để nhấn mạnh hoặc xác nhận.', 'used to emphasize a statement or to confirm that something is true.', 'The weather forecast said it would be cold, and it was indeed freezing outside.', 'Dự báo thời tiết nói trời sẽ lạnh, và quả thật bên ngoài rất lạnh cóng.', '{\"en\": \"The quarterly sales results were indeed impressive, exceeding all initial financial projections.\", \"vi\": \"Kết quả doanh số hàng quý quả thực rất ấn tượng, vượt qua mọi dự báo tài chính ban đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-ljspeech-a85ed0f0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-cori-a85ed0f0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/indeed-2da80633.webp', '[\"truly\", \"certainly\", \"really\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"very much indeed\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhiều, quả thực rất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"yes indeed\", \"meaning\": \"vâng quả đúng như vậy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"in fact\", \"note_vi\": \"dùng để bổ sung thông tin thực tế hoặc đính chính thông tin trước đó\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-cori-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru0-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru5-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru6-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru10-a85ed0f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru9-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru3-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru7-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru8-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-aru2-a85ed0f0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-ljspeech-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt408-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt138-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt624-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt396-a85ed0f0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt498-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt132-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt288-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt42-a85ed0f0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/indeed-lt90-a85ed0f0.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường đứng sau động từ to be hoặc trợ động từ để nhấn mạnh tính đúng đắn.', 'business', 1, 7),
('168511d7-2d22-5ff5-93ec-1c43fdd0028f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'artificial', 'UK: /ˌɑːtɪˈfɪʃl/ | US: /ˌɑːrtɪˈfɪʃl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'nhân tạo', 'made or produced by human beings rather than occurring naturally in the environment', 'The product contains no artificial colors or flavors.', 'Sản phẩm không chứa màu hoặc hương vị nhân tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The beverage manufacturer decided to eliminate artificial flavorings from its products.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà sản xuất đồ uống đã quyết định loại bỏ các chất hương liệu nhân tạo khỏi sản phẩm của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-ljspeech-d9004fc1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-cori-d9004fc1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/artificial-184b777c.webp', '[\"man-made\", \"synthetic\", \"manufactured\"]', '[\"natural\", \"genuine\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"artificial intelligence\", \"meaning\": \"trí tuệ nhân tạo (AI)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"artificial coloring\", \"meaning\": \"phẩm màu nhân tạo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"artificially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-cori-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru0-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru5-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru6-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru10-d9004fc1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru9-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru3-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru7-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru8-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-aru2-d9004fc1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-ljspeech-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt408-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt138-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt624-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt396-d9004fc1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt498-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt132-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt288-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt42-d9004fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/artificial-lt90-d9004fc1.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay xuất hiện trong các cụm như \'artificial intelligence\' (AI - trí tuệ nhân tạo) và \'artificial ingredients\' (thành phần nhân tạo).', 'general', 1, 8),
('ee58df92-b8e9-5e74-acb8-afc91fba38af', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'villain', '/ˈvɪlən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nhân vật phản diện trong một câu chuyện hoặc bộ phim.', 'a person in a story or movie who performs bad or evil actions.', 'The writer created a complex villain whose motives were surprisingly understandable to readers.', 'Tác giả đã tạo ra một nhân vật phản diện phức tạp có động cơ hiểu được một cách bất ngờ đối với độc giả.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing campaign portrayed the competitor as the villain to highlight our own product benefits.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị đã mô tả đối thủ cạnh tranh như một kẻ phản diện để làm nổi bật lợi ích sản phẩm của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-ljspeech-93f792c9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-cori-93f792c9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/villain-5f9d3c01.webp', '[\"criminal\", \"bad guy\"]', '[\"hero\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"main villain\", \"meaning\": \"nhân vật phản diện chính\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-cori-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru0-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru5-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru6-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru10-93f792c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru9-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru3-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru7-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru8-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-aru2-93f792c9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-ljspeech-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt408-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt138-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt624-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt396-93f792c9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt498-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt132-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt288-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt42-93f792c9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/villain-lt90-93f792c9.mp3\"]}}', 'nghĩa bóng dùng để chỉ người hoặc yếu tố gây ra rắc rối.', 'media', 1, 9),
('9a044e59-4c27-5ab6-a80d-da42bd886cf8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'extrapolate', '/ɪkˈstræpəleɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Suy luận, dự đoán dựa trên dữ liệu đã biết.', 'to estimate or decide something by using facts or information that are already known.', 'It\'s difficult to extrapolate future trends from such limited data.', 'Thật khó để ngoại suy các xu hướng tương lai từ dữ liệu hạn chế như vậy.', '{\"en\": \"Analysts try to extrapolate next year\'s sales performance based on current market trends.\", \"vi\": \"Các chuyên gia phân tích cố gắng suy luận hiệu suất bán hàng năm tới dựa trên các xu hướng thị trường hiện tại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-ljspeech-780e5528.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-cori-780e5528.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extrapolate-3f88712c.webp', '[\"infer\", \"deduce\", \"project\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"extrapolate from data\", \"meaning\": \"suy luận từ dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extrapolate trends\", \"meaning\": \"dự đoán các xu hướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"interpolate\", \"note_vi\": \"Interpolate là nội suy (tìm giá trị ở giữa), còn extrapolate là ngoại suy (dự đoán bên ngoài).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"extrapolation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-cori-780e5528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-aru0-780e5528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-aru5-780e5528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-aru6-780e5528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-aru10-780e5528.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-aru9-780e5528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extrapolate-aru3-780e5528.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob