('274b6868-5440-5cda-a681-1fa9b102ef26', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'hitchhike', '/ˈhɪtʃhaɪk/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Xin đi nhờ xe của người lạ để di chuyển.', 'to travel by asking for free rides from drivers of passing vehicles on the road.', 'The adventurous student opted to hitchhike to the coastal town during summer break.', 'Người sinh viên thích phiêu lưu đã chọn đi nhờ xe đến thành phố ven biển trong kỳ nghỉ hè.', '{\"en\": \"The budget travel consultant suggested that tourists should not hitchhike late at night for safety.\", \"vi\": \"Cố vấn du lịch tiết kiệm khuyên du khách không nên đi nhờ xe vào ban đêm để đảm bảo an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-ljspeech-6a0390f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-cori-6a0390f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hitchhike-e1ad8b6f.webp', '[\"hitch\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hitchhike across\", \"meaning\": \"đi nhờ xe dọc theo/băng qua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hitchhike home\", \"meaning\": \"xin đi nhờ xe về nhà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hitch\", \"note_vi\": \"Hitch vừa nghĩa là xin đi nhờ xe, vừa có nghĩa là sự cố nhỏ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hitchhiker\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hitchhiking\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-cori-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru0-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru5-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru6-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru10-6a0390f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru9-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru3-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru7-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru8-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-aru2-6a0390f7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-ljspeech-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt408-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt138-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt624-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt396-6a0390f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt498-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt132-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt288-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt42-6a0390f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hitchhike-lt90-6a0390f7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với các giới từ \'across\', \'to\', hoặc \'around\'.', 'travel', 1, 13),
('3cfef439-7051-5dfb-a9d7-f8ad9b6191fa', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'eleven', '/ɪˈlevn/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Con số hoặc số lượng tương đương mười cộng một.', 'the number that is equal to the sum of ten and one in counting.', 'The train is scheduled to depart at eleven o\'clock sharp.', 'Chuyến tàu dự kiến khởi hành đúng mười một giờ.', '{\"en\": \"The conference session will begin at eleven in the morning in the main meeting room.\", \"vi\": \"Phiên họp hội nghị sẽ bắt đầu lúc mười một giờ sáng tại phòng họp chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-ljspeech-cc5a0c50.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-cori-cc5a0c50.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eleven-09965716.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"at eleven\", \"meaning\": \"lúc 11 giờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eleven o\'clock\", \"meaning\": \"11 giờ đúng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"eleventh\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-cori-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru0-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru5-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru6-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru10-cc5a0c50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru9-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru3-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru7-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru8-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-aru2-cc5a0c50.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-ljspeech-cc5a0c50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eleven-lt408-cc5a0c50.