('f771c5ac-2f9c-56eb-812e-f239ad932618', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'wildfire', '/ˈwaɪldfaɪə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Đám cháy lớn, không kiểm soát được trong rừng hoặc khu vực hoang dã.', 'a large and destructive fire that spreads very quickly through forests or open grassy areas.', 'The dry weather conditions increased the risk of wildfire.', 'Điều kiện thời tiết khô hạn làm tăng nguy cơ cháy rừng.', '{\"en\": \"The severe wildfire destroyed many acres of land, causing significant damage to the local environment.\", \"vi\": \"Đám cháy rừng dữ dội đã phá hủy nhiều mẫu đất, gây thiệt hại đáng kể cho môi trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-ljspeech-745d14a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-cori-745d14a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wildfire-2e54c7bb.webp', '[\"forest fire\", \"bushfire\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spread like wildfire\", \"meaning\": \"lan nhanh như cháy rừng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"risk of wildfire\", \"meaning\": \"nguy cơ cháy rừng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-cori-745d14a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru0-745d14a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru5-745d14a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru6-745d14a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru10-745d14a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru9-745d14a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru3-745d14a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru7-745d14a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru8-745d14a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wildfire-aru2-745d14a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storag