('6996a7c6-df6f-51d9-a1cb-92aad2578d80', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'classy', '/ˈklɑːsi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Sang trọng, lịch thiệp và có phong cách.', 'showing high quality, style, and good taste in appearance or behavior.', 'She always dresses in a very classy way, even for casual events.', 'Cô ấy luôn ăn mặc rất sang trọng, ngay cả trong các sự kiện bình thường.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby has a classy design that impresses all business guests.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn có thiết kế sang trọng gây ấn tượng với tất cả khách doanh nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-ljspeech-2519bd6a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-cori-2519bd6a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/classy-a2b5d6e8.webp', '[\"elegant\", \"stylish\", \"sophisticated\"]', '[\"cheap\", \"tacky\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"classy look\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài sang trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"classy restaurant\", \"meaning\": \"nhà hàng sang trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"classical\", \"note_vi\": \"thuộc về cổ điển, không phải sang trọng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"class\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"classily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-cori-2519bd6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-aru0-2519bd6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-aru5-2519bd6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-aru6-2519bd6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-aru10-2519bd6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-aru9-2519bd6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-aru3-2519bd6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-aru7-2519bd6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/classy-aru8-2519bd6a.mp3\", 