('b5896223-1192-58b2-988b-af08a8a4e7e2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '452c5042-759c-590c-a746-986435d7bf30', '81939e19-cbc4-50fa-b2a3-63a4a18a63c2', 'contract', '/ˈkɒntrækt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thỏa thuận pháp lý ràng buộc giữa hai bên.', 'an official written agreement between two or more people, companies, or organizations.', 'Always read the terms and conditions carefully before signing a contract.', 'Luôn đọc kỹ các điều khoản và điều kiện trước khi ký hợp đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department reviewed the service contract before the CEO signed it.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận pháp lý đã xem xét hợp đồng dịch vụ trước khi giám đốc điều hành ký tên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-ljspeech-d61ceadb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-cori-d61ceadb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contract-5b6f755f.webp', '[\"agreement\", \"pact\", \"covenant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sign a contract\", \"meaning\": \"ký hợp đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"breach of contract\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm hợp đồng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"contact\", \"note_vi\": \"Contact là liên lạc (thiếu chữ \'r\'); contract là hợp đồng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contractor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"contractual\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-cori-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru0-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru5-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru6-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru10-d61ceadb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru9-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru3-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contract-aru7-d61ceadb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro