('52715512-0d38-5807-b5c3-832a482c3ffa', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '4bb38d7b-3bd1-55c4-9bfa-c87e13ae418b', '7fe13fca-6c64-51e9-a720-a2669210a35f', 'presumably', '/prɪˈzjuːməbli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Có thể giả định là đúng, có lẽ.', 'used to say that you believe something is true based on the available information.', 'They were late, presumably because their car broke down on the way.', 'Họ đến muộn, có lẽ là do xe của họ bị hỏng trên đường.', '{\"en\": \"The meeting was presumably postponed because the keynote speaker could not attend on time.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc họp có lẽ đã bị hoãn vì diễn giả chính không thể đến kịp giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-ljspeech-c23090e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-cori-c23090e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/presumably-1602d748.webp', '[\"probably\", \"likely\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"presumably true\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ là đúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"presumably correct\", \"meaning\": \"có lẽ là chính xác\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"presume\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"presumption\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-cori-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru0-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru5-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru6-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru10-c23090e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru9-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru3-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru7-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru8-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-aru2-c23090e7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-ljspeech-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt408-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt138-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt624-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt396-c23090e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt498-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt132-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt288-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt42-c23090e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presumably-lt90-c23090e7.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi suy đoán dựa trên logic hoặc bằng chứng hiện có.', 'office', 1, 4),
('0459fc63-044e-51a1-b6de-ba60b8b3f712', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '4bb38d7b-3bd1-55c4-9bfa-c87e13ae418b', '7fe13fca-6c64-51e9-a720-a2669210a35f', 'allowance', 'UK: /əˈlaʊəns/ | US: /əˈlaʊəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'phụ cấp, khoản trợ cấp', 'a specific sum of money granted regularly to cover particular expenses or needs.', 'Employees receive a travel allowance for business trips.', 'Nhân viên nhận được phụ cấp đi lại cho các chuyến công tác.', '{\"en\": \"Sales representatives receive a monthly travel allowance to cover client visit expenses.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện kinh doanh nhận được khoản phụ cấp đi lại hàng tháng để chi trả chi phí đi thăm khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-ljspeech-4da8d5d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-cori-4da8d5d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/allowance-605c8d28.webp', '[\"stipend\", \"subsidy\", \"grant\", \"per diem\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"travel allowance\", \"meaning\": \"phụ cấp đi lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"baggage allowance\", \"meaning\": \"hạn mức hành lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"housing allowance\", \"meaning\": \"phụ cấp nhà ở\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"allow\", \"note_vi\": \"allow là động từ (cho phép), allowance là danh từ (khoản phụ cấp / hạn mức)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"allow\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-cori-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru0-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru5-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru6-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru10-4da8d5d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru9-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru3-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru7-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru8-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-aru2-4da8d5d4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-ljspeech-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt408-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt138-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt624-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt396-4da8d5d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt498-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt132-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt288-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt42-4da8d5d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allowance-lt90-4da8d5d4.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đề thi TOEIC, \'allowance\' thường đi kèm danh từ chỉ loại chi phí (travel/housing allowance) hoặc hạn mức (baggage allowance).', 'human resources', 1, 5),
('d9b0ed47-720d-5f7f-af04-103ddac7a7b8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '4bb38d7b-3bd1-55c4-9bfa-c87e13ae418b', '7fe13fca-6c64-51e9-a720-a2669210a35f', 'supersized', '/ˈsuːpəsaɪzd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có kích thước lớn hơn bình thường, thường là rất lớn.', 'much larger than the standard size of something.', 'Many fast-food restaurants offer supersized portions of fries and drinks.', 'Nhiều nhà hàng thức ăn nhanh cung cấp các phần khoai tây chiên và đồ uống cỡ lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The fast-food chain decided to stop offering supersized meals to promote healthier eating habits.\", \"vi\": \"Chuỗi thức ăn nhanh đã quyết định ngừng cung cấp các suất ăn kích thước cực đại để khuyến khích thói quen ăn uống lành mạnh hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-ljspeech-633e422e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-cori-633e422e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supersized-f01016ab.webp', '[\"giant\", \"huge\", \"oversized\"]', '[\"undersized\", \"miniature\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"supersized portion\", \"meaning\": \"phần ăn kích thước cực đại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supersized screen\", \"meaning\": \"màn hình kích thước cực lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"supersize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supersize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-cori-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru0-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru5-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru6-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru10-633e422e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru9-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru3-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru7-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru8-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-aru2-633e422e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-ljspeech-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt408-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt138-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt624-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt396-633e422e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt498-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt132-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt288-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt42-633e422e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supersized-lt90-633e422e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng trong ngành ẩm thực (đặc biệt là đồ ăn nhanh) hoặc thiết bị điện tử.', 'dining', 1, 6),
('fa097cb9-a1b2-5b73-b257-193193a5bd2d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '4bb38d7b-3bd1-55c4-9bfa-c87e13ae418b', '7fe13fca-6c64-51e9-a720-a2669210a35f', 'volume', '/ˈvɒljuːm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Mức độ lớn nhỏ của âm thanh; âm lượng.', 'the level of sound produced by a device or in a space.', 'Could you please turn down the volume on the television? It\'s too loud.', 'Bạn có thể vặn nhỏ âm lượng TV xuống được không? Nó ồn quá.', '{\"en\": \"Please lower the volume during the conference call so other staff are not disturbed.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng giảm âm lượng trong cuộc gọi hội nghị để không làm phiền nhân viên khác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-ljspeech-d387fc8d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-cori-d387fc8d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/volume-b67028fb.webp', '[\"loudness\", \"sound level\", \"audio level\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"turn up/down the volume\", \"meaning\": \"tăng/giảm âm lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"volume control\", \"meaning\": \"bộ điều chỉnh âm lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at full volume\", \"meaning\": \"ở mức âm lượng tối đa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"volume\", \"note_vi\": \"volume còn nghĩa là khối lượng/số lượng; ngữ cảnh quyết định nghĩa nào.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"volumetric\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"voluminous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-cori-d387fc8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-aru0-d387fc8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-aru5-d387fc8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-aru6-d387fc8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-aru10-d387fc8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-aru9-d387fc8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/volume-aru3-d387fc8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/v