('07116064-de33-5a43-a522-dd35c001c372', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '4bb38d7b-3bd1-55c4-9bfa-c87e13ae418b', '7fe13fca-6c64-51e9-a720-a2669210a35f', 'ceiling', 'UK: /ˈsiːlɪŋ/ | US: /ˈsiːlɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'trần nhà', 'the upper interior surface that covers the top of a room', 'The light is fixed to the ceiling.', 'Đèn được gắn vào trần nhà.', '{\"en\": \"Maintenance workers are currently repairing the lighting fixtures on the main conference room ceiling.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân bảo trì hiện đang sửa chữa các bộ đèn trên trần phòng họp chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-ljspeech-baacee0a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-cori-baacee0a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ceiling-c24aca45.webp', '[\"roofing\", \"upper limit\"]', '[\"floor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high ceiling\", \"meaning\": \"trần nhà cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"price ceiling\", \"meaning\": \"mức giá trần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sealing\", \"note_vi\": \"sealing (dạng V-ing của seal) nghĩa là việc niêm phong/dán kín, đồng âm với ceiling.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-cori-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru0-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru5-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru6-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru10-baacee0a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru9-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru3-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru7-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru8-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-aru2-baacee0a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-ljspeech-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt408-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt138-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt624-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt396-baacee0a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt498-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt132-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt288-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt42-baacee0a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceiling-lt90-baacee0a.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tài chính/kinh tế, \'ceiling\' còn mang nghĩa ẩn dụ là mức trần/mức tối đa (như \'price ceiling\' - mức giá trần).', 'office', 1, 13),
('53a2040c-9abe-51cc-a8aa-42e2afcde8e2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '4bb38d7b-3bd1-55c4-9bfa-c87e13ae418b', '7fe13fca-6c64-51e9-a720-a2669210a35f', 'sample', '/ˈsɑːmpl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một phần nhỏ đại diện cho một tổng thể lớn hơn.', 'a small part showing the quality of the whole.', 'The doctor took a blood sample for analysis.', 'Bác sĩ đã lấy một mẫu máu để phân tích.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier sent a free sample of the fabric to our office.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp đã gửi một mẫu vải miễn phí đến văn phòng chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-ljspeech-8151325d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-cori-8151325d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sample-209684e9.webp', '[\"specimen\", \"example\", \"model\"]', '[\"whole\", \"entirety\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"free sample\", \"meaning\": \"mẫu miễn phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sample size\", \"meaning\": \"kích thước mẫu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"random sample\", \"meaning\": \"mẫu ngẫu nhiên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"simple\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là đơn giản, dễ nhầm chính tả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sample\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sampling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-cori-8151325d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru0-8151325d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru5-8151325d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru6-8151325d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru10-8151325d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru9-8151325d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru3-8151325d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru7-8151325d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru8-8151325d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sample-aru2-8151325