('803021a4-0918-5f0e-a89e-88ad72a1be99', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '4bb38d7b-3bd1-55c4-9bfa-c87e13ae418b', '7fe13fca-6c64-51e9-a720-a2669210a35f', 'fortunate', '/ˈfɔːtʃənət/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Gặp may mắn hoặc có hoàn cảnh tốt, may mắn.', 'having good luck or being in a good situation.', 'The manager felt fortunate to secure a reliable business partner for the new project.', 'Người quản lý cảm thấy may mắn khi có được một đối tác kinh doanh đáng tin cậy cho dự án mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company was fortunate to sign a big contract before the deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã May mắn ký được hợp đồng lớn trước thời hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-ljspeech-552b515b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-cori-552b515b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fortunate-e218ca58.webp', '[\"lucky\", \"blessed\"]', '[\"unfortunate\", \"unlucky\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fortunate enough\", \"meaning\": \"đủ may mắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fortunate to\", \"meaning\": \"may mắn được\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fortune\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"fortunately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-cori-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru0-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru5-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru6-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru10-552b515b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru9-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru3-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru7-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru8-552b515b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortunate-aru2-552b515b.m