('d72ca388-25c5-5ab7-920e-a8f5eceee580', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '54079cd5-1bd8-5fdf-a715-bdffaa90b370', '0d4e1153-15c9-593e-9e47-1b2f04bee79d', 'spacious', '/ˈspeɪʃəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rộng lớn, có nhiều không gian.', 'having a large amount of space to move around in easily.', 'The new apartment has a very spacious living room, perfect for entertaining guests.', 'Căn hộ mới có phòng khách rất rộng rãi, hoàn hảo để tiếp khách.', '{\"en\": \"The new conference room is spacious enough to accommodate fifty board members comfortably.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng hội nghị mới đủ rộng rãi để chứa năm mươi thành viên ban quản trị một cách thoải mái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-ljspeech-29715c18.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-cori-29715c18.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spacious-c2aa6f73.webp', '[\"roomy\", \"large\", \"sizeable\"]', '[\"cramped\", \"small\", \"confined\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spacious office\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng rộng rãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spacious living area\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực sống rộng rãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spatial\", \"note_vi\": \"thuộc về không gian (vật lý, hình học), không phải rộng rãi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"space\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"spaciously\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spaciousness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-cori-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru0-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru5-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru6-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru10-29715c18.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru9-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru3-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru7-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru8-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-aru2-29715c18.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-ljspeech-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt408-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt138-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt624-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt396-29715c18.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt498-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt132-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt288-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt42-29715c18.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spacious-lt90-29715c18.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với spatial (thuộc về không gian) hoặc special (đặc biệt).', 'housing', 1, 3),
('0a17f65c-3414-5c3e-87b5-94a23d8fb257', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '54079cd5-1bd8-5fdf-a715-bdffaa90b370', '0d4e1153-15c9-593e-9e47-1b2f04bee79d', 'alike', 'UK: /əˈlaɪk/ | US: /əˈlaɪk/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'giống nhau, tương tự', 'in a similar or identical manner to someone or something else.', 'The twins looked so much alike that it was hard to tell them apart.', 'Cặp song sinh trông giống nhau đến nỗi rất khó phân biệt.', '{\"en\": \"The new flexible working hours benefit full-time and part-time staff alike.\", \"vi\": \"Giờ làm việc linh hoạt mới mang lại lợi ích cho cả nhân viên toàn thời gian lẫn bán thời gian như nhau.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-ljspeech-b79634d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-cori-b79634d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/alike-ef77ad5c.webp', '[\"equally\", \"similarly\", \"identically\"]', '[\"differently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look alike\", \"meaning\": \"trông giống nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"treat alike\", \"meaning\": \"đối xử bình đẳng như nhau\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"like\", \"note_vi\": \"like có thể đứng trước danh từ (like a professional), còn alike đứng sau\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"alike\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-cori-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru0-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru5-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru6-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru10-b79634d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru9-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru3-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru7-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alike-aru8-b79634d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu