('2c0d4646-945a-57da-a1fe-ebd698f7d200', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '54079cd5-1bd8-5fdf-a715-bdffaa90b370', '0d4e1153-15c9-593e-9e47-1b2f04bee79d', 'dulcet', '/ˈdʌlsɪt/', 'C2', 'adjective', '(Âm thanh) Ngọt ngào, êm dịu và dễ chịu.', 'Characterized by a pleasing, gentle tone that sounds agreeable, soft, and melodious to the ear.', 'She listened to the dulcet tones of the piano, feeling completely relaxed.', 'Cô ấy lắng nghe những âm thanh êm dịu của đàn piano, cảm thấy hoàn toàn thư giãn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel lobby was filled with the dulcet sounds of classical violin music.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh khách sạn tràn ngập những âm thanh êm dịu của nhạc vĩ cầm cổ điển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-ljspeech-99a9eb2e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-cori-99a9eb2e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dulcet-9cc82a53.webp', '[\"melodious\", \"sweet\", \"soothing\"]', '[\"harsh\", \"cacophonous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dulcet tones\", \"meaning\": \"giọng điệu ngọt ngào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dulcet voice\", \"meaning\": \"giọng nói êm dịu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-cori-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru0-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru5-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru6-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru10-99a9eb2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru9-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru3-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru7-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru8-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-aru2-99a9eb2e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-ljspeech-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt408-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt138-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt624-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt396-99a9eb2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt498-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt132-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt288-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt42-99a9eb2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dulcet-lt90-99a9eb2e.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng trang trọng để tả âm thanh, giọng nói êm tai.', 'travel', 1, 6),
('aa8d14f7-8951-5f6b-b115-2d734216084c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '54079cd5-1bd8-5fdf-a715-bdffaa90b370', '0d4e1153-15c9-593e-9e47-1b2f04bee79d', 'damage', '/ˈdæmɪdʒ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự hư hại hoặc tổn thất gây ra cho vật gì.', 'physical harm caused to an object that makes it less valuable or functional.', 'The computer virus caused severe damage to the company\'s central database.', 'Virus máy tính đã gây ra thiệt hại nghiêm trọng cho cơ sở dữ liệu trung tâm của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"Please inspect the shipment carefully to ensure there is no damage to the fragile items.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra lô hàng cẩn thận để đảm bảo không có hư hại nào đối với các mặt hàng dễ vỡ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-ljspeech-54198309.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-cori-54198309.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/damage-d6fa11d0.webp', '[\"harm\", \"injury\"]', '[\"repair\", \"improvement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cause damage\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra hư hại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extensive damage\", \"meaning\": \"hư hại trên diện rộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"damages\", \"note_vi\": \"Số nhiều mang nghĩa là tiền bồi thường thiệt hại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"damaging\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"damage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-cori-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru0-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru5-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru6-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru10-54198309.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru9-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru3-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru7-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru8-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-aru2-54198309.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-ljspeech-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt408-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt138-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt624-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt396-54198309.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt498-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt132-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt288-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt42-54198309.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/damage-lt90-54198309.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ không đếm được khi nói về sự hư hại chung.', 'office', 1, 7),
('1247f7fd-43c0-5bef-a5ab-825440b7a643', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '54079cd5-1bd8-5fdf-a715-bdffaa90b370', '0d4e1153-15c9-593e-9e47-1b2f04bee79d', 'undervalue', '/ˌʌndəˈvæljuː/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Đánh giá thấp giá trị, tầm quan trọng hoặc khả năng của ai/cái gì.', 'to think that someone or something is less important or valuable than they really are.', 'Many companies tend to undervalue the importance of employee well-being, leading to burnout.', 'Nhiều công ty có xu hướng đánh giá thấp tầm quan trọng của phúc lợi nhân viên, dẫn đến tình trạng kiệt sức.', '{\"en\": \"Do not undervalue the benefits of attending professional training workshops to improve your career skills.\", \"vi\": \"Đừng đánh giá thấp lợi ích của việc tham gia các hội thảo đào tạo chuyên môn để cải thiện kỹ năng nghề nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-ljspeech-7fb41bb7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-cori-7fb41bb7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/undervalue-e1c39849.webp', '[\"underestimate\", \"downplay\"]', '[\"overvalue\", \"overestimate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"undervalue the importance\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá thấp tầm quan trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"undervalue assets\", \"meaning\": \"định giá thấp tài sản\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"value\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"valuable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-cori-7fb41bb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-aru0-7fb41bb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-aru5-7fb41bb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-aru6-7fb41bb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-aru10-7fb41bb7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-aru9-7fb41bb7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/undervalue-aru3-7fb