('100f1154-82f6-573b-a535-0bda4c25d5e8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '54079cd5-1bd8-5fdf-a715-bdffaa90b370', '0d4e1153-15c9-593e-9e47-1b2f04bee79d', 'cost-cutting', '/ˈkɒstˌkʌtɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc chính sách giảm bớt chi phí.', 'the act of reducing the amount of money spent by a company or organization.', 'Management introduced several cost-cutting initiatives to lower monthly operational expenses.', 'Ban quản lý đã đưa ra một số sáng kiến cắt giảm chi phí để giảm chi phí vận hành hàng tháng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager introduced a cost-cutting plan to reduce unnecessary office expenses this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đưa ra một kế hoạch cắt giảm chi phí để giảm các khoản chi tiêu văn phòng không cần thiết trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-ljspeech-ff2b2488.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-cori-ff2b2488.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cost-cutting-b8013868.webp', '[\"downsizing\", \"economizing\"]', '[\"spending\", \"expansion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cost-cutting measures\", \"meaning\": \"các biện pháp cắt giảm chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cost-cutting strategy\", \"meaning\": \"chiến lược cắt giảm chi phí\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-cori-ff2b2488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-aru0-ff2b2488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-aru5-ff2b2488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-aru6-ff2b2488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-aru10-ff2b2488.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-aru9-ff2b2488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-aru3-ff2b2488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-cutting-aru7-ff2b2488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/