('0995c726-87da-5738-b311-c85f705a7787', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '54079cd5-1bd8-5fdf-a715-bdffaa90b370', '0d4e1153-15c9-593e-9e47-1b2f04bee79d', 'hastily', '/ˈheɪstɪli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách nhanh chóng, vội vàng, thường thiếu cẩn thận.', 'doing something very quickly because you do not have enough time, often without enough care.', 'She hastily packed her bags, worried about missing the train.', 'Cô ấy vội vã đóng gói hành lý, lo lắng sẽ lỡ chuyến tàu.', '{\"en\": \"The assistant hastily prepared the report before the meeting started, leading to several small errors.\", \"vi\": \"Người trợ lý vội vàng chuẩn bị báo cáo trước khi cuộc họp bắt đầu, dẫn đến vài lỗi nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-ljspeech-ff24ba87.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-cori-ff24ba87.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hastily-68022084.webp', '[\"hurriedly\", \"quickly\"]', '[\"carefully\", \"slowly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hastily arranged\", \"meaning\": \"được sắp xếp vội vàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hastily written\", \"meaning\": \"được viết vội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"haste\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hasty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-cori-ff24ba87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-aru0-ff24ba87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-aru5-ff24ba87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-aru6-ff24ba87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-aru10-ff24ba87.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-aru9-ff24ba87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-aru3-ff24ba87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-aru7-ff24ba87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hastily-aru8-ff24ba87.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/