('14f2eb67-8b17-52b4-95e9-d3320ad96e7b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'sparse', '/spɑːs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rải rác, không dày đặc, số lượng ít ỏi.', 'present in small amounts or numbers, spread over a wide area.', 'The desert landscape was characterized by sparse vegetation.', 'Cảnh quan sa mạc được đặc trưng bởi thảm thực vật thưa thớt.', '{\"en\": \"Attendance at the annual trade fair was sparse due to the bad weather conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Số người tham dự hội chợ thương mại hàng năm rất thưa thớt do thời tiết xấu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-ljspeech-bea8411e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-cori-bea8411e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sparse-2298d37a.webp', '[\"scarce\", \"meager\", \"thin\"]', '[\"dense\", \"abundant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sparse population\", \"meaning\": \"dân số thưa thớt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sparse data\", \"meaning\": \"dữ liệu ít ỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sparse coverage\", \"meaning\": \"phạm vi bao phủ thưa thớt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scarce\", \"note_vi\": \"scarce nhấn mạnh sự thiếu hụt; sparse nhấn mạnh sự phân tán rải rác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sparsely\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sparseness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-cori-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru0-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru5-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru6-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru10-bea8411e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru9-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru3-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru7-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru8-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-aru2-bea8411e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-ljspeech-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt408-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt138-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt624-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt396-bea8411e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt498-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt132-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt288-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt42-bea8411e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sparse-lt90-bea8411e.mp3\"]}}', 'Sparse thường đi với population, vegetation, data — nhớ nghĩa \'thưa thớt, rải rác\'.', 'other', 1, 2),
('219b6f69-e541-50b2-91dc-1c7dba2afaed', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'poultry', '/ˈpəʊltri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Các loài chim được nuôi để lấy thịt hoặc trứng, như gà, vịt.', 'birds such as chickens and ducks that are kept on farms for their meat or eggs.', 'We often buy fresh poultry from the local farm market.', 'Chúng tôi thường mua gia cầm tươi từ chợ nông sản địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant sources its poultry from certified local farms to ensure quality.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng lấy nguồn gia cầm từ các trang trại địa phương được chứng nhận để đảm bảo chất lượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-ljspeech-8bd5efef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-cori-8bd5efef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/poultry-81498e66.webp', '[\"fowl\", \"game birds\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"poultry farm\", \"meaning\": \"trang trại gia cầm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fresh poultry\", \"meaning\": \"gia cầm tươi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poultry products\", \"meaning\": \"các sản phẩm từ gia cầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"livestock\", \"note_vi\": \"livestock chỉ chung vật nuôi kể cả bò, lợn; poultry chỉ riêng các loài chim\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-cori-8bd5efef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-aru0-8bd5efef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-aru5-8bd5efef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-aru6-8bd5efef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-aru10-8bd5efef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-aru9-8bd5efef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-aru3-8bd5efef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-aru7-8bd5efef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/poultry-aru