('4ca8e3fd-3af7-5469-8a22-45d7f3a979cc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'unwilling', '/ʌnˈwɪlɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Không muốn làm điều gì đó; miễn cưỡng.', 'not ready or wanting to do something, showing reluctance.', 'He was unwilling to admit his mistake, even when presented with clear evidence.', 'Anh ấy không sẵn lòng thừa nhận sai lầm của mình, ngay cả khi được đưa ra bằng chứng rõ ràng.', '{\"en\": \"The client was unwilling to sign the contract without legal review.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng không sẵn lòng ký hợp đồng nếu chưa có sự xem xét pháp lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-ljspeech-eb015113.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-cori-eb015113.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unwilling-9efa9bd0.webp', '[\"reluctant\", \"disinclined\", \"averse\"]', '[\"willing\", \"eager\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unwilling to help\", \"meaning\": \"không sẵn lòng giúp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unwilling participant\", \"meaning\": \"người tham gia miễn cưỡng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unwilling compliance\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ miễn cưỡng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unwell\", \"note_vi\": \"unwell là không khỏe, unwilling là không sẵn lòng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"unwillingly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"unwillingness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-cori-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru0-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru5-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru6-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru10-eb015113.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru9-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru3-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru7-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru8-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-aru2-eb015113.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-ljspeech-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt408-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt138-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt624-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt396-eb015113.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt498-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt132-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt288-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt42-eb015113.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unwilling-lt90-eb015113.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa willing; nhầm với unwell (ốm).', 'business', 1, 4),
('7a4c87f6-8408-5f2d-b15a-d727183c6173', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'thus', '/θʌs/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Vì vậy, kết quả là, dùng để chỉ hậu quả.', 'used to show that something happens as a result of a previous action or fact.', 'He missed the bus; thus, he was late for his appointment.', 'Anh ấy đã lỡ chuyến xe buýt; do đó, anh ấy đã đến muộn cuộc hẹn.', '{\"en\": \"The company failed to meet its sales target; thus, the manager resigned from his position.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty không đạt mục tiêu doanh số; vì vậy, người quản lý đã từ chức khỏi vị trí của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-ljspeech-2e53d1fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-cori-2e53d1fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thus-209e55d6.webp', '[\"consequently\", \"therefore\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"thus far\", \"meaning\": \"cho đến nay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thus created\", \"meaning\": \"được tạo ra như vậy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"this\", \"note_vi\": \"This là đại từ chỉ định, thus là trạng từ chỉ kết quả.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-cori-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru0-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru5-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru6-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru10-2e53d1fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru9-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru3-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru7-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru8-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-aru2-2e53d1fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-ljspeech-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt408-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt138-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt624-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt396-2e53d1fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt498-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt132-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt288-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt42-2e53d1fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thus-lt90-2e53d1fd.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong văn viết trang trọng để nối hai mệnh đề.', 'business', 1, 5),
('61d189c4-a0bb-5aec-870e-c9e0fa8fb937', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'ego', '/ˈiːɡəʊ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Khái niệm về bản thân, lòng tự trọng hoặc sự tự cao.', 'your idea or opinion of yourself, especially your feeling of your own importance and ability.', 'The new manager\'s inflated ego prevents her from listening to valuable team feedback.', 'Cái tôi quá lớn của người quản lý mới ngăn cô ấy lắng nghe phản hồi giá trị từ nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"The new supervisor has a massive ego and rarely listens to feedback from his team.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát mới có cái tôi rất lớn và hiếm khi lắng nghe phản hồi từ nhóm của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-ljspeech-c13571db.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-cori-c13571db.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ego-e1c33038.webp', '[\"self-esteem\", \"self-image\", \"pride\"]', '[\"humility\", \"modesty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"boost someone\'s ego\", \"meaning\": \"làm tăng lòng tự trọng của ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"massive ego\", \"meaning\": \"cái tôi quá lớn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"egocentric\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"egotistical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-cori-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru0-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru5-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru6-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru10-c13571db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru9-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru3-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru7-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru8-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-aru2-c13571db.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-ljspeech-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt408-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt138-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt624-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt396-c13571db.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt498-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt132-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt288-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt42-c13571db.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ego-lt90-c13571db.mp3\"]}}', 'Ego thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực khi nói ai đó có \'big ego\' (tự cao).', 'hr', 1, 6),
('a4a489db-0434-5fa2-9967-c0598cbdbf25', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'trifling', '/ˈtraɪflɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không quan trọng, tầm thường hoặc nhỏ nhặt.', 'small and not important enough to be considered serious or valuable.', 'The auditor ignored the trifling error because it did not affect the total balance.', 'Kiểm toán viên đã bỏ qua lỗi nhỏ nhặt đó vì nó không ảnh hưởng đến tổng số dư.', '{\"en\": \"The manager urged the staff not to waste time on trifling accounting errors.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý kêu gọi nhân viên không lãng phí thời gian vào những lỗi kế toán nhỏ nhặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-ljspeech-255126d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-cori-255126d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trifling-83c2de96.webp', '[\"trivial\", \"insignificant\", \"minor\"]', '[\"important\", \"significant\", \"crucial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"trifling amount\", \"meaning\": \"số lượng nhỏ nhặt/không đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trifling matter\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề tầm thường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trifle\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"trifle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-cori-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru0-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru5-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru6-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru10-255126d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru9-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru3-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru7-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru8-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-aru2-255126d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-ljspeech-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt408-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt138-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt624-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt396-255126d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt498-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt132-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt288-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt42-255126d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trifling-lt90-255126d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ trang trọng (formal), đồng nghĩa với \'trivial\'.', 'office', 1, 7),
('93a628c3-e088-5c42-b0ec-ff5897899484', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'in advance', '/ɪn ədˈvɑːns/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Sớm hơn thời điểm cần thiết hoặc mong đợi.', 'before a particular time or before something else happens or is done.', 'Conference participants are asked to submit their registration forms two weeks in advance.', 'Các vị khách tham dự hội thảo được yêu cầu nộp đơn đăng ký trước hai tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Clients must pay a deposit in advance to reserve the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng phải đặt cọc trước để giữ chỗ phòng hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-ljspeech-dd027479.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-cori-dd027479.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/in-advance-adcca05a.webp', '[\"beforehand\", \"ahead of time\"]', '[\"afterwards\", \"later\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"book in advance\", \"meaning\": \"đặt chỗ trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pay in advance\", \"meaning\": \"thanh toán trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"advanced\", \"note_vi\": \"Advanced là tính từ chỉ sự tiên tiến, khác với cụm in advance nghĩa là trước.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-cori-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru0-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru5-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru6-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru10-dd027479.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru9-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru3-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru7-dd027479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-advance-aru8-dd027479.mp3\", \"/stor