('cbc5dc4d-7eba-5ac3-b13a-c6cf017523fb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'vending machine', '/ˈvɛndɪŋ məˈʃiːn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Máy tự động bán đồ ăn, thức uống hoặc các mặt hàng khác.', 'a machine that provides snacks or drinks when you put money or a card into it.', 'Staff members frequently purchase snacks from the vending machine installed in the breakroom.', 'Các nhân viên thường xuyên mua đồ ăn vặt từ máy bán hàng tự động được lắp đặt ở phòng nghỉ.', '{\"en\": \"Please use the vending machine in the break room if you need a quick afternoon snack.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng sử dụng máy bán hàng tự động trong phòng nghỉ nếu bạn cần ăn nhẹ buổi chiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-ljspeech-25c3e56a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-cori-25c3e56a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vending-machine-0b037b73.webp', '[\"dispenser\", \"kiosk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"use a vending machine\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng máy bán hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vending machine snack\", \"meaning\": \"đồ ăn từ máy bán hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"vend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-cori-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru0-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru5-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru6-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru10-25c3e56a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru9-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru3-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru7-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru8-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-aru2-25c3e56a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-ljspeech-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt408-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt138-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt624-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt396-25c3e56a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt498-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt132-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt288-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt42-25c3e56a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vending-machine-lt90-25c3e56a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường thấy ở sảnh văn phòng hoặc nhà ga, rất tiện lợi cho nhân viên.', 'office', 1, 10),
('c8dbc1fb-939e-5ee5-916e-9c6bea02b2f5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'one of a kind', '/wʌn əv ə kaɪnd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'độc nhất vô nhị, có một không hai.', 'being the only one of its type and very special or unusual.', 'Her artistic style is truly one of a kind; you won\'t find anything similar.', 'Phong cách nghệ thuật của cô ấy thực sự độc nhất vô nhị; bạn sẽ không tìm thấy điều gì tương tự.', '{\"en\": \"Our boutique hotel offers one of a kind experiences for business travelers.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn phong cách của chúng tôi mang lại những trải nghiệm độc nhất vô nhị cho khách thương gia.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-ljspeech-57d42f21.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-cori-57d42f21.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/one-of-a-kind-2c919ff1.webp', '[\"unique\", \"unrivaled\"]', '[\"common\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"one of a kind design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế độc nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"truly one of a kind\", \"meaning\": \"thật sự có một không hai\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-cori-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru0-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru5-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru6-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru10-57d42f21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru9-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru3-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru7-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru8-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-aru2-57d42f21.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-ljspeech-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt408-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt138-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt624-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt396-57d42f21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt498-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt132-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt288-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt42-57d42f21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-a-kind-lt90-57d42f21.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để khen sản phẩm hoặc dịch vụ độc đáo không trùng lặp.', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('3afc47ae-afeb-534a-9b93-9856f681c2b1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'fare', '/feə(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Diễn biến, tiến triển hoặc đạt được kết quả nào đó.', 'to perform or succeed in a particular situation or activity in a specific way.', 'Many small businesses managed to fare quite well during the recent economic downturn.', 'Nhiều doanh nghiệp nhỏ đã xoay sở làm ăn khá tốt trong cuộc suy thoái kinh tế vừa qua.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing manager will fare well if she understands the local consumer needs.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị mới sẽ đạt kết quả tốt nếu cô ấy hiểu được nhu cầu người tiêu dùng địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-ljspeech-c5675e96.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-cori-c5675e96.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fare-6d34faca.webp', '[\"succeed\", \"manage\"]', '[\"fail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fare well\", \"meaning\": \"diễn biến tốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fare badly\", \"meaning\": \"diễn biến xấu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fair\", \"note_vi\": \"Fair là tính từ (công bằng) hoặc danh từ (hội chợ), không phải động từ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-cori-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru0-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru5-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru6-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru10-c5675e96.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru9-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru3-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru7-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru8-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-aru2-c5675e96.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-ljspeech-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt408-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt138-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt624-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt396-c5675e96.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt498-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt132-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt288-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt42-c5675e96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fare-lt90-c5675e96.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường đi kèm với trạng từ chỉ mức độ như \'well\' hoặc \'badly\'.', 'business', 1, 12),
('7047f535-5372-5144-84b0-41653fb018de', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'betray', '/bɪˈtreɪ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'phản bội lòng tin hoặc tiết lộ bí mật.', 'to be disloyal to someone by revealing their secrets or acting against them.', 'He felt betrayed when his best friend told his secret to everyone.', 'Anh ấy cảm thấy bị phản bội khi người bạn thân nhất của mình kể bí mật của anh ấy cho mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The employee betrayed the company by sharing confidential client data with a competitor.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đó đã phản bội công ty bằng cách chia sẻ dữ liệu khách hàng bí mật cho đối thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/betray-ljspeech-2f9c1dc5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/betray-cori-2f9c1dc5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/betray-6003957c.webp', '[\"deceive\", \"double-cross\", \"reveal\"]', '[\"protect\", \"guard\", \"support\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"betray trust\", \"meaning\": \"phản bội lòng tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"betray a secret\", \"meaning\": \"tiết lộ bí mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"betray confidence\", \"meaning\": \"phản bội sự tin tưởng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"beware\", \"note_vi\": \"beware nghĩa là \'cẩn thận, đề phòng\', không liên quan đến phản bội.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"betrayal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"betrayer\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"betrayed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/betray-cori-2f9c1dc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/betray-aru0-2f9c1dc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/betray-aru5-2f9c1dc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/betray-aru6-2f9c1dc5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/betray-aru10-2f9c1dc5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/betray-aru9-2f9c1dc5.mp3\", \"/stor