('276c77d9-492b-5774-8433-ff9fd7843336', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'precisely', '/prɪˈsaɪsli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách chính xác, đúng đắn hoặc rõ ràng.', 'in a way that is very clear and shows no mistakes in measurement or detail.', 'The architect measured the dimensions of the room precisely to ensure the furniture would fit.', 'Kiến trúc sư đã đo kích thước căn phòng một cách chính xác để đảm bảo đồ nội thất sẽ vừa vặn.', '{\"en\": \"The accountant calculated the quarterly tax returns precisely to avoid any potential financial penalties.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán đã tính toán các tờ khai thuế hàng quý một cách chính xác để tránh mọi hình phạt tài chính tiềm ẩn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-ljspeech-77c3cf9b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-cori-77c3cf9b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/precisely-08fc4928.webp', '[\"accurately\", \"exactly\"]', '[\"vaguely\", \"imprecisely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"precisely the same\", \"meaning\": \"giống hệt nhau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"measure precisely\", \"meaning\": \"đo lường chính xác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"precis\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ chỉ bản tóm tắt, phát âm khác hoàn toàn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"precise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"precision\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-cori-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru0-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru5-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru6-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru10-77c3cf9b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru9-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru3-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru7-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru8-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-aru2-77c3cf9b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-ljspeech-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt408-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt138-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt624-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt396-77c3cf9b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt498-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt132-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt288-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt42-77c3cf9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precisely-lt90-77c3cf9b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để nhấn mạnh sự đúng đắn tuyệt đối trong số liệu hoặc hướng dẫn.', 'finance', 1, 18),
('2bb2f374-f641-534e-9d18-1cf3b71938f3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'chuckle', '/ˈtʃʌkl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cười nhỏ, khẽ, thường vì thích thú hoặc buồn cười.', 'to laugh quietly in a way that shows you are happy or amused.', 'He couldn\'t help but chuckle at the silly joke his friend told.', 'Anh ấy không thể nhịn cười thầm trước câu đùa ngớ ngẩn mà bạn mình kể.', '{\"en\": \"The team members began to chuckle when the presenter accidentally clicked the wrong slide.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên trong nhóm bắt đầu cười khẽ khi người thuyết trình vô tình bấm nhầm slide.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-ljspeech-8d916ecd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-cori-8d916ecd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chuckle-d31865a4.webp', '[\"giggle\", \"snicker\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chuckle to oneself\", \"meaning\": \"tự cười một mình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"give a chuckle\", \"meaning\": \"cười khẽ một tiếng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"chuckle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-cori-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru0-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru5-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru6-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru10-8d916ecd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru9-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru3-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru7-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru8-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-aru2-8d916ecd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-ljspeech-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt408-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt138-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt624-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt396-8d916ecd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt498-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt132-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt288-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt42-8d916ecd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chuckle-lt90-8d916ecd.mp3\"]}}', 'Khác với \'laugh\' là cười lớn, \'chuckle\' là cười kín đáo, thường không mở miệng to.', 'daily', 1, 19),
('7772a4d2-3522-535e-9e6c-87951ed8c7bb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'accountant', 'UK: /əˈkaʊntənt/ | US: /əˈkaʊntənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'kế toán viên', 'a professional person whose job is to keep, inspect, and manage financial records.', 'Our accountant handles all company finances.', 'Kế toán của chúng tôi xử lý tất cả tài chính công ty.', '{\"en\": \"Our senior accountant prepared the balance sheet in preparation for the upcoming annual audit.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán viên cao cấp của chúng tôi đã chuẩn bị bảng cân đối kế toán để chuẩn bị cho kỳ kiểm toán hàng năm sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-ljspeech-4cd5edcd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-cori-4cd5edcd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accountant-15d23f99.webp', '[\"auditor\", \"bookkeeper\", \"financial officer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"certified public accountant\", \"meaning\": \"kế toán viên công chứng (CPA)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chief accountant\", \"meaning\": \"kế toán trưởng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"accounting\", \"note_vi\": \"Accounting là hoạt động/ngành kế toán, không phải là danh từ chỉ người (accountant).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"account\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accounting\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accountable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-cori-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru0-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru5-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru6-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru10-4cd5edcd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru9-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru3-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru7-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru8-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-aru2-4cd5edcd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-ljspeech-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt408-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt138-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt624-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt396-4cd5edcd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt498-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt132-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt288-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt42-4cd5edcd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accountant-lt90-4cd5edcd.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'accountant\' (danh từ chỉ người: kế toán viên) và \'accounting\' (danh từ chỉ ngành/công việc: ngành kế toán).', 'finance', 1, 20),
('f96e4451-1a8a-5570-bdc1-2570f8a2aa21', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'swot', '/swɒt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Học hành rất chăm chỉ và tập trung, thường là để chuẩn bị cho kỳ thi.', 'to study very hard and intensively, especially to prepare for an examination.', 'He had to swot all night for his final exams, barely getting any sleep.', 'Anh ấy phải học cật lực cả đêm để chuẩn bị cho kỳ thi cuối kỳ, hầu như không ngủ chút nào.', '{\"en\": \"Employees had to swot up on new safety regulations before the audit began.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải học kỹ các quy định an toàn mới trước khi cuộc kiểm toán bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-ljspeech-dcf3bc03.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-cori-dcf3bc03.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/swot-c833d272.webp', '[\"cram\", \"study\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"swot up on\", \"meaning\": \"ôn luyện kỹ về cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"SWOT\", \"note_vi\": \"Phân biệt động từ swot (cày học) với mô hình SWOT (Strengths, Weaknesses...).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"swot\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-cori-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru0-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru5-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru6-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru10-dcf3bc03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru9-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru3-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru7-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru8-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-aru2-dcf3bc03.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-ljspeech-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt408-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt138-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt624-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt396-dcf3bc03.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt498-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt132-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt288-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt42-dcf3bc03.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swot-lt90-dcf3bc03.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm giới từ \'up on\' (swot up on something), là từ tiếng Anh - Anh (British English).', 'education', 1, 21),
('e2a3589f-aeb0-5553-94da-0ff81ea2265a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'unanimously', '/juˈnænɪməsli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Với sự đồng ý hoàn toàn của tất cả mọi người có liên quan.', 'in a way that everyone in a group agrees with the same decision.', 'Board members unanimously agreed on selecting the new office location.', 'Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã nhất trí đồng ý về việc chọn địa điểm văn phòng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors voted unanimously to accept the merger offer from our competitor.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã bỏ phiếu nhất trí chấp nhận đề nghị sáp nhập từ đối thủ cạnh tranh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-ljspeech-9d972316.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-cori-9d972316.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unanimously-8f45820f.webp', '[\"collectively\", \"consensually\"]', '[\"disagreeably\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"voted unanimously\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ phiếu nhất trí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"agreed unanimously\", \"meaning\": \"đồng ý nhất trí\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unanimous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-cori-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru0-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru5-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru6-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru10-9d972316.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru9-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru3-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru7-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru8-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-aru2-9d972316.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-ljspeech-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt408-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt138-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt624-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt396-9d972316.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt498-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt132-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt288-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt42-9d972316.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unanimously-lt90-9d972316.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong biên bản họp hoặc quyết định của hội đồng.', 'business', 1, 22),
('41d65cb3-7afa-529b-94d3-d7f723d5e214', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'pessimism', '/ˈpesɪmɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Khuynh hướng tin rằng điều tồi tệ nhất sẽ xảy ra hoặc nhìn mọi việc một cách tiêu cực.', 'a feeling or belief that bad things will happen in the future.', 'Despite the team\'s strong performance, his pessimism made him doubt their chances of winning.', 'Mặc dù đội đã thể hiện tốt, sự bi quan của anh ấy khiến anh ấy nghi ngờ cơ hội chiến thắng của họ.', '{\"en\": \"There is growing pessimism among investors regarding the recovery of the global real estate market.\", \"vi\": \"Ngày càng có nhiều sự bi quan trong giới đầu tư về sự phục hồi của thị trường bất động sản toàn cầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-ljspeech-8b80b1e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-cori-8b80b1e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pessimism-e1cf3aae.webp', '[\"cynicism\", \"negativity\", \"despair\"]', '[\"optimism\", \"hopefulness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"growing pessimism\", \"meaning\": \"sự bi quan ngày càng tăng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economic pessimism\", \"meaning\": \"sự bi quan về kinh tế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pessimist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"pessimistic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-cori-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru0-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru5-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru6-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru10-8b80b1e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru9-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru3-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru7-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru8-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-aru2-8b80b1e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-ljspeech-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt408-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt138-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt624-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt396-8b80b1e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt498-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt132-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt288-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt42-8b80b1e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pessimism-lt90-8b80b1e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với \'optimism\' (sự lạc quan). Hãy nhớ cặp từ này vì chúng hay đi cùng nhau.', 'finance', 1, 23),
('fc430e36-e5d2-5422-a86f-fcf33288ed3c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'salute', '/səˈluːt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Chào theo nghi thức hoặc bày tỏ sự tôn kính.', 'to show formal respect to someone by raising your hand to your head.', 'The honor guard stood at attention to salute the flag during the opening ceremony.', 'Đội danh dự đứng nghiêm để chào cờ trong lễ khai mạc.', '{\"en\": \"The security guards salute the company president whenever he enters the main office.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên bảo vệ chào theo nghi thức với chủ tịch công ty mỗi khi ông vào văn phòng chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-ljspeech-17040e92.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-cori-17040e92.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/salute-6f0e8839.webp', '[\"greet\", \"honor\", \"respect\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"insult\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"salute the flag\", \"meaning\": \"chào cờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"salute someone\'s courage\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự kính trọng đối với lòng dũng cảm của ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dilute\", \"note_vi\": \"dilute là pha loãng, salute là chào tôn kính\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"salute\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-cori-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru0-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru5-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru6-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru10-17040e92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru9-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru3-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru7-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru8-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-aru2-17040e92.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-ljspeech-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt408-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt138-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt624-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt396-17040e92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt498-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt132-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt288-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt42-17040e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/salute-lt90-17040e92.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường dùng trong quân đội hoặc các nghi lễ trang trọng.', 'other', 1, 24)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('b74e461e-4085-549f-bbef-5539aeb3c167', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'syrupy', '/ˈsɪrəpi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Giống như si-rô, đặc và ngọt; hoặc quá tình cảm, giả tạo.', 'thick and sweet like sugar liquid, or sounding too emotional and insincere in a way.', 'The cough medicine had a thick, syrupy consistency and a very sweet taste.', 'Thuốc ho có độ đặc sền sệt như si-rô và vị rất ngọt.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing campaign used a syrupy tone that many customers found insincere and quite annoying.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị đã sử dụng một giọng điệu ngọt ngào thái quá mà nhiều khách hàng thấy không chân thành và khá khó chịu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-ljspeech-fad03061.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-cori-fad03061.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/syrupy-bcdd5d1d.webp', '[\"sweet\", \"cloying\"]', '[\"bitter\", \"sharp\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"syrupy voice\", \"meaning\": \"giọng điệu ngọt ngào giả tạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"syrupy consistency\", \"meaning\": \"độ đặc như siro\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"syrup\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-cori-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru0-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru5-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru6-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru10-fad03061.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru9-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru3-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru7-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru8-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-aru2-fad03061.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-ljspeech-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt408-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt138-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt624-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt396-fad03061.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt498-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt132-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt288-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt42-fad03061.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/syrupy-lt90-fad03061.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng là \"ngọt ngào giả tạo\", cần lưu ý.', 'marketing', 1, 25),
('989064d7-ff4a-5216-9ea2-b1d32a45e584', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'rise above', '/raɪz əˈbʌv/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Vượt lên trên một tình huống khó khăn hoặc cảm xúc tiêu cực.', 'to overcome a difficult situation or negative feeling without letting it affect your behavior.', 'It\'s important to rise above petty arguments and focus on what truly matters.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải vượt lên trên những cuộc cãi vã vặt vãnh và tập trung vào những gì thực sự quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Strong leaders learn to rise above workplace conflicts and focus on strategic corporate goals.\", \"vi\": \"Những nhà lãnh đạo giỏi biết cách vượt lên trên các xung đột nơi công sở và tập trung vào các mục tiêu chiến lược của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-ljspeech-cd11837e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-cori-cd11837e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rise-above-b7c20740.webp', '[\"overcome\", \"transcend\", \"surmount\"]', '[\"succumb to\", \"give in to\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rise above criticism\", \"meaning\": \"vượt lên trên những lời chỉ trích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rise above challenges\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua thử thách\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-cori-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru0-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru5-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru6-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru10-cd11837e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru9-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru3-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru7-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru8-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-aru2-cd11837e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-ljspeech-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt408-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt138-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt624-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt396-cd11837e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt498-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt132-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt288-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt42-cd11837e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rise-above-lt90-cd11837e.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ \'rise\' là bất quy tắc (rise - rose - risen).', 'office', 1, 26),
('55597891-c56f-5807-a2c0-7bcc493f91ab', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'additional', 'UK: /əˈdɪʃənəl/ | US: /əˈdɪʃənəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'bổ sung, thêm vào', 'extra or supplementary to what is already present or available', 'There is an additional charge for express delivery service.', 'Có một khoản phí bổ sung cho dịch vụ giao hàng nhanh.', '{\"en\": \"If you require additional information regarding the conference, please contact customer support.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu bạn cần thêm thông tin liên quan đến hội nghị, vui lòng liên hệ bộ phận hỗ trợ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-ljspeech-20412476.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-cori-20412476.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/additional-efab3a65.webp', '[\"extra\", \"supplementary\", \"further\", \"spare\"]', '[\"original\", \"base\", \"primary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"additional fee\", \"meaning\": \"phí phụ thu, phí bổ sung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"additional details\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin chi tiết bổ sung\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"add\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"addition\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"additionally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-cori-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru0-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru5-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru6-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru10-20412476.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru9-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru3-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru7-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru8-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-aru2-20412476.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-ljspeech-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt408-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt138-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt624-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt396-20412476.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt498-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt132-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt288-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt42-20412476.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/additional-lt90-20412476.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng trước danh từ trong hợp đồng/email thương mại (ví dụ: additional costs, additional details).', 'office', 1, 27),
('c1d0ad19-9c75-53cc-8136-5fd647897a7e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'Nollywood', '/ˈnɒl.i.wʊd/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Ngành công nghiệp điện ảnh của Nigeria.', 'the film industry based in the country of nigeria.', 'Nollywood has become one of the largest film industries in the world by number of films produced.', 'Nollywood đã trở thành một trong những ngành công nghiệp điện ảnh lớn nhất thế giới về số lượng phim sản xuất.', '{\"en\": \"Investors are looking at Nollywood as a growing market for international media distribution.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà đầu tư đang xem xét Nollywood như một thị trường đang phát triển cho việc phân phối truyền thông quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-ljspeech-7460c38a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-cori-7460c38a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nollywood-b9ac169f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"Nollywood film\", \"meaning\": \"phim của Nigeria\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"Hollywood\", \"note_vi\": \"ngành điện ảnh Mỹ, khác với Nollywood của Nigeria.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-cori-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru0-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru5-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru6-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru10-7460c38a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru9-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru3-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru7-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru8-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-aru2-7460c38a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-ljspeech-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt408-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt138-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt624-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt396-7460c38a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt498-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt132-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt288-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt42-7460c38a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nollywood-lt90-7460c38a.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là tên riêng, viết hoa chữ N đầu tiên.', 'media', 1, 28),
('aa15c238-7640-5525-9ac7-e9ae430ad53f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '55b1a1ef-3c08-5d17-ae33-f4119d16ad26', 'a968f50b-2c5c-5bfa-b8f5-80d1929a2e24', 'barely', '/ˈbeəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Hầu như không, vừa đủ để làm gì đó.', 'by a very small amount, or only just in a way that is true.', 'He was so tired that he could barely keep his eyes open.', 'Anh ấy mệt đến nỗi hầu như không thể mở mắt.', '{\"en\": \"The flight was delayed, so the manager barely arrived in time for the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến bay bị hoãn nên người quản lý vừa kịp đến dự cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-ljspeech-7ac36259.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-cori-7ac36259.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/barely-e137a54d.webp', '[\"hardly\", \"scarcely\", \"just\"]', '[\"completely\", \"fully\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"barely enough\", \"meaning\": \"hầu như không đủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"barely audible\", \"meaning\": \"hầu như không nghe thấy\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rarely\", \"note_vi\": \"rarely chỉ tần suất (hiếm khi), còn barely chỉ mức độ (vừa đủ/suýt soát).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bare\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-cori-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru0-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru5-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru6-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru10-7ac36259.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru9-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru3-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru7-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru8-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-aru2-7ac36259.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-ljspeech-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt408-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt138-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt624-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt396-7ac36259.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt498-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt132-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt288-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt42-7ac36259.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/barely-lt90-7ac36259.mp3\"]}}', 'Barely mang nghĩa phủ định nhẹ (vừa đủ/hầu như không), không dùng kèm với not.', 'travel', 1, 29),
('525cf357-f8bc-518b-8cde-cf546c451c14', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '56219406-3c9a-5857-a92f-77dc52f21938', 'b39984ce-d55b-58dd-8ea2-0c0f6e52ecd7', 'haunt', '/hɔːnt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Thường xuyên xuất hiện hoặc gây lo lắng trong tâm trí ai đó.', 'to cause repeated suffering or anxiety for someone over a long period of time.', 'Dark secrets from his past continued to haunt the politician during his campaign.', 'Những bí mật đen tối từ quá khứ tiếp tục ám ảnh vị chính trị gia trong suốt chiến dịch của ông.', '{\"en\": \"The negative reviews from last year continue to haunt the restaurant\'s reputation and sales.\", \"vi\": \"Những đánh giá tiêu cực từ năm ngoái tiếp tục ám ảnh danh tiếng và doanh thu của nhà hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-ljspeech-48c66c3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-cori-48c66c3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/haunt-239b04ff.webp', '[\"torment\", \"trouble\", \"obsess\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"haunt someone\'s memory\", \"meaning\": \"ám ảnh trí nhớ của ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"come back to haunt\", \"meaning\": \"quay lại ám ảnh hoặc gây rắc rối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hunt\", \"note_vi\": \"hunt là săn bắn, haunt là ám ảnh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"haunting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-cori-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru0-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru5-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru6-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru10-48c66c3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru9-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru3-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru7-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru8-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-aru2-48c66c3c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-ljspeech-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt408-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt138-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt624-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt396-48c66c3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt498-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt132-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt288-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt42-48c66c3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/haunt-lt90-48c66c3c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'come back to haunt someone\' rất hay dùng khi một sai lầm trong quá khứ gây hậu quả hiện tại.', 'business', 1, 0),
('802517ae-917b-5347-9193-89891a123b84', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '56219406-3c9a-5857-a92f-77dc52f21938', 'b39984ce-d55b-58dd-8ea2-0c0f6e52ecd7', 'get off the ground', '/ɡɛt ɒf ðə ɡraʊnd/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Bắt đầu một dự án, ý tưởng hoặc doanh nghiệp một cách thành công.', 'to begin a new project or business successfully after a period of planning.', 'It took a lot of effort to get the new startup off the ground, but now it\'s thriving.', 'Phải mất rất nhiều nỗ lực để khởi nghiệp mới này thành công, nhưng giờ đây nó đang phát triển mạnh mẽ.', '{\"en\": \"The team worked overtime to get the new logistics project off the ground by Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Cả nhóm đã làm thêm giờ để đưa dự án hậu cần mới đi vào hoạt động trước thứ Hai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-ljspeech-f639d483.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-cori-f639d483.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/get-off-the-ground-1e44d16f.webp', '[\"launch\", \"initiate\"]', '[\"fail\", \"collapse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"help get off the ground\", \"meaning\": \"giúp khởi động dự án\"}, {\"phrase\": \"struggle to get off the ground\", \"meaning\": \"vật lộn để khởi động\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-cori-f639d483.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-aru0-f639d483.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-aru5-f639d483.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-aru6-f639d483.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-aru10-f639d483.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-aru9-f639d483.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-aru3-f639d483.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/get-off-the-ground-aru7-f639d