('52345a61-56b3-5d7e-9aac-d555682d3920', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '56219406-3c9a-5857-a92f-77dc52f21938', 'b39984ce-d55b-58dd-8ea2-0c0f6e52ecd7', 'regime', '/reɪˈʒiːm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một hệ thống hoặc phương pháp quản lý, đặc biệt là chính phủ.', 'a particular government or a system of organizing and controlling something.', 'The new regime promised to bring about significant reforms.', 'Chế độ mới hứa hẹn sẽ mang lại những cải cách đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"The new management regime implemented stricter rules regarding office working hours.\", \"vi\": \"Chế độ quản lý mới đã áp dụng các quy định nghiêm ngặt hơn về giờ làm việc tại văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-ljspeech-814189e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-cori-814189e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regime-ba2feb75.webp', '[\"government\", \"administration\", \"system\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"authoritarian regime\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ độc tài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"management regime\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ quản lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"regimen\", \"note_vi\": \"regimen là chế độ ăn uống, tập luyện để cải thiện sức khỏe.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-cori-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru0-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru5-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru6-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru10-814189e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru9-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru3-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru7-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru8-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-aru2-814189e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-ljspeech-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt408-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt138-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt624-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt396-814189e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt498-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt132-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt288-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt42-814189e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regime-lt90-814189e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \"regimen\" (chế độ dinh dưỡng hoặc điều trị y tế).', 'business', 1, 15),
('4235839e-c831-5a0a-a7c0-f03679e9df3a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'disinterested', '/dɪsˈɪntrəstɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Khách quan, không thiên vị, không vụ lợi.', 'having no stake in outcome and thus able to be fair.', 'A judge must remain disinterested to ensure a fair trial.', 'Một thẩm phán phải giữ thái độ vô tư để đảm bảo một phiên tòa công bằng.', '{\"en\": \"The disinterested consultant gave neutral advice on the merger deal.\", \"vi\": \"Vị tư vấn khách quan đã đưa lời khuyên trung lập về thương vụ sáp nhập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-ljspeech-39908c88.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-cori-39908c88.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disinterested-633563cf.webp', '[\"impartial\", \"unbiased\", \"objective\"]', '[\"biased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disinterested party\", \"meaning\": \"bên không vụ lợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disinterested observer\", \"meaning\": \"người quan sát khách quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain disinterested\", \"meaning\": \"giữ thái độ không thiên vị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"uninterested\", \"note_vi\": \"uninterested là không quan tâm, không phải khách quan\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disinterest\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-cori-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru0-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru5-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru6-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru10-39908c88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru9-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru3-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru7-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru8-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-aru2-39908c88.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-ljspeech-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt408-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt138-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt624-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt396-39908c88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt498-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt132-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt288-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt42-39908c88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disinterested-lt90-39908c88.mp3\"]}}', 'Disinterested không phải là không quan tâm (uninterested).', 'business', 1, 0),
('9da6310d-b627-5e22-8fbc-f65c50ac27ac', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'glance', '/ɡlɑːns/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nhìn nhanh chóng, thoáng qua một cái gì đó.', 'to look quickly or briefly at something or someone.', 'She glanced at her watch to check the time.', 'Cô ấy liếc nhìn đồng hồ để xem giờ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager glanced at the financial report during the brief meeting this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã liếc nhìn báo cáo tài chính trong cuộc họp ngắn sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-ljspeech-0a6ca81d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-cori-0a6ca81d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glance-cc8e4ca8.webp', '[\"glimpse\", \"peek\", \"scan\"]', '[\"stare\", \"gaze\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"glance at a watch\", \"meaning\": \"liếc nhìn đồng hồ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"glance through a document\", \"meaning\": \"đọc lướt qua tài liệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stare\", \"note_vi\": \"stare là nhìn chằm chằm trong thời gian dài.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"glance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-cori-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru0-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru5-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru6-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru10-0a6ca81d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru9-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru3-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru7-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru8-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-aru2-0a6ca81d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-ljspeech-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt408-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt138-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt624-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt396-0a6ca81d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt498-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt132-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt288-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt42-0a6ca81d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glance-lt90-0a6ca81d.mp3\"]}}', 'Glance thường đi với giới từ \'at\' (liếc nhìn) hoặc \'through\' (đọc lướt).', 'office', 1, 1),
('f099c53a-e77c-5a43-b821-f5e0f3eb8f28', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'incapable', '/ɪnˈkeɪpəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không thể làm được điều gì đó.', 'not having the necessary skill or ability to do a particular task.', 'He seems completely incapable of understanding complex instructions.', 'Anh ấy dường như hoàn toàn không có khả năng hiểu các hướng dẫn phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The old system was incapable of handling the high volume of online orders.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống cũ không có khả năng xử lý số lượng lớn đơn hàng trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-ljspeech-70df746e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-cori-70df746e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/incapable-02ea73da.webp', '[\"unable\", \"incompetent\", \"powerless\"]', '[\"capable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"incapable of doing\", \"meaning\": \"không thể làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem incapable\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ như không thể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unable\", \"note_vi\": \"unable đi với to V, incapable đi với of V-ing\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"incapacity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-cori-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru0-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru5-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru6-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru10-70df746e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru9-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru3-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru7-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru8-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-aru2-70df746e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-ljspeech-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt408-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt138-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt624-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt396-70df746e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt498-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt132-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt288-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt42-70df746e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/incapable-lt90-70df746e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cấu trúc \'incapable of + V-ing/Noun\'.', 'technology', 1, 2),
('096a2001-4517-53b2-8dc2-36ef84c78112', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'pragmatic', '/præɡˈmætɪk/', '', 'noun', 'Người có cách tiếp cận vấn đề một cách thực tế.', 'a person who deals with problems in a sensible and practical way.', 'She is a true pragmatic, always looking for practical solutions.', 'Cô ấy là một người thực tế đúng nghĩa, luôn tìm kiếm các giải pháp thiết thực.', '{\"en\": \"As a pragmatic, he suggested cutting unnecessary expenses to save the company budget this year.\", \"vi\": \"Là một người thực tế, anh ấy đề nghị cắt giảm các chi phí không cần thiết để tiết kiệm ngân sách công ty năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-ljspeech-ba0e1d1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-cori-ba0e1d1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pragmatic-00cc5c43.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-cori-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru0-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru5-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru6-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru10-ba0e1d1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru9-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru3-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru7-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru8-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-aru2-ba0e1d1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-ljspeech-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt408-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt138-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt624-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt396-ba0e1d1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt498-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt132-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt288-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt42-ba0e1d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pragmatic-lt90-ba0e1d1d.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 3),
('7aec5e92-559f-58dd-8935-2a03ca281bbe', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'prefer', '/prɪˈfɜː(r)/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Thích cái gì hơn cái khác.', 'to like, choose, or want one thing rather than another thing.', 'Many clients prefer receiving digital invoices rather than paper statements by mail.', 'Nhiều khách hàng thích nhận hóa đơn điện tử hơn là bản sao kê bằng giấy qua thư.', '{\"en\": \"Most clients prefer to receive their monthly billing statements via email rather than regular mail.\", \"vi\": \"Hầu hết khách hàng thích nhận sao kê hóa đơn hàng tháng qua email hơn là thư thông thường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-ljspeech-866e90df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-cori-866e90df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prefer-e8de0f65.webp', '[\"favor\", \"choose\", \"select\"]', '[\"dislike\", \"reject\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prefer A to B\", \"meaning\": \"thích A hơn B\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly prefer\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ thích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"refer\", \"note_vi\": \"refer là tham khảo hoặc giới thiệu, còn từ này là thích hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"preference\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"preferable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-cori-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru0-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru5-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru6-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru10-866e90df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru9-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru3-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru7-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru8-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-aru2-866e90df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-ljspeech-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt408-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt138-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt624-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt396-866e90df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt498-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt132-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt288-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt42-866e90df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prefer-lt90-866e90df.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến là prefer something TO something (không dùng THAN).', 'daily', 1, 4),
('06f7f2c1-82fb-5e0a-bd15-2d37f02f0d14', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'rabbi', '/ˈræbaɪ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một giáo sĩ hoặc lãnh đạo tinh thần trong đạo Do Thái.', 'a person who is trained in Jewish law and serves as a leader of a community.', 'The rabbi led the congregation in prayer during the Sabbath service.', 'Vị giáo sĩ Do Thái đã dẫn dắt cộng đồng cầu nguyện trong buổi lễ ngày Sa-bát.', '{\"en\": \"The rabbi provided guidance to the community members regarding the upcoming religious holiday schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Vị giáo sĩ đã hướng dẫn các thành viên cộng đồng về lịch trình ngày lễ tôn giáo sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-ljspeech-45d3a775.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-cori-45d3a775.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rabbi-82a20ae7.webp', '[\"cleric\", \"priest\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"the local rabbi\", \"meaning\": \"giáo sĩ địa phương\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-cori-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru0-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru5-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru6-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru10-45d3a775.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru9-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru3-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru7-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru8-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-aru2-45d3a775.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-ljspeech-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt408-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt138-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt624-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt396-45d3a775.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt498-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt132-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt288-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt42-45d3a775.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rabbi-lt90-45d3a775.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ dùng riêng cho đạo Do Thái.', 'other', 1, 5),
('51d5b9dc-ba2b-5b90-8774-04dd1fcbabf1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'widely', 'UK: /ˈwaɪdli/ | US: /ˈwaɪdli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'rộng rãi, khắp nơi', 'over a vast area or by a large number of people.', 'The new policy was widely accepted by employees.', 'Chính sách mới được nhân viên chấp nhận rộng rãi.', '{\"en\": \"This accounting software is widely used by multinational corporations for financial reporting.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm kế toán này được sử dụng rộng rãi bởi các tập đoàn đa quốc gia để báo cáo tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-ljspeech-c6e280af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-cori-c6e280af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/widely-68fd5ea2.webp', '[\"extensively\", \"broadly\", \"universally\", \"commonly\"]', '[\"narrowly\", \"rarely\", \"scarcely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"widely used\", \"meaning\": \"được sử dụng rộng rãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"widely available\", \"meaning\": \"có sẵn rộng rãi/khắp nơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"widely accepted\", \"meaning\": \"được chấp nhận rộng rãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wide\", \"note_vi\": \"Wide là tính từ (rộng lớn về kích thước), trong khi Widely là trạng từ (ở phạm vi rộng / được nhiều người biết đến).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"wide\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"widen\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"width\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-cori-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru0-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru5-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru6-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru10-c6e280af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru9-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru3-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru7-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru8-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-aru2-c6e280af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-ljspeech-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt408-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt138-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt624-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt396-c6e280af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt498-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt132-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt288-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt42-c6e280af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/widely-lt90-c6e280af.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi trước các quá khứ phân từ làm tính từ: \'widely used\' (dùng rộng rãi), \'widely known\' (nổi tiếng rộng rãi), \'widely accepted\' (được công nhận rộng rãi).', 'office', 1, 6),
('7ee7454c-46af-5912-8bfa-3b56a02e8a93', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'mantle', '/ˈmæntl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một vai trò hoặc trách nhiệm quan trọng mà ai đó phải đảm nhận.', 'an important role or responsibility that someone takes over from another person.', 'The young leader bravely took on the mantle of leadership for the struggling company.', 'Người lãnh đạo trẻ tuổi đã dũng cảm gánh vác trọng trách lãnh đạo cho công ty đang gặp khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"After the director retired, she took on the mantle of leading the entire operations team.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi giám đốc nghỉ hưu, cô ấy đảm nhận vai trò lãnh đạo toàn bộ đội vận hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-ljspeech-4b3be861.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-cori-4b3be861.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mantle-4db3c06e.webp', '[\"role\", \"responsibility\", \"burden\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take on the mantle\", \"meaning\": \"đảm nhận vai trò/trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assume the mantle\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp nhận trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mantle of leadership\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò lãnh đạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mantel\", \"note_vi\": \"mantel (hoặc mantelpiece) là kệ trên lò sưởi, còn mantle là vai trò/trách nhiệm hoặc áo choàng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-cori-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru0-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru5-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru6-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru10-4b3be861.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru9-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru3-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru7-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru8-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-aru2-4b3be861.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-ljspeech-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt408-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt138-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt624-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt396-4b3be861.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt498-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt132-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt288-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt42-4b3be861.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mantle-lt90-4b3be861.mp3\"]}}', '\'Mantle\' trong nghĩa bóng thường đi với \'take on/assume the mantle of\'; đừng nhầm với \'mantel\' (kệ lò sưởi).', 'hr', 1, 7),
('c0b2f8e5-7262-5f7d-b76e-c9a8dd6b8e33', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'dignify', '/ˈdɪɡnɪfaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'làm cho cái gì đó trở nên trang trọng, đáng kính.', 'to make something or someone seem worthy of respect and serious attention.', 'Her presence alone was enough to dignify the simple ceremony.', 'Chỉ sự hiện diện của cô ấy thôi cũng đủ để làm cho buổi lễ đơn giản trở nên trang trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO\'s speech helped dignify the opening of the new branch office.\", \"vi\": \"Bài phát biểu của CEO đã giúp làm trang trọng lễ khai trương chi nhánh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-ljspeech-3ee3c228.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-cori-3ee3c228.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dignify-fb061746.webp', '[\"honor\", \"elevate\", \"ennoble\"]', '[\"degrade\", \"demean\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dignify an occasion\", \"meaning\": \"làm trang trọng dịp sự kiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dignify a ceremony\", \"meaning\": \"làm trọng thể buổi lễ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dignify with presence\", \"meaning\": \"làm vinh dự bằng sự hiện diện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"identify\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm gần nhưng nghĩa nhận diện.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dignity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dignified\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-cori-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru0-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru5-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru6-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru10-3ee3c228.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru9-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru3-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru7-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru8-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-aru2-3ee3c228.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-ljspeech-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt408-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt138-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt624-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt396-3ee3c228.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt498-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt132-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt288-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt42-3ee3c228.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dignify-lt90-3ee3c228.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm với identify (nhận diện) hay dignity (danh từ).', 'business', 1, 8),
('2df020bc-8c9b-5d37-a356-d4061558fa70', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'praiseworthy', '/ˈpreɪzwɜːði/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Đáng được khen ngợi, tán dương.', 'deserving approval and admiration because of good behavior or great achievement.', 'The team\'s quick response to the emergency situation was highly praiseworthy.', 'Phản ứng nhanh chóng của toàn đội trước tình huống khẩn cấp rất đáng được khen ngợi.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team received special bonuses for their praiseworthy performance during the last quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kinh doanh đã nhận được tiền thưởng đặc biệt vì thành tích đáng khen ngợi trong quý trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-ljspeech-6006bc06.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-cori-6006bc06.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/praiseworthy-2d0b42bd.webp', '[\"commendable\", \"laudable\", \"admirable\"]', '[\"blameworthy\", \"reprehensible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"praiseworthy effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực đáng khen ngợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"praiseworthy conduct\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi đáng tuyên dương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"blameworthy\", \"note_vi\": \"Praiseworthy là đáng khen ngợi; blameworthy là đáng bị khiển trách.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"praise\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"praise\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-cori-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru0-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru5-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru6-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru10-6006bc06.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru9-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru3-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru7-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru8-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-aru2-6006bc06.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-ljspeech-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt408-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt138-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt624-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt396-6006bc06.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt498-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt132-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt288-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt42-6006bc06.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/praiseworthy-lt90-6006bc06.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ ghép giữa \'praise\' (khen ngợi) và \'worthy\' (xứng đáng).', 'hr', 1, 9),
('69f801e5-e1d4-57bf-9570-18468ab9d876', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'cheapen', '/ˈtʃiːpən/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm giảm giá trị, phẩm chất hoặc sự tôn trọng của cái gì đó.', 'to make something seem less valuable, useful, or respected than before.', 'Don\'t cheapen your reputation by getting involved in gossip.', 'Đừng hạ thấp danh tiếng của bạn bằng cách tham gia vào chuyện tầm phào.', '{\"en\": \"Excessive price discounts might cheapen the brand image of our luxury products.\", \"vi\": \"Giảm giá quá mức có thể làm giảm giá trị hình ảnh thương hiệu của các sản phẩm xa xỉ của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-ljspeech-bb8cb834.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-cori-bb8cb834.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cheapen-470157e9.webp', '[\"devalue\", \"degrade\", \"depreciate\"]', '[\"enhance\", \"value\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cheapen the brand\", \"meaning\": \"làm giảm giá trị thương hiệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cheapen the value\", \"meaning\": \"làm giảm giá trị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"depreciate\", \"note_vi\": \"depreciate thường dùng cho sự giảm giá trị tiền tệ hoặc tài sản theo thời gian.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"cheap\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"cheaply\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-cori-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru0-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru5-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru6-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru10-bb8cb834.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru9-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru3-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru7-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru8-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-aru2-bb8cb834.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-ljspeech-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt408-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt138-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt624-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt396-bb8cb834.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt498-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt132-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt288-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt42-bb8cb834.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cheapen-lt90-bb8cb834.mp3\"]}}', 'Cheapen vừa có nghĩa giảm giá bán vừa có nghĩa làm giảm giá trị thương hiệu.', 'marketing', 1, 10),
('c5522641-68f1-5f8a-8076-88521cd02888', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'toothless', '/ˈtuːθləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Yếu ớt, không có hiệu lực hoặc khả năng gây hại.', 'lacking the power or authority to be effective or to force people to obey.', 'Without proper enforcement, the new regulations will be largely toothless.', 'Nếu không có sự thực thi đúng đắn, các quy định mới sẽ phần lớn trở nên yếu ớt.', '{\"en\": \"The committee was criticized for being a toothless organization with no real power.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban bị chỉ trích là một tổ chức không có thực quyền và không có sức mạnh thực sự.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-ljspeech-15dd6d5a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-cori-15dd6d5a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/toothless-1c4c7526.webp', '[\"ineffective\", \"powerless\", \"weak\"]', '[\"powerful\", \"effective\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"toothless organization\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức không có thực quyền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"toothless policy\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách không có hiệu lực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tooth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-cori-15dd6d5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-aru0-15dd6d5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-aru5-15dd6d5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-aru6-15dd6d5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-aru10-15dd6d5a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-aru9-15dd6d5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-aru3-15dd6d5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-aru7-15dd6d5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toothless-aru8-15dd6d5a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1