('c5ed2030-259d-50c6-8427-8ac043b57170', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '57d4e690-b28e-5129-a3e2-7c72a603154d', '3833f0a0-07e0-5c6d-96ed-fcfcd2b846f1', 'methane', '/ˈmiːθeɪn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một loại khí không màu, không mùi, dễ cháy, là thành phần chính của khí tự nhiên.', 'a colorless and odorless gas that burns easily and is a primary component of natural gas.', 'Methane is a potent greenhouse gas that contributes to climate change.', 'Khí mêtan là một loại khí nhà kính mạnh góp phần vào biến đổi khí hậu.', '{\"en\": \"The factory installed new filters to reduce the amount of methane released into the atmosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã lắp đặt các bộ lọc mới để giảm lượng khí mê-tan thải ra bầu khí quyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-ljspeech-1dfb31a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-cori-1dfb31a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/methane-86ec69f8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"methane emissions\", \"meaning\": \"khí thải mê-tan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"methane gas\", \"meaning\": \"khí mê-tan\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-cori-1dfb31a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru0-1dfb31a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru5-1dfb31a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru6-1dfb31a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru10-1dfb31a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru9-1dfb31a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru3-1dfb31a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru7-1dfb31a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru8-1dfb31a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-aru2-1dfb31a5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/methane-