('b9cf0d77-7f12-5d18-b155-dabd66627f98', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5bcd236f-d62b-52a3-ae83-d2458840ec0f', 'ef1255df-817c-5777-9209-5e8fbf3bc7f5', 'twirl', '/twɜːl/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Xoay nhanh hoặc quay vòng.', 'to turn around and around quickly, or to make something do this.', 'She loved to twirl around in her new dress, watching it flare out.', 'Cô bé thích xoay tròn trong chiếc váy mới, ngắm nhìn nó xòe ra.', '{\"en\": \"The dancer had to twirl gracefully on stage during the grand opening ceremony.\", \"vi\": \"Vũ công phải xoay người một cách duyên dáng trên sân khấu trong buổi lễ khai trương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-ljspeech-8ff307a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-cori-8ff307a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/twirl-47c06eea.webp', '[\"spin\", \"whirl\", \"rotate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"twirl around\", \"meaning\": \"xoay vòng tròn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"twirl a pen\", \"meaning\": \"xoay bút\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"whirl\", \"note_vi\": \"whirl thường chỉ chuyển động quay rất nhanh, đôi khi gây chóng mặt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"twirl\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-cori-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru0-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru5-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru6-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru10-8ff307a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru9-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru3-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru7-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru8-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-aru2-8ff307a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-ljspeech-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt408-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt138-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt624-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt396-8ff307a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt498-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt132-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt288-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt42-8ff307a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/twirl-lt90-8ff307a4.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy liên tưởng đến việc xoay tròn một cây bút trên tay.', 'other', 1, 7),
('5249b0bf-96d4-54ef-b8b5-b2d6cddc7073', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5bcd236f-d62b-52a3-ae83-d2458840ec0f', 'ef1255df-817c-5777-9209-5e8fbf3bc7f5', 'tile', 'UK: /taɪl/ | US: /taɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'gạch lát', 'a thin square piece of baked clay or stone used for covering floors or walls', 'The floor tiles were made of ceramic.', 'Những viên gạch lát sàn được làm bằng gốm sứ.', '{\"en\": \"Workers are currently replacing damaged ceramic tiles in the lobby.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân hiện đang thay thế các viên gạch gốm bị hỏng ở sảnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-ljspeech-fad7abc8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-cori-fad7abc8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tile-0784b0eb.webp', '[\"slab\", \"brick\", \"paving\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"floor tile\", \"meaning\": \"gạch lát sàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ceramic tile\", \"meaning\": \"gạch gốm/sứ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"title\", \"note_vi\": \"Title có thêm chữ \'t\' ở giữa, nghĩa là tiêu đề hoặc chức danh công việc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tile\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tiler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-cori-fad7abc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru0-fad7abc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru5-fad7abc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru6-fad7abc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru10-fad7abc8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru9-fad7abc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru3-fad7abc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru7-fad7abc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru8-fad7abc8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-aru2-fad7abc8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tile-ljspe