('42e4457c-b253-53aa-ad83-02d6d40ffc78', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5bcd236f-d62b-52a3-ae83-d2458840ec0f', 'ef1255df-817c-5777-9209-5e8fbf3bc7f5', 'nauseous', '/ˈnɔːziəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy buồn nôn, khó chịu trong dạ dày.', 'feeling as if you might vomit, or causing this feeling in your stomach.', 'The smell of the old fish made me feel nauseous.', 'Mùi cá cũ làm tôi cảm thấy buồn nôn.', '{\"en\": \"The strong chemical smell in the manufacturing plant made several factory workers feel nauseous yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Mùi hóa chất nồng nặc trong nhà máy sản xuất đã làm vài công nhân cảm thấy buồn nôn hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-ljspeech-4ebb6ed1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-cori-4ebb6ed1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nauseous-db37b26b.webp', '[\"sick\", \"queasy\", \"nauseated\"]', '[\"well\", \"healthy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel nauseous\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy buồn nôn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make someone nauseous\", \"meaning\": \"làm ai đó buồn nôn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"nauseated\", \"note_vi\": \"nauseous thường chỉ thứ gây buồn nôn, nhưng nay dùng như nauseated (bị buồn nôn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"nausea\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-cori-4ebb6ed1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-aru0-4ebb6ed1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-aru5-4ebb6ed1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-aru6-4ebb6ed1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-aru10-4ebb6ed1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-aru9-4ebb6ed1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-aru3-4ebb6ed1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-aru7-4ebb6ed1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nauseous-aru8