('e9e72256-67e7-53f3-91df-874e81f34f09', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5bcd236f-d62b-52a3-ae83-d2458840ec0f', 'ef1255df-817c-5777-9209-5e8fbf3bc7f5', 'mountainous', '/ˈmaʊntənəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều núi hoặc địa hình đồi núi.', 'having many mountains or being covered with high, steep land areas.', 'The country\'s northern region is very mountainous, making travel difficult.', 'Vùng phía bắc của đất nước rất nhiều núi, khiến việc đi lại khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The mountainous terrain makes it challenging to transport goods to the remote northern branch office.\", \"vi\": \"Địa hình đồi núi gây khó khăn cho việc vận chuyển hàng hóa đến chi nhánh phía bắc xa xôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-ljspeech-8fb59b38.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-cori-8fb59b38.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mountainous-32192dc7.webp', '[\"hilly\", \"rugged\"]', '[\"flat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mountainous region\", \"meaning\": \"vùng núi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mountain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-cori-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru0-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru5-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru6-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru10-8fb59b38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru9-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru3-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru7-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru8-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-aru2-8fb59b38.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-ljspeech-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt408-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt138-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt624-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt396-8fb59b38.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt498-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt132-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt288-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt42-8fb59b38.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mountainous-lt90-8fb59b38.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả địa hình gây khó khăn cho logistics hoặc vận tải.', 'travel', 1, 27),
('c2febad2-9002-5a52-b139-91fd78ddbee5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5bcd236f-d62b-52a3-ae83-d2458840ec0f', 'ef1255df-817c-5777-9209-5e8fbf3bc7f5', 'fraudulent', '/ˈfrɔːdʒələnt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có tính chất lừa đảo, gian dối nhằm trục lợi bất chính.', 'involving illegal or dishonest methods to obtain money or unfair advantages from other people.', 'The company was accused of fraudulent accounting practices to inflate its profits.', 'Công ty bị buộc tội gian lận trong các hoạt động kế toán để thổi phồng lợi nhuận.', '{\"en\": \"The bank detected several fraudulent transactions on the client\'s account during the last business week.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân hàng đã phát hiện một vài giao dịch gian lận trong tài khoản của khách hàng trong tuần làm việc vừa qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-ljspeech-095437ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-cori-095437ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fraudulent-ad3dbbae.webp', '[\"dishonest\", \"deceptive\"]', '[\"honest\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fraudulent activity\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động gian lận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fraudulent claim\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu bồi thường gian lận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fraud\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-cori-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru0-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru5-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru6-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru10-095437ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru9-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru3-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru7-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru8-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-aru2-095437ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-ljspeech-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt408-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt138-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt624-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt396-095437ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt498-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt132-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt288-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt42-095437ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fraudulent-lt90-095437ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý, tài chính, liên quan đến lừa đảo.', 'finance', 1, 28),
('74e5eea9-4440-5f2b-a958-0ee017965884', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5bcd236f-d62b-52a3-ae83-d2458840ec0f', 'ef1255df-817c-5777-9209-5e8fbf3bc7f5', 'foolish', '/ˈfuːlɪʃ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Thiếu suy nghĩ, không khôn ngoan, thường dẫn đến kết quả không tốt.', 'lacking good sense or judgment, often resulting in poor decisions or silly actions.', 'It would be foolish to ignore the warnings about the approaching storm.', 'Sẽ thật ngu ngốc nếu bỏ qua những cảnh báo về cơn bão đang đến gần.', '{\"en\": \"It was a foolish decision to sign the contract without reading the fine print carefully.\", \"vi\": \"Đó là một quyết định thiếu suy nghĩ khi ký hợp đồng mà không đọc kỹ các điều khoản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-ljspeech-0e2adffc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-cori-0e2adffc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/foolish-0871cb8e.webp', '[\"silly\", \"unwise\"]', '[\"wise\", \"sensible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"foolish mistake\", \"meaning\": \"sai lầm ngớ ngẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"act foolishly\", \"meaning\": \"hành động dại dột\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fool\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"foolishly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-cori-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru0-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru5-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru6-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru10-0e2adffc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru9-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru3-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru7-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru8-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-aru2-0e2adffc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-ljspeech-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt408-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt138-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt624-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt396-0e2adffc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt498-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt132-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt288-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt42-0e2adffc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/foolish-lt90-0e2adffc.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'fool\' (danh từ: kẻ ngốc).', 'business', 1, 29),
('0f9e4107-7355-5d53-82f6-7aa4cee14350', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'surrealism', '/səˈriːəlɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một phong trào nghệ thuật và văn học nhấn mạnh yếu tố giấc mơ và vô thức.', 'a style of art and literature that uses strange images inspired by dreams and subconscious minds.', 'Salvador Dalí is one of the most famous artists associated with surrealism.', 'Salvador Dalí là một trong những nghệ sĩ nổi tiếng nhất gắn liền với chủ nghĩa siêu thực.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team used elements of surrealism in the new advertisement to attract young clients.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã sử dụng các yếu tố của chủ nghĩa siêu thực trong quảng cáo mới để thu hút khách hàng trẻ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-ljspeech-91b1fb19.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-cori-91b1fb19.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surrealism-281894ef.webp', NULL, '[\"realism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"elements of surrealism\", \"meaning\": \"các yếu tố siêu thực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surrealism movement\", \"meaning\": \"phong trào chủ nghĩa siêu thực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"realism\", \"note_vi\": \"chủ nghĩa thực tế, trái ngược với chủ nghĩa siêu thực\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"surreal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surrealist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-cori-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru0-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru5-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru6-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru10-91b1fb19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru9-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru3-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru7-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru8-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-aru2-91b1fb19.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-ljspeech-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt408-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt138-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt624-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt396-91b1fb19.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt498-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt132-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt288-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt42-91b1fb19.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrealism-lt90-91b1fb19.mp3\"]}}', 'Là thuật ngữ nghệ thuật chỉ chủ nghĩa siêu thực khai thác yếu tố giấc mơ.', 'media', 1, 0),
('247f2e6f-a29b-5550-b679-7e1ccfe46fa9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'eminent', '/ˈemɪnənt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Nổi tiếng và được kính trọng, đặc biệt trong một lĩnh vực cụ thể.', 'famous, respected, and important, especially within a particular profession.', 'Several eminent economists will speak at the upcoming international business conference.', 'Một số nhà kinh tế học nổi tiếng sẽ phát biểu tại hội nghị kinh doanh quốc tế sắp tới.', '{\"en\": \"The conference organizers invited an eminent economist to deliver the keynote speech.\", \"vi\": \"Ban tổ chức hội nghị đã mời một nhà kinh tế học lỗi lạc đến trình bày bài phát biểu chủ đạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-ljspeech-b1fd9e12.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-cori-b1fd9e12.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eminent-909f61d1.webp', '[\"distinguished\", \"prominent\", \"famous\"]', '[\"unknown\", \"insignificant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eminent scholar\", \"meaning\": \"học giả lỗi lạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eminent scientist\", \"meaning\": \"nhà khoa học lỗi lạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eminent authority\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên gia uy tín hàng đầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"imminent\", \"note_vi\": \"sắp xảy ra (thường là điều xấu), phát âm gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eminence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"eminently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-cori-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru0-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru5-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru6-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru10-b1fd9e12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru9-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru3-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru7-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru8-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-aru2-b1fd9e12.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-ljspeech-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt408-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt138-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt624-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt396-b1fd9e12.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt498-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt132-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt288-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt42-b1fd9e12.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eminent-lt90-b1fd9e12.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa \'eminent\' (lỗi lạc) và \'imminent\' (sắp xảy ra).', 'business', 1, 1),
('11297b48-784a-58c6-9cb9-27380de1cae2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'broaden', 'UK: /ˈbrɔːdn/ | US: /ˈbrɔːdn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'mở rộng', 'To expand the width, scope, or extent of knowledge, skills, or physical dimensions of something.', 'We need to broaden our client network.', 'Chúng ta cần mở rộng mạng lưới khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The company aims to broaden its product line to attract younger consumers.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có mục tiêu mở rộng dòng sản phẩm của mình để thu hút người tiêu dùng trẻ tuổi hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-ljspeech-9483bc9b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-cori-9483bc9b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/broaden-38d0d1a4.webp', '[\"expand\", \"widen\", \"extend\"]', '[\"narrow\", \"restrict\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"broaden one\'s horizons\", \"meaning\": \"mở rộng tầm nhìn/hiểu biết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"broaden the scope\", \"meaning\": \"mở rộng quy mô/phạm vi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"broad\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"broadly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"breadth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-cori-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru0-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru5-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru6-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru10-9483bc9b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru9-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru3-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru7-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru8-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-aru2-9483bc9b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-ljspeech-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt408-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt138-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt624-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt396-9483bc9b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt498-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt132-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt288-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt42-9483bc9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/broaden-lt90-9483bc9b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: \'broaden one\'s horizons\' (mở rộng tầm mắt/hiểu biết) hoặc \'broaden product lines\' (mở rộng dòng sản phẩm).', 'business strategy', 1, 2),
('c173319e-eb03-5a37-b642-eccf9399d0a3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'sedan', 'UK: /sɪˈdæn/ | US: /sɪˈdæn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'xe sedan', 'An enclosed passenger car featuring four doors and a separate rear compartment for luggage.', 'The executive drove a luxury sedan to the meeting.', 'Vị giám đốc đã lái một chiếc xe sedan sang trọng đến cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The rental agency upgraded our reservation to a full-size sedan at no extra charge.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý cho thuê xe đã nâng cấp đơn đặt xe của chúng tôi lên chiếc sedan cỡ lớn mà không tính thêm phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-ljspeech-28961833.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-cori-28961833.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sedan-b1f9c7f8.webp', '[\"car\", \"automobile\", \"passenger car\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"luxury sedan\", \"meaning\": \"xe sedan sang trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rent a sedan\", \"meaning\": \"thuê một chiếc xe sedan\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-cori-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru0-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru5-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru6-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru10-28961833.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru9-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru3-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru7-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru8-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-aru2-28961833.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-ljspeech-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt408-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt138-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt624-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt396-28961833.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt498-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt132-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt288-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt42-28961833.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sedan-lt90-28961833.mp3\"]}}', 'Loại xe hơi 4 chỗ phổ biến, hay gặp trong phần nghe/đọc TOEIC về dịch vụ thuê xe (car rental) hoặc bãi đỗ xe.', 'travel', 1, 3),
('3f27e2c9-5123-50a1-9f43-b221913c46a4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'frequency', '/ˈfriːkwənsi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Số lần một sự việc xảy ra trong một khoảng thời gian nhất định; hoặc số dao động trong một đơn vị thời gian.', 'the number of times that something happens during a particular period.', 'The frequency of his visits to the gym increased after he set a new fitness goal.', 'Tần suất anh ấy đến phòng tập gym đã tăng lên sau khi anh ấy đặt ra mục tiêu thể hình mới.', '{\"en\": \"We need to increase the frequency of our team meetings to improve communication.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần tăng tần suất các cuộc họp nhóm để cải thiện giao tiếp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-ljspeech-48a8832d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-cori-48a8832d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frequency-3adfba10.webp', '[\"regularity\", \"recurrence\"]', '[\"infrequency\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high frequency\", \"meaning\": \"tần suất cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"increase the frequency\", \"meaning\": \"tăng tần suất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"frequent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"frequently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-cori-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru0-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru5-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru6-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru10-48a8832d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru9-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru3-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru7-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru8-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-aru2-48a8832d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-ljspeech-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt408-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt138-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt624-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt396-48a8832d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt498-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt132-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt288-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt42-48a8832d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frequency-lt90-48a8832d.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ của frequent. Chỉ số lần lặp lại của một sự việc.', 'office', 1, 4),
('f89ff0b9-291a-58cb-b909-33a7df4fb28d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'affect', 'UK: /əˈfɛkt/ | US: /əˈfɛkt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'ảnh hưởng', 'to produce a change or influence on someone or something.', 'The new policy will affect all employees.', 'Chính sách mới sẽ ảnh hưởng đến tất cả nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"Unexpected delays in shipping will significantly affect our third-quarter sales results.\", \"vi\": \"Những sự trì hoãn bất ngờ trong giao hàng sẽ ảnh hưởng đáng kể đến kết quả doanh số quý 3 của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-ljspeech-5c1b9018.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-cori-5c1b9018.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/affect-3851fcac.webp', '[\"influence\", \"impact\", \"alter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"directly affect\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng trực tiếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adversely affect\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng bất lợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"significantly affect\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng đáng kể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"effect\", \"note_vi\": \"Effect đóng vai trò danh từ (kết quả/tác động), còn Affect đóng vai trò động từ (gây ảnh hưởng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"effect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"effective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-cori-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru0-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru5-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru6-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru10-5c1b9018.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru9-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru3-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru7-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru8-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-aru2-5c1b9018.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-ljspeech-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt408-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt138-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt624-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt396-5c1b9018.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt498-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt132-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt288-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt42-5c1b9018.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/affect-lt90-5c1b9018.mp3\"]}}', 'Affect là động từ (gây ảnh hưởng, đi trực tiếp với tân ngữ), khác với Effect là danh từ (sự ảnh hưởng, dùng \'have an effect on\').', 'business operations', 1, 5),
('fadae0c0-1ae8-550c-b4e1-770138401e71', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'grip', '/ɡrɪp/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Giữ hoặc nắm chặt một vật gì đó.', 'to hold something firmly and tightly with your hand or fingers.', 'She gripped the railing tightly as the boat rocked on the waves.', 'Cô ấy nắm chặt lan can khi con thuyền chòng chành trên sóng.', '{\"en\": \"The technician gripped the equipment carefully while moving it to the new workstation.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên nắm chặt thiết bị cẩn thận khi di chuyển nó đến trạm làm việc mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-ljspeech-e752c3b3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-cori-e752c3b3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grip-0adda561.webp', '[\"grasp\", \"clutch\", \"hold\"]', '[\"release\", \"let go\", \"drop\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grip tightly\", \"meaning\": \"nắm chặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"firm grip\", \"meaning\": \"cái nắm chắc chắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grip on something\", \"meaning\": \"sự kiểm soát/nắm giữ cái gì đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grasp\", \"note_vi\": \"grasp thường mang nghĩa hiểu/nắm bắt ý tưởng; grip thiên về nắm vật lý hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"grip\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"gripping\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-cori-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru0-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru5-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru6-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru10-e752c3b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru9-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru3-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru7-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru8-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-aru2-e752c3b3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-ljspeech-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt408-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt138-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt624-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt396-e752c3b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt498-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt132-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt288-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt42-e752c3b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grip-lt90-e752c3b3.mp3\"]}}', 'Grip (verb) = nắm chặt; grip (noun) = cái nắm hoặc sự kiểm soát — hai dạng từ loại khác nhau.', 'manufacturing', 1, 6),
('97907a58-715a-59f7-b342-3bf910b03a40', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'analyze', '/ˈænəlaɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Nghiên cứu kỹ lưỡng một cái gì đó để hiểu các phần và cấu trúc của nó.', 'to study something carefully by looking at its parts and how they relate.', 'Researchers will analyze the data to identify key trends and patterns.', 'Các nhà nghiên cứu sẽ phân tích dữ liệu để xác định các xu hướng và mẫu chính.', '{\"en\": \"The finance team will analyze last month\'s expenses to find areas for cost reduction.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tài chính sẽ phân tích chi phí tháng trước để tìm ra các khu vực có thể cắt giảm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-ljspeech-6257f84c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-cori-6257f84c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/analyze-f40eca88.webp', '[\"examine\", \"evaluate\", \"assess\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"analyze data\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"analyze results\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích kết quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"analyze trends\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích xu hướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"analyse\", \"note_vi\": \"analyse là cách viết tiếng Anh-Anh; analyze là cách viết tiếng Anh-Mỹ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analysis\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analyst\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"analytical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"analytically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-cori-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru0-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru5-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru6-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru10-6257f84c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru9-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru3-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru7-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru8-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru2-6257f84c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-ljspeech-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt408-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt138-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt624-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt396-6257f84c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt498-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt132-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt288-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt42-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt90-6257f84c.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Mỹ viết \'analyze\', người Anh viết \'analyse\'; cả hai đều đúng trong TOEIC.', 'business', 1, 7),
('b18cad11-2cb1-5954-a15b-aa95e25d625e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'oblige', '/əˈblaɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'làm điều gì đó để giúp đỡ hoặc làm hài lòng ai đó.', 'to do something to help or please someone by satisfying their requests or needs.', 'Could you oblige me by closing the window? It\'s quite cold.', 'Bạn có thể giúp tôi đóng cửa sổ được không? Trời khá lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel manager was happy to oblige when the client asked for a room upgrade.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý khách sạn rất vui lòng đáp ứng khi khách hàng yêu cầu nâng hạng phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-ljspeech-dd334cb8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-cori-dd334cb8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oblige-8449fe45.webp', '[\"accommodate\", \"assist\"]', '[\"refuse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be happy to oblige\", \"meaning\": \"vui lòng giúp đỡ hoặc đáp ứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oblige a customer\", \"meaning\": \"chiều lòng khách hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"obligate\", \"note_vi\": \"obligate mang tính bắt buộc pháp lý, oblige mang tính giúp đỡ/làm ơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obligation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obligatory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-cori-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru0-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru5-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru6-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru10-dd334cb8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru9-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru3-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru7-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru8-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-aru2-dd334cb8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-ljspeech-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt408-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt138-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt624-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt396-dd334cb8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt498-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt132-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt288-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt42-dd334cb8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oblige-lt90-dd334cb8.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc hay gặp: oblige somebody by doing something (giúp ai bằng cách làm gì).', 'travel', 1, 8),
('36282d15-9f07-5ec6-b5a7-07755b49d370', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'supervise', '/ˈsuːpəvaɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Theo dõi và chỉ đạo công việc hoặc hoạt động của người khác.', 'to watch and direct the work or activities of other people to ensure they are correct.', 'The manager\'s job is to supervise the team and ensure tasks are completed on time.', 'Công việc của người quản lý là giám sát nhóm và đảm bảo các nhiệm vụ được hoàn thành đúng hạn.', '{\"en\": \"The senior manager will supervise the new staff members during their first month of training.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý cấp cao sẽ giám sát các nhân viên mới trong suốt tháng đào tạo đầu tiên của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-ljspeech-a25f3fc1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-cori-a25f3fc1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supervise-1a13fb79.webp', '[\"oversee\", \"manage\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"supervise staff\", \"meaning\": \"giám sát nhân viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supervise work\", \"meaning\": \"giám sát công việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supervisor\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supervision\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-cori-a25f3fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-aru0-a25f3fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-aru5-a25f3fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-aru6-a25f3fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-aru10-a25f3fc1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-aru9-a25f3fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-aru3-a25f3fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supervise-aru7-a25f3fc1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/super