('fb8e76f4-05ef-5dfd-a826-478583bf7543', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'completion', 'UK: /kəmˈpliːʃən/ | US: /kəmˈpliːʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự hoàn thành', 'The act or process of finishing something entirely or reaching the final step.', 'The project is nearing completion.', 'Dự án đang gần hoàn thành.', '{\"en\": \"Final payment will be released upon completion of the construction project.\", \"vi\": \"Khoản thanh toán cuối cùng sẽ được giải ngân ngay khi hoàn tất dự án xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-ljspeech-cadc9141.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-cori-cadc9141.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/completion-839bbc73.webp', '[\"finish\", \"conclusion\", \"fulfillment\"]', '[\"commencement\", \"beginning\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"upon completion of\", \"meaning\": \"sau khi hoàn thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"target completion date\", \"meaning\": \"ngày dự kiến hoàn thành\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"complete\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"completely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-cori-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru0-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru5-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru6-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru10-cadc9141.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru9-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru3-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru7-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru8-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-aru2-cadc9141.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-ljspeech-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt408-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt138-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt624-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt396-cadc9141.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt498-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt132-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt288-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt42-cadc9141.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/completion-lt90-cadc9141.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'of\' (completion of the project) hoặc cấu trúc \'upon completion\' (ngay khi hoàn tất).', 'project management', 1, 14),
('d81e08cd-4138-5f2d-82e5-ca9d1f035c07', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'sarcastically', '/sɑːˈkæstɪkli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách châm biếm, mỉa mai.', 'in a way that uses remarks that mean the opposite of what is said.', '\"Oh, you\'re so helpful,\" she said sarcastically when he offered no assistance.', '\"Ồ, anh thật là hữu ích,\" cô ấy nói một cách mỉa mai khi anh ta không giúp đỡ gì cả.', '{\"en\": \"He commented sarcastically about the continuous delay of the annual staff meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy nhận xét một cách mỉa mai về sự chậm trễ liên tục của cuộc họp nhân viên hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-ljspeech-ebe8dd47.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-cori-ebe8dd47.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sarcastically-e2b92ebd.webp', '[\"ironically\", \"mockingly\"]', '[\"sincerely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"smile sarcastically\", \"meaning\": \"cười mỉa mai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reply sarcastically\", \"meaning\": \"trả lời châm biếm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ironically\", \"note_vi\": \"Trớ trêu thay/mỉa mai, nhưng irony thiên về sự trái ngược thực tế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sarcasm\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sarcastic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-cori-ebe8dd47.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-aru0-ebe8dd47.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-aru5-ebe8dd47.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-aru6-ebe8dd47.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-aru10-ebe8dd47.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-aru9-ebe8dd47.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sarcastically-aru3-ebe8dd47.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj