('e677c52c-6932-5fdd-bf16-b8af9975e7f5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d67e6bd-599f-5230-9426-68e248ef2960', 'adea7740-ac3f-5711-9f65-5f03586db1ea', 'powdery', '/ˈpaʊdəri/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có kết cấu như bột mịn, hoặc được phủ một lớp bột.', 'consisting of or covered with very small, dry pieces like sand or fine dust.', 'The snow felt soft and powdery under our boots as we walked.', 'Tuyết mềm và mịn như bột dưới ủng của chúng tôi khi chúng tôi đi bộ.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse floor was covered in a powdery substance after the chemical containers leaked.\", \"vi\": \"Sàn kho bị phủ một lớp chất bột sau khi các thùng chứa hóa chất bị rò rỉ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-ljspeech-c49a0beb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-cori-c49a0beb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/powdery-ad26378b.webp', '[\"dusty\", \"fine\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"powdery substance\", \"meaning\": \"chất dạng bột\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"powder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-cori-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru0-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru5-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru6-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru10-c49a0beb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru9-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru3-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru7-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru8-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-aru2-c49a0beb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/powdery-ljspeech-c49a0beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati