('3d28beb5-8f06-5d7a-a1e7-be97c71c69f9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d9abbf3-d065-5bfc-9128-334fa05a91dc', '94cba643-785f-5764-835b-1c72727d5172', 'decorator', 'UK: /ˈdɛkəˌreɪtə/ | US: /ˈdɛkəˌreɪtər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'người trang trí', 'A professional who plans and adds attractive features to internal spaces of buildings.', 'The interior decorator chose a modern design.', 'Người trang trí nội thất đã chọn một thiết kế hiện đại.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired an interior decorator to redesign the main lobby before the grand reopening.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một nhà trang trí nội thất để thiết kế lại sảnh chính trước buổi lễ mở cửa lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-ljspeech-ee329fb6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-cori-ee329fb6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decorator-22d51f27.webp', '[\"designer\", \"stylist\", \"ornamenter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"interior decorator\", \"meaning\": \"nhà trang trí nội thất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hire a decorator\", \"meaning\": \"thuê người trang trí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decoration\", \"note_vi\": \"chỉ sự trang trí hoặc đồ trang trí chứ không chỉ người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"decorate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"decoration\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"decorative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-cori-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru0-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru5-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru6-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru10-ee329fb6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru9-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru3-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru7-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru8-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-aru2-ee329fb6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-ljspeech-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt408-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt138-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt624-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt396-ee329fb6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt498-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt132-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt288-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt42-ee329fb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorator-lt90-ee329fb6.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'decorator\' (người trang trí/thiết kế nội thất) với \'decoration\' (vật trang trí/sự trang trí).', 'office', 1, 19),
('ede81b31-9f2f-53da-a812-3ce0a620fce4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5d9abbf3-d065-5bfc-9128-334fa05a91dc', '94cba643-785f-5764-835b-1c72727d5172', 'pointless', '/ˈpɔɪntləs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không có mục đích, giá trị hoặc ý nghĩa; vô ích.', 'having no useful purpose, value, or meaning, leading to no helpful result.', 'It\'s pointless to worry about things you can\'t control.', 'Lo lắng về những điều bạn không thể kiểm soát là vô nghĩa.', '{\"en\": \"Continuing this unproductive business meeting without clear agendas is completely pointless.\", \"vi\": \"Tiếp tục cuộc họp kinh doanh không hiệu quả này mà không có chương trình nghị sự rõ ràng là hoàn toàn vô ích.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-ljspeech-11e3b0c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-cori-11e3b0c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pointless-2df5731c.webp', '[\"useless\", \"futile\", \"meaningless\"]', '[\"useful\", \"meaningful\", \"worthwhile\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"seem pointless\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ vô ích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"completely pointless\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn vô nghĩa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pointy\", \"note_vi\": \"pointy nghĩa là nhọn, còn pointless nghĩa là vô ích.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"point\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"pointlessly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-cori-11e3b0c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-aru0-11e3b0c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-aru5-11e3b0c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-aru6-11e3b0c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-aru10-11e3b0c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-aru9-11e3b0c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pointless-aru3-11e3b0c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati