('e7c1ca56-157b-5879-bd0b-04596eaec62b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'pie', '/paɪ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Loại bánh có nhân ngọt hoặc mặn, thường có vỏ bột mì.', 'a baked dish consisting of a pastry crust filled with fruit, meat, or vegetables.', 'My grandmother makes the best apple pie I\'ve ever tasted.', 'Bà tôi làm món bánh táo ngon nhất mà tôi từng được nếm.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service provided a savory meat pie for the employees at the lunch meeting today.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống đã cung cấp món bánh nhân thịt cho các nhân viên tại buổi họp trưa hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-ljspeech-cfb3e59a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-cori-cfb3e59a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pie-67bcf201.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apple pie\", \"meaning\": \"bánh táo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"meat pie\", \"meaning\": \"bánh nhân thịt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-cori-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru0-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru5-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru6-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru10-cfb3e59a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru9-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru3-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru7-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru8-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-aru2-cfb3e59a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-ljspeech-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt408-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt138-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt624-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt396-cfb3e59a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt498-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt132-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt288-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt42-cfb3e59a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pie-lt90-cfb3e59a.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ cụm \'easy as pie\' để nói về việc gì đó rất dễ dàng.', 'dining', 1, 1),
('24a47d91-93c7-5068-a271-2f428edbac4c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'irritated', '/ˈɪrɪteɪtɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy khó chịu, bực bội hoặc tức giận nhẹ.', 'feeling slightly angry or annoyed because of something unpleasant or bothersome.', 'He became easily irritated by the constant noise from the construction site.', 'Anh ấy dễ dàng trở nên bực mình vì tiếng ồn liên tục từ công trường xây dựng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was irritated by the repeated delays in the monthly financial report submission.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy bực bội vì sự chậm trễ lặp đi lặp lại trong việc nộp báo cáo tài chính hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-ljspeech-63e0b78b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-cori-63e0b78b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/irritated-cd091332.webp', '[\"annoyed\", \"frustrated\", \"agitated\"]', '[\"calm\", \"pleased\", \"content\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel irritated\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy bực bội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get irritated\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên khó chịu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"irritated by/with\", \"meaning\": \"bực bội vì/với ai/điều gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"irritating\", \"note_vi\": \"irritated là cảm giác của người; irritating mô tả thứ gây khó chịu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"irritate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"irritation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"irritating\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"irritably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-cori-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru0-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru5-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru6-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru10-63e0b78b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru9-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru3-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru7-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru8-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-aru2-63e0b78b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-ljspeech-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt408-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt138-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt624-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt396-63e0b78b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt498-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt132-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt288-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt42-63e0b78b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritated-lt90-63e0b78b.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ: irritated = người bực bội; irritating = thứ gây bực bội — đừng nhầm hai dạng này.', 'office', 1, 2),
('d08e67ac-a75c-5fa1-9526-10cbed99ac1b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'passivity', '/pæˈsɪvəti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Tình trạng không hành động hoặc không phản ứng.', 'the state of allowing things to happen without active response or resistance.', 'The team\'s passivity in the first half led to them conceding two goals.', 'Sự thụ động của đội bóng trong hiệp một đã khiến họ bị thủng lưới hai bàn.', '{\"en\": \"The board criticized the director\'s passivity during the company\'s financial crisis last year.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã chỉ trích sự thụ động của giám đốc trong cuộc khủng hoảng tài chính của công ty năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-ljspeech-04984be5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-cori-04984be5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passivity-c8724e11.webp', '[\"inaction\", \"apathy\", \"submissiveness\"]', '[\"activity\", \"action\", \"assertiveness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"total passivity\", \"meaning\": \"sự thụ động hoàn toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accept with passivity\", \"meaning\": \"chấp nhận một cách thụ động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"patience\", \"note_vi\": \"patience là sự kiên nhẫn, passivity là sự thụ động\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"passive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"passively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-cori-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru0-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru5-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru6-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru10-04984be5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru9-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru3-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru7-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru8-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-aru2-04984be5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-ljspeech-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt408-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt138-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt624-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt396-04984be5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt498-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt132-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt288-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt42-04984be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passivity-lt90-04984be5.mp3\"]}}', 'Passivity mang nghĩa tiêu cực, chỉ sự thiếu chủ động hoặc không chịu phản kháng.', 'office', 1, 3),
('9375f3a8-ecd8-5f9d-8aff-569f510629b6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'intellectual', '/ˌɪntəˈlektʃuəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về trí tuệ, có trí thức.', 'relating to the ability to think, learn, and understand things at a high level.', 'Lawyers protected the company\'s valuable intellectual property during the corporate merger.', 'Các luật sư đã bảo vệ tài sản trí tuệ có giá trị của công ty trong vụ sáp nhập doanh nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"The company seeks candidates with strong intellectual skills for the research department.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tìm kiếm ứng viên có kỹ năng trí tuệ tốt cho bộ phận nghiên cứu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-ljspeech-3c29719b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-cori-3c29719b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intellectual-e43052bf.webp', '[\"academic\", \"cerebral\", \"scholarly\"]', '[\"physical\", \"manual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intellectual ability\", \"meaning\": \"năng lực trí tuệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intellectual property\", \"meaning\": \"sở hữu trí tuệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intellectual challenge\", \"meaning\": \"thách thức về mặt trí tuệ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intelligent\", \"note_vi\": \"intelligent nghĩa là \'thông minh\' (cá nhân); intellectual liên quan đến tư duy học thuật\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intellect\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"intellectually\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intellectual\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intellectualize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-cori-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru0-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru5-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru6-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru10-3c29719b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru9-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru3-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru7-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru8-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-aru2-3c29719b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-ljspeech-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt408-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt138-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt624-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt396-3c29719b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt498-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt132-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt288-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt42-3c29719b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intellectual-lt90-3c29719b.mp3\"]}}', '\'Intellectual property\' (sở hữu trí tuệ) là cụm từ rất hay gặp trong đề TOEIC.', 'education', 1, 4),
('bb445f63-3d8d-51e5-9315-90cfc24ffd4d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'acknowledge', '/əkˈnɒlɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Công nhận, thừa nhận sự thật hoặc sự tồn tại của điều gì đó.', 'to accept or admit that something is true or that a situation exists.', 'He refused to acknowledge his mistake, even when presented with clear evidence.', 'Anh ta từ chối thừa nhận lỗi lầm của mình, ngay cả khi được đưa ra bằng chứng rõ ràng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was quick to acknowledge the hard work of the entire sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã nhanh chóng công nhận sự nỗ lực làm việc của toàn bộ đội ngũ bán hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-ljspeech-4f6c0a36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-cori-4f6c0a36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acknowledge-00f5aca1.webp', '[\"admit\", \"concede\", \"recognize\"]', '[\"deny\", \"reject\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"acknowledge receipt of\", \"meaning\": \"xác nhận đã nhận được (thư/đơn)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"acknowledge a mistake\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận sai lầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"admit\", \"note_vi\": \"Admit thường dùng khi thừa nhận lỗi sai hoặc thừa nhận sự thật một cách miễn cưỡng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"acknowledgment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-cori-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru0-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru5-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru6-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru10-4f6c0a36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru9-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru3-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru7-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru8-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru2-4f6c0a36.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-ljspeech-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt408-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt138-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt624-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt396-4f6c0a36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt498-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt132-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt288-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt42-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-lt90-4f6c0a36.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong email thương mại, \'acknowledge receipt of...\' nghĩa là xác nhận đã nhận được tài liệu.', 'office', 1, 5),
('1df73b81-c821-5da3-9ccc-3e3a351dade4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'conspire', '/kənˈspaɪə(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Âm mưu, cùng nhau bí mật lên kế hoạch làm điều xấu.', 'to work together in secret to perform an illegal or harmful act against someone.', 'The two politicians were accused of trying to conspire against the government.', 'Hai chính trị gia bị buộc tội âm mưu chống lại chính phủ.', '{\"en\": \"The rival firms were found to conspire to fix prices and limit market competition.\", \"vi\": \"Các công ty đối thủ bị phát hiện đã thông đồng để ấn định giá và hạn chế cạnh tranh thị trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-ljspeech-8efb12c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-cori-8efb12c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conspire-ccdefc0f.webp', '[\"plot\", \"collude\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conspire against\", \"meaning\": \"âm mưu chống lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conspire to do something\", \"meaning\": \"cùng nhau bí mật làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inspire\", \"note_vi\": \"inspire là truyền cảm hứng, conspire là âm mưu xấu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conspiracy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-cori-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru0-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru5-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru6-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru10-8efb12c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru9-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru3-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru7-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru8-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-aru2-8efb12c2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-ljspeech-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt408-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt138-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt624-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt396-8efb12c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt498-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt132-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt288-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt42-8efb12c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspire-lt90-8efb12c2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý hoặc các âm mưu chính trị.', 'law', 1, 6),
('efe1d93c-e89d-5e67-9799-1c26d9e13f60', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'bibliography', '/ˌbɪbliˈɒɡrəfi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'danh sách các sách, bài báo hoặc nguồn tài liệu đã được sử dụng trong một công trình nghiên cứu.', 'a list of books, articles, and other sources used in a scholarly work.', 'Remember to include a complete bibliography at the end of your research paper.', 'Hãy nhớ đưa vào một danh mục tham khảo đầy đủ ở cuối bài nghiên cứu của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The market research report includes a detailed bibliography of all industry sources consulted.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo nghiên cứu thị trường bao gồm một danh mục tài liệu tham khảo chi tiết về tất cả các nguồn ngành đã tham khảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-ljspeech-3df54196.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-cori-3df54196.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bibliography-09d66f6e.webp', '[\"references\", \"literature cited\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"annotated bibliography\", \"meaning\": \"thư mục có chú giải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compile a bibliography\", \"meaning\": \"biên soạn danh mục tài liệu tham khảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"biography\", \"note_vi\": \"Tiểu sử cuộc đời của một người, dễ nhầm mặt chữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bibliographic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-cori-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru0-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru5-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru6-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru10-3df54196.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru9-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru3-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru7-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru8-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-aru2-3df54196.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-ljspeech-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt408-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt138-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt624-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt396-3df54196.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt498-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt132-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt288-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt42-3df54196.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bibliography-lt90-3df54196.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \'biography\' (tiểu sử).', 'academic', 1, 7),
('30042f88-a673-51c1-8ac7-2cfa977f955a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'glorify', '/ˈɡlɔːrɪfaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Ca ngợi, tôn vinh ai đó hoặc điều gì đó.', 'to praise or honor someone or something highly, making them seem great.', 'The monument was built to glorify the heroes of the war.', 'Đài tưởng niệm được xây dựng để tôn vinh các anh hùng chiến tranh.', '{\"en\": \"The annual report was designed to glorify the company\'s achievements over the past decade.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo thường niên được thiết kế để tôn vinh những thành tựu của công ty trong thập kỷ qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-ljspeech-6ff2d4ae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-cori-6ff2d4ae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glorify-d8643b2f.webp', '[\"praise\", \"exalt\", \"celebrate\"]', '[\"condemn\", \"criticize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"glorify achievements\", \"meaning\": \"tôn vinh thành tích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"glorify heroes\", \"meaning\": \"ca ngợi anh hùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"glorify success\", \"meaning\": \"tôn vinh sự thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"praise\", \"note_vi\": \"praise là khen ngợi thông thường; glorify mang tính tôn vinh, thần thánh hóa hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"glory\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"glorious\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"glorification\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"gloriously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-cori-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru0-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru5-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru6-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru10-6ff2d4ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru9-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru3-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru7-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru8-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-aru2-6ff2d4ae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-ljspeech-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt408-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt138-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt624-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt396-6ff2d4ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt498-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt132-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt288-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt42-6ff2d4ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glorify-lt90-6ff2d4ae.mp3\"]}}', '\'Glorify\' đôi khi mang nghĩa tiêu cực: tôn vinh quá mức hoặc thần thánh hóa sai lệch.', 'marketing', 1, 8)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('c0c1e969-b036-5d4d-9d37-1b0a282fb466', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'monarchy', '/ˈmɒnəki/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hệ thống chính trị mà người đứng đầu là vua hoặc nữ hoàng.', 'a system of government ruled by a king or a queen.', 'Many countries in Europe once had a monarchy, but now they are republics.', 'Nhiều quốc gia ở châu Âu từng có nền quân chủ, nhưng giờ đây họ là các nước cộng hòa.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency organized a historic tour to the palaces of the ancient monarchy.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã tổ chức một chuyến tham quan lịch sử đến các cung điện của vương triều cổ đại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-ljspeech-27a9140e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-cori-27a9140e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monarchy-2044f773.webp', '[\"kingdom\", \"royalty\"]', '[\"republic\", \"democracy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"absolute monarchy\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ quân chủ chuyên chế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constitutional monarchy\", \"meaning\": \"chế độ quân chủ lập hiến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monastery\", \"note_vi\": \"tu viện, dễ nhầm vì viết gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"monarch\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"monarchic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-cori-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru0-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru5-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru6-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru10-27a9140e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru9-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru3-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru7-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru8-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-aru2-27a9140e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-ljspeech-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt408-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt138-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt624-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt396-27a9140e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt498-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt132-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt288-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt42-27a9140e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monarchy-lt90-27a9140e.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'monastery\' nghĩa là tu viện.', 'travel', 1, 9),
('57880d69-9e8a-58d7-9f9c-4ff845fcdfc9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'annual', 'UK: /ˈænjuəl/ | US: /ˈænjuəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'hàng năm', 'happening or done once every year, or calculated over a twelve-month period.', 'The company holds an annual performance review for all staff.', 'Công ty tổ chức đánh giá hiệu suất hàng năm cho tất cả nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"All department heads are required to submit their annual budget proposals by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các trưởng bộ phận được yêu cầu nộp đề xuất ngân sách hàng năm trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-ljspeech-80ff69d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-cori-80ff69d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/annual-5704e7a3.webp', '[\"yearly\", \"per annum\"]', '[\"biennial\", \"monthly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"annual meeting\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp thường niên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"annual revenue\", \"meaning\": \"doanh thu hàng năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"annual review\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá hàng năm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"biennial\", \"note_vi\": \"biennial có nghĩa là 2 năm một lần, còn annual là mỗi năm một lần.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"annually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-cori-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru0-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru5-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru6-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru10-80ff69d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru9-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru3-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru7-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru8-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-aru2-80ff69d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-ljspeech-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt408-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt138-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt624-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt396-80ff69d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt498-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt132-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt288-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt42-80ff69d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/annual-lt90-80ff69d5.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ luôn đứng trước danh từ. Cụm từ cực kỳ phổ biến trong TOEIC: \'annual general meeting\' (đại hội cổ đông thường niên).', 'business operations', 1, 10),
('1e174997-a639-506e-a410-46fb4c27f752', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'sensor', '/ˈsensə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thiết bị phát hiện và phản ứng với một số loại tín hiệu vật lý hoặc hóa học.', 'a piece of equipment that can find light, heat, or movement and send signals.', 'The security system uses motion sensors to detect any unauthorized entry.', 'Hệ thống an ninh sử dụng cảm biến chuyển động để phát hiện bất kỳ sự xâm nhập trái phép nào.', '{\"en\": \"The modern office building uses a sensor to automatically turn off lights when empty.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng hiện đại sử dụng cảm biến để tự động tắt đèn khi không có người.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-ljspeech-2fc03be5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-cori-2fc03be5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sensor-de74d49c.webp', '[\"detector\", \"monitor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"motion sensor\", \"meaning\": \"cảm biến chuyển động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"temperature sensor\", \"meaning\": \"cảm biến nhiệt độ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sense\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-cori-2fc03be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru0-2fc03be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru5-2fc03be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru6-2fc03be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru10-2fc03be5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru9-2fc03be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru3-2fc03be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru7-2fc03be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru8-2fc03be5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensor-aru2-2fc03be5.mp3\"]}, \"us\