('39fab04f-ca95-5052-b9f0-af9c403f61a0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5e50cb7e-7135-580d-b286-cce8093b5813', '09e71600-139c-561e-9209-ff65ffb06adb', 'filth', '/fɪlθ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Rác rưởi, chất bẩn thỉu.', 'a large amount of dirt or very unpleasant waste material.', 'The health inspector shut down the restaurant after finding thick filth on the kitchen counters.', 'Thanh tra y tế đã đóng cửa nhà hàng sau khi tìm thấy lớp rác rưởi dày trên mặt bàn bếp.', '{\"en\": \"The cleaning crew removed all the filth from the warehouse before the inspection.\", \"vi\": \"Đội vệ sinh đã dọn sạch rác rưởi khỏi nhà kho trước buổi kiểm tra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-ljspeech-dae844fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-cori-dae844fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/filth-9d3c08c1.webp', '[\"dirt\", \"grime\"]', '[\"cleanliness\", \"purity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"covered in filth\", \"meaning\": \"phủ đầy rác bẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remove filth\", \"meaning\": \"dọn sạch rác bẩn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"filthy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-cori-dae844fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru0-dae844fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru5-dae844fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru6-dae844fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru10-dae844fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru9-dae844fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru3-dae844fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru7-dae844fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru8-dae844fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-aru2-dae844fd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/filth-ljspeech-da