('4ae120a4-71f4-5314-ae8f-a40faead6c57', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5efb1130-1f2b-5124-9a9f-021669dd5e2e', 'dc04400c-86e3-5061-a351-d7649bdcc76f', 'conviction', '/kənˈvɪkʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự kết tội, tuyên án trong một vụ án.', 'a formal declaration by a court that someone is guilty of an offense.', 'The evidence led to his conviction for the crime.', 'Bằng chứng đã dẫn đến việc anh ta bị kết tội vì tội ác đó.', '{\"en\": \"The court\'s conviction of the fraud manager prevented his promotion to director.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kết tội của tòa án đối với vị quản lý gian lận ngăn ông ta thăng tiến làm giám đốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-ljspeech-3d4057c4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-cori-3d4057c4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conviction-b9c0b20c.webp', '[\"condemnation\", \"verdict\"]', '[\"acquittal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"criminal conviction\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên án hình sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conviction for fraud\", \"meaning\": \"kết tội gian lận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"convince\", \"note_vi\": \"convince là thuyết phục, khác với kết tội\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"convict\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"convicted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-cori-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru0-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru5-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru6-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru10-3d4057c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru9-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru3-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conviction-aru7-3d4057c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convicti