('b4bf3f86-8ce7-5ea3-b3fd-a43eb4e02624', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5efb1130-1f2b-5124-9a9f-021669dd5e2e', 'dc04400c-86e3-5061-a351-d7649bdcc76f', 'breath', '/breθ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Không khí được hít vào và thở ra.', 'the air that you take into your lungs and send out again.', 'Take a deep breath before you start your presentation.', 'Hãy hít thở sâu trước khi bạn bắt đầu bài thuyết trình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager took a deep breath before announcing the budget cuts to the team.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã hít một hơi thật sâu trước khi thông báo việc cắt giảm ngân sách cho cả đội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-ljspeech-a99a9c01.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-cori-a99a9c01.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/breath-1e77183c.webp', '[\"respiration\", \"inhalation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a breath\", \"meaning\": \"hít thở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"out of breath\", \"meaning\": \"hết hơi, thở hổn hển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shortness of breath\", \"meaning\": \"khó thở\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"breathe\", \"note_vi\": \"breathe là động từ (phát âm /briːð/), breath là danh từ (phát âm /breθ/).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"breathe\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"breathless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-cori-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru0-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru5-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru6-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru10-a99a9c01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru9-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru3-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru7-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru8-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-aru2-a99a9c01.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-ljspeech-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt408-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt138-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt624-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt396-a99a9c01.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt498-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt132-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt288-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt42-a99a9c01.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/breath-lt90-a99a9c01.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phát âm: danh từ \'breath\' kết thúc bằng âm /θ/, còn động từ \'breathe\' kết thúc bằng âm /ð/.', 'health', 1, 12),
('740a03cf-c35d-533b-a383-ae532ad51627', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5efb1130-1f2b-5124-9a9f-021669dd5e2e', 'dc04400c-86e3-5061-a351-d7649bdcc76f', 'content', '/ˈkɒntent/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thông tin, ý tưởng hoặc chủ đề có trong một cái gì đó.', 'the information, ideas, or writing that are included in a book, website, or document.', 'The book\'s content was both informative and engaging for young readers.', 'Nội dung của cuốn sách vừa mang tính thông tin vừa hấp dẫn đối với độc giả trẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department is responsible for creating engaging content for the company website.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận tiếp thị chịu trách nhiệm tạo ra nội dung hấp dẫn cho trang web của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-ljspeech-040f06fd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-cori-040f06fd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/content-6940ef69.webp', '[\"subject matter\", \"substance\", \"material\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"digital content\", \"meaning\": \"nội dung kỹ thuật số\"}, {\"phrase\": \"table of contents\", \"meaning\": \"mục lục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"content creator\", \"meaning\": \"người sáng tạo nội dung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"context\", \"note_vi\": \"ngữ cảnh hoặc bối cảnh của một sự việc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"content\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contentment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-cori-040f06fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-aru0-040f06fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-aru5-040f06fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-aru6-040f06fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-aru10-040f06fd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-aru9-040f06fd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/content-aru3-040f06fd.mp3\", \"/stora