('a27ad954-4eb6-5b81-bee0-1d7488e1ef61', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5efb1130-1f2b-5124-9a9f-021669dd5e2e', 'dc04400c-86e3-5061-a351-d7649bdcc76f', 'transistor', '/trænˈzɪstə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một linh kiện điện tử nhỏ dùng để khuếch đại hoặc chuyển mạch tín hiệu.', 'a small piece of electronic equipment used to control the flow of electricity in machines.', 'Modern microchips contain billions of tiny transistors.', 'Các vi mạch hiện đại chứa hàng tỷ bóng bán dẫn nhỏ xíu.', '{\"en\": \"The technology firm has developed a new transistor that uses significantly less power.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty công nghệ đã phát triển một bóng bán dẫn mới sử dụng ít năng lượng hơn đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-ljspeech-c7eaa302.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-cori-c7eaa302.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/transistor-1ba8b703.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"transistor radio\", \"meaning\": \"đài bán dẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"silicon transistor\", \"meaning\": \"bóng bán dẫn silicon\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"resistor\", \"note_vi\": \"resistor là điện trở, transistor là bóng bán dẫn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-cori-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru0-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru5-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru6-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru10-c7eaa302.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru9-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru3-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru7-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru8-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-aru2-c7eaa302.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-ljspeech-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt408-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt138-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt624-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt396-c7eaa302.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt498-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt132-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt288-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt42-c7eaa302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transistor-lt90-c7eaa302.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên ngành kỹ thuật điện tử, ít gặp trong tiếng Anh giao tiếp hàng ngày.', 'technology', 1, 20),
('74878822-0002-5642-9be5-ddde978be9dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5efb1130-1f2b-5124-9a9f-021669dd5e2e', 'dc04400c-86e3-5061-a351-d7649bdcc76f', 'amp up', '/æmp ʌp/', 'C1', 'phrasal verb', 'Tăng cường hoặc làm cho cái gì đó trở nên thú vị, sôi động hơn.', 'to make something stronger, more extreme, or more exciting in order to get a better result.', 'The band decided to amp up the energy of their performance with a new song.', 'Ban nhạc quyết định tăng cường năng lượng cho màn trình diễn của họ bằng một bài hát mới.', '{\"en\": \"We need to amp up our marketing efforts to attract more clients before the quarter ends.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần tăng cường nỗ lực tiếp thị để thu hút thêm khách hàng trước khi quý kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-ljspeech-e5146227.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-cori-e5146227.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amp-up-049d5244.webp', '[\"boost\", \"increase\", \"intensify\"]', '[\"reduce\", \"decrease\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"amp up production\", \"meaning\": \"tăng cường sản xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amp up the volume\", \"meaning\": \"tăng âm lượng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"amp\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-cori-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru0-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru5-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru6-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru10-e5146227.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru9-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru3-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru7-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru8-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-aru2-e5146227.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-ljspeech-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt408-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt138-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt624-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt396-e5146227.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt498-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt132-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt288-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt42-e5146227.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amp-up-lt90-e5146227.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm động từ mang tính thân mật, thường dùng trong kinh doanh để nói về việc đẩy mạnh hoạt động.', 'marketing', 1, 21),
('2a0eb990-92aa-515f-b128-d34182cecf43', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5efb1130-1f2b-5124-9a9f-021669dd5e2e', 'dc04400c-86e3-5061-a351-d7649bdcc76f', 'logical', '/ˈlɒdʒɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có lý, hợp với lẽ phải.', 'based on clear thinking and good reasons that make sense to other people.', 'Her explanation was so logical that everyone immediately understood the complex issue.', 'Lời giải thích của cô ấy rất hợp lý nên mọi người ngay lập tức hiểu được vấn đề phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"The manager presented a logical plan to increase sales during the next fiscal quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã trình bày một kế hoạch hợp lý để tăng doanh số trong quý tài chính tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-ljspeech-38dd6692.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-cori-38dd6692.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/logical-d6feb574.webp', '[\"reasonable\", \"sensible\"]', '[\"illogical\", \"irrational\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"logical conclusion\", \"meaning\": \"kết luận hợp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"logical thinking\", \"meaning\": \"tư duy logic\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"logic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"logically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-cori-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru0-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru5-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru6-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru10-38dd6692.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru9-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru3-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru7-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logical-aru8-38dd6692.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr