('90152455-77e1-5bfa-97f7-f3ddc830f719', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5efb1130-1f2b-5124-9a9f-021669dd5e2e', 'dc04400c-86e3-5061-a351-d7649bdcc76f', 'reel', '/riːl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một cuộn chỉ, phim, băng hoặc dây.', 'a round object around which you wind thread, wire, or film for storage or use.', 'She bought a new reel of fishing line for her upcoming trip.', 'Cô ấy đã mua một cuộn dây câu mới cho chuyến đi sắp tới của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The technician replaced the empty reel of thermal paper in the office receipt printer.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã thay cuộn giấy in nhiệt trống trong máy in hóa đơn văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-ljspeech-81a2e435.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-cori-81a2e435.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reel-ba936033.webp', '[\"spool\", \"coil\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fishing reel\", \"meaning\": \"cuộn dây câu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"film reel\", \"meaning\": \"cuộn phim\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"real\", \"note_vi\": \"Real là tính từ nghĩa là thật, khác hoàn toàn với danh từ cuộn dây.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-cori-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru0-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru5-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru6-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru10-81a2e435.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru9-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru3-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru7-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru8-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-aru2-81a2e435.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-ljspeech-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt408-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt138-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt624-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt396-81a2e435.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt498-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt132-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt288-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt42-81a2e435.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reel-lt90-81a2e435.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy nhớ hình ảnh cuộn dây để không nhầm với từ \'real\' (thật).', 'technology', 1, 29),
('84329d2a-1b4a-5d45-b39d-e4cbda852e04', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'retain', 'UK: /rɪˈteɪn/ | US: /rɪˈteɪn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'giữ chân', 'to keep or continue to employ someone or maintain possession of something over time.', 'It\'s important to retain experienced employees.', 'Việc giữ chân những nhân viên có kinh nghiệm là rất quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"The management implemented a new bonus structure to retain talented software developers.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý đã áp dụng cấu trúc thưởng mới nhằm giữ chân các nhà phát triển phần mềm tài năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-ljspeech-7eb6050d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-cori-7eb6050d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/retain-d34b7370.webp', '[\"keep\", \"maintain\", \"preserve\", \"hold\"]', '[\"lose\", \"release\", \"dismiss\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"retain customers\", \"meaning\": \"giữ chân khách hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"retain staff\", \"meaning\": \"giữ chân nhân viên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"obtain\", \"note_vi\": \"Obtain có nghĩa là đạt được, lấy được; trong khi retain là giữ lại cái đang có.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"retention\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"retentive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-cori-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru0-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru5-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru6-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru10-7eb6050d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru9-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru3-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru7-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru8-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-aru2-7eb6050d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-ljspeech-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt408-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt138-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt624-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt396-7eb6050d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt498-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt132-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt288-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt42-7eb6050d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retain-lt90-7eb6050d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong TOEIC với nghĩa \'retain clients/employees\' (giữ chân khách hàng/nhân viên) hoặc \'retain records\' (lưu trữ hồ sơ).', 'human resources', 1, 0),
('e91ddfc2-eb0d-53d5-9e19-c9befa36c300', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'patriotism', '/ˈpætriətɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Lòng yêu nước, sự tận tụy và gắn bó với đất nước.', 'the feeling of love, devotion, and sense of attachment to one\'s own country or nation.', 'His speech was filled with a strong sense of patriotism.', 'Bài phát biểu của anh ấy tràn đầy tinh thần yêu nước mạnh mẽ.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s marketing campaign emphasizes patriotism to attract customers who prefer locally made products.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị của công ty nhấn mạnh lòng yêu nước để thu hút khách hàng ưu tiên sản phẩm nội địa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-ljspeech-bc73966b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-cori-bc73966b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/patriotism-c74e5d2e.webp', '[\"nationalism\", \"loyalty\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sense of patriotism\", \"meaning\": \"tinh thần yêu nước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"patriotic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-cori-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru0-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru5-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru6-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru10-bc73966b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru9-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru3-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru7-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru8-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-aru2-bc73966b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-ljspeech-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt408-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt138-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt624-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt396-bc73966b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt498-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt132-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt288-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt42-bc73966b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/patriotism-lt90-bc73966b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được dùng trong các chiến dịch quảng cáo để khơi gợi lòng tự hào dân tộc.', 'marketing', 1, 1),
('6b815083-9dea-5bce-9af9-84d8cd8cf0d3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'talk into', '/tɔːk ɪntə/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'thuyết phục ai đó làm gì.', 'to persuade someone to do something they were not planning to do.', 'It was hard to talk him into joining the team, but he eventually agreed.', 'Thật khó để thuyết phục anh ấy tham gia đội, nhưng cuối cùng anh ấy cũng đồng ý.', '{\"en\": \"The sales director managed to talk the client into signing a two-year service contract.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc kinh doanh đã thuyết phục được khách hàng ký hợp đồng dịch vụ hai năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-ljspeech-e55c8412.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-cori-e55c8412.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/talk-into-510dea40.webp', '[\"persuade\", \"convince\", \"coax\"]', '[\"talk out of\", \"dissuade\", \"deter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"talk someone into a deal\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục ai đó chấp nhận một thỏa thuận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"talk into joining\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục tham gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"talk into accepting\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục chấp nhận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"talk out of\", \"note_vi\": \"talk out of là thuyết phục không làm gì, ngược nghĩa với talk into\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-cori-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru0-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru5-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru6-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru10-e55c8412.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru9-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru3-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru7-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru8-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-aru2-e55c8412.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-ljspeech-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt408-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt138-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt624-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt396-e55c8412.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt498-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt132-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt288-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt42-e55c8412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/talk-into-lt90-e55c8412.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: talk + someone + into + V-ing. Đừng nhầm với \'talk out of\' (khuyên không làm).', 'business', 1, 2),
('c84bbe2f-d217-58ac-839d-cb05b2b70e7a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'creep', '/kriːp/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Di chuyển chậm rãi, lặng lẽ và cẩn thận để không bị phát hiện.', 'to move slowly and quietly so that others do not notice you.', 'I tried to creep into the conference room without disturbing the speaker.', 'Tôi đã cố rón rén đi vào phòng hội nghị mà không làm phiền diễn giả.', '{\"en\": \"The technician had to creep under the raised floor to fix the server cables.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên phải bò vào gầm sàn nâng để sửa cáp máy chủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-ljspeech-5f008f9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-cori-5f008f9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/creep-764070fa.webp', '[\"sneak\", \"tiptoe\", \"slink\"]', '[\"stride\", \"march\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"creep silently\", \"meaning\": \"di chuyển lặng lẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"creep along\", \"meaning\": \"bò dọc theo, tiến chậm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"creep up on\", \"meaning\": \"lén lại gần ai đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crawl\", \"note_vi\": \"crawl là bò bằng tay và đầu gối, creep nhấn mạnh sự lén lút, chậm rãi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"creepy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creeper\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-cori-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru0-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru5-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru6-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru10-5f008f9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru9-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru3-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creep-aru7-5f008f9f.mp3\", \"/stor