('e98a2e7f-4731-5686-b962-37eced4ba240', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'split', '/splɪt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự chia rẽ, sự phân tách thành các phần hoặc nhóm.', 'a disagreement that causes a group of people to separate into smaller parts.', 'There was a clear split in opinion among the committee members on the new proposal.', 'Có một sự chia rẽ rõ ràng về quan điểm giữa các thành viên ủy ban về đề xuất mới.', '{\"en\": \"A split in the board of directors led to a delay in the merger agreement.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chia rẽ trong hội đồng quản trị đã dẫn đến việc trì hoãn thỏa thuận sáp nhập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-ljspeech-94d5cab6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-cori-94d5cab6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/split-9c237304.webp', '[\"division\", \"disagreement\"]', '[\"unity\", \"agreement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a split in opinion\", \"meaning\": \"sự chia rẽ trong quan điểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a split decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định phân cực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"split\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-cori-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru0-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru5-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru6-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru10-94d5cab6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru9-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru3-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru7-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru8-94d5cab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/split-aru2-94d5cab6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stor