('d196ab1e-0520-56cf-8956-3cf304fd7b3d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'branch', 'UK: /brɑːntʃ/ | US: /bræntʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'chi nhánh', 'A local office or shop that belongs to a larger organization, business, or banking system.', 'The bank opened a new branch in the city center.', 'Ngân hàng đã mở một chi nhánh mới ở trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Our company plans to open a new branch in downtown Chicago next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi dự định mở một chi nhánh mới ở trung tâm thành phố Chicago vào quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-ljspeech-10d735e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-cori-10d735e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/branch-8db42762.webp', '[\"division\", \"office\", \"subsidiary\"]', '[\"headquarters\", \"main office\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"branch manager\", \"meaning\": \"giám đốc chi nhánh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local branch\", \"meaning\": \"chi nhánh địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"branch office\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng chi nhánh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"branch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-cori-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru0-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru5-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru6-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru10-10d735e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru9-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru3-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru7-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru8-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-aru2-10d735e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-ljspeech-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt408-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt138-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt624-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt396-10d735e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt498-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt132-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt288-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt42-10d735e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/branch-lt90-10d735e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với \'branch manager\' (giám đốc chi nhánh) hoặc đối lập với \'headquarters\' (trụ sở chính).', 'business', 1, 14),
('a6fe627e-c1e1-55ce-bbae-f36fea7d058d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'microclimate', '/ˈmaɪkrəʊklaɪmət/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Khí hậu đặc trưng của một khu vực nhỏ, khác biệt với khu vực xung quanh.', 'the particular weather conditions in a small area that differ from the surrounding region.', 'The garden has its own unique microclimate, allowing tropical plants to thrive.', 'Khu vườn có vi khí hậu độc đáo riêng, cho phép các loài cây nhiệt đới phát triển mạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel\'s location creates a pleasant microclimate that attracts guests throughout the entire year.\", \"vi\": \"Vị trí của khách sạn tạo ra một tiểu khí hậu dễ chịu thu hút du khách quanh năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-ljspeech-7c206a54.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-cori-7c206a54.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/microclimate-ebed2e15.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local microclimate\", \"meaning\": \"tiểu khí hậu địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"create a microclimate\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra tiểu khí hậu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-cori-7c206a54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-aru0-7c206a54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-aru5-7c206a54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-aru6-7c206a54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-aru10-7c206a54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-aru9-7c206a54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-aru3-7c206a54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-aru7-7c206a54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/microclimate-aru8-7c206a54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub