('a0ff715b-85d9-537a-b192-29a23a55dd84', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'spectacular', '/spekˈtækjələ(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất ấn tượng, đẹp mắt hoặc đáng kinh ngạc.', 'very impressive, beautiful, or exciting to look at or experience.', 'The fireworks display over the harbor was truly spectacular, lighting up the entire sky.', 'Màn trình diễn pháo hoa trên bến cảng thực sự ngoạn mục, thắp sáng cả bầu trời.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a spectacular view of the city skyline from the rooftop lounge.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp tầm nhìn ngoạn mục ra đường chân trời thành phố từ sảnh trên tầng thượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-ljspeech-8911def3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-cori-8911def3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spectacular-2598480f.webp', '[\"impressive\", \"breathtaking\"]', '[\"dull\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spectacular view\", \"meaning\": \"tầm nhìn ngoạn mục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spectacular success\", \"meaning\": \"thành công rực rỡ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spectacle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-cori-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru0-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru5-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru6-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru10-8911def3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru9-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru3-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru7-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru8-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-aru2-8911def3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-ljspeech-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt408-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt138-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt624-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt396-8911def3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt498-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt132-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt288-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt42-8911def3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spectacular-lt90-8911def3.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen ngợi những thứ gây ấn tượng mạnh về thị giác.', 'travel', 1, 25),
('7af11c80-5d79-5456-8a4f-81c18f0e6434', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'look out for', '/lʊk aʊt fə/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Cẩn thận, chú ý để tránh nguy hiểm hoặc tìm kiếm ai/cái gì.', 'to watch carefully to avoid danger or to find someone or something.', 'When you\'re hiking in the mountains, always look out for sudden weather changes.', 'Khi đi bộ đường dài trên núi, hãy luôn cảnh giác với những thay đổi thời tiết đột ngột.', '{\"en\": \"Please look out for the new shipment of office supplies arriving this afternoon.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng chú ý đến lô hàng văn phòng phẩm mới sẽ đến vào chiều nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-ljspeech-412721f8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-cori-412721f8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/look-out-for-a85bccfc.webp', '[\"watch out for\", \"beware of\", \"keep an eye out for\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look out for danger\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh giác với nguy hiểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"look out for opportunities\", \"meaning\": \"tìm kiếm cơ hội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"look after\", \"note_vi\": \"chăm sóc ai đó hoặc cái gì\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-cori-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru0-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru5-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru6-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru10-412721f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru9-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru3-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru7-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru8-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-aru2-412721f8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-ljspeech-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt408-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt138-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt624-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt396-412721f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt498-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt132-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt288-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt42-412721f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/look-out-for-lt90-412721f8.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này thường đi với giới từ \'for\' khi muốn tìm kiếm hoặc đề phòng cái gì.', 'office', 1, 26),
('b0d6f3f7-f262-512e-9ce4-72a92bbaf06a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'disaster', '/dɪˈzɑːstə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một sự kiện gây thiệt hại lớn, thảm họa.', 'an event that causes great harm, damage, or death to a lot of people.', 'Unexpected server crashes ruined the product launch, turning it into a complete disaster.', 'Sự cố máy chủ bất ngờ đã phá hỏng buổi ra mắt sản phẩm, biến nó thành một thảm họa hoàn toàn.', '{\"en\": \"The unexpected power outage during the product launch was a total financial disaster.\", \"vi\": \"Sự cố mất điện đột ngột trong buổi ra mắt sản phẩm là một thảm họa tài chính hoàn toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-ljspeech-ac58bf0f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-cori-ac58bf0f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disaster-51046e16.webp', '[\"catastrophe\", \"calamity\", \"tragedy\"]', '[\"success\", \"triumph\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"natural disaster\", \"meaning\": \"thảm họa thiên nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"financial disaster\", \"meaning\": \"thảm họa tài chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hazard\", \"note_vi\": \"Hazard là mối nguy hiểm tiềm ẩn, disaster là thảm họa đã xảy ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disastrous\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"disastrously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-cori-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru0-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru5-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru6-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru10-ac58bf0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru9-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru3-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru7-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru8-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-aru2-ac58bf0f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-ljspeech-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt408-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt138-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt624-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt396-ac58bf0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt498-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt132-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt288-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt42-ac58bf0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disaster-lt90-ac58bf0f.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ của disaster là disastrous (chú ý bỏ chữ \'e\').', 'business', 1, 27),
('2c5d3994-a9ff-50cf-9622-8293c2142449', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'attribute', 'UK: /əˈtrɪbjuːt/ | US: /əˈtrɪbjuːt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'quy cho, cho là do', 'to regard something as being caused by or belonging to a specific person or factor.', 'The success of the project was attributed to the team\'s hard work.', 'Thành công của dự án được quy cho sự làm việc chăm chỉ của đội.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO attributes the strong quarterly profits to the dedication of the sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng giám đốc quy lợi nhuận quý tăng trưởng mạnh là nhờ sự nỗ lực của đội ngũ kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-ljspeech-2c317cd0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-cori-2c317cd0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attribute-ba975221.webp', '[\"ascribe\", \"credit\", \"assign\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"attribute A to B\", \"meaning\": \"quy A là do/nhờ B\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attribute success to\", \"meaning\": \"quy thành công cho\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"contribute\", \"note_vi\": \"contribute to nghĩa là đóng góp vào, khác với attribute A to B là quy A cho B\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attribution\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-cori-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru0-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru5-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru6-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru10-2c317cd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru9-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru3-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru7-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru8-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-aru2-2c317cd0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-ljspeech-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt408-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt138-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt624-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt396-2c317cd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt498-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt132-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt288-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt42-2c317cd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attribute-lt90-2c317cd0.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn nhớ cấu trúc \'attribute A to B\' (cho rằng A là nhờ/do B). Đừng nhầm với danh từ \'attribute\' /ˈæt.rɪ.bjuːt/ có nghĩa là đặc tính/thuộc tính.', 'management', 1, 28),
('ad336f98-d922-5c8c-92ad-9191e3bfcec0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '5f158ac7-1af3-5548-84ad-9d1cf7b2d95c', '993e9c4e-cc08-595e-9da8-756dcc96db5f', 'capacity', '/kəˈpæsəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'khả năng làm gì đó; sức chứa.', 'the maximum amount that something can contain or the power to perform a task.', 'The newly renovated warehouse now operates at maximum storage capacity throughout the peak season.', 'Kho hàng mới được cải tạo hiện hoạt động với sức chứa tối đa trong suốt mùa cao điểm.', '{\"en\": \"The factory increased its production capacity to meet the rising demand for new electronic devices.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã tăng công suất sản xuất để đáp ứng nhu cầu ngày càng tăng đối với các thiết bị điện tử mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-ljspeech-7cb1f56d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-cori-7cb1f56d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/capacity-28d535bc.webp', '[\"volume\", \"ability\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"production capacity\", \"meaning\": \"công suất sản xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full capacity\", \"meaning\": \"hết công suất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"capacitate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"capable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-cori-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru0-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru5-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru6-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru10-7cb1f56d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru9-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru3-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru7-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru8-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-aru2-7cb1f56d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-ljspeech-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt408-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt138-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt624-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt396-7cb1f56d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt498-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt132-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt288-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt42-7cb1f56d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capacity-lt90-7cb1f56d.mp3\"]}}', 'Cần phân biệt giữa sức chứa (không gian) và năng lực (khả năng làm việc).', 'manufacturing', 1, 29),
('56256024-cac9-53b7-b8ef-c95e0213a3df', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'exemplary', '/ɪɡˈzempləri/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Đáng được noi gương, xuất sắc.', 'providing a very good pattern for people to copy because of quality.', 'Her exemplary leadership skills inspired the entire team to achieve their goals.', 'Kỹ năng lãnh đạo mẫu mực của cô ấy đã truyền cảm hứng cho toàn đội đạt được mục tiêu.', '{\"en\": \"The company recognized the employee for her exemplary service to international clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tuyên dương nhân viên vì dịch vụ xuất sắc dành cho các khách hàng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-ljspeech-bd272912.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-cori-bd272912.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exemplary-c38c80b8.webp', '[\"model\", \"praiseworthy\", \"commendable\"]', '[\"deplorable\", \"blameworthy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"exemplary conduct\", \"meaning\": \"tư cách đạo đức gương mẫu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exemplary performance\", \"meaning\": \"thành tích/màn thể hiện xuất sắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"example\", \"note_vi\": \"Example là danh từ (ví dụ), exemplary là tính từ (gương mẫu, xuất sắc).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exemplify\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"exemplification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-cori-bd272912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-aru0-bd272912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-aru5-bd272912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-aru6-bd272912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-aru10-bd272912.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-aru9-bd272912.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exemplary-aru3-bd2729