('10e55cf8-e9e7-5b25-9c42-8cbe310ff984', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'slam', '/slæm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đóng sầm, ném mạnh.', 'to shut a door or lid forcefully and with a loud noise.', 'He was so angry that he slammed the door shut behind him.', 'Anh ấy giận đến mức đóng sầm cửa lại sau lưng.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not slam the office doors when leaving the building late at night.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng không đóng sầm cửa văn phòng khi rời khỏi tòa nhà vào đêm muộn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-ljspeech-233c2903.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-cori-233c2903.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slam-a0d88473.webp', '[\"bang\", \"shut\", \"crash\"]', '[\"open\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"slam the door\", \"meaning\": \"đóng sầm cửa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slam the brakes\", \"meaning\": \"phanh gấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slang\", \"note_vi\": \"slang là tiếng lóng, không liên quan đến hành động đóng sầm\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-cori-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru0-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru5-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru6-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru10-233c2903.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru9-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru3-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru7-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru8-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-aru2-233c2903.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-ljspeech-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt408-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt138-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt624-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt396-233c2903.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt498-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt132-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt288-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt42-233c2903.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slam-lt90-233c2903.mp3\"]}}', 'Slam thường đi với \'door\' hoặc \'brakes\' (phanh gấp).', 'office', 1, 10),
('d1d837a7-6461-5b76-881b-814137a1a449', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'linear', '/ˈlɪniə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'theo một đường thẳng; có tính chất tuyến tính.', 'consisting of or relating to lines, or progressing directly from one stage to another.', 'The story has a linear plot, moving from beginning to end in chronological order.', 'Câu chuyện có cốt truyện tuyến tính, đi từ đầu đến cuối theo thứ tự thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager preferred a linear workflow where each task must finish before the next begins.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng dự án thích một quy trình làm việc tuyến tính, nơi mỗi nhiệm vụ phải hoàn thành trước khi nhiệm vụ tiếp theo bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-ljspeech-cb1fa73a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-cori-cb1fa73a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/linear-eb748a45.webp', '[\"sequential\", \"straight\"]', '[\"nonlinear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"linear relationship\", \"meaning\": \"mối quan hệ tuyến tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"linear process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình tuyến tính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"line\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"linearly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-cori-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru0-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru5-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru6-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru10-cb1fa73a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru9-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru3-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru7-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru8-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-aru2-cb1fa73a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-ljspeech-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt408-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt138-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt624-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt396-cb1fa73a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt498-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt132-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt288-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt42-cb1fa73a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linear-lt90-cb1fa73a.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong công việc, quy trình tuyến tính nghĩa là các bước diễn ra tuần tự nối tiếp nhau.', 'business', 1, 11),
('6fa140a6-47cc-5794-b87b-cf267c4def2b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'reheat', '/ˌriːˈhiːt/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Làm nóng lại thức ăn đã nguội.', 'to make food hot again after it has become cold or has been cooked.', 'It\'s often quicker to reheat leftovers in the microwave than to cook a new meal.', 'Hâm nóng lại thức ăn thừa bằng lò vi sóng thường nhanh hơn nấu một bữa mới.', '{\"en\": \"Please use the microwave in the break room to reheat your lunch before eating.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng sử dụng lò vi sóng trong phòng nghỉ để hâm nóng bữa trưa trước khi ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-ljspeech-180920ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-cori-180920ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reheat-b7dfaa16.webp', '[\"warm up\", \"heat up\"]', '[\"cool\", \"freeze\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reheat food\", \"meaning\": \"hâm nóng thức ăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reheat leftovers\", \"meaning\": \"hâm nóng thức ăn thừa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"heat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-cori-180920ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru0-180920ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru5-180920ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru6-180920ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru10-180920ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru9-180920ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru3-180920ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru7-180920ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru8-180920ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reheat-aru2-180920ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reh