('1430a807-5f71-59e6-89f9-4f01a91b74eb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'swift', '/swɪft/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Loài chim yến, bay rất nhanh.', 'a small bird that flies very quickly and spends most of its time in the air.', 'We watched a swift dart across the sky, catching insects.', 'Chúng tôi nhìn thấy một con chim yến bay vụt qua bầu trời, bắt côn trùng.', '{\"en\": \"The nature documentary showed a swift flying over the wetlands during the migration season.\", \"vi\": \"Phim tài liệu về thiên nhiên đã chiếu cảnh một con chim yến bay qua vùng đất ngập nước trong mùa di cư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-ljspeech-49dab569.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-cori-49dab569.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/swift-774d3ea3.webp', '[\"bird\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a flock of swifts\", \"meaning\": \"một đàn chim yến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"swift flight\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến bay nhanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"swift\", \"note_vi\": \"Tính từ có nghĩa là nhanh chóng, khác với danh từ chỉ loài chim. (adj)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"swift\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-cori-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru0-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru5-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru6-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru10-49dab569.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru9-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru3-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru7-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru8-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-aru2-49dab569.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-ljspeech-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt408-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt138-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt624-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt396-49dab569.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt498-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt132-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt288-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt42-49dab569.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/swift-lt90-49dab569.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý từ này vừa là danh từ (chim yến) vừa là tính từ (nhanh chóng).', 'nature', 1, 13),
('4ce9591a-f7ee-554d-8d3b-5912ba861c24', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'roadway', 'UK: /ˈrəʊdweɪ/ | US: /ˈroʊdweɪ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'lòng đường, đường đi', 'The part of a street or highway used by traveling vehicles.', 'A car broke down in the middle of the roadway.', 'Một chiếc xe bị hỏng giữa lòng đường.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew blocked off one lane of the roadway to repair the damaged asphalt.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã phong tỏa một làn đường để sửa chữa phần nhựa đường bị hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-ljspeech-c0121e98.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-cori-c0121e98.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/roadway-c1d2e095.webp', '[\"carriageway\", \"thoroughfare\", \"pavement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clear the roadway\", \"meaning\": \"dọn dẹp lòng đường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"roadway maintenance\", \"meaning\": \"bảo trì lòng đường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"roadwork\", \"note_vi\": \"Roadway là phần lòng đường cho xe chạy, còn roadwork là công trình sửa chữa đường.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"road\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-cori-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru0-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru5-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru6-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru10-c0121e98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru9-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru3-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru7-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru8-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-aru2-c0121e98.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-ljspeech-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt408-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt138-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt624-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt396-c0121e98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt498-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt132-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt288-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt42-c0121e98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadway-lt90-c0121e98.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'roadway\' (phần đường dành riêng cho xe chạy) và \'sidewalk\' (lề đường dành cho người đi bộ).', 'transportation', 1, 14),
('5c6e029f-0139-5b3a-9614-912fd1d2a8c6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'conservatism', '/kənˈsɜːvətɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'khuynh hướng giữ gìn các giá trị, truyền thống cũ, không muốn thay đổi.', 'a tendency to prefer traditional values and avoid sudden social or political changes.', 'His political conservatism made him hesitant to support new social reforms.', 'Chủ nghĩa bảo thủ chính trị của anh ấy khiến anh ấy do dự trong việc ủng hộ các cải cách xã hội mới.', '{\"en\": \"The board\'s financial conservatism prevented the company from investing in risky overseas markets.\", \"vi\": \"Sự thận trọng về tài chính của ban giám đốc đã ngăn công ty đầu tư vào các thị trường nước ngoài rủi ro.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservatism-ljspeech-baaf9dfa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservatism-cori-baaf9dfa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conservatism-ddad9060.webp', '[\"traditionalism\"]', '[\"liberalism\", \"progressivism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"political conservatism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa bảo thủ chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fiscal conservatism\", \"meaning\": \"sự bảo thủ/thận trọng về tài chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conservation\", \"note_vi\": \"conservation là sự bảo tồn (thiên nhiên), conservatism là chủ nghĩa bảo thủ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conservative\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conserve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservatism-cori-baaf9dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservatism-aru0-baaf9dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservatism-aru5-baaf9dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservatism-aru6-baaf9dfa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservatism-aru10-baaf9dfa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pub