('9db8703b-e94e-5efb-8162-748c6deef1de', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'odorous', '/ˈəʊdərəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có mùi, đặc biệt là mùi mạnh và khó chịu.', 'having a particular smell, especially one that is very strong or unpleasant.', 'The garbage bin was quite odorous after sitting in the sun all day.', 'Thùng rác bốc mùi khá nồng sau khi để dưới nắng cả ngày.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance staff cleaned the cafeteria to eliminate the odorous waste from last night.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo trì đã dọn dẹp nhà ăn để loại bỏ rác thải có mùi hôi từ tối qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-ljspeech-0708aa7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-cori-0708aa7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/odorous-a5a32ded.webp', '[\"smelly\", \"malodorous\", \"stinky\"]', '[\"fragrant\", \"inodorous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly odorous\", \"meaning\": \"rất nặng mùi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"odorous substance\", \"meaning\": \"chất có mùi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"odious\", \"note_vi\": \"odious nghĩa là đáng ghét, ghê tởm chứ không phải có mùi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"odor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"odorless\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-cori-0708aa7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-aru0-0708aa7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-aru5-0708aa7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-aru6-0708aa7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-aru10-0708aa7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-aru9-0708aa7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-aru3-0708aa7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/odorous-aru7-0708aa7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio