('cfd02445-9bde-5580-92be-2dbd93e67230', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '60573bd3-db5e-5bbc-98fa-6581611106ce', 'd8266d07-9783-5eb0-8a88-929dd4aa1f53', 'shoulder', '/ˈʃəʊldə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Phần cơ thể nối cánh tay với thân.', 'the part of the body between the top of the arm and the neck.', 'She carried her heavy backpack on one shoulder as she walked home.', 'Cô ấy vác chiếc ba lô nặng trịch trên một vai khi đi bộ về nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The manager patted his assistant on the shoulder to show appreciation for the hard work.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý vỗ vai trợ lý của mình để thể hiện sự cảm kích vì công việc khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-ljspeech-a460abdc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-cori-a460abdc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shoulder-f87c3746.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cold shoulder\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ lạnh nhạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shoulder the burden\", \"meaning\": \"gánh vác trách nhiệm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shoulder\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-cori-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru0-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru5-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru6-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru10-a460abdc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru9-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru3-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru7-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru8-a460abdc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-aru2-a460abdc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shoulder-ljspeech-a460ab