('5e45a691-03cc-5027-aaac-47e16e14733e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'accessibly', 'UK: /əkˈsɛsəbli/ | US: /əkˈsɛsəbli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách có thể tiếp cận được, dễ hiểu', 'in a clear manner that allows information or facilities to be easily understood or reached.', 'This information is clearly accessibly presented.', 'Thông tin này được trình bày rõ ràng, dễ hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The new policy guide is accessibly written so that all staff members can understand their obligations.\", \"vi\": \"Hướng dẫn chính sách mới được viết rất dễ hiểu để tất cả nhân viên có thể nắm rõ nghĩa vụ của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-ljspeech-b6298040.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-cori-b6298040.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accessibly-51119fd1.webp', '[\"understandably\", \"clearly\", \"conveniently\"]', '[\"inaccessibly\", \"obscurely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accessibly priced\", \"meaning\": \"được định giá vừa túi tiền/dễ tiếp cận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accessibly presented\", \"meaning\": \"được trình bày một cách dễ hiểu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accessibility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accessible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-cori-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru0-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru5-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru6-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru10-b6298040.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru9-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru3-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru7-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru8-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-aru2-b6298040.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-ljspeech-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt408-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt138-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt624-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt396-b6298040.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt498-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt132-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt288-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt42-b6298040.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessibly-lt90-b6298040.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ly chỉ cách thức. Thường đi kèm các động từ phân nhánh như written, presented (được trình bày/viết dễ hiểu).', 'office', 1, 4),
('1c5c8067-2606-5207-92f2-fcc5d378e22f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'penniless', '/ˈpeniləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không có tiền, nghèo khó.', 'having no money at all and suffering from extreme poverty.', 'After losing his job, he found himself completely penniless.', 'Sau khi mất việc, anh ấy thấy mình hoàn toàn trắng tay.', '{\"en\": \"After the company went bankrupt, many investors found themselves penniless within a few months.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi công ty phá sản, nhiều nhà đầu tư rơi vào cảnh trắng tay chỉ trong vài tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-ljspeech-f49a77df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-cori-f49a77df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/penniless-4898518f.webp', '[\"destitute\", \"broke\", \"impoverished\"]', '[\"wealthy\", \"rich\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"penniless state\", \"meaning\": \"tình cảnh trắng tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"left penniless\", \"meaning\": \"bị bỏ lại trong cảnh không một xu dính túi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"broke\", \"note_vi\": \"hết tiền tạm thời, penniless mang tính nghèo khó kiệt quệ hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"penny\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-cori-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru0-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru5-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru6-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru10-f49a77df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru9-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru3-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru7-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru8-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-aru2-f49a77df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-ljspeech-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt408-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt138-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt624-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt396-f49a77df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt498-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt132-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt288-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt42-f49a77df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penniless-lt90-f49a77df.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ miêu tả tình trạng hoàn toàn không có tiền.', 'finance', 1, 5),
('e2666137-7428-51fb-9855-84b67f1aa083', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'holder', '/ˈhəʊldə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Vật dùng để giữ hoặc chứa một thứ gì đó.', 'a device or container that is used to support or contain something.', 'The receptionist placed a clear plastic holder on the counter for business cards.', 'Lễ tân đã đặt một giá đỡ bằng nhựa trong suốt trên quầy để danh thiếp.', '{\"en\": \"Please place the pens back into the plastic holder on the reception desk.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đặt bút trở lại vào ống cắm bằng nhựa trên bàn tiếp tân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-ljspeech-ff17c071.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-cori-ff17c071.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/holder-dddad676.webp', '[\"container\", \"support\", \"stand\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cup holder\", \"meaning\": \"khay để cốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"card holder\", \"meaning\": \"ví đựng thẻ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"holder\", \"note_vi\": \"holder còn có nghĩa là người nắm giữ (như share holder)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hold\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-cori-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru0-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru5-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru6-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru10-ff17c071.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru9-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru3-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru7-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru8-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-aru2-ff17c071.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-ljspeech-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt408-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt138-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt624-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt396-ff17c071.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt498-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt132-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt288-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt42-ff17c071.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/holder-lt90-ff17c071.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này vừa chỉ vật chứa (cup holder) vừa chỉ người nắm giữ (cardholder, shareholder).', 'office', 1, 6),
('3c099a23-eae0-5543-b52c-a2e10efcbe68', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'stall', '/stɔːl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một quầy nhỏ hoặc gian hàng bán đồ trong chợ, hội chợ.', 'a small shop with an open front where goods are sold in public areas.', 'She bought some fresh vegetables from a fruit stall at the local market.', 'Cô ấy đã mua một ít rau tươi từ một quầy trái cây ở chợ địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The local craft fair featured a stall selling handmade office supplies and stationery.\", \"vi\": \"Hội chợ thủ công địa phương có một gian hàng bán đồ dùng văn phòng và văn phòng phẩm thủ công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-ljspeech-6e1c6c9e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-cori-6e1c6c9e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stall-79d16852.webp', '[\"booth\", \"stand\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"market stall\", \"meaning\": \"gian hàng ngoài chợ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"set up a stall\", \"meaning\": \"dựng gian hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stall\", \"note_vi\": \"Động từ có nghĩa là làm trì hoãn hoặc chết máy. (verb)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-cori-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru0-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru5-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru6-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru10-6e1c6c9e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru9-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru3-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru7-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru8-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-aru2-6e1c6c9e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-ljspeech-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt408-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt138-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt624-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt396-6e1c6c9e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt498-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt132-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt288-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt42-6e1c6c9e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stall-lt90-6e1c6c9e.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'stall\' (động từ) nghĩa là trì hoãn công việc.', 'shopping', 1, 7),
('3405fc9c-e548-51bd-9aa5-bb1a5784af12', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'grimace', '/ˈɡrɪməs/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Nét mặt nhăn nhó, méo mó thể hiện sự khó chịu hoặc đau đớn.', 'an expression on your face that shows pain, disgust, or unhappiness.', 'The child made a funny grimace after tasting the bitter medicine.', 'Đứa trẻ làm một nét mặt nhăn nhó buồn cười sau khi nếm món thuốc đắng.', '{\"en\": \"With a grimace of pain, the injured worker waited for the medical team to arrive.\", \"vi\": \"Với vẻ mặt nhăn nhó vì đau đớn, người công nhân bị thương đợi đội y tế đến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-ljspeech-8f4399a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-cori-8f4399a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grimace-663da3d4.webp', '[\"scowl\", \"frown\", \"wry face\"]', '[\"smile\", \"grin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"grimace of pain\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ nhăn nhó vì đau đớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a grimace\", \"meaning\": \"nhăn mặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grimy\", \"note_vi\": \"grimy là tính từ chỉ sự bẩn thỉu, đầy bụi bẩn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"grimace\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-cori-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru0-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru5-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru6-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru10-8f4399a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru9-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru3-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru7-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru8-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-aru2-8f4399a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-ljspeech-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt408-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt138-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt624-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt396-8f4399a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt498-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt132-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt288-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt42-8f4399a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grimace-lt90-8f4399a1.mp3\"]}}', 'Grimace vừa là danh từ (sự nhăn mặt) vừa là động từ (nhăn mặt).', 'health', 1, 8),
('2007ad4a-82b0-5e86-a86a-57e91ab43608', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'idealism', '/aɪˈdiːəlɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Niềm tin vào các ý tưởng hoàn hảo, thường không thực tế, về cách mọi thứ nên diễn ra.', 'the belief that it is possible to make the world perfect or much better.', 'Her idealism led her to believe that all problems could be solved with kindness.', 'Chủ nghĩa lý tưởng của cô ấy khiến cô ấy tin rằng mọi vấn đề đều có thể được giải quyết bằng lòng tốt.', '{\"en\": \"His idealism about the new project was inspiring, even if the budget was limited.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ nghĩa lý tưởng của anh ấy về dự án mới rất truyền cảm hứng, dù ngân sách có hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-ljspeech-92ab2f1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-cori-92ab2f1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/idealism-5af8dd5c.webp', '[\"vision\", \"optimism\"]', '[\"realism\", \"cynicism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"youthful idealism\", \"meaning\": \"lý tưởng tuổi trẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"political idealism\", \"meaning\": \"lý tưởng chính trị\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ideal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"idealist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-cori-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru0-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru5-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru6-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru10-92ab2f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru9-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru3-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru7-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru8-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-aru2-92ab2f1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-ljspeech-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt408-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt138-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt624-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt396-92ab2f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt498-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt132-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt288-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt42-92ab2f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idealism-lt90-92ab2f1b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang nghĩa tích cực nhưng đôi khi ám chỉ sự thiếu thực tế.', 'academic', 1, 9),
('4998ce71-e324-5849-8b66-c6c4a238fa2c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'persistent', '/pəˈsɪstənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Bền bỉ, không từ bỏ dù gặp khó khăn.', 'continuing to do something or trying to achieve something despite difficulties or opposition.', 'The sales agent secured a major account thanks to persistent follow-up emails.', 'Nhân viên kinh doanh đã giành được một hợp đồng lớn nhờ những email theo dõi kiên trì.', '{\"en\": \"Thanks to her persistent negotiations, the company finally secured the multi-million dollar contract.\", \"vi\": \"Nhờ vào sự đàm phán kiên trì của cô ấy, công ty cuối cùng đã giành được hợp đồng triệu đô.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-ljspeech-112ade0f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-cori-112ade0f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/persistent-a0b36729.webp', '[\"determined\", \"tenacious\", \"relentless\"]', '[\"irresolute\", \"yielding\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"persistent effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực bền bỉ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"persistent problem\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề dai dẳng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consistent\", \"note_vi\": \"consistent là nhất quán, persistent là kiên trì, dai dẳng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"persist\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"persistence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"persistently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-cori-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru0-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru5-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru6-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru10-112ade0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru9-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru3-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru7-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru8-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-aru2-112ade0f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-ljspeech-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt408-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt138-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt624-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt396-112ade0f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt498-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt132-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt288-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt42-112ade0f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/persistent-lt90-112ade0f.mp3\"]}}', 'Persistent thường mang nghĩa tích cực (kiên trì) hoặc tiêu cực (dai dẳng, phiền toái).', 'hr', 1, 10),
('643b559a-ad02-5df6-973a-efafac5f7ff7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'vagabond', '/ˈvæɡəbɒnd/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Người lang thang, không có nhà cửa hay công việc ổn định.', 'a person who has no home and usually no job, and who travels from place to place.', 'The old vagabond often slept under the bridge by the river.', 'Người lang thang già đó thường ngủ dưới cầu cạnh con sông.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard asked the vagabond to leave the front entrance of the corporate building.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ đã yêu cầu người lang thang rời khỏi lối vào chính của tòa nhà công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-ljspeech-84219047.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-cori-84219047.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vagabond-bc010eaf.webp', '[\"tramp\", \"drifter\", \"wanderer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"live as a vagabond\", \"meaning\": \"sống như một kẻ lang thang\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-cori-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru0-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru5-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru6-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru10-84219047.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru9-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru3-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru7-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru8-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-aru2-84219047.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-ljspeech-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt408-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt138-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt624-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt396-84219047.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt498-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt132-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt288-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt42-84219047.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vagabond-lt90-84219047.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái hơi cổ hoặc văn chương, ít dùng trong giao tiếp hàng ngày.', 'other', 1, 11),
('c19de9f4-be82-5ee2-a883-9afe7d498c79', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'diminish', '/dɪˈmɪnɪʃ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm giảm bớt kích thước, mức độ hoặc tầm quan trọng của cái gì đó.', 'to become smaller or less important, or to make something do this over time.', 'The pain should diminish after you take this medicine.', 'Cơn đau sẽ giảm bớt sau khi bạn uống thuốc này.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s profits began to diminish after the new competitor entered the local market.\", \"vi\": \"Lợi nhuận của công ty bắt đầu giảm sút sau khi đối thủ cạnh tranh mới gia nhập thị trường địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-ljspeech-08ede7ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-cori-08ede7ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diminish-c6ce16c0.webp', '[\"decrease\", \"reduce\", \"decline\"]', '[\"increase\", \"grow\", \"enhance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"diminish the impact\", \"meaning\": \"giảm bớt tác động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rapidly diminish\", \"meaning\": \"giảm đi nhanh chóng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"diminished\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"diminution\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-cori-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru0-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru5-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru6-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru10-08ede7ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru9-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru3-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru7-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru8-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-aru2-08ede7ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-ljspeech-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt408-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt138-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt624-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt396-08ede7ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt498-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt132-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt288-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt42-08ede7ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diminish-lt90-08ede7ab.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để nói về sự sụt giảm giá trị, tầm quan trọng hoặc lợi nhuận.', 'finance', 1, 12),
('2fb60b9f-530a-554c-932b-10539155dea9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'grid', '/ɡrɪd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hệ thống đường thẳng song song và vuông góc tạo thành các ô vuông.', 'a network of straight lines crossing at right angles to form squares.', 'The city\'s streets are laid out on a grid pattern, making it easy to navigate.', 'Các con phố của thành phố được bố trí theo mô hình lưới, giúp việc định hướng dễ dàng.', '{\"en\": \"The new office layout uses a grid to organize workstations efficiently.\", \"vi\": \"Bố cục văn phòng mới sử dụng một hệ lưới để sắp xếp các trạm làm việc hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-ljspeech-f3c543ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-cori-f3c543ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grid-ead11f87.webp', '[\"network\", \"lattice\", \"mesh\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"grid pattern\", \"meaning\": \"mô hình lưới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grid system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống lưới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grid lines\", \"meaning\": \"các đường lưới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"grind\", \"note_vi\": \"khác nghĩa: xay, nghiền, không phải lưới\"}, {\"word\": \"grit\", \"note_vi\": \"hạt nhỏ, cát, không phải lưới\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-cori-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru0-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru5-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru6-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru10-f3c543ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru9-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru3-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru7-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru8-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-aru2-f3c543ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-ljspeech-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt408-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt138-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt624-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt396-f3c543ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt498-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt132-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt288-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt42-f3c543ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grid-lt90-f3c543ad.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm grid với grit (hạt cát) hay grind (xay).', 'office', 1, 13),
('5216e771-af92-558c-bbe7-d018aad202a0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'underrate', '/ˌʌndəˈreɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đánh giá thấp giá trị hoặc khả năng của ai/cái gì.', 'to judge someone or something as less capable than reality.', 'Many people tend to underrate the importance of a good night\'s sleep.', 'Nhiều người có xu hướng đánh giá thấp tầm quan trọng của một giấc ngủ ngon.', '{\"en\": \"Managers should not underrate the skills of new interns in the department.\", \"vi\": \"Các quản lý không nên đánh giá thấp kỹ năng của thực tập sinh mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-ljspeech-fd7f5d58.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-cori-fd7f5d58.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/underrate-723af4ae.webp', '[\"underestimate\", \"undervalue\", \"discount\"]', '[\"overrate\", \"overestimate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"underrate someone\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá thấp ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"underrate importance\", \"meaning\": \"coi nhẹ tầm quan trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"undertake\", \"note_vi\": \"undertake nghĩa là đảm nhận, không phải đánh giá thấp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"underrated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-cori-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru0-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru5-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru6-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru10-fd7f5d58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru9-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru3-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru7-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru8-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-aru2-fd7f5d58.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-ljspeech-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt408-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt138-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt624-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt396-fd7f5d58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt498-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt132-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt288-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt42-fd7f5d58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underrate-lt90-fd7f5d58.mp3\"]}}', 'Underrate = under + rate, nghĩa là đánh giá thấp.', 'hr', 1, 14),
('66393b31-52ef-5221-8d4a-0b0812eb01b9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'agreeable', 'UK: /əˈɡriːəbəl/ | US: /əˈɡriːəbəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'có thể chấp nhận được, tán thành', 'acceptable or pleasing to someone\'s tastes, wishes, or expectations in a business context.', 'The terms of the contract were agreeable to both parties.', 'Các điều khoản của hợp đồng được cả hai bên chấp nhận.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors was agreeable to the proposed budget increase.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã chấp thuận mức tăng ngân sách được đề xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-ljspeech-b6cd1be4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-cori-b6cd1be4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/agreeable-2e4de8e7.webp', '[\"acceptable\", \"favorable\", \"amenable\", \"pleasant\"]', '[\"disagreeable\", \"unacceptable\", \"unpleasant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be agreeable to\", \"meaning\": \"tán thành / chấp nhận điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"agreeable working environment\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường làm việc dễ chịu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"agreed\", \"note_vi\": \"Agreed chỉ sự việc/điều khoản đã được chốt (agreed price), agreeable chỉ thái độ sẵn sàng chấp nhận hoặc tính chất dễ chịu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"agree\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"agreement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-cori-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru0-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru5-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru6-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru10-b6cd1be4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru9-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru3-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru7-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru8-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-aru2-b6cd1be4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-ljspeech-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt408-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt138-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt624-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt396-b6cd1be4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt498-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt132-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt288-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt42-b6cd1be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agreeable-lt90-b6cd1be4.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: \'be agreeable to something\' (sẵn sàng tán thành/chấp nhận điều gì).', 'management', 1, 15),
('27dd099c-7b39-56bc-9337-e1cd00dbc351', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'ecotourism', '/ˌiːkəʊˈtʊərɪzəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Loại hình du lịch có trách nhiệm với môi trường và bảo tồn thiên nhiên.', 'business of organizing travel to natural areas that protects the environment and helps local people.', 'The country is promoting ecotourism to protect its natural habitats and wildlife.', 'Quốc gia này đang thúc đẩy du lịch sinh thái để bảo vệ môi trường sống tự nhiên và động vật hoang dã của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The resort owner invested in ecotourism to attract environmentally conscious guests to the island.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ khu nghỉ dưỡng đã đầu tư vào du lịch sinh thái để thu hút du khách có ý thức bảo vệ môi trường đến đảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-ljspeech-6c634ca5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-cori-6c634ca5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ecotourism-d765c874.webp', '[\"green tourism\", \"sustainable tourism\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"promote ecotourism\", \"meaning\": \"quảng bá du lịch sinh thái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ecotourism industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành du lịch sinh thái\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tourism\", \"note_vi\": \"Tourism là ngành du lịch nói chung, ecotourism là du lịch sinh thái.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ecotourist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-cori-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru0-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru5-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru6-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru10-6c634ca5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru9-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru3-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru7-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru8-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-aru2-6c634ca5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-ljspeech-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt408-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt138-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt624-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt396-6c634ca5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt498-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt132-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt288-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt42-6c634ca5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ecotourism-lt90-6c634ca5.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ được kết hợp giữa \'eco\' (môi trường) và \'tourism\' (du lịch).', 'travel', 1, 16),
('a6391c75-eb24-5402-b409-f755941a8389', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'unqualified', '/ˌʌnˈkwɒlɪfaɪd/', '', 'adjective', 'Không có đủ kỹ năng, kinh nghiệm hoặc bằng cấp cần thiết cho một vị trí.', 'not having the necessary skills, knowledge, or official papers for a specific job.', 'The committee decided he was unqualified for the role due to his lack of experience.', 'Ủy ban quyết định anh ấy không đủ tiêu chuẩn cho vai trò này do thiếu kinh nghiệm.', '{\"en\": \"He was considered unqualified for the senior accountant position due to his lack of certification.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy bị coi là không đủ tiêu chuẩn cho vị trí kế toán cấp cao do thiếu chứng chỉ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-ljspeech-fb97909c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-cori-fb97909c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unqualified-f532e392.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-cori-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru0-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru5-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru6-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru10-fb97909c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru9-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru3-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru7-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru8-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-aru2-fb97909c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unqualified-ljspeech-fb97909c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/