('0195e9ac-6bc7-5c53-98a7-52d9fcebac8f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'ironically', '/aɪˈrɒnɪkli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách mỉa mai, trái ngược với điều mong đợi.', 'in a way that is the opposite of what you expect to happen.', 'Ironically, the computer technician needed help to fix his own laptop yesterday.', 'Trớ trêu thay, kỹ thuật viên máy tính lại cần giúp đỡ để sửa máy tính xách tay của chính mình hôm qua.', '{\"en\": \"Ironically, the new software designed to save time actually caused more delays during the launch.\", \"vi\": \"Trớ trêu thay, phần mềm mới được thiết kế để tiết kiệm thời gian lại thực sự gây ra nhiều sự chậm trễ hơn trong quá trình ra mắt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-ljspeech-5aee10ba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-cori-5aee10ba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ironically-62fee32e.webp', '[\"paradoxically\", \"unexpectedly\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ironically enough\", \"meaning\": \"thật trớ trêu thay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"irony\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ironic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-cori-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru0-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru5-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru6-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru10-5aee10ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru9-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru3-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru7-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru8-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-aru2-5aee10ba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-ljspeech-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt408-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt138-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt624-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt396-5aee10ba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt498-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt132-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt288-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt42-5aee10ba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ironically-lt90-5aee10ba.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi kết quả xảy ra trái ngược hoàn toàn với dự định ban đầu.', 'other', 1, 24),
('6c7c0729-a095-5015-b5cc-5285eee5ed7b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'commitment', 'UK: /kəˈmɪtmənt/ | US: /kəˈmɪtmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cam kết', 'a firm promise or pledge to do something regularly or consistently', 'The company showed its commitment to customer satisfaction.', 'Công ty đã thể hiện cam kết của mình đối với sự hài lòng của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Our firm has demonstrated a strong commitment to environmental sustainability.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã thể hiện sự cam kết mạnh mẽ đối với sự bền vững môi trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-ljspeech-ad068955.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-cori-ad068955.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commitment-11c9280e.webp', '[\"pledge\", \"promise\", \"dedication\", \"obligation\"]', '[\"indifference\", \"breach\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"make a commitment\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra cam kết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"long-term commitment\", \"meaning\": \"cam kết dài hạn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"commit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"committed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-cori-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru0-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru5-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru6-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru10-ad068955.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru9-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru3-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru7-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru8-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-aru2-ad068955.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-ljspeech-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt408-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt138-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt624-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt396-ad068955.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt498-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt132-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt288-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt42-ad068955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commitment-lt90-ad068955.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cấu trúc \'make a commitment to do/doing sth\' hoặc \'demonstrate commitment to sth\'.', 'corporate policy', 1, 25),
('6159264a-e6d7-5777-a33b-683661359a81', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'rationalism', '/ˈræʃnəlɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Triết lý nhấn mạnh vai trò của lý trí và logic trong việc đạt được kiến thức.', 'the belief that your actions and thoughts should be based on reason rather than emotions.', 'Descartes is often considered a key figure in the development of rationalism.', 'Descartes thường được coi là một nhân vật chủ chốt trong sự phát triển của chủ nghĩa duy lý.', '{\"en\": \"The manager\'s approach to solving business problems is based on strict economic rationalism.\", \"vi\": \"Cách tiếp cận của người quản lý để giải quyết các vấn đề kinh doanh dựa trên chủ nghĩa duy lý kinh tế nghiêm ngặt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-ljspeech-4b192048.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-cori-4b192048.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rationalism-cbc99e7f.webp', '[\"logic\", \"reasoning\"]', '[\"empiricism\", \"irrationalism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economic rationalism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa duy lý kinh tế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rational\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rationalize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"rationally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-cori-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru0-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru5-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru6-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru10-4b192048.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru9-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru3-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru7-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru8-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-aru2-4b192048.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-ljspeech-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt408-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt138-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt624-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt396-4b192048.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt498-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt132-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt288-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt42-4b192048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rationalism-lt90-4b192048.mp3\"]}}', 'Hậu tố \'-ism\' thường chỉ một chủ nghĩa hoặc học thuyết.', 'academic', 1, 26),
('c77d03a0-43d9-5dec-969f-3c3dba39f356', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'renew', 'UK: /rɪˈnjuː/ | US: /rɪˈnuː/', 'B2', 'verb', 'gia hạn, làm mới', 'To extend the period of validity of an official document or agreement.', 'You need to renew your driver\'s license annually.', 'Bạn cần gia hạn bằng lái xe hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"You must renew your employment contract before the end of this month.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn phải gia hạn hợp đồng lao động trước cuối tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-ljspeech-f102476a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-cori-f102476a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/renew-49ffe590.webp', '[\"extend\", \"continue\", \"refresh\"]', '[\"cancel\", \"terminate\", \"expire\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"renew a contract\", \"meaning\": \"gia hạn hợp đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"renew a subscription\", \"meaning\": \"gia hạn gói đăng ký\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"renovate\", \"note_vi\": \"renovate là sửa chữa/cải tạo nhà cửa, còn renew là gia hạn văn bản/hợp đồng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"renewal\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"renewable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-cori-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru0-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru5-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru6-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru10-f102476a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru9-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru3-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru7-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru8-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-aru2-f102476a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-ljspeech-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt408-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt138-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt624-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt396-f102476a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt498-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt132-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt288-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt42-f102476a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renew-lt90-f102476a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với các từ như contract, subscription, lease (hợp đồng, đăng ký, hợp đồng thuê).', 'contracts', 1, 27),
('be1b8a33-98d6-5cfe-8f1f-b6fde95ef71e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'abandonment', '/əˈbændənmənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc trạng thái bị bỏ lại, không được chăm sóc.', 'the act of leaving someone or something with no intention of returning.', 'The abandonment of pets is a serious problem in many cities.', 'Sự bỏ rơi thú cưng là một vấn đề nghiêm trọng ở nhiều thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden abandonment of the construction project left many subcontractors without pay.\", \"vi\": \"Việc đột ngột từ bỏ dự án xây dựng đã khiến nhiều nhà thầu phụ không được thanh toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-ljspeech-9942b261.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-cori-9942b261.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/abandonment-b3c5b50e.webp', '[\"desertion\", \"renunciation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"abandonment of property\", \"meaning\": \"sự từ bỏ tài sản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"abandonment of project\", \"meaning\": \"sự hủy bỏ dự án\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"abandon\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"abandoned\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-cori-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru0-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru5-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru6-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru10-9942b261.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru9-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru3-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru7-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru8-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-aru2-9942b261.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-ljspeech-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt408-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt138-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt624-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt396-9942b261.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt498-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt132-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt288-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt42-9942b261.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abandonment-lt90-9942b261.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ của abandon, hay xuất hiện trong hợp đồng và dự án bị bỏ dở.', 'business', 1, 28),
('5caec55c-54d8-52fc-89c7-611b809d0ef0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '625c2456-bd97-5923-bd6f-cf12ad931c35', '67f576af-6af8-5f66-8d21-ee054791b69d', 'launch', '/lɔːntʃ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Bắt đầu, giới thiệu một sản phẩm, dự án mới.', 'to start a new activity, project, or introduce a product to the market.', 'Our marketing department will launch an extensive advertising campaign early next year.', 'Phòng marketing của chúng tôi sẽ khởi động một chiến dịch quảng cáo sâu rộng vào đầu năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"We are excited to launch our new line of eco-friendly office supplies next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi rất hào hứng ra mắt dòng sản phẩm văn phòng phẩm thân thiện với môi trường vào quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-ljspeech-f7c91fef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-cori-f7c91fef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/launch-005e7086.webp', '[\"introduce\", \"initiate\"]', '[\"cancel\", \"withdraw\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"launch a product\", \"meaning\": \"ra mắt sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"launch a campaign\", \"meaning\": \"khởi động chiến dịch\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"launch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-cori-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru0-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru5-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru6-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru10-f7c91fef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru9-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru3-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru7-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru8-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-aru2-f7c91fef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-ljspeech-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt408-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt138-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt624-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt396-f7c91fef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt498-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt132-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt288-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt42-f7c91fef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/launch-lt90-f7c91fef.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ khóa quan trọng trong các bài thi về marketing và kinh doanh.', 'marketing', 1, 29),
('a198a327-c565-52c4-87c2-7cad516ed308', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'a frog in your throat', '/ə frɒɡ ɪn jɔː θrəʊt/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'Bị khàn giọng, khó nói rõ ràng.', 'a temporary difficulty in speaking caused by dryness or throat irritation.', 'Excuse me, I think I have a frog in my throat; I need a glass of water.', 'Xin lỗi, tôi nghĩ mình bị khàn giọng; tôi cần một cốc nước.', '{\"en\": \"The speaker paused during the presentation because he had a frog in his throat.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn giả đã tạm dừng trong bài thuyết trình vì ông ấy bị khàn giọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-ljspeech-02218acb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-cori-02218acb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-frog-in-your-throat-d653b648.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have a frog in your throat\", \"meaning\": \"bị khàn giọng, vướng họng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sore throat\", \"note_vi\": \"sore throat là đau họng do bệnh, còn a frog in your throat là bị vướng/khàn giọng tạm thời.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-cori-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru0-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru5-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru6-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru10-02218acb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru9-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru3-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru7-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru8-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-aru2-02218acb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-ljspeech-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt408-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt138-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt624-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt396-02218acb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt498-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt132-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt288-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt42-02218acb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-frog-in-your-throat-lt90-02218acb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thay đổi tính từ sở hữu (your/my/his/her) phù hợp với chủ ngữ.', 'office', 1, 0),
('dc33df84-9280-569a-8e76-6c2cb427d8a9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'commune', '/ˈkɒmjuːn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người sống chung và chia sẻ tài sản, công việc.', 'An intentional community where residents reside together, sharing common property, work duties, and mutual resources.', 'They decided to live together in a self-sufficient commune in the countryside.', 'Họ quyết định sống cùng nhau trong một cộng xã tự cung tự cấp ở vùng nông thôn.', '{\"en\": \"Several agricultural specialists established an eco-friendly commune to promote sustainable farming methods.\", \"vi\": \"Một số chuyên gia nông nghiệp đã thành lập một cộng đồng sinh thái để thúc đẩy các phương pháp canh tác bền vững.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-ljspeech-0e279f39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-cori-0e279f39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commune-de114458.webp', '[\"community\", \"cooperative\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rural commune\", \"meaning\": \"cộng đồng nông thôn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"living in a commune\", \"meaning\": \"sống trong một cộng đồng chung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"community\", \"note_vi\": \"commune là cộng đồng sống chung chia sẻ tài sản, community rộng hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"communal\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"commune\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-cori-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru0-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru5-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru6-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru10-0e279f39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru9-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru3-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru7-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru8-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-aru2-0e279f39.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-ljspeech-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt408-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt138-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt624-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt396-0e279f39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt498-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt132-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt288-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt42-0e279f39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commune-lt90-0e279f39.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở Việt Nam \'commune\' còn được dùng dịch từ \'xã\' trong địa giới hành chính.', 'housing', 1, 1),
('0321fc79-f6ba-58b6-8ca5-b4d0c95e4aff', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'sequel', '/ˈsiːkwəl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tác phẩm (phim, sách) tiếp nối câu chuyện của một tác phẩm trước đó.', 'a book, movie, or play that continues the story of a previous work.', 'Fans are eagerly awaiting the sequel to the popular fantasy novel, which is due out next year.', 'Người hâm mộ đang háo hức chờ đợi phần tiếp theo của cuốn tiểu thuyết giả tưởng nổi tiếng, dự kiến ra mắt vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The studio decided to produce a sequel to the successful marketing campaign video.\", \"vi\": \"Hãng phim đã quyết định sản xuất phần tiếp theo cho video chiến dịch tiếp thị thành công.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-ljspeech-692c8a2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-cori-692c8a2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sequel-74140aa7.webp', '[\"follow-up\", \"continuation\"]', '[\"prequel\", \"original\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"movie sequel\", \"meaning\": \"phần phim tiếp theo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly anticipated sequel\", \"meaning\": \"phần tiếp theo rất được mong đợi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sequence\", \"note_vi\": \"sequence là chuỗi/trình tự, sequel là phần tiếp theo.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-cori-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru0-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru5-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru6-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru10-692c8a2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru9-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru3-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru7-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru8-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-aru2-692c8a2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-ljspeech-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt408-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt138-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt624-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt396-692c8a2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt498-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt132-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt288-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt42-692c8a2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sequel-lt90-692c8a2b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với sequence (chuỗi, tiến trình).', 'media', 1, 2),
('531ca4fb-1b63-5051-a582-65dbe6307a24', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'piracy', '/ˈpaɪrəsi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành vi sao chép hoặc sử dụng trái phép tác phẩm có bản quyền.', 'the act of illegally copying and selling books, music, or computer programs.', 'Strict regulations were implemented to combat online music piracy across the country.', 'Các quy định nghiêm ngặt đã được thực thi để chống lại nạn vi phạm bản quyền âm nhạc trực tuyến trên toàn quốc.', '{\"en\": \"The software company implemented new security measures to prevent digital piracy of their products.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phần mềm đã triển khai các biện pháp bảo mật mới để ngăn chặn nạn vi phạm bản quyền kỹ thuật số đối với sản phẩm của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-ljspeech-88ef23a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-cori-88ef23a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/piracy-1364d9f6.webp', '[\"copyright infringement\", \"theft\", \"plagiarism\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"software piracy\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm bản quyền phần mềm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"digital piracy\", \"meaning\": \"vi phạm bản quyền kỹ thuật số\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"privacy\", \"note_vi\": \"privacy là sự riêng tư, piracy là nạn vi phạm bản quyền\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pirate\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pirate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-cori-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru0-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru5-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru6-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru10-88ef23a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru9-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru3-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru7-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru8-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-aru2-88ef23a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-ljspeech-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt408-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt138-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt624-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt396-88ef23a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt498-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt132-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt288-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt42-88ef23a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/piracy-lt90-88ef23a4.mp3\"]}}', 'Cực kỳ dễ nhầm lẫn giữa piracy (vi phạm bản quyền) và privacy (sự riêng tư).', 'law', 1, 3),
('37ec4753-00b0-5687-83af-3bfe186cbc6e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'penny-pinching', '/ˈpɛniˌpɪntʃɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất tiết kiệm hoặc keo kiệt, đặc biệt là với những khoản nhỏ.', 'very careful with money, often to the point of being stingy.', 'My uncle is so penny-pinching that he reuses teabags multiple times.', 'Chú tôi rất keo kiệt đến nỗi ông ấy dùng lại túi trà nhiều lần.', '{\"en\": \"The penny-pinching manager refused to buy new laptops for the team.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý keo kiệt từ chối mua laptop mới cho đội ngũ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-ljspeech-11eca1d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-cori-11eca1d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/penny-pinching-c83725fd.webp', '[\"stingy\", \"miserly\", \"tightfisted\"]', '[\"generous\", \"lavish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"penny-pinching attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ keo kiệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"penny-pinching boss\", \"meaning\": \"sếp hà tiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"penny-pinching habits\", \"meaning\": \"thói quen tiết kiệm thái quá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"penny-wise\", \"note_vi\": \"khôn ngoan về tiền, không phải keo kiệt\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-cori-11eca1d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-aru0-11eca1d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-aru5-11eca1d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-aru6-11eca1d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-aru10-11eca1d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-aru9-11eca1d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-aru3-11eca1d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/penny-pinching-aru7-