('9b0670ec-ee38-5b9f-ac60-76a7333f6eae', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'weakness', 'UK: /ˈwiːk.nəs/ | US: /ˈwiːk.nəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự suy yếu', 'the state, quality, or condition of lacking physical strength, vigor, or effectiveness.', 'The recent weakness in sales is a concern for investors.', 'Sự suy yếu gần đây trong doanh số là mối lo ngại cho các nhà đầu tư.', '{\"en\": \"During the interview, candidates were asked to discuss their key strengths and main weaknesses.\", \"vi\": \"Trong cuộc phỏng vấn, các ứng viên được yêu cầu thảo luận về điểm mạnh chính và điểm yếu lớn nhất của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-ljspeech-301ce395.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-cori-301ce395.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weakness-65812b19.webp', '[\"flaw\", \"shortcoming\", \"deficiency\"]', '[\"strength\", \"advantage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strengths and weaknesses\", \"meaning\": \"điểm mạnh và điểm yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"address a weakness\", \"meaning\": \"khắc phục một điểm yếu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"weak\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weaken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-cori-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru0-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru5-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru6-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru10-301ce395.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru9-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru3-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru7-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru8-301ce