('690aa7ec-7081-581c-bdf3-c457c7cd2b7d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'fruitless', '/ˈfruːtləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Vô ích, không mang lại kết quả gì.', 'failing to achieve the desired outcome despite a lot of hard work and effort.', 'Their efforts to find a solution proved fruitless, and they had to start over.', 'Những nỗ lực tìm kiếm giải pháp của họ đã vô ích, và họ phải bắt đầu lại.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team made a fruitless attempt to increase sales during the slow summer season.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị đã thực hiện một nỗ lực vô ích nhằm tăng doanh số trong mùa hè ế ẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-ljspeech-955f762b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-cori-955f762b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fruitless-154bba6a.webp', '[\"unproductive\", \"futile\"]', '[\"successful\", \"productive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fruitless attempt\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực vô ích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fruitless search\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tìm kiếm không kết quả\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fruit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-cori-955f762b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-aru0-955f762b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-aru5-955f762b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-aru6-955f762b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-aru10-955f762b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-aru9-955f762b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-aru3-955f762b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-aru7-955f762b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fruitless-aru8-955f762b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fr