('039a6956-d451-58f7-b67c-0562bd66a215', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'toast', '/təʊst/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Lát bánh mì được nướng vàng giòn.', 'a piece of bread heated until it becomes crisp and golden.', 'For breakfast, I usually have a slice of toast with jam.', 'Buổi sáng, tôi thường ăn một lát bánh mì nướng với mứt.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel breakfast buffet offers warm toast with butter and fruit jam.\", \"vi\": \"Buffet bữa sáng khách sạn phục vụ bánh mì nướng nóng với bơ và mứt trái cây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-ljspeech-2d885aa8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-cori-2d885aa8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/toast-f05005a0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"slice of toast\", \"meaning\": \"lát bánh mì nướng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"buttered toast\", \"meaning\": \"bánh mì nướng bơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"toast topping\", \"meaning\": \"món ăn kèm trên bánh mì nướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"roast\", \"note_vi\": \"Roast là quay/nướng thịt, toast là nướng bánh mì.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"toast\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-cori-2d885aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru0-2d885aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru5-2d885aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru6-2d885aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru10-2d885aa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru9-2d885aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru3-2d885aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru7-2d885aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru8-2d885aa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toast-aru2-2d885aa8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/