('3ad80e69-486c-5e94-ac35-d41177cdbf50', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6585582b-63d1-5286-960f-f8e7f5f7240a', 'cf765965-6895-5d99-8602-fa63349e5bb3', 'sensitive', 'UK: /ˈsensətɪv/ | US: /ˈsensətɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'nhạy cảm, mật', 'Requiring careful handling or strict privacy because of confidential or critical information.', 'Please handle these sensitive documents with care.', 'Vui lòng xử lý các tài liệu mật này cẩn thận.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must sign a non-disclosure agreement before handling sensitive client data.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải ký thỏa thuận bảo mật trước khi xử lý dữ liệu nhạy cảm của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-ljspeech-7a9b93cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-cori-7a9b93cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sensitive-7043b46c.webp', '[\"confidential\", \"secret\", \"delicate\"]', '[\"public\", \"unrestricted\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sensitive information\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin bảo mật / nhạy cảm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly sensitive\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhạy cảm / độ bảo mật cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sensible\", \"note_vi\": \"có lý, khôn ngoan (dựa trên thực tế/lý trí)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sensitivity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sensitively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-cori-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru0-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru5-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru6-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru10-7a9b93cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru9-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru3-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru7-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru8-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-aru2-7a9b93cf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-ljspeech-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt408-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt138-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt624-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt396-7a9b93cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt498-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt132-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt288-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt42-7a9b93cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sensitive-lt90-7a9b93cf.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'sensitive information/data\' chỉ thông tin bảo mật, cần giữ kín; tránh nhầm với \'sensible\' (hợp lý, khôn ngoan).', 'office', 1, 29),
('8ac800ad-2691-5e09-a988-c41673df7a95', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'spirited', '/ˈspɪrɪtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đầy năng lượng, nhiệt tình và mạnh mẽ.', 'showing a lot of energy, enthusiasm, and strong determination in action.', 'The team put up a spirited defense throughout the entire second half of the game.', 'Đội đã phòng thủ đầy nhiệt huyết trong suốt hiệp hai của trận đấu.', '{\"en\": \"The employees made a spirited presentation to win the new client contract.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên đã có một bài thuyết trình đầy nhiệt huyết để giành hợp đồng khách hàng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-ljspeech-6f646f5b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-cori-6f646f5b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spirited-5fb7ff00.webp', '[\"energetic\", \"enthusiastic\", \"lively\"]', '[\"listless\", \"apathetic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spirited debate\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tranh luận sôi nổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spirited defense\", \"meaning\": \"sự phòng thủ quyết liệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spirited performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn trình diễn đầy năng lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spiritual\", \"note_vi\": \"spiritual là thuộc về tâm linh, khác với spirited\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spirit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"spiritedly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-cori-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru0-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru5-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru6-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru10-6f646f5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru9-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru3-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru7-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru8-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-aru2-6f646f5b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-ljspeech-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt408-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt138-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt624-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt396-6f646f5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt498-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt132-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt288-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt42-6f646f5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spirited-lt90-6f646f5b.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với spiritual (tâm linh). Spirited chỉ sự nhiệt tình, mạnh mẽ.', 'office', 1, 0),
('7ede74fd-b05c-5162-9cd5-3522dfe5c88c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'trail', 'UK: /treɪl/ | US: /treɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'đường mòn', 'a rough path across countryside or through a forest created by people walking.', 'The trail leads to a beautiful hidden waterfall.', 'Con đường mòn dẫn đến một thác nước ẩn đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The resort offers a guided hike along the coastal trail for its guests.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng cung cấp một chuyến đi bộ có hướng dẫn dọc theo đường mòn ven biển cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-ljspeech-81a85c61.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-cori-81a85c61.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trail-d0b2e8c3.webp', '[\"path\", \"pathway\", \"track\", \"route\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"nature trail\", \"meaning\": \"đường mòn thiên nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hiking trail\", \"meaning\": \"đường mòn đi bộ đường dài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"trial\", \"note_vi\": \"dễ nhầm do đảo chữ: trial (n) cuộc thử nghiệm/phiên tòa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"trail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-cori-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru0-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru5-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru6-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru10-81a85c61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru9-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru3-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru7-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru8-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-aru2-81a85c61.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-ljspeech-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt408-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt138-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt624-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt396-81a85c61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt498-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt132-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt288-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt42-81a85c61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trail-lt90-81a85c61.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'path\' (đường nhỏ chung) và \'track\' (đường ray/dấu vết). \'Nature trail\' là tuyến đường tản bộ ngắm cảnh.', 'travel', 1, 1),
('c9b02758-767d-5a71-9356-029da096bd33', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'eager', '/ˈiːɡə(r)/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất mong muốn, nhiệt tình hoặc háo hức làm gì đó.', 'very interested and excited to do something or wanting something to happen.', 'The new applicant seemed very eager to start working with our software development team.', 'Ứng viên mới có vẻ rất háo hức bắt đầu làm việc với đội ngũ phát triển phần mềm của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The new interns were eager to learn more about the corporate software system.\", \"vi\": \"Các thực tập sinh mới rất háo hức muốn tìm hiểu thêm về hệ thống phần mềm công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-ljspeech-a5a6b9cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-cori-a5a6b9cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eager-e19c1751.webp', '[\"enthusiastic\", \"keen\", \"excited\"]', '[\"reluctant\", \"unwilling\", \"indifferent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eager to learn\", \"meaning\": \"háo hức học hỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eager for success\", \"meaning\": \"khát khao thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"anxious\", \"note_vi\": \"Anxious mang sắc thái lo âu, eager mang sắc thái hào hứng, mong đợi tích cực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"eagerly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eagerness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-cori-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru0-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru5-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru6-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru10-a5a6b9cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru9-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru3-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru7-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru8-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-aru2-a5a6b9cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-ljspeech-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt408-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt138-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt624-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt396-a5a6b9cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt498-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt132-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt288-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt42-a5a6b9cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eager-lt90-a5a6b9cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc cực kỳ phổ biến trong TOEIC: eager to do something (háo hức làm việc gì).', 'hr', 1, 2),
('6588cc5c-e23a-5965-845b-fee5a17a5298', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'noticed', '/ˈnəʊtɪs/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đã nhận ra hoặc chú ý đến điều gì đó.', 'saw or became aware of something or someone.', 'The vigilant security guard noticed a suspicious vehicle parked near the main entrance.', 'Nhân viên bảo vệ cảnh giác đã nhận thấy một chiếc xe nghi vấn đậu gần lối vào chính.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor noticed that the printer in the main office was out of ink again.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát nhận thấy rằng máy in trong văn phòng chính lại hết mực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-ljspeech-2d1dfd43.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-cori-2d1dfd43.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/noticed-e00e98e8.webp', '[\"observed\", \"spotted\", \"perceived\"]', '[\"ignored\", \"overlooked\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"noticed a difference\", \"meaning\": \"nhận ra sự khác biệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"noticed a change\", \"meaning\": \"nhận ra sự thay đổi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"notify\", \"note_vi\": \"notify là thông báo cho ai đó, còn notice là nhận ra.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"notice\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"noticeable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-cori-2d1dfd43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-aru0-2d1dfd43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-aru5-2d1dfd43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-aru6-2d1dfd43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-aru10-2d1dfd43.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-aru9-2d1dfd43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-aru3-2d1dfd43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noticed-aru7-2d1dfd43.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/p