('e9ccf725-5177-5816-9720-d364dbfdddf5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'heartwarming', '/ˈhɑːt wɔːmɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây cảm giác vui vẻ, ấm áp, xúc động trong lòng.', 'causing feelings of happiness, pleasure, or love in a way that satisfies the heart.', 'Seeing the community come together to help the flood victims was truly heartwarming.', 'Chứng kiến cộng đồng cùng nhau giúp đỡ các nạn nhân lũ lụt thật sự ấm lòng.', '{\"en\": \"The charity gala ended with a heartwarming video about the children we helped.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi dạ tiệc từ thiện đã kết thúc bằng một video ấm lòng về những trẻ em chúng tôi đã giúp đỡ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-ljspeech-d21bdada.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-cori-d21bdada.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heartwarming-f5af8c48.webp', '[\"touching\", \"moving\", \"comforting\"]', '[\"depressing\", \"heartbreaking\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"heartwarming story\", \"meaning\": \"câu chuyện ấm lòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heartwarming welcome\", \"meaning\": \"sự chào đón nồng ấm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heartbreaking\", \"note_vi\": \"heartbreaking nghĩa là đau lòng, trái ngược với heartwarming.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-cori-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru0-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru5-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru6-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru10-d21bdada.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru9-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru3-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru7-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru8-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-aru2-d21bdada.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-ljspeech-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt408-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt138-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt624-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt396-d21bdada.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt498-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt132-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt288-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt42-d21bdada.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heartwarming-lt90-d21bdada.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghép từ heart (tim) và warm (ấm áp), mang nghĩa làm ấm lòng, cảm động.', 'other', 1, 13),
('4a6d01a1-661c-5a56-9008-2c1b17817868', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'bureau', 'UK: /ˈbjʊərəʊ/ | US: /ˈbjʊroʊ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cục, phòng', 'an organization or specialized department that collects information or provides specific administrative services', 'She works at the local tourism bureau.', 'Cô ấy làm việc tại cục du lịch địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The tourism bureau released an official report showing a significant increase in international visitors.\", \"vi\": \"Cục du lịch đã phát hành một báo cáo chính thức cho thấy sự gia tăng đáng kể của khách du lịch quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-ljspeech-fe22b520.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-cori-fe22b520.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bureau-0b2412a6.webp', '[\"agency\", \"department\", \"office\", \"division\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"information bureau\", \"meaning\": \"cục/phòng thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"credit bureau\", \"meaning\": \"cục thông tin tín dụng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bureaucracy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bureaucratic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-cori-fe22b520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-aru0-fe22b520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-aru5-fe22b520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-aru6-fe22b520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-aru10-fe22b520.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-aru9-fe22b520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-aru3-fe22b520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-aru7-fe22b520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bureau-aru8-fe22b520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/b