('c14683f9-26cb-5ab2-91b1-042720d1bee3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'substance', 'UK: /ˈsʌbstəns/ | US: /ˈsʌbstəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'chất, bản chất, nội dung chính', 'the essential meaning, solid content, or real quality of a piece of work.', 'The article lacks substance and is merely a collection of opinions.', 'Bài báo thiếu chiều sâu và chỉ là một tập hợp các ý kiến.', '{\"en\": \"Although the presentation was visually appealing, the board felt it lacked practical substance.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù bài thuyết trình bắt mắt về mặt hình ảnh, hội đồng quản trị cảm thấy nó thiếu đi nội dung thực tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-ljspeech-54ccb2d9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-cori-54ccb2d9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/substance-eaf3b7cb.webp', '[\"matter\", \"material\", \"essence\", \"core\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hazardous substance\", \"meaning\": \"chất độc hại / nguy hiểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in substance\", \"meaning\": \"về bản chất / thực chất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"substantial\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"substantially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-cori-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru0-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru5-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru6-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru10-54ccb2d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru9-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru3-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru7-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru8-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-aru2-54ccb2d9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-ljspeech-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt408-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt138-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt624-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt396-54ccb2d9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt498-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt132-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt288-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt42-54ccb2d9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/substance-lt90-54ccb2d9.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa \'hóa chất/vật chất\', trong văn phòng \'substance\' chỉ tính thực chất, cốt lõi của bài báo cáo/bản đề xuất.', 'office', 1, 16),
('7cc519c5-4ad7-5a20-ba1a-24c2deceecc6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'exile', '/ˈeksaɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng phải rời khỏi quê hương hoặc bị trục xuất khỏi đất nước.', 'a state of being forced to live away from one\'s own country.', 'The former president lived in exile for many years after the revolution.', 'Cựu tổng thống đã sống lưu vong nhiều năm sau cuộc cách mạng.', '{\"en\": \"The famous writer spent years in exile before returning to sign his new book.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà văn nổi tiếng đã sống nhiều năm lưu vong trước khi trở về ký tặng cuốn sách mới của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-ljspeech-64f8faad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-cori-64f8faad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/exile-994c035f.webp', '[\"banishment\", \"expulsion\"]', '[\"repatriation\", \"return\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"live in exile\", \"meaning\": \"sống lưu vong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"force into exile\", \"meaning\": \"buộc phải lưu vong\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exit\", \"note_vi\": \"exit là lối ra, không phải sự lưu vong\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"exile\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-cori-64f8faad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-aru0-64f8faad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-aru5-64f8faad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-aru6-64f8faad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-aru10-64f8faad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-aru9-64f8faad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-aru3-64f8faad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-aru7-64f8faad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exile-aru8-64f8faad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/exi