('8d4e0876-be39-5b06-a814-37180ca54f2e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'hello stranger', '/həˈləʊ ˈstreɪndʒə/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Lời chào thân mật khi gặp người quen sau một thời gian dài.', 'a friendly greeting used when meeting someone you have not seen for a long time.', '\"Well, hello stranger! It\'s been ages since we last saw each other,\" she exclaimed.', '\"Chào người lạ lâu ngày không gặp! Đã lâu lắm rồi chúng ta không gặp nhau,\" cô ấy reo lên.', '{\"en\": \"When my former colleague visited the office, I smiled and said, \\\"Hello stranger!\\\"\", \"vi\": \"Khi đồng nghiệp cũ của tôi ghé thăm văn phòng, tôi đã mỉm cười và nói: \\\"Chào người lạ phương nào!\\\"\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-ljspeech-5ca31cb3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-cori-5ca31cb3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hello-stranger-b608c25e.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-cori-5ca31cb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru0-5ca31cb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru5-5ca31cb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru6-5ca31cb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru10-5ca31cb3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru9-5ca31cb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru3-5ca31cb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru7-5ca31cb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru8-5ca31cb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-stranger-aru2-5ca31cb3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hello-s