('6fb09318-a25f-5a78-8c74-8d6052de05cd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'frost', '/frɒst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lớp băng mỏng hình thành khi nhiệt độ dưới 0 độ C.', 'a thin, white layer of ice that forms on surfaces outside when it is very cold.', 'The car windows were covered with a thick layer of frost this morning.', 'Sáng nay, cửa sổ xe ô tô bị phủ một lớp sương giá dày.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden morning frost caused significant delays for the delivery trucks heading to the distribution center.\", \"vi\": \"Lớp sương giá bất ngờ vào buổi sáng đã gây ra sự chậm trễ đáng kể cho các xe tải giao hàng hướng đến trung tâm phân phối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-ljspeech-7784005a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-cori-7784005a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frost-65dbbef7.webp', '[\"ice\", \"rime\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy frost\", \"meaning\": \"sương giá dày đặc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"morning frost\", \"meaning\": \"sương giá buổi sáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"frost damage\", \"meaning\": \"thiệt hại do sương giá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"snow\", \"note_vi\": \"snow là tuyết rơi từ trời, frost là băng mỏng bám trên bề mặt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"frosty\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"defrost\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-cori-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru0-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru5-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru6-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru10-7784005a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru9-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru3-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru7-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru8-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-aru2-7784005a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-ljspeech-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt408-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt138-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt624-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt396-7784005a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt498-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt132-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt288-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt42-7784005a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frost-lt90-7784005a.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý từ \'defrost\' (rã đông) rất hay gặp trong ngữ cảnh nấu ăn hoặc tủ lạnh.', 'nature', 1, 22),
('fd5955bd-d68e-58fa-b877-3d47b0ffa1ce', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'obliged', '/əˈblaɪdʒd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Bị bắt buộc phải làm gì đó do luật pháp, đạo đức hoặc tình huống.', 'feeling that you must do something because it is the right thing to do now.', 'As a citizen, you are obliged to pay your taxes on time.', 'Là một công dân, bạn có nghĩa vụ phải nộp thuế đúng hạn.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are obliged to follow the safety regulations while working in the factory area.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có nghĩa vụ tuân thủ các quy định an toàn khi làm việc trong khu vực nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-ljspeech-673c2d0b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-cori-673c2d0b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obliged-f1b25c27.webp', '[\"required\", \"compelled\"]', '[\"exempt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel obliged\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy có nghĩa vụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"legally obliged\", \"meaning\": \"có nghĩa vụ pháp lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"obligate\", \"note_vi\": \"obligate thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý, y tế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obligation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-cori-673c2d0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-aru0-673c2d0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-aru5-673c2d0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-aru6-673c2d0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-aru10-673c2d0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-aru9-673c2d0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-aru3-673c2d0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-aru7-673c2d0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obliged-aru8-673c2d0b.mp3\", \"/storage/