('7e541d68-39c7-5c6b-b156-46dc730de234', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'depleted uranium', '/dɪˈpliːtɪd jʊˈreɪniəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Loại uranium đã được loại bỏ phần lớn đồng vị phóng xạ, thường dùng trong quân sự.', 'a dense metal left after most radioactive parts are removed from a natural chemical element.', 'Heavy tank armor frequently incorporates depleted uranium to enhance defense against incoming missiles.', 'Lớp giáp xe tăng hạng nặng thường kết hợp uranium nghèo để tăng cường khả năng phòng thủ trước tên lửa đang lao tới.', '{\"en\": \"The defense contractor manufactured heavy armor plates using depleted uranium for maximum protection.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thầu quốc phòng đã sản xuất các tấm giáp nặng sử dụng uranium nghèo để bảo vệ tối đa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-ljspeech-b3d101ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-cori-b3d101ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/depleted-uranium-25917973.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"depleted uranium weapons\", \"meaning\": \"vũ khí uranium nghèo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"depleted uranium dust\", \"meaning\": \"bụi uranium nghèo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-cori-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru0-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru5-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru6-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru10-b3d101ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru9-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru3-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru7-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru8-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-aru2-b3d101ee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-ljspeech-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt408-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt138-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt624-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt396-b3d101ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt498-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt132-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt288-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt42-b3d101ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depleted-uranium-lt90-b3d101ee.mp3\"]}}', 'Uranium nghèo có tính phóng xạ thấp nhưng cực kỳ nặng và đặc.', 'manufacturing', 1, 28),
('7ab39970-2922-507e-b848-aaf867f40422', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '69376c09-8801-598b-aeef-d2bdc69acd49', '62641004-099b-5fea-84c9-011df99d95b5', 'fume', '/fjuːm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khói, hơi hoặc khí có mùi mạnh, thường là độc hại.', 'strong, unpleasant, and sometimes dangerous gas or smoke produced by chemicals or fires.', 'Be careful when working with these chemicals; the fumes can be quite harmful if inhaled.', 'Hãy cẩn thận khi làm việc với các hóa chất này; khói có thể khá độc nếu hít phải.', '{\"en\": \"Workers must wear protective masks to avoid breathing toxic fumes in the manufacturing plant.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân phải đeo mặt nạ bảo hộ để tránh hít phải khói độc trong nhà máy sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-ljspeech-0e53bfc3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-cori-0e53bfc3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fume-62c47643.webp', '[\"vapor\", \"smoke\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"toxic fumes\", \"meaning\": \"khói độc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"exhaust fumes\", \"meaning\": \"khói thải\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fume\", \"note_vi\": \"động từ nghĩa là giận dữ, danh từ nghĩa là khói. (verb)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-cori-0e53bfc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru0-0e53bfc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru5-0e53bfc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru6-0e53bfc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru10-0e53bfc3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru9-0e53bfc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru3-0e53bfc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru7-0e53bfc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru8-0e53bfc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fume-aru2-0e53bfc3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": 