('2b23cc6e-e4ff-5369-9960-229f6a9af463', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'numbing', '/ˈnʌmɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây tê liệt, làm mất cảm giác.', 'making a part of the body unable to feel anything for a short time.', 'Standing in frozen water for ten minutes produced a numbing feeling throughout his legs.', 'Đứng trong nước đóng băng khoảng mười phút tạo ra cảm giác tê liệt khắp đôi chân của anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The long hours of typing had a numbing effect on the office worker\'s hands.\", \"vi\": \"Việc gõ máy tính trong nhiều giờ đã gây ra cảm giác tê liệt trên bàn tay của nhân viên văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-ljspeech-efddd104.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-cori-efddd104.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/numbing-7c207f71.webp', '[\"deadening\", \"anesthetic\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"numbing effect\", \"meaning\": \"tác dụng gây tê\"}, {\"phrase\": \"numbing cold\", \"meaning\": \"cái lạnh tê tái\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"numb\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-cori-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru0-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru5-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru6-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru10-efddd104.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru9-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru3-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru7-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru8-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-aru2-efddd104.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-ljspeech-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt408-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt138-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt624-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt396-efddd104.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt498-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt132-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt288-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt42-efddd104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/numbing-lt90-efddd104.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng nghĩa đen (cơ thể) hoặc nghĩa bóng (cảm xúc).', 'health', 1, 11),
('a84f56ea-738d-53a1-b2a7-01bdee54dfb6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'scant', '/skænt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'không đủ, rất ít hoặc thiếu.', 'very little and not enough of something that is needed.', 'There was scant evidence to support his claims, so the jury remained unconvinced.', 'Có rất ít bằng chứng để ủng hộ những tuyên bố của anh ấy, nên bồi thẩm đoàn vẫn không bị thuyết phục.', '{\"en\": \"The startup failed because it had scant resources to develop the new software.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp thất bại vì có quá ít tài nguyên để phát triển phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-ljspeech-a061fba2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-cori-a061fba2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scant-e1750685.webp', '[\"meager\", \"limited\", \"scarce\"]', '[\"abundant\", \"plentiful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scant attention\", \"meaning\": \"sự chú ý ít ỏi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scant resources\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn lực hạn hẹp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"scantly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-cori-a061fba2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru0-a061fba2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru5-a061fba2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru6-a061fba2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru10-a061fba2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru9-a061fba2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru3-a061fba2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru7-a061fba2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru8-a061fba2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scant-aru2-a061fba2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/