('79d34968-7be0-5fc4-b7d9-31d6b2edaadd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'advise', 'UK: /ədˈvaɪz/ | US: /ədˈvaɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'khuyên bảo, tư vấn', 'to give suggestions to someone about what they should do in a situation.', 'The manager will advise us on the next steps.', 'Quản lý sẽ tư vấn cho chúng ta về các bước tiếp theo.', '{\"en\": \"The legal team advised the CEO to review the terms of the contract carefully.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ pháp lý đã khuyên Giám đốc điều hành xem xét kỹ các điều khoản hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-ljspeech-1ce9e22b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-cori-1ce9e22b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/advise-4fd6f073.webp', '[\"counsel\", \"recommend\", \"suggest\"]', '[\"dissuade\", \"discourage\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"advise somebody to do something\", \"meaning\": \"khuyên ai làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"advise on something\", \"meaning\": \"tư vấn về cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"advice\", \"note_vi\": \"Advise (động từ, phát âm /z/) khuyên bảo; Advice (danh từ, phát âm /s/) lời khuyên.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"advice\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"advisable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"adviser\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-cori-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru0-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru5-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru6-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru10-1ce9e22b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru9-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru3-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru7-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru8-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-aru2-1ce9e22b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-ljspeech-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt408-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt138-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt624-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt396-1ce9e22b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt498-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt132-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt288-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt42-1ce9e22b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/advise-lt90-1ce9e22b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: \'advise somebody to do something\' hoặc \'advise somebody on/about something\'. Đuôi \'-se\' phát âm là /z/.', 'legal', 1, 17),
('aabe2e92-78fa-54bd-a896-89ca791be1d9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'dehydration', '/ˌdiːhaɪˈdreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng cơ thể bị thiếu nước nghiêm trọng.', 'a condition caused by the loss of too much water from the body.', 'Drinking enough water is crucial to prevent dehydration during exercise.', 'Uống đủ nước là rất quan trọng để ngăn ngừa mất nước khi tập thể dục.', '{\"en\": \"Outdoor construction workers must drink water regularly to prevent severe dehydration during summer.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân xây dựng ngoài trời phải uống nước thường xuyên để ngăn ngừa tình trạng mất nước nghiêm trọng vào mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-ljspeech-f9a90f6f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-cori-f9a90f6f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dehydration-cb19b747.webp', '[\"dryness\"]', '[\"hydration\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severe dehydration\", \"meaning\": \"sự mất nước nghiêm trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent dehydration\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn ngừa sự mất nước\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dehydrate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dehydrated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-cori-f9a90f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-aru0-f9a90f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-aru5-f9a90f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-aru6-f9a90f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-aru10-f9a90f6f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-aru9-f9a90f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-aru3-f9a90f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dehydration-aru7-f9a90f6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio