('71a3c112-88da-57cc-9237-a0f4a25621e0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'compile', 'UK: /kəmˈpaɪl/ | US: /kəmˈpaɪl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'biên soạn, tổng hợp', 'to gather information from various sources and arrange it into a list or report', 'The team needs to compile all data for the presentation.', 'Nhóm cần tổng hợp tất cả dữ liệu để thuyết trình.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting team is compiling the financial report for the fourth quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kế toán đang tổng hợp báo cáo tài chính cho quý bốn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-ljspeech-36d0981b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-cori-36d0981b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compile-9bb339b9.webp', '[\"assemble\", \"gather\", \"collect\", \"organize\"]', '[\"disperse\", \"scatter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"compile data\", \"meaning\": \"tổng hợp dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compile a report\", \"meaning\": \"biên soạn một báo cáo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"compilation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-cori-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru0-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru5-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru6-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru10-36d0981b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru9-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru3-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru7-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru8-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru2-36d0981b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-ljspeech-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt408-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt138-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt624-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt396-36d0981b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt498-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt132-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt288-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt42-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt90-36d0981b.mp3\"]}}', 'Mang nghĩa thu thập và sắp xếp dữ liệu/thông tin. Thường đi với \'data\', \'report\', \'list\'.', 'office', 1, 20),
('2a519020-8c65-5984-b12e-50f3eb493ad5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'carefree', '/ˈkeəfriː/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không lo lắng, vô tư lự.', 'having no worries or responsibilities, feeling relaxed and happy without stress.', 'The children spent a carefree summer playing in the park.', 'Bọn trẻ đã trải qua một mùa hè vô tư lự khi chơi đùa trong công viên.', '{\"en\": \"After retiring from the company, she enjoyed a carefree lifestyle travelling around the world.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi nghỉ hưu khỏi công ty, bà ấy tận hưởng một lối sống vô tư đi du lịch khắp thế giới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-ljspeech-06cb52dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-cori-06cb52dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/carefree-72f59ad3.webp', '[\"untroubled\", \"unconcerned\", \"relaxed\"]', '[\"anxious\", \"worried\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"carefree attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ vô tư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"carefree life\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc sống vô tư lự\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"careless\", \"note_vi\": \"careless nghĩa là bất cẩn, cẩu thả chứ không phải vô tư.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"carefreely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-cori-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru0-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru5-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru6-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru10-06cb52dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru9-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru3-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru7-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru8-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-aru2-06cb52dd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-ljspeech-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt408-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt138-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt624-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt396-06cb52dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt498-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt132-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt288-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt42-06cb52dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/carefree-lt90-06cb52dd.mp3\"]}}', 'Carefree mang nghĩa tích cực (vô tư, thoải mái), còn careless là tiêu cực (bất cẩn).', 'daily', 1, 21),
('63d53d86-fa06-597a-aec6-ba6209e491cc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'lowering', '/ˈlaʊə(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Trông u ám, đe dọa, thường nói về bầu trời hoặc vẻ mặt.', 'looking dark and threatening, often describing sky or face.', 'The lowering clouds suggested that a storm was approaching.', 'Những đám mây u ám cho thấy một cơn bão đang đến gần.', '{\"en\": \"The lowering sky forced the outdoor event to move indoors.\", \"vi\": \"Bầu trời u ám đã buộc sự kiện ngoài trời phải chuyển vào trong nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-ljspeech-f22483b3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-cori-f22483b3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lowering-0b31c1dd.webp', '[\"gloomy\", \"threatening\", \"sullen\"]', '[\"bright\", \"clear\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lowering sky\", \"meaning\": \"bầu trời u ám\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lowering clouds\", \"meaning\": \"mây đen đe dọa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lowering brow\", \"meaning\": \"trán nhíu đe dọa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lowering\", \"note_vi\": \"lowering có thể là V-ing của lower, nhưng đây là tính từ u ám.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lower\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"low\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-cori-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru0-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru5-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru6-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru10-f22483b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru9-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru3-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru7-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru8-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-aru2-f22483b3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-ljspeech-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt408-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt138-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt624-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt396-f22483b3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt498-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt132-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt288-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt42-f22483b3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lowering-lt90-f22483b3.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này hiếm, dễ nhầm với dạng V-ing của \'lower\' (hạ xuống).', 'nature', 1, 22),
('1508539c-2a10-530d-8ae8-411c574be3da', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'cuboid', '/ˈkjuːbɔɪd/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hình khối có sáu mặt, mỗi mặt là hình chữ nhật.', 'a solid three-dimensional object with six faces that are all rectangular in shape.', 'A standard shoebox is an excellent example of a cuboid.', 'Một hộp giày tiêu chuẩn là một ví dụ tuyệt vời về hình hộp chữ nhật.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping department packaged the product inside a durable cuboid cardboard box.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận vận chuyển đã đóng gói sản phẩm bên trong một hộp carton hình khối chữ nhật bền bỉ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-ljspeech-4a68a046.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-cori-4a68a046.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cuboid-5363c7a7.webp', '[\"rectangular prism\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cuboid shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình dạng khối chữ nhật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cuboid box\", \"meaning\": \"hộp hình khối chữ nhật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cube\", \"note_vi\": \"Cube là hình lập phương (6 mặt vuông); cuboid là hình khối chữ nhật.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-cori-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru0-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru5-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru6-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru10-4a68a046.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru9-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru3-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru7-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru8-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-aru2-4a68a046.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-ljspeech-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt408-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt138-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt624-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt396-4a68a046.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt498-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt132-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt288-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt42-4a68a046.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cuboid-lt90-4a68a046.mp3\"]}}', 'Cuboid có các mặt là hình chữ nhật, khác với cube có 6 mặt vuông bằng nhau.', 'manufacturing', 1, 23),
('1b9fee70-0ee1-5f37-a212-767c31205929', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'vibrant', '/ˈvaɪbrənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đầy sức sống, rực rỡ hoặc sôi nổi.', 'full of energy, excitement, and bright colors that make a place feel lively.', 'The city\'s market was a vibrant place, full of colors and sounds.', 'Chợ của thành phố là một nơi sôi động, đầy màu sắc và âm thanh.', '{\"en\": \"The downtown area has a vibrant business district with many new shops and restaurants.\", \"vi\": \"Khu trung tâm có một khu thương mại sôi động với nhiều cửa hàng và nhà hàng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-ljspeech-08fe0690.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-cori-08fe0690.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vibrant-ff23533f.webp', '[\"lively\", \"energetic\"]', '[\"dull\", \"lifeless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vibrant city\", \"meaning\": \"thành phố sôi động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vibrant colors\", \"meaning\": \"màu sắc rực rỡ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-cori-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru0-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru5-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru6-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru10-08fe0690.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru9-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru3-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru7-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru8-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-aru2-08fe0690.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-ljspeech-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt408-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt138-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt624-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt396-08fe0690.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt498-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt132-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt288-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt42-08fe0690.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vibrant-lt90-08fe0690.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả không khí làm việc hoặc thị trường đầy tiềm năng.', 'marketing', 1, 24),
('c5cf7bdc-eb5d-5a7e-8cd3-78a1184c0a44', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'logo', '/ˈləʊɡəʊ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Biểu tượng hoặc thiết kế đồ họa dùng để nhận diện một công ty, sản phẩm hoặc tổ chức.', 'a special design or symbol that a company uses to identify its products.', 'The company decided to update its logo to reflect a more modern image.', 'Công ty quyết định cập nhật logo của mình để phản ánh một hình ảnh hiện đại hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department designed a new logo for the upcoming product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận tiếp thị đã thiết kế một biểu tượng mới cho buổi ra mắt sản phẩm sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-ljspeech-5807dd60.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-cori-5807dd60.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/logo-9f21c46b.webp', '[\"symbol\", \"emblem\", \"trademark\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"company logo\", \"meaning\": \"biểu tượng công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"design a logo\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế biểu tượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"slogan\", \"note_vi\": \"slogan là khẩu hiệu bằng chữ, logo là biểu tượng hình ảnh\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-cori-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru0-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru5-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru6-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru10-5807dd60.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru9-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru3-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru7-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru8-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-aru2-5807dd60.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-ljspeech-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt408-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt138-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt624-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt396-5807dd60.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt498-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt132-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt288-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt42-5807dd60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/logo-lt90-5807dd60.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với slogan là câu khẩu hiệu.', 'marketing', 1, 25),
('23380912-3295-5b57-b8ec-370b79d4707a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'taper', '/ˈteɪpə(r)/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Giảm dần, thu nhỏ dần về một phía.', 'to become gradually narrower or thinner toward one end.', 'The road began to taper into a narrow path as we approached the forest.', 'Con đường bắt đầu thu hẹp dần thành một lối đi nhỏ khi chúng tôi đến gần khu rừng.', '{\"en\": \"Sales of the old product model began to taper off after the new version was released.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số của mẫu sản phẩm cũ bắt đầu giảm dần sau khi phiên bản mới được ra mắt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-ljspeech-8f5b1be7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-cori-8f5b1be7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/taper-93e94c56.webp', '[\"narrow\", \"decrease\", \"diminish\"]', '[\"widen\", \"expand\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"taper off\", \"meaning\": \"giảm dần về số lượng hoặc mức độ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"taper to a point\", \"meaning\": \"nhỏ dần thành một điểm nhọn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tap\", \"note_vi\": \"gõ nhẹ hoặc vòi nước, khác với taper\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"taper\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-cori-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru0-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru5-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru6-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru10-8f5b1be7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru9-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru3-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru7-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru8-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-aru2-8f5b1be7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-ljspeech-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt408-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt138-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt624-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt396-8f5b1be7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt498-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt132-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt288-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt42-8f5b1be7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taper-lt90-8f5b1be7.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ \'taper off\' cực kỳ phổ biến khi nói về sự giảm dần doanh số hoặc sản lượng.', 'business', 1, 26),
('df16229a-51c0-5ff0-baee-9d946086a99a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '694aaf5c-1ac9-58f2-8a79-a247fc7931ba', 'deb7a673-053c-5d81-88c2-a2c976fd8c25', 'board meeting', 'UK: /bɔːd ˈmiːtɪŋ/ | US: /bɔːrd ˈmiːtɪŋ/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị', 'a formal gathering of senior directors to discuss company policies and strategies', 'The board meeting will be held next Tuesday.', 'Cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị sẽ được tổ chức vào thứ Ba tới.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO announced the strategic expansion plans during the quarterly board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã thông báo các kế hoạch mở rộng chiến lược trong cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị hàng quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-ljspeech-9985e32f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-cori-9985e32f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/board-meeting-70cec3da.webp', '[\"directors\' meeting\", \"executive meeting\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"attend a board meeting\", \"meaning\": \"tham dự cuộc họp HĐQT\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convene a board meeting\", \"meaning\": \"triệu tập cuộc họp HĐQT\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-cori-9985e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-aru0-9985e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-aru5-9985e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-aru6-9985e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-aru10-9985e32f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-aru9-9985e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-aru3-9985e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-aru7-9985e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/board-meeting-aru8-9985e32f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v