('d390cbd8-6be4-5913-be5a-9d0207798e72', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6a947d2b-99c7-5b9a-86fd-d5fa4fc17818', 'b973bf90-dd91-5705-80ee-b5a27ea88100', 'forum', '/ˈfɔːrəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một nơi hoặc cuộc họp để thảo luận công khai về các vấn đề quan trọng.', 'a place or meeting where people can discuss particular matters of public interest.', 'The online forum allows users to share ideas and ask questions about technology.', 'Diễn đàn trực tuyến cho phép người dùng chia sẻ ý tưởng và đặt câu hỏi về công nghệ.', '{\"en\": \"The annual economic forum attracts business leaders from all over the world.\", \"vi\": \"Diễn đàn kinh tế hàng năm thu hút các lãnh đạo doanh nghiệp từ khắp nơi trên thế giới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-ljspeech-732d18e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-cori-732d18e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/forum-7edb778a.webp', '[\"platform\", \"discussion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"open forum\", \"meaning\": \"diễn đàn mở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"online forum\", \"meaning\": \"diễn đàn trực tuyến\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-cori-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru0-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru5-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru6-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru10-732d18e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru9-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru3-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru7-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru8-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-aru2-732d18e7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-ljspeech-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt408-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt138-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt624-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt396-732d18e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt498-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt132-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt288-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt42-732d18e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/forum-lt90-732d18e7.mp3\"]}}', 'Dạng số nhiều của forum có thể viết là forums hoặc fora.', 'business', 1, 19),
('148245b0-7e9a-5683-a451-2a31efb4c62d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6a947d2b-99c7-5b9a-86fd-d5fa4fc17818', 'b973bf90-dd91-5705-80ee-b5a27ea88100', 'adorable', '/əˈdɔːrəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất dễ thương, đáng yêu.', 'very attractive and charming in a sweet or innocent way.', 'The puppy with its big eyes and fluffy fur was absolutely adorable.', 'Chú chó con với đôi mắt to và bộ lông mềm mại thật sự rất đáng yêu.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s new mascot design was so adorable that customers loved it immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế linh vật mới của công ty dễ thương đến mức khách hàng yêu thích ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-ljspeech-f91bac5c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-cori-f91bac5c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/adorable-4d866907.webp', '[\"charming\", \"delightful\", \"cute\"]', '[\"unappealing\", \"repulsive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"absolutely adorable\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ đáng yêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adorable smile\", \"meaning\": \"nụ cười đáng yêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find something adorable\", \"meaning\": \"thấy cái gì đó dễ thương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"admirable\", \"note_vi\": \"admirable nghĩa là đáng ngưỡng mộ vì tài năng, không phải dễ thương\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"adore\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"adoration\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"adorably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-cori-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru0-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru5-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru6-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru10-f91bac5c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru9-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru3-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru7-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru8-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-aru2-f91bac5c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-ljspeech-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt408-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt138-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt624-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt396-f91bac5c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt498-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt132-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt288-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt42-f91bac5c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adorable-lt90-f91bac5c.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'adore\' (yêu mến); adorable thường dùng cho người, động vật hoặc vật nhỏ xinh.', 'marketing', 1, 20),
('2416f268-b1ed-5e4b-9731-29b64a7f10ac', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6a947d2b-99c7-5b9a-86fd-d5fa4fc17818', 'b973bf90-dd91-5705-80ee-b5a27ea88100', 'decorum', '/dɪˈkɔːrəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự đúng mực, phép tắc trong cách cư xử.', 'polite behavior that is appropriate for a social situation or official meeting.', 'Guests were reminded to observe proper decorum during the formal dinner.', 'Khách được nhắc nhở phải giữ phép tắc đúng mực trong bữa tối trang trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are expected to maintain professional decorum when interacting with clients at the conference.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được kỳ vọng duy trì tác phong đúng mực khi tương tác với khách hàng tại hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-ljspeech-b97a17f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-cori-b97a17f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decorum-a8e9398c.webp', '[\"propriety\", \"decency\", \"politeness\"]', '[\"impropriety\", \"rudeness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"maintain decorum\", \"meaning\": \"duy trì sự đúng mực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sense of decorum\", \"meaning\": \"ý thức về phép tắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decoration\", \"note_vi\": \"decoration là sự trang trí, decorum là sự đúng mực\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"decorous\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"decorously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-cori-b97a17f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-aru0-b97a17f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-aru5-b97a17f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-aru6-b97a17f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-aru10-b97a17f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-aru9-b97a17f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decorum-aru3-b97a17f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/