('8701a5ce-a7a1-5b7d-a335-2a0f71fd6bbb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6a947d2b-99c7-5b9a-86fd-d5fa4fc17818', 'b973bf90-dd91-5705-80ee-b5a27ea88100', 'toxin', '/ˈtɒksɪn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Chất độc hại do sinh vật sống tạo ra.', 'a poisonous substance, especially one produced by bacteria, that causes disease.', 'Certain bacteria produce a toxin that can cause food poisoning.', 'Một số vi khuẩn tạo ra độc tố có thể gây ngộ độc thực phẩm.', '{\"en\": \"The factory was fined for releasing a dangerous toxin into the local river.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy đã bị phạt vì thải chất độc nguy hiểm ra dòng sông địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-ljspeech-0b6bd4de.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-cori-0b6bd4de.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/toxin-6c46ff98.webp', '[\"poison\", \"venom\"]', '[\"antidote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eliminate toxins\", \"meaning\": \"loại bỏ chất độc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"environmental toxin\", \"meaning\": \"chất độc môi trường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"toxicant\", \"note_vi\": \"chất độc nhân tạo, khác với toxin là tự nhiên\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"toxic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"toxicity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-cori-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru0-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru5-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru6-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru10-0b6bd4de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru9-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru3-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru7-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru8-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-aru2-0b6bd4de.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-ljspeech-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt408-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt138-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt624-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt396-0b6bd4de.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt498-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt132-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt288-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt42-0b6bd4de.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/toxin-lt90-0b6bd4de.mp3\"]}}', 'Toxin là chất độc sinh học tự nhiên, phân biệt với poison (chất độc nói chung).', 'health', 1, 27),
('e4c2158c-4ef4-5fb8-896e-dd492b59fcfa', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6a947d2b-99c7-5b9a-86fd-d5fa4fc17818', 'b973bf90-dd91-5705-80ee-b5a27ea88100', 'temperate', '/ˈtempərət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khí hậu ôn hòa, không quá nóng cũng không quá lạnh.', 'describing weather or climate that is mild and never extremely hot or cold.', 'The temperate climate of this region is ideal for growing various crops.', 'Khí hậu ôn hòa của vùng này lý tưởng để trồng nhiều loại cây trồng khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The agricultural corporation prefers investing in regions with a temperate climate for crop stability.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn nông nghiệp ưu tiên đầu tư vào các khu vực có khí hậu ôn hòa để giữ sự ổn định cây trồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-ljspeech-f195e2d7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-cori-f195e2d7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/temperate-5132a4b4.webp', '[\"mild\", \"moderate\"]', '[\"extreme\", \"severe\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"temperate climate\", \"meaning\": \"khí hậu ôn hòa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"temperate zone\", \"meaning\": \"vùng ôn đới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"temperature\", \"note_vi\": \"temperature là nhiệt độ (danh từ), temperate là ôn hòa (tính từ)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"temperance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-cori-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru0-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru5-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru6-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru10-f195e2d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru9-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru3-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru7-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru8-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-aru2-f195e2d7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-ljspeech-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt408-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt138-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt624-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt396-f195e2d7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt498-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt132-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt288-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt42-f195e2d7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperate-lt90-f195e2d7.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm lẫn với từ temperature (nhiệt độ).', 'nature', 1, 28),
('4c6adfb3-3a7d-5898-a774-5bc894c36d88', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6a947d2b-99c7-5b9a-86fd-d5fa4fc17818', 'b973bf90-dd91-5705-80ee-b5a27ea88100', 'passing', '/ˈpɑːsɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cái chết của một người nào đó.', 'a polite way of saying that someone has died.', 'We were saddened to hear of the sudden passing of our old friend.', 'Chúng tôi rất buồn khi nghe tin người bạn cũ của chúng tôi đột ngột qua đời.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors expressed their deep sorrow upon the passing of the company founder.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị bày tỏ sự đau buồn sâu sắc trước sự ra đi của người sáng lập công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-ljspeech-f0374386.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-cori-f0374386.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/passing-9e681878.webp', '[\"death\", \"demise\"]', '[\"birth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sad passing\", \"meaning\": \"sự ra đi đáng buồn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pass\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-cori-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru0-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru5-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru6-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru10-f0374386.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru9-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru3-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru7-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru8-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-aru2-f0374386.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-ljspeech-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt408-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt138-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt624-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt396-f0374386.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt498-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt132-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt288-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt42-f0374386.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/passing-lt90-f0374386.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là cách nói giảm nói tránh trang trọng thay cho từ \'death\'.', 'other', 1, 29),
('799e7ecf-3a6f-5b3c-882a-5c0376b8175b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c402eec-e29f-5cde-a6a2-b5f3509e8f9e', '0f739503-60be-5288-9d93-ae26ff495fdc', 'edgy', '/ˈedʒi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Căng thẳng, lo lắng hoặc dễ bị kích động.', 'feeling nervous, worried, or easily annoyed by things around you.', 'The caffeine from three cups of coffee made the manager feel tense and edgy.', 'Chất caffeine từ ba tách cà phê đã khiến vị quản lý cảm thấy căng thẳng và bồn chồn.', '{\"en\": \"The staff felt edgy while waiting for the results of the annual performance reviews.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cảm thấy căng thẳng khi chờ đợi kết quả đánh giá hiệu suất hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-ljspeech-84e232dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-cori-84e232dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/edgy-4d4a64dc.webp', '[\"nervous\", \"tense\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel edgy\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy căng thẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make someone edgy\", \"meaning\": \"làm ai đó lo lắng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"edge\", \"note_vi\": \"Edge là danh từ (cạnh), edgy là tính từ (căng thẳng).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-cori-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru0-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru5-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru6-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru10-84e232dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru9-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru3-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru7-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru8-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-aru2-84e232dd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-ljspeech-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt408-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt138-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt624-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt396-84e232dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt498-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt132-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt288-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt42-84e232dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/edgy-lt90-84e232dd.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả tâm trạng nhân viên trước các kỳ đánh giá hoặc sự kiện quan trọng.', 'hr', 1, 0),
('93cf3e53-4d57-55e9-a277-62a398685fb1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c402eec-e29f-5cde-a6a2-b5f3509e8f9e', '0f739503-60be-5288-9d93-ae26ff495fdc', 'bony', '/ˈbəʊni/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gầy gò đến mức nhìn rõ xương, hoặc có nhiều xương.', 'very thin so that the bones can be seen clearly under the skin.', 'The stray dog looked very bony and hungry, so we gave it some food.', 'Con chó hoang trông rất xương xẩu và đói, nên chúng tôi đã cho nó ít thức ăn.', '{\"en\": \"The stray cat looked quite bony, so the office staff decided to provide it with food.\", \"vi\": \"Con mèo hoang trông khá gầy gò, nên nhân viên văn phòng quyết định cho nó thức ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-ljspeech-8f3691f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-cori-8f3691f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bony-02c64223.webp', '[\"thin\", \"gaunt\"]', '[\"plump\", \"fleshy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bony fingers\", \"meaning\": \"những ngón tay gầy guộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bony structure\", \"meaning\": \"cấu trúc xương\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bone\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-cori-8f3691f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru0-8f3691f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru5-8f3691f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru6-8f3691f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru10-8f3691f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru9-8f3691f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru3-8f3691f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru7-8f3691f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru8-8f3691f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-aru2-8f3691f2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bony-ljspeech-8f3691