('ea122747-a44a-5083-add8-75467104a10f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c402eec-e29f-5cde-a6a2-b5f3509e8f9e', '0f739503-60be-5288-9d93-ae26ff495fdc', 'cut back', '/kʌt bæk/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Giảm bớt số lượng, mức độ hoặc chi phí của cái gì đó.', 'to reduce the size, amount, or cost of something.', 'We need to cut back on our expenses if we want to save money for a new house.', 'Chúng ta cần cắt giảm chi tiêu nếu muốn tiết kiệm tiền mua nhà mới.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to cut back on travel expenses to save money.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty quyết định cắt giảm chi phí đi lại để tiết kiệm tiền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-ljspeech-93bc06ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-cori-93bc06ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cut-back-8eada397.webp', '[\"reduce\", \"decrease\", \"curtail\"]', '[\"increase\", \"expand\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cut back on spending\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm chi tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cut back production\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm sản lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cut down\", \"note_vi\": \"thường đi với \'on\', nghĩa là giảm tần suất/lượng tiêu thụ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cutback\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-cori-93bc06ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-aru0-93bc06ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-aru5-93bc06ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-aru6-93bc06ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-aru10-93bc06ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-aru9-93bc06ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-aru3-93bc06ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-aru7-93bc06ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cut-back-aru8-93bc06ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/o