('dd9db55d-a558-52f9-85e2-26f8bc8d9ca4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c402eec-e29f-5cde-a6a2-b5f3509e8f9e', '0f739503-60be-5288-9d93-ae26ff495fdc', 'implausible', '/ɪmˈplɔːzəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Khó tin, không hợp lý hoặc không thể xảy ra.', 'difficult to believe and unlikely to be true or to happen.', 'His excuse for being late was so implausible that nobody believed him.', 'Lời bào chữa cho việc đến muộn của anh ấy quá phi lý đến nỗi không ai tin.', '{\"en\": \"The manager found the employee\'s explanation for the missing budget report highly implausible.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhận thấy lời giải thích của nhân viên về báo cáo ngân sách bị thiếu là rất khó tin.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-ljspeech-d4a41245.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-cori-d4a41245.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/implausible-6f847f61.webp', '[\"unbelievable\", \"improbable\", \"unlikely\"]', '[\"plausible\", \"believable\", \"likely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"implausible explanation\", \"meaning\": \"lời giải thích khó tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"implausible scenario\", \"meaning\": \"kịch bản khó xảy ra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"impossible\", \"note_vi\": \"impossible là không thể làm được, implausible là khó tin\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"plausibility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"implausibly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-cori-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru0-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru5-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru6-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru10-d4a41245.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru9-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru3-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru7-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru8-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-aru2-d4a41245.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-ljspeech-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt408-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt138-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt624-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt396-d4a41245.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt498-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt132-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt288-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt42-d4a41245.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/implausible-lt90-d4a41245.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với plausible (hợp lý, đáng tin).', 'office', 1, 20),
('8412ead3-0e55-56b4-baa0-ae4e9a6d9a94', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c402eec-e29f-5cde-a6a2-b5f3509e8f9e', '0f739503-60be-5288-9d93-ae26ff495fdc', 'wicked', '/ˈwɪkɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Xấu xa, độc địa, có ý định làm hại.', 'morally bad, evil, or intending to cause harm and pain to other people.', 'The witch in the story was known for her wicked spells and cruel laughter.', 'Mụ phù thủy trong câu chuyện nổi tiếng với những câu thần chú độc ác và tiếng cười tàn nhẫn.', '{\"en\": \"The auditor uncovered a wicked scheme designed to misappropriate company funds over several years.\", \"vi\": \"Kiểm toán viên đã phát hiện ra một âm mưu độc hại nhằm biển thủ ngân sách công ty trong nhiều năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-ljspeech-9e38cc8b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-cori-9e38cc8b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wicked-15c7a8ec.webp', '[\"evil\", \"malicious\", \"sinister\"]', '[\"good\", \"virtuous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wicked intention\", \"meaning\": \"ý định độc ác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wicked scheme\", \"meaning\": \"mưu đồ xấu xa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wickedness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"wickedly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-cori-9e38cc8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-aru0-9e38cc8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-aru5-9e38cc8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-aru6-9e38cc8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-aru10-9e38cc8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-aru9-9e38cc8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-aru3-9e38cc8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-aru7-9e38cc8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wicked-aru8-9e38cc8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p