('20eaa847-9b7f-5486-b78f-b7290bd76bf3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c402eec-e29f-5cde-a6a2-b5f3509e8f9e', '0f739503-60be-5288-9d93-ae26ff495fdc', 'intimidating', '/ɪnˈtɪmɪdeɪtɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Khiến người khác cảm thấy sợ hãi hoặc lo lắng.', 'causing a person to feel afraid or worried about something.', 'The professor\'s strict demeanor could be quite intimidating to new students.', 'Thái độ nghiêm khắc của giáo sư có thể khá đáng sợ đối với những sinh viên mới.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager\'s demanding style seemed intimidating to the junior staff members.\", \"vi\": \"Phong cách đòi hỏi khắt khe của vị quản lý mới dường như đáng sợ với nhân viên cấp dưới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-ljspeech-2a7f890b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-cori-2a7f890b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intimidating-d0920772.webp', '[\"frightening\", \"daunting\", \"scary\"]', '[\"reassuring\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intimidating presence\", \"meaning\": \"sự hiện diện đáng sợ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intimidating manner\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ đáng sợ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intimate\", \"note_vi\": \"intimate là thân mật, khác intimidating là đáng sợ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intimidate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intimidation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-cori-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru0-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru5-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru6-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru10-2a7f890b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru9-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru3-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru7-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru8-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-aru2-2a7f890b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-ljspeech-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt408-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt138-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt624-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt396-2a7f890b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt498-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt132-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt288-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt42-2a7f890b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intimidating-lt90-2a7f890b.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm với intimate (thân mật) vì gần giống mặt chữ.', 'office', 1, 22),
('d3dd8871-e761-5f46-b560-6289e18ea5dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c402eec-e29f-5cde-a6a2-b5f3509e8f9e', '0f739503-60be-5288-9d93-ae26ff495fdc', 'strategic', 'UK: /strəˈtiː.dʒɪk/ | US: /strəˈtiː.dʒɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thuộc về chiến lược', 'relating to the long-term planning and deliberate actions designed to achieve a major objective.', 'The company developed a strategic plan for global expansion.', 'Công ty đã phát triển một kế hoạch chiến lược để mở rộng toàn cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The Board of Directors met to discuss strategic plans for international expansion.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã họp để thảo luận về các kế hoạch chiến lược nhằm mở rộng ra quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-ljspeech-78a6f39c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-cori-78a6f39c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/strategic-b7785c9d.webp', '[\"calculated\", \"tactical\", \"planned\"]', '[\"unplanned\", \"random\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strategic partnership\", \"meaning\": \"đối tác chiến lược\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strategic planning\", \"meaning\": \"lập kế hoạch chiến lược\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strategic location\", \"meaning\": \"vị trí chiến lược\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"strategy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"strategically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-cori-78a6f39c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-aru0-78a6f39c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-aru5-78a6f39c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-aru6-78a6f39c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-aru10-78a6f39c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-aru9-78a6f39c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strategic-aru3-78a6f39c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stra