('18cf62fa-9c99-50dd-9a82-a2ce36487d08', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'craft', 'UK: /krɑːft/ | US: /kræft/', 'B1', 'noun', 'đồ thủ công', 'An activity or object involving skill in making things by hand in a traditional way.', 'She sells beautiful handmade crafts at the market.', 'Cô ấy bán những món đồ thủ công mỹ nghệ đẹp tại chợ.', '{\"en\": \"The trade fair will feature unique handmade crafts produced by regional artisans.\", \"vi\": \"Hội chợ thương mại sẽ trưng bày các sản phẩm thủ công độc đáo do các nghệ nhân trong vùng sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-ljspeech-8e3e95f3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-cori-8e3e95f3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/craft-38a75b6b.webp', '[\"handicraft\", \"artisanry\", \"trade\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"craft fair\", \"meaning\": \"hội chợ đồ thủ công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handcrafted goods\", \"meaning\": \"hàng hóa làm thủ công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"draft\", \"note_vi\": \"Bản phác thảo tài liệu, hợp đồng hoặc bản vẽ kỹ thuật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"crafted\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"craftsman\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-cori-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru0-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru5-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru6-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru10-8e3e95f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru9-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru3-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru7-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru8-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-aru2-8e3e95f3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-ljspeech-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt408-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt138-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt624-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt396-8e3e95f3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt498-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt132-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt288-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt42-8e3e95f3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/craft-lt90-8e3e95f3.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể làm danh từ (đồ thủ công/kỹ nghệ) hoặc động từ (chế tác tỉ mỉ).', 'general business', 1, 0),
('89377f32-d55c-57db-bd4f-61d0216b31dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'inconsequential', '/ɪnˌkɒnsɪˈkwenʃl/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Không quan trọng, không đáng kể.', 'not important or significant enough to matter or have an effect.', 'The slight delay in delivery proved inconsequential because the event was postponed.', 'Sự chậm trễ nhỏ trong việc giao hàng hóa ra không đáng kể vì sự kiện đã bị hoãn lại.', '{\"en\": \"The minor delay in shipping proved to be inconsequential to the client\'s total satisfaction.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chậm trễ nhỏ trong giao hàng hóa ra không đáng kể đối với sự hài lòng tổng thể của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-ljspeech-fcedc629.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-cori-fcedc629.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inconsequential-86785e32.webp', '[\"insignificant\", \"trivial\", \"minor\"]', '[\"important\", \"significant\", \"crucial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inconsequential detail\", \"meaning\": \"chi tiết không đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem inconsequential\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ không quan trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consequential\", \"note_vi\": \"Consequential nghĩa là quan trọng hoặc là hậu quả của cái gì.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inconsequence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"inconsequentially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-cori-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru0-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru5-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru6-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru10-fcedc629.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru9-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru3-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru7-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru8-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-aru2-fcedc629.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-ljspeech-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt408-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt138-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt624-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt396-fcedc629.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt498-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt132-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt288-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt42-fcedc629.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsequential-lt90-fcedc629.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố in- mang nghĩa phủ định: inconsequential nghĩa là không quan trọng.', 'business', 1, 1),
('e7628851-f26e-5dd9-98cd-d558bfc7a7e2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'reconcile', '/ˈrekənsaɪl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Khôi phục mối quan hệ hòa thuận giữa những người có mâu thuẫn.', 'to find a way to make two different ideas, situations, or people agree with each other.', 'After years of disagreement, the brothers finally decided to reconcile.', 'Sau nhiều năm bất đồng, hai anh em cuối cùng đã quyết định hòa giải.', '{\"en\": \"The accountant managed to reconcile the company financial records with the bank statements.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên kế toán đã đối chiếu thành công hồ sơ tài chính của công ty với sao kê ngân hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-ljspeech-14a8e5f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-cori-14a8e5f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reconcile-aa24dec1.webp', '[\"resolve\", \"harmonize\", \"settle\"]', '[\"estrange\", \"clash\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reconcile accounts\", \"meaning\": \"đối chiếu tài khoản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reconcile differences\", \"meaning\": \"hòa giải những khác biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conciliate\", \"note_vi\": \"conciliate là xoa dịu, làm giảm sự giận dữ của ai đó\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reconciliation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-cori-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru0-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru5-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru6-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru10-14a8e5f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru9-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru3-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru7-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru8-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-aru2-14a8e5f4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-ljspeech-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt408-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt138-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt624-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt396-14a8e5f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt498-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt132-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt288-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt42-14a8e5f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reconcile-lt90-14a8e5f4.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC tài chính, reconcile thường mang nghĩa là đối chiếu số liệu cho khớp.', 'finance', 1, 2),
('ef70f85a-50a4-53fb-9b20-4bb5e1bdb2dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'fleet', '/fliːt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một nhóm tàu, xe cộ hoặc máy bay hoạt động cùng nhau.', 'a group of ships, buses, taxis, or planes moving together or owned by one company.', 'The company expanded its delivery services by adding new vans to its fleet.', 'Công ty đã mở rộng dịch vụ giao hàng bằng cách bổ sung thêm nhiều xe tải mới vào đội xe của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics company purchased a new fleet of electric trucks to reduce emissions.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty hậu cần đã mua một đội xe tải điện mới để giảm lượng khí thải.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-ljspeech-f35f940f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-cori-f35f940f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fleet-76124e37.webp', '[\"group\", \"armada\", \"convoy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fleet management\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý đội xe/tàu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"merchant fleet\", \"meaning\": \"đội tàu thương mại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flee\", \"note_vi\": \"flee là động từ chạy trốn, phát âm gần giống fleet.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-cori-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru0-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru5-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru6-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru10-f35f940f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru9-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru3-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru7-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru8-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-aru2-f35f940f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-ljspeech-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt408-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt138-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt624-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt396-f35f940f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt498-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt132-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt288-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt42-f35f940f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fleet-lt90-f35f940f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, fleet thường chỉ đội xe giao hàng (delivery fleet) của công ty vận chuyển.', 'business', 1, 3),
('36530bc4-e096-5bb4-afea-360e0e12ff1a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'assertive', '/əˈsɜːtɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tự tin và thẳng thắn trong việc bày tỏ ý kiến, yêu cầu.', 'behaving in a confident and direct way when expressing opinions or making requests.', 'You need to be more assertive if you want your ideas to be heard in the meeting.', 'Bạn cần quyết đoán hơn nếu muốn ý kiến của mình được lắng nghe trong cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"An assertive negotiator can secure better terms for the company during contract talks.\", \"vi\": \"Một nhà đàm phán quyết đoán có thể đảm bảo các điều khoản tốt hơn cho công ty trong các cuộc đàm phán hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-ljspeech-5b0d5e35.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-cori-5b0d5e35.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assertive-37271f22.webp', '[\"confident\", \"decisive\", \"forthright\"]', '[\"passive\", \"timid\", \"submissive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"assertive communication\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp quyết đoán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"assertive behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi tự tin, thẳng thắn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be assertive\", \"meaning\": \"tỏ ra quyết đoán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"aggressive\", \"note_vi\": \"aggressive là hung hăng, gây hấn; assertive là tự tin nhưng vẫn tôn trọng người khác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assert\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"assertively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assertiveness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-cori-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru0-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru5-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru6-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru10-5b0d5e35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru9-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru3-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru7-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru8-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-aru2-5b0d5e35.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-ljspeech-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt408-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt138-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt624-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt396-5b0d5e35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt498-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt132-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt288-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt42-5b0d5e35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assertive-lt90-5b0d5e35.mp3\"]}}', 'Assertive khác aggressive: assertive là tự tin lịch sự, aggressive là hung hăng; người Việt hay nhầm hai từ này.', 'hr', 1, 4),
('b6461b7a-3b4d-5d34-8754-15a71efc27e7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'gale', '/ɡeɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cơn gió rất mạnh, thường đi kèm với mưa hoặc bão.', 'a very strong wind, often causing damage or danger.', 'The ship struggled to stay on course during the fierce gale.', 'Con tàu phải vật lộn để giữ đúng lộ trình trong cơn gió mạnh dữ dội.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor corporate event was canceled because of a sudden gale warning.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện ngoài trời của công ty đã bị hủy vì cảnh báo gió lớn đột ngột.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-ljspeech-b449ee4c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-cori-b449ee4c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gale-659d2ae1.webp', '[\"tempest\", \"storm\", \"windstorm\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"gale-force winds\", \"meaning\": \"sức gió mạnh như bão\"}, {\"phrase\": \"howling gale\", \"meaning\": \"cơn gió rít liên hồi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"gate\", \"note_vi\": \"gate là cái cổng, gale là cơn gió mạnh\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-cori-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru0-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru5-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru6-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru10-b449ee4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru9-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru3-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru7-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru8-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-aru2-b449ee4c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-ljspeech-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt408-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt138-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt624-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt396-b449ee4c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt498-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt132-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt288-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt42-b449ee4c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gale-lt90-b449ee4c.mp3\"]}}', 'Gale chỉ gió rất mạnh, cấp độ dưới bão lớn (hurricane/typhoon).', 'travel', 1, 5),
('3f35b8d6-c97d-596f-901a-42394d50abb7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'stingy', '/ˈstɪndʒi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'keo kiệt, không muốn chi tiêu hoặc chia sẻ', 'unwilling to spend money or give things to other people even when necessary.', 'He\'s so stingy that he rarely buys anyone a gift.', 'Anh ấy keo kiệt đến nỗi hiếm khi mua quà cho ai.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was too stingy to approve the budget for new office equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý quá keo kiệt để phê duyệt ngân sách cho thiết bị văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-ljspeech-5115e200.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-cori-5115e200.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stingy-bebf0cbb.webp', '[\"mean\", \"cheap\"]', '[\"generous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stingy with money\", \"meaning\": \"keo kiệt tiền bạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stingy person\", \"meaning\": \"người bủn xỉn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stinginess\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-cori-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru0-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru5-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru6-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru10-5115e200.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru9-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru3-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru7-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru8-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-aru2-5115e200.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-ljspeech-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt408-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt138-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt624-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt396-5115e200.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt498-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt132-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt288-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt42-5115e200.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stingy-lt90-5115e200.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ tính cách không tốt trong môi trường làm việc.', 'office', 1, 6),
('a0487780-6c20-54bd-a81b-0b7b994e7547', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'portend', '/pɔːˈtend/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Báo trước, là dấu hiệu của một sự kiện sắp xảy ra.', 'to be a sign that something, especially something bad, is going to happen.', 'Economic analysts warn that falling housing prices could portend a major financial crisis.', 'Các nhà phân tích kinh tế cảnh báo rằng giá nhà đất sụt giảm có thể báo hiệu một cuộc khủng hoảng tài chính lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden drop in stock prices May portend a difficult quarter for the company.\", \"vi\": \"Sự sụt giảm đột ngột của giá cổ phiếu có thể báo hiệu một quý khó khăn cho công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-ljspeech-4543e632.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-cori-4543e632.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/portend-9993f1a8.webp', '[\"foreshadow\", \"predict\", \"herald\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"portend disaster\", \"meaning\": \"báo trước thảm họa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"portend change\", \"meaning\": \"báo trước sự thay đổi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pretend\", \"note_vi\": \"giả vờ, viết gần giống nhưng nghĩa khác hoàn toàn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"portent\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"portentous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-cori-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru0-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru5-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru6-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru10-4543e632.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru9-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru3-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru7-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru8-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-aru2-4543e632.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-ljspeech-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt408-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt138-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt624-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt396-4543e632.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt498-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt132-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt288-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt42-4543e632.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portend-lt90-4543e632.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang sắc thái báo hiệu một điều gì đó tiêu cực hoặc nghiêm trọng.', 'finance', 1, 7),
('bc008542-45a6-53a8-90d1-ba7cbda3600a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6c532192-d501-5763-8886-6ba202e68783', '08c2a60f-0887-56ec-98e0-2ae84b5bbe5b', 'bistro', '/ˈbiːstrəʊ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một nhà hàng nhỏ, thường phục vụ các món ăn đơn giản.', 'a small, informal restaurant that serves simple meals and drinks at reasonable prices.', 'We had a lovely dinner at a cozy French bistro downtown.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một bữa tối tuyệt vời tại một quán bistro Pháp ấm cúng ở trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The corporate team decided to host their welcome lunch at a local French bistro.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ công ty đã quyết định tổ chức bữa trưa chào mừng tại một quán ăn kiểu Pháp ở địa phương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-ljspeech-b7e6f2ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-cori-b7e6f2ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bistro-53c417fd.webp', '[\"cafe\", \"eatery\", \"restaurant\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cozy bistro\", \"meaning\": \"quán ăn nhỏ ấm cúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local bistro\", \"meaning\": \"quán ăn nhỏ ở địa phương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"buffet\", \"note_vi\": \"buffet là tiệc tự chọn, còn bistro là quán ăn nhỏ phục vụ tại bàn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-cori-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru0-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru5-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru6-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru10-b7e6f2ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru9-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru3-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru7-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru8-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-aru2-b7e6f2ea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-ljspeech-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt408-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt138-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt624-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt396-b7e6f2ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt498-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt132-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt288-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt42-b7e6f2ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bistro-lt90-b7e6f2ea.mp3\"]}}', 'Bistro là quán ăn nhỏ, ấm cúng và bình dân, nguồn gốc từ tiếng Pháp.', 'dining', 1, 8)
