('545c7418-a582-527a-a2fd-c44025f34e2d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'civil war', '/sɪvəl wɔː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cuộc chiến giữa các nhóm hoặc phe phái trong cùng một quốc gia.', 'armed conflict between groups within the same country or nation.', 'The country was ravaged by a brutal civil war for many years.', 'Đất nước bị tàn phá bởi một cuộc nội chiến tàn khốc trong nhiều năm.', '{\"en\": \"The civil war disrupted trade and forced many companies to close offices.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc nội chiến làm gián đoạn thương mại và buộc nhiều công ty đóng văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-ljspeech-a0d2a85d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-cori-a0d2a85d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/civil-war-32e340be.webp', '[\"internal conflict\", \"intrastate war\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"civil war broke out\", \"meaning\": \"nội chiến bùng nổ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"civil war ravaged\", \"meaning\": \"nội chiến tàn phá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"during civil war\", \"meaning\": \"trong thời nội chiến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"civil law\", \"note_vi\": \"civil law là luật dân sự, không phải chiến tranh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"civil\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"civilian\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-cori-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru0-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru5-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru6-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru10-a0d2a85d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru9-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru3-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru7-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru8-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-aru2-a0d2a85d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-ljspeech-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt408-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt138-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt624-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt396-a0d2a85d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt498-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt132-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt288-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt42-a0d2a85d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/civil-war-lt90-a0d2a85d.mp3\"]}}', 'Civil war là nội chiến, giữa các phe trong nước, không phải chiến tranh với nước ngoài.', 'other', 1, 6),
('02f43f6d-6e0b-5609-967a-7aeb01cd59ef', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'cooperative', '/kəʊˈɒpərətɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Sẵn lòng làm việc cùng người khác để đạt mục tiêu chung.', 'willing to work together with others to achieve a common goal.', 'The local residents were exceptionally cooperative with the police during the investigation.', 'Người dân địa phương đã cực kỳ hợp tác với cảnh sát trong suốt cuộc điều tra.', '{\"en\": \"The staff members were very cooperative during the transition to the new software system.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên đã rất hợp tác trong quá trình chuyển đổi sang hệ thống phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-ljspeech-78e5cf37.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-cori-78e5cf37.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cooperative-9ade50b5.webp', '[\"helpful\", \"collaborative\", \"supportive\"]', '[\"uncooperative\", \"unhelpful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cooperative effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực hợp tác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cooperative relationship\", \"meaning\": \"mối quan hệ hợp tác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"corporate\", \"note_vi\": \"corporate thuộc về tập đoàn, cooperative là hợp tác\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cooperate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cooperation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-cori-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru0-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru5-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru6-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru10-78e5cf37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru9-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru3-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru7-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru8-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-aru2-78e5cf37.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-ljspeech-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt408-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt138-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt624-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt396-78e5cf37.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt498-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt132-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt288-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt42-78e5cf37.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cooperative-lt90-78e5cf37.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn với \'corporate\' (thuộc về doanh nghiệp/tập đoàn).', 'hr', 1, 7),
('4607013a-745f-5b22-871a-17dd9f1628cd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'call off', 'UK: /kɔːl ɒf/ | US: /kɔːl ɔːf/', 'B1', 'v.phr', 'hủy bỏ', 'to decide that a planned event, activity, or agreement will not happen', 'We had to call off the meeting due to bad weather.', 'Chúng tôi phải hủy cuộc họp vì thời tiết xấu.', '{\"en\": \"The organizers had to call off the outdoor product presentation due to severe weather conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Ban tổ chức đã phải hủy bỏ buổi giới thiệu sản phẩm ngoài trời do điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-ljspeech-3ebdaad2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-cori-3ebdaad2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/call-off-b67f53c4.webp', '[\"cancel\", \"scrap\", \"abort\"]', '[\"proceed with\", \"continue\", \"carry out\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"call off a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"hủy một cuộc họp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"call off the event\", \"meaning\": \"hủy bỏ sự kiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"postpone\", \"note_vi\": \"Call off là hủy bỏ hoàn toàn, còn postpone (hoặc put off) là hoãn sang thời điểm khác.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-cori-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru0-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru5-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru6-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru10-3ebdaad2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru9-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru3-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru7-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru8-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-aru2-3ebdaad2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-ljspeech-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt408-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt138-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt624-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt396-3ebdaad2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt498-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt132-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt288-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt42-3ebdaad2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-off-lt90-3ebdaad2.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm động từ (phrasal verb) đồng nghĩa với \'cancel\'. Nếu tân ngữ là đại từ, đại từ phải nằm ở giữa (ví dụ: call it off).', 'general business', 1, 8),
('83896575-56da-530b-a14e-d7171c3f7fb8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'replete', '/rɪˈpliːt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Đầy đủ, tràn ngập một cái gì đó.', 'filled with something, or having a large amount of something.', 'The book is replete with historical facts and fascinating anecdotes.', 'Cuốn sách tràn đầy những sự thật lịch sử và những giai thoại hấp dẫn.', '{\"en\": \"The annual financial report is replete with charts showing our steady growth.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo tài chính hàng năm tràn ngập các biểu đồ cho thấy sự tăng trưởng ổn định của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-ljspeech-e6040ab1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-cori-e6040ab1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/replete-691c58d9.webp', '[\"full\", \"abundant\", \"teeming\"]', '[\"empty\", \"lacking\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"replete with\", \"meaning\": \"đầy rẫy, tràn ngập cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"complete\", \"note_vi\": \"complete là hoàn thành, đầy đủ; replete là tràn ngập\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"repletion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-cori-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru0-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru5-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru6-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru10-e6040ab1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru9-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru3-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru7-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru8-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-aru2-e6040ab1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-ljspeech-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt408-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt138-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt624-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt396-e6040ab1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt498-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt132-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt288-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt42-e6040ab1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/replete-lt90-e6040ab1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với giới từ \'with\' để chỉ trạng thái tràn ngập.', 'business', 1, 9),
('a9e232c9-8cbb-5670-b397-d8f110d9c68d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'equalizer', '/ˈiːkwəlaɪzə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Thiết bị hoặc yếu tố giúp cân bằng, làm cho mọi thứ công bằng hơn.', 'a thing that makes different people or situations have the same level of opportunity.', 'Access to the internet serves as a powerful social equalizer for remote communities.', 'Khả năng truy cập internet đóng vai trò là một yếu tố cân bằng xã hội mạnh mẽ cho các cộng đồng vùng sâu vùng xa.', '{\"en\": \"The new software acts as an equalizer, allowing small firms to compete with large corporations.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới đóng vai trò như một công cụ cân bằng, cho phép các công ty nhỏ cạnh tranh với các tập đoàn lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-ljspeech-2827c0d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-cori-2827c0d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/equalizer-982f0dc6.webp', '[\"leveler\", \"balancer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"great equalizer\", \"meaning\": \"công cụ cân bằng tuyệt vời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"social equalizer\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố cân bằng xã hội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"equalize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"equality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-cori-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru0-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru5-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru6-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru10-2827c0d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru9-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru3-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru7-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru8-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-aru2-2827c0d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-ljspeech-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt408-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt138-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt624-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt396-2827c0d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt498-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt132-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt288-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt42-2827c0d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/equalizer-lt90-2827c0d6.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh xã hội hoặc kinh doanh để nói về sự công bằng.', 'business', 1, 10),
('f4818032-0828-52c6-a834-f1fcf7affb20', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'teeny-weeny', '/ˌtiːni ˈwiːni/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất nhỏ, bé tí.', 'extremely small in size or amount, often used in informal spoken English.', 'There is still a teeny-weeny possibility that our team will win the contract.', 'Vẫn có một khả năng bé tẹo rằng đội của chúng tôi sẽ giành được hợp đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The client asked for a teeny-weeny adjustment to the final design of the logo.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng yêu cầu một điều chỉnh nhỏ xíu đối với thiết kế logo cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-ljspeech-ff1f4932.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-cori-ff1f4932.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/teeny-weeny-dbb79cbf.webp', '[\"tiny\", \"miniature\"]', '[\"huge\", \"enormous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"teeny-weeny bit\", \"meaning\": \"một chút xíu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tiny\", \"note_vi\": \"Tiny dùng trong giao tiếp bình thường, teeny-weeny rất thân mật/khẩu ngữ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-cori-ff1f4932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru0-ff1f4932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru5-ff1f4932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru6-ff1f4932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru10-ff1f4932.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru9-ff1f4932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru3-ff1f4932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru7-ff1f4932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru8-ff1f4932.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/teeny-weeny-aru2-ff1f4932.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {