('5a984856-411d-5038-9e0f-9d3d8170f886', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'perfumed', '/ˈpɜːfjuːmd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có mùi thơm dễ chịu, thường là do nước hoa hoặc hương liệu.', 'having a pleasant sweet smell, often because a sweet substance has been added.', 'The perfumed soap left a lovely scent on her skin.', 'Xà phòng thơm để lại một mùi hương dễ chịu trên da cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury hotel provides guests with perfumed soaps and high-quality toiletries in every room.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn sang trọng cung cấp cho khách xà phòng thơm và đồ vệ sinh cá nhân chất lượng cao trong mỗi phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-ljspeech-cfd57551.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-cori-cfd57551.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/perfumed-846efaf4.webp', '[\"scented\", \"fragrant\", \"sweet-smelling\"]', '[\"smelly\", \"malodorous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"perfumed soap\", \"meaning\": \"xà phòng thơm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perfumed candle\", \"meaning\": \"nến thơm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scented\", \"note_vi\": \"scented là có mùi thơm tự nhiên hoặc nhân tạo, perfumed thường là do thêm nước hoa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"perfume\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"perfume\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-cori-cfd57551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-aru0-cfd57551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-aru5-cfd57551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-aru6-cfd57551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-aru10-cfd57551.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-aru9-cfd57551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perfumed-aru3-cfd57551.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati