('690b1b4c-37b3-5bb9-9fe5-417dcf095840', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'composer', 'UK: /kəmˈpəʊzə/ | US: /kəmˈpoʊzər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'nhà soạn nhạc', 'A person who creates original pieces of music, especially as a professional career.', 'The famous composer wrote a new opera.', 'Nhà soạn nhạc nổi tiếng đã viết một vở opera mới.', '{\"en\": \"The film company commissioned a famous composer to create the soundtrack.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty điện ảnh đã thuê một nhà soạn nhạc nổi tiếng tạo phần nhạc phim.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-ljspeech-874ad8df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-cori-874ad8df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/composer-21fa7f0b.webp', '[\"musician\", \"songwriter\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"classical composer\", \"meaning\": \"nhà soạn nhạc cổ điển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"resident composer\", \"meaning\": \"nhà soạn nhạc thường trú\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compose\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"composition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-cori-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru0-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru5-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru6-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru10-874ad8df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru9-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru3-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru7-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru8-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-aru2-874ad8df.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-ljspeech-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt408-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt138-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt624-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt396-874ad8df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt498-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt132-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt288-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt42-874ad8df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/composer-lt90-874ad8df.mp3\"]}}', 'Hậu tố -er chỉ người tạo ra bài nhạc/bản nhạc.', 'entertainment', 1, 28),
('0bd25714-ee96-56e6-9beb-087d0119dd9d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '6ebc0bf5-9022-540e-a5a4-d43188a23584', '85e8bffd-84b4-5ed1-b0d2-d75e1ddb4558', 'overrule', '/ˌəʊvəˈruːl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Bác bỏ, hủy bỏ một quyết định hoặc phán quyết.', 'to use official power to stop a previous choice or rule from being used.', 'The judge decided to overrule the objection raised by the defense lawyer.', 'Thẩm phán quyết định bác bỏ sự phản đối của luật sư bào chữa.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors voted to overrule the CEO\'s plan to reduce the marketing budget.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã bỏ phiếu bác bỏ kế hoạch cắt giảm ngân sách tiếp thị của giám đốc điều hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-ljspeech-d3c2f320.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-cori-d3c2f320.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overrule-5349ae26.webp', '[\"override\", \"overturn\"]', '[\"uphold\", \"support\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"overrule an objection\", \"meaning\": \"bác bỏ sự phản đối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overrule a decision\", \"meaning\": \"hủy bỏ một quyết định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"overrun\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là tràn ngập hoặc vượt quá thời gian/ngân sách.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-cori-d3c2f320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-aru0-d3c2f320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-aru5-d3c2f320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-aru6-d3c2f320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-aru10-d3c2f320.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-aru9-d3c2f320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-aru3-d3c2f320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-aru7-d3c2f320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overrule-aru8-d3c2f320.mp3\", \"/storage/