('3df4a8be-176a-5c5d-a6a6-807262000533', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'idolize', '/ˈaɪdəlaɪz/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Tôn sùng, ngưỡng mộ ai đó một cách mù quáng.', 'to admire and love someone very much, often so much that you think they are perfect.', 'Aspiring entrepreneurs often idolize successful CEOs who built global companies from scratch.', 'Các doanh nhân trẻ đầy triển vọng thường tôn sùng những giám đốc điều hành thành công, những người đã xây dựng các công ty toàn cầu từ con số không.', '{\"en\": \"Many junior employees idolize the chief executive officer for her remarkable leadership and business success.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên cấp dưới tôn sùng giám đốc điều hành vì khả năng lãnh đạo xuất chúng và thành công kinh doanh của bà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-ljspeech-6fd58346.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-cori-6fd58346.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/idolize-4e64c376.webp', '[\"worship\", \"adore\", \"revere\"]', '[\"despise\", \"hate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"idolize someone\", \"meaning\": \"tôn sùng ai đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"idealize\", \"note_vi\": \"idealize là lý tưởng hóa, idolize là thần tượng hóa/tôn sùng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"idol\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"idolatry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-cori-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru0-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru5-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru6-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru10-6fd58346.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru9-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru3-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru7-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru8-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-aru2-6fd58346.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-ljspeech-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt408-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt138-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt624-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt396-6fd58346.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt498-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt132-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt288-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt42-6fd58346.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/idolize-lt90-6fd58346.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt với \'idealize\' (lý tưởng hóa một sự việc/con người).', 'hr', 1, 0),
('5bae6d76-f819-5d23-92b0-f1eb24acc075', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'conservationist', '/ˌkɒnsəˈveɪʃənɪst/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Người hoạt động để bảo vệ môi trường và các loài động vật hoang dã.', 'a person who works actively to protect nature, wildlife, and the natural environment from damage.', 'A dedicated conservationist spent his life working to protect endangered species.', 'Một nhà bảo tồn tận tâm đã dành cả đời mình để bảo vệ các loài có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired a conservationist to advise on its new environmental sustainability policy.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty thuê một nhà bảo tồn để tư vấn về chính sách bền vững môi trường mới của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-ljspeech-98aa3fd4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-cori-98aa3fd4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conservationist-1e8ef0df.webp', '[\"environmentalist\", \"preservationist\", \"ecologist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wildlife conservationist\", \"meaning\": \"nhà bảo tồn động vật hoang dã\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dedicated conservationist\", \"meaning\": \"nhà bảo tồn tận tâm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"marine conservationist\", \"meaning\": \"nhà bảo tồn biển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conservative\", \"note_vi\": \"conservative nghĩa là bảo thủ (chính trị/thái độ), không phải người bảo vệ môi trường\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conservation\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conserve\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conservative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-cori-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru0-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru5-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru6-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru10-98aa3fd4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru9-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru3-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru7-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru8-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-aru2-98aa3fd4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-ljspeech-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt408-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt138-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt624-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt396-98aa3fd4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt498-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt132-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt288-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt42-98aa3fd4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conservationist-lt90-98aa3fd4.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm \'conservationist\' (bảo tồn thiên nhiên) với \'conservative\' (bảo thủ về chính trị).', 'nature', 1, 1),
('6906d3cb-50fa-51df-ae74-d586c81c03f0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'superposition', '/ˌsuːpəpəˈzɪʃn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự chồng chất, đặt lên nhau (thường trong vật lý, toán học).', 'the action of placing one thing on top of another, or the state of being placed.', 'The principle of superposition is fundamental in quantum mechanics.', 'Nguyên lý chồng chất là cơ bản trong cơ học lượng tử.', '{\"en\": \"The research team analyzed the superposition of different light waves in the laboratory.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu đã phân tích sự chồng chất của các sóng ánh sáng khác nhau trong phòng thí nghiệm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-ljspeech-de270303.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-cori-de270303.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/superposition-1facb024.webp', '[\"overlap\", \"layering\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"quantum superposition\", \"meaning\": \"sự chồng chất lượng tử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"principle of superposition\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên lý chồng chất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"superpose\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-cori-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru0-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru5-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru6-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru10-de270303.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru9-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru3-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru7-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru8-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-aru2-de270303.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-ljspeech-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt408-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt138-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt624-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt396-de270303.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt498-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt132-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt288-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt42-de270303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/superposition-lt90-de270303.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang tính học thuật cao, thường dùng trong vật lý hoặc địa chất.', 'academic', 1, 2),
('0fec6d66-c2bb-5ddb-83eb-645d14c62904', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'shuffle', '/ˈʃʌfl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cách đi bộ kéo lê chân, thường do mệt mỏi hoặc không muốn di chuyển nhanh.', 'the act of moving your feet slowly along the ground without lifting them up completely.', 'He walked with a slow shuffle, clearly tired after the long journey.', 'Anh ấy đi với bước chân lê chậm chạp, rõ ràng là mệt mỏi sau chuyến đi dài.', '{\"en\": \"The exhausted employee moved with a slow shuffle toward the office exit after the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên kiệt sức di chuyển với dáng đi lê bước chậm chạp về phía cửa văn phòng sau cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-ljspeech-187dc570.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-cori-187dc570.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shuffle-871f9a87.webp', '[\"drag\", \"scuff\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a slow shuffle\", \"meaning\": \"dáng đi lê bước chậm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"the shuffle of feet\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng chân lê trên sàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shuffle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-cori-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru0-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru5-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru6-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru10-187dc570.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru9-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru3-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru7-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru8-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-aru2-187dc570.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-ljspeech-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt408-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt138-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt624-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt396-187dc570.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt498-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt132-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt288-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt42-187dc570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shuffle-lt90-187dc570.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để mô tả dáng đi khi mệt mỏi hoặc già yếu.', 'daily', 1, 3),
('05f164dd-629e-5611-8672-ec42f47729f7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'wetland', '/ˈwɛtlænd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khu vực đất bị ngập nước thường xuyên hoặc theo mùa, có hệ sinh thái đặc trưng.', 'an area of land that is regularly covered with water and supports unique plants and animals.', 'Wetlands play a crucial role in filtering water and providing habitats for many species.', 'Đất ngập nước đóng vai trò quan trọng trong việc lọc nước và cung cấp môi trường sống cho nhiều loài.', '{\"en\": \"The government approved a project to restore the wetland area near the industrial zone.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ phê duyệt dự án phục hồi khu vực đất ngập nước gần khu công nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-ljspeech-9227cfa8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-cori-9227cfa8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wetland-f11bec9c.webp', '[\"marsh\", \"swamp\", \"bog\"]', '[\"dryland\", \"upland\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wetland conservation\", \"meaning\": \"bảo tồn đất ngập nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wetland ecosystem\", \"meaning\": \"hệ sinh thái đất ngập nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wetland habitat\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường sống đất ngập nước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"marsh\", \"note_vi\": \"marsh là loại wetland cụ thể có cỏ; wetland là thuật ngữ chung hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"wet\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"land\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-cori-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru0-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru5-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru6-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru10-9227cfa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru9-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru3-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru7-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru8-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-aru2-9227cfa8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-ljspeech-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt408-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt138-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt624-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt396-9227cfa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt498-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt132-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt288-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt42-9227cfa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wetland-lt90-9227cfa8.mp3\"]}}', 'Wetland là từ ghép: wet + land; nhớ nghĩa là vùng đất ngập nước, không phải đất ướt thông thường.', 'nature', 1, 4),
('5e1cff3b-215e-5522-bdef-0e49aa3b8f1a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'tack', 'UK: /tæk/ | US: /tæk/', 'B2', 'verb', 'ghim, đính', 'To fasten or attach a small paper or notice onto a surface using a sharp pin.', 'He tacked the notice to the board.', 'Anh ấy ghim thông báo vào bảng.', '{\"en\": \"Please tack the updated holiday schedule onto the staff notice board.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng ghim lịch nghỉ lễ cập nhật lên bảng thông báo của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-ljspeech-5de37ce0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-cori-5de37ce0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tack-239b2346.webp', '[\"pin\", \"fasten\", \"attach\", \"clip\"]', '[\"detach\", \"remove\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tack up\", \"meaning\": \"ghim/đính lên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tack onto\", \"meaning\": \"gắn thêm vào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"track\", \"note_vi\": \"track có nghĩa là theo dõi hoặc đường ray, khác với tack là ghim đính.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tack\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-cori-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru0-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru5-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru6-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru10-5de37ce0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru9-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru3-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru7-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru8-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-aru2-5de37ce0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-ljspeech-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt408-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt138-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt624-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt396-5de37ce0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt498-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt132-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt288-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt42-5de37ce0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tack-lt90-5de37ce0.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm động từ \'tack up\' thường được dùng khi treo/đính thông báo lên bảng bulletin board.', 'office', 1, 5),
('553a0f07-5cfd-59cf-85b5-47d8f7217bad', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'trilogy', '/ˈtrɪlədʒi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'một bộ gồm ba tác phẩm văn học, phim ảnh hoặc âm nhạc có liên quan đến nhau.', 'a series of three books, plays, or movies that have the same characters or subject.', '\"The Lord of the Rings\" is a famous fantasy trilogy.', '\"Chúa tể những chiếc nhẫn\" là một bộ ba tiểu thuyết giả tưởng nổi tiếng.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing director suggested creating a trilogy of short videos to promote the new product.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị đề xuất tạo một bộ ba video ngắn để quảng bá sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-ljspeech-b9b1dec7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-cori-b9b1dec7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trilogy-4122f109.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"film trilogy\", \"meaning\": \"bộ ba phim\"}, {\"phrase\": \"successful trilogy\", \"meaning\": \"bộ ba tác phẩm thành công\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-cori-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru0-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru5-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru6-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru10-b9b1dec7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru9-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru3-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru7-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru8-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-aru2-b9b1dec7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-ljspeech-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt408-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt138-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt624-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt396-b9b1dec7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt498-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt132-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt288-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt42-b9b1dec7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trilogy-lt90-b9b1dec7.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'tri-\' có nghĩa là ba (như triangle - hình tam giác).', 'media', 1, 6),
('b7df9f9c-48c7-5306-a9d9-b8ac3d618f27', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'diner', 'UK: /ˈdaɪnər/ | US: /ˈdaɪnər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'thực khách', 'a person who eats a meal, especially in a restaurant or public establishment.', 'The restaurant was full of happy diners.', 'Nhà hàng đầy những thực khách vui vẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The head chef personally greeted diners at their tables to ask about their experience.\", \"vi\": \"Bếp trưởng đã trực tiếp chào hỏi các thực khách tại bàn để hỏi thăm về trải nghiệm của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-ljspeech-322ffac5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-cori-322ffac5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diner-244f8ec8.webp', '[\"patron\", \"customer\", \"eater\", \"guest\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"satisfied diners\", \"meaning\": \"những thực khách hài lòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"frequent diner\", \"meaning\": \"khách ăn thường xuyên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dinner\", \"note_vi\": \"Dinner là bữa ăn tối (danh từ chỉ bữa ăn), còn diner là thực khách (người ăn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dine\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-cori-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru0-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru5-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru6-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru10-322ffac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru9-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru3-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru7-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru8-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-aru2-322ffac5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-ljspeech-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt408-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt138-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt624-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt396-322ffac5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt498-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt132-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt288-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt42-322ffac5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diner-lt90-322ffac5.mp3\"]}}', '\'Diner\' dùng để chỉ thực khách (người ăn), tránh nhầm với \'dinner\' (bữa ăn tối).', 'dining', 1, 7),
('709b68e5-d32a-50eb-ac71-f919105971b9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'eccentric', '/ɪkˈsentrɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có hành vi, tính cách hoặc sở thích khác thường, kỳ quặc.', 'behaving in a strange or unusual way that is different from most people.', 'My neighbor is an eccentric artist who paints his house a different color every month.', 'Hàng xóm của tôi là một nghệ sĩ lập dị, người sơn nhà mình một màu khác mỗi tháng.', '{\"en\": \"The eccentric designer decided to use bright purple chairs in the new conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế kỳ dị đã quyết định sử dụng những chiếc ghế màu tím sáng trong phòng họp mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-ljspeech-a77c1b28.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-cori-a77c1b28.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eccentric-95028ae9.webp', '[\"unusual\", \"weird\", \"peculiar\"]', '[\"normal\", \"conventional\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"eccentric behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi kỳ quặc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eccentric genius\", \"meaning\": \"thiên tài lập dị\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"concentric\", \"note_vi\": \"concentric nghĩa là đồng tâm, còn eccentric là kỳ quặc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eccentricity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"eccentrically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-cori-a77c1b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-aru0-a77c1b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-aru5-a77c1b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-aru6-a77c1b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-aru10-a77c1b28.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-aru9-a77c1b28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eccentric-aru3-a77c1b28.mp3\", \"/s