('9b3226e6-85d7-56a7-950a-519d0e097992', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'sphere', '/sfɪə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một vật thể hình tròn hoàn hảo, ba chiều.', 'a round object shaped like a ball where every point is the same distance from center.', 'The Earth is not a perfect sphere, but rather an oblate spheroid.', 'Trái Đất không phải là một hình cầu hoàn hảo, mà là một khối hình cầu dẹt.', '{\"en\": \"The new office design features a large glass sphere in the lobby to impress our clients.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế văn phòng mới có một quả cầu thủy tinh lớn ở sảnh để gây ấn tượng với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-ljspeech-f2954408.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-cori-f2954408.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sphere-878e5854.webp', '[\"ball\", \"globe\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"perfect sphere\", \"meaning\": \"hình cầu hoàn hảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sphere of influence\", \"meaning\": \"phạm vi ảnh hưởng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"spherical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-cori-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru0-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru5-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru6-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru10-f2954408.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru9-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru3-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru7-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru8-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-aru2-f2954408.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-ljspeech-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt408-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt138-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt624-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt396-f2954408.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt498-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt132-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt288-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt42-f2954408.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sphere-lt90-f2954408.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng thường dùng để chỉ lĩnh vực hoạt động hoặc phạm vi ảnh hưởng.', 'other', 1, 10),
('553dcfd2-34cc-5d9d-8244-ddda0d2847c7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'chaos', '/ˈkeɪɒs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tình trạng hoàn toàn không có trật tự hoặc trật tự.', 'a state of complete confusion and lack of order.', 'The unexpected flight cancellations created utter chaos at the airport terminal.', 'Việc hủy chuyến bay đột ngột đã tạo ra sự hỗn loạn tột cùng tại nhà ga sân bay.', '{\"en\": \"The cancelled flight created chaos at the airport check-in counter.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến bay bị hủy gây ra hỗn loạn tại quầy làm thủ tục sân bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-ljspeech-b23b4b8d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-cori-b23b4b8d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chaos-fdc5158d.webp', '[\"disorder\", \"confusion\", \"turmoil\"]', '[\"order\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"complete chaos\", \"meaning\": \"hỗn loạn hoàn toàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause chaos\", \"meaning\": \"gây hỗn loạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in chaos\", \"meaning\": \"trong tình trạng hỗn loạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chaise\", \"note_vi\": \"chaise là ghế dài, dễ nhầm chính tả với chaos.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"chaotic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"chaotically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-cori-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru0-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru5-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru6-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru10-b23b4b8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru9-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru3-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru7-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru8-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-aru2-b23b4b8d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-ljspeech-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt408-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt138-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt624-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt396-b23b4b8d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt498-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt132-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt288-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt42-b23b4b8d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chaos-lt90-b23b4b8d.mp3\"]}}', 'Chaos phát âm là /ˈkeɪ.ɒs/, tránh viết nhầm thành caos.', 'travel', 1, 11),
('e5144f04-eb24-59d1-8484-a60ec3fa5e6f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'process', '/ˈprəʊses/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi các bước hoặc hành động để đạt được kết quả.', 'A sequence of systematic procedures or operations performed to accomplish a desired objective.', 'Applying for a business visa can be a complex and time-consuming process.', 'Xin thị thực kinh doanh có thể là một quá trình phức tạp và tốn thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"The recruitment process involves several interviews and a final assessment by the department head.\", \"vi\": \"Quy trình tuyển dụng bao gồm nhiều cuộc phỏng vấn và đánh giá cuối cùng bởi trưởng bộ phận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-ljspeech-c2e2d662.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-cori-c2e2d662.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/process-064a082c.webp', '[\"procedure\", \"method\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"application process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình nộp đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"manufacturing process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình sản xuất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"process\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-cori-c2e2d662.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru0-c2e2d662.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru5-c2e2d662.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru6-c2e2d662.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru10-c2e2d662.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru9-c2e2d662.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru3-c2e2d662.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru7-c2e2d662.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru8-c2e2d662.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/process-aru2-c2