('293dcda2-e562-58a1-9f0c-2c219c74d8ab', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'significantly', '/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəntli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách có ý nghĩa, rõ rệt hoặc ở mức độ lớn.', 'in a way that is easy to see or large enough to be important.', 'The new policy has significantly reduced air pollution in the city.', 'Chính sách mới đã giảm đáng kể ô nhiễm không khí trong thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Sales increased significantly after the company launched the new advertising campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số bán hàng đã tăng đáng kể sau khi công ty tung ra chiến dịch quảng cáo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-ljspeech-acb03f8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-cori-acb03f8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/significantly-1e69b82d.webp', '[\"considerably\", \"substantially\", \"markedly\"]', '[\"slightly\", \"insignificantly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increase significantly\", \"meaning\": \"tăng đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"differ significantly\", \"meaning\": \"khác biệt đáng kể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"significant\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"significance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-cori-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru0-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru5-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru6-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru10-acb03f8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru9-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru3-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru7-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru8-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru2-acb03f8f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-ljspeech-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt408-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt138-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt624-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt396-acb03f8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt498-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt132-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt288-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt42-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-lt90-acb03f8f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với các động từ chỉ sự tăng/giảm trong biểu đồ.', 'finance', 1, 20),
('fdaa5b13-535d-5c4a-81a7-2489ab673ec8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'modulate', '/ˈmɒdjəleɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Thay đổi hoặc điều hòa cường độ, tần số, hoặc mức độ của cái gì đó.', 'to change or adjust the sound, speed, or intensity of something to make it suitable.', 'The speaker tried to modulate her voice to convey different emotions.', 'Người nói cố gắng điều chỉnh giọng mình để truyền tải những cảm xúc khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service representative learned to modulate her tone to handle difficult calls more effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên chăm sóc khách hàng đã học cách điều chỉnh giọng điệu để xử lý các cuộc gọi khó hiệu quả hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-ljspeech-1ddab0ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-cori-1ddab0ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/modulate-cdaef657.webp', '[\"adjust\", \"regulate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"modulate voice\", \"meaning\": \"điều chỉnh giọng nói\"}, {\"phrase\": \"modulate tone\", \"meaning\": \"điều chỉnh tông giọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"modulation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-cori-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru0-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru5-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru6-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru10-1ddab0ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru9-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru3-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru7-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru8-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-aru2-1ddab0ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-ljspeech-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt408-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt138-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt624-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt396-1ddab0ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt498-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt132-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt288-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt42-1ddab0ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/modulate-lt90-1ddab0ca.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh điều chỉnh giọng nói hoặc tín hiệu âm thanh.', 'business', 1, 21),
('9bc11da3-5e7c-52f6-862e-614022f21446', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'colloquialism', '/kəˈləʊkwiəlɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Từ hoặc cụm từ được sử dụng trong giao tiếp hàng ngày, không trang trọng.', 'a word or phrase used in everyday informal speech, not in formal writing.', '\"Kick the bucket\" is a colloquialism for \"to die.\"', '\"Kick the bucket\" là một từ thông tục để chỉ \"chết\".', '{\"en\": \"The trainer reminded staff to avoid colloquialism when writing official client emails.\", \"vi\": \"Người đào tạo nhắc nhở nhân viên tránh dùng từ thông tục khi viết email chính thức cho khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colloquialism-ljspeech-c5be4da3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colloquialism-cori-c5be4da3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/colloquialism-35c1e916.webp', '[\"informal expression\", \"slang\", \"vernacular\"]', '[\"formal language\", \"technical term\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"use a colloquialism\", \"meaning\": \"dùng từ thông tục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"informal colloquialism\", \"meaning\": \"từ thông tục không trang trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"regional colloquialism\", \"meaning\": \"từ thông tục theo vùng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"idiom\", \"note_vi\": \"idiom là thành ngữ có nghĩa bóng; colloquialism là từ/cụm từ thông tục hàng ngày\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"colloquial\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"colloquially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colloquialism-cori-c5be4da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colloquialism-aru0-c5be4da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colloquialism-aru5-c5be4da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colloquialism-aru6-c5be4da3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/colloquialism-aru10-c5be4da3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [