('13b39a82-36b5-5db3-9c55-aca0267de99d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'behalf', '', 'B2', 'preposition', 'thay mặt cho', 'as a representative of or for the benefit of another person or group.', 'We accept this award on behalf of the entire team.', 'Chúng tôi nhận giải thưởng này thay mặt cho cả đội.', '{\"en\": \"Mr. Harrison signed the lease agreement on behalf of the regional branch manager.\", \"vi\": \"Ông Harrison đã ký hợp đồng thuê thay mặt cho giám đốc chi nhánh khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-ljspeech-45ba5108.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-cori-45ba5108.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/behalf-0541b3aa.webp', '[\"in place of\", \"representing\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"on behalf of\", \"meaning\": \"thay mặt cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"act on behalf of\", \"meaning\": \"hành động nhân danh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"speak on behalf of\", \"meaning\": \"phát biểu thay mặt cho\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"in front of\", \"note_vi\": \"ở phía trước (vị trí không gian)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-cori-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru0-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru5-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru6-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru10-45ba5108.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru9-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru3-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru7-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru8-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-aru2-45ba5108.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-ljspeech-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt408-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt138-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt624-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt396-45ba5108.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt498-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt132-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt288-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt42-45ba5108.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behalf-lt90-45ba5108.mp3\"]}}', 'Gần như luôn dùng trong cụm cố định \'on behalf of someone\' (thay mặt cho ai).', 'corporate governance', 1, 24),
('d8a2f1f3-9f12-50e8-919f-cc1b6ea9fc22', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'troublesome', '/ˈtrʌblsəm/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây rắc rối, khó chịu hoặc phiền phức.', 'causing difficulty, annoyance, or problems, often in a way that is hard to fix.', 'We\'ve been having some troublesome issues with the old plumbing system.', 'Chúng tôi đã gặp phải một số vấn đề phiền toái với hệ thống ống nước cũ.', '{\"en\": \"The new software update has been troublesome for our accounting department throughout this entire week.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm mới đã gây rắc rối cho bộ phận kế toán suốt cả tuần này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-ljspeech-9c9634d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-cori-9c9634d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/troublesome-cb2535d3.webp', '[\"annoying\", \"problematic\"]', '[\"easy\", \"helpful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"troublesome issue\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề gây rắc rối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"troublesome child\", \"meaning\": \"đứa trẻ khó bảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"troubled\", \"note_vi\": \"troubled chỉ người đang lo âu, troublesome chỉ vật gây rắc rối.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trouble\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"trouble\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-cori-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru0-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru5-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru6-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru10-9c9634d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru9-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru3-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru7-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru8-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-aru2-9c9634d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-ljspeech-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt408-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt138-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt624-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt396-9c9634d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt498-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt132-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt288-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt42-9c9634d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/troublesome-lt90-9c9634d5.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cho sự vật, sự việc gây phiền toái.', 'office', 1, 25),
('e6be04b7-b171-55cf-8d91-43f64843b9c6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'bulky', '/ˈbʌlki/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cồng kềnh, chiếm nhiều không gian.', 'large and taking up a lot of space, often making it difficult to move or carry.', 'Travelers avoided carrying bulky luggage on the long hiking trail.', 'Du khách tránh mang theo hành lý cồng kềnh trên tuyến đường đi bộ dài.', '{\"en\": \"Shipping costs for bulky items like office furniture are usually higher than standard packages.\", \"vi\": \"Chi phí vận chuyển cho các mặt hàng cồng kềnh như nội thất văn phòng thường cao hơn các kiện hàng tiêu chuẩn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-ljspeech-9af59206.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-cori-9af59206.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bulky-ecf7960a.webp', '[\"cumbersome\", \"unwieldy\", \"oversized\"]', '[\"compact\", \"small\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bulky items\", \"meaning\": \"hàng hóa cồng kềnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bulky package\", \"meaning\": \"kiện hàng cồng kềnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heavy\", \"note_vi\": \"heavy là nặng, còn bulky là to lớn cồng kềnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bulk\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-cori-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru0-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru5-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru6-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru10-9af59206.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru9-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru3-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru7-9af59206.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bulky-aru8-9af59206.mp3\", \"/stor