('53ac4cec-ddf3-5968-a6cc-e0d0fce121b2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'specialty', 'UK: /ˈspɛʃəlti/ | US: /ˈspɛʃəlti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'đặc sản, chuyên môn', 'a particular subject, skill, or product that a person or place focuses on', 'Italian food is the restaurant\'s specialty.', 'Món ăn Ý là đặc sản của nhà hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Corporate law is the senior attorney\'s main specialty, although she also resolves property disputes.\", \"vi\": \"Luật doanh nghiệp là chuyên môn chính của vị luật sư cấp cao, mặc dù cô ấy cũng giải quyết các tranh chấp tài sản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-ljspeech-6cde6c81.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-cori-6cde6c81.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/specialty-29f752de.webp', '[\"specialization\", \"expertise\", \"field\", \"delicacy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"area of specialty\", \"meaning\": \"lĩnh vực chuyên môn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local specialty\", \"meaning\": \"đặc sản địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"house specialty\", \"meaning\": \"món đặc sản của nhà hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"specialist\", \"note_vi\": \"Specialist chỉ bản thân người chuyên gia, còn specialty chỉ ngành/lĩnh vực chuyên môn của người đó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"specialize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"specialist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-cori-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru0-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru5-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru6-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru10-6cde6c81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru9-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru3-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru7-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru8-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-aru2-6cde6c81.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-ljspeech-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt408-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt138-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt624-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt396-6cde6c81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt498-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt132-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt288-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt42-6cde6c81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/specialty-lt90-6cde6c81.mp3\"]}}', 'Có 2 nghĩa chính: 1) Lĩnh vực chuyên môn của cá nhân/công ty; 2) Món đặc sản ẩm thực của địa phương.', 'business', 1, 27),
('f54a4a90-6edd-5240-8265-f5e092fdfebb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'conversely', '/ˈkɒnvɜːsli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Ngược lại; theo một cách đối lập.', 'used to introduce a statement that is the opposite of what was just said.', 'Some people prefer working from home; conversely, others thrive in an office environment.', 'Một số người thích làm việc tại nhà; ngược lại, những người khác lại phát triển tốt trong môi trường văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"High sales in Q1 boosted morale; conversely, Q2 results disappointed the entire team.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số cao trong quý 1 nâng cao tinh thần; ngược lại, kết quả quý 2 làm cả nhóm thất vọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-ljspeech-5cc1c6b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-cori-5cc1c6b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conversely-549ee2d8.webp', '[\"on the contrary\", \"on the other hand\", \"inversely\"]', '[\"similarly\", \"likewise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conversely, however\", \"meaning\": \"ngược lại, tuy nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conversely related\", \"meaning\": \"có quan hệ ngược chiều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conversely speaking\", \"meaning\": \"nói theo chiều ngược lại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inversely\", \"note_vi\": \"inversely nhấn vào tỉ lệ nghịch; conversely nhấn vào ý đối lập chung hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"converse\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"converse\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conversion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-cori-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru0-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru5-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru6-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru10-5cc1c6b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru9-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru3-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru7-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru8-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-aru2-5cc1c6b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-ljspeech-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt408-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt138-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt624-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt396-5cc1c6b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt498-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt132-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt288-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt42-5cc1c6b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conversely-lt90-5cc1c6b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng conversely để đối lập hai ý, không dùng thay cho \'however\' đơn thuần.', 'business', 1, 28),
('617ef857-2e55-5c23-be30-8d8a8cb24c93', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7219178d-4e3d-5045-b027-51389f6cef7d', 'e72864f0-a0b7-5ca1-81a8-a734244920c1', 'vote', '/vəʊt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Bỏ phiếu, bầu cử.', 'to show your choice or opinion in an election or meeting by marking a paper.', 'Citizens have the right to vote for their representatives in the election.', 'Công dân có quyền bỏ phiếu cho đại diện của mình trong cuộc bầu cử.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors will vote on the proposed merger at the next annual meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị sẽ bỏ phiếu về đề xuất sáp nhập tại cuộc họp thường niên tiếp theo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-ljspeech-fd63f1ed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-cori-fd63f1ed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vote-b14291a8.webp', '[\"elect\", \"choose\", \"ballot\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"vote for\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ phiếu cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vote against\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ phiếu chống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cast a vote\", \"meaning\": \"bỏ phiếu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"veto\", \"note_vi\": \"phủ quyết, bác bỏ, trái ngược với việc bỏ phiếu ủng hộ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vote\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"voter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-cori-fd63f1ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-aru0-fd63f1ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-aru5-fd63f1ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-aru6-fd63f1ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-aru10-fd63f1ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-aru9-fd63f1ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-aru3-fd63f1ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-aru7-fd63f1ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vote-aru8-fd63f1ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob