('b9030be6-74ae-5f35-b2bc-195ed024cf31', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'geriatrics', '/ˌdʒeriˈætrɪk/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Ngành y học chuyên về chăm sóc sức khỏe người cao tuổi.', 'the branch of medicine that focuses on the health care and treatment of old people.', 'She decided to specialize in geriatrics because she enjoys working with elderly patients.', 'Cô ấy quyết định chuyên về lão khoa vì cô ấy thích làm việc với bệnh nhân lớn tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"The new hospital wing dedicated to geriatrics will open next month to serve older patients.\", \"vi\": \"Khu vực bệnh viện mới dành riêng cho khoa lão khoa sẽ mở cửa vào tháng tới để phục vụ bệnh nhân lớn tuổi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-ljspeech-b6a56e02.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-cori-b6a56e02.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/geriatrics-cafdd173.webp', '[\"gerontology\"]', '[\"pediatrics\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"specialize in geriatrics\", \"meaning\": \"chuyên về lão khoa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"department of geriatrics\", \"meaning\": \"khoa lão khoa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pediatrics\", \"note_vi\": \"pediatrics là nhi khoa, ngược với geriatrics là lão khoa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"geriatric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-cori-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru0-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru5-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru6-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru10-b6a56e02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru9-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru3-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru7-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru8-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-aru2-b6a56e02.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-ljspeech-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt408-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt138-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt624-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt396-b6a56e02.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt498-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt132-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt288-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt42-b6a56e02.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/geriatrics-lt90-b6a56e02.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ tiền tố \'geri-\' thường liên quan đến người già hoặc tuổi già.', 'health', 1, 0),
('ed0b2c3e-f40f-5676-ac5b-1a2ff5e9c60a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'accessory', 'UK: /əkˈsesəriːz/ | US: /ækˈsesəriːz/', 'B1', 'noun', 'phụ kiện', 'a supplementary item worn or used to add beauty, style, or convenience to something.', 'This store sells clothes and fashion accessories.', 'Cửa hàng này bán quần áo và phụ kiện thời trang.', '{\"en\": \"Customers who purchase a laptop this week will receive a 20 percent discount on computer accessories.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng mua máy tính xách tay trong tuần này sẽ được giảm giá 20% cho các phụ kiện máy tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-ljspeech-4f57da69.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-cori-4f57da69.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accessory-1bf3fe50.webp', '[\"attachment\", \"addition\", \"supplement\", \"extra\"]', '[\"essential\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"optional accessory\", \"meaning\": \"phụ kiện tùy chọn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"computer accessories\", \"meaning\": \"các phụ kiện máy tính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ancillary\", \"note_vi\": \"Ancillary mang nghĩa phụ thuộc/bổ trợ (thường dùng cho dịch vụ hoặc chi phí phụ trợ).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-cori-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru0-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru5-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru6-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru10-4f57da69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru9-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru3-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru7-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru8-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-aru2-4f57da69.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-ljspeech-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt408-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt138-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt624-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt396-4f57da69.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt498-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt132-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt288-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt42-4f57da69.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accessory-lt90-4f57da69.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong danh mục sản phẩm thiết bị văn phòng/điện tử, \'accessories\' là các phụ kiện đi kèm như sạc, chuột, tai nghe.', 'shopping', 1, 1),
('f3a9ceb7-cb42-5838-9ea3-2ba46ae32d91', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'ailment', '/ˈeɪlmənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một chứng bệnh nhẹ, không nghiêm trọng.', 'an illness that is usually not very serious or dangerous to health.', 'She often complains of minor ailments like headaches and colds.', 'Cô ấy thường than phiền về những chứng bệnh nhẹ như đau đầu và cảm lạnh.', '{\"en\": \"The company health insurance plan covers routine medical treatment for minor ailments.\", \"vi\": \"Kế hoạch bảo hiểm y tế của công ty chi trả cho việc điều trị y tế thông thường đối với các bệnh nhẹ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-ljspeech-de340904.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-cori-de340904.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ailment-6fafca04.webp', '[\"illness\", \"complaint\", \"indisposition\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"minor ailment\", \"meaning\": \"bệnh nhẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"treat an ailment\", \"meaning\": \"chữa trị một chứng bệnh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-cori-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru0-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru5-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru6-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru10-de340904.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru9-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru3-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru7-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru8-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-aru2-de340904.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-ljspeech-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt408-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt138-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt624-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt396-de340904.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt498-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt132-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt288-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt42-de340904.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ailment-lt90-de340904.mp3\"]}}', '', 'health', 1, 2),
('512c3dc7-b8d3-524f-900a-d06a5711c944', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'turn down', '/tɜːn daʊn/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Giảm âm lượng, nhiệt độ, cường độ của cái gì đó.', 'to reduce the amount of sound, heat, or power produced by a piece of equipment.', 'Can you turn down the air conditioner because this room is getting freezing?', 'Bạn có thể giảm máy điều hòa xuống vì phòng này đang trở nên rất lạnh không?', '{\"en\": \"Please turn down the air conditioning in the conference room because it is too cold.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng giảm nhiệt độ máy lạnh trong phòng hội nghị vì trời quá lạnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-ljspeech-b679548c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-cori-b679548c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/turn-down-7dd6d11e.webp', '[\"lower\", \"decrease\", \"reduce\"]', '[\"turn up\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"turn down the volume\", \"meaning\": \"giảm âm lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"turn down the heat\", \"meaning\": \"giảm nhiệt độ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"turn down\", \"note_vi\": \"cùng cụm từ nhưng mang nghĩa từ chối một lời mời hoặc đề nghị\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-cori-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru0-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru5-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru6-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru10-b679548c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru9-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru3-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru7-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru8-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-aru2-b679548c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-ljspeech-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt408-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt138-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt624-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt396-b679548c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt498-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt132-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt288-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt42-b679548c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/turn-down-lt90-b679548c.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, cụm này còn rất hay gặp với nghĩa thứ hai là từ chối (từ chối ứng viên, lời mời).', 'office', 1, 3),
('1b91c8ea-3ab4-5c2c-96a4-9b67674ee15f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'obligate', '/ˈɒblɪɡeɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Bắt buộc ai đó làm gì theo luật hoặc nghĩa vụ.', 'to force someone to do something because of a legal duty or moral promise.', 'The contract will obligate both parties to fulfill their responsibilities.', 'Hợp đồng sẽ ràng buộc cả hai bên phải thực hiện trách nhiệm của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The signed agreement will obligate the vendor to deliver goods within five business days.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng đã ký sẽ bắt buộc nhà cung cấp phải giao hàng trong vòng năm ngày làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-ljspeech-24dafddb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-cori-24dafddb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obligate-849e15a8.webp', '[\"compel\", \"require\", \"bind\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"legally obligate\", \"meaning\": \"bắt buộc về mặt pháp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be obligated to\", \"meaning\": \"có nghĩa vụ phải làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"oblige\", \"note_vi\": \"Oblige có thể nghĩa là giúp đỡ; obligate mang tính bắt buộc pháp lý cao hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obligation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obligatory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-cori-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru0-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru5-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru6-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru10-24dafddb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru9-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru3-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru7-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru8-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru2-24dafddb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-ljspeech-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt408-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt138-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt624-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt396-24dafddb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt498-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt132-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt288-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt42-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-lt90-24dafddb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng ở dạng bị động: be obligated to do something (có nghĩa vụ phải làm gì).', 'law', 1, 4),
('d9bc9887-d7b5-5ab0-823e-983a449014e6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'scene', '/siːn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một phần của vở kịch, phim, hoặc một khung cảnh cụ thể.', 'a part of a play or movie, or a view that you see.', 'The final scene of the movie was very emotional and brought tears to many viewers\' eyes.', 'Cảnh cuối cùng của bộ phim rất xúc động và khiến nhiều khán giả rơi nước mắt.', '{\"en\": \"The director decided to reshoot the opening scene of the commercial in the office.\", \"vi\": \"Đạo diễn quyết định quay lại cảnh mở đầu của quảng cáo tại văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-ljspeech-ea5e0445.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-cori-ea5e0445.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scene-6c142253.webp', '[\"view\", \"sight\", \"sequence\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"behind the scenes\", \"meaning\": \"hậu trường, âm thầm phía sau\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crime scene\", \"meaning\": \"hiện trường vụ án\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"seen\", \"note_vi\": \"seen là phân từ 2 của see, đồng âm với scene\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scenic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-cori-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru0-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru5-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru6-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru10-ea5e0445.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru9-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru3-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru7-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru8-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-aru2-ea5e0445.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-ljspeech-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt408-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt138-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt624-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt396-ea5e0445.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt498-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt132-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt288-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt42-ea5e0445.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scene-lt90-ea5e0445.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'behind the scenes\' rất hay gặp trong công việc, nghĩa là hậu trường.', 'media', 1, 5),
('0b73057b-c86a-55b0-9599-e67951f74c31', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'CD burner', '/siː diː bɜːnə/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thiết bị máy tính dùng để ghi dữ liệu lên đĩa CD.', 'a computer device that writes data, music, or images onto a compact disc.', 'My old computer had a CD burner, but new laptops rarely include them now.', 'Máy tính cũ của tôi có một máy ghi đĩa CD, nhưng các máy tính xách tay mới hiếm khi có chúng bây giờ.', '{\"en\": \"The IT office bought an external CD burner to back up old company records safely.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng công nghệ thông tin đã mua một ổ ghi CD ngoài để sao lưu hồ sơ cũ của công ty một cách an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-ljspeech-5e09c2d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-cori-5e09c2d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cd-burner-abe3c762.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"external CD burner\", \"meaning\": \"ổ ghi CD gắn ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"internal CD burner\", \"meaning\": \"ổ ghi CD gắn trong\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"CD drive\", \"note_vi\": \"CD drive chỉ đọc được đĩa, CD burner ghi được đĩa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"burn\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-cori-5e09c2d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-aru0-5e09c2d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-aru5-5e09c2d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-aru6-5e09c2d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-aru10-5e09c2d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-aru9-5e09c2d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-aru3-5e09c2d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-burner-aru7-5e09c2d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cd-b