('3e7828e6-bd8f-56cb-8d61-7b6a404db8ad', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'weld', '/weld/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Mối nối tạo ra bằng cách nung chảy và gắn hai mảnh kim loại.', 'a joint formed by heating and melting two pieces of metal together.', 'The quality of the weld is crucial for the structural integrity of the bridge.', 'Chất lượng của mối hàn rất quan trọng đối với tính toàn vẹn kết cấu của cây cầu.', '{\"en\": \"The inspector checked every weld on the steel frame to ensure the building\'s safety.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra đã kiểm tra từng mối hàn trên khung thép để đảm bảo an toàn cho tòa nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-ljspeech-6a036201.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-cori-6a036201.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weld-5535c52c.webp', '[\"joint\", \"seam\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"weld joint\", \"meaning\": \"mối nối hàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quality of the weld\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng mối hàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"welder\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weld\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-cori-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru0-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru5-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru6-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru10-6a036201.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru9-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru3-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru7-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru8-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-aru2-6a036201.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-ljspeech-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt408-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt138-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt624-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt396-6a036201.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt498-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt132-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt288-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt42-6a036201.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weld-lt90-6a036201.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong kỹ thuật, xây dựng và sản xuất cơ khí.', 'manufacturing', 1, 7),
('b070050d-b3f3-58a2-9643-022d2fe13849', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'reef', '/riːf/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Rạn san hô, dải đá ngầm dưới biển.', 'a line of rocks or sand just above or below the surface of the sea.', 'Divers explored the colorful coral reef, home to many marine species.', 'Các thợ lặn khám phá rạn san hô đầy màu sắc, nơi sinh sống của nhiều loài sinh vật biển.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency offers boat tours to the nearby coral reef for snorkeling.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch cung cấp các tour du lịch bằng thuyền đến rạn san hô gần đó để lặn ống thở.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-ljspeech-cfb5e25b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-cori-cfb5e25b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reef-ed3dad6d.webp', '[\"shoal\", \"sandbank\", \"ledge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"coral reef\", \"meaning\": \"rạn san hô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"barrier reef\", \"meaning\": \"rạn san hô chắn bờ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-cori-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru0-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru5-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru6-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru10-cfb5e25b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru9-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru3-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru7-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru8-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-aru2-cfb5e25b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-ljspeech-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt408-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt138-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt624-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt396-cfb5e25b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt498-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt132-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt288-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt42-cfb5e25b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reef-lt90-cfb5e25b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với từ coral tạo thành cụm coral reef (rạn san hô).', 'travel', 1, 8),
('0eae2580-d087-5f67-af98-47848f91e9a8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'scatter', 'UK: /ˈskætə/ | US: /ˈskætər/', 'B2', 'verb', 'rải rác, phân tán', 'to throw or spread things in different directions over a wide area.', 'The wind scattered the leaves across the yard.', 'Gió làm lá rải rác khắp sân.', '{\"en\": \"Important paperwork was scattered all over the conference table after the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Giấy tờ quan trọng bị rải rác khắp bàn hội nghị sau cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-ljspeech-3bf7e63e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-cori-3bf7e63e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scatter-1dbf976a.webp', '[\"disperse\", \"spread\", \"strew\", \"distribute\"]', '[\"gather\", \"collect\", \"assemble\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"scatter across\", \"meaning\": \"rải rác khắp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"widely scattered\", \"meaning\": \"được phân tán rộng rãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shatter\", \"note_vi\": \"shatter nghĩa là làm vỡ tan tành, còn scatter là rải rác/phân tán.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scattered\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-cori-3bf7e63e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru0-3bf7e63e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru5-3bf7e63e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru6-3bf7e63e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru10-3bf7e63e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru9-3bf7e63e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru3-3bf7e63e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru7-3bf7e63e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru8-3bf7e63e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scatter-aru2-