('95dd990f-dd6d-54ab-964e-72b9029f155d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'bonus', '/ˈbəʊnəs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khoản tiền thêm được trả cho nhân viên ngoài lương cơ bản.', 'an extra amount of money given to someone as a reward for good work performance.', 'The sales representative earned a substantial bonus after exceeding her quarterly target.', 'Đại diện kinh doanh đã nhận được một khoản tiền thưởng lớn sau khi vượt mục tiêu quý.', '{\"en\": \"The manager announced that every staff member would receive a performance bonus this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý thông báo rằng mỗi nhân viên sẽ nhận được khoản thưởng hiệu suất trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-ljspeech-57da3dfb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-cori-57da3dfb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bonus-eaa9f4a3.webp', '[\"reward\", \"incentive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"year-end bonus\", \"meaning\": \"thưởng cuối năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sign-on bonus\", \"meaning\": \"thưởng khi ký hợp đồng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-cori-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru0-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru5-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru6-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru10-57da3dfb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru9-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru3-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru7-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru8-57da3dfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bonus-aru2-57da3dfb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio