('7383f5ee-70b9-5f3c-bdb5-ab57e64043ba', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'lenient', '/ˈliːniənt/', '', 'adjective', 'Khoan dung, không quá nghiêm khắc khi trừng phạt, nhân hậu.', 'not being strict when judging or punishing someone for their bad behavior.', 'The judge was lenient with the young offender, giving him a lighter sentence.', 'Vị thẩm phán đã nhân hậu với người phạm tội trẻ tuổi, cho anh ta một bản án nhẹ hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor was lenient with the new intern who made a small mistake on the report.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã khoan dung với thực tập sinh mới, người đã mắc một lỗi nhỏ trong báo cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-ljspeech-4334223d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-cori-4334223d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lenient-c95717d8.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-cori-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru0-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru5-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru6-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru10-4334223d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru9-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru3-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru7-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru8-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-aru2-4334223d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-ljspeech-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lenient-lt408-4334223d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio