('d8dda02b-1e49-5d6e-bf4f-5eb7c4038f0d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'precious', '/ˈpreʃəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất có giá trị, được yêu quý hoặc hiếm có.', 'having great value because of being rare, expensive, or important to someone.', 'The museum displays several precious gems that belonged to ancient royal families.', 'Bảo tàng trưng bày nhiều viên đá quý từng thuộc về các gia đình hoàng gia cổ đại.', '{\"en\": \"The jewelry store keeps its most precious items in a secure safe overnight.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng trang sức cất giữ những món đồ quý giá nhất của mình trong két sắt an toàn qua đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-ljspeech-42e63a94.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-cori-42e63a94.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/precious-378c1b57.webp', '[\"valuable\", \"priceless\", \"treasured\"]', '[\"worthless\", \"cheap\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"precious metal\", \"meaning\": \"kim loại quý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"precious stone\", \"meaning\": \"đá quý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"precious memory\", \"meaning\": \"kỷ niệm quý giá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"previous\", \"note_vi\": \"previous nghĩa là trước đó, viết gần giống precious\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-cori-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru0-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru5-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru6-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru10-42e63a94.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru9-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru3-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru7-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru8-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-aru2-42e63a94.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-ljspeech-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt408-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt138-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt624-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt396-42e63a94.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt498-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt132-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt288-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt42-42e63a94.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/precious-lt90-42e63a94.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn chính tả với từ previous (trước đó).', 'shopping', 1, 25),
('a6afc6f4-c386-5c29-8f89-7b42b2d2ff0d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'discourse', '/ˈdɪskɔːs/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Cuộc thảo luận hoặc trao đổi ý kiến về một chủ đề.', 'a formal talk or writing about a particular subject between people or groups.', 'Academic discourse often involves complex ideas and specialized vocabulary.', 'Thảo luận học thuật thường bao gồm các ý tưởng phức tạp và từ vựng chuyên ngành.', '{\"en\": \"The conference encouraged open discourse among industry experts regarding future tech trends.\", \"vi\": \"Hội nghị đã khuyến khích thảo luận cởi mở giữa các chuyên gia ngành về các xu hướng công nghệ tương lai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-ljspeech-e8fcfa62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-cori-e8fcfa62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/discourse-cf2541b2.webp', '[\"discussion\", \"debate\", \"dialogue\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"academic discourse\", \"meaning\": \"thảo luận học thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"public discourse\", \"meaning\": \"tranh luận công khai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"resource\", \"note_vi\": \"resource là tài nguyên hoặc nguồn lực, mặt chữ hơi giống discourse.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"discourse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-cori-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru0-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru5-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru6-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru10-e8fcfa62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru9-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru3-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru7-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru8-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-aru2-e8fcfa62.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-ljspeech-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt408-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt138-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt624-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt396-e8fcfa62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt498-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt132-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt288-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt42-e8fcfa62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discourse-lt90-e8fcfa62.mp3\"]}}', 'Mang sắc thái trang trọng hơn discussion, thường nói về hội thảo hoặc cuộc đối thoại chuyên sâu.', 'business', 1, 26),
('cbf71a28-4b2d-5f45-b990-be8fa3f12247', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '731816cb-a97e-5a11-8461-16b929dac6a3', '29d562af-684b-534b-87a2-1ed58c0f9511', 'thump', '/θʌmp/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Đánh, đập hoặc va chạm mạnh, tạo ra tiếng động lớn.', 'to hit or fall against something heavily and cause a loud noise.', 'His heart began to thump loudly as he approached the finish line.', 'Tim anh ấy bắt đầu đập mạnh khi anh ấy tiến gần vạch đích.', '{\"en\": \"The heavy delivery boxes began to thump against the wall during transport.\", \"vi\": \"Các thùng hàng nặng bắt đầu va đập mạnh vào tường trong quá trình vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-ljspeech-3945fea7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-cori-3945fea7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thump-6e55bfae.webp', '[\"pound\", \"thug\", \"beat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"thump heavily\", \"meaning\": \"đập mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thump against\", \"meaning\": \"va đập vào\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"thud\", \"note_vi\": \"thud tạo tiếng bịch trầm đục khi rơi, thump là đập hoặc vỗ mạnh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thump\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-cori-3945fea7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru0-3945fea7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru5-3945fea7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru6-3945fea7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru10-3945fea7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru9-3945fea7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru3-3945fea7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru7-3945fea7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru8-3945fea7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thump-aru2-3945fea7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/objec