('3748f46d-aee4-53b6-8ab0-1326b042801c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7489d6b6-b7b3-5509-8b04-7b6531321da0', '81e7ce2a-f020-5392-b14f-0f94b2fd9654', 'afford', 'UK: /əˈfɔːd/ | US: /əˈfɔːrd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'có đủ khả năng', 'to have enough money, time, or resources to pay for or do something.', 'The company can afford to invest in new technology.', 'Công ty có đủ khả năng để đầu tư vào công nghệ mới.', '{\"en\": \"With the recent budget cuts, the department cannot afford to hire additional staff this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Với sự cắt giảm ngân sách gần đây, bộ phận không thể có đủ khả năng thuê thêm nhân viên trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-ljspeech-15cdad7a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-cori-15cdad7a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/afford-1430ec22.webp', '[\"pay for\", \"manage\", \"bear\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cannot afford to\", \"meaning\": \"không thể gánh chịu / không có khả năng làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"afford a luxury\", \"meaning\": \"có đủ khả năng chi trả cho thứ xa xỉ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"affordable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"affordability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-cori-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru0-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru5-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru6-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru10-15cdad7a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru9-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru3-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru7-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru8-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-aru2-15cdad7a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-ljspeech-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt408-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt138-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt624-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt396-15cdad7a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt498-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt132-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt288-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt42-15cdad7a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/afford-lt90-15cdad7a.mp3\"]}}', 'Afford thường đi cùng trợ động từ \'can/cannot\' và theo sau là động từ nguyên mẫu có \'to\' (afford to do sth) hoặc danh từ.', 'finance', 1, 19),
('4a8c51c2-2ed1-5769-a51e-01e54876c032', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7489d6b6-b7b3-5509-8b04-7b6531321da0', '81e7ce2a-f020-5392-b14f-0f94b2fd9654', 'calmness', '/ˈkɑːmnəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái yên tĩnh, thanh thản, không có lo lắng hay kích động.', 'the state of being quiet and peaceful without showing any worry or strong emotion.', 'Despite the chaos, she maintained an impressive calmness throughout the emergency.', 'Bất chấp sự hỗn loạn, cô ấy vẫn giữ được sự bình tĩnh đáng kinh ngạc trong suốt tình huống khẩn cấp.', '{\"en\": \"Her calmness during the stressful client meeting helped resolve the conflict effectively and quickly.\", \"vi\": \"Sự bình tĩnh của cô ấy trong cuộc họp khách hàng căng thẳng đã giúp giải quyết xung đột hiệu quả và nhanh chóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-ljspeech-13334f48.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-cori-13334f48.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/calmness-93352d9b.webp', '[\"tranquility\", \"composure\"]', '[\"agitation\", \"anxiety\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"maintain calmness\", \"meaning\": \"duy trì sự bình tĩnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sense of calmness\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác bình tĩnh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"calm\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-cori-13334f48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-aru0-13334f48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-aru5-13334f48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-aru6-13334f48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-aru10-13334f48.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-aru9-13334f48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-aru3-13334f48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calmness-aru7-13334f48.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc