('7d60b022-b24e-561d-be41-34a2673b3c5a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7489d6b6-b7b3-5509-8b04-7b6531321da0', '81e7ce2a-f020-5392-b14f-0f94b2fd9654', 'tasteless', '/ˈteɪstləs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không có hương vị; hoặc thiếu tế nhị, thô tục.', 'having no flavor or showing a lack of good judgment in style or behavior.', 'The soup was so bland and tasteless that I couldn\'t finish it.', 'Món súp nhạt nhẽo và vô vị đến nỗi tôi không thể ăn hết.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team rejected the advertisement because it was considered offensive and highly tasteless.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã từ chối quảng cáo vì nó bị coi là xúc phạm và rất thiếu tế nhị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-ljspeech-f57535f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-cori-f57535f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tasteless-ab6bc07c.webp', '[\"bland\", \"offensive\"]', '[\"delicious\", \"refined\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tasteless joke\", \"meaning\": \"trò đùa vô duyên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tasteless food\", \"meaning\": \"thức ăn nhạt nhẽo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"taste\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tasty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-cori-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru0-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru5-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru6-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru10-f57535f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru9-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru3-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru7-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru8-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-aru2-f57535f1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-ljspeech-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt408-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt138-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt624-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt396-f57535f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt498-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt132-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt288-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt42-f57535f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tasteless-lt90-f57535f1.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này có hai nghĩa: nhạt nhẽo (vị giác) và vô duyên (hành vi).', 'marketing', 1, 24),
('b3a51dea-3a9d-5ef5-8983-0dbc177eb121', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7489d6b6-b7b3-5509-8b04-7b6531321da0', '81e7ce2a-f020-5392-b14f-0f94b2fd9654', 'out of the ordinary', '/aʊt əv ðɪ ɔːdɪnəri/', 'B2', 'phrase', 'Khác thường, không bình thường.', 'not normal or typical, often surprising or different from what is usually expected.', 'The security team noticed several out of the ordinary computer login requests overnight.', 'Đội ngũ bảo mật đã nhận thấy một số yêu cầu đăng nhập máy tính bất thường qua đêm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager noticed something out of the ordinary in the monthly financial report this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhận thấy điều gì đó khác thường trong báo cáo tài chính hàng tháng sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-ljspeech-8b5b8aad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-cori-8b5b8aad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/out-of-the-ordinary-e79af757.webp', '[\"unusual\", \"abnormal\"]', '[\"normal\", \"typical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"nothing out of the ordinary\", \"meaning\": \"không có gì bất thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"something out of the ordinary\", \"meaning\": \"điều gì đó khác lạ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-cori-8b5b8aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-aru0-8b5b8aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-aru5-8b5b8aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-aru6-8b5b8aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-aru10-8b5b8aad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-aru9-8b5b8aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-aru3-8b5b8aad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-the-ordinary-aru7-8b5b8a