('e43abb19-38fe-5df1-a14c-17bdf59d3490', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7489d6b6-b7b3-5509-8b04-7b6531321da0', '81e7ce2a-f020-5392-b14f-0f94b2fd9654', 'puzzle', '/ˈpʌzl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Trò chơi hoặc vấn đề khó giải, đòi hỏi suy nghĩ.', 'a game or problem that tests a person\'s skill and brain power.', 'She spent hours trying to solve the complex jigsaw puzzle.', 'Cô ấy đã dành hàng giờ để cố gắng giải câu đố ghép hình phức tạp.', '{\"en\": \"Finding a cost-effective solution for this project proved to be a difficult puzzle.\", \"vi\": \"Việc tìm kiếm một giải pháp hiệu quả về chi phí cho dự án này tỏ ra là một bài toán khó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-ljspeech-ddcb4be4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-cori-ddcb4be4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/puzzle-120f0d4b.webp', '[\"riddle\", \"enigma\", \"mystery\"]', '[\"solution\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"jigsaw puzzle\", \"meaning\": \"trò chơi xếp hình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"solve a puzzle\", \"meaning\": \"giải một bài toán/câu đố\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"riddle\", \"note_vi\": \"Riddle thường là câu đố bằng lời nói mang tính chơi chữ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"puzzle\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"puzzling\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"puzzlement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-cori-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru0-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru5-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru6-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru10-ddcb4be4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru9-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru3-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru7-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru8-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-aru2-ddcb4be4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-ljspeech-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt408-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt138-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt624-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt396-ddcb4be4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt498-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt132-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt288-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt42-ddcb4be4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/puzzle-lt90-ddcb4be4.mp3\"]}}', 'Puzzle vừa là danh từ (câu đố/bài toán) vừa là động từ (làm ai bối rối).', 'other', 1, 29),
('1a35d758-018a-599f-b3e1-fb7ca24b23bd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '78c60784-bab8-5077-9838-783e2bb54130', 'e4c22dff-4779-573a-9a0c-95725d92f63a', 'segment', 'UK: /ˈsɛɡmənt/ | US: /ˈsɛɡmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'phân khúc, bộ phận', 'A distinct portion or part into which something larger, such as a market, is divided.', 'The company is targeting a new market segment with its latest offering.', 'Công ty đang nhắm đến một phân khúc thị trường mới với sản phẩm mới nhất của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our upcoming campaign aims to target a younger customer segment in urban areas.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch sắp tới của chúng tôi nhằm mục tiêu vào phân khúc khách hàng trẻ tuổi hơn ở các khu vực đô thị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-ljspeech-6a80eba8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-cori-6a80eba8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/segment-cafd4a51.webp', '[\"section\", \"portion\", \"part\", \"division\"]', '[\"whole\", \"entirety\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"market segment\", \"meaning\": \"phân khúc thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customer segment\", \"meaning\": \"phân khúc khách hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"segment\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"segmentation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-cori-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru0-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru5-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru6-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru10-6a80eba8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru9-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru3-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru7-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru8-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-aru2-6a80eba8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-ljspeech-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt408-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt138-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt624-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt396-6a80eba8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt498-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt132-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt288-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt42-6a80eba8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/segment-lt90-6a80eba8.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi là danh từ đọc là /ˈseɡmənt/ (phân khúc thị trường = market segment). Khi là động từ đọc là /seɡˈment/ (phân chia).', 'marketing', 1, 0),
('251ccdd7-0eb3-5da7-992f-1d68b01518b6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '78c60784-bab8-5077-9838-783e2bb54130', 'e4c22dff-4779-573a-9a0c-95725d92f63a', 'workload', 'UK: /ˈwɜːkˌləʊd/ | US: /ˈwɜrkˌloʊd/', 'B2', 'noun', 'khối lượng công việc', 'The total amount of task or duty that a person is expected to complete.', 'The team\'s workload increased significantly after the merger.', 'Khối lượng công việc của nhóm tăng đáng kể sau vụ sáp nhập.', '{\"en\": \"To handle the heavy workload, the department manager decided to recruit two assistant accountants.\", \"vi\": \"Để xử lý khối lượng công việc nặng nề, trưởng phòng đã quyết định tuyển thêm hai trợ lý kế toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-ljspeech-8c6e326c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-cori-8c6e326c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/workload-58c01b47.webp', '[\"task load\", \"assignment volume\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy workload\", \"meaning\": \"khối lượng công việc nặng nề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"manage workload\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý khối lượng công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"distribute workload\", \"meaning\": \"phân chia khối lượng công việc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"workforce\", \"note_vi\": \"tổng số nhân sự/lực lượng lao động, không phải khối lượng công việc (workload)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-cori-8c6e326c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-aru0-8c6e326c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-aru5-8c6e326c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-aru6-8c6e326c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-aru10-8c6e326c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-aru9-8c6e326c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-aru3-8c6e326c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/workload-aru7-8c