('4514f3d9-3437-5c08-ae28-df1c84337fad', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '78c60784-bab8-5077-9838-783e2bb54130', 'e4c22dff-4779-573a-9a0c-95725d92f63a', 'strenuous', '/ˈstrenjuəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đòi hỏi rất nhiều sức lực, nỗ lực.', 'requiring a lot of physical or mental effort to do.', 'Climbing to the top of the mountain was a strenuous but rewarding experience.', 'Leo lên đỉnh núi là một trải nghiệm vất vả nhưng đáng giá.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse workers avoided strenuous tasks during the hot afternoon shift.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân kho tránh các nhiệm vụ nặng nhọc trong ca chiều nóng bức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-ljspeech-27ca6138.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-cori-27ca6138.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/strenuous-3bf69b19.webp', '[\"arduous\", \"taxing\"]', '[\"effortless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"strenuous exercise\", \"meaning\": \"bài tập nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strenuous effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"strict\", \"note_vi\": \"strict nghĩa nghiêm ngặt, strenuous nghĩa tốn sức\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"strenuously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-cori-27ca6138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru0-27ca6138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru5-27ca6138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru6-27ca6138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru10-27ca6138.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru9-27ca6138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru3-27ca6138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru7-27ca6138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru8-27ca6138.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strenuous-aru