('268a9aa1-a8e4-54c5-8ef4-cfa9206eceef', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '78c60784-bab8-5077-9838-783e2bb54130', 'e4c22dff-4779-573a-9a0c-95725d92f63a', 'brake', 'UK: /breɪk/ | US: /breɪk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'phanh', 'A device fitted to a vehicle for slowing down or bringing it to a complete stop.', 'Always check the brake fluid levels regularly.', 'Luôn kiểm tra mức dầu phanh thường xuyên.', '{\"en\": \"The mechanic recommended replacing the front brake pads during the routine maintenance.\", \"vi\": \"Người thợ máy đã khuyên nên thay má phanh trước trong đợt bảo dưỡng định kỳ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-ljspeech-39cabc71.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-cori-39cabc71.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/brake-632fc686.webp', '[\"restraint\", \"damper\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply the brakes\", \"meaning\": \"đạp phanh / hãm phanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"brake pedal\", \"meaning\": \"bàn đạp phanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"break\", \"note_vi\": \"break mang nghĩa làm vỡ hoặc giờ nghỉ, phát âm giống hệt brake.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"brake\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-cori-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru0-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru5-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru6-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru10-39cabc71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru9-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru3-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru7-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru8-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-aru2-39cabc71.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-ljspeech-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt408-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt138-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt624-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt396-39cabc71.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt498-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt132-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt288-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt42-39cabc71.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/brake-lt90-39cabc71.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phân biệt chính tả: \'brake\' (phanh xe) và \'break\' (làm vỡ / giờ nghỉ).', 'transportation', 1, 26),
('f9ded0ef-4e3e-5372-9ad1-63040ef61371', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '78c60784-bab8-5077-9838-783e2bb54130', 'e4c22dff-4779-573a-9a0c-95725d92f63a', 'glowing', '/ˈɡləʊɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đầy lời khen ngợi, rất tích cực.', 'expressing great approval or praise for someone or something in a very positive way.', 'She received a glowing review for her performance in the play.', 'Cô ấy đã nhận được một bài đánh giá đầy ca ngợi về màn trình diễn của mình trong vở kịch.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave a glowing recommendation for the employee who applied for the senior position.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đưa ra lời giới thiệu đầy khen ngợi cho nhân viên ứng tuyển vào vị trí cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-ljspeech-39d3acbc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-cori-39d3acbc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glowing-0eef2d04.webp', '[\"enthusiastic\", \"complimentary\"]', '[\"critical\", \"negative\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"glowing report\", \"meaning\": \"bản báo cáo đầy khen ngợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"glowing review\", \"meaning\": \"bài đánh giá tích cực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"glow\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-cori-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru0-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru5-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru6-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru10-39d3acbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru9-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru3-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru7-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru8-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-aru2-39d3acbc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-ljspeech-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt408-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt138-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt624-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt396-39d3acbc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt498-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt132-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt288-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt42-39d3acbc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glowing-lt90-39d3acbc.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh đánh giá nhân sự hoặc phản hồi của khách hàng.', 'hr', 1, 27),
('13b70fd1-e6dc-5834-a3b5-48932dfaf8bc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '78c60784-bab8-5077-9838-783e2bb54130', 'e4c22dff-4779-573a-9a0c-95725d92f63a', 'slightly', '/ˈslaɪtli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Một chút, không nhiều.', 'by a small amount or to a minor degree.', 'The weather today is slightly warmer than yesterday.', 'Thời tiết hôm nay ấm hơn một chút so với hôm qua.', '{\"en\": \"The new software update is slightly faster than the previous version we used last year.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm mới nhanh hơn một chút so với phiên bản cũ chúng ta đã dùng năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-ljspeech-c28dd595.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-cori-c28dd595.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slightly-f569db08.webp', '[\"somewhat\", \"a little\"]', '[\"significantly\", \"greatly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"slightly different\", \"meaning\": \"khác một chút\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slightly higher\", \"meaning\": \"cao hơn một chút\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"slight\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-cori-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru0-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru5-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru6-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru10-c28dd595.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru9-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru3-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru7-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru8-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-aru2-c28dd595.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-ljspeech-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt408-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt138-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt624-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt396-c28dd595.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt498-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt132-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt288-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt42-c28dd595.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slightly-lt90-c28dd595.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để giảm nhẹ mức độ của một tính từ hoặc trạng từ.', 'technology', 1, 28),
('ec1177a8-e532-522e-be19-d77913747fd1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '78c60784-bab8-5077-9838-783e2bb54130', 'e4c22dff-4779-573a-9a0c-95725d92f63a', 'promise', '/ˈprɒmɪs/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Lời cam kết sẽ làm gì đó.', 'a statement that you will certainly do or not do something.', 'He made a promise to his mother that he would always tell the truth.', 'Anh ấy đã hứa với mẹ rằng anh ấy sẽ luôn nói sự thật.', '{\"en\": \"The manager kept his promise to promote the top-performing salesperson at the end of the year.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã giữ lời hứa thăng chức cho nhân viên bán hàng có thành tích xuất sắc nhất vào cuối năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-ljspeech-8c2fd844.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-cori-8c2fd844.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/promise-d0c53fad.webp', '[\"pledge\", \"commitment\", \"vow\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make a promise\", \"meaning\": \"hứa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep a promise\", \"meaning\": \"giữ lời hứa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"break a promise\", \"meaning\": \"thất hứa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compromise\", \"note_vi\": \"compromise nghĩa là sự thỏa hiệp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"promise\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"promising\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-cori-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru0-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru5-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru6-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru10-8c2fd844.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru9-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru3-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru7-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru8-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-aru2-8c2fd844.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-ljspeech-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt408-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt138-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt624-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt396-8c2fd844.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt498-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt132-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt288-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt42-8c2fd844.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/promise-lt90-8c2fd844.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là danh từ vừa là động từ. Tính từ promising nghĩa là đầy hứa hẹn, triển vọng.', 'hr', 1, 29),
('dab7929f-7865-5f8a-9cb9-9b919bc1943e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7a879fba-e78a-57d5-b640-a82959b20f00', '858699eb-b538-5735-8eec-215cfdcb32bb', 'biweekly', '/baɪˈwiːkli/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Xảy ra hoặc được xuất bản hai lần một tuần hoặc mỗi hai tuần một lần.', 'happening or produced once every two weeks or two times a week.', 'Employees receive their salary on a biweekly schedule every second Friday afternoon.', 'Nhân viên nhận lương theo định kỳ hai tuần một lần vào chiều thứ Sáu của tuần thứ hai.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting department issues biweekly financial reports to help management monitor spending.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận kế toán phát hành các báo cáo tài chính hai tuần một lần để giúp ban quản lý theo dõi chi tiêu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-ljspeech-f8023597.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-cori-f8023597.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/biweekly-eddf3363.webp', '[\"fortnightly\", \"semiweekly\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"biweekly report\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo hai tuần một lần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"biweekly salary\", \"meaning\": \"lương trả mỗi hai tuần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bimonthly\", \"note_vi\": \"Bimonthly nghĩa là hai tháng một lần hoặc một tháng hai lần.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"biweekly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-cori-f8023597.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-aru0-f8023597.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-aru5-f8023597.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-aru6-f8023597.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-aru10-f8023597.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-aru9-f8023597.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-aru3-f8023597.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/biweekly-aru7-