('867e0b58-4360-5f04-adc1-e8ff822cc6b5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7a879fba-e78a-57d5-b640-a82959b20f00', '858699eb-b538-5735-8eec-215cfdcb32bb', 'heat wave', '/hiːt weɪv/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một giai đoạn thời tiết cực kỳ nóng kéo dài.', 'a period of unusually hot weather that lasts for several days.', 'The city experienced a severe heat wave last summer, with temperatures soaring.', 'Thành phố đã trải qua một đợt sóng nhiệt nghiêm trọng vào mùa hè năm ngoái, với nhiệt độ tăng vọt.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden heat wave caused a dramatic increase in electricity usage at the office.\", \"vi\": \"Đợt nắng nóng đột ngột đã khiến lượng sử dụng điện tại văn phòng tăng mạnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-ljspeech-e4328e09.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-cori-e4328e09.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heat-wave-79bb27dc.webp', NULL, '[\"cold spell\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severe heat wave\", \"meaning\": \"đợt nắng nóng gay gắt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"experience a heat wave\", \"meaning\": \"trải qua một đợt nắng nóng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-cori-e4328e09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru0-e4328e09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru5-e4328e09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru6-e4328e09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru10-e4328e09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru9-e4328e09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru3-e4328e09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru7-e4328e09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru8-e4328e09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heat-wave-aru2-e4328e09.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pu