('949672fb-7eb5-5c43-8b07-b28068a9e342', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7a879fba-e78a-57d5-b640-a82959b20f00', '858699eb-b538-5735-8eec-215cfdcb32bb', 'sprawl', '/sprɔːl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Trải rộng ra một cách lộn xộn, không có tổ chức.', 'to cover a large area of land in a way that is not planned or organized.', 'The city continued to sprawl outwards, consuming more agricultural land.', 'Thành phố tiếp tục trải rộng ra, chiếm mất nhiều đất nông nghiệp hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The new industrial park will sprawl across the eastern edge of the city limits.\", \"vi\": \"Khu công nghiệp mới sẽ trải rộng khắp rìa phía đông của ranh giới thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-ljspeech-a283d118.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-cori-a283d118.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sprawl-00b3c414.webp', '[\"spread\", \"extend\", \"stretch\"]', '[\"shrink\", \"contract\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sprawl out\", \"meaning\": \"trải dài ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"urban sprawl\", \"meaning\": \"sự mở rộng đô thị lộn xộn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crawl\", \"note_vi\": \"crawl là bò, trườn, khác hoàn toàn với sprawl.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sprawl\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sprawling\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-cori-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru0-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru5-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru6-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru10-a283d118.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru9-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru3-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru7-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru8-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-aru2-a283d118.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-ljspeech-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt408-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt138-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt624-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt396-a283d118.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt498-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt132-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt288-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt42-a283d118.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sprawl-lt90-a283d118.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để miêu tả sự phát triển đô thị (urban sprawl) thiếu quy hoạch.', 'housing', 1, 10),
('cf157a66-17bb-5159-87b2-3a321372f5ea', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7a879fba-e78a-57d5-b640-a82959b20f00', '858699eb-b538-5735-8eec-215cfdcb32bb', 'hearty', '/ˈhɑːti/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'nồng nhiệt, chân thành; bổ dưỡng (thức ăn).', 'enthusiastic and friendly, or describing food that is wholesome and large in quantity.', 'She received a hearty welcome from her old friends.', 'Cô ấy đã nhận được sự chào đón nồng nhiệt từ những người bạn cũ.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel served a hearty breakfast to prepare guests for a full day of meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã phục vụ một bữa sáng thịnh soạn để chuẩn bị cho khách dự họp cả ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-ljspeech-85e2df75.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-cori-85e2df75.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hearty-5ae1e7ff.webp', '[\"warm\", \"wholesome\"]', '[\"cold\", \"meager\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hearty meal\", \"meaning\": \"bữa ăn thịnh soạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hearty welcome\", \"meaning\": \"sự đón tiếp nồng nhiệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"healthy\", \"note_vi\": \"Healthy nghĩa là lành mạnh/khỏe mạnh, hearty là thịnh soạn/nồng nhiệt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"heartily\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"heartiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-cori-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru0-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru5-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru6-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru10-85e2df75.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru9-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru3-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru7-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru8-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-aru2-85e2df75.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-ljspeech-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt408-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt138-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt624-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt396-85e2df75.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt498-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt132-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt288-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt42-85e2df75.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hearty-lt90-85e2df75.mp3\"]}}', 'Hearty meal mang nghĩa là bữa ăn no nê, giàu năng lượng.', 'dining', 1, 11),
('53a8693a-ff33-568b-a171-1b7966c4dfda', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7a879fba-e78a-57d5-b640-a82959b20f00', '858699eb-b538-5735-8eec-215cfdcb32bb', 'reasonably', '/ˈriːznəbli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Ở một mức độ chấp nhận được, có lý do chính đáng hoặc không quá nhiều.', 'to a degree that is fair, acceptable, or sensible but not extreme.', 'The price of the new smartphone is reasonably affordable for most consumers.', 'Giá của chiếc điện thoại thông minh mới khá hợp lý đối với hầu hết người tiêu dùng.', '{\"en\": \"The new office space is reasonably priced considering its prime city location.\", \"vi\": \"Văn phòng mới có giá cả khá hợp lý xét đến vị trí đắc địa ở trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-ljspeech-ad55c1b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-cori-ad55c1b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reasonably-e8df6427.webp', '[\"fairly\", \"moderately\", \"acceptably\"]', '[\"unreasonably\", \"excessively\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reasonably priced\", \"meaning\": \"có giá cả hợp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reasonably well\", \"meaning\": \"khá tốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rationally\", \"note_vi\": \"Rationally nhấn mạnh sự lý trí và logic thay vì mức độ vừa phải.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reasonable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reason\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reason\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-cori-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru0-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru5-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru6-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru10-ad55c1b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru9-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru3-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru7-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru8-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-aru2-ad55c1b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-ljspeech-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt408-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt138-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt624-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt396-ad55c1b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt498-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt132-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt288-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt42-ad55c1b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reasonably-lt90-ad55c1b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường kết hợp với tính từ chỉ giá cả hoặc chất lượng như reasonably priced.', 'finance', 1, 12),
('8e0ba133-003c-53e0-af52-1605ac2c4e83', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7a879fba-e78a-57d5-b640-a82959b20f00', '858699eb-b538-5735-8eec-215cfdcb32bb', 'lean', '/liːn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự nghiêng, độ nghiêng của một vật.', 'a movement or position in which something slopes or bends away from vertical.', 'The tower had a noticeable lean after the earthquake.', 'Tòa tháp có độ nghiêng rõ rệt sau trận động đất.', '{\"en\": \"Engineers inspected the noticeable lean of the old factory wall after the heavy storm.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ sư đã kiểm tra độ nghiêng rõ rệt của bức tường nhà máy cũ sau trận bão lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-ljspeech-8be47d2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-cori-8be47d2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lean-0a4f332c.webp', '[\"tilt\", \"incline\", \"sloping\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"slight lean\", \"meaning\": \"độ nghiêng nhẹ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"noticeable lean\", \"meaning\": \"độ nghiêng rõ rệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"learn\", \"note_vi\": \"learn là học hỏi, khác với lean là nghiêng hoặc nạc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lean\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lean\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-cori-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru0-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru5-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru6-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru10-8be47d2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru9-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru3-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru7-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru8-8be47d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lean-aru2-8be47d2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\":