('3d0e6520-e088-5620-a2d3-f63d092bff45', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7d218316-4f38-5c04-87b0-6d3884f4b11e', '52a2ea0c-76d8-5c18-b65d-adede20572ce', 'portly', '/ˈpɔːtli/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Hơi béo, có thân hình tròn trịa.', 'having a round and slightly fat body, often used to describe a man.', 'A portly executive greeted the international delegates warmly in the conference room.', 'Một vị lãnh đạo đẫy đà đã nồng nhiệt chào đón các đại biểu quốc tế trong phòng họp.', '{\"en\": \"The portly executive sat at the head of the table during the board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vị giám đốc có thân hình tròn trịa ngồi ở đầu bàn trong cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-ljspeech-7003cf81.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-cori-7003cf81.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/portly-a5641fe0.webp', '[\"stout\", \"plump\"]', '[\"thin\", \"slim\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"portly gentleman\", \"meaning\": \"quý ông béo tốt\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-cori-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru0-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru5-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru6-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru10-7003cf81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru9-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru3-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru7-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru8-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-aru2-7003cf81.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-ljspeech-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt408-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt138-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt624-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt396-7003cf81.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt498-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt132-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt288-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt42-7003cf81.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portly-lt90-7003cf81.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái lịch sự, nhẹ nhàng hơn từ \'fat\'.', 'other', 1, 9),
('dc1c7e8d-886a-54d0-a8b9-6d3ab3aa304c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7d218316-4f38-5c04-87b0-6d3884f4b11e', '52a2ea0c-76d8-5c18-b65d-adede20572ce', 'heavy industry', '/ˈhɛvi ˈɪndəstri/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Ngành công nghiệp sản xuất hàng hóa lớn, đòi hỏi nhiều vốn và nguyên vật liệu.', 'large-scale manufacturing that produces goods like steel, ships, or machinery using large equipment.', 'Steel manufacturing is a classic example of heavy industry.', 'Sản xuất thép là một ví dụ điển hình của công nghiệp nặng.', '{\"en\": \"Many countries are shifting their focus from heavy industry to technology and service sectors.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều quốc gia đang chuyển trọng tâm từ công nghiệp nặng sang các lĩnh vực công nghệ và dịch vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-ljspeech-5cb96a4a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-cori-5cb96a4a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heavy-industry-24afa7d9.webp', '[\"manufacturing\", \"industrial sector\"]', '[\"light industry\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"heavy industry sector\", \"meaning\": \"ngành công nghiệp nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"invest in heavy industry\", \"meaning\": \"đầu tư vào công nghiệp nặng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-cori-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru0-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru5-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru6-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru10-5cb96a4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru9-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru3-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru7-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru8-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-aru2-5cb96a4a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-ljspeech-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt408-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt138-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt624-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt396-5cb96a4a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt498-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt132-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt288-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt42-5cb96a4a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heavy-industry-lt90-5cb96a4a.mp3\"]}}', 'Đối lập với \'light industry\' (công nghiệp nhẹ).', 'manufacturing', 1, 10),
('187edbf8-2020-5ef2-8966-dbc3a73ebfd5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7d218316-4f38-5c04-87b0-6d3884f4b11e', '52a2ea0c-76d8-5c18-b65d-adede20572ce', 'unequalled', '/ʌnˈiːkwəld/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không có gì sánh bằng, không có đối thủ; vượt trội.', 'better or greater than any other of the same type, having no peer or rival.', 'Her talent for playing the piano was unequalled among her peers.', 'Tài năng chơi piano của cô ấy là vô song trong số những người cùng lứa.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate was selected for the position due to her unequalled expertise in international law.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên đã được lựa chọn vào vị trí này nhờ chuyên môn không ai sánh bằng trong luật quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-ljspeech-6ba24104.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-cori-6ba24104.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unequalled-19f8f98c.webp', '[\"unmatched\", \"unrivaled\", \"peerless\"]', '[\"surpassed\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unequalled quality\", \"meaning\": \"chất lượng không gì sánh bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unequalled reputation\", \"meaning\": \"danh tiếng vượt trội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"equal\", \"note_vi\": \"bằng nhau, còn unequalled nghĩa là vượt trội không ai sánh bằng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"equal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"equality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-cori-6ba24104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-aru0-6ba24104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-aru5-6ba24104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-aru6-6ba24104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-aru10-6ba24104.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-aru9-6ba24104.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unequalled-aru3-6ba24104