('8e342aa8-ccfe-56da-ac61-afa166caaec8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7d218316-4f38-5c04-87b0-6d3884f4b11e', '52a2ea0c-76d8-5c18-b65d-adede20572ce', 'taxing', '/ˈtæksɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đòi hỏi nhiều nỗ lực, vất vả hoặc khó khăn.', 'needing a lot of effort, strength, or mental energy.', 'Running a marathon is a physically and mentally taxing experience.', 'Chạy marathon là một trải nghiệm nặng nhọc cả về thể chất lẫn tinh thần.', '{\"en\": \"Completing the quarterly report was a taxing task for the new clerk.\", \"vi\": \"Hoàn thành báo cáo quý là một nhiệm vụ vất vả với nhân viên mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-ljspeech-bce910a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-cori-bce910a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/taxing-36fcca47.webp', '[\"arduous\", \"demanding\"]', '[\"easy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"taxing work\", \"meaning\": \"công việc vất vả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mentally taxing\", \"meaning\": \"tốn sức trí óc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"taxi\", \"note_vi\": \"taxi là xe taxi, taxing là vất vả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"tax\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-cori-bce910a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru0-bce910a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru5-bce910a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru6-bce910a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru10-bce910a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru9-bce910a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru3-bce910a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru7-bce910a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru8-bce910a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/taxing-aru2-bce910a6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia