('e38b3988-dc41-5841-98fd-c8ff7f343fd7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7d218316-4f38-5c04-87b0-6d3884f4b11e', '52a2ea0c-76d8-5c18-b65d-adede20572ce', 'structural', 'UK: /ˈstrʌktʃərəl/ | US: /ˈstrʌktʃərəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thuộc về cấu trúc', 'relating to the overall arrangement, system, or essential framework of a building or object.', 'There are some structural defects in the old bridge.', 'Có một số khuyết tật cấu trúc trong cây cầu cũ.', '{\"en\": \"Engineers conducted a thorough inspection to ensure the building suffered no structural damage after the storm.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ sư đã tiến hành kiểm tra toàn diện để đảm bảo tòa nhà không chịu thiệt hại về mặt cấu trúc sau trận bão.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-ljspeech-fbed31bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-cori-fbed31bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/structural-8195efad.webp', '[\"constructional\", \"architectural\", \"organizational\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"structural damage\", \"meaning\": \"thiệt hại về mặt cấu trúc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"structural changes\", \"meaning\": \"những thay đổi mang tính cơ cấu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"structure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"structurally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-cori-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru0-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru5-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru6-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru10-fbed31bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru9-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru3-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru7-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru8-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-aru2-fbed31bc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-ljspeech-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt408-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt138-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt624-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt396-fbed31bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt498-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt132-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt288-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt42-fbed31bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/structural-lt90-fbed31bc.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong mảng xây dựng hoặc bất động sản TOEIC, thường gặp \'structural damage\' (thiệt hại cấu trúc) hay \'structural stability\' (độ ổn định cấu trúc).', 'construction', 1, 23),
('6add59b4-3425-57ba-85de-4b090ac4706e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '7d218316-4f38-5c04-87b0-6d3884f4b11e', '52a2ea0c-76d8-5c18-b65d-adede20572ce', 'inflammation', '/ˌɪnfləˈmeɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Phản ứng của cơ thể khi bị thương hoặc nhiễm trùng, gây sưng, đỏ, đau.', 'a physical condition where a part of the body becomes red, swollen, and painful.', 'Applying a cold compress immediately can help minimize inflammation after a workout injury.', 'Chườm lạnh ngay lập tức có thể giúp giảm thiểu tình trạng viêm sau chấn thương lúc tập thể thao.', '{\"en\": \"The company health plan covers treatments for chronic inflammation caused by repetitive office tasks.\", \"vi\": \"Chương trình chăm sóc sức khỏe công ty chi trả cho việc điều trị viêm mãn tính do các công việc văn phòng lặp đi lặp lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-ljspeech-82623b00.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-cori-82623b00.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inflammation-70fb28ab.webp', '[\"swelling\", \"irritation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reduce inflammation\", \"meaning\": \"giảm viêm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chronic inflammation\", \"meaning\": \"viêm mãn tính\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"inflame\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-cori-82623b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-aru0-82623b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-aru5-82623b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-aru6-82623b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-aru10-82623b00.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-aru9-82623b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-aru3-82623b00.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inflammation-aru7-82623b00.mp3\", \"/sto