('83d507a7-4c53-50f6-b6a5-a526cf090fd5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'tremendous', '/trəˈmendəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất lớn, phi thường hoặc đáng kinh ngạc.', 'very great in amount, scale, or intensity, often causing surprise or admiration.', 'The new marketing strategy brought tremendous growth in online sales this quarter.', 'Chiến lược tiếp thị mới đã mang lại sự tăng trưởng to lớn cho doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department achieved a tremendous increase in sales after launching the new advertising campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng tiếp thị đã đạt được sự gia tăng doanh số đáng kể sau khi tung ra chiến dịch quảng cáo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-ljspeech-e6c8f31e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-cori-e6c8f31e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tremendous-3825fa7a.webp', '[\"enormous\", \"immense\"]', '[\"tiny\", \"insignificant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tremendous effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực to lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tremendous success\", \"meaning\": \"thành công vang dội\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"tremendously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-cori-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru0-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru5-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru6-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru10-e6c8f31e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru9-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru3-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru7-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru8-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-aru2-e6c8f31e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-ljspeech-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt408-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt138-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt624-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt396-e6c8f31e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt498-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt132-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt288-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt42-e6c8f31e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tremendous-lt90-e6c8f31e.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để nhấn mạnh quy mô hoặc mức độ của một sự việc.', 'business', 1, 0),
('aa2aeb70-d771-5bce-9008-20a39ec1bdb6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'consideration', 'UK: /kənˌsɪdəˈreɪʃn/ | US: /kənˌsɪdəˈreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự cân nhắc, sự xem xét', 'Careful thought about something, especially before making a choice or deciding what to do.', 'Please give careful consideration to my proposal.', 'Xin hãy xem xét kỹ lưỡng đề xuất của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors will take all job applicants\' qualifications into careful consideration.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị sẽ cân nhắc kỹ lưỡng tất cả bằng cấp của các ứng viên xin việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-ljspeech-5e05bd28.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-cori-5e05bd28.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consideration-fa4d791a.webp', '[\"deliberation\", \"scrutiny\", \"thought\", \"attention\"]', '[\"disregard\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take into consideration\", \"meaning\": \"tính đến, cân nhắc đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under consideration\", \"meaning\": \"đang được xem xét\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"consider\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"considerable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"considerate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-cori-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru0-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru5-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru6-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru10-5e05bd28.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru9-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru3-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru7-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru8-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-aru2-5e05bd28.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-ljspeech-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt408-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt138-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt624-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt396-5e05bd28.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt498-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt132-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt288-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt42-5e05bd28.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consideration-lt90-5e05bd28.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay xuất hiện trong các cấu trúc: \'take something into consideration\' (cân nhắc) hoặc \'under consideration\' (đang được xem xét).', 'human resources', 1, 1),
('e794f43c-ce71-5f3e-91f6-5a765a221d80', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'unfulfilled', '/ˌʌnfʊlˈfɪld/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Chưa đạt được, chưa thực hiện được hoặc cảm thấy trống rỗng.', 'not having achieved what you wanted or feeling that your life lacks something important.', 'Despite her success, she felt an unfulfilled desire to travel the world.', 'Mặc dù thành công, cô ấy vẫn cảm thấy một khao khát chưa thỏa mãn là được đi du lịch vòng quanh thế giới.', '{\"en\": \"The manager felt unfulfilled because the project goals were not met by the team.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảm thấy không thỏa mãn vì các mục tiêu dự án không được nhóm hoàn thành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-ljspeech-f188a890.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-cori-f188a890.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unfulfilled-a91b71bb.webp', '[\"unsatisfied\", \"incomplete\"]', '[\"fulfilled\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unfulfilled potential\", \"meaning\": \"tiềm năng chưa được khai phá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unfulfilled promise\", \"meaning\": \"lời hứa chưa thực hiện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fulfill\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-cori-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru0-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru5-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru6-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru10-f188a890.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru9-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru3-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru7-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru8-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-aru2-f188a890.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-ljspeech-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt408-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt138-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt624-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt396-f188a890.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt498-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt132-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt288-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt42-f188a890.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfulfilled-lt90-f188a890.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả cảm giác chưa thỏa mãn hoặc mục tiêu chưa đạt.', 'office', 1, 2),
('b00272f8-bbdb-53f2-bd18-b7351ce286c5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'Bollywood', '/ˈbɒlɪwʊd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'ngành công nghiệp điện ảnh lớn của Ấn Độ, có trụ sở tại Mumbai.', 'the large film industry based in mumbai that produces many popular musical movies.', 'Many people enjoy the vibrant music and dance in Bollywood movies.', 'Nhiều người yêu thích âm nhạc và điệu nhảy sôi động trong các bộ phim Bollywood.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing agency is planning to collaborate with a famous Bollywood studio for the advertisement.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý tiếp thị của chúng tôi đang lên kế hoạch hợp tác với một hãng phim Bollywood nổi tiếng cho quảng cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-ljspeech-b7e0f1cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-cori-b7e0f1cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bollywood-522f0d26.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"Bollywood movie\", \"meaning\": \"phim Bollywood\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-cori-b7e0f1cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru0-b7e0f1cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru5-b7e0f1cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru6-b7e0f1cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru10-b7e0f1cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru9-b7e0f1cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru3-b7e0f1cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru7-b7e0f1cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru8-b7e0f1cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-aru2-b7e0f1cd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bollywood-ljspeech-b7e0f1cd.m