('127b6d04-44d8-596f-93b4-4f78299bfe31', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'fin', '/fɪn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bộ phận dẹt, mỏng dùng để bơi lội hoặc giữ thăng bằng của cá và các loài thủy sinh.', 'a thin flat part on a fish\'s body that helps it move or stay balanced.', 'The diver noticed a small fish with a colorful dorsal fin swimming nearby.', 'Người thợ lặn nhận ra một chú cá nhỏ với chiếc vây lưng sặc sỡ đang bơi gần đó.', '{\"en\": \"The aquarium staff carefully checked the shark\'s fin for any signs of injury or disease.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên thủy cung đã kiểm tra cẩn thận vây của con cá mập để tìm dấu hiệu bị thương hoặc bệnh tật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-ljspeech-b76049e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-cori-b76049e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fin-12eeb20a.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"dorsal fin\", \"meaning\": \"vây lưng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shark fin\", \"meaning\": \"vây cá mập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fine\", \"note_vi\": \"phát âm gần giống nhưng nghĩa là tốt hoặc tiền phạt.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-cori-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru0-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru5-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru6-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru10-b76049e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru9-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru3-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru7-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru8-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-aru2-b76049e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-ljspeech-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt408-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt138-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt624-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt396-b76049e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt498-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt132-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt288-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt42-b76049e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fin-lt90-b76049e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'fine\' (tiền phạt) vì cách phát âm khác nhau ở âm cuối.', 'other', 1, 10),
('d328119b-bf9b-53ca-9168-8adfab54351a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'motion sickness', '/ˈməʊʃən ˈsɪknəs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cảm giác buồn nôn, chóng mặt khi di chuyển bằng phương tiện.', 'feeling of nausea caused by movement in a vehicle.', 'Passengers should take medication before the flight if they frequently suffer from motion sickness.', 'Hành khách nên uống thuốc trước chuyến bay nếu họ thường xuyên bị say tàu xe.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agent advised pills for motion sickness on the flight.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch khuyên dùng thuốc cho chứng say tàu xe khi bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-ljspeech-7c6d7770.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-cori-7c6d7770.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/motion-sickness-c8ede92c.webp', '[\"travel sickness\", \"car sickness\", \"seasickness\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"get motion sickness\", \"meaning\": \"bị say tàu xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"suffer from motion sickness\", \"meaning\": \"chịu cảnh say tàu xe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent motion sickness\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn ngừa say tàu xe\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"morning sickness\", \"note_vi\": \"morning sickness là ốm nghén, không phải do đi xe\"}, {\"word\": \"motion picture\", \"note_vi\": \"motion picture là phim điện ảnh, khác say xe\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"motion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sick\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-cori-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru0-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru5-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru6-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru10-7c6d7770.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru9-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru3-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru7-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru8-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-aru2-7c6d7770.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-ljspeech-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt408-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt138-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt624-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt396-7c6d7770.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt498-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt132-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt288-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt42-7c6d7770.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/motion-sickness-lt90-7c6d7770.mp3\"]}}', 'Motion sickness là say tàu xe, không nhầm với morning sickness (ốm nghén).', 'travel', 1, 11),
('8bd7a065-f1e8-51f6-ac7c-4c665274ea6e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'rudely', '/ˈruːdli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách bất lịch sự, thiếu tôn trọng người khác.', 'in a way that is impolite or shows a lack of respect for others.', 'He spoke rudely to the waiter, which made everyone at the table uncomfortable.', 'Anh ta nói chuyện thô lỗ với người phục vụ, khiến mọi người ở bàn đều cảm thấy khó chịu.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist answered the client rudely, causing a formal complaint to human resources.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân đã trả lời khách hàng một cách bất lịch sự, gây ra một khiếu nại chính thức gửi đến phòng nhân sự.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-ljspeech-f7ada363.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-cori-f7ada363.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rudely-5291394d.webp', '[\"impolitely\", \"discourteously\", \"disrespectfully\"]', '[\"politely\", \"courteously\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"speak rudely\", \"meaning\": \"nói chuyện bất lịch sự\"}, {\"phrase\": \"behave rudely\", \"meaning\": \"cư xử khiếm nhã\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crudely\", \"note_vi\": \"crudely nghĩa là thô sơ, chưa gọt giũa hoặc thô thiển.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rude\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rudeness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-cori-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru0-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru5-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru6-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru10-f7ada363.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru9-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru3-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru7-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru8-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-aru2-f7ada363.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-ljspeech-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt408-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt138-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt624-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt396-f7ada363.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt498-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt132-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt288-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt42-f7ada363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rudely-lt90-f7ada363.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'crudely\' (thô sơ, đơn giản).', 'office', 1, 12),
('8f01f93c-23e3-50f5-a43d-5525a89c4a1f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'sincerely', '/sɪnˈsɪəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách thật lòng, không giả dối.', 'in a way that shows your true feelings and you really mean what you say.', 'I sincerely apologize for the misunderstanding.', 'Tôi thành thật xin lỗi vì sự hiểu lầm.', '{\"en\": \"I sincerely hope that our two companies can build a strong and long-term business partnership.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi chân thành hy vọng rằng hai công ty chúng ta có thể xây dựng mối quan hệ đối tác lâu dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-ljspeech-aac84030.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-cori-aac84030.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sincerely-2a90834f.webp', '[\"genuinely\", \"honestly\"]', '[\"insincerely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sincerely apologize\", \"meaning\": \"chân thành xin lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"yours sincerely\", \"meaning\": \"trân trọng (kết thư)\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"sincere\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sincerity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-cori-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru0-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru5-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru6-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru10-aac84030.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru9-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru3-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru7-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru8-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-aru2-aac84030.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-ljspeech-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt408-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt138-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt624-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt396-aac84030.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt498-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt132-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt288-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt42-aac84030.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sincerely-lt90-aac84030.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng ở cuối thư trang trọng trước khi ký tên.', 'office', 1, 13),
('321c8713-194a-56f7-b5d9-3d802e8b5825', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'alliteration', '/əˌlɪtəˈreɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Biện pháp tu từ lặp lại âm đầu của các từ gần nhau.', 'the use of the same sound at the beginning of words that are close together.', 'Poets frequently use alliteration to create a rhythmic sound in their verses.', 'Các nhà thơ thường xuyên sử dụng phép điệp âm để tạo ra âm điệu nhịp nhàng trong các câu thơ của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team used alliteration in the new slogan to make it more memorable.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã sử dụng biện pháp lặp âm đầu trong khẩu hiệu mới để làm nó dễ nhớ hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-ljspeech-42f9c38d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-cori-42f9c38d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/alliteration-b2ea8eb2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"use alliteration\", \"meaning\": \"sử dụng biện pháp lặp âm đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"poetic alliteration\", \"meaning\": \"sự lặp âm đầu trong thơ ca\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assonance\", \"note_vi\": \"assonance là lặp lại nguyên âm, alliteration là lặp âm đầu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"alliterative\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"alliterate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-cori-42f9c38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-aru0-42f9c38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-aru5-42f9c38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-aru6-42f9c38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-aru10-42f9c38d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-aru9-42f9c38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/alliteration-aru3-42f9c38d.mp3\", \"/storag