('7a76d723-795a-5c9f-842c-c6e4557971f2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'whisker', '/ˈwɪskə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sợi lông cứng dài trên mặt động vật (như mèo, chuột) hoặc râu mép của người.', 'a long, stiff hair that grows near the mouth of some animals.', 'The rabbit brushed its long whiskers clean after finishing a meal of carrots.', 'Con thỏ lau sạch bộ râu dài của nó sau khi ăn xong bữa cà rốt.', '{\"en\": \"The mascot costume was designed with long whiskers to make it look like a friendly cat.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ trang phục linh vật được thiết kế với những sợi râu dài để trông giống một chú mèo thân thiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-ljspeech-b1205041.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-cori-b1205041.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whisker-9718472b.webp', '[\"bristle\", \"beard\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cat\'s whiskers\", \"meaning\": \"râu mèo\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-cori-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru0-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru5-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru6-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru10-b1205041.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru9-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru3-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru7-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru8-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-aru2-b1205041.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-ljspeech-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt408-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt138-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt624-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt396-b1205041.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt498-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt132-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt288-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt42-b1205041.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whisker-lt90-b1205041.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'by a whisker\' rất phổ biến trong kinh doanh khi nói về việc thắng thầu sát nút.', 'other', 1, 16),
('19ad19a5-181d-5c75-b117-fd008993b43b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'confine', '/kənˈfaɪn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Giam giữ hoặc giới hạn trong một không gian, phạm vi.', 'to keep someone or something within a limited space or area.', 'The doctor advised her to confine herself to bed for a few days.', 'Bác sĩ khuyên cô ấy nên nằm nghỉ trên giường vài ngày.', '{\"en\": \"Management decided to confine the budget discussion to senior staff members only.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý quyết định giới hạn cuộc thảo luận ngân sách chỉ dành cho các nhân viên cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-ljspeech-181f12ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-cori-181f12ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confine-fa85dde3.webp', '[\"restrict\", \"limit\", \"contain\"]', '[\"free\", \"release\", \"liberate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"confine to\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn vào, giam trong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confine oneself to\", \"meaning\": \"tự giới hạn bản thân trong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confine the discussion\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn phạm vi thảo luận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"restrain\", \"note_vi\": \"restrain nhấn mạnh kiềm chế hành động; confine nhấn mạnh giới hạn không gian\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"confinement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confined\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"confines\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-cori-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru0-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru5-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru6-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru10-181f12ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru9-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru3-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru7-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru8-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-aru2-181f12ff.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-ljspeech-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt408-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt138-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt624-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt396-181f12ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt498-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt132-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt288-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt42-181f12ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confine-lt90-181f12ff.mp3\"]}}', 'Confine to rất hay gặp trong văn bản hành chính khi giới hạn phạm vi công việc.', 'office', 1, 17),
('b715d915-c198-5621-a851-6e73731b411d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'half-life', '/ˈhɑːfˌlaɪf/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thời gian cần thiết để một nửa số nguyên tử phóng xạ phân rã.', 'period required for fifty percent of atoms to break down.', 'The half-life of Carbon-14 is about 5,730 years, which is used for dating ancient artifacts.', 'Chu kỳ bán rã của Carbon-14 là khoảng 5.730 năm, được dùng để xác định niên đại các cổ vật.', '{\"en\": \"The lab technician explained the half-life during the safety training.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên phòng thí nghiệm giải thích thời gian bán rã trong buổi đào tạo an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-ljspeech-4af4c546.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-cori-4af4c546.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/half-life-d39457a0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"half-life period\", \"meaning\": \"chu kỳ bán rã\"}, {\"phrase\": \"biological half-life\", \"meaning\": \"thời gian bán thải sinh học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lifetime\", \"note_vi\": \"lifetime là tuổi thọ, dài hơn half-life\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-cori-4af4c546.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-aru0-4af4c546.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-aru5-4af4c546.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-aru6-4af4c546.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-aru10-4af4c546.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-aru9-4af4c546.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-aru3-4af4c546.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-aru7-4af4c546.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-life-aru8-4af4c546.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v