('2d565bff-f3a2-5dc4-893f-2a0ea7764fbc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'renovate', 'UK: /ˈrenəveɪt/ | US: /ˈrenəveɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'cải tạo, sửa chữa', 'To restore a building or structure to a good condition by repairing or updating it.', 'The company plans to renovate the old office building next year.', 'Công ty có kế hoạch cải tạo tòa nhà văn phòng cũ vào năm tới.', '{\"en\": \"The company decided to renovate the main office building to attract modern tech clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã quyết định cải tạo tòa nhà văn phòng chính để thu hút các khách hàng công nghệ hiện đại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-ljspeech-687943ae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-cori-687943ae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/renovate-0cd37f29.webp', '[\"remodel\", \"refurbish\", \"restore\", \"upgrade\"]', '[\"demolish\", \"destroy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"renovate the office\", \"meaning\": \"cải tạo văn phòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extensively renovate\", \"meaning\": \"cải tạo trên quy mô lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"renew\", \"note_vi\": \"renew là gia hạn thời hạn hợp đồng/giấy tờ, renovate là sửa sang nâng cấp nhà cửa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"renovation\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"renovator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-cori-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru0-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru5-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru6-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru10-687943ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru9-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru3-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru7-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru8-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-aru2-687943ae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-ljspeech-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt408-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt138-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt624-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt396-687943ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt498-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt132-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt288-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt42-687943ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renovate-lt90-687943ae.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cho tòa nhà, văn phòng, phòng ốc (cải tạo, nâng cấp cơ sở vật chất).', 'real estate', 1, 28),
('d6face53-b83d-5e2a-b172-ead2a705e799', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '80496d89-b7bd-53e1-a9ed-eab952a49469', '72ad7a19-3ae7-567e-ac2d-cf2c17883d08', 'airy', '/ˈeəri/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều không khí trong lành, thoáng đãng.', 'having plenty of fresh wind and space, making a room feel pleasant and light.', 'The living room was bright and airy, with large windows overlooking the garden.', 'Phòng khách sáng sủa và thoáng mát, với những cửa sổ lớn nhìn ra vườn.', '{\"en\": \"The new office design features an airy layout to improve employee comfort and productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế văn phòng mới có bố cục thoáng đãng để cải thiện sự thoải mái và năng suất của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-ljspeech-9318bf60.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-cori-9318bf60.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/airy-940991db.webp', '[\"spacious\", \"ventilated\"]', '[\"stuffy\", \"cramped\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"airy room\", \"meaning\": \"căn phòng thoáng đãng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"light and airy\", \"meaning\": \"sáng sủa và thoáng mát\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"air\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-cori-9318bf60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru0-9318bf60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru5-9318bf60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru6-9318bf60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru10-9318bf60.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru9-9318bf60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru3-9318bf60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru7-9318bf60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru8-9318bf60.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/airy-aru2-9318bf60.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/objec