('00355b8c-ff90-5b48-9223-62048298089e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'stalking', '/ˈstɔːkɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành vi theo dõi, quấy rối hoặc đe dọa ai đó một cách dai dẳng.', 'the act of following or watching someone in a way that is annoying or dangerous.', 'Strict laws have been introduced to protect victims from online stalking.', 'Các luật lệ nghiêm khắc đã được đưa ra để bảo vệ nạn nhân khỏi sự rình rập trên mạng.', '{\"en\": \"The company has a strict policy against workplace stalking to ensure the safety of all employees.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty có chính sách nghiêm ngặt chống lại hành vi theo dõi tại nơi làm việc để đảm bảo an toàn cho nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-ljspeech-c814081c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-cori-c814081c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stalking-90fc7d21.webp', '[\"harassment\", \"following\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"workplace stalking\", \"meaning\": \"theo dõi tại nơi làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"report stalking\", \"meaning\": \"báo cáo hành vi theo dõi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stalk\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stalker\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-cori-c814081c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-aru0-c814081c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-aru5-c814081c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-aru6-c814081c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-aru10-c814081c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-aru9-c814081c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-aru3-c814081c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stalking-aru7-c814081c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2