('be7d2bb8-f75d-5057-8427-d841cb1558af', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'fortify', '/ˈfɔːtɪfaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho một nơi hoặc một thứ gì đó mạnh hơn, kiên cố hơn.', 'to make a place or structure stronger and more secure against possible attacks or damage.', 'They decided to fortify the old castle walls against potential attacks.', 'Họ quyết định củng cố các bức tường lâu đài cũ để chống lại các cuộc tấn công tiềm tàng.', '{\"en\": \"The security team decided to fortify the main entrance to prevent any unauthorized access attempts.\", \"vi\": \"Đội an ninh quyết định gia cố lối vào chính để ngăn chặn mọi nỗ lực truy cập trái phép.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-ljspeech-3d2d27eb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-cori-3d2d27eb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fortify-57cc3a02.webp', '[\"strengthen\", \"reinforce\"]', '[\"weaken\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fortify a position\", \"meaning\": \"củng cố vị trí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fortify against\", \"meaning\": \"gia cố chống lại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fortification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-cori-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru0-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru5-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru6-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru10-3d2d27eb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru9-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru3-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru7-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru8-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-aru2-3d2d27eb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-ljspeech-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt408-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt138-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt624-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt396-3d2d27eb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt498-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt132-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt288-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt42-3d2d27eb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fortify-lt90-3d2d27eb.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với \'fort\' (pháo đài), từ này là động từ.', 'business', 1, 6),
('a6f7a73c-86f6-53e1-9c4a-855db5307fa1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'inviting', '/ɪnˈvaɪtɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Hấp dẫn, lôi cuốn, khiến người khác muốn đến gần hoặc tham gia.', 'having attractive qualities that make people feel comfortable and want to be involved.', 'The clear blue water of the swimming pool looked extremely inviting on hot afternoons.', 'Làn nước xanh trong của hồ bơi trông cực kỳ hấp dẫn vào những buổi chiều oi nóng.', '{\"en\": \"The renovated lobby creates an inviting atmosphere for potential clients entering the office.\", \"vi\": \"Sảnh mới được cải tạo tạo ra một bầu không khí lôi cuốn cho các khách hàng tiềm năng khi vào văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-ljspeech-0993ede8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-cori-0993ede8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inviting-95d8a1e9.webp', '[\"welcoming\", \"attractive\", \"appealing\"]', '[\"unwelcoming\", \"repulsive\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inviting atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí thân thiện lôi cuốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inviting smile\", \"meaning\": \"nụ cười lôi cuốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"invitation\", \"note_vi\": \"Invitation là danh từ (lời mời), còn inviting là tính từ (hấp dẫn/lôi cuốn).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"invite\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"invitation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-cori-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru0-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru5-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru6-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru10-0993ede8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru9-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru3-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru7-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru8-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-aru2-0993ede8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-ljspeech-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt408-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt138-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt624-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt396-0993ede8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt498-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt132-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt288-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt42-0993ede8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inviting-lt90-0993ede8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng mô tả không gian, bầu không khí làm việc hoặc nụ cười đón khách.', 'office', 1, 7),
('adbe0c14-d1e3-506b-98a3-312936067b27', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'deposit', 'UK: /dɪˈpɒzɪt/ | US: /dɪˈpɑzɪt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'mỏ, trầm tích', 'A layer or mass of a natural substance that has accumulated in the ground.', 'The region has rich mineral deposits.', 'Khu vực này có các mỏ khoáng sản phong phú.', '{\"en\": \"Geologists discovered a rich mineral deposit beneath the proposed construction site.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà địa chất đã phát hiện một mỏ khoáng sản phong phú bên dưới công trường xây dựng dự kiến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-ljspeech-1ffb8796.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-cori-1ffb8796.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deposit-98459446.webp', '[\"accumulation\", \"layer\", \"vein\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mineral deposit\", \"meaning\": \"mỏ khoáng sản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"oil deposit\", \"meaning\": \"mỏ dầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"depot\", \"note_vi\": \"kho chứa hàng hoặc trạm xe, khác với deposit (mỏ/tiền cọc)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"deposit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-cori-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru0-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru5-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru6-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru10-1ffb8796.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru9-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru3-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru7-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru8-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-aru2-1ffb8796.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-ljspeech-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt408-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt138-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt624-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt396-1ffb8796.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt498-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt132-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt288-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt42-1ffb8796.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deposit-lt90-1ffb8796.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa tiền đặt cọc/tiền gửi ngân hàng, trong ngữ cảnh tự nhiên/kỹ thuật \'deposit\' chỉ mỏ khoáng sản hoặc lớp tích tụ.', 'environment', 1, 8)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('8941089a-0e53-5e3e-8e90-19c4b09c6fd5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'subculture', '/ˈsʌbkʌltʃə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một nhóm người trong xã hội có những giá trị, chuẩn mực và phong cách sống riêng biệt.', 'a distinct cultural group within a larger culture with its own values and lifestyle.', 'The punk movement was a significant subculture in the 1970s.', 'Phong trào punk là một tiểu văn hóa quan trọng vào những năm 1970.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing agency studied the corporate subculture among young tech employees to design suitable ads.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tiếp thị đã nghiên cứu văn hóa phụ doanh nghiệp của các nhân viên công nghệ trẻ để thiết kế quảng cáo phù hợp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-ljspeech-3e191024.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-cori-3e191024.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/subculture-4ef4c062.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"youth subculture\", \"meaning\": \"văn hóa phụ của giới trẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"distinct subculture\", \"meaning\": \"văn hóa nhóm riêng biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"counterculture\", \"note_vi\": \"Counterculture là văn hóa phản kháng lại dòng văn hóa chính thống.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-cori-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru0-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru5-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru6-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru10-3e191024.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru9-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru3-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru7-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru8-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-aru2-3e191024.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-ljspeech-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt408-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt138-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt624-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt396-3e191024.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt498-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt132-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt288-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt42-3e191024.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subculture-lt90-3e191024.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố sub- nghĩa là phụ/tiểu, subculture là văn hóa phụ của một nhóm.', 'marketing', 1, 9),
('ba66ab9d-b680-5b04-9e9c-6baa55e8bd85', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'bravely', '/ˈbreɪvli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách dũng cảm, không sợ hãi khi đối mặt với nguy hiểm hay khó khăn.', 'in a way that shows no fear when facing danger or hard situations.', 'She bravely spoke up against unfair treatment during the department meeting.', 'Cô ấy đã dũng cảm lên tiếng chống lại sự đối xử bất công trong cuộc họp phòng ban.', '{\"en\": \"The manager bravely handled the angry client during the product launch meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã dũng cảm xử lý khách hàng giận dữ trong buổi ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-ljspeech-3830e287.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-cori-3830e287.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bravely-56f8d2de.webp', '[\"courageously\", \"valiantly\", \"heroically\"]', '[\"fearfully\", \"timidly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"act bravely\", \"meaning\": \"hành động dũng cảm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bravely face\", \"meaning\": \"dũng cảm đối mặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bravely fight\", \"meaning\": \"chiến đấu dũng cảm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"briefly\", \"note_vi\": \"briefly nghĩa là ngắn gọn, khác bravely dũng cảm\"}, {\"word\": \"brave\", \"note_vi\": \"brave là tính từ, bravely là phó từ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"brave\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bravery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-cori-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru0-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru5-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru6-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru10-3830e287.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru9-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru3-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru7-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru8-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-aru2-3830e287.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-ljspeech-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt408-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt138-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt624-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt396-3830e287.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt498-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt132-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt288-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt42-3830e287.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bravely-lt90-3830e287.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ bravely là phó từ, dùng bổ nghĩa động từ, không dùng làm tính từ.', 'office', 1, 10),
('6675bedc-d8cd-5051-9210-e930735839c3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'enunciate', '/ɪˈnʌnsieɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Phát âm rõ ràng, rành mạch.', 'to pronounce words clearly and carefully so that people can understand them easily.', 'The speaker was advised to enunciate during his presentation to sound more convincing.', 'Diễn giả được khuyên nên phát âm rõ ràng trong bài thuyết trình để nghe thuyết phục hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The customer service representative was trained to enunciate clearly when speaking with clients over the phone.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên chăm sóc khách hàng được đào tạo để phát âm rõ ràng khi nói chuyện điện thoại với khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-ljspeech-fa4b6059.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-cori-fa4b6059.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enunciate-3dbb6e3c.webp', '[\"articulate\", \"pronounce\", \"vocalize\"]', '[\"mumble\", \"mutter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enunciate clearly\", \"meaning\": \"phát âm rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enunciate words\", \"meaning\": \"phát âm các từ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"announce\", \"note_vi\": \"announce là thông báo, enunciate là phát âm rõ chữ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enunciation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-cori-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru0-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru5-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru6-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru10-fa4b6059.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru9-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru3-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru7-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru8-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-aru2-fa4b6059.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-ljspeech-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt408-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt138-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt624-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt396-fa4b6059.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt498-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt132-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt288-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt42-fa4b6059.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enunciate-lt90-fa4b6059.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất quan trọng trong các công việc đòi hỏi giao tiếp như tổng đài viên, diễn giả.', 'hr', 1, 11),
('1925554a-c520-599e-b3c9-5bded6063130', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'lunge', '/lʌndʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Đột ngột lao tới phía trước hoặc sang một bên.', 'to make a sudden forward movement towards someone or something in a forceful way.', 'The cat lunged at the toy mouse, catching it quickly.', 'Con mèo lao vào con chuột đồ chơi, tóm lấy nó rất nhanh.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard had to lunge forward to stop the intruder from entering the warehouse.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ đã phải lao tới phía trước để ngăn kẻ đột nhập vào kho hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-ljspeech-5ae8a327.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-cori-5ae8a327.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lunge-4c13f7c3.webp', '[\"pounce\", \"thrust\", \"charge\"]', '[\"retreat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lunge forward\", \"meaning\": \"lao về phía trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lunge at\", \"meaning\": \"lao vào ai hoặc cái gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"plunge\", \"note_vi\": \"Lunge là lao tới trước, plunge là lao xuống nước hoặc giảm mạnh.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"lunge\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-cori-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru0-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru5-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru6-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru10-5ae8a327.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru9-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru3-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru7-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru8-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-aru2-5ae8a327.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-ljspeech-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt408-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt138-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt624-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt396-5ae8a327.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt498-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt132-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt288-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt42-5ae8a327.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lunge-lt90-5ae8a327.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lunge (lao tới) với plunge (lao dốc/chìm xuống).', 'daily', 1, 12),
('86858c51-7595-5e8e-9648-7cf179db114a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'defect', 'UK: /ˈdiː.fekt/ | US: /ˈdiː.fekt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'lỗi, khuyết tật', 'A fault or imperfection that prevents something from working properly.', 'The car was returned due to a manufacturing defect.', 'Chiếc xe đã được trả lại do lỗi sản xuất.', '{\"en\": \"The factory inspector identified a minor manufacturing defect in the batch of laptop batteries.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra nhà máy đã phát hiện một lỗi sản xuất nhỏ trong lô pin máy tính xách tay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-ljspeech-1ca07399.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-cori-1ca07399.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defect-1b0b9a75.webp', '[\"flaw\", \"fault\", \"imperfection\", \"blemish\"]', '[\"perfection\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"manufacturing defect\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi sản xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"zero defects\", \"meaning\": \"không có lỗi / khuyết tật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"defeat\", \"note_vi\": \"đánh bại hoặc sự thất bại (khác với defect là khuyết điểm/lỗi sản phẩm)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"defective\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-cori-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru0-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru5-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru6-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru10-1ca07399.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru9-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru3-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru7-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defect-aru8-1ca07399.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public