('8af9861b-35bb-59f7-b5a8-df8c41c1948d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '83de1112-855a-5499-baad-9d0e670f361e', 'ecdfe342-59f0-58df-8fcd-4c8674884af5', 'infected', '/ɪnˈfektɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Bị nhiễm trùng, bị lây bệnh.', 'containing harmful bacteria or viruses that cause illness or prevent a wound from healing.', 'The doctor said the wound was infected and needed immediate treatment.', 'Bác sĩ nói vết thương đã bị nhiễm trùng và cần được điều trị ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"The medical report indicated that the equipment was contaminated and potentially infected the patient\'s wound.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo y tế chỉ ra rằng thiết bị đã bị nhiễm bẩn và có khả năng làm vết thương của bệnh nhân bị nhiễm trùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-ljspeech-afc795ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-cori-afc795ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/infected-c56487ee.webp', '[\"contaminated\", \"septic\"]', '[\"clean\", \"sterile\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"infected wound\", \"meaning\": \"vết thương nhiễm trùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become infected\", \"meaning\": \"bị nhiễm trùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"infection\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"infect\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-cori-afc795ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-aru0-afc795ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-aru5-afc795ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-aru6-afc795ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-aru10-afc795ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-aru9-afc795ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-aru3-afc795ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-aru7-afc795ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/infected-aru8