('563150fc-6df1-5978-9cb1-d3321a38ec9b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'trim', '/trɪm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Cắt tỉa để làm cho gọn gàng, đẹp hơn hoặc giảm bớt.', 'to make something look neater by cutting small pieces off it, or to reduce an amount.', 'I need to trim the hedges in the garden before they get too overgrown.', 'Tôi cần cắt tỉa hàng rào trong vườn trước khi chúng mọc quá um tùm.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors decided to trim the marketing budget to save money this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã quyết định cắt giảm ngân sách tiếp thị để tiết kiệm tiền trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-ljspeech-7ab4b0a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-cori-7ab4b0a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/trim-09f7b28b.webp', '[\"cut\", \"reduce\", \"prune\"]', '[\"increase\", \"expand\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"trim costs\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"trim the budget\", \"meaning\": \"cắt giảm ngân sách\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trim\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"trimmer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-cori-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru0-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru5-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru6-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru10-7ab4b0a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru9-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru3-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru7-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru8-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-aru2-7ab4b0a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-ljspeech-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt408-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt138-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt624-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt396-7ab4b0a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt498-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt132-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt288-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt42-7ab4b0a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/trim-lt90-7ab4b0a8.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'trim\' thường mang nghĩa bóng là cắt giảm chi phí (trim costs/budget) hơn là cắt tóc/cây.', 'finance', 1, 6),
('d7c3c4c9-2bbc-586d-ac44-ddd052c9116f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'preclude', '/prɪˈkluːd/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Ngăn cản, loại trừ khả năng xảy ra điều gì đó.', 'to prevent something from happening or make it impossible for someone to do something.', 'Budget constraints will preclude the team from hiring additional staff this quarter.', 'Những hạn chế về ngân sách sẽ ngăn cản nhóm tuyển thêm nhân viên trong quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The terms of the contract preclude the manager from working with other competing firms.\", \"vi\": \"Các điều khoản của hợp đồng ngăn cản người quản lý làm việc với các công ty đối thủ khác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-ljspeech-085ba735.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-cori-085ba735.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/preclude-7d268f62.webp', '[\"prevent\", \"exclude\", \"hinder\"]', '[\"permit\", \"allow\", \"promote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"preclude the possibility\", \"meaning\": \"loại trừ khả năng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"preclude someone from doing\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn cản ai đó làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exclude\", \"note_vi\": \"exclude là loại ra khỏi nhóm, preclude là ngăn chặn xảy ra\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"preclusion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-cori-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru0-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru5-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru6-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru10-085ba735.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru9-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru3-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru7-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru8-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-aru2-085ba735.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-ljspeech-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt408-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt138-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt624-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt396-085ba735.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt498-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt132-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt288-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt42-085ba735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preclude-lt90-085ba735.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'from\' + V-ing.', 'law', 1, 7),
('c605945b-8103-50b4-b2cf-f6af162e7450', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'delve', '/delv/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Nghiên cứu hoặc tìm hiểu kỹ lưỡng một vấn đề, thông tin.', 'to search deeply and thoroughly to find information about something.', 'She decided to delve deeper into the historical records to find the truth.', 'Cô ấy quyết định tìm hiểu sâu hơn vào các tài liệu lịch sử để tìm ra sự thật.', '{\"en\": \"The market research team will delve into customer data before launching the new product.\", \"vi\": \"Đội nghiên cứu thị trường sẽ tìm hiểu kỹ dữ liệu khách hàng trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-ljspeech-c231b852.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-cori-c231b852.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delve-cee56b85.webp', '[\"investigate\", \"explore\", \"research\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"delve into details\", \"meaning\": \"đi sâu vào chi tiết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delve into the past\", \"meaning\": \"tìm hiểu về quá khứ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dwell\", \"note_vi\": \"Dwell là sinh sống hoặc cứ suy nghĩ mãi về điều gì.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-cori-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru0-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru5-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru6-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru10-c231b852.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru9-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru3-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru7-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru8-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-aru2-c231b852.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-ljspeech-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt408-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt138-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt624-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt396-c231b852.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt498-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt132-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt288-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt42-c231b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delve-lt90-c231b852.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'into\' để chỉ việc đào sâu, nghiên cứu kỹ một chủ đề.', 'business', 1, 8),
('8f217816-afa8-5ce8-a6ec-ad4a1a405a8a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'ambiguous', '/æmˈbɪɡjuəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Khó hiểu, có nhiều hơn một nghĩa, không rõ ràng.', 'having or expressing more than one possible meaning, causing confusion or doubt.', 'The instructions were so ambiguous that nobody knew what to do.', 'Các hướng dẫn quá mơ hồ đến nỗi không ai biết phải làm gì.', '{\"en\": \"The contract contained ambiguous terms, so both companies decided to rewrite the document.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng chứa các điều khoản không rõ ràng, nên cả hai công ty quyết định viết lại tài liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-ljspeech-f476109f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-cori-f476109f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ambiguous-18b9a6ed.webp', '[\"unclear\", \"vague\", \"equivocal\"]', '[\"clear\", \"unambiguous\", \"explicit\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ambiguous terms\", \"meaning\": \"các điều khoản mơ hồ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ambiguous statement\", \"meaning\": \"phát biểu mập mờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ambivalent\", \"note_vi\": \"ambivalent chỉ cảm xúc mâu thuẫn, ambiguous chỉ thông tin mơ hồ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ambiguity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ambiguously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-cori-f476109f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-aru0-f476109f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-aru5-f476109f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-aru6-f476109f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-aru10-f476109f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-aru9-f476109f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambiguous-aru3-f476109f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub