('0a9faccb-60bf-5b4a-84a1-bf07e8b0caa0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'honeyed', '/ˈhʌnid/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Ngọt ngào, êm tai (thường dùng cho lời nói, giọng nói).', 'sounding very sweet and pleasant, but often not completely honest or sincere.', 'He used honeyed words to persuade her to agree.', 'Anh ấy dùng những lời ngọt ngào để thuyết phục cô ấy đồng ý.', '{\"en\": \"The salesperson used honeyed words to convince the client to sign the expensive contract.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bán hàng đã dùng những lời đường mật để thuyết phục khách hàng ký hợp đồng đắt tiền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-ljspeech-9b05fa14.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-cori-9b05fa14.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/honeyed-006aa2f5.webp', '[\"sweet\", \"soothing\", \"flattering\"]', '[\"harsh\", \"gruff\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"honeyed words\", \"meaning\": \"lời đường mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"honeyed tones\", \"meaning\": \"giọng điệu ngọt ngào\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"honey\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-cori-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru0-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru5-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru6-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru10-9b05fa14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru9-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru3-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru7-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru8-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-aru2-9b05fa14.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-ljspeech-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt408-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt138-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt624-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt396-9b05fa14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt498-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt132-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt288-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt42-9b05fa14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/honeyed-lt90-9b05fa14.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng với nghĩa bóng chỉ những lời nói ngọt ngào nhưng có thể giả tạo.', 'business', 1, 12),
('a6dbb2d5-c641-5e62-9ec1-acc9e7e98c4a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'stockroom', 'UK: /ˈstɒkruːm/ | US: /ˈstɑːkruːm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'kho chứa hàng', 'a room in a business establishment used for storing goods that are not currently displayed.', 'Please check the stockroom for additional supplies.', 'Vui lòng kiểm tra kho chứa hàng để lấy thêm vật tư.', '{\"en\": \"The clerk went to the stockroom to check if they had the shirt in a larger size.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bán hàng đã vào kho chứa hàng để kiểm tra xem họ có áo sơ mi cỡ lớn hơn không.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-ljspeech-f9d29b0c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-cori-f9d29b0c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stockroom-3d5d41a0.webp', '[\"storeroom\", \"depot\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stockroom clerk\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên quản lý kho hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep in the stockroom\", \"meaning\": \"cất giữ trong kho\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"warehouse\", \"note_vi\": \"nhà kho lớn dùng trong công nghiệp/hậu cần, quy mô rộng hơn stockroom\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-cori-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru0-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru5-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru6-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru10-f9d29b0c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru9-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru3-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru7-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru8-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-aru2-f9d29b0c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-ljspeech-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt408-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt138-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt624-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt396-f9d29b0c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt498-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt132-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt288-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt42-f9d29b0c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stockroom-lt90-f9d29b0c.mp3\"]}}', '\'Stockroom\' là kho chứa phía sau cửa hàng/văn phòng, khác với \'warehouse\' là nhà kho quy mô công nghiệp.', 'shopping', 1, 13),
('8313e0d2-e13a-5779-b6ef-5a3ec62c58ff', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'commuter', 'UK: /kəˈmjuːtər/ | US: /kəˈmjuːtər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'người đi làm hàng ngày', 'a person who travels a significant distance to work on a daily basis', 'Many commuters use public transport to avoid traffic.', 'Nhiều người đi làm hàng ngày sử dụng phương tiện giao thông công cộng để tránh kẹt xe.', '{\"en\": \"The commuter train was crowded during rush hour this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyến tàu dành cho người đi làm sáng nay rất đông đúc vào giờ cao điểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-ljspeech-2824b7c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-cori-2824b7c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commuter-85c0a036.webp', '[\"traveler\", \"passenger\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"commuter train\", \"meaning\": \"tàu chở khách đi làm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commuter pass\", \"meaning\": \"vé tháng/thẻ đi lại cho người đi làm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"commute\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commute\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-cori-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru0-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru5-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru6-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru10-2824b7c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru9-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru3-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru7-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru8-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-aru2-2824b7c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-ljspeech-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt408-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt138-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt624-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt396-2824b7c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt498-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt132-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt288-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt42-2824b7c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commuter-lt90-2824b7c1.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ người di chuyển hàng ngày từ nơi ở (thường ngoại thành) tới nơi làm việc (nội thành).', 'transportation', 1, 14),
('98638ac7-0f70-5db4-a4fa-5d384ee27dcc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'symmetrical', '/sɪˈmetrɪkl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng cân đối, hai bên giống hệt nhau.', 'having two sides that are the same in size, shape, and position to each other.', 'The artist designed the garden to be perfectly symmetrical, with identical flower beds on both sides.', 'Người nghệ sĩ đã thiết kế khu vườn đối xứng hoàn hảo, với những luống hoa giống hệt nhau ở cả hai bên.', '{\"en\": \"The architect created a symmetrical office layout to ensure a balanced and professional workspace.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã tạo ra bố cục văn phòng cân đối để đảm bảo không gian làm việc chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-ljspeech-95cc7b17.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-cori-95cc7b17.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/symmetrical-0204d299.webp', '[\"balanced\", \"even\"]', '[\"asymmetrical\", \"uneven\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"perfectly symmetrical\", \"meaning\": \"cân đối hoàn hảo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"symmetrical design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế cân xứng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"symmetry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-cori-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru0-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru5-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru6-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru10-95cc7b17.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru9-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru3-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru7-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru8-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-aru2-95cc7b17.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-ljspeech-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt408-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt138-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt624-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt396-95cc7b17.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt498-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt132-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt288-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt42-95cc7b17.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/symmetrical-lt90-95cc7b17.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ \'symmetry\' (sự đối xứng), dùng để mô tả sự hài hòa.', 'office', 1, 15),
('7d8c9ff4-8741-581e-8fef-bb388dcdc48d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'productivity', '/ˌprɒdʌkˈtɪvəti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Năng suất làm việc hoặc sản xuất.', 'the rate at which goods are produced or work is done.', 'Regular breaks can significantly improve employee productivity.', 'Nghỉ giải lao thường xuyên có thể cải thiện đáng kể năng suất của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"Our manager measured team productivity by the number of completed sales calls.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý của chúng tôi đo lường năng suất đội ngũ qua số lượng cuộc gọi bán hàng hoàn tất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-ljspeech-0d117e42.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-cori-0d117e42.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/productivity-082c041a.webp', '[\"efficiency\", \"output\", \"performance\"]', '[\"inefficiency\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"increase productivity\", \"meaning\": \"tăng năng suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"worker productivity\", \"meaning\": \"năng suất công nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"productivity tool\", \"meaning\": \"công cụ tăng năng suất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"production\", \"note_vi\": \"chỉ quá trình tạo ra hàng, không phải tỉ lệ hiệu quả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"productive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"productively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-cori-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru0-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru5-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru6-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru10-0d117e42.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru9-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru3-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru7-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru8-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-aru2-0d117e42.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-ljspeech-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt408-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt138-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt624-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt396-0d117e42.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt498-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt132-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt288-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt42-0d117e42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productivity-lt90-0d117e42.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ \'productive\' (adj) đi kèm thường là \'improve\' hoặc \'boost\'.', 'office', 1, 16),
('1c94ab15-ab9a-5de3-a1cb-88f581a69e0c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '860c05b3-ab2e-5a96-a0cb-3ac00217d1af', '6e81c9fb-99e5-5604-8971-5d2d74bf5a78', 'telecommunication', '/ˌtelikəˌmjuːnɪˈkeɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Việc truyền thông tin qua khoảng cách bằng các công nghệ điện tử.', 'the technology or process of sending signals, images, and words over long distances electronically.', 'Advances in telecommunication have made global communication much easier and faster.', 'Những tiến bộ trong viễn thông đã làm cho giao tiếp toàn cầu dễ dàng và nhanh chóng hơn rất nhiều.', '{\"en\": \"The telecommunication company launched a new high-speed mobile network service for corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty viễn thông đã ra mắt dịch vụ mạng di động tốc độ cao mới cho các khách hàng doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telecommunication-ljspeech-31763f61.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telecommunication-cori-31763f61.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/telecommunication-a8fcd579.webp', '[\"telecoms\", \"broadcasting\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"telecommunication network\", \"meaning\": \"mạng lưới viễn thông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"telecommunication industry\", \"meaning\": \"ngành công nghiệp viễn thông\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"communication\", \"note_vi\": \"Communication là truyền thông nói chung, telecommunication là viễn thông (truyền xa).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"telecommunicate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telecommunication-cori-31763f61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telecommunication-aru0-31763f61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telecommunication-aru5-31763f61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telecommunication-aru6-31763f61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/telecommunication-aru10-31763f61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pub