('3345b574-7c52-5088-9453-d162e59a11bb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'maybe', '/ˈmeɪbi/', 'A1', 'adverb', 'Biểu thị khả năng hoặc sự không chắc chắn, có thể xảy ra.', 'an adverb expressing uncertainty or indicating that an outcome has a chance of occurring', 'Maybe we should try a different approach to solve this problem.', 'Có lẽ chúng ta nên thử một cách tiếp cận khác để giải quyết vấn đề này.', '{\"en\": \"Maybe we should reschedule the meeting since the manager is currently busy.\", \"vi\": \"Có lẽ chúng ta nên đổi lịch cuộc họp vì quản lý hiện đang bận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-ljspeech-f1b58e1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-cori-f1b58e1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/maybe-12b121fa.webp', '[\"perhaps\", \"possibly\"]', '[\"definitely\", \"certainly\"]', NULL, '[{\"word\": \"may be\", \"note_vi\": \"maybe là trạng từ; may be là động từ khuyết thiếu đi kèm be.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-cori-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru0-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru5-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru6-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru10-f1b58e1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru9-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru3-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru7-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru8-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-aru2-f1b58e1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/maybe-ljspeech-f1b58e1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mayb