('0f79a1ee-3ab7-52a8-a4a1-c49b52c1e4e6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'climber', 'UK: /ˈklaɪmə/ | US: /ˈklaɪmər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'người leo núi', 'a person who scales mountains or high structures as a sport or job.', 'Experienced climbers prepared for the difficult ascent.', 'Những người leo núi kinh nghiệm đã chuẩn bị cho cuộc leo núi khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The outdoor equipment retailer sponsored a team of professional climbers for the expedition.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà bán lẻ thiết bị ngoài trời đã tài trợ cho một đội gồm các vận động viên leo núi chuyên nghiệp cho chuyến thám hiểm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-ljspeech-08e74d1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-cori-08e74d1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/climber-348fc9e5.webp', '[\"mountaineer\", \"scaler\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"experienced climber\", \"meaning\": \"người leo núi có kinh nghiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mountain climber\", \"meaning\": \"vận động viên leo núi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"climb\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"climb\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-cori-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru0-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru5-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru6-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru10-08e74d1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru9-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru3-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru7-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru8-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-aru2-08e74d1e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-ljspeech-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt408-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt138-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt624-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt396-08e74d1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt498-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt132-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt288-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt42-08e74d1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/climber-lt90-08e74d1e.mp3\"]}}', 'Chữ \'b\' trong \'climber\' cũng là âm câm (/ˈklaɪ.mər/). Cụm \'social climber\' chỉ người luôn tìm cách thăng tiến vị thế xã hội.', 'sports', 1, 7),
('1c115135-55e0-5a6e-a2b6-40a7e2759fa6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'enthusiastically', '/ɪnˌθjuːziˈæstɪkli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Với sự hăng hái, đầy nhiệt huyết.', 'in a way that shows great excitement, energy, and strong interest.', 'She greeted her old friends enthusiastically at the reunion.', 'Cô ấy chào đón những người bạn cũ một cách nhiệt tình tại buổi họp mặt.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team enthusiastically presented the new product line to potential investors.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng đã nhiệt tình giới thiệu dòng sản phẩm mới cho các nhà đầu tư tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiastically-ljspeech-86f4d091.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiastically-cori-86f4d091.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enthusiastically-d08481e2.webp', '[\"eagerly\", \"keenly\", \"passionately\"]', '[\"reluctantly\", \"half-heartedly\", \"apathetically\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"respond enthusiastically\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi một cách nhiệt tình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enthusiastically support\", \"meaning\": \"ủng hộ nhiệt tình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enthusiastically participate\", \"meaning\": \"tham gia hăng hái\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enthusiasm\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"enthusiastic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enthusiast\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiastically-cori-86f4d091.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiastically-aru0-86f4d091.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiastically-aru5-86f4d091.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiastically-aru6-86f4d091.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiastically-aru10-86f4d091.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enthusiastically-aru9-