('04beabbb-280f-515f-b1b8-7ce3b8ff4eca', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'flutter', '/ˈflʌtə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Bay phấp phới, rung động nhẹ nhàng.', 'to move lightly and quickly, often with small, rapid motions back and forth.', 'The butterflies began to flutter their wings in the warm breeze.', 'Những con bướm bắt đầu vỗ cánh phấp phới trong làn gió ấm.', '{\"en\": \"The flags began to flutter in the wind outside the hotel entrance this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Những lá cờ bắt đầu bay phấp phới trong gió bên ngoài lối vào khách sạn sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-ljspeech-ff25d178.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-cori-ff25d178.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flutter-87b618bb.webp', '[\"wave\", \"flap\"]', '[\"remain still\", \"settle\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"heart flutter\", \"meaning\": \"tim đập nhanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flutter in the breeze\", \"meaning\": \"bay phấp phới trong gió\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-cori-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru0-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru5-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru6-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru10-ff25d178.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru9-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru3-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru7-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru8-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-aru2-ff25d178.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-ljspeech-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt408-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt138-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt624-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt396-ff25d178.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt498-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt132-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt288-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt42-ff25d178.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flutter-lt90-ff25d178.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng tả chuyển động của lá cờ, cánh chim hoặc cảm giác hồi hộp.', 'travel', 1, 21),
('52d32fd5-aae8-57b4-9c1a-95e7e7576002', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'realism', '/ˈriːəlɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Xu hướng miêu tả sự vật, hiện tượng một cách chân thực, không tô vẽ.', 'the practice of representing things in a way that is accurate and true to life.', 'The artist is known for the striking realism in her portraits.', 'Nghệ sĩ này nổi tiếng với chủ nghĩa hiện thực nổi bật trong các bức chân dung của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing campaign focused on the realism of the product features to attract practical customers.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị tập trung vào tính thực tế của các tính năng sản phẩm để thu hút khách hàng thực tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-ljspeech-dfbfdcce.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-cori-dfbfdcce.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/realism-625b6e64.webp', '[\"authenticity\", \"truthfulness\"]', '[\"idealism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"social realism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa hiện thực xã hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stark realism\", \"meaning\": \"sự chân thực trần trụi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"realist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"realistic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-cori-dfbfdcce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-aru0-dfbfdcce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-aru5-dfbfdcce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-aru6-dfbfdcce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-aru10-dfbfdcce.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-aru9-dfbfdcce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-aru3-dfbfdcce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/realism-aru7-dfbfdcce.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v