('fefc24fc-e234-5ef7-903e-dc764b572641', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'disengaged', '/ˌdɪsɪnˈɡeɪdʒd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không tham gia, không quan tâm hoặc tách rời.', 'not feeling involved, interested, or emotionally connected to something.', 'Students who feel disengaged from school are more likely to drop out.', 'Những học sinh cảm thấy không còn quan tâm đến trường học có nhiều khả năng bỏ học hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The manager noticed that several disengaged workers were losing interest in their tasks.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhận thấy một vài nhân viên thiếu gắn kết đang dần mất hứng thú với nhiệm vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-ljspeech-2104b4ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-cori-2104b4ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disengaged-04c1cf1d.webp', '[\"detached\", \"indifferent\", \"uninvolved\"]', '[\"engaged\", \"involved\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disengaged employee\", \"meaning\": \"nhân viên thiếu gắn kết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel disengaged\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy thờ ơ, tách rời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"unemployed\", \"note_vi\": \"Disengaged là không gắn kết/thờ ơ, unemployed là thất nghiệp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disengage\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disengagement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-cori-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru0-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru5-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru6-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru10-2104b4ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru9-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru3-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru7-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru8-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-aru2-2104b4ec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-ljspeech-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt408-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt138-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt624-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt396-2104b4ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt498-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt132-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt288-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt42-2104b4ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disengaged-lt90-2104b4ec.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong nhân sự (HR), \'disengaged employee\' chỉ nhân viên làm việc hời hợt, thiếu gắn bó với công ty.', 'hr', 1, 23),
('025d43ad-30c6-5848-9de7-c573f0f32f5f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'dessert', '/dɪˈzɜːt/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Món ăn ngọt được dùng sau bữa chính.', 'a sweet dish that you eat at the end of a main meal.', 'For dessert, we had a delicious chocolate cake with ice cream.', 'Món tráng miệng của chúng tôi là một chiếc bánh sô cô la ngon tuyệt với kem.', '{\"en\": \"The business lunch concluded with a light fruit dessert served in the private room.\", \"vi\": \"Bữa trưa công việc kết thúc với món tráng miệng trái cây nhẹ được phục vụ tại phòng riêng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-ljspeech-f5194be9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-cori-f5194be9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dessert-a63f44c9.webp', '[\"sweet\", \"pudding\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have dessert\", \"meaning\": \"ăn tráng miệng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dessert menu\", \"meaning\": \"thực đơn tráng miệng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"desert\", \"note_vi\": \"sa mạc (danh từ) hoặc bỏ rơi (động từ), nhấn âm khác.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-cori-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru0-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru5-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru6-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru10-f5194be9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru9-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru3-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru7-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru8-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-aru2-f5194be9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-ljspeech-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt408-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt138-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt624-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt396-f5194be9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt498-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt132-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt288-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt42-f5194be9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dessert-lt90-f5194be9.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ gấp đôi chữ \'s\' vì nó là món ăn ngọt (sweet).', 'dining', 1, 24),
('920643cf-cc22-55a8-a6ec-f4ffa99eef0e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'relief', '/rɪˈliːf/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác nhẹ nhõm, thoải mái khi một điều khó chịu kết thúc.', 'a feeling of happiness when something unpleasant or difficult has ended.', 'It was a great relief to finally finish the difficult exam.', 'Thật là một sự khuây khỏa lớn khi cuối cùng cũng hoàn thành bài kiểm tra khó khăn đó.', '{\"en\": \"It was a great relief when the client signed the contract after months of negotiation.\", \"vi\": \"Thật là một sự nhẹ nhõm lớn khi khách hàng ký hợp đồng sau nhiều tháng đàm phán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-ljspeech-60cba265.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-cori-60cba265.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/relief-fb7b1e7d.webp', '[\"comfort\", \"solace\"]', '[\"anxiety\", \"worry\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sigh of relief\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng thở dài nhẹ nhõm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disaster relief\", \"meaning\": \"cứu trợ thiên tai\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"relieve\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"relieved\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-cori-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru0-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru5-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru6-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru10-60cba265.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru9-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru3-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru7-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru8-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-aru2-60cba265.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-ljspeech-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt408-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt138-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt624-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt396-60cba265.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt498-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt132-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt288-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt42-60cba265.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/relief-lt90-60cba265.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ của động từ relieve.', 'business', 1, 25),
('87a5ccce-318a-552b-9166-3fe4784f85e1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8804217b-30e4-53bf-be66-81b7aec7e4cb', 'fbf13434-b983-5284-8539-72de5154fbd2', 'constructive', 'UK: /kənˈstrʌktɪv/ | US: /kənˈstrʌktɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'mang tính xây dựng', 'Serving a useful purpose and helping to develop, produce, or improve something.', 'Your constructive criticism helps us improve our services.', 'Những lời phê bình mang tính xây dựng của bạn giúp chúng tôi cải thiện dịch vụ.', '{\"en\": \"Employees appreciated receiving constructive feedback during their annual performance reviews.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên rất trân trọng việc nhận được phản hồi mang tính xây dựng trong các kỳ đánh giá hiệu suất hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constructive-ljspeech-a419e37e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constructive-cori-a419e37e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/constructive-0f7247aa.webp', '[\"useful\", \"helpful\", \"productive\", \"valuable\"]', '[\"destructive\", \"unhelpful\", \"negative\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"constructive feedback\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi mang tính xây dựng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constructive suggestion\", \"meaning\": \"gợi ý mang tính xây dựng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"constructively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"construction\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"construct\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constructive-cori-a419e37e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constructive-aru0-a419e37e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constructive-aru5-a419e37e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constructive-aru6-a419e37e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constructive-aru10-a419e37e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constructive-aru9-a419e37e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cons