('cfbcc53a-bd6f-56c7-af2c-53453e86da01', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'costume', 'UK: /ˈkɒstjuːm/ | US: /ˈkɑːstuːm/', 'B1', 'noun', 'trang phục, y phục', 'clothes worn by actors or performer groups to portray a particular character or era', 'Actors wore colorful costumes for the play.', 'Các diễn viên mặc trang phục sặc sỡ cho vở kịch.', '{\"en\": \"The theater group hired a designer to create historical costumes for the play.\", \"vi\": \"Đoàn kịch đã thuê một nhà thiết kế để tạo ra các trang phục lịch sử cho vở diễn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-ljspeech-d55c6418.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-cori-d55c6418.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/costume-e730f1bb.webp', '[\"outfit\", \"attire\", \"garment\", \"disguise\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"costume party\", \"meaning\": \"tiệc hóa trang\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stage costume\", \"meaning\": \"trang phục sân khấu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"custom\", \"note_vi\": \"phong tục, tập quán\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"costumier\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-cori-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru0-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru5-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru6-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru10-d55c6418.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru9-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru3-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru7-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru8-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-aru2-d55c6418.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-ljspeech-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt408-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt138-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt624-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt396-d55c6418.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt498-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt132-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt288-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt42-d55c6418.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/costume-lt90-d55c6418.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'costume\' (trang phục biểu diễn/hóa trang) với \'custom\' (tập quán, phong tục).', 'entertainment', 1, 2),
('b53b3eec-c5b8-5a9e-a3b1-23f0bf183ac6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'acupuncture', '/ˈækjupʌŋktʃə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phương pháp chữa bệnh cổ truyền dùng kim châm vào các huyệt đạo.', 'a traditional medical treatment that involves sticking thin needles into specific body points to relieve pain.', 'The marketing director attends weekly acupuncture sessions to manage stress.', 'Giám đốc tiếp thị tham gia các buổi châm cứu hàng tuần để kiểm soát căng thẳng.', '{\"en\": \"The company health insurance policy covers acupuncture treatments for employees with chronic pain.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách bảo hiểm y tế của công ty chi trả cho các liệu trình châm cứu cho nhân viên bị đau mãn tính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-ljspeech-2c5866c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-cori-2c5866c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acupuncture-00eb26cf.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"acupuncture treatment\", \"meaning\": \"liệu trình châm cứu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"undergo acupuncture\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện châm cứu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"acupuncturist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-cori-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru0-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru5-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru6-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru10-2c5866c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru9-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru3-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru7-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru8-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-aru2-2c5866c3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-ljspeech-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt408-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt138-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt624-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt396-2c5866c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt498-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt132-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt288-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt42-2c5866c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acupuncture-lt90-2c5866c3.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý phát âm nhấn vào âm tiết thứ nhất /ˈæk.jə.pʌŋk.tʃər/.', 'health', 1, 3),
('c52cdaa0-12bc-59e1-b076-57815ce9db73', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'under the weather', '/ˈʌndə ðə ˈwɛðə/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Cảm thấy không khỏe, hơi ốm.', 'feeling slightly sick, ill, or unwell and not in good health.', 'Because Mark was under the weather, he missed the morning strategy session.', 'Vì Mark cảm thấy không khỏe, anh ấy đã bỏ lỡ buổi họp chiến lược buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"Mr. Jones called the office to say he was under the weather today.\", \"vi\": \"Ông Jones đã gọi điện cho văn phòng để báo rằng hôm nay ông ấy hơi mệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-ljspeech-9eb6e510.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-cori-9eb6e510.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/under-the-weather-e2e413b0.webp', '[\"unwell\", \"sick\", \"indisposed\"]', '[\"healthy\", \"well\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel under the weather\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy không khỏe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a bit under the weather\", \"meaning\": \"hơi mệt mỏi trong người\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-cori-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru0-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru5-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru6-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru10-9eb6e510.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru9-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru3-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru7-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru8-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-aru2-9eb6e510.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-ljspeech-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt408-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt138-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt624-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt396-9eb6e510.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt498-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt132-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt288-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt42-9eb6e510.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-weather-lt90-9eb6e510.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong văn nói để chỉ trạng thái mệt mỏi nhẹ, không đến mức bệnh nặng.', 'health', 1, 4),
('c223784b-018e-55a8-8b57-e41ae71119e5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'envision', '/ɪnˈvɪʒn/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Hình dung, tưởng tượng ra điều gì đó trong tương lai hoặc trong tâm trí.', 'to picture or imagine something in your mind, especially a future situation or outcome.', 'She could clearly envision her future as a successful artist.', 'Cô ấy có thể hình dung rõ ràng tương lai của mình là một nghệ sĩ thành công.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO envisions a global expansion of the company within five years.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành hình dung sự mở rộng toàn cầu của công ty trong vòng năm năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-ljspeech-2a84fb8c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-cori-2a84fb8c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/envision-9abc9932.webp', '[\"imagine\", \"visualize\", \"picture\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"envision a future\", \"meaning\": \"hình dung tương lai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"envision success\", \"meaning\": \"tưởng tượng ra thành công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"envision a scenario\", \"meaning\": \"hình dung một tình huống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"envisage\", \"note_vi\": \"envisage gần nghĩa nhưng phổ biến hơn ở tiếng Anh Anh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vision\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"visionary\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"envisage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-cori-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru0-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru5-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru6-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru10-2a84fb8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru9-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru3-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru7-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru8-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-aru2-2a84fb8c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-ljspeech-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt408-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt138-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt624-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt396-2a84fb8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt498-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt132-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt288-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt42-2a84fb8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/envision-lt90-2a84fb8c.mp3\"]}}', 'envision thường dùng trong văn phong trang trọng, hay gặp trong bài phát biểu của lãnh đạo doanh nghiệp.', 'business', 1, 5),
('43c5a5c3-fbe8-59bc-b77a-a5bd63a3769d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'defeated', '/dɪˈfiːtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Bị đánh bại, thua cuộc hoặc cảm thấy mất hết hy vọng.', 'feeling that you cannot achieve something or having lost a game or battle.', 'After losing the championship, the team looked utterly defeated.', 'Sau khi thua giải vô địch, đội bóng trông hoàn toàn thất bại.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team felt defeated after losing the major contract to a rival company.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm bán hàng cảm thấy thất bại sau khi để mất hợp đồng lớn vào tay công ty đối thủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-ljspeech-baeaa6d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-cori-baeaa6d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defeated-fed7574d.webp', '[\"beaten\", \"crushed\", \"hopeless\"]', '[\"victorious\", \"triumphant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look defeated\", \"meaning\": \"trông có vẻ thất bại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel defeated\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy thất bại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"utterly defeated\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn thất bại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"defective\", \"note_vi\": \"defective là bị lỗi (sản phẩm), defeated là bị đánh bại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"defeat\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"defeat\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-cori-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru0-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru5-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru6-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru10-baeaa6d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru9-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defeated-aru3-baeaa6d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/