('439932e0-020c-58ae-95bc-44aec95d6a1b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'romanticism', '/rəʊˈmæntɪsɪzəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phong trào nghệ thuật, văn học nhấn mạnh cảm xúc, cá nhân và sự tôn vinh tự nhiên.', 'a movement in arts that values emotion, individuality, and nature.', 'Romanticism in literature often features strong emotions and a focus on nature\'s beauty.', 'Chủ nghĩa lãng mạn trong văn học thường thể hiện những cảm xúc mạnh mẽ và tập trung vào vẻ đẹp của thiên nhiên.', '{\"en\": \"The museum exhibit on romanticism attracted many clients from the agency.\", \"vi\": \"Triển lãm bảo tàng về chủ nghĩa lãng mạn thu hút nhiều khách hàng từ agency.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-ljspeech-5abf0423.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-cori-5abf0423.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/romanticism-a7c89d6a.webp', NULL, '[\"realism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"romanticism movement\", \"meaning\": \"phong trào lãng mạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"literary romanticism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa lãng mạn văn học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"romance\", \"note_vi\": \"romance là chuyện tình cảm, romanticism là trào lưu nghệ thuật\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"romantic\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"romanticize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-cori-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru0-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru5-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru6-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru10-5abf0423.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru9-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru3-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru7-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru8-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-aru2-5abf0423.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-ljspeech-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt408-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt138-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt624-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt396-5abf0423.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt498-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt132-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt288-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt42-5abf0423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/romanticism-lt90-5abf0423.mp3\"]}}', 'Romanticism viết hoa khi nói phong trào lịch sử, không phải tình yêu.', 'other', 1, 12),
('744ff48c-a2ed-5a28-a270-c3b56a3dfb32', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'accuracy', 'UK: /ˈækjərəsi/ | US: /ˈækjərəsi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'độ chính xác', 'the quality or state of being exact, correct, and free from error.', 'The financial report was prepared with great accuracy.', 'Báo cáo tài chính đã được lập với độ chính xác cao.', '{\"en\": \"Please double-check all calculation entries for accuracy before submitting the budget proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra kỹ tất cả các ô tính toán để đảm bảo độ chính xác trước khi nộp đề xuất ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-ljspeech-26de05a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-cori-26de05a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accuracy-9c4b5915.webp', '[\"precision\", \"exactness\", \"correctness\"]', '[\"inaccuracy\", \"error\", \"imprecision\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ensure accuracy\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo tính chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"check for accuracy\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra độ chính xác\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accurate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"accurately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-cori-26de05a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-aru0-26de05a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-aru5-26de05a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-aru6-26de05a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-aru10-26de05a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-aru9-26de05a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-aru3-26de05a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-aru7-26de05a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accuracy-aru8-26de05a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v