('59ba5f6e-4479-550e-998c-10d28ec1e857', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'considerable', '/kənˈsɪdərəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Lớn về kích thước, số lượng hoặc mức độ, đáng để xem xét.', 'large in size, amount, or degree, and worthy of attention.', 'The project required a considerable amount of effort and time.', 'Dự án này đòi hỏi một lượng lớn nỗ lực và thời gian đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"The merger brought considerable profits to the small company this year.\", \"vi\": \"Vụ sáp nhập đã mang lại khoản lợi nhuận đáng kể cho công ty nhỏ trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-ljspeech-72cb60c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-cori-72cb60c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/considerable-473e633a.webp', '[\"substantial\", \"significant\", \"sizeable\"]', '[\"insignificant\", \"negligible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"considerable amount\", \"meaning\": \"số lượng đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"considerable effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"considerable influence\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"considerate\", \"note_vi\": \"considerate nghĩa là chu đáo, considerable là lớn/lượng nhiều\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"consider\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consideration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-cori-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru0-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru5-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru6-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru10-72cb60c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru9-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru3-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru7-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru8-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-aru2-72cb60c2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-ljspeech-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt408-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt138-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt624-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt396-72cb60c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt498-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt132-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt288-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt42-72cb60c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerable-lt90-72cb60c2.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với considerate (chu đáo) khi làm bài điền từ.', 'business', 1, 15),
('2a5f0acf-442e-5fbc-853a-d0eda1162785', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'outcrop', '/ˈaʊtkrɒp/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Khối đá lộ thiên trên mặt đất.', 'a part of a rock formation that appears above the surface of the ground.', 'We hiked to a large rock outcrop that offered a panoramic view of the valley.', 'Chúng tôi đi bộ đến một mỏm đá lớn lộ thiên, nơi có thể ngắm toàn cảnh thung lũng.', '{\"en\": \"Engineers carefully inspected the rocky outcrop near the proposed construction site for safety.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ sư đã cẩn thận kiểm tra khối đá lộ thiên gần công trường xây dựng dự kiến vì mục đích an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-ljspeech-424f09ea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-cori-424f09ea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outcrop-82629690.webp', '[\"exposure\", \"ledge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rocky outcrop\", \"meaning\": \"khối đá nhô lên lộ thiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rock outcrop\", \"meaning\": \"mỏm đá trồi lên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crop\", \"note_vi\": \"Outcrop là khối đá lộ thiên, còn crop là cây trồng hoặc mùa màng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"outcrop\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-cori-424f09ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-aru0-424f09ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-aru5-424f09ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-aru6-424f09ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-aru10-424f09ea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-aru9-424f09ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-aru3-424f09ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-aru7-424f09ea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outcrop-aru8-424f09ea.mp3