('7e68f926-0ab3-57ad-bbc5-00c69dd2e8d2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '88f54ebd-eb52-5bb2-bbb0-75c0e7e76871', '7797e8be-4473-5841-acf0-f257c6bf9008', 'percussion instrument', '/pəˈkʌʃən ˈɪnstrʊmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nhạc cụ tạo ra âm thanh khi bị gõ, lắc hoặc cọ xát.', 'a musical object that you play by hitting it with your hand or a stick.', 'Drums, cymbals, and xylophones are all examples of percussion instruments.', 'Trống, chũm chọe và mộc cầm đều là những ví dụ về nhạc cụ gõ.', '{\"en\": \"The music store offers a discount on every percussion instrument, including drums and tambourines.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng nhạc cụ giảm giá cho mọi nhạc cụ gõ, bao gồm trống và trống lắc tay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-ljspeech-10f020e9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-cori-10f020e9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/percussion-instrument-23245042.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"play a percussion instrument\", \"meaning\": \"chơi nhạc cụ gõ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"percussion instrument section\", \"meaning\": \"phần nhạc cụ gõ (trong dàn nhạc)\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"percussion\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"percussionist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-cori-10f020e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-aru0-10f020e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-aru5-10f020e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-aru6-10f020e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-aru10-10f020e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-aru9-10f020e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/percussion-instrument-aru3-10f020e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia