('e6f08de4-1517-576a-8693-da3c888546b7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '89946880-3570-5133-84f6-887ae9625b57', 'f098d7a2-b12d-592d-b618-9a71d25ab346', 'dome', '/dəʊm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cấu trúc mái hình bán cầu.', 'a large rounded roof on a building that is shaped like half of a ball.', 'The capitol building is famous for its magnificent dome.', 'Tòa nhà quốc hội nổi tiếng với mái vòm tráng lệ của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed a glass dome for the new corporate headquarters building downtown.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế một mái vòm kính cho tòa nhà trụ sở công ty mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-ljspeech-872b7412.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-cori-872b7412.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dome-66ab318a.webp', '[\"cupola\", \"vault\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"glass dome\", \"meaning\": \"mái vòm kính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"architectural dome\", \"meaning\": \"mái vòm kiến trúc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"domed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-cori-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru0-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru5-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru6-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru10-872b7412.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru9-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru3-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru7-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru8-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-aru2-872b7412.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-ljspeech-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt408-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt138-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt624-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt396-872b7412.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt498-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt132-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt288-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt42-872b7412.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dome-lt90-872b7412.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong kiến trúc, mô tả mái nhà hình bán cầu.', 'housing', 1, 3),
('52f34fa9-ef51-57e5-957c-56345847c30a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '89946880-3570-5133-84f6-887ae9625b57', 'f098d7a2-b12d-592d-b618-9a71d25ab346', 'hoarse', '/hɔːs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'giọng nói bị khàn hoặc thô ráp do ốm hoặc la hét.', 'having a rough or harsh voice, often because of a sore throat or shouting too much.', 'After shouting at the concert all night, her voice was hoarse.', 'Sau khi la hét ở buổi hòa nhạc suốt đêm, giọng cô ấy bị khàn.', '{\"en\": \"The presenter sounded hoarse after speaking for three hours at the international trade conference.\", \"vi\": \"Người thuyết trình bị khàn giọng sau khi nói chuyện suốt ba tiếng tại hội nghị thương mại quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-ljspeech-059701c4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-cori-059701c4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hoarse-df634dfe.webp', '[\"raspy\", \"husky\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hoarse voice\", \"meaning\": \"giọng khàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become hoarse\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên khàn giọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"horse\", \"note_vi\": \"Horse là con ngựa, hoarse là khàn giọng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-cori-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru0-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru5-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru6-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru10-059701c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru9-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru3-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru7-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru8-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-aru2-059701c4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-ljspeech-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt408-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt138-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt624-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt396-059701c4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt498-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt132-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt288-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt42-059701c4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hoarse-lt90-059701c4.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm lẫn với \'horse\' (con ngựa) vì phát âm gần giống nhau.', 'health', 1, 4),
('6bc2b798-c031-5d39-ba8e-9a3b953e389e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '89946880-3570-5133-84f6-887ae9625b57', 'f098d7a2-b12d-592d-b618-9a71d25ab346', 'instance', '/ˈɪnstəns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một trường hợp hoặc ví dụ cụ thể của một điều gì đó.', 'a particular situation, event, or example of something.', 'For instance, you could try using a different approach to solve the problem.', 'Chẳng hạn, bạn có thể thử sử dụng một cách tiếp cận khác để giải quyết vấn đề.', '{\"en\": \"There was another instance of system failure during the online transaction yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Đã có một trường hợp lỗi hệ thống khác xảy ra trong quá trình giao dịch trực tuyến ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-ljspeech-c3bec6bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-cori-c3bec6bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/instance-3149e649.webp', '[\"example\", \"case\", \"occurrence\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"for instance\", \"meaning\": \"ví dụ như\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in this instance\", \"meaning\": \"trong trường hợp này\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"instant\", \"note_vi\": \"instant là tính từ nghĩa là ngay lập tức, ăn liền\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-cori-c3bec6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-aru0-c3bec6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-aru5-c3bec6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-aru6-c3bec6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-aru10-c3bec6bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-aru9-c3bec6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-aru3-c3bec6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-aru7-c3bec6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instance-aru8-c3bec6bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/i