('1463cefd-c7f6-597e-ad35-1b062bad69b8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '89946880-3570-5133-84f6-887ae9625b57', 'f098d7a2-b12d-592d-b618-9a71d25ab346', 'drawn-out', '/ˌdrɔːnˈaʊt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Kéo dài hơn mức cần thiết, gây mệt mỏi hoặc khó chịu.', 'lasting a very long time, often longer than is necessary or wanted.', 'The drawn-out negotiations finally concluded after several months.', 'Cuộc đàm phán kéo dài cuối cùng đã kết thúc sau vài tháng.', '{\"en\": \"The legal department wants to avoid a drawn-out court battle over the patent dispute.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận pháp lý muốn tránh một cuộc chiến pháp lý kéo dài tại tòa về tranh chấp bằng sáng chế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-ljspeech-82d00694.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-cori-82d00694.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/drawn-out-2f8227b8.webp', '[\"prolonged\", \"extended\", \"lengthy\"]', '[\"brief\", \"short\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"drawn-out process\", \"meaning\": \"quá trình kéo dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"drawn-out negotiations\", \"meaning\": \"các cuộc đàm phán kéo dài\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-cori-82d00694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru0-82d00694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru5-82d00694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru6-82d00694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru10-82d00694.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru9-82d00694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru3-82d00694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru7-82d00694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru8-82d00694.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/drawn-out-aru2-82d00694.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"