('083b6d34-e700-5230-aa4d-23149b262e5d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '89946880-3570-5133-84f6-887ae9625b57', 'f098d7a2-b12d-592d-b618-9a71d25ab346', 'shell', '/ʃel/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Lớp vỏ cứng bên ngoài bảo vệ động vật, hạt hoặc vật thể.', 'the hard outer covering of some animals, nuts, seeds, or eggs.', 'We collected beautiful seashells on the beach during our vacation.', 'Chúng tôi đã thu thập những vỏ sò đẹp trên bãi biển trong kỳ nghỉ.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant chef carefully removed the shell from each lobster before preparing the dish.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp nhà hàng đã cẩn thận bóc vỏ từng con tôm hùm trước khi chuẩn bị món ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-ljspeech-ec122f54.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-cori-ec122f54.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shell-b17fcc15.webp', '[\"casing\", \"crust\", \"husk\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"eggshell\", \"meaning\": \"vỏ trứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seashell\", \"meaning\": \"vỏ sò\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shale\", \"note_vi\": \"shale là đá phiến sét, shell là vỏ cứng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shelled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-cori-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru0-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru5-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru6-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru10-ec122f54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru9-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru3-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru7-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru8-ec122f54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shell-aru2-ec122f54.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/obje