('d47064a3-4184-563b-8264-2f52bce1e30f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '89946880-3570-5133-84f6-887ae9625b57', 'f098d7a2-b12d-592d-b618-9a71d25ab346', 'antibiotic', '/ˌæntibaɪˈɒtɪk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thuốc dùng để tiêu diệt hoặc làm chậm sự phát triển của vi khuẩn.', 'a substance used to destroy or stop the growth of harmful bacteria.', 'Patients must complete the entire course of this antibiotic as advised by the pharmacist.', 'Bệnh nhân phải uống hết toàn bộ liều thuốc kháng sinh này theo lời khuyên của dược sĩ.', '{\"en\": \"The clinic provided an antibiotic to the sick employee after the medical check.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám đã cung cấp thuốc kháng sinh cho nhân viên bị ốm sau khi khám sức khỏe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-ljspeech-57d91230.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-cori-57d91230.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/antibiotic-dbb5a06f.webp', '[\"germicide\", \"bactericide\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take an antibiotic\", \"meaning\": \"uống thuốc kháng sinh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prescribe an antibiotic\", \"meaning\": \"kê đơn thuốc kháng sinh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"broad-spectrum antibiotic\", \"meaning\": \"thuốc kháng sinh phổ rộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"antibody\", \"note_vi\": \"kháng thể, không phải thuốc kháng sinh\"}, {\"word\": \"antiseptic\", \"note_vi\": \"chất sát trùng, dùng ngoài da\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-cori-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru0-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru5-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru6-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru10-57d91230.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru9-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru3-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru7-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru8-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-aru2-57d91230.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-ljspeech-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt408-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt138-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt624-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt396-57d91230.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt498-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt132-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt288-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt42-57d91230.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antibiotic-lt90-57d91230.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm với antibody (kháng thể); antibiotic là thuốc, antibody là protein trong cơ thể.', 'health', 1, 22),
('53448064-11df-5a76-8b9e-e25fd147197a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '89946880-3570-5133-84f6-887ae9625b57', 'f098d7a2-b12d-592d-b618-9a71d25ab346', 'revenue', '/ˈrevənjuː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Tổng số tiền thu được từ việc kinh doanh hoặc hoạt động khác.', 'the total amount of money received from business or activities.', 'The new marketing strategy generated substantial extra revenue for the retail chain.', 'Chiến lược tiếp thị mới đã tạo ra doanh thu phụ trội đáng kể cho chuỗi bán lẻ.', '{\"en\": \"Our hotel\'s monthly revenue rose after we launched the online booking system.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh thu hàng tháng của khách sạn chúng tôi tăng sau khi ra mắt hệ thống đặt phòng trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-ljspeech-abf72c05.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-cori-abf72c05.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/revenue-32a0891a.webp', '[\"income\", \"earnings\", \"proceeds\"]', '[\"expenditure\", \"expense\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"generate revenue\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra doanh thu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"annual revenue\", \"meaning\": \"doanh thu hàng năm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"revenue stream\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn doanh thu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"revenge\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là trả thù, dễ nhầm phát âm\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-cori-abf72c05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-aru0-abf72c05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-aru5-abf72c05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-aru6-abf72c05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-aru10-abf72c05.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-aru9-abf72c05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-aru3-abf72c05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/revenue-aru7-abf72c05.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public