('685d6795-0901-5c5b-b95d-35721f86f38f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'hexagon', '/ˈheksəɡən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hình có sáu cạnh và sáu góc.', 'a flat shape with six straight sides and six angles of equal measure.', 'The pattern on the floor was made of small hexagons.', 'Họa tiết trên sàn được tạo thành từ những hình lục giác nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The engineer designed a hexagonal nut using a precise hexagon template.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ sư đã thiết kế một đai ốc lục giác bằng khuôn hình lục giác chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-ljspeech-11725d3f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-cori-11725d3f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hexagon-39d0bb5e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"regular hexagon\", \"meaning\": \"lục giác đều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hexagon shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình lục giác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hexagram\", \"note_vi\": \"hexagram là sao 6 cánh, hexagon là hình 6 cạnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hexagonal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-cori-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru0-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru5-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru6-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru10-11725d3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru9-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru3-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru7-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru8-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-aru2-11725d3f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-ljspeech-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt408-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt138-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt624-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt396-11725d3f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt498-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt132-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt288-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt42-11725d3f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hexagon-lt90-11725d3f.mp3\"]}}', 'Hexagon là hình 6 cạnh, nhớ không phải hexagram (sao 6 cánh).', 'manufacturing', 1, 5),
('8f2e2b58-26ce-5452-99f5-203a8d4a4e74', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'neighbourhood', '/ˈneɪbəhʊd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một khu vực nhỏ trong thành phố hoặc thị trấn, thường có cư dân.', 'an area of a town or city that people live in, or the people who live there.', 'Our neighbourhood has a strong sense of community, with many local events.', 'Khu phố của chúng tôi có ý thức cộng đồng mạnh mẽ, với nhiều sự kiện địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The real estate agent showed us several commercial properties located in a quiet residential neighbourhood.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bất động sản đã cho chúng tôi xem vài bất động sản thương mại nằm trong một khu dân cư yên tĩnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-ljspeech-6b719d2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-cori-6b719d2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/neighbourhood-7de13e34.webp', '[\"area\", \"district\", \"community\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"residential neighbourhood\", \"meaning\": \"khu dân cư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quiet neighbourhood\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực yên tĩnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surrounding neighbourhood\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực lân cận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"neighbour\", \"note_vi\": \"neighbour là người hàng xóm, neighbourhood là khu vực sống.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"neighbour\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"neighbouring\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-cori-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru0-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru5-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru6-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru10-6b719d2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru9-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru3-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru7-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru8-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-aru2-6b719d2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-ljspeech-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt408-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt138-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt624-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt396-6b719d2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt498-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt132-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt288-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt42-6b719d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/neighbourhood-lt90-6b719d2b.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý cách viết Anh-Anh (neighbourhood) và Anh-Mỹ (neighborhood).', 'housing', 1, 6),
('8423e324-4c18-5b7e-a880-85f474f1ee6a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'diseased', '/dɪˈziːzd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Bị mắc bệnh, ốm yếu hoặc có bệnh tật.', 'affected by an illness or an abnormal unhealthy condition.', 'The farmer had to cut down the diseased trees to prevent the spread of infection.', 'Người nông dân phải chặt bỏ những cây bị bệnh để ngăn chặn sự lây lan của nhiễm trùng.', '{\"en\": \"The health inspector removed diseased products from the store shelves immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra y tế đã lập tức gỡ bỏ các sản phẩm bị bệnh khỏi kệ hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-ljspeech-365ceefd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-cori-365ceefd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diseased-382cb084.webp', '[\"sick\", \"ill\", \"infected\"]', '[\"healthy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"diseased tissue\", \"meaning\": \"mô bị bệnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"diseased plant\", \"meaning\": \"cây mắc bệnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deceased\", \"note_vi\": \"deceased là đã qua đời, khác diseased bị bệnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disease\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-cori-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru0-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru5-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru6-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru10-365ceefd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru9-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru3-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru7-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru8-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-aru2-365ceefd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-ljspeech-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt408-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt138-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt624-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt396-365ceefd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt498-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt132-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt288-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt42-365ceefd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diseased-lt90-365ceefd.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận phát âm: diseased (bệnh) vs deceased (đã mất).', 'health', 1, 7),
('42a71177-dfaf-57c7-82c2-098ecd898c61', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'ramp', '/ræmp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một con đường hoặc bề mặt nghiêng nối hai độ cao khác nhau.', 'a sloping surface that joins two different levels, allowing easier access for people or vehicles.', 'The wheelchair ramp makes the building accessible for everyone.', 'Đường dốc dành cho xe lăn giúp mọi người dễ dàng tiếp cận tòa nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The facility manager installed a new ramp at the entrance to improve accessibility for all visitors.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cơ sở đã lắp đặt một đường dốc mới ở lối vào để cải thiện khả năng tiếp cận cho tất cả khách tham quan.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-ljspeech-05ba9423.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-cori-05ba9423.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ramp-af4e2784.webp', '[\"slope\", \"incline\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wheelchair ramp\", \"meaning\": \"đường dốc cho xe lăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"loading ramp\", \"meaning\": \"cầu dẫn hàng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-cori-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru0-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru5-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru6-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru10-05ba9423.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru9-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru3-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru7-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru8-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-aru2-05ba9423.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-ljspeech-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt408-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt138-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt624-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt396-05ba9423.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt498-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt132-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt288-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt42-05ba9423.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ramp-lt90-05ba9423.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong môi trường công nghiệp, \'ramp\' còn là cầu dẫn để xe tải bốc dỡ hàng hóa.', 'housing', 1, 8)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('db3e2cfc-f9e0-5013-aa4b-76f2d6384c9b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'capitalism', '/ˈkæpɪtəlɪzəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống kinh tế dựa trên sở hữu tư nhân và hoạt động vì lợi nhuận.', 'an economic system in which businesses are owned by private people for profit.', 'Many economists argue that modern capitalism has created unprecedented global economic growth.', 'Nhiều nhà kinh tế học cho rằng chủ nghĩa tư bản hiện đại đã tạo ra sự tăng trưởng kinh tế toàn cầu chưa từng có.', '{\"en\": \"Free market capitalism has led to rapid economic growth in many developing nations.\", \"vi\": \"Chủ nghĩa tư bản thị trường tự do đã dẫn đến sự phát triển kinh tế nhanh chóng ở nhiều quốc gia đang phát triển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-ljspeech-3334a0f5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-cori-3334a0f5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/capitalism-e8aeca9a.webp', '[\"free enterprise\"]', '[\"socialism\", \"communism\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"market capitalism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa tư bản thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"global capitalism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa tư bản toàn cầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"capital\", \"note_vi\": \"capitalism là hệ thống tư bản, capital là vốn hoặc thủ đô.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"capitalist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"capitalist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-cori-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru0-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru5-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru6-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru10-3334a0f5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru9-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru3-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru7-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru8-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-aru2-3334a0f5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-ljspeech-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt408-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt138-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt624-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt396-3334a0f5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt498-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt132-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt288-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt42-3334a0f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capitalism-lt90-3334a0f5.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn trọng âm vào âm tiết đầu tiên.', 'finance', 1, 9),
('44071863-bfde-548b-a168-c7ea6ea41b13', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'unroll', 'UK: /ʌnˈrəʊl/ | US: /ʌnˈroʊl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'mở ra, trải ra (vật cuộn)', 'to open or spread out an item that was previously wound or rolled up.', 'Workers unroll a large carpet in the main hall.', 'Các công nhân trải một tấm thảm lớn ở sảnh chính.', '{\"en\": \"The architects unrolled the updated floor plans on the conference table for discussion.\", \"vi\": \"Các kiến trúc sư đã trải bản vẽ mặt bằng cập nhật lên bàn họp để thảo luận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-ljspeech-dd55b882.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-cori-dd55b882.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unroll-95b7803d.webp', '[\"unfurl\", \"uncoil\", \"spread out\", \"open out\"]', '[\"roll\", \"roll up\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unroll a blueprint\", \"meaning\": \"mở bản vẽ thiết kế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unroll a carpet\", \"meaning\": \"trải tấm thảm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"enroll\", \"note_vi\": \"đăng ký / ghi danh vào khóa học (khác hoàn toàn với unroll = trải vật cuộn ra)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"roll\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-cori-dd55b882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-aru0-dd55b882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-aru5-dd55b882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-aru6-dd55b882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-aru10-dd55b882.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-aru9-dd55b882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-aru3-dd55b882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-aru7-dd55b882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unroll-aru8-dd55b882.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu