('4c0842f2-edf2-58fd-8b90-996ddad37ea5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'attempt', 'UK: /əˈtempt/ | US: /əˈtempt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự cố gắng, sự thử', 'an effort made to accomplish something, especially when success is not guaranteed.', 'He made an attempt to climb the mountain last year.', 'Anh ấy đã cố gắng leo lên núi vào năm ngoái.', '{\"en\": \"In an attempt to reduce operating costs, the company decided to automate several administrative tasks.\", \"vi\": \"Nhằm nỗ lực giảm chi phí vận hành, công ty quyết định tự động hóa một số nhiệm vụ hành chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-ljspeech-38e4e4b0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-cori-38e4e4b0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attempt-8a5a1212.webp', '[\"effort\", \"try\", \"endeavor\", \"undertaking\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an attempt\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực / thử làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in an attempt to\", \"meaning\": \"nhằm nỗ lực làm gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attend\", \"note_vi\": \"Attend nghĩa là tham dự, phát âm gần giống nhưng nghĩa khác hẳn với attempt (nỗ lực/cố gắng).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"attempt\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-cori-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru0-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru5-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru6-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru10-38e4e4b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru9-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru3-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru7-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru8-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-aru2-38e4e4b0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-ljspeech-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt408-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt138-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt624-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt396-38e4e4b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt498-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt132-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt288-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt42-38e4e4b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attempt-lt90-38e4e4b0.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là danh từ vừa là động từ. Đi với cấu trúc \'make an attempt to do sth\' hoặc \'in an attempt to do sth\' (nhằm nỗ lực làm gì).', 'business strategy', 1, 11),
('846d0782-758d-5228-b4f9-1efecc999d12', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'accentuate', '/əkˈsentʃueɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm nổi bật, nhấn mạnh một điều gì đó.', 'to make something more noticeable or to emphasize its special features.', 'The new lighting system was designed to accentuate the artwork in the gallery.', 'Hệ thống chiếu sáng mới được thiết kế để làm nổi bật các tác phẩm nghệ thuật trong phòng trưng bày.', '{\"en\": \"The manager used charts to accentuate the sales growth during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý dùng biểu đồ để làm nổi bật sự tăng trưởng doanh số trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-ljspeech-2d43d7a5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-cori-2d43d7a5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accentuate-bb796811.webp', '[\"emphasize\", \"highlight\"]', '[\"downplay\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accentuate the positive\", \"meaning\": \"nhấn mạnh mặt tích cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accentuate differences\", \"meaning\": \"nhấn mạnh sự khác biệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"accent\", \"note_vi\": \"accent là trọng âm/giọng, accentuate là làm nổi bật\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accentuation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-cori-2d43d7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-aru0-2d43d7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-aru5-2d43d7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-aru6-2d43d7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-aru10-2d43d7a5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-aru9-2d43d7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-aru3-2d43d7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accentuate-aru7-2d43d7a5.mp3\", \"/storage/