('9e028e64-68ea-55e0-858e-ff2928de37d8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'vector', '/ˈvektə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Đại lượng có cả độ lớn và hướng, hoặc vật trung gian truyền bệnh.', 'a quantity that has size and direction, or an insect that carries diseases.', 'In physics, force is a vector quantity, having both magnitude and direction.', 'Trong vật lý, lực là một đại lượng vectơ, có cả độ lớn và hướng.', '{\"en\": \"The design department used vector graphics to ensure high quality for large print banners.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận thiết kế đã sử dụng đồ họa vector để đảm bảo chất lượng cao cho các băng rôn in khổ lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-ljspeech-027c1146.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-cori-027c1146.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vector-31e1c093.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"vector graphics\", \"meaning\": \"đồ họa vector\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disease vector\", \"meaning\": \"vật trung gian truyền bệnh\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-cori-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru0-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru5-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru6-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru10-027c1146.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru9-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru3-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru7-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru8-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-aru2-027c1146.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-ljspeech-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt408-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt138-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt624-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt396-027c1146.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt498-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt132-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt288-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt42-027c1146.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vector-lt90-027c1146.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tin học/thiết kế, \'vector\' chỉ dạng đồ họa không bị vỡ ảnh khi phóng to.', 'technology', 1, 21),
('abac6ad0-8460-5eac-9ba2-c1d7d6d4d2fc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'unfold', '/ʌnˈfəʊld/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Mở ra hoặc làm lộ ra thứ gì đó đang được gấp lại, hoặc một câu chuyện diễn biến.', 'to open out something that was folded, or to develop and become known gradually.', 'The story began to unfold with unexpected twists and turns.', 'Câu chuyện bắt đầu diễn biến với những khúc mắc bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"Management will watch how the new market strategy begins to unfold next quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý sẽ theo dõi chiến lược thị trường mới bắt đầu diễn biến ra sao trong quý tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-ljspeech-1e0eecbd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-cori-1e0eecbd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unfold-b7dd174c.webp', '[\"unroll\", \"develop\", \"reveal\"]', '[\"fold\", \"hide\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unfold a plan\", \"meaning\": \"hé lộ một kế hoạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"events unfold\", \"meaning\": \"các sự kiện diễn ra\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"infold\", \"note_vi\": \"infold có nghĩa là bọc lại, ôm vào lòng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"folding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-cori-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru0-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru5-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru6-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru10-1e0eecbd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru9-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru3-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru7-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru8-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-aru2-1e0eecbd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-ljspeech-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt408-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt138-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt624-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt396-1e0eecbd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt498-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt132-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt288-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt42-1e0eecbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unfold-lt90-1e0eecbd.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'un-\' mang nghĩa đảo ngược hành động \'fold\' (gấp lại).', 'office', 1, 22),
('6ac33ae6-7539-57b9-9220-add2e977365d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'conspiracy', '/kənˈspɪrəsi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kế hoạch bí mật của một nhóm người để làm điều gì đó bất hợp pháp hoặc có hại.', 'secret plan by group to do something unlawful or harmful.', 'The police uncovered a complex conspiracy to smuggle drugs across the border.', 'Cảnh sát đã khám phá ra một âm mưu phức tạp nhằm buôn lậu ma túy qua biên giới.', '{\"en\": \"The board suspected a conspiracy among rivals to steal trade secrets.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng nghi ngờ một âm mưu của đối thủ nhằm đánh cắp bí mật thương mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-ljspeech-61656283.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-cori-61656283.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conspiracy-3b478ce5.webp', '[\"plot\", \"scheme\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conspiracy theory\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết âm mưu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"uncover a conspiracy\", \"meaning\": \"phát hiện âm mưu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conspiracy charge\", \"meaning\": \"cáo buộc âm mưu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consensus\", \"note_vi\": \"consensus là đồng thuận, không phải âm mưu bí mật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conspire\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conspirator\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-cori-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru0-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru5-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru6-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru10-61656283.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru9-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru3-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru7-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru8-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-aru2-61656283.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-ljspeech-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt408-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt138-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt624-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt396-61656283.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt498-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt132-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt288-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt42-61656283.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspiracy-lt90-61656283.mp3\"]}}', 'Conspiracy luôn có hàm ý bí mật và bất hợp pháp, khác với plan.', 'law', 1, 23),
('d44c1f5b-f52f-52d0-a057-6ac2a4a26815', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8b7f0915-f40b-59f8-8344-9d9be856870e', 'cdd9b106-9841-514e-b063-dd92070d5b98', 'analysis', 'UK: /əˈnæləsɪs/ | US: /əˈnæləsɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự phân tích', 'the detailed examination of the elements or structure of something to understand it better.', 'The financial analysis revealed some unexpected results.', 'Bản phân tích tài chính đã tiết lộ một số kết quả bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"Our marketing team conducted a thorough market analysis before launching the product.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị của chúng tôi đã tiến hành phân tích thị trường kỹ lưỡng trước khi ra mắt sản phẩm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-ljspeech-36847a29.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-cori-36847a29.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/analysis-5c551158.webp', '[\"examination\", \"investigation\", \"scrutiny\", \"evaluation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conduct an analysis\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành phân tích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"market analysis\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích thị trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"analyze\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analyst\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"analytical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-cori-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru0-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru5-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru6-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru10-36847a29.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru9-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru3-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analysis-aru7-36847a29.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ana