('42cc60ad-9430-57ca-8051-e4bd1c89b4fb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'direct', 'UK: /dɪˈrɛkt/ | US: /daɪˈrɛkt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'chỉ dẫn, điều khiển', 'to show or give someone instructions on how to reach a destination.', 'Please direct me to the nearest exit.', 'Vui lòng chỉ cho tôi lối ra gần nhất.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist will direct visitors to the main conference hall on the second floor.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân sẽ chỉ dẫn khách tham quan đến hội trường chính ở tầng hai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-ljspeech-24a1733c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-cori-24a1733c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/direct-76629533.webp', '[\"guide\", \"lead\", \"steer\", \"instruct\"]', '[\"misguide\", \"mislead\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"direct questions to\", \"meaning\": \"gửi/hướng câu hỏi tới...\"}, {\"phrase\": \"direct traffic\", \"meaning\": \"điều tiết giao thông\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"direction\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"director\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"directly\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"direct\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-cori-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru0-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru5-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru6-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru10-24a1733c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru9-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru3-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru7-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru8-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-aru2-24a1733c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-ljspeech-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt408-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt138-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt624-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt396-24a1733c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt498-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt132-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt288-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt42-24a1733c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/direct-lt90-24a1733c.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi làm động từ, \'direct someone to...\' có nghĩa là hướng dẫn ai đó đến vị trí nào.', 'office', 1, 8),
('aa963450-92a9-5c9c-940e-6eed3eea97ed', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'fatigue', '/fəˈtiːɡ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trạng thái cực kỳ mệt mỏi về thể chất hoặc tinh thần.', 'a feeling of being very tired because of hard work or lack of sleep.', 'The doctor advised him to rest to recover from chronic fatigue.', 'Bác sĩ khuyên anh ấy nên nghỉ ngơi để hồi phục sau chứng mệt mỏi mãn tính.', '{\"en\": \"Long working hours can lead to extreme fatigue, which affects the productivity of the staff.\", \"vi\": \"Giờ làm việc dài có thể dẫn đến sự mệt mỏi cực độ, ảnh hưởng đến năng suất của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-ljspeech-4feba2dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-cori-4feba2dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fatigue-a8f2e2aa.webp', '[\"exhaustion\", \"weariness\"]', '[\"energy\", \"vitality\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mental fatigue\", \"meaning\": \"mệt mỏi tinh thần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"suffer from fatigue\", \"meaning\": \"bị kiệt sức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fatigued\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-cori-4feba2dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru0-4feba2dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru5-4feba2dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru6-4feba2dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru10-4feba2dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru9-4feba2dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru3-4feba2dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru7-4feba2dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru8-4feba2dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fatigue-aru2-4feba2dd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\