('5acfbb1a-07a3-5d82-a2b8-c7d38ebeb053', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'pressing', '/ˈpresɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Khẩn cấp, cần được giải quyết ngay lập tức.', 'needing immediate attention or action because it is very important and cannot wait.', 'The most pressing issue facing the community is the lack of clean water.', 'Vấn đề cấp bách nhất mà cộng đồng đang đối mặt là thiếu nước sạch.', '{\"en\": \"The director called an emergency meeting to address the pressing budget issues this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc triệu tập cuộc họp khẩn để giải quyết các vấn đề ngân sách cấp bách trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-ljspeech-c5cddf20.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-cori-c5cddf20.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pressing-6e15424b.webp', '[\"urgent\", \"critical\", \"immediate\"]', '[\"trivial\", \"minor\", \"unimportant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pressing issue\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề cấp bách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pressing need\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu khẩn cấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pressing matter\", \"meaning\": \"vấn đề cần giải quyết ngay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"urgent\", \"note_vi\": \"urgent và pressing gần nghĩa nhưng pressing nhấn mạnh tầm quan trọng hơn là tốc độ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"press\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pressure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"pressingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-cori-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru0-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru5-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru6-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru10-c5cddf20.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru9-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru3-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru7-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru8-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-aru2-c5cddf20.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-ljspeech-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt408-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt138-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt624-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt396-c5cddf20.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt498-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt132-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt288-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt42-c5cddf20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pressing-lt90-c5cddf20.mp3\"]}}', '\'Pressing\' trong ngữ cảnh TOEIC thường đi với \'issue\', \'matter\', \'need\' — hãy nhớ các cụm này.', 'office', 1, 14),
('7449f8b8-1e47-55ee-8d02-9f4799d600b2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'shaky', '/ˈʃeɪki/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không vững, dễ rung lắc hoặc không ổn định.', 'moving with quick, short movements from side to side, not firm or safe.', 'After the long flight, I felt a bit shaky on my feet.', 'Sau chuyến bay dài, tôi cảm thấy hơi run chân.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s financial situation remains shaky despite the recent increase in quarterly sales.\", \"vi\": \"Tình hình tài chính của công ty vẫn không ổn định bất chấp sự gia tăng doanh số hàng quý gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-ljspeech-081dbaea.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-cori-081dbaea.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shaky-18f6276d.webp', '[\"unsteady\", \"unstable\", \"wobbly\"]', '[\"stable\", \"steady\", \"firm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"shaky start\", \"meaning\": \"sự khởi đầu không vững chắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"shaky ground\", \"meaning\": \"tình thế bấp bênh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shake\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"shakily\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-cori-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru0-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru5-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru6-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru10-081dbaea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru9-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru3-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru7-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru8-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-aru2-081dbaea.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-ljspeech-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt408-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt138-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt624-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt396-081dbaea.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt498-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt132-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt288-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt42-081dbaea.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shaky-lt90-081dbaea.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kinh doanh, từ này thường ám chỉ sự thiếu ổn định về tài chính hoặc nền tảng.', 'finance', 1, 15),
('c9b06ce4-7359-566f-82d9-006029f6d21a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'mortgage', '/ˈmɔːɡɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Khoản vay dùng để mua nhà hoặc tài sản, với tài sản đó làm vật thế chấp.', 'an amount of money borrowed from a bank to buy a house.', 'Many young couples struggle to afford their first mortgage payment.', 'Nhiều cặp vợ chồng trẻ gặp khó khăn để chi trả khoản thanh toán thế chấp đầu tiên của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The bank approved our mortgage application for the new commercial building yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân hàng đã phê duyệt đơn xin vay thế chấp của chúng tôi cho tòa nhà thương mại mới vào ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-ljspeech-53a64aee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-cori-53a64aee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mortgage-212d059a.webp', '[\"home loan\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"apply for a mortgage\", \"meaning\": \"xin vay thế chấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mortgage rate\", \"meaning\": \"lãi suất thế chấp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pay off a mortgage\", \"meaning\": \"trả hết khoản thế chấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"loan\", \"note_vi\": \"Loan là khoản vay nói chung, mortgage là vay thế chấp bất động sản.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mortgagee\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mortgagor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-cori-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru0-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru5-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru6-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru10-53a64aee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru9-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru3-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru7-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru8-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-aru2-53a64aee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-ljspeech-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt408-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt138-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt624-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt396-53a64aee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt498-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt132-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt288-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt42-53a64aee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mortgage-lt90-53a64aee.mp3\"]}}', 'Âm \'t\' trong từ này là âm câm, phát âm là /ˈmɔːɡɪdʒ/.', 'finance', 1, 16),
('e3d646d3-c75b-5c4a-8cf0-17f621646cc8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'different', '/ˈdɪfrənt/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Không giống, không tương tự.', 'not the same as another person or thing in appearance, character, or some other quality.', 'We have very different opinions on this matter.', 'Chúng tôi có những ý kiến rất khác nhau về vấn đề này.', '{\"en\": \"The two departments have different procedures for processing invoices and managing client expense reports.\", \"vi\": \"Hai bộ phận có các quy trình khác nhau để xử lý hóa đơn và quản lý báo cáo chi phí khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-ljspeech-517d5a72.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-cori-517d5a72.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/different-38233f03.webp', '[\"distinct\", \"dissimilar\"]', '[\"identical\", \"same\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"different from\", \"meaning\": \"khác với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quite different\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn khác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"indifferent\", \"note_vi\": \"Indifferent nghĩa là thờ ơ, không quan tâm, khác với different là khác biệt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"difference\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"differ\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-cori-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru0-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru5-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru6-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru10-517d5a72.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru9-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru3-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru7-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru8-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-aru2-517d5a72.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-ljspeech-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt408-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt138-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt624-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt396-517d5a72.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt498-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt132-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt288-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt42-517d5a72.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/different-lt90-517d5a72.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn đi kèm với giới từ \'from\' hoặc \'to\' trong tiếng Anh Mỹ.', 'business', 1, 17),
('ab89915e-145b-57e9-ba61-5cd208e2db1e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'verbalize', '/ˈvɜːbəlaɪz/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Diễn đạt suy nghĩ hoặc cảm xúc bằng lời nói.', 'to express thoughts or feelings clearly by using spoken words or language.', 'It can be difficult to verbalize complex emotions, but it\'s important to try.', 'Có thể khó diễn đạt những cảm xúc phức tạp bằng lời, nhưng điều quan trọng là phải cố gắng.', '{\"en\": \"Managers should learn to verbalize their expectations clearly to avoid confusion among team members.\", \"vi\": \"Các quản lý nên học cách diễn đạt kỳ vọng của họ một cách rõ ràng để tránh nhầm lẫn giữa các thành viên trong nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-ljspeech-5f079ab0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-cori-5f079ab0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/verbalize-3ef89c7e.webp', '[\"articulate\", \"express\"]', '[\"suppress\", \"hide\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"verbalize thoughts\", \"meaning\": \"diễn đạt suy nghĩ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"verbalize concerns\", \"meaning\": \"nói ra mối lo ngại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"verbal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-cori-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru0-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru5-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru6-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru10-5f079ab0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru9-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru3-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru7-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru8-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-aru2-5f079ab0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-ljspeech-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt408-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt138-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt624-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt396-5f079ab0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt498-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt132-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt288-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt42-5f079ab0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbalize-lt90-5f079ab0.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong ngữ cảnh giao tiếp chuyên nghiệp hoặc đánh giá nhân sự.', 'office', 1, 18),
('81d3f3b4-b792-5aea-9b2f-ec9cfa5729ed', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'the Antarctic Circle', '/ðə ænˈtɑːktɪk ˈsɜːkl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Đường vĩ tuyến bao quanh khu vực Nam Cực.', 'an imaginary line drawn around the earth near the south pole area.', 'Expeditions to the Antarctic Circle often encounter extreme cold and unique wildlife.', 'Các chuyến thám hiểm đến Vòng Nam Cực thường gặp phải cái lạnh khắc nghiệt và động vật hoang dã độc đáo.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency offers luxury cruise tours near the Antarctic Circle for adventurous tourists.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch cung cấp các chuyến du thuyền sang trọng gần Vòng Nam Cực cho du khách thích phiêu lưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-antarctic-circle-ljspeech-db8ec35c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-antarctic-circle-cori-db8ec35c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/the-antarctic-circle-8bd6968d.webp', NULL, '[\"the Arctic Circle\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cross the Antarctic Circle\", \"meaning\": \"băng qua Vòng Nam Cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"south of the Antarctic Circle\", \"meaning\": \"phía nam Vòng Nam Cực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"the Arctic Circle\", \"note_vi\": \"Arctic Circle là Vòng Bắc Cực, Antarctic Circle là Vòng Nam Cực.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-antarctic-circle-cori-db8ec35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-antarctic-circle-aru0-db8ec35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-antarctic-circle-aru5-db8ec35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-antarctic-circle-aru6-db8ec35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-antarctic-circle-aru10-db8ec35c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/the-antarctic-circle-aru9-db8ec35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia