('c473a271-eee4-5694-9c1e-24216ec8dbed', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'currency', '/ˈkʌrənsi/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hệ thống tiền tệ được sử dụng trong một quốc gia.', 'the system of money that a country uses to buy and sell goods.', 'Travelers should convert their foreign money into the national currency upon arrival.', 'Du khách nên đổi tiền nước ngoài sang đồng nội tệ khi vừa đến nơi.', '{\"en\": \"Customers can pay in local currency or use their credit cards at the hotel.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể thanh toán bằng tiền tệ địa phương hoặc sử dụng thẻ tín dụng tại khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-ljspeech-001517ee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-cori-001517ee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/currency-1869e6b1.webp', '[\"money\", \"cash\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"foreign currency\", \"meaning\": \"ngoại tệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local currency\", \"meaning\": \"tiền tệ địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"currency exchange\", \"meaning\": \"đổi tiền tệ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"current\", \"note_vi\": \"current là dòng chảy hoặc hiện tại, currency là tiền tệ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"current\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-cori-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru0-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru5-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru6-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru10-001517ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru9-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru3-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru7-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru8-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-aru2-001517ee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-ljspeech-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt408-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt138-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt624-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt396-001517ee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt498-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt132-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt288-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt42-001517ee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/currency-lt90-001517ee.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa currency (tiền tệ) và current (hiện tại/dòng nước).', 'finance', 1, 27),
('d465baa7-9070-5867-9ca7-b0d12f402b3e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'rotten', '/ˈrɒtn/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Bị hỏng, thối rữa (thường dùng cho thực phẩm).', 'decayed or gone bad, usually referring to food that is no longer safe to eat.', 'Don\'t eat that apple; it looks completely rotten.', 'Đừng ăn quả táo đó; trông nó đã thối rữa hoàn toàn rồi.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant manager threw away the rotten vegetables found in the kitchen storage area today.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý nhà hàng đã vứt bỏ những loại rau bị thối rữa được tìm thấy trong khu vực kho bếp hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-ljspeech-f3d4a5a4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-cori-f3d4a5a4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rotten-a5af8544.webp', '[\"decayed\", \"spoiled\"]', '[\"fresh\", \"sound\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rotten food\", \"meaning\": \"thực phẩm thối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"smell rotten\", \"meaning\": \"có mùi thối\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-cori-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru0-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru5-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru6-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru10-f3d4a5a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru9-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru3-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru7-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru8-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-aru2-f3d4a5a4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-ljspeech-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt408-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt138-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt624-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt396-f3d4a5a4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt498-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt132-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt288-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt42-f3d4a5a4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rotten-lt90-f3d4a5a4.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng cho thực phẩm hỏng hoặc nghĩa bóng là xấu xa.', 'dining', 1, 28),
('0c275ecc-ee90-5acf-be3a-8d2ae43f32c1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8ec37bd0-5ea6-568e-a0f1-df6313ff82e7', '2b333bcf-16e3-5c48-a359-727c77ad0728', 'pitch', '/pɪtʃ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một bài thuyết trình ngắn gọn nhằm thuyết phục ai đó về một ý tưởng hoặc sản phẩm.', 'a short talk given to persuade someone to buy or support something.', 'The startup founder delivered a compelling pitch to the investors.', 'Người sáng lập công ty khởi nghiệp đã trình bày một bài thuyết trình hấp dẫn trước các nhà đầu tư.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team prepared a short pitch to win the prospective client\'s contract.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng đã chuẩn bị một bài thuyết trình ngắn để giành hợp đồng với khách hàng tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-ljspeech-5bfb7116.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-cori-5bfb7116.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pitch-597a9236.webp', '[\"presentation\", \"proposal\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sales pitch\", \"meaning\": \"bài chào hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elevator pitch\", \"meaning\": \"bài thuyết trình siêu ngắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"speech\", \"note_vi\": \"Speech là bài phát biểu chung, pitch là bài nói nhằm thuyết phục.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pitch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-cori-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru0-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru5-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru6-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru10-5bfb7116.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru9-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru3-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru7-5bfb7116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pitch-aru8-5