('0f3c365d-a489-5f70-a9a4-827c9374f0a0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'depreciate', '/dɪˈpriːʃieɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Giảm giá trị theo thời gian.', 'to lose value or become less valuable over a period of time.', 'Most new cars begin to depreciate in value as soon as they are driven off the lot.', 'Hầu hết xe ô tô mới bắt đầu mất giá ngay khi chúng được lái ra khỏi đại lý.', '{\"en\": \"Company assets like computers and office furniture will depreciate over the next five years.\", \"vi\": \"Các tài sản của công ty như máy tính và nội thất văn phòng sẽ giảm giá trị trong năm năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-ljspeech-5b9bab66.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-cori-5b9bab66.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/depreciate-dfe78a1d.webp', '[\"devalue\", \"cheapen\", \"decline\"]', '[\"appreciate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"depreciate in value\", \"meaning\": \"giảm giá trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"depreciate rapidly\", \"meaning\": \"giảm giá trị nhanh chóng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deprecate\", \"note_vi\": \"phản đối, phản kháng hoặc xem thường\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"depreciation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-cori-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru0-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru5-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru6-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru10-5b9bab66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru9-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru3-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru7-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru8-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-aru2-5b9bab66.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-ljspeech-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt408-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt138-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt624-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt396-5b9bab66.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt498-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt132-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt288-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt42-5b9bab66.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/depreciate-lt90-5b9bab66.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với deprecate (phản đối). Depreciate là giảm giá trị tài sản.', 'finance', 1, 0),
('64dad507-7c17-5ce3-b1e8-32b1c8705248', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'transmission', 'UK: /trænzˈmɪʃən/ | US: /trænzˈmɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'hộp số (xe cộ); sự truyền tải (dữ liệu)', 'the mechanism in a vehicle that delivers power from the engine to the wheels.', 'The car\'s transmission needed a complete overhaul.', 'Hộp số của xe cần được đại tu hoàn chỉnh.', '{\"en\": \"The mechanic inspected the delivery truck to fix an issue with its automatic transmission.\", \"vi\": \"Thợ máy đã kiểm tra xe tải giao hàng để sửa lỗi ở hộp số tự động của xe.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-ljspeech-34899a33.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-cori-34899a33.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/transmission-3e52c0d1.webp', '[\"gearbox\", \"broadcast\", \"transfer\", \"conveyance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"automatic transmission\", \"meaning\": \"hộp số tự động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"data transmission\", \"meaning\": \"sự truyền dữ liệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"transmit\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"transmitter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-cori-34899a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-aru0-34899a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-aru5-34899a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-aru6-34899a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-aru10-34899a33.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-aru9-34899a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-aru3-34899a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-aru7-34899a33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/transmission-aru8-34899a33.mp3\", \"/stor