('0628bcb3-2f7c-53cc-b5ce-f4ffe8bb4c2a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'devise', '/dɪˈvaɪz/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Suy nghĩ và tạo ra một kế hoạch, hệ thống hoặc thiết bị mới.', 'to invent a clever plan, system, or object by thinking about it very carefully and creatively.', 'Scientists are working to devise a new method for detecting diseases early.', 'Các nhà khoa học đang nỗ lực nghĩ ra một phương pháp mới để phát hiện bệnh sớm.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team will devise a new strategy to increase sales during the holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị sẽ nghĩ ra một chiến lược mới để tăng doanh số trong mùa lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-ljspeech-c2c479ad.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-cori-c2c479ad.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/devise-52d8c047.webp', '[\"design\", \"invent\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"devise a plan\", \"meaning\": \"lập kế hoạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"devise a method\", \"meaning\": \"nghĩ ra phương pháp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"device\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Device\' là danh từ (thiết bị), \'devise\' là động từ (nghĩ ra).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"device\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-cori-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru0-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru5-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru6-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru10-c2c479ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru9-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru3-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru7-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru8-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-aru2-c2c479ad.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-ljspeech-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt408-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt138-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt624-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt396-c2c479ad.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt498-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt132-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt288-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt42-c2c479ad.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/devise-lt90-c2c479ad.mp3\"]}}', 'Phát âm đuôi \'s\' của \'devise\' nghe giống âm /z/, khác với âm /s/ của \'device\'.', 'business', 1, 2),
('306ae428-6d92-5fb3-a219-cddb7fdfd472', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'discussion', 'UK: /dɪˈskʌʃn/ | US: /dɪˈskʌʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cuộc thảo luận', 'a conversation in which people talk about a particular topic to exchange ideas.', 'We had a productive discussion about the budget.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một cuộc thảo luận hiệu quả về ngân sách.', '{\"en\": \"After a lengthy discussion, the committee unanimously approved the new marketing plan.\", \"vi\": \"Sau cuộc thảo luận kéo dài, ủy ban đã nhất trí thông qua kế hoạch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-ljspeech-c255751d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-cori-c255751d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/discussion-b55476ad.webp', '[\"debate\", \"dialogue\", \"consultation\", \"conversation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"panel discussion\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc tọa đàm/thảo luận chuyên gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"open for discussion\", \"meaning\": \"sẵn sàng để thảo luận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under discussion\", \"meaning\": \"đang được đưa ra thảo luận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"discuss\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-cori-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru0-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru5-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru6-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru10-c255751d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru9-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru3-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru7-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru8-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-aru2-c255751d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-ljspeech-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt408-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt138-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt624-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt396-c255751d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt498-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt132-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt288-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt42-c255751d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discussion-lt90-c255751d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với cụm \'have a discussion on/about\' hoặc \'under discussion\' (đang được xem xét/thảo luận).', 'meetings', 1, 3),
('7f7bbf5f-614c-5aec-8df6-429e3f213ab6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'impart', '/ɪmˈpɑːt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Truyền đạt hoặc chia sẻ (kiến thức, thông tin).', 'to convey or pass on a particular quality, skill, or piece of news to others.', 'Senior managers often hold workshops to impart valuable professional experience to young employees.', 'Các quản lý cấp cao thường tổ chức hội thảo để truyền đạt kinh nghiệm chuyên môn quý báu cho nhân viên trẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The senior consultant was invited to impart his extensive industry knowledge to the junior staff members.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyên gia tư vấn cấp cao được mời để truyền đạt kiến thức ngành sâu rộng cho các nhân viên cấp dưới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-ljspeech-5b59c048.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-cori-5b59c048.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impart-d474976e.webp', '[\"convey\", \"transmit\"]', '[\"withhold\", \"keep\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impart knowledge\", \"meaning\": \"truyền đạt kiến thức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impart skills\", \"meaning\": \"truyền đạt kỹ năng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-cori-5b59c048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-aru0-5b59c048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-aru5-5b59c048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-aru6-5b59c048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-aru10-5b59c048.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-aru9-5b59c048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-aru3-5b59c048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-aru7-5b59c048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart-aru8-5b59c048.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impart