('f69f9afc-4dcf-5e81-b0bc-986d6813ec95', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'stratum', '/ˈstrɑːtəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Lớp, tầng (thường dùng trong địa chất, xã hội, hoặc cấu trúc).', 'a layer or level in a structure, society, or rock formation.', 'Geologists found different fossils in each stratum of rock they excavated.', 'Các nhà địa chất đã tìm thấy những hóa thạch khác nhau trong mỗi lớp đá mà họ khai quật.', '{\"en\": \"The market research targets a specific social stratum to increase luxury sales.\", \"vi\": \"Nghiên cứu thị trường hướng đến một tầng lớp xã hội cụ thể để tăng doanh số hàng xa xỉ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-ljspeech-68291dac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-cori-68291dac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stratum-aa9ceb58.webp', '[\"layer\", \"tier\", \"level\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"social stratum\", \"meaning\": \"tầng lớp xã hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rock stratum\", \"meaning\": \"tầng đá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stratify\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-cori-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru0-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru5-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru6-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru10-68291dac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru9-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru3-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru7-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru8-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-aru2-68291dac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-ljspeech-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt408-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt138-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt624-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt396-68291dac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt498-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt132-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt288-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt42-68291dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stratum-lt90-68291dac.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ số nhiều của stratum là strata.', 'academic', 1, 13),
('38105cdf-e2de-5ddb-a2f0-bbfbb22166c4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'atmosphere', 'UK: /ˈætməsfɪə/ | US: /ˈætməsfɪr/', 'B1', 'noun', 'bầu không khí', 'the mood or general feeling present in a particular environment or social place.', 'The office has a very positive and supportive atmosphere.', 'Văn phòng có một bầu không khí rất tích cực và hỗ trợ.', '{\"en\": \"The new office design aims to create a more collaborative and relaxed working atmosphere.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế văn phòng mới nhằm tạo ra một bầu không khí làm việc hợp tác và thoải mái hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-ljspeech-ffa2fbc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-cori-ffa2fbc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atmosphere-61b92450.webp', '[\"ambiance\", \"environment\", \"mood\", \"climate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"friendly atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"bầu không khí thân thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"working atmosphere\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường/không khí làm việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"atmospheric\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-cori-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru0-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru5-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru6-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru10-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru9-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru3-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru7-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru8-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-aru2-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-ljspeech-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt408-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt138-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt624-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt396-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt498-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt132-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt288-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt42-ffa2fbc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atmosphere-lt90-ffa2fbc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, từ này ít khi chỉ bầu khí quyển Trái Đất mà thường chỉ bầu không khí hoặc môi trường làm việc (\'work atmosphere\').', 'office', 1, 14),
('47f33dc8-e79e-50a0-9a71-29270a66f035', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'cortisol', '/ˈkɔːtɪsɒl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một hormone steroid được sản xuất bởi tuyến thượng thận, liên quan đến căng thẳng.', 'a hormone made by the body\'s adrenal glands that rises when a person feels stressed.', 'High levels of cortisol in the body can be a sign of chronic stress.', 'Nồng độ cortisol cao trong cơ thể có thể là dấu hiệu của căng thẳng mãn tính.', '{\"en\": \"The health seminar explained how high cortisol levels can reduce workplace productivity.\", \"vi\": \"Hội thảo sức khỏe giải thích cách mức cortisol cao có thể làm giảm năng suất làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-ljspeech-36ff88e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-cori-36ff88e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cortisol-e4964383.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cortisol levels\", \"meaning\": \"mức độ cortisol\"}, {\"phrase\": \"high cortisol\", \"meaning\": \"cortisol cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cortisol release\", \"meaning\": \"sự giải phóng cortisol\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adrenaline\", \"note_vi\": \"adrenaline là hormone phản ứng tức thời, cortisol liên quan đến căng thẳng kéo dài\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-cori-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru0-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru5-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru6-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru10-36ff88e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru9-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru3-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru7-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru8-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-aru2-36ff88e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-ljspeech-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt408-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt138-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt624-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt396-36ff88e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt498-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt132-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt288-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt42-36ff88e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cortisol-lt90-36ff88e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Cortisol thường gặp trong bài đọc IELTS chủ đề sức khỏe và tâm lý học.', 'health', 1, 15),
('4865c283-edda-5d46-a5ee-bd1ad8ec0a6e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'extracurricular', '/ˌekstrəkəˈrɪkjələ(r)/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Hoạt động bổ sung ngoài chương trình học chính thức ở trường.', 'not part of the usual school or college course of study.', 'Participating in extracurricular activities like sports or clubs can enrich your school experience.', 'Tham gia các hoạt động ngoại khóa như thể thao hoặc câu lạc bộ có thể làm phong phú thêm trải nghiệm học đường của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"The university offers various extracurricular programs to help students develop leadership skills.\", \"vi\": \"Trường đại học cung cấp nhiều chương trình ngoại khóa khác nhau để giúp sinh viên phát triển kỹ năng lãnh đạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-ljspeech-6d51e578.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-cori-6d51e578.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/extracurricular-8c0367cc.webp', '[\"co-curricular\", \"after-school\"]', '[\"academic\", \"curricular\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"extracurricular activities\", \"meaning\": \"các hoạt động ngoại khóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extracurricular programs\", \"meaning\": \"các chương trình ngoại khóa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"curriculum\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-cori-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru0-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru5-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru6-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru10-6d51e578.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru9-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru3-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru7-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru8-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-aru2-6d51e578.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-ljspeech-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt408-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt138-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt624-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt396-6d51e578.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt498-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt132-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt288-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt42-6d51e578.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/extracurricular-lt90-6d51e578.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiền tố \'extra-\' nghĩa là ngoài/thêm vào, \'curriculum\' là chương trình học.', 'education', 1, 16),
('a6f7923c-050f-5dec-93af-af3a1fe329d6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'hypothesis', '/haɪˈpɒθəsɪs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'giả thuyết, nhận định ban đầu cần kiểm chứng.', 'an idea suggested as basis for reasoning before proof.', 'Scientists conducted experiments to test their hypothesis about climate change.', 'Các nhà khoa học đã tiến hành thí nghiệm để kiểm tra giả thuyết của họ về biến đổi khí hậu.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team proposed a hypothesis about customer behavior for the new campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ marketing đưa ra một giả thuyết về hành vi khách hàng cho chiến dịch mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-ljspeech-ed4b436c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-cori-ed4b436c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hypothesis-f208a844.webp', '[\"assumption\", \"premise\"]', '[\"fact\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"test a hypothesis\", \"meaning\": \"kiểm tra giả thuyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prove a hypothesis\", \"meaning\": \"chứng minh giả thuyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"form a hypothesis\", \"meaning\": \"hình thành giả thuyết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hypocrisy\", \"note_vi\": \"hypocrisy là đạo đức giả, khác với giả thuyết.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hypothesize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hypothetical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-cori-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru0-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru5-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru6-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru10-ed4b436c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru9-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru3-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru7-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru8-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-aru2-ed4b436c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-ljspeech-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt408-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt138-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt624-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt396-ed4b436c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt498-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt132-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt288-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt42-ed4b436c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypothesis-lt90-ed4b436c.mp3\"]}}', 'Hypothesis là giả thuyết, không nhầm với hypocrisy (đạo đức giả).', 'marketing', 1, 17),
('5eafd938-0a22-5d68-a939-4318279e4f7e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'blank verse', '/blæŋk vɜːs/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Thơ được viết bằng thơ năm nhịp không vần điệu (iambic pentameter) nhưng có nhịp điệu.', 'unrhymed poetry with regular rhythmic pattern of five beats per line.', 'Shakespeare often used blank verse in his plays to give them a natural, spoken quality.', 'Shakespeare thường sử dụng thơ không vần trong các vở kịch của mình để mang lại chất lượng tự nhiên, như lời nói.', '{\"en\": \"The publishing team discussed using blank verse in the new educational book for schools.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ xuất bản thảo luận việc sử dụng thơ năm nhịp không vần trong cuốn sách giáo dục mới cho trường học.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-ljspeech-f17ae223.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-cori-f17ae223.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blank-verse-e331759c.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"write blank verse\", \"meaning\": \"viết thơ năm nhịp không vần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blank verse drama\", \"meaning\": \"kịch thơ năm nhịp không vần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"free verse\", \"note_vi\": \"thơ tự do không có vần và nhịp năm nhịp cố định.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-cori-f17ae223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-aru0-f17ae223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-aru5-f17ae223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-aru6-f17ae223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-aru10-f17ae223.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-aru9-f17ae223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-aru3-f17ae223.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blank-verse-