('133e9bb8-d53e-5418-8758-c813119be7ee', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'actually', '/ˈæktʃuəli/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Thật ra, trên thực tế.', 'used to refer to what is real or true in a situation.', 'I thought it would be difficult, but it was actually quite easy.', 'Tôi nghĩ nó sẽ khó, nhưng thực ra nó khá dễ.', '{\"en\": \"The seminar was actually more informative than the promotional brochure had suggested.\", \"vi\": \"Buổi hội thảo thực sự cung cấp nhiều thông tin hơn những gì tài liệu quảng cáo đã gợi ý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-ljspeech-d617b5ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-cori-d617b5ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/actually-9f2e2e79.webp', '[\"really\", \"in fact\", \"truly\"]', '[\"apparently\", \"theoretically\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"actually happen\", \"meaning\": \"thực sự xảy ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"not actually\", \"meaning\": \"không thực sự\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"currently\", \"note_vi\": \"Khác nhau: actually là thực sự/thực tế, currently là hiện tại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"actual\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"actuality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-cori-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru0-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru5-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru6-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru10-d617b5ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru9-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru3-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru7-d617b5ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/actually-aru8-d617b5ef.m