('08875502-feca-5b3a-b863-934143a3e8ba', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'boldly', '/ˈbəʊldli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách dũng cảm, tự tin và không sợ hãi.', 'in a way that shows a willingness to take risks or act bravely.', 'She boldly stood up to the bullies and defended her friend.', 'Cô ấy đã dũng cảm đứng lên chống lại những kẻ bắt nạt và bảo vệ bạn mình.', '{\"en\": \"The startup boldly entered the competitive market with a unique and innovative product.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp đã mạnh dạn bước vào thị trường cạnh tranh với một sản phẩm độc đáo và sáng tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-ljspeech-3f5bfad5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-cori-3f5bfad5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/boldly-49064585.webp', '[\"bravely\", \"courageously\", \"fearlessly\"]', '[\"timidly\", \"fearfully\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"boldly go\", \"meaning\": \"dũng cảm đi tới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"state boldly\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố một cách táo bạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"baldly\", \"note_vi\": \"baldly nghĩa là một cách trần trụi, boldly là một cách táo bạo\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bold\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"boldness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-cori-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru0-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru5-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru6-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru10-3f5bfad5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru9-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru3-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru7-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru8-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-aru2-3f5bfad5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-ljspeech-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt408-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt138-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt624-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt396-3f5bfad5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt498-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt132-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt288-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt42-3f5bfad5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boldly-lt90-3f5bfad5.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'baldly\' (một cách trần trụi, không che đậy).', 'business', 1, 26),
('d1a29eea-3339-5f30-8df9-1c0fddef04a5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '8fdec5e4-2958-5a70-8691-366a925278ab', '7847ed3c-550e-5595-987a-3409ce7c0075', 'renaissance', '/rɪˈneɪsns/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Thời kỳ phục hưng về văn hóa, nghệ thuật, khoa học.', 'a period of new growth or activity in art, literature, or music after a decline.', 'Vinyl records are currently undergoing a major renaissance among young music lovers.', 'Đĩa than hiện đang trải qua một sự phục hưng lớn trong giới trẻ yêu âm nhạc.', '{\"en\": \"The local tourism industry is enjoying a renaissance thanks to the new cultural festival program.\", \"vi\": \"Ngành du lịch địa phương đang tận hưởng sự phục hưng nhờ chương trình lễ hội văn hóa mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-ljspeech-8aa8e6a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-cori-8aa8e6a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/renaissance-5bf893bb.webp', '[\"revival\", \"rebirth\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"cultural renaissance\", \"meaning\": \"sự phục hưng văn hóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"experience a renaissance\", \"meaning\": \"trải qua sự phục hưng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-cori-8aa8e6a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-aru0-8aa8e6a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-aru5-8aa8e6a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-aru6-8aa8e6a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-aru10-8aa8e6a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-aru9-8aa8e6a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-aru3-8aa8e6a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-aru7-8aa8e6a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/renaissance-aru8-8aa8e6a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/re