('90f33976-7945-5220-b4c0-d55f5d0df754', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9735b5aa-8b3f-532d-8399-9cd28ced0369', 'b10fc361-121e-54b6-a483-91ae76a190ee', 'excessively', '/ɪkˈsesɪvli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách quá mức, vượt quá giới hạn hợp lý.', 'in a way that is more than is necessary, normal, or desirable.', 'He worries excessively about small problems, which affects his sleep.', 'Anh ấy lo lắng quá mức về những vấn đề nhỏ, điều này ảnh hưởng đến giấc ngủ của anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The manager warned the team not to spend excessively on office supplies this month.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảnh báo nhóm không được chi tiêu quá mức cho văn phòng phẩm trong tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-ljspeech-fa5a3fdf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-cori-fa5a3fdf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/excessively-a8ab25e3.webp', '[\"overly\", \"unduly\", \"immoderately\"]', '[\"moderately\", \"reasonably\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spend excessively\", \"meaning\": \"chi tiêu quá mức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"excessively high\", \"meaning\": \"cao quá mức\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"excess\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"excessive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-cori-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru0-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru5-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru6-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru10-fa5a3fdf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru9-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru3-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru7-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru8-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-aru2-fa5a3fdf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-ljspeech-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt408-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt138-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt624-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt396-fa5a3fdf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt498-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt132-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt288-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt42-fa5a3fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/excessively-lt90-fa5a3fdf.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để phê bình việc lãng phí hoặc làm gì đó quá đà.', 'finance', 1, 6),
('2a3afc88-67e3-5f72-8fe4-9a5182b98b64', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9735b5aa-8b3f-532d-8399-9cd28ced0369', 'b10fc361-121e-54b6-a483-91ae76a190ee', 'roadside', 'UK: /ˈrəʊdˌsaɪd/ | US: /ˈroʊdˌsaɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'bên đường', 'located or situated directly by the side of a street, highway, or path.', 'There is a small roadside cafe on the way to the office.', 'Có một quán cà phê nhỏ bên đường trên đường đến văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The car rental agreement includes free 24-hour roadside assistance in case of breakdowns.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng thuê xe bao gồm dịch vụ cứu hộ đường bộ 24 giờ miễn phí trong trường hợp hỏng hóc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-ljspeech-ad4d0f8e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-cori-ad4d0f8e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/roadside-6dcd284f.webp', '[\"wayside\", \"curbside\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"roadside assistance\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ cứu hộ đường bộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"roadside billboard\", \"meaning\": \"biển quảng cáo bên đường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"roadside\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-cori-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru0-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru5-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru6-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru10-ad4d0f8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru9-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru3-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru7-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru8-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-aru2-ad4d0f8e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-ljspeech-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt408-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt138-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt624-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt396-ad4d0f8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt498-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt132-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt288-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt42-ad4d0f8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roadside-lt90-ad4d0f8e.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'roadside assistance\' (dịch vụ cứu hộ đường bộ) rất hay gặp trong chủ đề travel/automobile.', 'travel', 1, 7),
('b3a86d4e-668a-5351-b538-7d1790413625', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9735b5aa-8b3f-532d-8399-9cd28ced0369', 'b10fc361-121e-54b6-a483-91ae76a190ee', 'pivotal', '/ˈpɪvətl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất quan trọng, có tính chất quyết định.', 'of crucial importance in relation to the development or success of something.', 'Her research played a pivotal role in the development of the new medicine.', 'Nghiên cứu của cô ấy đã đóng một vai trò then chốt trong việc phát triển loại thuốc mới.', '{\"en\": \"Securing this contract will play a pivotal role in our company\'s expansion plans.\", \"vi\": \"Việc giành được hợp đồng này sẽ đóng vai trò then chốt trong kế hoạch mở rộng của công ty chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-ljspeech-67f528b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-cori-67f528b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pivotal-d30796fa.webp', '[\"crucial\", \"vital\", \"decisive\"]', '[\"minor\", \"trivial\", \"insignificant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pivotal role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò then chốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pivotal moment\", \"meaning\": \"thời điểm quyết định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"crucial\", \"note_vi\": \"Crucial là quan trọng cấp bách; pivotal nhấn mạnh tính làm xoay chuyển tình thế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pivot\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pivot\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-cori-67f528b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-aru0-67f528b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-aru5-67f528b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-aru6-67f528b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-aru10-67f528b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-aru9-67f528b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pivotal-aru3-67f528b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ