('afa0c148-88c0-5979-a493-1b513e1c381a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9735b5aa-8b3f-532d-8399-9cd28ced0369', 'b10fc361-121e-54b6-a483-91ae76a190ee', 'mutter', '/ˈmʌtə(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Nói khẽ, không rõ ràng, thường là do khó chịu hoặc không muốn người khác nghe thấy.', 'to speak very quietly in a low voice because you are unhappy or annoyed.', 'He began to mutter under his breath about the unfair decision.', 'Anh ta bắt đầu lẩm bẩm trong hơi thở về quyết định không công bằng.', '{\"en\": \"The dissatisfied client began to mutter complaints about the slow service at the counter.\", \"vi\": \"Vị khách không hài lòng bắt đầu lầm bầm phàn nàn về dịch vụ chậm chạp tại quầy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-ljspeech-d23498d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-cori-d23498d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mutter-f01f304a.webp', '[\"mumble\", \"grumble\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mutter to oneself\", \"meaning\": \"lầm bầm một mình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mutter complaints\", \"meaning\": \"lầm bầm phàn nàn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-cori-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru0-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru5-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru6-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru10-d23498d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru9-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru3-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru7-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru8-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-aru2-d23498d4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-ljspeech-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt408-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt138-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt624-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt396-d23498d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt498-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt132-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt288-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt42-d23498d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mutter-lt90-d23498d4.mp3\"]}}', 'thể hiện sự không hài lòng nhưng không dám nói lớn tiếng.', 'daily', 1, 24),
('06e5b98d-9c1e-5713-8118-a4fdef531589', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9735b5aa-8b3f-532d-8399-9cd28ced0369', 'b10fc361-121e-54b6-a483-91ae76a190ee', 'call', '/kɔːl/', '', 'noun', 'Hành động gọi điện thoại hoặc một tiếng kêu.', 'a conversation on the telephone or a request for someone to come to you.', 'She decided to make a quick phone call to confirm her hotel reservation.', 'Cô ấy quyết định thực hiện một cuộc gọi nhanh để xác nhận việc đặt phòng khách sạn của mình.', '{\"en\": \"I have to make a quick call to the supplier regarding the delayed shipment today.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi phải thực hiện một cuộc gọi nhanh cho nhà cung cấp về lô hàng bị chậm trễ hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-ljspeech-bc8d8647.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-cori-bc8d8647.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/call-d263adbb.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-cori-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru0-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru5-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru6-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru10-bc8d8647.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru9-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru3-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru7-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru8-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-aru2-bc8d8647.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-ljspeech-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt408-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt138-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt624-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt396-bc8d8647.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt498-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt132-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt288-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt42-bc8d8647.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-lt90-bc8d8647.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 25),
('aaecfb26-1c8f-5ddd-8db2-d2a91cc3a348', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9735b5aa-8b3f-532d-8399-9cd28ced0369', 'b10fc361-121e-54b6-a483-91ae76a190ee', 'unproblematic', '/ˌʌnprɒbləˈmætɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không gây ra vấn đề, dễ dàng hoặc không phức tạp.', 'not causing any problems or difficulties and easy to deal with.', 'The transition to the new software was surprisingly unproblematic, with no major issues reported.', 'Việc chuyển đổi sang phần mềm mới diễn ra đáng ngạc nhiên là không có vấn đề gì, không có sự cố lớn nào được báo cáo.', '{\"en\": \"The installation of the new office printers was completely unproblematic for the staff.\", \"vi\": \"Việc lắp đặt máy in văn phòng mới hoàn toàn không gặp vấn đề gì đối với nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-ljspeech-31c1785f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-cori-31c1785f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unproblematic-b551be83.webp', '[\"trouble-free\", \"straightforward\", \"easy\"]', '[\"problematic\", \"troublesome\", \"difficult\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"relatively unproblematic\", \"meaning\": \"tương đối không gặp vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unproblematic transition\", \"meaning\": \"sự chuyển đổi suôn sẻ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"problem\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"problematic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-cori-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru0-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru5-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru6-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru10-31c1785f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru9-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru3-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru7-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru8-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-aru2-31c1785f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-ljspeech-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt408-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt138-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt624-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt396-31c1785f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt498-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt132-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt288-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt42-31c1785f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unproblematic-lt90-31c1785f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thêm tiền tố un- vào trước problematic (gây rắc rối) để tạo nghĩa phủ định.', 'office', 1, 26),
('dfda8176-227d-5928-8568-b0577c18cb38', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9735b5aa-8b3f-532d-8399-9cd28ced0369', 'b10fc361-121e-54b6-a483-91ae76a190ee', 'break room', 'UK: /ˈbreɪk ruːm/ | US: /ˈbreɪk ruːm/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'phòng nghỉ', 'A designated space in a workplace where employees can relax, eat, or socialize during rest periods.', 'The break room has a new coffee machine.', 'Phòng nghỉ có một máy pha cà phê mới.', '{\"en\": \"Complimentary tea and coffee are available in the employee break room.\", \"vi\": \"Trà và cà phê miễn phí có sẵn trong phòng nghỉ của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-ljspeech-9a195688.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-cori-9a195688.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/break-room-63776340.webp', '[\"lunchroom\", \"lounge\", \"staff room\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"employee break room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng nghỉ dành cho nhân viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clean the break room\", \"meaning\": \"dọn dẹp phòng nghỉ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-cori-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru0-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru5-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru6-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru10-9a195688.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru9-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru3-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru7-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru8-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-aru2-9a195688.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-ljspeech-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt408-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt138-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt624-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt396-9a195688.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt498-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt132-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt288-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt42-9a195688.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/break-room-lt90-9a195688.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh công sở, \'break room\' là nơi trang bị máy pha cà phê, tủ lạnh để nhân viên nghỉ trưa.', 'office', 1, 27),
('1b87345d-858c-523d-8210-eff894c5abdc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9735b5aa-8b3f-532d-8399-9cd28ced0369', 'b10fc361-121e-54b6-a483-91ae76a190ee', 'steady', 'UK: /ˈstɛdi/ | US: /ˈstɛdi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'ổn định, vững chắc', 'firmly fixed, constant, or developing in a regular and continuous manner over time.', 'The growth of the economy has been quite steady recently.', 'Sự tăng trưởng của nền kinh tế gần đây khá ổn định.', '{\"en\": \"The store has enjoyed a steady flow of customers since launching its promotional campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng đã có một lượng khách hàng ổn định kể từ khi khởi động chiến dịch quảng cáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-ljspeech-0c69e7aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-cori-0c69e7aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/steady-f273e0e2.webp', '[\"stable\", \"constant\", \"firm\"]', '[\"unstable\", \"fluctuating\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"steady income\", \"meaning\": \"thu nhập ổn định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"steady growth\", \"meaning\": \"tăng trưởng ổn định\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"steadily\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"steady\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-cori-0c69e7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru0-0c69e7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru5-0c69e7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru6-0c69e7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru10-0c69e7aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru9-0c69e7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru3-0c69e7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru7-0c69e7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru8-0c69e7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/steady-aru2-0c69e7aa.mp3\"]}, \"us\"