('29974b98-2633-575e-a167-016f66427cba', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9cc075fc-e230-5986-97fd-7d52f6886d4e', '50103e05-44be-5063-9d70-b2d216938d52', 'reassure', '/ˌriːəˈʃʊə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Trấn an, làm cho ai đó bớt lo lắng.', 'to say or do something to make someone stop worrying about a problem.', 'She tried to reassure her daughter that everything would be okay after the bad dream.', 'Cô ấy cố gắng trấn an con gái mình rằng mọi thứ sẽ ổn sau cơn ác mộng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager tried to reassure the clients that their shipments would arrive on time.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã cố gắng trấn an khách hàng rằng các lô hàng của họ sẽ đến đúng giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-ljspeech-7c4bcd61.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-cori-7c4bcd61.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reassure-e55e3c86.webp', '[\"comfort\", \"soothe\", \"encourage\"]', '[\"alarm\", \"worry\", \"frighten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reassure the public\", \"meaning\": \"trấn an công chúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reassure customers\", \"meaning\": \"trấn an khách hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ensure\", \"note_vi\": \"ensure là bảo đảm việc gì đó sẽ xảy ra\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reassurance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reassuring\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-cori-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru0-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru5-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru6-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru10-7c4bcd61.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru9-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru3-7c4bcd61.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reassure-aru7-7c4bcd61.mp3\", 