('062833ef-7efb-57c3-a4f0-94d1fdb0cf6c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9cc075fc-e230-5986-97fd-7d52f6886d4e', '50103e05-44be-5063-9d70-b2d216938d52', 'appoint', '/əˈpɔɪnt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Chỉ định hoặc chọn ai đó vào một vị trí hoặc chức vụ.', 'to choose someone officially for a job or a position.', 'The committee decided to appoint a new director next month.', 'Ủy ban đã quyết định bổ nhiệm một giám đốc mới vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors plans to appoint a new chief executive officer tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc có kế hoạch bổ nhiệm một giám đốc điều hành mới vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-ljspeech-1b2a623b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-cori-1b2a623b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appoint-c6e766eb.webp', '[\"designate\", \"nominate\", \"assign\"]', '[\"dismiss\", \"fire\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"appoint someone as\", \"meaning\": \"bổ nhiệm ai làm vị trí gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"appoint a committee\", \"meaning\": \"thành lập/chỉ định một ủy ban\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assign\", \"note_vi\": \"appoint là bổ nhiệm chức vụ; assign là phân công nhiệm vụ hoặc công việc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"appointment\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"appointee\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-cori-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru0-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru5-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru6-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru10-1b2a623b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru9-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru3-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru7-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru8-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru2-1b2a623b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-ljspeech-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt408-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt138-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt624-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt396-1b2a623b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt498-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt132-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt288-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt42-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt90-1b2a623b.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: appoint someone to/as something.', 'hr', 1, 27),
('d09f58c0-8ab8-5366-b147-c9bc35de9f22', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9cc075fc-e230-5986-97fd-7d52f6886d4e', '50103e05-44be-5063-9d70-b2d216938d52', 'unintentionally', '/ˌʌnɪnˈtenʃənəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách không cố ý, không chủ tâm hoặc ngoài ý muốn.', 'in a way that is not planned or intended.', 'I unintentionally offended her with my blunt comment.', 'Tôi đã vô tình làm cô ấy phật ý bằng lời bình luận thẳng thừng của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The employee unintentionally deleted the important financial report from the shared company drive.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đã vô tình xóa báo cáo tài chính quan trọng khỏi ổ đĩa chung của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-ljspeech-5f49adcb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-cori-5f49adcb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unintentionally-e857163b.webp', '[\"accidentally\", \"inadvertently\", \"unwittingly\"]', '[\"intentionally\", \"deliberately\", \"purposely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unintentionally cause\", \"meaning\": \"vô tình gây ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unintentionally omit\", \"meaning\": \"vô tình bỏ sót\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unintentional\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intention\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"intend\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-cori-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru0-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru5-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru6-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru10-5f49adcb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru9-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru3-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru7-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru8-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-aru2-5f49adcb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-ljspeech-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt408-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt138-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt624-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt396-5f49adcb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt498-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt132-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt288-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt42-5f49adcb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unintentionally-lt90-5f49adcb.mp3\"]}}', 'Đồng nghĩa với accidentally nhưng mang sắc thái trang trọng hơn.', 'office', 1, 28),
('383b91c5-b73d-55a2-99ee-0146039a653c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9cc075fc-e230-5986-97fd-7d52f6886d4e', '50103e05-44be-5063-9d70-b2d216938d52', 'stimulus', '/ˈstɪmjələs/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Tác nhân gây ra phản ứng hoặc thay đổi ở một sinh vật hay hệ thống.', 'something that causes growth, activity, or reaction in a person or system.', 'Tax cuts provided a welcome financial stimulus for small business owners.', 'Việc cắt giảm thuế đã mang lại một sự kích thích tài chính đáng hoan nghênh cho các chủ doanh nghiệp nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The government introduced a new tax cut as a stimulus for economic growth.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đã đưa ra một đợt giảm thuế mới như một chất xúc tác cho sự tăng trưởng kinh tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-ljspeech-4a7986ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-cori-4a7986ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stimulus-65252efa.webp', '[\"incentive\", \"impetus\", \"spur\"]', '[\"deterrent\", \"discouragement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"economic stimulus\", \"meaning\": \"kích thích kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"provide a stimulus\", \"meaning\": \"tạo ra sự kích thích/động lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stimulant\", \"note_vi\": \"chất kích thích (như caffeine, thuốc)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stimulate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stimulating\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-cori-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru0-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru5-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru6-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru10-4a7986ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru9-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru3-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru7-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru8-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-aru2-4a7986ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-ljspeech-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt408-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt138-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt624-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt396-4a7986ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt498-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt132-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt288-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt42-4a7986ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulus-lt90-4a7986ab.mp3\"]}}', 'Số nhiều của từ này là \'stimuli\', tránh viết sai chính tả.', 'finance', 1, 29),
('f2cbb9f8-d36e-5afc-b904-9706c8eaea7f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9d7f2a3b-10a3-5f0e-a8c8-421e99fd2bf3', '5263c150-552b-5c1f-addc-4f970e352a6f', 'wholesale', '/ˈhəʊlseɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Việc bán hàng với số lượng lớn cho các nhà bán lẻ hoặc doanh nghiệp.', 'the business of selling goods in large quantities to stores or other companies.', 'Many small shops buy their products at wholesale prices to save money.', 'Nhiều cửa hàng nhỏ mua sản phẩm với giá bán sỉ để tiết kiệm tiền.', '{\"en\": \"Our supplier specializes in wholesale, offering lower prices for bulk orders of office supplies.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp của chúng tôi chuyên bán buôn, đưa ra mức giá thấp hơn cho các đơn hàng đồ dùng văn phòng số lượng lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-ljspeech-8c941ab6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-cori-8c941ab6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wholesale-fc5ccf74.webp', '[\"bulk selling\"]', '[\"retail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wholesale price\", \"meaning\": \"giá bán buôn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wholesale distributor\", \"meaning\": \"nhà phân phối bán buôn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"retail\", \"note_vi\": \"retail là bán lẻ cho người tiêu dùng, wholesale là bán buôn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wholesaler\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-cori-8c941ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-aru0-8c941ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-aru5-8c941ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-aru6-8c941ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-aru10-8c941ab6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-aru9-8c941ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-aru3-8c941ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wholesale-aru7-8c941ab6.mp3\",