('3b25185c-73da-53f5-8c0a-60e84dcc1765', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9d7f2a3b-10a3-5f0e-a8c8-421e99fd2bf3', '5263c150-552b-5c1f-addc-4f970e352a6f', 'regrettably', '/rɪˈɡretəbli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách đáng buồn hoặc đáng tiếc.', 'in a manner that is sad or worthy of regret.', 'Regrettably, due to unforeseen circumstances, the event has been canceled.', 'Đáng tiếc thay, do những trường hợp bất khả kháng, sự kiện đã bị hủy bỏ.', '{\"en\": \"Regrettably, the shipment was delayed, causing complaints from our major client.\", \"vi\": \"Đáng tiếc, lô hàng bị trễ, gây khiếu nại từ khách hàng lớn của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-ljspeech-6a45700b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-cori-6a45700b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regrettably-737bc7a7.webp', '[\"unfortunately\", \"sadly\"]', '[\"fortunately\", \"luckily\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"regrettably delayed\", \"meaning\": \"đáng tiếc bị trễ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"regrettably absent\", \"meaning\": \"đáng tiếc vắng mặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"regrettably necessary\", \"meaning\": \"đáng tiếc mà cần thiết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"regretfully\", \"note_vi\": \"có nghĩa chứa sự hối tiếc cá nhân, khác regrettably\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"regret\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"regretful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-cori-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru0-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru5-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru6-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru10-6a45700b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru9-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru3-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru7-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru8-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-aru2-6a45700b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-ljspeech-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt408-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt138-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt624-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt396-6a45700b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt498-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt132-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt288-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt42-6a45700b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regrettably-lt90-6a45700b.mp3\"]}}', 'Regrettably (đáng tiếc) khác regretfully (với sự hối tiếc).', 'business', 1, 27),
('cb8c74fe-022f-5d6d-a74d-ec2e409d2a77', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9d7f2a3b-10a3-5f0e-a8c8-421e99fd2bf3', '5263c150-552b-5c1f-addc-4f970e352a6f', 'documentary', 'UK: /ˌdɒkjuˈmentri/ | US: /ˌdɑːkjuˈmentri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'phim tài liệu', 'a film or television program that presents factual information about real events or subjects.', 'Her new documentary explores urban development.', 'Bộ phim tài liệu mới của cô ấy khám phá sự phát triển đô thị.', '{\"en\": \"The media group produced a documentary detailing the company\'s 50-year history.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn truyền thông đã sản xuất một bộ phim tài liệu chi tiết về lịch sử 50 năm của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-ljspeech-6de8a320.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-cori-6de8a320.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/documentary-15fa4165.webp', '[\"factual film\", \"non-fiction film\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"produce a documentary\", \"meaning\": \"sản xuất phim tài liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"documentary film\", \"meaning\": \"phim tài liệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"document\", \"note_vi\": \"Document là văn bản/tài liệu giấy hoặc điện tử.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"document\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-cori-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru0-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru5-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru6-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru10-6de8a320.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru9-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru3-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru7-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru8-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-aru2-6de8a320.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-ljspeech-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt408-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt138-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt624-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt396-6de8a320.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt498-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt132-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt288-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt42-6de8a320.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/documentary-lt90-6de8a320.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với danh từ \'document\' (tài liệu thông thường). \'Documentary\' chỉ phim hoặc chương trình truyền hình tài liệu.', 'media', 1, 28),
('782f440d-0603-5267-b6e3-d4563294598a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9d7f2a3b-10a3-5f0e-a8c8-421e99fd2bf3', '5263c150-552b-5c1f-addc-4f970e352a6f', 'database', '/ˈdeɪtəbeɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một bộ sưu tập dữ liệu được tổ chức có hệ thống.', 'a large, organized collection of information stored and accessed by a computer system.', 'The library uses a large database to manage all its books and members.', 'Thư viện sử dụng một cơ sở dữ liệu lớn để quản lý tất cả sách và thành viên của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Please update the customer database with the new contact details before Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng cập nhật cơ sở dữ liệu khách hàng với thông tin liên hệ mới trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-ljspeech-6d613a1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-cori-6d613a1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/database-64bf5857.webp', '[\"data repository\", \"data system\", \"records\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"update a database\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật cơ sở dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"database management\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý cơ sở dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"access a database\", \"meaning\": \"truy cập cơ sở dữ liệu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"spreadsheet\", \"note_vi\": \"spreadsheet là bảng tính đơn giản, database là hệ thống dữ liệu phức tạp hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"data\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-cori-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru0-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru5-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru6-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru10-6d613a1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru9-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru3-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru7-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru8-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru2-6d613a1e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-ljspeech-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt408-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt138-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt624-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt396-6d613a1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt498-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt132-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt288-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt42-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt90-6d613a1e.mp3\"]}}', '\"Database\" thường xuất hiện trong đề TOEIC liên quan đến công nghệ thông tin và quản lý dữ liệu.', 'technology', 1, 29),
('2a02cd22-3fc4-5c23-8913-f8495a13a961', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'naive', '/naɪˈiːv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thiếu kinh nghiệm và dễ tin người, ngây thơ.', 'lacking experience of life and too ready to trust or believe other people.', 'It is naive to assume that starting a new business will yield immediate profits.', 'Thật ngây thơ khi cho rằng bắt đầu một doanh nghiệp mới sẽ mang lại lợi nhuận ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"The naive intern signed the contract without reading the terms and conditions carefully.\", \"vi\": \"Thực tập sinh ngây thơ đã ký hợp đồng mà không đọc kỹ các điều khoản và điều kiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-ljspeech-0bc5b86f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-cori-0bc5b86f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/naive-9efa7600.webp', '[\"gullible\", \"innocent\", \"inexperienced\"]', '[\"experienced\", \"sophisticated\", \"worldly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"naive assumption\", \"meaning\": \"giả định ngây thơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"politically naive\", \"meaning\": \"ngây thơ về chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"naive approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận thiếu kinh nghiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"innocent\", \"note_vi\": \"innocent thiên về vô tội/trong sáng; naive thiên về thiếu kinh nghiệm, dễ bị lừa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"naively\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"naivety\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-cori-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru0-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru5-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru6-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru10-0bc5b86f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru9-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru3-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru7-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru8-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-aru2-0bc5b86f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-ljspeech-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt408-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt138-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt624-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt396-0bc5b86f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt498-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt132-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt288-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt42-0bc5b86f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/naive-lt90-0bc5b86f.mp3\"]}}', '\'Naive\' thường mang hàm ý nhẹ tiêu cực; phát âm là /naɪˈiːv/, đừng đọc như \'na-ive\' một âm tiết.', 'hr', 1, 0),
('bc781dd4-5e4d-59cb-a404-16c788dc80fd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'asymmetrical', '/ˌeɪsɪˈmetrɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không có sự đối xứng, không cân đối.', 'having parts that do not match in size, shape, or position on either side.', 'The artist created an interesting asymmetrical design for the sculpture.', 'Nghệ sĩ đã tạo ra một thiết kế bất đối xứng thú vị cho tác phẩm điêu khắc.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed an asymmetrical layout for the office to create a modern visual effect.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế một bố cục không đối xứng cho văn phòng để tạo hiệu ứng thị giác hiện đại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-ljspeech-3c2c5c52.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-cori-3c2c5c52.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/asymmetrical-e6b532a2.webp', '[\"unbalanced\", \"irregular\"]', '[\"symmetrical\", \"balanced\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"asymmetrical design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế không đối xứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"asymmetrical balance\", \"meaning\": \"cân bằng bất đối xứng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"asymmetry\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-cori-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru0-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru5-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru6-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru10-3c2c5c52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru9-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru3-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru7-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru8-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-aru2-3c2c5c52.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-ljspeech-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt408-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt138-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt624-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt396-3c2c5c52.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt498-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt132-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt288-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt42-3c2c5c52.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asymmetrical-lt90-3c2c5c52.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong thiết kế, nghệ thuật hoặc kiến trúc.', 'housing', 1, 1),
('7f93e34b-f1e8-51ac-9fdd-4dd012da0027', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'judicious', '/dʒuˈdɪʃəs/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Sáng suốt, khôn ngoan, có óc phán đoán tốt.', 'showing good sense and careful thought in making decisions or taking action.', 'Making a judicious decision requires careful thought and consideration.', 'Đưa ra một quyết định sáng suốt đòi hỏi suy nghĩ và cân nhắc kỹ lưỡng.', '{\"en\": \"The board appreciated her judicious use of the department budget during the financial crisis.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đánh giá cao việc cô ấy sử dụng ngân sách phòng ban một cách sáng suốt trong khủng hoảng tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-ljspeech-d4a136bc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-cori-d4a136bc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/judicious-c6ab513e.webp', '[\"wise\", \"prudent\", \"sensible\"]', '[\"foolish\", \"imprudent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"judicious use\", \"meaning\": \"việc sử dụng khôn ngoan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"judicious decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định sáng suốt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"judicial\", \"note_vi\": \"judicial thuộc về tòa án/tư pháp, judicious là sáng suốt/khôn ngoan.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"judiciously\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"judiciousness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-cori-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru0-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru5-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru6-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru10-d4a136bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru9-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru3-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru7-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru8-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-aru2-d4a136bc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-ljspeech-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt408-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt138-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt624-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt396-d4a136bc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt498-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt132-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt288-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt42-d4a136bc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judicious-lt90-d4a136bc.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất dễ nhầm với judicial (liên quan đến tòa án/tư pháp).', 'business', 1, 2),
('e73faaf4-c075-5360-9df4-16968669e520', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'capital punishment', '/ˌkæpɪtl̩ ˈpʌnɪʃmənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hình phạt tử hình; việc giết người phạm tội theo luật pháp.', 'the legal execution of a person as a penalty for committing a serious crime.', 'There is ongoing debate in many countries about the ethics of capital punishment.', 'Có một cuộc tranh luận không ngừng ở nhiều quốc gia về đạo đức của án tử hình.', '{\"en\": \"The legal consultant explained how recent law reforms abolished capital punishment for financial offenses.\", \"vi\": \"Cố vấn pháp lý đã giải thích việc cải cách luật gần đây xóa bỏ án tử hình đối với các tội danh tài chính như thế nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-ljspeech-fb52b620.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-cori-fb52b620.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/capital-punishment-6de85999.webp', '[\"death penalty\", \"execution\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"abolish capital punishment\", \"meaning\": \"bãi bỏ hình phạt tử hình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"face capital punishment\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt với án tử hình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"death penalty\", \"note_vi\": \"hoàn toàn tương đương về nghĩa, nhưng capital punishment mang tính pháp lý hơn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-cori-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru0-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru5-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru6-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru10-fb52b620.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru9-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru3-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru7-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru8-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-aru2-fb52b620.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-ljspeech-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt408-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt138-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt624-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt396-fb52b620.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt498-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt132-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt288-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt42-fb52b620.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/capital-punishment-lt90-fb52b620.mp3\"]}}', 'Thuật ngữ pháp lý chính thức, thường dùng trong văn bản luật và báo chí.', 'law', 1, 3),
('80d9d05d-10eb-54c1-970c-93010f3e5755', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'restrict', 'UK: /rɪˈstrɪkt/ | US: /rɪˈstrɪkt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'hạn chế, giới hạn', 'to limit or control the amount, size, range, or movement of something.', 'Access to the executive lounge is restricted to premium members.', 'Quyền vào phòng chờ điều hành được giới hạn cho các thành viên cao cấp.', '{\"en\": \"Access to the confidential database is restricted to authorized personnel only.\", \"vi\": \"Việc truy cập vào cơ sở dữ liệu bảo mật bị hạn chế chỉ dành cho nhân viên được ủy quyền.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-ljspeech-ee1e5b88.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-cori-ee1e5b88.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/restrict-ede7a121.webp', '[\"limit\", \"constrain\", \"curb\", \"regulate\"]', '[\"permit\", \"allow\", \"expand\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"restrict access to\", \"meaning\": \"giới hạn truy cập vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strictly restrict\", \"meaning\": \"hạn chế một cách nghiêm ngặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prohibit\", \"note_vi\": \"Prohibit là cấm hoàn toàn; restrict là giới hạn phạm vi/đối tượng được làm gì.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"restriction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"restrictive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-cori-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru0-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru5-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru6-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru10-ee1e5b88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru9-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru3-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru7-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru8-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-aru2-ee1e5b88.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-ljspeech-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt408-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt138-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt624-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt396-ee1e5b88.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt498-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt132-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt288-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt42-ee1e5b88.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restrict-lt90-ee1e5b88.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'to\' (restrict access to...).', 'office', 1, 4),
('82227d88-a170-5319-867b-49dab01028b7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'karaoke', '/ˌkæriˈəʊki/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hoạt động hát theo nhạc đã thu âm với lời bài hát hiển thị trên màn hình.', 'a form of entertainment where people sing along with recorded music using a microphone.', 'We often go to a karaoke bar on Friday nights to sing our favorite songs.', 'Chúng tôi thường đi quán karaoke vào tối thứ Sáu để hát những bài hát yêu thích.', '{\"en\": \"The company rented a karaoke machine for the annual office holiday party.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một máy karaoke cho bữa tiệc nghỉ lễ thường niên của văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-ljspeech-f9d20f9b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-cori-f9d20f9b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/karaoke-5e6731c0.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"karaoke bar\", \"meaning\": \"quán karaoke\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sing karaoke\", \"meaning\": \"hát karaoke\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-cori-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru0-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru5-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru6-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru10-f9d20f9b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru9-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru3-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru7-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru8-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-aru2-f9d20f9b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/karaoke-ljspeech-f9d20f9b.mp3\", \