('a24c0f09-c19b-5c99-b97b-01c011d03f5e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'arm', '/ɑːm/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Bộ phận cơ thể từ vai đến bàn tay.', 'either of the two long parts of the body between the shoulder and the wrist.', 'She carried her baby in her arms while walking through the park.', 'Cô ấy bế đứa bé trong vòng tay khi đi dạo qua công viên.', '{\"en\": \"The technician hurt his arm while installing the heavy printer in the main office.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã bị thương ở tay khi đang lắp đặt chiếc máy in nặng trong văn phòng chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-ljspeech-ed945d6b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-cori-ed945d6b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arm-ba389beb.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"arm in arm\", \"meaning\": \"tay trong tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"upper arm\", \"meaning\": \"bắp tay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"arm\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ nghĩa là cánh tay, nhưng động từ lại có nghĩa là trang bị vũ khí.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"armed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-cori-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru0-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru5-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru6-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru10-ed945d6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru9-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru3-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru7-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru8-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-aru2-ed945d6b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-ljspeech-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt408-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt138-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt624-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt396-ed945d6b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt498-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt132-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt288-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt42-ed945d6b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arm-lt90-ed945d6b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt nghĩa cơ thể (cánh tay) với động từ (vũ trang) hoặc danh từ (chi nhánh).', 'health', 1, 6),
('8072c42e-a100-564f-9df6-73a662bd78d1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'interminable', '/ɪnˈtɜːmɪnəbl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Dài lê thê, dường như không bao giờ kết thúc.', 'continuing for a very long time in a way that is boring or annoying.', 'The meeting felt interminable, lasting for over three hours.', 'Cuộc họp dường như dài vô tận, kéo dài hơn ba tiếng đồng hồ.', '{\"en\": \"The interminable wait for the delayed flight caused many passengers to complain to the staff.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chờ đợi kéo dài lê thê cho chuyến bay bị hoãn đã khiến nhiều hành khách phàn nàn với nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-ljspeech-4f261c6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-cori-4f261c6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/interminable-f506a166.webp', '[\"endless\", \"long-lasting\"]', '[\"brief\", \"short\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"interminable meeting\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp kéo dài lê thê\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interminable wait\", \"meaning\": \"sự chờ đợi vô tận\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-cori-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru0-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru5-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru6-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru10-4f261c6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru9-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru3-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru7-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru8-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-aru2-4f261c6d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-ljspeech-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt408-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt138-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt624-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt396-4f261c6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt498-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt132-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt288-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt42-4f261c6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/interminable-lt90-4f261c6d.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh sự mệt mỏi, chán nản do thời gian kéo dài quá mức.', 'travel', 1, 7),
('4d950321-1298-5c18-b918-47acc128b3bc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'rubber', '/ˈrʌbə(r)/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Vật liệu đàn hồi, thường được dùng để làm lốp xe, gôm tẩy.', 'an elastic substance made from the juice of a tropical tree or produced chemically.', 'Many modern shoes have soles made of durable rubber for better grip.', 'Nhiều đôi giày hiện đại có đế làm từ cao su bền để bám đường tốt hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturing plant imports natural rubber to produce high-quality tires for commercial trucks.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy sản xuất nhập khẩu cao su tự nhiên để sản xuất lốp xe chất lượng cao cho xe tải thương mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-ljspeech-386a231f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-cori-386a231f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rubber-88822e34.webp', '[\"latex\", \"elastic\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"natural rubber\", \"meaning\": \"cao su tự nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rubber band\", \"meaning\": \"dây thun\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rubber sole\", \"meaning\": \"đế cao su\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eraser\", \"note_vi\": \"eraser là cục tẩy (Mỹ), rubber là cao su hoặc cục tẩy (Anh)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rubbery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-cori-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru0-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru5-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru6-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru10-386a231f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru9-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru3-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru7-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru8-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-aru2-386a231f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-ljspeech-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt408-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt138-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt624-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt396-386a231f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt498-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt132-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt288-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt42-386a231f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rubber-lt90-386a231f.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong tiếng Anh-Anh, rubber còn có nghĩa là cục tẩy (eraser trong tiếng Anh-Mỹ).', 'manufacturing', 1, 8),
('3edeb594-540d-5524-a9b3-f487d9e16099', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'histogram', '/ˈhɪstəɡræm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Biểu đồ dùng các cột để thể hiện tần suất phân bố dữ liệu.', 'a graph consisting of thick lines or blocks that shows how often different amounts happen.', 'The statistics professor used a histogram to display the distribution of student scores.', 'Giáo sư thống kê đã sử dụng biểu đồ tần suất để hiển thị sự phân bố điểm số của sinh viên.', '{\"en\": \"The financial analyst presented a histogram to illustrate the distribution of customer ages in the store.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyên viên phân tích tài chính đã trình bày một biểu đồ tần suất để minh họa sự phân bố độ tuổi khách hàng trong cửa hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-ljspeech-b48e3038.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-cori-b48e3038.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/histogram-738bc2d8.webp', '[\"bar chart\", \"graph\", \"diagram\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"plot a histogram\", \"meaning\": \"vẽ biểu đồ tần suất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bar chart\", \"note_vi\": \"bar chart cho dữ liệu rời rạc, histogram cho dữ liệu liên tục.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-cori-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru0-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru5-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru6-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru10-b48e3038.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru9-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru3-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru7-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru8-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-aru2-b48e3038.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-ljspeech-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt408-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt138-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt624-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt396-b48e3038.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt498-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt132-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt288-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt42-b48e3038.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/histogram-lt90-b48e3038.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong IELTS Writing Task 1 hoặc các báo cáo phân tích dữ liệu.', 'academic', 1, 9),
('49a82426-088a-555b-9a79-0d17f6989c6a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'linoleum', '/lɪˈnəʊliəm/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Vật liệu lát sàn bền, thường làm từ dầu hạt lanh và các thành phần tự nhiên khác.', 'a strong material used for covering floors, which is easy to clean and maintain.', 'The old kitchen floor was covered with a worn linoleum pattern from the 1970s.', 'Sàn bếp cũ được phủ một lớp linoleum hoa văn đã mòn từ những năm 1970.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew will replace the old linoleum flooring in the staff break room.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì sẽ thay thế sàn lót linoleum cũ trong phòng nghỉ của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-ljspeech-5690ffc3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-cori-5690ffc3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/linoleum-9a785ae6.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"linoleum floor\", \"meaning\": \"sàn lót linoleum\"}, {\"phrase\": \"linoleum flooring\", \"meaning\": \"vật liệu lát sàn linoleum\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"petroleum\", \"note_vi\": \"petroleum là dầu mỏ, linoleum là vật liệu lát sàn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-cori-5690ffc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-aru0-5690ffc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-aru5-5690ffc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-aru6-5690ffc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-aru10-5690ffc3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-aru9-5690ffc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-aru3-5690ffc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-aru7-5690ffc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linoleum-aru8-5690ffc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia