('715111bb-1fcb-58a2-87d2-8acaada62359', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'acid rain', '/æsɪd reɪn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Mưa có tính axit do ô nhiễm không khí.', 'precipitation containing harmful chemicals caused by atmospheric pollution from factories and cars.', 'Acid rain can cause significant damage to forests and aquatic ecosystems.', 'Mưa axit có thể gây ra thiệt hại đáng kể cho rừng và hệ sinh thái dưới nước.', '{\"en\": \"The environmental inspection team reported that local factories contributed to heavy acid rain.\", \"vi\": \"Đoàn kiểm tra môi trường báo cáo rằng các nhà máy địa phương đã góp phần gây ra mưa axit nặng hạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-ljspeech-a0821474.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-cori-a0821474.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acid-rain-8587bd29.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"effects of acid rain\", \"meaning\": \"tác hại của mưa axit\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cause acid rain\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra mưa axit\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-cori-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru0-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru5-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru6-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru10-a0821474.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru9-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru3-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru7-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru8-a0821474.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acid-rain-aru2-a0821474.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/