('5c0d3584-26b4-5334-aaad-1460dc5be7ec', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'wrinkle', 'UK: /ˈrɪŋkəl/ | US: /ˈrɪŋkəl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nếp nhăn', 'A small line or fold on paper, cloth, skin, or a minor unexpected issue.', 'The manager noticed a new wrinkle in the project plan.', 'Người quản lý nhận thấy một vấn đề mới trong kế hoạch dự án.', '{\"en\": \"We need to iron out a few wrinkles in the new software system before launching it.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi cần giải quyết một vài trục trặc nhỏ trong hệ thống phần mềm mới trước khi ra mắt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-ljspeech-a72cc496.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-cori-a72cc496.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wrinkle-e384aeda.webp', '[\"crease\", \"fold\", \"flaw\", \"glitch\"]', '[\"smoothness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"iron out wrinkles\", \"meaning\": \"tháo gỡ các vướng mắc/trục trặc nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wrinkle-free fabric\", \"meaning\": \"vải chống nhăn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"wrinkle\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"wrinkled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-cori-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru0-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru5-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru6-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru10-a72cc496.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru9-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru3-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru7-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru8-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-aru2-a72cc496.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-ljspeech-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt408-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt138-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt624-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt396-a72cc496.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt498-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt132-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt288-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt42-a72cc496.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wrinkle-lt90-a72cc496.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa nếp nhăn trên da hay vải, trong công việc nó còn mang nghĩa bóng là trục trặc nhỏ phát sinh.', 'office', 1, 22),
('538c1772-26c7-5595-bdb8-0e8759e966cb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'tune', '/tjuːn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi các nốt nhạc tạo thành một giai điệu dễ nhận biết.', 'a series of musical notes that are pleasant to listen to and easy to remember.', 'The children were humming a cheerful tune as they played.', 'Bọn trẻ đang ngân nga một giai điệu vui tươi khi chúng chơi đùa.', '{\"en\": \"The background music in the hotel lobby played a soft, relaxing tune for the guests.\", \"vi\": \"Nhạc nền ở sảnh khách sạn phát một giai điệu nhẹ nhàng, thư giãn cho các vị khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-ljspeech-920ae2fa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-cori-920ae2fa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tune-3f2b420f.webp', '[\"melody\", \"song\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"catchy tune\", \"meaning\": \"giai điệu bắt tai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hum a tune\", \"meaning\": \"ngân nga một giai điệu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tuneful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-cori-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru0-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru5-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru6-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru10-920ae2fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru9-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru3-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru7-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru8-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-aru2-920ae2fa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-ljspeech-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt408-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt138-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt624-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt396-920ae2fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt498-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt132-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt288-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt42-920ae2fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tune-lt90-920ae2fa.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ phần giai điệu của một bài hát.', 'travel', 1, 23),
('a8dc08d9-1bc2-5ab2-baa6-b5c35ad5662f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'oil rig', '/ɔɪl rɪɡ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cấu trúc lớn dùng để khoan và khai thác dầu khí.', 'a large structure in the ocean used for drilling and getting oil from the ground.', 'Workers on the oil rig often spend months at sea away from their families.', 'Các công nhân trên giàn khoan dầu thường phải ở ngoài biển hàng tháng trời xa gia đình.', '{\"en\": \"The safety inspector visited the oil rig to check for any potential hazards to workers.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra an toàn đã đến giàn khoan dầu để kiểm tra các mối nguy hiểm tiềm ẩn cho công nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-ljspeech-db58772b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-cori-db58772b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/oil-rig-65dffdd3.webp', '[\"drilling platform\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"offshore oil rig\", \"meaning\": \"giàn khoan dầu ngoài khơi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work on an oil rig\", \"meaning\": \"làm việc trên giàn khoan\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-cori-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru0-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru5-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru6-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru10-db58772b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru9-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru3-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru7-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru8-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-aru2-db58772b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-ljspeech-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt408-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt138-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt624-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt396-db58772b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt498-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt132-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt288-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt42-db58772b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/oil-rig-lt90-db58772b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các bài đọc về năng lượng hoặc môi trường.', 'manufacturing', 1, 24),
('389a30b6-2972-55da-b8a8-ee099324ace7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', '9dee1249-c3ac-5ef4-a83e-03499d88c5a6', '7ae20a8f-1008-5f0c-870e-5bc41e90cc76', 'beckon', '/ˈbekən/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Ra hiệu bằng cử chỉ (thường là tay) để gọi hoặc mời ai đó đến gần.', 'to wave your hand or nod your head to tell someone to come closer.', 'The beautiful beach beckoned us to come closer and enjoy the warm water.', 'Bãi biển tuyệt đẹp vẫy gọi chúng tôi đến gần hơn và tận hưởng làn nước ấm áp.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist beckoned the client to enter the private meeting room.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên lễ tân đã vẫy tay ra hiệu cho khách hàng bước vào phòng họp riêng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-ljspeech-6ea7cbd1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-cori-6ea7cbd1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beckon-03984580.webp', '[\"gesture\", \"signal\", \"summon\"]', '[\"repel\", \"dismiss\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"beckon someone over\", \"meaning\": \"vẫy tay gọi ai đó lại gần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beckon to someone\", \"meaning\": \"ra hiệu cho ai đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"beacon\", \"note_vi\": \"beacon là đèn hiệu/hải đăng, beckon là vẫy tay ra hiệu\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-cori-6ea7cbd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-aru0-6ea7cbd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-aru5-6ea7cbd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-aru6-6ea7cbd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-aru10-6ea7cbd1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-aru9-6ea7cbd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-aru3-6ea7cbd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-aru7-6ea7cbd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beckon-aru8-6ea7cbd1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v