('7de892c3-302e-5276-9717-2a328d08dcb1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'competent', '/ˈkɒmpɪtənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có năng lực, thạo việc, đủ khả năng.', 'having the necessary ability, knowledge, or skill to do something successfully.', 'She is a highly competent manager who can handle complex projects with ease.', 'Cô ấy là một quản lý rất có năng lực, có thể xử lý các dự án phức tạp một cách dễ dàng.', '{\"en\": \"We need to hire a competent accountant to manage our annual tax reports.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi cần thuê một kế toán viên có năng lực để quản lý các báo cáo thuế hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-ljspeech-5025f723.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-cori-5025f723.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/competent-ffa15ba3.webp', '[\"capable\", \"skilled\", \"proficient\"]', '[\"incompetent\", \"inept\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly competent\", \"meaning\": \"rất có năng lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"competent authority\", \"meaning\": \"cơ quan có thẩm quyền\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"competitive\", \"note_vi\": \"competitive nghĩa là cạnh tranh, competent là có năng lực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"competence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"competently\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-cori-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru0-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru5-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru6-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru10-5025f723.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru9-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru3-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru7-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru8-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-aru2-5025f723.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-ljspeech-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt408-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt138-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt624-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt396-5025f723.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt498-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt132-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt288-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt42-5025f723.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/competent-lt90-5025f723.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -ent thường là tính từ chỉ năng lực, tránh nhầm với competitive (cạnh tranh).', 'hr', 1, 2),
('66b37688-0b50-57ca-8be2-65405bc03721', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'beefy', '/ˈbiːfi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có cơ bắp cuồn cuộn, to lớn và mạnh mẽ.', 'having a large, strong, and heavy body with a lot of muscles.', 'The beefy bouncer stood at the entrance, ensuring only authorized guests entered.', 'Người bảo vệ vạm vỡ đứng ở lối vào, đảm bảo chỉ những khách được phép mới được vào.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse manager hired several beefy workers to help move the heavy manufacturing equipment safely.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhà kho đã thuê vài công nhân to khỏe để giúp di chuyển thiết bị sản xuất nặng an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-ljspeech-6d697f91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-cori-6d697f91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beefy-bafa53f8.webp', '[\"muscular\", \"brawny\", \"burly\"]', '[\"skinny\", \"puny\", \"frail\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"beefy man\", \"meaning\": \"người đàn ông to khỏe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"beefy arms\", \"meaning\": \"cánh tay vạm vỡ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"beef\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-cori-6d697f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru0-6d697f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru5-6d697f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru6-6d697f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru10-6d697f91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru9-6d697f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru3-6d697f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru7-6d697f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru8-6d697f91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beefy-aru2-6d697f91.mp3\"]}, \"us\"