('f3025745-dd19-57fb-bac2-eacd0bbd125a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'solvent', '/ˈsɒlvənt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'chất lỏng có khả năng hòa tan các chất khác.', 'a liquid substance capable of dissolving other materials to form a uniform mixture.', 'Water is a common solvent used in many chemical reactions.', 'Nước là một chất dung môi phổ biến được sử dụng trong nhiều phản ứng hóa học.', '{\"en\": \"Factory workers must wear protective gloves when handling chemical solvent during the cleaning process.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân nhà máy phải đeo găng tay bảo hộ khi xử lý dung môi hóa chất trong quá trình làm sạch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-ljspeech-a56675f5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-cori-a56675f5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/solvent-5eeb04e9.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"organic solvent\", \"meaning\": \"dung môi hữu cơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"industrial solvent\", \"meaning\": \"dung môi công nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"solution\", \"note_vi\": \"dung dịch (kết quả sau khi hòa tan)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"solvency\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"solvent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-cori-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru0-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru5-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru6-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru10-a56675f5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru9-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru3-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru7-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru8-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-aru2-a56675f5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-ljspeech-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt408-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt138-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt624-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt396-a56675f5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt498-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt132-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt288-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt42-a56675f5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/solvent-lt90-a56675f5.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ \'solvent\' có nghĩa là có khả năng trả nợ (tài chính).', 'manufacturing', 1, 9),
('78f9dda0-3728-51ae-b4c4-6537d85202a9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'acquisition', '/ˌækwɪˈzɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc quá trình mua lại, giành được một thứ gì đó.', 'the process of getting something, or something that you have bought or obtained recently.', 'The company announced the acquisition of a smaller competitor to expand its market share.', 'Công ty đã công bố việc mua lại một đối thủ nhỏ hơn để mở rộng thị phần.', '{\"en\": \"The recent acquisition of the local factory will help our company increase its production capacity.\", \"vi\": \"Việc mua lại nhà máy địa phương gần đây sẽ giúp công ty chúng ta tăng năng lực sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-ljspeech-e6520fc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-cori-e6520fc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acquisition-efdeb066.webp', '[\"purchase\", \"addition\", \"procurement\"]', '[\"loss\", \"sale\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"merger and acquisition\", \"meaning\": \"sáp nhập và mua lại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"recent acquisition\", \"meaning\": \"sự mua lại gần đây\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inquisition\", \"note_vi\": \"inquisition là cuộc điều tra thẩm vấn, acquisition là sự mua lại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"acquire\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-cori-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru0-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru5-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru6-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru10-e6520fc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru9-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru3-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru7-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru8-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-aru2-e6520fc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-ljspeech-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt408-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt138-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt624-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt396-e6520fc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt498-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt132-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt288-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt42-e6520fc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquisition-lt90-e6520fc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm Mergers and Acquisitions (M&A) cực kỳ phổ biến trong tiếng Anh thương mại.', 'finance', 1, 10),
('a4220257-14d6-523a-b30d-d0a90bbfb8f4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'collaboration', '/kəˌlæbəˈreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động làm việc cùng nhau để tạo ra hoặc đạt được điều gì đó.', 'the process of working with others to produce or create something together.', 'Their new album is a collaboration with a famous producer.', 'Album mới của họ là sự cộng tác với một nhà sản xuất nổi tiếng.', '{\"en\": \"Successful collaboration between the marketing and sales departments led to a significant increase in revenue.\", \"vi\": \"Sự hợp tác thành công giữa phòng marketing và phòng kinh doanh đã dẫn đến sự tăng trưởng doanh thu đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-ljspeech-efac6f62.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-cori-efac6f62.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/collaboration-81e8d3c3.webp', '[\"cooperation\", \"partnership\"]', '[\"competition\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"close collaboration\", \"meaning\": \"sự hợp tác chặt chẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in collaboration with\", \"meaning\": \"hợp tác với\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"collaborate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-cori-efac6f62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-aru0-efac6f62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-aru5-efac6f62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-aru6-efac6f62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-aru10-efac6f62.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-aru9-efac6f62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-aru3-efac6f62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/collaboration-aru7-efac6f62.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v