('4b02af95-417b-5a7e-9d42-6812babe29d8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'sturdy', '/ˈstɜːdi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Mạnh mẽ, bền bỉ và khó bị phá vỡ.', 'strong and well built, not easily broken or damaged by force.', 'The old oak tree remained sturdy even after the strong storm.', 'Cây sồi già vẫn vững chãi ngay cả sau cơn bão lớn.', '{\"en\": \"We need a sturdy shelf to hold the heavy office files safely.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần một cái kệ bền chắc để đựng các tệp hồ sơ văn phòng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-ljspeech-7ce61bfb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-cori-7ce61bfb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sturdy-c110d63e.webp', '[\"robust\", \"solid\", \"durable\"]', '[\"fragile\", \"weak\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sturdy furniture\", \"meaning\": \"nội thất bền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sturdy construction\", \"meaning\": \"kết cấu vững chắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sturdy build\", \"meaning\": \"dáng người rắn chắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"study\", \"note_vi\": \"study là học, sturdy là bền chắc.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sturdily\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sturdiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-cori-7ce61bfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-aru0-7ce61bfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-aru5-7ce61bfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-aru6-7ce61bfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-aru10-7ce61bfb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-aru9-7ce61bfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-aru3-7ce61bfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-aru7-7ce61bfb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sturdy-aru8-7ce61bfb.mp3\", \"/st