('bbd714b8-6a44-5763-9e54-22a9d27439ab', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'confusing', 'UK: /kənˈfjuːzɪŋ/ | US: /kənˈfjuːzɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'gây khó hiểu, gây nhầm lẫn', 'Difficult to understand or think about clearly because of being complicated or unclear.', 'The instructions for assembling the new desk were very confusing.', 'Hướng dẫn lắp ráp chiếc bàn mới rất khó hiểu.', '{\"en\": \"The instructions on the new expense reimbursement form were extremely confusing to employees.\", \"vi\": \"Các hướng dẫn trên mẫu hoàn trả chi phí mới cực kỳ gây khó hiểu đối với nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-ljspeech-5bccaca1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-cori-5bccaca1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/confusing-149175b4.webp', '[\"puzzling\", \"perplexing\", \"unclear\", \"baffling\"]', '[\"clear\", \"straightforward\", \"understandable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"confusing instructions\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn gây khó hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confusing message\", \"meaning\": \"thông điệp gây bối rối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confused\", \"note_vi\": \"bị bối rối/hiểu nhầm (diễn tả cảm xúc của con người)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"confuse\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"confusion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"confused\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-cori-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru0-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru5-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru6-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru10-5bccaca1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/confusing-aru9-5bccaca1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia