('4c3e2d01-f1e6-5719-9fb0-41c3698940f0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'strap', 'UK: /stræp/ | US: /stræp/', 'B2', 'noun', 'dây đeo', 'a narrow strip of flexible material used for fastening, securing, or carrying something.', 'The bag has a comfortable shoulder strap.', 'Chiếc túi có dây đeo vai thoải mái.', '{\"en\": \"Make sure the shoulder strap of your laptop bag is securely fastened.\", \"vi\": \"Hãy đảm bảo dây đeo vai của túi đựng máy tính xách tay của bạn được thắt chắc chắn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-ljspeech-237509bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-cori-237509bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/strap-56ba5ee4.webp', '[\"band\", \"belt\", \"fastener\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"shoulder strap\", \"meaning\": \"dây đeo vai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adjustable strap\", \"meaning\": \"dây đeo có thể điều chỉnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"strip\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Strip\' là dải vải/giấy dài mảnh, còn \'strap\' là quai/dây đeo dùng để giữ đồ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"strap\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-cori-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru0-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru5-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru6-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru10-237509bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru9-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru3-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru7-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru8-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-aru2-237509bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-ljspeech-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt408-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt138-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt624-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt396-237509bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt498-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt132-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt288-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt42-237509bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/strap-lt90-237509bb.mp3\"]}}', '\'Strap\' chỉ quai/dây đeo của cặp, balo hoặc dây đai an toàn (leather strap, shoulder strap).', 'shopping', 1, 28),
('fa0413fb-1e77-519a-8a23-c46ca934f9a2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a2acd23e-8d32-5382-9b3d-ffc10bef5714', '84be45bf-c1b7-51cb-ae73-64d72fafce43', 'deity', '/ˈdeɪəti/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một vị thần hoặc nữ thần được thờ cúng.', 'a supernatural being that is worshipped by people as having power over nature or life.', 'In ancient mythology, Zeus was considered the chief deity of the Olympian gods.', 'Trong thần thoại cổ đại, Zeus được coi là vị thần tối cao của các vị thần Olympus.', '{\"en\": \"The ancient temple was built to honor a local deity believed to protect the harvest.\", \"vi\": \"Ngôi đền cổ được xây dựng để tôn vinh một vị thần địa phương được tin là bảo vệ mùa màng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-ljspeech-7adc80ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-cori-7adc80ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deity-a0138197.webp', '[\"god\", \"goddess\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"worship a deity\", \"meaning\": \"thờ phụng một vị thần\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-cori-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru0-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru5-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru6-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru10-7adc80ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru9-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru3-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru7-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru8-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-aru2-7adc80ca.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-ljspeech-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt408-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt138-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt624-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt396-7adc80ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt498-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt132-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt288-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt42-7adc80ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deity-lt90-7adc80ca.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các bài đọc về lịch sử hoặc văn hóa.', 'other', 1, 29),
('f4c8a057-d0d8-5b80-88d7-9c7f66543548', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'desirable', '/dɪˈzaɪərəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đáng mong muốn, hấp dẫn.', 'worth having or doing because it is useful, necessary, or popular.', 'A good work-life balance is highly desirable for many employees.', 'Sự cân bằng tốt giữa công việc và cuộc sống là điều rất đáng mong muốn đối với nhiều nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"Having previous experience in sales is highly desirable for this position.\", \"vi\": \"Có kinh nghiệm bán hàng trước đó là điều rất được mong muốn cho vị trí này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-ljspeech-c930857d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-cori-c930857d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/desirable-3a4a8967.webp', '[\"attractive\", \"advantageous\", \"beneficial\"]', '[\"undesirable\", \"unwanted\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly desirable\", \"meaning\": \"rất đáng mong đợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"desirable outcome\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả mong muốn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"desirous\", \"note_vi\": \"desirous nghĩa là khao khát (chỉ cảm xúc của con người).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"desire\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"desire\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"desirability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-cori-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru0-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru5-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru6-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru10-c930857d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru9-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru3-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru7-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru8-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-aru2-c930857d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-ljspeech-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt408-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt138-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt624-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt396-c930857d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt498-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt132-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt288-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt42-c930857d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/desirable-lt90-c930857d.mp3\"]}}', 'Desirable dùng cho vật/việc (đáng thèm muốn), desirous dùng cho người (khao khát).', 'hr', 1, 0),
('d78c8f0e-5c48-584c-8154-cad5900d2769', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'miserable', '/ˈmɪzrəbl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Rất bất hạnh, buồn bã hoặc khó chịu.', 'feeling very unhappy, uncomfortable, or suffering from bad conditions or sad events.', 'After losing his job, he felt utterly miserable for weeks.', 'Sau khi mất việc, anh ấy cảm thấy vô cùng khốn khổ trong nhiều tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Rainy weather caused a miserable delay for commuters waiting at the bus stop this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Thời tiết mưa đã gây ra sự trì hoãn tồi tệ cho những người đi làm đang chờ ở trạm xe buýt sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-ljspeech-d4cad4e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-cori-d4cad4e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/miserable-b0397f00.webp', '[\"unhappy\", \"wretched\", \"depressed\"]', '[\"cheerful\", \"happy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel miserable\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy khổ sở\"}, {\"phrase\": \"miserable failure\", \"meaning\": \"thất bại thảm hại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"miserly\", \"note_vi\": \"miserable là khổ sở/tồi tệ, miserly là keo kiệt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"misery\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"miserably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-cori-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru0-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru5-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru6-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru10-d4cad4e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru9-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru3-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru7-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru8-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-aru2-d4cad4e3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-ljspeech-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt408-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt138-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt624-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt396-d4cad4e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt498-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt132-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt288-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt42-d4cad4e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miserable-lt90-d4cad4e3.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm \'miserable\' (khổ sở) với \'miserly\' (bủn xỉn, keo kiệt).', 'daily', 1, 1),
('5b96e638-7ee7-533d-b374-dd5f563fab41', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'frail', '/freɪl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Yếu ớt, mỏng manh, dễ vỡ hoặc dễ bị tổn thương.', 'weak and thin, especially because of old age or illness.', 'Despite her frail appearance, the old woman had a surprisingly strong will.', 'Mặc dù vẻ ngoài yếu ớt, bà cụ lại có một ý chí mạnh mẽ đáng ngạc nhiên.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery service must handle these frail glass items with extreme care.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ giao hàng phải xử lý những món đồ thủy tinh dễ vỡ này một cách cực kỳ cẩn thận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-ljspeech-a89d4778.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-cori-a89d4778.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/frail-8c79faf5.webp', '[\"weak\", \"fragile\", \"delicate\"]', '[\"strong\", \"robust\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"frail health\", \"meaning\": \"sức khỏe yếu ớt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"frail elderly\", \"meaning\": \"người già yếu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fragile\", \"note_vi\": \"fragile dùng cho vật dễ vỡ, frail dùng cho người yếu ớt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"frailty\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-cori-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru0-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru5-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru6-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru10-a89d4778.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru9-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru3-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru7-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru8-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-aru2-a89d4778.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-ljspeech-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt408-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt138-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt624-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt396-a89d4778.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt498-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt132-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt288-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt42-a89d4778.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/frail-lt90-a89d4778.mp3\"]}}', 'Frail thường mô tả sức khỏe con người yếu ớt do tuổi tác hoặc bệnh tật.', 'business', 1, 2),
('e76cced7-41e4-5345-a2bb-ef87bc8856da', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'compliment', '/ˈkɒmplɪmənt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Khen ngợi ai đó vì điều gì tốt đẹp.', 'to say something nice to someone to express approval of their work or appearance.', 'She complimented him on his excellent presentation.', 'Cô ấy khen anh ấy về bài thuyết trình xuất sắc của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager decided to compliment the sales team on their record-breaking performance this month.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý quyết định khen ngợi đội ngũ bán hàng vì thành tích phá kỷ lục tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-ljspeech-b4b8739d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-cori-b4b8739d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compliment-e5186b7a.webp', '[\"praise\", \"commend\"]', '[\"criticize\", \"blame\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"compliment on\", \"meaning\": \"khen ngợi về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"receive a compliment\", \"meaning\": \"nhận được lời khen\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"complement\", \"note_vi\": \"Complement là bổ sung cho hoàn thiện, compliment là khen ngợi.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"complimentary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-cori-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru0-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru5-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru6-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru10-b4b8739d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru9-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru3-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru7-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru8-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-aru2-b4b8739d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-ljspeech-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt408-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt138-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt624-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt396-b4b8739d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt498-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt132-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt288-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt42-b4b8739d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliment-lt90-b4b8739d.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với \'complement\' (bổ sung).', 'office', 1, 3),
('1ef99022-1236-5dce-b0ed-3e773c25a210', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'accurate', 'UK: /ˈæk.jə.rət/ | US: /ˈæk.jə.rət/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'chính xác', 'correct in all details and without any mistakes', 'The report provides accurate financial information.', 'Báo cáo cung cấp thông tin tài chính chính xác.', '{\"en\": \"The financial controller insisted on receiving accurate data before approving the annual budget.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc kiểm soát tài chính yêu cầu phải nhận được dữ liệu chính xác trước khi phê duyệt ngân sách hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-ljspeech-72c8f75b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-cori-72c8f75b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accurate-344f9fe3.webp', '[\"precise\", \"correct\", \"exact\"]', '[\"inaccurate\", \"incorrect\", \"wrong\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accurate information\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin chính xác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly accurate\", \"meaning\": \"độ chính xác cao\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"precise\", \"note_vi\": \"Precise nhấn mạnh sự tỉ mỉ, chi tiết cụ thể; trong khi accurate nhấn mạnh việc không có lỗi sai.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"accurately\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accuracy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inaccuracy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-cori-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru0-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru5-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru6-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru10-72c8f75b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru9-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru3-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru7-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru8-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-aru2-72c8f75b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-ljspeech-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt408-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt138-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt624-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt396-72c8f75b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt498-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt132-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt288-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt42-72c8f75b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accurate-lt90-72c8f75b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm các danh từ như data, report, information để nhấn mạnh tính chính xác không có sai sót.', 'finance', 1, 4),
('9bd737b5-c838-5669-98f5-6bf7c6ad4e15', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'warehousing', '/ˈweəhaʊzɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hoạt động lưu trữ hàng hóa trong kho bãi.', 'the practice or business of storing large quantities of goods in a large building.', 'Efficient warehousing is crucial for businesses that deal with large inventories.', 'Việc lưu trữ kho bãi hiệu quả rất quan trọng đối với các doanh nghiệp kinh doanh hàng tồn kho lớn.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics firm has invested heavily in modern warehousing facilities to speed up delivery.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty logistics đã đầu tư mạnh vào các cơ sở kho bãi hiện đại để đẩy nhanh tốc độ giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-ljspeech-53cdf05a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-cori-53cdf05a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/warehousing-442d5c8b.webp', '[\"storage\", \"stockpiling\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"warehousing facilities\", \"meaning\": \"cơ sở kho bãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"warehousing costs\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí lưu kho\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inventory\", \"note_vi\": \"Inventory là hàng tồn kho, còn warehousing là hoạt động/việc lưu kho hàng hóa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"warehouse\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"warehouse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-cori-53cdf05a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-aru0-53cdf05a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-aru5-53cdf05a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-aru6-53cdf05a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-aru10-53cdf05a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-aru9-53cdf05a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warehousing-aru3-53cdf05