('b39618c6-3402-5805-8683-845d6a8a691f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'rumbling', '/ˈrʌmblɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Âm thanh trầm, kéo dài, thường là tiếng động lớn.', 'a deep continuous noise that is often felt as well as heard.', 'We heard a low rumbling sound in the distance, perhaps thunder.', 'Chúng tôi nghe thấy một tiếng ầm ầm trầm thấp từ xa, có lẽ là tiếng sấm.', '{\"en\": \"The workers noticed a rumbling from the old machine before it stopped.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân nhận thấy tiếng động trầm từ chiếc máy cũ trước khi nó dừng lại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-ljspeech-043c3fe9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-cori-043c3fe9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rumbling-6c70dd0d.webp', '[\"roar\", \"boom\"]', '[\"silence\", \"quiet\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rumbling sound\", \"meaning\": \"âm thanh trầm kéo dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"distant rumbling\", \"meaning\": \"tiếng động trầm từ xa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"rambling\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là nói lan man, không phải tiếng động trầm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"rumble\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-cori-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru0-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru5-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru6-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru10-043c3fe9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru9-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru3-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru7-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru8-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-aru2-043c3fe9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-ljspeech-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt408-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt138-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt624-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt396-043c3fe9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt498-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt132-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt288-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt42-043c3fe9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rumbling-lt90-043c3fe9.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'rumbling\' (tiếng trầm) với \'rambling\' (nói/lang thang lan man).', 'manufacturing', 1, 12),
('79de28d6-8f14-5177-a453-19910e795c12', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'mugger', '/ˈmʌɡə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Kẻ tấn công và cướp tiền hoặc tài sản của người khác, thường ở nơi công cộng.', 'a person who attacks someone in a public place to steal their money or belongings.', 'She was warned to be careful walking alone at night because of muggers in the area.', 'Cô ấy được cảnh báo phải cẩn thận khi đi bộ một mình vào ban đêm vì có những kẻ cướp trong khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel security guard warned guests to avoid dark alleys to stay safe from any mugger.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ khách sạn cảnh báo khách lưu trú nên tránh các con hẻm tối để an toàn trước kẻ cướp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-ljspeech-7657d88a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-cori-7657d88a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mugger-e27cd009.webp', '[\"robber\", \"thief\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"avoid a mugger\", \"meaning\": \"tránh kẻ cướp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fear of muggers\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi sợ kẻ cướp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mug\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-cori-7657d88a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-aru0-7657d88a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-aru5-7657d88a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-aru6-7657d88a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-aru10-7657d88a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-aru9-7657d88a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-aru3-7657d88a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-aru7-7657d88a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-aru8-7657d88a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mugger-a