('c055c799-1958-53f4-8101-41e2132db951', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a3290185-5f99-5b20-943d-112b45a37f51', '615f17b9-8448-5d11-a3e7-da7432ec1276', 'obstacle', '/ˈɒbstəkl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Vật cản hoặc khó khăn ngăn cản sự tiến bộ hay đạt được mục tiêu.', 'a thing that blocks one\'s way or prevents progress in achieving a specific goal or task.', 'Lack of experience proved to be a major obstacle for the young applicant.', 'Thiếu kinh nghiệm đã trở thành một trở ngại lớn cho ứng viên trẻ tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"The lack of funding remains the biggest obstacle to completing the new office renovation project.\", \"vi\": \"Việc thiếu kinh phí vẫn là trở ngại lớn nhất để hoàn thành dự án cải tạo văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-ljspeech-d17f8079.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-cori-d17f8079.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obstacle-307a0a29.webp', '[\"barrier\", \"hurdle\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"overcome an obstacle\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua trở ngại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"major obstacle\", \"meaning\": \"trở ngại lớn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-cori-d17f8079.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru0-d17f8079.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru5-d17f8079.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru6-d17f8079.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru10-d17f8079.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru9-d17f8079.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru3-d17f8079.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru7-d17f8079.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru8-d17f8079.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obstacle-aru2-d17f8079.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v