('6f051cb0-7f54-5385-94cf-a8cbd5ef9ff1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6716f50-3a15-5357-8276-488845df36c8', 'da1b14ed-286c-5988-b841-6b269fbda61b', 'balance', 'UK: /ˈbæləns/ | US: /ˈbæləns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự cân bằng', 'a state where different elements, forces, or weights exist in equal and stable proportions', 'Achieving a work-life balance is crucial for well-being.', 'Đạt được sự cân bằng giữa công việc và cuộc sống là rất quan trọng cho sức khỏe.', '{\"en\": \"Clients can view their remaining account balance by logging into the online banking portal.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng có thể xem số dư tài khoản còn lại bằng cách đăng nhập vào cổng ngân hàng trực tuyến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-ljspeech-8dfa30e0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-cori-8dfa30e0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/balance-e8662418.webp', '[\"equilibrium\", \"remainder\", \"stability\"]', '[\"imbalance\", \"instability\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"account balance\", \"meaning\": \"số dư tài khoản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outstanding balance\", \"meaning\": \"số dư nợ chưa thanh toán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"work-life balance\", \"meaning\": \"sự cân bằng giữa công việc và cuộc sống\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"balance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"balanced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-cori-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru0-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru5-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru6-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru10-8dfa30e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru9-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru3-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru7-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru8-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-aru2-8dfa30e0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-ljspeech-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt408-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt138-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt624-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt396-8dfa30e0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt498-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt132-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt288-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt42-8dfa30e0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/balance-lt90-8dfa30e0.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh tài chính TOEIC, \'balance\' thường mang nghĩa \'số dư tài khoản\' hoặc \'số tiền còn nợ\'.', 'finance', 1, 7),
('f62f2591-77f0-55b3-b074-d738348250ff', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6716f50-3a15-5357-8276-488845df36c8', 'da1b14ed-286c-5988-b841-6b269fbda61b', 'towering', '/ˈtaʊərɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất cao, nổi bật hơn những thứ xung quanh.', 'extremely tall and impressive, often rising high above the surrounding buildings or natural features.', 'Hikers paused to admire the towering mountain peaks surrounding the peaceful valley.', 'Những người đi bộ đường dài dừng chân chiêm ngưỡng các đỉnh núi cao chót vót bao quanh thung lũng yên bình.', '{\"en\": \"The towering office building stands as a landmark in the center of the business district.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng cao chót vót đứng như một cột mốc ở trung tâm khu thương mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-ljspeech-f89835cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-cori-f89835cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/towering-b5498a84.webp', '[\"tall\", \"huge\"]', '[\"short\", \"tiny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"towering building\", \"meaning\": \"tòa nhà cao tầng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"towering figure\", \"meaning\": \"nhân vật vĩ đại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"tower\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-cori-f89835cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-aru0-f89835cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-aru5-f89835cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-aru6-f89835cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-aru10-f89835cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-aru9-f89835cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-aru3-f89835cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-aru7-f89835cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/towering-aru8-f89835cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi