('1fa19992-858d-598c-bee9-11d658d6d10e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6716f50-3a15-5357-8276-488845df36c8', 'da1b14ed-286c-5988-b841-6b269fbda61b', 'compost', '/ˈkɒmpɒst/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Phân hữu cơ dùng để cải tạo đất.', 'decaying organic material used to improve the quality of soil for growing plants.', 'We add kitchen scraps and garden waste to the compost pile to enrich our soil.', 'Chúng tôi thêm rác nhà bếp và chất thải sân vườn vào đống phân hữu cơ để làm giàu đất.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel garden uses organic compost made from kitchen waste to fertilize the flowers.\", \"vi\": \"Khu vườn của khách sạn sử dụng phân hữu cơ làm từ rác thải nhà bếp để bón cho hoa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-ljspeech-c0601a5b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-cori-c0601a5b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compost-b6fc6686.webp', '[\"fertilizer\", \"manure\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"compost heap\", \"meaning\": \"đống phân ủ hữu cơ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"organic compost\", \"meaning\": \"phân hữu cơ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compose\", \"note_vi\": \"soạn nhạc, sáng tác, cấu thành\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"compost\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-cori-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru0-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru5-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru6-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru10-c0601a5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru9-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru3-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru7-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru8-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-aru2-c0601a5b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-ljspeech-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt408-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt138-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt624-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt396-c0601a5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt498-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt132-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt288-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt42-c0601a5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compost-lt90-c0601a5b.mp3\"]}}', 'Compost là phân hữu cơ tự ủ từ lá cây, thức ăn thừa. Tránh nhầm với compose (sáng tác).', 'nature', 1, 9),
('103465d5-d8c6-54ca-9b08-b998780bdd11', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6716f50-3a15-5357-8276-488845df36c8', 'da1b14ed-286c-5988-b841-6b269fbda61b', 'decisive', '/dɪˈsaɪsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng đưa ra quyết định nhanh chóng và dứt khoát; hoặc có tính chất quyết định.', 'able to make choices quickly and confidently, or producing a definite final result.', 'Her decisive leadership helped the team overcome the crisis quickly.', 'Khả năng lãnh đạo quyết đoán của cô ấy đã giúp đội vượt qua khủng hoảng nhanh chóng.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO took decisive action to resolve the supply chain problem immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã có hành động dứt khoát để giải quyết sự cố chuỗi cung ứng ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-ljspeech-01a27bed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-cori-01a27bed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decisive-0cee00a5.webp', '[\"determined\", \"resolute\", \"conclusive\"]', '[\"indecisive\", \"hesitant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"decisive action\", \"meaning\": \"hành động dứt khoát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"decisive factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố quyết định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"indecisive\", \"note_vi\": \"Trái nghĩa, chỉ người hay do dự, khó đưa ra lựa chọn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"decide\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"decision\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"decisively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-cori-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru0-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru5-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru6-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru10-01a27bed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru9-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru3-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru7-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru8-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-aru2-01a27bed.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-ljspeech-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt408-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt138-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt624-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt396-01a27bed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt498-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt132-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt288-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt42-01a27bed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decisive-lt90-01a27bed.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa mang nghĩa dứt khoát (về tính cách), vừa mang nghĩa có tính quyết định (về kết quả).', 'office', 1, 10),
('93c655ee-ee1b-59df-b0fe-99f8a739a1be', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6716f50-3a15-5357-8276-488845df36c8', 'da1b14ed-286c-5988-b841-6b269fbda61b', 'paramount', '/ˈpærəmaʊnt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Quan trọng nhất, có ý nghĩa hàng đầu.', 'more important than anything else in a particular situation or process.', 'Maintaining strict confidentiality regarding client records remains paramount for our legal firm.', 'Duy trì tính bảo mật nghiêm ngặt đối với hồ sơ khách hàng vẫn là điều tối quan trọng đối với công ty luật của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"It is of paramount importance that all employees follow the new safety regulations strictly.\", \"vi\": \"Việc tất cả nhân viên tuân thủ nghiêm ngặt các quy định an toàn mới là điều quan trọng nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-ljspeech-6ba3b21a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-cori-6ba3b21a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/paramount-8f136b54.webp', '[\"supreme\", \"chief\"]', '[\"minor\", \"trivial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"paramount importance\", \"meaning\": \"tầm quan trọng hàng đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"paramount concern\", \"meaning\": \"mối quan tâm hàng đầu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-cori-6ba3b21a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-aru0-6ba3b21a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-aru5-6ba3b21a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-aru6-6ba3b21a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-aru10-6ba3b21a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-aru9-6ba3b21a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-aru3-6ba3b21a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-aru7-6ba3b21a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paramount-aru8-6ba3b21a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec