('abab78fb-5546-538c-bc98-62cb1278adcc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6716f50-3a15-5357-8276-488845df36c8', 'da1b14ed-286c-5988-b841-6b269fbda61b', 'approachable', '/əˈprəʊtʃəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dễ tiếp cận, thân thiện và dễ nói chuyện.', 'friendly and easy to talk to, making other people feel comfortable around them.', 'The new manager is very approachable and always willing to listen.', 'Người quản lý mới rất dễ gần và luôn sẵn lòng lắng nghe.', '{\"en\": \"The human resources director is very approachable, so staff feel comfortable discussing their problems.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc nhân sự rất dễ tiếp cận, vì vậy nhân viên cảm thấy thoải mái khi thảo luận các vấn đề của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-ljspeech-01f0f8cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-cori-01f0f8cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/approachable-17552c32.webp', '[\"accessible\", \"friendly\", \"welcoming\"]', '[\"unapproachable\", \"distant\", \"aloof\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"approachable leader\", \"meaning\": \"lãnh đạo dễ tiếp cận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly approachable\", \"meaning\": \"rất thân thiện dễ gần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"accessible\", \"note_vi\": \"Accessible thường dùng cho vị trí địa lý hoặc tài liệu, approachable cho tính cách con người.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"approach\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"approach\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-cori-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru0-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru5-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru6-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru10-01f0f8cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru9-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru3-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru7-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru8-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru2-01f0f8cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-ljspeech-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt408-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt138-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt624-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt396-01f0f8cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt498-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt132-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt288-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt42-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt90-01f0f8cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng khen ngợi phong cách quản lý, lãnh đạo trong môi trường công sở.', 'hr', 1, 16),
('c9a944ec-7cde-54d7-9197-9d14fee04e60', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6716f50-3a15-5357-8276-488845df36c8', 'da1b14ed-286c-5988-b841-6b269fbda61b', 'demolition', 'UK: /ˌdɛməˈlɪʃən/ | US: /ˌdɛməˈlɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự phá hủy, dỡ bỏ', 'The act of tearing down or destroying a structure or building completely.', 'The demolition of the old building will begin next month.', 'Việc phá dỡ tòa nhà cũ sẽ bắt đầu vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"Safety inspectors checked the site before the demolition of the structure began.\", \"vi\": \"Các thanh tra an toàn đã kiểm tra công trường trước khi sự dỡ bỏ công trình bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-ljspeech-89415c7d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-cori-89415c7d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/demolition-7b8b13c2.webp', '[\"destruction\", \"teardown\", \"dismantling\"]', '[\"construction\", \"building\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"demolition crew\", \"meaning\": \"đội thợ dỡ bỏ công trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"demolition site\", \"meaning\": \"khu vực dỡ bỏ công trình\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"demolish\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-cori-89415c7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru0-89415c7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru5-89415c7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru6-89415c7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru10-89415c7d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru9-89415c7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru3-89415c7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru7-89415c7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru8-89415c7d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demolition-aru2-894