('b731d0a6-7c10-5a00-8531-cea8ecf0e1e3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6a0471f-27e8-5687-9e22-6670d78590e6', 'e40490b3-e06c-5d6e-8b1e-7c855c258fd6', 'copier', 'UK: /ˈkɒpiə/ | US: /ˈkɑpiər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'máy photocopy', 'a machine that reproduces printed or written material by making duplicate paper documents', 'The office needs a new copier for daily use.', 'Văn phòng cần một máy photocopy mới để sử dụng hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"Technicians were called to repair the main office copier on the third floor.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ thuật viên đã được gọi đến để sửa máy photocopy chính của văn phòng ở tầng ba.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-ljspeech-04aec32b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-cori-04aec32b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/copier-97265083.webp', '[\"photocopier\", \"duplicator\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"copier paper\", \"meaning\": \"giấy in máy photocopy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"digital copier\", \"meaning\": \"máy photocopy kỹ thuật số\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"copy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"copy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-cori-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru0-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru5-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru6-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru10-04aec32b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru9-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru3-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru7-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru8-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-aru2-04aec32b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-ljspeech-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt408-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt138-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt624-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt396-04aec32b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt498-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt132-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt288-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt42-04aec32b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copier-lt90-04aec32b.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ thiết bị văn phòng phổ biến. Hay xuất hiện trong các bài nghe/đọc về sự cố thiết bị (\'copier breakdown\', \'paper jam\').', 'office technology', 1, 17),
('0b134841-35b1-5d22-876c-65c807365b50', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6a0471f-27e8-5687-9e22-6670d78590e6', 'e40490b3-e06c-5d6e-8b1e-7c855c258fd6', 'portrait', '/ˈpɔːtreɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bức tranh, ảnh hoặc mô tả về khuôn mặt và tính cách của một người.', 'a painting, drawing, or photograph of a person, especially of their face.', 'A formal portrait of the company founder hangs prominently in the main boardroom.', 'Một bức chân dung trang trọng của người sáng lập công ty được treo ở vị trí nổi bật trong phòng họp chính.', '{\"en\": \"The company commissioned a professional portrait of the retiring chief executive officer.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã đặt làm một bức chân dung chuyên nghiệp của vị giám đốc điều hành sắp nghỉ hưu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-ljspeech-25c60488.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-cori-25c60488.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/portrait-04bb2628.webp', '[\"picture\", \"likeness\", \"depiction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"paint a portrait\", \"meaning\": \"vẽ một bức chân dung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"portrait photography\", \"meaning\": \"chụp ảnh chân dung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"landscape\", \"note_vi\": \"landscape là tranh phong cảnh hoặc hướng giấy ngang; portrait là dọc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"portray\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"portrayal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-cori-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru0-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru5-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru6-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru10-25c60488.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru9-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru3-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru7-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru8-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-aru2-25c60488.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-ljspeech-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt408-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt138-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt624-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt396-25c60488.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt498-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt132-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt288-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt42-25c60488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/portrait-lt90-25c60488.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong in ấn, \'portrait\' nghĩa là khổ giấy dọc, đối lập với \'landscape\' là khổ giấy ngang.', 'office', 1, 18),
('6d80d1ec-04ab-572c-9804-d98872d14e3d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6a0471f-27e8-5687-9e22-6670d78590e6', 'e40490b3-e06c-5d6e-8b1e-7c855c258fd6', 'allow', 'UK: /əˈlaʊ/ | US: /əˈlaʊ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'cho phép', 'to give permission or permit someone to do something without restriction or prohibition.', 'Employees are not allowed to bring pets to the office.', 'Nhân viên không được phép mang thú cưng đến văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"The new software application allows employees to access client records securely from home.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng dụng phần mềm mới cho phép nhân viên truy cập hồ sơ khách hàng một cách an toàn từ nhà.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-ljspeech-6452e7c5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-cori-6452e7c5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/allow-768a5175.webp', '[\"permit\", \"enable\", \"authorize\"]', '[\"prohibit\", \"forbid\", \"ban\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"allow access to\", \"meaning\": \"cho phép truy cập vào\"}, {\"phrase\": \"allow time for\", \"meaning\": \"dành thời gian cho\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"allot\", \"note_vi\": \"phân bổ/chia phần, không dùng theo cấu trúc allot somebody to do\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"allowance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"allowable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-cori-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru0-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru5-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru6-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru10-6452e7c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru9-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru3-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru7-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru8-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-aru2-6452e7c5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-ljspeech-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt408-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt138-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt624-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt396-6452e7c5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt498-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt132-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt288-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt42-6452e7c5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/allow-lt90-6452e7c5.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: allow somebody TO DO something (chủ động) hoặc allow DOING something (khi không có tân ngữ chỉ người).', 'office', 1, 19),
('72c9eacc-c2f5-5aa4-bc20-c306bf6a7c46', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a6a0471f-27e8-5687-9e22-6670d78590e6', 'e40490b3-e06c-5d6e-8b1e-7c855c258fd6', 'dwarfish', '/ˈdwɔːfɪʃ/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có vóc dáng nhỏ bé, lùn hơn bình thường.', 'much smaller than the usual size for things of the same kind.', 'The dwarfish trees in the alpine region are adapted to harsh winds.', 'Những cây lùn tịt ở vùng núi cao đã thích nghi với gió khắc nghiệt.', '{\"en\": \"The landscaping company selected dwarfish shrubs to decorate the small office entrance.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty cảnh quan đã chọn những bụi cây lùn để trang trí lối vào văn phòng nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-ljspeech-f4e09249.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-cori-f4e09249.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dwarfish-f134878c.webp', '[\"tiny\", \"dwarf\", \"miniature\"]', '[\"giant\", \"huge\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dwarfish plant\", \"meaning\": \"cây lùn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dwarfish appearance\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài nhỏ bé\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dwarf\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dwarf\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-cori-f4e09249.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru0-f4e09249.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru5-f4e09249.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru6-f4e09249.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru10-f4e09249.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru9-f4e09249.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru3-f4e09249.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru7-f4e09249.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru8-f4e09249.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dwarfish-aru2-f4e09249.mp3\"]}, 