('38aa2285-d23c-547e-97e2-24a7ec24d902', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a8338ad6-6ffa-575c-92e2-edb7f61c74d4', '042eef3e-8434-5338-b286-f76c8437f182', 'hardly', '/ˈhɑːdli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Hầu như không, rất ít hoặc gần như không.', 'used to emphasize that something is almost not true or is very difficult to happen.', 'She was so tired that she could hardly keep her eyes open.', 'Cô ấy mệt đến nỗi hầu như không thể mở mắt.', '{\"en\": \"The office was so noisy that I could hardly hear the instructions from my supervisor.\", \"vi\": \"Văn phòng ồn ào đến mức tôi hầu như không thể nghe thấy hướng dẫn từ người giám sát của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-ljspeech-be67ab6f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-cori-be67ab6f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hardly-dd0f6452.webp', '[\"scarcely\", \"barely\"]', '[\"easily\", \"fully\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"hardly any\", \"meaning\": \"hầu như không có\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hardly ever\", \"meaning\": \"hiếm khi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hard\", \"note_vi\": \"hard là chăm chỉ/cứng, hardly là trạng từ chỉ tần suất/mức độ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"hard\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-cori-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru0-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru5-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru6-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru10-be67ab6f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru9-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru3-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru7-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru8-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-aru2-be67ab6f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-ljspeech-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt408-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt138-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt624-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt396-be67ab6f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt498-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt132-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt288-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt42-be67ab6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hardly-lt90-be67ab6f.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận: \'hardly\' mang nghĩa phủ định, không dùng thêm \'not\' trong câu.', 'office', 1, 12),
('3e5cbdb5-6a5f-57b8-bf82-742df8e568f2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a8338ad6-6ffa-575c-92e2-edb7f61c74d4', '042eef3e-8434-5338-b286-f76c8437f182', 'accidentally', 'UK: /ˌæksɪˈdɛntəli/ | US: /ˌæksɪˈdɛntəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'tình cờ, ngẫu nhiên', 'by chance or mistake without any conscious intention or advance planning.', 'He accidentally deleted an important file from the company network.', 'Anh ấy đã vô tình xóa một tệp quan trọng khỏi mạng công ty.', '{\"en\": \"The confidential document was accidentally sent to an external vendor due to an address auto-complete error.\", \"vi\": \"Tài liệu mật đã bị vô tình gửi đến nhà cung cấp bên ngoài do lỗi tự động điền địa chỉ email.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-ljspeech-b7f71f41.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-cori-b7f71f41.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accidentally-bdd2592b.webp', '[\"unintentionally\", \"inadvertently\", \"by mistake\"]', '[\"intentionally\", \"deliberately\", \"purposely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accidentally deleted\", \"meaning\": \"vô tình bị xóa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accidentally omitted\", \"meaning\": \"vô tình bị bỏ sót\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"incidentally\", \"note_vi\": \"Incidentally nghĩa là \'nhân tiện / tiện thể\' (dùng chuyển chủ đề), khác với accidentally là \'vô tình / trót\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accident\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accidental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-cori-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru0-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru5-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru6-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru10-b7f71f41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru9-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru3-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru7-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru8-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-aru2-b7f71f41.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-ljspeech-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt408-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt138-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt624-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt396-b7f71f41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt498-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt132-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt288-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt42-b7f71f41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accidentally-lt90-b7f71f41.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay dùng trong email công việc để giải thích sơ suất: \'I accidentally attached the wrong file...\' (Tôi lỡ tay đính kèm sai tệp...).', 'office', 1, 13),
('4b35b66b-8530-562c-bd47-bc250f69acda', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a8338ad6-6ffa-575c-92e2-edb7f61c74d4', '042eef3e-8434-5338-b286-f76c8437f182', 'universal', '/ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːsl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Phổ biến rộng rãi; mang tính toàn cầu.', 'existing or true for all people or things in the world.', 'The company aims to develop a universal smartphone charger compatible with every device model.', 'Công ty nhằm mục đích phát triển một bộ sạc điện thoại thông minh phổ quát tương thích với mọi dòng thiết bị.', '{\"en\": \"The company aims to provide universal access to its online training courses.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty hướng tới việc cung cấp quyền truy cập phổ biến vào các khóa đào tạo trực tuyến của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-ljspeech-da5f51a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-cori-da5f51a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/universal-aab3c5ce.webp', '[\"global\", \"worldwide\", \"general\"]', '[\"local\", \"specific\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"universal truth\", \"meaning\": \"chân lý phổ quát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"universal access\", \"meaning\": \"tiếp cận toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"universal language\", \"meaning\": \"ngôn ngữ chung\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"university\", \"note_vi\": \"university là trường đại học, universal là toàn cầu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"universe\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"universally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-cori-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru0-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru5-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru6-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru10-da5f51a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru9-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru3-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru7-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru8-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-aru2-da5f51a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-ljspeech-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt408-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt138-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt624-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt396-da5f51a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt498-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt132-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt288-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt42-da5f51a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/universal-lt90-da5f51a1.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm universal (toàn cầu) với university (đại học).', 'education', 1, 14),
('f78677af-3d20-5973-a60d-cc892d89f86f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a8338ad6-6ffa-575c-92e2-edb7f61c74d4', '042eef3e-8434-5338-b286-f76c8437f182', 'raw-boned', '/ˌrɔːˈbəʊnd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất gầy, để lộ rõ xương.', 'very thin so that bones can be seen clearly under the skin.', 'The old farmer, with his raw-boned frame, still worked tirelessly in the fields.', 'Người nông dân già, với thân hình gầy gò, vẫn làm việc không ngừng nghỉ trên đồng.', '{\"en\": \"The raw-boned stray dog was found near the office building yesterday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Con chó hoang rất gầy đã được tìm thấy gần tòa nhà văn phòng sáng hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-ljspeech-1e0b6601.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-cori-1e0b6601.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/raw-boned-2f19578b.webp', '[\"skinny\", \"bony\", \"emaciated\"]', '[\"plump\", \"fat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"raw-boned frame\", \"meaning\": \"thân hình gầy gò\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raw-boned horse\", \"meaning\": \"ngựa gầy nhom\"}, {\"phrase\": \"raw-boned look\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài gầy gò\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"raw\", \"note_vi\": \"raw nghĩa là sống, chưa nấu; raw-boned chỉ gầy.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-cori-1e0b6601.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-aru0-1e0b6601.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-aru5-1e0b6601.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-aru6-1e0b6601.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-aru10-1e0b6601.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-aru9-1e0b6601.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-aru3-1e0b6601.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-aru7-1e0b6601.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/raw-boned-aru8-1e0b6601