('93246a18-f17e-5908-920b-e86fdf311d7f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a8338ad6-6ffa-575c-92e2-edb7f61c74d4', '042eef3e-8434-5338-b286-f76c8437f182', 'lazily', '/ˈleɪzɪli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách uể oải, không muốn làm gì.', 'in a slow and relaxed way, showing no effort or energy.', 'Smoke drifted lazily from the chimney of the quiet country cottage.', 'Khói lững lờ bốc lên từ ống khói của ngôi nhà nhỏ yên bình ở vùng quê.', '{\"en\": \"During the summer holiday, the resort guests lounged lazily by the swimming pool.\", \"vi\": \"Trong kỳ nghỉ hè, khách của khu nghỉ dưỡng nằm thư giãn một cách uể oải bên hồ bơi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-ljspeech-64402477.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-cori-64402477.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lazily-d83768f5.webp', '[\"sluggishly\", \"leisurely\", \"idly\"]', '[\"actively\", \"energetically\", \"busily\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"drift lazily\", \"meaning\": \"trôi lững lờ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stretch lazily\", \"meaning\": \"vươn vai uể oải\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"lazy\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"laziness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-cori-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru0-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru5-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru6-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru10-64402477.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru9-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru3-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru7-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru8-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-aru2-64402477.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-ljspeech-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt408-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt138-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt624-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt396-64402477.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt498-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt132-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt288-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt42-64402477.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lazily-lt90-64402477.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ chỉ cách thức, thường đi sau các động từ như lounge, drift, stretch.', 'travel', 1, 17),
('71ed05de-b3cf-5084-b531-72c12f56e5e4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a8338ad6-6ffa-575c-92e2-edb7f61c74d4', '042eef3e-8434-5338-b286-f76c8437f182', 'impressive', '/ɪmˈpresɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Gây ra sự ngưỡng mộ hoặc tôn trọng sâu sắc.', 'causing a strong feeling of admiration or respect because of great quality or skill.', 'The new architectural design received impressive feedback from the city planning committee.', 'Thiết kế kiến trúc mới đã nhận được phản hồi ấn tượng từ ủy ban quy hoạch thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team delivered an impressive quarterly report that exceeded all targets.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bán hàng đã trình bày một báo cáo quý ấn tượng, vượt qua tất cả các chỉ tiêu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-ljspeech-2193563c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-cori-2193563c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/impressive-2f2fe041.webp', '[\"remarkable\", \"outstanding\", \"striking\"]', '[\"unimpressive\", \"mediocre\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"impressive performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn trình diễn ấn tượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impressive results\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả ấn tượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"impressive track record\", \"meaning\": \"thành tích đáng nể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"expressive\", \"note_vi\": \"expressive nghĩa là \'biểu cảm, diễn đạt tốt\', khác với impressive là \'gây ấn tượng\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"impress\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"impression\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"impressively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-cori-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru0-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru5-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru6-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru10-2193563c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru9-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru3-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru7-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru8-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-aru2-2193563c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-ljspeech-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt408-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt138-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt624-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt396-2193563c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt498-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt132-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt288-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt42-2193563c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/impressive-lt90-2193563c.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay gặp trong TOEIC với cụm \'impressive resume/results\'; đừng nhầm với \'expressive\'.', 'office', 1, 18),
('96e6a66c-315c-573d-81b3-870bd5057b45', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'a8338ad6-6ffa-575c-92e2-edb7f61c74d4', '042eef3e-8434-5338-b286-f76c8437f182', 'sawmill', '/ˈsɔːmɪl/', 'C1', 'noun', 'nhà máy dùng để xẻ gỗ thành ván', 'a factory where wood is cut into boards using large machines.', 'The old sawmill by the river has been abandoned for decades.', 'Xưởng cưa cũ bên sông đã bị bỏ hoang hàng thập kỷ.', '{\"en\": \"The local sawmill supplies high-quality timber to construction companies across the entire region.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy xẻ gỗ địa phương cung cấp gỗ chất lượng cao cho các công ty xây dựng trên toàn khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-ljspeech-2e0a4bf0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-cori-2e0a4bf0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sawmill-7f7ca4ec.webp', '[\"lumber mill\", \"timber mill\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"operate a sawmill\", \"meaning\": \"vận hành nhà máy xẻ gỗ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local sawmill\", \"meaning\": \"nhà máy xẻ gỗ địa phương\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-cori-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru0-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru5-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru6-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru10-2e0a4bf0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru9-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru3-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru7-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru8-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-aru2-2e0a4bf0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sawmill-ljspeech-2e0a4bf0.mp3\", \"/storage/v