('6005cfc8-4822-5b79-ae0d-e4057befc203', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'particularly', '/pəˈtɪkjələli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách đặc biệt hoặc hơn mức bình thường.', 'more than usual or to a greater degree than other things.', 'The board members were particularly impressed by the manager\'s innovative marketing strategy.', 'Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đặc biệt ấn tượng với chiến lược tiếp thị sáng tạo của vị quản lý.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was particularly pleased with the sales team\'s impressive performance this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đặc biệt hài lòng với hiệu suất ấn tượng của đội ngũ bán hàng trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-ljspeech-2dc7c1a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-cori-2dc7c1a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/particularly-a31dec72.webp', '[\"especially\", \"notably\", \"exceptionally\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"particularly useful\", \"meaning\": \"đặc biệt hữu ích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"particularly important\", \"meaning\": \"đặc biệt quan trọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"particular\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-cori-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru0-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru5-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru6-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru10-2dc7c1a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru9-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru3-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru7-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru8-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-aru2-2dc7c1a0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-ljspeech-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt408-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt138-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt624-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt396-2dc7c1a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt498-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt132-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt288-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt42-2dc7c1a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/particularly-lt90-2dc7c1a0.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'particular\' là tính từ đứng trước danh từ.', 'office', 1, 10),
('138b8259-d384-5813-a10b-3dd022dce70f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'denounce', '/dɪˈnaʊns/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Công khai lên án hoặc tố cáo ai đó/cái gì đó.', 'to criticize someone or something strongly and publicly.', 'The human rights organization denounced the government\'s actions as a violation of international law.', 'Tổ chức nhân quyền đã tố cáo hành động của chính phủ là vi phạm luật pháp quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The consumer protection agency denounced the company for selling unsafe electronic products to the public.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ quan bảo vệ người tiêu dùng đã lên án công ty vì bán các sản phẩm điện tử không an toàn cho công chúng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-ljspeech-7803acfd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-cori-7803acfd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/denounce-fae72480.webp', '[\"condemn\", \"criticize\", \"censure\"]', '[\"praise\", \"commend\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"denounce violence\", \"meaning\": \"lên án bạo lực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"publicly denounce\", \"meaning\": \"công khai lên án\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"announce\", \"note_vi\": \"announce là thông báo, denounce là lên án.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"denunciation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-cori-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru0-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru5-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru6-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru10-7803acfd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru9-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru3-7803acfd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/denounce-aru7-7803acfd.