('22cbc8f0-46f6-58dd-9321-0ba999d8a3ce', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'unreservedly', '/ˌʌnrɪˈzɜːvɪdli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách hoàn toàn, không chút dè dặt hay nghi ngờ.', 'completely and without any hesitation, doubt, or conditions.', 'The board of directors unreservedly endorsed the new chief executive officer\'s strategic plan.', 'Hội đồng quản trị đã hoàn toàn ủng hộ kế hoạch chiến lược của giám đốc điều hành mới.', '{\"en\": \"The chief executive officer apologized unreservedly for the delay in shipping the client orders.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã xin lỗi một cách thành thật và hoàn toàn vì sự chậm trễ trong việc giao đơn hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-ljspeech-b5e02809.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-cori-b5e02809.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unreservedly-07c4777f.webp', '[\"fully\", \"unconditionally\", \"completely\"]', '[\"partially\", \"reservedly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"apologize unreservedly\", \"meaning\": \"xin lỗi một cách hoàn toàn thành thật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"support unreservedly\", \"meaning\": \"ủng hộ tuyệt đối\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unreserved\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"reserve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-cori-b5e02809.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-aru0-b5e02809.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-aru5-b5e02809.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-aru6-b5e02809.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-aru10-b5e02809.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-aru9-b5e02809.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unreservedly-aru3-b5e02809.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj