('4e8304f2-c514-5f54-a791-65273e1c4e7e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'pleasant', '/ˈpleznt/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Dễ chịu, thú vị, làm hài lòng.', 'enjoyable, attractive, or friendly, making you feel happy and comfortable in a situation.', 'The hotel staff provided excellent service, ensuring guests enjoyed a pleasant stay throughout the week.', 'Nhân viên khách sạn cung cấp dịch vụ xuất sắc, đảm bảo du khách có một kỳ nghỉ dễ chịu suốt cả tuần.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel aims to provide a pleasant experience for all guests during their stay.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn hướng tới việc cung cấp một trải nghiệm dễ chịu cho tất cả khách trong thời gian lưu trú.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-ljspeech-72ccfda0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-cori-72ccfda0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pleasant-4a03dbff.webp', '[\"enjoyable\", \"nice\", \"delightful\"]', '[\"unpleasant\", \"awful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pleasant surprise\", \"meaning\": \"bất ngờ thú vị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pleasant environment\", \"meaning\": \"môi trường dễ chịu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pleasant weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết dễ chịu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"peasant\", \"note_vi\": \"peasant là nông dân, pleasant là dễ chịu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"please\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"pleasantly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"pleasure\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-cori-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru0-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru5-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru6-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru10-72ccfda0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru9-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru3-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru7-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru8-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-aru2-72ccfda0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-ljspeech-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt408-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt138-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt624-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt396-72ccfda0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt498-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt132-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt288-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt42-72ccfda0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pleasant-lt90-72ccfda0.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất hay gặp trong các bài đánh giá dịch vụ (reviews) của khách sạn, nhà hàng.', 'travel', 1, 19),
('783fae52-9164-5a6c-80ff-6cf4d4a4b490', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'keen', '/kiːn/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Sắc bén, nhạy bén hoặc rất nhiệt tình.', 'having a sharp mind, strong interest, or a very good ability to notice things.', 'With her keen eyesight, she spotted the tiny bird in the distance.', 'Với thị lực sắc bén của mình, cô ấy đã phát hiện ra con chim nhỏ ở đằng xa.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring manager is looking for candidates with a keen interest in software development.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tuyển dụng đang tìm kiếm những ứng viên có sự quan tâm nhiệt tình với việc phát triển phần mềm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-ljspeech-ec00cfc2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-cori-ec00cfc2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/keen-72d5ba27.webp', '[\"eager\", \"sharp\", \"enthusiastic\"]', '[\"indifferent\", \"dull\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"keen interest\", \"meaning\": \"sự quan tâm sâu sắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keen eye\", \"meaning\": \"con mắt tinh tường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"keenly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"keenness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-cori-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru0-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru5-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru6-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru10-ec00cfc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru9-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru3-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru7-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru8-ec00cfc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/keen-aru2-ec00cfc2.