('71893230-8c3a-51cb-b20e-40438b64a9ab', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'self-disciplined', '/ˌselfˈdɪsɪplɪnd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Tự giác, có kỷ luật với bản thân.', 'able to control your own actions and work hard without needing someone to tell you what to do.', 'To achieve your goals, you need to be highly self-disciplined.', 'Để đạt được mục tiêu, bạn cần phải rất tự giác.', '{\"en\": \"Highly self-disciplined employees usually complete their assigned tasks ahead of the scheduled deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Những nhân viên giàu tính tự giác thường hoàn thành các nhiệm vụ được giao trước thời hạn quy định.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-ljspeech-512642e9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-cori-512642e9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/self-disciplined-5b941d6b.webp', '[\"self-controlled\", \"focused\"]', '[\"undisciplined\", \"irresponsible\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly self-disciplined\", \"meaning\": \"rất có tính kỷ luật tự giác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stay self-disciplined\", \"meaning\": \"giữ vững tinh thần tự giác\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"self-discipline\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-cori-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru0-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru5-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru6-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru10-512642e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru9-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru3-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru7-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru8-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-aru2-512642e9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-ljspeech-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt408-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt138-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt624-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt396-512642e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt498-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt132-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt288-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt42-512642e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-disciplined-lt90-512642e9.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghép từ self (bản thân) và disciplined (có kỷ luật).', 'hr', 1, 21),
('cbd287bc-929f-5c72-b10e-3b585d3b04f7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'commercially', 'UK: /kəˈmɜːʃəli/ | US: /kəˈmɜːrʃəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'về mặt thương mại', 'in a way that relates to buying, selling, or making financial profit', 'The product was not commercially viable.', 'Sản phẩm không có tính khả thi về mặt thương mại.', '{\"en\": \"The new drug has been proven effective, but it is not yet commercially available.\", \"vi\": \"Thuốc mới đã được chứng minh là có hiệu quả, nhưng nó vẫn chưa sẵn có trên thị trường thương mại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-ljspeech-7dcb75d3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-cori-7dcb75d3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commercially-3a3d45e4.webp', '[\"profitably\", \"financially\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"commercially viable\", \"meaning\": \"khả thi về mặt thương mại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commercially available\", \"meaning\": \"có sẵn để mua bán trên thị trường\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"commercial\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commerce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-cori-7dcb75d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-aru0-7dcb75d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-aru5-7dcb75d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-aru6-7dcb75d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-aru10-7dcb75d3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-aru9-7dcb75d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-aru3-7dcb75d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-aru7-7dcb75d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commercially-aru8-7dcb75d3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob