('bddf044b-378e-5dee-a971-2430126376cf', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'decoration', 'UK: /ˌdɛkəˈreɪʃən/ | US: /ˌdɛkəˈreɪʃən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'đồ trang trí', 'An object used to make a room, building, or event look more attractive and pleasant.', 'The store put up new decorations for the holiday season.', 'Cửa hàng đã treo đồ trang trí mới cho mùa lễ.', '{\"en\": \"All holiday decorations in the reception area must be taken down by Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các vật dụng trang trí lễ hội ở khu vực lễ tân phải được dỡ bỏ trước thứ Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-ljspeech-98007a76.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-cori-98007a76.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decoration-e7fb5aa7.webp', '[\"ornament\", \"adornment\", \"embellishment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"festive decoration\", \"meaning\": \"đồ trang trí dịp lễ hội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"interior decoration\", \"meaning\": \"việc trang trí nội thất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"decorate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"decorative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-cori-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru0-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru5-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru6-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru10-98007a76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru9-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru3-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru7-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru8-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-aru2-98007a76.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-ljspeech-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt408-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt138-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt624-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt396-98007a76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt498-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt132-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt288-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt42-98007a76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decoration-lt90-98007a76.mp3\"]}}', 'Ở dạng số nhiều (\'decorations\'), từ này chỉ các vật dụng dùng để trang trí.', 'office', 1, 23),
('84952a6d-4548-5d17-8ced-b41b21c7babf', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'circumstance', 'UK: /ˈsɜːkəmstəns/ | US: /ˈsɜːrkəmstæns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'hoàn cảnh, trường hợp', 'a condition, fact, or event connected with and affecting a situation or person\'s life.', 'Under no circumstances can the policy be changed.', 'Trong bất kỳ trường hợp nào, chính sách không thể thay đổi.', '{\"en\": \"Under no circumstances should confidential client data be shared without written permission.\", \"vi\": \"Trong bất kỳ hoàn cảnh nào, dữ liệu bảo mật của khách hàng cũng không được chia sẻ nếu không có sự cho phép bằng văn bản.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-ljspeech-a40ec44a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-cori-a40ec44a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/circumstance-731aaf01.webp', '[\"situation\", \"condition\", \"state of affairs\", \"context\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"under no circumstances\", \"meaning\": \"trong bất kỳ hoàn cảnh nào cũng không\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unforeseen circumstances\", \"meaning\": \"những trường hợp/hoàn cảnh không lường trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"substance\", \"note_vi\": \"Vật chất, chất liệu hoặc bản chất cốt lõi\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"circumstantial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-cori-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru0-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru5-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru6-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru10-a40ec44a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru9-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru3-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru7-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru8-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru2-a40ec44a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-ljspeech-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt408-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt138-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt624-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt396-a40ec44a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt498-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt132-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt288-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt42-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt90-a40ec44a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng ở dạng số nhiều \'circumstances\'. Cụm đảo ngữ kinh điển trong TOEIC: \'Under no circumstances + trợ động từ + S + V\' (Dù trong hoàn cảnh nào cũng không...).', 'office', 1, 24),
('0dcf48cb-9776-5eeb-8766-3abbaa49ffb8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'careful', '/ˈkeəfl/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Chú ý để tránh sai sót, nguy hiểm hoặc làm hại; thận trọng.', 'giving a lot of attention to what you are doing so that you do not make a mistake.', 'You should be careful when reviewing confidential documents before signing the agreement.', 'Bạn nên cẩn thận khi xem xét các tài liệu bảo mật trước khi ký hợp đồng.', '{\"en\": \"Please be careful when reviewing the financial reports to ensure all numbers are accurate.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng cẩn thận khi xem xét các báo cáo tài chính để đảm bảo tất cả các con số đều chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-ljspeech-7c41bee1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-cori-7c41bee1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/careful-a8125ff0.webp', '[\"cautious\", \"attentive\", \"prudent\"]', '[\"careless\", \"reckless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"careful consideration\", \"meaning\": \"sự cân nhắc cẩn thận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"careful attention\", \"meaning\": \"sự chú ý cẩn thận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"caring\", \"note_vi\": \"Nghĩa là chu đáo, quan tâm đến người khác.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"care\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"carefully\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"carelessness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-cori-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru0-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru5-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru6-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru10-7c41bee1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru9-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru3-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru7-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru8-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-aru2-7c41bee1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-ljspeech-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt408-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt138-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt624-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt396-7c41bee1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt498-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt132-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt288-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt42-7c41bee1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/careful-lt90-7c41bee1.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với giới từ \'with\' (careful with money) hoặc \'of\' (careful of the dog).', 'office', 1, 25),
('45d4e4e3-bde7-5565-92e1-9a7b3794bc63', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'plasma', '/ˈplæzmə/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Phần chất lỏng trong máu, không chứa tế bào máu, mang các protein và chất dinh dưỡng.', 'the clear liquid part of blood that carries cells and proteins through the body.', 'Donating plasma is a way to help patients with various medical conditions.', 'Hiến huyết tương là một cách để giúp đỡ bệnh nhân mắc các tình trạng bệnh lý khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The local hospital is organizing a blood and plasma donation drive for next week.\", \"vi\": \"Bệnh viện địa phương đang tổ chức một đợt hiến máu và huyết tương vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-ljspeech-14e8d839.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-cori-14e8d839.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/plasma-b0adcf44.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"blood plasma\", \"meaning\": \"huyết tương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plasma donation\", \"meaning\": \"hiến huyết tương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"plastic\", \"note_vi\": \"plastic là nhựa, plasma là huyết tương hoặc trạng thái vật chất.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-cori-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru0-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru5-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru6-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru10-14e8d839.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru9-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru3-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru7-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru8-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-aru2-14e8d839.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-ljspeech-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt408-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt138-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt624-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt396-14e8d839.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt498-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt132-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt288-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt42-14e8d839.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/plasma-lt90-14e8d839.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên ngành y tế, ít gặp trong TOEIC nhưng phổ biến trong IELTS Reading.', 'health', 1, 26),
('feb686ea-3a9a-55cd-92f7-f62944108943', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'lieutenant', '/lefˈtenənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cấp bậc sĩ quan trong quân đội hoặc cảnh sát.', 'an officer of middle rank in the police force or the armed forces.', 'The lieutenant led his squad on a reconnaissance mission.', 'Viên trung úy đã dẫn đội của mình thực hiện nhiệm vụ trinh sát.', '{\"en\": \"The police lieutenant coordinated the security team to ensure the event remained safe today.\", \"vi\": \"Trung úy cảnh sát đã điều phối đội an ninh để đảm bảo sự kiện an toàn hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-ljspeech-49a611ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-cori-49a611ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lieutenant-b10dbde8.webp', '[\"officer\", \"commander\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"police lieutenant\", \"meaning\": \"trung úy cảnh sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"army lieutenant\", \"meaning\": \"trung úy quân đội\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-cori-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru0-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru5-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru6-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru10-49a611ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru9-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru3-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru7-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru8-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-aru2-49a611ab.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-ljspeech-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt408-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt138-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt624-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt396-49a611ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt498-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt132-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt288-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt42-49a611ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lieutenant-lt90-49a611ab.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấp bậc này thường đứng dưới đội trưởng hoặc đại úy.', 'law', 1, 27),
('687c4f7f-43da-5919-aed5-eda201709072', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'risk', '/rɪsk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khả năng xảy ra điều không mong muốn hoặc gây hại.', 'the possibility that something unpleasant or harmful might happen in the future.', 'There\'s a high risk of losing money if you invest in that volatile stock.', 'Có nguy cơ mất tiền rất cao nếu bạn đầu tư vào cổ phiếu biến động đó.', '{\"en\": \"The manager assessed the financial risk before approving the investment in the new overseas project.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đánh giá rủi ro tài chính trước khi phê duyệt khoản đầu tư vào dự án mới ở nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-ljspeech-11a110bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-cori-11a110bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/risk-8f478e8e.webp', '[\"danger\", \"hazard\", \"threat\"]', '[\"safety\", \"security\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"high risk\", \"meaning\": \"rủi ro cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a risk\", \"meaning\": \"chấp nhận rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"minimize risk\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu rủi ro\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"brisk\", \"note_vi\": \"Brisk nghĩa là nhanh nhẹn, hoạt bát, không liên quan đến nguy hiểm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"risky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-cori-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru0-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru5-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru6-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru10-11a110bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru9-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru3-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru7-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru8-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru2-11a110bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-ljspeech-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt408-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt138-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt624-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt396-11a110bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt498-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt132-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt288-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt42-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt90-11a110bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong cụm \'at risk\' (đang gặp nguy hiểm).', 'business', 1, 28),
('d9bc1612-91b3-54f9-9e3f-49fd44a226f6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'aa3a3226-d148-5f70-af8d-1ffde4b04f32', '9de6032d-5c1d-5ee4-8595-fba9913d4334', 'humanism', '/ˈhjuːmənɪzəm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Triết lý nhấn mạnh giá trị và khả năng của con người, đề cao lý trí và đạo đức.', 'a philosophy emphasizing the value, potential, and reason of people rather than religion.', 'Renaissance art often reflected the ideals of humanism, focusing on human experience and achievement.', 'Nghệ thuật thời Phục hưng thường phản ánh lý tưởng của chủ nghĩa nhân văn, tập trung vào trải nghiệm và thành tựu của con người.', '{\"en\": \"The modern training course incorporates humanism to improve employee relations and well-being.\", \"vi\": \"Khóa đào tạo hiện đại kết hợp nhân văn luận để cải thiện mối quan hệ và phúc lợi của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-ljspeech-b783c638.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-cori-b783c638.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/humanism-5809be61.webp', '[\"humanitarianism\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"secular humanism\", \"meaning\": \"chủ nghĩa nhân văn thế tục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"principles of humanism\", \"meaning\": \"các nguyên tắc của chủ nghĩa nhân văn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"humanitarianism\", \"note_vi\": \"humanitarianism là chủ nghĩa nhân đạo, còn humanism là nhân văn luận\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"humanist\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"humanistic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-cori-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru0-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru5-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru6-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru10-b783c638.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru9-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru3-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru7-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru8-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-aru2-b783c638.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-ljspeech-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt408-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt138-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt624-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt396-b783c638.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt498-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt132-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt288-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt42-b783c638.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/humanism-lt90-b783c638.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với humanitarianism (chủ nghĩa nhân đạo cứu trợ người gặp khó khăn).', 'academic', 1, 29),
('8833d696-1010-59fa-8938-0495a983b7fc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b5dbfbad-6669-5f74-a97a-db3b1b3cdd74', 'd1224d0b-fbb0-555c-9611-e279e48c8ce5', 'cushion', 'UK: /ˈkʊʃn/ | US: /ˈkʊʃn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'đệm, gối', 'A soft bag filled with soft material, used for sitting or resting on comfortably.', 'She arranged the cushions neatly on the sofa.', 'Cô ấy xếp gọn gàng những chiếc đệm trên ghế sofa.', '{\"en\": \"The company created a financial cushion to protect itself against unexpected market downturns.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã tạo ra một khoản dự phòng tài chính để tự bảo vệ trước sự sụt giảm bất ngờ của thị trường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-ljspeech-db894fbf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-cori-db894fbf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cushion-5648a5a2.webp', '[\"pad\", \"pillow\", \"buffer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"financial cushion\", \"meaning\": \"khoản dự phòng tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seat cushion\", \"meaning\": \"đệm ngồi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pillow\", \"note_vi\": \"Pillow là gối nằm ngủ trên giường, cushion thường là gối trang trí/tựa lưng trên ghế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"cushion\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-cori-db894fbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-aru0-db894fbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-aru5-db894fbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-aru6-db894fbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-aru10-db894fbf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-aru9-db894fbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-aru3-db894fbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-aru7-db894fbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cushion-aru8-db894fbf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu