('60425c0b-b88a-5289-8c4e-56e15ec1fd4c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b5dbfbad-6669-5f74-a97a-db3b1b3cdd74', 'd1224d0b-fbb0-555c-9611-e279e48c8ce5', 'considerate', 'UK: /kənˈsɪdərət/ | US: /kənˈsɪdərət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'chu đáo, cân nhắc, thận trọng', 'Always thinking about the feelings and needs of other people, showing kindness and care.', 'He was considerate of his colleagues\' busy schedules.', 'Anh ấy đã chu đáo với lịch trình bận rộn của đồng nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"It was very considerate of Mr. Tanaka to quiet down while others were presenting.\", \"vi\": \"Thật chu đáo khi ông Tanaka giữ trật tự trong khi những người khác đang thuyết trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-ljspeech-6271c4b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-cori-6271c4b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/considerate-b761f67d.webp', '[\"thoughtful\", \"attentive\", \"caring\", \"mindful\"]', '[\"inconsiderate\", \"thoughtless\", \"selfish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"considerate of others\", \"meaning\": \"chu đáo/quan tâm đến người khác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be considerate towards\", \"meaning\": \"ân cần với ai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"considerable\", \"note_vi\": \"đáng kể, to lớn về quy mô/số lượng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"considerately\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consideration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-cori-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru0-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru5-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru6-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru10-6271c4b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru9-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru3-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru7-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru8-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-aru2-6271c4b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-ljspeech-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt408-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt138-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt624-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt396-6271c4b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt498-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt132-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt288-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt42-6271c4b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/considerate-lt90-6271c4b6.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'of\' (be considerate of others: biết nghĩ cho người khác). Tránh nhầm với \'considerable\'.', 'office', 1, 25),
('73cf78b6-61d8-545e-9d6e-ca1e3d373835', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b5dbfbad-6669-5f74-a97a-db3b1b3cdd74', 'd1224d0b-fbb0-555c-9611-e279e48c8ce5', 'thickset', '/θɪkˈset/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Cứng cáp, vạm vỡ, có thân hình dày.', 'having a broad, solid, and strong body shape.', 'The rugby player had a thickset build, making him difficult to tackle.', 'Cầu thủ bóng bầu dục có thân hình vạm vỡ, khiến anh ta khó bị cản phá.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard had a thickset frame, which helped him maintain order at the entrance.\", \"vi\": \"Người bảo vệ có thân hình vạm vỡ, điều đó giúp anh ta duy trì trật tự tại lối vào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-ljspeech-2fcada50.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-cori-2fcada50.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thickset-a0227927.webp', '[\"sturdy\", \"stocky\"]', '[\"slender\", \"thin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thickset build\", \"meaning\": \"thân hình vạm vỡ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thickset man\", \"meaning\": \"người đàn ông vạm vỡ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-cori-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru0-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru5-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru6-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru10-2fcada50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru9-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru3-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru7-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru8-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-aru2-2fcada50.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-ljspeech-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt408-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt138-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt624-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt396-2fcada50.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt498-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt132-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt288-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt42-2fcada50.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thickset-lt90-2fcada50.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để mô tả ngoại hình nhân viên an ninh hoặc lao động chân tay.', 'other', 1, 26),
('a6ed2238-31e5-509a-a083-ed18f1e49fe5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b5dbfbad-6669-5f74-a97a-db3b1b3cdd74', 'd1224d0b-fbb0-555c-9611-e279e48c8ce5', 'attendance', 'UK: /əˈtɛndəns/ | US: /əˈtɛndəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự tham dự', 'the act of being present at a specific place, event, or function.', 'Attendance at the workshop is required for all new employees.', 'Việc tham dự buổi hội thảo là bắt buộc đối với tất cả nhân viên mới.', '{\"en\": \"Attendance at the mandatory safety orientation training will be recorded by the HR coordinator.\", \"vi\": \"Sự tham dự tại buổi đào tạo định hướng an toàn bắt buộc sẽ được ghi nhận bởi điều phối viên HR.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-ljspeech-f61b43b4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-cori-f61b43b4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attendance-2d6afd7e.webp', '[\"presence\", \"turnout\", \"participation\"]', '[\"absence\", \"non-attendance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take attendance\", \"meaning\": \"điểm danh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"record attendance\", \"meaning\": \"ghi nhận sự có mặt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attendee\", \"note_vi\": \"Attendance là danh từ chỉ sự có mặt/lượng người tham dự, còn attendee là bản thân người tham dự.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"attend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attendee\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attendant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-cori-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru0-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru5-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru6-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru10-f61b43b4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru9-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru3-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru7-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru8-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-aru2-f61b43b4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-ljspeech-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt408-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt138-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt624-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt396-f61b43b4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt498-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt132-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt288-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt42-f61b43b4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attendance-lt90-f61b43b4.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ việc có mặt hoặc số lượng người có mặt. Hay đi với các động từ như \'take attendance\' (điểm danh), \'record attendance\' (ghi nhận sự tham gia).', 'human resources', 1, 27),
('1c9cdc00-0daa-5f81-a9ac-a2ef5e8eccfe', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b5dbfbad-6669-5f74-a97a-db3b1b3cdd74', 'd1224d0b-fbb0-555c-9611-e279e48c8ce5', 'understandably', '/ˌʌndəˈstændəbli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách dễ hiểu, có thể thông cảm được.', 'in a way that is logical and easy to understand because of the situation.', 'She was understandably upset after losing her beloved pet.', 'Cô ấy buồn bã là điều dễ hiểu sau khi mất đi thú cưng yêu quý của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The stock price fell, which was understandably concerning for the company\'s major shareholders this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Giá cổ phiếu giảm, điều này dễ hiểu là gây lo ngại cho các cổ đông lớn của công ty sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-ljspeech-9791b580.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-cori-9791b580.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/understandably-6aaf7a61.webp', '[\"naturally\", \"logically\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"understandably concerned\", \"meaning\": \"dễ hiểu là lo ngại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"understandably upset\", \"meaning\": \"dễ hiểu là buồn bã\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"understand\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"understanding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-cori-9791b580.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-aru0-9791b580.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-aru5-9791b580.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-aru6-9791b580.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-aru10-9791b580.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-aru9-9791b580.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-aru3-9791b580.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/understandably-aru7-9791b580.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/