('d075db9a-cb30-5b71-8a69-c3ce93c28682', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b5dbfbad-6669-5f74-a97a-db3b1b3cdd74', 'd1224d0b-fbb0-555c-9611-e279e48c8ce5', 'arson', '/ˈɑːsn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Tội cố ý đốt cháy tài sản.', 'the crime of intentionally burning a building or other property.', 'The police suspect the fire was started by arson, not an accident.', 'Cảnh sát nghi ngờ vụ cháy là do phóng hỏa, không phải tai nạn.', '{\"en\": \"The insurance investigator confirmed that the warehouse fire was a result of arson.\", \"vi\": \"Điều tra viên bảo hiểm đã xác nhận rằng vụ cháy kho hàng là do cố ý phóng hỏa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-ljspeech-95016576.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-cori-95016576.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arson-3f13d032.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"commit arson\", \"meaning\": \"phạm tội phóng hỏa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arson investigation\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc điều tra vụ cố ý phóng hỏa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"arsonist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-cori-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru0-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru5-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru6-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru10-95016576.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru9-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru3-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru7-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru8-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-aru2-95016576.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-ljspeech-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt408-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt138-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt624-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt396-95016576.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt498-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt132-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt288-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt42-95016576.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arson-lt90-95016576.mp3\"]}}', 'Đây là danh từ không đếm được chỉ hành vi tội phạm đốt phá tài sản.', 'law', 1, 29),
('ac41952b-f346-5b7a-8f45-a0a400c2874d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'whole', '/həʊl/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Toàn bộ, không thiếu sót hay bị chia cắt.', 'including every part of something with nothing left out or removed.', 'Our sales team spent the whole week preparing for the upcoming trade exhibition.', 'Đội ngũ kinh doanh của chúng tôi đã dành cả tuần để chuẩn bị cho triển lãm thương mại sắp tới.', '{\"en\": \"The whole team worked overtime to ensure the project was completed before the deadline.\", \"vi\": \"Toàn bộ đội ngũ đã làm thêm giờ để đảm bảo dự án được hoàn thành trước thời hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-ljspeech-af811326.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-cori-af811326.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/whole-f877f0ba.webp', '[\"entire\", \"complete\"]', '[\"partial\", \"incomplete\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"the whole time\", \"meaning\": \"suốt thời gian đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"the whole day\", \"meaning\": \"cả ngày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hole\", \"note_vi\": \"hole là cái lỗ, whole là toàn bộ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-cori-af811326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru0-af811326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru5-af811326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru6-af811326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru10-af811326.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru9-af811326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru3-af811326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru7-af811326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru8-af811326.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/whole-aru2-af811326.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\