('dd35eb86-03d1-578d-a6cd-bc4b9776add3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'streak', '/striːk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một vạch dài, hẹp hoặc một chuỗi liên tục các sự kiện.', 'a long, thin mark or a continuous period of success or failure in something.', 'A streak of lightning lit up the night sky during the storm.', 'Một vệt sét lóe sáng bầu trời đêm trong cơn bão.', '{\"en\": \"Our sales team is currently on a winning streak, having closed five deals this month.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng của chúng tôi hiện đang có chuỗi thắng lợi, đã chốt năm hợp đồng trong tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-ljspeech-21e97889.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-cori-21e97889.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/streak-5e05671e.webp', '[\"series\", \"line\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"winning streak\", \"meaning\": \"chuỗi thắng lợi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"streak of luck\", \"meaning\": \"vận may liên tiếp\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"streaky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-cori-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru0-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru5-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru6-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru10-21e97889.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru9-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru3-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru7-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru8-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-aru2-21e97889.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-ljspeech-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt408-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt138-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt624-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt396-21e97889.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt498-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt132-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt288-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt42-21e97889.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/streak-lt90-21e97889.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong thể thao hoặc kinh doanh (chuỗi thắng/thua).', 'business', 1, 2),
('05c4a0c3-7259-5b26-928f-1415fb2ebb3f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'gross', '/ɡrəʊs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất thô tục, kinh tởm hoặc khó chịu.', 'extremely unpleasant, dirty, or offensive to look at or think about.', 'That smell coming from the trash can is absolutely gross.', 'Mùi bốc ra từ thùng rác thật sự kinh tởm.', '{\"en\": \"The restaurant was shut down after inspectors found gross violations of hygiene standards.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng đã bị đóng cửa sau khi các thanh tra phát hiện những vi phạm nghiêm trọng về tiêu chuẩn vệ sinh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-ljspeech-d96d1a6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-cori-d96d1a6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gross-8973bd1c.webp', '[\"disgusting\", \"offensive\", \"revolting\"]', '[\"pleasant\", \"clean\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gross negligence\", \"meaning\": \"sự cẩu thả nghiêm trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gross income\", \"meaning\": \"thu nhập gộp (trước thuế)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"net\", \"note_vi\": \"gross là tổng/gộp (chưa trừ chi phí), net là thực/ròng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"grossly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-cori-d96d1a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-aru0-d96d1a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-aru5-d96d1a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-aru6-d96d1a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-aru10-d96d1a6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-aru9-d96d1a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-aru3-d96d1a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-aru7-d96d1a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gross-aru8-d96d1a6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu