('fc63db9b-2ea0-5f89-8da5-b0a38c247ae8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'meadow', '/ˈmedəʊ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một khu đất rộng, thường có cỏ và hoa dại, dùng làm nơi chăn thả.', 'a large area of land covered with grass and often wild flowers, used for animals.', 'The cows were grazing peacefully in the green meadow.', 'Những con bò đang gặm cỏ yên bình trên đồng cỏ xanh.', '{\"en\": \"The new corporate office park was built on a former meadow near the city center.\", \"vi\": \"Khu văn phòng công ty mới được xây dựng trên một đồng cỏ cũ gần trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-ljspeech-cf185b44.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-cori-cf185b44.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/meadow-32f767b5.webp', '[\"pasture\", \"field\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"green meadow\", \"meaning\": \"đồng cỏ xanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wildflower meadow\", \"meaning\": \"đồng cỏ hoa dại\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-cori-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru0-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru5-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru6-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru10-cf185b44.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru9-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru3-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru7-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru8-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-aru2-cf185b44.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/meadow-ljspeech-cf185b44.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat