('54d6bdf2-bf70-5ba0-9091-c32456a68589', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'X-ray', '/ˈɛksˌreɪ/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Tia bức xạ dùng để chụp ảnh bên trong cơ thể hoặc vật thể.', 'a type of radiation that can pass through solid objects and show pictures of the inside.', 'The dentist took an X-ray to examine the root of my painful tooth.', 'Nha sĩ đã chụp X-quang để kiểm tra chân của chiếc răng đang bị đau của tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The clinic installed a modern X-ray machine to improve the speed of patient diagnoses.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng khám đã lắp đặt một máy chụp X-quang hiện đại để cải thiện tốc độ chẩn đoán cho bệnh nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-ljspeech-d8852099.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-cori-d8852099.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/x-ray-ab70a265.webp', '[\"radiograph\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"chest X-ray\", \"meaning\": \"chụp X-quang ngực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take an X-ray\", \"meaning\": \"chụp X-quang\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"X-ray\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-cori-d8852099.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru0-d8852099.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru5-d8852099.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru6-d8852099.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru10-d8852099.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru9-d8852099.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru3-d8852099.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru7-d8852099.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru8-d8852099.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/x-ray-aru2-d8852099.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2