('04b85165-873c-59f0-bf11-893228bef08c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'stab', '/stæb/', 'B2', 'verb', 'đâm bằng vật nhọn.', 'to push a sharp object into someone or something with force and sudden movement.', 'The chef accidentally used a sharp fork to stab his hand during prep work.', 'Đầu bếp đã vô tình dùng một chiếc nĩa nhọn đâm vào tay mình trong lúc chuẩn bị.', '{\"en\": \"The technician had to stab the reset button to fix the malfunctioning office printer.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên phải nhấn mạnh vào nút reset để sửa máy in văn phòng bị lỗi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-ljspeech-9a8b470c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-cori-9a8b470c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stab-4273c024.webp', '[\"pierce\", \"puncture\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stab at\", \"meaning\": \"cố gắng làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stab wound\", \"meaning\": \"vết đâm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stab\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-cori-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru0-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru5-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru6-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru10-9a8b470c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru9-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru3-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru7-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru8-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-aru2-9a8b470c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-ljspeech-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt408-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt138-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt624-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt396-9a8b470c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt498-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt132-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt288-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt42-9a8b470c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stab-lt90-9a8b470c.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa bóng là \"cố gắng\" hoặc \"phản bội\" trong công việc.', 'other', 1, 17),
('621b6047-05a5-52a7-82bd-1e992feca100', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'footnote', '/ˈfʊtnəʊt/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Chú thích hoặc thông tin bổ sung ở cuối trang sách, tài liệu.', 'a note printed at the bottom of a page that gives extra information about something.', 'Remember to check the footnote for more details about the source.', 'Hãy nhớ kiểm tra chú thích cuối trang để biết thêm chi tiết về nguồn.', '{\"en\": \"Please read the footnote on the contract carefully before you sign the final agreement.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đọc kỹ phần chú thích ở cuối hợp đồng trước khi bạn ký thỏa thuận cuối cùng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-ljspeech-89ef0900.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-cori-89ef0900.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/footnote-b0181405.webp', '[\"note\", \"annotation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"add a footnote\", \"meaning\": \"thêm chú thích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"read the footnote\", \"meaning\": \"đọc chú thích\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-cori-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru0-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru5-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru6-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru10-89ef0900.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru9-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru3-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru7-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru8-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-aru2-89ef0900.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-ljspeech-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt408-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt138-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt624-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt396-89ef0900.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt498-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt132-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt288-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt42-89ef0900.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/footnote-lt90-89ef0900.mp3\"]}}', 'Foot (chân/cuối) + note (ghi chú) = ghi chú ở cuối trang.', 'law', 1, 18),
('b3962896-5815-51b1-ae35-f6d43a64aeed', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'preacher', '/ˈpriːtʃə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người thuyết giảng các bài kinh hoặc đạo lý tôn giáo.', 'a person who gives talks about religious or moral subjects.', 'The preacher delivered a powerful sermon that touched many hearts in the congregation.', 'Nhà thuyết giáo đã có một bài giảng mạnh mẽ chạm đến trái tim của nhiều người trong giáo đoàn.', '{\"en\": \"The local preacher invited business leaders to a charity event next Sunday.\", \"vi\": \"Vị mục sư địa phương đã mời các nhà lãnh đạo doanh nghiệp đến một sự kiện từ thiện vào Chủ Nhật tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-ljspeech-3c838312.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-cori-3c838312.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/preacher-f6e05726.webp', '[\"minister\", \"clergyman\", \"evangelist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lay preacher\", \"meaning\": \"người giảng đạo giáo dân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"traveling preacher\", \"meaning\": \"người giảng đạo lưu động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"teacher\", \"note_vi\": \"teacher là giáo viên dạy học bình thường\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"preach\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"preachy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-cori-3c838312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-aru0-3c838312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-aru5-3c838312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-aru6-3c838312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-aru10-3c838312.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-aru9-3c838312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-aru3-3c838312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/preacher-aru7-3