('a98d5f29-8d6b-5f8c-b735-94c479a8e3dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'predominant', '/prɪˈdɒmɪnənt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Chiếm ưu thế, nổi bật nhất hoặc quan trọng nhất.', 'being more important, powerful, or noticeable than anything or anyone else.', 'The predominant color in the painting was a vibrant blue.', 'Màu sắc chủ đạo trong bức tranh là màu xanh lam rực rỡ.', '{\"en\": \"Quality service remains the predominant factor in attracting repeat customers to our hotel.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ chất lượng vẫn là yếu tố chủ đạo trong việc thu hút khách hàng quay lại khách sạn chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-ljspeech-44888382.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-cori-44888382.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/predominant-45816b1a.webp', '[\"dominant\", \"main\", \"primary\"]', '[\"minor\", \"secondary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"predominant factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố chủ đạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"predominant role\", \"meaning\": \"vai trò nổi bật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prominent\", \"note_vi\": \"Prominent nhấn mạnh sự nổi bật/xuất sắc, predominant nhấn mạnh tính ưu thế/chiếm đa số.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"predominantly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"predominance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-cori-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru0-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru5-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru6-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru10-44888382.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru9-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru3-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru7-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru8-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-aru2-44888382.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-ljspeech-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt408-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt138-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt624-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt396-44888382.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt498-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt132-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt288-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt42-44888382.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/predominant-lt90-44888382.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với danh từ như factor, role, feature trong tiếng Anh doanh nghiệp.', 'marketing', 1, 21),
('c6fd039b-1962-50f6-968e-888f76710491', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'computer-aided manufacturing', '/kəmˈpjuːtə ˈeɪdɪd ˌmænjʊˈfæktʃərɪŋ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Việc sử dụng máy tính để điều khiển quy trình sản xuất.', 'the use of software and machinery to control and automate production processes.', 'Automobile plants heavily rely on computer-aided manufacturing to precision assemble vehicle engines.', 'Các nhà máy ô tô phụ thuộc rất nhiều vào sản xuất có sự hỗ trợ của máy tính để lắp ráp chính xác động cơ xe.', '{\"en\": \"Our factory implemented computer-aided manufacturing to reduce waste and speed up production.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy của chúng tôi đã áp dụng sản xuất có hỗ trợ bằng máy tính để giảm lãng phí và tăng tốc độ sản xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-ljspeech-9f304523.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-cori-9f304523.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/computer-aided-manufacturing-6d9499fb.webp', '[\"CAM\", \"automated production\"]', '[\"manual manufacturing\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"computer-aided manufacturing system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống sản xuất hỗ trợ bằng máy tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"computer-aided manufacturing software\", \"meaning\": \"phần mềm sản xuất hỗ trợ bằng máy tính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"computer-aided design\", \"note_vi\": \"CAD - thiết kế hỗ trợ bằng máy tính, khác với CAM là sản xuất\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-cori-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru0-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru5-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru6-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru10-9f304523.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru9-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru3-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru7-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru8-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-aru2-9f304523.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-ljspeech-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt408-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt138-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt624-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt396-9f304523.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt498-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt132-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt288-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt42-9f304523.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/computer-aided-manufacturing-lt90-9f304523.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường viết tắt là CAM, hay đi đôi với CAD (Computer-Aided Design).', 'manufacturing', 1, 22),
('0aa29f73-b65e-5d80-889e-c54f09470489', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'credential', 'UK: /krɪˈdenʃəl/ | US: /krɪˈdɛnʃəl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'chứng chỉ, bằng cấp', 'A document or qualification that proves a person\'s identity, skill, training, or official authority.', 'Please provide your academic credentials with your application.', 'Vui lòng cung cấp các bằng cấp học vấn của bạn cùng với đơn đăng ký.', '{\"en\": \"The hiring panel verified the academic credentials of all candidates prior to the interview.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng tuyển dụng đã xác minh bằng cấp học thuật của tất cả ứng viên trước buổi phỏng vấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-ljspeech-bdfa1c95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-cori-bdfa1c95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/credential-54e39e67.webp', '[\"qualification\", \"certificate\", \"license\", \"accreditation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"academic credentials\", \"meaning\": \"bằng cấp/chứng chỉ học thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"verify credentials\", \"meaning\": \"xác minh bằng cấp/chứng chỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"credibility\", \"note_vi\": \"Sự uy tín, độ tin cậy của cá nhân hay tổ chức.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"credentialed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-cori-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru0-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru5-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru6-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru10-bdfa1c95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru9-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru3-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru7-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru8-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-aru2-bdfa1c95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-ljspeech-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt408-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt138-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt624-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt396-bdfa1c95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt498-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt132-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt288-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt42-bdfa1c95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/credential-lt90-bdfa1c95.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện ở dạng số nhiều \'credentials\' chỉ tập hợp bằng cấp, chứng chỉ chuyên môn của ứng viên.', 'personnel', 1, 23),
('ef5c9450-eceb-540a-96c4-4293bf4602ff', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'self-centered', '/ˌselfˈsentəd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Chỉ quan tâm đến bản thân mà không nghĩ đến người khác.', 'caring only about yourself and your own needs, without thinking about other people.', 'His self-centered attitude made it difficult for him to work in a team.', 'Thái độ ích kỷ của anh ấy khiến anh ấy khó làm việc nhóm.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager is too self-centered to listen to any suggestions from the marketing team.\", \"vi\": \"Vị quản lý mới quá ích kỷ nên không chịu lắng nghe bất kỳ đề xuất nào từ nhóm tiếp thị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-ljspeech-6946801f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-cori-6946801f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/self-centered-f6c66918.webp', '[\"selfish\", \"egocentric\", \"narcissistic\"]', '[\"selfless\", \"altruistic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a self-centered person\", \"meaning\": \"một người ích kỷ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"self-centered behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi ích kỷ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"self-confident\", \"note_vi\": \"tự tin (tích cực), khác với self-centered là ích kỷ (tiêu cực)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"self-centeredness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-cori-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru0-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru5-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru6-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru10-6946801f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru9-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru3-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru7-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru8-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-aru2-6946801f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-ljspeech-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt408-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt138-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt624-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt396-6946801f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt498-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt132-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt288-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt42-6946801f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/self-centered-lt90-6946801f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực, chỉ trích ai đó chỉ biết nghĩ cho mình.', 'hr', 1, 24),
('438b589c-b4f2-5a82-be8d-25ae5b715a99', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'b71008f5-f3db-507a-afe3-ec46fe5a5611', '8e750c21-615b-5f47-80f4-e3b095489892', 'amnesia', '/æmˈniːziə/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng mất khả năng nhớ lại thông tin hoặc trải nghiệm.', 'a medical condition where someone cannot remember things that happened in the past.', 'After the accident, he suffered from temporary amnesia and couldn\'t recall the event.', 'Sau vụ tai nạn, anh ấy bị mất trí nhớ tạm thời và không thể nhớ lại sự việc.', '{\"en\": \"The employee claimed temporary amnesia regarding the missing files during the internal company audit.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đó tuyên bố bị mất trí nhớ tạm thời liên quan đến các tệp tin bị mất trong cuộc kiểm toán nội bộ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-ljspeech-2362d540.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-cori-2362d540.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amnesia-08f21913.webp', '[\"memory loss\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"temporary amnesia\", \"meaning\": \"mất trí nhớ tạm thời\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"amnesiac\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-cori-2362d540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru0-2362d540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru5-2362d540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru6-2362d540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru10-2362d540.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru9-2362d540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru3-2362d540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru7-2362d540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru8-2362d540.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amnesia-aru2-2362d540.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pu