('326e7708-f7bd-5b26-9f34-bc50d97504d8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'underway', 'UK: /ˌʌndəˈweɪ/ | US: /ˌʌndərˈweɪ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đang diễn ra', 'Having started and currently in progress or motion towards completion or continuation.', 'The project is already underway.', 'Dự án đã đang được tiến hành.', '{\"en\": \"Preparations for the annual trade exposition are already underway.\", \"vi\": \"Công tác chuẩn bị cho hội chợ triển lãm thương mại hàng năm hiện đã và đang diễn ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-ljspeech-297f0bc0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-cori-297f0bc0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/underway-0fd33247.webp', '[\"in progress\", \"ongoing\", \"proceeding\", \"under development\"]', '[\"completed\", \"halted\", \"finished\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"get underway\", \"meaning\": \"bắt đầu khởi động / diễn ra\"}, {\"phrase\": \"already underway\", \"meaning\": \"đã và đang trong quá trình thực hiện\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"underway\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Underway\' viết liền thành một từ khi chỉ trạng thái đang diễn ra.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-cori-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru0-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru5-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru6-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru10-297f0bc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru9-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru3-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru7-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru8-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-aru2-297f0bc0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-ljspeech-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt408-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt138-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt624-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt396-297f0bc0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt498-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt132-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt288-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt42-297f0bc0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/underway-lt90-297f0bc0.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường làm vị ngữ đứng sau động từ to be hoặc đi trong cụm \'get underway\'.', 'event management', 1, 4),
('45f45297-2f27-5f23-a21c-90d5aed60d6f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'warranty', 'UK: /ˈwɒrənti/ | US: /ˈwɔrənti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'bảo hành', 'a written guarantee promising to repair or replace a purchased product within a specified timeframe.', 'The product comes with a one-year warranty.', 'Sản phẩm được bảo hành một năm.', '{\"en\": \"The new office printer comes with a two-year warranty that covers all repair costs.\", \"vi\": \"Máy in văn phòng mới đi kèm bảo hành hai năm bao gồm toàn bộ chi phí sửa chữa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-ljspeech-0cf5f9cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-cori-0cf5f9cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/warranty-1dd5fb72.webp', '[\"guarantee\", \"pledge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"under warranty\", \"meaning\": \"đang trong thời gian bảo hành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"extended warranty\", \"meaning\": \"gói bảo hành mở rộng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"guarantee\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Guarantee\' có thể vừa là động từ vừa là danh từ, còn \'warranty\' là danh từ cam kết bằng văn bản.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-cori-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru0-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru5-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru6-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru10-0cf5f9cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru9-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru3-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru7-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru8-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-aru2-0cf5f9cd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-ljspeech-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt408-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt138-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt624-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt396-0cf5f9cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt498-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt132-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt288-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt42-0cf5f9cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/warranty-lt90-0cf5f9cd.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với cụm \'under warranty\' (còn thời hạn bảo hành) hoặc \'warranty period\' (thời gian bảo hành).', 'shopping', 1, 5),
('49eeb320-7d54-5418-8af4-f8be5b09aa6c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'ransom', '/ˈrænsəm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Số tiền yêu cầu để thả một người bị bắt cóc.', 'a sum of money demanded in exchange for releasing a person who has been taken by force.', 'Hackers demanded a huge ransom to restore access to the hospital database.', 'Các tin tặc đã đòi một khoản tiền chuộc khổng lồ để khôi phục quyền truy cập vào cơ sở dữ liệu bệnh viện.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s crisis plan included procedures for handling ransom demands against executives.\", \"vi\": \"Kế hoạch khủng hoảng của công ty bao gồm các quy trình xử lý yêu cầu tiền chuộc nhắm vào các giám đốc điều hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-ljspeech-11cef29c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-cori-11cef29c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ransom-11f926e8.webp', '[\"payment\", \"demand\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pay a ransom\", \"meaning\": \"trả tiền chuộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ransom demand\", \"meaning\": \"yêu cầu tiền chuộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hold for ransom\", \"meaning\": \"bắt giữ để đòi tiền chuộc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reward\", \"note_vi\": \"reward là phần thưởng tự nguyện, ransom là tiền chuộc bị ép buộc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ransom\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-cori-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru0-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru5-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru6-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru10-11cef29c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru9-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru3-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru7-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru8-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-aru2-11cef29c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-ljspeech-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt408-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt138-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt624-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt396-11cef29c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt498-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt132-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt288-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt42-11cef29c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ransom-lt90-11cef29c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'hold to ransom\' nghĩa bóng là gây áp lực, ép buộc — hay gặp trong văn bản kinh doanh.', 'law', 1, 6),
('4c0e5fba-6db3-5ca8-a787-bbd33d6aa7c0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'wellness', 'UK: /ˈwɛlnəs/ | US: /ˈwɛlnəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'trạng thái khỏe mạnh về thể chất và tinh thần', 'the state of being in good health, especially as an actively pursued goal.', 'The company promotes employee wellness through various programs.', 'Công ty thúc đẩy sức khỏe nhân viên thông qua nhiều chương trình khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The HR department introduced a workplace wellness program to promote exercise and stress reduction.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng nhân sự đã giới thiệu một chương trình sức khỏe làm việc để thúc đẩy tập thể dục và giảm căng thẳng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-ljspeech-1644d71a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-cori-1644d71a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wellness-a9c4b120.webp', '[\"health\", \"well-being\", \"wholeness\"]', '[\"illness\", \"sickness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wellness program\", \"meaning\": \"chương trình chăm sóc sức khỏe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corporate wellness\", \"meaning\": \"sức khỏe doanh nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wellbeing\", \"note_vi\": \"Wellbeing chỉ tình trạng hạnh phúc/khỏe mạnh chung, trong khi wellness nhấn mạnh các hành động chủ động nâng cao sức khỏe.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"well\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-cori-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru0-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru5-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru6-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru10-1644d71a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru9-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru3-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru7-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru8-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-aru2-1644d71a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-ljspeech-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt408-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt138-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt624-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt396-1644d71a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt498-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt132-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt288-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt42-1644d71a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wellness-lt90-1644d71a.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay xuất hiện trong các bài đọc TOEIC về chế độ phúc lợi nhân viên, như \'wellness program\' (chương trình chăm sóc sức khỏe).', 'health', 1, 7),
('c110f656-e234-5054-9876-af6951cf7a6f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'suburb', 'UK: /ˈsʌbɜːb/ | US: /ˈsʌbərb/', 'B2', 'noun', 'vùng ngoại ô', 'a residential area located just outside the main center of a city', 'They live in a quiet suburb outside the city.', 'Họ sống ở một vùng ngoại ô yên tĩnh bên ngoài thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees prefer living in the suburbs and commuting to the city center by express train.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên thích sống ở vùng ngoại ô và đi làm vào trung tâm thành phố bằng tàu hỏa tốc hành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-ljspeech-26967ae2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-cori-26967ae2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/suburb-dcf4bc34.webp', '[\"outskirts\", \"residential area\"]', '[\"city center\", \"downtown\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in the suburbs\", \"meaning\": \"ở vùng ngoại ô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"quiet suburb\", \"meaning\": \"vùng ngoại ô yên tĩnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"outskirts\", \"note_vi\": \"outskirts chỉ phần rìa của thành phố, còn suburb nhấn mạnh vào khu dân cư sinh sống cận kề thành phố\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"suburban\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"suburbanite\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-cori-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru0-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru5-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru6-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru10-26967ae2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru9-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru3-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru7-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru8-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-aru2-26967ae2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-ljspeech-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt408-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt138-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt624-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt396-26967ae2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt498-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt132-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt288-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt42-26967ae2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/suburb-lt90-26967ae2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường được dùng ở dạng số nhiều trong cụm từ \'in the suburbs\' (ở vùng ngoại ô).', 'real estate', 1, 8)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('72caf771-1ba8-5bc9-9503-b12b539e2c61', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'vacationer', '/veɪˈkeɪʃənə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Người đang đi nghỉ dưỡng hoặc du lịch.', 'a person who is spending time away from home for leisure.', 'The beach was full of vacationers enjoying the sunny weather.', 'Bãi biển đầy những khách du lịch đang tận hưởng thời tiết nắng đẹp.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offered a discount package specifically for vacationers booking early this summer.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đưa ra gói giảm giá dành riêng cho du khách đặt chỗ sớm mùa hè này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-ljspeech-fb05db45.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-cori-fb05db45.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vacationer-a1b4ae76.webp', '[\"tourist\", \"holidaymaker\", \"traveler\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"package vacationer\", \"meaning\": \"du khách đi theo gói du lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"foreign vacationer\", \"meaning\": \"du khách nước ngoài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vacationer destination\", \"meaning\": \"điểm đến của du khách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"visitor\", \"note_vi\": \"người đến thăm, không nhất thiết đi nghỉ dưỡng\"}, {\"word\": \"vagabond\", \"note_vi\": \"kẻ lang thang, không phải du khách có kế hoạch\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vacation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-cori-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru0-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru5-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru6-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru10-fb05db45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru9-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru3-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru7-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru8-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-aru2-fb05db45.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-ljspeech-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt408-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt138-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt624-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt396-fb05db45.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt498-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt132-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt288-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt42-fb05db45.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vacationer-lt90-fb05db45.mp3\"]}}', 'Không nhầm với \'vacation\' (kỳ nghỉ); \'vacationer\' là người đi nghỉ.', 'travel', 1, 9),
('46bb44f8-66ad-58e6-b9c4-a1c24baf820a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'outskirts', '/ˈaʊtskɜːts/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Vùng ngoại ô, khu vực rìa thành phố.', 'the outer parts of a town or city, furthest from the center.', 'They live in a quiet neighborhood on the outskirts of London.', 'Họ sống ở một khu phố yên tĩnh ở ngoại ô Luân Đôn.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics company built a new warehouse on the outskirts of the city to save rent.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty hậu cần đã xây dựng một nhà kho mới ở ngoại ô thành phố để tiết kiệm tiền thuê.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-ljspeech-1bc80ab6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-cori-1bc80ab6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/outskirts-f81f858d.webp', '[\"suburbs\", \"fringes\"]', '[\"center\", \"downtown\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"on the outskirts\", \"meaning\": \"ở vùng ngoại ô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"city outskirts\", \"meaning\": \"rìa thành phố\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"suburbs\", \"note_vi\": \"suburbs là khu dân cư ngoại ô, outskirts chỉ chung vùng rìa ngoài của thành phố\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-cori-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru0-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru5-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru6-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru10-1bc80ab6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru9-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru3-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru7-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru8-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-aru2-1bc80ab6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-ljspeech-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt408-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt138-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt624-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt396-1bc80ab6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt498-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt132-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt288-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt42-1bc80ab6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/outskirts-lt90-1bc80ab6.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này luôn ở dạng số nhiều (có \'s\' ở cuối) và thường đi với giới từ \'on\'.', 'housing', 1, 10),
('54c16a23-7061-5e66-bc77-b260b94dca53', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'dissuade', '/dɪˈsweɪd/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Khuyên can, thuyết phục ai đó không làm điều gì.', 'to persuade someone not to do something by giving reasons against it.', 'My supervisor managed to dissuade me from making a risky investment decision.', 'Người giám sát của tôi đã thuyết phục được tôi từ bỏ quyết định đầu tư rủi ro.', '{\"en\": \"The HR manager tried to dissuade the senior analyst from resigning before the project ended.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhân sự đã cố thuyết phục nhà phân tích cấp cao không từ chức trước khi dự án kết thúc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-ljspeech-725991e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-cori-725991e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dissuade-cfb77fd0.webp', '[\"discourage\", \"deter\", \"talk out of\"]', '[\"persuade\", \"encourage\", \"convince\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dissuade someone from doing\", \"meaning\": \"khuyên can ai đó không làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dissuade a client\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục khách hàng từ bỏ ý định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strongly dissuade\", \"meaning\": \"khuyên can mạnh mẽ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"persuade\", \"note_vi\": \"persuade là thuyết phục làm điều gì, dissuade là thuyết phục không làm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dissuasion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"dissuasive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-cori-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru0-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru5-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru6-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru10-725991e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru9-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru3-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru7-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru8-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-aru2-725991e3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-ljspeech-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt408-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt138-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt624-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt396-725991e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt498-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt132-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt288-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt42-725991e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissuade-lt90-725991e3.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhớ cấu trúc: dissuade + someone + from + V-ing.', 'hr', 1, 11),
('dd91ac28-5f3f-51ff-a78a-b3c4df8c8724', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'legislate', '/ˈledʒɪsleɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Tạo hoặc ban hành luật pháp.', 'to create official rules that people in a country must follow.', 'Parliament will meet next month to legislate new environmental protection policies.', 'Quốc hội sẽ họp vào tháng tới để ban hành các chính sách bảo vệ môi trường mới.', '{\"en\": \"The government plans to legislate stricter safety regulations for all construction sites next year.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ có kế hoạch ban hành các quy định an toàn nghiêm ngặt hơn cho tất cả các công trường xây dựng vào năm tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-ljspeech-9275d955.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-cori-9275d955.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/legislate-492a0822.webp', '[\"enact\", \"codify\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"legislate for\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành luật cho việc gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"legislate against\", \"meaning\": \"ban hành luật cấm cái gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"legislation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"legislative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-cori-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru0-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru5-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru6-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru10-9275d955.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru9-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru3-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru7-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru8-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-aru2-9275d955.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-ljspeech-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt408-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt138-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt624-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt396-9275d955.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt498-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt132-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt288-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt42-9275d955.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/legislate-lt90-9275d955.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh chính trị hoặc quy định pháp lý chính thức.', 'law', 1, 12),
('f75fa00a-a446-51e5-8f94-35e67c3dc4dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'movement', '/ˈmuːvmənt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự di chuyển hoặc thay đổi vị trí của vật thể.', 'an act of changing physical location or position.', 'The slow movement of glaciers can carve out valleys over thousands of years.', 'Sự chuyển động chậm chạp của sông băng có thể tạo ra các thung lũng trong hàng nghìn năm.', '{\"en\": \"The security cameras detected suspicious movement near the warehouse entrance.\", \"vi\": \"Các camera an ninh đã phát hiện chuyển động đáng ngờ gần lối vào kho hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-ljspeech-b727a735.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-cori-b727a735.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/movement-dbe18d32.webp', '[\"motion\", \"action\", \"progress\"]', '[\"stillness\", \"inactivity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"freedom of movement\", \"meaning\": \"tự do di chuyển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"detect movement\", \"meaning\": \"phát hiện chuyển động\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"moment\", \"note_vi\": \"moment là khoảnh khắc, movement là sự chuyển động\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"move\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"movable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-cori-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru0-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru5-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru6-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru10-b727a735.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru9-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru3-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru7-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru8-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-aru2-b727a735.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-ljspeech-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt408-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt138-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt624-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt396-b727a735.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt498-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt132-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt288-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt42-b727a735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/movement-lt90-b727a735.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa movement (sự chuyển động) và moment (khoảnh khắc).', 'manufacturing', 1, 13),
('dcd5e838-e359-53d6-b1f0-5fde8aa03035', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'baf5ac2d-ab95-5b33-b5fa-751113847b34', 'c8d1cd0a-8c50-5bf9-9763-7f985bcb6593', 'instruction', '/ɪnˈstrʌkʃn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Lời chỉ dẫn, hướng dẫn cách làm một điều gì đó.', 'detailed information or direction telling someone how to do or use something.', 'Please read the instruction manual carefully before assembling the furniture.', 'Vui lòng đọc kỹ sách hướng dẫn trước khi lắp ráp đồ nội thất.', '{\"en\": \"Employees must follow every safety instruction carefully when operating heavy machinery in the factory.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phải tuân thủ nghiêm ngặt từng hướng dẫn an toàn khi vận hành máy móc hạng nặng trong nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instruction-ljspeech-81529fbd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instruction-cori-81529fbd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/instruction-e3ab1657.webp', '[\"direction\", \"guidance\", \"order\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"follow instructions\", \"meaning\": \"làm theo hướng dẫn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"written instructions\", \"meaning\": \"hướng dẫn bằng văn bản\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"construction\", \"note_vi\": \"instruction là sự hướng dẫn, construction là việc xây dựng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"instruct\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"instructor\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"instructive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instruction-cori-81529fbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instruction-aru0-81529fbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instruction-aru5-81529fbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instruction-aru6-81529fbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instruction-aru10-81529fbd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/instruction-aru9-81529fbd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro