('eabe063c-309e-53a5-9b89-20aa6c229a42', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c07bdf48-bcb6-5980-8aca-e1b8f690696c', '959983bd-ac0a-5f2d-a32e-7a1c9c95c953', 'elementary school', '/ˌɛlɪˈmɛntəri skuːl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Trường dành cho trẻ em từ khoảng 5 đến 11 tuổi.', 'a place of learning where young children receive their first basic formal education.', 'My youngest sister just started her first year of elementary school.', 'Em gái út của tôi vừa bắt đầu năm học đầu tiên ở trường tiểu học.', '{\"en\": \"Our company donated fifty new laptops to the local elementary school last week.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã quyên góp năm mươi máy tính xách tay mới cho trường tiểu học địa phương tuần trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-ljspeech-cda03e6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-cori-cda03e6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elementary-school-4441ec5e.webp', '[\"primary school\"]', '[\"high school\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"elementary school teacher\", \"meaning\": \"giáo viên tiểu học\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attend elementary school\", \"meaning\": \"đi học tiểu học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"elemental\", \"note_vi\": \"thuộc về nguyên tố/tự nhiên\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-cori-cda03e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-aru0-cda03e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-aru5-cda03e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-aru6-cda03e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-aru10-cda03e6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-aru9-cda03e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-aru3-cda03e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elementary-school-aru7-cda03e6d.mp3\