('496cd3c2-30bd-5fe2-a797-84c9a3d2a556', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c07bdf48-bcb6-5980-8aca-e1b8f690696c', '959983bd-ac0a-5f2d-a32e-7a1c9c95c953', 'policy', '/ˈpɒləsi/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Quy tắc, kế hoạch hành động do chính phủ hoặc tổ chức đề ra.', 'a set of rules or a plan of action chosen by a business, government, or group.', 'The company has a strict policy against discrimination in the workplace.', 'Công ty có chính sách nghiêm ngặt chống lại sự phân biệt đối xử tại nơi làm việc.', '{\"en\": \"The new return policy requires customers to provide a valid receipt within thirty days.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách hoàn trả mới yêu cầu khách hàng cung cấp biên lai hợp lệ trong vòng ba mươi ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-ljspeech-9f00fad9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-cori-9f00fad9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/policy-fc75c348.webp', '[\"rule\", \"guideline\", \"procedure\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"company policy\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách công ty\"}, {\"phrase\": \"strict policy\", \"meaning\": \"chính sách nghiêm ngặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"implement a policy\", \"meaning\": \"thực thi chính sách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"police\", \"note_vi\": \"cảnh sát, khác hoàn toàn về nghĩa và cách phát âm\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-cori-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru0-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru5-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru6-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru10-9f00fad9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru9-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru3-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru7-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru8-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-aru2-9f00fad9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-ljspeech-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt408-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt138-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt624-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt396-9f00fad9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt498-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt132-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt288-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt42-9f00fad9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/policy-lt90-9f00fad9.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với động từ implement (thực thi) hoặc adopt (áp dụng) trong bài thi TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 6),
('7117a50d-30e3-5a59-8fd7-b16110f8c00c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c07bdf48-bcb6-5980-8aca-e1b8f690696c', '959983bd-ac0a-5f2d-a32e-7a1c9c95c953', 'ridicule', '/ˈrɪdɪkjuːl/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Trêu chọc, cười nhạo ai đó hoặc điều gì đó.', 'to make fun of someone or something in a mocking way.', 'It\'s unfair to ridicule someone just because they have different opinions.', 'Thật không công bằng khi chế giễu ai đó chỉ vì họ có ý kiến khác biệt.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor should never ridicule employees for making minor mistakes.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát không bao giờ nên chế giễu nhân viên vì những lỗi nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-ljspeech-28a349bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-cori-28a349bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ridicule-5ceaaea7.webp', '[\"mock\", \"taunt\", \"deride\"]', '[\"praise\", \"compliment\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ridicule someone\", \"meaning\": \"chế giễu ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"openly ridicule\", \"meaning\": \"công khai chế giễu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ridicule for\", \"meaning\": \"chế giễu vì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"riddle\", \"note_vi\": \"gần mặt chữ, nghĩa là câu đố\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ridicule\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ridiculous\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-cori-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru0-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru5-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru6-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru10-28a349bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru9-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru3-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru7-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru8-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-aru2-28a349bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-ljspeech-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt408-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt138-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt624-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt396-28a349bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt498-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt132-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt288-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt42-28a349bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ridicule-lt90-28a349bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Ridicule là chế giễu, không liên quan đến riddle (câu đố).', 'office', 1, 7),
('9550c883-e0d5-5b66-8a79-36d900791bbd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c07bdf48-bcb6-5980-8aca-e1b8f690696c', '959983bd-ac0a-5f2d-a32e-7a1c9c95c953', 'notable', '/ˈnəʊtəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đáng chú ý, nổi bật.', 'important or interesting enough to be noticed or remembered by people.', 'The company made a notable improvement in its sales figures this quarter.', 'Công ty đã đạt được sự cải thiện đáng chú ý trong doanh số bán hàng quý này.', '{\"en\": \"The new branch manager made a notable contribution to the team\'s quarterly performance.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc chi nhánh mới đã có đóng góp đáng chú ý cho hiệu suất quý của nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-ljspeech-cb9c0b0b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-cori-cb9c0b0b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/notable-80420da4.webp', '[\"remarkable\", \"significant\", \"outstanding\"]', '[\"unremarkable\", \"ordinary\", \"insignificant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"notable achievement\", \"meaning\": \"thành tích đáng chú ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"notable exception\", \"meaning\": \"ngoại lệ đáng chú ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"notable improvement\", \"meaning\": \"sự cải thiện đáng kể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"noticeable\", \"note_vi\": \"noticeable nghĩa là \'dễ nhận thấy\'; notable nhấn mạnh tầm quan trọng hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"note\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"note\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"notably\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"notation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-cori-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru0-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru5-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru6-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru10-cb9c0b0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru9-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru3-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru7-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru8-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-aru2-cb9c0b0b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-ljspeech-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt408-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt138-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt624-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt396-cb9c0b0b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt498-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt132-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt288-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt42-cb9c0b0b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/notable-lt90-cb9c0b0b.mp3\"]}}', '\'Notably\' (trạng từ) cũng hay xuất hiện trong văn bản TOEIC để nhấn mạnh điểm quan trọng.', 'business', 1, 8),
('ebf12f83-9ac9-5d1c-bbb3-bf5251460373', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c07bdf48-bcb6-5980-8aca-e1b8f690696c', '959983bd-ac0a-5f2d-a32e-7a1c9c95c953', 'aridity', '/əˈrɪdəti/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng khô cằn, thiếu độ ẩm, đặc biệt là ở khí hậu.', 'the quality of being very dry and having very little rain or water.', 'The aridity of the desert makes it challenging for plants to grow.', 'Sự khô hạn của sa mạc khiến cây cối khó phát triển.', '{\"en\": \"The extreme aridity of the region makes it difficult to maintain the landscaping around the hotel.\", \"vi\": \"Tình trạng khô cằn khắc nghiệt của khu vực khiến việc duy trì cảnh quan quanh khách sạn trở nên khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-ljspeech-8c4abebc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-cori-8c4abebc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aridity-825513c7.webp', '[\"dryness\"]', '[\"humidity\", \"moisture\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"soil aridity\", \"meaning\": \"độ khô cằn của đất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"climate aridity\", \"meaning\": \"độ khô cằn của khí hậu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"arid\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-cori-8c4abebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru0-8c4abebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru5-8c4abebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru6-8c4abebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru10-8c4abebc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru9-8c4abebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru3-8c4abebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru7-8c4abebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru8-8c4abebc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aridity-aru2-8c4abebc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"