('6c9a7039-140c-52ab-bbed-2e8c4fa17b78', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c815243a-86ed-561f-9b5f-ea06bfa9a8bc', '348793f4-a1f3-58ad-930c-16fdaf1e7539', 'amiable', '/ˈeɪmiəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dễ mến, thân thiện, hòa nhã.', 'having a pleasant and friendly manner that makes people like you.', 'The new neighbor was very amiable and quickly made friends with everyone.', 'Người hàng xóm mới rất thân thiện và nhanh chóng kết bạn với mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The amiable receptionist greeted every client with a warm smile.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ tân hòa nhã đã chào đón mọi khách hàng với nụ cười ấm áp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-ljspeech-f0c5ded9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-cori-f0c5ded9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amiable-cb140ad6.webp', '[\"friendly\", \"pleasant\"]', '[\"hostile\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"amiable character\", \"meaning\": \"tính tình dễ mến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amiable smile\", \"meaning\": \"nụ cười thân thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amiable person\", \"meaning\": \"người hòa nhã\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"amicable\", \"note_vi\": \"amicable chỉ quan hệ hòa thuận, amiable chỉ người\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"amiability\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"amiably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-cori-f0c5ded9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-aru0-f0c5ded9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-aru5-f0c5ded9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-aru6-f0c5ded9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-aru10-f0c5ded9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-aru9-f0c5ded9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-aru3-f0c5ded9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amiable-aru7-f0c5ded9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2