('5944642e-6643-5d49-976e-35249fcfe34f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c815243a-86ed-561f-9b5f-ea06bfa9a8bc', '348793f4-a1f3-58ad-930c-16fdaf1e7539', 'threatening', '/ˈθretnɪŋ/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có vẻ đe dọa, báo hiệu nguy hiểm.', 'looking dangerous or likely to cause harm, making people feel afraid or worried.', 'The dark, threatening clouds suggested a storm was coming.', 'Những đám mây đen, đầy đe dọa báo hiệu một cơn bão sắp đến.', '{\"en\": \"The manager received a threatening message from a dissatisfied client about the delayed order.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhận được một tin nhắn đe dọa từ khách hàng không hài lòng về đơn hàng bị trễ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-ljspeech-a338f2d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-cori-a338f2d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/threatening-aef4f108.webp', '[\"menacing\", \"intimidating\", \"ominous\"]', '[\"reassuring\", \"friendly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"threatening behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi đe dọa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"threatening letter\", \"meaning\": \"thư đe dọa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"threatening tone\", \"meaning\": \"giọng điệu đe dọa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"frightening\", \"note_vi\": \"frightening gây sợ hãi trực tiếp; threatening báo hiệu nguy hiểm sắp xảy ra\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"threaten\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"threat\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"threateningly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-cori-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru0-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru5-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru6-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru10-a338f2d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru9-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru3-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru7-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru8-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-aru2-a338f2d6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-ljspeech-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt408-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt138-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt624-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt396-a338f2d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt498-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt132-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt288-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt42-a338f2d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/threatening-lt90-a338f2d6.mp3\"]}}', '\'Threatening\' nhấn mạnh dấu hiệu nguy hiểm sắp đến, khác với \'frightening\' là đang gây sợ ngay lúc đó.', 'office', 1, 26),
('7b773758-1d2a-54af-90ce-bd7a0acade09', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c815243a-86ed-561f-9b5f-ea06bfa9a8bc', '348793f4-a1f3-58ad-930c-16fdaf1e7539', 'ground', '/ɡraʊnd/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Bề mặt trái đất, đất liền.', 'the solid surface of the earth that people walk or stand upon every day.', 'The ball rolled across the ground and into the bushes.', 'Quả bóng lăn trên mặt đất và vào bụi cây.', '{\"en\": \"The construction crew cleared the ground before starting the foundation for the new office building.\", \"vi\": \"Đội xây dựng đã dọn dẹp mặt bằng trước khi bắt đầu làm móng cho tòa nhà văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-ljspeech-cd12af96.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-cori-cd12af96.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ground-4b4cccb4.webp', '[\"land\", \"earth\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ground floor\", \"meaning\": \"tầng trệt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"on the ground\", \"meaning\": \"trên mặt đất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ground\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-cori-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru0-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru5-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru6-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru10-cd12af96.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru9-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru3-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru7-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru8-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-aru2-cd12af96.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-ljspeech-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt408-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt138-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt624-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt396-cd12af96.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt498-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt132-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt288-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt42-cd12af96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ground-lt90-cd12af96.mp3\"]}}', '\'Ground floor\' là tầng trệt (Anh-Anh), khác với \'first floor\' (tầng 1).', 'housing', 1, 27),
('8479b687-8098-5234-ac74-aa6821facdef', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c815243a-86ed-561f-9b5f-ea06bfa9a8bc', '348793f4-a1f3-58ad-930c-16fdaf1e7539', 'disastrous', '/dɪˈzɑːstrəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây ra hậu quả rất xấu, tai hại.', 'causing a lot of damage, failure, or very bad results for a person or organization.', 'The company\'s new product launch was a disastrous failure.', 'Việc ra mắt sản phẩm mới của công ty là một thất bại thảm hại.', '{\"en\": \"The disastrous weather conditions forced the airline to cancel all flights scheduled for the entire weekend.\", \"vi\": \"Điều kiện thời tiết thảm khốc buộc hãng hàng không phải hủy tất cả các chuyến bay dự kiến vào cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-ljspeech-69caeb9f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-cori-69caeb9f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disastrous-3f1533cd.webp', '[\"catastrophic\", \"devastating\"]', '[\"successful\", \"beneficial\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disastrous result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả tai hại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disastrous effect\", \"meaning\": \"ảnh hưởng tồi tệ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disaster\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-cori-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru0-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru5-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru6-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru10-69caeb9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru9-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru3-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru7-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru8-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-aru2-69caeb9f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-ljspeech-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt408-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt138-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt624-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt396-69caeb9f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt498-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt132-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt288-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt42-69caeb9f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disastrous-lt90-69caeb9f.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh hậu quả cực kỳ tồi tệ.', 'business', 1, 28),
('41c1ab34-063c-57c0-b5f3-1a56e8cf2e57', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c815243a-86ed-561f-9b5f-ea06bfa9a8bc', '348793f4-a1f3-58ad-930c-16fdaf1e7539', 'merry', '/ˈmeri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Vui vẻ, hân hoan và tràn đầy niềm vui.', 'feeling or showing happiness and having a very cheerful and lively mood.', 'We had a very merry time celebrating Christmas with our family.', 'Chúng tôi đã có một khoảng thời gian rất vui vẻ khi đón Giáng sinh cùng gia đình.', '{\"en\": \"The staff had a merry time at the annual holiday party held last Friday.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên đã có khoảng thời gian vui vẻ tại bữa tiệc cuối năm tổ chức thứ Sáu vừa rồi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-ljspeech-c4411116.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-cori-c4411116.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/merry-b8721259.webp', '[\"cheerful\", \"joyful\"]', '[\"sad\", \"gloomy\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"merry christmas\", \"meaning\": \"giáng sinh vui vẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"merry mood\", \"meaning\": \"tâm trạng vui vẻ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"merriment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-cori-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru0-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru5-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru6-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru10-c4411116.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru9-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru3-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru7-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru8-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-aru2-c4411116.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-ljspeech-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt408-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt138-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt624-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt396-c4411116.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt498-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt132-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt288-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt42-c4411116.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/merry-lt90-c4411116.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang sắc thái cổ điển, thường dùng trong các dịp lễ hội.', 'daily', 1, 29),
('33aee527-257c-5426-adc8-1c1eb5e51118', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c874c109-b15e-5c98-830e-66c3ca0e599a', '50290673-58dc-513c-8a39-9d6816627e05', 'inappreciable', '/ˌɪnəˈpriːʃəbəl/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Không thể nhận thấy hoặc đo lường được vì quá nhỏ.', 'so small or tiny that it cannot be easily seen, noticed, or measured.', 'The change in temperature was inappreciable, so we didn\'t notice it.', 'Sự thay đổi nhiệt độ là không đáng kể, nên chúng tôi đã không nhận ra.', '{\"en\": \"The price adjustment had an inappreciable effect on overall customer demand this month.\", \"vi\": \"Việc điều chỉnh giá có tác động không đáng kể đến nhu cầu tổng thể của khách hàng trong tháng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-ljspeech-1d6d3d2a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-cori-1d6d3d2a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inappreciable-288e8eb4.webp', '[\"imperceptible\", \"negligible\", \"insignificant\"]', '[\"appreciable\", \"significant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inappreciable difference\", \"meaning\": \"sự khác biệt không đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inappreciable effect\", \"meaning\": \"tác động không đáng kể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inappreciative\", \"note_vi\": \"inappreciative nghĩa là không biết ơn, không đánh giá cao.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"inappreciably\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-cori-1d6d3d2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-aru0-1d6d3d2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-aru5-1d6d3d2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-aru6-1d6d3d2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-aru10-1d6d3d2a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-aru9-1d6d3d2a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inappreciable-ar