('05d68b04-9913-5d66-928e-141f5d63c9e9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c874c109-b15e-5c98-830e-66c3ca0e599a', '50290673-58dc-513c-8a39-9d6816627e05', 'chief', '/tʃiːf/', 'B1', 'noun', 'người đứng đầu, lãnh đạo, thủ lĩnh.', 'a person who is in charge of a group or organization.', 'The chief of the police department announced new safety measures.', 'Cảnh sát trưởng đã công bố các biện pháp an toàn mới.', '{\"en\": \"The chief of the marketing department approved the new advertising budget yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng bộ phận tiếp thị đã phê duyệt ngân sách quảng cáo mới vào ngày hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-ljspeech-c4b038d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-cori-c4b038d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chief-4021343c.webp', '[\"leader\", \"head\", \"boss\"]', '[\"subordinate\", \"follower\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chief executive officer\", \"meaning\": \"giám đốc điều hành (CEO)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"police chief\", \"meaning\": \"trưởng cảnh sát\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chef\", \"note_vi\": \"đầu bếp trưởng, viết gần giống nhưng nghĩa khác hẳn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"chiefly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-cori-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru0-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru5-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru6-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru10-c4b038d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru9-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru3-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru7-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru8-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru2-c4b038d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-ljspeech-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt408-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt138-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt624-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt396-c4b038d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt498-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt132-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt288-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt42-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt90-c4b038d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn chính tả giữa \"chief\" (người đứng đầu) và \"chef\" (đầu bếp).', 'office', 1, 5),
('47280c06-b519-5361-9cd0-f14047194259', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c874c109-b15e-5c98-830e-66c3ca0e599a', '50290673-58dc-513c-8a39-9d6816627e05', 'worsen', 'UK: /ˈwɜːsnɪŋ/ | US: /ˈwɜrsnɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'ngày càng tệ hơn, xấu đi', 'To become increasingly bad, severe, or lower in quality than before.', 'The worsening economic situation led to job losses.', 'Tình hình kinh tế ngày càng tệ hơn đã dẫn đến mất việc làm.', '{\"en\": \"If supply chain disruptions worsen, product deliveries may be delayed by several weeks.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu tình trạng gián đoạn chuỗi cung ứng trở nên tồi tệ hơn, việc giao sản phẩm có thể bị hoãn vài tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-ljspeech-620e1b1f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-cori-620e1b1f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/worsen-7d394f23.webp', '[\"deteriorate\", \"decline\", \"exacerbate\"]', '[\"improve\", \"better\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"worsen the situation\", \"meaning\": \"làm tình hình tồi tệ hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"worsen significantly\", \"meaning\": \"xấu đi đáng kể\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"worse\", \"note_vi\": \"worse là hình thức so sánh hơn của tính từ/trạng từ \'bad\', trong khi worsen là động từ (trở nên tệ hơn)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"worse\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bad\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-cori-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru0-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru5-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru6-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru10-620e1b1f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru9-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru3-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru7-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru8-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-aru2-620e1b1f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-ljspeech-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt408-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt138-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt624-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt396-620e1b1f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt498-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt132-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt288-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt42-620e1b1f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/worsen-lt90-620e1b1f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thực chất là một động từ (to worsen). Thường đi với chủ ngữ như situation, condition, weather, conflict.', 'general business', 1, 6),
('3bcd7710-4582-55b7-92e0-cb4d215e651f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c874c109-b15e-5c98-830e-66c3ca0e599a', '50290673-58dc-513c-8a39-9d6816627e05', 'avalanche', '/ˈævəlɑːnʃ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một khối lượng lớn tuyết, băng và đá trượt nhanh xuống sườn núi.', 'a sudden fall of a large amount of snow or ice down the side of a mountain.', 'Skiers were warned about the risk of an avalanche after heavy snowfall.', 'Các vận động viên trượt tuyết đã được cảnh báo về nguy cơ tuyết lở sau trận tuyết rơi dày.', '{\"en\": \"The mountain resort closed the ski slopes due to the high risk of an avalanche today.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng trên núi đã đóng cửa các sườn dốc trượt tuyết do nguy cơ lở tuyết cao hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-ljspeech-dd99c25c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-cori-dd99c25c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/avalanche-bb9fcca1.webp', '[\"snowslide\", \"landslide\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"risk of avalanche\", \"meaning\": \"nguy cơ lở tuyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid an avalanche\", \"meaning\": \"tránh lở tuyết\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-cori-dd99c25c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru0-dd99c25c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru5-dd99c25c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru6-dd99c25c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru10-dd99c25c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru9-dd99c25c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru3-dd99c25c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru7-dd99c25c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru8-dd99c25c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/avalanche-aru2-dd99c25c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\