('d86e3fa8-9049-5ec2-9e29-c34a77163cb6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c874c109-b15e-5c98-830e-66c3ca0e599a', '50290673-58dc-513c-8a39-9d6816627e05', 'irritable', '/ˈɪrɪtəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dễ bị khó chịu, cáu kỉnh.', 'easily becoming annoyed or angry, especially when you are tired or have to wait for something.', 'Lack of sleep often makes me feel irritable and impatient.', 'Thiếu ngủ thường khiến tôi cảm thấy dễ cáu kỉnh và thiếu kiên nhẫn.', '{\"en\": \"The long delay at the airport made many passengers feel irritable and very tired today.\", \"vi\": \"Sự chậm trễ kéo dài tại sân bay khiến nhiều hành khách cảm thấy cáu kỉnh và rất mệt mỏi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-ljspeech-fdc8ebe6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-cori-fdc8ebe6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/irritable-68cc1d35.webp', '[\"grumpy\", \"annoyed\"]', '[\"calm\", \"patient\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel irritable\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy cáu kỉnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"become irritable\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên dễ cáu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"irritating\", \"note_vi\": \"irritable là cảm giác của người, irritating là gây ra cảm giác đó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"irritate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"irritation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-cori-fdc8ebe6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-aru0-fdc8ebe6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-aru5-fdc8ebe6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-aru6-fdc8ebe6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-aru10-fdc8ebe6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-aru9-fdc8ebe6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-aru3-fdc8ebe6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/irritable-aru7-fdc8ebe6.mp3\", \"/sto