('defb25a6-a288-5311-a2a7-762fe443cae1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9987783-8fc8-5cea-a649-1b22b13ae61a', '5a418ac9-d551-5b41-9521-d5cdfd4d9c8b', 'lessening', '/ˈlesnɪŋ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hành động hoặc quá trình làm cho cái gì đó ít hơn hoặc nhỏ hơn.', 'the process of becoming smaller in size, amount, degree, or importance.', 'We are hoping for a lessening of tensions between the two countries.', 'Chúng tôi đang hy vọng sự căng thẳng giữa hai nước sẽ giảm bớt.', '{\"en\": \"The company reported a gradual lessening of operational costs after implementing the new software.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty báo cáo sự giảm dần chi phí vận hành sau khi triển khai phần mềm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-ljspeech-e757c00a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-cori-e757c00a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lessening-93ccc60e.webp', '[\"reduction\", \"decrease\"]', '[\"increase\", \"growth\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lessening of tension\", \"meaning\": \"sự giảm bớt căng thẳng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lessening of impact\", \"meaning\": \"sự giảm bớt tác động\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"lessen\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-cori-e757c00a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-aru0-e757c00a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-aru5-e757c00a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-aru6-e757c00a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-aru10-e757c00a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-aru9-e757c00a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-aru3-e757c00a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-aru7-e757c00a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lessening-aru8-e757c00a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/les