('1f695fba-9494-5a8a-a07b-3c921303eaed', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9987783-8fc8-5cea-a649-1b22b13ae61a', '5a418ac9-d551-5b41-9521-d5cdfd4d9c8b', 'restoration', '/ˌrestəˈreɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự khôi phục, sửa chữa để đưa về trạng thái ban đầu hoặc tốt hơn.', 'the act of returning something to its original condition or a better state.', 'The restoration of the old painting took several years to complete.', 'Việc phục hồi bức tranh cũ đã mất vài năm để hoàn thành.', '{\"en\": \"The restoration of the historic office building will be completed by the end of June.\", \"vi\": \"Việc trùng tu tòa nhà văn phòng lịch sử sẽ được hoàn thành vào cuối tháng Sáu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-ljspeech-b4a4b6ca.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-cori-b4a4b6ca.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/restoration-80fc84a2.webp', '[\"renovation\", \"repair\"]', '[\"destruction\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"building restoration\", \"meaning\": \"trùng tu tòa nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"full restoration\", \"meaning\": \"khôi phục hoàn toàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"restore\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-cori-b4a4b6ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-aru0-b4a4b6ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-aru5-b4a4b6ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-aru6-b4a4b6ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-aru10-b4a4b6ca.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-aru9-b4a4b6ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-aru3-b4a4b6ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-aru7-b4a4b6ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/restoration-aru8-b4a4b6ca.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resto