('5c956215-7980-545a-aa7b-318e0fc804c0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9987783-8fc8-5cea-a649-1b22b13ae61a', '5a418ac9-d551-5b41-9521-d5cdfd4d9c8b', 'concerned', 'UK: /kənˈsɜːnd/ | US: /kənˈsɜrnd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'quan ngại, lo lắng', 'Feeling troubled, anxious, or worried about a particular situation, event, or problem.', 'Management is concerned about the new policy\'s impact on staff.', 'Ban quản lý quan ngại về tác động của chính sách mới lên nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"Management is deeply concerned about the rising costs of raw materials.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý rất lo ngại về chi phí nguyên vật liệu ngày càng tăng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-ljspeech-aac69b54.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-cori-aac69b54.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/concerned-a161b70a.webp', '[\"worried\", \"anxious\", \"apprehensive\"]', '[\"unconcerned\", \"calm\", \"indifferent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be concerned about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"as far as ... is concerned\", \"meaning\": \"theo như ... được biết / liên quan tới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"concerned party\", \"meaning\": \"bên liên quan\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"concern\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"concern\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-cori-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru0-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru5-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru6-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru10-aac69b54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru9-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru3-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru7-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru8-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-aru2-aac69b54.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-ljspeech-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt408-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt138-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt624-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt396-aac69b54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt498-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt132-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt288-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt42-aac69b54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concerned-lt90-aac69b54.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'concerned about/for\' (lo lắng về) và \'concerned with\' (liên quan đến, đề cập đến).', 'office', 1, 19),
('219b3749-47cb-5124-b884-829643e8fe74', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9987783-8fc8-5cea-a649-1b22b13ae61a', '5a418ac9-d551-5b41-9521-d5cdfd4d9c8b', 'deepen', 'UK: /ˈdiː.pən/ | US: /ˈdiː.pən/', 'B2', 'verb', 'làm sâu hơn', 'To make something become more profound, intense, or extend further downward.', 'They plan to deepen the river for larger boats.', 'Họ dự định nạo vét sông sâu hơn cho những con thuyền lớn hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The strategic merger will help both corporations deepen their presence in the Asian market.\", \"vi\": \"Vụ sáp nhập chiến lược sẽ giúp cả hai tập đoàn tăng cường/củng cố sự hiện diện tại thị trường châu Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-ljspeech-1931162a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-cori-1931162a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deepen-fce4ea50.webp', '[\"intensify\", \"strengthen\", \"expand\"]', '[\"weaken\", \"lessen\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deepen cooperation\", \"meaning\": \"thắt chặt hợp tác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deepen understanding\", \"meaning\": \"hiểu rõ/sâu sắc hơn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"deep\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"depth\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"deeply\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-cori-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru0-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru5-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru6-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru10-1931162a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru9-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru3-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru7-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deepen-aru8-1931162a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu