('3e1c8985-7ac0-5324-a9b1-0b17104b9bf8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9987783-8fc8-5cea-a649-1b22b13ae61a', '5a418ac9-d551-5b41-9521-d5cdfd4d9c8b', 'conform', '/kənˈfɔːm/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Tuân theo các quy tắc, tiêu chuẩn hoặc mong đợi.', 'to act in accordance with established regulations, accepted standards, or expected behavior.', 'All imported food products must conform to strict national quality standards.', 'Tất cả các sản phẩm thực phẩm nhập khẩu phải tuân thủ các tiêu chuẩn chất lượng quốc gia nghiêm ngặt.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must conform to the company\'s safety guidelines during factory shifts.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải tuân theo hướng dẫn an toàn của công ty trong ca làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-ljspeech-921bfebf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-cori-921bfebf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conform-1bec056c.webp', '[\"comply\", \"obey\", \"follow\"]', '[\"violate\", \"rebel\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conform to regulations\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ quy định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conform with standards\", \"meaning\": \"phù hợp với tiêu chuẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conform to expectations\", \"meaning\": \"đáp ứng kỳ vọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confirm\", \"note_vi\": \"confirm là xác nhận, conform là tuân thủ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conformity\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conformable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-cori-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru0-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru5-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru6-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru10-921bfebf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru9-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru3-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru7-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru8-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-aru2-921bfebf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-ljspeech-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt408-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt138-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt624-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt396-921bfebf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt498-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt132-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt288-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt42-921bfebf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conform-lt90-921bfebf.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm với confirm (xác nhận); nhớ conform có chữ \'form\' như form quy tắc.', 'manufacturing', 1, 22),
('32c29dba-fa46-52b0-ae29-34470835d9f7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9987783-8fc8-5cea-a649-1b22b13ae61a', '5a418ac9-d551-5b41-9521-d5cdfd4d9c8b', 'gullible', '/ˈɡʌləbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dễ bị lừa hoặc tin người khác, thiếu cảnh giác.', 'easily tricked because of trusting other people too much without thinking carefully.', 'My younger brother is so gullible; he believes almost everything I tell him.', 'Em trai tôi thật cả tin; nó tin gần như mọi điều tôi nói với nó.', '{\"en\": \"Customers should not be gullible when reading unverified promotional offers on social media.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng không nên quá nhẹ nhẹ dạ tin người khi đọc các ưu đãi quảng cáo chưa xác minh trên mạng xã hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-ljspeech-0b4b5ba7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-cori-0b4b5ba7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gullible-ca42bd69.webp', '[\"naive\", \"trusting\", \"credulous\"]', '[\"cynical\", \"suspicious\", \"skeptical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gullible public\", \"meaning\": \"công chúng nhẹ dạ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gullible consumer\", \"meaning\": \"người tiêu dùng dễ bị lừa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"credible\", \"note_vi\": \"credible là đáng tin, gullible là nhẹ dạ dễ bị lừa.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gullibility\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-cori-0b4b5ba7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-aru0-0b4b5ba7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-aru5-0b4b5ba7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-aru6-0b4b5ba7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-aru10-0b4b5ba7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-aru9-0b4b5ba7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-aru3-0b4b5ba7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gullible-ar