('8b125ea4-2cc7-55fb-bf76-2393e66470b4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9987783-8fc8-5cea-a649-1b22b13ae61a', '5a418ac9-d551-5b41-9521-d5cdfd4d9c8b', 'delighted', '/dɪˈlaɪtɪd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất vui vẻ, hài lòng về điều gì đó.', 'feeling or showing great pleasure, happiness, and satisfaction about a particular situation.', 'She was absolutely delighted with the surprise gift.', 'Cô ấy vô cùng vui mừng với món quà bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO was delighted with the quarterly financial report showing a significant increase in profits.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành rất hài lòng với báo cáo tài chính quý cho thấy sự gia tăng lợi nhuận đáng kể.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-ljspeech-17d0ecd7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-cori-17d0ecd7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delighted-6bd2596d.webp', '[\"thrilled\", \"overjoyed\", \"pleased\"]', '[\"disappointed\", \"displeased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"delighted with\", \"meaning\": \"vui mừng về điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delighted to do\", \"meaning\": \"rất vui khi làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"absolutely delighted\", \"meaning\": \"cực kỳ hài lòng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"delightful\", \"note_vi\": \"delighted miêu tả cảm xúc con người, delightedful miêu tả đặc điểm sự vật.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"delight\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"delight\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"delightful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"delightedly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-cori-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru0-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru5-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru6-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru10-17d0ecd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru9-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru3-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru7-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru8-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-aru2-17d0ecd7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-ljspeech-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt408-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt138-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt624-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt396-17d0ecd7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt498-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt132-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt288-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt42-17d0ecd7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delighted-lt90-17d0ecd7.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: delighted with/at something hoặc delighted to do something.', 'business', 1, 24),
('3cfa38d7-586d-5297-887b-7d12f1fe08db', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9987783-8fc8-5cea-a649-1b22b13ae61a', '5a418ac9-d551-5b41-9521-d5cdfd4d9c8b', 'profess', '/prəˈfes/', 'C2', 'verb', 'Công khai tuyên bố hoặc khẳng định một niềm tin hay cảm xúc.', 'to claim that something is true, often when it might not be.', 'He professed his love for her in front of everyone.', 'Anh ấy đã công khai tuyên bố tình yêu của mình dành cho cô ấy trước mặt mọi người.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate professed to have extensive experience in international trade during the interview.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên đã khẳng định mình có kinh nghiệm dày dặn trong thương mại quốc tế trong buổi phỏng vấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-ljspeech-fe0b27df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-cori-fe0b27df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/profess-28b45f06.webp', '[\"claim\", \"declare\"]', '[\"deny\", \"conceal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"profess to be\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"profess ignorance\", \"meaning\": \"tỏ ra không biết\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"profession\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"professional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-cori-fe0b27df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-aru0-fe0b27df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-aru5-fe0b27df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-aru6-fe0b27df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-aru10-fe0b27df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-aru9-fe0b27df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-aru3-fe0b27df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-aru7-fe0b27df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profess-aru8-fe0b27df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation