('d7ac0896-7c19-53e8-b886-582ab70102d7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'stunning', '/ˈstʌnɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Đẹp lộng lẫy, làm choáng váng vì vẻ đẹp.', 'extremely attractive or impressive in appearance, making people feel very surprised and full of admiration.', 'The architect presented a stunning design for the new headquarters building.', 'Kiến trúc sư đã trình bày một thiết kế vô cùng ấn tượng cho tòa nhà trụ sở mới.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel offers a stunning view of the ocean from every single guest room window.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp tầm nhìn tuyệt đẹp ra đại dương từ cửa sổ của mỗi phòng khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-ljspeech-00cf3e92.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-cori-00cf3e92.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stunning-13f1da5a.webp', '[\"beautiful\", \"impressive\"]', '[\"ugly\", \"plain\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stunning view\", \"meaning\": \"tầm nhìn tuyệt đẹp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stunning success\", \"meaning\": \"thành công rực rỡ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stun\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"stunningly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-cori-00cf3e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-aru0-00cf3e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-aru5-00cf3e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-aru6-00cf3e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-aru10-00cf3e92.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-aru9-00cf3e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-aru3-00cf3e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-aru7-00cf3e92.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stunning-aru8-00cf3e92.mp3\", \"/s