('8b13723e-a898-52fc-916d-b3960b795faf', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'wise', 'UK: /waɪz/ | US: /waɪz/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'khôn ngoan, sáng suốt', 'having or showing good judgment, knowledge, and common sense based on experience.', 'It is wise to save money for future investments.', 'Tiết kiệm tiền cho các khoản đầu tư trong tương lai là điều khôn ngoan.', '{\"en\": \"Consulting with a financial adviser is a wise step before making major investments.\", \"vi\": \"Tham vấn cố vấn tài chính là một bước đi sáng suốt trước khi thực hiện các khoản đầu tư lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-ljspeech-cb129d1d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-cori-cb129d1d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wise-fab2965f.webp', '[\"prudent\", \"sensible\", \"judicious\", \"shrewd\"]', '[\"foolish\", \"unwise\", \"imprudent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wise decision\", \"meaning\": \"quyết định sáng suốt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wise investment\", \"meaning\": \"khoản đầu tư khôn ngoan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wish\", \"note_vi\": \"\'wish\' nghĩa là ước/mong muốn, phát âm khác với \'wise\' (sáng suốt).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wisdom\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"wisely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-cori-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru0-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru5-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru6-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru10-cb129d1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru9-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru3-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru7-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru8-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-aru2-cb129d1d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-ljspeech-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt408-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt138-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt624-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt396-cb129d1d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt498-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt132-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt288-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt42-cb129d1d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wise-lt90-cb129d1d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi trong cấu trúc \'It is wise to do sth\' (Thật sáng suốt khi làm việc gì).', 'management', 1, 5),
('4902daa3-23d4-581c-9fa2-6823e0b42a50', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'surrender', '/səˈrendə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự đầu hàng, nhượng bộ.', 'the act of stopping resistance and giving control to another person or group.', 'The rebellious soldiers were forced to surrender after running out of ammunition.', 'Những người lính nổi dậy buộc phải đầu hàng sau khi hết đạn dược.', '{\"en\": \"After long negotiations, the firm accepted the surrender of the penalty clause.\", \"vi\": \"Sau cuộc đàm phán dài, công ty chấp nhận nhượng bộ điều khoản phạt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-ljspeech-3647690b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-cori-3647690b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surrender-d2c892dd.webp', '[\"capitulation\", \"submission\"]', '[\"resistance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unconditional surrender\", \"meaning\": \"sự đầu hàng vô điều kiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surrender of rights\", \"meaning\": \"sự từ bỏ quyền lợi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"surround\", \"note_vi\": \"surround là bao quanh, không phải đầu hàng\"}, {\"word\": \"render\", \"note_vi\": \"render là làm cho, không phải đầu hàng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"surrender\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-cori-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru0-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru5-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru6-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru10-3647690b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru9-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru3-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru7-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru8-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-aru2-3647690b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-ljspeech-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt408-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt138-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt624-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt396-3647690b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt498-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt132-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt288-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt42-3647690b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surrender-lt90-3647690b.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhầm với surround (bao quanh) do gần giống mặt chữ.', 'business', 1, 6),
('e537b92d-6b95-5aaa-ac00-1ffb56ec72cf', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'overpower', '/ˌəʊvəˈpaʊə(r)/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Đánh bại hoặc kiểm soát ai đó/cái gì đó bằng sức mạnh vượt trội.', 'to defeat someone or something by using much more strength, power, or influence than them.', 'The new operating system will completely overpower the old one in terms of speed and features.', 'Hệ điều hành mới sẽ hoàn toàn áp đảo cái cũ về tốc độ và tính năng.', '{\"en\": \"The strong demand for the new product will likely overpower the current supply chain capacity.\", \"vi\": \"Nhu cầu mạnh mẽ đối với sản phẩm mới có khả năng sẽ vượt xa năng lực chuỗi cung ứng hiện tại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-ljspeech-4718c155.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-cori-4718c155.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overpower-8a31dad8.webp', '[\"overwhelm\", \"defeat\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"overpower the market\", \"meaning\": \"áp đảo thị trường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overpower the competition\", \"meaning\": \"vượt qua đối thủ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"power\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"powerful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-cori-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru0-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru5-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru6-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru10-4718c155.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru9-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru3-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru7-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru8-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-aru2-4718c155.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-ljspeech-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt408-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt138-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt624-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt396-4718c155.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt498-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt132-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt288-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt42-4718c155.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overpower-lt90-4718c155.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh cạnh tranh hoặc áp lực công việc.', 'business', 1, 7),
('05001bf9-de87-535d-af6e-aa44563471b4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'noncritical', '/ˌnɒnˈkrɪtɪkl̩/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không quan trọng, không cấp thiết.', 'not essential or necessary for the success or completion of a specific task.', 'Please prioritize the critical tasks and leave the noncritical ones for later.', 'Vui lòng ưu tiên các nhiệm vụ quan trọng và để lại những việc không cấp thiết sau.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked us to focus on urgent reports and ignore noncritical emails for now.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý yêu cầu chúng tôi tập trung vào các báo cáo khẩn cấp và tạm thời bỏ qua các email không quan trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-ljspeech-b5ba36f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-cori-b5ba36f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/noncritical-1112cd13.webp', '[\"unimportant\", \"minor\"]', '[\"critical\", \"essential\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"noncritical task\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệm vụ không quan trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"noncritical error\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi không nghiêm trọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"critical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-cori-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru0-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru5-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru6-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru10-b5ba36f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru9-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru3-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru7-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru8-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-aru2-b5ba36f2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-ljspeech-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt408-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt138-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt624-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt396-b5ba36f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt498-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt132-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt288-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt42-b5ba36f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/noncritical-lt90-b5ba36f2.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để phân loại mức độ ưu tiên công việc trong quản lý dự án.', 'office', 1, 8)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('e4bd2c94-eb8f-5853-9ebb-74505ea612a5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'presence', '/ˈprɛz.əns/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Việc có mặt hoặc tồn tại ở một nơi cụ thể.', 'the state of being in a particular place or existing in a situation.', 'Her calm presence helped everyone feel more relaxed during the crisis.', 'Sự hiện diện điềm tĩnh của cô ấy đã giúp mọi người cảm thấy thư thái hơn trong suốt cuộc khủng hoảng.', '{\"en\": \"The firm established a strong online presence to reach more international customers this year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thiết lập sự hiện diện trực tuyến mạnh mẽ để tiếp cận nhiều khách hàng quốc tế hơn trong năm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-ljspeech-f65997ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-cori-f65997ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/presence-b2af3623.webp', '[\"existence\", \"attendance\"]', '[\"absence\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"online presence\", \"meaning\": \"sự hiện diện trực tuyến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"global presence\", \"meaning\": \"sự hiện diện toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in the presence of\", \"meaning\": \"trước sự có mặt của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"presents\", \"note_vi\": \"presents là danh từ số nhiều (món quà) hoặc động từ chia số ít (trình bày)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"present\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-cori-f65997ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-aru0-f65997ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-aru5-f65997ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-aru6-f65997ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-aru10-f65997ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-aru9-f65997ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/presence-aru3-f