('df90b28b-1a72-5d33-aa67-55a10de82fd2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'contentment', '/kənˈtentmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác thỏa mãn, hạnh phúc với những gì mình có.', 'a state of happiness and satisfaction with your life or situation.', 'After a long day of work, he found contentment in a quiet evening at home.', 'Sau một ngày làm việc dài, anh ấy tìm thấy sự hài lòng trong một buổi tối yên tĩnh ở nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The company aims to improve employee contentment by offering flexible working hours and bonuses.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đặt mục tiêu cải thiện sự hài lòng của nhân viên bằng cách cung cấp giờ làm việc linh hoạt và tiền thưởng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-ljspeech-1ac2c570.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-cori-1ac2c570.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contentment-c0761039.webp', '[\"satisfaction\", \"happiness\", \"pleasure\"]', '[\"discontent\", \"dissatisfaction\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"find contentment\", \"meaning\": \"tìm thấy sự mãn nguyện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep contentment\", \"meaning\": \"sự mãn nguyện sâu sắc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"content\", \"note_vi\": \"content vừa là tính từ (hài lòng) vừa là danh từ (nội dung)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"content\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"content\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-cori-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru0-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru5-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru6-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru10-1ac2c570.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru9-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru3-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru7-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru8-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-aru2-1ac2c570.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-ljspeech-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt408-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt138-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt624-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt396-1ac2c570.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt498-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt132-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt288-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt42-1ac2c570.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contentment-lt90-1ac2c570.mp3\"]}}', 'Là danh từ chỉ trạng thái hài lòng, mãn nguyện với hiện tại.', 'hr', 1, 10),
('28adea88-69a1-5314-b475-fb615ab8277b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'cost-effective', '/ˌkɒst ɪˈfɛktɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Mang lại hiệu quả tốt so với chi phí bỏ ra.', 'giving good value or profit in relation to the amount of money spent.', 'Solar panels are becoming more cost-effective for homes.', 'Các tấm pin năng lượng mặt trời đang ngày càng hiệu quả về chi phí cho các hộ gia đình.', '{\"en\": \"Switching to digital billing proved to be a highly cost-effective solution for the accounting department.\", \"vi\": \"Chuyển sang hóa đơn điện tử hóa ra là một giải pháp rất hiệu quả về chi phí cho bộ phận kế toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-ljspeech-ec6f4d3a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-cori-ec6f4d3a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cost-effective-3d584076.webp', '[\"economical\", \"cost-efficient\"]', '[\"uneconomical\", \"costly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cost-effective solution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp hiệu quả về chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly cost-effective\", \"meaning\": \"rất hiệu quả về chi phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cost-effective measure\", \"meaning\": \"biện pháp tiết kiệm chi phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cheap\", \"note_vi\": \"Cheap là giá rẻ (đôi khi chất lượng kém), khác với hiệu quả tốt so với chi phí.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"cost-effectiveness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-cori-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru0-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru5-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru6-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru10-ec6f4d3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru9-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru3-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru7-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru8-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-aru2-ec6f4d3a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-ljspeech-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt408-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt138-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt624-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt396-ec6f4d3a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt498-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt132-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt288-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt42-ec6f4d3a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cost-effective-lt90-ec6f4d3a.mp3\"]}}', 'Khác với \'cheap\' (rẻ), từ này nhấn mạnh giá trị mang lại xứng đáng với số tiền chi ra.', 'finance', 1, 11),
('1690dc00-46ab-53cc-ba30-57a5c36ba16b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'boycott', '/ˈbɔɪkɒt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'từ chối mua, sử dụng sản phẩm, hoặc tham gia để phản đối.', 'to stop buying or using something as a way of showing strong public disagreement.', 'Consumers decided to boycott the brand due to its unethical labor practices.', 'Người tiêu dùng quyết định tẩy chay nhãn hiệu đó vì các hành vi lao động phi đạo đức của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The union members decided to boycott the company until they improve the working conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên công đoàn quyết định tẩy chay công ty cho đến khi họ cải thiện điều kiện làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-ljspeech-c5ed859b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-cori-c5ed859b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/boycott-ed71dee0.webp', '[\"reject\", \"avoid\"]', '[\"support\", \"patronize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"boycott a product\", \"meaning\": \"tẩy chay một sản phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"organize a boycott\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức một cuộc tẩy chay\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"boycott\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-cori-c5ed859b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-aru0-c5ed859b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-aru5-c5ed859b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-aru6-c5ed859b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-aru10-c5ed859b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-aru9-c5ed859b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-aru3-c5ed859b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-aru7-c5ed859b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boycott-aru8-c5ed859b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu