('800ac20e-6e52-5b2e-8855-d2e170058c75', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'subtle', '/ˈsʌtl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Khó nhận ra, không rõ ràng nhưng có ý nghĩa sâu sắc; tinh xảo.', 'not loud, bright, noticeable, or obvious in any way.', 'She gave a subtle hint that she wasn\'t happy with the decision.', 'Cô ấy đã đưa ra một gợi ý tinh tế rằng cô ấy không hài lòng với quyết định đó.', '{\"en\": \"There are subtle differences between the two marketing strategies proposed by the team.\", \"vi\": \"Có những sự khác biệt tinh tế giữa hai chiến lược tiếp thị do nhóm đề xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-ljspeech-10a4d47a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-cori-10a4d47a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/subtle-050e21fe.webp', '[\"delicate\", \"slight\", \"understated\"]', '[\"obvious\", \"noticeable\", \"harsh\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"subtle difference\", \"meaning\": \"sự khác biệt tinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"subtle hint\", \"meaning\": \"gợi ý ngầm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"supple\", \"note_vi\": \"supple nghĩa là mềm dẻo, dễ uốn nắn, dễ nhầm với subtle.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"subtlety\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"subtly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-cori-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru0-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru5-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru6-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru10-10a4d47a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru9-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru3-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subtle-aru7-10a4d47a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pr