('4da3e5d9-105e-50f3-b9da-aca2f8622ee8', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'c9d61f8c-b78e-5b32-829d-37707d82cf3d', '626443c0-0139-5721-9731-ceab336b203c', 'practically', '/ˈpræktɪkli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Gần như, hầu như, hoặc theo một cách thực tế.', 'almost completely, or in a way that relates to real situations rather than ideas.', 'After finishing the marathon, he was practically unable to walk.', 'Sau khi hoàn thành cuộc chạy marathon, anh ấy hầu như không thể đi được.', '{\"en\": \"The new software is practically identical to the previous version we used last year.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm mới gần như giống hệt phiên bản trước mà chúng ta đã dùng năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-ljspeech-99fb355f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-cori-99fb355f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/practically-df288683.webp', '[\"almost\", \"virtually\", \"nearly\"]', '[\"hardly\", \"barely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"practically impossible\", \"meaning\": \"gần như không thể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"practically identical\", \"meaning\": \"gần như giống hệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"practicably\", \"note_vi\": \"practicably là có thể thực hiện được, practically là gần như.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"practical\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"practicality\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-cori-99fb355f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-aru0-99fb355f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-aru5-99fb355f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-aru6-99fb355f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-aru10-99fb355f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-aru9-99fb355f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/practically-aru3-99fb355f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p