('4a7c2650-762b-5e5b-a5f1-d2813b2f3f1b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'caaedb64-fac2-59ca-ad94-e9ea9156a7b3', '9136058f-d115-5ac3-a832-fd53ab18438d', 'involved', '/ɪnˈvɒlvd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Phức tạp, rắc rối.', 'complicated and difficult to follow or understand clearly.', 'The plot of the novel was so involved that it required careful attention to follow.', 'Cốt truyện của cuốn tiểu thuyết phức tạp đến mức cần phải chú ý kỹ để theo dõi.', '{\"en\": \"The involved contract negotiations took several weeks to finalize with the client.\", \"vi\": \"Cuộc đàm phán hợp đồng phức tạp mất vài tuần để chốt với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-ljspeech-58b2f303.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-cori-58b2f303.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/involved-edde16b7.webp', '[\"complicated\", \"complex\", \"intricate\"]', '[\"simple\", \"straightforward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"involved process\", \"meaning\": \"quy trình phức tạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly involved\", \"meaning\": \"rất rắc rối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"evolved\", \"note_vi\": \"evolved nghĩa là tiến hóa, không phải phức tạp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"involve\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"involvement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-cori-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru0-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru5-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru6-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru10-58b2f303.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru9-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru3-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru7-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru8-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-aru2-58b2f303.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-ljspeech-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt408-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt138-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt624-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt396-58b2f303.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt498-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt132-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt288-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt42-58b2f303.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/involved-lt90-58b2f303.mp3\"]}}', 'Involved có thể là tính từ của involve, nghĩa \'phức tạp\'.', 'business', 1, 1),
('8874a940-e82c-55af-a4c7-2a1172d4f133', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'caaedb64-fac2-59ca-ad94-e9ea9156a7b3', '9136058f-d115-5ac3-a832-fd53ab18438d', 'paper-thin', '/ˈpeɪpəˌθɪn/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rất mỏng, mỏng như tờ giấy.', 'extremely thin, almost as thin as a single sheet of paper.', 'The walls in the old apartment were paper-thin, so you could hear everything.', 'Những bức tường trong căn hộ cũ mỏng như giấy, nên bạn có thể nghe thấy mọi thứ.', '{\"en\": \"The new laptop features a paper-thin display that significantly reduces the overall weight of the device.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc máy tính xách tay mới có màn hình mỏng như giấy giúp giảm đáng kể trọng lượng tổng thể của thiết bị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-ljspeech-30895daf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-cori-30895daf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/paper-thin-4648db3f.webp', '[\"ultra-thin\", \"delicate\", \"flimsy\"]', '[\"thick\", \"bulky\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"paper-thin walls\", \"meaning\": \"tường mỏng dính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"paper-thin slices\", \"meaning\": \"lát cắt mỏng như giấy\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-cori-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru0-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru5-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru6-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru10-30895daf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru9-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru3-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru7-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru8-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-aru2-30895daf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-ljspeech-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt408-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt138-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt624-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt396-30895daf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt498-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt132-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt288-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt42-30895daf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paper-thin-lt90-30895daf.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để miêu tả đồ công nghệ mỏng nhẹ hoặc tường cách âm kém.', 'technology', 1, 2),
('6c5ea3b1-483f-5a6f-a9b5-63aff05ff379', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'caaedb64-fac2-59ca-ad94-e9ea9156a7b3', '9136058f-d115-5ac3-a832-fd53ab18438d', 'convey', '/kənˈveɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Truyền đạt thông tin, cảm xúc hoặc ý nghĩa.', 'to communicate or express information, feelings, or ideas to someone.', 'The artist used bright colors to convey a sense of joy.', 'Người nghệ sĩ đã dùng màu sắc tươi sáng để truyền tải cảm giác vui vẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The memo was written to convey the new company policy to all staff.\", \"vi\": \"Bản ghi nhớ được viết để truyền đạt chính sách mới của công ty đến toàn bộ nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-ljspeech-3fe6fc09.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-cori-3fe6fc09.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/convey-77b8563f.webp', '[\"communicate\", \"express\", \"transmit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"convey a message\", \"meaning\": \"truyền đạt một thông điệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convey information\", \"meaning\": \"truyền đạt thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"convey feelings\", \"meaning\": \"truyền đạt cảm xúc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"convert\", \"note_vi\": \"convert là chuyển đổi, convey là truyền đạt hoặc vận chuyển\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conveyance\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conveyor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-cori-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru0-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru5-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru6-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru10-3fe6fc09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru9-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru3-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru7-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru8-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-aru2-3fe6fc09.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-ljspeech-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt408-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt138-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt624-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt396-3fe6fc09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt498-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt132-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt288-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt42-3fe6fc09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/convey-lt90-3fe6fc09.mp3\"]}}', '\"Convey\" thường dùng trong văn phong trang trọng khi truyền đạt thông tin hoặc ý nghĩa.', 'office', 1, 3),
('7fe811f6-74ef-5781-866e-4305778df62b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'caaedb64-fac2-59ca-ad94-e9ea9156a7b3', '9136058f-d115-5ac3-a832-fd53ab18438d', 'surge', '/sɜːdʒ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Tăng vọt, dâng trào mạnh mẽ hoặc di chuyển nhanh chóng.', 'to increase suddenly and strongly, or to move forward quickly in a large body.', 'Online sales experienced a massive surge during the holiday shopping weekend.', 'Doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến đã trải qua sự tăng mạnh trong cuối tuần mua sắm kỳ nghỉ.', '{\"en\": \"Online sales began to surge significantly after the department launched its new online marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến bắt đầu tăng vọt đáng kể sau khi bộ phận khởi động chiến dịch tiếp thị trực tuyến mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-ljspeech-c5b9c04c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-cori-c5b9c04c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surge-8ca74d7d.webp', '[\"soar\", \"spike\", \"gush\"]', '[\"plummet\", \"decline\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"surge dramatically\", \"meaning\": \"tăng vọt một cách dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"surge forward\", \"meaning\": \"trào dâng về phía trước\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"purge\", \"note_vi\": \"Purge nghĩa là thanh lọc hoặc loại bỏ, không phải tăng vọt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surge\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-cori-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru0-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru5-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru6-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru10-c5b9c04c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru9-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru3-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru7-c5b9c04c.mp3\", 