('efac6ddd-30f2-54a0-b7b9-76af45c6b8f7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cad40c56-dd08-5f3b-bc54-636b0b38cd91', 'ec5d7e7a-811b-59ab-b517-4aaf75016529', 'chapter', 'UK: /ˈtʃæptə/ | US: /ˈtʃæptər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'chương (sách)', 'One of the main sections into which a book or text is divided.', 'Please read the first chapter of the book.', 'Vui lòng đọc chương đầu tiên của cuốn sách.', '{\"en\": \"Please review the second chapter of the employee handbook before your first day of work.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xem lại chương thứ hai của sổ tay nhân viên trước ngày làm việc đầu tiên của bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-ljspeech-09d4c7f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-cori-09d4c7f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chapter-6c15cd20.webp', '[\"section\", \"division\", \"part\", \"unit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"final chapter\", \"meaning\": \"chương cuối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local chapter\", \"meaning\": \"chi nhánh / hội nhóm địa phương\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-cori-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru0-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru5-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru6-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru10-09d4c7f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru9-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru3-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru7-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru8-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-aru2-09d4c7f1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-ljspeech-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt408-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt138-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt624-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt396-09d4c7f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt498-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt132-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt288-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt42-09d4c7f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chapter-lt90-09d4c7f1.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa chương sách, \'chapter\' còn dùng trong kinh doanh để chỉ một chi nhánh/hội nhóm địa phương của một tổ chức lớn.', 'publishing', 1, 0),
('cd0e5bbb-8b51-56f3-b727-c5ec3e4cf8aa', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cad40c56-dd08-5f3b-bc54-636b0b38cd91', 'ec5d7e7a-811b-59ab-b517-4aaf75016529', 'unsettling', '/ʌnˈsetlɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây bất an, lo lắng hoặc khó chịu.', 'making you feel slightly worried, anxious, or uncomfortable about a situation or event.', 'The sudden silence in the forest was quite unsettling.', 'Sự im lặng đột ngột trong rừng khá là bất an.', '{\"en\": \"The unsettling news about the company\'s financial losses caused concern among the major shareholders.\", \"vi\": \"Tin tức đáng lo ngại về các khoản lỗ tài chính của công ty đã gây lo lắng cho các cổ đông lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-ljspeech-18aa76d6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-cori-18aa76d6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unsettling-a8fd61c3.webp', '[\"disturbing\", \"worrying\"]', '[\"comforting\", \"reassuring\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unsettling news\", \"meaning\": \"tin tức đáng lo ngại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unsettling experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm gây bất an\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"unsettle\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-cori-18aa76d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-aru0-18aa76d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-aru5-18aa76d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-aru6-18aa76d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-aru10-18aa76d6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-aru9-18aa76d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-aru3-18aa76d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-aru7-18aa76d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unsettling-aru8-18aa76d6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/u