('25eb3cc6-ef9e-5ec2-ac78-118fa3586219', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cad40c56-dd08-5f3b-bc54-636b0b38cd91', 'ec5d7e7a-811b-59ab-b517-4aaf75016529', 'apparently', '/əˈpærəntli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Rõ ràng là, dường như là (dựa trên thông tin có được).', 'according to what you have heard or read, although it May not be true.', 'Apparently, it\'s going to rain tomorrow, so we should bring umbrellas.', 'Dường như ngày mai trời sẽ mưa, nên chúng ta nên mang ô.', '{\"en\": \"Apparently, the quarterly financial report was delayed because of a technical issue.\", \"vi\": \"Rõ ràng là báo cáo tài chính hàng quý đã bị trì hoãn do sự cố kỹ thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-ljspeech-5715ee98.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-cori-5715ee98.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/apparently-c2cb0808.webp', '[\"seemingly\", \"evidently\", \"ostensibly\"]', '[\"definitely\", \"certainly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"apparently simple\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn qua thì đơn giản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"apparently not\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ như là không\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"obviously\", \"note_vi\": \"obviously là rõ ràng hiển nhiên, còn word này mang ý nghe nói/thấy vậy.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"apparent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-cori-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru0-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru5-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru6-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru10-5715ee98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru9-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru3-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru7-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru8-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-aru2-5715ee98.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-ljspeech-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt408-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt138-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt624-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt396-5715ee98.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt498-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt132-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt288-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt42-5715ee98.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/apparently-lt90-5715ee98.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi bạn nghe thông tin từ người khác chứ chưa chắc chắn 100%.', 'office', 1, 8),
('023a10a4-0206-5790-9829-d94aa3c88f29', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cad40c56-dd08-5f3b-bc54-636b0b38cd91', 'ec5d7e7a-811b-59ab-b517-4aaf75016529', 'insolent', '/ˈɪnsələnt/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Hỗn xược, vô lễ, thể hiện sự thiếu tôn trọng.', 'behaving in a rude way that shows a lack of respect for other people.', 'The manager fired the employee for his insolent remarks to a customer.', 'Người quản lý đã sa thải nhân viên vì những lời lẽ hỗn xược của anh ta với khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor warned the staff that insolent behavior will lead to immediate disciplinary action.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát cảnh báo nhân viên rằng thái độ vô lễ sẽ dẫn đến kỷ luật ngay lập tức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-ljspeech-28d9ab8c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-cori-28d9ab8c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/insolent-65e87afb.webp', '[\"rude\", \"impolite\"]', '[\"polite\", \"respectful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"insolent behavior\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ hỗn xược\"}, {\"phrase\": \"insolent remark\", \"meaning\": \"lời nhận xét vô lễ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"insolence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-cori-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru0-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru5-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru6-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru10-28d9ab8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru9-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru3-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru7-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru8-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-aru2-28d9ab8c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-ljspeech-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt408-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt138-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt624-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt396-28d9ab8c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt498-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt132-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt288-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt42-28d9ab8c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/insolent-lt90-28d9ab8c.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ hành vi thiếu tôn trọng cấp trên hoặc khách hàng.', 'hr', 1, 9),
('4acfd419-d677-54a7-bb0e-1879759ecb15', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cad40c56-dd08-5f3b-bc54-636b0b38cd91', 'ec5d7e7a-811b-59ab-b517-4aaf75016529', 'critique', '/krɪˈtiːk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một bài phân tích và đánh giá chi tiết về một tác phẩm hoặc ý tưởng.', 'a detailed analysis and assessment of something, often written by an expert or a reviewer.', 'Her critique of the new art exhibition was insightful and well-received.', 'Bài phê bình của cô ấy về triển lãm nghệ thuật mới rất sâu sắc và được đón nhận nồng nhiệt.', '{\"en\": \"The director asked for a written critique of the marketing campaign from the entire team.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã yêu cầu một bài đánh giá bằng văn bản về chiến dịch tiếp thị từ toàn bộ đội ngũ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-ljspeech-e08906a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-cori-e08906a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/critique-d2995fd2.webp', '[\"analysis\", \"assessment\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"write a critique\", \"meaning\": \"viết bài đánh giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"offer a critique\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra nhận xét\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"criticism\", \"note_vi\": \"Critique là đánh giá chuyên môn, criticism là chỉ trích tiêu cực.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"critic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"critical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-cori-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru0-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru5-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru6-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru10-e08906a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru9-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru3-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru7-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru8-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru2-e08906a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-ljspeech-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt408-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt138-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt624-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt396-e08906a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt498-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt132-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt288-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt42-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt90-e08906a1.mp3\"]}}', 'Khác với \'criticism\' (thường mang nghĩa tiêu cực, chỉ trích).', 'marketing', 1, 10),
('de5b051f-524f-5552-ae5d-95074aabad12', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cad40c56-dd08-5f3b-bc54-636b0b38cd91', 'ec5d7e7a-811b-59ab-b517-4aaf75016529', 'amateurish', '/ˈæmətərɪʃ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thiếu chuyên nghiệp, không đạt tiêu chuẩn.', 'done without skill or experience and not meeting professional standards.', 'The stage design for the play looked rather amateurish.', 'Thiết kế sân khấu cho vở kịch trông khá nghiệp dư.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked the designer to redo the logo because it looked amateurish.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã yêu cầu thiết kế làm lại logo vì nó trông có vẻ thiếu chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-ljspeech-72ff18cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-cori-72ff18cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amateurish-7fe9a078.webp', '[\"unprofessional\", \"incompetent\", \"inexperienced\"]', '[\"professional\", \"expert\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"amateurish performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn trình diễn thiếu chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"amateurish mistake\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi nghiệp dư ngớ ngẩn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"amateur\", \"note_vi\": \"Amateur là người nghiệp dư (danh từ), amateurish là tính từ chê bai làm việc kém.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"amateur\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"amateurishly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-cori-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru0-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru5-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru6-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru10-72ff18cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru9-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru3-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru7-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru8-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-aru2-72ff18cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-ljspeech-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt408-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt138-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt624-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt396-72ff18cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt498-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt132-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt288-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt42-72ff18cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amateurish-lt90-72ff18cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Mang sắc thái tiêu cực, dùng để chê tác phẩm hoặc hành động làm kém chất lượng.', 'office', 1, 11),
('8da83b99-3d97-517d-9168-50c068cc2dac', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cad40c56-dd08-5f3b-bc54-636b0b38cd91', 'ec5d7e7a-811b-59ab-b517-4aaf75016529', 'flatter', '/ˈflætə(r)/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Khen ngợi ai đó quá mức, thường là để lấy lòng hoặc vì lợi ích cá nhân.', 'to praise someone in order to make them feel attractive or important, sometimes in a way that is not sincere.', 'Don\'t try to flatter me; just tell me what you really think.', 'Đừng cố tâng bốc tôi; cứ nói cho tôi biết bạn thực sự nghĩ gì.', '{\"en\": \"The sales representative tried to flatter the client in hopes of securing a large order for the quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện bán hàng đã cố gắng nịnh nọt khách hàng với hy vọng chốt được một đơn hàng lớn cho quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-ljspeech-01506896.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-cori-01506896.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flatter-c8ac008a.webp', '[\"praise\", \"compliment\", \"sweet-talk\"]', '[\"insult\", \"criticize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flatter someone\", \"meaning\": \"nịnh nọt ai đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel flattered\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy được tâng bốc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flatten\", \"note_vi\": \"flatten là làm phẳng, flatter là nịnh nọt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flattery\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"flattering\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-cori-01506896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-aru0-01506896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-aru5-01506896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-aru6-01506896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-aru10-01506896.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-aru9-01506896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flatter-aru3-01506896.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec