('49fdb46d-ab9f-5f97-97cb-273a1f576044', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'linen', '/ˈlɪnɪn/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại vải làm từ sợi cây lanh, thường dùng làm quần áo hoặc khăn trải bàn.', 'a type of cloth made from the fibers of a plant, often used for summer clothes.', 'The hotel manager prefers using high-quality linen sheets for all guest bedrooms.', 'Quản lý khách sạn thích sử dụng ga giường bằng vải lanh chất lượng cao cho tất cả phòng khách.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel provides fresh linen sheets for every guest to ensure a comfortable night stay.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cung cấp ga trải giường bằng vải lanh sạch sẽ cho mỗi khách để đảm bảo một đêm nghỉ thoải mái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-ljspeech-30bda0f1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-cori-30bda0f1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/linen-d344493d.webp', '[\"fabric\", \"textile\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"table linen\", \"meaning\": \"khăn trải bàn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bed linen\", \"meaning\": \"ga trải giường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"line\", \"note_vi\": \"Line là đường kẻ, còn linen là chất liệu vải.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-cori-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru0-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru5-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru6-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru10-30bda0f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru9-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru3-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru7-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru8-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-aru2-30bda0f1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-ljspeech-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt408-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt138-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt624-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt396-30bda0f1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt498-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt132-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt288-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt42-30bda0f1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/linen-lt90-30bda0f1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng số nhiều \'linens\' khi chỉ chung các loại khăn, ga trải giường.', 'travel', 1, 17),
('8e643955-0f57-5e4f-ae66-9acad749f3df', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'wasted', '/ˈweɪstɪd/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Gầy mòn, suy nhược (do bệnh tật, thiếu ăn).', 'extremely thin and weak because of sickness or lack of food.', 'After a long illness, he looked very thin and wasted.', 'Sau một thời gian dài bệnh tật, anh ấy trông rất gầy và suy nhược.', '{\"en\": \"The medical team treated wasted patients recovering from the severe drought.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ y tế điều trị những bệnh nhân suy nhược đang hồi phục sau hạn hán nghiêm trọng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-ljspeech-7862383a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-cori-7862383a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wasted-d5d5cae2.webp', '[\"emaciated\", \"gaunt\"]', '[\"plump\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wasted body\", \"meaning\": \"cơ thể gầy mòn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wasted from illness\", \"meaning\": \"suy kiệt vì bệnh tật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"waisted\", \"note_vi\": \"waisted là có eo, wasted là gầy mòn/suy nhược\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"waste\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-cori-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru0-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru5-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru6-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru10-7862383a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru9-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru3-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru7-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru8-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-aru2-7862383a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-ljspeech-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt408-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt138-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt624-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt396-7862383a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt498-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt132-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt288-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt42-7862383a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wasted-lt90-7862383a.mp3\"]}}', 'Wasted thường nghĩa lãng phí, nhưng trong ngữ cảnh này là gầy mòn suy nhược.', 'health', 1, 18),
('b751a3c6-a778-5c3f-ba2d-ce21927d7a5c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'nonetheless', '/ˌnɒnðəˈlɛs/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Mặc dù vậy, tuy nhiên, dùng để giới thiệu một sự thật đối lập.', 'despite what has just been said or referred to, used to show a contrast.', 'The rain was heavy; nonetheless, they decided to go for a walk.', 'Trời mưa rất to; tuy nhiên, họ vẫn quyết định đi dạo.', '{\"en\": \"The sales figures were low; nonetheless, the team remains optimistic about the upcoming holiday season.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số bán hàng thấp; tuy nhiên, cả nhóm vẫn lạc quan về mùa lễ hội sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-ljspeech-cefc253f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-cori-cefc253f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nonetheless-8e0ecc89.webp', '[\"nevertheless\", \"however\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-cori-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru0-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru5-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru6-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru10-cefc253f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru9-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru3-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru7-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru8-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-aru2-cefc253f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-ljspeech-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt408-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt138-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt624-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt396-cefc253f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt498-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt132-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt288-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt42-cefc253f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nonetheless-lt90-cefc253f.mp3\"]}}', 'dùng trong văn viết trang trọng để nối hai mệnh đề đối lập.', 'business', 1, 19),
('3c29c889-0e06-57c5-92e5-18d25b12b86c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'since', '/sɪns/', 'A2', 'adverb', 'Từ một thời điểm cụ thể trong quá khứ cho đến hiện tại.', 'starting from a time in the past and continuing until the present moment.', 'Since the new policy took effect, overall employee productivity has improved substantially.', 'Vì chính sách mới có hiệu lực, năng suất làm việc tổng thể của nhân viên đã cải thiện đáng kể.', '{\"en\": \"Our company has grown significantly since we launched the new software last year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi đã phát triển đáng kể kể từ khi chúng tôi ra mắt phần mềm mới năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-ljspeech-2eb888e9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-cori-2eb888e9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/since-32e32a91.webp', '[\"from then on\", \"following that\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ever since\", \"meaning\": \"kể từ đó\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ever since then\", \"meaning\": \"kể từ lúc đó\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"since\", \"note_vi\": \"Dùng trước mốc thời gian, còn trạng từ đứng cuối câu. (preposition)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-cori-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru0-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru5-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru6-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru10-2eb888e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru9-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru3-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru7-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru8-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-aru2-2eb888e9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-ljspeech-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt408-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt138-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt624-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt396-2eb888e9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt498-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt132-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt288-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt42-2eb888e9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/since-lt90-2eb888e9.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng với thì hiện tại hoàn thành để chỉ mốc thời gian bắt đầu.', 'business', 1, 20),
('0d060a46-5bad-5085-a22c-60b26188263d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'assurance', '/əˈʃʊərəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lời cam đoan, sự đảm bảo về điều gì đó.', 'a promise that something will certainly happen or be true.', 'The manager gave his assurance that the project would be completed on time.', 'Người quản lý đã đảm bảo rằng dự án sẽ hoàn thành đúng thời hạn.', '{\"en\": \"The supplier gave us an assurance that the replacement parts would arrive tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp đã đưa ra lời đảm bảo với chúng tôi rằng các bộ phận thay thế sẽ đến vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-ljspeech-f3753f1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-cori-f3753f1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assurance-d34064da.webp', '[\"guarantee\", \"promise\", \"pledge\"]', '[\"doubt\", \"uncertainty\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"quality assurance\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo chất lượng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"give an assurance\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra lời cam đoan\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"insurance\", \"note_vi\": \"Khác nhau: assurance là sự cam đoan/bảo đảm, insurance là bảo hiểm tài chính.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assure\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"assured\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"assuredly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-cori-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru0-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru5-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru6-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru10-f3753f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru9-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru3-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru7-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru8-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-aru2-f3753f1b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-ljspeech-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt408-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt138-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt624-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt396-f3753f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt498-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt132-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt288-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt42-f3753f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assurance-lt90-f3753f1b.mp3\"]}}', 'Quality assurance (QA) là vị trí kiểm định chất lượng rất phổ biến trong doanh nghiệp.', 'business', 1, 21),
('244badc2-7926-5285-a968-0e00e8377b4d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'sandstorm', '/ˈsændstɔːm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng thời tiết có gió mạnh cuốn theo nhiều cát.', 'a strong wind in a desert that blows clouds of sand through the air.', 'The desert travelers had to seek shelter from the sudden sandstorm.', 'Những người du hành sa mạc phải tìm chỗ trú ẩn khỏi cơn bão cát bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency advised tourists to stay indoors due to a severe sandstorm in the area.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch khuyên du khách nên ở trong nhà do có bão cát dữ dội trong khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-ljspeech-dd06db31.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-cori-dd06db31.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sandstorm-d01441ca.webp', '[\"duststorm\", \"haboob\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"severe sandstorm\", \"meaning\": \"bão cát dữ dội\"}, {\"phrase\": \"desert sandstorm\", \"meaning\": \"bão cát sa mạc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"snowstorm\", \"note_vi\": \"bão tuyết, phân biệt với bão cát (sandstorm)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-cori-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru0-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru5-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru6-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru10-dd06db31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru9-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru3-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru7-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru8-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-aru2-dd06db31.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-ljspeech-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt408-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt138-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt624-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt396-dd06db31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt498-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt132-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt288-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt42-dd06db31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sandstorm-lt90-dd06db31.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ ghép từ \'sand\' (cát) và \'storm\' (bão).', 'travel', 1, 22),
('093160f9-8aad-5def-9a73-8294080a07c2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'uneasy', '/ʌnˈiːzi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng, không thoải mái hoặc không yên tâm.', 'experiencing a sense of anxiety, apprehension, or psychological discomfort regarding an impending event.', 'Investors grew uneasy following the sudden drop in company stock prices this morning.', 'Các nhà đầu tư trở nên lo lắng sau sự sụt giảm đột ngột của giá cổ phiếu công ty sáng nay.', '{\"en\": \"The investor felt uneasy about the sudden drop in stock prices before the quarterly report.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà đầu tư cảm thấy không yên tâm về sự sụt giảm đột ngột của giá cổ phiếu trước báo cáo hàng quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-ljspeech-6ea416d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-cori-6ea416d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uneasy-4b18b5ef.webp', '[\"anxious\", \"worried\"]', '[\"comfortable\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel uneasy\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy lo lắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"uneasy feeling\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác bất an\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"uneasiness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-cori-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru0-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru5-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru6-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru10-6ea416d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru9-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru3-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru7-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru8-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-aru2-6ea416d4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-ljspeech-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt408-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt138-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt624-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt396-6ea416d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt498-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt132-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt288-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt42-6ea416d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uneasy-lt90-6ea416d4.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi cảm thấy có điều gì đó không ổn hoặc không chắc chắn.', 'finance', 1, 23),
('d1ee05fa-3a71-5379-beee-05fc3ace4c05', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'closure', '/ˈkləʊʒə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác kết thúc hoặc giải quyết một vấn đề, giúp tâm lý ổn định.', 'a feeling of peace and acceptance that comes after a difficult situation is finally resolved.', 'Attending the memorial service provided peaceful closure to the grieving family members.', 'Việc tham dự lễ tưởng niệm đã mang lại sự thanh thản khép lại nỗi đau cho các thành viên trong gia đình đau thương.', '{\"en\": \"The manager held a final meeting to give the team closure after the project was cancelled.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý tổ chức cuộc họp cuối cùng để giúp nhóm cảm thấy ổn định sau khi dự án bị hủy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-ljspeech-d091cefc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-cori-d091cefc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/closure-de4bd457.webp', '[\"resolution\", \"conclusion\", \"finality\"]', '[\"uncertainty\", \"unresolved\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bring closure\", \"meaning\": \"mang lại cảm giác kết thúc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sense of closure\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác được giải tỏa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find closure\", \"meaning\": \"tìm được sự bình yên sau biến cố\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"closing\", \"note_vi\": \"closing là hành động đóng/kết thúc; closure là cảm giác tâm lý được giải quyết xong\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"close\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"closed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-cori-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru0-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru5-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru6-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru10-d091cefc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru9-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru3-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru7-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru8-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-aru2-d091cefc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-ljspeech-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt408-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt138-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt624-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt396-d091cefc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt498-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt132-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt288-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt42-d091cefc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/closure-lt90-d091cefc.mp3\"]}}', 'closure trong tâm lý học khác với closure nghĩa là đóng cửa doanh nghiệp — chú ý ngữ cảnh.', 'office', 1, 24),
('32c24bc6-55eb-5103-82e6-021eec228584', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdda46d9-1328-517e-a78c-2fbaa784ce16', 'e2ebf474-95d5-5715-a73d-f72c88db6c07', 'hike', '/haɪk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một chuyến đi bộ dài, thường là ở vùng nông thôn hoặc núi.', 'a long walk taken in the countryside, hills, or mountains for exercise or pleasure.', 'We\'re planning a challenging hike up the mountain next weekend.', 'Chúng tôi đang lên kế hoạch cho một chuyến đi bộ đường dài đầy thử thách lên núi vào cuối tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"The team-building event included a group hike through the national park on Saturday.\", \"vi\": \"Sự kiện xây dựng đội nhóm bao gồm một chuyến đi bộ tập thể qua công viên quốc gia vào thứ Bảy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-ljspeech-ecec1d54.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-cori-ecec1d54.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hike-4c190dc4.webp', '[\"trek\", \"walk\", \"ramble\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go on a hike\", \"meaning\": \"đi bộ đường dài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"nature hike\", \"meaning\": \"chuyến đi bộ trong thiên nhiên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hike trail\", \"meaning\": \"đường mòn đi bộ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bike\", \"note_vi\": \"bike là xe đạp hoặc đi xe đạp, không phải đi bộ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"hike\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hiker\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hiking\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-cori-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru0-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru5-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru6-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru10-ecec1d54.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru9-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hike-aru3-ecec1d54.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj