('435a606a-63c7-57d6-8a2f-6038568c90c4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'subside', '/səbˈsaɪd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Trở nên ít dữ dội hoặc mạnh mẽ hơn; lắng xuống.', 'to decrease in strength or level after being strong.', 'After the storm, the floodwaters slowly began to subside.', 'Sau cơn bão, nước lũ từ từ bắt đầu rút xuống.', '{\"en\": \"The recent market turmoil subsided after the central bank\'s announcement.\", \"vi\": \"Sự biến động thị trường gần đây đã lắng xuống sau thông báo của ngân hàng trung ương.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-ljspeech-1f6a388e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-cori-1f6a388e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/subside-86ac950f.webp', '[\"abate\", \"ease\", \"diminish\"]', '[\"intensify\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"subside gradually\", \"meaning\": \"dần lắng xuống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"subside completely\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn dịu đi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"waters subside\", \"meaning\": \"nước rút\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"preside\", \"note_vi\": \"preside là chủ trì, không liên quan\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"subsidence\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-cori-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru0-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru5-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru6-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru10-1f6a388e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru9-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru3-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru7-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru8-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-aru2-1f6a388e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-ljspeech-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt408-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt138-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt624-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt396-1f6a388e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt498-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt132-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt288-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt42-1f6a388e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subside-lt90-1f6a388e.mp3\"]}}', 'Subside thường đi với sóng, nước, cơn đau, biến động.', 'finance', 1, 4),
('beab9e96-b517-57b1-b632-1f9df0a32261', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'witless', '/ˈwɪtləs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Thiếu thông minh, hành động hoặc lời nói ngớ ngẩn.', 'showing a lack of good sense or intelligence in the way you speak or act.', 'The new assistant was fired after making several witless decisions during the meeting.', 'Trợ lý mới đã bị sa thải sau khi đưa ra một vài quyết định ngớ ngẩn trong cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant avoided making witless remarks during the high-stakes meeting with the potential client.\", \"vi\": \"Vị tư vấn viên đã tránh đưa ra những bình luận ngớ ngẩn trong cuộc họp quan trọng với khách hàng tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-ljspeech-43dbdc78.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-cori-43dbdc78.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/witless-539f517c.webp', '[\"foolish\", \"stupid\"]', '[\"witty\", \"intelligent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"witless comment\", \"meaning\": \"bình luận ngớ ngẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"witless remark\", \"meaning\": \"lời nhận xét thiếu suy nghĩ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"witless\", \"note_vi\": \"khác với witness (nhân chứng) về cả nghĩa và cách phát âm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"wit\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-cori-43dbdc78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-aru0-43dbdc78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-aru5-43dbdc78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-aru6-43dbdc78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-aru10-43dbdc78.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-aru9-43dbdc78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-aru3-43dbdc78.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/witless-aru7-43dbdc78.