('5deb9125-38e4-58c3-8f07-917e421fa9f3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'vesicle', '/ˈvesɪkl/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một túi nhỏ chứa chất lỏng hoặc khí trong cơ thể hoặc tế bào.', 'a very small structure like a bag in a human, animal, or plant that contains liquid.', 'The cell uses a tiny vesicle to transport molecules to its membrane.', 'Tế bào sử dụng một túi nhỏ (vesicle) để vận chuyển các phân tử đến màng của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The laboratory technicians analyzed the fluid from the cellular vesicle to determine the cause of the disease.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ thuật viên phòng thí nghiệm đã phân tích chất lỏng từ túi tế bào để xác định nguyên nhân gây bệnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-ljspeech-efa039c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-cori-efa039c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vesicle-16078c5d.webp', '[\"sac\", \"cyst\", \"bladder\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"seminal vesicle\", \"meaning\": \"túi tinh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"transport vesicle\", \"meaning\": \"túi vận chuyển (trong tế bào)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vessel\", \"note_vi\": \"vessel là mạch máu hoặc tàu thuyền, vesicle là túi nhỏ trong tế bào\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"vesicular\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-cori-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru0-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru5-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru6-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru10-efa039c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru9-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru3-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru7-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru8-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-aru2-efa039c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-ljspeech-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt408-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt138-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt624-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt396-efa039c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt498-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt132-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt288-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt42-efa039c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vesicle-lt90-efa039c1.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ vựng chuyên ngành sinh học/y học, ít gặp trong giao tiếp hàng ngày.', 'health', 1, 6),
('1bda5c68-2cdb-58bb-8f83-5f7e70273df5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'defendant', '/dɪˈfendənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người bị kiện hoặc bị buộc tội trong một vụ án.', 'a person who is being blamed for a crime in a court of law.', 'The defense attorney presented key evidence proving that the defendant was innocent.', 'Luật sư bào chữa đã đưa ra bằng chứng then chốt chứng minh rằng bị cáo vô tội.', '{\"en\": \"The defendant appeared in court today to answer questions regarding the recent contract dispute.\", \"vi\": \"Bị cáo đã xuất hiện tại tòa hôm nay để trả lời các câu hỏi liên quan đến tranh chấp hợp đồng gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-ljspeech-81e6e282.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-cori-81e6e282.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/defendant-76136606.webp', '[\"accused\", \"prisoner\"]', '[\"plaintiff\", \"prosecutor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"the defendant\'s lawyer\", \"meaning\": \"luật sư của bị cáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accuse the defendant\", \"meaning\": \"buộc tội bị cáo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"plaintiff\", \"note_vi\": \"Plaintiff là nguyên đơn (người kiện), defendant là bị đơn (người bị kiện).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"defend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"defense\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-cori-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru0-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru5-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru6-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru10-81e6e282.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru9-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru3-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru7-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru8-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-aru2-81e6e282.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-ljspeech-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt408-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt138-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt624-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt396-81e6e282.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt498-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt132-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt288-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt42-81e6e282.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/defendant-lt90-81e6e282.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn dùng trong ngữ cảnh pháp lý, tòa án.', 'law', 1, 7),
('42b1976b-c1a4-5a2d-ac69-46e1857bbfb6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'compute', '/kəmˈpjuːt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Thực hiện các phép tính toán để tìm ra một số hoặc kết quả.', 'to find an answer or result by using mathematics or a machine.', 'The software can compute complex calculations in seconds.', 'Phần mềm có thể tính toán các phép tính phức tạp trong vài giây.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting software can compute the total project costs within a few seconds.\", \"vi\": \"Phần mềm kế toán có thể tính toán tổng chi phí dự án chỉ trong vài giây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-ljspeech-24989d8e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-cori-24989d8e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compute-1e2f9716.webp', '[\"calculate\", \"process\", \"figure out\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"compute data\", \"meaning\": \"tính toán dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compute results\", \"meaning\": \"tính ra kết quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compute costs\", \"meaning\": \"tính toán chi phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"calculate\", \"note_vi\": \"calculate thường dùng cho phép tính đơn giản, compute thiên về xử lý dữ liệu phức tạp hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"computer\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"computation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"computational\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-cori-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru0-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru5-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru6-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru10-24989d8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru9-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru3-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru7-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru8-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-aru2-24989d8e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-ljspeech-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt408-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt138-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt624-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt396-24989d8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt498-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt132-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt288-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt42-24989d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compute-lt90-24989d8e.mp3\"]}}', 'Compute cùng gốc với computer; nhớ: máy tính (computer) là thiết bị dùng để \'compute\'.', 'technology', 1, 8),
('dd5e96fc-a71c-570f-9264-8db286158ac7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'conspicuous', '/kənˈspɪkjuəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'dễ nhìn thấy, nổi bật, thu hút sự chú ý', 'very easy to notice or see, often because something is different from its surroundings.', 'His total absence from the emergency staff meeting was remarkably conspicuous.', 'Sự vắng mặt hoàn toàn của anh ấy trong cuộc họp nhân viên khẩn cấp là vô cùng dễ thấy.', '{\"en\": \"The company made a conspicuous effort to reduce waste during the annual manufacturing conference.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã nỗ lực đáng kể để giảm thiểu rác thải trong hội nghị sản xuất thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-ljspeech-adfab20d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-cori-adfab20d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conspicuous-84a4a78b.webp', '[\"noticeable\", \"prominent\"]', '[\"inconspicuous\", \"hidden\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conspicuous by its absence\", \"meaning\": \"vắng mặt một cách đáng chú ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a conspicuous effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực rõ rệt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"suspicious\", \"note_vi\": \"Suspicious là nghi ngờ, conspicuous là dễ thấy.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"conspicuously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-cori-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru0-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru5-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru6-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru10-adfab20d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru9-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru3-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru7-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru8-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-aru2-adfab20d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-ljspeech-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt408-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt138-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt624-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt396-adfab20d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt498-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt132-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt288-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt42-adfab20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conspicuous-lt90-adfab20d.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ những thứ gây chú ý mạnh, có thể tích cực hoặc tiêu cực.', 'business', 1, 9),
('076f66ba-6b41-5500-9c61-9a631bd95a52', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'bend', '/bend/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một chỗ cong hoặc khúc cua trên đường, sông hoặc vật gì đó.', 'a curved part of a road, path, or river that changes the direction you are going.', 'The train slowed down significantly as it approached a sharp bend.', 'Đoàn tàu giảm tốc độ đáng kể khi tiến gần đến một khúc cua gấp.', '{\"en\": \"The delivery truck slowed down as it approached a sharp bend on the mountain road.\", \"vi\": \"Xe tải giao hàng giảm tốc độ khi đến gần một khúc cua gắt trên đường núi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-ljspeech-abf1da7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-cori-abf1da7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bend-8fbc9a1b.webp', '[\"curve\", \"turn\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sharp bend\", \"meaning\": \"khúc cua gắt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"around the bend\", \"meaning\": \"vòng qua khúc cua\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"band\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Band\' là ban nhạc hoặc dải băng, \'bend\' là chỗ cong.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bending\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-cori-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru0-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru5-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru6-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru10-abf1da7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru9-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru3-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru7-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru8-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru2-abf1da7e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\":