('049f102a-36bc-58ac-82ab-9517209dcb90', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'regulation', '/ˌreɡjʊˈleɪʃən/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một luật lệ hoặc quy tắc chính thức do chính phủ hoặc tổ chức đặt ra.', 'an official rule or order that controls how something should be done in a system.', 'New safety regulations were introduced after the accident.', 'Các quy định an toàn mới đã được ban hành sau vụ tai nạn.', '{\"en\": \"All staff members must follow the new safety regulation regarding the use of office equipment.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải tuân thủ quy định an toàn mới liên quan đến việc sử dụng thiết bị văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-ljspeech-7320e2b5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-cori-7320e2b5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/regulation-b7dd3665.webp', '[\"rule\", \"policy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"comply with regulations\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ quy định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safety regulation\", \"meaning\": \"quy định an toàn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"legislation\", \"note_vi\": \"Chỉ luật do quốc hội ban hành, regulation là quy định nội bộ/ngành.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"regulate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-cori-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru0-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru5-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru6-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru10-7320e2b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru9-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru3-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru7-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru8-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-aru2-7320e2b5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-ljspeech-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt408-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt138-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt624-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt396-7320e2b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt498-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt132-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt288-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt42-7320e2b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/regulation-lt90-7320e2b5.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất phổ biến trong các văn bản hướng dẫn công việc hoặc thông báo công ty.', 'law', 1, 19),
('a9509152-e2d4-567c-b7fe-bad3e382b5f5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'unambiguous', '/ˌʌnæmˈbɪɡjuəs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Rõ ràng, không mơ hồ, dễ hiểu.', 'easy to understand and having only one possible meaning that cannot be doubted by anyone.', 'The instructions were unambiguous, leaving no room for misinterpretation.', 'Các hướng dẫn rất rõ ràng, không để lại chỗ cho sự hiểu lầm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager provided unambiguous guidelines for the new project to ensure everyone follows the same process.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã cung cấp các hướng dẫn rõ ràng cho dự án mới để đảm bảo mọi người tuân theo cùng một quy trình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-ljspeech-3a5cbb64.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-cori-3a5cbb64.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unambiguous-349fd8b4.webp', '[\"clear\", \"explicit\"]', '[\"vague\", \"ambiguous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"unambiguous terms\", \"meaning\": \"các điều khoản rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unambiguous evidence\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng không thể chối cãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"ambiguous\", \"note_vi\": \"ambiguous là mơ hồ, trái nghĩa hoàn toàn với unambiguous.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"unambiguously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-cori-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru0-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru5-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru6-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru10-3a5cbb64.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru9-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru3-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru7-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru8-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-aru2-3a5cbb64.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-ljspeech-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt408-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt138-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt624-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt396-3a5cbb64.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt498-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt132-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt288-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt42-3a5cbb64.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unambiguous-lt90-3a5cbb64.mp3\"]}}', 'tiền tố un- mang nghĩa phủ định, giúp bạn nhớ từ này là không mơ hồ.', 'office', 1, 20),
('590503e9-d0ba-5fd6-b235-153dbc18215f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'boast', '/bəʊst/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tự hào nói về điều gì đó một cách quá mức hoặc tự phụ.', 'to talk with too much pride about something you own or have achieved.', 'He tends to boast about his achievements rather than letting them speak for themselves.', 'Anh ấy có xu hướng khoe khoang về thành tích của mình thay vì để chúng tự nói lên.', '{\"en\": \"The sales manager likes to boast about his team performance during monthly meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng kinh doanh thích khoe khoang về thành tích của đội mình trong các cuộc họp hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-ljspeech-42c485bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-cori-42c485bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/boast-93bcc9c1.webp', '[\"brag\", \"gloat\"]', '[\"understate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"boast about something\", \"meaning\": \"khoe khoang về cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"boast of success\", \"meaning\": \"tự hào về thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"boost\", \"note_vi\": \"boost nghĩa là thúc đẩy, tăng cường, không phải khoe khoang.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"boastful\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"boastfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-cori-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru0-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru5-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru6-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru10-42c485bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru9-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru3-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru7-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru8-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-aru2-42c485bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-ljspeech-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt408-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt138-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt624-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt396-42c485bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt498-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt132-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt288-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt42-42c485bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/boast-lt90-42c485bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với boost (thúc đẩy) do phát âm và mặt chữ gần giống nhau.', 'business', 1, 21),
('124c7511-3a83-5333-bd40-2efad37d2797', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'ceremony', 'UK: /ˈsɛrɪməni/ | US: /ˈsɛrəˌmoʊni/', 'B1', 'noun', 'buổi lễ', 'A formal public or religious event performed on an important occasion according to tradition.', 'The opening ceremony of the new branch was impressive.', 'Buổi lễ khai trương chi nhánh mới rất ấn tượng.', '{\"en\": \"All department heads are expected to attend the annual employee award ceremony tonight.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả các trưởng bộ phận dự kiến sẽ tham dự lễ trao giải thưởng cho nhân viên hàng năm vào tối nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-ljspeech-92efd0d1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-cori-92efd0d1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ceremony-b06263a5.webp', '[\"rite\", \"ritual\", \"service\", \"observance\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"award ceremony\", \"meaning\": \"lễ trao giải\"}, {\"phrase\": \"opening ceremony\", \"meaning\": \"lễ khai mạc / lễ khai trương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"celebration\", \"note_vi\": \"Celebration mang tính không khí vui vẻ, chúc mừng; ceremony tập trung vào nghi thức trang trọng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ceremonial\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"ceremonially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-cori-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru0-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru5-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru6-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru10-92efd0d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru9-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru3-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru7-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru8-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-aru2-92efd0d1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-ljspeech-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt408-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt138-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt624-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt396-92efd0d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt498-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt132-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt288-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt42-92efd0d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ceremony-lt90-92efd0d1.mp3\"]}}', '\'Ceremony\' chỉ nghi thức, lễ kỷ niệm chính thức (như lễ trao giải, lễ khai trương), mang tính trang trọng hơn \'celebration\'.', 'company events', 1, 22),
('094980e9-d31a-5715-aa01-a52714bdba1a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'proclaim', '/prəˈkleɪm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Công bố, tuyên bố một cách chính thức hoặc công khai.', 'to announce something publicly or officially, especially something important.', 'The king will proclaim the new law to all his subjects tomorrow.', 'Nhà vua sẽ công bố luật mới cho tất cả thần dân của mình vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors will proclaim the merger at the annual press conference.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc sẽ tuyên bố việc sáp nhập tại cuộc họp báo thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-ljspeech-6f2ddf5b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-cori-6f2ddf5b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/proclaim-bfb6f173.webp', '[\"declare\", \"announce\", \"publish\"]', '[\"conceal\", \"hide\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"proclaim a winner\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố người chiến thắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proclaim independence\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố độc lập\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"claim\", \"note_vi\": \"claim là tự nhận, yêu cầu; proclaim là tuyên bố công khai\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"proclamation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-cori-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru0-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru5-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru6-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru10-6f2ddf5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru9-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru3-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru7-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru8-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-aru2-6f2ddf5b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-ljspeech-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt408-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt138-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt624-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt396-6f2ddf5b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt498-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt132-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt288-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt42-6f2ddf5b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/proclaim-lt90-6f2ddf5b.mp3\"]}}', 'Proclaim mang tính chất trang trọng và công khai hơn so với announce.', 'business', 1, 23),
('86da6f3b-878a-5eda-af18-3980d77ad26b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cdf4856a-2f1f-5a84-a02c-acc0a296eb6b', 'b165c0d5-08a9-5806-a514-2df987bb095a', 'adequate', 'UK: /ˈædɪkwət/ | US: /ˈædɪkwət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'đủ, thích đáng', 'satisfactory or acceptable in quality or quantity for a particular purpose', 'The report provides adequate information for the decision.', 'Báo cáo cung cấp đủ thông tin cho quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"The current budget is adequate to cover all planned marketing expenses for this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Ngân sách hiện tại đủ để chi trả cho tất cả các chi phí tiếp thị dự kiến trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-ljspeech-48a72c68.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-cori-48a72c68.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/adequate-275f3778.webp', '[\"sufficient\", \"enough\", \"satisfactory\", \"acceptable\"]', '[\"inadequate\", \"insufficient\", \"lacking\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"adequate preparation\", \"meaning\": \"sự chuẩn bị đầy đủ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adequate resources\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn lực đáp ứng đủ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"adequately\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"adequacy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inadequate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-cori-48a72c68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-aru0-48a72c68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-aru5-48a72c68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-aru6-48a72c68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-aru10-48a72c68.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-aru9-48a72c68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-aru3-48a72c68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adequate-aru7-48a72c68.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro