('4fe0a39f-308c-5a3a-a296-d1e809f4affb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cf8afcaf-fbba-5073-a771-9838ed86f330', '31ff056a-1185-546b-a130-be3145aa499e', 'observe', '/əbˈzɜːv/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Quan sát kỹ lưỡng để học hỏi hoặc nhận biết điều gì đó.', 'to watch someone or something carefully in order to learn or notice details.', 'Scientists observe animal behavior in their natural habitat.', 'Các nhà khoa học quan sát hành vi của động vật trong môi trường sống tự nhiên của chúng.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor will observe the new staff members to ensure they follow safety protocols correctly.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát sẽ quan sát các nhân viên mới để đảm bảo họ tuân thủ đúng các quy định an toàn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-ljspeech-4f4224f4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-cori-4f4224f4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/observe-16622db4.webp', '[\"watch\", \"monitor\"]', '[\"ignore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"observe rules\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ quy tắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"observe behavior\", \"meaning\": \"quan sát hành vi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"observation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-cori-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru0-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru5-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru6-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru10-4f4224f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru9-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru3-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru7-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru8-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-aru2-4f4224f4.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-ljspeech-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt408-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt138-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt624-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt396-4f4224f4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt498-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt132-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt288-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt42-4f4224f4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/observe-lt90-4f4224f4.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này có hai nghĩa: quan sát và tuân thủ (quy định/luật lệ).', 'office', 1, 5),
('94f7c5b0-92ba-5537-b729-3793f2b6220e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cf8afcaf-fbba-5073-a771-9838ed86f330', '31ff056a-1185-546b-a130-be3145aa499e', 'hostel', '/ˈhɒstl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Nhà nghỉ giá rẻ, thường dành cho sinh viên hoặc du khách ba lô.', 'a building that provides cheap accommodation for travelers, often with shared rooms and facilities.', 'Backpackers often choose to stay at a budget hostel to save money.', 'Du khách ba lô thường chọn ở tại một nhà nghỉ bình dân để tiết kiệm tiền.', '{\"en\": \"The business traveler chose a clean hostel near the train station to save on expenses.\", \"vi\": \"Người đi công tác đã chọn một nhà nghỉ sạch sẽ gần ga tàu để tiết kiệm chi phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-ljspeech-028cd03a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-cori-028cd03a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hostel-763b2123.webp', '[\"inn\", \"lodge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"youth hostel\", \"meaning\": \"nhà nghỉ thanh niên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stay in a hostel\", \"meaning\": \"ở tại nhà nghỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hotel\", \"note_vi\": \"Hotel là khách sạn tiện nghi, hostel là nhà nghỉ giá rẻ bình dân.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-cori-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru0-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru5-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru6-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru10-028cd03a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru9-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru3-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru7-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru8-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-aru2-028cd03a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-ljspeech-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt408-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt138-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt624-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt396-028cd03a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt498-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt132-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt288-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt42-028cd03a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hostel-lt90-028cd03a.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm với \'hotel\' (khách sạn) vì hostel thường có phòng ngủ chung.', 'travel', 1, 6),
('2678d049-3904-564e-acff-e6b2fdebff6f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cf8afcaf-fbba-5073-a771-9838ed86f330', '31ff056a-1185-546b-a130-be3145aa499e', 'hot tub', '/hɒt tʌb/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bồn tắm lớn có nước nóng và vòi phun massage.', 'a large pool of warm water with jets for soaking.', 'After a long day of skiing, relaxing in the hot tub felt amazing.', 'Sau một ngày dài trượt tuyết, thư giãn trong bồn tắm nước nóng thật tuyệt vời.', '{\"en\": \"The resort booked for the conference has an outdoor hot tub for guests.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng được đặt cho hội nghị có bồn tắm nước nóng ngoài trời cho khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-ljspeech-75185123.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-cori-75185123.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hot-tub-a1e5f427.webp', '[\"jacuzzi\", \"spa\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"outdoor hot tub\", \"meaning\": \"bồn tắm nóng ngoài trời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hot tub jets\", \"meaning\": \"vòi phun bồn tắm nóng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bathtub\", \"note_vi\": \"bathtub là bồn tắm thường, không có vòi phun massage.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-cori-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru0-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru5-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru6-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru10-75185123.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru9-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru3-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru7-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru8-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-aru2-75185123.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-ljspeech-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt408-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt138-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt624-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt396-75185123.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt498-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt132-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt288-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt42-75185123.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hot-tub-lt90-75185123.mp3\"]}}', 'Là danh từ đếm được, thường có trong khách sạn nghỉ dưỡng.', 'travel', 1, 7),
('0f15a7bf-3583-5f2c-b861-e8e74181321a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cf8afcaf-fbba-5073-a771-9838ed86f330', '31ff056a-1185-546b-a130-be3145aa499e', 'glamorous', '/ˈɡlæmərəs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Hấp dẫn, quyến rũ và đầy mê hoặc, thường liên quan đến sự sang trọng.', 'attractive, exciting, and full of charm, often connected with wealth or high social status.', 'The fashion designer hosted a glamorous evening gala to showcase his spring collection.', 'Nhà thiết kế thời trang đã tổ chức một dạ tiệc tối hào nhoáng để ra mắt bộ sưu tập mùa xuân.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel held a glamorous gala dinner to celebrate its twentieth anniversary last night.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã tổ chức một bữa tiệc tối sang trọng để kỷ niệm 20 năm thành lập vào tối qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-ljspeech-91080b58.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-cori-91080b58.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/glamorous-4503e318.webp', '[\"attractive\", \"charming\", \"stylish\"]', '[\"plain\", \"ordinary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"glamorous lifestyle\", \"meaning\": \"lối sống sang trọng hào nhoáng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"glamorous job\", \"meaning\": \"công việc hấp dẫn hào nhoáng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"charming\", \"note_vi\": \"quyến rũ, duyên dáng nhẹ nhàng hơn glamorous\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"glamour\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"glamorously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-cori-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru0-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru5-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru6-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru10-91080b58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru9-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru3-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru7-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru8-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-aru2-91080b58.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-ljspeech-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt408-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt138-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt624-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt396-91080b58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt498-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt132-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt288-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt42-91080b58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/glamorous-lt90-91080b58.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh vẻ đẹp sang trọng, lộng lẫy và thu hút chú ý.', 'dining', 1, 8)
