('d5115b26-421b-5c5d-a875-7c170c0be6ca', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cf8afcaf-fbba-5073-a771-9838ed86f330', '31ff056a-1185-546b-a130-be3145aa499e', 'futile', '/ˈfjuːtaɪl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Vô ích, không có kết quả, phí công.', 'having no effective result or point and being a waste of time.', 'It was futile to try and argue with him once he had made up his mind.', 'Cố gắng tranh cãi với anh ta là vô ích một khi anh ta đã quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"It is futile to negotiate with the supplier since they refuse to lower the price.\", \"vi\": \"Thật vô ích khi đàm phán với nhà cung cấp vì họ từ chối giảm giá.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-ljspeech-fa93eb2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-cori-fa93eb2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/futile-9d7fcb5a.webp', '[\"useless\", \"pointless\", \"ineffective\"]', '[\"useful\", \"effective\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"futile attempt\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực vô ích\"}, {\"phrase\": \"futile effort\", \"meaning\": \"cố gắng vô ích\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fertile\", \"note_vi\": \"fertile nghĩa là phì nhiêu, màu mỡ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"futility\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"futilely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-cori-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru0-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru5-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru6-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru10-fa93eb2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru9-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru3-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru7-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru8-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-aru2-fa93eb2b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-ljspeech-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt408-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt138-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt624-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt396-fa93eb2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt498-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt132-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt288-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt42-fa93eb2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/futile-lt90-fa93eb2b.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với fertile (phì nhiêu, màu mỡ) do viết gần giống.', 'business', 1, 12),
('b5f5b657-6e45-591d-a9b8-61289e943971', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cf8afcaf-fbba-5073-a771-9838ed86f330', '31ff056a-1185-546b-a130-be3145aa499e', 'redshift', '/ˈrɛdʃɪft/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng ánh sáng từ vật thể xa trong vũ trụ chuyển sang màu đỏ hơn.', 'a change in light from space toward red wavelengths as objects move away.', 'Astronomers use redshift to determine how fast galaxies are moving away from us.', 'Các nhà thiên văn học sử dụng sự dịch chuyển đỏ để xác định tốc độ các thiên hà đang di chuyển ra xa chúng ta.', '{\"en\": \"The research center published data about redshift measurement in distant star systems.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm nghiên cứu đã xuất bản dữ liệu về phép đo độ lệch đỏ trong các hệ sao xa xôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-ljspeech-2ef0ce79.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-cori-2ef0ce79.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/redshift-d9997603.webp', NULL, '[\"blueshift\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cosmological redshift\", \"meaning\": \"độ lệch đỏ vũ trụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"measure redshift\", \"meaning\": \"đo độ lệch đỏ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"blueshift\", \"note_vi\": \"blueshift là hiện tượng bước sóng ánh sáng lệch về màu xanh (lại gần)\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-cori-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru0-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru5-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru6-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru10-2ef0ce79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru9-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru3-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru7-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru8-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-aru2-2ef0ce79.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-ljspeech-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt408-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt138-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt624-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt396-2ef0ce79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt498-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt132-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt288-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt42-2ef0ce79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/redshift-lt90-2ef0ce79.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ ghép từ \'red\' (đỏ) và \'shift\' (dịch chuyển), dùng trong thiên văn học.', 'academic', 1, 13),
('56ec9dfd-3d37-5b3e-ab06-ef163904644e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'cf8afcaf-fbba-5073-a771-9838ed86f330', '31ff056a-1185-546b-a130-be3145aa499e', 'petition', '/pəˈtɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Văn bản có chữ ký của nhiều người yêu cầu chính quyền hoặc tổ chức làm gì đó.', 'an official written request submitted to an authority after being endorsed by numerous citizens.', 'They organized a petition to save the old park from being redeveloped.', 'Họ đã tổ chức một bản kiến nghị để cứu công viên cũ khỏi bị tái phát triển.', '{\"en\": \"Employees signed a petition asking the board of directors to improve the office cafeteria.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhân viên đã ký một bản kiến nghị yêu cầu ban giám đốc cải thiện nhà ăn văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-ljspeech-f05a1517.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-cori-f05a1517.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/petition-e6da9c7c.webp', '[\"appeal\", \"request\", \"application\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sign a petition\", \"meaning\": \"ký vào đơn kiến nghị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"submit a petition\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn kiến nghị\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"petition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-cori-f05a1517.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-aru0-f05a1517.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-aru5-f05a1517.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-aru6-f05a1517.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-aru10-f05a1517.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-aru9-f05a1517.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-aru3-f05a1517.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-aru7-f05a1517.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petition-aru8-f05a1517.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/