('bc57bfab-ebd7-5074-a604-43d8657d1732', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0552c98-1a58-520d-b4d4-2277b2bfd0a1', 'bcbff1bb-a9dd-57aa-9d58-988815030cd2', 'corporate', 'UK: /ˈkɔː.pər.ət/ | US: /ˈkɔːr.pər.ət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thuộc về công ty', 'relating to a large company or group that operates as a single business entity', 'The corporate policy was updated last quarter.', 'Chính sách của công ty đã được cập nhật vào quý trước.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO announced a major overhaul of the corporate travel policy.\", \"vi\": \"Tổng giám đốc đã thông báo về sự thay đổi lớn trong chính sách công tác của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-ljspeech-e276d18d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-cori-e276d18d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/corporate-6ed9ef7c.webp', '[\"company\", \"business\", \"commercial\"]', '[\"individual\", \"personal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"corporate culture\", \"meaning\": \"văn hóa doanh nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corporate headquarters\", \"meaning\": \"trụ sở chính của công ty\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"corporation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-cori-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru0-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru5-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru6-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru10-e276d18d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru9-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru3-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru7-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru8-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-aru2-e276d18d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-ljspeech-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt408-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt138-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt624-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt396-e276d18d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt498-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt132-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt288-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt42-e276d18d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/corporate-lt90-e276d18d.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ bổ nghĩa cho các danh từ doanh nghiệp, như \'corporate culture\' (văn hóa doanh nghiệp), \'corporate event\' (sự kiện công ty).', 'business', 1, 4),
('18b2d189-47cc-51b8-82c1-fd4426522cda', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0552c98-1a58-520d-b4d4-2277b2bfd0a1', 'bcbff1bb-a9dd-57aa-9d58-988815030cd2', 'rigorously', 'UK: /ˈrɪɡərəsli/ | US: /ˈrɪɡərəsli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'một cách nghiêm ngặt, chặt chẽ', 'in an extremely thorough, detailed, and strict manner according to exact standards.', 'The new procedures require rigorously tested equipment.', 'Các quy trình mới đòi hỏi thiết bị được kiểm tra nghiêm ngặt.', '{\"en\": \"Safety regulations are rigorously enforced throughout the construction site.\", \"vi\": \"Các quy định an toàn được thực thi một cách nghiêm ngặt trên toàn bộ công trường xây dựng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-ljspeech-87df92ac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-cori-87df92ac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rigorously-52f2374c.webp', '[\"thoroughly\", \"strictly\", \"meticulously\"]', '[\"loosely\", \"leniently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"rigorously enforce\", \"meaning\": \"thực thi nghiêm ngặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rigorously tested\", \"meaning\": \"được kiểm tra chặt chẽ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rigorous\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"rigor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-cori-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru0-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru5-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru6-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru10-87df92ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru9-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru3-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru7-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru8-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-aru2-87df92ac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-ljspeech-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt408-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt138-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt624-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt396-87df92ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt498-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt132-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt288-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt42-87df92ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rigorously-lt90-87df92ac.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ bổ nghĩa cho các động từ như enforce (thực thi), test (kiểm tra), inspect (thanh tra).', 'quality control', 1, 5),
('b10cd0d8-92bf-5ebb-96f1-4137caab411c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0552c98-1a58-520d-b4d4-2277b2bfd0a1', 'bcbff1bb-a9dd-57aa-9d58-988815030cd2', 'mechanism', '/ˈmekənɪzəm/', '', 'noun', 'Cơ chế, cách thức một hệ thống hoạt động.', 'a system of parts working together in a machine to perform a specific task.', 'The clock\'s intricate mechanism ensures its accurate timekeeping.', 'Cơ chế phức tạp của chiếc đồng hồ đảm bảo việc giữ thời gian chính xác của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The internal mechanism of the printer was jammed, causing a delay in printing the contracts.\", \"vi\": \"Cơ chế bên trong của máy in bị kẹt, gây ra sự chậm trễ trong việc in các hợp đồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-ljspeech-a955073d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-cori-a955073d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mechanism-73b4005a.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-cori-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru0-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru5-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru6-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru10-a955073d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru9-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru3-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru7-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru8-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-aru2-a955073d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-ljspeech-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mechanism-lt408-a955073d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mech