('02362bf0-b5f7-5b8b-91d3-40397182aa78', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0552c98-1a58-520d-b4d4-2277b2bfd0a1', 'bcbff1bb-a9dd-57aa-9d58-988815030cd2', 'prized', '/praɪzd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Được đánh giá cao, coi trọng.', 'very valuable or important to the person who owns it.', 'Her prized antique vase was carefully displayed in the living room.', 'Chiếc bình cổ quý giá của cô ấy được trưng bày cẩn thận trong phòng khách.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO kept his prized collection of awards in the main lobby for visitors.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành giữ bộ sưu tập giải thưởng quý giá của mình ở sảnh chính cho khách tham quan.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-ljspeech-bf77d38d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-cori-bf77d38d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prized-f53449a0.webp', '[\"valued\", \"treasured\"]', '[\"worthless\", \"unimportant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prized possession\", \"meaning\": \"tài sản quý giá\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly prized\", \"meaning\": \"được đánh giá rất cao\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"prize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-cori-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru0-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru5-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru6-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru10-bf77d38d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru9-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru3-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru7-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru8-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-aru2-bf77d38d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-ljspeech-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt408-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt138-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt624-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt396-bf77d38d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt498-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt132-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt288-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt42-bf77d38d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prized-lt90-bf77d38d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng làm tính từ đứng trước danh từ.', 'business', 1, 20),
('c8085915-cc78-5c64-af78-4006126bd09d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0552c98-1a58-520d-b4d4-2277b2bfd0a1', 'bcbff1bb-a9dd-57aa-9d58-988815030cd2', 'pinch', '/pɪntʃ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một lượng nhỏ của một chất, thường là bột, có thể kẹp giữa ngón tay.', 'a small amount of something that you can hold between your finger and thumb.', 'Add just a pinch of salt to enhance the flavor of the soup.', 'Chỉ cần thêm một nhúm muối để tăng hương vị cho món súp.', '{\"en\": \"The chef added a pinch of salt to the soup before serving the customers.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu bếp đã thêm một nhúm muối vào súp trước khi phục vụ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-ljspeech-fae64103.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-cori-fae64103.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pinch-d1ebb8da.webp', '[\"bit\", \"dash\", \"speck\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a pinch of salt\", \"meaning\": \"một nhúm muối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel the pinch\", \"meaning\": \"gặp khó khăn về tài chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"punch\", \"note_vi\": \"Cú đấm hoặc đục lỗ, tránh nhầm với pinch là nhúm/kẹp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"pinch\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-cori-fae64103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru0-fae64103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru5-fae64103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru6-fae64103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru10-fae64103.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru9-fae64103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru3-fae64103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru7-fae64103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru8-fae64103.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pinch-aru2-fae64103.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\"