('24a2c0e0-aa1a-5b36-8467-4ffa00a12949', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0552c98-1a58-520d-b4d4-2277b2bfd0a1', 'bcbff1bb-a9dd-57aa-9d58-988815030cd2', 'series', '/ˈsɪəriːz/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một chuỗi các sự việc, vật thể hoặc chương trình có liên quan đến nhau.', 'A continuous sequence of similar items, actions, or occurrences occurring in a specific order.', 'The new TV series about ancient Rome is very popular.', 'Loạt phim truyền hình mới về La Mã cổ đại rất được yêu thích.', '{\"en\": \"The company launched a series of training workshops to improve employee communication skills.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty tổ chức một loạt hội thảo đào tạo để nâng cao kỹ năng giao tiếp của nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-ljspeech-8c45d090.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-cori-8c45d090.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/series-3924bffe.webp', '[\"sequence\", \"chain\", \"succession\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"a series of\", \"meaning\": \"một loạt, một chuỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"TV series\", \"meaning\": \"phim truyền hình nhiều tập\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lecture series\", \"meaning\": \"chuỗi bài giảng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"serious\", \"note_vi\": \"series và serious gần giống nhau về chữ viết nhưng hoàn toàn khác nghĩa\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"serial\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"serial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-cori-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru0-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru5-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru6-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru10-8c45d090.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru9-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru3-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru7-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru8-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-aru2-8c45d090.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-ljspeech-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt408-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt138-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt624-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt396-8c45d090.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt498-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt132-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt288-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt42-8c45d090.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/series-lt90-8c45d090.mp3\"]}}', 'Series không đổi hình thức ở số nhiều (one series, two series); đừng viết thành serieses.', 'office', 1, 24),
('3d94207e-8a2d-5860-b85d-67d5e145a2d6', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0552c98-1a58-520d-b4d4-2277b2bfd0a1', 'bcbff1bb-a9dd-57aa-9d58-988815030cd2', 'arrangement', 'UK: /əˈreɪndʒmənt/ | US: /əˈreɪndʒmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'sự sắp xếp, chuẩn bị', 'a plan, preparation, or agreement made to ensure that a future event can take place successfully', 'The travel arrangements were handled by the assistant.', 'Việc sắp xếp chuyến đi do trợ lý xử lý.', '{\"en\": \"We need to make travel arrangements for the representatives attending the conference.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần chuẩn bị lịch trình di chuyển cho các đại diện tham dự hội thảo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-ljspeech-b40e1a7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-cori-b40e1a7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arrangement-7354b6a1.webp', '[\"preparation\", \"agreement\", \"organization\", \"plan\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make arrangements\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành chuẩn bị/sắp xếp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seating arrangement\", \"meaning\": \"sự bố trí chỗ ngồi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"arrange\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-cori-b40e1a7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-aru0-b40e1a7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-aru5-b40e1a7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-aru6-b40e1a7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-aru10-b40e1a7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-aru9-b40e1a7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-aru3-b40e1a7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-aru7-b40e1a7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangement-aru8-b40e1a7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arrangeme