('e80f264c-a319-57af-ac48-c2c2e6a85c3a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'blunt', '/blʌnt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Không sắc bén, không nhọn (vật thể); thẳng thắn, không tế nhị (người, lời nói).', 'Describing an instrument lacking a sharp edge, or a person communicating with uncompromising directness.', 'Our manager gave blunt feedback regarding the poor performance of the sales team.', 'Quản lý của chúng tôi đã đưa ra phản hồi thẳng thắn về hiệu suất kém của đội ngũ bán hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave a blunt assessment of the team\'s poor sales performance.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng đã đưa ra một đánh giá thẳng thắn về hiệu suất doanh số kém của nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-ljspeech-30a83295.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-cori-30a83295.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blunt-769b3710.webp', '[\"dull\", \"direct\", \"frank\"]', '[\"sharp\", \"tactful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"blunt instrument\", \"meaning\": \"dụng cụ cùn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"blunt criticism\", \"meaning\": \"lời phê bình thẳng thắn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bold\", \"note_vi\": \"bold nghĩa là dũng cảm hoặc táo bạo, không phải thẳng thắn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"bluntly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bluntness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-cori-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru0-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru5-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru6-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru10-30a83295.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru9-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru3-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru7-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru8-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-aru2-30a83295.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-ljspeech-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt408-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt138-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt624-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt396-30a83295.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt498-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt132-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt288-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt42-30a83295.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blunt-lt90-30a83295.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này vừa chỉ lưỡi dao cùn, vừa chỉ tính cách thẳng thắn đến mức hơi thô lỗ.', 'office', 1, 15),
('95682f54-fc1c-527a-9e4d-c3ea36421ab4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'attentive', 'UK: /əˈtɛn.tɪv/ | US: /əˈtɛn.tɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'chu đáo, ân cần', 'paying close attention and showing helpful consideration toward the needs of others.', 'Our attentive staff will ensure your comfort during the conference.', 'Đội ngũ nhân viên chu đáo của chúng tôi sẽ đảm bảo sự thoải mái cho bạn trong suốt hội nghị.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel staff received high praise from guests for providing exceptionally attentive customer service.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ nhân viên khách sạn nhận được lời khen ngợi cao từ khách hàng vì cung cấp dịch vụ chăm sóc cực kỳ chu đáo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-ljspeech-65b65874.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-cori-65b65874.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attentive-96cfb07c.webp', '[\"considerate\", \"mindful\", \"observant\", \"thoughtful\"]', '[\"inattentive\", \"neglectful\", \"careless\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"attentive service\", \"meaning\": \"dịch vụ chu đáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be attentive to\", \"meaning\": \"ân cần / chú tâm đến ai hoặc cái gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"attend\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attentiveness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"attentively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-cori-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru0-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru5-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru6-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru10-65b65874.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru9-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru3-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru7-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru8-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-aru2-65b65874.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-ljspeech-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt408-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt138-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt624-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt396-65b65874.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt498-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt132-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt288-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt42-65b65874.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attentive-lt90-65b65874.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các đánh giá dịch vụ (\'attentive service/staff\' - dịch vụ/nhân viên chu đáo) hoặc thái độ (\'attentive listener\').', 'hospitality', 1, 16),
('6c181baa-5854-5a64-85f6-ae184ca82a74', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'petrify', '/ˈpetrɪfaɪ/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm cho ai đó sợ hãi đến mức không thể cử động hoặc suy nghĩ.', 'to make someone feel so frightened that they are unable to move or think.', 'The thought of giving a presentation to hundreds of executives completely petrified the young intern.', 'Ý nghĩ về việc trình bày trước hàng trăm lãnh đạo cấp cao đã khiến thực tập sinh trẻ tuổi hoàn toàn khiếp sợ.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden news of mass layoffs might petrify employees across the company.\", \"vi\": \"Tin tức đột ngột về việc sa thải hàng loạt có thể làm nhân viên toàn công ty hoảng sợ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-ljspeech-42bd02a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-cori-42bd02a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/petrify-a0ae227f.webp', '[\"terrify\", \"frighten\", \"paralyze\"]', '[\"reassure\", \"calm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"petrify someone with fear\", \"meaning\": \"làm ai đó hoảng sợ đến lặng người\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"terrify\", \"note_vi\": \"terrify làm sợ hãi tột độ, petrify nhấn mạnh đến việc sợ cứng người không cử động được.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"petrified\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-cori-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru0-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru5-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru6-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru10-42bd02a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru9-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru3-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru7-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru8-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-aru2-42bd02a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-ljspeech-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt408-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt138-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt624-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt396-42bd02a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt498-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt132-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt288-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt42-42bd02a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/petrify-lt90-42bd02a1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp ở dạng tính từ bị động petrified (be petrified of sth: vô cùng sợ hãi).', 'other', 1, 17),
('6eaaf485-6288-5463-a64f-e92adae6dc24', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'campground', '/ˈkæmpɡraʊnd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nơi dành cho việc cắm trại, thường có các tiện nghi cơ bản.', 'an area where people can pitch tents and stay overnight with facilities.', 'We booked a spot at the national park campground for our summer vacation.', 'Chúng tôi đã đặt một chỗ tại khu cắm trại của công viên quốc gia cho kỳ nghỉ hè.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agent recommended a quiet campground near the lake for tourists.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch đã giới thiệu một khu cắm trại yên tĩnh gần hồ cho khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-ljspeech-5b2bb428.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-cori-5b2bb428.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/campground-10199923.webp', '[\"campsite\", \"camping area\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"national park campground\", \"meaning\": \"khu cắm trại công viên quốc gia\"}, {\"phrase\": \"campground facilities\", \"meaning\": \"tiện nghi khu cắm trại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"book a campground\", \"meaning\": \"đặt chỗ cắm trại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"battleground\", \"note_vi\": \"battleground là chiến trường, campground là khu cắm trại\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"camp\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"camping\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-cori-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru0-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru5-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru6-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru10-5b2bb428.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru9-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru3-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru7-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru8-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-aru2-5b2bb428.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-ljspeech-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt408-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt138-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt624-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt396-5b2bb428.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt498-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt132-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt288-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt42-5b2bb428.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/campground-lt90-5b2bb428.mp3\"]}}', 'Campground là nơi cắm trại, nhớ không phải battleground.', 'travel', 1, 18),
('0b33f15f-6a68-5225-acbd-dbc5ddcde771', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'wintry', '/ˈwɪntri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thuộc về mùa đông; lạnh giá, ảm đạm.', 'typical of winter, especially by being very cold, snowy, or gloomy.', 'The wintry weather made driving conditions very difficult.', 'Thời tiết giá lạnh khiến điều kiện lái xe trở nên rất khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency offered discounts on trips to escape the wintry weather of the north.\", \"vi\": \"Đại lý du lịch đã đưa ra các chương trình giảm giá cho các chuyến đi trốn thời tiết lạnh giá của miền bắc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-ljspeech-61e56f96.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-cori-61e56f96.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wintry-a4992d41.webp', '[\"cold\", \"chilly\", \"freezing\"]', '[\"summery\", \"warm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wintry weather\", \"meaning\": \"thời tiết giá lạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wintry shower\", \"meaning\": \"mưa tuyết lạnh giá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"winter\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-cori-61e56f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru0-61e56f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru5-61e56f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru6-61e56f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru10-61e56f96.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru9-61e56f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru3-61e56f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru7-61e56f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru8-61e56f96.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wintry-aru2-61e56f96.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/publi