('bb122244-e777-5b39-9202-6e9cbb279de3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'clutch', '/klʌtʃ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại túi xách nhỏ không có quai, thường dùng để cầm tay.', 'a small bag for women that has no handle and is carried by hand.', 'She carried a small black clutch with her phone and keys to the party.', 'Cô ấy mang một chiếc ví cầm tay nhỏ màu đen đựng điện thoại và chìa khóa đến bữa tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"A guest left a golden clutch in the conference hall after the annual meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Một vị khách đã bỏ quên một chiếc túi cầm tay màu vàng ở phòng hội nghị sau cuộc họp thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-ljspeech-e3d1507f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-cori-e3d1507f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clutch-20b7be12.webp', '[\"pouch\", \"handbag\", \"purse\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"carry a clutch\", \"meaning\": \"cầm một túi xách nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leather clutch\", \"meaning\": \"túi xách nhỏ bằng da\"}, {\"phrase\": \"evening clutch\", \"meaning\": \"túi cầm tay dự tiệc tối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"clutch\", \"note_vi\": \"cùng chính tả nhưng làm động từ nghĩa là nắm chặt.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-cori-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru0-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru5-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru6-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru10-e3d1507f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru9-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru3-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru7-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru8-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-aru2-e3d1507f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-ljspeech-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt408-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt138-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt624-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt396-e3d1507f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt498-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt132-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt288-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt42-e3d1507f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clutch-lt90-e3d1507f.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ clutch còn là động từ \'nắm chặt\', không nhầm nghĩa túi xách.', 'business', 1, 21),
('d549b468-ee9c-55e4-82f6-315447ad4d96', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'backseat', 'UK: /ˈbæksiːt/ | US: /ˈbækˌsit/', 'B1', 'noun', 'ghế sau (ô tô)', 'the rear sitting row situated behind the driver inside a passenger vehicle or car', 'The client sat in the backseat of the car.', 'Khách hàng ngồi ở ghế sau xe.', '{\"en\": \"During the company trip, the executives sat in the backseat of the hired limousine.\", \"vi\": \"Trong chuyến đi của công ty, các giám đốc điều hành ngồi ở ghế sau của chiếc limousine được thuê.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-ljspeech-3857ab74.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-cori-3857ab74.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/backseat-1db8e948.webp', '[\"rear seat\"]', '[\"front seat\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take a backseat\", \"meaning\": \"lùi về sau, nhận vai trò phụ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"backseat driver\", \"meaning\": \"người ngồi sau chỉ tay 5 ngón / can thiệp việc lái xe\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-cori-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru0-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru5-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru6-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru10-3857ab74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru9-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru3-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru7-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru8-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-aru2-3857ab74.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-ljspeech-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt408-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt138-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt624-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt396-3857ab74.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt498-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt132-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt288-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt42-3857ab74.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/backseat-lt90-3857ab74.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết liền \'backseat\'. Cụm \'take a backseat\' có nghĩa là lùi về sau, giữ vai trò ít quan trọng hơn.', 'travel', 1, 22),
('aa3daab1-e012-51fd-9bd3-a4e8c39ca603', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'copper', '/ˈkɒpə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một kim loại màu đỏ nâu, mềm, dẫn điện tốt.', 'a reddish-brown metal that is soft and very good at carrying electricity and heat.', 'Electrical wires are often made of copper due to its conductivity.', 'Dây điện thường được làm bằng đồng vì khả năng dẫn điện của nó.', '{\"en\": \"The contractor ordered a large shipment of copper cables for the new office building wiring.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thầu đã đặt một lô hàng cáp đồng lớn cho hệ thống dây điện của tòa nhà văn phòng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-ljspeech-9c5c7205.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-cori-9c5c7205.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/copper-6901247f.webp', '[\"metal\", \"conductor\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"copper wire\", \"meaning\": \"dây đồng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"copper pipe\", \"meaning\": \"ống đồng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-cori-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru0-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru5-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru6-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru10-9c5c7205.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru9-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru3-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru7-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru8-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-aru2-9c5c7205.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-ljspeech-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt408-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt138-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt624-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt396-9c5c7205.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt498-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt132-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt288-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt42-9c5c7205.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/copper-lt90-9c5c7205.mp3\"]}}', 'Đồng là vật liệu phổ biến trong xây dựng và điện tử.', 'manufacturing', 1, 23),
('e046a04c-f816-55fa-8daf-b3aa7b7acd7a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0a14666-ca27-5b74-be25-13cf87372ff7', 'bc2ad68c-2cbc-5b7a-8efd-8f60591aaaf7', 'howl', '/haʊl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Kêu một tiếng dài, to và buồn (như chó sói).', 'to make a long, loud, and sad sound like an animal or the wind blowing.', 'The strong wind began to howl through the trees all night.', 'Gió mạnh bắt đầu hú qua những hàng cây suốt đêm.', '{\"en\": \"The old ventilation system began to howl loudly during the meeting in the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống thông gió cũ bắt đầu rít lên ầm ĩ trong suốt cuộc họp tại phòng hội nghị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-ljspeech-c3f51c20.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-cori-c3f51c20.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/howl-a2af09d7.webp', '[\"wail\", \"roar\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"howl with wind\", \"meaning\": \"gió rít\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-cori-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru0-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru5-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru6-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru10-c3f51c20.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru9-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru3-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru7-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru8-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-aru2-c3f51c20.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-ljspeech-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-lt408-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/howl-lt138-c3f51c20.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi