('bfe0ecda-3bfd-5fd2-866d-e7f75da807ea', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0cf9265-24de-5c5a-bd5d-663e347ecbe7', 'd9c229ca-4dcf-568d-a30d-b4c213be1cce', 'inevitable', '/ɪnˈevɪtəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Chắc chắn xảy ra, không thể tránh khỏi.', 'certain to happen and impossible to avoid or prevent from occurring in the future.', 'With rapid market shifts, restructuring the company had become completely inevitable.', 'Với sự thay đổi thị trường nhanh chóng, việc tái cơ cấu công ty đã trở nên hoàn toàn không thể tránh khỏi.', '{\"en\": \"Given the current market trends, a price increase for our raw materials seems quite inevitable.\", \"vi\": \"Với xu hướng thị trường hiện tại, việc tăng giá nguyên liệu thô của chúng ta dường như là không thể tránh khỏi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-ljspeech-c991d290.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-cori-c991d290.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inevitable-cbe3cd36.webp', '[\"unavoidable\", \"inescapable\"]', '[\"avoidable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inevitable consequence\", \"meaning\": \"hệ quả tất yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem inevitable\", \"meaning\": \"dường như không thể tránh khỏi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"inevitability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-cori-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru0-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru5-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru6-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru10-c991d290.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru9-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru3-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inevitable-aru7-c991d290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publ