('6d2c9b88-6caa-55c0-aa97-b6672406d92b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0cf9265-24de-5c5a-bd5d-663e347ecbe7', 'd9c229ca-4dcf-568d-a30d-b4c213be1cce', 'supplementary', 'UK: /ˌsʌplɪˈmɛntəri/ | US: /ˌsʌplɪˈmɛntəri/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'bổ sung', 'Serving as an extra addition to complete or enhance an existing set of materials.', 'The company provided supplementary materials for the new software.', 'Công ty cung cấp tài liệu bổ sung cho phần mềm mới.', '{\"en\": \"Supplementary materials will be distributed to all participants before the seminar.\", \"vi\": \"Tài liệu bổ sung sẽ được phát cho tất cả người tham dự trước buổi thảo luận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-ljspeech-b7421eb9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-cori-b7421eb9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/supplementary-3ab4fd9d.webp', '[\"additional\", \"complementary\", \"extra\"]', '[\"essential\", \"core\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"supplementary information\", \"meaning\": \"thông tin bổ sung\"}, {\"phrase\": \"supplementary materials\", \"meaning\": \"tài liệu bổ sung\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"supplement\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"supplement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"supplemental\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-cori-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru0-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru5-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru6-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru10-b7421eb9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru9-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru3-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru7-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru8-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-aru2-b7421eb9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-ljspeech-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt408-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt138-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt624-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt396-b7421eb9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt498-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt132-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt288-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt42-b7421eb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/supplementary-lt90-b7421eb9.mp3\"]}}', '\'Supplementary\' thường hay đi kèm với các danh từ chỉ tài liệu, thông tin như \'supplementary information/materials\'.', 'office', 1, 3),
('697d71d1-6077-5d75-9b0c-0c6382ab26a9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0cf9265-24de-5c5a-bd5d-663e347ecbe7', 'd9c229ca-4dcf-568d-a30d-b4c213be1cce', 'chagrined', '/ˈʃæɡrɪnd/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy thất vọng hoặc bẽ bàng vì đã làm sai hoặc thất bại.', 'feeling disappointed, annoyed, or embarrassed because of failure or a mistake.', 'She was chagrined when her mistake was pointed out in front of the whole team.', 'Cô ấy cảm thấy bẽ bàng khi lỗi của mình bị chỉ ra trước toàn đội.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was chagrined to discover that the budget reports contained several major errors.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã cảm thấy thất vọng và bẽ bàng khi phát hiện ra báo cáo ngân sách chứa nhiều lỗi lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-ljspeech-4bdcaea0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-cori-4bdcaea0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chagrined-fa0998d3.webp', '[\"embarrassed\", \"disappointed\", \"mortified\"]', '[\"delighted\", \"pleased\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deeply chagrined\", \"meaning\": \"rất thất vọng và bẽ bàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"felt chagrined\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy ngượng ngùng thất vọng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"chagrin\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"chagrin\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-cori-4bdcaea0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-aru0-4bdcaea0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-aru5-4bdcaea0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-aru6-4bdcaea0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-aru10-4bdcaea0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-aru9-4bdcaea0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-aru3-4bdcaea0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chagrined-aru7-4bdcaea0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obj