('2b34f5eb-7e10-5af4-9aa9-3a7245fc98be', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0cf9265-24de-5c5a-bd5d-663e347ecbe7', 'd9c229ca-4dcf-568d-a30d-b4c213be1cce', 'stimulate', 'UK: /ˈstɪmjəleɪt/ | US: /ˈstɪmjəleɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'kích thích, khuyến khích', 'to encourage or arouse interest, enthusiasm, or activity in someone or something.', 'They aim to stimulate economic growth in the region.', 'Họ nhằm mục đích kích thích tăng trưởng kinh tế trong khu vực.', '{\"en\": \"The government introduced tax incentives to stimulate investment in renewable energy projects.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đã đưa ra các chính sách ưu đãi thuế để kích thích đầu tư vào các dự án năng lượng tái tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-ljspeech-e26c861b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-cori-e26c861b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stimulate-06d06e2b.webp', '[\"encourage\", \"boost\", \"foster\", \"prompt\"]', '[\"discourage\", \"suppress\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stimulate the economy\", \"meaning\": \"kích thích nền kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stimulate demand\", \"meaning\": \"kích cầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"simulate\", \"note_vi\": \"mô phỏng, giả lập (khác với stimulate là kích thích/thúc đẩy)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stimulation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stimulating\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stimulus\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-cori-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru0-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru5-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru6-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru10-e26c861b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru9-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru3-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru7-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru8-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-aru2-e26c861b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-ljspeech-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt408-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt138-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt624-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt396-e26c861b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt498-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt132-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt288-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt42-e26c861b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stimulate-lt90-e26c861b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'stimulate\' (kích thích, thúc đẩy) với \'simulate\' (mô phỏng, giả lập).', 'finance', 1, 14),
('7e2b46ac-c47f-5fec-9f0f-3ea29102ce10', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0cf9265-24de-5c5a-bd5d-663e347ecbe7', 'd9c229ca-4dcf-568d-a30d-b4c213be1cce', 'economy', '/ɪˈkɒnəmi/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Hệ thống sản xuất và phân phối hàng hóa, dịch vụ của một quốc gia.', 'An organized system that encompasses the production, distribution, and consumption of goods and services nationwide.', 'The global economy is facing several challenges, including inflation and supply chain issues.', 'Nền kinh tế toàn cầu đang đối mặt với nhiều thách thức, bao gồm lạm phát và các vấn đề chuỗi cung ứng.', '{\"en\": \"Rising interest rates are affecting the economy and slowing down business investment.\", \"vi\": \"Lãi suất tăng đang ảnh hưởng đến nền kinh tế và làm chậm đầu tư kinh doanh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-ljspeech-8ec4382b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-cori-8ec4382b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/economy-24b1536a.webp', '[\"financial system\", \"market\", \"commerce\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"global economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế toàn cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"boost the economy\", \"meaning\": \"thúc đẩy nền kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economy of scale\", \"meaning\": \"lợi thế kinh tế theo quy mô\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"economic\", \"note_vi\": \"economic là tính từ nghĩa \'thuộc về kinh tế\', còn economical nghĩa là \'tiết kiệm, không lãng phí\'.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"economic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"economical\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"economically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"economist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-cori-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru0-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru5-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru6-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru10-8ec4382b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru9-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru3-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru7-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru8-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-aru2-8ec4382b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-ljspeech-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt408-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt138-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt624-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt396-8ec4382b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt498-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt132-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt288-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt42-8ec4382b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/economy-lt90-8ec4382b.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt: \'economic\' (thuộc về kinh tế) và \'economical\' (tiết kiệm) — hai tính từ này rất dễ nhầm trong TOEIC.', 'finance', 1, 15),
('7ea3f3a0-0794-5292-8da0-a2f6110df657', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0cf9265-24de-5c5a-bd5d-663e347ecbe7', 'd9c229ca-4dcf-568d-a30d-b4c213be1cce', 'shrinkage', '/ˈʃrɪŋkɪdʒ/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự giảm kích thước, khối lượng hoặc giá trị.', 'the process of becoming smaller in size, amount, or value.', 'The manufacturer replaced the cotton fabric to prevent shrinkage during high-temperature drying.', 'Nhà sản xuất đã thay thế vải cotton để ngăn ngừa tình trạng co lại khi sấy ở nhiệt độ cao.', '{\"en\": \"The retail store reported a loss due to inventory shrinkage this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng bán lẻ đã báo cáo một khoản lỗ do hao hụt hàng tồn kho trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-ljspeech-e113f94a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-cori-e113f94a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shrinkage-b61a23ac.webp', '[\"reduction\", \"decrease\", \"contraction\"]', '[\"growth\", \"expansion\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inventory shrinkage\", \"meaning\": \"sự hao hụt hàng tồn kho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent shrinkage\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn ngừa sự co rút/hao hụt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"shortage\", \"note_vi\": \"shortage là sự thiếu hụt, còn shrinkage là sự hao hụt/co rút.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"shrink\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"shrunken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-cori-e113f94a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-aru0-e113f94a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-aru5-e113f94a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-aru6-e113f94a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-aru10-e113f94a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-aru9-e113f94a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shrinkage-aru3-e113f94a.mp3\", \"/stora