('53dd10ea-80b7-5aa2-85ff-fa118d4a9801', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0cf9265-24de-5c5a-bd5d-663e347ecbe7', 'd9c229ca-4dcf-568d-a30d-b4c213be1cce', 'coagulation', '/kəʊˌæɡjuˈleɪʃn/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Quá trình chất lỏng đặc lại hoặc đông lại, đặc biệt là máu.', 'the process by which a liquid, especially blood, changes into a solid or semi-solid state.', 'The doctor explained that proper blood coagulation is essential for wound healing.', 'Bác sĩ giải thích rằng quá trình đông máu thích hợp rất cần thiết cho việc chữa lành vết thương.', '{\"en\": \"The medical report indicates that the patient has a problem with the process of blood coagulation.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo y tế chỉ ra rằng bệnh nhân gặp vấn đề với quá trình đông máu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-ljspeech-1483301a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-cori-1483301a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coagulation-aef175a2.webp', '[\"clotting\", \"thickening\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"blood coagulation\", \"meaning\": \"sự đông máu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coagulation factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố đông máu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"coagulate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-cori-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru0-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru5-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru6-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru10-1483301a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru9-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru3-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru7-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru8-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-aru2-1483301a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-ljspeech-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt408-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt138-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt624-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt396-1483301a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt498-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt132-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt288-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt42-1483301a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coagulation-lt90-1483301a.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ chuyên môn y khoa, ít dùng trong giao tiếp thông thường.', 'health', 1, 18),
('3e324862-37b5-58a3-ae4f-9e20cf210407', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd0cf9265-24de-5c5a-bd5d-663e347ecbe7', 'd9c229ca-4dcf-568d-a30d-b4c213be1cce', 'under the knife', '/ˈʌndə ðə naɪf/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Trải qua phẫu thuật, mổ xẻ.', 'to have a medical operation performed on your body in a hospital setting.', 'The famous athlete went under the knife yesterday to repair a damaged shoulder tendon.', 'Vận động viên nổi tiếng đã lên bàn mổ ngày hôm qua để điều trị gân vai bị tổn thương.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO had to go under the knife last week, so he is currently on leave.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã phải phẫu thuật vào tuần trước, vì vậy ông ấy hiện đang nghỉ phép.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-ljspeech-2bd0546d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-cori-2bd0546d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/under-the-knife-4bd8b592.webp', '[\"have surgery\", \"undergo an operation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"go under the knife\", \"meaning\": \"đi phẫu thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"scheduled to go under the knife\", \"meaning\": \"được lên lịch phẫu thuật\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-cori-2bd0546d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-aru0-2bd0546d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-aru5-2bd0546d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-aru6-2bd0546d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-aru10-2bd0546d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-aru9-2bd0546d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-aru3-2bd0546d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-aru7-2bd0546d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/under-the-knife-aru8-2bd0546d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/ob