('f012853e-1693-5ee4-8303-3d808c243b7f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd4e9617e-a282-5e1f-945c-797ec943003f', '46727505-dc1d-5759-9cca-9b1bba157e49', 'marvelous', '/ˈmɑːvələs/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất tuyệt vời, phi thường hoặc đáng kinh ngạc.', 'extremely good, impressive, or wonderful in a way that surprises you.', 'The chef prepared a marvelous dinner for all the international delegates.', 'Đầu bếp đã chuẩn bị một bữa tối tuyệt vời cho tất cả các đại biểu quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The sales team delivered a marvelous performance during the annual review meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ bán hàng đã có màn trình bày tuyệt vời trong cuộc họp đánh giá hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-ljspeech-15303209.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-cori-15303209.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/marvelous-3a45ff49.webp', '[\"wonderful\", \"extraordinary\", \"magnificent\"]', '[\"terrible\", \"dreadful\", \"awful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"marvelous performance\", \"meaning\": \"màn trình bày tuyệt vời\"}, {\"phrase\": \"marvelous achievement\", \"meaning\": \"thành tích phi thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"simply marvelous\", \"meaning\": \"thật sự tuyệt vời\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"miraculous\", \"note_vi\": \"miraculous mang nghĩa kỳ diệu như phép màu, marvelous chỉ đơn giản là rất tuyệt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"marvel\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"marvel\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"marvelously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-cori-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru0-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru5-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru6-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru10-15303209.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru9-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru3-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru7-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru8-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-aru2-15303209.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-ljspeech-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt408-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt138-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt624-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt396-15303209.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt498-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt132-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt288-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt42-15303209.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/marvelous-lt90-15303209.mp3\"]}}', 'Người Mỹ viết \'marvelous\', người Anh viết \'marvellous\' — cả hai đều đúng.', 'other', 1, 5),
('0fbef2c9-b351-5c91-bce7-719dc25a12ab', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd4e9617e-a282-5e1f-945c-797ec943003f', '46727505-dc1d-5759-9cca-9b1bba157e49', 'livestock', '/ˈlaɪvstɒk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Các loài vật nuôi trong trang trại như bò, cừu, lợn.', 'animals such as cows, sheep, and pigs that are kept on a farm.', 'The farmer raised various types of livestock, including cows and chickens.', 'Người nông dân nuôi nhiều loại gia súc, bao gồm bò và gà.', '{\"en\": \"The agricultural company exports high-quality livestock to several countries in Asia.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty nông nghiệp xuất khẩu gia súc chất lượng cao sang một số nước ở châu Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-ljspeech-6285a5ff.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-cori-6285a5ff.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/livestock-c516ebc2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"raise livestock\", \"meaning\": \"chăn nuôi gia súc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"livestock farming\", \"meaning\": \"ngành chăn nuôi gia súc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"livestock feed\", \"meaning\": \"thức ăn gia súc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"poultry\", \"note_vi\": \"Chỉ gia cầm (gà, vịt), còn livestock là gia súc.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-cori-6285a5ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-aru0-6285a5ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-aru5-6285a5ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-aru6-6285a5ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-aru10-6285a5ff.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-aru9-6285a5ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-aru3-6285a5ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-aru7-6285a5ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/livestock-aru8-6285a5ff.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object