('0dc370b6-4e1a-5199-921e-b85db3e24a7e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd4e9617e-a282-5e1f-945c-797ec943003f', '46727505-dc1d-5759-9cca-9b1bba157e49', 'problematic', '/ˌprɒbləˈmætɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây ra vấn đề, khó khăn; có vấn đề.', 'causing difficulties or likely to result in a negative situation for people or organizations.', 'The new policy has proven to be quite problematic for small businesses.', 'Chính sách mới đã chứng tỏ là khá có vấn đề đối với các doanh nghiệp nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The manager found the current scheduling system to be highly problematic for the night shift.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý thấy hệ thống lịch trình hiện tại gây ra nhiều khó khăn cho ca đêm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-ljspeech-9245884c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-cori-9245884c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/problematic-5721057a.webp', '[\"troublesome\", \"difficult\"]', '[\"straightforward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly problematic\", \"meaning\": \"rất có vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain problematic\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn còn gây khó khăn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"problem\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-cori-9245884c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-aru0-9245884c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-aru5-9245884c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-aru6-9245884c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-aru10-9245884c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-aru9-9245884c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-aru3-9245884c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-aru7-9245884c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/problematic-aru8-9245884c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje