('6788e521-ae87-5977-9f3f-a104ed8694f7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd64ad65b-79c0-566c-af2c-4675dc9f5f4d', '885c36f7-9c94-5e76-9a46-3d69de35b00f', 'gladness', '/ˈɡlædnəs/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác vui vẻ, hạnh phúc hoặc sự hài lòng.', 'state of being happy and pleased about something good.', 'There was a general feeling of gladness when the good news was announced.', 'Có một cảm giác vui mừng chung khi tin tốt được công bố.', '{\"en\": \"The team\'s success brought gladness to all employees at the annual meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Thành công của đội ngũ mang lại niềm vui cho mọi nhân viên tại cuộc họp thường niên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-ljspeech-5bdf9914.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-cori-5bdf9914.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gladness-573ed655.webp', '[\"joy\", \"happiness\"]', '[\"sadness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"feel gladness\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy vui mừng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"express gladness\", \"meaning\": \"thể hiện sự vui mừng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"glad\", \"note_vi\": \"glad là tính từ, gladness là danh từ chỉ sự vui vẻ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"glad\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"gladly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-cori-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru0-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru5-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru6-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru10-5bdf9914.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru9-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru3-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru7-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru8-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-aru2-5bdf9914.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-ljspeech-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt408-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt138-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt624-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt396-5bdf9914.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt498-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt132-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt288-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt42-5bdf9914.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gladness-lt90-5bdf9914.mp3\"]}}', 'Gladness trang trọng hơn happiness, ít dùng trong giao tiếp hàng ngày.', 'office', 1, 20),
('17c6255b-6be4-572f-bd56-dc9f0364aa94', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd64ad65b-79c0-566c-af2c-4675dc9f5f4d', '885c36f7-9c94-5e76-9a46-3d69de35b00f', 'thoughtfully', '/ˈθɔːtfəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách cẩn thận, chu đáo hoặc suy nghĩ sâu sắc.', 'in a way that shows you are thinking carefully about the needs of other people.', 'He listened thoughtfully to her explanation before giving his advice.', 'Anh ấy lắng nghe lời giải thích của cô ấy một cách chu đáo trước khi đưa ra lời khuyên.', '{\"en\": \"She thoughtfully prepared the meeting agenda to address all the concerns of the international clients.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy đã chuẩn bị chương trình họp một cách chu đáo để giải quyết mọi mối quan tâm của khách hàng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-ljspeech-e5a1c376.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-cori-e5a1c376.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/thoughtfully-c7b64b75.webp', '[\"considerately\", \"carefully\"]', '[\"thoughtlessly\", \"carelessly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"thoughtfully prepared\", \"meaning\": \"được chuẩn bị chu đáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"thoughtfully considered\", \"meaning\": \"được cân nhắc kỹ lưỡng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"thoughtful\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"thought\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-cori-e5a1c376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-aru0-e5a1c376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-aru5-e5a1c376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-aru6-e5a1c376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-aru10-e5a1c376.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-aru9-e5a1c376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/thoughtfully-aru3-e5a1c376.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat