('60e2e982-c8d6-5c93-9aff-d57d15e5ce83', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd64ad65b-79c0-566c-af2c-4675dc9f5f4d', '885c36f7-9c94-5e76-9a46-3d69de35b00f', 'faithful', '/ˈfeɪθfl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'trung thành, đáng tin cậy, tận tâm.', 'remaining loyal and true to a person, organization, or set of beliefs.', 'Our dog is a very faithful companion and always waits for us by the door.', 'Con chó của chúng tôi là một người bạn rất trung thành và luôn đợi chúng tôi ở cửa.', '{\"en\": \"The company rewarded its most faithful clients with exclusive discounts and special service packages.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thưởng cho những khách hàng trung thành nhất các khoản giảm giá độc quyền và gói dịch vụ đặc biệt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-ljspeech-9bfdd8b5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-cori-9bfdd8b5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/faithful-cfe3e385.webp', '[\"loyal\", \"devoted\", \"trustworthy\"]', '[\"disloyal\", \"unfaithful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"faithful service\", \"meaning\": \"sự phục vụ tận tụy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"faithful customer\", \"meaning\": \"khách hàng trung thành\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"faithfully\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"faithfulness\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"faith\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-cori-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru0-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru5-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru6-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru10-9bfdd8b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru9-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru3-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru7-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru8-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-aru2-9bfdd8b5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-ljspeech-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt408-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt138-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt624-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt396-9bfdd8b5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt498-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt132-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt288-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt42-9bfdd8b5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/faithful-lt90-9bfdd8b5.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC hay dùng cho khách hàng trung thành hoặc nhân viên tận tụy.', 'business', 1, 24),
('631a1d44-71c8-5e16-90f1-0725a5a558a4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd64ad65b-79c0-566c-af2c-4675dc9f5f4d', '885c36f7-9c94-5e76-9a46-3d69de35b00f', 'discontent', '/ˌdɪskənˈtent/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác không hài lòng hoặc không vui với một tình huống.', 'a feeling of wanting something better than what you have, or not being satisfied.', 'Widespread discontent among customers forced the airline to improve its baggage handling system.', 'Sự bất mãn diện rộng của khách hàng đã buộc hãng hàng không phải cải thiện hệ thống xử lý hành lý.', '{\"en\": \"The management addressed the growing discontent among employees by offering a small salary increase.\", \"vi\": \"Ban quản lý đã giải quyết sự bất mãn ngày càng tăng của nhân viên bằng cách tăng lương nhẹ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-ljspeech-59e1c9bd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-cori-59e1c9bd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/discontent-bc5dc6e4.webp', '[\"dissatisfaction\", \"unhappiness\", \"displeasure\"]', '[\"contentment\", \"satisfaction\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"express discontent\", \"meaning\": \"bày tỏ sự bất mãn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"growing discontent\", \"meaning\": \"sự bất mãn ngày càng tăng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"discontented\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-cori-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru0-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru5-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru6-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru10-59e1c9bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru9-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru3-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru7-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru8-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-aru2-59e1c9bd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-ljspeech-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt408-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt138-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt624-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt396-59e1c9bd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt498-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt132-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt288-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt42-59e1c9bd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/discontent-lt90-59e1c9bd.mp3\"]}}', 'Discontent là sự bất mãn, ngược nghĩa với contentment (sự hài lòng).', 'hr', 1, 25),
('f304c0e9-e0fe-590f-9a81-6dc2b99de21d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd64ad65b-79c0-566c-af2c-4675dc9f5f4d', '885c36f7-9c94-5e76-9a46-3d69de35b00f', 'savory', '/ˈseɪvəri/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có vị mặn hoặc cay, không ngọt; ngon miệng.', 'having a salty or spicy taste rather than sweet; pleasant to eat.', 'The restaurant serves delicious savory pastries filled with seasoned beef and vegetables.', 'Nhà hàng phục vụ bánh nướng nhân mặn thơm ngon chứa thịt bò ướp gia vị cùng rau củ.', '{\"en\": \"Our hotel breakfast includes savory pastries with cheese for the guests.\", \"vi\": \"Bữa sáng khách sạn chúng tôi bao gồm các bánh mặn có phô mai cho khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-ljspeech-c67a342e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-cori-c67a342e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/savory-0781d892.webp', '[\"salty\", \"tasty\", \"flavorful\"]', '[\"sweet\", \"bland\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"savory dish\", \"meaning\": \"món ăn mặn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"savory flavor\", \"meaning\": \"vị mặn ngon miệng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"savory snack\", \"meaning\": \"đồ ăn nhẹ mặn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"suave\", \"note_vi\": \"suave nghĩa là lịch lãm, không liên quan vị mặn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"savor\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"savoriness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-cori-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru0-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru5-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru6-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru10-c67a342e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru9-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru3-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru7-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru8-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-aru2-c67a342e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-ljspeech-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt408-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt138-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt624-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt396-c67a342e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt498-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt132-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt288-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt42-c67a342e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/savory-lt90-c67a342e.mp3\"]}}', 'Savory chỉ vị mặn/cay, không dùng cho đồ ngọt; tránh nhầm với sweet.', 'dining', 1, 26),
('f4d2e2f3-1246-5b7e-8b55-84e95ea2ae98', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd64ad65b-79c0-566c-af2c-4675dc9f5f4d', '885c36f7-9c94-5e76-9a46-3d69de35b00f', 'bitter', '/ˈbɪtə/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có vị đắng, khó chịu; hoặc cảm giác giận dữ, cay đắng.', 'having a sharp, unpleasant taste, or feeling angry and unhappy about past events.', 'The former business partners expressed bitter feelings toward each other after the dispute.', 'Các đối tác kinh doanh cũ đã bày tỏ cảm xúc cay đắng dành cho nhau sau cuộc tranh chấp.', '{\"en\": \"The executive expressed bitter disappointment following the unexpected failure of the merger negotiation.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành đã thể hiện sự thất vọng cay đắng sau thất bại bất ngờ của cuộc đàm phán sáp nhập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-ljspeech-23fda791.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-cori-23fda791.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bitter-4c321540.webp', '[\"acrid\", \"resentful\", \"hostile\"]', '[\"sweet\", \"content\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bitter taste\", \"meaning\": \"vị đắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bitter disappointment\", \"meaning\": \"nỗi thất vọng cay đắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bitter dispute\", \"meaning\": \"tranh chấp gay gắt\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sour\", \"note_vi\": \"vị chua (chanh, giấm), khác với vị đắng (cà phê, thuốc)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bitterness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"bitterly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-cori-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru0-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru5-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru6-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru10-23fda791.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bitter-aru9-23fda791.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec