('44aacf9d-6cef-5a61-8512-6c1685847bf3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd975b600-6bc6-52ce-9bca-95f5bec4ddbc', 'd49e035c-8e71-5c6f-9dd3-eaa466a40e94', 'eighteen', '/ˌeɪˈtiːn/', 'A1', 'adjective', 'Số lượng tương đương mười tám đơn vị.', 'being the number that is equal to ten plus eight.', 'My younger brother will turn eighteen next month and can finally get his driver\'s license.', 'Em trai tôi sẽ tròn mười tám tuổi vào tháng tới và cuối cùng có thể lấy bằng lái xe.', '{\"en\": \"The project took eighteen months to complete, which was longer than we expected.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án đã mất mười tám tháng để hoàn thành, lâu hơn chúng tôi dự kiến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-ljspeech-70c6adb6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-cori-70c6adb6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/eighteen-c62f74f7.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"eighteen years old\", \"meaning\": \"mười tám tuổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"eighteen percent\", \"meaning\": \"mười tám phần trăm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eighty\", \"note_vi\": \"tám mươi, dễ nhầm khi nghe\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"eighteen\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"eighteenth\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-cori-70c6adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-aru0-70c6adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-aru5-70c6adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-aru6-70c6adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-aru10-70c6adb6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-aru9-70c6adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-aru3-70c6adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-aru7-70c6adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/eighteen-aru8-70c6adb6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro