('97377e04-d426-5ae6-9fc6-df57711dac98', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'd975b600-6bc6-52ce-9bca-95f5bec4ddbc', 'd49e035c-8e71-5c6f-9dd3-eaa466a40e94', 'mushroom', '/ˈmʌʃrʊm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một loại nấm có mũ và thân, thường mọc trên mặt đất hoặc gỗ.', 'a type of fungus with a short stem and a round top that you can eat.', 'We picked some wild mushrooms in the forest, but we made sure they were safe to eat.', 'Chúng tôi hái một vài cây nấm dại trong rừng, nhưng chúng tôi đã đảm bảo chúng an toàn để ăn.', '{\"en\": \"The catering service will prepare a special mushroom soup for the upcoming business luncheon.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ ăn uống sẽ chuẩn bị món súp nấm đặc biệt cho bữa trưa doanh nhân sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-ljspeech-917eaf5e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-cori-917eaf5e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mushroom-00f73cea.webp', '[\"fungus\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wild mushroom\", \"meaning\": \"nấm dại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mushroom soup\", \"meaning\": \"súp nấm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mushroom\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-cori-917eaf5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru0-917eaf5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru5-917eaf5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru6-917eaf5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru10-917eaf5e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru9-917eaf5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru3-917eaf5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru7-917eaf5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru8-917eaf5e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mushroom-aru2-917eaf5e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stor