('6584c695-a963-56dc-a2df-2a890a8d738a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'dc98caf9-9744-530e-9a8b-7fb3e96c7c54', '1439c32e-da6b-5ff4-9039-1ed978deea9c', 'feast', '/fiːst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bữa ăn lớn, thịnh soạn, thường trong dịp đặc biệt.', 'a large and elaborate meal served on a special celebration or event.', 'The villagers prepared a grand feast to celebrate the harvest.', 'Dân làng đã chuẩn bị một bữa tiệc lớn để mừng vụ mùa bội thu.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel arranged a lavish feast for the international business conference guests.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn đã bày biện một bữa tiệc thịnh soạn cho khách tham dự hội nghị kinh doanh quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-ljspeech-f37a74d8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-cori-f37a74d8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/feast-614e40fe.webp', '[\"banquet\", \"spread\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"grand feast\", \"meaning\": \"bữa tiệc lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feast on\", \"meaning\": \"thưởng thức ăn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wedding feast\", \"meaning\": \"tiệc cưới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fiesta\", \"note_vi\": \"fiesta là lễ hội, feast là bữa ăn thịnh soạn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"feast\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-cori-f37a74d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-aru0-f37a74d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-aru5-f37a74d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-aru6-f37a74d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-aru10-f37a74d8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-aru9-f37a74d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-aru3-f37a74d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-aru7-f37a74d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/feast-aru8-f37a74d8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/