('8642056b-c533-585d-93dc-a698d148af30', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'pudding', '/ˈpʊdɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại món tráng miệng mềm, ngọt, thường được làm từ sữa, trứng và đường.', 'a sweet, soft food eaten at the end of a meal as a dessert.', 'For dessert, we had a delicious chocolate pudding with vanilla ice cream.', 'Để tráng miệng, chúng tôi đã ăn món bánh pudding sô cô la ngon tuyệt với kem vani.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel restaurant serves a complimentary chocolate pudding to all dinner guests.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà hàng khách sạn phục vụ bánh pudding sô-cô-la miễn phí cho tất cả khách ăn tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-ljspeech-935a8fb1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-cori-935a8fb1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/pudding-a1dae006.webp', '[\"dessert\", \"sweet\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"rice pudding\", \"meaning\": \"bánh pudding gạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chocolate pudding\", \"meaning\": \"pudding sô-cô-la\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-cori-935a8fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru0-935a8fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru5-935a8fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru6-935a8fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru10-935a8fb1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru9-935a8fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru3-935a8fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru7-935a8fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru8-935a8fb1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-aru2-935a8fb1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/pudding-ljsp