('1c39799c-5cd0-5e85-9da4-42c9491da30e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'erosion', '/ɪˈrəʊʒn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự bào mòn hoặc phá hủy dần dần bởi gió, nước, hoặc các yếu tố tự nhiên khác.', 'the slow process of wearing away the surface of land by natural forces like water.', 'The constant waves led to severe coastal erosion near the resort.', 'Những con sóng liên tục đã dẫn đến xói mòn bờ biển nghiêm trọng gần khu nghỉ dưỡng.', '{\"en\": \"The construction team built a wall to prevent soil erosion near the factory site.\", \"vi\": \"Đội xây dựng đã xây một bức tường để ngăn chặn sự xói mòn đất gần khu vực nhà máy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-ljspeech-57bda499.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-cori-57bda499.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/erosion-958ab917.webp', '[\"corrosion\", \"wearing away\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"soil erosion\", \"meaning\": \"xói mòn đất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent erosion\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn chặn sự xói mòn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"erode\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-cori-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru0-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru5-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru6-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru10-57bda499.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru9-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru3-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru7-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru8-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-aru2-57bda499.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-ljspeech-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt408-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt138-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt624-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt396-57bda499.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt498-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt132-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt288-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt42-57bda499.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/erosion-lt90-57bda499.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường gặp trong các bài đọc về môi trường hoặc xây dựng.', 'manufacturing', 1, 3),
('37062238-844e-570c-afa9-0b92dc1454ac', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'physiology', '/ˌfɪziˈɒlədʒi/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Ngành khoa học nghiên cứu chức năng cơ thể sống.', 'the scientific study of how the bodies of living things work.', 'Understanding human physiology is crucial for medical students.', 'Hiểu biết về sinh lý học con người là rất quan trọng đối với sinh viên y khoa.', '{\"en\": \"The fitness center hired a specialist in exercise physiology to design training programs.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm thể hình đã thuê một chuyên gia về sinh lý học thể dục để thiết kế các chương trình tập luyện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-ljspeech-ac014429.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-cori-ac014429.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/physiology-d5851321.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"human physiology\", \"meaning\": \"sinh lý học người\"}, {\"phrase\": \"plant physiology\", \"meaning\": \"sinh lý học thực vật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"psychology\", \"note_vi\": \"psychology là tâm lý học, physiology là sinh lý học\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"physiological\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"physiologist\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-cori-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru0-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru5-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru6-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru10-ac014429.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru9-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru3-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru7-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru8-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-aru2-ac014429.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-ljspeech-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt408-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt138-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt624-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt396-ac014429.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt498-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt132-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt288-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt42-ac014429.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physiology-lt90-ac014429.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt đuôi -ology (ngành học) với -ologist (nhà nghiên cứu).', 'health', 1, 4),
('964fb2dd-1607-5bc2-beea-367a0731ed8d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'bemoan', '/bɪˈməʊn/', 'C1', 'verb', 'bày tỏ sự không hài lòng hoặc buồn bã về điều gì đó.', 'to express sorrow, regret, or strong unhappiness about something that has happened.', 'Many employees bemoaned the company\'s decision to cut benefits.', 'Nhiều nhân viên đã than thở về quyết định cắt giảm phúc lợi của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"Local business owners bemoaned the loss of customers after the main road closed for repairs.\", \"vi\": \"Các chủ doanh nghiệp địa phương than phiền về việc mất khách hàng sau khi đường chính bị đóng để sửa chữa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-ljspeech-34efcdee.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-cori-34efcdee.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bemoan-132c965d.webp', '[\"lament\", \"complain\"]', '[\"praise\", \"applaud\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bemoan the fact that\", \"meaning\": \"than phiền về thực tế là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bemoan the loss of\", \"meaning\": \"tiếc nuối sự mất mát của\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"complain\", \"note_vi\": \"bemoan mang sắc thái trang trọng hơn và thể hiện sự tiếc nuối sâu sắc\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-cori-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru0-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru5-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru6-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru10-34efcdee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru9-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru3-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru7-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru8-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-aru2-34efcdee.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-ljspeech-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt408-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt138-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt624-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt396-34efcdee.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt498-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt132-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt288-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt42-34efcdee.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bemoan-lt90-34efcdee.mp3\"]}}', 'Bemoan là động từ trang trọng, nghĩa là than phiền hoặc tiếc nuối về điều gì.', 'business', 1, 5),
('85869a39-cca2-5af2-b793-d4485a8f4d6b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'acquit', '/əˈkwɪt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Tuyên bố ai đó không có tội sau khi xét xử.', 'to decide officially in a court of law that someone is not guilty of a crime.', 'The jury decided to acquit the defendant due to insufficient evidence.', 'Bồi thẩm đoàn quyết định tha bổng bị cáo vì không đủ bằng chứng.', '{\"en\": \"The judge decided to acquit the employee after the internal audit proved his complete innocence.\", \"vi\": \"Thẩm phán quyết định tuyên trắng án cho nhân viên sau khi kiểm toán nội bộ chứng minh anh ta hoàn toàn vô tội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-ljspeech-53323faa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-cori-53323faa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acquit-43a16646.webp', '[\"clear\", \"exonerate\"]', '[\"convict\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"acquit of charges\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên trắng án các cáo buộc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"convict\", \"note_vi\": \"trái nghĩa, nghĩa là kết tội.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"acquittal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-cori-53323faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru0-53323faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru5-53323faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru6-53323faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru10-53323faa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru9-53323faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru3-53323faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru7-53323faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru8-53323faa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acquit-aru2-53323faa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"