('25859234-24d4-5d17-91a4-48b9212e1455', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'switch off', '/swɪtʃ ɒf/', 'A2', 'phrasal verb', 'Tắt một thiết bị điện tử; ngừng suy nghĩ.', 'to stop a machine or light from working, or to stop thinking about something.', 'I like to switch off my phone before going to bed for a good night\'s sleep.', 'Tôi thích tắt điện thoại trước khi đi ngủ để có một giấc ngủ ngon.', '{\"en\": \"Please switch off all computers and lights before leaving the office tonight.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng tắt tất cả máy tính và đèn trước khi rời văn phòng tối nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-ljspeech-08a500a7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-cori-08a500a7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/switch-off-dc25b09e.webp', '[\"turn off\", \"deactivate\"]', '[\"switch on\", \"turn on\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"switch off the light\", \"meaning\": \"tắt đèn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"switch off the engine\", \"meaning\": \"tắt động cơ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"switch\", \"note_vi\": \"switch là chuyển đổi, switch off là tắt đi\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-cori-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru0-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru5-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru6-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru10-08a500a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru9-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru3-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru7-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru8-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-aru2-08a500a7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-ljspeech-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt408-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt138-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt624-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt396-08a500a7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt498-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt132-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt288-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt42-08a500a7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/switch-off-lt90-08a500a7.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng nghĩa bóng là ngừng suy nghĩ, thư giãn đầu óc.', 'office', 1, 9),
('98e58b6c-16b2-518c-a8d9-a75452977739', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'weaken', '/ˈwiːkən/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó trở nên yếu hơn hoặc kém hiệu quả hơn.', 'to make someone or something less strong, powerful, or effective.', 'The illness began to weaken his immune system over time.', 'Căn bệnh bắt đầu làm suy yếu hệ miễn dịch của anh ấy theo thời gian.', '{\"en\": \"High inflation rates could weaken the purchasing power of consumers this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Tỷ lệ lạm phát cao có thể làm suy yếu sức mua của người tiêu dùng trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-ljspeech-fcb9e7c6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-cori-fcb9e7c6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weaken-67de41c9.webp', '[\"enfeeble\", \"undermine\", \"diminish\"]', '[\"strengthen\", \"fortify\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"weaken the economy\", \"meaning\": \"làm suy yếu nền kinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"weaken the position\", \"meaning\": \"làm suy yếu vị thế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wake\", \"note_vi\": \"thức giấc, phát âm và viết khác hoàn toàn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"weak\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"weakness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"weakly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-cori-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru0-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru5-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru6-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru10-fcb9e7c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru9-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru3-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru7-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru8-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-aru2-fcb9e7c6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-ljspeech-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt408-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt138-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt624-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt396-fcb9e7c6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt498-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt132-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt288-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt42-fcb9e7c6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weaken-lt90-fcb9e7c6.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -en thường dùng để tạo động từ từ tính từ (weak -> weaken).', 'finance', 1, 10),
('a80d6c1f-1975-528c-b33f-c68f5a5f3d2e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'clear-cut', '/ˌklɪəˈkʌt/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rõ ràng, dễ hiểu, không mơ hồ.', 'easy to understand and leaving no doubt about what is meant or intended.', 'The instructions for assembling the furniture were not very clear-cut.', 'Hướng dẫn lắp ráp đồ nội thất không thực sự rõ ràng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager provided a clear-cut explanation regarding the new company policy during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã đưa ra lời giải thích rõ ràng về chính sách công ty mới trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-ljspeech-fc83a0a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-cori-fc83a0a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/clear-cut-ee20cbf4.webp', '[\"obvious\", \"distinct\"]', '[\"vague\", \"ambiguous\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"clear-cut evidence\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear-cut case\", \"meaning\": \"trường hợp rõ ràng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-cori-fc83a0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru0-fc83a0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru5-fc83a0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru6-fc83a0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru10-fc83a0a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru9-fc83a0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru3-fc83a0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru7-fc83a0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru8-fc83a0a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/clear-cut-aru2-fc83a0a2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pron