('78f2bf50-7d14-5a2d-ba2c-485a957c8aa4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'flash drive', '/flæʃ draɪv/', '', 'noun', 'Thiết bị lưu trữ dữ liệu di động nhỏ gọn.', 'a small device used for storing digital information that connects to a computer.', 'I saved all my important documents on a flash drive before reinstalling the operating system.', 'Tôi đã lưu tất cả tài liệu quan trọng của mình vào một ổ USB trước khi cài đặt lại hệ điều hành.', '{\"en\": \"Please save your presentation on a flash drive so you can easily access it during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng lưu bài thuyết trình của bạn vào thiết bị lưu trữ để có thể dễ dàng truy cập trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-ljspeech-cb6896e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-cori-cb6896e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flash-drive-5a46add1.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-cori-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru0-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru5-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru6-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru10-cb6896e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru9-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru3-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru7-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru8-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-aru2-cb6896e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-ljspeech-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt408-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt138-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt624-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt396-cb6896e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt498-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt132-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt288-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt42-cb6896e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flash-drive-lt90-cb6896e5.mp3\"]}}', '', 'other', 1, 12),
('baafef2f-50ed-5940-a5ee-4368b1b79508', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'set list', '/set lɪst/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Danh sách các bài hát mà một nghệ sĩ biểu diễn trong một buổi hòa nhạc.', 'a list of songs that a performer intends to play during a show.', 'The band announced their set list for tonight\'s concert, much to the fans\' excitement.', 'Ban nhạc đã công bố danh sách bài hát cho buổi hòa nhạc tối nay, khiến người hâm mộ rất phấn khích.', '{\"en\": \"The event coordinator reviewed the set list to ensure it fits the corporate gala theme.\", \"vi\": \"Điều phối viên sự kiện đã xem xét danh sách bài hát để đảm bảo nó phù hợp với chủ đề buổi tiệc công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-ljspeech-89d99b32.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-cori-89d99b32.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/set-list-90dbca5b.webp', '[\"playlist\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prepare a set list\", \"meaning\": \"chuẩn bị danh sách bài hát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"change the set list\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi danh sách bài hát\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-cori-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru0-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru5-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru6-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru10-89d99b32.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru9-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru3-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru7-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru8-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-aru2-89d99b32.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-ljspeech-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt408-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt138-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt624-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt396-89d99b32.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt498-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt132-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt288-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt42-89d99b32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/set-list-lt90-89d99b32.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng phổ biến trong ngành giải trí và tổ chức sự kiện.', 'media', 1, 13),
('9a9ccfdd-45be-5c9f-bd7c-0415ee8013f2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'appropriate', 'UK: /əˈprəʊpriət/ | US: /əˈproʊpriət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thích hợp, phù hợp', 'Suitable, proper, or right for a particular situation, purpose, or audience.', 'They ensured the content was appropriate for all ages.', 'Họ đảm bảo nội dung phù hợp với mọi lứa tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"Please wear appropriate business attire for the upcoming job interview.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng mặc trang phục công sở phù hợp cho buổi phỏng vấn xin việc sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-ljspeech-f290fd9a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-cori-f290fd9a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appropriate-d387d884.webp', '[\"suitable\", \"proper\", \"fitting\"]', '[\"inappropriate\", \"unsuitable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"appropriate for\", \"meaning\": \"thích hợp cho\"}, {\"phrase\": \"appropriate action\", \"meaning\": \"hành động phù hợp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"approximate\", \"note_vi\": \"approximate (adj) nghĩa là xấp xỉ/ước chừng, khác với appropriate là phù hợp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"appropriately\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"appropriateness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-cori-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru0-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru5-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru6-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru10-f290fd9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru9-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru3-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru7-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru8-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-aru2-f290fd9a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-ljspeech-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt408-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt138-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt624-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt396-f290fd9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt498-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt132-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt288-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt42-f290fd9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appropriate-lt90-f290fd9a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'for\' hoặc \'to\' (appropriate for/to sth). Chú ý cách phát âm tính từ khác với động từ cùng mặt chữ.', 'personnel', 1, 14),
('acafd8fe-3f39-5522-9b06-c26dde489855', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'commonplace', '/ˈkɒmənpleɪs/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'phổ biến, thông thường, không có gì đặc biệt.', 'happening often or existing in many places, so not special or unusual.', 'Smartphones have become commonplace in almost every household.', 'Điện thoại thông minh đã trở nên phổ biến ở hầu hết mọi gia đình.', '{\"en\": \"Working remotely has become commonplace for modern technology companies worldwide.\", \"vi\": \"Làm việc từ xa đã trở nên phổ biến đối với các công ty công nghệ hiện đại trên toàn thế giới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-ljspeech-3bf3b87a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-cori-3bf3b87a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/commonplace-7be40b31.webp', '[\"widespread\", \"ordinary\", \"routine\"]', '[\"rare\", \"unusual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"become commonplace\", \"meaning\": \"trở nên phổ biến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"commonplace occurrence\", \"meaning\": \"sự việc phổ biến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"common\", \"note_vi\": \"Common là phổ biến chung; commonplace nhấn mạnh việc đã trở thành chuyện thường nhật.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-cori-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru0-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru5-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru6-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru10-3bf3b87a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru9-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru3-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru7-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru8-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-aru2-3bf3b87a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-ljspeech-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt408-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt138-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt624-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt396-3bf3b87a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt498-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt132-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt288-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt42-3bf3b87a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/commonplace-lt90-3bf3b87a.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết liền là một từ (commonplace), mang nghĩa bình thường, phổ biến rộng rãi.', 'business', 1, 15),
('addadc19-99b6-5274-ac59-4b3e17a7d78b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'sickly', '/ˈsɪkli/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thường xuyên ốm yếu, hay bệnh.', 'in a state of poor health or appearing weak and likely to be ill.', 'The sickly child often missed school due to various illnesses.', 'Đứa trẻ ốm yếu thường xuyên nghỉ học vì nhiều bệnh khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The sickly plant in the office lobby needs more sunlight and better care immediately.\", \"vi\": \"Cây cảnh ốm yếu ở sảnh văn phòng cần thêm ánh sáng và sự chăm sóc tốt hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-ljspeech-547ba90d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-cori-547ba90d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sickly-c95fe524.webp', '[\"unhealthy\", \"weak\"]', '[\"healthy\", \"robust\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"look sickly\", \"meaning\": \"trông ốm yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sickly appearance\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài ốm yếu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sickness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-cori-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru0-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru5-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru6-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru10-547ba90d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru9-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru3-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru7-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru8-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-aru2-547ba90d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sickly-ljspeech-547ba90d.mp3\", \"/st