('edfc7494-3028-52c3-9b4e-aa39c089ceaf', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de06157c-4bfe-51e5-9172-c8a6b94811c4', '1acb7e73-596f-5361-9108-0e8be6c335a4', 'asthma', '/ˈæsmə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một bệnh mãn tính của đường hô hấp gây khó thở, ho và thở khò khè.', 'a medical condition that makes breathing difficult and causes coughing or chest tightness.', 'She carries an inhaler with her everywhere because of her severe asthma.', 'Cô ấy luôn mang theo ống hít bên mình vì bệnh hen suyễn nặng.', '{\"en\": \"The company provided special air purifiers in the office to help employees with asthma.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã trang bị máy lọc không khí đặc biệt trong văn phòng để giúp các nhân viên bị bệnh hen suyễn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-ljspeech-e361db6f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-cori-e361db6f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/asthma-3654e034.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"severe asthma\", \"meaning\": \"bệnh hen suyễn nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"asthma attack\", \"meaning\": \"cơn hen suyễn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"asthmatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-cori-e361db6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru0-e361db6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru5-e361db6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru6-e361db6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru10-e361db6f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru9-e361db6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru3-e361db6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru7-e361db6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru8-e361db6f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/asthma-aru2-e361db6f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pu