('6b2d05eb-5818-540a-ab66-936feb867015', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'fluffy', '/ˈflʌfi/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Mềm mại, nhẹ và có nhiều lông tơ hoặc sợi.', 'soft and light and containing a lot of soft feathers or fur.', 'The cat\'s tail was so fluffy that I wanted to pet it.', 'Đuôi con mèo mềm mại đến mức tôi muốn vuốt ve nó.', '{\"en\": \"The luxury hotel provides guests with soft bathrobes and fluffy towels in every room.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn sang trọng cung cấp cho khách hàng áo khăn tắm mềm mại và khăn bông xốp trong mỗi phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-ljspeech-d9d71ab7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-cori-d9d71ab7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fluffy-e1f4331b.webp', '[\"soft\", \"downy\", \"feathery\"]', '[\"hard\", \"rough\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fluffy towel\", \"meaning\": \"khăn bông xốp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fluffy pillow\", \"meaning\": \"gối mềm mại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fluff\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fluff\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-cori-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru0-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru5-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru6-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru10-d9d71ab7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru9-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru3-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru7-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru8-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-aru2-d9d71ab7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-ljspeech-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt408-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt138-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt624-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt396-d9d71ab7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt498-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt132-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt288-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt42-d9d71ab7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluffy-lt90-d9d71ab7.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để tả đồ vật mềm xốp như khăn, gối hoặc thức ăn nhẹ như bánh, trứng.', 'travel', 1, 1),
('c4ab708e-7d02-5fd8-8d8f-eeae27ce94ec', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'paranoia', '/ˌpærəˈnɔɪə/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng tâm lý bị hoang tưởng, nghi ngờ vô cớ người khác.', 'an extreme and unreasonable feeling that other people want to harm you.', 'His paranoia made him believe that everyone was watching him.', 'Sự hoang tưởng khiến anh ấy tin rằng mọi người đều đang theo dõi mình.', '{\"en\": \"The director\'s paranoia about corporate espionage led to strict security measures in the office.\", \"vi\": \"Sự hoang tưởng của giám đốc về gián điệp doanh nghiệp đã dẫn đến các biện pháp an ninh nghiêm ngặt tại văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-ljspeech-7e6f31cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-cori-7e6f31cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/paranoia-bf79f6d1.webp', '[\"distrust\", \"suspicion\"]', '[\"trust\", \"confidence\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"suffer from paranoia\", \"meaning\": \"bị chứng hoang tưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"corporate paranoia\", \"meaning\": \"sự hoang tưởng trong doanh nghiệp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"paradox\", \"note_vi\": \"nghịch lý, dễ nhầm do phát âm gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"paranoid\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-cori-7e6f31cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-aru0-7e6f31cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-aru5-7e6f31cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-aru6-7e6f31cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-aru10-7e6f31cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-aru9-7e6f31cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-aru3-7e6f31cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paranoia-aru7-7e6f31cf.mp3\", \"