('eea2f16c-a637-541c-aaec-b245a768a575', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'gifted', '/ˈɡɪftɪd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có năng khiếu đặc biệt, tài giỏi bẩm sinh.', 'having a special natural ability to do something extremely well.', 'The young pianist was clearly gifted with extraordinary musical talent.', 'Nghệ sĩ piano trẻ tuổi rõ ràng là có năng khiếu âm nhạc phi thường.', '{\"en\": \"The company is looking for gifted designers to lead the new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đang tìm kiếm những nhà thiết kế tài năng để dẫn dắt chiến dịch tiếp thị mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-ljspeech-2f9b03e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-cori-2f9b03e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/gifted-a08f3778.webp', '[\"talented\", \"exceptional\", \"skilled\"]', '[\"untalented\", \"average\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"gifted student\", \"meaning\": \"học sinh năng khiếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly gifted\", \"meaning\": \"rất có năng khiếu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"gift\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-cori-2f9b03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru0-2f9b03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru5-2f9b03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru6-2f9b03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru10-2f9b03e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru9-2f9b03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru3-2f9b03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru7-2f9b03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru8-2f9b03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/gifted-aru2-2f9b03e1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/pu