('bd3c556c-0fb4-5704-aca1-2ff45eacd2a0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'minimal', '/ˈmɪnɪml/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Ở mức độ nhỏ nhất, ít nhất có thể.', 'the smallest amount or degree that is possible or necessary.', 'The project requires only minimal funding to get started.', 'Dự án chỉ yêu cầu nguồn tài trợ tối thiểu để bắt đầu.', '{\"en\": \"We need to make a minimal effort to clean the office before the client arrives.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta cần nỗ lực tối thiểu để dọn dẹp văn phòng trước khi khách hàng đến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-ljspeech-5c482174.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-cori-5c482174.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/minimal-17b7358e.webp', '[\"slight\", \"smallest\"]', '[\"maximal\", \"significant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"minimal cost\", \"meaning\": \"chi phí tối thiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"minimal impact\", \"meaning\": \"tác động nhỏ nhất\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"minimum\", \"note_vi\": \"danh từ, còn minimal là tính từ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"minimize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"minimum\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-cori-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru0-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru5-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru6-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru10-5c482174.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru9-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru3-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru7-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru8-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-aru2-5c482174.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-ljspeech-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt408-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt138-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt624-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt396-5c482174.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt498-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt132-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt288-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt42-5c482174.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimal-lt90-5c482174.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để nói về việc tiết kiệm nguồn lực hoặc giảm thiểu rủi ro.', 'business', 1, 16),
('ddb13600-233c-55b8-b515-60533250001c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'take a turn', '/teɪk ə tɜːn/', 'B2', 'phrase', 'Diễn biến, thay đổi (thường là tình hình).', 'to change or develop in a particular way, often becoming worse or better.', 'The patient\'s condition sadly took a turn for the worse overnight.', 'Tình trạng bệnh nhân không may đã diễn biến xấu hơn trong đêm.', '{\"en\": \"The market situation took a turn for the better after the new trade agreement was signed.\", \"vi\": \"Tình hình thị trường đã có chuyển biến tốt hơn sau khi hiệp định thương mại mới được ký kết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-ljspeech-e2af4680.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-cori-e2af4680.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/take-a-turn-b743d68c.webp', '[\"change\", \"develop\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a turn for the better\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển biến tốt hơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take a turn for the worse\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển biến xấu đi\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-cori-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru0-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru5-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru6-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru10-e2af4680.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru9-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru3-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru7-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru8-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-aru2-e2af4680.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-ljspeech-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt408-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt138-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt624-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt396-e2af4680.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt498-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt132-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt288-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt42-e2af4680.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-a-turn-lt90-e2af4680.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với \'for the better\' hoặc \'for the worse\' để chỉ hướng thay đổi.', 'business', 1, 17),
('f7b9d150-fca1-5dc4-a0a1-89f558b3c1a4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'consumer', 'UK: /kənˈsjuːmə/ | US: /kənˈsuːmər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'người tiêu dùng', 'A person who buys goods or services for personal use rather than for resale.', 'Consumers expect high quality products and good service.', 'Người tiêu dùng mong đợi các sản phẩm chất lượng cao và dịch vụ tốt.', '{\"en\": \"Recent surveys show a rise in consumer demand for energy-efficient appliances.\", \"vi\": \"Các khảo sát gần đây cho thấy sự gia tăng nhu cầu của người tiêu dùng đối với các thiết bị tiết kiệm năng lượng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-ljspeech-cb7a82c3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-cori-cb7a82c3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consumer-d7561303.webp', '[\"buyer\", \"purchaser\", \"customer\", \"user\"]', '[\"producer\", \"manufacturer\", \"seller\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"consumer confidence\", \"meaning\": \"lòng tin của người tiêu dùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consumer goods\", \"meaning\": \"hàng tiêu dùng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"consume\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consumption\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-cori-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru0-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru5-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru6-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru10-cb7a82c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru9-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru3-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru7-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru8-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-aru2-cb7a82c3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-ljspeech-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt408-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt138-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt624-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt396-cb7a82c3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt498-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt132-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt288-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt42-cb7a82c3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consumer-lt90-cb7a82c3.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ chỉ người mua/tiêu dùng sản phẩm. Hay đi với \'consumer demand\' hoặc \'consumer confidence\'.', 'marketing', 1, 18),
('9fcb2dd0-ce17-5741-aebe-3d205101f86a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'contamination', '/kənˌtæmɪˈneɪʃn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự làm bẩn, nhiễm độc một chất hoặc môi trường.', 'the process of making a substance or place dirty or poisonous by adding harmful chemicals.', 'The factory was fined for causing water contamination in the local river.', 'Nhà máy bị phạt vì gây ô nhiễm nguồn nước sông địa phương.', '{\"en\": \"The health inspector closed the restaurant due to severe food contamination in the kitchen.\", \"vi\": \"Thanh tra y tế đã đóng cửa nhà hàng do sự ô nhiễm thực phẩm nghiêm trọng trong nhà bếp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contamination-ljspeech-dcd5e599.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contamination-cori-dcd5e599.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contamination-1e5d28d0.webp', '[\"pollution\"]', '[\"purification\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"water contamination\", \"meaning\": \"sự nhiễm bẩn nguồn nước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent contamination\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn ngừa sự nhiễm bẩn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"pollution\", \"note_vi\": \"pollution chỉ ô nhiễm môi trường chung, contamination chỉ sự nhiễm độc vào một chất cụ thể\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"contaminate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"contaminated\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contamination-cori-dcd5e599.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contamination-aru0-dcd5e599.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contamination-aru5-dcd5e599.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contamination-aru6-dcd5e599.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contamination-aru10-dcd5e599.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contamination-aru9-dcd5e599.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/con