('bc591a88-270e-519b-ad23-b8912d3dbeb7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'elliptical', '/ɪˈlɪptɪkl/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng giống như hình elip hoặc hình bầu dục.', 'having the shape of an oval or a stretched circle.', 'The planet orbits the sun in an elliptical path.', 'Hành tinh quay quanh mặt trời theo quỹ đạo hình elip.', '{\"en\": \"The new office building features a modern lobby with a large, elliptical conference table.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng mới có sảnh chờ hiện đại với một chiếc bàn họp lớn hình bầu dục.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-ljspeech-b2479088.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-cori-b2479088.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/elliptical-411b806b.webp', '[\"oval\", \"egg-shaped\"]', '[\"circular\", \"round\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"elliptical shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình dạng elip\"}, {\"phrase\": \"elliptical trainer\", \"meaning\": \"máy tập đi bộ trên không (hình elip)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"eclipse\", \"note_vi\": \"eclipse là hiện tượng nhật thực/nguyệt thực, không phải hình elip\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"ellipse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-cori-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru0-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru5-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru6-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru10-b2479088.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru9-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru3-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru7-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru8-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-aru2-b2479088.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-ljspeech-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt408-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt138-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt624-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt396-b2479088.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt498-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt132-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt288-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt42-b2479088.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/elliptical-lt90-b2479088.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này có gốc từ ellipse (hình elip).', 'office', 1, 20),
('04a1c11d-7172-526a-8b6b-fa608fb36afa', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'command', 'UK: /kəˈmɑːnd/ | US: /kəˈmænd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'lệnh, chỉ dẫn', 'an instruction given by a person or a computer program to perform a specific action', 'The software responds to voice commands.', 'Phần mềm phản hồi các lệnh bằng giọng nói.', '{\"en\": \"The system will execute the updated code as soon as you press the command key.\", \"vi\": \"Hệ thống sẽ thực thi mã cập nhật ngay khi bạn nhấn phím lệnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-ljspeech-1925f793.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-cori-1925f793.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/command-bdf46780.webp', '[\"order\", \"instruction\", \"directive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have a good command of\", \"meaning\": \"thông thạo, sử dụng tốt (kỹ năng/ngôn ngữ)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"command line\", \"meaning\": \"dòng lệnh hệ thống\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commend\", \"note_vi\": \"commend (v) nghĩa là khen ngợi, còn command (n/v) là ra lệnh hoặc sự thông thạo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"command\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"commanding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-cori-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru0-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru5-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru6-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru10-1925f793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru9-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru3-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru7-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru8-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-aru2-1925f793.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-ljspeech-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt408-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt138-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt624-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt396-1925f793.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt498-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt132-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt288-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt42-1925f793.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/command-lt90-1925f793.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'have a good command of\' nghĩa là thông thạo một ngôn ngữ hoặc kỹ năng nào đó.', 'office', 1, 21),
('c48c9ed4-d29e-5e75-8d9c-f5131967f900', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'sluggish', '/ˈslʌɡɪʃ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Chậm chạp, uể oải, thiếu năng lượng hoặc hoạt động.', 'moving or operating more slowly than usual with very little energy or activity.', 'After a big meal, I often feel sluggish and want to take a nap.', 'Sau một bữa ăn lớn, tôi thường cảm thấy uể oải và muốn ngủ một giấc.', '{\"en\": \"Sales were sluggish during the first quarter due to weak customer demand nationwide.\", \"vi\": \"Doanh số bán hàng chậm chạp trong quý một do nhu cầu khách hàng yếu trên toàn quốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-ljspeech-4e47b852.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-cori-4e47b852.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sluggish-bed2174d.webp', '[\"slow\", \"inactive\", \"lethargic\"]', '[\"fast\", \"brisk\", \"active\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sluggish economy\", \"meaning\": \"nền kinh tế trì trệ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sluggish sales\", \"meaning\": \"doanh số tăng trưởng chậm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lazy\", \"note_vi\": \"Lazy chỉ bản tính lười biếng, sluggish mô tả tốc độ hoặc hiệu suất chậm chạp, trì trệ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"sluggishly\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sluggishness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-cori-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru0-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru5-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru6-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru10-4e47b852.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru9-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru3-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru7-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru8-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-aru2-4e47b852.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-ljspeech-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt408-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt138-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt624-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt396-4e47b852.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt498-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt132-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt288-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt42-4e47b852.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sluggish-lt90-4e47b852.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC, \'sluggish market/sales\' chỉ thị trường hoặc doanh số trì trệ, ảm đạm.', 'business', 1, 22),
('1a26d220-1ebe-5564-addd-9b605854f370', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'cathedral', '/kəˈθiːdrəl/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một nhà thờ lớn, thường là nhà thờ chính của một giáo phận.', 'a very large and important church, usually the main church of a district.', 'The ancient cathedral stood majestically in the city center.', 'Nhà thờ lớn cổ kính sừng sững uy nghi giữa trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency organized a tour to the historic cathedral in the city center.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã tổ chức một chuyến tham quan đến nhà thờ lớn lịch sử ở trung tâm thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-ljspeech-5c92c39a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-cori-5c92c39a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cathedral-694ea52a.webp', '[\"church\", \"basilica\", \"temple\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"historic cathedral\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thờ lớn lịch sử\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gothic cathedral\", \"meaning\": \"nhà thờ lớn kiểu Gothic\"}, {\"phrase\": \"cathedral square\", \"meaning\": \"quảng trường nhà thờ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"church\", \"note_vi\": \"Nhà thờ nói chung, còn cathedral là nhà thờ lớn có tòa giám mục.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-cori-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru0-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru5-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru6-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru10-5c92c39a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru9-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru3-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru7-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru8-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-aru2-5c92c39a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-ljspeech-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt408-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt138-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt624-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt396-5c92c39a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt498-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt132-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt288-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt42-5c92c39a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cathedral-lt90-5c92c39a.mp3\"]}}', 'Cathedral là nhà thờ chính tòa, nơi có ngai tòa của giám mục, lớn hơn church thông thường.', 'travel', 1, 23),
('82f38755-63ba-51b0-87a8-aac851820718', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'finesse', '/fɪˈnes/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Giải quyết một tình huống khó khăn bằng sự khéo léo, tinh tế.', 'to handle a difficult situation or task with great skill and careful attention to detail.', 'She managed to finesse the tricky negotiation with her charm and diplomatic skills.', 'Cô ấy đã khéo léo xử lý cuộc đàm phán khó khăn bằng sự quyến rũ và kỹ năng ngoại giao của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was able to finesse the complex contract dispute during the board meeting yesterday.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã có thể giải quyết tranh chấp hợp đồng phức tạp trong cuộc họp hội đồng hôm qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-ljspeech-c49ce132.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-cori-c49ce132.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/finesse-f176c1f6.webp', '[\"maneuver\", \"manipulate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"finesse a situation\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý một tình huống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"finesse a deal\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện một thỏa thuận khéo léo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"finance\", \"note_vi\": \"finance liên quan đến tài chính, finesse liên quan đến sự khéo léo.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"finesse\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-cori-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru0-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru5-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru6-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru10-c49ce132.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru9-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru3-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru7-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru8-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-aru2-c49ce132.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-ljspeech-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt408-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt138-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt624-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt396-c49ce132.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt498-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt132-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt288-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt42-c49ce132.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/finesse-lt90-c49ce132.mp3\"]}}', 'Hãy nhớ từ này gắn liền với sự khéo léo, tinh tế trong giao tiếp công việc.', 'business', 1, 24),
('32154874-6662-5969-bfb5-e208830c96b2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'delicate', '/ˈdelɪkət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Mỏng manh, dễ vỡ; tinh tế.', 'easily broken or damaged, or needing to be handled with great care.', 'Negotiating the contract required extra tact due to the delicate diplomatic situation.', 'Việc đàm phán hợp đồng đòi hỏi sự khéo léo đặc biệt do tình hình ngoại giao nhạy cảm.', '{\"en\": \"The courier service requires a special label for packages containing delicate electronic components.\", \"vi\": \"Dịch vụ chuyển phát nhanh yêu cầu nhãn đặc biệt cho các kiện hàng chứa linh kiện điện tử dễ vỡ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-ljspeech-a5cbba14.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-cori-a5cbba14.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/delicate-6f811950.webp', '[\"fragile\", \"frail\"]', '[\"sturdy\", \"durable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"delicate balance\", \"meaning\": \"sự cân bằng mong manh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"delicate skin\", \"meaning\": \"da nhạy cảm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"delicacy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-cori-a5cbba14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru0-a5cbba14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru5-a5cbba14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru6-a5cbba14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru10-a5cbba14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru9-a5cbba14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru3-a5cbba14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru7-a5cbba14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru8-a5cbba14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/delicate-aru2-a