('8101ef23-11ac-514d-b489-bfc4a62812cb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'typhoon', '/taɪˈfuːn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một cơn bão nhiệt đới dữ dội xảy ra ở khu vực Tây Thái Bình Dương.', 'a violent tropical storm with very strong winds that occurs in the western Pacific Ocean.', 'The island was severely damaged after a powerful typhoon swept through.', 'Hòn đảo đã bị hư hại nặng nề sau khi một cơn bão lớn quét qua.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping company delayed all deliveries due to the approaching typhoon.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty vận chuyển đã hoãn tất cả các chuyến giao hàng do cơn bão đang đến gần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-ljspeech-52c4c1e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-cori-52c4c1e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/typhoon-fb3759de.webp', '[\"hurricane\", \"cyclone\", \"tempest\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"powerful typhoon\", \"meaning\": \"cơn bão mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"typhoon warning\", \"meaning\": \"cảnh báo bão\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monsoon\", \"note_vi\": \"monsoon là gió mùa gây mưa, typhoon là bão nhiệt đới dữ dội.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-cori-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru0-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru5-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru6-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru10-52c4c1e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru9-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru3-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru7-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru8-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-aru2-52c4c1e7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-ljspeech-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt408-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt138-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt624-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt396-52c4c1e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt498-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt132-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt288-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt42-52c4c1e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/typhoon-lt90-52c4c1e7.mp3\"]}}', 'Typhoon dùng cho bão ở Tây Thái Bình Dương (như Việt Nam), hurricane ở Đại Tây Dương.', 'nature', 1, 26),
('929201f7-0f47-51a0-bd2f-b9181bbc7522', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'de992005-e073-5a03-ba9f-972cc9368b00', 'a47516a3-b7ab-5758-afc0-c40e68514eae', 'robust', '/rəʊˈbʌst/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'khỏe mạnh, cường tráng; vững chắc, bền bỉ.', 'strong and unlikely to break or fail, even in difficult conditions or situations.', 'The company needs a robust security system to protect its data from cyber threats.', 'Công ty cần một hệ thống bảo mật mạnh mẽ để bảo vệ dữ liệu khỏi các mối đe dọa mạng.', '{\"en\": \"Our team developed a robust software platform that can handle thousands of users daily.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ của chúng tôi đã phát triển một nền tảng phần mềm mạnh mẽ có thể xử lý hàng ngàn người dùng mỗi ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-ljspeech-581aae1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-cori-581aae1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/robust-1eefe7d8.webp', '[\"sturdy\", \"strong\"]', '[\"weak\", \"fragile\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"robust growth\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng trưởng mạnh mẽ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"robust system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống vững chắc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"robustness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-cori-581aae1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru0-581aae1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru5-581aae1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru6-581aae1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru10-581aae1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru9-581aae1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru3-581aae1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru7-581aae1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru8-581aae1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/robust-aru