('ad7dcc66-08d8-5518-bbc1-1155c0feb41e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'stain', 'UK: /steɪn/ | US: /steɪn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'vết bẩn, vết ố', 'A colored mark on a surface that is usually difficult to clean or remove.', 'The coffee stain on the report made it look unprofessional.', 'Vết cà phê trên báo cáo làm cho nó trông thiếu chuyên nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance crew successfully removed the oil stain from the warehouse floor.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã tẩy thành công vết bẩn dầu mỡ khỏi sàn nhà kho.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-ljspeech-3538a58b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-cori-3538a58b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stain-065b3817.webp', '[\"spot\", \"mark\", \"blot\", \"smudge\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"remove a stain\", \"meaning\": \"tẩy vết bẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stubborn stain\", \"meaning\": \"vết bẩn cứng đầu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"stainless\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"stain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-cori-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru0-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru5-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru6-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru10-3538a58b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru9-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru3-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru7-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru8-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-aru2-3538a58b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-ljspeech-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt408-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt138-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt624-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt396-3538a58b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt498-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt132-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt288-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt42-3538a58b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stain-lt90-3538a58b.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là danh từ (vết bẩn) vừa là động từ (làm ố, gây ra vết bẩn). Có thể gặp dạng tính từ \'stainless\' (không gỉ).', 'facilities', 1, 4),
('1b467398-3222-5be6-9321-0540550e31fe', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'dune', '/djuːn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một ngọn đồi hoặc gò đất được tạo thành từ cát do gió thổi.', 'a large pile of sand found in a desert or near the sea by wind.', 'We enjoyed climbing the sand dunes at the beach and rolling down.', 'Chúng tôi thích leo lên những đồi cát ở bãi biển và lăn xuống.', '{\"en\": \"The resort development project was delayed to protect the natural sand dune landscape nearby.\", \"vi\": \"Dự án phát triển khu nghỉ dưỡng đã bị trì hoãn để bảo vệ cảnh quan cồn cát tự nhiên gần đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-ljspeech-9dc0593c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-cori-9dc0593c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dune-d10255de.webp', '[\"mound\", \"hillock\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"sand dune\", \"meaning\": \"cồn cát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"climb a dune\", \"meaning\": \"leo lên đồi cát\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-cori-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru0-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru5-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru6-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru10-9dc0593c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru9-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru3-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru7-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru8-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-aru2-9dc0593c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-ljspeech-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt408-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt138-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt624-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt396-9dc0593c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt498-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt132-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt288-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt42-9dc0593c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dune-lt90-9dc0593c.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này thường xuất hiện trong các bài đọc về du lịch hoặc môi trường.', 'travel', 1, 5),
('4b1b0700-d2f2-52a5-8a3d-aee5e1be0e48', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'curl', '/kɜːl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lọn tóc xoăn hoặc vật gì đó có hình xoắn ốc.', 'a piece of hair or other material that grows or is shaped like a curve.', 'She styled her hair into soft curls for the party.', 'Cô ấy tạo kiểu tóc thành những lọn xoăn nhẹ nhàng để đi dự tiệc.', '{\"en\": \"The salon specializes in styling natural curls and offers discounts for corporate clients.\", \"vi\": \"Tiệm làm tóc chuyên tạo kiểu cho tóc xoăn tự nhiên và có giảm giá cho khách hàng doanh nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-ljspeech-5300d17a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-cori-5300d17a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/curl-72c495b3.webp', '[\"ringlet\", \"spiral\", \"loop\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tight curls\", \"meaning\": \"những lọn tóc xoăn tít\"}, {\"phrase\": \"loose curls\", \"meaning\": \"những lọn tóc xoăn nhẹ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"curl\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"curly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-cori-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru0-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru5-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru6-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru10-5300d17a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru9-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru3-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru7-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru8-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-aru2-5300d17a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-ljspeech-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt408-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt138-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt624-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt396-5300d17a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt498-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt132-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt288-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt42-5300d17a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curl-lt90-5300d17a.mp3\"]}}', 'Vừa là danh từ (lọn xoăn) vừa là động từ (uốn xoăn, cuộn tròn).', 'other', 1, 6),
('f472af4d-e00c-5dd0-b011-2e63a46278e9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'heroine', '/ˈherəʊɪn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Nữ nhân vật chính hoặc người phụ nữ dũng cảm, được ngưỡng mộ.', 'a woman who is admired for her brave actions or the main female character in a story.', 'The young girl admired the heroine of the story for her bravery and intelligence.', 'Cô bé ngưỡng mộ nữ anh hùng trong câu chuyện vì sự dũng cảm và thông minh của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was praised as a local heroine for saving the company from bankruptcy last year.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý được ca ngợi như một nữ anh hùng địa phương vì đã cứu công ty khỏi phá sản năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-ljspeech-e99ba87d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-cori-e99ba87d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heroine-3037aad9.webp', '[\"idol\", \"star\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"local heroine\", \"meaning\": \"nữ anh hùng địa phương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"literary heroine\", \"meaning\": \"nữ nhân vật chính trong văn học\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"heroin\", \"note_vi\": \"Heroin là một loại ma túy, không có chữ \'e\' ở cuối.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"hero\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"heroic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-cori-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru0-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru5-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru6-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru10-e99ba87d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru9-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru3-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru7-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru8-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-aru2-e99ba87d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-ljspeech-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt408-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt138-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt624-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt396-e99ba87d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt498-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt132-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt288-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt42-e99ba87d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heroine-lt90-e99ba87d.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận nhầm với heroin (ma túy), từ này có thêm chữ \'e\' ở cuối.', 'other', 1, 7),
('4256cd0b-42eb-5a9c-a134-1922f5dde30d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'binocular', 'UK: /bɪˈnɒkjʊlər/ | US: /bɪˈnɑːkjuːlər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'ống nhòm', 'an optical instrument with two lenses used for viewing distant objects clearly', 'The new binoculars offer excellent magnification for birdwatching.', 'Ống nhòm mới có độ phóng đại tuyệt vời để ngắm chim.', '{\"en\": \"The security guard used binoculars to inspect the perimeter of the facility.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên bảo vệ đã dùng ống nhòm để kiểm tra chu vi của cơ sở.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-ljspeech-9aa0342b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-cori-9aa0342b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/binocular-327880ff.webp', '[\"field glasses\", \"spyglass\", \"opera glasses\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"look through binoculars\", \"meaning\": \"nhìn qua ống nhòm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pair of binoculars\", \"meaning\": \"một chiếc ống nhòm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monocular\", \"note_vi\": \"ống nhòm một mắt, khác với binoculars là ống nhòm hai mắt\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-cori-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru0-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru5-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru6-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru10-9aa0342b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru9-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru3-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru7-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru8-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-aru2-9aa0342b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-ljspeech-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt408-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt138-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt624-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt396-9aa0342b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt498-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt132-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt288-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt42-9aa0342b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/binocular-lt90-9aa0342b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng dạng số nhiều \'binoculars\'. Hay có trong Part 1 mô tả hành động \'looking through binoculars\'.', 'facilities', 1, 8)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('9b028e04-aa0b-5aed-8521-fab80aeeb7aa', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'ambush', '/ˈæmbʊʃ/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Cuộc tấn công bất ngờ từ nơi ẩn nấp.', 'a secret plan to wait in a hidden place and attack someone suddenly.', 'The soldiers set up an ambush in the dense forest, waiting for the enemy.', 'Những người lính đã thiết lập một cuộc phục kích trong rừng rậm, chờ đợi kẻ thù.', '{\"en\": \"The security team feared an ambush by protesters during the high-profile corporate merger meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Đội an ninh lo ngại một cuộc tấn công bất ngờ từ những người biểu tình trong cuộc họp sáp nhập doanh nghiệp cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-ljspeech-e12c9682.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-cori-e12c9682.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ambush-da8ebc59.webp', '[\"trap\", \"snare\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lay an ambush\", \"meaning\": \"giăng bẫy tấn công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fall into an ambush\", \"meaning\": \"rơi vào ổ phục kích\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ambush\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-cori-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru0-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru5-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru6-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru10-e12c9682.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru9-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru3-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru7-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru8-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-aru2-e12c9682.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-ljspeech-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt408-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt138-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt624-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt396-e12c9682.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt498-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt132-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt288-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt42-e12c9682.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ambush-lt90-e12c9682.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh quân sự hoặc ẩn dụ về sự tấn công bất ngờ.', 'law', 1, 9),
('265a67ad-89db-5ce5-baa1-28d9c9559022', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'anniversary', 'UK: /ˌænɪˈvɜːsəri/ | US: /ˌænɪˈvɜːrsəri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'ngày kỷ niệm', 'a date on which a memorable event took place in a previous year.', 'They are planning a party for their tenth anniversary.', 'Họ đang lên kế hoạch một bữa tiệc cho kỷ niệm mười năm của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The company will host a formal gala to celebrate its 20th anniversary next month.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty sẽ tổ chức một buổi dạ tiệc trang trọng để kỷ niệm 20 năm thành lập vào tháng tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-ljspeech-9280ae13.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-cori-9280ae13.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anniversary-80b598f2.webp', '[\"commemoration\", \"jubilee\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"anniversary celebration\", \"meaning\": \"lễ kỷ niệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mark an anniversary\", \"meaning\": \"đánh dấu một cột mốc kỷ niệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"annual\", \"note_vi\": \"annual là tính từ (hàng năm), còn anniversary là danh từ (ngày kỷ niệm).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-cori-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru0-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru5-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru6-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru10-9280ae13.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru9-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru3-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru7-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru8-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-aru2-9280ae13.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-ljspeech-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt408-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt138-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt624-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt396-9280ae13.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt498-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt132-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt288-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt42-9280ae13.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anniversary-lt90-9280ae13.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'birthday\' (ngày sinh nhật); \'anniversary\' dùng cho ngày kỷ niệm thành lập công ty, ngày cưới hoặc sự kiện lịch sử.', 'company culture', 1, 10),
('1641a911-7894-55e5-8382-abac434e2e3d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'squat', '/skwɒt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Ngồi với đầu gối gập sát người, gần mặt đất.', 'to bend your knees and lower your body so that you are close to the ground.', 'The little boy had to squat down to play with his toy car on the floor.', 'Cậu bé phải ngồi xổm xuống để chơi ô tô đồ chơi trên sàn.', '{\"en\": \"The technician had to squat down to inspect the wiring underneath the office desk.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên phải ngồi xổm xuống để kiểm tra hệ thống dây điện bên dưới bàn làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-ljspeech-5cf7ff79.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-cori-5cf7ff79.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/squat-9ebcfeb8.webp', '[\"crouch\"]', '[\"stand\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"squat down\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi xổm xuống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deep squat\", \"meaning\": \"ngồi xổm sâu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-cori-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru0-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru5-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru6-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru10-5cf7ff79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru9-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru3-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru7-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru8-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-aru2-5cf7ff79.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-ljspeech-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt408-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt138-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt624-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt396-5cf7ff79.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt498-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt132-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt288-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt42-5cf7ff79.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/squat-lt90-5cf7ff79.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi cần hạ thấp cơ thể để làm việc ở vị trí thấp.', 'daily', 1, 11),
('4ba2a329-7130-5199-8c75-d1ed288088e3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'custom', 'UK: /ˈkʌstəm/ | US: /ˈkʌstəm/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'tùy chỉnh, đặt làm riêng', 'Designed or made according to the specific needs or requests of an individual purchaser.', 'We ordered custom furniture for the new office.', 'Chúng tôi đã đặt làm đồ nội thất tùy chỉnh cho văn phòng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The software vendor offers custom solutions tailored to each client\'s workflow.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà cung cấp phần mềm cung cấp các giải pháp tùy chỉnh được thiết kế riêng cho quy trình làm việc của từng khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-ljspeech-f9ac14b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-cori-f9ac14b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/custom-437f407d.webp', '[\"tailored\", \"personalized\", \"bespoke\"]', '[\"standard\", \"generic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"custom software\", \"meaning\": \"phần mềm viết theo yêu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"custom solution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp tùy chỉnh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"customs\", \"note_vi\": \"Customs (luôn ở dạng số nhiều) nghĩa là cơ quan hải quan hoặc thuế hải quan.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"custom\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"customize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"customer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-cori-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru0-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru5-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru6-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru10-f9ac14b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru9-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru3-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru7-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru8-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-aru2-f9ac14b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-ljspeech-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt408-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt138-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt624-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt396-f9ac14b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt498-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt132-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt288-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt42-f9ac14b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/custom-lt90-f9ac14b6.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi làm tính từ, \'custom\' đứng trước danh từ có nghĩa là \'thiết kế riêng\'. Đừng nhầm với danh từ \'custom\' (phong tục) hoặc \'customs\' (hải quan).', 'technology', 1, 12),
('99eea673-2762-57ad-9372-317b97b16a7f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'constrict', '/kənˈstrɪkt/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Làm cho cái gì đó trở nên hẹp hơn, chật hơn hoặc hạn chế.', 'to make something narrower or tighter, or to limit the growth of something.', 'The tight collar began to constrict his breathing, making him uncomfortable.', 'Cổ áo chật bắt đầu siết chặt hơi thở của anh ấy, khiến anh khó chịu.', '{\"en\": \"The new policy might constrict market expansion for small financial technology companies.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách mới có thể làm hạn chế sự mở rộng thị trường cho các công ty công nghệ tài chính nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-ljspeech-7053f479.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-cori-7053f479.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/constrict-39f18196.webp', '[\"restrict\", \"tighten\", \"compress\"]', '[\"expand\", \"loosen\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"constrict movement\", \"meaning\": \"hạn chế sự di chuyển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constrict growth\", \"meaning\": \"kìm hãm sự phát triển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"construct\", \"note_vi\": \"Construct nghĩa là xây dựng, còn constrict là làm hẹp lại hoặc hạn chế.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"constriction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"constricted\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-cori-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru0-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru5-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru6-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru10-7053f479.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru9-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru3-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru7-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru8-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-aru2-7053f479.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-ljspeech-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt408-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt138-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt624-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt396-7053f479.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt498-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt132-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt288-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt42-7053f479.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constrict-lt90-7053f479.mp3\"]}}', 'Đừng nhầm constrict (thu hẹp, thắt lại) với construct (xây dựng).', 'business', 1, 13),
('85be0130-a64d-518a-baea-f746b9f26bbb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'rucksack', '/ˈrʌksæk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một loại túi lớn đeo trên lưng, thường dùng khi đi bộ đường dài.', 'a large bag carried on the back, used for hiking.', 'She placed her heavy laptop inside the durable rucksack before commuting.', 'Cô ấy đặt chiếc máy tính xách tay nặng vào trong chiếc ba lô bền trước khi đi làm.', '{\"en\": \"The tourist stored his rucksack in the hotel locker before the city tour.\", \"vi\": \"Du khách cất ba lô vào tủ khóa khách sạn trước chuyến tham quan thành phố.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-ljspeech-3ea80368.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-cori-3ea80368.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/rucksack-b2e889ec.webp', '[\"backpack\", \"knapsack\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hiking rucksack\", \"meaning\": \"ba lô leo núi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heavy rucksack\", \"meaning\": \"ba lô nặng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sack\", \"note_vi\": \"sack là túi thường, không đeo lưng như rucksack\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-cori-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru0-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru5-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru6-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru10-3ea80368.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru9-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru3-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru7-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru8-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-aru2-3ea80368.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-ljspeech-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt408-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt138-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt624-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt396-3ea80368.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt498-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt132-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt288-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt42-3ea80368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/rucksack-lt90-3ea80368.mp3\"]}}', 'Rucksack là ba lô, phổ biến ở Anh, Mỹ thường dùng backpack.', 'travel', 1, 14),
('8ca0c3a7-7761-5b60-863e-b6748cf25d96', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'calendar', 'UK: /ˈkælɪndər/ | US: /ˈkælɪndər/', 'B1', 'noun', 'lịch', 'a chart or system showing the days, weeks, and months of a specific year', 'Please check the team calendar for meeting dates.', 'Vui lòng kiểm tra lịch nhóm để biết ngày họp.', '{\"en\": \"Please check the department calendar to make sure the conference room is available next Tuesday.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra lịch của bộ phận để đảm bảo phòng hội nghị vẫn còn trống vào thứ Ba tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-ljspeech-e4ffacba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-cori-e4ffacba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/calendar-a0501e17.webp', '[\"schedule\", \"timetable\", \"agenda\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"calendar year\", \"meaning\": \"năm lịch (1/1 - 31/12)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mark on the calendar\", \"meaning\": \"đánh dấu trên lịch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"online calendar\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trực tuyến\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"calender\", \"note_vi\": \"Calender (viết đuôi -er) là máy cán/ép giấy hoặc vải trong sản xuất công nghiệp, khác với calendar (lịch).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-cori-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru0-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru5-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru6-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru10-e4ffacba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru9-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru3-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru7-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru8-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-aru2-e4ffacba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-ljspeech-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt408-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt138-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt624-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt396-e4ffacba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt498-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt132-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt288-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt42-e4ffacba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/calendar-lt90-e4ffacba.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý chính tả: đuôi \'-ar\' chứ không phải \'-er\' (calendar). Trong văn phòng hay gặp cụm \'calendar year\' (năm dương lịch) hoặc \'on the calendar\' (trên lịch công tác).', 'office', 1, 15),
('0b7edd2a-694b-5280-a905-08f7c927d8e9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'mystifying', '/ˈmɪstɪfaɪɪŋ/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Gây bối rối, khó hiểu hoặc khó giải thích.', 'making you feel confused because you cannot understand or explain why something has happened.', 'The magician\'s trick was truly mystifying; no one could figure out how it was done.', 'Màn ảo thuật của ảo thuật gia thực sự khó hiểu; không ai có thể tìm ra cách nó được thực hiện.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden drop in quarterly profits was mystifying to the board of directors and investors.\", \"vi\": \"Sự sụt giảm lợi nhuận hàng quý đột ngột gây khó hiểu cho hội đồng quản trị và nhà đầu tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-ljspeech-94584959.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-cori-94584959.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mystifying-7770e561.webp', '[\"puzzling\", \"confusing\"]', '[\"clear\", \"obvious\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"mystifying result\", \"meaning\": \"kết quả khó hiểu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"mystifying behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi khó hiểu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mystery\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-cori-94584959.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-aru0-94584959.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-aru5-94584959.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-aru6-94584959.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-aru10-94584959.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-aru9-94584959.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-aru3-94584959.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-aru7-94584959.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mystifying-aru8-94