('6945b7e9-b6f9-5919-b733-57309f1e88cd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e0c29eca-0022-590f-8975-aa155e809539', 'b93ac254-4b5d-5c29-b632-99ea093336a9', 'overwhelm', '/ˌəʊvəˈwelm/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm choáng ngợp, áp đảo, vượt quá khả năng xử lý.', 'to have such a strong effect that someone is unable to think or act normally.', 'The sheer amount of information on the internet can sometimes overwhelm new users.', 'Lượng thông tin khổng lồ trên internet đôi khi có thể làm choáng ngợp người dùng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The administrative assistant felt overwhelmed by the large number of urgent emails this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Trợ lý hành chính cảm thấy bị choáng ngợp bởi số lượng lớn email khẩn cấp sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-ljspeech-95c65348.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-cori-95c65348.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/overwhelm-83358abb.webp', '[\"overload\", \"swamp\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"completely overwhelmed\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn bị choáng ngợp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"overwhelmed by work\", \"meaning\": \"bị quá tải bởi công việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"overwhelming\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-cori-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru0-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru5-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru6-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru10-95c65348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru9-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru3-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru7-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru8-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-aru2-95c65348.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-ljspeech-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt408-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt138-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt624-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt396-95c65348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt498-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt132-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt288-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt42-95c65348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/overwhelm-lt90-95c65348.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi khối lượng công việc vượt quá khả năng xử lý của bạn.', 'office', 1, 29),
('17d54485-1181-5305-be5c-a8fdfd7f54b1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'sky-high', '/skaɪˈhaɪ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất cao, thường dùng để chỉ giá cả hoặc mức độ.', 'describing something that reaches an extremely large or expensive level that is difficult to afford.', 'The prices for houses in the city have gone sky-high recently.', 'Giá nhà ở thành phố gần đây đã tăng vọt lên rất cao.', '{\"en\": \"The company faced sky-high shipping costs due to the recent fuel price increases globally.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty phải đối mặt với chi phí vận chuyển cao ngất ngưởng do giá nhiên liệu tăng gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-ljspeech-82f618fa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-cori-82f618fa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sky-high-9677e7f2.webp', '[\"exorbitant\", \"astronomical\"]', '[\"low\", \"reasonable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sky-high prices\", \"meaning\": \"giá cả đắt đỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sky-high demand\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu cực kỳ lớn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-cori-82f618fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru0-82f618fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru5-82f618fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru6-82f618fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru10-82f618fa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru9-82f618fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru3-82f618fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru7-82f618fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru8-82f618fa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sky-high-aru2-82f618fa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/o