('75832779-4ba7-5cfe-8f48-531f0a48cdaa', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'amusement', '/əˈmjuːzmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Hoạt động hoặc cảm giác vui vẻ, được giải trí.', 'the feeling of being entertained or made to laugh by something funny or enjoyable.', 'The children found great amusement in playing hide-and-seek in the park.', 'Bọn trẻ tìm thấy niềm vui lớn khi chơi trốn tìm trong công viên.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel features an indoor pool and an amusement arcade for guests to enjoy.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn có hồ bơi trong nhà và khu vui chơi giải trí để khách tận hưởng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-ljspeech-e800291f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-cori-e800291f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/amusement-203a11a6.webp', '[\"entertainment\", \"enjoyment\", \"recreation\"]', '[\"boredom\", \"sadness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"amusement park\", \"meaning\": \"công viên giải trí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"for amusement\", \"meaning\": \"để giải trí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"amazement\", \"note_vi\": \"amazement là sự kinh ngạc, amusement là sự giải trí.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"amuse\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"amusing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-cori-e800291f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-aru0-e800291f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-aru5-e800291f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-aru6-e800291f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-aru10-e800291f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-aru9-e800291f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-aru3-e800291f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/amusement-aru7-e800291f.mp3\", \"/s