('2d1ad7e2-fe58-58cd-a8b2-ccf806bd0bdb', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'demographic', 'UK: /ˌdɛm.əˈɡræf.ɪk/ | US: /ˌdɛm.əˈɡræf.ɪk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'nhóm dân số, nhóm đối tượng nhân khẩu học', 'A particular section of a population sharing similar social or age characteristics.', 'The marketing team analyzed the demographic of potential customers.', 'Nhóm tiếp thị đã phân tích nhóm đối tượng nhân khẩu học của khách hàng tiềm năng.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing campaign aims to attract a younger demographic.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch tiếp thị mới nhằm mục đích thu hút nhóm đối tượng khách hàng trẻ hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-ljspeech-65aa5fa9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-cori-65aa5fa9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/demographic-b30cc599.webp', '[\"population group\", \"target group\", \"sector\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"target demographic\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm đối tượng mục tiêu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"key demographic\", \"meaning\": \"nhóm nhân khẩu học chủ chốt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"demographic\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"demographically\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"demographics\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-cori-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru0-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru5-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru6-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru10-65aa5fa9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru9-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru3-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru7-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru8-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-aru2-65aa5fa9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-ljspeech-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt408-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt138-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt624-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt396-65aa5fa9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt498-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt132-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt288-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt42-65aa5fa9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/demographic-lt90-65aa5fa9.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong lĩnh vực marketing, \'target demographic\' ám chỉ phân khúc khách hàng mục tiêu theo độ tuổi, thu nhập, giới tính.', 'marketing', 1, 2),
('1d2b7e48-3922-596d-8a91-4ff95089d466', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'fracture', '/ˈfræktʃə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Vết nứt hoặc chỗ gãy trong xương hoặc vật liệu cứng.', 'a small break or crack in a hard material, such as bone or metal.', 'The doctor confirmed that he had a hairline fracture in his ankle.', 'Bác sĩ xác nhận anh ấy bị rạn xương mắt cá chân.', '{\"en\": \"The inspector found a minor fracture in the support beam of the warehouse building.\", \"vi\": \"Người thanh tra đã tìm thấy một vết nứt nhỏ trên dầm đỡ của tòa nhà kho bãi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-ljspeech-b03727da.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-cori-b03727da.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fracture-97f575c9.webp', '[\"crack\", \"break\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"hairline fracture\", \"meaning\": \"vết nứt nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stress fracture\", \"meaning\": \"vết nứt do áp lực\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"fracture\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-cori-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru0-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru5-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru6-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru10-b03727da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru9-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru3-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru7-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru8-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-aru2-b03727da.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-ljspeech-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt408-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt138-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt624-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt396-b03727da.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt498-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt132-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt288-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt42-b03727da.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fracture-lt90-b03727da.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong kỹ thuật, dùng để chỉ sự hư hại cấu trúc vật liệu.', 'manufacturing', 1, 3),
('ff3fbeb1-fa10-548e-b7ab-4b5f2b0c766e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'authority', 'UK: /ɔːˈθɒrəti/ | US: /əˈθɔːrɪti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'quyền hành, thẩm quyền', 'official power or right to make decisions, give orders, and enforce legal rules.', 'The manager has the authority to approve expenses.', 'Người quản lý có thẩm quyền phê duyệt chi phí.', '{\"en\": \"Only the division head has the authority to sign off on major expenditures.\", \"vi\": \"Chỉ có trưởng bộ phận mới có thẩm quyền ký duyệt các khoản chi tiêu lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-ljspeech-66f5c871.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-cori-66f5c871.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/authority-a2681537.webp', '[\"power\", \"jurisdiction\", \"command\", \"control\"]', '[\"powerlessness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have the authority to\", \"meaning\": \"có thẩm quyền làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"local authorities\", \"meaning\": \"chính quyền địa phương\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"authorization\", \"note_vi\": \"authority là quyền hạn/thẩm quyền, trong khi authorization là sự cho phép hay văn bản cấp phép\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"authorize\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"authoritative\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"authorization\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-cori-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru0-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru5-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru6-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru10-66f5c871.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru9-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru3-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru7-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru8-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-aru2-66f5c871.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-ljspeech-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt408-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt138-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt624-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt396-66f5c871.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt498-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt132-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt288-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt42-66f5c871.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/authority-lt90-66f5c871.mp3\"]}}', 'Ghi nhớ cấu trúc \'have the authority to do something\'. Nếu ở dạng số nhiều \'authorities\' thì mang nghĩa \'cơ quan nhà nước/chính quyền\'.', 'management', 1, 4),
('b613b8c2-2b99-5908-8a5a-246f326921dd', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'intricate', '/ˈɪntrɪkət/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Rất phức tạp, nhiều chi tiết nhỏ.', 'having many small parts or details that are put together in a complicated way.', 'The watch had an intricate mechanism that was difficult to repair.', 'Chiếc đồng hồ có một bộ máy phức tạp rất khó sửa chữa.', '{\"en\": \"The designer created an intricate pattern for the new luxury watch collection.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thiết kế đã tạo ra một hoa văn phức tạp cho bộ sưu tập đồng hồ sang trọng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-ljspeech-b0192ae0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-cori-b0192ae0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/intricate-0bf3568d.webp', '[\"complex\", \"complicated\", \"elaborate\"]', '[\"simple\", \"straightforward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"intricate design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế phức tạp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"intricate details\", \"meaning\": \"chi tiết phức tạp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"intimate\", \"note_vi\": \"intimate nghĩa là thân mật, sâu sắc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"intricacy\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"intricately\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-cori-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru0-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru5-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru6-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru10-b0192ae0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru9-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru3-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru7-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru8-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-aru2-b0192ae0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-ljspeech-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt408-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt138-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt624-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt396-b0192ae0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt498-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt132-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt288-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt42-b0192ae0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/intricate-lt90-b0192ae0.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này nhấn mạnh vào sự tinh xảo và nhiều chi tiết nhỏ.', 'manufacturing', 1, 5),
('c161a907-2593-5f5e-abc4-31641437ed1b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'spare', 'UK: /speər/ | US: /spɛr/', 'B2', 'verb', 'dành ra, chia sẻ', 'to give or make available something such as time or money to someone', 'Can you spare some time to review this report?', 'Bạn có thể dành chút thời gian để xem xét báo cáo này không?', '{\"en\": \"Could you spare a few minutes to review the draft proposal before the board meeting starts?\", \"vi\": \"Bạn có thể dành ra vài phút để xem qua bản thảo đề xuất trước khi cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị bắt đầu không?\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-ljspeech-8715c95f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-cori-8715c95f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spare-b6ba6708.webp', '[\"afford\", \"grant\", \"provide\", \"allot\"]', '[\"withhold\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spare a minute\", \"meaning\": \"dành ra một phút\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spare no effort\", \"meaning\": \"không tiếc công sức / cố gắng hết sức\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spare the time\", \"meaning\": \"dành thời gian\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"share\", \"note_vi\": \"Share là chia sẻ dùng chung, còn spare là nhường/dành bớt ra cho người khác.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"spare\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spare\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-cori-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru0-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru5-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru6-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru10-8715c95f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru9-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru3-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru7-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru8-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-aru2-8715c95f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-ljspeech-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt408-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt138-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt624-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt396-8715c95f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt498-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt132-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt288-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt42-8715c95f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spare-lt90-8715c95f.mp3\"]}}', 'Mẫu câu lịch sự cực phổ biến trong giao tiếp công sở: \'Can you spare a few minutes?\' (Bạn có thể dành ra vài phút không?).', 'office', 1, 6),
('2d369863-3fef-55ec-b8b8-3497687ab01c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'atypical', '/ˌeɪˈtɪpɪkl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Không theo quy tắc thông thường, bất thường.', 'not usual or normal for a particular type of person or thing.', 'His reaction was quite atypical; usually, he\'s very calm.', 'Phản ứng của anh ấy khá bất thường; thường thì anh ấy rất bình tĩnh.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden drop in sales this quarter is highly atypical for our retail business.\", \"vi\": \"Sự sụt giảm doanh số đột ngột trong quý này là rất bất thường đối với hoạt động kinh doanh bán lẻ của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-ljspeech-158c742e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-cori-158c742e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atypical-5482cbbb.webp', '[\"unusual\", \"abnormal\", \"uncommon\"]', '[\"typical\", \"normal\", \"usual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"highly atypical\", \"meaning\": \"rất bất thường\"}, {\"phrase\": \"atypical behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi bất thường\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"typical\", \"note_vi\": \"Typical là điển hình, còn atypical là bất thường (tiền tố a- mang nghĩa phủ định).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"atypically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-cori-158c742e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-aru0-158c742e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-aru5-158c742e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-aru6-158c742e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-aru10-158c742e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-aru9-158c742e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-aru3-158c742e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atypical-aru7-158c742e.mp3\", \"/storag