('02d0aa65-ecd6-5fa6-b5f6-379d7157e2ed', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'manifest', '/ˈmænɪfest/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Rõ ràng, dễ thấy hoặc dễ hiểu.', 'easy to see or notice because it is very clear and obvious to everyone.', 'Her deep disappointment was manifest in her downcast eyes and quiet demeanor.', 'Sự thất vọng sâu sắc của cô ấy thể hiện rõ ràng qua đôi mắt cụp xuống và thái độ trầm lặng.', '{\"en\": \"The lack of communication was manifest in the confusion during the project launch meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Sự thiếu giao tiếp thể hiện rõ ràng qua sự bối rối trong cuộc họp ra mắt dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-ljspeech-c5beef2d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-cori-c5beef2d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/manifest-43acc107.webp', '[\"obvious\", \"clear\"]', '[\"hidden\", \"obscure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"manifest error\", \"meaning\": \"lỗi rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"manifest sign\", \"meaning\": \"dấu hiệu rõ ràng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"manifestation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-cori-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru0-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru5-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru6-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru10-c5beef2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru9-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru3-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru7-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru8-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-aru2-c5beef2d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-ljspeech-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt408-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt138-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt624-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt396-c5beef2d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt498-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt132-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt288-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt42-c5beef2d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/manifest-lt90-c5beef2d.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này mang tính trang trọng, thường dùng trong văn viết.', 'business', 1, 9),
('c3e1bf9c-7bd0-5f62-ba4a-367f1e8338d0', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'decade', 'UK: /ˈdɛkeɪd/ | US: /ˈdɛkeɪd/', 'B1', 'noun', 'thập kỷ', 'A continuous period of ten consecutive years in time.', 'The company has grown significantly over the past decade.', 'Công ty đã phát triển đáng kể trong thập kỷ qua.', '{\"en\": \"Our corporation has been a global leader in renewable energy for over a decade.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn của chúng tôi đã đi đầu toàn cầu về năng lượng tái tạo trong hơn một thập kỷ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-ljspeech-964ec44c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-cori-964ec44c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/decade-c02d4d69.webp', '[\"ten-year period\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"over the past decade\", \"meaning\": \"trong suốt thập kỷ vừa qua\"}, {\"phrase\": \"decade of growth\", \"meaning\": \"thập kỷ tăng trưởng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decay\", \"note_vi\": \"Decay nghĩa là sự suy tàn hoặc phân hủy, khác hoàn toàn với decade là thập kỷ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-cori-964ec44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru0-964ec44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru5-964ec44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru6-964ec44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru10-964ec44c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru9-964ec44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru3-964ec44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru7-964ec44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru8-964ec44c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/decade-aru2-964ec44c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati