('0e91bf86-c82b-5a40-bbcd-af3e5a4b995a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'engaging', '/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thu hút, lôi cuốn sự chú ý.', 'pleasant, attractive, and charming in a way that keeps people interested or involved.', 'The speaker\'s engaging style kept the audience interested throughout the presentation.', 'Phong cách lôi cuốn của diễn giả đã giữ cho khán giả hứng thú suốt buổi thuyết trình.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team created an engaging video advertisement to attract younger customers.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã tạo một video quảng cáo lôi cuốn để thu hút khách hàng trẻ tuổi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-ljspeech-cf7b1657.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-cori-cf7b1657.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/engaging-27709695.webp', '[\"captivating\", \"charming\", \"attractive\"]', '[\"boring\", \"uninteresting\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"engaging personality\", \"meaning\": \"tính cách lôi cuốn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"engaging presentation\", \"meaning\": \"bài thuyết trình thu hút\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"engaged\", \"note_vi\": \"Engaged nghĩa là đã đính hôn hoặc đang bận; engaging là thu hút.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"engage\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"engagement\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-cori-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru0-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru5-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru6-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru10-cf7b1657.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru9-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru3-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru7-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru8-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-aru2-cf7b1657.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-ljspeech-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt408-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt138-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt624-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt396-cf7b1657.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt498-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt132-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt288-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt42-cf7b1657.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/engaging-lt90-cf7b1657.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt engaging (tính chất thu hút) và engaged (đang bận hoặc đã đính hôn).', 'marketing', 1, 11),
('a407f087-614a-51ff-a54e-8f49aa605297', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'wishy-washy', '/ˈwɪʃiˌwɒʃi/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Thiếu quyết đoán, không có chính kiến.', 'not having clear ideas, firm opinions, or strong determination to make decisions.', 'We need a leader, not someone who is wishy-washy about every decision.', 'Chúng ta cần một nhà lãnh đạo, không phải một người thiếu quyết đoán trong mọi quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"Clients dislike wishy-washy answers when asking about project completion deadlines.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng không thích những câu trả lời mập mờ khi hỏi về thời hạn hoàn thành dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-ljspeech-5707d8b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-cori-5707d8b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/wishy-washy-ed538dd6.webp', '[\"indecisive\", \"irresolute\", \"vague\"]', '[\"decisive\", \"firm\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"wishy-washy answer\", \"meaning\": \"câu trả lời không rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"wishy-washy attitude\", \"meaning\": \"thái độ ba phải\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-cori-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru0-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru5-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru6-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru10-5707d8b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru9-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru3-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru7-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru8-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-aru2-5707d8b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-ljspeech-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt408-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt138-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt624-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt396-5707d8b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt498-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt132-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt288-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt42-5707d8b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/wishy-washy-lt90-5707d8b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ mang tính khẩu ngữ, miêu tả người hoặc ý kiến mập mờ, thiếu quyết đoán.', 'hr', 1, 12),
('304f6606-c265-5daf-bd88-3393357fd03d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'utility', '/juːˈtɪləti/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dùng để chỉ cái gì đó có tính thực dụng, đa năng.', 'designed for useful or practical purposes rather than beauty or style.', 'The apartment comes with a small utility room for laundry and storage.', 'Căn hộ có một phòng tiện ích nhỏ để giặt giũ và cất đồ.', '{\"en\": \"The facility manager inspected the utility room to check the water heaters.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý tòa nhà đã kiểm tra phòng kỹ thuật để kiểm tra bình nước nóng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-ljspeech-8884fd30.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-cori-8884fd30.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/utility-bd16d87f.webp', '[\"practical\", \"functional\", \"useful\"]', '[\"decorative\", \"impractical\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"utility room\", \"meaning\": \"phòng tiện ích/kỹ thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"utility vehicle\", \"meaning\": \"xe bán tải/đa dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"futile\", \"note_vi\": \"futile là vô ích, không có tác dụng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"utility\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"utilize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"utilization\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-cori-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru0-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru5-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru6-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru10-8884fd30.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru9-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru3-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru7-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru8-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-aru2-8884fd30.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-ljspeech-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt408-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt138-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt624-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt396-8884fd30.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt498-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt132-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt288-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt42-8884fd30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/utility-lt90-8884fd30.mp3\"]}}', 'Khi làm tính từ thường đứng trước danh từ chỉ phòng, xe hoặc thiết bị thực dụng.', 'housing', 1, 13),
('5b5fa9b0-693f-5419-a8ce-402523d07b9c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'chronic', '/ˈkrɒnɪk/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Kéo dài trong thời gian dài, thường là về bệnh tật.', 'continuing for a long time and not easily cured or solved, especially a disease.', 'He suffers from chronic back pain, which affects his daily life.', 'Anh ấy bị đau lưng mãn tính, điều này ảnh hưởng đến cuộc sống hàng ngày của anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The manufacturing plant has been experiencing a chronic shortage of skilled workers since last year.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy sản xuất đã và đang trải qua tình trạng thiếu hụt công nhân lành nghề kéo dài từ năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-ljspeech-24fc197e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-cori-24fc197e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chronic-9ce75ac9.webp', '[\"persistent\", \"long-lasting\", \"constant\"]', '[\"acute\", \"temporary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chronic disease\", \"meaning\": \"bệnh mãn tính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chronic shortage\", \"meaning\": \"sự thiếu hụt triền miên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"acute\", \"note_vi\": \"acute là cấp tính (ngắn, nghiêm trọng), chronic là mãn tính (kéo dài).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"chronically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-cori-24fc197e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-aru0-24fc197e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-aru5-24fc197e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-aru6-24fc197e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-aru10-24fc197e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-aru9-24fc197e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-aru3-24fc197e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronic-aru7-