('7a10dd6b-2998-5237-b5e0-c30272d84390', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'compliance', '/kəmˈplaɪəns/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sự tuân thủ, sự chấp hành các quy tắc, luật lệ hoặc yêu cầu.', 'the state of obeying a particular rule, law, or agreement.', 'Strict compliance with safety guidelines is mandatory for all factory workers.', 'Sự tuân thủ nghiêm ngặt các hướng dẫn an toàn là bắt buộc đối với tất cả công nhân nhà máy.', '{\"en\": \"Our factory operates in strict compliance with safety regulations to protect workers.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy của chúng tôi hoạt động tuân thủ nghiêm ngặt các quy định an toàn để bảo vệ công nhân.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-ljspeech-036cb735.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-cori-036cb735.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compliance-0195a828.webp', '[\"obedience\", \"conformity\", \"agreement\"]', '[\"noncompliance\", \"violation\", \"defiance\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"in compliance with\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ theo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"regulatory compliance\", \"meaning\": \"sự tuân thủ quy định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compliment\", \"note_vi\": \"compliment là lời khen ngợi, phát âm gần giống compliance.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"comply\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"compliant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-cori-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru0-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru5-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru6-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru10-036cb735.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru9-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru3-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru7-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru8-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-aru2-036cb735.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-ljspeech-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt408-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt138-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt624-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt396-036cb735.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt498-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt132-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt288-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt42-036cb735.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compliance-lt90-036cb735.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'with\' trong cụm \'in compliance with\'.', 'law', 1, 15),
('891ff331-2171-59ae-89a6-7b69247f182d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'crude', '/kruːd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Thô sơ, chưa tinh chế, hoặc thiếu tinh tế, không hoàn chỉnh.', 'in a natural or raw state, not simple or fully developed yet.', 'The artist made a crude sketch before starting the detailed painting.', 'Người nghệ sĩ đã phác thảo một bản nháp thô trước khi bắt đầu bức tranh chi tiết.', '{\"en\": \"The manager presented a crude estimate of the total construction costs for the project.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã trình bày một ước tính thô sơ về tổng chi phí xây dựng cho dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-ljspeech-b48c292b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-cori-b48c292b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crude-2f363c81.webp', '[\"raw\", \"unrefined\", \"basic\"]', '[\"refined\", \"sophisticated\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"crude oil\", \"meaning\": \"dầu thô\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crude estimate\", \"meaning\": \"ước tính thô\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cruel\", \"note_vi\": \"Cruel nghĩa là tàn nhẫn, độc ác, không phải thô sơ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"crudeness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"crudely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-cori-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru0-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru5-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru6-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru10-b48c292b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru9-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru3-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru7-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru8-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-aru2-b48c292b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-ljspeech-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt408-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt138-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt624-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt396-b48c292b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt498-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt132-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt288-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt42-b48c292b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crude-lt90-b48c292b.mp3\"]}}', 'Crude oil là dầu thô; ngoài ra còn mang nghĩa thô sơ, chưa trau chuốt.', 'manufacturing', 1, 16),
('e02e64bf-46aa-5b9f-b29b-dd2e87093435', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'attract', 'UK: /əˈtrækt/ | US: /əˈtrækt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'thu hút', 'to draw interest, attention, or admiration toward someone or a particular thing.', 'The new marketing campaign aims to attract more clients.', 'Chiến dịch tiếp thị mới nhằm mục đích thu hút thêm khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The new promotional campaign managed to attract thousands of potential customers.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến dịch quảng bá mới đã thu hút hàng ngàn khách hàng tiềm năng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-ljspeech-dd335b0d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-cori-dd335b0d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/attract-ae17639d.webp', '[\"draw\", \"lure\", \"entice\", \"appeal to\"]', '[\"repel\", \"deter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"attract investment\", \"meaning\": \"thu hút đầu tư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attract customers\", \"meaning\": \"thu hút khách hàng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"distract\", \"note_vi\": \"làm xao nhãng, phân tâm (trái ngược với attract là thu hút sự chú ý)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"attraction\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"attractive\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"attractively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-cori-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru0-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru5-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru6-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru10-dd335b0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru9-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru3-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru7-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru8-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-aru2-dd335b0d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-ljspeech-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt408-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt138-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt624-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt396-dd335b0d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt498-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt132-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt288-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt42-dd335b0d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/attract-lt90-dd335b0d.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến trong đề thi TOEIC: \'attract attention/customers/investment\' (thu hút sự chú ý/khách hàng/đầu tư).', 'marketing', 1, 17),
('91ef4d8d-328d-57b7-b2e1-afaa503b40a4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e1518932-5bcd-5622-bb9e-6a39cff06688', '8d17c5cc-2d90-5da0-8c23-97e5404ca99f', 'flirt', '/flɜːt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tán tỉnh, ve vãn ai đó một cách vui đùa.', 'behave in a playful way that shows mild romantic interest in someone.', 'He likes to flirt with new ideas, even if he doesn\'t always pursue them.', 'Anh ấy thích đùa giỡn với những ý tưởng mới, ngay cả khi anh ấy không phải lúc nào cũng theo đuổi chúng.', '{\"en\": \"She seemed to flirt with the client to keep the negotiation friendly.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy dường như tán tỉnh khách hàng để giữ cho cuộc đàm phán thân thiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-ljspeech-cab0c9e4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-cori-cab0c9e4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/flirt-8f49d1ee.webp', '[\"tease\", \"dally\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"snub\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"flirt with\", \"meaning\": \"tán tỉnh, hoặc dởm ý tưởng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"flirt with danger\", \"meaning\": \"liều lĩnh đùa với nguy hiểm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"flick\", \"note_vi\": \"flick là búng hoặc lia nhanh, khác flirt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"flirtation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-cori-cab0c9e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-aru0-cab0c9e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-aru5-cab0c9e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-aru6-cab0c9e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-aru10-cab0c9e4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-aru9-cab0c9e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-aru3-cab0c9e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-aru7-cab0c9e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/flirt-aru8-cab0c9e4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v