('1031b0d8-a4e1-582a-8497-72d58e93ea68', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e37df36c-df41-5c6d-a061-1e44113885c9', 'a74f7bf4-eb16-5de3-8c5b-d30ed9053e53', 'scurvy', '/ˈskɜːvi/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Bệnh do thiếu vitamin C, gây chảy máu nướu và mệt mỏi.', 'a disease caused by a lack of vitamin c, causing weak gums and bleeding.', 'Sailors on long voyages in the past often suffered from scurvy due to a lack of fresh produce.', 'Các thủy thủ trong những chuyến đi dài ngày trước đây thường mắc bệnh scurvy do thiếu rau quả tươi.', '{\"en\": \"The shipping company provided fresh fruit to prevent crew members from developing scurvy.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty vận tải biển đã cung cấp trái cây tươi để ngăn các thành viên thủy thủ đoàn bị bệnh scurvy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-ljspeech-a1ac6885.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-cori-a1ac6885.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scurvy-78026347.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"suffer from scurvy\", \"meaning\": \"bị bệnh scurvy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent scurvy\", \"meaning\": \"ngăn ngừa bệnh scurvy\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-cori-a1ac6885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru0-a1ac6885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru5-a1ac6885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru6-a1ac6885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru10-a1ac6885.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru9-a1ac6885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru3-a1ac6885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru7-a1ac6885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru8-a1ac6885.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scurvy-aru2-a1ac6885.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu