('31f02b8b-c159-5935-8155-d998a1077001', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e37df36c-df41-5c6d-a061-1e44113885c9', 'a74f7bf4-eb16-5de3-8c5b-d30ed9053e53', 'determined', '/dɪˈtɜːmɪnd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Quyết chí, kiên quyết làm điều gì đó.', 'showing a strong decision to do something even if it is difficult.', 'She was determined to finish the marathon, despite the difficult weather conditions.', 'Cô ấy quyết tâm hoàn thành cuộc thi marathon, bất chấp điều kiện thời tiết khắc nghiệt.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team is determined to increase sales by twenty percent this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị quyết tâm tăng doanh số bán hàng lên hai mươi phần trăm trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determined-ljspeech-3e3e6c7b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determined-cori-3e3e6c7b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/determined-2a5b49c7.webp', '[\"resolute\", \"persistent\", \"firm\"]', '[\"hesitant\", \"undecided\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"determined effort\", \"meaning\": \"nỗ lực kiên quyết\"}, {\"phrase\": \"determined to succeed\", \"meaning\": \"quyết tâm thành công\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"decided\", \"note_vi\": \"decided là rõ ràng, dứt khoát; determined là quyết tâm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"determine\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"determination\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"determinedly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determined-cori-3e3e6c7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determined-aru0-3e3e6c7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determined-aru5-3e3e6c7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determined-aru6-3e3e6c7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determined-aru10-3e3e6c7b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/determined-aru9-3e3e6c7b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/de