('07e7af21-f67e-5fa4-8833-d43c79da8a86', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e57e0636-2236-52e3-b1ce-c4b17dc5d3cf', '1da9b406-d14e-51db-a63f-fa9c2fe3b42b', 'spam', '/spæm/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thư điện tử không mong muốn, thường là quảng cáo hoặc lừa đảo.', 'unwanted digital messages that are sent to many people at the same time, usually for advertising.', 'My inbox is full of spam messages, so I have to delete them every day.', 'Hộp thư đến của tôi đầy thư rác, nên tôi phải xóa chúng hàng ngày.', '{\"en\": \"Please check your spam folder if you do not receive the confirmation email within an hour.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng kiểm tra thư mục spam nếu bạn không nhận được email xác nhận trong vòng một giờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-ljspeech-ded982e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-cori-ded982e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spam-56f4967a.webp', '[\"junk mail\", \"unsolicited email\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"spam folder\", \"meaning\": \"thư mục thư rác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"filter spam\", \"meaning\": \"lọc thư rác\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"spam\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-cori-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru0-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru5-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru6-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru10-ded982e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru9-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru3-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru7-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru8-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-aru2-ded982e7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-ljspeech-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt408-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt138-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt624-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt396-ded982e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt498-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt132-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt288-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt42-ded982e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spam-lt90-ded982e7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường là thư quảng cáo hoặc lừa đảo, cần cẩn thận khi mở.', 'technology', 1, 1),
('df5f8a8c-98cf-5b5b-a793-1ba2d048393b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e57e0636-2236-52e3-b1ce-c4b17dc5d3cf', '1da9b406-d14e-51db-a63f-fa9c2fe3b42b', 'unravel', '/ʌnˈrævl/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Tháo ra, gỡ rối (sợi, kế hoạch, bí ẩn).', 'to make a complicated situation or a secret easier to understand or solve completely.', 'Detectives are working to unravel the mystery behind the sudden disappearance.', 'Các thám tử đang cố gắng tháo gỡ bí ẩn đằng sau vụ mất tích đột ngột.', '{\"en\": \"The audit team is trying to unravel the reasons behind the company\'s sudden financial loss.\", \"vi\": \"Đội kiểm toán đang cố gắng làm sáng tỏ những lý do đằng sau khoản lỗ tài chính bất ngờ của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-ljspeech-f6b48019.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-cori-f6b48019.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/unravel-0522eee2.webp', '[\"solve\", \"clarify\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"unravel a mystery\", \"meaning\": \"giải mã bí ẩn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unravel a plan\", \"meaning\": \"làm sáng tỏ kế hoạch\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reveal\", \"note_vi\": \"Reveal là tiết lộ, unravel là gỡ rối/làm rõ vấn đề phức tạp.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-cori-f6b48019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-aru0-f6b48019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-aru5-f6b48019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-aru6-f6b48019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-aru10-f6b48019.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-aru9-f6b48019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-aru3-f6b48019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-aru7-f6b48019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/unravel-aru8-f6b48019.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat