('274dd777-c541-517e-8f3c-e92a80569821', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e57e0636-2236-52e3-b1ce-c4b17dc5d3cf', '1da9b406-d14e-51db-a63f-fa9c2fe3b42b', 'fieldwork', '/ˈfiːldwɜːk/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nghiên cứu hoặc công việc được thực hiện ngoài môi trường phòng thí nghiệm, trong thực tế.', 'practical work done outside the office or laboratory setting.', 'Anthropology students often spend a lot of time doing fieldwork in remote communities.', 'Sinh viên nhân học thường dành nhiều thời gian làm công việc thực địa ở các cộng đồng xa xôi.', '{\"en\": \"The agriculture consultant conducted fieldwork at the farm to assess crop health.\", \"vi\": \"Cố vấn nông nghiệp đã thực hiện công tác thực địa tại trang trại để đánh giá sức khỏe cây trồng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-ljspeech-16785503.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-cori-16785503.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fieldwork-d32d76e4.webp', '[\"field study\", \"field research\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"conduct fieldwork\", \"meaning\": \"tiến hành công tác thực địa\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fieldwork experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm thực địa\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"field trip\", \"note_vi\": \"field trip là chuyến tham quan, fieldwork là nghiên cứu thực địa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-cori-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru0-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru5-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru6-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru10-16785503.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru9-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru3-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru7-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru8-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-aru2-16785503.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-ljspeech-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt408-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt138-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt624-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt396-16785503.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt498-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt132-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt288-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt42-16785503.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fieldwork-lt90-16785503.mp3\"]}}', 'Khác field trip: fieldwork là làm việc thực tế, không phải đi chơi.', 'business', 1, 20),
('f3fe90dd-659d-599b-81e3-d242a1e7f90c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e57e0636-2236-52e3-b1ce-c4b17dc5d3cf', '1da9b406-d14e-51db-a63f-fa9c2fe3b42b', 'sound check', '/saʊnd tʃek/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Buổi kiểm tra hệ thống âm thanh trước buổi biểu diễn.', 'a test of audio equipment before a musical or public performance starts.', 'The band did a quick sound check before their concert to ensure everything was perfect.', 'Ban nhạc đã kiểm tra âm thanh nhanh chóng trước buổi hòa nhạc để đảm bảo mọi thứ hoàn hảo.', '{\"en\": \"The audio engineers finished the sound check an hour before the conference began.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ sư âm thanh đã hoàn tất việc kiểm tra âm thanh một giờ trước khi hội nghị bắt đầu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-ljspeech-9d1f4a9a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-cori-9d1f4a9a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sound-check-73174e8f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"do a sound check\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện kiểm tra âm thanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"final sound check\", \"meaning\": \"lần kiểm tra âm thanh cuối cùng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-cori-9d1f4a9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru0-9d1f4a9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru5-9d1f4a9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru6-9d1f4a9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru10-9d1f4a9a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru9-9d1f4a9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru3-9d1f4a9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru7-9d1f4a9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru8-9d1f4a9a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sound-check-aru2-9d1f4a9