('cca8cb90-fc81-5528-9358-fab84abe3add', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e738fd10-f5de-528b-8706-ba8f1ad107d5', '962b4086-5c66-500b-8685-9928699d76ce', 'halogen', '/ˈhælədʒən/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Một nhóm nguyên tố hóa học có tính phi kim cao, ví dụ clo hoặc flo.', 'a group of chemical elements that form acidic compounds with hydrogen.', 'Chlorine is a common halogen used to disinfect water.', 'Clo là một halogen phổ biến được dùng để khử trùng nước.', '{\"en\": \"The maintenance team replaced all old bulbs in the office with energy-saving halogen lights.\", \"vi\": \"Đội bảo trì đã thay thế tất cả bóng đèn cũ trong văn phòng bằng đèn halogen tiết kiệm điện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-ljspeech-6e41e0c7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-cori-6e41e0c7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/halogen-8d7ea9a2.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"halogen lamp\", \"meaning\": \"đèn halogen\"}, {\"phrase\": \"halogen bulb\", \"meaning\": \"bóng đèn halogen\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-cori-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru0-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru5-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru6-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru10-6e41e0c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru9-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru3-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru7-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru8-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-aru2-6e41e0c7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-ljspeech-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt408-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt138-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt624-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt396-6e41e0c7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt498-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt132-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt288-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt42-6e41e0c7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/halogen-lt90-6e41e0c7.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong đời sống và TOEIC, từ này thường gặp nhất trong cụm đèn halogen.', 'manufacturing', 1, 8),
('8c004679-31e6-5100-837d-bcbf0abf8d9d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e738fd10-f5de-528b-8706-ba8f1ad107d5', '962b4086-5c66-500b-8685-9928699d76ce', 'chunky', '/ˈtʃʌŋki/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều cục, miếng lớn; dày và chắc.', 'having large pieces or a thick and heavy appearance that is not smooth or thin.', 'She knitted a chunky scarf to keep warm in winter.', 'Cô ấy đã đan một chiếc khăn dày dặn để giữ ấm vào mùa đông.', '{\"en\": \"The warehouse manager ordered chunky sweaters for the staff to wear in the cold storage.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý kho đã đặt những chiếc áo len dày cho nhân viên mặc trong kho lạnh.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-ljspeech-72c07659.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-cori-72c07659.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chunky-2397e824.webp', '[\"thick\", \"heavy\"]', '[\"thin\", \"slender\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chunky knit\", \"meaning\": \"đan len dày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chunky style\", \"meaning\": \"phong cách dày dặn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"chunk\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-cori-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru0-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru5-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru6-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru10-72c07659.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru9-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru3-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru7-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru8-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-aru2-72c07659.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-ljspeech-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt408-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt138-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt624-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt396-72c07659.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt498-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt132-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt288-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt42-72c07659.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chunky-lt90-72c07659.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng cho quần áo hoặc đồ trang sức có kích thước lớn và dày.', 'shopping', 1, 9),
('8909dd2a-8f0e-5169-8643-d780e5707b0b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e738fd10-f5de-528b-8706-ba8f1ad107d5', '962b4086-5c66-500b-8685-9928699d76ce', 'roughly', '/ˈrʌfli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Khoảng, xấp xỉ.', 'approximately or about, not completely accurate or exact.', 'The new marketing strategy cost roughly ten thousand dollars to implement.', 'Chiến lược tiếp thị mới tốn khoảng mười nghìn đô la để triển khai.', '{\"en\": \"The renovation of the office headquarters will cost roughly fifty thousand dollars.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cải tạo trụ sở văn phòng sẽ tốn khoảng năm mươi nghìn đô la.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-ljspeech-a029138b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-cori-a029138b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/roughly-0ffff9f8.webp', '[\"approximately\", \"about\", \"nearly\"]', '[\"exactly\", \"precisely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"roughly equivalent\", \"meaning\": \"xấp xỉ tương đương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"roughly speaking\", \"meaning\": \"nói một cách đại khái\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"rough\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"roughness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-cori-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru0-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru5-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru6-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru10-a029138b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru9-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru3-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru7-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru8-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-aru2-a029138b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-ljspeech-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt408-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt138-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt624-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt396-a029138b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt498-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt132-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt288-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt42-a029138b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/roughly-lt90-a029138b.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất thường gặp trong TOEIC khi nói về số liệu ước lượng, ngân sách hoặc thời gian.', 'finance', 1, 10),
('66391ff3-44fb-5970-91a5-e83dfcf1d547', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e738fd10-f5de-528b-8706-ba8f1ad107d5', '962b4086-5c66-500b-8685-9928699d76ce', 'conjectural', '/kənˈdʒektʃərəl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Dựa trên phỏng đoán, không có bằng chứng chắc chắn.', 'based on guesses or incomplete information rather than on solid facts or proof.', 'Many of the theories about ancient civilizations remain purely conjectural.', 'Nhiều lý thuyết về các nền văn minh cổ đại vẫn chỉ là phỏng đoán.', '{\"en\": \"The sales forecast for the next quarter is largely conjectural due to the unpredictable market conditions.\", \"vi\": \"Dự báo doanh số cho quý tới phần lớn là phỏng đoán do điều kiện thị trường khó đoán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conjectural-ljspeech-4f0d6d76.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conjectural-cori-4f0d6d76.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conjectural-785c4ca9.webp', '[\"speculative\", \"hypothetical\", \"theoretical\"]', '[\"factual\", \"certain\", \"proven\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conjectural evidence\", \"meaning\": \"bằng chứng mang tính phỏng đoán\"}, {\"phrase\": \"purely conjectural\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn là phỏng đoán\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conceptual\", \"note_vi\": \"conceptual là thuộc về khái niệm, conjectural là phỏng đoán\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"conjecture\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"conjecture\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conjectural-cori-4f0d6d76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conjectural-aru0-4f0d6d76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conjectural-aru5-4f0d6d76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conjectural-aru6-4f0d6d76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conjectural-aru10-4f0d6d76.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conjectural-aru9-4f0d6d76.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu