('663eb052-0bed-5285-b6b0-9e7c5063ba32', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e738fd10-f5de-528b-8706-ba8f1ad107d5', '962b4086-5c66-500b-8685-9928699d76ce', 'storefront', 'UK: /ˈstɔːfʌnt/ | US: /ˈstɔrˌfrʌnt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'mặt tiền cửa hàng', 'the side or facade of a retail shop facing the public street, usually including display windows.', 'The new shop has a modern storefront on the main street.', 'Cửa hàng mới có mặt tiền hiện đại trên phố chính.', '{\"en\": \"The company hired an architect to redesign the storefront to attract more pedestrians.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã thuê một kiến trúc sư để thiết kế lại mặt tiền cửa hàng nhằm thu hút nhiều người đi bộ hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-ljspeech-781592fc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-cori-781592fc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/storefront-2e80e7ce.webp', '[\"facade\", \"shopfront\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"storefront display\", \"meaning\": \"trưng bày mặt tiền cửa hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"attractive storefront\", \"meaning\": \"mặt tiền cửa hàng bắt mắt\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"store\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-cori-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru0-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru5-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru6-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru10-781592fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru9-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru3-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru7-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru8-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-aru2-781592fc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-ljspeech-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt408-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt138-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt624-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt396-781592fc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt498-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt132-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt288-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt42-781592fc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/storefront-lt90-781592fc.mp3\"]}}', '\'Storefront\' chỉ phần phía trước cửa hàng nhìn ra đường, thường lắp kính trưng bày sản phẩm.', 'business', 1, 27),
('3c033237-16db-52f5-9921-fe0702bde151', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'e738fd10-f5de-528b-8706-ba8f1ad107d5', '962b4086-5c66-500b-8685-9928699d76ce', 'on occasion', '/ɒn əˈkeɪʒən/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Đôi khi, thỉnh thoảng, không thường xuyên.', 'happening sometimes but not very often or on a regular basis.', 'We still meet up for coffee on occasion, even though we live in different cities.', 'Chúng tôi vẫn thỉnh thoảng gặp nhau uống cà phê, dù sống ở các thành phố khác nhau.', '{\"en\": \"The manager meets with the department heads on occasion to discuss new project goals.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý gặp gỡ các trưởng bộ phận đôi khi để thảo luận về các mục tiêu dự án mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-ljspeech-b7094312.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-cori-b7094312.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/on-occasion-6c260bd4.webp', '[\"occasionally\", \"sometimes\"]', '[\"frequently\", \"always\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"every now and then\", \"meaning\": \"thỉnh thoảng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"from time to time\", \"meaning\": \"đôi lúc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"occasion\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"occasional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-cori-b7094312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-aru0-b7094312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-aru5-b7094312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-aru6-b7094312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-aru10-b7094312.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-aru9-b7094312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-aru3-b7094312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-aru7-b7094312.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-occasion-aru8-b