('b43e9ce4-cba5-5685-a850-55ddcf47f653', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'eb139df7-71e9-50dc-9792-ae687367d129', '8058afbb-97a5-525f-a95c-c8da66a262d5', 'distasteful', '/dɪsˈteɪstfl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Gây cảm giác khó chịu, không dễ chịu.', 'causing a feeling of dislike or disapproval because of being unpleasant or offensive.', 'Many found his comments about her appearance to be quite distasteful.', 'Nhiều người thấy những bình luận của anh ấy về ngoại hình cô ấy khá khó chịu.', '{\"en\": \"The company removed the advertisement after customers complained that the content was highly distasteful.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã gỡ bỏ quảng cáo sau khi khách hàng phàn nàn rằng nội dung rất phản cảm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distasteful-ljspeech-983de9df.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distasteful-cori-983de9df.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/distasteful-3fad3009.webp', '[\"offensive\", \"unpleasant\", \"objectionable\"]', '[\"pleasant\", \"agreeable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"distasteful remark\", \"meaning\": \"nói năng vô duyên, khó nghe\"}, {\"phrase\": \"distasteful practice\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi đáng chê trách\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tasteless\", \"note_vi\": \"Tasteless là nhạt nhẽo (vị) hoặc thiếu thẩm mỹ; distasteful là gây khó chịu/phản cảm.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"distaste\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"distastefully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distasteful-cori-983de9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distasteful-aru0-983de9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distasteful-aru5-983de9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distasteful-aru6-983de9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distasteful-aru10-983de9df.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/distasteful-aru9-983de9df.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/objec