('95134a84-e21e-56cd-9af7-ab95d20622d3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'eb139df7-71e9-50dc-9792-ae687367d129', '8058afbb-97a5-525f-a95c-c8da66a262d5', 'complaint', 'UK: /kəmˈpleɪnt/ | US: /kəmˈpleɪnt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'lời than phiền', 'a statement expressing unhappiness, grief, or dissatisfaction with something', 'We received a complaint about the late delivery.', 'Chúng tôi nhận được một lời than phiền về việc giao hàng trễ.', '{\"en\": \"Customer service handled the complaint promptly and offered a full refund.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận chăm sóc khách hàng đã xử lý khiếu nại nhanh chóng và đề nghị hoàn tiền đầy đủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-ljspeech-903571af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-cori-903571af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/complaint-8da5e2b0.webp', '[\"grievance\", \"objection\", \"protest\"]', '[\"compliment\", \"praise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"file a complaint\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn khiếu nại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"handle complaints\", \"meaning\": \"xử lý các khiếu nại\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"complain\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-cori-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru0-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru5-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru6-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru10-903571af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru9-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru3-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru7-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru8-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-aru2-903571af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-ljspeech-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt408-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt138-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt624-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt396-903571af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt498-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt132-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt288-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt42-903571af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/complaint-lt90-903571af.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ đếm được. Các cụm từ kinh điển trong TOEIC: \'file a complaint\' (nộp đơn khiếu nại), \'handle complaints\' (xử lý khiếu nại).', 'customer service', 1, 19),
('1d2d7a48-3aec-54ac-8d24-dc3fde03ee97', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'eb139df7-71e9-50dc-9792-ae687367d129', '8058afbb-97a5-525f-a95c-c8da66a262d5', 'lay out', '/leɪ aʊt/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Sắp xếp, trình bày rõ ràng hoặc giải thích chi tiết.', 'to arrange something clearly or explain ideas, plans, or details in an organized way.', 'He laid out his plans for the new project in the meeting.', 'Anh ấy đã trình bày kế hoạch của mình cho dự án mới trong cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"The consultant will lay out the project timeline during the orientation meeting tomorrow morning.\", \"vi\": \"Cố vấn sẽ trình bày rõ ràng tiến độ dự án trong buổi họp định hướng vào sáng mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-ljspeech-4881d564.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-cori-4881d564.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lay-out-90420729.webp', '[\"present\", \"explain\", \"arrange\"]', '[\"conceal\", \"disorganize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"lay out a plan\", \"meaning\": \"trình bày một kế hoạch\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lay out options\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra các lựa chọn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"layout\", \"note_vi\": \"Layout (danh từ, viết liền) là bố cục; lay out (động từ) là trình bày/sắp xếp.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"layout\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-cori-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru0-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru5-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru6-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru10-4881d564.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru9-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru3-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru7-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru8-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-aru2-4881d564.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-ljspeech-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt408-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt138-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt624-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt396-4881d564.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt498-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt132-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt288-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt42-4881d564.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lay-out-lt90-4881d564.mp3\"]}}', 'Viết cách nhau là động từ (lay out), viết liền là danh từ chỉ bố cục (layout).', 'office', 1, 20),
('95ff858f-21de-5fdb-9f95-4577f5bde28a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'eb139df7-71e9-50dc-9792-ae687367d129', '8058afbb-97a5-525f-a95c-c8da66a262d5', 'looming', '/luːm/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'sắp xảy ra, hiện ra một cách đáng sợ hoặc lớn lao', 'appearing large and threatening, often used for something unpleasant that will happen soon.', 'The looming storm clouds warned us to head home quickly.', 'Những đám mây bão đang đến gần báo hiệu chúng tôi nên nhanh chóng về nhà.', '{\"en\": \"The looming deadline forced the team to work overtime to complete the project on time.\", \"vi\": \"Thời hạn sắp đến gần buộc cả nhóm phải làm thêm giờ để hoàn thành dự án đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-ljspeech-61ff63a6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-cori-61ff63a6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/looming-a080a9ff.webp', '[\"impending\", \"approaching\"]', '[\"distant\", \"remote\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"looming deadline\", \"meaning\": \"hạn chót sắp đến gần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"looming crisis\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc khủng hoảng sắp xảy ra\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"loom\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-cori-61ff63a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru0-61ff63a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru5-61ff63a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru6-61ff63a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru10-61ff63a6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru9-61ff63a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru3-61ff63a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru7-61ff63a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru8-61ff63a6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/looming-aru2-61ff63a6.mp3\"]}, \"us