('4b25e248-3640-5993-a54c-61ae452c7037', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'eb139df7-71e9-50dc-9792-ae687367d129', '8058afbb-97a5-525f-a95c-c8da66a262d5', 'antler', '/ˈæntlə(r)/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Sừng của hươu, nai.', 'one of the two hard bony parts growing on the head of deer.', 'A male deer grows new antlers every year.', 'Một con hươu đực mọc sừng mới mỗi năm.', '{\"en\": \"The resort decorated its lobby with traditional crafts made from shed deer antlers.\", \"vi\": \"Khu nghỉ dưỡng trang trí sảnh chờ bằng đồ thủ công truyền thống làm từ sừng hươu rụng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-ljspeech-74123cc3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-cori-74123cc3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/antler-ab1df414.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"pair of antlers\", \"meaning\": \"cặp sừng hươu/nai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deer antler\", \"meaning\": \"sừng hươu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"horn\", \"note_vi\": \"Horn là sừng cứng không rụng (trâu, bò); antler là sừng nhánh rụng hàng năm (hươu, nai).\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-cori-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru0-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru5-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru6-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru10-74123cc3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru9-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru3-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru7-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru8-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-aru2-74123cc3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-ljspeech-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt408-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt138-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt624-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt396-74123cc3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt498-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt132-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt288-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt42-74123cc3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/antler-lt90-74123cc3.mp3\"]}}', 'Antler thường chỉ sừng nhánh của loài hươu/nai, rụng và mọc lại hàng năm.', 'nature', 1, 26),
('70aa0ae5-d1db-5b97-938d-0130a2db144d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'eb139df7-71e9-50dc-9792-ae687367d129', '8058afbb-97a5-525f-a95c-c8da66a262d5', 'processed', '/ˈprəʊses/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Đã qua chế biến, được xử lý để bảo quản hoặc thay đổi hình dạng.', 'treated or changed by a special method to preserve or alter form.', 'Many processed foods contain high levels of sugar and salt.', 'Nhiều thực phẩm đã qua chế biến chứa hàm lượng đường và muối cao.', '{\"en\": \"The supermarket labels clearly show if the meat is processed.\", \"vi\": \"Nhãn siêu thị ghi rõ ràng nếu thịt đã qua chế biến.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-ljspeech-46c7abc9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-cori-46c7abc9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/processed-482a1404.webp', '[\"refined\", \"manufactured\"]', '[\"natural\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"processed food\", \"meaning\": \"thực phẩm chế biến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"processed meat\", \"meaning\": \"thịt chế biến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly processed\", \"meaning\": \"tinh chế kỹ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"progressed\", \"note_vi\": \"progressed là tiến bộ, processed là đã chế biến\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"process\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"processing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-cori-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru0-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru5-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru6-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru10-46c7abc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru9-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru3-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru7-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru8-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-aru2-46c7abc9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-ljspeech-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt408-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt138-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt624-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt396-46c7abc9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt498-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt132-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt288-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt42-46c7abc9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/processed-lt90-46c7abc9.mp3\"]}}', 'Processed là đã chế biến, không nhầm progressed (tiến triển).', 'shopping', 1, 27),
('6b76df7e-bdca-5190-840c-65beabe1e874', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'eb139df7-71e9-50dc-9792-ae687367d129', '8058afbb-97a5-525f-a95c-c8da66a262d5', 'simplify', 'UK: /ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ/ | US: /ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'đơn giản hóa', 'to make something easier to do or understand by reducing its complexity.', 'We need to simplify the process for new users.', 'Chúng tôi cần đơn giản hóa quy trình cho người dùng mới.', '{\"en\": \"The software upgrade aims to simplify the inventory management process for store managers.\", \"vi\": \"Bản nâng cấp phần mềm nhằm mục đích đơn giản hóa quy trình quản lý hàng tồn kho cho các quản lý cửa hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-ljspeech-e1d6f3c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-cori-e1d6f3c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/simplify-6b5456dc.webp', '[\"streamline\", \"ease\", \"facilitate\", \"shorten\"]', '[\"complicate\", \"obfuscate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"simplify the process\", \"meaning\": \"đơn giản hóa quy trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"simplify procedures\", \"meaning\": \"đơn giản hóa thủ tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"streamline\", \"note_vi\": \"streamline là tinh giản quy trình để tăng hiệu quả, simplify là làm bớt rắc rối/dễ hiểu hơn.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"simple\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"simply\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"simplification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-cori-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru0-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru5-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru6-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru10-e1d6f3c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru9-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru3-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru7-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru8-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-aru2-e1d6f3c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-ljspeech-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt408-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt138-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt624-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt396-e1d6f3c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt498-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt132-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt288-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt42-e1d6f3c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/simplify-lt90-e1d6f3c1.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi \'-fy\' biến từ thành động từ. Hay đi với các danh từ như \'process\', \'procedure\', \'task\'.', 'office', 1, 28),
('4ce30956-a764-52d6-a2f6-3b1c13e2d869', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'eb139df7-71e9-50dc-9792-ae687367d129', '8058afbb-97a5-525f-a95c-c8da66a262d5', 'stairway', 'UK: /ˈsteəweɪ/ | US: /ˈsterˌweɪ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cầu thang', 'A passage containing a flight of steps connecting different floors inside or outside a building.', 'The stairway led to the second floor offices.', 'Cầu thang dẫn đến các văn phòng tầng hai.', '{\"en\": \"Please keep the emergency stairway clear of any boxes or equipment at all times.\", \"vi\": \"Xin vui lòng luôn giữ cho lối cầu thang thoát hiểm không bị vướng thùng hay thiết bị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-ljspeech-733ed8b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-cori-733ed8b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stairway-23eb258a.webp', '[\"staircase\", \"stairs\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"emergency stairway\", \"meaning\": \"cầu thang thoát hiểm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outdoor stairway\", \"meaning\": \"cầu thang ngoài trời\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stair\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-cori-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru0-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru5-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru6-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru10-733ed8b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru9-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru3-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru7-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru8-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-aru2-733ed8b1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-ljspeech-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt408-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt138-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt624-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt396-733ed8b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt498-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt132-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt288-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt42-733ed8b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stairway-lt90-733ed8b1.mp3\"]}}', 'Stairway thường chỉ lối đi cầu thang, hay gặp trong cụm \'emergency stairway\' (cầu thang thoát hiểm).', 'facilities', 1, 29),
('f61034a1-6d0b-5742-80c0-02be6aa2780d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'chronology', '/krəˈnɒlədʒi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trình tự các sự kiện theo thời gian xảy ra của chúng.', 'the arrangement of events in the order they happened in time.', 'It\'s important to establish a clear chronology of events to understand the historical context.', 'Điều quan trọng là phải thiết lập một trình tự thời gian rõ ràng của các sự kiện để hiểu bối cảnh lịch sử.', '{\"en\": \"The project manager prepared a chronology of all completed tasks for the audit.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý dự án đã chuẩn bị trình tự thời gian của tất cả nhiệm vụ hoàn thành cho cuộc kiểm toán.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-ljspeech-e7218bc2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-cori-e7218bc2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chronology-ff97bec5.webp', '[\"timeline\", \"sequence\", \"order\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"clear chronology\", \"meaning\": \"trình tự rõ ràng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chronology of events\", \"meaning\": \"trình tự sự kiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"historical chronology\", \"meaning\": \"niên biểu lịch sử\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chronicle\", \"note_vi\": \"chronicle là bản ghi chép sử liệu, không phải trình tự.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"chronological\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"chronologically\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-cori-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru0-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru5-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru6-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru10-e7218bc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru9-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru3-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru7-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru8-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-aru2-e7218bc2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-ljspeech-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt408-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt138-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt624-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt396-e7218bc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt498-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt132-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt288-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt42-e7218bc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chronology-lt90-e7218bc2.mp3\"]}}', 'Chronology khác chronicle; một là thứ tự thời gian, hai là sử ký.', 'business', 1, 0),
('110c53b8-e94f-5f2d-a871-de3672bcca58', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'deceitful', '/dɪˈsiːtfl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Gian dối, lừa bịp, không trung thực.', 'behaving in a dishonest way by making people believe things that are not true.', 'His deceitful actions cost him the trust of his friends and colleagues.', 'Những hành động lừa dối của anh ta đã khiến anh ta mất đi sự tin tưởng của bạn bè và đồng nghiệp.', '{\"en\": \"The company fired the accountant after discovering his deceitful financial reports.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã sa thải kế toán viên sau khi phát hiện các báo cáo tài chính gian dối của ông ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deceitful-ljspeech-60ee8225.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deceitful-cori-60ee8225.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deceitful-e699ce95.webp', '[\"dishonest\", \"deceptive\", \"fraudulent\"]', '[\"honest\", \"truthful\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deceitful behavior\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi gian dối\"}, {\"phrase\": \"deceitful practices\", \"meaning\": \"các thủ đoạn lừa đảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"deceptive\", \"note_vi\": \"Deceptive tả điều gì gây hiểu lầm; deceitful tả người hoặc hành vi cố tình lừa dối.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"deceive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"deceit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"deceitfully\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deceitful-cori-60ee8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deceitful-aru0-60ee8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deceitful-aru5-60ee8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deceitful-aru6-60ee8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deceitful-aru10-60ee8225.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deceitful-aru9-60ee8225.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p