('bec1d6b6-a9d6-5198-a083-259a247d4290', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'curved', '/kɜːvd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có hình dạng uốn cong, không thẳng.', 'having a continuous rounded shape rather than a straight line.', 'The road ahead was very curved, making it difficult to see oncoming traffic.', 'Con đường phía phía trước rất cong, khiến việc nhìn thấy xe cộ đi ngược chiều trở nên khó khăn.', '{\"en\": \"The architect designed a curved reception desk to modernise the hotel lobby area.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế bàn lễ tân uốn cong để hiện đại hóa khu vực sảnh khách sạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-ljspeech-33d59279.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-cori-33d59279.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/curved-d0b72f86.webp', '[\"bent\", \"arched\", \"rounded\"]', '[\"straight\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"curved line\", \"meaning\": \"đường uốn cong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"curved surface\", \"meaning\": \"bề mặt cong\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"curve\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"curve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-cori-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru0-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru5-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru6-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru10-33d59279.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru9-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru3-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru7-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru8-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-aru2-33d59279.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-ljspeech-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt408-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt138-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt624-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt396-33d59279.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt498-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt132-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt288-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt42-33d59279.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curved-lt90-33d59279.mp3\"]}}', 'Là dạng tính từ đuôi -ed xuất phát từ danh từ/động từ curve.', 'housing', 1, 8),
('4cd83b3c-0c17-5c13-b336-9918158ed404', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'curvy', '/ˈkɜːvi/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có nhiều đường cong mềm mại, hấp dẫn (thường dùng cho phụ nữ).', 'having a shape that is rounded and smooth rather than straight or sharp.', 'The artist preferred to paint curvy figures rather than straight lines.', 'Người nghệ sĩ thích vẽ những hình dáng cong mềm mại hơn là những đường thẳng.', '{\"en\": \"The new office chair features a curvy design to provide better support for the back.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc ghế văn phòng mới có thiết kế đường cong để hỗ trợ tốt hơn cho lưng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-ljspeech-4480ec6a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-cori-4480ec6a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/curvy-7fe289b0.webp', '[\"rounded\", \"curved\"]', '[\"straight\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"curvy lines\", \"meaning\": \"đường cong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"curvy shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình dáng uốn lượn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"curve\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-cori-4480ec6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru0-4480ec6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru5-4480ec6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru6-4480ec6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru10-4480ec6a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru9-4480ec6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru3-4480ec6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru7-4480ec6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru8-4480ec6a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-aru2-4480ec6a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/curvy-l