('99156bdc-6f65-53ea-a6b3-6b5d3c5f34f3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'despite', '/dɪˈspaɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Bất kể điều gì đó xảy ra hoặc tồn tại.', 'used to show that something happened or is true even though there was a difficulty.', 'Despite the heavy rain, the concert went on as scheduled.', 'Mặc dù trời mưa to, buổi hòa nhạc vẫn diễn ra theo đúng lịch trình.', '{\"en\": \"Despite the tight deadline, the marketing team successfully launched the new campaign on time.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù thời hạn gấp rút, đội ngũ marketing đã khởi chạy chiến dịch mới đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-ljspeech-68e3e937.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-cori-68e3e937.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/despite-1fe3d5ed.webp', '[\"although\", \"notwithstanding\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"despite the fact that\", \"meaning\": \"mặc dù thực tế là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"despite the delay\", \"meaning\": \"bất chấp sự chậm trễ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"in spite of\", \"note_vi\": \"Nghĩa giống hệt nhưng \'despite\' không đi kèm \'of\'.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-cori-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru0-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru5-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru6-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru10-68e3e937.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru9-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru3-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru7-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru8-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-aru2-68e3e937.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-ljspeech-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt408-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt138-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt624-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt396-68e3e937.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt498-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt132-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt288-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt42-68e3e937.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/despite-lt90-68e3e937.mp3\"]}}', 'Lưu ý: \'Despite\' không bao giờ đi kèm với \'of\'.', 'business', 1, 11),
('68062a95-25cc-596c-bfe5-f2264a2f7f92', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'spiteful', '/ˈspaɪtfl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có ý định làm hại hoặc gây khó chịu cho người khác một cách cố ý.', 'showing a desire to hurt or upset someone because you are angry or jealous.', 'Nobody in the office liked working with him because of his spiteful behavior.', 'Không ai trong văn phòng thích làm việc với anh ta vì hành vi đầy ác ý của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager warned the team against making spiteful remarks during the heated project meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảnh báo nhóm không được đưa ra những nhận xét ác ý trong cuộc họp dự án căng thẳng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-ljspeech-ea36a2a2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-cori-ea36a2a2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spiteful-f45a449f.webp', '[\"malicious\", \"nasty\"]', '[\"kind\", \"friendly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"spiteful remark\", \"meaning\": \"lời nhận xét ác ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"spiteful comment\", \"meaning\": \"bình luận ác ý\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"spite\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-cori-ea36a2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-aru0-ea36a2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-aru5-ea36a2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-aru6-ea36a2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-aru10-ea36a2a2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-aru9-ea36a2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-aru3-ea36a2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-aru7-ea36a2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spiteful-aru8-ea36a2a2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro