('c67eee92-e932-59c9-bbad-855a462b9519', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'customer service', 'UK: /ˈkʌstəmə ˈsɜːvɪs/ | US: /ˈkʌstəmər ˈsɜːrvɪs/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'dịch vụ khách hàng', 'The assistance and advice provided by a business to people who purchase its goods.', 'Contact customer service for assistance.', 'Liên hệ dịch vụ khách hàng để được hỗ trợ.', '{\"en\": \"Please contact our customer service representative if you experience any issues with delivery.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng liên hệ với đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng của chúng tôi nếu bạn gặp bất kỳ sự cố nào về giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-ljspeech-9219698c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-cori-9219698c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/customer-service-ae349cdf.webp', '[\"client support\", \"customer care\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"customer service representative\", \"meaning\": \"đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"customer service department\", \"meaning\": \"phòng chăm sóc khách hàng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-cori-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru0-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru5-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru6-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru10-9219698c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru9-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru3-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru7-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru8-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-aru2-9219698c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-ljspeech-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt408-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt138-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt624-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt396-9219698c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt498-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt132-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt288-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt42-9219698c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/customer-service-lt90-9219698c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường kết hợp với \'representative\' (đại diện CSKH) hoặc \'department\' (bộ phận CSKH).', 'customer service', 1, 25),
('585f3f6f-ca54-5c3c-9eba-1b5843e6859a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'arbitration', '/ˌɑːbɪˈtreɪʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Quá trình giải quyết tranh chấp thông qua một bên thứ ba trung lập.', 'a process where a neutral third party helps two sides settle a disagreement outside of court.', 'The two parties agreed to refer their dispute to arbitration rather than go to court.', 'Hai bên đã đồng ý đưa tranh chấp của họ ra phân xử thay vì ra tòa.', '{\"en\": \"Both companies agreed to resolve the contract dispute through binding arbitration.\", \"vi\": \"Cả hai công ty đồng ý giải quyết tranh chấp hợp đồng thông qua trọng tài bắt buộc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-ljspeech-94a73074.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-cori-94a73074.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/arbitration-1579685a.webp', '[\"mediation\", \"conciliation\"]', '[\"litigation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"binding arbitration\", \"meaning\": \"trọng tài bắt buộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go to arbitration\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra trọng tài\"}, {\"phrase\": \"arbitration clause\", \"meaning\": \"điều khoản trọng tài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mediation\", \"note_vi\": \"mediation là hòa giải không ràng buộc, arbitration có quyết định mang tính bắt buộc hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"arbitrate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"arbitrator\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"arbitrary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-cori-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru0-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru5-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru6-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru10-94a73074.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru9-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru3-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru7-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru8-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-aru2-94a73074.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-ljspeech-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt408-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt138-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt624-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt396-94a73074.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt498-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt132-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt288-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt42-94a73074.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/arbitration-lt90-94a73074.mp3\"]}}', 'Arbitration khác mediation ở chỗ quyết định của trọng tài thường có giá trị pháp lý ràng buộc.', 'law', 1, 26),
('3c2ac06e-74bf-5ee2-8da9-0fe9be9992c7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'booklet', 'UK: /ˈbʊklɪt/ | US: /ˈbʊklɪt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cuốn sách nhỏ', 'a small thin publication with paper covers containing information about a subject', 'The company distributed a booklet with product information.', 'Công ty đã phát một cuốn sách nhỏ chứa thông tin sản phẩm.', '{\"en\": \"Please refer to the instruction booklet for details on operating the new copy machine.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng tham khảo cuốn sách hướng dẫn nhỏ để biết chi tiết về cách vận hành máy photo mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-ljspeech-cacbdf35.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-cori-cacbdf35.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/booklet-31ce04d9.webp', '[\"pamphlet\", \"brochure\", \"leaflet\", \"manual\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"information booklet\", \"meaning\": \"cẩm nang/cuốn sách nhỏ thông tin\"}, {\"phrase\": \"instruction booklet\", \"meaning\": \"sách hướng dẫn nhỏ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"book\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-cori-cacbdf35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru0-cacbdf35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru5-cacbdf35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru6-cacbdf35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru10-cacbdf35.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru9-cacbdf35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru3-cacbdf35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru7-cacbdf35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru8-cacbdf35.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/booklet-aru2-cacbdf35.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/stor