('1556df34-d630-5d16-87ab-a881f1281dce', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'hypotenuse', '/haɪˈpɒtənjuːz/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Cạnh dài nhất đối diện với góc vuông trong tam giác vuông.', 'the longest side of a triangle that has one angle of ninety degrees.', 'In a right-angled triangle, the square of the hypotenuse is equal to the sum of the squares of the other two sides.', 'Trong một tam giác vuông, bình phương cạnh huyền bằng tổng bình phương hai cạnh góc vuông.', '{\"en\": \"The engineer calculated the length of the hypotenuse to ensure the structural support was accurate.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ sư đã tính toán chiều dài cạnh huyền để đảm bảo phần hỗ trợ kết cấu được chính xác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-ljspeech-1b90e38f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-cori-1b90e38f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/hypotenuse-463ce767.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"calculate the hypotenuse\", \"meaning\": \"tính cạnh huyền\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-cori-1b90e38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru0-1b90e38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru5-1b90e38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru6-1b90e38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru10-1b90e38f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru9-1b90e38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru3-1b90e38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru7-1b90e38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru8-1b90e38f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/hypotenuse-aru2-1b90e38f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/p