('17e6b65b-91b2-5a0d-9f5f-3caea3913d33', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ec7fca94-b077-5b87-8f3d-b1e93ef176fb', '78e014b2-1b1d-524c-adf7-a014b96ccf13', 'reprove', '/rɪˈpruːv/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Trách mắng hoặc chỉ trích nhẹ nhàng ai đó vì hành vi sai trái.', 'to speak to someone in a gentle but firm way about something wrong they did.', 'The teacher had to reprove the student for talking during the exam.', 'Giáo viên đã phải khiển trách học sinh vì nói chuyện trong giờ thi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gently reproved the intern for missing the client meeting without notice.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý nhẹ nhàng khiển trách thực tập sinh vì đã vắng mặt trong cuộc họp khách hàng mà không báo trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-ljspeech-2f81ff95.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-cori-2f81ff95.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reprove-f3b63407.webp', '[\"rebuke\", \"reprimand\", \"admonish\"]', '[\"praise\", \"commend\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"reprove someone for\", \"meaning\": \"trách mắng ai vì điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gently reprove\", \"meaning\": \"nhẹ nhàng khiển trách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reprove publicly\", \"meaning\": \"khiển trách công khai\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reprieve\", \"note_vi\": \"reprieve nghĩa là hoãn hình phạt, không phải khiển trách\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reproof\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"reprovingly\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reproving\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-cori-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru0-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru5-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru6-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru10-2f81ff95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru9-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru3-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru7-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru8-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-aru2-2f81ff95.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-ljspeech-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt408-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt138-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt624-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt396-2f81ff95.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt498-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt132-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt288-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt42-2f81ff95.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reprove-lt90-2f81ff95.mp3\"]}}', 'Reprove nhẹ hơn \'reprimand\'; dùng khi muốn diễn đạt sự phê bình lịch sự, không gay gắt.', 'hr', 1, 29),
('b35e1648-e027-5ab5-839e-5da09f0acf8d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ed49bd0a-32de-57f4-9496-85a1965a7eca', '3e817b9d-cc63-5a6c-a7c3-a5bf893ba05e', 'tollbooth', 'UK: /ˈtəʊlˌbuːθ/ | US: /ˈtoʊlˌbuθ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'trạm thu phí', 'a small building beside a road where drivers stop to pay a travel fee', 'The driver stopped at the tollbooth to pay.', 'Người lái xe dừng lại ở trạm thu phí để trả tiền.', '{\"en\": \"Drivers are encouraged to use electronic payment tags to speed up traffic at the tollbooth.\", \"vi\": \"Các tài xế được khuyến khích sử dụng thẻ thanh toán điện tử để đẩy nhanh giao thông tại trạm thu phí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-ljspeech-cdaf539b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-cori-cdaf539b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tollbooth-3eb0a9db.webp', '[\"toll station\", \"toll gate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"highway tollbooth\", \"meaning\": \"trạm thu phí đường cao tốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"pass through a tollbooth\", \"meaning\": \"đi qua trạm thu phí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"telephone booth\", \"note_vi\": \"Telephone booth là bốt điện thoại công cộng, không phải trạm thu phí giao thông.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-cori-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru0-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru5-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru6-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru10-cdaf539b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru9-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru3-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru7-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru8-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-aru2-cdaf539b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-ljspeech-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt408-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt138-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt624-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt396-cdaf539b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt498-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt132-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt288-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt42-cdaf539b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tollbooth-lt90-cdaf539b.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ ghép (toll + booth). Thường xuất hiện trong TOEIC chủ đề giao thông/di chuyển trên đường cao tốc.', 'travel', 1, 0),
('6f4eddd8-67f2-5c07-a03d-cd4569cbe5bc', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ed49bd0a-32de-57f4-9496-85a1965a7eca', '3e817b9d-cc63-5a6c-a7c3-a5bf893ba05e', 'sympathetic', '/ˌsɪmpəˈθetɪk/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng hiểu và chia sẻ cảm xúc của người khác, thông cảm.', 'showing that you understand and care about someone else\'s problems or sad feelings.', 'The manager proved to be sympathetic to the employee\'s family emergency.', 'Người quản lý tỏ ra thông cảm với trường hợp khẩn cấp của gia đình nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The manager was very sympathetic when the employee explained the reasons for his late project submission.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý rất thông cảm khi nhân viên giải thích lý do nộp dự án trễ của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-ljspeech-28760016.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-cori-28760016.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sympathetic-5a921e9c.webp', '[\"compassionate\", \"understanding\"]', '[\"indifferent\", \"unsympathetic\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"sympathetic ear\", \"meaning\": \"người biết lắng nghe và chia sẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be sympathetic to\", \"meaning\": \"thông cảm với\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"empathetic\", \"note_vi\": \"Sympathetic là thương hại/chia sẻ, empathetic là thấu hiểu cảm xúc như chính mình.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"sympathy\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sympathize\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-cori-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru0-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru5-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru6-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru10-28760016.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru9-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru3-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru7-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru8-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-aru2-28760016.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-ljspeech-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt408-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt138-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt624-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt396-28760016.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt498-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt132-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt288-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt42-28760016.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sympathetic-lt90-28760016.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'sympathy\' (danh từ) và \'sympathize\' (động từ).', 'office', 1, 1),
('1315c905-9295-5f16-88cc-60f53774dbad', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ed49bd0a-32de-57f4-9496-85a1965a7eca', '3e817b9d-cc63-5a6c-a7c3-a5bf893ba05e', 'heptagon', '/ˈheptəɡən/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một đa giác có bảy cạnh và bảy góc.', 'Any closed plane figure formed by seven straight lines and containing seven interior angles.', 'The architect designed a unique building with a heptagon shape for its base.', 'Kiến trúc sư đã thiết kế một tòa nhà độc đáo với hình thất giác làm phần đế.', '{\"en\": \"The new office building features a heptagon floor plan that maximizes natural lighting.\", \"vi\": \"Tòa nhà văn phòng mới có mặt bằng hình thất giác giúp tận dụng tối đa ánh sáng tự nhiên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-ljspeech-46568032.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-cori-46568032.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/heptagon-e646a624.webp', '[\"septagon\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"regular heptagon\", \"meaning\": \"hình thất giác đều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heptagon shape\", \"meaning\": \"hình dạng thất giác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"heptagon design\", \"meaning\": \"thiết kế hình thất giác\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"hexagon\", \"note_vi\": \"hexagon có 6 cạnh; heptagon có 7 cạnh\"}, {\"word\": \"pentagon\", \"note_vi\": \"pentagon có 5 cạnh; heptagon có 7 cạnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"heptagonal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-cori-46568032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-aru0-46568032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-aru5-46568032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-aru6-46568032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-aru10-46568032.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-aru9-46568032.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/heptagon-aru3-46568032.mp3\", 