('ac335993-8e86-5602-8b67-8c5f60c23032', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ed49bd0a-32de-57f4-9496-85a1965a7eca', '3e817b9d-cc63-5a6c-a7c3-a5bf893ba05e', 'tissue', '/ˈtɪʃuː/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tập hợp các tế bào có cấu trúc và chức năng tương tự trong cơ thể.', 'a group of cells that have a similar structure and work together in a living body.', 'Muscle tissue is responsible for movement in the body.', 'Mô cơ chịu trách nhiệm cho sự vận động trong cơ thể.', '{\"en\": \"The medical research team studied the damaged tissue to understand the effects of the new medicine.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm nghiên cứu y tế đã nghiên cứu mô bị tổn thương để hiểu tác dụng của loại thuốc mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-ljspeech-bb8eb17c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-cori-bb8eb17c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tissue-b80fd171.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"damaged tissue\", \"meaning\": \"mô bị tổn thương\"}, {\"phrase\": \"connective tissue\", \"meaning\": \"mô liên kết\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-cori-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru0-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru5-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru6-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru10-bb8eb17c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru9-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru3-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru7-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru8-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-aru2-bb8eb17c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-ljspeech-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt408-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt138-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt624-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt396-bb8eb17c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt498-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt132-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt288-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt42-bb8eb17c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tissue-lt90-bb8eb17c.mp3\"]}}', 'cần phân biệt với \'tissue\' nghĩa là khăn giấy dùng một lần.', 'health', 1, 10),
('b18db1ca-9563-54dc-92d9-3828b35d4db3', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ed49bd0a-32de-57f4-9496-85a1965a7eca', '3e817b9d-cc63-5a6c-a7c3-a5bf893ba05e', 'atomic energy', '/əˈtɒmɪk ˈɛnədʒi/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Năng lượng được giải phóng từ các phản ứng hạt nhân.', 'power produced by changing the center of tiny particles to create heat for electricity.', 'Many countries use atomic energy to generate electricity in power plants.', 'Nhiều quốc gia sử dụng năng lượng nguyên tử để sản xuất điện trong các nhà máy điện.', '{\"en\": \"The government is investing in atomic energy to reduce reliance on traditional fossil fuel sources.\", \"vi\": \"Chính phủ đang đầu tư vào năng lượng hạt nhân để giảm sự phụ thuộc vào các nguồn nhiên liệu hóa thạch.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-ljspeech-4a922792.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-cori-4a922792.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/atomic-energy-091ee9db.webp', '[\"nuclear energy\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"atomic energy plant\", \"meaning\": \"nhà máy năng lượng hạt nhân\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-cori-4a922792.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru0-4a922792.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru5-4a922792.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru6-4a922792.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru10-4a922792.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru9-4a922792.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru3-4a922792.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru7-4a922792.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru8-4a922792.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/atomic-energy-aru2-4a922792.mp3\"]