('eac0011a-7031-5af1-9af0-ca999151d505', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ed49bd0a-32de-57f4-9496-85a1965a7eca', '3e817b9d-cc63-5a6c-a7c3-a5bf893ba05e', 'responsive', 'UK: /rɪˈspɒnsɪv/ | US: /rɪˈspɑːnsɪv/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'phản hồi nhanh chóng, nhiệt tình', 'reacting quickly, positively, and helpfully to suggestions, requests, or new developments.', 'The customer service team is very responsive to inquiries.', 'Đội ngũ dịch vụ khách hàng rất nhanh nhạy với các yêu cầu.', '{\"en\": \"Customer service representatives must remain responsive to client inquiries at all times.\", \"vi\": \"Đại diện dịch vụ khách hàng phải luôn phản hồi nhanh chóng với các thắc mắc của khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-ljspeech-78674579.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-cori-78674579.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/responsive-4a236c7e.webp', '[\"receptive\", \"quick to respond\", \"attentive\"]', '[\"unresponsive\", \"indifferent\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"responsive to customer needs\", \"meaning\": \"phản hồi nhanh với nhu cầu khách hàng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly responsive\", \"meaning\": \"rất nhạy bén/phản hồi rất nhanh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"responsible\", \"note_vi\": \"Responsible mang nghĩa chịu trách nhiệm, trong khi responsive nghĩa là phản hồi nhanh nhạy.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"responsiveness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"responsively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-cori-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru0-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru5-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru6-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru10-78674579.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru9-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru3-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru7-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru8-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-aru2-78674579.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-ljspeech-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt408-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt138-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt624-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt396-78674579.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt498-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt132-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt288-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt42-78674579.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsive-lt90-78674579.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với \'responsive to\' (nhanh nhạy/phản hồi tốt với cái gì). Đừng nhầm với \'responsible\'.', 'customer service', 1, 14),
('89056f73-9e18-512e-8fd6-f066aec581e5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ed49bd0a-32de-57f4-9496-85a1965a7eca', '3e817b9d-cc63-5a6c-a7c3-a5bf893ba05e', 'spoiler', '/ˈspɔɪlə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thông tin tiết lộ một phần quan trọng của cốt truyện phim, sách, v.v., làm mất đi sự bất ngờ.', 'information that reveals the ending or important parts of a story before you see it.', 'Please don\'t tell me the ending; I hate spoilers!', 'Làm ơn đừng nói cho tôi biết kết thúc; tôi ghét những phần tiết lộ!', '{\"en\": \"Please avoid sharing any plot spoilers regarding the new training video before the staff meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng tránh chia sẻ bất kỳ tiết lộ nội dung nào về video đào tạo mới trước cuộc họp nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-ljspeech-91df01cf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-cori-91df01cf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/spoiler-1b5daa5c.webp', '[\"revelation\", \"disclosure\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"plot spoiler\", \"meaning\": \"tiết lộ nội dung phim/truyện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"avoid spoilers\", \"meaning\": \"tránh tiết lộ nội dung\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"spoil\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-cori-91df01cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-aru0-91df01cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-aru5-91df01cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-aru6-91df01cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-aru10-91df01cf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-aru9-91df01cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-aru3-91df01cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-aru7-91df01cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoiler-aru8-91df01cf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/spoil