('772042eb-f639-52f9-9605-ba0866678c41', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ed49bd0a-32de-57f4-9496-85a1965a7eca', '3e817b9d-cc63-5a6c-a7c3-a5bf893ba05e', 'appreciative', '/əˈpriːʃətɪv/', '', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy biết ơn hoặc đánh giá cao điều gì đó, cảm kích.', 'feeling or showing that you are thankful for something good that happened.', 'The audience was highly appreciative of the musical performance, applauding warmly at the end.', 'Khán giả rất cảm kích buổi biểu diễn âm nhạc, vỗ tay nồng nhiệt khi kết thúc.', '{\"en\": \"We are very appreciative of the extra effort the team put into finishing the project early.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi rất cảm kích về nỗ lực thêm mà nhóm đã bỏ ra để hoàn thành dự án sớm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-ljspeech-6f20f28b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-cori-6f20f28b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appreciative-971b42d5.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-cori-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru0-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru5-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru6-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru10-6f20f28b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru9-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru3-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru7-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru8-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-aru2-6f20f28b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appreciative-ljspeech-6f20f28b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciat