('27bade18-04a3-5e7a-b0a0-36e80fcbc43f', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'appointment', 'UK: /əˈpɔɪntmənt/ | US: /əˈpɔɪntmənt/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cuộc hẹn', 'An arrangement to meet someone at a particular time and designated location.', 'I have an appointment with the doctor at 10 AM.', 'Tôi có cuộc hẹn với bác sĩ lúc 10 giờ sáng.', '{\"en\": \"You need to make an appointment before visiting the legal consultant.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn cần đặt một cuộc hẹn trước khi đến gặp tư vấn viên pháp lý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-ljspeech-d93e8eec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-cori-d93e8eec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appointment-cebf9870.webp', '[\"meeting\", \"consultation\", \"session\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an appointment\", \"meaning\": \"đặt lịch hẹn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"confirm an appointment\", \"meaning\": \"xác nhận cuộc hẹn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"appoint\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-cori-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru0-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru5-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru6-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru10-d93e8eec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru9-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru3-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru7-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru8-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-aru2-d93e8eec.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-ljspeech-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt408-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt138-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt624-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt396-d93e8eec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt498-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt132-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt288-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt42-d93e8eec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appointment-lt90-d93e8eec.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt \'make an appointment\' (hẹn gặp bác sĩ, đối tác, chuyên gia) với \'make a date\' (hẹn hò tình cảm).', 'office', 1, 10),
('515e0330-5c28-517c-b7c8-a26217983f0b', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'diarrhea', '/ˌdaɪəˈrɪə/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Tình trạng đi ngoài phân lỏng nhiều lần.', 'an illness in which waste matter is emptied from the bowels frequently and in liquid form.', 'Travelers to certain regions should be careful about food to avoid diarrhea.', 'Du khách đến một số khu vực nên cẩn thận về thức ăn để tránh bị tiêu chảy.', '{\"en\": \"Several employees missed the meeting due to sudden diarrhea caused by the cafeteria food.\", \"vi\": \"Một vài nhân viên đã lỡ cuộc họp do bị tiêu chảy đột ngột bởi thức ăn nhà ăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-ljspeech-bbbe462a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-cori-bbbe462a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diarrhea-87977507.webp', NULL, '[\"constipation\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"severe diarrhea\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu chảy nặng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevent diarrhea\", \"meaning\": \"phòng ngừa tiêu chảy\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"diarrheal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-cori-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru0-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru5-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru6-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru10-bbbe462a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru9-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru3-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru7-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru8-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-aru2-bbbe462a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-ljspeech-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt408-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt138-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt624-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt396-bbbe462a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt498-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt132-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt288-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt42-bbbe462a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diarrhea-lt90-bbbe462a.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý cách viết tiếng Anh-Anh là \"diarrhoea\", tiếng Anh-Mỹ là \"diarrhea\".', 'health', 1, 11),
('feea891d-ad10-507e-8c8e-716605bf626a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'grind', '/ɡraɪnd/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Công việc hoặc hoạt động thường ngày vất vả, lặp đi lặp lại và nhàm chán.', 'a difficult or boring activity that is repeated every day for a long time.', 'Long hours of paperwork during tax season became a tedious grind for accountants.', 'Nhiều giờ làm giấy tờ trong mùa thuế đã trở thành một công việc buồn tẻ cho các kế toán viên.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees feel exhausted by the daily grind of commuting to the office every morning.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên cảm thấy kiệt sức vì công việc lặp đi lặp lại hàng ngày là đi làm vào mỗi sáng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-ljspeech-59ff6a3d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-cori-59ff6a3d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grind-4910aafa.webp', '[\"drudgery\", \"toil\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"daily grind\", \"meaning\": \"công việc thường ngày vất vả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"the grind of work\", \"meaning\": \"sự vất vả của công việc\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"grinding\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-cori-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru0-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru5-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru6-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru10-59ff6a3d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru9-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru3-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru7-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru8-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-aru2-59ff6a3d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-ljspeech-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt408-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt138-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt624-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt396-59ff6a3d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt498-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt132-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt288-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt42-59ff6a3d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grind-lt90-59ff6a3d.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để than phiền về sự nhàm chán của công việc.', 'office', 1, 12),
('172cd3f2-2046-50e4-9026-ed5ad9349a92', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'uplifting', '/ˌʌpˈlɪftɪŋ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Gây cảm giác vui vẻ, hy vọng, và tích cực.', 'making someone feel happy, hopeful, and full of positive energy.', 'The movie had such an uplifting message that everyone left the cinema feeling inspired.', 'Bộ phim có một thông điệp thật sự phấn chấn đến mức mọi người rời rạp chiếu phim đều cảm thấy được truyền cảm hứng.', '{\"en\": \"The manager gave an uplifting speech that motivated the entire sales team.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã có bài phát biểu truyền cảm hứng giúp cả đội bán hàng có thêm động lực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-ljspeech-95d20cc2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-cori-95d20cc2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uplifting-0f71a89d.webp', '[\"inspiring\", \"encouraging\", \"heartening\"]', '[\"depressing\", \"discouraging\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"uplifting message\", \"meaning\": \"thông điệp truyền cảm hứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"uplifting speech\", \"meaning\": \"bài phát biểu truyền cảm hứng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"uplifting experience\", \"meaning\": \"trải nghiệm tích cực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"inspiring\", \"note_vi\": \"inspiring thiên về khơi dậy sáng tạo; uplifting thiên về nâng cao tinh thần\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"uplift\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"uplift\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"upliftingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-cori-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru0-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru5-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru6-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru10-95d20cc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru9-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru3-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru7-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru8-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-aru2-95d20cc2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-ljspeech-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt408-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt138-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt624-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt396-95d20cc2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt498-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt132-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt288-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt42-95d20cc2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uplifting-lt90-95d20cc2.mp3\"]}}', 'Uplifting hay dùng trong bối cảnh diễn văn, phim, âm nhạc mang lại cảm giác tích cực.', 'hr', 1, 13),
('69c15b2d-c36b-55c0-a00a-34bd6cf14a1e', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'put off', '/pʊt ɒf/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'trì hoãn, lùi lại một sự kiện.', 'to decide to do something at a later time than planned.', 'We had to put off the meeting until next week due to a scheduling conflict.', 'Chúng tôi phải hoãn cuộc họp sang tuần sau vì trùng lịch.', '{\"en\": \"The board decided to put off the annual budget meeting until next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Ban giám đốc đã quyết định hoãn cuộc họp ngân sách hàng năm cho đến thứ Hai tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-ljspeech-b1425b24.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-cori-b1425b24.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/put-off-bc94a6f0.webp', '[\"postpone\", \"delay\", \"defer\"]', '[\"advance\", \"expedite\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"put off a decision\", \"meaning\": \"trì hoãn một quyết định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"put off a meeting\", \"meaning\": \"trì hoãn một cuộc họp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"call off\", \"note_vi\": \"call off là hủy bỏ hoàn toàn, còn put off chỉ là trì hoãn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-cori-b1425b24.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru0-b1425b24.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru5-b1425b24.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru6-b1425b24.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru10-b1425b24.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru9-b1425b24.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru3-b1425b24.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru7-b1425b24.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru8-b1425b24.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-off-aru2-b1425b24.mp3\