('3d953f5b-a279-5b8e-9ec7-04cb487916a1', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'muster', '/ˈmʌstə(r)/', 'C2', 'noun', 'Sự tập hợp hoặc điểm danh quân lính, thành viên.', 'a gathering of people, especially soldiers, for inspection or to count them.', 'The general called for a muster of all troops at dawn.', 'Vị tướng yêu cầu tập hợp tất cả binh lính vào lúc bình minh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager called a muster of all staff members to discuss the emergency procedures.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã gọi một buổi tập hợp toàn bộ nhân viên để thảo luận về các quy trình khẩn cấp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-ljspeech-35be2368.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-cori-35be2368.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/muster-5a1dcdb1.webp', '[\"gathering\", \"assembly\", \"rally\"]', '[\"dispersion\", \"dismissal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"pass muster\", \"meaning\": \"đạt tiêu chuẩn, được chấp nhận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"muster roll\", \"meaning\": \"danh sách điểm danh\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mustard\", \"note_vi\": \"mù tạt (gia vị), phát âm gần giống\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"muster\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-cori-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru0-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru5-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru6-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru10-35be2368.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru9-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru3-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru7-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru8-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-aru2-35be2368.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-ljspeech-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt408-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt138-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt624-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt396-35be2368.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt498-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt132-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt288-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt42-35be2368.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/muster-lt90-35be2368.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ \'pass muster\' rất hay gặp trong văn phong công sở.', 'hr', 1, 15),
('69abe64e-57a2-5a58-8ee3-54e182a44cc9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'dampen', '/ˈdæmpən/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm ẩm ướt hoặc làm giảm đi sự nhiệt tình, cảm xúc.', 'to make something slightly wet, or to reduce the strength of a feeling or reaction.', 'The bad weather did not dampen their spirits for the outdoor concert.', 'Thời tiết xấu không làm giảm đi tinh thần của họ đối với buổi hòa nhạc ngoài trời.', '{\"en\": \"The unexpected budget cuts dampened the team\'s enthusiasm for the new marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cắt giảm ngân sách bất ngờ đã làm giảm sự nhiệt tình của nhóm đối với chiến dịch marketing mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-ljspeech-222cfcf6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-cori-222cfcf6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dampen-bee48d09.webp', '[\"moisten\", \"discourage\", \"suppress\"]', '[\"boost\", \"encourage\", \"heighten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dampen enthusiasm\", \"meaning\": \"làm giảm sự nhiệt tình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dampen spirits\", \"meaning\": \"làm nản lòng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dampen demand\", \"meaning\": \"làm giảm nhu cầu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dampen\", \"note_vi\": \"damp (adj) là ẩm ướt; dampen (verb) là làm ẩm hoặc làm giảm cảm xúc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"damp\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dampness\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dampener\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-cori-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru0-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru5-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru6-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru10-222cfcf6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru9-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru3-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru7-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru8-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-aru2-222cfcf6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-ljspeech-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt408-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt138-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt624-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt396-222cfcf6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt498-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt132-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt288-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt42-222cfcf6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dampen-lt90-222cfcf6.mp3\"]}}', '\'Dampen\' có hai nghĩa: làm ẩm (vật lý) và làm giảm nhiệt tình (cảm xúc), cần chú ý ngữ cảnh.', 'business', 1, 16),
('d1621e00-3c2e-5333-86e3-5b6d071228f2', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'aloof', '/əˈluːf/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có vẻ xa lánh, không thân thiện hoặc không muốn tham gia.', 'not friendly or willing to take part in things with other people.', 'The new department manager stayed aloof from office politics to remain fair.', 'Trưởng phòng mới giữ thái độ xa cách với các phe phái công sở để đảm bảo tính công bằng.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager remained aloof from the office politics to maintain his professional stance.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng mới giữ thái độ đứng ngoài các cuộc tranh chấp nội bộ để duy trì lập trường chuyên nghiệp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-ljspeech-fdd7e497.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-cori-fdd7e497.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/aloof-7a46dd15.webp', '[\"distant\", \"detached\", \"unfriendly\"]', '[\"friendly\", \"sociable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remain aloof\", \"meaning\": \"vẫn giữ thái độ xa cách\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep aloof\", \"meaning\": \"đứng ngoài cuộc, tránh xa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"aloofness\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-cori-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru0-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru5-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru6-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru10-fdd7e497.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru9-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru3-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru7-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru8-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-aru2-fdd7e497.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-ljspeech-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt408-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt138-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt624-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt396-fdd7e497.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt498-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt132-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt288-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt42-fdd7e497.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/aloof-lt90-fdd7e497.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi với giới từ \'from\' khi muốn nói tránh xa, đứng ngoài việc gì.', 'hr', 1, 17),
('e74d6107-0fe0-5bf9-b503-ed91445344db', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ee4f8817-09af-5e12-8d31-41020c6ea51a', 'd296e8db-713a-515a-86bc-75f0e8ee9325', 'lipid', '/ˈlɪpɪd/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một loại chất béo, dầu hoặc sáp không hòa tan trong nước, quan trọng cho cơ thể.', 'a substance like fat or oil that does not mix with water and stores energy.', 'Lipids are essential components of cell membranes and energy storage.', 'Lipid là thành phần thiết yếu của màng tế bào và dự trữ năng lượng.', '{\"en\": \"The laboratory report indicates that the new health supplement contains a high level of lipids.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo phòng thí nghiệm chỉ ra rằng thực phẩm bổ sung sức khỏe mới chứa hàm lượng lipid cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-ljspeech-baca44e6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-cori-baca44e6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/lipid-3f6e2a05.webp', '[\"fat\", \"oil\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lipid profile\", \"meaning\": \"hồ sơ lipid\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lipid metabolism\", \"meaning\": \"chuyển hóa lipid\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-cori-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru0-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru5-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru6-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru10-baca44e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru9-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru3-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru7-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru8-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-aru2-baca44e6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-ljspeech-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt408-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt138-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt624-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt396-baca44e6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt498-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt132-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt288-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt42-baca44e6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/lipid-lt90-baca44e6.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ chất béo, thường gặp trong các báo cáo y tế.', 'health', 1, 18),
