('d5e7efbe-982f-5573-9745-8458d8902dd5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'conveniently', 'UK: /kənˈviː.ni.ənt.li/ | US: /kənˈviː.njənt.li/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'một cách tiện lợi', 'in a way that is easy, useful, or suitable for a particular situation.', 'The office is conveniently located near the train station.', 'Văn phòng được đặt ở vị trí thuận tiện gần ga tàu.', '{\"en\": \"Our conference facility is conveniently located near the central train station.\", \"vi\": \"Trung tâm hội nghị của chúng tôi nằm ở vị trí thuận tiện ngay gần ga tàu trung tâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-ljspeech-363802f7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-cori-363802f7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/conveniently-4feef1d3.webp', '[\"handily\", \"suitably\", \"easily\"]', '[\"inconveniently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"conveniently located\", \"meaning\": \"tọa lạc ở vị trí thuận tiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"conveniently placed\", \"meaning\": \"được đặt ở chỗ tiện dụng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conventionally\", \"note_vi\": \"Một cách thông thường/theo quy ước, khác với conveniently (một cách thuận tiện).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"convenience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"convenient\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-cori-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru0-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru5-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru6-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru10-363802f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru9-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru3-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru7-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru8-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-aru2-363802f7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-ljspeech-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt408-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt138-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt624-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt396-363802f7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt498-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt132-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt288-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt42-363802f7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/conveniently-lt90-363802f7.mp3\"]}}', 'Trạng từ rất hay đi cùng phân từ hai \'located\' thành cụm \'conveniently located\' (nằm ở vị trí thuận tiện).', 'real estate', 1, 1),
('3455a3cb-cb5f-59d4-9b90-00fbbbdf927d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'bilingual', '/ˌbaɪˈlɪŋɡwəl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người có thể nói thành thạo hai ngôn ngữ.', 'a person who is able to speak two different languages fluently and naturally every day.', 'As a bilingual, she can easily switch between English and Spanish during meetings.', 'Là một người song ngữ, cô ấy có thể dễ dàng chuyển đổi giữa tiếng Anh và tiếng Tây Ban Nha trong các cuộc họp.', '{\"en\": \"Our company prefers to hire a bilingual candidate to communicate effectively with our international clients.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty chúng tôi ưu tiên tuyển dụng ứng viên song ngữ để giao tiếp hiệu quả với khách hàng quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-ljspeech-fc0fd9d4.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-cori-fc0fd9d4.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bilingual-a0908c5a.webp', '[\"fluent speaker\", \"polyglot\"]', '[\"monolingual\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bilingual speaker\", \"meaning\": \"người nói song ngữ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bilingual education\", \"meaning\": \"giáo dục song ngữ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"bilingualism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-cori-fc0fd9d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-aru0-fc0fd9d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-aru5-fc0fd9d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-aru6-fc0fd9d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-aru10-fc0fd9d4.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-aru9-fc0fd9d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-aru3-fc0fd9d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bilingual-aru7-fc0fd9d4.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciati