('9c7c71bb-32a7-5cbe-9599-afdfff14cc93', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'monk', '/mʌŋk/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người sống đời tu hành, thường ở trong tu viện.', 'a member of a religious group of men who live together in a monastery.', 'The old monk spent his days in meditation and prayer.', 'Vị sư già dành cả ngày để thiền định và cầu nguyện.', '{\"en\": \"The travel agency organized a special tour to visit the ancient temple where the monk lives.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty du lịch đã tổ chức một chuyến tour đặc biệt để ghé thăm ngôi đền cổ nơi vị sư sinh sống.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-ljspeech-6257b557.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-cori-6257b557.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monk-bd7610de.webp', '[\"friar\", \"ascetic\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"Buddhist monk\", \"meaning\": \"nhà sư Phật giáo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"monk\'s robe\", \"meaning\": \"áo cà sa của nhà sư\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"monkey\", \"note_vi\": \"Monkey là con khỉ, viết gần giống monk.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"monastic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-cori-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru0-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru5-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru6-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru10-6257b557.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru9-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru3-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru7-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru8-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-aru2-6257b557.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-ljspeech-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt408-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt138-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt624-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt396-6257b557.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt498-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt132-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt288-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt42-6257b557.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monk-lt90-6257b557.mp3\"]}}', 'Monk chỉ nam tu sĩ, còn nữ tu sĩ là nun.', 'travel', 1, 3),
('2de5037e-07ee-5b8b-8d2a-b76357f6ee7c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'temperamental', '/ˌtemprəˈmentl/', 'C1', 'adjective', 'Có tính khí dễ thay đổi, dễ cáu kỉnh.', 'tending to become angry or upset very easily and suddenly.', 'The artist was known for being temperamental, often getting angry over small details.', 'Người nghệ sĩ nổi tiếng là người thất thường, thường xuyên tức giận vì những chi tiết nhỏ.', '{\"en\": \"The old printing machine in the office is quite temperamental and often breaks down unexpectedly.\", \"vi\": \"Chiếc máy in cũ trong văn phòng khá thất thường và thường xuyên hỏng hóc bất ngờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-ljspeech-a841ee04.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-cori-a841ee04.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/temperamental-9194fb98.webp', '[\"moody\", \"volatile\", \"unpredictable\"]', '[\"calm\", \"reliable\", \"stable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"temperamental machine\", \"meaning\": \"máy móc hay hỏng vặt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"temperamental boss\", \"meaning\": \"sếp dễ nổi cáu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"temperament\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"temperamentally\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-cori-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru0-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru5-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru6-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru10-a841ee04.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru9-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru3-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru7-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru8-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-aru2-a841ee04.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-ljspeech-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt408-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt138-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt624-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt396-a841ee04.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt498-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt132-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt288-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt42-a841ee04.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/temperamental-lt90-a841ee04.mp3\"]}}', 'Có thể dùng cho người (dễ cáu kỉnh) hoặc máy móc (hoạt động thất thường).', 'office', 1, 4),
('6b8e6781-65bb-590e-9fd6-c33e8899bb84', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'sanction', '/ˈsæŋkʃn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Lệnh cấm vận, biện pháp trừng phạt kinh tế hoặc chính trị.', 'an official action taken to stop trade or communication with a country to force change.', 'The international community imposed sanctions on the country due to its human rights violations.', 'Cộng đồng quốc tế đã áp đặt các lệnh cấm vận lên quốc gia đó vì vi phạm nhân quyền.', '{\"en\": \"The trade agreement was cancelled after the government imposed a strict sanction on the company.\", \"vi\": \"Thỏa thuận thương mại đã bị hủy bỏ sau khi chính phủ áp đặt lệnh trừng phạt nghiêm ngặt lên công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-ljspeech-0a11c486.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-cori-0a11c486.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/sanction-4a6012da.webp', '[\"penalty\", \"restriction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"impose a sanction\", \"meaning\": \"áp đặt lệnh trừng phạt\"}, {\"phrase\": \"economic sanction\", \"meaning\": \"lệnh trừng phạt kinh tế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"section\", \"note_vi\": \"Section là phần, bộ phận; sanction là lệnh trừng phạt.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"sanction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-cori-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru0-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru5-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru6-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru10-0a11c486.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru9-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru3-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru7-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru8-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-aru2-0a11c486.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-ljspeech-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt408-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt138-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt624-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt396-0a11c486.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt498-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt132-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt288-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt42-0a11c486.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sanction-lt90-0a11c486.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường xuất hiện trong các bản tin kinh tế hoặc văn bản pháp lý quốc tế.', 'business', 1, 5),
('e48ac676-ddd9-51f3-ad05-30ca08be2502', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'assistance', 'UK: /əˈsɪstəns/ | US: /əˈsɪstəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự hỗ trợ, sự giúp đỡ', 'help or support provided to someone in order to help them accomplish something', 'I need your assistance with this complex task.', 'Tôi cần sự hỗ trợ của bạn với nhiệm vụ phức tạp này.', '{\"en\": \"Please contact the help desk if you require further technical assistance.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng liên hệ bàn hỗ trợ nếu bạn cần thêm sự hỗ trợ kỹ thuật.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-ljspeech-9e8a01f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-cori-9e8a01f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/assistance-7a7f5c96.webp', '[\"help\", \"support\", \"aid\", \"guidance\"]', '[\"hindrance\", \"obstruction\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"financial assistance\", \"meaning\": \"sự hỗ trợ tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"technical assistance\", \"meaning\": \"sự hỗ trợ kỹ thuật\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"assistant\", \"note_vi\": \"trợ lý (danh từ chỉ người), khác với assistance (sự giúp đỡ).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"assist\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"assistant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-cori-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru0-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru5-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru6-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru10-9e8a01f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru9-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru3-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru7-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru8-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-aru2-9e8a01f2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-ljspeech-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt408-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt138-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt624-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt396-9e8a01f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt498-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt132-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt288-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt42-9e8a01f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/assistance-lt90-9e8a01f2.mp3\"]}}', 'Là danh từ không đếm được. Thường gặp trong các cụm như \'financial assistance\' (hỗ trợ tài chính) hay \'technical assistance\' (hỗ trợ kỹ thuật).', 'customer service', 1, 6),
('46fc4f88-7f8f-5132-914e-9b976c98f457', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'seaquake', '/ˈsiːkweɪk/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Trận động đất xảy ra dưới đáy biển hoặc đại dương.', 'a sudden shaking of the earth surface under the ocean floor.', 'A powerful seaquake can trigger tsunamis, posing a great danger to coastal areas.', 'Một trận động đất dưới biển mạnh có thể gây ra sóng thần, tạo ra mối nguy hiểm lớn cho các khu vực ven biển.', '{\"en\": \"The cargo ship delayed its departure after safety alerts about a recent seaquake.\", \"vi\": \"Tàu chở hàng đã hoãn chuyến khởi hành sau các cảnh báo an toàn về một trận động đất dưới đáy biển gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-ljspeech-463d5339.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-cori-463d5339.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/seaquake-f19e4081.webp', '[\"submarine earthquake\", \"oceanic earthquake\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"underwater seaquake\", \"meaning\": \"động đất dưới đáy biển\"}, {\"phrase\": \"severe seaquake\", \"meaning\": \"trận động đất dưới biển dữ dội\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"earthquake\", \"note_vi\": \"Earthquake là động đất nói chung trên mặt đất hoặc dưới biển.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-cori-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru0-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru5-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru6-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru10-463d5339.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru9-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru3-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru7-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru8-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-aru2-463d5339.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-ljspeech-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt408-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt138-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt624-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt396-463d5339.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt498-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt132-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt288-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt42-463d5339.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/seaquake-lt90-463d5339.mp3\"]}}', 'Seaquake là sự kết hợp giữa sea (biển) và earthquake (động đất).', 'nature', 1, 7),
('637515ae-c8ba-51f7-bc27-3b3d255e7f69', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'condense', '/kənˈdens/', 'B2', 'verb', 'chuyển từ thể khí sang thể lỏng, hoặc làm cho cái gì đó trở nên đặc hơn, ngắn gọn hơn.', 'to change from gas to liquid, or to make something shorter and thicker.', 'Water vapor will condense into droplets when it cools down.', 'Hơi nước sẽ ngưng tụ thành giọt khi nó nguội đi.', '{\"en\": \"Please condense this long annual report into a brief summary for the board members.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng rút ngắn báo cáo thường niên dài này thành một bản tóm tắt ngắn gọn cho các thành viên hội đồng quản trị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-ljspeech-7ff49fb3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-cori-7ff49fb3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/condense-38739f3f.webp', '[\"shorten\", \"summarize\", \"compress\"]', '[\"expand\", \"lengthen\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"condense into\", \"meaning\": \"ngưng tụ thành / rút gọn thành\"}, {\"phrase\": \"condensed milk\", \"meaning\": \"sữa đặc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dense\", \"note_vi\": \"dense là tính từ nghĩa là dày đặc, đông đúc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"condensation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"condensed\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-cori-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru0-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru5-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru6-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru10-7ff49fb3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru9-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru3-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru7-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru8-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-aru2-7ff49fb3.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-ljspeech-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt408-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt138-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt624-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt396-7ff49fb3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt498-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt132-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt288-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt42-7ff49fb3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/condense-lt90-7ff49fb3.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong văn phòng, từ này hay dùng với nghĩa rút gọn văn bản, báo cáo.', 'office', 1, 8)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('29a0b4cd-24e4-5bd3-a4a7-df4698e05dee', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'standardize', 'UK: /ˈstændədaɪzd/ | US: /ˈstændərˌdaɪzd/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'được tiêu chuẩn hóa', 'Made consistent and conforming to a set model or established set of quality guidelines.', 'Our products are highly standardized for consistent quality.', 'Sản phẩm của chúng tôi được tiêu chuẩn hóa cao để đảm bảo chất lượng đồng nhất.', '{\"en\": \"The corporation plans to standardize operating procedures across all regional branches.\", \"vi\": \"Tập đoàn có kế hoạch tiêu chuẩn hóa các quy trình vận hành trên tất cả các chi nhánh khu vực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-ljspeech-015d5296.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-cori-015d5296.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/standardize-bb506a13.webp', '[\"normalize\", \"systematize\", \"regulate\"]', '[\"differentiate\", \"customize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"standardize procedures\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu chuẩn hóa quy trình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"standardize training\", \"meaning\": \"tiêu chuẩn hóa việc đào tạo\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"standard\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"standardization\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"standardized\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-cori-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru0-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru5-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru6-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru10-015d5296.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru9-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru3-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru7-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru8-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-aru2-015d5296.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-ljspeech-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt408-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt138-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt624-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt396-015d5296.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt498-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt132-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt288-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt42-015d5296.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/standardize-lt90-015d5296.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ mang nghĩa làm cho đúng chuẩn mực (ở dạng tính từ thường là standardized).', 'management', 1, 9),
('7cdc8ce5-a701-53e3-95d8-6f847dd5cf06', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'address', '/əˈdres/', 'A1', 'noun', 'Thông tin chi tiết về vị trí của một nơi hoặc người nào đó.', 'the specific details of where a building is located or where someone receives their mail.', 'The applicant forgot to include her current residential address on the resume.', 'Ứng viên đã quên ghi địa chỉ thường trú hiện tại của cô ấy vào sơ yếu lý lịch.', '{\"en\": \"Please confirm your current office address so we can send the contract by courier today.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xác nhận địa chỉ văn phòng hiện tại của bạn để chúng tôi gửi hợp đồng qua chuyển phát nhanh hôm nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-ljspeech-c6621802.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-cori-c6621802.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/address-ac7693c9.webp', '[\"location\", \"residence\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"mailing address\", \"meaning\": \"địa chỉ gửi thư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"change of address\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi địa chỉ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"addressee\", \"note_vi\": \"người nhận thư, khác với địa chỉ nơi nhận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"address\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-cori-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru0-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru5-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru6-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru10-c6621802.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru9-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru3-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru7-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru8-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-aru2-c6621802.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-ljspeech-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt408-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt138-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt624-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt396-c6621802.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt498-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt132-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt288-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt42-c6621802.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/address-lt90-c6621802.mp3\"]}}', 'Từ này còn là động từ nghĩa là giải quyết vấn đề (address an issue).', 'office', 1, 10),
('c676ddde-17f5-5bc3-bdfc-94b955d03b1d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'compensate', 'UK: /ˈkɒmpənseɪt/ | US: /ˈkɑːmpənseɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'bồi thường, đền bù', 'to pay someone money in exchange for work done or loss suffered', 'The company will compensate employees for their extra work hours.', 'Công ty sẽ bồi thường cho nhân viên về những giờ làm việc thêm của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The airline compensated passengers for the long flight delay.\", \"vi\": \"Hãng hàng không đã bồi thường cho hành khách vì sự chậm trễ chuyến bay dài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-ljspeech-3ff7e0af.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-cori-3ff7e0af.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compensate-edc3fa9e.webp', '[\"reimburse\", \"remunerate\", \"indemnify\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"compensate for losses\", \"meaning\": \"bồi thường tổn thất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fairly compensate\", \"meaning\": \"đền bù xứng đáng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"compensation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"compensatory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-cori-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru0-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru5-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru6-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru10-3ff7e0af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru9-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru3-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru7-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru8-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-aru2-3ff7e0af.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-ljspeech-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt408-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt138-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt624-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt396-3ff7e0af.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt498-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt132-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt288-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt42-3ff7e0af.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compensate-lt90-3ff7e0af.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: \'compensate somebody for something\' (bồi thường cho ai về cái gì).', 'human resources', 1, 11),
('d3ee3b0d-f30e-5c40-8203-07d769f3d942', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'consequence', 'UK: /ˈkɒnsɪkwəns/ | US: /ˈkɑːnsəkwens/', 'B2', 'noun', 'hậu quả', 'A result or effect of a particular action or situation, usually an unpleasant one.', 'Failure to meet the deadline will have serious consequences.', 'Không hoàn thành đúng hạn sẽ gây ra hậu quả nghiêm trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Failing to comply with workplace safety regulations can lead to serious financial consequences for the firm.\", \"vi\": \"Không tuân thủ các quy định an toàn lao động có thể dẫn đến những hậu quả tài chính nghiêm trọng cho công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-ljspeech-f4475dac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-cori-f4475dac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/consequence-7e3ae889.webp', '[\"result\", \"outcome\", \"effect\", \"repercussion\"]', '[\"cause\", \"origin\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"as a consequence of\", \"meaning\": \"do hậu quả/kết quả của\"}, {\"phrase\": \"serious consequences\", \"meaning\": \"những hậu quả nghiêm trọng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"sequence\", \"note_vi\": \"trình tự/chuỗi nối tiếp, không phải hậu quả\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"consequently\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"consequent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-cori-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru0-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru5-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru6-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru10-f4475dac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru9-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru3-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru7-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru8-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-aru2-f4475dac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-ljspeech-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt408-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt138-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt624-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt396-f4475dac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt498-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt132-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt288-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt42-f4475dac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/consequence-lt90-f4475dac.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang sắc thái kết quả tiêu cực. Cụm từ thường gặp: as a consequence of (là kết quả/hậu quả của).', 'business management', 1, 12),
('59bafb18-a2af-5e75-b3f2-6e396ccccaa7', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'dosage', '/ˈdəʊsɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Lượng thuốc hoặc chất cụ thể cần dùng trong một lần hoặc trong một khoảng thời gian.', 'the amount of medicine that you should take at one time or regularly.', 'Patients should consult a pharmacist if they are unsure about the recommended dosage.', 'Bệnh nhân nên tham khảo ý kiến dược sĩ nếu không chắc chắn về liều lượng được khuyến cáo.', '{\"en\": \"Please read the label carefully to find the correct dosage for this allergy medication.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đọc kỹ nhãn để tìm liều lượng chính xác cho loại thuốc dị ứng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-ljspeech-ae1b9dba.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-cori-ae1b9dba.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dosage-79dc8d92.webp', '[\"dose\", \"amount\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"recommended dosage\", \"meaning\": \"liều lượng khuyến nghị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"adjust the dosage\", \"meaning\": \"điều chỉnh liều lượng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dose\", \"note_vi\": \"dose là một liều đơn lẻ, dosage là liều lượng hệ thống.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dose\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"dose\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-cori-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru0-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru5-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru6-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru10-ae1b9dba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru9-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru3-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru7-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru8-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-aru2-ae1b9dba.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-ljspeech-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt408-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt138-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt624-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt396-ae1b9dba.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt498-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt132-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt288-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt42-ae1b9dba.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dosage-lt90-ae1b9dba.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'dose\', \'dosage\' thường dùng cho chỉ dẫn liều lượng chung.', 'health', 1, 13),
('fe75d594-8dca-5a26-879e-c8c7ec478536', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'radioactivity', '/ˌreɪdiəʊækˈtɪvəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hiện tượng hạt nhân nguyên tử tự phân rã và phát ra bức xạ.', 'the process by which unstable atoms release energy in the form of dangerous invisible rays.', 'The discovery of radioactivity revolutionized our understanding of atomic structure.', 'Việc phát hiện ra phóng xạ đã cách mạng hóa sự hiểu biết của chúng ta về cấu trúc nguyên tử.', '{\"en\": \"The laboratory staff must wear protective gear to avoid exposure to high levels of radioactivity.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên phòng thí nghiệm phải mặc đồ bảo hộ để tránh tiếp xúc với mức độ phóng xạ cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-ljspeech-363e072a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-cori-363e072a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/radioactivity-bd3d8d9a.webp', '[\"radiation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"high radioactivity\", \"meaning\": \"phóng xạ cao\"}, {\"phrase\": \"detect radioactivity\", \"meaning\": \"phát hiện phóng xạ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"radioactive\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-cori-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru0-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru5-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru6-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru10-363e072a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru9-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru3-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru7-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru8-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-aru2-363e072a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-ljspeech-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt408-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt138-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt624-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt396-363e072a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt498-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt132-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt288-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt42-363e072a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/radioactivity-lt90-363e072a.mp3\"]}}', 'Cẩn thận với từ \"radiation\" (bức xạ) thường dùng phổ biến hơn.', 'health', 1, 14),
('32ea9de4-c323-5ca7-8fc8-5ed5df294174', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'prevail on', '/prɪˈveɪl ɒn/', 'C1', 'phrasal verb', 'Thuyết phục ai đó làm điều gì.', 'to persuade someone to do something after urging or requesting gently.', 'She managed to prevail on her boss to give her a raise.', 'Cô ấy đã thuyết phục được sếp tăng lương cho mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager prevailed on the senior consultant to extend his contract by another six months.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã thuyết phục vị cố vấn cao cấp gia hạn hợp đồng thêm sáu tháng nữa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-ljspeech-460d8310.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-cori-460d8310.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/prevail-on-8729268f.webp', '[\"persuade\", \"convince\", \"coax\"]', '[\"dissuade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"prevail upon\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục ai đó (dạng trang trọng hơn)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prevail on somebody to do something\", \"meaning\": \"thuyết phục ai làm điều gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prevail over\", \"note_vi\": \"Prevail on = thuyết phục ai đó; prevail over = đánh bại hoặc chiến thắng ai đó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"prevail\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-cori-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru0-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru5-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru6-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru10-460d8310.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru9-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru3-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru7-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru8-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-aru2-460d8310.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-ljspeech-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt408-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt138-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt624-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt396-460d8310.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt498-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt132-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt288-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt42-460d8310.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/prevail-on-lt90-460d8310.mp3\"]}}', 'Cũng có thể dùng \'prevail upon\'. Phân biệt với \'prevail over\' (chiếm ưu thế/thắng thế).', 'office', 1, 15),
('42ca6751-7468-5b76-9511-11fb1283466a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'doctrine', '/ˈdɒktrɪn/', 'C1', 'noun', 'Một tập hợp các niềm tin hoặc nguyên tắc được giảng dạy và chấp nhận rộng rãi.', 'a set of beliefs or rules that a group officially teaches and follows.', 'The new doctrine of the political party focuses on economic growth.', 'Học thuyết mới của đảng chính trị tập trung vào tăng trưởng kinh tế.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s core doctrine emphasizes customer satisfaction above all other priorities.\", \"vi\": \"Học thuyết cốt lõi của công ty nhấn mạnh sự hài lòng của khách hàng hơn tất cả các ưu tiên khác.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-ljspeech-49fcb575.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-cori-49fcb575.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/doctrine-ed332794.webp', '[\"principle\", \"belief\", \"tenet\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"political doctrine\", \"meaning\": \"học thuyết chính trị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"core doctrine\", \"meaning\": \"học thuyết cốt lõi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"follow a doctrine\", \"meaning\": \"tuân theo một học thuyết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"dogma\", \"note_vi\": \"dogma mang tính cứng nhắc, không được phép nghi ngờ; doctrine mềm hơn, có thể thảo luận.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"doctrinal\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"doctrinaire\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-cori-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru0-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru5-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru6-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru10-49fcb575.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru9-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru3-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru7-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru8-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-aru2-49fcb575.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-ljspeech-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt408-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt138-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt624-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt396-49fcb575.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt498-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt132-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt288-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt42-49fcb575.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/doctrine-lt90-49fcb575.mp3\"]}}', '\'Doctrine\' thường gặp trong văn bản chính trị, tôn giáo, pháp lý; không dùng cho quy định thông thường.', 'other', 1, 16),
('b82a216a-1886-5d3d-9a1e-b354d1b1de25', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'tempt', '/tempt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Quyến rũ, cám dỗ ai đó làm điều gì, đặc biệt là điều không nên.', 'to entice or encourage a person to take an action that may be risky or inadvisable.', 'The smell of freshly baked cookies was enough to tempt me to break my diet.', 'Mùi bánh quy mới nướng đủ để cám dỗ tôi phá vỡ chế độ ăn kiêng.', '{\"en\": \"The low prices during the seasonal clearance sale tempt many customers to overspend.\", \"vi\": \"Giá thấp trong đợt xả hàng theo mùa cám dỗ nhiều khách hàng chi tiêu quá mức.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-ljspeech-e976c086.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-cori-e976c086.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tempt-4923432e.webp', '[\"entice\", \"attract\", \"lure\"]', '[\"repel\", \"deter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tempt someone to do something\", \"meaning\": \"cám dỗ ai làm điều gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"be tempted by something\", \"meaning\": \"bị lôi cuốn bởi điều gì\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attempt\", \"note_vi\": \"Attempt nghĩa là nỗ lực, cố gắng thực hiện điều gì đó.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"temptation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"tempting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-cori-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru0-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru5-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru6-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru10-e976c086.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru9-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru3-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru7-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru8-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru2-e976c086.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-ljspeech-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt408-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt138-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt624-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt396-e976c086.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt498-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt132-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt288-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt42-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-lt90-e976c086.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: tempt somebody to do something (xúi giục/cám dỗ ai làm gì).', 'shopping', 1, 17),
('3bed5e5c-5b81-5f0f-b3ed-caaec0a7dca4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'vinegary', '/ˈvɪnɪɡəri/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'Có vị hoặc mùi giống giấm; chua gắt.', 'tasting or smelling like a sour liquid often used in cooking or food preservation.', 'The old wine had turned vinegary and was no longer pleasant to drink.', 'Chai rượu cũ đã chuyển sang vị chua gắt như giấm và không còn ngon để uống nữa.', '{\"en\": \"The quality inspector rejected the batch of salad dressing because it tasted too vinegary.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên kiểm định chất lượng đã từ chối lô nước sốt salad vì nó có vị quá chua gắt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-ljspeech-ec93a0b6.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-cori-ec93a0b6.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/vinegary-00a349c3.webp', '[\"sour\", \"acidic\"]', '[\"sweet\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"vinegary taste\", \"meaning\": \"vị chua gắt như giấm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"vinegary smell\", \"meaning\": \"mùi chua như giấm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"vinegar\", \"note_vi\": \"vinegar là danh từ (giấm), vinegary là tính từ (có vị hoặc mùi như giấm).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"vinegar\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-cori-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru0-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru5-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru6-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru10-ec93a0b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru9-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru3-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru7-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru8-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-aru2-ec93a0b6.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-ljspeech-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt408-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt138-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt624-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt396-ec93a0b6.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt498-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt132-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt288-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt42-ec93a0b6.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/vinegary-lt90-ec93a0b6.mp3\"]}}', 'Hậu tố -y được thêm vào sau danh từ vinegar để tạo thành tính từ vinegary.', 'dining', 1, 18),
('cb6c4fed-88ac-5d10-898b-93444d9177a9', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f07e5085-7c7b-53cb-af2c-af5cf11a1afc', 'c4f00124-e700-530b-a3d5-1974b91c284e', 'contrite', '/kənˈtraɪt/', 'C2', 'adjective', 'cảm thấy rất hối lỗi hoặc ăn năn về lỗi lầm đã gây ra.', 'feeling very sorry and guilty for something bad that you have done.', 'After realizing his mistake, he sent a contrite apology to his friend.', 'Sau khi nhận ra lỗi lầm của mình, anh ấy đã gửi lời xin lỗi đầy hối hận đến bạn mình.', '{\"en\": \"The representative offered a contrite apology to the clients for the delay in shipment.\", \"vi\": \"Người đại diện đã đưa ra lời xin lỗi ăn năn tới khách hàng vì sự chậm trễ trong việc giao hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-ljspeech-e0c415a0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-cori-e0c415a0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/contrite-26d3f285.webp', '[\"apologetic\", \"remorseful\", \"repentant\"]', '[\"unrepentant\", \"defiant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"contrite apology\", \"meaning\": \"lời xin lỗi chân thành/hối lỗi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"contrite look\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ mặt hối lỗi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"contrition\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-cori-e0c415a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-aru0-e0c415a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-aru5-e0c415a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-aru6-e0c415a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-aru10-e0c415a0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-aru9-e0c415a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-aru3-e0c415a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-aru7-e0c415a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/contrite-aru8-e0c415a0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/obje