('c4897c35-ae4d-5ede-97ff-d6cc78d49af5', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'subscriber', 'UK: /səbˈskraɪbər/ | US: /səbˈskraɪbər/', 'B2', 'noun', 'người đăng ký, thuê bao', 'a person who pays money regularly to receive a service, publication, or broadcast channel.', 'New subscribers receive a discount on their first month\'s service.', 'Các thuê bao mới nhận được chiết khấu cho tháng dịch vụ đầu tiên của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The online journal has gained over fifty thousand new subscribers within the past six months.\", \"vi\": \"Tạp chí trực tuyến đã có thêm hơn 50.000 người đăng ký mới trong vòng sáu tháng qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-ljspeech-32086137.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-cori-32086137.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/subscriber-8acf8d85.webp', '[\"member\", \"reader\", \"patron\", \"customer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"new subscribers\", \"meaning\": \"người đăng ký mới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"annual subscribers\", \"meaning\": \"thuê bao theo năm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"subscribe\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"subscription\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-cori-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru0-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru5-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru6-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru10-32086137.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru9-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru3-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru7-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru8-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-aru2-32086137.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-ljspeech-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt408-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt138-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt624-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt396-32086137.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt498-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt132-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt288-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt42-32086137.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/subscriber-lt90-32086137.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi \'-er\' chỉ người/đơn vị đăng ký dịch vụ hoặc tạp chí định kỳ.', 'media', 1, 0),
('16d1d2f5-ccf1-5103-a57a-27f28ed55606', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'comment', 'UK: /ˈkɒment/ | US: /ˈkɑːment/', 'B1', 'noun', 'bình luận, nhận xét', 'a written or spoken remark expressing an opinion or reaction', 'The manager asked for comments on the new project proposal.', 'Quản lý yêu cầu nhận xét về đề xuất dự án mới.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor invited all team members to share their comments on the proposed policy.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát đã mời tất cả thành viên trong nhóm chia sẻ nhận xét của họ về chính sách được đề xuất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-ljspeech-118a9989.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-cori-118a9989.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/comment-69ade4c2.webp', '[\"remark\", \"observation\", \"feedback\", \"statement\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"no comment\", \"meaning\": \"không có bình luận gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make a comment\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra lời nhận xét\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"comment\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"commentary\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-cori-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru0-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru5-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru6-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru10-118a9989.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru9-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru3-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru7-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru8-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-aru2-118a9989.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-ljspeech-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt408-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt138-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt624-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt396-118a9989.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt498-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt132-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt288-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt42-118a9989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/comment-lt90-118a9989.mp3\"]}}', 'Đi với giới từ \'on\' hoặc \'about\' (comment on/about sth). Tránh dùng \'comment for\'.', 'office', 1, 1),
('44043462-5bca-51a4-ae63-6986d8038c0d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'agile', '/ˈædʒaɪl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng di chuyển hoặc suy nghĩ nhanh chóng và dễ dàng.', 'able to move quickly and easily, or able to think and understand quickly.', 'The agile cat quickly climbed the tree to catch the bird.', 'Con mèo nhanh nhẹn đã nhanh chóng trèo cây để bắt con chim.', '{\"en\": \"To survive in this competitive market, our company needs to adopt more agile business methods.\", \"vi\": \"Để tồn tại trong thị trường cạnh tranh này, công ty chúng ta cần áp dụng các phương thức kinh doanh linh hoạt hơn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-ljspeech-8ecf325a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-cori-8ecf325a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/agile-ce8312ae.webp', '[\"nimble\", \"quick\", \"flexible\"]', '[\"clumsy\", \"slow\", \"rigid\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"agile mind\", \"meaning\": \"đầu óc nhanh nhạy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"agile methodology\", \"meaning\": \"phương pháp luận linh hoạt (trong quản lý dự án)\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"active\", \"note_vi\": \"active là tích cực hoạt động, agile là nhanh nhẹn, linh hoạt\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"agility\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-cori-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru0-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru5-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru6-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru10-8ecf325a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru9-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru3-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru7-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru8-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-aru2-8ecf325a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-ljspeech-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt408-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt138-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt624-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt396-8ecf325a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt498-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt132-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt288-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt42-8ecf325a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/agile-lt90-8ecf325a.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngành IT, \'Agile\' là một phương pháp phát triển phần mềm rất phổ biến.', 'business', 1, 2),
('f3f96763-05b4-5f44-865c-785052ba6879', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'miniature', '/ˈmɪnətʃə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Vật thu nhỏ, mô hình nhỏ.', 'a small version of something that is usually much larger in reality.', 'He collects miniature cars and has hundreds of them on display.', 'Anh ấy sưu tập những chiếc ô tô mô hình và có hàng trăm chiếc được trưng bày.', '{\"en\": \"The architect presented a miniature model of the new office building to the investors.\", \"vi\": \"Kiến trúc sư đã trình bày mô hình thu nhỏ của tòa nhà văn phòng mới cho các nhà đầu tư.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-ljspeech-7e18cf42.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-cori-7e18cf42.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/miniature-b2f4b760.webp', '[\"model\", \"replica\"]', '[\"giant\", \"full-scale\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"miniature model\", \"meaning\": \"mô hình thu nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"in miniature\", \"meaning\": \"ở dạng thu nhỏ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"miniature\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-cori-7e18cf42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru0-7e18cf42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru5-7e18cf42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru6-7e18cf42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru10-7e18cf42.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru9-7e18cf42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru3-7e18cf42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru7-7e18cf42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru8-7e18cf42.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/miniature-aru2-7e18cf42.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/