('636bd55c-a8f6-5b07-b3fa-597e7abc6372', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'disorganized', '/dɪsˈɔːɡənaɪzd/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Lộn xộn, không có trật tự hay kế hoạch.', 'not tidy and without a clear system to follow.', 'Her desk was so disorganized that she couldn\'t find her important documents.', 'Bàn làm việc của cô ấy lộn xộn đến mức cô ấy không thể tìm thấy tài liệu quan trọng của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The disorganized files caused delays in the monthly financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Các tệp tin lộn xộn gây ra sự chậm trễ trong báo cáo tài chính hàng tháng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-ljspeech-c0f945ae.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-cori-c0f945ae.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disorganized-19fce21e.webp', '[\"messy\", \"chaotic\", \"cluttered\"]', '[\"tidy\", \"orderly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disorganized person\", \"meaning\": \"người lộn xộn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disorganized desk\", \"meaning\": \"bàn làm việc bừa bộn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disorganized system\", \"meaning\": \"hệ thống thiếu trật tự\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"disorient\", \"note_vi\": \"gần mặt chữ nhưng nghĩa là làm mất phương hướng\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"disorganize\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disorganization\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-cori-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru0-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru5-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru6-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru10-c0f945ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru9-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru3-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru7-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru8-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-aru2-c0f945ae.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-ljspeech-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt408-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt138-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt624-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt396-c0f945ae.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt498-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt132-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt288-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt42-c0f945ae.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disorganized-lt90-c0f945ae.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm disorganized với disorient (làm mất phương hướng).', 'office', 1, 5),
('4cea5b10-e7a8-5f64-8cc2-728d2dac5081', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'fairly', '/ˈfeəli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách công bằng, hợp lý.', 'in a way that treats everyone equally and without showing preference.', 'The judge ruled fairly, considering all the evidence presented.', 'Vị thẩm phán đã phán xử công bằng, xem xét mọi bằng chứng được đưa ra.', '{\"en\": \"The manager distributed the workload fairly among all team members this quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã phân chia khối lượng công việc một cách công bằng cho tất cả thành viên trong quý này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-ljspeech-e94221b1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-cori-e94221b1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fairly-0cdb93fb.webp', '[\"justly\", \"equitably\", \"impartially\"]', '[\"unfairly\", \"unjustly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fairly distribute\", \"meaning\": \"phân phối công bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fairly treat\", \"meaning\": \"đối xử công bằng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fairly priced\", \"meaning\": \"được định giá hợp lý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"barely\", \"note_vi\": \"barely nghĩa là hầu như không, trái nghĩa với fairly về mức độ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"fair\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fairness\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"unfair\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-cori-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru0-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru5-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru6-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru10-e94221b1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru9-e94221b1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fairly-aru3-e9422