('05deb51f-ac77-5592-b829-1f6ac179060d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'crucial', 'UK: /ˈkruːʃəl/ | US: /ˈkruːʃəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'quan trọng, cốt yếu', 'Of supreme importance, especially in determining the success or failure of something.', 'Timely delivery is crucial for customer satisfaction.', 'Giao hàng đúng hẹn là yếu tố cốt yếu cho sự hài lòng của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Effective communication is crucial for the success of any cross-departmental project.\", \"vi\": \"Giao tiếp hiệu quả là vô cùng quan trọng đối với sự thành công của bất kỳ dự án liên phòng ban nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-ljspeech-dd3cf290.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-cori-dd3cf290.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/crucial-2cb19405.webp', '[\"essential\", \"vital\", \"critical\", \"pivotal\"]', '[\"trivial\", \"unimportant\", \"minor\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"play a crucial role\", \"meaning\": \"đóng vai trò quan trọng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"crucial factor\", \"meaning\": \"yếu tố cốt yếu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"it is crucial that\", \"meaning\": \"điều quan trọng là\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"crucially\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-cori-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru0-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru5-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru6-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru10-dd3cf290.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru9-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru3-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru7-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru8-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-aru2-dd3cf290.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-ljspeech-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt408-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt138-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt624-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt396-dd3cf290.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt498-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt132-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt288-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt42-dd3cf290.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/crucial-lt90-dd3cf290.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đứng trước mệnh đề hoặc động từ nguyên mẫu: \'It is crucial to do something\' hoặc \'play a crucial role in\'. Xuất hiện nhiều trong Part 5 & 7.', 'business', 1, 11),
('53c8496a-c25c-5d83-8c7b-3ee126eb4c46', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'inarguably', '/ɪnˈɑːɡjuəbli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách không thể tranh cãi, hiển nhiên đúng.', 'in a way that is certainly true and cannot be doubted or disagreed with.', 'She is inarguably one of the most talented musicians of her generation.', 'Cô ấy hiển nhiên là một trong những nhạc sĩ tài năng nhất thế hệ của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The new marketing strategy is inarguably the main reason for our recent sales growth.\", \"vi\": \"Chiến lược tiếp thị mới không thể tranh cãi là lý do chính cho sự tăng trưởng doanh số gần đây của chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-ljspeech-e3091a32.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-cori-e3091a32.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inarguably-f7516b76.webp', '[\"undeniably\", \"indisputably\", \"unquestionably\"]', '[\"arguably\", \"questionably\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"inarguably true\", \"meaning\": \"hiển nhiên đúng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"inarguably the best\", \"meaning\": \"chắc chắn là tốt nhất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"argue\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"argument\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inarguable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-cori-e3091a32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-aru0-e3091a32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-aru5-e3091a32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-aru6-e3091a32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-aru10-e3091a32.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-aru9-e3091a32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarguably-aru3-e3091a32.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inarg