('0c8d2472-1773-5c7e-a021-c4f75a516b0d', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'f7be4afb-660e-54bf-b271-cf07194857bd', 'a6421abb-9cc7-5e96-ba5b-45f6b41b1057', 'reptile', '/ˈreptaɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Động vật máu lạnh có vảy, như rắn, thằn lằn, hoặc cá sấu.', 'a type of animal that has cold blood and skin covered in hard dry plates.', 'Lizards and snakes are common examples of reptiles.', 'Thằn lằn và rắn là những ví dụ phổ biến về loài bò sát.', '{\"en\": \"The logistics company had to follow strict regulations when transporting a rare reptile for the zoo.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty vận tải phải tuân thủ các quy định nghiêm ngặt khi vận chuyển một loài bò sát quý hiếm cho sở thú.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-ljspeech-9e2f8663.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-cori-9e2f8663.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/reptile-cda5ea45.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reptile house\", \"meaning\": \"nhà nuôi bò sát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rare reptile\", \"meaning\": \"loài bò sát quý hiếm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"reptilian\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-cori-9e2f8663.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru0-9e2f8663.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru5-9e2f8663.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru6-9e2f8663.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru10-9e2f8663.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru9-9e2f8663.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru3-9e2f8663.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru7-9e2f8663.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru8-9e2f8663.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/reptile-aru2-9e2f8663.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation