('0e197a40-da78-5b1c-9a26-c8bca851e47a', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ffce82be-e3f0-5b62-921d-6d0493ffb306', 'ae9dac72-8f08-5eb5-963f-20908d5e5c7b', 'paradigm', '/ˈpærədaɪm/', 'C1', 'noun', 'một mô hình, khuôn mẫu hoặc ví dụ điển hình.', 'a typical model or pattern that is used as a standard example for something.', 'The internet created a new paradigm for communication and commerce.', 'Internet đã tạo ra một mô hình mới cho giao tiếp và thương mại.', '{\"en\": \"The company\'s remote work policy has become a paradigm for other firms in the industry.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách làm việc từ xa của công ty đã trở thành khuôn mẫu cho các doanh nghiệp khác trong ngành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-ljspeech-a3b8317c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-cori-a3b8317c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/paradigm-52d4f346.webp', '[\"model\", \"framework\", \"pattern\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"new paradigm\", \"meaning\": \"khuôn mẫu mới\"}, {\"phrase\": \"paradigm shift\", \"meaning\": \"sự thay đổi mô hình tư duy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dominant paradigm\", \"meaning\": \"mô hình chiếm ưu thế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"parameter\", \"note_vi\": \"parameter là thông số giới hạn, không phải mô hình mẫu như paradigm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"paradigmatic\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-cori-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru0-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru5-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru6-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru10-a3b8317c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru9-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru3-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru7-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru8-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-aru2-a3b8317c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-ljspeech-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt408-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt138-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt624-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt396-a3b8317c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt498-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt132-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt288-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt42-a3b8317c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/paradigm-lt90-a3b8317c.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm paradigm shift rất phổ biến trong văn phong kinh doanh và học thuật.', 'business', 1, 9),
('462da219-1da3-58d0-9c54-945bdda3cca4', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ffce82be-e3f0-5b62-921d-6d0493ffb306', 'ae9dac72-8f08-5eb5-963f-20908d5e5c7b', 'division', 'UK: /dɪˈvɪʒən/ | US: /dɪˈvɪʒən/', 'B1', 'noun', 'bộ phận, chi nhánh', 'a major section or department within a large company or administrative organization.', 'Our division handles all international accounts.', 'Bộ phận của chúng tôi xử lý tất cả các tài khoản quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"She was recently appointed as the head of the international marketing division.\", \"vi\": \"Cô ấy vừa mới được bổ nhiệm làm người đứng đầu bộ phận tiếp thị quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-ljspeech-4fd95a30.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-cori-4fd95a30.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/division-69975579.webp', '[\"department\", \"branch\", \"section\", \"unit\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"marketing division\", \"meaning\": \"bộ phận tiếp thị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"head of division\", \"meaning\": \"trưởng bộ phận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"division manager\", \"meaning\": \"quản lý bộ phận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"department\", \"note_vi\": \"Department thường là phòng ban nhỏ hơn hoặc nằm trực thuộc một division.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"divide\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"divisional\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-cori-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru0-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru5-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru6-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru10-4fd95a30.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru9-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru3-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru7-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru8-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-aru2-4fd95a30.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-ljspeech-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt408-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt138-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt624-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt396-4fd95a30.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt498-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt132-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt288-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt42-4fd95a30.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/division-lt90-4fd95a30.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong ngữ cảnh doanh nghiệp, \'division\' nghĩa là bộ phận/chi nhánh lớn, thường bao gồm nhiều phòng ban (departments).', 'office', 1, 10),
('23f6657e-b745-534f-a4fa-b6803f9ee39c', '51593eab-afc9-5ad7-9776-2e5deeada393', 'ffce82be-e3f0-5b62-921d-6d0493ffb306', 'ae9dac72-8f08-5eb5-963f-20908d5e5c7b', 'invariably', '/ɪnˈveəriəbli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Luôn luôn, không thay đổi hay ngoại lệ.', 'happening in every case or on every occasion without any exception.', 'He invariably arrives late for appointments, no matter how early he starts.', 'Anh ấy luôn đến muộn các cuộc hẹn, dù có bắt đầu sớm đến mấy.', '{\"en\": \"The quarterly financial report invariably shows a slight increase in sales during the summer.\", \"vi\": \"Báo cáo tài chính hàng quý luôn cho thấy doanh số bán hàng tăng nhẹ trong mùa hè.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-ljspeech-cbe6da9c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-cori-cbe6da9c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/invariably-30831ed1.webp', '[\"always\", \"constantly\"]', '[\"never\", \"rarely\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"invariably lead to\", \"meaning\": \"luôn dẫn đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"almost invariably\", \"meaning\": \"gần như luôn luôn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"invariably\", \"note_vi\": \"Nhấn mạnh tính lặp lại không thay đổi, dùng trong văn viết.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"invariable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-cori-cbe6da9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-aru0-cbe6da9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-aru5-cbe6da9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-aru6-cbe6da9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-aru10-cbe6da9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-aru9-cbe6da9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-aru3-cbe6da9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/invariably-aru7-cbe6da9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia